ce":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:D8","text":"The human capacity to endure and overcome pain is traced back to the operative form of courage.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_3:A7","CH_97E9_1C_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:D9","text":"A greater depth of seeing life produces not relief, but greater proximity to suffering.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_3:A9","CH_97E9_1C_3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:D10","text":"The formula “Once more!” transforms death from an endpoint into a challenge to be answered anew.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_3:A7","CH_97E9_1C_3:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:SD1","text":"Self-overcoming produces its own counterthrust: the one who throws himself upward becomes the object of relapse.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_3:A3","CH_97E9_1C_3:A4","CH_97E9_1C_3:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:SD2","text":"Gravity is the structure through which the attempt at ascent is converted into self-reference, solitude, and self-endangerment.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_3:A4","CH_97E9_1C_3:A5","CH_97E9_1C_3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:SD3","text":"Courage does not abolish suffering, but changes its status from an overwhelming condition to an object of attack.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_3:A7","CH_97E9_1C_3:A8","CH_97E9_1C_3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:SD4","text":"The system replaces final overcoming with repeated resistance against gravity, abyss, and death.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_3:A5","CH_97E9_1C_3:A7","CH_97E9_1C_3:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:SD5","text":"Knowledge and suffering do not form separate spheres: the depth of seeing is determined by the depth of what it discloses as suffering.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_3:A9","CH_97E9_1C_3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:DNX1","text":"There is no secured self-transcendence exempt from the law of relapse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:DNX2","text":"There is no epistemic standpoint outside the abyss and suffering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:DNX3","text":"There is no passive form of compassion that could dissolve the depth produced by insight.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:DNX4","text":"There is no external instance from which the inner adversary could be definitively neutralized.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:DNX5","text":"There is no conclusive conceptual derivation that replaces the riddle structure with explanation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:DNX6","text":"There is no death that functions as the unconditional cessation of every further answer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:SNX1","text":"A final escape from gravity is excluded; only renewed attack remains available.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:SNX2","text":"A final reconciliation of ascent and fall is not achieved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:SNX3","text":"A position of knowledge free of suffering remains inaccessible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:SNX4","text":"No conclusive solution to the riddle is provided by any conceptual concluding formula.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:SNX5","text":"An affirmation of life beyond repetition, danger, and death is not opened up.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:FGS1","text":"Dangerous listening → suspension of silence → release of speech.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:FGS2","text":"Addressing the riddle → exclusion of linear explanation → indirect form of communication.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:FGS3","text":"Ascent → activation of gravity → return of the thrown self to itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:FGS4","text":"Threat of relapse → intensification of solitude → interruption through attacking courage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:FGS5","text":"Seeing the abyss → depth of suffering → transformation of vertigo, compassion, and death into objects of attack.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:FGS6","text":"Courage of attack → “ringing play” → renewed affirmability of life in the formula “Once more!”","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:AF1","text":"Expectation of the sailors → two-day silence → dangerous listening → tongue loosened.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:AF2","text":"Addressing the riddle → vision of the loneliest one → ascent against the spirit of gravity → threat of relapse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:AF3","text":"Inner oppression → decision “You! Or I!” → courage as attack → abyss, compassion, and death as resistances.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:AF4","text":"Human pain → ringing play → “Was that life?” → “Very well! Once more!”","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:ME1","text":"Listening is remapped from passive reception into a condition of linguistic production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:ME2","text":"The mountain path is remapped from an external place into a map of inner resistance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:ME3","text":"The adversary is reclassified from an external enemy into gravity operative within the self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:ME4","text":"Solitude is shifted from social absence to the structure of split self-reference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:ME5","text":"The abyss is classified simultaneously as a form of knowledge, a space of suffering, and a field of attack.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:ME6","text":"Courage becomes visible not as a character trait, but as the operative transformation of passivity into attack.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:ME7","text":"The time of life is mapped not as a one-time course, but as the possibility of renewed enactment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** A solitary ascent is dramatically articulated through a dwarf, gravity, and the formula of courage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** The text organizes ascent, relapse, solitude, abyss, and attack as functions of a model of inner resistance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** The argument rejects explanation and linear derivation and privileges riddle, listening, confrontation, and renewed attack.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Life, death, and suffering are arranged under a temporal form of repetition and renewed affirmation, without elaborating a complete doctrine of this repetition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from dangerous listening through inner gravity and courage to the formula of repetition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether the dwarf is to be understood as a psychic instance, a metaphysical adversary, or a rhetorical embodiment of gravity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:MRT3","text":"It likewise remains underdetermined whether “Once more!” asserts a cosmological return or merely denotes an existential readiness for repetition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0023","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:MRT4","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as gravity, abyss, and death are read as forms of pressure and courage as a counter-operation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:MRT5","text":"A central tension remains between the assertion that every thrown stone must fall and the assertion that courage can kill death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:MRT6","text":"A second tension arises from the fact that compassion is rejected as the deepest abyss, although precisely the deepest insight into life produces the deepest insight into suffering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_3:MRT7","text":"The machine is strongest in the concatenation of gravity, self-reference, solitude, and attack; its closure depends on metaphorical condensation and on the concluding formula that is not fully resolved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_3:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_1C_3@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_1C_3:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On the Vision and the Riddle","source_section_label":"1.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"On the Vision and the Riddle · 1","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On the Vision and the Riddle","1."],"original_title":"1."}],"source_title_context":"Vom Gesicht und Räthsel","source_section_label":"1.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"On the Vision and the Riddle · 1","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On the Vision and the Riddle","1."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 66","title":"On the Vision and the Riddle · 1","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Vom Gesicht und Räthsel · 1"},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3","layer":"CH","title":"On the Vision and the Riddle · 2","order":67,"parents":["RAW_97E9_2C_3"],"revision":"CH_97E9_2C_3@R001","sha256":"73cf36ea3be1b921cd46ace96d42330b7e2dd1e14bba540854fdc172b529655b","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:AS1","text":"Der Text setzt einen Gedanken ein, dessen Last den Zwerg übersteigt und dessen Tragbarkeit selbst zum Problem wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:AS2","text":"Der Augenblick wird als Torweg bestimmt, an dem Vergangenheit und Zukunft in entgegengesetzten Richtungen zusammenlaufen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:AS3","text":"Die zeitliche Opposition wird durch die Annahme einer ewigen Wiederkehr in eine Frage nach der Identität beider Wege überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:AS4","text":"Das abstrakte Zeitproblem kehrt als wiedererkanntes Heulen zurück und verwandelt die Spekulation in eine Vision.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:AS5","text":"Die Vision verkörpert die schwerste Belastung als Schlange im Schlund des Menschen und schließt ihre äußere Entfernung aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:AS6","text":"Die Selbsttötung der Schlange durch den Biss erzeugt die Verwandlung des Menschen in einen nichtmehrmenschlichen Lachenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:AS7","text":"Die Verwandlung bildet keinen Abschluss für Zarathustra, sondern erzeugt eine unstillbare Sehnsucht nach dem Lachen des Kommenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:A1","text":"Der abgründliche Gedanke übersteigt die Tragfähigkeit des Zwergs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:A2","text":"Der Augenblick ist ein Torweg, an dem zwei ewige Wege zusammenkommen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:A3","text":"Die beiden Wege verlaufen rückwärts und vorwärts und erscheinen zunächst als widersprüchliche Ewigkeiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:A4","text":"Was von allen Dingen geschehen kann, ist bereits geschehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:A5","text":"Alle Dinge sind so verknotet, dass der gegenwärtige Augenblick die kommenden Dinge nach sich zieht und sich selbst wieder einbezieht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:A6","text":"Der gegenwärtige Augenblick und die in ihm versammelten Dinge müssen bereits dagewesen sein und ewig wiederkommen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:A7","text":"Ein gegenwärtiges Heulen wiederholt ein in der Kindheit gehörtes Heulen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:A8","text":"Die Vision zeigt einen Menschen, in dessen Schlund eine schwarze, schwere Schlange eingedrungen ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:A9","text":"Die Schlange lässt sich durch äußeres Herausziehen nicht entfernen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:A10","text":"Die Schlange wird durch den Biss des Hirten aus dem eigenen Schlund ausgestoßen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:A11","text":"Der Biss verwandelt den Hirten aus dem Menschen in einen Umleuchteten, der auf nichtmenschliche Weise lacht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:A12","text":"Zarathustra bleibt von der Sehnsucht nach diesem Lachen verzehrt und findet weder im Weiterleben noch im Sterben Ruhe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:NX1","text":"Der Zwerg wird als Instanz ausgeschlossen, die den abgründlichen Gedanken tragen oder kennen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:NX2","text":"Die gerade Linie wird als Träger letzter Wahrheit ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:NX3","text":"Die bloße Formel, die Zeit sei ein Kreis, wird als zu leichte Lösung zurückgewiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:NX4","text":"Eine einmalige, nicht wiederkehrende Ordnung von Vergangenheit, Gegenwart und Zukunft wird ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:NX5","text":"Eine stabile Trennung zwischen Traum, Erwachen und Vision bleibt ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:NX6","text":"Die äußere Rettung des Menschen durch Entfernung der Schlange wird ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:NX7","text":"Der Hirte bleibt nach der Bewältigung der Schlange nicht Hirte und nicht Mensch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:NX8","text":"Das menschliche Lachen bildet keinen ausreichenden Endpunkt der Verwandlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:D1","text":"Die zeitliche Gegensätzlichkeit wird im Augenblick nicht aufgehoben, sondern an einem gemeinsamen Schwellenpunkt konzentriert.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_3:A2","CH_97E9_2C_3:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:D2","text":"Der Augenblick wird zum Knotenpunkt, an dem vergangene und kommende Ereignisse als wiederkehrende Folge zusammengezogen werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_3:A4","CH_97E9_2C_3:A5","CH_97E9_2C_3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:D3","text":"Die Wiederkehr wird nicht nur kosmologisch behauptet, sondern als Wiederkehr eines konkreten Wahrnehmungsereignisses dramatisiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_3:A6","CH_97E9_2C_3:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:D4","text":"Das abstrakte Zeitproblem kippt durch das Heulen aus der begrifflichen Erörterung in eine körperlich-szenische Vision.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_3:A7","CH_97E9_2C_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:D5","text":"Die Schlange verkörpert die schwerste und schwärzeste Last, die in das Innere des Menschen eindringen kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_3:A1","CH_97E9_2C_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:D6","text":"Weil die Schlange nicht von außen herausgezogen werden kann, wird die Überwindung als innere Selbsthandlung bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_3:A9","CH_97E9_2C_3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:D7","text":"Die Überwindung der Last erzeugt keine Rückkehr zum früheren Subjekt, sondern eine ontologische Verwandlung.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_3:A10","CH_97E9_2C_3:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:D8","text":"Das Lachen bezeichnet die gelungene Verwandlung, bleibt für Zarathustra jedoch ein entzogener Zustand.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_3:A11","CH_97E9_2C_3:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:SD1","text":"Die ewige Wiederkehr verwandelt den Augenblick in keinen Durchgangspunkt, sondern in eine wiederkehrende Totalstruktur, in der Anfang, Ende und Wiederholung zusammenfallen.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_3:A2","CH_97E9_2C_3:A4","CH_97E9_2C_3:A5","CH_97E9_2C_3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:SD2","text":"Der abgründliche Gedanke erhält seine volle Last erst dort, wo er als körperliche, verschlingende und nicht äußerlich ablösbare Belastung erscheint.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_3:A1","CH_97E9_2C_3:A6","CH_97E9_2C_3:A8","CH_97E9_2C_3:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:SD3","text":"Überwindung wird als gewaltsame Selbsttransformation erzeugt, nicht als Entfernung eines fremden Hindernisses.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_3:A9","CH_97E9_2C_3:A10","CH_97E9_2C_3:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:SD4","text":"Die Verwandlung erzeugt mit dem nichtmenschlichen Lachen ein Zukunftsbild, das die gegenwärtige Figur nicht besitzt, sondern nur ersehnt.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_3:A11","CH_97E9_2C_3:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:SD5","text":"Die Wiederkehr wird mit einer noch ausstehenden Verwandlung verschaltet: Alles kehrt wieder, aber die entscheidende Gestalt bleibt als kommendes Ereignis markiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_3:A6","CH_97E9_2C_3:A11","CH_97E9_2C_3:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:DNX1","text":"Eine lineare Zeit mit endgültigem Ursprung und endgültigem Ende muss falsch sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:DNX2","text":"Ein Standpunkt außerhalb der wiederkehrenden Verknotung aller Dinge darf nicht verfügbar sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:DNX3","text":"Die Wiederkehr darf nicht durch eine bloße Kreisformel erschöpfend erklärt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:DNX4","text":"Ein menschliches Subjekt, das der schwersten Last äußerlich gegenübersteht, kann die Verwandlung nicht vollziehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:DNX5","text":"Eine Interpretation, die die Vision abschließend in einen eindeutigen Begriff überführt, ist nicht vorgesehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:SNX1","text":"Eine endgültige Außenposition gegenüber der ewigen Wiederkehr bleibt unmöglich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:SNX2","text":"Eine Entlastung, die das Schwerste entfernt, ohne das Subjekt zu verändern, bleibt unzulässig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:SNX3","text":"Eine stabile menschliche Endgestalt der Überwindung bleibt abwesend; an ihre Stelle tritt ein nichtmenschliches Lachen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:SNX4","text":"Eine abschließende Antwort auf die Bedeutung der Vision bleibt versperrt und wird an die noch kommende Gestalt delegiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:FGS1","text":"Untragbarer Gedanke → hierarchische Konfrontation → Entlastung durch den Sprung des Zwergs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:FGS2","text":"Torweg des Augenblicks → zwei entgegengesetzte Ewigkeiten → Prüfung, ob der Widerspruch bei unendlicher Fortsetzung bestehen bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:FGS3","text":"Universalisierung des Geschehens → Verknotung aller Dinge → ewige Wiederkehr des Augenblicks samt seiner Elemente.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:FGS4","text":"Wiederholtes Heulen → Rücklauf der Erinnerung → Übergang von der Zeitthese zur visionären Szene.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:FGS5","text":"Schlange im Schlund → Scheitern äußerer Entfernung → Selbstbiss → Ausstoßung des Kopfes → Verwandlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:FGS6","text":"Nichtmenschliches Lachen → Entzug des erreichten Zustands → unstillbare Sehnsucht nach einer kommenden Gestalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:AF1","text":"Untragbarer abgründlicher Gedanke → Augenblick als gemeinsamer Torweg → zeitliche Opposition → Verknotung und ewige Wiederkehr → erinnerte Wiederholung im Heulen → Schlange als verkörperte Last → Selbstbiss als Überwindungsoperation → nichtmenschliches Lachen → offene Sehnsucht nach dem Kommenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:ME1","text":"Vergangenheit und Zukunft werden nicht mehr als getrennte Zeitbereiche, sondern als zwei Richtungen derselben wiederkehrenden Struktur kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:ME2","text":"Der Augenblick wird von einem flüchtigen Jetzt zu einem ontologischen Knotenpunkt umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:ME3","text":"Die abstrakte Zeitfrage wird in eine körperliche Szene übersetzt, in der Erkenntnis als Würgen, Ekel und Handlung erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:ME4","text":"Die Last wird von einem äußeren Hindernis zu einer inneren, selbst zu bearbeitenden Verschlingung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:ME5","text":"Überwindung wird nicht als Rückkehr zur Identität, sondern als Wechsel der Seinsform klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:ME6","text":"Der Abschluss des Arguments wird von einer erreichten Erkenntnis auf eine unerfüllte Sehnsucht nach einer zukünftigen Gestalt verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Dialog, Torweg, Heulen, Schlange, Biss und Lachen bilden die unmittelbar sichtbare Handlungsfolge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Zeit wird als verknotete Wiederkehr organisiert; die schwerste Last verlangt eine innere Selbstoperation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Die leichte Antwort des Zwergs wird der riskanten Aufgabe gegenübergestellt, einen Gedanken nicht nur zu formulieren, sondern zu tragen und zu verwandeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Vergangenheit, Gegenwart und Zukunft werden als wiederkehrende Richtungen eines einzigen zeitlichen Zusammenhangs bestimmt; das Subjekt kann diese Struktur nur durch Verwandlung bewohnen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von der Zeitfrage über die Wiederkehrthese zur Vision und zur Verwandlung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob die Wiederkehr als ontologische Wahrheit, als abgründiger Gedanke oder als visionäre Zumutung endgültig gelten soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:MRT3","text":"Intern kohärent ist die Struktur, sofern die Wiederkehrthese nicht mit der bloßen Kreisformel des Zwergs gleichgesetzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Verbindung liegt in der Kopplung von Zeitstruktur, körperlicher Last und Selbsttransformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:MRT5","text":"Die entscheidenden Bruchlinien liegen zwischen der behaupteten Totalität der Wiederkehr und der noch ausstehenden Zukunftsgestalt sowie zwischen vollzogener Verwandlung und Zarathustras fortbestehender Sehnsucht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0033","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0034","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0035","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, solange der Sprung vom erinnerten Heulen zur Vision und die offene Deutung des Lachens nicht als logisch vollständig bewiesene Schritte ausgegeben werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T190433998583Z_c390321e","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"2.","source_sha256":"73cf36ea3be1b921cd46ace96d42330b7e2dd1e14bba540854fdc172b529655b","sha256":"930a595aa69abed6c8e396e098bf20894125d511ffa70046ee35c30bf2ef4327","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:04:34.000955+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:AS1","text":"The text introduces a thought whose burden exceeds the dwarf and whose bearability itself becomes a problem.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:AS2","text":"The moment is determined as a gateway at which past and future converge in opposite directions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:AS3","text":"The temporal opposition is transformed, through the assumption of eternal recurrence, into a question concerning the identity of both paths.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:AS4","text":"The abstract problem of time returns as a recognized howling and transforms speculation into a vision.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:AS5","text":"The vision embodies the heaviest burden as a snake in the human being's gullet and excludes its external removal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:AS6","text":"The snake's self-destruction through the bite brings about the transformation of the human being into a no-longer-human laughing one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:AS7","text":"For Zarathustra, the transformation forms no conclusion, but produces an unappeasable longing for the laughter of what is to come.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:A1","text":"The abyssal thought exceeds the dwarf's capacity to bear it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:A2","text":"The moment is a gateway at which two eternal paths meet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:A3","text":"The two paths run backward and forward and initially appear as contradictory eternities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:A4","text":"Whatever can happen of all things has already happened.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:A5","text":"All things are so knotted together that the present moment draws the coming things after it and includes itself again.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:A6","text":"The present moment and the things gathered within it must already have been there and eternally recur.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:A7","text":"A present howling repeats a howling heard in childhood.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:A8","text":"The vision shows a human being into whose gullet a black, heavy snake has entered.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:A9","text":"The snake cannot be removed by external pulling-out.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:A10","text":"The snake is expelled from its own gullet by the shepherd's bite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:A11","text":"The bite transforms the shepherd from a human being into an illumined one, who laughs in a nonhuman manner.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:A12","text":"Zarathustra remains consumed by longing for this laughter and finds rest neither in continuing to live nor in dying.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:NX1","text":"The dwarf is excluded as an instance that could bear or know the abyssal thought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:NX2","text":"The straight line is excluded as the bearer of ultimate truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:NX3","text":"The mere formula that time is a circle is rejected as too easy a solution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:NX4","text":"A singular, nonrecurring order of past, present, and future is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:NX5","text":"A stable separation between dream, awakening, and vision remains excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:NX6","text":"The external rescue of the human being through removal of the snake is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:NX7","text":"After overcoming the snake, the shepherd remains neither shepherd nor human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:NX8","text":"Human laughter forms no sufficient endpoint of the transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:D1","text":"Temporal opposition is not annulled in the moment, but concentrated at a shared threshold point.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_3:A2","CH_97E9_2C_3:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:D2","text":"The moment becomes the nodal point at which past and coming events are drawn together as a recurring sequence.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_3:A4","CH_97E9_2C_3:A5","CH_97E9_2C_3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:D3","text":"Recurrence is not merely asserted cosmologically, but dramatized as the recurrence of a concrete event of perception.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_3:A6","CH_97E9_2C_3:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:D4","text":"Through the howling, the abstract problem of time tips from conceptual discussion into a corporeal-scenic vision.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_3:A7","CH_97E9_2C_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:D5","text":"The snake embodies the heaviest and blackest burden that can penetrate into the interior of the human being.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_3:A1","CH_97E9_2C_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:D6","text":"Because the snake cannot be pulled out from outside, overcoming is determined as an inner self-act.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_3:A9","CH_97E9_2C_3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:D7","text":"Overcoming the burden produces no return to the former subject, but an ontological transformation.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_3:A10","CH_97E9_2C_3:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:D8","text":"The laughter designates the successful transformation, but for Zarathustra remains a withdrawn state.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_3:A11","CH_97E9_2C_3:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:SD1","text":"Eternal recurrence transforms the moment not into a point of passage, but into a recurring total structure in which beginning, end, and repetition coincide.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_3:A2","CH_97E9_2C_3:A4","CH_97E9_2C_3:A5","CH_97E9_2C_3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:SD2","text":"The abyssal thought receives its full burden only where it appears as a corporeal, devouring, and not externally detachable affliction.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_3:A1","CH_97E9_2C_3:A6","CH_97E9_2C_3:A8","CH_97E9_2C_3:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:SD3","text":"Overcoming is produced as violent self-transformation, not as the removal of a foreign obstacle.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_3:A9","CH_97E9_2C_3:A10","CH_97E9_2C_3:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:SD4","text":"With nonhuman laughter, transformation produces an image of the future that the present figure does not possess, but only longs for.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_3:A11","CH_97E9_2C_3:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:SD5","text":"Recurrence is coupled with a transformation still outstanding: everything recurs, but the decisive figure remains marked as a coming event.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_3:A6","CH_97E9_2C_3:A11","CH_97E9_2C_3:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:DNX1","text":"A linear time with a final origin and a final end must be false.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:DNX2","text":"A standpoint outside the recurring knotting-together of all things must not be available.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:DNX3","text":"Recurrence must not be exhaustively explained by a mere circle formula.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:DNX4","text":"A human subject that stands externally opposed to the heaviest burden cannot accomplish the transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:DNX5","text":"An interpretation that conclusively translates the vision into a univocal concept is not intended.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:SNX1","text":"A final external position in relation to eternal recurrence remains impossible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:SNX2","text":"A relief that removes the heaviest thing without transforming the subject remains inadmissible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:SNX3","text":"A stable human final form of overcoming remains absent; in its place appears a nonhuman laughter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:SNX4","text":"A conclusive answer to the meaning of the vision remains barred and is delegated to the figure yet to come.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:FGS1","text":"Unbearable thought → hierarchical confrontation → relief through the dwarf's leap.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:FGS2","text":"Gateway of the moment → two opposed eternities → testing whether the contradiction persists under infinite continuation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:FGS3","text":"Universalization of occurrence → knotting-together of all things → eternal recurrence of the moment together with its elements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:FGS4","text":"Repeated howling → return of memory → transition from the time thesis to the visionary scene.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:FGS5","text":"Snake in the gullet → failure of external removal → self-bite → expulsion of the head → transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:FGS6","text":"Nonhuman laughter → withdrawal of the attained state → unappeasable longing for a coming figure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:AF1","text":"Unbearable abyssal thought → moment as shared gateway → temporal opposition → knotting-together and eternal recurrence → remembered repetition in the howling → snake as embodied burden → self-bite as operation of overcoming → nonhuman laughter → open longing for what is to come.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:ME1","text":"Past and future are no longer mapped as separate temporal domains, but as two directions of the same recurring structure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:ME2","text":"The moment is reclassified from a fleeting now into an ontological nodal point.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:ME3","text":"The abstract question of time is translated into a corporeal scene in which cognition appears as choking, disgust, and action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:ME4","text":"The burden is remapped from an external obstacle into an internal engulfment that must itself be worked upon.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:ME5","text":"Overcoming is classified not as a return to identity, but as a change in the mode of being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:ME6","text":"The conclusion of the argument is displaced from an attained cognition to an unfulfilled longing for a future figure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Dialogue, gateway, howling, snake, bite, and laughter form the immediately visible sequence of action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Time is organized as knotted recurrence; the heaviest burden demands an inner self-operation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** The dwarf's easy answer is juxtaposed with the risky task of not merely formulating a thought, but bearing and transforming it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Past, present, and future are determined as recurring directions of a single temporal nexus; the subject can inhabit this structure only through transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from the question of time through the recurrence thesis to the vision and to transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether recurrence is to count definitively as ontological truth, as an abyssal thought, or as a visionary imposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as the recurrence thesis is not equated with the dwarf's mere circle formula.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:MRT4","text":"Its strongest connection lies in the coupling of temporal structure, corporeal burden, and self-transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:MRT5","text":"The decisive fault lines lie between the asserted totality of recurrence and the future figure still outstanding, as well as between accomplished transformation and Zarathustra's continuing longing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0033","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0034","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0035","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_3:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument so long as the leap from the remembered howling to the vision and the open interpretation of laughter are not presented as logically fully proven steps.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_3:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_2C_3@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_2C_3:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On the Vision and the Riddle","source_section_label":"2.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"On the Vision and the Riddle · 2","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On the Vision and the Riddle","2."],"original_title":"2."}],"source_title_context":"Vom Gesicht und Räthsel","source_section_label":"2.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"On the Vision and the Riddle · 2","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On the Vision and the Riddle","2."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 67","title":"On the Vision and the Riddle · 2","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Vom Gesicht und Räthsel · 2"},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW","layer":"CH","title":"On Involuntary Bliss","order":68,"parents":["RAW_97E9_VDSW"],"revision":"CH_97E9_VDSW@R001","sha256":"fb7346fd8b134d72feb141655deb9311b8ff7c0769866631ee4c5d27a38ec615","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:AS1","text":"Die überwundene Bindung an Schmerz führt Zarathustra in eine gewählte Einsamkeit zurück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:AS2","text":"Gefährten und Kinder der Hoffnung werden nicht vorgefunden, sondern durch den Schaffenden hervorgebracht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:AS3","text":"Die hervorgebrachten Kinder müssen aus der gemeinsamen Pflanzung gelöst und durch Einsamkeit, Trotz, Vorsicht und Gefahr geprüft werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:AS4","text":"Ihre mögliche Gefährtenschaft und Mitschöpferschaft hängt von ihrer geprüften Fähigkeit zur Selbstbestimmung und Willensdauer ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:AS5","text":"Zarathustras eigene Vollendung bleibt an die Vollendung dieser Kinder gebunden und verlangt deshalb die Abkehr von Glück und Sicherheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:AS6","text":"Der noch nicht heraufgerufene Abgrund markiert die ausstehende letzte Prüfung, während die selige Stunde gerade durch ihre Zurückweisung wiederkehrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:AS7","text":"Die Verweigerung des Glücks erzeugt keine Abwesenheit des Glücks, sondern dessen paradoxe Annäherung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:A1","text":"Die Einsamkeit des Schaffenden ist eine gewollte Bedingung seiner weiteren Selbstwerdung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:A2","text":"Gefährten und Kinder der Hoffnung können nicht einfach gefunden werden; sie müssen geschaffen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:A3","text":"Liebe zum Kind und zum Werk bindet die Selbstliebe an einen zeugenden Prozess.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:A4","text":"Die gemeinsam wachsenden Kinder bilden zunächst eine zusammenstehende Pflanzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:A5","text":"Die Reifung jedes Kindes erfordert seine spätere Vereinzelung in Einsamkeit, Trotz und Vorsicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:A6","text":"Die Vereinzelten müssen sich an Sturm, Meer, Gebirge und wechselnder Wache bewähren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:A7","text":"Zugehörigkeit zu Zarathustras Art zeigt sich an langem Willen, schweigsamer Rede und einem Geben, das zugleich nimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:A8","text":"Das geprüfte Kind soll Gefährte, Mitschaffender und Mitfeiernder werden und Zarathustras Willen auf seine Tafeln schreiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:A9","text":"Zarathustra muss sich um seiner Kinder und ihresgleichen willen selbst vollenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:A10","text":"Selbstvollendung verlangt die Abkehr vom Glück und die Bereitschaft, sich dem Unglück als letzter Prüfung auszusetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:A11","text":"Das Begehren nach Liebe kann den Schaffenden zum Besitz seiner Kinder und damit zum Verlust seiner selbst machen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:A12","text":"Der abgründige Gedanke muss heraufgerufen und überwunden werden, bevor eine höhere Vollendung möglich ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:A13","text":"Zarathustra besitzt die Stärke zur letzten Heraufbeschwörung und zum letzten Kampf noch nicht vollständig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:A14","text":"Glück erscheint als tückische, unzeitige Seligkeit, die sich gerade demjenigen nähert, der ihr nicht nachläuft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:NX1","text":"Gefährtenschaft ist keine vorgefundene soziale Verfügbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:NX2","text":"Die gemeinsame Pflanzung ist keine endgültige Form der Kinder.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:NX3","text":"Nähe und gemeinsames Wachstum ersetzen nicht die Prüfung der Vereinzelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:NX4","text":"Liebe ist nicht ausschließlich Befreiung, sondern kann zur Schlinge des Begehrens werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:NX5","text":"Haben darf nicht in Begehren und Selbstverlust umschlagen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:NX6","text":"Glück ist kein verlässlicher Hafen, kein sicherer Frieden und kein unproblematisches Ziel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:NX7","text":"Zarathustra ist noch nicht in der letzten Prüfung und nicht in der endgültigen Vollendung angekommen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:NX8","text":"Der Abgrund ist nicht durch bloßes Mit-sich-Tragen bereits überwunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:D1","text":"Die Suche nach Gefährten wird in einen Prozess eigener Hervorbringung umgewandelt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSW:A1","CH_97E9_VDSW:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:D2","text":"Die Kinder fungieren zunächst als gemeinsame Lebensform, werden aber erst durch ihre spätere Trennung zu möglichen eigenständigen Trägern von Zarathustras Zukunft.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSW:A4","CH_97E9_VDSW:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:D3","text":"Die Vereinzelung ist kein Verlust der Kinder, sondern das Selektionsverfahren für ihre mögliche Zugehörigkeit zu Zarathustras Art.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSW:A5","CH_97E9_VDSW:A6","CH_97E9_VDSW:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:D4","text":"Gefährtenschaft entsteht erst nach bestandener Prüfung und bezeichnet dann eine gemeinsame Produktion, nicht bloße Begleitung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSW:A7","CH_97E9_VDSW:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:D5","text":"Zarathustras Selbstvollendung ist relational organisiert, weil sie durch die Hervorbringung und Bewährung anderer Schaffender vermittelt wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSW:A2","CH_97E9_VDSW:A8","CH_97E9_VDSW:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:D6","text":"Das Begehren nach Liebe bedroht gerade jene schöpferische Selbstständigkeit, die durch Liebe zu Kindern und Werk hervorgebracht wurde.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSW:A3","CH_97E9_VDSW:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:D7","text":"Unglück und Abgrund erhalten die Funktion einer Initiationsprüfung, weil Glück und Sicherheit die Vollendung unterbrechen würden.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSW:A10","CH_97E9_VDSW:A12","CH_97E9_VDSW:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:D8","text":"Die Zurückweisung der seligen Stunde verhindert ihre Aufhebung nicht, sondern lässt sie als nachfolgende Macht wiederkehren.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSW:A10","CH_97E9_VDSW:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:SD1","text":"Vollendung bildet keinen erreichten Endzustand, sondern eine rekursive Erzeugungsordnung, in der der Schaffende Kinder hervorbringt, damit diese selbst zu Mitschaffenden werden und dadurch seine eigene Vollendung ermöglichen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSW:A2","CH_97E9_VDSW:A8","CH_97E9_VDSW:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:SD2","text":"Autonomie wird nicht gegen Beziehung, sondern durch die gewaltsame Unterbrechung unmittelbarer Nähe erzeugt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSW:A4","CH_97E9_VDSW:A5","CH_97E9_VDSW:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:SD3","text":"Das System verwandelt Schmerz, Unglück und Unsicherheit von bloßen Widerständen in Prüfmedien der schöpferischen Rangordnung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSW:A6","CH_97E9_VDSW:A10","CH_97E9_VDSW:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:SD4","text":"Die Verweigerung des Glücks bleibt in der Logik des Glücks gefangen, weil das abgewiesene Glück gerade dadurch zum aktiven Verfolger wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSW:A10","CH_97E9_VDSW:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:SD5","text":"Die zeitliche Struktur der Vollendung bleibt offen: Ein angekündigtes Siegel der Vollendung wird vorausgesetzt, aber durch die ausstehende letzte Prüfung ständig aufgeschoben.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSW:A9","CH_97E9_VDSW:A12","CH_97E9_VDSW:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:DNX1","text":"Falsch ist die Annahme, dass schöpferische Gefährtenschaft durch bloßes Finden oder durch soziale Nähe verfügbar wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:DNX2","text":"Falsch ist die Annahme, dass gemeinsame Herkunft oder gemeinsames Wachstum bereits eigenständige Stärke erzeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:DNX3","text":"Falsch ist die Annahme, dass Liebe den Schaffenden ohne Gefahr an seine Kinder bindet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:DNX4","text":"Falsch ist die Annahme, dass Besitz Sicherheit erzeugt, ohne in Begehren und Selbstverlust umzuschlagen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:DNX5","text":"Falsch ist die Annahme, dass Glück mit Selbstvollendung ohne Spannung vereinbar ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:DNX6","text":"Falsch ist die Annahme, dass das Mittragen des Abgrunds seiner Heraufbeschwörung und Überwindung gleichkommt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:DNX7","text":"Falsch ist die Annahme, dass die eigene Art durch Abstammung genügt; sie muss durch Prüfung bestätigt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine endgültige Einheit von Einsamkeit und Gefährtenschaft ohne vermittelnde Trennung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Vollendung, die zugleich sicher, glücklich und abgeschlossen wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Möglichkeit, Kinder zu besitzen, ohne sie freizusetzen und dabei die eigene Bindung an sie zu riskieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein letzter Zustand, in dem der Abgrund nicht mehr als noch ausstehende Prüfung wirksam bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:SNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine eindeutige Entscheidung zwischen Glück als Ziel und Glück als Gefahr; diese Unentscheidbarkeit trägt die Schlussbewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0033","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0036","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0039","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:FGS1","text":"Gewählte Einsamkeit und überwundener Schmerz erzeugen die Position des Schaffenden außerhalb unmittelbarer Gefährtenschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:FGS2","text":"Der Mangel an vorgefundenen Gefährten wird durch die Hervorbringung von Kindern und Werken ersetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:FGS3","text":"Die anfängliche gemeinsame Pflanzung wird in individuelle Vereinzelung überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:FGS4","text":"Vereinzelung unter Gefahr erzeugt Prüfung; Prüfung selektiert langen Willen, Schweigen, Nachgiebigkeit und Zugehörigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:FGS5","text":"Bewährte Kinder werden zu Mitschaffenden; ihre mögliche Mitschöpferschaft vermittelt die Selbstvollendung des ursprünglichen Schaffenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:FGS6","text":"Die Bindung an Kinder erzeugt die Gefahr des Selbstverlusts; diese Gefahr erzwingt die Wendung von Glück zu Unglück und vom Besitz zum Verzicht auf Begehren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:FGS7","text":"Der noch nicht heraufgerufene Abgrund hält die Vollendung offen; die Zurückweisung der Seligkeit kehrt als Annäherung des Glücks zurück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:AF1","text":"Rätsel und Bitternis → überwundener Schmerz → gewählte Einsamkeit → selbstgeschaffene Kinder → Aufhebung der gemeinsamen Pflanzung → Vereinzelung und Prüfung → mögliche Mitschöpferschaft → Selbstvollendung durch Unglück → ausstehender Abgrund → Zurückweisung der Seligkeit → Verfolgung durch das Glück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:AF2","text":"Die anfängliche Suche nach Gefährten wird in eine rekursive Ordnung überführt, in der der Schaffende andere Schaffende hervorbringt, um selbst vollendet zu werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:AF3","text":"Die Verneinung des Glücks erzeugt als Schlussfigur nicht dessen Verschwinden, sondern seine paradoxe Rückkehr.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:ME1","text":"Der Begriff des Gefährten wird vom vorgefundenen Gegenüber auf den hervorgebrachten und geprüften Mitschaffenden verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:ME2","text":"Gemeinschaft wird als vorläufige Wachstumsform klassifiziert, deren Funktion in der Hervorbringung von Vereinzelten liegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:ME3","text":"Prüfung wird von einer bloßen Belastung zu einem Verfahren der ontologischen und schöpferischen Auswahl umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:ME4","text":"Unglück wird vom negativen Gegenpol des Glücks zum notwendigen Medium der Vollendung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:ME5","text":"Glück wird vom Zielzustand zur tückischen, unzeitigen und verfolgenden Macht umgezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:ME6","text":"Vollendung wird vom individuellen Endpunkt auf eine zirkuläre Beziehung zwischen Schöpfer, Werk und künftigen Mitschöpfern verteilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:ALT1","text":"Surface — Zarathustra steht allein am Meer, betrachtet seine Kinder, weist die selige Stunde zurück und wartet auf das Unglück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:ALT2","text":"Structural — Das Verhältnis von Schaffendem, Kindern, Vereinzelung, Prüfung und Mitschöpferschaft organisiert die Produktion zukünftiger Gefährten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Glück, Sicherheit und unmittelbare Nähe werden zurückgewiesen, damit Unglück, Distanz und Prüfung als Bedingungen höherer Schöpfung fungieren können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Sein wird als Werden durch Prüfung bestimmt; Vollendung liegt in der Zukunft, bleibt vom letzten Kampf abhängig und erzeugt sich rekursiv durch andere Werdende.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von Einsamkeit über Hervorbringung und Prüfung bis zur paradoxen Rückkehr des Glücks zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob die Kinder primär Werke, Lehren, Nachfolger oder personale Gefährten sind; der Text hält diese Ebenen metaphorisch zusammen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:MRT3","text":"Die Spannung zwischen gewollter Einsamkeit und gewünschter Gefährtenschaft wird durch die Figur der Mitschöpferschaft vermittelt, aber nicht aufgehoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:MRT4","text":"Liebe ist zugleich Ursprung der Schöpfung und Gefahr der Gefangenschaft; die Differenz zwischen Haben und Begehren bleibt nur partiell geklärt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:MRT5","text":"Die Vollendung wird als notwendiges Ziel behauptet, bleibt aber durch den nicht bewältigten Abgrund und den ausstehenden letzten Kampf suspendiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:MRT6","text":"Die Zurückweisung des Glücks und seine anschließende Annäherung erzeugen einen unaufgelösten Widerspruch zwischen strategischer Verweigerung und faktischer Wiederkehr.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0036","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0039","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, sofern die Bildfelder von Pflanzung, Schwangerschaft, Leuchtturm, Abgrund und Weiblichkeit als operative Strukturträger und nicht als bloße Ausschmückung behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T194719654755Z_2a1bcd28","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"On Blessedness Against One's Will","source_sha256":"fb7346fd8b134d72feb141655deb9311b8ff7c0769866631ee4c5d27a38ec615","sha256":"423134fbf3ebda65ceb4a84213545f2dbb41e9c3c983cb516db483a151096ee3","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:47:19.656949+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:AS1","text":"The overcome attachment to pain leads Zarathustra back into a chosen solitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:AS2","text":"Companions and children of hope are not found but brought forth by the creator.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:AS3","text":"The children brought forth must be released from the common planting and tested through solitude, defiance, caution, and danger.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:AS4","text":"Their possible companionship and co-creation depend on their tested capacity for self-determination and endurance of will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:AS5","text":"Zarathustra's own completion remains bound to the completion of these children and therefore demands the turning away from happiness and security.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:AS6","text":"The abyss not yet summoned marks the pending final trial, while the blessed hour returns precisely through its rejection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:AS7","text":"The refusal of happiness produces not the absence of happiness, but its paradoxical approach.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:A1","text":"The creator's solitude is a willed condition of his further self-becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:A2","text":"Companions and children of hope cannot simply be found; they must be created.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:A3","text":"Love of the child and of the work binds self-love to a generative process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:A4","text":"The children growing together initially form a standing-together planting.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:A5","text":"The maturation of each child requires its subsequent individuation in solitude, defiance, and caution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:A6","text":"The individuated ones must prove themselves against storm, sea, mountains, and changing watch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:A7","text":"Belonging to Zarathustra's kind is shown in long will, silent speech, and a giving that also takes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:A8","text":"The tested child is to become companion, co-creator, and co-celebrant, and write Zarathustra's will upon its tablets.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:A9","text":"Zarathustra must complete himself for the sake of his children and their like.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:A10","text":"Self-completion demands the turning away from happiness and readiness to expose oneself to misfortune as the final trial.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:A11","text":"The desire for love can make the creator the possession of his children and thereby lead to the loss of himself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:A12","text":"The abysmal thought must be summoned and overcome before a higher completion is possible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:A13","text":"Zarathustra does not yet fully possess the strength for the final conjuration and the final struggle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:A14","text":"Happiness appears as treacherous, untimely blessedness that approaches precisely the one who does not pursue it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:NX1","text":"Companionship is not a socially available thing already found.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:NX2","text":"The common planting is not the children's final form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:NX3","text":"Proximity and common growth do not replace the trial of the individuated ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:NX4","text":"Love is not exclusively liberation, but can become the snare of desire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:NX5","text":"Having must not turn into desire and self-loss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:NX6","text":"Happiness is no reliable harbor, no secure peace, and no unproblematic goal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:NX7","text":"Zarathustra has not yet arrived at the final trial or at definitive completion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:NX8","text":"The abyss is not already overcome merely by being carried with oneself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:D1","text":"The search for companions is transformed into a process of one's own bringing-forth.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSW:A1","CH_97E9_VDSW:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:D2","text":"The children initially function as a common form of life, but only through their subsequent separation do they become possible independent bearers of Zarathustra's future.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSW:A4","CH_97E9_VDSW:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:D3","text":"Individuation is not a loss of the children, but the selection procedure for their possible belonging to Zarathustra's kind.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSW:A5","CH_97E9_VDSW:A6","CH_97E9_VDSW:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:D4","text":"Companionship arises only after the trial has been passed and then denotes a common production, not mere accompaniment.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSW:A7","CH_97E9_VDSW:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:D5","text":"Zarathustra's self-completion is relationally organized because it is mediated by the bringing-forth and proving of other creators.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSW:A2","CH_97E9_VDSW:A8","CH_97E9_VDSW:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:D6","text":"The desire for love threatens precisely that creative independence which was brought forth through love of children and work.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSW:A3","CH_97E9_VDSW:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:D7","text":"Misfortune and the abyss acquire the function of an initiation trial because happiness and security would interrupt completion.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSW:A10","CH_97E9_VDSW:A12","CH_97E9_VDSW:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:D8","text":"The rejection of the blessed hour does not prevent its sublation, but lets it return as a following power.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSW:A10","CH_97E9_VDSW:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:SD1","text":"Completion constitutes not an attained final state, but a recursive order of generation in which the creator brings forth children so that they themselves become co-creators and thereby make possible his own completion.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSW:A2","CH_97E9_VDSW:A8","CH_97E9_VDSW:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:SD2","text":"Autonomy is produced not against relation, but through the violent interruption of immediate proximity.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSW:A4","CH_97E9_VDSW:A5","CH_97E9_VDSW:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:SD3","text":"The system transforms pain, misfortune, and uncertainty from mere resistances into media of trial for the creative order of rank.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSW:A6","CH_97E9_VDSW:A10","CH_97E9_VDSW:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:SD4","text":"The refusal of happiness remains trapped in the logic of happiness because the rejected happiness thereby becomes an active pursuer.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSW:A10","CH_97E9_VDSW:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:SD5","text":"The temporal structure of completion remains open: an announced seal of completion is presupposed, but is continually deferred by the pending final trial.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDSW:A9","CH_97E9_VDSW:A12","CH_97E9_VDSW:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:DNX1","text":"False is the assumption that creative companionship becomes available through mere finding or through social proximity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:DNX2","text":"False is the assumption that common origin or common growth already produces independent strength.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:DNX3","text":"False is the assumption that love binds the creator to his children without danger.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:DNX4","text":"False is the assumption that possession produces security without turning into desire and self-loss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:DNX5","text":"False is the assumption that happiness is compatible with self-completion without tension.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:DNX6","text":"False is the assumption that carrying the abyss along with oneself is equivalent to its conjuration and overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:DNX7","text":"False is the assumption that one's own kind suffices by descent; it must be confirmed through trial.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a definitive unity of solitude and companionship without mediating separation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:SNX2","text":"Excluded is a completion that would be at once secure, happy, and concluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:SNX3","text":"Excluded is the possibility of possessing children without releasing them and thereby risking one's own attachment to them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:SNX4","text":"Excluded is a final state in which the abyss no longer remains effective as a still-pending trial.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:SNX5","text":"Excluded is an unambiguous decision between happiness as goal and happiness as danger; this undecidability bears the concluding movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0033","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0036","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0039","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:FGS1","text":"Chosen solitude and overcome pain produce the position of the creator outside immediate companionship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:FGS2","text":"The lack of companions already found is replaced by the bringing-forth of children and works.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:FGS3","text":"The initial common planting is transferred into individual individuation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:FGS4","text":"Individuation under danger produces trial; trial selects long will, silence, yieldingness, and belonging.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:FGS5","text":"Proven children become co-creators; their possible co-creation mediates the self-completion of the original creator.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:FGS6","text":"Attachment to children produces the danger of self-loss; this danger compels the turn from happiness to misfortune and from possession to the renunciation of desire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:FGS7","text":"The abyss not yet summoned keeps completion open; the rejection of blessedness returns as the approach of happiness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:AF1","text":"Riddle and bitterness → overcome pain → chosen solitude → self-created children → sublation of the common planting → individuation and trial → possible co-creation → self-completion through misfortune → pending abyss → rejection of blessedness → pursuit by happiness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:AF2","text":"The initial search for companions is transferred into a recursive order in which the creator brings forth other creators in order to become completed himself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:AF3","text":"The negation of happiness produces, as its concluding figure, not its disappearance but its paradoxical return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:ME1","text":"The concept of the companion is shifted from the counterpart already found to the co-creator who has been brought forth and tested.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:ME2","text":"Community is classified as a provisional form of growth whose function lies in the bringing-forth of individuated ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:ME3","text":"Trial is remapped from a mere burden into a procedure of ontological and creative selection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:ME4","text":"Misfortune is reclassified from the negative opposite pole of happiness into the necessary medium of completion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:ME5","text":"Happiness is redrawn from a goal state into a treacherous, untimely, and pursuing power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:ME6","text":"Completion is distributed from the individual endpoint across a circular relation between creator, work, and future co-creators.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:ALT1","text":"Surface — Zarathustra stands alone by the sea, contemplates his children, rejects the blessed hour, and awaits misfortune.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:ALT2","text":"Structural — The relation of creator, children, individuation, trial, and co-creation organizes the production of future companions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Happiness, security, and immediate proximity are rejected so that misfortune, distance, and trial can function as conditions of higher creation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Being is determined as becoming through trial; completion lies in the future, remains dependent on the final struggle, and recursively generates itself through other beings-in-becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from solitude through bringing-forth and trial to the paradoxical return of happiness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether the children are primarily works, teachings, successors, or personal companions; the text holds these levels together metaphorically.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:MRT3","text":"The tension between willed solitude and desired companionship is mediated by the figure of co-creation, but not sublated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:MRT4","text":"Love is at once the origin of creation and the danger of captivity; the difference between having and desiring remains only partially clarified.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:MRT5","text":"Completion is asserted as a necessary goal, but remains suspended by the abyss not mastered and the pending final struggle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:MRT6","text":"The rejection of happiness and its subsequent approach produce an unresolved contradiction between strategic refusal and factual return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0036","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0039","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDSW:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument insofar as the image-fields of planting, pregnancy, lighthouse, abyss, and femininity are treated as operative bearers of structure and not as mere embellishment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDSW:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_VDSW@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_VDSW:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 68","title":"On Involuntary Bliss","context":"Chapter 68","original_title":"Von der Seligkeit wider Willen","original_context":"Chapter 68"},"original_title":"Von der Seligkeit wider Willen","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0","layer":"CH","title":"Before Sunrise","order":69,"parents":["RAW_97E9_VSA0"],"revision":"CH_97E9_VSA0@R001","sha256":"87057add93c264893f67cb5a1917df7039bb89eec4a4e025337f0c9e4bf10638","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:AS1","text":"Die Rede bearbeitet die Frage, wie ein unbedingtes Ja zur Welt möglich wird, wenn Zweck, Schuld, Gut und Böse sowie ein ewiger Wille keinen letzten Grund liefern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:AS2","text":"Sie verfährt als metaphysische Umwertung und strategische Selbstformung: Aus der Beziehung zum reinen Himmel wird eine neue Weise des Erkennens und Wertens gewonnen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:AS3","text":"Unmittelbare Stille und Verhüllung werden als höhere Formen gemeinsamer Erkenntnis bestimmt, während Vermittlung, Mischung und Halbheit als Verunreinigung erscheinen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:AS4","text":"Die Zurückweisung der ziehenden Wolken erzwingt die Entscheidung zwischen Segnen und Fluchen und führt zur Befreiung der Hände für das Segnen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:AS5","text":"Das Segnen überführt jedes Ding unter seinen eigenen Himmel und ersetzt Zweck, ewigen Willen und universale Vernunft durch Zufall, Unschuld, Ohngefähr und Übermuth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:AS6","text":"Mit dem nahenden Tag endet nicht die Tiefe der Welt, sondern die gemeinsame Rede; die Offenbarung bleibt an Schweigen, Zeit und Trennung gebunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:A1","text":"Höhe und Tiefe werden in der Beziehung zum Himmel ineinander übersetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:A2","text":"Verhüllung kann Schönheit offenbaren, und Schweigen kann Weisheit verkünden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:A3","text":"Gemeinsames Wissen bedarf keiner sprachlichen Mitteilung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:A4","text":"Wandern und Bergsteigen sind nur Notbehelfe gegenüber dem eigentlichen Willen zum Flug in den Himmel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:A5","text":"Die ziehenden Wolken verkörpern Vermittlung, Mischung und Halbheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:A6","text":"Vermittlung entzieht dem Sprecher und dem Himmel das gemeinsame uneingeschränkte Ja und Amen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:A7","text":"Unentschiedenheit ist unzulässig; wer nicht segnen kann, soll fluchen lernen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:A8","text":"Segnen heißt, über jedem Ding als dessen eigener Himmel, rundes Dach und azurne Glocke zu stehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:A9","text":"Alle Dinge sind am Born der Ewigkeit und jenseits von Gut und Böse getauft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:A10","text":"Der Himmel über den Dingen besteht aus Zufall, Unschuld, Ohngefähr und Übermuth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:A11","text":"Zweckbindung ist Knechtschaft, und die Rückgabe des Ohngefährs ist eine Befreiung der Dinge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:A12","text":"Über den Dingen und durch sie will kein ewiger Wille.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:A13","text":"Vernünftigkeit als universales Prinzip ist unmöglich, obwohl ein begrenztes Maß an Weisheit in allen Dingen enthalten bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:A14","text":"Die in den Dingen enthaltene Weisheit steht im Dienst der Narrheit, und die Dinge tanzen auf den Füßen des Zufalls.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:A15","text":"Die Welt ist tiefer, als der Tag gedacht hat, und nicht alles darf vor dem Tag Worte haben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:NX1","text":"Das reine Himmelsverhältnis darf nicht durch ziehende Wolken befleckt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:NX2","text":"Mittler, Mischer und Halb- und Halbe werden als unzulässige Formen der Beziehung ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:NX3","text":"Zweifelnde, zögernde und leisetretende Ruhe gilt nicht als höhere Haltung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:NX4","text":"Zweck, Zwang und Schuld werden aus dem Raum des wolkenlosen Segnens entfernt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:NX5","text":"Gut und Böse werden als letzte ontologische Instanzen zurückgewiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:NX6","text":"Ein ewiger Wille als kosmische Steuerungsinstanz wird ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:NX7","text":"Eine durchgängige Vernünftigkeit aller Dinge wird ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:NX8","text":"Der Tag wird als vollständige und sofortige Artikulation der Welt zurückgewiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:NX9","text":"Bergsteigen und Wandern werden als endgültige Erfüllung des Willens zum Himmel ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:D1","text":"Schweigen und Verhüllung erscheinen nicht als Mangel an Erkenntnis, sondern als deren privilegierte Form.","refs":["CH_97E9_VSA0:A2","CH_97E9_VSA0:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:D2","text":"Das Wandern wird als Symptom einer noch nicht verwirklichten Flugbewegung bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VSA0:A1","CH_97E9_VSA0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:D3","text":"Vermittlung ist nicht neutral, sondern ein aktiver Entzug des gemeinsamen Ja und Amen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VSA0:A5","CH_97E9_VSA0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:D4","text":"Die Alternative zu bedächtiger Unsicherheit ist nicht bloß Zustimmung, sondern die entschiedene Fähigkeit zu segnen oder zu fluchen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VSA0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:D5","text":"Das Segnen universalisiert die Affirmation, indem es jedem Ding einen eigenen Himmel zuspricht.","refs":["CH_97E9_VSA0:A8","CH_97E9_VSA0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:D6","text":"Die Umwertung befreit die Dinge, indem sie ihren Wert nicht mehr aus Zweck, sondern aus Zufall und Ohngefähr ableitet.","refs":["CH_97E9_VSA0:A10","CH_97E9_VSA0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:D7","text":"Die Welt wird als nichtteleologischer Zusammenhang bestimmt, in dem weder ewiger Wille noch universale Vernünftigkeit regieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_VSA0:A12","CH_97E9_VSA0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:D8","text":"Zufall wird vom Mangel an Ordnung in einen tragenden Bewegungsgrund des Tanzes umgewertet.","refs":["CH_97E9_VSA0:A13","CH_97E9_VSA0:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:D9","text":"Die bevorstehende Trennung beendet die Mitteilung, ohne die Tiefe der Welt auf eine abschließende Aussage zu reduzieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_VSA0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:SD1","text":"Der Grund des Wertes verschiebt sich von kosmischer Ordnung und Zweckmäßigkeit auf die Fähigkeit, Kontingenz unbedingt zu bejahen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VSA0:A7","CH_97E9_VSA0:A10","CH_97E9_VSA0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:SD2","text":"Die Rede unterscheidet unmittelbare Beziehung und Vermittlung nicht nach Nähe und Ferne, sondern nach Offenbarung und Verunreinigung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VSA0:A2","CH_97E9_VSA0:A3","CH_97E9_VSA0:A5","CH_97E9_VSA0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:SD3","text":"Freiheit wird nicht als Herrschaft des Subjekts über die Dinge, sondern als Befreiung der Dinge von ihrem Zweck bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VSA0:A8","CH_97E9_VSA0:A10","CH_97E9_VSA0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:SD4","text":"Die universale Affirmation bleibt von einer aggressiven Ausschließung der Halbheit abhängig.","refs":["CH_97E9_VSA0:A6","CH_97E9_VSA0:A7","CH_97E9_VSA0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:SD5","text":"Erkenntnis besitzt eine zeitliche Schichtung: Das Schweigen offenbart vor dem Tag, während der Tag die Rede beendet, ohne die Welt auszuschöpfen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VSA0:A2","CH_97E9_VSA0:A3","CH_97E9_VSA0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:SD6","text":"Sicherheit wird nicht durch teleologische Garantie, sondern durch die segnende Überwölbung kontingenter Dinge erzeugt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VSA0:A8","CH_97E9_VSA0:A10","CH_97E9_VSA0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:DNX1","text":"Das System kann nicht auf einem letzten Warum beruhen, das jedem Ding seinen Zweck vorschreibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:DNX2","text":"Es kann keine transzendente moralische Instanz voraussetzen, die Gut und Böse endgültig stabilisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:DNX3","text":"Es kann keine neutrale Mitte zwischen unbedingtem Segnen und entschiedener Verwerfung anerkennen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:DNX4","text":"Es kann keine vollständige Transparenz der Welt durch den Tag oder durch öffentliche Sprache zulassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:DNX5","text":"Es kann Weisheit nicht an eine von Narrheit und Zufall unabhängige Vernunft binden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:DNX6","text":"Es kann die Affirmation nicht als autonome Leistung eines isolierten Subjekts verstehen; sie bleibt an die Gegenwart des Himmels gebunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:SNX1","text":"Die Kraft der Rede beruht auf der Abwesenheit eines letzten teleologischen Grundes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein unentschiedener Zwischenraum, in dem weder Segen noch Fluch, weder Ja noch Nein vollständig gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Welt, deren gesamter Sinn gleichzeitig, öffentlich und erschöpfend artikulierbar wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein von Himmel, Scham, Reinheit und Tiefe unabhängiger Sinnhorizont.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:SNX5","text":"Unaufgelöst bleibt die Möglichkeit einer universalen Affirmation, die nicht zugleich durch Ausschluss, Abscheu und Verwerfung konstituiert wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:FGS1","text":"Himmelbeziehung → Umkehrung von Höhe und Tiefe → Verhüllung und Schweigen als Offenbarung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:FGS2","text":"Gemeinsame Stille und geteiltes Wissen → Überschreitung von Zwang, Zweck und Schuld → Wandern als bloßer Notbehelf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:FGS3","text":"Ziehende Wolken → Klassifikation von Vermittlung als Mischung und Halbheit → Entzug des gemeinsamen Ja und Amen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:FGS4","text":"Ausschluss der Halbheit → Entscheidung für Segnen oder Fluchen → Befreiung der Hände → Entstehung des segnenden Ja-Sagers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:FGS5","text":"Segnen → Überwölbung jedes Dings durch seinen eigenen Himmel → Relativierung von Gut und Böse zu Schatten und Wolken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:FGS6","text":"Überwölbung → Ersetzung von Zweck, ewigem Willen und universaler Vernunft durch Zufall, Unschuld, Ohngefähr und Übermuth → tanzende Kontingenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:FGS7","text":"Nahender Tag → Begrenzung der Mitteilbarkeit → Trennung der Sprecher → Erhaltung der Welttiefe als nicht vollständig ausgesprochene Tiefe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:AF1","text":"Verhüllte Himmelserkenntnis → gemeinsame wortlose Beziehung → Wandern als unzureichender Ersatz für Flug → Wolken als verderbliche Vermittlung → Ausschluss der Halbheit → Freisetzung des Segnens → Überwölbung jedes Dings → Rückgabe von Zufall und Ohngefähr → Aufhebung von Zweck, ewigem Willen und universaler Vernunft → zeitliche Begrenzung durch den kommenden Tag.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:ME1","text":"Der Himmel wird von einer transzendenten Herrschaftsinstanz zu einem immanenten Feld kontingenter Dinge umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:ME2","text":"Zufall und Ohngefähr werden von Defizitbegriffen zu Formen des ältesten Adels und der Unschuld umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:ME3","text":"Gut, Böse, Zweck und ewiger Wille werden in einer gemeinsamen Kategorie vergänglicher Verdunkelungen zusammengeführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:ME4","text":"Affirmation wird nicht mehr als bloßes Gegenstück zur Verneinung, sondern als Gegensatz zur vermittelnden Halbheit bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:ME5","text":"Schweigen und Verhüllung werden als Erkenntnisformen sichtbar, die der vollständigen Tageshelligkeit vorausliegen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:ME6","text":"Das handelnde Subjekt wird vom Wandernden und Ringenden zum segnenden Überwölber der Dinge umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:ALT1","text":"Surface — Die Rede richtet sich an den reinen, hohen und schamhaften Himmel und vollzieht vor dem Tag eine Trennung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:ALT2","text":"Structural — Wolken, Mittler und Halb- und Halbe organisieren die negative Mechanik der Vermittlung; Zweck, Schuld und Moral fungieren als Formen der Knechtschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text ersetzt zögernde Distanz durch die strategische Entscheidung zum Segnen oder Fluchen und macht aus innerem Ringen eine Freisetzung zur Affirmation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Die Welt wird als kontingent, nichtteleologisch und jenseits von Gut und Böse bestimmt; ihre Tiefe übersteigt die Artikulationsmacht des kommenden Tages.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von wortloser Himmelsbeziehung über die Ablehnung der Vermittlung zur kosmologischen Affirmation des Zufalls zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob der Himmel als Gottheit, kosmische Instanz, Bild des Seins oder relationale Gegenfigur zu verstehen ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist als Umwertungsmaschine kohärent, aber nicht als vollständig widerspruchsfreie Ontologie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0029","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Verbindung liegt in der Überführung der Polemik gegen die Wolken in die Befreiung der Dinge vom Zweck.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:MRT5","text":"Die Rede behauptet zugleich Kontingenz und ewige Sicherheit; sie vermittelt diesen Gegensatz durch die Form des Segnens, löst ihn aber nicht begrifflich auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:MRT6","text":"Die Zurückweisung universaler Vernunft bleibt an die Annahme eines begrenzten Weisheitsrestes gebunden, der der Narrheit dient.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0029","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:MRT7","text":"Die Aufhebung von Gut und Böse erzeugt weiterhin normative Rangordnungen zwischen Reinheit, Segen, Halbheit und Befleckung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, sofern die Bildfelder Himmel, Wolke, Licht und Tag als Operationen und nicht als bloße Ornamente behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:MRT9","text":"Die Kompression verliert die affektive Gewalt der Rede, nicht jedoch ihre generative Abfolge von Offenbarung, Ausschluss, Entscheidung, Umwertung und zeitlicher Schließung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T195343045047Z_e5eee1a4","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Before Sunrise","source_sha256":"87057add93c264893f67cb5a1917df7039bb89eec4a4e025337f0c9e4bf10638","sha256":"889173b5402fe26ff572fb979cadcb2a8c6dfdd278adf47cdf6d481973e61b48","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:53:43.046308+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:AS1","text":"The discourse addresses the question of how an unconditional Yes to the world becomes possible when purpose, guilt, good and evil, as well as an eternal will, provide no ultimate ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:AS2","text":"It proceeds as a metaphysical revaluation and strategic self-formation: from the relation to the pure heaven, a new mode of knowing and valuing is gained.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:AS3","text":"Immediate silence and veiling are determined as higher forms of shared knowledge, whereas mediation, mixture, and halfness appear as contamination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:AS4","text":"The rejection of the passing clouds compels the decision between blessing and cursing and leads to the freeing of the hands for blessing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:AS5","text":"Blessing places every thing beneath its own heaven and replaces purpose, eternal will, and universal reason with chance, innocence, happenstance, and high-spiritedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:AS6","text":"With the approaching day, not the depth of the world but the shared discourse comes to an end; revelation remains bound to silence, time, and separation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:A1","text":"Height and depth are translated into one another in the relation to heaven.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:A2","text":"Veiling can reveal beauty, and silence can proclaim wisdom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:A3","text":"Shared knowledge requires no linguistic communication.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:A4","text":"Wandering and mountain climbing are merely makeshifts in comparison with the true will to fly into heaven.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:A5","text":"The passing clouds embody mediation, mixture, and halfness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:A6","text":"Mediation deprives the speaker and heaven of their shared unrestricted Yes and Amen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:A7","text":"Indecision is impermissible; whoever cannot bless should learn to curse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:A8","text":"To bless means to stand over every thing as its own heaven, round roof, and azure bell.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:A9","text":"All things are baptized at the fountain of eternity and beyond good and evil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:A10","text":"The heaven over things consists of chance, innocence, happenstance, and high-spiritedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:A11","text":"Bondage to purpose is servitude, and the restoration of happenstance is a liberation of things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:A12","text":"Over things and through them no eternal will wills.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:A13","text":"Reasonableness as a universal principle is impossible, although a limited measure of wisdom remains contained in all things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:A14","text":"The wisdom contained in things stands in the service of folly, and things dance upon the feet of chance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:A15","text":"The world is deeper than the day has thought, and not everything may have words before the day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:NX1","text":"The pure relation to heaven must not be sullied by passing clouds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:NX2","text":"Mediators, mixers, and half-and-halves are excluded as impermissible forms of relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:NX3","text":"Doubting, hesitating, and softly treading repose does not count as a higher attitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:NX4","text":"Purpose, compulsion, and guilt are removed from the space of cloudless blessing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:NX5","text":"Good and evil are rejected as ultimate ontological instances.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:NX6","text":"An eternal will as an instance of cosmic governance is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:NX7","text":"A pervasive reasonableness of all things is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:NX8","text":"The day is rejected as a complete and immediate articulation of the world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:NX9","text":"Mountain climbing and wandering are excluded as the final fulfillment of the will to heaven.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:D1","text":"Silence and veiling appear not as a lack of knowledge but as its privileged form.","refs":["CH_97E9_VSA0:A2","CH_97E9_VSA0:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:D2","text":"Wandering is determined as the symptom of a movement of flight not yet realized.","refs":["CH_97E9_VSA0:A1","CH_97E9_VSA0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:D3","text":"Mediation is not neutral but an active deprivation of the shared Yes and Amen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VSA0:A5","CH_97E9_VSA0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:D4","text":"The alternative to circumspect uncertainty is not mere assent, but the resolute capacity to bless or curse.","refs":["CH_97E9_VSA0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:D5","text":"Blessing universalizes affirmation by granting every thing its own heaven.","refs":["CH_97E9_VSA0:A8","CH_97E9_VSA0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:D6","text":"The revaluation liberates things by deriving their value no longer from purpose but from chance and happenstance.","refs":["CH_97E9_VSA0:A10","CH_97E9_VSA0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:D7","text":"The world is determined as a non-teleological nexus in which neither eternal will nor universal reasonableness reigns.","refs":["CH_97E9_VSA0:A12","CH_97E9_VSA0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:D8","text":"Chance is revalued from a lack of order into a supporting motive force of dance.","refs":["CH_97E9_VSA0:A13","CH_97E9_VSA0:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:D9","text":"The impending separation ends communication without reducing the depth of the world to a conclusive statement.","refs":["CH_97E9_VSA0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:SD1","text":"The ground of value shifts from cosmic order and purposiveness to the capacity unconditionally to affirm contingency.","refs":["CH_97E9_VSA0:A7","CH_97E9_VSA0:A10","CH_97E9_VSA0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:SD2","text":"The discourse distinguishes immediate relation and mediation not according to nearness and distance, but according to revelation and contamination.","refs":["CH_97E9_VSA0:A2","CH_97E9_VSA0:A3","CH_97E9_VSA0:A5","CH_97E9_VSA0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:SD3","text":"Freedom is determined not as the subject's mastery over things, but as the liberation of things from their purpose.","refs":["CH_97E9_VSA0:A8","CH_97E9_VSA0:A10","CH_97E9_VSA0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:SD4","text":"Universal affirmation remains dependent on an aggressive exclusion of halfness.","refs":["CH_97E9_VSA0:A6","CH_97E9_VSA0:A7","CH_97E9_VSA0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:SD5","text":"Knowledge possesses a temporal stratification: silence reveals before the day, whereas the day ends the discourse without exhausting the world.","refs":["CH_97E9_VSA0:A2","CH_97E9_VSA0:A3","CH_97E9_VSA0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:SD6","text":"Certainty is produced not through teleological guarantee but through the blessing arching-over of contingent things.","refs":["CH_97E9_VSA0:A8","CH_97E9_VSA0:A10","CH_97E9_VSA0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:DNX1","text":"The system cannot rest on an ultimate why that prescribes to every thing its purpose.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:DNX2","text":"It cannot presuppose a transcendent moral instance that definitively stabilizes good and evil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:DNX3","text":"It cannot acknowledge a neutral middle between unconditional blessing and resolute rejection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:DNX4","text":"It cannot permit complete transparency of the world through the day or through public language.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:DNX5","text":"It cannot bind wisdom to a reason independent of folly and chance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:DNX6","text":"It cannot understand affirmation as the autonomous achievement of an isolated subject; it remains bound to the presence of heaven.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:SNX1","text":"The force of the discourse rests on the absence of an ultimate teleological ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:SNX2","text":"Excluded is an undecided intermediate space in which neither blessing nor curse, neither Yes nor No, fully applies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:SNX3","text":"Excluded is a world whose entire meaning could be articulated simultaneously, publicly, and exhaustively.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:SNX4","text":"Excluded is a horizon of meaning independent of heaven, shame, purity, and depth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:SNX5","text":"What remains unresolved is the possibility of a universal affirmation that would not at the same time be constituted through exclusion, disgust, and rejection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:FGS1","text":"Relation to heaven → reversal of height and depth → veiling and silence as revelation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:FGS2","text":"Shared silence and shared knowledge → transcendence of compulsion, purpose, and guilt → wandering as a mere makeshift.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:FGS3","text":"Passing clouds → classification of mediation as mixture and halfness → deprivation of the shared Yes and Amen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:FGS4","text":"Exclusion of halfness → decision for blessing or cursing → freeing of the hands → emergence of the blessing Yes-sayer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:FGS5","text":"Blessing → arching over every thing with its own heaven → relativization of good and evil into shadows and clouds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:FGS6","text":"Arching-over → replacement of purpose, eternal will, and universal reason by chance, innocence, happenstance, and high-spiritedness → dancing contingency.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:FGS7","text":"Approaching day → limitation of communicability → separation of the speakers → preservation of worldly depth as depth not fully spoken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:AF1","text":"Veiled knowledge of heaven → shared wordless relation → wandering as an inadequate substitute for flight → clouds as corrupting mediation → exclusion of halfness → release of blessing → arching over every thing → restoration of chance and happenstance → abolition of purpose, eternal will, and universal reason → temporal limitation through the coming day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:ME1","text":"Heaven is remapped from a transcendent instance of dominion into an immanent field of contingent things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:ME2","text":"Chance and happenstance are reclassified from deficit concepts into forms of the oldest nobility and innocence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:ME3","text":"Good, evil, purpose, and eternal will are brought together in a common category of transient obscurations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:ME4","text":"Affirmation is determined no longer as a mere counterpart to negation, but as the opposite of mediating halfness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:ME5","text":"Silence and veiling become visible as forms of knowledge that precede complete daylight.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:ME6","text":"The acting subject is reclassified from the wanderer and struggler into the blessing one who arches over things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:ALT1","text":"Surface — The discourse addresses the pure, high, and shamefast heaven and enacts a separation before the day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:ALT2","text":"Structural — Clouds, mediators, and half-and-halves organize the negative mechanics of mediation; purpose, guilt, and morality function as forms of servitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text replaces hesitant distance with the strategic decision to bless or curse and turns inner struggle into a release toward affirmation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The world is determined as contingent, non-teleological, and beyond good and evil; its depth exceeds the articulating power of the coming day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from wordless relation to heaven, through the rejection of mediation, to the cosmological affirmation of chance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether heaven is to be understood as deity, cosmic instance, image of being, or relational counterfigure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:MRT3","text":"The structure is coherent as a machine of revaluation, but not as a fully contradiction-free ontology.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0029","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:MRT4","text":"Its strongest connection lies in the conversion of the polemic against the clouds into the liberation of things from purpose.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:MRT5","text":"The discourse asserts contingency and eternal certainty at once; it mediates this opposition through the form of blessing, but does not resolve it conceptually.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:MRT6","text":"The rejection of universal reason remains bound to the assumption of a limited remnant of wisdom that serves folly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0029","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:MRT7","text":"The abolition of good and evil nevertheless produces normative hierarchies among purity, blessing, halfness, and defilement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument insofar as the image-fields of heaven, cloud, light, and day are treated as operations rather than as mere ornaments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VSA0:MRT9","text":"The compression loses the affective force of the discourse, but not its generative sequence of revelation, exclusion, decision, revaluation, and temporal closure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VSA0:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_VSA0@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_VSA0:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 69","title":"Before Sunrise","context":"Chapter 69","original_title":"Vor Sonnen-Aufgang","original_context":"Chapter 69"},"original_title":"Vor Sonnen-Aufgang","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4","layer":"CH","title":"On the Diminishing Virtue · 1","order":70,"parents":["RAW_97E9_1C_4"],"revision":"CH_97E9_1C_4@R001","sha256":"37410216595e281305e90befd824d45123374528c6d0de60bada870ab4c025e3","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:AS1","text":"Zarathustras Rückkehr wird nicht als unmittelbare Heimkehr, sondern als Umweg durch Beobachtung und Befragung organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:AS2","text":"Der Umweg soll klären, was aus dem Menschen geworden ist und ob er größer oder kleiner geworden ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:AS3","text":"Neue Häuser werden als sichtbare Zeichen einer verkleinerten menschlichen Maßordnung gelesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:AS4","text":"Die bauliche Verkleinerung wird auf eine Verkleinerung des Menschen und seiner Tugend bezogen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:AS5","text":"Die neue Ordnung zwingt selbst Angehörige von Zarathustras Art zur körperlichen und symbolischen Beugung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:AS6","text":"Aus der Diagnose der Verkleinerung entsteht die Sehnsucht nach einer Heimat jenseits der Beugung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:AS7","text":"Die Rede über die verkleinernde Tugend bildet die begriffliche Fortsetzung dieser Diagnose.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:A1","text":"Zarathustras Rückkehr zur Quelle erfolgt über viele Umwege.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:A2","text":"Der Zustand des Menschen wird an seiner Größenveränderung geprüft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:A3","text":"Gebaute Formen können als Gleichnisse einer menschlichen Ordnung gelesen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:A4","text":"Kleine, niedrige und enge Räume entsprechen einer verkleinerten Existenzform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:A5","text":"Eine Ordnung kann Angehörige einer höheren oder fremden Art zur Beugung zwingen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:A6","text":"Die sichtbare Verkleinerung wird von Zarathustra als allgemeiner Zustand gedeutet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:A7","text":"Eine Heimat ist als Raum vorstellbar, in dem Beugung nicht erforderlich ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:A8","text":"Die verkleinernde Tugend ist die begriffliche Form, in der die beobachtete Verkleinerung artikuliert werden soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:NX1","text":"Die neuen Häuser sind nicht als Ausdruck einer großen Seele anerkannt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:NX2","text":"Die Häuser sind nicht für große menschliche Bewegungen und Maßstäbe gebaut.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:NX3","text":"Die neuen Räume sind nicht als angemessene Räume für Männer bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:NX4","text":"Zarathustras Heimat ist nicht mit dem Zustand gleichzusetzen, in dem er sich bücken muss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:NX5","text":"Menschliche Entwicklung wird nicht als eindeutige Vergrößerung vorausgesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:NX6","text":"Die sichtbare Ordnung wird nicht als neutraler architektonischer Sachverhalt behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:NX7","text":"Die Rede über Tugend wird nicht von der Diagnose sozialer und räumlicher Verkleinerung getrennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:D1","text":"Zarathustras Reise ist zugleich ein Erkenntnisverfahren, weil die Rückkehr zur Quelle durch die Prüfung des gegenwärtigen Menschen vermittelt wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_4:A1","CH_97E9_1C_4:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:D2","text":"Die Häuser fungieren als kulturelle Indikatoren, weil ihre Form eine Aussage über das zugrunde liegende Menschenmaß ermöglicht.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_4:A3","CH_97E9_1C_4:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:D3","text":"Die räumliche Enge wird zur sozialen Zumutung, sobald selbst Zarathustras Art den Raum nur gebückt durchqueren kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_4:A4","CH_97E9_1C_4:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:D4","text":"Die Diagnose „Alles ist kleiner geworden“ verallgemeinert die Beobachtung einzelner Häuser zu einer Diagnose der gesamten Gegenwart.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_4:A3","CH_97E9_1C_4:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:D5","text":"Die Heimat wird negativ über die Abwesenheit von Beugung bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_4:A7","CH_97E9_1C_4:NX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:D6","text":"Die verkleinernde Tugend erscheint als ethische oder soziale Vermittlung der allgemeinen Verkleinerung.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_4:A6","CH_97E9_1C_4:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:SD1","text":"Die Gegenwart wird als zusammenhängende Ordnung lesbar, in der Architektur, Körperhaltung, Menschenmaß und Tugend dieselbe Verkleinerungslogik ausdrücken.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_4:A3","CH_97E9_1C_4:A4","CH_97E9_1C_4:A6","CH_97E9_1C_4:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:SD2","text":"Die Rückkehr zur Quelle erzeugt keine einfache Wiedergewinnung des Ursprungs, sondern eine rückläufige Diagnose der historischen Gegenwart.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_4:A1","CH_97E9_1C_4:A2","CH_97E9_1C_4:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:SD3","text":"Die politische und ethische Herrschaft der Kleinen wird nicht primär durch offene Gewalt, sondern durch Maßstäbe verkörpert, die größere Gestalten zur Beugung zwingen.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_4:A4","CH_97E9_1C_4:A5","CH_97E9_1C_4:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:SD4","text":"Die Rede über Tugend steht am Ende einer Verschiebung von sichtbarer Form über körperliche Erfahrung zu normativer Diagnose.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_4:A3","CH_97E9_1C_4:A5","CH_97E9_1C_4:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:DNX1","text":"Das System setzt voraus, dass bauliche Formen nicht bloß funktional, zufällig oder geschmacklich sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:DNX2","text":"Es schließt aus, dass die Größe des Menschen ausschließlich quantitativ oder körperlich bestimmt werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:DNX3","text":"Es verwirft die Annahme, dass Anpassung an niedrige Räume eine neutrale oder akzeptable Lebensform sei.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:DNX4","text":"Es schließt eine Entwicklung aus, in der die Verkleinerung des Menschen als Fortschritt gelten könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:DNX5","text":"Es setzt voraus, dass eine überlieferte oder gesuchte Heimat nicht durch die gegenwärtige Ordnung repräsentiert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:DNX6","text":"Es disqualifiziert eine Tugendordnung, deren Funktion in der Selbstverkleinerung und Anpassung besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Welt, in der der Mensch ohne Verlust in kleinere Maße, Räume und Tugenden eingeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Möglichkeit, dass Beugung bloß eine körperliche Bewegung ohne Herrschafts- und Wertdimension bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:SNX3","text":"Die verborgene Abwesenheit ist ein nicht verkleinerter Maßstab des Menschen, der im Text nur als verlorene oder ferne Heimat erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:SNX4","text":"Unverfügbar ist eine Gegenwart, in der die Größe Zarathustras Art nicht durch die räumlichen und normativen Bedingungen der Kleinen vermittelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:FGS1","text":"Rückkehr zur Quelle → Umweg und Erkundung → Prüfung des gegenwärtigen Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:FGS2","text":"Prüfung des Menschen → Wahrnehmung neuer Häuser → Lesung der Architektur als Menschenmaß.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:FGS3","text":"Kleines und Niedriges → erzwungene Beugung → Verkleinerung der menschlichen Existenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:FGS4","text":"Verkleinerung der Existenz → Verallgemeinerung zur Diagnose der Gegenwart → „Alles ist kleiner geworden“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:FGS5","text":"Diagnose der Gegenwart → negative Bestimmung der Heimat → Raum ohne Beugung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:FGS6","text":"Raum ohne Beugung → Übergang von räumlicher Beobachtung zu normativer Kritik → Rede über die verkleinernde Tugend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:AF1","text":"Rückkehr zur Quelle → aufgeschobene Heimkehr → Erkundung des gegenwärtigen Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:AF2","text":"Erkundung → neue Häuser → Architektur als Gleichnis der menschlichen Größe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:AF3","text":"Architektur der Enge → körperliche Beugung → Herrschaft des kleinen Maßes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:AF4","text":"Herrschaft des kleinen Maßes → Diagnose allgemeiner Verkleinerung → Verlust einer nicht-beugenden Heimat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:AF5","text":"Verlust der Heimat → begriffliche Zuspitzung → Rede über die verkleinernde Tugend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:ME1","text":"Häuser werden von Gebrauchsgegenständen zu Indikatoren einer anthropologischen und normativen Ordnung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:ME2","text":"Körperliche Beugung wird als sichtbare Form sozialer Unterordnung und geistiger Verkleinerung klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:ME3","text":"Die Unterscheidung zwischen groß und klein verschiebt sich von räumlicher Größe auf Menschenmaß, Lebensform und Tugend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:ME4","text":"Die Rückkehrbewegung wird von einer geografischen Route zu einer diagnostischen Schleife über Gegenwart und Ursprung umgeordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:ME5","text":"Heimat wird nicht positiv-räumlich, sondern als Abwesenheit von Zwangsbeugung kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:ME6","text":"Die Tugend wird als möglicher Mechanismus der Verkleinerung und nicht ausschließlich als moralischer Wert sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:ALT1","text":"Surface — Wahrgenommen werden neue Häuser, niedrige Tore, enge Stuben und die Notwendigkeit, sich zu bücken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:ALT2","text":"Structural — Architektur organisiert ein Menschenmaß, in dem größere Gestalten nur durch Anpassung und Beugung bestehen können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Zarathustra verwandelt die Rückkehr in eine Prüfung der Gegenwart und die Beobachtung in eine Anklage gegen ihre Maßordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Die Gegenwart erscheint als Zustand nach einer Verkleinerung des Menschen; die ersehnte Heimat fungiert als zeitlich oder ontologisch anderer Raum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den Übergang von Rückkehr über Erkundung und Architekturdiagnose zur Rede über die verkleinernde Tugend zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wodurch die Verkleinerung historisch, politisch oder moralisch verursacht wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt ebenfalls, ob die „Heimat“ realer Ursprung, zukünftiger Zustand oder rhetorische Gegenposition ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:MRT4","text":"Intern kohärent ist die Zuordnung von räumlicher Enge, erzwungener Beugung und allgemeiner Verkleinerung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung des Systems liegt in der Übertragung architektonischer Maße auf anthropologische und normative Maße.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:MRT6","text":"Die Verbindung zwischen beobachteten Häusern und der „verkleinernden Tugend“ bleibt als angekündigte, noch nicht ausgeführte Ableitung spannungsvoll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, sofern die Rede über die Tugend als nachfolgende begriffliche Ausarbeitung und nicht als bereits vollständig bewiesene Schlussfolgerung behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T185328597455Z_a041258e","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"1.","source_sha256":"37410216595e281305e90befd824d45123374528c6d0de60bada870ab4c025e3","sha256":"66bc4d1fbb02db84b57cc13bfa4ccc5e8f4857a4ab9a397530fd83f24b910918","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T18:53:28.598563+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:AS1","text":"Zarathustra's return is organized not as an immediate homecoming, but as a detour through observation and inquiry.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:AS2","text":"The detour is intended to clarify what has become of the human being and whether he has become greater or smaller.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:AS3","text":"New houses are read as visible signs of a diminished human order of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:AS4","text":"The architectural diminishment is related to a diminishment of the human being and of his virtue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:AS5","text":"The new order compels even members of Zarathustra's kind to bend physically and symbolically.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:AS6","text":"From the diagnosis of diminishment arises the longing for a homeland beyond bending.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:AS7","text":"The discourse on diminishing virtue forms the conceptual continuation of this diagnosis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:A1","text":"Zarathustra's return to the source proceeds by way of many detours.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:A2","text":"The condition of the human being is tested by the change in his magnitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:A3","text":"Built forms can be read as parables of a human order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:A4","text":"Small, low, and narrow spaces correspond to a diminished form of existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:A5","text":"An order can compel members of a higher or alien kind to bend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:A6","text":"Zarathustra interprets visible diminishment as a general condition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:A7","text":"A homeland can be conceived as a space in which bending is not required.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:A8","text":"Diminishing virtue is the conceptual form in which the observed diminishment is to be articulated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:NX1","text":"The new houses are not acknowledged as an expression of a great soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:NX2","text":"The houses are not built for great human movements and measures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:NX3","text":"The new spaces are not intended as appropriate spaces for men.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:NX4","text":"Zarathustra's homeland is not to be equated with the condition in which he must stoop.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:NX5","text":"Human development is not assumed to be an unambiguous enlargement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:NX6","text":"The visible order is not treated as a neutral architectural fact.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:NX7","text":"The discourse on virtue is not separated from the diagnosis of social and spatial diminishment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:D1","text":"Zarathustra's journey is at the same time a procedure of knowledge, because the return to the source is mediated through the examination of the present human being.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_4:A1","CH_97E9_1C_4:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:D2","text":"The houses function as cultural indicators, because their form permits a statement about the underlying human measure.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_4:A3","CH_97E9_1C_4:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:D3","text":"Spatial narrowness becomes a social imposition as soon as even Zarathustra's kind can traverse the space only while bent.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_4:A4","CH_97E9_1C_4:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:D4","text":"The diagnosis “Everything has become smaller” generalizes the observation of individual houses into a diagnosis of the entire present.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_4:A3","CH_97E9_1C_4:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:D5","text":"The homeland is determined negatively through the absence of bending.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_4:A7","CH_97E9_1C_4:NX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:D6","text":"Diminishing virtue appears as the ethical or social mediation of general diminishment.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_4:A6","CH_97E9_1C_4:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:SD1","text":"The present becomes readable as a coherent order in which architecture, bodily posture, human measure, and virtue express the same logic of diminishment.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_4:A3","CH_97E9_1C_4:A4","CH_97E9_1C_4:A6","CH_97E9_1C_4:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:SD2","text":"The return to the source produces not a simple recovery of origin, but a retrospective diagnosis of the historical present.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_4:A1","CH_97E9_1C_4:A2","CH_97E9_1C_4:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:SD3","text":"The political and ethical rule of the small is embodied not primarily through open violence, but through measures that compel greater figures to bend.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_4:A4","CH_97E9_1C_4:A5","CH_97E9_1C_4:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:SD4","text":"The discourse on virtue stands at the end of a shift from visible form through bodily experience to normative diagnosis.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_4:A3","CH_97E9_1C_4:A5","CH_97E9_1C_4:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:DNX1","text":"The system presupposes that built forms are not merely functional, accidental, or matters of taste.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:DNX2","text":"It excludes the possibility that the greatness of the human being can be determined exclusively quantitatively or physically.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:DNX3","text":"It rejects the assumption that adaptation to low spaces is a neutral or acceptable form of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:DNX4","text":"It excludes a development in which the diminishment of the human being could count as progress.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:DNX5","text":"It presupposes that an inherited or sought homeland is not represented by the present order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:DNX6","text":"It disqualifies an order of virtue whose function consists in self-diminishment and adaptation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a world in which the human being enters into smaller measures, spaces, and virtues without loss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:SNX2","text":"Excluded is the possibility that bending remains merely a bodily movement without a dimension of domination and value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:SNX3","text":"The hidden absence is an undiminished measure of the human being, which appears in the text only as a lost or distant homeland.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:SNX4","text":"Unavailable is a present in which the greatness of Zarathustra's kind is not mediated by the spatial and normative conditions of the small.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:FGS1","text":"Return to the source → detour and exploration → examination of the present human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:FGS2","text":"Examination of the human being → perception of new houses → reading of architecture as human measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:FGS3","text":"Smallness and lowness → compelled bending → diminishment of human existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:FGS4","text":"Diminishment of existence → generalization into a diagnosis of the present → “Everything has become smaller”.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:FGS5","text":"Diagnosis of the present → negative determination of the homeland → space without bending.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:FGS6","text":"Space without bending → transition from spatial observation to normative critique → discourse on diminishing virtue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:AF1","text":"Return to the source → deferred homecoming → exploration of the present human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:AF2","text":"Exploration → new houses → architecture as a parable of human greatness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:AF3","text":"Architecture of narrowness → bodily bending → rule of the small measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:AF4","text":"Rule of the small measure → diagnosis of general diminishment → loss of a homeland without bending.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:AF5","text":"Loss of the homeland → conceptual intensification → discourse on diminishing virtue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:ME1","text":"Houses are remapped from objects of use into indicators of an anthropological and normative order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:ME2","text":"Bodily bending is classified as a visible form of social subordination and spiritual diminishment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:ME3","text":"The distinction between great and small shifts from spatial size to human measure, form of life, and virtue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:ME4","text":"The movement of return is reordered from a geographical route into a diagnostic loop concerning present and origin.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:ME5","text":"Homeland is mapped not positively and spatially, but as the absence of compelled bending.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:ME6","text":"Virtue becomes visible as a possible mechanism of diminishment and not exclusively as a moral value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:ALT1","text":"Surface — New houses, low gates, narrow rooms, and the necessity of stooping are perceived.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:ALT2","text":"Structural — Architecture organizes a human measure in which greater figures can exist only through adaptation and bending.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Zarathustra transforms the return into an examination of the present and observation into an indictment of its order of measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The present appears as a condition after a diminishment of the human being; the longed-for homeland functions as a temporally or ontologically other space.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the transition from return through exploration and architectural diagnosis to the discourse on diminishing virtue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is what historically, politically, or morally causes the diminishment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:MRT3","text":"Also underdetermined is whether the “homeland” is a real origin, a future condition, or a rhetorical counter-position.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:MRT4","text":"The association of spatial narrowness, compelled bending, and general diminishment is internally coherent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:MRT5","text":"The system's strongest connection lies in the transfer of architectural measures to anthropological and normative measures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:MRT6","text":"The connection between the observed houses and “diminishing virtue” remains fraught as an announced, not yet executed derivation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_4:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement insofar as the discourse on virtue is treated as a subsequent conceptual elaboration and not as an already fully proven conclusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_4:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_1C_4@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_1C_4:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On the Diminishing Virtue","source_section_label":"1.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"On the Diminishing Virtue · 1","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On the Diminishing Virtue","1."],"original_title":"1."}],"source_title_context":"Von der verkleinernden Tugend","source_section_label":"1.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"On the Diminishing Virtue · 1","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On the Diminishing Virtue","1."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 70","title":"On the Diminishing Virtue · 1","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Von der verkleinernden Tugend · 1"},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4","layer":"CH","title":"On the Diminishing Virtue · 2","order":71,"parents":["RAW_97E9_2C_4"],"revision":"CH_97E9_2C_4@R001","sha256":"fb0ba2841a127c8848f22cdc82d54d4817ed6d08f43d62fd9b2a5488dc897482","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:AS1","text":"Der Sprecher begegnet einem Volk, dessen kleine Tugenden seine Feindseligkeit gegen ihn erklären.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:AS2","text":"Die Zurückweisung kleiner Tugenden wird als Zurückweisung eines auf Behagen gegründeten Lebensmodells bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:AS3","text":"Gerede, Husten, Lob und Zeitverweigerung werden als Formen sozialer Abwehr und Verdeckung neu bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:AS4","text":"Das diagnostisch-polemische Argument überführt Tugend, Güte, Gerechtigkeit und Dienst in Mechanismen von Schwäche, Furcht und Anpassung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:AS5","text":"Aus sichtbaren Verhaltensformen wird auf einen Mangel an eigenem Wollen, Echtheit, Kraft und auf eine Übermacht des Schauspielens geschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:AS6","text":"Die Bewegung endet in der Umbenennung scheinbarer Mässigkeit als Mittelmässigkeit und in der Aufrechterhaltung der Distanz des Sprechers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:A1","text":"Das Volk reagiert feindselig auf die Zurückweisung seiner kleinen Tugenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:A2","text":"Kleine Leute halten kleine Tugenden für notwendig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:A3","text":"Der Sprecher empfindet die Notwendigkeit kleiner Leute als Belastung und Zumutung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:A4","text":"Gerede und Lärm des Volkes können die Gedanken des Sprechers verdecken, ohne sie zu erfassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:A5","text":"Das Volk deutet starke Rede als Krankheit, Gefahr oder Störung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:A6","text":"Das Lobende gibt scheinbar zurück, verlangt aber tatsächlich weitere Beschenkung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:A7","text":"Das Volk richtet Tugend und Glück am Maßstab des Behagens aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:A8","text":"Die Lehre vom kleinen Glück macht die Menschen kleiner und verwandelt Vorwärtsschreiten in Humpeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:A9","text":"Bei den kleinen Leuten bestehen Wollen und Echtheit nur selten; die Mehrheit wird gewollt oder spielt Rollen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:A10","text":"Körper und Blick sollen übereinstimmen, doch das Volk ist durch vielfältige Lügen gekennzeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:A11","text":"Der Mangel an männlicher Kraft führt zur Vermännlichung der Frauen; die Erlösung des Weibes setzt Mannesgenüge voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:A12","text":"Herrschende heucheln die Tugenden der Dienenden und verwandeln Herrschaft in die Sprache des Dienstes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:A13","text":"Güte, Gerechtigkeit und Mitleiden stehen im Volk in einem direkten Verhältnis zur Schwäche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:A14","text":"Der Wunsch, niemandem wehgetan zu werden, erzeugt vorbeugende Gefälligkeit und wird als Feigheit bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:A15","text":"Klugheit ohne Fäuste besitzt taktische Finger, aber keine durchsetzende Kraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:A16","text":"Die Tugend des Volkes domestiziert Wolf und Mensch und macht beide zu Haustieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:A17","text":"Die scheinbare Mitte zwischen Extremen ist nicht Mässigkeit, sondern Mittelmässigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:NX1","text":"Kleine Tugend ist nicht Stärke, sondern eine dem Behagen angepasste Form der Selbstbegrenzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:NX2","text":"Lob ist keine Rückgabe, sondern eine verdeckte Forderung nach weiterer Gabe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:NX3","text":"Husten ist kein Einwand gegen starke Rede, sondern ein Zeichen mangelnder Aufnahmefähigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:NX4","text":"Die Erklärung, keine Zeit für den Sprecher zu haben, begründet keine gültige zeitliche Priorität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:NX5","text":"Vorwärtsschreiten ist nicht schon Fortschritt, wenn es als Humpeln und Rückblick organisiert ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:NX6","text":"Bescheidenes Glück ist keine Ergebung, sondern die vorwegnehmende Sicherung des eigenen Komforts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:NX7","text":"Rauheit der Rede ist nicht Kraft, sondern Heiserkeit unter dem Druck jedes Windzuges.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:NX8","text":"Güte, Gerechtigkeit und Mitleid sind nicht als Stärke zugelassen, sobald sie aus Schutzbedürfnis hervorgehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:NX9","text":"Dienstsprache der Herrschenden ist nicht Dienst, sondern Herrschaftsheuchelei.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:NX10","text":"Klugheit mit geschickten Fingern ist keine Macht, solange ihr die Fäuste fehlen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:NX11","text":"Die Tugend der Zahmheit ist keine Erhöhung des Menschen, sondern seine Haustierwerdung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:NX12","text":"Die Mitte zwischen Kampf und Genuss ist keine ausgewogene Ordnung, sondern Mittelmässigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:D1","text":"Die Feindseligkeit des Volkes entsteht als Abwehr gegen die Infragestellung seiner komfortorientierten Tugendordnung.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_4:A1","CH_97E9_2C_4:A2","CH_97E9_2C_4:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:D2","text":"Der soziale Lärm fungiert als Schutzschicht, die den Gedanken des Sprechers verdeckt und zugleich seine Wirkung bestätigt.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_4:A4","CH_97E9_2C_4:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:D3","text":"Lob erzeugt eine asymmetrische Gabeordnung, in der Anerkennung als Mittel weiterer Aneignung wirkt.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_4:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:D4","text":"Die zeitliche Verweigerung des Volkes verliert ihre Autorität, weil die Geltung des Sprechers nicht von dessen Bereitschaft abhängt.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_4:A4","CH_97E9_2C_4:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:D5","text":"Das Behagen verkleinert nicht nur die Tugend, sondern erzeugt eine verkleinerte soziale Gestalt.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_4:A7","CH_97E9_2C_4:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:D6","text":"Bewegungsformen ohne innere Geradheit werden zu Hindernissen für jede beschleunigte Bewegung.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_4:A8","CH_97E9_2C_4:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:D7","text":"Die soziale Ordnung erscheint als Übergewicht fremden Wollens, gespielter Identität und körperlich sichtbarer Unwahrheit.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_4:A9","CH_97E9_2C_4:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:D8","text":"Vorbeugende Güte und Mitleid stabilisieren eine Ordnung, in der Schadensvermeidung als moralische Tugend auftritt.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_4:A13","CH_97E9_2C_4:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:D9","text":"Taktische Klugheit bleibt machtlos, wenn sie nicht in körperliche Durchsetzung übergeht.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_4:A14","CH_97E9_2C_4:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:D10","text":"Die Tugendordnung verwandelt potenziell widerständige Gestalten in domestizierte und berechenbare Subjekte.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_4:A15","CH_97E9_2C_4:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:D11","text":"Die Sprache des Dienstes verbindet die Selbsterniedrigung der Dienenden mit der Selbstverkleidung der Herrschenden.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_4:A9","CH_97E9_2C_4:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:D12","text":"Die scheinbare Ausgeglichenheit des Volkes erweist sich als Ausschluss sowohl kämpferischer Intensität als auch überschäumender Lebensbejahung.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_4:A7","CH_97E9_2C_4:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:SD1","text":"Eine auf Behagen gegründete Tugendordnung produziert systematisch Kleinheit, Feigheit, Schauspiel und gegenseitige Domestikation.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_4:A7","CH_97E9_2C_4:A9","CH_97E9_2C_4:A14","CH_97E9_2C_4:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:SD2","text":"Anerkennung, Zeitverweigerung und Lärm bilden gemeinsam ein soziales Erfassungssystem, das den Sprecher zugleich abwehrt und umkreist.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_4:A4","CH_97E9_2C_4:A5","CH_97E9_2C_4:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:SD3","text":"Die moralische Oberfläche von Volk und Herrschenden beruht auf derselben Struktur aus Rollenübernahme, Selbstschutz und verdeckter Aneignung.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_4:A6","CH_97E9_2C_4:A9","CH_97E9_2C_4:A12","CH_97E9_2C_4:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:SD4","text":"Die politische Anthropologie des Textes bestimmt die Mehrheit nicht als autonome Willensgemeinschaft, sondern als Menge von Gewollten, Schauspielern und Haustieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_4:A9","CH_97E9_2C_4:A12","CH_97E9_2C_4:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:SD5","text":"Die gesellschaftliche Mitte ist kein neutraler Vermittlungsraum, sondern ein Hindernis für Kraft, Geschwindigkeit und Transformation.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_4:A8","CH_97E9_2C_4:A15","CH_97E9_2C_4:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:SD6","text":"Die Ausgrenzung des Sprechers wird in einen Erkenntnisvorteil verwandelt, weil die Reaktionen des Volkes dessen verborgene Ordnung sichtbar machen.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_4:A1","CH_97E9_2C_4:A4","CH_97E9_2C_4:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt eine Gleichwertigkeit verschiedener Tugendordnungen aus und setzt die hierarchische Unterscheidung von klein und stark voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:DNX2","text":"Es schließt aus, dass Behagen, Sicherheit und Schadensvermeidung neutrale oder unschuldige Lebensbedingungen sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:DNX3","text":"Es schließt aus, dass soziale Rede transparent mitteilt, was sie behauptet; Gerede, Lob und Dienstsprache besitzen verdeckte Funktionen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:DNX4","text":"Es schließt aus, dass die Mehrheit als einheitliches, selbstbestimmtes Subjekt handelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:DNX5","text":"Es schließt aus, dass zwischen Sprecher und Volk ein gemeinsamer Erkenntnis- oder Zeithorizont besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:DNX6","text":"Es schließt aus, dass Harmlosigkeit bloße Abwesenheit von Gewalt ist; sie gilt als aktive Strategie der Vorbeugung und Unterwerfung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:DNX7","text":"Es schließt aus, dass die Mitte eine unparteiische oder versöhnende Position bildet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:DNX8","text":"Es schließt aus, dass echte Individualität gesellschaftlich häufig oder institutionell abgesichert ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:SNX1","text":"Die Argumentation organisiert sich um das Verschwinden eines eigenständig wollenden Subjekts hinter Rollen, Gewolltheit und Anpassung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:SNX2","text":"Ihre Kraft beruht auf der versperrten Möglichkeit einer nicht domestizierten, nicht komfortkompatiblen Stärke.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:SNX3","text":"Den Diskurs strukturiert die Abwesenheit gegenseitiger Verständigung: Das Volk spricht über den Sprecher, denkt aber nicht an ihn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:SNX4","text":"Der Text behandelt eine gemeinsame Zeitordnung als unmöglich, weil das Volk die Zukunft des Sprechers weder erkennt noch aufnehmen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:SNX5","text":"Als unzulässig erscheint eine Tugend, die nicht zugleich Schutz, Zahmheit, Gefälligkeit oder Selbstverkleinerung bedeutet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:FGS1","text":"Fremde Beobachtung → sichtbare Feindseligkeit → Rückführung der Feindseligkeit auf den Bedarf nach kleinen Tugenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:FGS2","text":"Soziales Gerede → Verdeckung der Gedanken → funktionale Neubestimmung des Lärms als Schutzmantel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:FGS3","text":"Lob und Zeitverweigerung → scheinbare Anerkennung oder Ausschließung → Entlarvung als Aneignung und Machtlosigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:FGS4","text":"Behagen → bescheidene Tugend → Verkleinerung → Humpeln → Behinderung jeder beschleunigten Bewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:FGS5","text":"Schadensvermeidung → vorbeugende Gefälligkeit → Feigheit → moralische Selbstrechtfertigung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:FGS6","text":"Rollenübernahme und Dienstsprache → Verlust des eigenen Wollens → Schauspiel, Heuchelei und politische Domestikation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:FGS7","text":"Taktische Klugheit ohne Durchsetzung → zahnlose Tugend → Haustierwerdung von Wolf und Mensch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:FGS8","text":"Scheinbare Mässigkeit → Ausschluss von Kampf und Überschwang → begriffliche Schliessung als Mittelmässigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:AF1","text":"Begegnung mit dem Volk → feindliche Reaktion auf die Kritik kleiner Tugenden → Lärm, Lob und Zeitverweigerung als Abwehrformen → Behagen als Ursprung der Tugendordnung → Kleinheit, Feigheit und Schauspiel → Domestikation → Umbenennung der Mitte als Mittelmässigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:AF2","text":"Beobachtung äusserer Gesten → Entschlüsselung ihrer verborgenen Funktion → Rückführung moralischer Begriffe auf Schwäche und Selbstschutz → Bestimmung des Volkes als nichtautonome Menge → Distanzierung des Sprechers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:ME1","text":"Das Problem wird von individueller Unhöflichkeit auf die generative Struktur einer kleinen Tugendordnung verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:ME2","text":"Tugenden werden nicht mehr nach ihrem Namen, sondern nach ihrer sozialen Funktion als Schutz, Anpassung oder Domestikation klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:ME3","text":"Lob, Dienst, Güte und Mitleid werden auf einer gemeinsamen Karte verdeckter Gegengaben und Selbstsicherung verknüpft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:ME4","text":"Die Unterscheidung zwischen eigenem Wollen, Gewolltwerden, Echtheit und Schauspiel ersetzt die bloße Unterscheidung zwischen guten und schlechten Personen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:ME5","text":"Bewegung wird von räumlichem Vorankommen gelöst und an innere Geradheit, Blickrichtung und Kraft gebunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:ME6","text":"Die gesellschaftliche Mitte wird aus der Kategorie des Ausgleichs in die Kategorie des Hindernisses überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:ME7","text":"Die soziale Zurückweisung des Sprechers wird von einem persönlichen Angriff in ein diagnostisches Anzeigeinstrument verwandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:ME8","text":"Herrschaft und Dienst erscheinen nicht mehr als Gegensätze, sondern als ineinander verschränkte Formen derselben Heuchelei.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Sprecher beschreibt Gerede, Husten, Lob, Rückwärtsblicken, Gefälligkeit und scheinbare Mässigkeit des Volkes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:ALT2","text":"Structural — Diese Verhaltensweisen werden als Mechanismen von Behagen, Selbstschutz, Rollenspiel, Herrschaftsheuchelei und Domestikation geordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Sprecher verwandelt Ablehnung, Missverständnis und Ausgrenzung in Distanz, Erkenntnisvorsprung und Widerstand gegen die soziale Taktung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Das System setzt einen Gegensatz zwischen seltenem eigenem Wollen und überwiegendem Gewolltwerden sowie zwischen der Zeit des Volkes und der nicht von ihr abhängigen Zeit des Sprechers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von der Begegnung über die Diagnose kleiner Tugenden bis zur Bestimmung der Mittelmässigkeit zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:MRT2","text":"Die Verbindung von Behagen, kleiner Tugend, Feigheit und Domestikation bildet den stärksten generativen Knoten des Systems.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:MRT3","text":"Die Konstruktion der sozialen Abwehr aus Lärm, Lob, Husten und Zeitverweigerung bleibt als Funktionszusammenhang hinreichend bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:MRT4","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, woran die behauptete Echtheit des seltenen eigenständigen Subjekts positiv erkannt werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:MRT5","text":"Die Kategorie des echten Schauspielers erzeugt eine ungelöste Spannung zwischen Schauspiel als Täuschung und Schauspiel als möglicher Form von Echtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:MRT6","text":"Die Bestimmung des Weiblichen durch vorausgesetzte Mannesgenüge bleibt nur lose mit der übrigen Mechanik von Behagen, Heuchelei und Domestikation verbunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:MRT7","text":"Die höfliche Duldung des Kleinen steht unaufgelöst neben dem Wunsch, dem Vorwärtsblickenden körperlich entgegenzurennen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, verliert jedoch die aphoristische Mehrdeutigkeit der Bilder und die rhetorische Kraft ihrer Gleichsetzungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T190526562075Z_ae1c9c53","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"2.","source_sha256":"fb0ba2841a127c8848f22cdc82d54d4817ed6d08f43d62fd9b2a5488dc897482","sha256":"4dacaa81ce2d45ea9b09082f75919663ca073fdfecf93bb696d344f454df1e1f","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:05:26.563586+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:AS1","text":"The speaker encounters a people whose small virtues explain its hostility toward him.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:AS2","text":"The rejection of small virtues is determined as the rejection of a model of life founded on comfort.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:AS3","text":"Chatter, coughing, praise, and the refusal of time are redetermined as forms of social defense and concealment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:AS4","text":"The diagnostic-polemical argument translates virtue, goodness, justice, and service into mechanisms of weakness, fear, and adaptation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:AS5","text":"From visible forms of behavior, it infers a lack of one's own willing, genuineness, and strength, and a predominance of acting.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:AS6","text":"The movement ends in the renaming of apparent moderation as mediocrity and in the maintenance of the speaker's distance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:A1","text":"The people reacts with hostility to the rejection of its small virtues.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:A2","text":"Small people consider small virtues necessary.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:A3","text":"The speaker experiences the necessity of small people as a burden and an imposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:A4","text":"The chatter and noise of the people can conceal the speaker's thoughts without grasping them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:A5","text":"The people interprets strong speech as illness, danger, or disturbance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:A6","text":"That which praises seemingly gives back, but in fact demands further bestowal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:A7","text":"The people measures virtue and happiness by the standard of comfort.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:A8","text":"The doctrine of small happiness makes human beings smaller and transforms advancing into limping.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:A9","text":"Among small people, willing and genuineness exist only rarely; the majority are willed or play roles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:A10","text":"Body and gaze ought to accord, yet the people is marked by manifold lies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:A11","text":"The lack of masculine strength leads to the masculinization of women; the redemption of woman presupposes male sufficiency.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:A12","text":"Rulers feign the virtues of those who serve and transform rule into the language of service.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:A13","text":"Among the people, goodness, justice, and compassion stand in a direct relation to weakness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:A14","text":"The wish not to be hurt by anyone produces preventive obligingness and is determined as cowardice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:A15","text":"Cleverness without fists possesses tactical fingers, but no force capable of asserting itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:A16","text":"The virtue of the people domesticates wolf and human being and makes both into pets.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:A17","text":"The apparent middle between extremes is not moderation, but mediocrity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:NX1","text":"Small virtue is not strength, but a form of self-limitation adapted to comfort.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:NX2","text":"Praise is not a return, but a concealed demand for further gift.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:NX3","text":"Coughing is not an objection to strong speech, but a sign of deficient receptivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:NX4","text":"The declaration that one has no time for the speaker does not establish a valid temporal priority.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:NX5","text":"Advancing is not already progress when it is organized as limping and looking backward.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:NX6","text":"Modest happiness is not resignation, but the anticipatory securing of one's own comfort.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:NX7","text":"Roughness of speech is not strength, but hoarseness under the pressure of every gust of wind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:NX8","text":"Goodness, justice, and compassion are not admitted as strength once they arise from a need for protection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:NX9","text":"The language of service used by rulers is not service, but the hypocrisy of rule.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:NX10","text":"Cleverness with skillful fingers is not power so long as it lacks fists.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:NX11","text":"The virtue of tameness is not an elevation of the human being, but his becoming a pet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:NX12","text":"The middle between struggle and enjoyment is not a balanced order, but mediocrity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:D1","text":"The hostility of the people arises as defense against the calling into question of its comfort-oriented order of virtue.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_4:A1","CH_97E9_2C_4:A2","CH_97E9_2C_4:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:D2","text":"Social noise functions as a protective layer that conceals the speaker's thought while at the same time confirming its effect.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_4:A4","CH_97E9_2C_4:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:D3","text":"Praise produces an asymmetrical order of giving in which recognition operates as a means of further appropriation.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_4:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:D4","text":"The people's temporal refusal loses its authority because the speaker's validity does not depend on its willingness.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_4:A4","CH_97E9_2C_4:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:D5","text":"Comfort not only diminishes virtue, but produces a diminished social form.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_4:A7","CH_97E9_2C_4:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:D6","text":"Forms of movement without inner straightness become obstacles to every accelerated movement.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_4:A8","CH_97E9_2C_4:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:D7","text":"The social order appears as a preponderance of alien willing, performed identity, and bodily visible untruth.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_4:A9","CH_97E9_2C_4:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:D8","text":"Preventive goodness and compassion stabilize an order in which the avoidance of harm appears as a moral virtue.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_4:A13","CH_97E9_2C_4:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:D9","text":"Tactical cleverness remains powerless if it does not pass into bodily assertion.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_4:A14","CH_97E9_2C_4:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:D10","text":"The order of virtue transforms potentially resistant figures into domesticated and calculable subjects.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_4:A15","CH_97E9_2C_4:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:D11","text":"The language of service joins the self-abasement of those who serve with the self-disguise of rulers.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_4:A9","CH_97E9_2C_4:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:D12","text":"The apparent equanimity of the people proves to be the exclusion of both combative intensity and exuberant affirmation of life.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_4:A7","CH_97E9_2C_4:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:SD1","text":"An order of virtue founded on comfort systematically produces smallness, cowardice, acting, and mutual domestication.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_4:A7","CH_97E9_2C_4:A9","CH_97E9_2C_4:A14","CH_97E9_2C_4:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:SD2","text":"Recognition, refusal of time, and noise together form a social capture system that simultaneously repels and encircles the speaker.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_4:A4","CH_97E9_2C_4:A5","CH_97E9_2C_4:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:SD3","text":"The moral surface of people and rulers rests on the same structure of role assumption, self-protection, and concealed appropriation.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_4:A6","CH_97E9_2C_4:A9","CH_97E9_2C_4:A12","CH_97E9_2C_4:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:SD4","text":"The political anthropology of the text determines the majority not as an autonomous community of will, but as a multitude of those who are willed, actors, and pets.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_4:A9","CH_97E9_2C_4:A12","CH_97E9_2C_4:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:SD5","text":"The social middle is not a neutral space of mediation, but an obstacle to strength, speed, and transformation.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_4:A8","CH_97E9_2C_4:A15","CH_97E9_2C_4:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:SD6","text":"The exclusion of the speaker is transformed into an epistemic advantage because the reactions of the people render its hidden order visible.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_4:A1","CH_97E9_2C_4:A4","CH_97E9_2C_4:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:DNX1","text":"The system excludes an equivalence of different orders of virtue and presupposes the hierarchical distinction between small and strong.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:DNX2","text":"It excludes that comfort, security, and the avoidance of harm are neutral or innocent conditions of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:DNX3","text":"It excludes that social speech transparently communicates what it claims; chatter, praise, and the language of service possess concealed functions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:DNX4","text":"It excludes that the majority acts as a unified, self-determining subject.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:DNX5","text":"It excludes that a shared horizon of knowledge or time exists between speaker and people.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:DNX6","text":"It excludes that harmlessness is a mere absence of violence; it counts as an active strategy of prevention and subjugation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:DNX7","text":"It excludes that the middle constitutes an impartial or reconciling position.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:DNX8","text":"It excludes that genuine individuality is socially frequent or institutionally secured.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:SNX1","text":"The argumentation organizes itself around the disappearance of an independently willing subject behind roles, being willed, and adaptation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:SNX2","text":"Its force rests on the blocked possibility of a strength that is neither domesticated nor compatible with comfort.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:SNX3","text":"The discourse is structured by the absence of mutual understanding: the people speaks about the speaker, but does not think of him.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:SNX4","text":"The text treats a shared temporal order as impossible because the people can neither recognize nor receive the speaker's future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:SNX5","text":"A virtue that does not at the same time mean protection, tameness, obligingness, or self-diminishment appears inadmissible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:FGS1","text":"Alien observation → visible hostility → reduction of hostility to the need for small virtues.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:FGS2","text":"Social chatter → concealment of thoughts → functional redetermination of noise as a protective mantle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:FGS3","text":"Praise and refusal of time → apparent recognition or exclusion → unmasking as appropriation and powerlessness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:FGS4","text":"Comfort → modest virtue → diminishment → limping → obstruction of every accelerated movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:FGS5","text":"Avoidance of harm → preventive obligingness → cowardice → moral self-justification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:FGS6","text":"Role assumption and language of service → loss of one's own willing → acting, hypocrisy, and political domestication.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:FGS7","text":"Tactical cleverness without assertion → toothless virtue → the becoming-pet of wolf and human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:FGS8","text":"Apparent moderation → exclusion of struggle and exuberance → conceptual closure as mediocrity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:AF1","text":"Encounter with the people → hostile reaction to the critique of small virtues → noise, praise, and refusal of time as forms of defense → comfort as the origin of the order of virtue → smallness, cowardice, and acting → domestication → renaming of the middle as mediocrity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:AF2","text":"Observation of external gestures → decipherment of their concealed function → reduction of moral concepts to weakness and self-protection → determination of the people as a non-autonomous multitude → distancing of the speaker.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:ME1","text":"The problem is shifted from individual impoliteness to the generative structure of an order of small virtue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:ME2","text":"Virtues are no longer classified according to their name, but according to their social function as protection, adaptation, or domestication.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:ME3","text":"Praise, service, goodness, and compassion are linked on a common map of concealed counter-gifts and self-securing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:ME4","text":"The distinction between one's own willing, being willed, genuineness, and acting replaces the mere distinction between good and bad persons.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:ME5","text":"Movement is detached from spatial advance and bound to inner straightness, direction of gaze, and strength.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:ME6","text":"The social middle is transferred from the category of balance into the category of obstacle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:ME7","text":"The social rejection of the speaker is transformed from a personal attack into a diagnostic instrument of indication.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:ME8","text":"Rule and service no longer appear as opposites, but as interlocked forms of the same hypocrisy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:ALT1","text":"Surface — The speaker describes the people's chatter, coughing, praise, looking backward, obligingness, and apparent moderation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:ALT2","text":"Structural — These behaviors are ordered as mechanisms of comfort, self-protection, role-playing, the hypocrisy of rule, and domestication.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The speaker transforms rejection, misunderstanding, and exclusion into distance, epistemic advantage, and resistance to social timing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The system posits an opposition between rare one's-own willing and predominant being willed, as well as between the time of the people and the speaker's time, which does not depend on it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from the encounter through the diagnosis of small virtues to the determination of mediocrity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:MRT2","text":"The connection of comfort, small virtue, cowardice, and domestication forms the system's strongest generative node.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:MRT3","text":"The construction of social defense from noise, praise, coughing, and refusal of time remains sufficiently determined as a functional nexus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:MRT4","text":"What remains underdetermined is by what positive criteria the asserted genuineness of the rare independent subject can be recognized.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:MRT5","text":"The category of the genuine actor produces an unresolved tension between acting as deception and acting as a possible form of genuineness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:MRT6","text":"The determination of the feminine through presupposed male sufficiency remains only loosely connected with the remaining mechanics of comfort, hypocrisy, and domestication.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:MRT7","text":"The polite toleration of the small stands unresolved alongside the wish to run physically against the one who looks forward.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_4:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_4:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument, but loses the aphoristic ambiguity of the images and the rhetorical force of their equations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_2C_4@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_2C_4:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On the Diminishing Virtue","source_section_label":"2.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"On the Diminishing Virtue · 2","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On the Diminishing Virtue","2."],"original_title":"2."}],"source_title_context":"Von der verkleinernden Tugend","source_section_label":"2.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"On the Diminishing Virtue · 2","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On the Diminishing Virtue","2."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 71","title":"On the Diminishing Virtue · 2","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Von der verkleinernden Tugend · 2"},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3","layer":"CH","title":"On the Diminishing Virtue · 3","order":72,"parents":["RAW_97E9_3C_3"],"revision":"CH_97E9_3C_3@R001","sha256":"d2a71e5843b5c9bf3a038cb8a1afb504ffd84e5aaabe773e50897e479ce480cb","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:AS1","text":"Die Sprecherfigur steht vor einem Publikum, das Worte weder aufnehmen noch behalten kann und die Rede in eine falsche moralische Kategorie einordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:AS2","text":"Die Rede verschiebt ihren Gegenstand von der Korrektur einzelner Laster zur Diagnose einer durch Feigheit, Ergebung und kleine Tugenden erzeugten Verkleinerung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:AS3","text":"Gottlosigkeit wird als Selbstgebung des Willens und als Abwerfung jeder Ergebung bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:AS4","text":"Diese Bestimmung wird an der Unterwerfung des Zufalls unter den Willen und an der Unterscheidung zwischen bloßem Wollen und willensfähiger Existenz durchgeführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:AS5","text":"Daraus entsteht eine Gegenordnung, in der Härte, Entschlossenheit, Selbstliebe und aktive Aneignung die Bedingungen von Größe bilden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:AS6","text":"Die gegenwärtige Unempfänglichkeit wird als Vorstufe eines kommenden Zerfalls gerahmt, aus dem Feuer und der große Mittag hervorgehen sollen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:A1","text":"Das angesprochene Volk kann die fallengelassenen Worte weder aufnehmen noch behalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:A2","text":"Der Gegenstand der Rede ist die Erzeugung einer bestimmten Lebensform und nicht die Korrektur einzelner Laster.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:A3","text":"Gottlosigkeit besteht in der Selbstgebung des Willens und in der Abwerfung jeder Ergebung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:A4","text":"Gleichartig mit dem Sprecher sind diejenigen, die sich selbst ihren Willen geben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:A5","text":"Ein starker Wille kann den Zufall unterwerfen, verarbeiten und als eigene Speise aufnehmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:A6","text":"Kleine Tugenden, kleine Unterlassungen und Ergebung machen die Menschen kleiner.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:A7","text":"Größe verlangt Widerstand und harte Wurzeln in einem nicht schonenden Erdreich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:A8","text":"Auch das Unterlassen wirkt am Gewebe der menschlichen Zukunft mit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:A9","text":"Das Nehmen der kleinen Tugendhaften erscheint als Stehlen innerhalb einer bereits verarmten Ordnung der Ehre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:A10","text":"Die Lehre, dass es sich von selbst gebe, ist eine Form der Ergebung, durch die den Menschen immer mehr genommen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:A11","text":"Handeln nach eigenem Wollen ist erst dann gültig, wenn ein Subjekt überhaupt zu wollen vermag.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:A12","text":"Nächstenliebe setzt Selbstliebe voraus und wird durch große Liebe und große Verachtung bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:A13","text":"Das gegenwärtige Publikum ist für die Rede und ihre Wirkung noch nicht bereit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:A14","text":"Der kommende Zerfall soll in Feuer, Verkündigung und den großen Mittag übergehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:NX1","text":"Die Rede ist keine Predigt gegen Lüste, Laster oder Taschendiebstahl.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:NX2","text":"Sie ist keine Verfeinerung, Zuspitzung oder weitere Steigerung gewöhnlicher Klugheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:NX3","text":"Sie duldet keine feigen, winselnden, betenden oder sich unterwerfenden inneren Haltungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:NX4","text":"Sie akzeptiert die Lehrer der Ergebung und die Moral des Kleinen nicht als geistige Autoritäten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:NX5","text":"Ergebung ist nicht als neutrale Passivität, sondern als verkleinernde Lehre ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:NX6","text":"Halbheit des Wollens gilt nicht als ausreichende Form von Freiheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:NX7","text":"Nächstenliebe ohne Selbstliebe gilt nicht als vollgültige Liebe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:NX8","text":"Das gegenwärtige Unverständnis gilt nicht als endgültige Widerlegung der Rede.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:NX9","text":"Ein schonendes und nachgiebiges Erdreich gilt nicht als Bedingung von Größe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:D1","text":"Gottlosigkeit wird von einer bloßen theologischen Negation in eine Praxis der Selbstautorschaft umcodiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A3","CH_97E9_3C_3:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:D2","text":"Die Aufnahme des Zufalls ist keine passive Hinnahme, sondern das Ergebnis seiner vorherigen Verarbeitung durch den Willen.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:D3","text":"Unterlassung besitzt eine produktive Zukunftswirkung und kann deshalb nicht als bloßes Nichts gelten.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A6","CH_97E9_3C_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:D4","text":"Die Lehre des Sich-Gebens erzeugt keine Entlastung, sondern eine fortschreitende Enteignung.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A6","CH_97E9_3C_3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:D5","text":"Die Formel des eigenen Wollens bezeichnet keine schrankenlose Willkür, sondern die Bedingung, über eine tragfähige Willensfähigkeit zu verfügen.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:D6","text":"Nächstenliebe wird aus einer voraussetzungslosen Pflicht in eine sekundäre Funktion der Selbstbeziehung überführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:D7","text":"Die gegenwärtige Ablehnung des Publikums wird als Zeichen zeitlicher Unreife und nicht als Ende der Wirkung interpretiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A1","CH_97E9_3C_3:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:D8","text":"Der Verfall der kleinen Tugenden wird als Vorbereitung einer späteren Umwandlung in aktive Feuerkraft behandelt.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A6","CH_97E9_3C_3:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:SD1","text":"Die ethische Ordnung wird vom Inhalt einzelner Handlungen auf die Qualität des Wollens, die Fähigkeit zur Selbstgebung und die aktive Aneignung von Bedingungen verschoben.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A2","CH_97E9_3C_3:A3","CH_97E9_3C_3:A5","CH_97E9_3C_3:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:SD2","text":"Ergebung erzeugt eine rekursive Verkleinerung, weil Unterlassung, Nachgiebigkeit und kleine Tugenden die Bedingungen weiterer Passivität hervorbringen.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A6","CH_97E9_3C_3:A8","CH_97E9_3C_3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:SD3","text":"Zufall und Widerstand werden nicht als Gegenkräfte des Willens, sondern als Rohmaterial seiner Selbstbestimmung klassifiziert.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A5","CH_97E9_3C_3:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:SD4","text":"Die Rede organisiert sich nicht auf unmittelbare Verständigung, sondern auf eine zeitlich verzögerte Umwandlung eines noch unempfänglichen Volkes.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A1","CH_97E9_3C_3:A13","CH_97E9_3C_3:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:SD5","text":"Der angekündigte Untergang ist zugleich Zerstörung der bestehenden Lebensform und Produktionsbedingung einer neuen Verkündigung.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A6","CH_97E9_3C_3:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt ein autonom gültiges Leben der bloßen Ergebung aus.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A3","CH_97E9_3C_3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:DNX2","text":"Es schließt eine Auffassung von Freiheit aus, nach der jeder spontane Wunsch bereits als Wollen genügt.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:DNX3","text":"Es schließt einen Zufall aus, der unabhängig vom Willen als letzte bestimmende Instanz bestehen bleibt.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:DNX4","text":"Es schließt eine Gegenwart aus, in der kommunikative Anerkennung die Gültigkeit der Rede sichern müsste.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A1","CH_97E9_3C_3:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:DNX5","text":"Es schließt eine symmetrische Nächstenliebe aus, die nicht durch eine vorgängige Selbstbeziehung vermittelt wäre.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:DNX6","text":"Es schließt eine Wachstumstheorie aus, nach der Schonung, Weichheit und Nachgiebigkeit die produktiven Bedingungen von Größe bilden.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:SNX1","text":"Unverfügbar bleibt die Möglichkeit, dass kleine Tugend, Behaglichkeit und passive Moral ein hinreichendes Ziel menschlicher Entwicklung bilden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:SNX2","text":"Abwesend ist eine Gegenwart, in der Verständigung ohne zeitliche Reifung und ohne Umwandlung des Publikums gelingt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein neutraler Zufall, der weder angeeignet noch in eine eigene Lebensform überführt werden müsste.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:SNX4","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist ein unschädliches Nichts, weil jedes Unterlassen in die Zukunft eingreift.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:SNX5","text":"Versperrt ist eine Versöhnung von Liebe und Verachtung, sofern beide nicht durch eine gesteigerte Selbstbeziehung vermittelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:FGS1","text":"Unfähigkeit zur Aufnahme und falsche Erwartung einer Lasterpredigt werden zurückgewiesen und eröffnen die strukturelle Diagnose der Ergebung.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A1","CH_97E9_3C_3:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:FGS2","text":"Ergebung, kleine Tugend und Unterlassung erzeugen Verkleinerung, Zukunftsverzehr und den Bedarf an Widerstand.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A6","CH_97E9_3C_3:A7","CH_97E9_3C_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:FGS3","text":"Die Diagnose der Verkleinerung wird durch die positive Definition der Gottlosigkeit als Selbstgebung des Willens neu gerahmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A3","CH_97E9_3C_3:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:FGS4","text":"Selbstgebung des Willens überführt den Zufall in verarbeitete Speise und bestimmt dadurch aktive Aneignung als Gegenform der Ergebung.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:FGS5","text":"Die Bedingung willensfähiger Handlung und die Priorität der Selbstliebe reorganisieren Freiheit und Liebe als gestufte Fähigkeiten.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A11","CH_97E9_3C_3:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:FGS6","text":"Gegenwärtige Unreife wird in eine zeitliche Folge von Zerfall, Feuer und Verkündigung des großen Mittags überführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A13","CH_97E9_3C_3:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:AF1","text":"Unaufnehmbare Rede → falsche Erwartung einer Lasterpredigt → Zurückweisung von Klugheit, Ergebung und kleinen Tugenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:AF2","text":"Ergebung und Unterlassung → Verkleinerung und Zukunftsverzehr → Erfordernis harter Wurzeln und aktiver Willensbildung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:AF3","text":"Selbstgebung des Willens → Verarbeitung des Zufalls → fähiges Wollen → Selbstliebe als Bedingung der Nächstenliebe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:AF4","text":"Gegenwärtige Unreife → Vorläufer- und Hahnenruf → kommende Feuerzungen → Verkündung des großen Mittags.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:ME1","text":"Gottlosigkeit wird von einem negativen Glaubensverhältnis zu einer positiven Praxis der Willensautorschaft umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:ME2","text":"Unterlassung wird von Abwesenheit in eine aktive Kraft der Zukunftsbildung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:ME3","text":"Die Opposition von Tugend und Laster wird durch die Opposition von Ergebung und willensfähiger Selbstbestimmung ersetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:ME4","text":"Der Zufall erscheint nicht mehr als äußerer Widerpart, sondern als Material, das durch den Willen transformiert werden muss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:ME5","text":"Das Publikum wird nicht als stabile Kommunikationsgemeinschaft, sondern als noch nicht reifes zukünftiges Material klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:ME6","text":"Zerfall wird nicht als Endzustand, sondern als Übergangsform zur Erzeugung von Feuer und neuer Verkündigung sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Die Sprecherfigur konfrontiert ein Volk mit dessen falscher Erwartung, kleinen Tugenden, Ergebung und Unfähigkeit zum Hören.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Ergebung, Unterlassung und Nachgiebigkeit reproduzieren Verkleinerung, während Widerstand und Willensfähigkeit Größe ermöglichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Die Rede verzichtet auf unmittelbare Überzeugung und operiert als provokative Vorankündigung einer späteren Umwandlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Wirklichkeit wird als durch Willen aneignungsfähiger Zufall und Zeit als Entwicklungsfolge von Verkleinerung, Feuer und großem Mittag bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von der missverstandenen Rede zur Diagnose der Ergebung und zur positiven Bestimmung der Gottlosigkeit zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, woran sich im Einzelnen entscheidet, ob ein Subjekt tatsächlich „wollen kann“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Gottlosigkeit, Freiheit und Liebe als Umdeutungen ihrer gewöhnlichen moralischen Bedeutungen gelesen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Verbindung besteht zwischen Ergebung, Unterlassung, Verkleinerung und der aktiven Hervorbringung von Zukunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:MRT5","text":"Die Verbindung zwischen der Diagnose kleiner Tugenden und der späteren Erzeugung von Feuer bleibt stärker prophetisch behauptet als kausal ausgeführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:MRT6","text":"Ungelöst bleibt die Spannung zwischen der Abwerfung jeder Ergebung und der ausdrücklich bejahten „Unterweisung“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:MRT7","text":"Ebenfalls ungelöst bleibt die Spannung zwischen der Aufforderung, zu tun, was man will, und der gleichzeitigen Einschränkung auf diejenigen, die überhaupt wollen können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, sofern die fehlende Gegenwart des Hörers als Bedingung der zukünftigen, nicht als Scheitern der gegenwärtigen Rede behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T191333160969Z_33745105","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"3.","source_sha256":"d2a71e5843b5c9bf3a038cb8a1afb504ffd84e5aaabe773e50897e479ce480cb","sha256":"1b165842280570c69d4b7ce73790a9d803ef9c93b939e144185010b8f73e7590","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:13:33.163299+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:AS1","text":"The speaker figure stands before an audience that can neither receive nor retain words and that assigns the discourse to a false moral category.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:AS2","text":"The discourse shifts its object from the correction of individual vices to the diagnosis of a diminishment produced by cowardice, resignation, and small virtues.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:AS3","text":"Godlessness is determined as the self-bestowal of the will and as the casting off of all resignation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:AS4","text":"This determination is carried out through the subjection of chance to the will and through the distinction between mere willing and existence capable of willing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:AS5","text":"From this emerges a counter-order in which hardness, resoluteness, self-love, and active appropriation constitute the conditions of greatness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:AS6","text":"Present unreceptivity is framed as the preliminary stage of a coming decay, from which fire and the great noon are to emerge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:A1","text":"The addressed people can neither receive nor retain the words that have been dropped.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:A2","text":"The object of the discourse is the production of a particular form of life and not the correction of individual vices.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:A3","text":"Godlessness consists in the self-bestowal of the will and in the casting off of all resignation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:A4","text":"Those who give themselves their will are akin to the speaker.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:A5","text":"A strong will can subjugate chance, process it, and take it in as its own food.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:A6","text":"Small virtues, small omissions, and resignation make human beings smaller.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:A7","text":"Greatness demands resistance and hard roots in soil that does not spare.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:A8","text":"Omission, too, participates in the fabric of the human future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:A9","text":"The taking of the smallly virtuous appears as stealing within an already impoverished order of honor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:A10","text":"The doctrine that it gives itself is a form of resignation through which ever more is taken from human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:A11","text":"Acting according to one's own willing is valid only once a subject is capable of willing at all.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:A12","text":"Love of the neighbor presupposes self-love and is determined by great love and great contempt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:A13","text":"The present audience is not yet ready for the discourse and its effect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:A14","text":"The coming decay is to pass over into fire, proclamation, and the great noon.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:NX1","text":"The discourse is not a sermon against lusts, vices, or pickpocketing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:NX2","text":"It is not a refinement, sharpening, or further intensification of ordinary prudence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:NX3","text":"It tolerates no cowardly, whining, praying, or self-subjugating inner dispositions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:NX4","text":"It does not accept the teachers of resignation and the morality of the small as spiritual authorities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:NX5","text":"Resignation is excluded not as neutral passivity but as a diminishing doctrine.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:NX6","text":"Halfness of willing does not count as a sufficient form of freedom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:NX7","text":"Love of the neighbor without self-love does not count as fully valid love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:NX8","text":"Present incomprehension does not count as the definitive refutation of the discourse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:NX9","text":"Sparing and yielding soil does not count as a condition of greatness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:D1","text":"Godlessness is recoded from a merely theological negation into a practice of self-authorship.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A3","CH_97E9_3C_3:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:D2","text":"The taking in of chance is not passive acceptance, but the result of its prior processing by the will.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:D3","text":"Omission possesses a productive effect upon the future and can therefore not count as mere nothing.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A6","CH_97E9_3C_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:D4","text":"The doctrine of self-giving produces not relief but progressive expropriation.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A6","CH_97E9_3C_3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:D5","text":"The formula of one's own willing designates not boundless arbitrariness, but the condition of possessing a sustainable capacity for willing.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:D6","text":"Love of the neighbor is transferred from an unconditional duty into a secondary function of self-relation.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:D7","text":"The present rejection by the audience is interpreted as a sign of temporal immaturity and not as the end of the effect.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A1","CH_97E9_3C_3:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:D8","text":"The decline of the small virtues is treated as preparation for a later transformation into active fire-power.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A6","CH_97E9_3C_3:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:SD1","text":"The ethical order is shifted from the content of individual actions to the quality of willing, the capacity for self-bestowal, and the active appropriation of conditions.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A2","CH_97E9_3C_3:A3","CH_97E9_3C_3:A5","CH_97E9_3C_3:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:SD2","text":"Resignation produces a recursive diminishment because omission, yieldingness, and small virtues bring forth the conditions of further passivity.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A6","CH_97E9_3C_3:A8","CH_97E9_3C_3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:SD3","text":"Chance and resistance are classified not as opposing forces of the will, but as raw material for its self-determination.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A5","CH_97E9_3C_3:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:SD4","text":"The discourse organizes itself not around immediate understanding, but around a temporally delayed transformation of a people still unreceptive.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A1","CH_97E9_3C_3:A13","CH_97E9_3C_3:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:SD5","text":"The announced downfall is at once the destruction of the existing form of life and the productive condition of a new proclamation.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A6","CH_97E9_3C_3:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:DNX1","text":"The system excludes an autonomously valid life of mere resignation.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A3","CH_97E9_3C_3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:DNX2","text":"It excludes a conception of freedom according to which every spontaneous wish already suffices as willing.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:DNX3","text":"It excludes a chance that remains, independently of the will, as the final determining instance.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:DNX4","text":"It excludes a present in which communicative recognition would have to secure the validity of the discourse.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A1","CH_97E9_3C_3:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:DNX5","text":"It excludes a symmetrical love of the neighbor that would not be mediated by a prior self-relation.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:DNX6","text":"It excludes a theory of growth according to which sparingness, softness, and yieldingness constitute the productive conditions of greatness.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:SNX1","text":"Unavailable remains the possibility that small virtue, comfort, and passive morality constitute a sufficient goal of human development.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:SNX2","text":"Absent is a present in which understanding succeeds without temporal maturation and without transformation of the audience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:SNX3","text":"Excluded is a neutral chance that would need neither to be appropriated nor transferred into a form of life of one's own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:SNX4","text":"An innocuous nothing is unavailable, because every omission intervenes in the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:SNX5","text":"A reconciliation of love and contempt is barred insofar as both are not mediated by an intensified self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:FGS1","text":"Incapacity for reception and the false expectation of a sermon on vices are rejected and open up the structural diagnosis of resignation.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A1","CH_97E9_3C_3:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:FGS2","text":"Resignation, small virtue, and omission produce diminishment, consumption of the future, and the need for resistance.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A6","CH_97E9_3C_3:A7","CH_97E9_3C_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:FGS3","text":"The diagnosis of diminishment is reframed through the positive definition of godlessness as self-bestowal of the will.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A3","CH_97E9_3C_3:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:FGS4","text":"Self-bestowal of the will transforms chance into processed food and thereby determines active appropriation as the counter-form of resignation.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:FGS5","text":"The condition of action capable of willing and the priority of self-love reorganize freedom and love as graduated capacities.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A11","CH_97E9_3C_3:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:FGS6","text":"Present immaturity is transformed into a temporal sequence of decay, fire, and proclamation of the great noon.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_3:A13","CH_97E9_3C_3:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:AF1","text":"Unreceivable discourse → false expectation of a sermon on vices → rejection of prudence, resignation, and small virtues.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:AF2","text":"Resignation and omission → diminishment and consumption of the future → requirement of hard roots and active formation of the will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:AF3","text":"Self-bestowal of the will → processing of chance → capable willing → self-love as the condition of love of the neighbor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:AF4","text":"Present immaturity → precursor and cockcrow → coming tongues of fire → proclamation of the great noon.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:ME1","text":"Godlessness is reclassified from a negative relation to belief into a positive practice of authorship of the will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:ME2","text":"Omission is remapped from absence into an active force of the formation of the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:ME3","text":"The opposition of virtue and vice is replaced by the opposition of resignation and self-determination capable of willing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:ME4","text":"Chance no longer appears as an external adversary, but as material that must be transformed by the will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:ME5","text":"The audience is classified not as a stable communicative community, but as future material not yet mature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:ME6","text":"Decay becomes visible not as a final state, but as a transitional form toward the production of fire and new proclamation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** The speaker figure confronts a people with its false expectation, small virtues, resignation, and incapacity to hear.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Resignation, omission, and yieldingness reproduce diminishment, while resistance and the capacity for willing enable greatness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** The discourse renounces immediate persuasion and operates as a provocative advance announcement of a later transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Reality is determined as chance capable of appropriation by the will, and time as a developmental sequence of diminishment, fire, and great noon.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from the misunderstood discourse to the diagnosis of resignation and to the positive determination of godlessness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined what, in particular, decides whether a subject can in fact „wollen kann“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as godlessness, freedom, and love are read as reinterpretations of their ordinary moral meanings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:MRT4","text":"Its strongest connection lies between resignation, omission, diminishment, and the active production of the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:MRT5","text":"The connection between the diagnosis of small virtues and the later production of fire remains more prophetically asserted than causally elaborated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:MRT6","text":"The tension between the casting off of all resignation and the explicitly affirmed „Unterweisung“ remains unresolved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:MRT7","text":"Likewise unresolved remains the tension between the injunction to do what one wants and the simultaneous restriction to those who can will at all.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_3:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement insofar as the absence of the listener in the present is treated as the condition of the future discourse, rather than as the failure of the present discourse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_3:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_3C_3@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_3C_3:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On the Diminishing Virtue","source_section_label":"3.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"On the Diminishing Virtue · 3","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On the Diminishing Virtue","3."],"original_title":"3."}],"source_title_context":"Von der verkleinernden Tugend","source_section_label":"3.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"On the Diminishing Virtue · 3","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On the Diminishing Virtue","3."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 72","title":"On the Diminishing Virtue · 3","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Von der verkleinernden Tugend · 3"},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0","layer":"CH","title":"On the Mount of Olives","order":73,"parents":["RAW_97E9_ADL0"],"revision":"CH_97E9_ADL0@R001","sha256":"e74f6e277ce14718054c341e8d37513ee56e7f4698626ad4216a368a04e72fe5","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:AS1","text":"Die Sprecherfigur behandelt den Winter als harte, aber nutzbare Gegenwart im eigenen Haus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:AS2","text":"Sie verwandelt die erlittene Kälte durch Bewegung, Spott und selbstgesetzte Härte in eine Bedingung der Unabhängigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:AS3","text":"Der Winter wird vom feindlichen Zustand zum Modell eines langen, lichtvollen Schweigens umbestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:AS4","text":"Verbergen bedeutet nicht Verdunkeln, sondern die kontrollierte Sichtbarkeit einer Oberfläche bei unzugänglichem Grund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:AS5","text":"Die Sprecherfigur legt den Beobachtern absichtlich Winter, Unfälle und Frost vor, damit ihr Glück unsichtbar bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:AS6","text":"Die soziale Mitleidsordnung wird als Schutzmantel benutzt und zugleich durch die Flucht in den warmen Sonnenwinkel zurückgewiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:A1","text":"Der Winter ist eine harte, körperlich und sozial wirksame Gegenwart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:A2","text":"Eine Härte kann geehrt werden, ohne dass man sich ihr unterwirft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:A3","text":"Bewegung zu einem windstillen Sonnenwinkel ermöglicht die Distanz zur winterlichen Gegenwart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:A4","text":"Kälte, Einsamkeit und Schweigen beseitigen störende Geräusche und fremde Zugriffe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:A5","text":"Freiwillige Armut und körperliche Entbehrung sichern die Unabhängigkeit der Sprecherfigur.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:A6","text":"Bosheit und Selbstdisziplin können eine widrige Ordnung aktiv reizen und ihre Öffnung zum Licht erzwingen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:A7","text":"Gute und mutwillige Dinge besitzen keine einzige notwendige Herkunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:A8","text":"Langes Schweigen kann den Willen verbergen, ohne in bloße Dunkelheit überzugehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:A9","text":"Undurchsichtige Verbergung provoziert Entschlüsselung, während Durchsichtigkeit einen tieferen Grund unenthüllt lassen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:A10","text":"Die soziale Umgebung verwechselt sichtbare Not mit dem Gesamtzustand der Sprecherfigur.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:A11","text":"Glück kann durch dargestellte Unfälle, Frost und Bedürftigkeit vor fremdem Neid abgeschirmt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:A12","text":"Mitleid ist zugleich eine soziale Fehllektüre und ein verwendbarer Schutzmechanismus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:A13","text":"Einsamkeit kann Flucht vor den Kranken und nicht Flucht eines Kranken sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0038","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:A14","text":"Die verborgene innere Lage der Sprecherfigur ist warm, sonnenbezogen und dem Mitleid überlegen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:NX1","text":"Das tragende Verhältnis zur Härte ist keine Anbetung eines wärmenden Feuergötzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:NX2","text":"Unabhängigkeit besteht nicht im Kriechen vor Mächtigen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:NX3","text":"Wärme und Reichtum gelten nicht als notwendige Bedingungen des inneren Glücks.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:NX4","text":"Einsamkeit wird nicht als bloße Krankheit oder soziale Unfähigkeit bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:NX5","text":"Schweigen ist kein unmittelbares Preisgeben des Grundes und des letzten Willens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:NX6","text":"Verbergen ist nicht dasselbe wie trübes, undurchdringliches Verfinstern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:NX7","text":"Die sichtbaren Winterstürme erschöpfen nicht die wirkliche Bewegungs- und Wärmeregion der Sprecherfigur.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:NX8","text":"Unfälle und Frostnöte sind nicht die vollständige Wahrheit des Glücks.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:NX9","text":"Das Mitleid der Umgebung ist keine zuverlässige Erkenntnis des verborgenen Zustands.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0041","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:NX10","text":"Die Winterseite der Seele wird nicht vollständig verleugnet; ausgeschlossen wird nur ihre Gleichsetzung mit dem Ganzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:D1","text":"Der Winter wird von einer erlittenen Bedingung zu einem funktionalen Hausfreund, sobald seine störungsbeseitigende Wirkung anerkannt wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADL0:A1","CH_97E9_ADL0:A2","CH_97E9_ADL0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:D2","text":"Die Sprecherfigur behauptet ihre Freiheit durch eine Kombination aus Fluchtbewegung, kalter Selbstprüfung und Spott.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADL0:A3","CH_97E9_ADL0:A5","CH_97E9_ADL0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:D3","text":"Das lange Schweigen wird als aktiv erzeugte Form der Nichtpreisgabe bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADL0:A7","CH_97E9_ADL0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:D4","text":"Die wirksamste Verbergung besteht darin, hell und durchsichtig zu erscheinen, ohne den eigenen Grund preiszugeben.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADL0:A8","CH_97E9_ADL0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:D5","text":"Die Sprecherfigur steuert die Fremdwahrnehmung, indem sie reale Kälte zeigt und die gleichzeitige Wärme ausblendet.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADL0:A10","CH_97E9_ADL0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:D6","text":"Das zugelassene Mitleid schützt das Glück gerade dadurch, dass es dieses falsch klassifiziert.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADL0:A10","CH_97E9_ADL0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:D7","text":"Die endgültige Distanz zum sozialen Umfeld wird als Flucht aus dessen geheizter, mitleidiger Innenwelt organisiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADL0:A4","CH_97E9_ADL0:A13","CH_97E9_ADL0:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:SD1","text":"Das System macht aus Widrigkeit eine selektive Infrastruktur der Autonomie: Kälte schwächt den Körper, stärkt aber die Kontrolle über Zugang, Wahrnehmung und Willen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:SD2","text":"Die Sprecherfigur erzeugt eine doppelte Existenzordnung aus sichtbarer Frostarmut und unsichtbarer Sonnenfülle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:SD3","text":"Soziale Lesbarkeit wird strategisch umgekehrt: Je plausibler die öffentliche Not erscheint, desto besser bleibt das Glück vor Neid und Aneignung geschützt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:SD4","text":"Die innere Identität wird nicht durch unverhüllte Selbstaussage, sondern durch kontrollierte Differenz zwischen Erscheinung und Grund stabilisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:SD5","text":"Das Verhältnis von Winter und Sprecherfigur wird als wechselseitige Hervorbringung modelliert, nicht als eindeutige Ursache und Wirkung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:DNX1","text":"Das System hängt davon ab, dass unmittelbare Sichtbarkeit des Glücks soziale Feindschaft, Neid oder Zugriff hervorruft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:DNX2","text":"Es muss falsch sein, dass Schmerz nur passiv erlitten und nicht strategisch verwendet werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:DNX3","text":"Es muss falsch sein, dass eine dunkle oder verschlossene Oberfläche den inneren Grund besser schützt als helle Durchsichtigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:DNX4","text":"Es muss falsch sein, dass Mitleid den wirklichen Zustand eines Menschen erkennt, statt ihn nach sozialen Symptomen zu verfehlen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:DNX5","text":"Es muss falsch sein, dass Einsamkeit notwendig auf Krankheit, Mangel oder Flucht vor der Welt verweist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:DNX6","text":"Es muss ausgeschlossen werden, dass das Glück ohne Vermittlung durch eine sichtbare Notlage öffentlich bestehen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:SNX1","text":"Eine unvermittelte soziale Lesbarkeit des Glücks ist im System nicht verfügbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:SNX2","text":"Eine vollständige Offenlegung von Seele, Grund und letztem Willen wird als unzulässige Verwundbarkeit behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:SNX3","text":"Eine soziale Gemeinschaft, in der Glück, Bedürftigkeit und Wahrheit unmittelbar zusammenfallen, bleibt als Möglichkeit versperrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:FGS1","text":"Harte äußere Bedingung → Anerkennung ihrer störungsbeseitigenden Funktion → Umwandlung des Feindes in einen nutzbaren Hausfreund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:FGS2","text":"Winterliche Belastung → selbstgesetzte Gegenhandlung → gesteigerte Unabhängigkeit und Öffnung zum Licht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:FGS3","text":"Winterhimmel als schweigende Instanz → Übertragung auf die Seele → aktives Schweigen, das den Willen verbirgt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:FGS4","text":"Undurchsichtige Oberfläche → gesteigerter Entschlüsselungsdruck → Vorrang der hellen, transparenten, aber tiefen Erscheinung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:FGS5","text":"Selektive Darstellung von Frost, Unfall und Bedürftigkeit → soziale Fehllektüre → Abschirmung des warmen Glücks.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:FGS6","text":"Zugelassenes Mitleid → Flucht vor den mitleidigen und neidischen Innenwelten → Rückkehr zum warmen Sonnenwinkel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:FGS7","text":"Sichtbarer Winter plus verborgene Sonne → doppelte Selbstordnung → souveränes Spotten über die Mitleidsordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:AF1","text":"Harte Wintergegenwart → funktionale Umwertung der Härte → selbstgesetzte Bosheit und Bewegung → Schweigen als aktive Verbergung → sichtbare Not als Tarnung → soziale Fehllektüre und Mitleid → warme Einsamkeit auf dem Ölberg.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:ME1","text":"Der Winter wird von einem bloßen Leiden zu einem Instrument der Reizreduktion, Selbstprüfung und sozialen Distanzierung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:ME2","text":"Schweigen wird von Abwesenheit der Rede zu einer aktiven Technik der Willensverbergung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:ME3","text":"Transparenz und Tiefe werden nicht mehr als Gegensätze behandelt; eine helle Oberfläche kann den unzugänglichsten Grund tragen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:ME4","text":"Mitleid wird von einer möglichen Erkenntnisform zu einer steuerbaren Fehlklassifikation des Glücks umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:ME5","text":"Einsamkeit wird in zwei gegensätzliche Funktionen geteilt: Flucht des Kranken und Flucht vor den Kranken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0038","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:ME6","text":"Sichtbare Schwäche und verborgene Stärke werden als gleichzeitig wirksame, nicht ausschließende Zustände lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:ALT1","text":"Surface: Kälte, Schweigen, Frostbeulen, Unfälle und Mitleid bilden die sichtbare Handlungsebene.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:ALT2","text":"Structural: Entbehrung, Geräuschlosigkeit und selektive Selbstdarstellung organisieren Zugang, Fremdwahrnehmung und soziale Distanz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Die Sprecherfigur gewinnt Handlungsmacht, indem sie die Deutung ihrer Not an die Umgebung delegiert und deren Mitleid gegen deren Erkenntnisanspruch verwendet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Die Seele erscheint als geschichtete Wirklichkeit aus sichtbarer Winterform und verborgener Sonnenzone; gute Dinge und Schweigen entstehen vielfach und wiederholt statt aus einem einzigen Ursprung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von der winterlichen Belastung zur strategischen Nutzung von Kälte, Schweigen und Mitleid zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob der Winter als äußere Wirklichkeit, seelischer Zustand oder poetische Übertragung zu lesen ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:MRT3","text":"Intern kohärent ist das System dort, wo Härte als Bedingung von Autonomie und soziale Fehllektüre als Schutz erklärt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:MRT4","text":"Unaufgelöst bleibt die Spannung zwischen der Ehrung des Winters und der fortgesetzten Flucht vor ihm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:MRT5","text":"Unaufgelöst bleibt ferner, dass die Sprecherfigur sowohl Verbergen praktiziert als auch die helle Durchsichtigkeit als höchste Schweigeform privilegiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0023","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:MRT6","text":"Die stärkste Konstruktion ist die Umkehrung des Mitleids: Die sichtbare Not schützt eine unsichtbare Fülle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bleibt auf die rhetorische Doppelstruktur angewiesen, in der Frost tatsächlich gezeigt, Glück aber systematisch entzogen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:MRT8","text":"Die ursprüngliche Argumentbewegung bleibt erhalten, sofern Winter, Schweigen, Tarnung und Ölberg als aufeinanderfolgende Operationen und nicht als bloße Bilder behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T192817044934Z_6f0779ca","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"On the Mount of Olives","source_sha256":"e74f6e277ce14718054c341e8d37513ee56e7f4698626ad4216a368a04e72fe5","sha256":"cf0957310d9395f32624c0d701ea6df60a517b03851494c5dc37c4ff38ace489","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:28:17.049218+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:AS1","text":"The speaker figure treats winter as a harsh but usable presence in its own house.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:AS2","text":"It transforms the cold it has endured, through movement, mockery, and self-imposed harshness, into a condition of independence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:AS3","text":"Winter is redefined from a hostile state into the model of a long, luminous silence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:AS4","text":"Concealment does not mean darkening, but the controlled visibility of a surface with an inaccessible ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:AS5","text":"The speaker figure deliberately presents winter, accidents, and frost to observers so that its happiness remains invisible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:AS6","text":"The social order of pity is used as a protective cloak and at the same time rejected through flight into the warm corner of sunlight.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:A1","text":"Winter is a harsh presence effective both physically and socially.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:A2","text":"A harshness can be honored without submitting to it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:A3","text":"Movement toward a windless corner of sunlight makes possible distance from the wintry presence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:A4","text":"Cold, solitude, and silence eliminate disturbing noises and alien intrusions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:A5","text":"Voluntary poverty and bodily privation secure the independence of the speaker figure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:A6","text":"Malice and self-discipline can actively provoke an adverse order and force its opening toward the light.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:A7","text":"Good and willful things possess no single necessary origin.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:A8","text":"Long silence can conceal the will without passing into mere darkness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:A9","text":"Opaque concealment provokes decipherment, whereas transparency can leave a deeper ground undisclosed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:A10","text":"The social environment mistakes visible need for the speaker figure's overall condition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:A11","text":"Happiness can be shielded from others' envy through represented accidents, frost, and need.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:A12","text":"Pity is at once a social misreading and a usable protective mechanism.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:A13","text":"Solitude can be flight from the sick and not the flight of a sick person.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0038","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:A14","text":"The speaker figure's hidden inner condition is warm, related to the sun, and superior to pity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:NX1","text":"The sustaining relation to harshness is not the worship of a warming fire-god.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:NX2","text":"Independence does not consist in groveling before the powerful.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:NX3","text":"Warmth and wealth do not count as necessary conditions of inner happiness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:NX4","text":"Solitude is not determined as mere illness or social incapacity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:NX5","text":"Silence is not an immediate disclosure of the ground and the ultimate will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:NX6","text":"Concealment is not the same as murky, impenetrable obscuring.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:NX7","text":"The visible winter storms do not exhaust the speaker figure's actual region of movement and warmth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:NX8","text":"Accidents and frost distress are not the complete truth of happiness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:NX9","text":"The pity of the environment is not reliable knowledge of the hidden condition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0041","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:NX10","text":"The winter side of the soul is not wholly denied; only its identification with the whole is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:D1","text":"Winter is transformed from an endured condition into a functional house-friend as soon as its disturbance-eliminating effect is recognized.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADL0:A1","CH_97E9_ADL0:A2","CH_97E9_ADL0:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:D2","text":"The speaker figure asserts its freedom through a combination of flight movement, cold self-examination, and mockery.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADL0:A3","CH_97E9_ADL0:A5","CH_97E9_ADL0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:D3","text":"Long silence is determined as an actively produced form of non-disclosure.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADL0:A7","CH_97E9_ADL0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:D4","text":"The most effective concealment consists in appearing bright and transparent without disclosing one's own ground.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADL0:A8","CH_97E9_ADL0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:D5","text":"The speaker figure controls others' perception by showing real cold and blanking out the simultaneous warmth.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADL0:A10","CH_97E9_ADL0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:D6","text":"The permitted pity protects happiness precisely by misclassifying it.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADL0:A10","CH_97E9_ADL0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:D7","text":"The final distance from the social environment is organized as flight out of its heated, pitying inner world.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADL0:A4","CH_97E9_ADL0:A13","CH_97E9_ADL0:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:SD1","text":"The system turns adversity into a selective infrastructure of autonomy: cold weakens the body but strengthens control over access, perception, and will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:SD2","text":"The speaker figure produces a double order of existence from visible frost-poverty and invisible solar abundance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:SD3","text":"Social legibility is strategically reversed: the more plausible public need appears, the better happiness remains protected from envy and appropriation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:SD4","text":"Inner identity is stabilized not through unveiled self-statement but through controlled difference between appearance and ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:SD5","text":"The relation between winter and the speaker figure is modeled as mutual production, not as unambiguous cause and effect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:DNX1","text":"The system depends on the fact that immediate visibility of happiness produces social hostility, envy, or encroachment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:DNX2","text":"It must be false that pain can only be endured passively and cannot be used strategically.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:DNX3","text":"It must be false that a dark or closed surface protects the inner ground better than bright transparency.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:DNX4","text":"It must be false that pity recognizes a person's actual condition rather than misapprehending it according to social symptoms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:DNX5","text":"It must be false that solitude necessarily refers to illness, lack, or flight from the world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:DNX6","text":"It must be excluded that happiness can publicly subsist without mediation through a visible state of need.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:SNX1","text":"An unmediated social legibility of happiness is unavailable within the system.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:SNX2","text":"A complete disclosure of soul, ground, and ultimate will is treated as impermissible vulnerability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:SNX3","text":"A social community in which happiness, need, and truth immediately coincide remains barred as a possibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:FGS1","text":"Harsh external condition → recognition of its disturbance-eliminating function → transformation of the enemy into a usable house-friend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:FGS2","text":"Wintry burden → self-imposed counteraction → increased independence and opening toward the light.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:FGS3","text":"Winter sky as a silent instance → transfer to the soul → active silence that conceals the will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:FGS4","text":"Opaque surface → increased pressure for decipherment → priority of bright, transparent, yet deep appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:FGS5","text":"Selective presentation of frost, accident, and need → social misreading → shielding of warm happiness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:FGS6","text":"Permitted pity → flight from pitying and envious inner worlds → return to the warm corner of sunlight.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:FGS7","text":"Visible winter plus hidden sun → double self-ordering → sovereign mockery of the order of pity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:AF1","text":"Harsh winter presence → functional revaluation of harshness → self-imposed malice and movement → silence as active concealment → visible need as camouflage → social misreading and pity → warm solitude on the Mount of Olives.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:ME1","text":"Winter is remapped from mere suffering into an instrument of stimulus reduction, self-examination, and social distancing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:ME2","text":"Silence is reclassified from absence of speech into an active technique of concealing the will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:ME3","text":"Transparency and depth are no longer treated as opposites; a bright surface can bear the most inaccessible ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:ME4","text":"Pity is remapped from a possible form of knowledge into a controllable misclassification of happiness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:ME5","text":"Solitude is divided into two opposing functions: the flight of the sick and flight from the sick.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0038","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:ME6","text":"Visible weakness and hidden strength become legible as simultaneously effective, non-exclusive states.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:ALT1","text":"Surface: Cold, silence, chilblains, accidents, and pity constitute the visible level of action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:ALT2","text":"Structural: Privation, noiselessness, and selective self-presentation organize access, others' perception, and social distance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: The speaker figure gains agency by delegating the interpretation of its need to the environment and using its pity against its claim to knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: The soul appears as a layered reality of visible winter form and hidden solar zone; good things and silence arise multiply and repeatedly rather than from a single origin.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from wintry burden to the strategic use of cold, silence, and pity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether winter is to be read as external reality, psychic state, or poetic transfer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:MRT3","text":"The system is internally coherent where harshness is explained as a condition of autonomy and social misreading as protection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:MRT4","text":"The tension between honoring winter and continued flight from it remains unresolved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:MRT5","text":"Further unresolved is the fact that the speaker figure both practices concealment and privileges bright transparency as the highest form of silence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0023","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:MRT6","text":"The strongest construction is the reversal of pity: visible need protects an invisible abundance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction remains dependent on the rhetorical double structure in which frost is actually shown, but happiness is systematically withdrawn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_ADL0:MRT8","text":"The original argumentative movement remains preserved provided that winter, silence, camouflage, and the Mount of Olives are treated as successive operations and not as mere images.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_ADL0:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_ADL0@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_ADL0:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 73","title":"On the Mount of Olives","context":"Chapter 73","original_title":"Auf dem Ölberge","original_context":"Chapter 73"},"original_title":"Auf dem Ölberge","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0","layer":"CH","title":"On Passing By","order":74,"parents":["RAW_97E9_VVB0"],"revision":"CH_97E9_VVB0@R001","sha256":"cced21d456956b0a825347ba0350f6c4fae2c86447a15ba9f2aa307040eee041","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:AS1","text":"Der Text diagnostiziert die große Stadt als konzentrierten Raum der geistigen, affektiven, sozialen und ökonomischen Zersetzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:AS2","text":"Die Anklage gegen die Stadt wird durch einen Nachahmer Zarathustras vorgetragen, dessen Redeform selbst von der kritisierten Zersetzung erfasst ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:AS3","text":"Die Gültigkeit einer Kritik wird von ihrer affektiven Herkunft und ihrer sprachlichen Wirkung getrennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:AS4","text":"Zarathustra weist die Narrenrede zurück, weil ihr scheinbar richtiges Urteil aus Kränkung, Selbstverschmutzung und Rache hervorgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:AS5","text":"Er anerkennt dennoch den Ekel vor der Stadt und trennt dadurch den Gegenstand der Kritik von der Unzulänglichkeit des Kritikers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0037","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:AS6","text":"Da die Stadt weder durch Verbesserung noch durch Verschlimmerung bearbeitet werden soll, wird das Vorübergehen zur angemessenen strategischen Antwort.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:AS7","text":"Eine spätere Zerstörung bleibt als zeitlich und schicksalhaft gebundene Vorbedingung des großen Mittags geöffnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:A1","text":"Die große Stadt bündelt heterogene soziale, politische, religiöse, mediale und ökonomische Kräfte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:A2","text":"Diese Bündelung verwandelt große Gedanken und Gefühle in verkleinerte, verbrauchte und zirkulationsfähige Formen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:A3","text":"Die Medien der Stadt bringen geistigen Abfall als öffentliche Meinung und Zeitung erneut in Umlauf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:A4","text":"Die städtische Öffentlichkeit reguliert kranke, erhitzte und erkaltete Subjekte durch süchtige Meinungen und künstliche Gegenreize.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:A5","text":"Die anstellige Tugend und die Frömmigkeit der Stadt sind auf Dienst, Schmeichelei und aufwärts gerichtete Anerkennung organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:A6","text":"Die fürstliche Ordnung wird letztlich durch das Gold der Krämer gelenkt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:A7","text":"Der Narr übernimmt Satz, Fall und Teile des Weisheitsschatzes Zarathustras, ohne deren ursprüngliche Quelle zu besitzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:A8","text":"Langes Verweilen im Sumpf verwandelt den Kritiker selbst in ein sumpfartiges, schäumendes und quakendes Wesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:A9","text":"Der Mangel an Schmeichelei erzeugt beim Narren Kränkung, Rache und schäumende Anklage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:A10","text":"Die sachliche Richtigkeit einer Rede garantiert weder ihre angemessene Wirkung noch ihre rechtmäßige Verwendung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:A11","text":"Verachtung und Warnung sind nur dann legitim, wenn sie aus Liebe und nicht aus Sumpf oder Rache hervorgehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:A12","text":"Eine Warnung verliert ihre Autorität, wenn der Warnende die von ihm angegriffene Verderbnis nicht an sich selbst prüft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:A13","text":"Die große Stadt ist für Zarathustra weder zu bessern noch zu bösern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0037","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:A14","text":"Feuersäulen müssen dem großen Mittag vorausgehen, doch ihr Eintreten gehört einer eigenen Zeit und einem eigenen Schicksal an.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0039","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:A15","text":"Wo Liebe nicht mehr möglich ist, besteht die angemessene Bewegung im Vorübergehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:A16","text":"Die Verwerfung des Narren hebt Zarathustras eigenen Ekel vor der großen Stadt nicht auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0037","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:NX1","text":"Die große Stadt ist kein Ort, an dem Zarathustra etwas zu suchen hätte; sie ist ein Ort des Verlusts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:NX2","text":"Die Stadt ist kein neutraler Aufenthaltsraum für große Gedanken und Gefühle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:NX3","text":"Öffentliche Meinung ist keine Orientierung, sondern eine süchtige und krankmachende Regulationsform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:NX4","text":"Die anstellige Tugend ist keine autonome Tugend, sondern eine Form des Dienstes und der Anerkennungssuche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:NX5","text":"Die religiöse und höfische Ordnung ist nicht unabhängig vom ökonomischen Kommando des Goldes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:NX6","text":"Der Narr ist nicht Zarathustra; die Übernahme seiner Redeweise begründet keine Identität mit seiner Quelle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:NX7","text":"Eine Kritik ist nicht dadurch legitimiert, dass sie in einzelnen Aussagen Recht hat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:NX8","text":"Verachtung darf nicht aus Sumpf, Kränkung oder Rache hervorgehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:NX9","text":"Eine Warnung ist nicht selbstbeglaubigend, wenn sie den Warnenden von der Prüfung ausnimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:NX10","text":"Die große Stadt ist kein Gegenstand unmittelbarer Verbesserung durch moralische Anklage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:NX11","text":"Das angemessene Verhältnis zur unliebbar gewordenen Stadt ist nicht weitere Verstrickung, sondern Vorübergehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0041","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:NX12","text":"Der Ekel vor der Stadt darf nicht mit der Rache des Narren identifiziert werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:D1","text":"Die große Stadt erscheint nicht bloß als Ansammlung einzelner Laster, sondern als Aggregat, in dem geistige, affektive, mediale, höfische und ökonomische Verfallsformen zusammenlaufen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VVB0:A1","CH_97E9_VVB0:A2","CH_97E9_VVB0:A5","CH_97E9_VVB0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:D2","text":"Die öffentliche Zirkulation beseitigt den geistigen Abfall der Stadt nicht, sondern vervielfältigt und verbreitet ihn.","refs":["CH_97E9_VVB0:A2","CH_97E9_VVB0:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:D3","text":"Die scheinbare Tugend der Stadt bildet eine vertikale Anerkennungskette aus Dienst, Schmeichelei, Fürstenstatus und ökonomischer Macht.","refs":["CH_97E9_VVB0:A5","CH_97E9_VVB0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:D4","text":"Der Narr reproduziert die äußere Autoritätsform Zarathustras, ohne deren affektive und geistige Grundlage zu reproduzieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_VVB0:A7","CH_97E9_VVB0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:D5","text":"Der Kritiker wird durch seinen Aufenthalt im Sumpf zu einem Exemplar derjenigen Verfassung, die er an der Stadt bekämpft.","refs":["CH_97E9_VVB0:A8","CH_97E9_VVB0:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:D6","text":"Die aggressive Stadtkritik des Narren ist die sprachliche Umleitung einer unerfüllten Anerkennungsforderung in Rache.","refs":["CH_97E9_VVB0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:D7","text":"Eine richtige Diagnose kann durch ihre Herkunft und ihren Vollzug in eine falsche oder schädliche Rede übergehen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VVB0:A9","CH_97E9_VVB0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:D8","text":"Die Kritik des Gegenstands und die Kritik der Rede müssen getrennt werden: Die Stadt bleibt ekelerregend, obwohl die Rede des Narren verworfen wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_VVB0:A10","CH_97E9_VVB0:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:D9","text":"Die Legitimität der Verachtung hängt nicht primär von ihrem Gegenstand, sondern von ihrer affektiven Herkunft ab.","refs":["CH_97E9_VVB0:A10","CH_97E9_VVB0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:D10","text":"Weil die Stadt nicht verbessert oder verschlimmert werden soll, wird das Vorübergehen als nichtreformistische Handlung bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VVB0:A13","CH_97E9_VVB0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:D11","text":"Die erwartete Zerstörung der Stadt ist keine unmittelbare Handlungsanweisung, sondern eine aufgeschobene, schicksalhafte Zeitfigur.","refs":["CH_97E9_VVB0:A13","CH_97E9_VVB0:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:SD1","text":"Die Wahrheit einer Kritik und ihre ethische oder geistige Wirksamkeit bilden zwei getrennte Prüfungen; sachliche Richtigkeit kann die Redeform nicht retten.","refs":["CH_97E9_VVB0:A9","CH_97E9_VVB0:A10","CH_97E9_VVB0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:SD2","text":"Der Kritiker steht nicht außerhalb des kritisierten Systems, weil die städtische Verderbnis seine Sprache, seine Affekte und seine Motivstruktur erfassen kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_VVB0:A2","CH_97E9_VVB0:A7","CH_97E9_VVB0:A8","CH_97E9_VVB0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:SD3","text":"Die Nachahmung Zarathustras zeigt, dass Opposition gegen die Stadt innerhalb derselben Stadtlogik in bloße Wiederholung und Verschmutzung umschlagen kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_VVB0:A3","CH_97E9_VVB0:A7","CH_97E9_VVB0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:SD4","text":"Die Verbindung von fehlender Reformierbarkeit und aufgeschobener Feuersäule erzeugt eine Strategie des Rückzugs bei gleichzeitiger Offenhaltung einer zukünftigen Umwälzung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VVB0:A13","CH_97E9_VVB0:A14","CH_97E9_VVB0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:SD5","text":"Die große Stadt ist als vernetztes Verfallssystem bestimmt, in dem geistige Zersetzung, öffentliche Meinung, Diensttugend, Hof und Handel einander stabilisieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_VVB0:A1","CH_97E9_VVB0:A2","CH_97E9_VVB0:A3","CH_97E9_VVB0:A5","CH_97E9_VVB0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:DNX1","text":"Es gibt keinen unverunreinigten Außenstandpunkt, von dem aus die Stadt ohne Gefahr ihrer eigenen Übernahme kritisiert werden könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:DNX2","text":"Semantische Richtigkeit ist kein hinreichendes Kriterium für geistige oder ethische Geltung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:DNX3","text":"Öffentliche Sprache ist kein neutrales Medium, sondern kann Gedanken in Wortspiel, Abfall und Zirkulationsware verwandeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:DNX4","text":"Anerkennung, Rang und politische Ordnung sind nicht von Schmeichelei, Dienst und ökonomischer Steuerung ablösbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:DNX5","text":"Die bloße Enthüllung des Verfalls erzeugt keine Möglichkeit seiner Veränderung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:DNX6","text":"Der Kritiker besitzt keine automatische Immunität gegen die Formen, die er kritisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:DNX7","text":"Der Rückzug ist nicht als vorläufiges Versagen einer Reform gedacht, sondern als Ausschluss einer weiteren Verstrickung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen bleibt die Möglichkeit einer öffentlichen Gemeinschaft, in der große Gedanken und Gefühle ihre Größe bewahren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen bleibt eine zugleich wahre, nicht-rächende und nicht-korrumpierte Kritik, solange Liebe nicht als ihre Quelle wirksam ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen bleibt eine reinigende Funktion der öffentlichen Zirkulation; sie macht den Abfall sichtbar, ohne ihn aufzuheben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen bleibt die unmittelbare politische Bearbeitung der Stadt; an ihre Stelle treten Vorübergehen und aufgeschobenes Schicksal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:SNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen bleibt die unproblematische Aneignung einer fremden Weisheit durch bloße sprachliche Nachahmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:FGS1","text":"Soziale und institutionelle Aggregation → Verkleinerung von Gedanken und Gefühlen → mediale Zirkulation des geistigen Abfalls.","refs":["CH_97E9_VVB0:A1","CH_97E9_VVB0:A2","CH_97E9_VVB0:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:FGS2","text":"Städtische Verfallsumgebung → Übernahme von Zarathustras Redeform → scheinbar autonome Anklage ohne ursprüngliche geistige Grundlage.","refs":["CH_97E9_VVB0:A3","CH_97E9_VVB0:A7","CH_97E9_VVB0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:FGS3","text":"Entzug von Schmeichelei → Kränkung → Rache → schäumende Rede → Selbstverwandlung des Kritikers in den kritisierten Sumpf.","refs":["CH_97E9_VVB0:A8","CH_97E9_VVB0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:FGS4","text":"Sachliche Richtigkeit ohne liebevolle Herkunft → schädliche Rede → Trennung von Gegenstandswahrheit und Sprecherlegitimität.","refs":["CH_97E9_VVB0:A10","CH_97E9_VVB0:A11","CH_97E9_VVB0:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:FGS5","text":"Anerkannter Ekel vor der Stadt + Ausschluss ihrer unmittelbaren Reformierbarkeit → Vorübergehen → zeitlich aufgeschobene Möglichkeit der Feuersäule vor dem großen Mittag.","refs":["CH_97E9_VVB0:A13","CH_97E9_VVB0:A14","CH_97E9_VVB0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:AF1","text":"Große Stadt als Verfallsaggregat → Zersetzung von Geist und Gefühl → öffentliche Zirkulation des Abfalls → Nachahmung Zarathustras durch den Narren → Genealogie aus Kränkung und Rache → Trennung von richtiger Diagnose und falscher Rede → Anerkennung des städtischen Ekels bei Zurückweisung des Kritikers → Vorübergehen → aufgeschobene Feuersäule vor dem großen Mittag.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:AF2","text":"Mangel an Schmeichelei → Rachemotiv → Sumpfaufenthalt → kontaminierte Warnung → Verachtung der Verachtung → Rückkehr zur liebebegründeten Verachtung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:ME1","text":"Die Stadt wird von einem geografischen Ort zu einem umfassenden Kontaminationsfeld umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:ME2","text":"Einzelne Laster werden zu Funktionen eines Netzes aus öffentlicher Meinung, Medien, Dienst, Hof und Handel reorganisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:ME3","text":"Die Opposition zwischen wahrer und falscher Kritik wird durch die Unterscheidung von Aussageinhalt, affektiver Herkunft und Wirkung ersetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:ME4","text":"Die Grenze zwischen Kritiker und Gegenstand bricht zusammen, weil der Kritiker die Struktur des Gegenstands sprachlich und affektiv wiederholen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:ME5","text":"Vorübergehen wird von passiver Flucht zu einer bestimmten Strategie gegen kontaminierende Verstrickung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:ME6","text":"Die politische Zeit wird von unmittelbarer Verbesserung auf eine noch ausstehende, schicksalhaft gebundene Umwälzung verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Ein Narr attackiert die große Stadt; Zarathustra unterbricht ihn, weist seine Rede zurück und geht an ihm und der Stadt vorüber.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Die Stadt organisiert geistige Zersetzung als Zusammenspiel von Öffentlichkeit, Medien, Diensttugend, Hof und ökonomischer Lenkung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Der Text bestimmt die Bedingungen legitimer Kritik und ersetzt konfrontative Anklage durch Distanzierung von einer nicht mehr liebbaren Ordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Liebe fungiert als generative Quelle gültiger Verachtung, während Sumpf eine kontaminierte Seinsweise und der große Mittag eine noch nicht eingetretene Zeitordnung bezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von städtischer Zersetzung über die korrumpierte Kritik bis zum Vorübergehen zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, woran Liebe positiv erkannt werden kann und wie sie von einer bloß behaupteten Reinheit unterschieden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Aussagewahrheit und Sprecherlegitimität als getrennte Prüfungen behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:MRT4","text":"Eine ungelöste Spannung besteht zwischen der Anerkennung der richtigen Stadtkritik und der Behauptung, dass ihre Form den Kritiker selbst unwahr macht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0035","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0037","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:MRT5","text":"Eine zweite Spannung besteht zwischen dem Satz, die Stadt sei weder zu bessern noch zu bösern, und dem Wunsch nach ihrer Verbrennung durch zukünftige Feuersäulen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0037","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0038","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0039","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:MRT6","text":"Die Maschine ist am stärksten in der Genealogie der Rache und der Trennung von Gegenstand und Rede; die politische Funktion des Vorübergehens bleibt am wenigsten bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, sofern die rhetorische Stadtbeschreibung als Strukturmodell und nicht als bloßer Katalog von Beschimpfungen gelesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T195456244452Z_67930d9d","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"On Passing By","source_sha256":"cced21d456956b0a825347ba0350f6c4fae2c86447a15ba9f2aa307040eee041","sha256":"da2567a2fe378406cc1a6de190613ce60f910cd884e0de90394bdd7a79c7d0b1","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:54:56.245803+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:AS1","text":"The text diagnoses the great city as a concentrated space of spiritual, affective, social, and economic disintegration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:AS2","text":"The indictment of the city is advanced by an imitator of Zarathustra, whose form of speech is itself afflicted by the disintegration being criticized.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:AS3","text":"The validity of a critique is separated from its affective origin and its linguistic effect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:AS4","text":"Zarathustra rejects the fool's speech because its seemingly correct judgment proceeds from resentment, self-defilement, and revenge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:AS5","text":"He nevertheless acknowledges the disgust at the city, thereby separating the object of critique from the inadequacy of the critic.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0037","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:AS6","text":"Since the city is to be worked upon neither through improvement nor through worsening, passing by becomes the appropriate strategic response.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:AS7","text":"A later destruction remains open as a temporally and fate-bound precondition of the great noon.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:A1","text":"The great city concentrates heterogeneous social, political, religious, media, and economic forces.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:A2","text":"This concentration transforms great thoughts and feelings into diminished, spent, and circulation-capable forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:A3","text":"The media of the city put spiritual refuse back into circulation as public opinion and newspaper.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:A4","text":"The urban public regulates sick, overheated, and chilled subjects through addictive opinions and artificial counter-stimuli.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:A5","text":"The ambitious virtue and piety of the city are organized around service, flattery, and upward-directed recognition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:A6","text":"The princely order is ultimately directed by the gold of the shopkeepers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:A7","text":"The fool adopts Zarathustra's sentence, cadence, and parts of his treasury of wisdom without possessing their original source.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:A8","text":"Prolonged lingering in the swamp transforms the critic himself into a swamp-like, foaming, and croaking being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:A9","text":"The lack of flattery generates in the fool resentment, revenge, and foaming accusation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:A10","text":"The factual correctness of a speech guarantees neither its appropriate effect nor its rightful use.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:A11","text":"Contempt and warning are legitimate only when they proceed from love and not from swamp or revenge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:A12","text":"A warning loses its authority when the one issuing it does not test upon himself the corruption he attacks.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:A13","text":"For Zarathustra, the great city is neither to be improved nor made worse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0037","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:A14","text":"Pillars of fire must precede the great noon, yet their occurrence belongs to a time and a fate of their own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0039","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:A15","text":"Where love is no longer possible, the appropriate movement consists in passing by.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:A16","text":"The rejection of the fool does not abolish Zarathustra's own disgust at the great city.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0037","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:NX1","text":"The great city is not a place where Zarathustra would have anything to seek; it is a place of loss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:NX2","text":"The city is not a neutral place of sojourn for great thoughts and feelings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:NX3","text":"Public opinion is not orientation, but an addictive and pathogenic form of regulation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:NX4","text":"Ambitious virtue is not autonomous virtue, but a form of service and the pursuit of recognition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:NX5","text":"The religious and courtly order is not independent of the economic command of gold.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:NX6","text":"The fool is not Zarathustra; the adoption of his manner of speech establishes no identity with his source.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:NX7","text":"A critique is not legitimized by being right in individual assertions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:NX8","text":"Contempt must not proceed from swamp, resentment, or revenge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:NX9","text":"A warning is not self-authenticating when it exempts the warner from examination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:NX10","text":"The great city is not an object of direct improvement through moral accusation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:NX11","text":"The appropriate relation to the city that has become unlovable is not further entanglement, but passing by.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0041","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:NX12","text":"Disgust at the city must not be identified with the fool's revenge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:D1","text":"The great city appears not merely as an accumulation of individual vices, but as an aggregate in which spiritual, affective, media, courtly, and economic forms of decay converge.","refs":["CH_97E9_VVB0:A1","CH_97E9_VVB0:A2","CH_97E9_VVB0:A5","CH_97E9_VVB0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:D2","text":"Public circulation does not eliminate the city's spiritual refuse, but multiplies and disseminates it.","refs":["CH_97E9_VVB0:A2","CH_97E9_VVB0:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:D3","text":"The city's apparent virtue forms a vertical chain of recognition consisting of service, flattery, princely status, and economic power.","refs":["CH_97E9_VVB0:A5","CH_97E9_VVB0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:D4","text":"The fool reproduces Zarathustra's external form of authority without reproducing its affective and spiritual foundation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VVB0:A7","CH_97E9_VVB0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:D5","text":"Through his stay in the swamp, the critic becomes an exemplar of the very condition that he combats in the city.","refs":["CH_97E9_VVB0:A8","CH_97E9_VVB0:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:D6","text":"The fool's aggressive critique of the city is the linguistic diversion of an unfulfilled demand for recognition into revenge.","refs":["CH_97E9_VVB0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:D7","text":"A correct diagnosis can, through its origin and its enactment, turn into a false or harmful speech.","refs":["CH_97E9_VVB0:A9","CH_97E9_VVB0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:D8","text":"The critique of the object and the critique of the speech must be separated: the city remains disgusting although the fool's speech is rejected.","refs":["CH_97E9_VVB0:A10","CH_97E9_VVB0:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:D9","text":"The legitimacy of contempt depends not primarily on its object, but on its affective origin.","refs":["CH_97E9_VVB0:A10","CH_97E9_VVB0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:D10","text":"Because the city is to be neither improved nor worsened, passing by is determined as a non-reformist action.","refs":["CH_97E9_VVB0:A13","CH_97E9_VVB0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:D11","text":"The expected destruction of the city is not an immediate instruction for action, but a deferred, fate-bound temporal figure.","refs":["CH_97E9_VVB0:A13","CH_97E9_VVB0:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:SD1","text":"The truth of a critique and its ethical or spiritual efficacy constitute two separate tests; factual correctness cannot save the form of speech.","refs":["CH_97E9_VVB0:A9","CH_97E9_VVB0:A10","CH_97E9_VVB0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:SD2","text":"The critic does not stand outside the system criticized, because urban corruption can seize his language, his affects, and his motivational structure.","refs":["CH_97E9_VVB0:A2","CH_97E9_VVB0:A7","CH_97E9_VVB0:A8","CH_97E9_VVB0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:SD3","text":"The imitation of Zarathustra shows that opposition to the city can, within the same urban logic, turn into mere repetition and defilement.","refs":["CH_97E9_VVB0:A3","CH_97E9_VVB0:A7","CH_97E9_VVB0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:SD4","text":"The conjunction of lack of reformability and the deferred pillar of fire produces a strategy of withdrawal while keeping open a future upheaval.","refs":["CH_97E9_VVB0:A13","CH_97E9_VVB0:A14","CH_97E9_VVB0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:SD5","text":"The great city is determined as an interconnected system of decay in which spiritual disintegration, public opinion, service virtue, court, and trade stabilize one another.","refs":["CH_97E9_VVB0:A1","CH_97E9_VVB0:A2","CH_97E9_VVB0:A3","CH_97E9_VVB0:A5","CH_97E9_VVB0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:DNX1","text":"There is no uncontaminated external standpoint from which the city could be criticized without the danger of its own takeover.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:DNX2","text":"Semantic correctness is not a sufficient criterion for spiritual or ethical validity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:DNX3","text":"Public language is not a neutral medium, but can transform thoughts into wordplay, refuse, and a commodity of circulation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:DNX4","text":"Recognition, rank, and political order are not separable from flattery, service, and economic control.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:DNX5","text":"The mere unveiling of decay creates no possibility of changing it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:DNX6","text":"The critic possesses no automatic immunity against the forms he criticizes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:DNX7","text":"Withdrawal is not conceived as the provisional failure of a reform, but as the exclusion of further entanglement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:SNX1","text":"Excluded is the possibility of a public community in which great thoughts and feelings preserve their greatness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:SNX2","text":"Excluded is a critique that is at once true, non-vindictive, and uncorrupted, so long as love is not effective as its source.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:SNX3","text":"Excluded is a purifying function of public circulation; it makes the refuse visible without abolishing it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:SNX4","text":"Excluded is the direct political working upon the city; passing by and deferred fate take its place.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:SNX5","text":"Excluded is the unproblematic appropriation of another's wisdom through mere linguistic imitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:FGS1","text":"Social and institutional aggregation → diminution of thoughts and feelings → media circulation of spiritual refuse.","refs":["CH_97E9_VVB0:A1","CH_97E9_VVB0:A2","CH_97E9_VVB0:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:FGS2","text":"Urban environment of decay → adoption of Zarathustra's form of speech → seemingly autonomous accusation without original spiritual foundation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VVB0:A3","CH_97E9_VVB0:A7","CH_97E9_VVB0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:FGS3","text":"Withdrawal of flattery → resentment → revenge → foaming speech → self-transformation of the critic into the swamp being criticized.","refs":["CH_97E9_VVB0:A8","CH_97E9_VVB0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:FGS4","text":"Factual correctness without loving origin → harmful speech → separation of truth of the object and legitimacy of the speaker.","refs":["CH_97E9_VVB0:A10","CH_97E9_VVB0:A11","CH_97E9_VVB0:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:FGS5","text":"Acknowledged disgust at the city + exclusion of its direct reformability → passing by → temporally deferred possibility of the pillar of fire before the great noon.","refs":["CH_97E9_VVB0:A13","CH_97E9_VVB0:A14","CH_97E9_VVB0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:AF1","text":"Great city as aggregate of decay → disintegration of spirit and feeling → public circulation of refuse → imitation of Zarathustra by the fool → genealogy from resentment and revenge → separation of correct diagnosis and false speech → acknowledgment of urban disgust alongside rejection of the critic → passing by → deferred pillar of fire before the great noon.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:AF2","text":"Lack of flattery → motive of revenge → stay in the swamp → contaminated warning → contempt for contempt → return to contempt grounded in love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:ME1","text":"The city is remapped from a geographical place into a comprehensive field of contamination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:ME2","text":"Individual vices are reorganized into functions of a network of public opinion, media, service, court, and trade.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:ME3","text":"The opposition between true and false critique is replaced by the distinction among propositional content, affective origin, and effect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:ME4","text":"The boundary between critic and object collapses because the critic can repeat the structure of the object linguistically and affectively.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:ME5","text":"Passing by is reclassified from passive flight into a determinate strategy against contaminating entanglement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:ME6","text":"Political time is shifted from immediate improvement to an upheaval still outstanding and bound to fate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** A fool attacks the great city; Zarathustra interrupts him, rejects his speech, and passes by him and the city.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** The city organizes spiritual disintegration as an interplay of publicness, media, service virtue, court, and economic direction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** The text determines the conditions of legitimate critique and replaces confrontational accusation with distancing from an order no longer lovable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Love functions as the generative source of valid contempt, while swamp designates a contaminated mode of being and the great noon a temporal order not yet arrived.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from urban disintegration through corrupted critique to passing by.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is how love can positively be recognized and how it is distinguished from merely asserted purity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent provided that propositional truth and speaker legitimacy are treated as separate tests.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:MRT4","text":"An unresolved tension exists between the acknowledgment of correct critique of the city and the claim that its form itself makes the critic untrue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0035","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0037","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:MRT5","text":"A second tension exists between the proposition that the city is neither to be improved nor made worse and the wish for its burning by future pillars of fire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0037","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0038","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0039","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:MRT6","text":"The machine is strongest in the genealogy of revenge and the separation of object and speech; the political function of passing by remains least determined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VVB0:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual argumentative movement provided that the rhetorical description of the city is read as a structural model and not as a mere catalogue of insults.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VVB0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_VVB0@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_VVB0:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 74","title":"On Passing By","context":"Chapter 74","original_title":"Vom Vorübergehen","original_context":"Chapter 74"},"original_title":"Vom Vorübergehen","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5","layer":"CH","title":"On the Apostates · 1","order":75,"parents":["RAW_97E9_1C_5"],"revision":"CH_97E9_1C_5@R001","sha256":"391400aea1cc9a8345745a4f521dcdcc0f0a58c5a0bc22cc535535a8fc20cd00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:AS1","text":"Eine zunächst grüne, hoffnungstragende Gemeinschaft wird als verwelkt, müde und bequem diagnostiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:AS2","text":"Die ursprüngliche Erkenntnismutigkeit schlägt in Selbstverleumdung, Frömmigkeit und Rückzug um.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:AS3","text":"Diese Umkehr wird nicht als zufälliger individueller Wandel, sondern als Ausdruck einer feigen Menschenmehrheit bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:AS4","text":"Der andersartige Einzelne muss seine ersten Gefährten als Leichname und Possenreißer und seine späteren Gefährten als unreife Gläubige erfahren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:AS5","text":"Die strategische Konsequenz lautet: keine Bindung an die Gläubigen, keine Klage über das Verwelken, sondern Beschleunigung des Zerfalls durch den Wind des Einzelnen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:A1","text":"Hoffnung kann sich in eine verwelkte und graue soziale Wirklichkeit verwandeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:A2","text":"Junge Herzen können vorzeitig alt werden, ohne dadurch reif zu werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:A3","text":"Erkenntnismut kann in Müdigkeit und nachträgliche Verleumdung der eigenen früheren Tapferkeit umschlagen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:A4","text":"Das Zurückweichen vor Freiheit und Licht erzeugt Dunkelheit, Grübelei und häusliche Bequemlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:A5","text":"Die Fähigkeit zu langem Mut und Übermut ist selten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:A6","text":"Die Mehrheit bildet den Alltag, den Überfluss und die Viel-zu-Vielen und ist durch Feigheit bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:A7","text":"Wer dem andersartigen Typ angehört, begegnet notwendig Erfahrungen und Gefährten dieses Typs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:A8","text":"Die ersten Gefährten des andersartigen Typs erscheinen als Leichname und Possenreißer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:A9","text":"Die späteren Gefährten erscheinen als Gläubige mit Liebe, Torheit und unreifer Verehrung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:A10","text":"Die Möglichkeit eines anderen Wollens hängt von der Möglichkeit eines anderen Könnens ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:A11","text":"Halbheit beschädigt jede Ganzheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:A12","text":"Das Verwelken ist kein beklagenswerter Ausnahmefall, sondern ein Vorgang, den man geschehen lassen soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:A13","text":"Der Einzelne soll seine affektive Bindung an die Gläubigen und an die bunte Anfangshoffnung verweigern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:A14","text":"Der Einzelne kann den Zerfall des Verwelkten durch eine eigene Bewegung beschleunigen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:NX1","text":"Die jungen Herzen sind nicht durch Alter gereift, sondern durch Müdigkeit, Gemeinheit und Bequemlichkeit verdorben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:NX2","text":"Die Rückkehr zur Frömmigkeit gilt nicht als geistige Erneuerung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:NX3","text":"Das spätere Zurückweichen gilt nicht als legitime Korrektur der früheren Erkenntnismutigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:NX4","text":"Die Mehrheit ist nicht der Maßstab geistiger Gesundheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:NX5","text":"Die Gläubigen sind nicht als tragfähige Gefährtenschaft verfügbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:NX6","text":"Liebe und Verehrung der Gläubigen begründen keine berechtigte Herzensbindung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:NX7","text":"Das Verwelken ist nicht durch Klage aufzuhalten oder normativ zu widerrufen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:NX8","text":"Halbheit kann nicht als selbständige Form des Ganzen bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:D1","text":"Die sichtbare Frömmigkeit der ehemaligen Mutigen fungiert als Symptom eines Rückzugs aus Erkenntnis und Freiheit.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_5:A3","CH_97E9_1C_5:A4","CH_97E9_1C_5:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:D2","text":"Die soziale Mehrheit erscheint nicht bloß als zahlenmäßig groß, sondern als reproduktive Form von Feigheit.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_5:A5","CH_97E9_1C_5:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:D3","text":"Die Enttäuschung über die Verwandlung der jungen Herzen bestätigt die Einsamkeit des andersartigen Typs.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_5:A6","CH_97E9_1C_5:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:D4","text":"Die zeitliche Abfolge von Leichnamen, Possenreißern und Gläubigen bildet keine lineare Gemeinschaftsbildung, sondern eine Serie unzureichender Gefährtenschaften.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_5:A8","CH_97E9_1C_5:A9","CH_97E9_1C_5:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:D5","text":"Die Behauptung, die anderen könnten nicht anders, entlastet sie nicht moralisch, sondern fixiert ihre Unfähigkeit als Struktur.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_5:A10","CH_97E9_1C_5:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:D6","text":"Die angemessene Reaktion auf den Zerfall ist Loslassen statt Rettung oder Trauer.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_5:A11","CH_97E9_1C_5:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:D7","text":"Die Verweigerung der Bindung schützt den Einzelnen vor der Umdeutung unreifer Verehrung in geistige Gemeinschaft.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_5:A9","CH_97E9_1C_5:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:D8","text":"Der Einzelne wird vom Beobachter des Verfalls zum aktiven Beschleuniger seiner Auflösung.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_5:A12","CH_97E9_1C_5:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:SD1","text":"Das System ersetzt die Hoffnung auf kollektive Reifung durch die Selektion eines seltenen, ausdauernden Einzeltyps.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:SD2","text":"Gemeinschaft wird als Abfolge von Fehlformen kartiert: Verfall, Lächerlichkeit und unreife Gefolgschaft treten an die Stelle dauerhafter Gleichrangigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:SD3","text":"Der soziale Niedergang wird von einem tragischen Verlust in ein funktionales Ausscheidungsverfahren umgedeutet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:SD4","text":"Die Abkehr von den Gläubigen wird zur Bedingung dafür, dass der andersartige Typ seine Eigenart nicht in Verehrung auflöst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:SD5","text":"Das Argument erzeugt eine Ethik der Nicht-Bindung, in der Distanz und Beschleunigung gegenüber Fürsorge und Bewahrung privilegiert werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:DNX1","text":"Falsch ist die Annahme, dass anfängliche Begeisterung von selbst in dauerhafte Erkenntnis übergeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:DNX2","text":"Falsch ist die Annahme, dass Alter eine qualitative Reifung des Geistes garantiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:DNX3","text":"Falsch ist die Annahme, dass Frömmigkeit nach dem Verlust des Mutes eine höhere Form desselben Strebens darstellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:DNX4","text":"Falsch ist die Annahme, dass die Vielen durch ihre Vielzahl eine gültige soziale oder geistige Norm bilden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:DNX5","text":"Falsch ist die Annahme, dass Verehrung Gegenseitigkeit und Gleichrangigkeit erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:DNX6","text":"Falsch ist die Annahme, dass der Zerfall durch Bewahrung, Klage oder pädagogische Rückholung überwunden werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:DNX7","text":"Falsch ist die Annahme, dass ein Ganzes durch die Addition von Halbheiten entsteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine dauerhafte gemeinsame Welt, in der Erkenntnismut, Freiheit und soziale Gefährtenschaft zugleich erhalten bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:SNX2","text":"Unverfügbar ist eine reife Gemeinschaft zwischen dem andersartigen Einzelnen und denjenigen, die ihn zunächst verehren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:SNX3","text":"Versperrt ist die Möglichkeit, dass der ursprüngliche Aufbruch eine kollektiv tragfähige Zukunft besitzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:SNX4","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine Versöhnung zwischen Einsamkeit und Zugehörigkeit; die Bindung an die Vielen droht die Eigenart zu neutralisieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:SNX5","text":"Unzulässig ist jede Deutung des Verwelkens als Verlust, der den Einzelnen zur Wiederherstellung des Früheren verpflichtet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:FGS1","text":"Anfangshoffnung + Erkenntnismut → Ermüdung + Rückzug aus Licht und Freiheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:FGS2","text":"Ermüdung + Rückzug → Frömmigkeit, Dunkelheit, Bequemlichkeit und Verleumdung der früheren Tapferkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:FGS3","text":"Seltenheit des langen Mutes + Überzahl der Vielen → strukturelle Trennung von andersartigem Einzelnen und feiger Mehrheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:FGS4","text":"Andersartigkeit → Abfolge unzureichender Gefährtenschaften: Leichname/Possenreißer → Gläubige.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:FGS5","text":"Unzureichende Gefährtenschaft + Ausschluss der Bindung → Erhaltung der Eigenart durch Distanz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:FGS6","text":"Verwelken + Verzicht auf Klage → aktives Anblasen und Beschleunigen des Ausscheidens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:AF1","text":"Grüne Hoffnung → vorzeitige Ermüdung → Rückkehr zur Frömmigkeit → Diagnose der feigen Mehrheit → Einsamkeit des andersartigen Typs → Entwertung der Gläubigen als Gefährten → Verzicht auf Bindung und Klage → Beschleunigung des Verwelkens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:ME1","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Jugend und Alter wird durch den Gegensatz zwischen Mut und Müdigkeit ersetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:ME2","text":"Frömmigkeit wird von einem möglichen Ziel geistiger Entwicklung zu einem Index des Rückzugs umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:ME3","text":"Die soziale Landschaft wird nicht mehr in Individuen, sondern in seltene Ausdauernde und feige Viel-zu-Viele geteilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:ME4","text":"Gefährtenschaft wird zeitlich und qualitativ in Leichname, Possenreißer und Gläubige zerlegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:ME5","text":"Der Verfall wird von einem beklagenswerten Ereignis zu einem nützlichen Selektions- und Reinigungsprozess umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:ME6","text":"Wind, Distanz und Loslassen werden als operative Formen der Einwirkung auf das soziale Feld klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:ALT1","text":"Surface: Ehemals mutige junge Menschen werden müde, fromm, dunkel und bequem.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:ALT2","text":"Structural: Erkenntnis- und Freiheitsbewegungen scheitern an einer mehrheitlichen Struktur der Feigheit und Halbheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Der Einzelne soll Gefolgschaft nicht als Erfolg anerkennen, sondern seine Bindung an sie verweigern und ihren Zerfall beschleunigen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Zeit erzeugt nicht notwendig Reifung; sie kann eine ursprüngliche Möglichkeit in Müdigkeit und Rückzug verkehren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um den Übergang von Hoffnung und Erkenntnismut zu Müdigkeit, Frömmigkeit und Zerfall zu erzeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:MRT2","text":"Die Struktur erklärt die Sonderstellung des andersartigen Einzelnen durch die Seltenheit langen Mutes und die Überzahl der Feigen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:MRT3","text":"Die Funktion der Leichname, Possenreißer und Gläubigen bleibt als typologische Sequenz bestimmt, nicht als psychologisch ausgearbeitete Entwicklung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:MRT4","text":"Intern spannungsvoll bleibt die Verbindung von deterministischer Unfähigkeit und normativer Aufforderung zum Loslassen und Anblasen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:MRT5","text":"Ebenfalls ungelöst bleibt, ob die Gläubigen tatsächlich bloß unreif sind oder ob ihre Liebe eine alternative Form von Gemeinschaft darstellen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die Bewegung des Arguments, sofern Verfall nicht als bloßer Verlust, sondern als Bedingung strategischer Ablösung verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T185350419283Z_ad83b4e5","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"1.","source_sha256":"391400aea1cc9a8345745a4f521dcdcc0f0a58c5a0bc22cc535535a8fc20cd00","sha256":"fc711c0918fa7f4604d028d9010d7c297d663460453561a3ceb1216fd706e227","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T18:53:50.420435+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:AS1","text":"A community initially green and hope-bearing is diagnosed as withered, weary, and comfortable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:AS2","text":"The original courage of knowing turns into self-denigration, piety, and withdrawal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:AS3","text":"This reversal is determined not as an accidental individual change, but as the expression of a cowardly human majority.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:AS4","text":"The differently constituted individual must experience his first companions as corpses and buffoons, and his later companions as immature believers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:AS5","text":"The strategic consequence is: no attachment to the believers, no lamentation over the withering, but acceleration of the decay through the wind of the individual.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:A1","text":"Hope can turn into a withered and gray social reality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:A2","text":"Young hearts can grow old prematurely without thereby becoming mature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:A3","text":"Epistemic courage can turn into weariness and subsequent slander of one's own former bravery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:A4","text":"Retreating from freedom and light produces darkness, brooding, and domestic comfort.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:A5","text":"The capacity for long-lasting courage and overboldness is rare.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:A6","text":"The majority constitutes everyday life, abundance, and the far-too-many, and is determined by cowardice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:A7","text":"Whoever belongs to the different type necessarily encounters experiences and companions of this type.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:A8","text":"The first companions of the different type appear as corpses and jesters.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:A9","text":"The later companions appear as believers with love, folly, and immature veneration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:A10","text":"The possibility of a different willing depends on the possibility of a different being able.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:A11","text":"Halfness damages every wholeness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:A12","text":"Withering is not a regrettable exceptional case, but a process that one ought to let happen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:A13","text":"The individual ought to refuse affective attachment to the believers and to colorful initial hope.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:A14","text":"The individual can accelerate the disintegration of what has withered through a movement of his own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:NX1","text":"The young hearts have not matured through age, but have been corrupted by weariness, vulgarity, and comfort.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:NX2","text":"The return to piety does not count as spiritual renewal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:NX3","text":"The later retreat does not count as a legitimate correction of earlier epistemic courage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:NX4","text":"The majority is not the standard of spiritual health.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:NX5","text":"The believers are not available as a viable companionship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:NX6","text":"The love and veneration of the believers do not ground any justified attachment of the heart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:NX7","text":"Withering cannot be stopped by lamentation or normatively revoked.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:NX8","text":"Halfness cannot exist as an independent form of the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:D1","text":"The visible piety of the formerly courageous functions as a symptom of a retreat from knowledge and freedom.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_5:A3","CH_97E9_1C_5:A4","CH_97E9_1C_5:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:D2","text":"The social majority appears not merely as numerically large, but as a reproductive form of cowardice.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_5:A5","CH_97E9_1C_5:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:D3","text":"Disappointment at the transformation of the young hearts confirms the solitude of the different type.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_5:A6","CH_97E9_1C_5:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:D4","text":"The temporal sequence of corpses, jesters, and believers constitutes not a linear formation of community, but a series of insufficient companionships.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_5:A8","CH_97E9_1C_5:A9","CH_97E9_1C_5:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:D5","text":"The assertion that the others cannot do otherwise does not morally exculpate them, but fixes their incapacity as a structure.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_5:A10","CH_97E9_1C_5:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:D6","text":"The appropriate response to disintegration is letting go rather than rescue or mourning.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_5:A11","CH_97E9_1C_5:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:D7","text":"The refusal of attachment protects the individual from reinterpreting immature veneration as spiritual community.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_5:A9","CH_97E9_1C_5:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:D8","text":"The individual becomes, from an observer of decline, the active accelerator of its dissolution.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_5:A12","CH_97E9_1C_5:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:SD1","text":"The system replaces hope for collective maturation with the selection of a rare, enduring individual type.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:SD2","text":"Community is mapped as a sequence of defective forms: decline, ridiculousness, and immature following take the place of enduring equality of rank.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:SD3","text":"Social decline is reinterpreted from a tragic loss into a functional procedure of elimination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:SD4","text":"Turning away from the believers becomes the condition under which the different type does not dissolve its distinctiveness in veneration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:SD5","text":"The argument produces an ethics of non-attachment, in which distance and acceleration are privileged over care and preservation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:DNX1","text":"False is the assumption that initial enthusiasm passes of itself into enduring knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:DNX2","text":"False is the assumption that age guarantees a qualitative maturation of the mind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:DNX3","text":"False is the assumption that piety after the loss of courage constitutes a higher form of the same striving.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:DNX4","text":"False is the assumption that the many, by virtue of their multitude, constitute a valid social or spiritual norm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:DNX5","text":"False is the assumption that veneration produces reciprocity and equality of rank.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:DNX6","text":"False is the assumption that disintegration can be overcome through preservation, lamentation, or pedagogical retrieval.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:DNX7","text":"False is the assumption that a whole arises through the addition of halfnesses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:SNX1","text":"Excluded is an enduring shared world in which epistemic courage, freedom, and social companionship are preserved simultaneously.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:SNX2","text":"Unavailable is a mature community between the different individual and those who initially venerate him.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:SNX3","text":"Barred is the possibility that the original departure possesses a collectively viable future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:SNX4","text":"Unavailable is a reconciliation between solitude and belonging; attachment to the many threatens to neutralize distinctiveness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:SNX5","text":"Impermissible is every interpretation of withering as a loss that obliges the individual to restore what came before.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:FGS1","text":"Initial hope + courage of knowing → weariness + withdrawal from light and freedom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:FGS2","text":"Weariness + withdrawal → piety, darkness, comfort, and denigration of former bravery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:FGS3","text":"Rarity of enduring courage + preponderance of the many → structural separation of the differently constituted individual and the cowardly majority.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:FGS4","text":"Difference → sequence of inadequate companionships: corpses/buffoons → believers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:FGS5","text":"Inadequate companionship + exclusion of attachment → preservation of distinctiveness through distance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:FGS6","text":"Withering + renunciation of lamentation → active fanning and acceleration of departure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:AF1","text":"Green hope → premature weariness → return to piety → diagnosis of the cowardly majority → solitude of the different type → devaluation of the believers as companions → renunciation of attachment and lamentation → acceleration of withering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:ME1","text":"The contrast between youth and age is replaced by the contrast between courage and weariness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:ME2","text":"Piety is reclassified from a possible goal of spiritual development into an index of retreat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:ME3","text":"The social landscape is no longer divided into individuals, but into rare enduring ones and cowardly far-too-many.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:ME4","text":"Companionship is temporally and qualitatively broken down into corpses, jesters, and believers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:ME5","text":"Decline is remapped from a regrettable event into a useful process of selection and purification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:ME6","text":"Wind, distance, and letting go are classified as operative forms of intervention in the social field.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:ALT1","text":"Surface: Formerly courageous young people become weary, pious, dark, and comfortable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:ALT2","text":"Structural: Movements of knowledge and freedom fail because of a majority structure of cowardice and halfness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: The individual ought not to recognize following as success, but to refuse attachment to it and accelerate its disintegration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Time does not necessarily produce maturation; it can reverse an original possibility into weariness and retreat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to generate the transition from hope and courage of knowing to weariness, piety, and decay.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:MRT2","text":"The structure explains the exceptional position of the differently constituted individual through the rarity of enduring courage and the preponderance of the cowardly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:MRT3","text":"The function of the corpses, buffoons, and believers remains determined as a typological sequence, not as a psychologically elaborated development.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:MRT4","text":"The connection between deterministic incapacity and the normative injunction to let go and to fan remains internally fraught.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:MRT5","text":"Likewise unresolved is whether the believers are in fact merely immature, or whether their love could represent an alternative form of community.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_5:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the movement of the argument insofar as decline is understood not as mere loss, but as a condition of strategic detachment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_5:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_1C_5@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_1C_5:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On the Apostates","source_section_label":"1.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"On the Apostates · 1","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On the Apostates","1."],"original_title":"1."}],"source_title_context":"Von den Abtrünnigen","source_section_label":"1.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"On the Apostates · 1","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On the Apostates","1."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 75","title":"On the Apostates · 1","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Von den Abtrünnigen · 1"},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5","layer":"CH","title":"On the Apostates · 2","order":76,"parents":["RAW_97E9_2C_5"],"revision":"CH_97E9_2C_5@R001","sha256":"34e109d0b4f15e2c8b9881875013377ec5db3a18685af5d4b7fa413a37788af5","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:AS1","text":"Der Text behandelt die erneute Frömmigkeit als Rückfall der Abtrünnigen und der feigen Nichtbekenner.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:AS2","text":"Der Sprecher bestimmt das Beten für den angesprochenen selbstbewussten Menschen als Schande.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:AS3","text":"Er führt diese Rückkehr auf eine innere Feigheit zurück, die Bequemlichkeit, Passivität und den Glauben an Gott verlangt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:AS4","text":"Diese Feigheit erzeugt Lichtscheu, nächtlichen Rückzug und kleine fromme Gemeinschaften, in denen alte Formen wiederbelebt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:AS5","text":"Der Nachtwächterdialog verschiebt die Gottesfrage auf Vaterschaft, Beweis und Glauben und legt die Abhängigkeit des Gottesbildes vom bloßen Geglaubtwerden offen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:AS6","text":"Die erzählte Göttergenealogie kehrt den Monotheismus um: Der Anspruch auf den einen Gott erscheint als gottlosestes Wort, an dem die Götter sich zu Tode lachen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:AS7","text":"Die Bewegung schließt mit Zarathustras Lachen und seiner freudigen Rückkehr zur Höhle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:A1","text":"Die erneute Frömmigkeit gilt dem Sprecher als Regression und nicht als geistige Erneuerung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:A2","text":"Für den angesprochenen Menschen mit Gewissen und Verstand ist Beten schändlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:A3","text":"Eine innere Feigheit begehrt gefaltete Hände, Untätigkeit und Bequemlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:A4","text":"Diese Feigheit verkleidet ihr Bedürfnis nach Bequemlichkeit als Aussage, dass es einen Gott gebe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:A5","text":"Die Hinwendung zum Glauben erzeugt eine lichtscheue Orientierung an Nacht und Dunst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:A6","text":"Lichtscheu organisiert sich in kleinen abgeschlossenen Gemeinden und in Formen frommer gegenseitiger Erfassung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:A7","text":"Die frommen Formen arbeiten mit Infantilisierung, emotionalem Trost und Praktiken ohne wirklichen Gegenstand.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:A8","text":"Das im Nachtwächterdialog verhandelte Gottesbild kann seine Vaterschaft nicht beweisen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:A9","text":"In diesem Gottesbild ersetzt der Anspruch auf Glauben den fehlenden Beweis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:A10","text":"Die erzählte Göttergenealogie setzt den Anspruch auf den einzigen Gott gegen die Vielheit der Götter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:A11","text":"Die erzählte Göttergenealogie erklärt das Ende der alten Götter durch Selbstverlachen und nicht durch bloßes Erlöschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:NX1","text":"Beten ist nicht als neutrale oder ehrenhafte religiöse Handlung verfügbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:NX2","text":"Frömmigkeit ist nicht Licht, Klarheit oder Erkenntnis, sondern Lichtscheu, Nacht und Dunst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:NX3","text":"Fromme Gemeinschaften sind nicht harmlose Rückzugsorte, sondern Fangstellen für Duckmäuser.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:NX4","text":"Verborgene Tiefe ohne wirklichen Gegenstand gilt nicht als Tiefe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:NX5","text":"Glaube gilt nicht als Beweis für das Geglaubte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:NX6","text":"Der Anspruch auf den einen Gott gilt nicht als eigentliche Göttlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:NX7","text":"Das Ende der alten Götter ist nicht als passives Dahindämmern bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:D1","text":"Das Gebet erscheint als Symptom einer inneren Bequemlichkeits- und Feigheitsstruktur.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_5:A2","CH_97E9_2C_5:A3","CH_97E9_2C_5:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:D2","text":"Die religiöse Rückkehr vertieft nicht die Erkenntnis, sondern die Abkehr vom Licht.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_5:A1","CH_97E9_2C_5:A4","CH_97E9_2C_5:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:D3","text":"Private Feigheit wird durch kleine Gemeinden in eine soziale Organisation der gegenseitigen Beruhigung und Erfassung überführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_5:A5","CH_97E9_2C_5:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:D4","text":"Die unterschiedlichen frommen Tätigkeiten werden als Variationen derselben ersatzhaften und gegenstandslosen Tiefenproduktion klassifiziert.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_5:A6","CH_97E9_2C_5:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:D5","text":"Der Nachtwächterdialog stellt das väterliche Gottesbild durch den fehlenden Nachweis seiner Vaterschaft unter epistemischen Vorbehalt.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_5:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:D6","text":"Die Berufung auf Glauben erscheint als Ausweichbewegung gegenüber der Forderung nach Beweis.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_5:A8","CH_97E9_2C_5:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:D7","text":"Die monotheistische Ausschließlichkeit wird innerhalb der Göttergenealogie zur Selbstaufhebung des Göttlichen.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_5:A10","CH_97E9_2C_5:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:SD1","text":"Der Text verwandelt ein religiöses Bekenntnis in eine psychologische und soziale Diagnose.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_5:A1","CH_97E9_2C_5:A3","CH_97E9_2C_5:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:SD2","text":"Die Dunkelheit bezeichnet zugleich den inneren Antrieb der Frömmigkeit und ihre äußere Organisationsform.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_5:A4","CH_97E9_2C_5:A5","CH_97E9_2C_5:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:SD3","text":"Die Gottesfrage wird von einer metaphysischen Existenzfrage auf Autorität, Beweisfähigkeit und die soziale Funktion des Glaubens verschoben.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_5:A8","CH_97E9_2C_5:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:SD4","text":"Der Monotheismus erscheint nicht als höchste Form des Göttlichen, sondern als dessen späte und selbstzerstörerische Verengung.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_5:A10","CH_97E9_2C_5:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:SD5","text":"Die Wiederbelebung alter religiöser Formen findet gerade unter der Bedingung statt, dass ihre göttliche Grundlage bereits als beendet dargestellt ist.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_5:A1","CH_97E9_2C_5:A6","CH_97E9_2C_5:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0028","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0029","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt ein Gebet aus, das aus Mut, Erkenntnis oder nichtkompensatorischer Transzendenz hervorgehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:DNX2","text":"Es schließt aus, dass die Berufung auf Gott einen von psychischer Feigheit unabhängigen Ursprung besitzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:DNX3","text":"Es schließt aus, dass Rückzug, Verborgenheit oder Dunkelheit eigenständig Erkenntnis oder Tiefe erzeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:DNX4","text":"Es schließt aus, dass Alter, Überlieferung oder das Aufwecken alter Formeln ihnen erneut Autorität verleihen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:DNX5","text":"Es schließt aus, dass Glaube die fehlende Beweisführung kompensieren kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:DNX6","text":"Es schließt aus, dass göttliche Einheit ohne Verlust oder Verarmung des Göttlichen denkbar ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:SNX1","text":"Eine religiöse Rückkehr, die nicht feige, bequem oder regressiv wäre, bleibt außerhalb des Systems.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:SNX2","text":"Eine nachweisbare göttliche Vaterschaft fehlt als unaufhebbarer blinder Fleck des Gottesdialogs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:SNX3","text":"Eine wirkliche Wiederkehr der alten Götter ist nicht verfügbar; verfügbar ist nur ihre nächtliche Wiederaufführung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:SNX4","text":"Eine positive Bestimmung dessen, was Göttlichkeit nach dem Ende des Monotheismus wäre, wird nicht formalisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:SNX5","text":"Die Möglichkeit einer nicht-spöttischen, nicht-regressiven religiösen Wahrheit wird umkreist, aber nicht entwickelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:FGS1","text":"Religiöses Bekenntnis → direkte Konfrontation des Bekenntnisses als Feigheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:FGS2","text":"Beten → Umklassifizierung als Schande für den selbstbewussten Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:FGS3","text":"Schande → Rückführung auf ein inneres Bedürfnis nach Bequemlichkeit und Passivität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:FGS4","text":"Inneres Bedürfnis → Lichtscheu, Nacht und Dunst → Bildung kleiner frommer Erfassungsräume.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:FGS5","text":"Fromme Praktiken → Vorführung ihrer regressiven, ersatzhaften oder gegenstandslosen Formen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:FGS6","text":"Nachtwächterdialog → Prüfung des Gottesbildes durch Vaterschaft, Beweis und Glauben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:FGS7","text":"Fehlender Beweis → Offenlegung des Glaubens als Ersatzforderung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:FGS8","text":"Monotheistischer Ausschließlichkeitsanspruch → genealogische Umkehrung → Lachen als Ende der alten Götter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:AF1","text":"Rückkehr zur Frömmigkeit → Bloßstellung der Feigheit → Diagnose der Bequemlichkeit → Lichtscheu und fromme Erfassung → Prüfung von Vaterschaft und Beweis → Entlarvung des Glaubensersatzes → Umkehrung des Monotheismus → Lachen und Heimkehr.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:ME1","text":"Beten wird vom religiösen Vollzug zum psychologischen Symptom umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:ME2","text":"Die Grenze zwischen innerer Feigheit und äußerer Gemeindeorganisation wird aufgehoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:ME3","text":"Dunkelheit wird nicht mehr als Tiefe, sondern als sozial reproduzierbare Lichtscheu lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:ME4","text":"Der Gegensatz von Glauben und Beweis wird als Macht- und Autoritätsproblem neu gezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:ME5","text":"Der Monotheismus wird vom Endpunkt religiöser Wahrheit zur Selbstnegation der Vielheit der Götter umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:ME6","text":"Zweifel an Gott wird aus einer offenen Erkenntnisposition in ein verspätetes, lichtscheues Relikt verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:ALT1","text":"Surface — Frömmigkeit, Gebet, Gotteszweifel und die Rückkehr alter religiöser Formen werden unmittelbar verspottet und zurückgewiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:ALT2","text":"Structural — Innere Feigheit wird als Mechanismus dargestellt, der sich in Gemeinden, Ritualen, kulturellen Vermittlern und Fangstrukturen materialisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text ersetzt argumentative Widerlegung durch Bloßstellung, Satire und Lachen und entzieht dem Gegner dadurch seine Würde und Ernsthaftigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Die Vielheit der Götter, der Tod der alten Götter durch Lachen und die Wiederkehr alter Formen ordnen Göttlichkeit als geschichtlichen und selbstaufhebenden Prozess.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:MRT1","text":"Die extrahierten Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von der Frömmigkeitsrückkehr über die Feigheitsdiagnose bis zur Umkehrung des Monotheismus zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, warum Beten für den angesprochenen Typus notwendig schändlich und nicht nur psychologisch verdächtig sein soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt außerdem, ob die Vielheit der Götter eine positive Ontologie oder nur die Negation des Monotheismus bezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:MRT4","text":"Die interne Kohärenz beruht auf der durchgehenden Verbindung von Feigheit, Bequemlichkeit, Lichtscheu und religiöser Organisation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Operation ist die Umklassifizierung religiöser Behauptungen in Symptome und soziale Mechanismen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:MRT6","text":"Eine strukturelle Spannung bleibt zwischen der behaupteten Erledigung der alten Götter und ihrer fortgesetzten Wiederbelebung bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0028","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0029","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:MRT7","text":"Eine zweite Spannung besteht darin, dass der Beweisanspruch an Gott verworfen wird, während die Göttergenealogie selbst nicht beweisförmig begründet wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0032","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche argumentative Bewegung, komprimiert jedoch die tragende Wirkung der komischen und bildhaften Ausführung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T190551326337Z_6650c3dc","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"2.","source_sha256":"34e109d0b4f15e2c8b9881875013377ec5db3a18685af5d4b7fa413a37788af5","sha256":"165c5d7b80e6a6abe034293b2da57f2a9962924c668da8ab72ef48dc4a2de0fc","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:05:51.328568+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:AS1","text":"The text treats renewed piety as a relapse of apostates and cowardly non-confessors.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:AS2","text":"The speaker defines praying, for the self-confident person addressed, as shameful.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:AS3","text":"He traces this return back to an inner cowardice that demands comfort, passivity, and belief in God.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:AS4","text":"This cowardice produces light-shyness, nocturnal withdrawal, and small pious communities in which old forms are revived.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:AS5","text":"The night-watchman dialogue shifts the question of God onto fatherhood, proof, and belief, and exposes the dependence of the image of God on merely being believed in.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:AS6","text":"The narrated genealogy of the gods reverses monotheism: the claim to the one God appears as the most godless word, at which the gods laugh themselves to death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:AS7","text":"The movement concludes with Zarathustra's laughter and his joyful return to the cave.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:A1","text":"Renewed piety counts, for the speaker, as regression and not as spiritual renewal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:A2","text":"For the addressed person with conscience and understanding, praying is shameful.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:A3","text":"An inner cowardice desires folded hands, inactivity, and comfort.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:A4","text":"This cowardice disguises its need for comfort as the assertion that there is a God.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:A5","text":"The turn toward belief produces a light-shy orientation toward night and mist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:A6","text":"Light-shyness organizes itself in small closed communities and in forms of pious mutual apprehension.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:A7","text":"The pious forms operate through infantilization, emotional consolation, and practices without a real object.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:A8","text":"The image of God negotiated in the night-watchman dialogue cannot prove its fatherhood.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:A9","text":"In this image of God, the demand for belief replaces the missing proof.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:A10","text":"The narrated genealogy of the gods sets the claim to the sole God against the plurality of gods.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:A11","text":"The narrated genealogy of the gods explains the end of the old gods through self-laughter and not through mere extinction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:NX1","text":"Praying is not available as a neutral or honorable religious act.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:NX2","text":"Piety is not light, clarity, or knowledge, but light-shyness, night, and mist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:NX3","text":"Pious communities are not harmless places of retreat, but traps for cringing submissives.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:NX4","text":"Hidden depth without a real object does not count as depth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:NX5","text":"Belief does not count as proof of what is believed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:NX6","text":"The claim to the one God does not count as genuine divinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:NX7","text":"The end of the old gods is not determined as passive fading away.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:D1","text":"Prayer appears as a symptom of an inner structure of comfort and cowardice.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_5:A2","CH_97E9_2C_5:A3","CH_97E9_2C_5:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:D2","text":"The religious return does not deepen knowledge, but rather the turning away from light.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_5:A1","CH_97E9_2C_5:A4","CH_97E9_2C_5:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:D3","text":"Private cowardice is transformed through small communities into a social organization of mutual reassurance and apprehension.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_5:A5","CH_97E9_2C_5:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:D4","text":"The different pious activities are classified as variations of the same substitute and objectless production of depth.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_5:A6","CH_97E9_2C_5:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:D5","text":"The night-watchman dialogue places the paternal image of God under epistemic reservation through the missing demonstration of its fatherhood.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_5:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:D6","text":"The appeal to belief appears as an evasive movement in the face of the demand for proof.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_5:A8","CH_97E9_2C_5:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:D7","text":"Monotheistic exclusivity becomes, within the genealogy of the gods, the self-sublation of the divine.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_5:A10","CH_97E9_2C_5:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:SD1","text":"The text transforms a religious confession into a psychological and social diagnosis.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_5:A1","CH_97E9_2C_5:A3","CH_97E9_2C_5:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:SD2","text":"Darkness denotes both the inner drive of piety and its external organizational form.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_5:A4","CH_97E9_2C_5:A5","CH_97E9_2C_5:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:SD3","text":"The question of God is shifted from a metaphysical question of existence to authority, demonstrability, and the social function of belief.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_5:A8","CH_97E9_2C_5:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:SD4","text":"Monotheism appears not as the highest form of the divine, but as its late and self-destructive narrowing.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_5:A10","CH_97E9_2C_5:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:SD5","text":"The revival of old religious forms takes place precisely under the condition that their divine foundation is already represented as ended.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_5:A1","CH_97E9_2C_5:A6","CH_97E9_2C_5:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0028","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0029","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:DNX1","text":"The system excludes a prayer that could arise from courage, knowledge, or non-compensatory transcendence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:DNX2","text":"It excludes the possibility that the appeal to God has an origin independent of psychic cowardice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:DNX3","text":"It excludes the possibility that withdrawal, concealment, or darkness independently generate knowledge or depth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:DNX4","text":"It excludes the possibility that age, tradition, or the awakening of old formulas confer authority upon them anew.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:DNX5","text":"It excludes the possibility that belief can compensate for the lack of proof.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:DNX6","text":"It excludes the possibility that divine unity is conceivable without loss or impoverishment of the divine.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:SNX1","text":"A religious return that would not be cowardly, comfortable, or regressive remains outside the system.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:SNX2","text":"A demonstrable divine fatherhood is absent as an irreducible blind spot of the God-dialogue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:SNX3","text":"A real return of the old gods is unavailable; available is only their nocturnal reenactment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:SNX4","text":"A positive determination of what divinity would be after the end of monotheism is not formalized.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:SNX5","text":"The possibility of a non-mocking, non-regressive religious truth is circled around, but not developed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:FGS1","text":"Religious confession → direct confrontation of the confession as cowardice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:FGS2","text":"Praying → reclassification as shameful for the self-confident person.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:FGS3","text":"Shame → reduction to an inner need for comfort and passivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:FGS4","text":"Inner need → light-shyness, night, and mist → formation of small pious spaces of apprehension.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:FGS5","text":"Pious practices → exhibition of their regressive, substitute, or objectless forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:FGS6","text":"Night-watchman dialogue → examination of the image of God through fatherhood, proof, and belief.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:FGS7","text":"Missing proof → disclosure of belief as a substitute demand.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:FGS8","text":"Monotheistic claim to exclusivity → genealogical reversal → laughter as the end of the old gods.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:AF1","text":"Return to piety → exposure of cowardice → diagnosis of comfort → light-shyness and pious apprehension → examination of fatherhood and proof → unmasking of the substitute of belief → reversal of monotheism → laughter and homecoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:ME1","text":"Praying is remapped from religious performance to psychological symptom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:ME2","text":"The boundary between inner cowardice and external community organization is abolished.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:ME3","text":"Darkness is no longer legible as depth, but as socially reproducible light-shyness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:ME4","text":"The opposition between belief and proof is redrawn as a problem of power and authority.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:ME5","text":"Monotheism is reclassified from the endpoint of religious truth to the self-negation of the plurality of gods.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:ME6","text":"Doubt about God is shifted from an open epistemic position into a belated, light-shy relic.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:ALT1","text":"Surface — Piety, prayer, doubt about God, and the return of old religious forms are directly mocked and rejected.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:ALT2","text":"Structural — Inner cowardice is presented as a mechanism that materializes in communities, rituals, cultural mediators, and trapping structures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text replaces argumentative refutation with exposure, satire, and laughter, thereby depriving the opponent of dignity and seriousness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The plurality of gods, the death of the old gods through laughter, and the return of old forms order divinity as a historical and self-sublating process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:MRT1","text":"The extracted axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from the return to piety, through the diagnosis of cowardice, to the reversal of monotheism.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined why praying should be necessarily shameful for the addressed type and not merely psychologically suspect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:MRT3","text":"It further remains underdetermined whether the plurality of gods denotes a positive ontology or merely the negation of monotheism.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:MRT4","text":"The internal coherence rests on the continuous linkage of cowardice, comfort, light-shyness, and religious organization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:MRT5","text":"The strongest operation is the reclassification of religious assertions into symptoms and social mechanisms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:MRT6","text":"A structural tension remains between the asserted dispatching of the old gods and their continued revival.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0028","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0029","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:MRT7","text":"A second tension consists in the fact that the demand for proof is rejected with respect to God, while the genealogy of the gods itself is not grounded in a proof-like manner.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0032","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_5:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual argumentative movement, but compresses the sustaining effect of the comic and figurative elaboration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_5:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_2C_5@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_2C_5:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On the Apostates","source_section_label":"2.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"On the Apostates · 2","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On the Apostates","2."],"original_title":"2."}],"source_title_context":"Von den Abtrünnigen","source_section_label":"2.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"On the Apostates · 2","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On the Apostates","2."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 76","title":"On the Apostates · 2","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Von den Abtrünnigen · 2"},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH","layer":"CH","title":"The Homecoming","order":77,"parents":["RAW_97E9_DIEH"],"revision":"CH_97E9_DIEH@R001","sha256":"8933df538c2e8e78af134e620a460096d84c2cf00a201e67d4058850b1a75426","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:AS1","text":"Zarathustra bestimmt seine Rückkehr als Rückkehr aus menschlicher Fremde in die Einsamkeit als Heimat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:AS2","text":"Die Rückkehr setzt die Unterscheidung zwischen Einsamkeit als Selbstgegenwart und Verlassenheit als existenzieller Preisgabe voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:AS3","text":"Das menschliche Kollektiv wird als Raum des Lärms, der Oberflächlichkeit, der semantischen Entleerung und des Verrats bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:AS4","text":"Mitleid und Schonung erscheinen als Mechanismen, durch die Zarathustra sich selbst verbirgt, seine Sprache verfälscht und die Kleinheit der Anderen schützt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:AS5","text":"Die Einsamkeit eröffnet einen Raum direkter Rede, in dem Sein sprechbar und Werden artikulierbar wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:AS6","text":"Die Trennung von der Menschenwelt wird als Wiedergewinnung von Reinheit, Freiheit, Wahrnehmungsfähigkeit und Gesundheit geschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:A1","text":"Einsamkeit ist Zarathustras Heimat, weil sie Selbstgegenwart ohne soziale Verstellung ermöglicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:A2","text":"Einsamkeit und Verlassenheit sind ontologisch und affektiv verschiedene Zustände.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:A3","text":"Zarathustra bleibt unter Menschen wild und fremd, auch wenn sie ihn lieben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:A4","text":"Die Menschen wollen primär geschont werden und begrenzen dadurch die Möglichkeit unverstellter Beziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:A5","text":"Die menschliche Öffentlichkeit verwandelt Rede in Lärm und verhindert Verstehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:A6","text":"Öffentliche Rede entleert Tiefe, Geheimnis und Dauer, indem sie alles zerredet und verrät.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:A7","text":"Vollständiges Verstehen der Menschen erforderte Angriff und ist daher mit Zarathustras gegenwärtiger Reinheit unvereinbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:A8","text":"Mitleid zwingt freie Geister zu Lüge, Selbstverbergung und sprachlicher Anpassung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:A9","text":"Die moralisch als gut bezeichneten Menschen können gerade durch ihre Unschuld ungerecht, giftig und unwahrhaftig wirken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:A10","text":"Einsamkeit ermöglicht direkte Rede zu den Dingen und macht Sein und Werden sprachlich zugänglich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:A11","text":"Der Rückzug aus der Menschenwelt stellt Wahrnehmung, Atem, Freiheit und Gesundheit wieder her.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:NX1","text":"Einsamkeit ist nicht Verlassenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:NX2","text":"Menschliche Liebe ist nicht Zugehörigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:NX3","text":"Vieles Reden ist nicht Verstehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:NX4","text":"Öffentliche Mitteilung ist nicht Wahrheitsfähigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:NX5","text":"Mitleid ist nicht notwendig Güte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:NX6","text":"Die Guten sind nicht notwendig gerecht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:NX7","text":"Soziale Nähe ist nicht Bedingung von Heimat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:NX8","text":"Einsamkeit ist nicht Schweigen, sondern die Bedingung unverfälschter Rede.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:NX9","text":"Vollständiges Begreifen der Menschen ist nicht mit unschuldiger Teilnahme an ihrer Welt vereinbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:D1","text":"Die Einsamkeit wird als positive Form der Zugehörigkeit bestimmt, während Verlassenheit den Verlust von Führung, Empfang und Gegenseitigkeit bezeichnet.","refs":["CH_97E9_DIEH:A1","CH_97E9_DIEH:A2","CH_97E9_DIEH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:D2","text":"Menschliche Gemeinschaft kann Anwesenheit und Liebe bereitstellen, ohne Zarathustras Fremdheit oder Selbstverlust aufzuheben.","refs":["CH_97E9_DIEH:A3","CH_97E9_DIEH:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:D3","text":"Die soziale Öffentlichkeit erscheint als semantische Maschine, die alles Sagbare in Austausch, Lärm, Wiederholung und Verrat überführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_DIEH:A5","CH_97E9_DIEH:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:D4","text":"Mitleid fungiert als Anpassungszwang, weil es Zarathustra verpflichtet, die Anderen zu schonen und seine eigene Erkenntnis zu verschleiern.","refs":["CH_97E9_DIEH:A4","CH_97E9_DIEH:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:D5","text":"Die moralische Kategorie des Guten verliert ihre Schutzfunktion, weil Unschuld weder Wahrhaftigkeit noch Gerechtigkeit garantiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_DIEH:A8","CH_97E9_DIEH:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:D6","text":"Wahrheitsrede benötigt Distanz zur öffentlichen Redeordnung, weil direkte Rede nur dort möglich wird, wo sie nicht durch Schonung und Lärm vermittelt wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_DIEH:A5","CH_97E9_DIEH:A8","CH_97E9_DIEH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:D7","text":"Der Berg ist nicht bloß ein Ortswechsel, sondern die räumliche Form einer Wiederherstellung von Freiheit und Wahrnehmungsfähigkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_DIEH:A7","CH_97E9_DIEH:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:SD1","text":"Die Rückkehr in die Einsamkeit ist zugleich existenzielle Heimkehr, epistemische Reinigung und sprachliche Reorganisation.","refs":["CH_97E9_DIEH:A1","CH_97E9_DIEH:A5","CH_97E9_DIEH:A10","CH_97E9_DIEH:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:SD2","text":"Die Menschenwelt wird als System bestimmt, das Tiefe nur unter der Bedingung ihrer Verflachung, Zirkulation und Preisgabe aufnehmen kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_DIEH:A5","CH_97E9_DIEH:A6","CH_97E9_DIEH:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:SD3","text":"Zarathustras größte Gefahr ist nicht offene Feindschaft, sondern die innere Selbstverformung durch Schonung, Mitleid und sozial erzwungene Rücksicht.","refs":["CH_97E9_DIEH:A4","CH_97E9_DIEH:A8","CH_97E9_DIEH:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:SD4","text":"Die Einsamkeit wird zur Voraussetzung dafür, dass Sprache nicht Austauschmittel bleibt, sondern Ort der Artikulation von Sein und Werden wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_DIEH:A5","CH_97E9_DIEH:A6","CH_97E9_DIEH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Annahme, dass menschliche Gemeinschaft unverstellte Selbstoffenbarung tragen könne.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Annahme, dass moralische Güte durch gute Absicht, Unschuld oder Mitleid verbürgt sei.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Annahme, dass Wahrheit durch maximale Kommunikation oder öffentliche Zirkulation gestärkt werde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Annahme, dass Erkenntnis der Menschen ohne Gewalt, Angriff oder Selbstbeschädigung erreichbar sei.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Annahme, dass soziale Anerkennung Heimat erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:SNX1","text":"Unverfügbar bleibt eine menschliche Vielheit, in der Tiefe, Geheimnis und Wahrheit ohne Verrat bestehen könnten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:SNX2","text":"Unmöglich erscheint eine Form des Mitleids, die weder Lüge noch Schonung noch Unterwerfung unter die Bedürftigkeit der Anderen erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:SNX3","text":"Versperrt bleibt die Versöhnung von freier Wahrheitsrede und menschlicher Gesellschaft in ihrer dargestellten Gestalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:FGS1","text":"Menschliche Fremdheit → Unterscheidung von Einsamkeit und Verlassenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:FGS2","text":"Einsamkeit als Heimat → Selbstgegenwart → unverstellte Rede.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:FGS3","text":"Menschenwelt als Lärm → Überhören → Zerreden → Verrat von Tiefe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"