"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:ME2","text":"Verlassenheit wird von Einsamkeit getrennt und als negativer Zustand fehlender Führung, Gegenseitigkeit und existenzieller Stützung sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:ME3","text":"Öffentlichkeit wird nicht als Raum gemeinsamer Verständigung, sondern als Mechanismus der Entwertung von Rede kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:ME4","text":"Mitleid wird von einer Tugend in eine Technik der Selbstverbergung und sozialen Unwahrheit transformiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:ME5","text":"Die Guten werden von moralischen Gegenfiguren zu Trägern einer besonders schwer erkennbaren Form von Gift, Lüge und Ungerechtigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:ME6","text":"Räumliche Höhe wird als Bedingung geistiger Freiheit und nicht bloß als geographische Lage bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0042","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0043","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:ALT1","text":"Surface — Zarathustra kehrt aus der Menschenwelt in die Einsamkeit zurück und begrüßt sie als Heimat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Menschenwelt funktioniert als Ordnung von Lärm, Schonung, Oberflächenverkehr und sprachlicher Neutralisierung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Rückzug wird als strategische Bedingung der Wahrheitsrede und als Schutz vor mitleidiger Selbstverfälschung bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Sein verlangt nach Wortwerdung, Werden nach sprachlicher Lehre, während öffentliche Zeit alles Harte zernagt und entleert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von menschlicher Fremde über die Kritik von Lärm und Mitleid bis zur Heimkehr in die Einsamkeit zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, warum die Menschen notwendig und nicht nur faktisch als lärmend, schonungsbedürftig und wahrheitsunfähig gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist kohärent, sofern Einsamkeit als aktive Selbstgegenwart und nicht als bloßer Rückzug verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung des Systems liegt in der Kopplung von sozialer Kritik, Sprachtheorie und Selbstschutz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:MRT5","text":"Eine strukturelle Spannung entsteht, weil Einsamkeit zugleich als Raum der Rede und als Gegenraum zum alles zerstörenden Reden bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung entsteht, weil Zarathustra die Menschenwelt totalisiert, obwohl er vollständiges Begreifen der Menschen als unzulässig oder nur gewaltsam erreichbar bezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0029","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:MRT7","text":"Die Schlussfigur der Gesundheit hängt von der nicht weiter begründeten Annahme ab, dass räumliche und soziale Distanz Wahrnehmung notwendig reinigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die Bewegung des Textes, sofern Heimkehr als Übergang von sozial erzwungener Selbstverstellung zu einsamer Wahrheitsfähigkeit gelesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T193451191830Z_d6dfd07b","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"The Homecoming","source_sha256":"8933df538c2e8e78af134e620a460096d84c2cf00a201e67d4058850b1a75426","sha256":"5efe123ef912e19457336691df67e7a2fe0a66fb532742e19f6bb03f16111d9b","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:34:51.194250+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:AS1","text":"Zarathustra defines his return as a return from human estrangement into solitude as home.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:AS2","text":"The return presupposes the distinction between solitude as self-presence and abandonment as existential forsakenness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:AS3","text":"The human collective is defined as a space of noise, superficiality, semantic emptying, and betrayal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:AS4","text":"Pity and sparing appear as mechanisms through which Zarathustra conceals himself, falsifies his language, and protects the smallness of the others.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:AS5","text":"Solitude opens a space of direct speech in which Being becomes speakable and Becoming articulable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:AS6","text":"The separation from the human world concludes as a recovery of purity, freedom, perceptual capacity, and health.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:A1","text":"Solitude is Zarathustra's home because it makes self-presence without social dissimulation possible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:A2","text":"Solitude and abandonment are ontologically and affectively distinct states.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:A3","text":"Zarathustra remains wild and alien among human beings, even when they love him.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:A4","text":"Human beings primarily wish to be spared and thereby limit the possibility of undisguised relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:A5","text":"The human public sphere transforms speech into noise and prevents understanding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:A6","text":"Public speech empties depth, mystery, and duration by talking everything away and betraying it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:A7","text":"Complete understanding of human beings would require attack and is therefore incompatible with Zarathustra's present purity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:A8","text":"Pity compels free spirits to lie, conceal themselves, and adapt linguistically.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:A9","text":"Those human beings morally designated as good can, precisely through their innocence, appear unjust, poisonous, and untruthful.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:A10","text":"Solitude makes direct speech to things possible and renders Being and Becoming linguistically accessible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:A11","text":"Withdrawal from the human world restores perception, breath, freedom, and health.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:NX1","text":"Solitude is not abandonment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:NX2","text":"Human love is not belonging.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:NX3","text":"Much speaking is not understanding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:NX4","text":"Public communication is not capacity for truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:NX5","text":"Pity is not necessarily goodness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:NX6","text":"The good are not necessarily just.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:NX7","text":"Social proximity is not a condition of home.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:NX8","text":"Solitude is not silence, but the condition of unfalsified speech.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:NX9","text":"Complete comprehension of human beings is not compatible with innocent participation in their world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:D1","text":"Solitude is defined as a positive form of belonging, while abandonment denotes the loss of guidance, reception, and reciprocity.","refs":["CH_97E9_DIEH:A1","CH_97E9_DIEH:A2","CH_97E9_DIEH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:D2","text":"Human community can provide presence and love without eliminating Zarathustra's alienness or self-loss.","refs":["CH_97E9_DIEH:A3","CH_97E9_DIEH:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:D3","text":"The social public sphere appears as a semantic machine that converts everything speakable into exchange, noise, repetition, and betrayal.","refs":["CH_97E9_DIEH:A5","CH_97E9_DIEH:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:D4","text":"Pity functions as a compulsion to adapt because it obliges Zarathustra to spare the others and to conceal his own knowledge.","refs":["CH_97E9_DIEH:A4","CH_97E9_DIEH:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:D5","text":"The moral category of the good loses its protective function because innocence guarantees neither truthfulness nor justice.","refs":["CH_97E9_DIEH:A8","CH_97E9_DIEH:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:D6","text":"Truthful speech requires distance from the public order of speech, because direct speech becomes possible only where it is not mediated by sparing and noise.","refs":["CH_97E9_DIEH:A5","CH_97E9_DIEH:A8","CH_97E9_DIEH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:D7","text":"The mountain is not merely a change of place, but the spatial form of a restoration of freedom and perceptual capacity.","refs":["CH_97E9_DIEH:A7","CH_97E9_DIEH:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:SD1","text":"The return into solitude is at once existential homecoming, epistemic purification, and linguistic reorganization.","refs":["CH_97E9_DIEH:A1","CH_97E9_DIEH:A5","CH_97E9_DIEH:A10","CH_97E9_DIEH:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:SD2","text":"The human world is defined as a system that can receive depth only on the condition of its flattening, circulation, and surrender.","refs":["CH_97E9_DIEH:A5","CH_97E9_DIEH:A6","CH_97E9_DIEH:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:SD3","text":"Zarathustra's greatest danger is not open enmity, but the inner deformation of the self through sparing, pity, and socially compelled consideration.","refs":["CH_97E9_DIEH:A4","CH_97E9_DIEH:A8","CH_97E9_DIEH:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:SD4","text":"Solitude becomes the precondition for language not to remain a medium of exchange, but to become the site of the articulation of Being and Becoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_DIEH:A5","CH_97E9_DIEH:A6","CH_97E9_DIEH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:DNX1","text":"Excluded is the assumption that human community could sustain undisguised self-disclosure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:DNX2","text":"Excluded is the assumption that moral goodness is guaranteed by good intention, innocence, or pity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:DNX3","text":"Excluded is the assumption that truth is strengthened through maximum communication or public circulation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:DNX4","text":"Excluded is the assumption that knowledge of human beings is attainable without violence, attack, or self-injury.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:DNX5","text":"Excluded is the assumption that social recognition produces home.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:SNX1","text":"Unavailable remains a human multiplicity in which depth, mystery, and truth could endure without betrayal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:SNX2","text":"Impossible appears a form of pity that produces neither lie nor sparing nor subjection to the neediness of the others.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:SNX3","text":"Blocked remains the reconciliation of free truthful speech and human society in its represented form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:FGS1","text":"Human estrangement → distinction between solitude and abandonment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:FGS2","text":"Solitude as home → self-presence → undisguised speech.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:FGS3","text":"Human world as noise → not being heard → talking away → betrayal of depth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:FGS4","text":"Pity and sparing → self-concealment → linguistic falsification → inner endangerment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:FGS5","text":"Withdrawal from the human world → recovery of distance → direct speech to Being and Becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:FGS6","text":"Freedom of the mountain → purified perception → health as affirmative closure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0042","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0043","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:AF1","text":"Alienness among human beings → homecoming to solitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:AF2","text":"Homecoming → separation of solitude and abandonment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:AF3","text":"Distinction → solitude as a space of self-possession and speech.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:AF4","text":"Diagnosis of the human world → noise, betrayal, superficiality, and unintelligibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:AF5","text":"Diagnosis of pity → self-denial, lie, and protection of the others from knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:AF6","text":"Turning away from human beings and pity → freedom of the mountain, purified breath, and health.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:ME1","text":"Solitude is reclassified from a social deficit into a privileged form of home, knowledge, and linguistic capacity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:ME2","text":"Abandonment is separated from solitude and becomes visible as a negative state of lacking guidance, reciprocity, and existential support.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:ME3","text":"The public sphere is mapped not as a space of shared understanding, but as a mechanism for the devaluation of speech.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:ME4","text":"Pity is transformed from a virtue into a technique of self-concealment and social untruth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:ME5","text":"The good are transformed from moral counterfigures into bearers of a particularly difficult-to-recognize form of poison, lie, and injustice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:ME6","text":"Spatial height is defined as a condition of spiritual freedom and not merely as a geographical location.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0042","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0043","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:ALT1","text":"Surface — Zarathustra returns from the human world into solitude and greets it as home.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:ALT2","text":"Structural — The human world functions as an order of noise, sparing, traffic of surfaces, and linguistic neutralization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Withdrawal is defined as the strategic condition of truthful speech and as protection against self-falsification through pity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Being demands becoming word, Becoming linguistic teaching, while public time gnaws away and empties everything hard.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from human estrangement through the critique of noise and pity to homecoming into solitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined why human beings are held necessarily, rather than merely factually, to be noisy, in need of sparing, and incapable of truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:MRT3","text":"The structure is coherent insofar as solitude is understood as active self-presence and not as mere withdrawal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:MRT4","text":"The system's strongest connection lies in the coupling of social critique, theory of language, and self-protection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:MRT5","text":"A structural tension arises because solitude is defined both as a space of speech and as a counterspace to speech that destroys everything.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:MRT6","text":"A further tension arises because Zarathustra totalizes the human world, although he designates complete comprehension of human beings as impermissible or attainable only through violence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0029","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:MRT7","text":"The concluding figure of health depends on the not further justified assumption that spatial and social distance necessarily purifies perception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DIEH:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the movement of the text insofar as homecoming is read as a transition from socially compelled self-dissimulation to solitary capacity for truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DIEH:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_DIEH@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_DIEH:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 77","title":"The Homecoming","context":"Chapter 77","original_title":"Die Heimkehr","original_context":"Chapter 77"},"original_title":"Die Heimkehr","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6","layer":"CH","title":"On the Three Evils · 1","order":78,"parents":["RAW_97E9_1C_6"],"revision":"CH_97E9_1C_6@R001","sha256":"cd92bb1bcfd8a8279acaf098ce138b43f917c23e427d5df4562a81da69ae549e","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:AS1","text":"Die Welt wird aus einer jenseitigen Beobachterposition als mess-, wäg- und erkennbarer Zusammenhang bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:AS2","text":"Die endliche Welt erscheint weder als unauflösbares Rätsel noch als vollständig erschöpfte Lösung, sondern als menschlich zugängliches Gut.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:AS3","text":"Eine wache Weisheit ordnet Kraft und Zahl so, dass Quantifizierung der Kraft untersteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:AS4","text":"Die Traumwahrnehmung wird zur Tagesaufgabe der menschlich guten Neubewertung überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:AS5","text":"Die drei traditionell verfluchten Triebe Wollust, Herrschsucht und Selbstsucht werden aus der Sphäre des Fluches in die Sphäre des Wiegens überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:AS6","text":"Die gleich stehende Wage verschiebt die Entscheidung auf drei Fragen nach Zeitübergang, Rangordnung und Wachstum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:A1","text":"Was messbar, wägbar, erfliegbar oder errathbar ist, kann als Gegenstand einer Erkenntnisordnung behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:A2","text":"Die Welt ist endlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:A3","text":"Die Welt ist nicht vollständig rätselhaft und nicht vollständig gelöst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:A4","text":"Weltbezug kann ohne Neugier, Gier, Furcht oder Bitte vollzogen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:A5","text":"Die Welt kann als menschlich gutes Ding erscheinen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:A6","text":"Kraft bestimmt, wie Zahl zur Meisterin wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:A7","text":"Traumweisheit kann in eine wache Tagesweisheit überführt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:A8","text":"Segnen und Fluchen bilden eine gemeinsame Wertungsoperation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:A9","text":"Wollust, Herrschsucht und Selbstsucht sind die drei am stärksten verfluchten Dinge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:A10","text":"Verfluchte Dinge können durch menschliches Abwägen neu bestimmt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:A11","text":"Die Welt ist ein Zusammenhang, in dem Jetzt und Dereinst, Hohes und Niedriges sowie Wachstum aufeinander bezogen werden können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:A12","text":"Eine ausgeglichene Wage markiert nicht die Aufhebung der Fragen, sondern die Gleichgewichtigkeit von Fragen und Antworten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:NX1","text":"Die Welt ist nicht außerhalb jeder Messbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:NX2","text":"Die Welt ist nicht als unendliche, unzugängliche Totalität gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:NX3","text":"Die Welt ist nicht bloß Rätsel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:NX4","text":"Die Welt ist nicht bloß Lösung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:NX5","text":"Der Weltbezug ist nicht von Neugier, Gier, Furcht oder Bitte abhängig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:NX6","text":"Wollust, Herrschsucht und Selbstsucht sind nicht abschließend durch ihre bisherige Verfluchung bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:NX7","text":"Das Hohe ist nicht einfach als statische Endposition gegeben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:NX8","text":"Das Jetzt ist nicht ohne Übergang zum Dereinst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:NX9","text":"Die drei Fragen werden nicht durch eine explizit ausformulierte Lehre beantwortet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:D1","text":"Die Welt kann als Gegenstand einer aktiven Bewertungsoperation behandelt werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_6:A1","CH_97E9_1C_6:A2","CH_97E9_1C_6:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:D2","text":"Menschliche Zugänglichkeit entsteht durch eine mittlere Bestimmung zwischen Rätselhaftigkeit und vollständiger Lösbarkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_6:A3","CH_97E9_1C_6:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:D3","text":"Quantität besitzt keine letzte Selbständigkeit, sondern wird durch Kraft hierarchisiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_6:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:D4","text":"Die Traumanschauung fungiert als Modell für eine erneuerte Tagesbewertung.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_6:A4","CH_97E9_1C_6:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:D5","text":"Die bisherige moralische Verurteilung der drei Triebe wird als historisch erzeugte Wertung kenntlich.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_6:A8","CH_97E9_1C_6:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:D6","text":"Die drei Triebe werden von moralischen Verbotssignalen in prüfbare Gegenstände einer Neubewertung verwandelt.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_6:A9","CH_97E9_1C_6:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:D7","text":"Die Frage nach dem Höchsten wird als Frage nach einem Prozess des Hinaufwachsens reformuliert.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_6:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:D8","text":"Das Gleichgewicht der Wage bezeichnet eine noch offene Vermittlung zwischen Frage und Antwort.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_6:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:SD1","text":"Die Wertordnung wird von einer transzendenten Verfluchung auf eine immanente, menschlich vollziehbare Prüfung umgestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:SD2","text":"Erkenntnis, Bewertung und Selbstüberwindung werden in einer einzigen Operation des Wiegens gekoppelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:SD3","text":"Die Welt erscheint nicht als fremde Last, sondern als tragfähiger Zusammenhang, an dem menschliches Denken, Lieben und Werten teilnehmen können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:SD4","text":"Die drei verfluchten Triebe bilden keine bloßen Hindernisse, sondern Prüfstellen für die Neubestimmung menschlicher Güte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:SD5","text":"Die offene Zukunft wird nicht durch eine fertige Antwort geschlossen, sondern durch die Gleichordnung mehrerer schwerer Vermittlungsprobleme strukturiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:DNX1","text":"Ein moralisches System, dessen Werte durch bloße Verfluchung endgültig feststehen, wird ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:DNX2","text":"Eine Erkenntnis, die entweder totale Unwissenheit oder vollständige Auflösung voraussetzt, wird ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:DNX3","text":"Eine vom Menschen unabhängige Wertinstanz wird als notwendige Grundlage der Neubewertung nicht vorausgesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:DNX4","text":"Eine lineare Rangordnung, in der das Hohe vom Niederen getrennt bleibt, wird ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:DNX5","text":"Eine Weltauffassung ohne Übergänge zwischen Gegenwart, Zukunft, Höhe und Wachstum wird ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:DNX6","text":"Eine Kraftauffassung, die sich nicht in Ordnungen, Zahlen oder Wertungen artikuliert, bleibt strukturell unzureichend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Möglichkeit, dass die Welt nur durch Entsagung, Verdammung oder Distanzierung menschlich gut werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine endgültige Antwort, die die Spannung zwischen Jetzt und Dereinst, Hohem und Niedrigem sowie Wachstum beseitigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:SNX3","text":"Die abwesende transzendente Garantie wird durch die noch ausstehende menschliche Wertbildung ersetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:SNX4","text":"Die Möglichkeit einer rein passiven Weltbeziehung bleibt unzulässig; Weltbezug wird als aktives Wägen organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:FGS1","text":"Jenseitige Position → Distanz zur Welt → Messbarkeit und Wägung der Welt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:FGS2","text":"Endlichkeit + begrenzte Rätselhaftigkeit → menschliche Zugänglichkeit ohne vollständige Auflösung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:FGS3","text":"Kraftordnung → Unterordnung der Zahl → Vorrang qualitativer Macht vor bloßer Quantität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:FGS4","text":"Traumanschauung → wache Weisheit → Tagesauftrag zur Nachahmung und Neubewertung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:FGS5","text":"Fluchtradition → Identifikation der drei verfluchten Triebe → Überführung in die Wage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:FGS6","text":"Wägung → Gleichgewicht → Öffnung der Fragen nach Zeit, Rang und Wachstum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:FGS7","text":"Offene Fragen → keine dogmatische Schließung → Fortsetzung der Wertbildung als Bewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:AF1","text":"Jenseitige Beobachterposition → wägbarer Weltzusammenhang → menschlich gute Welt → Neubewertung der verfluchten Triebe → Fragen nach Übergang, Rang und Wachstum → offene Gleichgewichtslage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:ME1","text":"Die Welt wird von einem Gegenstand des Verdachts zu einem Gegenstand der prüfenden Zuwendung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:ME2","text":"Die Opposition zwischen Rätsel und Lösung wird durch eine mittlere Zone begrenzter Erkennbarkeit ersetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:ME3","text":"Die Opposition zwischen Segen und Fluch wird in eine gemeinsame Bewertungsoperation überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:ME4","text":"Wollust, Herrschsucht und Selbstsucht werden von verbotenen Affekten zu diagnostischen Wertungsobjekten umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:ME5","text":"Das Verhältnis von Jetzt und Dereinst wird als Brückenproblem statt als bloße zeitliche Trennung sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:ME6","text":"Das Hohe wird nicht mehr als fertige Höhe, sondern als Ergebnis eines Wachstumsprozesses kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:ALT1","text":"Surface: Ein Traum stellt die Welt als wägbar, endlich und menschlich gut dar; drei verfluchte Dinge werden auf die Wage gelegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:ALT2","text":"Structural: Die Bewertungsordnung verschiebt sich von moralischer Verfluchung zu kraftabhängiger Prüfung und Vermittlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Kritik besteht nicht in der bloßen Umkehrung bestehender Werte, sondern in ihrer erneuten Belastungsprobe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Realität wird als endlicher, übergangsfähiger und wachsender Zusammenhang zwischen Jetzt, Dereinst, Niedrigem und Hohem vorausgesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von Weltwägung zu Wertneubewertung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:MRT2","text":"Die konkrete Bedeutung der drei Antworten auf die drei Fragen bleibt unterbestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:MRT3","text":"Der Status der Wage bleibt zwischen Erkenntnismetapher, Wertinstrument und ontologischer Instanz unentschieden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:MRT4","text":"Die interne Bewegung ist kohärent, sofern die Neubewertung nicht als fertiges Urteil, sondern als Prüfung verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung besteht zwischen der Kritik des Fluches und der Überführung der Triebe in eine offene Wägung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:MRT6","text":"Die Konstruktion hängt von der nicht weiter begründeten Gleichsetzung von Kraft, Zahlordnung und Wertfähigkeit ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, solange die Schlusslage als suspendierte Vermittlung und nicht als abschließende Antwort gelesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T185413307123Z_ee48325f","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"1.","source_sha256":"cd92bb1bcfd8a8279acaf098ce138b43f917c23e427d5df4562a81da69ae549e","sha256":"3f429a6abd61243b9e07ec7f608603b52d5d6c8073649595305ef43744acf0e6","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T18:54:13.309283+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:AS1","text":"The world is determined from an otherworldly observer position as a nexus that can be measured, weighed, and known.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:AS2","text":"The finite world appears neither as an insoluble riddle nor as a completely exhausted solution, but as a humanly accessible good.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:AS3","text":"An alert wisdom orders force and number such that quantification is subordinate to force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:AS4","text":"Dream perception is transferred into the daytime task of humanly good revaluation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:AS5","text":"The three traditionally cursed drives of sensual pleasure, lust for domination, and selfishness are transferred from the sphere of cursing into the sphere of weighing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:AS6","text":"The evenly balanced scale shifts the decision onto three questions concerning transition in time, hierarchy, and growth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:A1","text":"What is measurable, weighable, attainable by flight, or conjecturable can be treated as an object of an order of knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:A2","text":"The world is finite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:A3","text":"The world is not completely enigmatic and not completely solved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:A4","text":"A relation to the world can be enacted without curiosity, greed, fear, or supplication.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:A5","text":"The world can appear as a humanly good thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:A6","text":"Force determines how number becomes mistress.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:A7","text":"Dream wisdom can be transferred into an alert daytime wisdom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:A8","text":"Blessing and cursing form a common operation of valuation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:A9","text":"Sensual pleasure, lust for domination, and selfishness are the three things most strongly cursed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:A10","text":"Cursed things can be redetermined through human weighing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:A11","text":"The world is a nexus in which now and hereafter, high and low, as well as growth, can be related to one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:A12","text":"A balanced scale marks not the abolition of questions, but the equal weight of questions and answers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:NX1","text":"The world is not beyond all measurability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:NX2","text":"The world is not posited as an infinite, inaccessible totality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:NX3","text":"The world is not merely a riddle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:NX4","text":"The world is not merely a solution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:NX5","text":"The relation to the world is not dependent on curiosity, greed, fear, or supplication.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:NX6","text":"Sensual pleasure, lust for domination, and selfishness are not conclusively determined by their prior cursing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:NX7","text":"The high is not simply given as a static final position.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:NX8","text":"The now is not without transition to the hereafter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:NX9","text":"The three questions are not answered by an explicitly formulated doctrine.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:D1","text":"The world can be treated as an object of an active operation of valuation.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_6:A1","CH_97E9_1C_6:A2","CH_97E9_1C_6:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:D2","text":"Human accessibility arises through an intermediate determination between enigmaticness and complete solvability.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_6:A3","CH_97E9_1C_6:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:D3","text":"Quantity possesses no ultimate independence, but is hierarchized by force.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_6:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:D4","text":"Dream intuition functions as a model for a renewed daytime valuation.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_6:A4","CH_97E9_1C_6:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:D5","text":"The prior moral condemnation of the three drives is made recognizable as a historically produced valuation.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_6:A8","CH_97E9_1C_6:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:D6","text":"The three drives are transformed from moral signals of prohibition into examinable objects of revaluation.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_6:A9","CH_97E9_1C_6:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:D7","text":"The question of the highest is reformulated as the question of a process of growing upward.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_6:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:D8","text":"The balance of the scale denotes a still open mediation between question and answer.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_6:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:SD1","text":"The order of valuation is shifted from a transcendent cursing to an immanent examination that can be carried out by humans.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:SD2","text":"Knowledge, valuation, and self-overcoming are coupled in a single operation of weighing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:SD3","text":"The world appears not as an alien burden, but as a sustainable nexus in which human thinking, loving, and valuing can participate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:SD4","text":"The three cursed drives form not mere obstacles, but testing points for the redetermination of human goodness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:SD5","text":"The open future is not closed by a ready-made answer, but structured by the equal ordering of several difficult problems of mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:DNX1","text":"A moral system whose values are definitively fixed by mere cursing is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:DNX2","text":"A knowledge that presupposes either total ignorance or complete resolution is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:DNX3","text":"A valuing instance independent of human beings is not presupposed as a necessary basis of revaluation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:DNX4","text":"A linear hierarchy in which the high remains separated from the low is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:DNX5","text":"A conception of the world without transitions between present, future, height, and growth is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:DNX6","text":"A conception of force that does not articulate itself in orders, numbers, or valuations remains structurally inadequate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:SNX1","text":"Excluded is the possibility that the world can become humanly good only through renunciation, condemnation, or distancing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:SNX2","text":"Excluded is a final answer that eliminates the tension between now and hereafter, high and low, as well as growth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:SNX3","text":"The absent transcendent guarantee is replaced by human value-formation that is still pending.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:SNX4","text":"The possibility of a purely passive relation to the world remains inadmissible; relation to the world is organized as active weighing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:FGS1","text":"Otherworldly position → distance from the world → measurability and weighing of the world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:FGS2","text":"Finitude + limited enigmaticness → human accessibility without complete resolution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:FGS3","text":"Order of force → subordination of number → primacy of qualitative power over mere quantity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:FGS4","text":"Dream intuition → alert wisdom → daytime task of imitation and revaluation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:FGS5","text":"Tradition of cursing → identification of the three cursed drives → transfer into the scale.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:FGS6","text":"Weighing → balance → opening of the questions of time, rank, and growth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:FGS7","text":"Open questions → no dogmatic closure → continuation of value-formation as movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:AF1","text":"Otherworldly observer position → weighable nexus of the world → humanly good world → revaluation of the cursed drives → questions of transition, rank, and growth → open state of equilibrium.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:ME1","text":"The world is remapped from an object of suspicion to an object of examining attentiveness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:ME2","text":"The opposition between riddle and solution is replaced by an intermediate zone of limited knowability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:ME3","text":"The opposition between blessing and curse is transferred into a common operation of valuation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:ME4","text":"Sensual pleasure, lust for domination, and selfishness are reclassified from forbidden affects into diagnostic objects of valuation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:ME5","text":"The relation between now and hereafter becomes visible as a problem of bridging rather than as a mere temporal separation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:ME6","text":"The high is no longer mapped as finished height, but as the result of a process of growth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:ALT1","text":"Surface: A dream presents the world as weighable, finite, and humanly good; three cursed things are placed on the scale.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:ALT2","text":"Structural: The order of valuation shifts from moral cursing to force-dependent examination and mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Critique does not consist in the mere reversal of existing values, but in their renewed stress test.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Reality is presupposed as a finite, transition-capable, and growing nexus between now, hereafter, low, and high.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from weighing the world to revaluation of values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:MRT2","text":"The concrete meaning of the three answers to the three questions remains underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:MRT3","text":"The status of the scale remains undecided between a metaphor of knowledge, an instrument of value, and an ontological instance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:MRT4","text":"The internal movement is coherent insofar as revaluation is understood not as a finished judgment, but as examination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:MRT5","text":"The strongest connection lies between the critique of cursing and the transfer of the drives into an open weighing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:MRT6","text":"The construction depends on the not further justified equation of force, numerical order, and capacity for valuation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_6:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement so long as the concluding configuration is read as suspended mediation and not as a conclusive answer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_6:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_1C_6@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_1C_6:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On the Three Evils","source_section_label":"1.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"On the Three Evils · 1","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On the Three Evils","1."],"original_title":"1."}],"source_title_context":"Von den drei Bösen","source_section_label":"1.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"On the Three Evils · 1","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On the Three Evils","1."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 78","title":"On the Three Evils · 1","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Von den drei Bösen · 1"},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6","layer":"CH","title":"On the Three Evils · 2","order":79,"parents":["RAW_97E9_2C_6"],"revision":"CH_97E9_2C_6@R001","sha256":"8108b7d972dca6735fe8333523ae3463b86d21e7b894e9cdd2354bbdc354ccb7","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:AS1","text":"Der Text problematisiert die einheitliche moralische Benennung von Wollust, Herrschsucht und Selbstsucht, indem er ihre Bedeutung an unterschiedliche Typen und Kräfte bindet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:AS2","text":"Wollust wird von der Verfalls- und Sündenfigur zur unschuldigen Erd-, Leib- und Gegenwartsbejahung der freien und starken Natur umgewertet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:AS3","text":"Herrschsucht erscheint zunächst als zerstörende und erniedrigende Macht, wird aber anschließend als gesunde Bewegung der Höhe in die Niederungen neu bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:AS4","text":"Diese Bewegung wird in der Selbst-Lust einer mächtigen Seele und eines hohen Leibes als Tugend begründet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:AS5","text":"Die neue Tugend konstituiert sich durch die Ausschließung von Feigheit, Knechtschaft, Selbstlosigkeit und priesterlicher After-Weisheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:AS6","text":"Der angekündigte große Mittag macht die Umwertung zu einem zukünftigen Offenbarungs- und Entscheidungsereignis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:A1","text":"Wollust und Herrschsucht besitzen keine für alle Typen gleichbleibende moralische Bedeutung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:A2","text":"Wollust wirkt auf welkende und niedere Typen als Gift oder Verbrennungsapparat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:A3","text":"Wollust stärkt die Löwen-Willigen und erscheint freien Herzen als unschuldige, freie Erdbejahung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:A4","text":"Wollust fungiert als Gleichnis für höheres Glück und höchste Hoffnung, ohne die Fremdheit zwischen Mann und Weib aufzuheben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:A5","text":"Der Schutz der eigenen Gedanken und Worte verlangt begrenzende Zäune gegen die nivellierende Invasion des Fremden und Schwärmerischen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:A6","text":"Herrschsucht zerstört das Morsche, entlarvt übertünchte Gräber und setzt harte sowie eitle Ordnungen unter strafenden Druck.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:A7","text":"Herrschsucht erniedrigt Menschen, Städte und Reiche, bis aus der Erniedrigung die große Verachtung und die Selbstverwerfung hervorgehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:A8","text":"Das Machtgelüsten der Höhe, die zur Macht hinabsteigt, ist nicht notwendig krank oder süchtig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:A9","text":"Die Bewegung der Höhe in die Niederungen kann als „Schenkende Tugend“ bestimmt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:A10","text":"Selbst-Lust entspringt einer mächtigen Seele, die mit einem hohen, schönen, sieghaften und erquicklichen Leib verbunden ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:A11","text":"Die Selbst-Lust nennt sich selbst Tugend und erzeugt ihre Wertordnung durch die Unterscheidung von Gut und Schlecht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:A12","text":"In dieser Wertordnung gelten Feigheit, Sorge, Klage, Misstrauen, Unterwürfigkeit, übermäßige Geduld und Knechtschaft als schlecht oder verächtlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:A13","text":"Priesterliche, weltmüde und knechtische Weisheit wird als After-Weisheit bestimmt, während Selbstlosigkeit als ihr eigener Wunsch nach Selbstbeschreibung erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:A14","text":"Der große Mittag bezeichnet eine kommende Wandlung, in der die verborgenen Wertordnungen offenbar werden sollen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:NX1","text":"Wollust ist nicht schlechthin Gift, Sünde oder Verfallszeichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:NX2","text":"Die Bejahung der Wollust ist keine schrankenlose Öffnung gegenüber jedem Eindringen in Gedanken, Worte oder Gärten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:NX3","text":"Herrschsucht ist nicht schlechthin Krankheit, sobald das Hohe nach Macht verlangt und hinabsteigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:NX4","text":"Tugend ist nicht mit Selbstlosigkeit gleichzusetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:NX5","text":"Das Sorgende, Seufzende, Klägliche und auf kleinste Vorteile Bedachte gilt nicht als moralisch überlegen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:NX6","text":"Misstrauen, Schwurabhängigkeit und vorsichtige Weisheit gelten nicht als höhere Erkenntnisformen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:NX7","text":"Demut, Hündigkeit, schnelle Gefälligkeit, Allzu-Geduld und Alles-Dulden bilden keine Tugend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:NX8","text":"Knechtschaft vor Göttern, Menschen oder Menschenmeinungen ist keine zulässige Form der Ordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:NX9","text":"Priesterliche und weltmüde Weisheit ist keine eigentliche Weisheit, sondern After-Weisheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:NX10","text":"Eine auf vorzeitigen Antworten beruhende Ordnung bleibt der zerstörenden Frage der Herrschsucht ausgesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:D1","text":"Die Bewertung eines Triebes wird aus seiner Wirkung auf unterschiedliche Lebens- und Krafttypen abgeleitet, nicht aus seinem Namen.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_6:A1","CH_97E9_2C_6:A2","CH_97E9_2C_6:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:D2","text":"Wollust wird zugleich zum diagnostischen Zeichen des Verfalls und zum positiven Symbol gesteigerter Lebensfähigkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_6:A2","CH_97E9_2C_6:A3","CH_97E9_2C_6:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:D3","text":"Die Zäune um Gedanken und Worte trennen bejahende Selbstgestaltung von einer unterschiedslosen Einverleibung durch fremde und schwärmerische Ansprüche.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_6:A4","CH_97E9_2C_6:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:D4","text":"Herrschsucht fungiert als destruktive Pädagogik, indem sie morsches Bestehen zerbricht und durch Erniedrigung die Möglichkeit großer Verachtung erzeugt.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_6:A6","CH_97E9_2C_6:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:D5","text":"Die Abwärtsbewegung der Macht wird von der Herrschaftsfigur in eine Gabe aus Überfluss umcodiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_6:A8","CH_97E9_2C_6:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:D6","text":"Der Leib ist nicht bloß Träger eines moralischen Subjekts, sondern das Medium, in dem sich Selbst-Lust und Wertbildung erzeugen.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_6:A10","CH_97E9_2C_6:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:D7","text":"Die neue Moral entsteht durch aktive Ausschließung bestimmter Haltungen und nicht durch Übernahme einer vorgegebenen Norm.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_6:A11","CH_97E9_2C_6:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:D8","text":"Die priesterliche Ordnung kehrt die Wertung um, indem sie Selbstlosigkeit, Demut und Knechtschaft als Tugend ausgibt.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_6:A12","CH_97E9_2C_6:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:D9","text":"Der große Mittag bildet die zeitliche Schwelle, an der die konkurrierenden Wertordnungen nicht mehr verborgen bleiben können.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_6:A13","CH_97E9_2C_6:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:SD1","text":"Moralische Qualität wird insgesamt als Funktion von Kraft, Leiblichkeit und Typus erzeugt; kein Trieb trägt seine Wertung unabhängig von diesen Bedingungen.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_6:A1","CH_97E9_2C_6:A3","CH_97E9_2C_6:A10","CH_97E9_2C_6:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:SD2","text":"Die positive Bewegung des Systems besteht nicht primär in der Aneignung von Macht, sondern in der Fähigkeit der Höhe, aus Überfluss hinabzusteigen und zu schenken.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_6:A6","CH_97E9_2C_6:A8","CH_97E9_2C_6:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:SD3","text":"Die Umwertung der Tugend ist zugleich eine Gegen-Genealogie, die Demut, Vorsicht und Selbstlosigkeit als Formen der Angst und Knechtschaft lesbar macht.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_6:A11","CH_97E9_2C_6:A12","CH_97E9_2C_6:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:SD4","text":"Der Text ersetzt eine transzendente Moralordnung durch eine leiblich erzeugte, selbstbejahende Ordnung der Werte.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_6:A10","CH_97E9_2C_6:A11","CH_97E9_2C_6:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:SD5","text":"Die behauptete Freiheit bleibt strukturell auf die Ausstoßung feiger, knechtischer und priesterlicher Formen angewiesen.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_6:A5","CH_97E9_2C_6:A11","CH_97E9_2C_6:A12","CH_97E9_2C_6:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:SD6","text":"Der große Mittag ist keine externe Begründung der neuen Werte, sondern die angekündigte zeitliche Sichtbarkeit eines bereits vollzogenen Wertkampfes.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_6:A11","CH_97E9_2C_6:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt einen universalen und typunabhängigen moralischen Maßstab aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:DNX2","text":"Es schließt die Vorstellung aus, dass Körper und Seele voneinander unabhängige Ebenen der Wertbildung seien.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:DNX3","text":"Es schließt eine Tugend aus, deren Ursprung in Selbstverneinung, Gehorsam oder dauernder Duldung liegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:DNX4","text":"Es schließt eine dauerhaft isolierte Höhe aus, die sich selbst genügt und nicht in die Niederungen hinabsteigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:DNX5","text":"Es schließt eine voraussetzungslose Gemeinschaft der Perspektiven aus, in der Fremdheit und Abgrenzung verschwänden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:DNX6","text":"Es schließt die Gleichsetzung von Macht, Herrschaft und Krankheit ebenso aus wie deren einfache moralische Trennung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:SNX1","text":"Die Ordnung des Textes hängt vom Fehlen eines neutralen moralischen Gerichtshofs ab, der die konkurrierenden Wertungen von außen entscheiden könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:SNX2","text":"Die Möglichkeit einer grenzenlosen gegenseitigen Durchsichtigkeit und Versöhnung bleibt versperrt; Fremdheit und Zäune organisieren die Bejahung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:SNX3","text":"Eine universalisierbare Tugend, die für starke und knechtische Typen gleichermaßen gilt, wird als unmöglich behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:SNX4","text":"Die Unterscheidung zwischen gesunder Selbst-Lust und bloßer Herrschsucht bleibt auf ein nicht vollständig formalisiertes Maß von Höhe, Kraft und Reinheit angewiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:SNX5","text":"Die versprochene endgültige Offenbarkeit des großen Mittags ersetzt die ausbleibende explizite Begründung des letzten Wertmaßstabs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:FGS1","text":"Gleichnamiger Trieb → typologische Differenzierung → gegensätzliche Wertung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:FGS2","text":"Niedere Wirkung der Wollust → Gift-, Feuer- und Verfallsfigur; starke Wirkung der Wollust → Erd-, Leib- und Gegenwartsbejahung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:FGS3","text":"Zerstörende Herrschsucht → Erniedrigung → große Verachtung → Möglichkeit der Selbstüberschreitung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:FGS4","text":"Macht der Höhe → Hinabsteigen → Gabe aus Überfluss → „Schenkende Tugend“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:FGS5","text":"Mächtige Seele + hoher Leib → Selbst-Lust → eigene Benennung als Tugend → Erzeugung von Gut und Schlecht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:FGS6","text":"Selbst-Lust → Ausschluss von Feigheit, Knechtschaft und After-Weisheit → Gegenordnung zur priesterlichen Moral.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:FGS7","text":"Gegenordnung → angekündigte Wandlung → großer Mittag als Offenlegung der Wertkonkurrenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:AF1","text":"Einheitliche moralische Triebbenennung → typologische Umwertung → Wollust als Erd- und Leibbejahung → Herrschsucht als zerstörende und schenkende Abwärtsbewegung → Selbst-Lust als Tugendquelle → Ausschluss knechtisch-priesterlicher Gegenwerte → großer Mittag als kommende Offenbarung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:ME1","text":"Wollust wird aus der einheitlichen Kategorie des moralischen Schmutzes in eine typologisch geteilte Kraft mit gegensätzlichen Wirkungen überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:ME2","text":"Herrschsucht wird nicht mehr nur als Herrschaftsanspruch, sondern als doppelte Bewegung von Zerstörung und Gabe kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:ME3","text":"Tugend wird von Selbstlosigkeit, Demut und Gehorsam auf gesunde Selbst-Lust und leibliche Mächtigkeit verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:ME4","text":"Weisheit wird neu klassifiziert: Vorsicht, Misstrauen und Weltmüdigkeit erscheinen als After-Weisheit, nicht als epistemische Überlegenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:ME5","text":"Gegenwart und Zukunft werden gekoppelt: Das Jetzt wird als Dankesüberschwang bejaht, während der große Mittag die vollständige Sichtbarkeit dieser Bejahung verspricht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:ME6","text":"Moralische Opposition wird als Kampf konkurrierender Lebensformen und nicht als bloßer Gegensatz abstrakter Prinzipien lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:ALT1","text":"Surface — Wollust, Herrschsucht und Selbstsucht werden in gegensätzlichen Bild- und Wertreihen bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:ALT2","text":"Structural — Triebe fungieren als Kräfte, deren Wert aus ihrer Wirkung auf Körper, Seele, soziale Ordnungen und Wertsysteme hervorgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text verwandelt moralische Benennungen in Waffen der Grenzziehung und führt eine Gegenordnung gegen die priesterliche Wertung ein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Leib und Seele bilden eine einheitliche Quelle der Wertsetzung; Erde und Jetzt werden bejaht, während der große Mittag die zeitliche Offenbarung der Umwertung bezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von typabhängiger Triebwertung über leibliche Selbst-Lust zur Gegenordnung gegen die Knechtsmoral zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleiben die genauen Kriterien, nach denen ein Typ als frei, stark, gesund, hoch oder löwenwillig gilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist grundsätzlich kohärent, enthält aber eine ungelöste Doppelbestimmung der Herrschsucht als Erniedrigung und als edle Gabe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:MRT4","text":"Eine zweite Bruchlinie entsteht daraus, dass die neue Freiheit ihre eigene Identität durch die Verachtung und Ausschließung schwacher oder knechtischer Formen bildet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0027","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:MRT5","text":"Die Unterscheidung zwischen gesunder Selbst-Lust und Herrschsucht wird behauptet, jedoch nicht durch ein unabhängiges Verfahren abgesichert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:MRT6","text":"Die Beziehung von Mann und Weib sowie die Ankündigung von Ehe und Mehr-als-Ehe bleiben als symbolische Fremdheitsstruktur offen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:MRT7","text":"Der große Mittag ist für die argumentative Bewegung notwendig, wird aber als Prophezeiung angekündigt und nicht aus den vorherigen Sätzen deduziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, sofern sie die poetischen Bilder als Operationen der Umwertung und nicht als bloße Beschreibung behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T190625600493Z_fc7b0cd0","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"2.","source_sha256":"8108b7d972dca6735fe8333523ae3463b86d21e7b894e9cdd2354bbdc354ccb7","sha256":"c11312c4e399398a3cbbb6fa2d1f589a97ca022ae8fa334186ec1767e87abd4a","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:06:25.602463+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:AS1","text":"The text problematizes the unitary moral designation of voluptuousness, lust for dominion, and selfishness by binding their significance to different types and forces.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:AS2","text":"Voluptuousness is revalued from a figure of decay and sin into the innocent affirmation of earth, body, and presentness of free and strong nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:AS3","text":"Lust for dominion initially appears as a destructive and degrading power, but is subsequently redetermined as the healthy movement of height down into the lowlands.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:AS4","text":"This movement is grounded as virtue in the self-delight of a powerful soul and a lofty body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:AS5","text":"The new virtue constitutes itself through the exclusion of cowardice, servitude, selflessness, and priestly after-wisdom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:AS6","text":"The announced great noon makes the revaluation into a future event of revelation and decision.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:A1","text":"Voluptuousness and lust for dominion possess no moral significance that remains constant for all types.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:A2","text":"For withering and lower types, voluptuousness acts as poison or an apparatus of combustion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:A3","text":"Voluptuousness strengthens those willing as lions and appears to free hearts as innocent, free affirmation of the earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:A4","text":"Voluptuousness functions as a parable for higher happiness and highest hope, without abolishing the strangeness between man and woman.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:A5","text":"The protection of one's own thoughts and words requires delimiting fences against the levelling invasion of the alien and the rhapsodic.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:A6","text":"Lust for dominion destroys what is rotten, exposes whitewashed graves, and places hard as well as vain orders under punishing pressure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:A7","text":"Lust for dominion degrades human beings, cities, and empires until great contempt and self-contempt emerge from degradation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:A8","text":"The craving for power of height that descends toward power is not necessarily sick or addictive.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:A9","text":"The movement of height into the lowlands can be determined as “Bestowing Virtue”.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:A10","text":"Self-delight springs from a powerful soul united with a lofty, beautiful, victorious, and refreshing body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:A11","text":"Self-delight calls itself virtue and produces its order of values through the distinction between good and bad.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:A12","text":"Within this order of values, cowardice, care, lamentation, mistrust, submissiveness, excessive patience, and servitude count as bad or contemptible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:A13","text":"Priestly, world-weary, and servile wisdom is determined as after-wisdom, while selflessness appears as its own desire for self-description.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:A14","text":"The great noon designates a coming transformation in which the hidden orders of value are to become manifest.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:NX1","text":"Voluptuousness is not simply poison, sin, or a sign of decay.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:NX2","text":"The affirmation of voluptuousness is not an unrestricted openness to every intrusion into thoughts, words, or gardens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:NX3","text":"Lust for dominion is not simply sickness whenever what is high craves power and descends.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:NX4","text":"Virtue is not to be equated with selflessness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:NX5","text":"That which is caring, sighing, lamentable, and attentive to the smallest advantages does not count as morally superior.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:NX6","text":"Mistrust, dependence on oaths, and cautious wisdom do not count as higher forms of knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:NX7","text":"Humility, doggishness, prompt complaisance, all-too-patience, and enduring everything do not constitute virtue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:NX8","text":"Servitude before gods, human beings, or human opinions is no permissible form of order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:NX9","text":"Priestly and world-weary wisdom is not wisdom proper, but after-wisdom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:NX10","text":"An order based on premature answers remains exposed to the destructive question of lust for dominion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:D1","text":"The evaluation of a drive is derived from its effect on different types of life and force, not from its name.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_6:A1","CH_97E9_2C_6:A2","CH_97E9_2C_6:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:D2","text":"Voluptuousness becomes at once a diagnostic sign of decay and a positive symbol of heightened vitality.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_6:A2","CH_97E9_2C_6:A3","CH_97E9_2C_6:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:D3","text":"The fences around thoughts and words separate affirmative self-formation from indiscriminate incorporation by alien and rhapsodic claims.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_6:A4","CH_97E9_2C_6:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:D4","text":"Lust for dominion functions as a destructive pedagogy by breaking apart rotten existence and producing, through degradation, the possibility of great contempt.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_6:A6","CH_97E9_2C_6:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:D5","text":"The downward movement of power is recoded from the figure of domination into a gift out of abundance.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_6:A8","CH_97E9_2C_6:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:D6","text":"The body is not merely the bearer of a moral subject, but the medium in which self-delight and the formation of values are produced.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_6:A10","CH_97E9_2C_6:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:D7","text":"The new morality arises through the active exclusion of particular attitudes and not through the adoption of a pre-given norm.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_6:A11","CH_97E9_2C_6:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:D8","text":"The priestly order reverses valuation by presenting selflessness, humility, and servitude as virtue.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_6:A12","CH_97E9_2C_6:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:D9","text":"The great noon forms the temporal threshold at which the competing orders of value can no longer remain hidden.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_6:A13","CH_97E9_2C_6:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:SD1","text":"Moral quality as a whole is produced as a function of force, corporeality, and type; no drive bears its valuation independently of these conditions.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_6:A1","CH_97E9_2C_6:A3","CH_97E9_2C_6:A10","CH_97E9_2C_6:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:SD2","text":"The positive movement of the system consists not primarily in the appropriation of power, but in the capacity of height to descend and bestow out of abundance.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_6:A6","CH_97E9_2C_6:A8","CH_97E9_2C_6:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:SD3","text":"The revaluation of virtue is at the same time a counter-genealogy that renders humility, caution, and selflessness legible as forms of fear and servitude.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_6:A11","CH_97E9_2C_6:A12","CH_97E9_2C_6:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:SD4","text":"The text replaces a transcendent moral order with a bodily produced, self-affirming order of values.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_6:A10","CH_97E9_2C_6:A11","CH_97E9_2C_6:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:SD5","text":"The asserted freedom remains structurally dependent on the expulsion of cowardly, servile, and priestly forms.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_6:A5","CH_97E9_2C_6:A11","CH_97E9_2C_6:A12","CH_97E9_2C_6:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:SD6","text":"The great noon is not an external grounding of the new values, but the announced temporal visibility of an already accomplished struggle of values.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_6:A11","CH_97E9_2C_6:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:DNX1","text":"The system excludes a universal moral standard independent of type.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:DNX2","text":"It excludes the notion that body and soul are levels of value-formation independent of one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:DNX3","text":"It excludes a virtue whose origin lies in self-negation, obedience, or enduring forbearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:DNX4","text":"It excludes a permanently isolated height that suffices unto itself and does not descend into the lowlands.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:DNX5","text":"It excludes a presuppositionless community of perspectives in which strangeness and delimitation would disappear.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:DNX6","text":"It excludes both the equation of power, domination, and sickness and their simple moral separation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:SNX1","text":"The order of the text depends on the absence of a neutral moral tribunal that could decide the competing valuations from outside.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:SNX2","text":"The possibility of boundless mutual transparency and reconciliation remains barred; strangeness and fences organize affirmation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:SNX3","text":"A universalizable virtue that applies equally to strong and servile types is treated as impossible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:SNX4","text":"The distinction between healthy self-delight and mere lust for dominion remains dependent on a measure of height, force, and purity that is not fully formalized.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:SNX5","text":"The promised final manifestness of the great noon replaces the absent explicit grounding of the ultimate standard of value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:FGS1","text":"Drive bearing the same name → typological differentiation → opposed valuation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:FGS2","text":"Lower effect of voluptuousness → figure of poison, fire, and decay; strong effect of voluptuousness → affirmation of earth, body, and presentness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:FGS3","text":"Destructive lust for dominion → degradation → great contempt → possibility of self-overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:FGS4","text":"Power of height → descent → gift out of abundance → “Bestowing Virtue”.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:FGS5","text":"Powerful soul + lofty body → self-delight → self-designation as virtue → production of good and bad.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:FGS6","text":"Self-delight → exclusion of cowardice, servitude, and after-wisdom → counter-order to priestly morality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:FGS7","text":"Counter-order → announced transformation → great noon as disclosure of the competition of values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:AF1","text":"Unitary moral designation of drives → typological revaluation → voluptuousness as affirmation of earth and body → lust for dominion as destructive and bestowing downward movement → self-delight as source of virtue → exclusion of servile-priestly counter-values → great noon as coming revelation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:ME1","text":"Voluptuousness is transferred from the unitary category of moral filth into a typologically divided force with opposed effects.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:ME2","text":"Lust for dominion is no longer mapped merely as a claim to domination, but as a double movement of destruction and gift.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:ME3","text":"Virtue is shifted from selflessness, humility, and obedience to healthy self-delight and bodily power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:ME4","text":"Wisdom is reclassified: caution, mistrust, and world-weariness appear as after-wisdom, not as epistemic superiority.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:ME5","text":"Present and future are coupled: the now is affirmed as an excess of gratitude, while the great noon promises the complete visibility of this affirmation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:ME6","text":"Moral opposition becomes legible as a struggle of competing forms of life and not as a mere opposition of abstract principles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:ALT1","text":"Surface — Voluptuousness, lust for dominion, and selfishness are determined in opposed series of images and values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:ALT2","text":"Structural — Drives function as forces whose value arises from their effect on body, soul, social orders, and value systems.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text transforms moral designations into weapons of boundary-drawing and introduces a counter-order against priestly valuation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Body and soul form a unitary source of value-positing; earth and now are affirmed, while the great noon designates the temporal revelation of revaluation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from type-dependent valuation of drives, through bodily self-delight, to the counter-order against slave morality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:MRT2","text":"The precise criteria according to which a type counts as free, strong, healthy, lofty, or lion-willed remain underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:MRT3","text":"The structure is fundamentally coherent, but contains an unresolved double determination of lust for dominion as degradation and as noble gift.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:MRT4","text":"A second line of fracture arises from the fact that the new freedom forms its own identity through contempt for and exclusion of weak or servile forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0027","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:MRT5","text":"The distinction between healthy self-delight and lust for dominion is asserted, but is not secured through an independent procedure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:MRT6","text":"The relation of man and woman, as well as the announcement of marriage and more-than-marriage, remain open as a symbolic structure of strangeness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:MRT7","text":"The great noon is necessary for the argumentative movement, but is announced as prophecy and not deduced from the preceding propositions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_6:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement insofar as it treats the poetic images as operations of revaluation and not as mere description.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_6:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_2C_6@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_2C_6:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On the Three Evils","source_section_label":"2.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"On the Three Evils · 2","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On the Three Evils","2."],"original_title":"2."}],"source_title_context":"Von den drei Bösen","source_section_label":"2.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"On the Three Evils · 2","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On the Three Evils","2."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 79","title":"On the Three Evils · 2","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Von den drei Bösen · 2"},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7","layer":"CH","title":"On the Spirit of Gravity · 1","order":80,"parents":["RAW_97E9_1C_7"],"revision":"CH_97E9_1C_7@R001","sha256":"2355388f8a8122e3ae4ad413e60afdba90c637e013dabc924298cba0511c69ca","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:AS1","text":"Der Sprecher bestimmt seine Ausdrucksweise als volkstümlich, grob und herzlich und grenzt sie damit von verfeinerten und gelehrten Sprachformen ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:AS2","text":"Die einzelnen Körperteile werden als operative Träger verschiedener Gegenkräfte bestimmt: Volkssprache, Narrentum, Beweglichkeit und Vogelart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:AS3","text":"Aus leichter Nahrung, Genügsamkeit und Flugbereitschaft wird eine nicht-schwere, flüchtige Existenzweise erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:AS4","text":"Die Feindschaft gegen den Geist der Schwere wird zur zentralen Negation und zur Bestätigung der Vogelart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:AS5","text":"Das Singen entsteht nicht aus sozialer Resonanz, sondern aus selbstgenügsamer Produktion in der Einsamkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:AS6","text":"Die Sprecherposition schließt sich gegen Sänger ab, deren Ausdruck von vollem Haus und äußerer Bestätigung abhängt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:A1","text":"Die Rede des Sprechers gehört dem Volk und ist grob sowie herzlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:A2","text":"Die Rede des Sprechers ist für verfeinerte und gelehrte Sprachmilieus fremd.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:A3","text":"Die Hand des Sprechers ist eine Narrenhand.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:A4","text":"Der Fuß des Sprechers ist ein Pferdefuß und ermöglicht schnelles, richtungsoffenes Traben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:A5","text":"Der Magen des Sprechers gehört einer vogelartigen, möglicherweise adlerartigen Ernährungsweise an.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:A6","text":"Der Sprecher wird von unschuldigen Dingen und von Wenigem genährt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:A7","text":"Der Sprecher ist bereit und ungeduldig davonzufliegen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:A8","text":"Der Sprecher ist dem Geist der Schwere feindlich bis zur radikalen Feindschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:A9","text":"Der Sprecher kann allein und für die eigenen Ohren singen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:A10","text":"Andere Sänger benötigen das volle Haus, damit ihre Stimme, Hand, ihr Auge und ihr Herz aktiviert werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:A11","text":"Der Sprecher identifiziert sich nicht mit diesen publikumsabhängigen Sängern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:NX1","text":"Die Rede des Sprechers ist nicht seidenhasenhaft verfeinert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:NX2","text":"Die Rede des Sprechers ist nicht tintenfischhaft oder federfüchsisch gelehrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:NX3","text":"Die Hand des Sprechers dient nicht der dekorativen Beschriftung von Tischen und Wänden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:NX4","text":"Der Sprecher ist nicht an eine geradlinige oder disziplinierte Bewegungsbahn gebunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:NX5","text":"Die Ernährung des Sprechers ist nicht durch Überfluss oder Schwere bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:NX6","text":"Der Sprecher akzeptiert den Geist der Schwere nicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:NX7","text":"Das Singen des Sprechers ist nicht von einem vollen Haus abhängig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:NX8","text":"Der Sprecher übernimmt nicht die Ausdrucksökonomie der sozial aktivierten Sänger.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:D1","text":"Die sprachliche Fremdheit des Sprechers folgt aus der bewussten Bindung an Volkstümlichkeit und der Abweisung gelehrter Ausdrucksformen.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_7:A1","CH_97E9_1C_7:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:D2","text":"Die Narrenhand erzeugt eine Schreib- und Zeichenpraxis, die bestehende Flächen eher beschädigt oder verunziert als ordnet.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_7:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:D3","text":"Pferdefuß und kreuzendes Traben erzeugen eine Bewegungsform, die Geschwindigkeit über Orientierung und Regelmäßigkeit stellt.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_7:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:D4","text":"Wenige und unschuldige Nahrung werden als materielle Bedingungen einer leichten und flugfähigen Existenz verwendet.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_7:A5","CH_97E9_1C_7:A6","CH_97E9_1C_7:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:D5","text":"Die Feindschaft gegen die Schwere bestätigt die Vogelart nicht als biologische Feststellung, sondern als Bewegungs- und Existenzprinzip.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_7:A7","CH_97E9_1C_7:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:D6","text":"Das Singen wird als autonome Handlung möglich, weil es nicht auf Zuhörer oder soziale Resonanz angewiesen ist.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_7:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:D7","text":"Die Abgrenzung von den anderen Sängern trennt selbstgenügsame Hervorbringung von publikumsabhängiger Ausdrucksaktivierung.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_7:A10","CH_97E9_1C_7:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:SD1","text":"Der Sprecher konstruiert eine zusammengesetzte Körpermaschine, in der Volkssprache, Narrentum, Geschwindigkeit, Leichtigkeit und Einsamkeit eine einheitliche Opposition gegen Schwere und Verfeinerung bilden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:SD2","text":"Die Abwertung des Publikums wird in ein positives Modell autonomer Hervorbringung überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:SD3","text":"Körperliche Metaphern ersetzen stabile Identität durch eine bewegliche, tierisch codierte und partiell widersprüchliche Existenzform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:SD4","text":"Die poetische Stimme legitimiert sich nicht durch kulturelle Anerkennung, sondern durch ihre Fähigkeit, ohne Anerkennung fortzubestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:SD5","text":"Die Feindschaft gegen Schwere verbindet materielle Genügsamkeit, räumliche Beweglichkeit, stilistische Grobheit und soziale Unabhängigkeit zu einem gemeinsamen Strukturprinzip.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:DNX1","text":"Das System hängt von der Unwahrheit ab, dass sprachliche Geltung aus Verfeinerung oder gelehrter Anerkennung hervorgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:DNX2","text":"Es schließt stillschweigend aus, dass Schreiben primär ordnet, verschönert oder dauerhaft auf Flächen fixiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:DNX3","text":"Es behandelt Schwere nicht als neutrale Eigenschaft, sondern als gegnerische Organisationsmacht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:DNX4","text":"Es setzt voraus, dass Ausdruck auch ohne Gegenüber vollständig wirksam sein kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:DNX5","text":"Es disqualifiziert die Vorstellung, dass soziale Resonanz die notwendige Quelle des Gesangs sei.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Kultur, in der Wert durch Eleganz, Schriftgelehrsamkeit, Ordnung und Publikum erzeugt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine sesshafte Subjektform, deren Identität auf Festigkeit, Richtung und Dauer beruht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Möglichkeit, dass Einsamkeit Ausdruck entkräftet; sie wird stattdessen zur Bedingung seiner Autonomie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird ein Körper ohne innere Rangordnung der Kräfte; an seine Stelle tritt ein Körper, der sich nur über gegensätzliche Funktionen artikuliert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:SNX5","text":"Die unbenannte Gegenmacht ist eine Welt, in der Schwere, Publikum und kulturelle Verfeinerung die Bedingungen des Sprechens bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:FGS1","text":"Volkstümliche Grobheit + Fremdheit gegenüber gelehrter Sprache → sprachliche Gegenposition.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_7:A1","CH_97E9_1C_7:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:FGS2","text":"Narrenhand + Pferdefuß → beschädigendes Zeichen + ungeregelte Geschwindigkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_7:A3","CH_97E9_1C_7:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:FGS3","text":"Wenige und unschuldige Nahrung + Flugbereitschaft → vogelartige Leichtigkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_7:A5","CH_97E9_1C_7:A6","CH_97E9_1C_7:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:FGS4","text":"Vogelartige Leichtigkeit + Feindschaft gegen Schwere → negative Existenzdefinition durch Aufhebung des Schweren.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_7:A7","CH_97E9_1C_7:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:FGS5","text":"Aufhebung der Schwere + Fähigkeit zum Alleinsingen → autonomer Gesang.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_7:A8","CH_97E9_1C_7:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:FGS6","text":"Autonomer Gesang − Publikumsabhängigkeit → Abgrenzung von den anderen Sängern.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_7:A10","CH_97E9_1C_7:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:AF1","text":"Volkstümliche Rede → Abweisung gelehrter Verfeinerung → Körperliche Zerlegung in Gegenkräfte → Leichtigkeit und Flugbereitschaft → Feindschaft gegen Schwere → Gesang in der Einsamkeit → Nichtidentität mit publikumsabhängigen Sängern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:ME1","text":"Sprache wird nicht nach Eleganz oder Gelehrsamkeit, sondern nach ihrer Nähe zum Volk und ihrer Widerständigkeit gegen kulturelle Verfeinerung kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:ME2","text":"Der Körper wird von einer biologischen Einheit in ein Ensemble funktionaler Kräfte umgezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:ME3","text":"Bewegung wird als wertvoller sichtbar als Orientierung, Stabilität oder Geradlinigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:ME4","text":"Einsamkeit wird von einem Mangel an Publikum in eine Bedingung unabhängiger Hervorbringung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:ME5","text":"Gesang wird von sozialer Aktivierung gelöst und als selbstbezügliche Produktion neu bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:ME6","text":"Schwere wird als umfassende Gegenkategorie sichtbar, die Körper, Geist, Sprache und soziale Abhängigkeit verbindet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Der Sprecher beschreibt Mundwerk, Hand, Fuß, Magen und Gesang durch grobe, tierische und soziale Metaphern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Die Körperteile organisieren ein System aus sprachlicher Abgrenzung, beschädigendem Schreiben, schneller Bewegung, leichter Ernährung und autonomem Gesang.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Der Text verschiebt die Geltungsgrundlage des Ausdrucks von kultureller Anerkennung auf Unabhängigkeit vom Publikum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Das Subjekt erscheint als flüchtige, nicht-schwere und stets zum Davonfliegen bereite Konfiguration; seine Identität liegt in Bewegung und Negation, nicht in Beständigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von volkstümlicher Rede über Körpermetaphorik und Vogelart zum autonomen Gesang zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob die Tierbilder als Selbstcharakterisierung, Übertreibung oder poetische Fiktion gelten sollen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Leichtigkeit und Beweglichkeit als gemeinsames Gegenprinzip zur Schwere gelesen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung besteht zwischen Feindschaft gegen Schwere, Flugbereitschaft und Unabhängigkeit vom Publikum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:MRT5","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen der Behauptung volkstümlicher Zugehörigkeit und der ausgeprägten Fremdheit gegenüber den anderen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung entsteht zwischen dem Wunsch zu singen und der Zurückweisung sozialer Bedingungen des Gesangs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die Argumentbewegung, sofern der Gesang als Endpunkt einer umfassenden Negation von Verfeinerung, Schwere und Resonanzabhängigkeit verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T185434819211Z_d638c99c","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"1.","source_sha256":"2355388f8a8122e3ae4ad413e60afdba90c637e013dabc924298cba0511c69ca","sha256":"7d0bf26b46689220f03f88e2a96144a9cc41796cad207b215b6c3d4fdcc8fb19","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T18:54:34.820327+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:AS1","text":"The speaker defines his manner of expression as popular, coarse, and heartfelt, thereby distinguishing it from refined and learned forms of language.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:AS2","text":"The individual body parts are defined as operative bearers of different counterforces: popular language, foolery, mobility, and bird-nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:AS3","text":"From light nourishment, frugality, and readiness for flight, a non-heavy, fleeting mode of existence is produced.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:AS4","text":"Enmity toward the spirit of gravity becomes the central negation and the affirmation of bird-nature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:AS5","text":"Singing arises not from social resonance, but from self-sufficient production in solitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:AS6","text":"The speaker's position sets itself apart from singers whose expression depends on a full house and external affirmation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:A1","text":"The speaker's speech belongs to the people and is coarse as well as heartfelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:A2","text":"The speaker's speech is alien to refined and learned linguistic milieus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:A3","text":"The speaker's hand is a fool's hand.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:A4","text":"The speaker's foot is a horse's hoof and enables swift trotting open to any direction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:A5","text":"The speaker's stomach belongs to a bird-like, possibly eagle-like, mode of nourishment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:A6","text":"The speaker is nourished by innocent things and by little.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:A7","text":"The speaker is ready and impatient to fly away.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:A8","text":"The speaker is hostile to the spirit of gravity, to the point of radical enmity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:A9","text":"The speaker can sing alone and for his own ears.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:A10","text":"Other singers require a full house in order for their voice, hand, eye, and heart to be activated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:A11","text":"The speaker does not identify with these audience-dependent singers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:NX1","text":"The speaker's speech is not refined in a silk-hare-like manner.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:NX2","text":"The speaker's speech is not learned in a cuttlefish-like or feather-fox-like manner.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:NX3","text":"The speaker's hand does not serve the decorative inscription of tables and walls.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:NX4","text":"The speaker is not bound to a rectilinear or disciplined trajectory of movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:NX5","text":"The speaker's nourishment is not determined by abundance or heaviness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:NX6","text":"The speaker does not accept the spirit of gravity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:NX7","text":"The speaker's singing does not depend on a full house.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:NX8","text":"The speaker does not adopt the economy of expression of the socially activated singers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:D1","text":"The speaker's linguistic foreignness follows from the conscious attachment to popularness and the rejection of learned forms of expression.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_7:A1","CH_97E9_1C_7:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:D2","text":"The fool's hand produces a practice of writing and marking that damages or defaces existing surfaces rather than ordering them.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_7:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:D3","text":"Horse's hoof and crisscrossing trot produce a form of movement that places speed above orientation and regularity.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_7:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:D4","text":"Few and innocent foods are employed as material conditions of a light and flight-capable existence.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_7:A5","CH_97E9_1C_7:A6","CH_97E9_1C_7:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:D5","text":"Enmity toward gravity affirms bird-nature not as a biological statement, but as a principle of movement and existence.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_7:A7","CH_97E9_1C_7:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:D6","text":"Singing becomes possible as an autonomous act because it does not depend on listeners or social resonance.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_7:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:D7","text":"The distinction from the other singers separates self-sufficient production from audience-dependent activation of expression.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_7:A10","CH_97E9_1C_7:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:SD1","text":"The speaker constructs a composite body-machine in which popular language, foolery, speed, lightness, and solitude form a unified opposition to gravity and refinement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:SD2","text":"The devaluation of the audience is transformed into a positive model of autonomous production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:SD3","text":"Bodily metaphors replace stable identity with a mobile, animal-coded, and partially contradictory mode of existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:SD4","text":"The poetic voice legitimates itself not through cultural recognition, but through its capacity to persist without recognition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:SD5","text":"Enmity toward gravity joins material frugality, spatial mobility, stylistic coarseness, and social independence into a common structural principle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:DNX1","text":"The system depends on the untruth that linguistic validity arises from refinement or learned recognition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:DNX2","text":"It tacitly excludes the possibility that writing primarily orders, beautifies, or permanently fixes itself upon surfaces.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:DNX3","text":"It treats gravity not as a neutral property, but as an adversarial organizing power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:DNX4","text":"It presupposes that expression can be fully effective even without an interlocutor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:DNX5","text":"It disqualifies the notion that social resonance is the necessary source of singing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a culture in which value is produced through elegance, scholarship, order, and audience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:SNX2","text":"Excluded is a sedentary form of subjectivity whose identity rests on firmness, direction, and duration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:SNX3","text":"Excluded is the possibility that solitude weakens expression; it instead becomes the condition of its autonomy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:SNX4","text":"Excluded is a body without an inner hierarchy of forces; in its place stands a body that articulates itself only through opposing functions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:SNX5","text":"The unnamed counterpower is a world in which gravity, audience, and cultural refinement determine the conditions of speaking.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:FGS1","text":"Popular coarseness + foreignness to learned language → linguistic counterposition.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_7:A1","CH_97E9_1C_7:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:FGS2","text":"Fool's hand + horse's hoof → damaging sign + unregulated speed.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_7:A3","CH_97E9_1C_7:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:FGS3","text":"Few and innocent foods + readiness for flight → bird-like lightness.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_7:A5","CH_97E9_1C_7:A6","CH_97E9_1C_7:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:FGS4","text":"Bird-like lightness + enmity toward gravity → negative definition of existence through the abolition of the heavy.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_7:A7","CH_97E9_1C_7:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:FGS5","text":"Abolition of gravity + capacity to sing alone → autonomous song.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_7:A8","CH_97E9_1C_7:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:FGS6","text":"Autonomous song − audience dependence → distinction from the other singers.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_7:A10","CH_97E9_1C_7:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:AF1","text":"Popular speech → rejection of learned refinement → bodily decomposition into counterforces → lightness and readiness for flight → enmity toward gravity → singing in solitude → non-identity with audience-dependent singers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:ME1","text":"Language is mapped not according to elegance or learning, but according to its proximity to the people and its resistance to cultural refinement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:ME2","text":"The body is redrawn from a biological unity into an ensemble of functional forces.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:ME3","text":"Movement becomes visible as more valuable than orientation, stability, or rectilinearity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:ME4","text":"Solitude is reclassified from a lack of audience into a condition of independent production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:ME5","text":"Singing is detached from social activation and redefined as self-referential production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:ME6","text":"Gravity becomes visible as a comprehensive countercategory joining body, spirit, language, and social dependence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** The speaker describes manner of speech, hand, foot, stomach, and singing through coarse, animal, and social metaphors.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** The body parts organize a system of linguistic demarcation, damaging writing, swift movement, light nourishment, and autonomous singing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** The text shifts the basis of validity of expression from cultural recognition to independence from the audience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** The subject appears as a fleeting, non-heavy configuration, always ready to fly away; its identity lies in movement and negation, not in permanence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from popular speech through bodily metaphorics and bird-nature to autonomous singing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether the animal images are to count as self-characterization, exaggeration, or poetic fiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as lightness and mobility are read as a shared counterprinciple to gravity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:MRT4","text":"The strongest connection exists between enmity toward gravity, readiness for flight, and independence from the audience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:MRT5","text":"A tension remains between the assertion of popular belonging and the pronounced foreignness toward the others.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:MRT6","text":"A further tension arises between the desire to sing and the rejection of the social conditions of singing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_7:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the movement of the argument insofar as singing is understood as the endpoint of a comprehensive negation of refinement, gravity, and dependence on resonance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_1C_7@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_1C_7:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On the Spirit of Gravity","source_section_label":"1.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"On the Spirit of Gravity · 1","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On the Spirit of Gravity","1."],"original_title":"1."}],"source_title_context":"Vom Geist der Schwere","source_section_label":"1.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"On the Spirit of Gravity · 1","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On the Spirit of Gravity","1."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 80","title":"On the Spirit of Gravity · 1","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Vom Geist der Schwere · 1"},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7","layer":"CH","title":"On the Spirit of Gravity · 2","order":81,"parents":["RAW_97E9_2C_7"],"revision":"CH_97E9_2C_7@R001","sha256":"fc16c3b76786541c63e4017a09629079d7b511b6db76a2f8054a82ed7542edc3","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:AS1","text":"Das zentrale Problem ist die menschliche Schwere, die aus übernommenen Werten, fremden Lasten und verhinderten Selbstbezug entsteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:AS2","text":"Die Diagnose verschiebt die Ursache der Schwere vom Leben selbst auf den Geist der Schwere und seine Wertübertragungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:AS3","text":"Die zentrale Behauptung lautet, dass Leichtigkeit durch gesunde Selbstliebe, eigene Wertung und verkörperte Übung erworben werden muss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:AS4","text":"Selbstliebe wird als erlerntes Aushalten des eigenen Selbst gegen äußere Zerstreuung bestimmt, nicht als Krankheit, Sucht oder soziale Gefälligkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:AS5","text":"Selbstentdeckung erfolgt nicht durch unmittelbare Transparenz, sondern durch Auswahl, Form, geschützte Oberfläche und die Ausbildung eines eigenen Geschmacks.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:AS6","text":"Der Übergang zur Leichtigkeit folgt einer gestuften körperlichen Praxis des Stehens, Gehens, Laufens, Kletterns und Tanzens; Fliegen ist kein Sprung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:AS7","text":"Die Bewegung endet in der Zurückweisung eines einzigen Weges: Es gibt eine gemeinsame Lernbewegung, aber keinen allgemein verfügbaren Weg zur Wahrheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:A1","text":"Das System setzt voraus, dass Erde und Leben dem Menschen als schwer erscheinen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:A2","text":"Der Geist der Schwere erzeugt oder verstärkt diese Schwere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:A3","text":"Menschen erhalten früh fremde Worte und Werte, insbesondere die Ordnung von „gut“ und „böse“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:A4","text":"Die soziale Wertübertragung hindert den Menschen daran, sich selbst zu lieben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:A5","text":"Das Tragen fremder Worte und Werte macht den Menschen schwerer, als es das Leben allein tun würde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:A6","text":"Der Mensch ist sich selbst nur schwer zugänglich, und der Geist kann die Seele falsch auslegen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:A7","text":"Gesunde Selbstliebe besteht darin, bei sich selbst auszuhalten und nicht nach außen zu zerstreuen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:A8","text":"Nächstenliebe kann als Name für Umherschweifen und als Verdeckung fehlender Selbstliebe fungieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:A9","text":"Selbstentdeckung verlangt die Bestimmung eines eigenen Guten und Bösen anstelle einer allgemeinen Wertung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:A10","text":"Eigener Geschmack muss auswählen und „Ich“, „Ja“ und „Nein“ sagen können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:A11","text":"Die tragfähige Wertung bleibt an Fleisch, Blut, Körperlichkeit und Leben gebunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:A12","text":"Das Innere ist nicht unmittelbar verfügbar, sondern verlangt eine erlernte Schale, einen schönen Schein und eine kluge Blindheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:A13","text":"Oberflächen können täuschen und zugleich verborgene Güte und Kraft schützen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:A14","text":"Leichtigkeit und Fliegen werden durch eine aufsteigende Folge körperlicher Bewegungen erworben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:A15","text":"Erkenntnis entsteht durch mehrere Wege, Fragen und Versuche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:A16","text":"Auf Fragen nach dem Weg muss der Einzelne selbst antworten lernen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:A17","text":"Es gibt keinen einzigen allgemeinen Weg zur Wahrheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0039","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:A18","text":"Die Erde kann durch die Aufhebung ihrer Schwerebeziehung als „die Leichte“ neu benannt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:NX1","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass die Schwere des Lebens eine unveränderliche Eigenschaft des Lebens selbst ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:NX2","text":"Es schließt kranke, süchtige und selbstbezogene Selbstliebe als Form der Befreiung aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:NX3","text":"Es schließt Nächstenliebe als automatisch positive Gegenkraft zur Selbstbezogenheit aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:NX4","text":"Es schließt übernommene Kategorien von „gut“ und „böse“ als ausreichende eigene Wertung aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:NX5","text":"Es schließt die Haltung aus, jedes Ding und diese Welt insgesamt als gut oder als die beste anzuerkennen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:NX6","text":"Es schließt unterschiedslose Genügsamkeit, Verdauung und Zustimmung als guten Geschmack aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:NX7","text":"Es schließt mumiensüchtige und gespensterbezogene Feindschaft gegen Fleisch und Blut aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:NX8","text":"Es schließt Speichelleckerei, parasitäres Leben und Liebe ohne eigene Liebesfähigkeit aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:NX9","text":"Es schließt die erzwungene Alternative aus, entweder böses Tier oder böser Tierbändiger zu werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:NX10","text":"Es schließt passives Warten, Bewahren und bloßes Verharren als Lebensform aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:NX11","text":"Es schließt die Annahme aus, das eigene Innere müsse ohne Form, Schale oder Vermittlung unmittelbar zugänglich sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:NX12","text":"Es schließt sowohl das unmittelbare Erfliegen des Fliegens als auch den einen vorgeschriebenen Weg aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:D1","text":"Menschliche Schwere erscheint als Effekt fremder Wertlasten und nicht als bloße Eigenschaft des Lebens.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_7:A1","CH_97E9_2C_7:A2","CH_97E9_2C_7:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:D2","text":"Selbstliebe wird zu einer Praxis der Selbstanwesenheit, sobald sie vom kranken Selbstbegehren und vom äußeren Umherschweifen unterschieden wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_7:A4","CH_97E9_2C_7:A7","CH_97E9_2C_7:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:D3","text":"Selbstentdeckung erzeugt eine eigene Wertordnung, indem sie die allgemeine Formel „allen gut, allen bös“ durch eigenes Gut und Bös ersetzt.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_7:A6","CH_97E9_2C_7:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:D4","text":"Geschmack wird zum operativen Organ der Unterscheidung, weil er Zustimmung, Ablehnung und Selbstzuordnung zugleich vollzieht.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_7:A9","CH_97E9_2C_7:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:D5","text":"Die Schale ist nicht bloß Täuschung, sondern eine erlernte Vermittlung zwischen verborgener Innerlichkeit und sichtbarer Gestalt.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_7:A6","CH_97E9_2C_7:A12","CH_97E9_2C_7:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:D6","text":"Eine lebensbejahende Wertung muss sich gegen Disembodiment und gegen unterschiedslose Zustimmung durchsetzen.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_7:A10","CH_97E9_2C_7:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:D7","text":"Fliegen wird als erworbene Fähigkeit erzeugt, indem die körperliche Bewegung stufenweise erweitert wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_7:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:D8","text":"Wahrheit wird als Ergebnis wiederholten Fragens, Versuchens und Antwortens erzeugt, nicht als Besitz eines vorgegebenen Weges.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_7:A15","CH_97E9_2C_7:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:D9","text":"Individuelle Autonomie verlangt sowohl die Entfernung fremder Lasten als auch die aktive Auswahl eigener Werte.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_7:A5","CH_97E9_2C_7:A9","CH_97E9_2C_7:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:SD1","text":"Befreiung entsteht nicht durch bloße Kritik an überlieferten Werten, sondern durch die Verbindung von Umwertung, Selbstbezug, Geschmack und körperlicher Übung.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_7:A5","CH_97E9_2C_7:A7","CH_97E9_2C_7:A9","CH_97E9_2C_7:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:SD2","text":"Das Selbst wird als selektive Praxis zwischen verborgener Innerlichkeit, geschützter Oberfläche und eigener Wertsetzung erzeugt.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_7:A6","CH_97E9_2C_7:A9","CH_97E9_2C_7:A12","CH_97E9_2C_7:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:SD3","text":"Die allgemeine moralische Landkarte zerfällt in individuelle Wertpfade, ohne dass diese Pfade dadurch beliebig werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_7:A10","CH_97E9_2C_7:A15","CH_97E9_2C_7:A16","CH_97E9_2C_7:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:SD4","text":"Leichtigkeit bezeichnet keine Flucht von der Erde, sondern eine veränderte Beziehung zu dem, was zuvor als Last erschien.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_7:A1","CH_97E9_2C_7:A5","CH_97E9_2C_7:A14","CH_97E9_2C_7:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:SD5","text":"Die Lehre liefert eine allgemeine Lernbewegung, verweigert aber eine allgemeine Route, auf der diese Bewegung vollzogen werden müsste.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_7:A14","CH_97E9_2C_7:A15","CH_97E9_2C_7:A16","CH_97E9_2C_7:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:DNX1","text":"Das System hängt davon ab, dass das Leben nicht aus sich selbst die Last der überlieferten Werte erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:DNX2","text":"Es setzt voraus, dass fremde Wertordnungen den Menschen nicht ohne Selbstverlust erfüllen können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:DNX3","text":"Es disqualifiziert die Möglichkeit, das eigene Selbst durch soziale Zerstreuung, Anerkennung oder Nächstenbezug zu gewinnen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:DNX4","text":"Es schließt eine unmittelbare Befreiung durch geistige Einsicht oder transzendenten Sprung aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:DNX5","text":"Es schließt ein vollständig transparentes Selbst aus, das ohne Form, Oberfläche und Schutz erkannt werden könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:DNX6","text":"Es schließt eine Wahrheit aus, die als einheitlicher, bereits vorhandener Weg außerhalb des Versuchs zugänglich wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:DNX7","text":"Es schließt die Gleichsetzung von Bejahung mit unterschiedsloser Aufnahmefähigkeit aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:DNX8","text":"Es schließt einen neutralen Standpunkt aus, der alle Werte ohne Geschmack, Körper oder Entscheidung bewahren könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:SNX1","text":"Die tiefste ausgeschlossene Möglichkeit ist eine einheitliche moralische Autorität, die dem Einzelnen verbindliche Werte und einen verbindlichen Weg vorgibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein vom Körper, von Übungen und von Wertentscheidungen unabhängiges Subjekt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Befreiung, die die Erde, die Schwere und die Bedingungen ihrer Überwindung hinter sich lässt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein endgültiger Wahrheitsort, an dem das Fragen, Versuchen und Antworten beendet wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:SNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein gemeinsamer Transformationsweg, der die Differenz der einzelnen Geschmäcker und Lebensformen aufheben könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:SNX6","text":"Die verborgene Abwesenheit des Systems ist eine allgemein garantierte Begründung dafür, warum eine bestimmte Wertung für alle gelten müsste.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:FGS1","text":"Übernommene Wertworte plus fremde Lasten erzeugen den Geist der Schwere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:FGS2","text":"Der Geist der Schwere erzeugt Selbstentfremdung, äußere Zerstreuung und die Erfahrung, dass Leben und Erde schwer seien.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:FGS3","text":"Die Diagnose wird umgekehrt: Nicht das Leben als solches, sondern das Fremde im Getragenen bildet die operative Last.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:FGS4","text":"Selbstanwesenheit, eigene Wertung und selektiver Geschmack erzeugen eine belastbare Beziehung zum eigenen Selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:FGS5","text":"Verborgene Innerlichkeit wird durch Schale, Schein und begrenzte Blindheit vermittelt, statt durch unmittelbare Transparenz freigelegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:FGS6","text":"Körperliche Übung und wiederholtes Versuchen transformieren schwere Selbstbewegung in erworbene Leichtigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:FGS7","text":"Mehrere Wege und selbst erteilte Antworten verhindern die Verfestigung eines universalen Pfades.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:FGS8","text":"Die gewonnene Leichtigkeit benennt die Erde neu und macht Fliegen zur Folge einer erlernten Transformation, nicht zu deren Voraussetzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:AF1","text":"Übernommene Werte und fremde Lasten → Geist der Schwere → Selbstentfremdung und Umherschweifen → gesunde Selbstliebe und eigenes Gut und Bös → selektiver, verkörperter Geschmack → gestufte Bewegung und Versuch → erworbene Leichtigkeit → keine allgemeine Route zur Wahrheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:ME1","text":"Schwere wird von einer Eigenschaft des Lebens zu einem Effekt fremder Wert- und Lastübertragung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:ME2","text":"Selbstliebe wird von einem Verdacht auf Egoismus zu einer Technik des Selbsthaltens umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:ME3","text":"Nächstenliebe wird als mögliche Form äußerer Zerstreuung und als Deckname für fehlenden Selbstbezug sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:ME4","text":"Die moralische Zweiteilung von allgemeinem Gut und Böse wird durch individuelle Wertsetzung und selektives Ja und Nein ersetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:ME5","text":"Oberfläche wird nicht mehr ausschließlich als Täuschung, sondern als notwendige Form der Vermittlung und des Schutzes kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:ME6","text":"Fliegen wird vom Wunder oder Sprung zur Folge einer körperlichen Lernsequenz umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:ME7","text":"Der Weg zur Wahrheit wird von einer singulären Route in ein Feld individueller Versuche und Antworten umgezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:ME8","text":"Erde und Leichtigkeit werden nicht mehr als Gegensätze, sondern als zwei Weisen derselben transformierten Beziehung kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der unmittelbare Gegensatz lautet schwerer Mensch gegen möglichen fliegenden, leichten Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Schwere entsteht durch soziale Wertübertragung, fremde Lasten, verhinderte Selbstliebe und fehlende eigene Unterscheidung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text ersetzt Anpassung, universale Zustimmung und passives Warten durch Geschmack, Selbstprüfung, Versuch und eigene Antwort.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Das Subjekt wird als werdende, verkörperte Praxis bestimmt; Leichtigkeit entsteht zeitlich durch Übung und verändert nachträglich die Bedeutung der Erde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Hauptbewegung von fremder Last über Selbstentdeckung und Wertung bis zur erlernten Leichtigkeit zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, nach welchem positiven Kriterium zwischen gesunder und kranker Selbstliebe entschieden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:MRT3","text":"Ebenfalls unterbestimmt bleibt, wie individuelles Gut und Böse gegenüber gemeinsamer Normativität begründet werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:MRT4","text":"Die Stellung der Schale bleibt spannungsvoll, weil sie zugleich schützt, vermittelt und täuscht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:MRT5","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Fliegen als erworbene Umwertung der Schwere und nicht als deren Abschaffung verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:MRT6","text":"Ihre stärkste Verbindung liegt in der Kopplung von Wertkritik, Selbstbezug und körperlicher Schulung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:MRT7","text":"Ihre schwächste Stelle liegt im nicht vollständig aufgelösten Verhältnis zwischen allgemeiner Lehre des Lernens und der Behauptung, dass es keinen allgemeinen Weg gibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0035","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0036","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0039","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, wenn sie eine gemeinsame Transformationssequenz von einem gemeinsamen Weg zur Wahrheit unterscheidet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T190655537171Z_af7e60cc","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"2.","source_sha256":"fc16c3b76786541c63e4017a09629079d7b511b6db76a2f8054a82ed7542edc3","sha256":"ad8d09cada3985afeaf472d9a78d44bf063a37e08bac7e4a01a3ac473bed3dfe","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:06:55.538751+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumentative Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:AS1","text":"The central problem is human heaviness, which arises from adopted values, alien burdens, and obstructed self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:AS2","text":"The diagnosis shifts the cause of heaviness from life itself to the spirit of heaviness and its transfers of value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:AS3","text":"The central claim is that lightness must be acquired through healthy self-love, one's own valuation, and embodied practice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:AS4","text":"Self-love is defined as a learned endurance of one's own self against external dispersal, not as illness, addiction, or social ingratiation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:AS5","text":"Self-discovery occurs not through immediate transparency, but through selection, form, protected surface, and the cultivation of one's own taste.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:AS6","text":"The transition to lightness follows a graduated bodily practice of standing, walking, running, climbing, and dancing; flying is not a leap.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:AS7","text":"The movement ends in the rejection of a single way: there is a shared movement of learning, but no universally available way to truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:A1","text":"The system presupposes that earth and life appear heavy to the human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:A2","text":"The spirit of heaviness produces or intensifies this heaviness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:A3","text":"Human beings receive alien words and values early on, especially the order of “good” and “evil.”","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:A4","text":"The social transfer of values prevents the human being from loving themselves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:A5","text":"Carrying alien words and values makes the human being heavier than life alone would.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:A6","text":"The human being is accessible to themselves only with difficulty, and the spirit can misinterpret the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:A7","text":"Healthy self-love consists in enduring with oneself and not dispersing oneself outwardly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:A8","text":"Love of one's neighbor can function as a name for wandering about and as a concealment of lacking self-love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:A9","text":"Self-discovery requires the determination of one's own good and evil in place of a general valuation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:A10","text":"One's own taste must be able to select and say “I,” “Yes,” and “No.”","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:A11","text":"Viable valuation remains bound to flesh, blood, corporeality, and life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:A12","text":"The interior is not immediately available, but requires a learned shell, a beautiful appearance, and a clever blindness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:A13","text":"Surfaces can deceive and at the same time protect hidden goodness and strength.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:A14","text":"Lightness and flying are acquired through an ascending sequence of bodily movements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:A15","text":"Knowledge arises through several paths, questions, and attempts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:A16","text":"In response to questions about the way, the individual must learn to answer for themselves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:A17","text":"There is no single general way to truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0039","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:A18","text":"Earth can be renamed as “the light one” through the abolition of its relation to heaviness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:NX1","text":"The system excludes the possibility that the heaviness of life is an unchangeable property of life itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:NX2","text":"It excludes sick, addictive, and self-regarding self-love as a form of liberation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:NX3","text":"It excludes love of one's neighbor as an automatically positive counterforce to self-regard.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:NX4","text":"It excludes adopted categories of “good” and “evil” as sufficient self-valuation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:NX5","text":"It excludes the attitude of recognizing every thing and this world as a whole as good or as the best.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:NX6","text":"It excludes indiscriminate contentment, digestion, and assent as good taste.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:NX7","text":"It excludes mummy-addicted and ghost-oriented hostility toward flesh and blood.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:NX8","text":"It excludes sycophancy, parasitic life, and love without one's own capacity for love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:NX9","text":"It excludes the forced alternative of becoming either an evil beast or an evil beast-tamer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:NX10","text":"It excludes passive waiting, preserving, and mere remaining as forms of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:NX11","text":"It excludes the assumption that one's own interior must be immediately accessible without form, shell, or mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:NX12","text":"It excludes both the immediate flying into flying and the one prescribed way.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:D1","text":"Human heaviness appears as an effect of alien burdens of value and not as a mere property of life.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_7:A1","CH_97E9_2C_7:A2","CH_97E9_2C_7:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:D2","text":"Self-love becomes a practice of self-presence once it is distinguished from sick self-desire and external wandering about.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_7:A4","CH_97E9_2C_7:A7","CH_97E9_2C_7:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:D3","text":"Self-discovery produces an order of value of its own by replacing the general formula “good to all, evil to all” with one's own good and evil.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_7:A6","CH_97E9_2C_7:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:D4","text":"Taste becomes the operative organ of distinction because it simultaneously performs assent, rejection, and self-attribution.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_7:A9","CH_97E9_2C_7:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:D5","text":"The shell is not mere deception, but a learned mediation between hidden inwardness and visible form.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_7:A6","CH_97E9_2C_7:A12","CH_97E9_2C_7:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:D6","text":"A life-affirming valuation must prevail against disembodiment and against indiscriminate assent.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_7:A10","CH_97E9_2C_7:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:D7","text":"Flying is produced as an acquired capacity by gradually expanding bodily movement.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_7:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:D8","text":"Truth is produced as the result of repeated questioning, attempting, and answering, not as possession of a pre-given way.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_7:A15","CH_97E9_2C_7:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:D9","text":"Individual autonomy requires both the removal of alien burdens and the active selection of one's own values.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_7:A5","CH_97E9_2C_7:A9","CH_97E9_2C_7:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:SD1","text":"Liberation arises not through mere critique of inherited values, but through the conjunction of revaluation, self-relation, taste, and bodily practice.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_7:A5","CH_97E9_2C_7:A7","CH_97E9_2C_7:A9","CH_97E9_2C_7:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:SD2","text":"The self is produced as a selective practice between hidden inwardness, protected surface, and one's own positing of values.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_7:A6","CH_97E9_2C_7:A9","CH_97E9_2C_7:A12","CH_97E9_2C_7:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:SD3","text":"The general moral map disintegrates into individual paths of value without these paths thereby becoming arbitrary.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_7:A10","CH_97E9_2C_7:A15","CH_97E9_2C_7:A16","CH_97E9_2C_7:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:SD4","text":"Lightness designates not a flight from earth, but an altered relation to what previously appeared as a burden.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_7:A1","CH_97E9_2C_7:A5","CH_97E9_2C_7:A14","CH_97E9_2C_7:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:SD5","text":"The teaching provides a general movement of learning, but refuses a general route along which this movement would have to be accomplished.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_7:A14","CH_97E9_2C_7:A15","CH_97E9_2C_7:A16","CH_97E9_2C_7:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:DNX1","text":"The system depends on life not producing from itself the burden of inherited values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:DNX2","text":"It presupposes that alien orders of value cannot fulfill the human being without loss of self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:DNX3","text":"It disqualifies the possibility of gaining one's own self through social dispersal, recognition, or relation to one's neighbor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:DNX4","text":"It excludes immediate liberation through spiritual insight or a transcendent leap.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:DNX5","text":"It excludes a fully transparent self that could be known without form, surface, and protection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:DNX6","text":"It excludes a truth that would be accessible as a unified, already existing way outside of attempting.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:DNX7","text":"It excludes the equation of affirmation with indiscriminate receptivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:DNX8","text":"It excludes a neutral standpoint that could preserve all values without taste, body, or decision.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:SNX1","text":"The deepest excluded possibility is a unified moral authority that prescribes binding values and a binding way to the individual.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:SNX2","text":"Excluded is a subject independent of the body, of exercises, and of decisions of value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:SNX3","text":"Excluded is a liberation that leaves behind earth, heaviness, and the conditions of their overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:SNX4","text":"Excluded is a final site of truth at which questioning, attempting, and answering would be ended.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:SNX5","text":"Excluded is a shared path of transformation that could abolish the difference of individual tastes and forms of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:SNX6","text":"The system's hidden absence is a universally guaranteed justification for why a particular valuation would have to apply to all.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:FGS1","text":"Adopted words of value plus alien burdens produce the spirit of heaviness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:FGS2","text":"The spirit of heaviness produces self-alienation, external dispersal, and the experience that life and earth are heavy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:FGS3","text":"The diagnosis is reversed: not life as such, but the alien within what is carried constitutes the operative burden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:FGS4","text":"Self-presence, one's own valuation, and selective taste produce a resilient relation to one's own self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:FGS5","text":"Hidden inwardness is mediated through shell, appearance, and limited blindness rather than uncovered through immediate transparency.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:FGS6","text":"Bodily practice and repeated attempting transform heavy self-movement into acquired lightness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:FGS7","text":"Several paths and self-given answers prevent the consolidation of a universal path.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:FGS8","text":"The lightness gained renames earth and makes flying the consequence of a learned transformation, not its precondition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:AF1","text":"Adopted values and alien burdens → spirit of heaviness → self-alienation and wandering about → healthy self-love and one's own good and evil → selective, embodied taste → graduated movement and attempt → acquired lightness → no general route to truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:ME1","text":"Heaviness is remapped from a property of life to an effect of alien transfers of value and burden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:ME2","text":"Self-love is reclassified from a suspicion of egoism into a technique of self-sustaining.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:ME3","text":"Love of one's neighbor becomes visible as a possible form of external dispersal and as a cover name for lacking self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:ME4","text":"The moral division into general good and evil is replaced by individual value-positing and selective Yes and No.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:ME5","text":"Surface is mapped no longer exclusively as deception, but as a necessary form of mediation and protection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:ME6","text":"Flying is reclassified from miracle or leap into the consequence of a bodily learning sequence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:ME7","text":"The way to truth is redrawn from a singular route into a field of individual attempts and answers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:ME8","text":"Earth and lightness are mapped no longer as opposites, but as two modes of the same transformed relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:ALT1","text":"Surface — The immediate opposition is that of the heavy human being against the possible flying, light human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:ALT2","text":"Structural — Heaviness arises through social transfer of values, alien burdens, obstructed self-love, and lacking self-distinction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text replaces adaptation, universal assent, and passive waiting with taste, self-examination, attempt, and one's own answer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The subject is defined as a becoming, embodied practice; lightness arises temporally through practice and subsequently alters the meaning of earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the main movement from alien burden through self-discovery and valuation to learned lightness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is the positive criterion according to which a decision is made between healthy and sick self-love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:MRT3","text":"Also underdetermined is how individual good and evil are justified in relation to shared normativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:MRT4","text":"The status of the shell remains tension-filled because it simultaneously protects, mediates, and deceives.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:MRT5","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as flying is understood as an acquired revaluation of heaviness and not as its abolition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:MRT6","text":"Its strongest connection lies in the coupling of critique of values, self-relation, and bodily training.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:MRT7","text":"Its weakest point lies in the not fully resolved relation between a general teaching of learning and the claim that there is no general way.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0035","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0036","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0039","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_7:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement when it distinguishes a shared sequence of transformation from a shared way to truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_7:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_2C_7@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_2C_7:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On the Spirit of Gravity","source_section_label":"2.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"On the Spirit of Gravity · 2","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On the Spirit of Gravity","2."],"original_title":"2."}],"source_title_context":"Vom Geist der Schwere","source_section_label":"2.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"On the Spirit of Gravity · 2","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On the Spirit of Gravity","2."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 81","title":"On the Spirit of Gravity · 2","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Vom Geist der Schwere · 2"},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8","layer":"CH","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 1","order":82,"parents":["RAW_97E9_1C_8"],"revision":"CH_97E9_1C_8@R001","sha256":"fe85be9c94c776f3e678ba53c16d99cfc125d036c64da48d72b47d5bef0f81ee","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:AS1","text":"Der Sprecher befindet sich zwischen zerbrochenen Überlieferungen und noch unvollständiger Hervorbringung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:AS2","text":"Die erwartete Stunde wird als Stunde des Niederganges und des Unterganges bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:AS3","text":"Der Niedergang erhält seine Funktion durch die erneute Hinwendung zu den Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:AS4","text":"Die Entscheidung zum Übergang bleibt an noch ausstehende Zeichen gebunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:AS5","text":"Während des Wartens ersetzt Selbstrede die ausbleibende Mitteilung durch Andere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:A1","text":"Der Sprecher befindet sich in einer Warteposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:A2","text":"Die ihn umgebenden Tafeln sind teils zerbrochen, teils unvollständig beschrieben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:A3","text":"Die erwartete Stunde ist die Stunde des eigenen Niederganges und Unterganges.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:A4","text":"Der Niedergang schließt eine weitere Hinwendung zu den Menschen ein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:A5","text":"Der Eintritt dieser Stunde wird durch Zeichen angekündigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:A6","text":"Das erwartete Zeichen besteht im lachenden Löwen mit dem Taubenschwarme.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:A7","text":"Niemand übermittelt dem Sprecher etwas Neues.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:A8","text":"Der Sprecher erzeugt im Warten Selbstrede, indem er sich selbst erzählt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:NX1","text":"Die gegenwärtige Zeit ist nicht die erwartete Stunde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:NX2","text":"Die vorhandenen Tafeln bilden keine intakte und abgeschlossene Ordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:NX3","text":"Der Niedergang ist nicht bloß ein Ende ohne erneuten Gang zu den Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:NX4","text":"Die Zeichen sind noch nicht eingetroffen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:NX5","text":"Die Selbstrede ist keine neue Mitteilung durch Andere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:D1","text":"Die Gegenwart ist als Zwischenzustand zwischen vergangener Beschädigung und zukünftiger Vollendung strukturiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_8:A1","CH_97E9_1C_8:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:D2","text":"Der erwartete Untergang fungiert zugleich als Voraussetzung einer erneuten öffentlichen Erscheinung.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_8:A3","CH_97E9_1C_8:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:D3","text":"Der Übergang zur erwarteten Stunde kann ohne die angekündigte Zeichengestalt nicht vollzogen werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_8:A5","CH_97E9_1C_8:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:D4","text":"Das Ausbleiben fremder Neuigkeit verschiebt die Hervorbringung von Rede in die Selbstbeziehung des Sprechers.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_8:A7","CH_97E9_1C_8:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:SD1","text":"Das System macht den eigenen Untergang nicht zum Abschluss, sondern zur Schwelle einer erneuten Vermittlung an die Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:SD2","text":"Zeit wird nicht chronologisch, sondern zeichenabhängig organisiert: Die Zukunft beginnt erst mit dem Eintreffen ihrer Gestalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:SD3","text":"Wo äußere Überlieferung ausbleibt und vorhandene Überlieferung beschädigt ist, wird das Selbst zum vorläufigen Medium der Fortsetzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:DNX1","text":"Eine abgeschlossene Lehre, die den Sprecher aus der Geschichte der Menschen entlassen hätte, ist ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:DNX2","text":"Eine Gegenwart, die sich selbst durch bereits vorhandene Zeichen legitimiert, ist ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:DNX3","text":"Eine kommunikative Ordnung, in der das Neue von außen übermittelt wird, ist ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:SNX1","text":"Der Text organisiert sich um die Abwesenheit des entscheidenden Zeichens, ohne dessen Ankunft die erwartete Transformation nicht eintreten kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen bleibt die Möglichkeit eines endgültigen Schweigens: Der Untergang muss in eine weitere Rede zu den Menschen übergehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:FGS1","text":"Beschädigte Vergangenheit plus unvollständige Zukunft → Warteposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:FGS2","text":"Warteposition plus erwartete Zeichengestalt → Bestimmung einer noch nicht eingetretenen Stunde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:FGS3","text":"Bestimmte Stunde plus Selbstuntergang → erneute Hinwendung zu den Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:FGS4","text":"Ausbleiben äußerer Neuigkeit → Selbstrede als provisorische Fortsetzung der Hervorbringung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:AF1","text":"Zerbrochene und unvollständige Tafeln → Warten → Neubestimmung des Untergangs als erneuter Gang zu den Menschen → ausstehendes Zeichen → Selbstrede im Intervall.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:ME1","text":"Untergang wird von einem Endpunkt in eine Übergangsfunktion umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:ME2","text":"Unvollständige Tafeln werden nicht als bloßer Mangel, sondern als zeitliche Spannung zwischen Überlieferung und Kommendem klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:ME3","text":"Schweigen und fehlende Neuigkeit werden in eine produktive Selbstbeziehung des Sprechers überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:ALT1","text":"Surface — Ein Sprecher wartet auf seine Stunde und spricht währenddessen zu sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:ALT2","text":"Structural — Beschädigte und unvollständige Zeichenordnungen erzeugen einen Übergangszustand, der durch ein zukünftiges Zeichen beendet werden soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der bevorstehende Untergang wird als Bedingung einer erneuten Ansprache der Menschen eingesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Die Identität des Sprechers konstituiert sich als zeitlich aufgeschobene Selbstvermittlung zwischen Ende und Wiederkehr.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um Warteposition, Zeichenabhängigkeit, Untergang und Selbstrede zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, was der lachende Löwe und der Taubenschwarm jenseits ihrer Funktion als Zeichen bedeuten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, weil der Untergang zugleich als Ende und als Übergang definiert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung besteht zwischen ausstehendem Zeichen und aufgeschobener Stunde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:MRT5","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen dem Anspruch auf erneute Rede zu den Menschen und der gegenwärtigen Abwesenheit fremder Mitteilung bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die Bewegung von beschädigter Überlieferung über zeichenabhängiges Warten zur selbst erzeugten Rede.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T185448975394Z_41e5fe4c","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"1.","source_sha256":"fe85be9c94c776f3e678ba53c16d99cfc125d036c64da48d72b47d5bef0f81ee","sha256":"0350d5574b3a060032ec066b1565ec32ad5c2e4ecc275c8452eb6764bd94cf5e","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T18:54:48.977613+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:AS1","text":"The speaker stands between broken traditions and production that is still incomplete.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:AS2","text":"The expected hour is determined as the hour of decline and going under.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:AS3","text":"Decline receives its function through the renewed turning toward human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:AS4","text":"The decision for transition remains bound to signs still outstanding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:AS5","text":"During waiting, self-speech replaces the absent communication by others.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:A1","text":"The speaker is in a position of waiting.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:A2","text":"The tablets surrounding him are in part broken, in part incompletely inscribed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:A3","text":"The expected hour is the hour of his own decline and going under.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:A4","text":"Decline includes a further turning toward human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:A5","text":"The arrival of this hour is announced by signs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:A6","text":"The expected sign consists in the laughing lion with the flock of doves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:A7","text":"No one conveys anything new to the speaker.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:A8","text":"While waiting, the speaker produces self-speech by narrating himself to himself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:NX1","text":"The present time is not the expected hour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:NX2","text":"The existing tablets do not form an intact and completed order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:NX3","text":"Decline is not merely an end without a renewed going to human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:NX4","text":"The signs have not yet arrived.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:NX5","text":"Self-speech is not a new communication by others.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:D1","text":"The present is structured as an intermediate state between past damage and future completion.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_8:A1","CH_97E9_1C_8:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:D2","text":"The expected going under functions simultaneously as the precondition for a renewed public appearance.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_8:A3","CH_97E9_1C_8:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:D3","text":"The transition to the expected hour cannot be accomplished without the announced sign-form.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_8:A5","CH_97E9_1C_8:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:D4","text":"The absence of news from others shifts the production of speech into the speaker's relation to himself.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_8:A7","CH_97E9_1C_8:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:SD1","text":"The system makes its own going under not a conclusion, but the threshold of a renewed mediation to human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:SD2","text":"Time is organized not chronologically but dependently on signs: the future begins only with the arrival of its form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:SD3","text":"Where external tradition is absent and existing tradition is damaged, the self becomes the provisional medium of continuation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:DNX1","text":"A completed teaching that would have released the speaker from the history of human beings is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:DNX2","text":"A present that legitimates itself through signs already present is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:DNX3","text":"A communicative order in which the new is conveyed from outside is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:SNX1","text":"The text organizes itself around the absence of the decisive sign, without whose arrival the expected transformation cannot occur.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:SNX2","text":"The possibility of definitive silence remains excluded: going under must pass into further speech to human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:FGS1","text":"Damaged past plus incomplete future → position of waiting.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:FGS2","text":"Position of waiting plus expected sign-form → determination of an hour not yet arrived.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:FGS3","text":"Determinate hour plus self-going-under → renewed turning toward human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:FGS4","text":"Absence of external news → self-speech as provisional continuation of production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:AF1","text":"Broken and incomplete tablets → waiting → redefinition of going under as renewed going to human beings → outstanding sign → self-speech in the interval.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:ME1","text":"Going under is remapped from an endpoint into a transitional function.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:ME2","text":"Incomplete tablets are classified not as mere deficiency, but as temporal tension between tradition and what is to come.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:ME3","text":"Silence and the absence of news are transferred into a productive self-relation of the speaker.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:ALT1","text":"Surface — A speaker waits for his hour and meanwhile speaks to himself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:ALT2","text":"Structural — Damaged and incomplete orders of signs produce a transitional state that is to be ended by a future sign.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The impending going under is deployed as the condition of a renewed address to human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The speaker's identity constitutes itself as temporally deferred self-mediation between end and return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the position of waiting, dependence on signs, going under, and self-speech.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is what the laughing lion and the flock of doves mean beyond their function as signs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent because going under is defined simultaneously as end and as transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:MRT4","text":"The strongest connection exists between the outstanding sign and the deferred hour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:MRT5","text":"A tension remains between the claim to renewed speech to human beings and the present absence of communication from others.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_8:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the movement from damaged tradition through sign-dependent waiting to self-produced speech.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_1C_8@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_1C_8:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On Old and New Tablets","source_section_label":"1.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 1","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","1."],"original_title":"1."}],"source_title_context":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln","source_section_label":"1.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 1","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","1."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 82","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 1","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln · 1"},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8","layer":"CH","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 2","order":83,"parents":["RAW_97E9_2C_8"],"revision":"CH_97E9_2C_8@R001","sha256":"213f66303da456e604ac9b98b18d27b984b9493e35bb0bc2b64349a6be43a744","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:AS1","text":"Der Text setzt den überlieferten Glauben an ein bereits bekanntes Gut und Böse als erstarrte Voraussetzung an.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:AS2","text":"Er bestimmt diese Voraussetzung als alten Dünkel, der durch Lehre, Heiligkeit, Dichtung und Erlösungsanspruch stabilisiert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:AS3","text":"Er verlagert die Erzeugung von Gut und Böse auf den Schaffenden, der Ziel, Sinn und Zukunft des Menschen und der Erde schafft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:AS4","text":"Die Zerstörung der alten Wertinstanzen eröffnet eine zukünftige, schöpferische Ordnung des Werdens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:AS5","text":"Diese Ordnung erscheint als göttlicher Tanz widersprüchlicher Kräfte, in dem Selbstwiderspruch und Wiederzugehörigkeit produktiv werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:AS6","text":"Freiheit wird als Gestalt der Notwendigkeit neu bestimmt, während der Geist der Schwere als Gegenmacht und zugleich notwendige Voraussetzung des Überschreitens erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:A1","text":"Die Menschen halten Gut und Böse irrtümlich für längst erkannt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:A2","text":"Überlieferte moralische Rede ist zu einer müden, einschläfernden Gewohnheit erstarrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:A3","text":"Gut und Böse sind nicht vorgegeben, sondern werden geschaffen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:A4","text":"Der Schaffende erzeugt menschliches Ziel, irdischen Sinn und Zukunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:A5","text":"Überlieferte Tugendmeister, Heilige, Dichter, Erlöser und warnende Weisen verkörpern die zu stürzenden alten Wertinstanzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:A6","text":"Die Kritik an diesen Wertinstanzen vollzieht sich als Lachen, Zorn und Entwertung ihrer vermeintlichen Größe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:A7","text":"Die schöpferische Zukunft ist dem gegenwärtigen Traum- und Vorstellungsvermögen äußerlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:A8","text":"Werden ist ein Spiel vieler Götter, die sich widersprechen, wiederhören und wiederzugehören suchen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:A9","text":"Die Zeit erscheint als Hohn auf isolierte Augenblicke.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:A10","text":"Notwendigkeit kann selbst als Freiheit erscheinen und mit dem Stachel der Freiheit spielen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:A11","text":"Der Geist der Schwere erzeugt Zwang, Satzung, Not, Folge, Zweck, Wille, Gut und Böse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:A12","text":"Das Leichte und Überschreitende setzt die Existenz des Schweren und zu Überschreitenden voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:NX1","text":"Gut und Böse sind nicht durch die überlieferte Moral bereits gewusst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:NX2","text":"Die alten Lehrstühle besitzen keine endgültige Autorität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:NX3","text":"Tugendmeister, Heilige, Dichter und Welterlöser sind keine unantastbaren Wertinstanzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:NX4","text":"Warnung, Buße und düstere Weisheit begründen keine letzte Orientierung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:NX5","text":"Die vergangene Größe ist nicht einfach bewahrenswert, sondern verfallen und mürbe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:NX6","text":"Das Bisherige liefert weder das endgültige Gute noch das endgültige Böse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:NX7","text":"Freiheit ist nicht notwendig der Gegensatz zur Notwendigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:NX8","text":"Das Leichte ist nicht ohne das Schwere möglich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:D1","text":"Wenn Gut und Böse geschaffen werden, dann ist moralische Erkenntnis eine schöpferische Leistung und keine bloße Entdeckung.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_8:A1","CH_97E9_2C_8:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:D2","text":"Wenn der Schaffende Ziel, Sinn und Zukunft erzeugt, dann hängt Wertsetzung an einer aktiven Gestaltung der Welt.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_8:A3","CH_97E9_2C_8:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:D3","text":"Wenn die alten Wertinstanzen den alten Dünkel tragen, dann muss ihre Autorität durch Umsturz und Lachen entkräftet werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_8:A1","CH_97E9_2C_8:A5","CH_97E9_2C_8:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:D4","text":"Wenn die Zukunft außerhalb des bisher Vorstellbaren liegt, dann kann sie nur in Gleichnissen, dichterischer Rede und unvollständiger Artikulation erscheinen.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_8:A6","CH_97E9_2C_8:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:D5","text":"Wenn Werden als Selbstwiderspruch vieler Götter erscheint, dann ist Widerspruch kein Mangel an Ordnung, sondern eine Form des Zusammenhangs.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_8:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:D6","text":"Wenn Notwendigkeit mit Freiheit spielt, dann wird Freiheit nicht als Entbindung von Bedingungen, sondern als bewegliche Form ihrer Bejahung verstanden.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_8:A9","CH_97E9_2C_8:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:D7","text":"Wenn der Geist der Schwere Gut und Böse hervorbringt, dann gehören die überlieferten Moralbegriffe zur zu überwindenden Last.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_8:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:D8","text":"Wenn Überschreitung das Schwere voraussetzt, dann ist die Gegenmacht des Geistes der Schwere zugleich Bedingung des Tanzes über ihn hinweg.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_8:A11","CH_97E9_2C_8:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:SD1","text":"Das System ersetzt moralische Erkenntnis durch eine Genealogie der Wertschöpfung: Werte gelten nur als Resultate einer schöpferischen Setzung.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_8:A1","CH_97E9_2C_8:A3","CH_97E9_2C_8:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:SD2","text":"Die Zerstörung der alten Werte ist keine bloße Negation, sondern die vorbereitende Operation für eine noch nicht verfügbare Zukunft.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_8:A5","CH_97E9_2C_8:A6","CH_97E9_2C_8:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:SD3","text":"Das Wirkliche wird als pluraler, widersprüchlicher und selbstbewegter Prozess statt als stabile moralische Ordnung konstituiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_8:A8","CH_97E9_2C_8:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:SD4","text":"Die höchste Freiheit entsteht nicht durch Abschaffung der Notwendigkeit, sondern durch ihre Umdeutung als spielende, tanzende Bewegungsform.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_8:A10","CH_97E9_2C_8:A11","CH_97E9_2C_8:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:SD5","text":"Das System bleibt auf die Last angewiesen, die es überwinden will: Der Geist der Schwere ist zugleich Gegner, Material und Bedingung der Leichtigkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_8:A11","CH_97E9_2C_8:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:DNX1","text":"Es darf keine unabhängig bestehende, vor aller Schöpfung gültige moralische Ordnung geben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:DNX2","text":"Es darf keine Autorität geben, die Gut und Böse endgültig festlegt, ohne selbst schöpferisch zu sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:DNX3","text":"Es darf keine lineare Zeitordnung geben, in der vergangene Größe und gegenwärtige Augenblicke den Sinn des Werdens abschließen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:DNX4","text":"Es darf keine Freiheit geben, die nur als Abwesenheit von Notwendigkeit verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:DNX5","text":"Es darf keine Überwindung geben, die ohne das fortbestehende Gegenüber des Schweren auskommt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Welt, deren Sinn bereits feststeht und nur noch erkannt oder befolgt werden muss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die endgültige Versöhnung von Werden, Freiheit, Notwendigkeit und Wert; ihre Spannung bleibt die Bewegungsform des Systems.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein letzter Standpunkt außerhalb des Werdens, von dem aus Gut, Böse und Zukunft abschließend beurteilt werden könnten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die reine Leichtigkeit: Das Überschreitende kann seine eigene Schwere nicht vollständig entfernen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:FGS1","text":"Vorgegebene Moralgewissheit → Diagnose als alter Dünkel und Schläfrigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:FGS2","text":"Diagnose der Überlieferung → Entthronung ihrer Lehr- und Erlösungsinstanzen durch Lachen, Zorn und Entwertung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:FGS3","text":"Entthronung der alten Werte → Verlagerung der Wertquelle auf den Schaffenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:FGS4","text":"Schöpferische Wertquelle → Erzeugung von Ziel, Sinn und Zukunft statt Entdeckung vorgegebener Normen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:FGS5","text":"Zukunftsüberschuss → Darstellung als wilde Weisheit, dichterisches Gleichnis und noch ungesehene Möglichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:FGS6","text":"Zukunftsordnung → Ontologie des Werdens als pluraler Selbstwiderspruch und Wiederzugehörigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:FGS7","text":"Ontologie des Werdens → Rekodierung von Freiheit als spielende Notwendigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:FGS8","text":"Rekodierte Freiheit → Identifikation des Geistes der Schwere als zu überwindende, aber notwendige Gegenstruktur.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:FGS9","text":"Gegenstruktur der Schwere → Bedingung für Tanz, Leichtigkeit und Überschreitung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:AF1","text":"Moralische Selbstgewissheit → Aufdeckung ihres Charakters als überlieferter Dünkel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:AF2","text":"Alter Dünkel → Umsturz der autoritativen Lehr- und Erlösungsfiguren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:AF3","text":"Umsturz → Freisetzung des Schaffenden als Quelle von Ziel, Sinn und Zukunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:AF4","text":"Freisetzung der Schöpfung → Zukunft jenseits des bisher Vorstellbaren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:AF5","text":"Zukunft → Vielheit, Selbstwiderspruch und göttlicher Tanz des Werdens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:AF6","text":"Werden → Einheit von Notwendigkeit und Freiheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:AF7","text":"Einheit von Notwendigkeit und Freiheit → Überschreitung des Geistes der Schwere unter seiner fortbestehenden Voraussetzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:ME1","text":"Moralische Werte werden von zeitlosen Wahrheiten zu erzeugten Setzungen umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:ME2","text":"Traditionelle Autoritäten werden von Quellen der Orientierung zu historischen Lasten und Gegenständen des Gelächters umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:ME3","text":"Widerspruch wird von einem Fehler der Ordnung zu einer produktiven Bewegungsform des Werdens umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:ME4","text":"Zukunft wird von einer erwartbaren Fortsetzung zu einem noch nicht träumbaren Schöpfungsraum umgezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:ME5","text":"Freiheit und Notwendigkeit werden nicht länger als einfache Gegensätze, sondern als ineinander verschränkte Kräfte sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:ME6","text":"Schwere wird zugleich als Herrschaftsform, moralische Last und notwendiger Widerstand der Leichtigkeit klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Text weist die vermeintliche Kenntnis von Gut und Böse zurück und fordert das Lachen über überlieferte Größen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:ALT2","text":"Structural — Moralische Begriffe werden als Erzeugnisse einer Instanz bestimmt, die menschliches Ziel, irdischen Sinn und Zukunft setzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Kritik wird als Umsturz, Entwertung und Freisetzung einer schöpferischen Zukunft organisiert, nicht als Reform der alten Lehre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Realität erscheint als vielfaches, widersprüchliches Werden, in dem Zeit, Freiheit und Notwendigkeit nicht außerhalb, sondern innerhalb des Prozesses bestimmt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von moralischer Selbstgewissheit zu schöpferischer Wertsetzung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:MRT2","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die doppelte Funktion des Geistes der Schwere als Gegner und Voraussetzung der Überschreitung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wer oder was der Schaffende ontologisch ist und wie seine Setzung institutionell oder praktisch wirksam wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:MRT4","text":"Intern kohärent ist die Bewegung, sofern Wert, Sinn und Zukunft als Erzeugnisse und nicht als Vorgegebenheiten behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:MRT5","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen dem singulären Schaffenden und der Vielheit der tanzenden Götter bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung liegt in der Gleichsetzung von Freiheit und Notwendigkeit, die behauptet, aber nicht begrifflich vollständig vermittelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion hängt an der rhetorisch starken, strukturell jedoch nicht vollständig ausformulierten Figur des Lachens als Übergangsoperation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:MRT8","text":"Die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung bleibt erhalten: Entlarvung der alten Moral → schöpferische Neubestimmung → kosmologische Umkehrung → paradoxe Befreiung durch die Überwindung der Schwere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T190722821884Z_ae60e391","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"2.","source_sha256":"213f66303da456e604ac9b98b18d27b984b9493e35bb0bc2b64349a6be43a744","sha256":"140ecbf16dd1b4dd98b96f0db79f551b13c417d99854e4c9bf01c3d17b5c9ff9","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:07:22.823417+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:AS1","text":"The text posits the inherited belief in an already known good and evil as a rigidified presupposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:AS2","text":"It determines this presupposition as an old conceit, stabilized by doctrine, holiness, poetry, and the claim to redemption.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:AS3","text":"It shifts the production of good and evil onto the creator, who creates the goal, meaning, and future of humankind and the earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:AS4","text":"The destruction of the old value-instances opens a future, creative order of becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:AS5","text":"This order appears as a divine dance of contradictory forces, in which self-contradiction and renewed belonging become productive.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:AS6","text":"Freedom is redefined as a form of necessity, while the spirit of gravity appears as a counterforce and at the same time as a necessary precondition of overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:A1","text":"Human beings mistakenly hold good and evil to have long since been recognized.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:A2","text":"Inherited moral discourse has rigidified into a weary, soporific habit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:A3","text":"Good and evil are not given in advance but are created.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:A4","text":"The creator produces human goal, earthly meaning, and future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:A5","text":"Inherited masters of virtue, saints, poets, redeemers, and warning sages embody the old value-instances that are to be overthrown.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:A6","text":"The critique of these value-instances is carried out as laughter, anger, and the devaluation of their supposed greatness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:A7","text":"The creative future is external to present capacities for dreaming and imagining.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:A8","text":"Becoming is a play of many gods who contradict one another, hear one another again, and seek to belong to one another again.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:A9","text":"Time appears as mockery of isolated moments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:A10","text":"Necessity can itself appear as freedom and play with the sting of freedom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:A11","text":"The spirit of gravity produces compulsion, statute, distress, consequence, purpose, will, good, and evil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:A12","text":"The light and that which overcomes presuppose the existence of the heavy and that which is to be overcome.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:NX1","text":"Good and evil are not already known through inherited morality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:NX2","text":"The old chairs of learning possess no final authority.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:NX3","text":"Masters of virtue, saints, poets, and world-redeemers are not inviolable value-instances.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:NX4","text":"Warning, penance, and gloomy wisdom establish no ultimate orientation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:NX5","text":"Past greatness is not simply worthy of preservation, but decayed and brittle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:NX6","text":"What has hitherto existed provides neither the final good nor the final evil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:NX7","text":"Freedom is not necessarily the opposite of necessity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:NX8","text":"The light is not possible without the heavy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:D1","text":"If good and evil are created, then moral knowledge is a creative achievement and not a mere discovery.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_8:A1","CH_97E9_2C_8:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:D2","text":"If the creator produces goal, meaning, and future, then value-positing depends on an active shaping of the world.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_8:A3","CH_97E9_2C_8:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:D3","text":"If the old value-instances sustain the old conceit, then their authority must be invalidated through overthrow and laughter.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_8:A1","CH_97E9_2C_8:A5","CH_97E9_2C_8:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:D4","text":"If the future lies outside what has hitherto been conceivable, then it can appear only in parables, poetic discourse, and incomplete articulation.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_8:A6","CH_97E9_2C_8:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:D5","text":"If becoming appears as the self-contradiction of many gods, then contradiction is not a lack of order but a form of connectedness.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_8:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:D6","text":"If necessity plays with freedom, then freedom is understood not as release from conditions but as a mobile form of their affirmation.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_8:A9","CH_97E9_2C_8:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:D7","text":"If the spirit of gravity brings forth good and evil, then inherited moral concepts belong to the burden that is to be overcome.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_8:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:D8","text":"If overcoming presupposes the heavy, then the counterforce of the spirit of gravity is at the same time the condition of dancing over and beyond it.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_8:A11","CH_97E9_2C_8:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:SD1","text":"The system replaces moral knowledge with a genealogy of value-creation: values are valid only as results of a creative positing.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_8:A1","CH_97E9_2C_8:A3","CH_97E9_2C_8:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:SD2","text":"The destruction of old values is not mere negation, but the preparatory operation for a future not yet available.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_8:A5","CH_97E9_2C_8:A6","CH_97E9_2C_8:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:SD3","text":"The real is constituted as a plural, contradictory, and self-moving process rather than as a stable moral order.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_8:A8","CH_97E9_2C_8:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:SD4","text":"The highest freedom arises not through the abolition of necessity, but through its reinterpretation as a playing, dancing form of movement.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_8:A10","CH_97E9_2C_8:A11","CH_97E9_2C_8:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:SD5","text":"The system remains dependent on the burden it seeks to overcome: the spirit of gravity is at once adversary, material, and condition of lightness.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_8:A11","CH_97E9_2C_8:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:DNX1","text":"There must be no independently existing moral order valid prior to all creation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:DNX2","text":"There must be no authority that definitively determines good and evil without itself being creative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:DNX3","text":"There must be no linear temporal order in which past greatness and present moments bring the meaning of becoming to a close.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:DNX4","text":"There must be no freedom understood solely as the absence of necessity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:DNX5","text":"There must be no overcoming that can do without the enduring counterpart of the heavy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a world whose meaning is already fixed and need only be recognized or followed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:SNX2","text":"Excluded is the final reconciliation of becoming, freedom, necessity, and value; their tension remains the system's form of movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:SNX3","text":"Excluded is a final standpoint outside becoming from which good, evil, and future could be conclusively judged.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:SNX4","text":"Excluded is pure lightness: that which overcomes cannot completely remove its own heaviness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:FGS1","text":"Given moral certainty → diagnosis as old conceit and somnolence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:FGS2","text":"Diagnosis of tradition → dethronement of its doctrinal and redemptive instances through laughter, anger, and devaluation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:FGS3","text":"Dethronement of the old values → shifting of the source of value onto the creator.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:FGS4","text":"Creative source of value → production of goal, meaning, and future rather than discovery of given norms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:FGS5","text":"Surplus of the future → presentation as wild wisdom, poetic parable, and possibility not yet seen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:FGS6","text":"Order of the future → ontology of becoming as plural self-contradiction and renewed belonging.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:FGS7","text":"Ontology of becoming → recoding of freedom as playing necessity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:FGS8","text":"Recoded freedom → identification of the spirit of gravity as a counterstructure to be overcome, yet necessary.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:FGS9","text":"Counterstructure of gravity → condition for dance, lightness, and overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:AF1","text":"Moral self-certainty → disclosure of its character as inherited conceit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:AF2","text":"Old conceit → overthrow of authoritative doctrinal and redemptive figures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:AF3","text":"Overthrow → liberation of the creator as the source of goal, meaning, and future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:AF4","text":"Liberation of creation → future beyond what has hitherto been conceivable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:AF5","text":"Future → multiplicity, self-contradiction, and divine dance of becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:AF6","text":"Becoming → unity of necessity and freedom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:AF7","text":"Unity of necessity and freedom → overcoming of the spirit of gravity under its enduring presupposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:ME1","text":"Moral values are remapped from timeless truths to produced positings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:ME2","text":"Traditional authorities are reclassified from sources of orientation to historical burdens and objects of laughter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:ME3","text":"Contradiction is remapped from an error of order to a productive form of movement of becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:ME4","text":"The future is redrawn from an expectable continuation into a space of creation not yet dreamable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:ME5","text":"Freedom and necessity are no longer visible as simple opposites, but as forces interwoven with one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:ME6","text":"Gravity is classified at once as a form of domination, a moral burden, and the necessary resistance of lightness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:ALT1","text":"Surface — The text rejects the supposed knowledge of good and evil and demands laughter at inherited greatnesss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:ALT2","text":"Structural — Moral concepts are determined as products of an instance that posits human goal, earthly meaning, and future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Critique is organized as overthrow, devaluation, and the liberation of a creative future, not as reform of the old doctrine.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Reality appears as manifold, contradictory becoming, in which time, freedom, and necessity are determined not outside but within the process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from moral self-certainty to creative value-positing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction preserves the double function of the spirit of gravity as adversary and precondition of overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:MRT3","text":"It remains underdetermined who or what the creator is ontologically and how its positing becomes institutionally or practically effective.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:MRT4","text":"The movement is internally coherent insofar as value, meaning, and future are treated as products and not as givens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:MRT5","text":"A tension remains between the singular creator and the multiplicity of the dancing gods.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:MRT6","text":"A further tension lies in the equation of freedom and necessity, which is asserted but not fully mediated conceptually.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction depends on the rhetorically powerful, yet structurally not fully elaborated, figure of laughter as a transitional operation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_8:MRT8","text":"The actual argumentative movement is preserved: unmasking of old morality → creative redefinition → cosmological reversal → paradoxical liberation through overcoming gravity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_8:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_2C_8@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_2C_8:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On Old and New Tablets","source_section_label":"2.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 2","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","2."],"original_title":"2."}],"source_title_context":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln","source_section_label":"2.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 2","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","2."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 83","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 2","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln · 2"},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4","layer":"CH","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 3","order":84,"parents":["RAW_97E9_3C_4"],"revision":"CH_97E9_3C_4@R001","sha256":"089cdd92fcb8a872eefad90747993ced84a1609fbb54f8882bb8da9acf426958","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:AS1","text":"Die Rede setzt den Menschen als Übergangswesen und nicht als Zweck seiner selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:AS2","text":"Die menschliche Existenz wird als Bruchstück, Rätsel und Zufall neu bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:AS3","text":"Dichtung, Rätsellösung und Erlösung sollen diese Zerstreuung in eine zukünftige Einheit überführen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:AS4","text":"Erlösung wird nicht als Aufhebung des Vergangenen, sondern als Umwilligung des Gewesenen erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:AS5","text":"Die Lehre vollendet sich in der Selbstaufgabe des Lehrenden und in der Übergabe neuer, noch unvollendeter Tafeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:A1","text":"Der Mensch muss überwunden werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:A2","text":"Der Mensch ist eine Brücke und kein Zweck.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:A3","text":"Das Menschliche ist durch Bruchstück, Rätsel und grausen Zufall gekennzeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:A4","text":"Dichtung kann das Zerstreute in ein zusammengetragenes Ganzes überführen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:A5","text":"Zukunft entsteht durch schöpferische Bearbeitung dessen, was war.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:A6","text":"Erlösung besteht darin, das Vergangene so umzuschauen, dass der Wille es bejaht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:A7","text":"Die höchste Gabe wird durch den Untergang des Gebenden übermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:A8","text":"Die kommende Ordnung ist durch alte zerbrochene und neue halbbeschriebene Tafeln zugleich bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:A9","text":"Überfluss verwirklicht sich als Ausschüttung an den Ärmsten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:NX1","text":"Der Mensch ist nicht das Ziel der Entwicklung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:NX2","text":"Erlösung ist nicht Flucht aus der Zeit oder Tilgung des Gewesenen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:NX3","text":"Die Zukunft ist keine bloße Fortsetzung einer gegebenen Ordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:NX4","text":"Das Menschliche bildet keine bereits geschlossene Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:NX5","text":"Die Lehre ist keine fertige, unveränderliche Gesetzestafel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:NX6","text":"Gabe und Reichtum werden nicht als Bewahrung beim Gebenden organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:D1","text":"Die Überwindung des Menschen verlangt eine zeitliche Vermittlung statt eines unmittelbaren Sprungs über den Menschen hinaus.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_4:A1","CH_97E9_3C_4:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:D2","text":"Der Zufall wird zur schöpferisch bearbeitbaren Bedingung einer zukünftigen Gestalt.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_4:A3","CH_97E9_3C_4:A4","CH_97E9_3C_4:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:D3","text":"Erlösung verändert nicht primär das Vergangene, sondern die Willensstellung zu ihm.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_4:A5","CH_97E9_3C_4:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:D4","text":"Die Bejahung des Gewesenen wird zum Modell einer rückwirkenden Herstellung von Sinn.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_4:A4","CH_97E9_3C_4:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:D5","text":"Der Lehrende muss seine Lehre durch Selbstverlust anstatt durch dauernde Herrschaft wirksam machen.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_4:A7","CH_97E9_3C_4:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:D6","text":"Die neue Ordnung entsteht aus der gleichzeitigen Zerstörung überlieferter Normen und der unvollständigen Setzung neuer Normen.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_4:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:SD1","text":"Das System verschiebt Erlösung von einer transzendenten Befreiung zu einer schöpferischen Umformung der Zeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:SD2","text":"Überwindung und Erlösung bilden keinen Gegensatz: Die Überwindung des Menschen wird durch die Bejahung seines gesamten Gewordenseins vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:SD3","text":"Autorität wird als vorläufige Übergabe organisiert: Der Lehrer gewinnt Geltung, indem er sich selbst als Endpunkt seiner Lehre entzieht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:SD4","text":"Die neue Zukunft bleibt strukturell offen, weil ihre normativen Tafeln erst begonnen und noch nicht vollendet sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:SD5","text":"Überfluss erhält seine höchste Form nicht in Akkumulation, sondern in der Selbstverausgabung bis zur Erreichbarkeit des Ärmsten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:DNX1","text":"Die Wahrheit des Systems hängt vom Ausschluss einer vorgegebenen menschlichen Endgestalt ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:DNX2","text":"Das System kann nur bestehen, wenn Vergangenheit nicht als unveränderlich abgeschlossene Tatsache gilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:DNX3","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass Sinn unabhängig von schöpferischer Willensbildung bereits vorhanden ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:DNX4","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass eine neue Ordnung aus der bloßen Bewahrung alter Tafeln hervorgehen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:DNX5","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass Lehre durch endgültige Fixierung und dauerhafte Anwesenheit des Lehrenden abgeschlossen werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:SNX1","text":"Der Text umkreist die Unmöglichkeit, den Menschen als stabile Heimat von Sinn zu erhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:SNX2","text":"Die versperrte Möglichkeit ist eine Erlösung ohne Umgestaltung des Willens zum Vergangenen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:SNX3","text":"Abwesend bleibt jede fertige Gestalt des Übermenschen; seine Funktion besteht primär in der Öffnung eines Übergangs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:SNX4","text":"Unzulässig ist eine Zukunft, die ohne Untergang, Risiko und unvollständige Gesetzgebung verfügbar wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:FGS1","text":"Endzweckverneinung des Menschen → Bestimmung des Menschen als Brücke.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:FGS2","text":"Brückenstatus + Fragmentcharakter → Erfordernis von Dichtung, Sammlung und Rätselbearbeitung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:FGS3","text":"Schöpferische Bearbeitung des Zufalls → Zukunftsbildung aus dem Gewesenen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:FGS4","text":"Zukunftsbildung + Umwilligung des Vergangenen → Erlösung als rückwirkende Sinnstiftung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:FGS5","text":"Erlösung als Gabe → Untergang des Lehrenden → Übergang von alten zu neuen, unvollendeten Tafeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:AF1","text":"Mensch als Endzweck → Mensch als Übergang → Mensch als Fragment und Zufall → schöpferische Sammlung → Umwilligung des Gewesenen → Erlösung → Selbstuntergang des Lehrenden → offene neue Gesetzgebung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:ME1","text":"Der Gegensatz von Vergangenheit und Zukunft wird in eine operative Beziehung der nachträglichen Umgestaltung überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:ME2","text":"Zufall wird von einem bloß erlittenen Ereignis zu einem Material schöpferischer Formgebung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:ME3","text":"Erlösung wird von einer jenseitigen Kategorie zu einer Praxis der Willensbildung innerhalb der Zeit verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:ME4","text":"Lehre wird nicht mehr als fertiger Bestand, sondern als Übergabe zwischen zerbrochener Überlieferung und unvollendeter Neuerung kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:ME5","text":"Reichtum wird als Maß der Weitergabe an den Ärmsten und nicht als Besitz beim Stärksten bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Zarathustra kündigt die Überwindung des Menschen, seine letzte Rückkehr und seine reichste Gabe an.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Menschliches Dasein wird als Übergangs-, Fragmentierungs- und Vermittlungsstruktur organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Der Lehrende erzeugt Zukunft nicht durch institutionelle Fixierung, sondern durch Selbstaufgabe und Weitergabe unvollendeter Tafeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Vergangenheit und Zukunft sind willensabhängig verschränkt; Erlösung bezeichnet eine nachträgliche Transformation des Gewesenen in Gewolltes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von der Überwindung des Menschen zur Erlösung des Vergangenen zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleiben die konkrete Gestalt des Übermenschen und die Kriterien seiner Verwirklichung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:MRT3","text":"Die Funktion der neuen Tafeln ist strukturell bestimmt, ihr normativer Inhalt bleibt offen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:MRT4","text":"Intern besteht eine Spannung zwischen angekündigtem letztem Gang zu den Menschen und der fortgesetzten Zukunftseröffnung durch neue Lehre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:MRT5","text":"Eine weitere Spannung liegt zwischen der Auflösung des Menschen als Zweck und der fortbestehenden Abhängigkeit der Erlösung von menschlicher Willensbildung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, sofern Selbstuntergang nicht als bloßes Ende, sondern als Übertragungsform der Lehre verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T191348091911Z_4a54b66d","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"3.","source_sha256":"089cdd92fcb8a872eefad90747993ced84a1609fbb54f8882bb8da9acf426958","sha256":"4303c6320a78ddb786a3216a44935f2ab71768b093c14a8f2874d2a779fe677d","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:13:48.094435+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:AS1","text":"The discourse posits the human being as a transitional being and not as an end in itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:AS2","text":"Human existence is redefined as fragment, riddle, and chance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:AS3","text":"Poetry, riddle-solving, and redemption are to transform this dispersion into a future unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:AS4","text":"Redemption is brought forth not as the abolition of the past, but as the re-willing of what has been.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:AS5","text":"The teaching consummates itself in the self-abandonment of the teacher and in the handing over of new, still unfinished tablets.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:A1","text":"Man must be overcome.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:A2","text":"Man is a bridge and not an end.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:A3","text":"The human is marked by fragment, riddle, and gruesome accident.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:A4","text":"Poetry can bring what is scattered into a gathered whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:A5","text":"The future arises through the creative working-over of what was.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:A6","text":"Redemption consists in looking upon the past in such a way that the will affirms it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:A7","text":"The highest gift is conveyed through the downfall of the giver.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:A8","text":"The coming order is determined at once by old shattered and new half-written tablets.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:A9","text":"Abundance realizes itself as bestowal upon the poorest.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:NX1","text":"Man is not the goal of development.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:NX2","text":"Redemption is not flight from time or the effacement of what has been.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:NX3","text":"The future is not a mere continuation of a given order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:NX4","text":"The human does not constitute an already closed unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:NX5","text":"The teaching is not a finished, unchangeable tablet of law.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:NX6","text":"Gift and wealth are not organized as preservation with the giver.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:D1","text":"The overcoming of man requires temporal mediation rather than an immediate leap beyond man.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_4:A1","CH_97E9_3C_4:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:D2","text":"Accident becomes a condition of a future form that can be creatively worked over.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_4:A3","CH_97E9_3C_4:A4","CH_97E9_3C_4:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:D3","text":"Redemption does not primarily alter the past, but rather the will's stance toward it.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_4:A5","CH_97E9_3C_4:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:D4","text":"The affirmation of what has been becomes the model of a retroactive production of meaning.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_4:A4","CH_97E9_3C_4:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:D5","text":"The teacher must make his teaching effective through self-loss rather than through enduring rule.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_4:A7","CH_97E9_3C_4:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:D6","text":"The new order arises from the simultaneous destruction of inherited norms and the incomplete positing of new norms.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_4:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:SD1","text":"The system shifts redemption from a transcendent liberation to a creative reshaping of time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:SD2","text":"Overcoming and redemption do not form an opposition: the overcoming of man is mediated through the affirmation of his entire becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:SD3","text":"Authority is organized as provisional transmission: the teacher gains validity by withdrawing himself as the endpoint of his teaching.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:SD4","text":"The new future remains structurally open because its normative tablets have only been begun and are not yet completed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:SD5","text":"Abundance attains its highest form not in accumulation, but in self-expenditure unto reachability by the poorest.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:DNX1","text":"The truth of the system depends upon the exclusion of a predetermined final human form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:DNX2","text":"The system can endure only if the past is not regarded as an unchangeably completed fact.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:DNX3","text":"It is excluded that meaning is already present independently of creative formation of the will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:DNX4","text":"It is excluded that a new order can arise from the mere preservation of old tablets.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:DNX5","text":"It is excluded that teaching can be completed through definitive fixation and the enduring presence of the teacher.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:SNX1","text":"The text circles around the impossibility of preserving man as a stable home of meaning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:SNX2","text":"The barred possibility is a redemption without a transformation of the will toward the past.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:SNX3","text":"Any finished form of the Overman remains absent; his function consists primarily in opening a transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:SNX4","text":"Inadmissible is a future that would be available without downfall, risk, and incomplete legislation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:FGS1","text":"Negation of the human being as final end → determination of the human being as bridge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:FGS2","text":"Bridge status + fragmentary character → requirement of poetry, gathering, and riddle-work.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:FGS3","text":"Creative working-over of chance → formation of the future out of what has been.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:FGS4","text":"Formation of the future + re-willing of the past → redemption as retroactive endowment with meaning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:FGS5","text":"Redemption as gift → downfall of the teacher → transition from old to new, unfinished tablets.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:AF1","text":"Man as final end → man as transition → man as fragment and accident → creative gathering → re-willing of what has been → redemption → self-downfall of the teacher → open new legislation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:ME1","text":"The opposition between past and future is transformed into an operative relation of retroactive reshaping.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:ME2","text":"Accident is reclassified from a merely suffered event into a material of creative formation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:ME3","text":"Redemption is shifted from an otherworldly category to a practice of formation of the will within time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:ME4","text":"Teaching is mapped no longer as a finished stock, but as a transmission between shattered tradition and unfinished innovation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:ME5","text":"Wealth is determined as the measure of what is passed on to the poorest and not as possession with the strongest.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Zarathustra announces the overcoming of man, his final return, and his richest gift.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Human existence is organized as a structure of transition, fragmentation, and mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** The teacher produces the future not through institutional fixation, but through self-renunciation and the transmission of unfinished tablets.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Past and future are intertwined in dependence upon the will; redemption designates a retroactive transformation of what has been into what is willed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from the overcoming of man to the redemption of the past.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:MRT2","text":"The concrete form of the Overman and the criteria of his realization remain underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:MRT3","text":"The function of the new tablets is structurally determined; their normative content remains open.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:MRT4","text":"Internally, there is a tension between the announced final journey to men and the continued opening of the future through new teaching.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:MRT5","text":"A further tension lies between the dissolution of man as end and redemption's continuing dependence on human formation of the will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_4:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument, provided that self-downfall is understood not as a mere end, but as a form of transmitting the teaching.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_4:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_3C_4@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_3C_4:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On Old and New Tablets","source_section_label":"3.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 3","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","3."],"original_title":"3."}],"source_title_context":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln","source_section_label":"3.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 3","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","3."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 84","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 3","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln · 3"},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2","layer":"CH","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 4","order":85,"parents":["RAW_97E9_4C_2"],"revision":"CH_97E9_4C_2@R001","sha256":"fd5ff78d4a07d1c5dfa2e5faef7d522a24d0e5235e42ab6b97b8e9c4c948c0af","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:AS1","text":"Eine neue Tafel verlangt Träger, die ihre Gebote gemeinsam in fleischerne Herzen einschreiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:AS2","text":"Die grosse Liebe richtet sich auf die Fernsten und hebt dadurch die Schonung des Nächsten auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:AS3","text":"Der Mensch wird als zu überwindende Gestalt bestimmt, nicht als zu überspringende Zwischenstufe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:AS4","text":"Überwindung besitzt mehrere Wege und schliesst die Selbstüberwindung im Verhältnis zum Nächsten ein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:AS5","text":"Ein Recht gilt nicht schon deshalb als legitim, weil es als eigenes Recht beansprucht oder verliehen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:AS6","text":"Handlungen sind nicht durch Vergeltung ausgleichbar; ihre Einmaligkeit begründet keine reziproke Rückgabe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:AS7","text":"Gehorsam setzt die Fähigkeit zum Befehl an sich selbst voraus und bleibt auch dann unvollständig, wenn Selbstbefehl möglich ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:A1","text":"Der Mensch ist eine zu überwindende Gestalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:A2","text":"Die Überwindung des Menschen darf nicht als Überspringen des Menschen verstanden werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:A3","text":"Überwindung erfolgt auf vielerlei Wegen und Weisen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:A4","text":"Selbstüberwindung vollzieht sich auch im Verhältnis zum Nächsten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:A5","text":"Die grosse Liebe gilt den Fernsten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:A6","text":"Der Nächste ist nicht zu schonen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:A7","text":"Ein Recht, das man sich rauben kann, soll man sich nicht geben lassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:A8","text":"Was jemand tut, kann ihm niemand wieder tun.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:A9","text":"Es gibt keine Vergeltung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:A10","text":"Wer sich nicht befehlen kann, soll gehorchen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:A11","text":"Selbstbefehl allein genügt noch nicht zum Selbstgehorsam.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:A12","text":"Die neue Tafel benötigt Träger, die sie gemeinsam in fleischerne Herzen tragen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:NX1","text":"Überwindung ist nicht das Überspringen des Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:NX2","text":"Liebe zum Fernsten ist nicht Schonung des Nächsten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:NX3","text":"Ein beanspruchtes Recht ist nicht schon dadurch unverlierbar oder legitim.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:NX4","text":"Eine Handlung ist nicht durch Vergeltung rückerstattbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:NX5","text":"Selbstbefehl ist nicht identisch mit Selbstgehorsam.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:NX6","text":"Der einzelne Weg zur Überwindung ist nicht der einzig mögliche Weg.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:NX7","text":"Der Nächste ist nicht das letzte Ziel der Liebe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:D1","text":"Die menschliche Gegenwart bleibt als notwendige Durchgangsbedingung der Überwindung erhalten.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_2:A1","CH_97E9_4C_2:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:D2","text":"Die Orientierung am Fernsten erzeugt eine Pflicht zur Nichtschonung des unmittelbar Nahen.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_2:A5","CH_97E9_4C_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:D3","text":"Selbstüberwindung ist keine rein innere Operation, sondern wird im Verhältnis zum Nächsten vollzogen.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_2:A4","CH_97E9_4C_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:D4","text":"Der Entzug eines raubbaren Rechts wird zur Bedingung dafür, dass dieses Recht nicht passiv empfangen wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:D5","text":"Handlungen entziehen sich einem Modell moralischer Kontenführung, weil keine Handlung durch eine gleichartige Rückhandlung ausgeglichen werden kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_2:A8","CH_97E9_4C_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:D6","text":"Gehorsam wird hierarchisch erzeugt: fehlender Selbstbefehl führt zum Gehorsam gegenüber einem Befehl, während Selbstbefehl erst durch Selbstgehorsam vollendet wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_2:A10","CH_97E9_4C_2:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:D7","text":"Die neue Tafel ist nicht durch ihre Verkündung, sondern durch ihre Verkörperung in mehreren Trägern wirksam.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_2:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:SD1","text":"Das System ersetzt die Norm des nachbarschaftlichen Schutzes durch eine vertikale Dynamik aus Fernziel, Zumutung und Überwindung.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_2:A4","CH_97E9_4C_2:A5","CH_97E9_4C_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:SD2","text":"Der Mensch bleibt zugleich Material und Grenze der Transformation: Er muss überwunden werden, darf aber nicht aus dem Prozess entfernt werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_2:A1","CH_97E9_4C_2:A2","CH_97E9_4C_2:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:SD3","text":"Das normative Zentrum verschiebt sich von reziproker Gerechtigkeit zu asymmetrischer Selbstformung.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_2:A7","CH_97E9_4C_2:A8","CH_97E9_4C_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:SD4","text":"Autorität wird nicht abgeschafft, sondern in die Fähigkeit zur Selbstbefehls- und Selbstgehorsamsstruktur verlagert.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_2:A10","CH_97E9_4C_2:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:SD5","text":"Die gemeinsame Trägerschaft der Tafel verbindet eine kollektive Form mit einer radikal individualisierten Prüfung der Selbstüberwindung.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_2:A3","CH_97E9_4C_2:A4","CH_97E9_4C_2:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:DNX1","text":"Falsch ist ein Menschenbild, das den Menschen als abschliessenden Wert, Zweck oder Endpunkt behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Gerechtigkeitsmodell, in dem jede Handlung durch eine entsprechende Gegenhandlung aufgehoben werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Freiheitsmodell, das Befehlsfähigkeit ohne Gehorsamsfähigkeit als vollendete Autonomie anerkennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Moral, die Nähe, Schonung und wechselseitige Rücksicht als letzte Form der Liebe setzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Transformation, die sich durch Abkürzung, Überspringen oder reine Distanzierung vom Menschen vollzieht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:DNX6","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Annahme, dass ein Recht durch seine Verleihung gegen Entzug gesichert sei.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:SNX1","text":"Unverfügbar ist eine stabile menschliche Endgestalt, auf die sich die Ordnung endgültig gründen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:SNX2","text":"Unzulässig ist eine reziproke Weltordnung, in der Handlungen durch Vergeltung in ein Gleichgewicht zurückgeführt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:SNX3","text":"Versperrt ist eine Versöhnung von Nähe und Überwindung, solange Liebe gerade durch Nichtschonung des Nächsten organisiert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:SNX4","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine Gemeinschaft, die allein aus gemeinsamer Zustimmung besteht; erforderlich bleibt die gemeinsame Verkörperung einer bindenden Tafel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:SNX5","text":"Unstatthaft ist eine Herrschafts- oder Freiheitsordnung ohne die offene Möglichkeit, dass Selbstbefehl in Selbstgehorsam übergehen muss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:FGS1","text":"Neue Tafel → notwendige Träger → Verkörperung in fleischernen Herzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:FGS2","text":"Fernstes als Liebesziel → Aufhebung der Nachsicht gegenüber dem Nächsten → Überwindung als Zumutung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:FGS3","text":"Mensch als zu Überwindender + Mensch als nicht Überspringbarer → gestufte Transformation statt Abkürzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:FGS4","text":"Selbstüberwindung im Nächsten → Entzug passiv empfangener Rechte → nicht-reziproke Handlungssphäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:FGS5","text":"Unmöglichkeit der Vergeltung → Auflösung des Ausgleichsmodells → asymmetrische Verantwortung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:FGS6","text":"Fehlender Selbstbefehl → Gehorsam; vorhandener Selbstbefehl → noch ausstehender Selbstgehorsam → hierarchische Vollendung der Selbstführung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:AF1","text":"Neue Tafel und fehlende Träger → Fernstes als Ziel der Liebe → Nichtschonung des Nächsten → Mensch als zu durchlaufende Überwindungsstufe → Selbstüberwindung im Nächsten → Entzug des passiv verliehenen Rechts → Aufhebung der Vergeltung → Selbstbefehl als unvollständige Vorstufe des Selbstgehorsams.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:AF2","text":"Der Text bewegt sich von einer neuen gemeinsamen Normsetzung zu einer asymmetrischen Ethik der Überwindung und schliesst in einer gestuften Theorie des Gehorsams.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:ME1","text":"Der Gegensatz von Nächstenliebe und Fernstenliebe wird in eine Rangordnung der Distanz und der Überwindungsfunktion umgezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:ME2","text":"Der Mensch wird von einem Zielwert zu einer Übergangsstruktur der Transformation umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:ME3","text":"Das Recht wird von einem geschützten Besitz zu einer gefährdeten, nicht passiv zu empfangenden Position umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:ME4","text":"Handlung wird aus dem Schema von Schuld, Rückgabe und Vergeltung herausgelöst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:ME5","text":"Gehorsam wird nicht mehr als Gegenbegriff zu Selbstbestimmung, sondern als deren innere Vollendungsbedingung kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:ME6","text":"Gemeinschaft wird als Trägerschaft einer verkörperten Norm sichtbar, nicht als blosse Koexistenz von Individuen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Text fordert eine neue Tafel, die Überwindung des Menschen, Nichtschonung des Nächsten und Gehorsam.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Forderungen ordnen Liebe, Recht, Handlung und Gehorsam in asymmetrische Beziehungen ohne reziproken Ausgleich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text verschiebt die Strategie von Schonung und Ausgleich zu Zumutung, Selbstüberwindung und verkörperter gemeinsamer Norm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Der Mensch erscheint als vorläufige Gestalt zwischen Gegenwart und Überwindung; Selbstbefehl ist eine unvollständige Stufe vor Selbstgehorsam.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von der neuen Tafel zur Überwindung und zur Gehorsamsstruktur zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, worin die neue Tafel materiell besteht und welche konkreten Wege der Überwindung gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Überwindung zugleich als notwendiger Durchgang und als nicht zu überspringender Prozess verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Verbindung liegt zwischen Fernstenliebe, Nichtschonung und der Umklassifizierung des Menschen als Übergangsgestalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:MRT5","text":"Die grösste Spannung liegt zwischen gemeinsamer Trägerschaft und individualisierter Selbstüberwindung sowie zwischen Selbstbefehl und gefordertem Selbstgehorsam.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, solange Vergeltung nicht als bloße Ablehnung, sondern als Ausschluss eines vollständigen Ausgleichsmodells verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T191736030915Z_010a904f","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"4.","source_sha256":"fd5ff78d4a07d1c5dfa2e5faef7d522a24d0e5235e42ab6b97b8e9c4c948c0af","sha256":"7e4c45d3bc909ad56e5bfd524e8e3393c5fd1a592e4b19b05b16014451beaa47","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:17:36.033503+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:AS1","text":"A new table requires bearers who jointly inscribe its commandments into fleshly hearts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:AS2","text":"The great love is directed toward the most distant and thereby abolishes the sparing of the neighbor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:AS3","text":"The human being is determined as a figure to be overcome, not as an intermediate stage to be skipped over.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:AS4","text":"Overcoming has several paths and includes self-overcoming in relation to the neighbor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:AS5","text":"A right is not legitimate merely because it is claimed or granted as one's own right.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:AS6","text":"Actions cannot be balanced through retribution; their uniqueness does not ground a reciprocal return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:AS7","text":"Obedience presupposes the capacity for self-command and remains incomplete even when self-command is possible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:A1","text":"The human being is a form to be overcome.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:A2","text":"The overcoming of the human being must not be understood as skipping over the human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:A3","text":"Overcoming takes place in many ways and manners.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:A4","text":"Self-overcoming is also enacted in relation to the neighbor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:A5","text":"The great love is for the most distant.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:A6","text":"The neighbor is not to be spared.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:A7","text":"One should not let oneself be given a right that one can seize for oneself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:A8","text":"What someone does, no one can do to him again.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:A9","text":"There is no retribution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:A10","text":"Whoever cannot command himself should obey.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:A11","text":"Self-command alone does not yet suffice for self-obedience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:A12","text":"The new tablet requires bearers who together carry it into hearts of flesh.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:NX1","text":"Overcoming is not the skipping over of the human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:NX2","text":"Love for the most distant is not sparing the neighbor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:NX3","text":"A claimed right is not thereby inalienable or legitimate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:NX4","text":"An action is not restitutable through retribution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:NX5","text":"Self-command is not identical with self-obedience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:NX6","text":"The individual path to overcoming is not the only possible path.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:NX7","text":"The neighbor is not the ultimate goal of love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:D1","text":"Human presence is preserved as a necessary condition of passage for overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_2:A1","CH_97E9_4C_2:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:D2","text":"Orientation toward the most distant produces a duty not to spare what is immediately near.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_2:A5","CH_97E9_4C_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:D3","text":"Self-overcoming is not a purely inner operation, but is enacted in relation to the neighbor.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_2:A4","CH_97E9_4C_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:D4","text":"The withdrawal of a seizable right becomes the condition for this right not to be passively received.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:D5","text":"Actions evade a model of moral accounting, because no action can be balanced by a like counteraction.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_2:A8","CH_97E9_4C_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:D6","text":"Obedience is generated hierarchically: lacking self-command leads to obedience to a command, whereas self-command is completed only through self-obedience.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_2:A10","CH_97E9_4C_2:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:D7","text":"The new tablet is effective not through its proclamation, but through its embodiment in several bearers.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_2:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:SD1","text":"The system replaces the norm of neighborly protection with a vertical dynamic of distant goal, demand, and overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_2:A4","CH_97E9_4C_2:A5","CH_97E9_4C_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:SD2","text":"The human being remains at once material and limit of transformation: he must be overcome, but must not be removed from the process.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_2:A1","CH_97E9_4C_2:A2","CH_97E9_4C_2:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:SD3","text":"The normative center shifts from reciprocal justice to asymmetric self-formation.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_2:A7","CH_97E9_4C_2:A8","CH_97E9_4C_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:SD4","text":"Authority is not abolished, but relocated into the capacity for the structure of self-command and self-obedience.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_2:A10","CH_97E9_4C_2:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:SD5","text":"The shared bearing of the tablet joins a collective form with a radically individualized test of self-overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_2:A3","CH_97E9_4C_2:A4","CH_97E9_4C_2:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:DNX1","text":"False is a conception of the human being that treats the human being as a final value, purpose, or endpoint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a model of justice in which every action can be annulled by a corresponding counteraction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a model of freedom that recognizes the capacity to command without the capacity to obey as completed autonomy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a morality that posits proximity, sparing, and mutual consideration as the ultimate form of love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:DNX5","text":"Excluded is a transformation that takes place through shortcut, skipping over, or mere distancing from the human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:DNX6","text":"Excluded is the assumption that a right is secured against withdrawal by its conferral.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:SNX1","text":"Unavailable is a stable final human form upon which order could be definitively founded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:SNX2","text":"Impermissible is a reciprocal world order in which actions are returned to equilibrium through retribution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:SNX3","text":"A reconciliation of proximity and overcoming is barred so long as love is organized precisely through not sparing the neighbor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:SNX4","text":"Unavailable is a community consisting solely of shared consent; the shared embodiment of a binding tablet remains necessary.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:SNX5","text":"Improper is an order of domination or freedom without the open possibility that self-command must pass over into self-obedience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:FGS1","text":"New table → necessary bearers → embodiment in fleshly hearts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:FGS2","text":"Most distant as the aim of love → abolition of indulgence toward the neighbor → overcoming as an imposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:FGS3","text":"Human being as one to be overcome + human being as not to be skipped over → graduated transformation rather than shortcut.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:FGS4","text":"Self-overcoming in the neighbor → withdrawal of passively received rights → non-reciprocal sphere of action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:FGS5","text":"Impossibility of retribution → dissolution of the model of balancing → asymmetric responsibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:FGS6","text":"Absent self-command → obedience; present self-command → self-obedience still outstanding → hierarchical completion of self-governance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:AF1","text":"New table and absent bearers → most distant as the goal of love → non-sparing of the neighbor → human being as a stage of overcoming to be traversed → self-overcoming in the neighbor → withdrawal of the passively granted right → abolition of retribution → self-command as an incomplete preliminary stage of self-obedience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:AF2","text":"The text moves from a new shared norm-setting to an asymmetric ethics of overcoming and concludes in a graduated theory of obedience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:ME1","text":"The opposition between love of the neighbor and love of the most distant is redrawn into a hierarchy of distance and overcoming-function.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:ME2","text":"The human being is reclassified from a terminal value into a transitional structure of transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:ME3","text":"Right is remapped from a protected possession into a vulnerable position not to be passively received.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:ME4","text":"Action is detached from the schema of guilt, restitution, and retribution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:ME5","text":"Obedience is mapped no longer as the counterconcept to self-determination, but as its inner condition of completion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:ME6","text":"Community becomes visible as the bearing of an embodied norm, not as the mere coexistence of individuals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:ALT1","text":"Surface — The text demands a new tablet, the overcoming of the human being, not sparing the neighbor, and obedience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:ALT2","text":"Structural — The demands arrange love, right, action, and obedience into asymmetric relations without reciprocal compensation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text shifts the strategy from sparing and compensation to demand, self-overcoming, and embodied shared norm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The human being appears as a provisional form between presence and overcoming; self-command is an incomplete stage before self-obedience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from the new tablet to overcoming and to the structure of obedience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is what the new tablet materially consists in and which concrete paths of overcoming apply.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as overcoming is understood simultaneously as a necessary passage and as a process not to be skipped over.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:MRT4","text":"Its strongest connection lies between love of the most distant, not sparing, and the reclassification of the human being as a transitional form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:MRT5","text":"The greatest tension lies between shared bearing and individualized self-overcoming, as well as between self-command and required self-obedience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_2:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement so long as retribution is understood not as mere rejection, but as the exclusion of a complete model of compensation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_4C_2@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_4C_2:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On Old and New Tablets","source_section_label":"4.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 4","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","4."],"original_title":"4."}],"source_title_context":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln","source_section_label":"4.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 4","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","4."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 85","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 4","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln · 4"},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2","layer":"CH","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 5","order":86,"parents":["RAW_97E9_5C_2"],"revision":"CH_97E9_5C_2@R001","sha256":"6c476ecff009b7a676e5bbfba1dbd2e4f0ac713d0e5c50697cfcdc1f67a85ff3","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:AS1","text":"Das zentrale Problem ist, wie ein edles Verhältnis zum Leben gegenüber dem Anspruch des Umsonstlebens bestimmt werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:AS2","text":"Das Leben wird als Gabe bestimmt, der eine Gegengabe und keine bloße Aneignung entsprechen soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:AS3","text":"Die Verpflichtung gegenüber dem Leben besteht darin, seine Versprechen am Leben zu halten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:AS4","text":"Genuss wird an die vorgängige Gabe von Genuss gebunden und zugleich als nicht zu suchendes Gut bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:AS5","text":"Die positive Haltung zum Leben verschiebt das Begehren von gesuchtem Genuss und Unschuld auf Schuld und Schmerz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:A1","text":"Edle Seelen wollen nichts umsonst haben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:A2","text":"Das Leben ist den edlen Seelen gegeben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:A3","text":"Eine Gabe des Lebens verlangt eine Gegengabe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:A4","text":"Das Leben enthält Versprechen, die ihm gegenüber gehalten werden müssen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:A5","text":"Genuss darf nicht beansprucht werden, wenn man keinen Genuss gibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:A6","text":"Genuss soll nicht gesucht werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:A7","text":"Genuss und Unschuld sind schamhaft und widerstehen der direkten Suche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:A8","text":"Schuld und Schmerz können als vorzugswürdige Suchziele gegenüber Genuss und Unschuld fungieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:A9","text":"Das Verhältnis zum Leben unterscheidet sich nach der Bereitschaft zur Gegengabe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:A10","text":"Der Pöbel wird durch den Wunsch charakterisiert, umsonst zu leben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:NX1","text":"Das edle Leben ist kein kostenlos verfügbares Leben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:NX2","text":"Leben ist keine einseitige Aneignung einer Gabe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:NX3","text":"Genuss ist kein Anspruch ohne vorherige eigene Gabe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:NX4","text":"Genuss ist kein Gut, das durch unmittelbare Suche gewonnen werden soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:NX5","text":"Unschuld ist kein absichtlich herstellbarer oder suchbarer Zustand.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:NX6","text":"Die edle Haltung ist nicht durch den Wunsch bestimmt, umsonst zu leben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:NX7","text":"Das Leben wird nicht als von jeder Verpflichtung freigestellte Existenz behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:D1","text":"Wer das Leben als Gabe anerkennt, muss eine Gegengabe leisten.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_2:A2","CH_97E9_5C_2:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:D2","text":"Das Halten dessen, was das Leben verspricht, wird zur Form der Gegengabe.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_2:A3","CH_97E9_5C_2:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:D3","text":"Genuss wird legitim, wenn ihm eine eigene Gabe von Genuss vorausgeht.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_2:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:D4","text":"Die Nicht-Suche nach Genuss gehört zur angemessenen Weise, Genuss zu haben.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_2:A6","CH_97E9_5C_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:D5","text":"Die Nicht-Suchbarkeit von Unschuld verschiebt die aktive Suche auf Schuld und Schmerz.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_2:A7","CH_97E9_5C_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:D6","text":"Die Unterscheidung zwischen edler Seele und Pöbel wird als Unterschied zwischen Gegengabe und Gratisanspruch erzeugt.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_2:A1","CH_97E9_5C_2:A9","CH_97E9_5C_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:SD1","text":"Das Leben wird als reziproke Schuldordnung organisiert, in der Existenz selbst einen Anspruch auf Antwort erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:SD2","text":"Die höchste Form der Lebensbejahung erscheint nicht als Genussmaximierung, sondern als freiwillige Übernahme von Verpflichtung, Schuld und Schmerz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:SD3","text":"Der Text ersetzt die Gegenüberstellung von Leben und Verzicht durch eine Ökonomie der Gegengabe innerhalb des Lebens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:SD4","text":"Das Gute wird durch seine Nicht-Suchbarkeit stabilisiert, während das Belastende gerade als aktiv Suchbares aufgewertet wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:DNX1","text":"Das Leben darf nicht als selbstgenügsamer Besitz ohne Gegenforderung verstanden werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:DNX2","text":"Freiheit von Schuld und Verpflichtung ist kein gültiger Maßstab der Lebensbejahung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:DNX3","text":"Das Verhältnis zum Leben darf nicht auf Konsum, Empfang oder Genuss reduziert werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:DNX4","text":"Die unmittelbare Verfolgung des Angenehmen gilt nicht als verlässlicher Zugang zum Guten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:DNX5","text":"Eine Moral, in der Unschuld durch absichtliche Selbstreinigung hergestellt wird, ist strukturell ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:DNX6","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Lebensbejahung und Schmerzsuche wird nicht als notwendig vorausgesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Möglichkeit eines Lebens ohne vorausgesetzte Schuldbeziehung zwischen Gabe und Gegengabe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:SNX2","text":"Unverfügbarer Genuss bildet die verborgene Grenze, an der sich das normative System organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:SNX3","text":"Ein Leben, das sich selbst genügt und nichts zurückgeben muss, bleibt als unzulässige Existenzform außerhalb des Systems.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:SNX4","text":"Die Möglichkeit, Unschuld und Genuss direkt zu wollen, wird durch die Struktur des Wollens selbst blockiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:FGS1","text":"Gabe des Lebens → Zurückweisung des Gratisanspruchs → Forderung der Gegengabe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:FGS2","text":"Gegengabe → Verpflichtung, die Versprechen des Lebens zu halten → vornehme Rede.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:FGS3","text":"Gabe von Genuss als Bedingung des Genusses → Ausschluss des einseitigen Genusses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:FGS4","text":"Schamhaftigkeit von Genuss und Unschuld → Verbot ihrer Suche → Öffnung der Suche nach Schuld und Schmerz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:FGS5","text":"Reziprozitätsordnung → moralische Trennung von edler Seele und Pöbel → Lebensbejahung als verpflichtende Selbsthingabe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:AF1","text":"Gratisanspruch auf das Leben → Leben als Gabe → Gegengabe als Pflicht → Halten der Lebensversprechen → Genuss nur durch Gegengabe → Nicht-Suche nach Genuss und Unschuld → Suche nach Schuld und Schmerz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:ME1","text":"Leben wird von einem verfügbaren Gut zu einer verpflichtenden Gabe umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:ME2","text":"Genuss wird von einem Ziel zu einer abgeleiteten Folge eigener Gabe umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:ME3","text":"Unschuld wird aus dem Bereich absichtlicher Herstellung in den Bereich des nicht Suchbaren verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:ME4","text":"Schuld und Schmerz werden von bloßen Negativa zu bevorzugten Gegenständen aktiver Suche umcodiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:ME5","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Pöbel und edler Seele wird als Gegensatz zwischen Gratisbegehren und reziproker Verpflichtung kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Genuss, Unschuld, Schuld und Schmerz werden nach ihrer jeweiligen Suchbarkeit und Berechtigung geordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Das Verhältnis zum Leben wird durch Gabe, Gegengabe, Anspruch und Schuld vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Lebensbejahung wird gegen passive Aneignung und unmittelbare Bedürfnisbefriedigung neu gerahmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Das gegebene Leben erzeugt nachträglich eine Verpflichtung, seine Versprechen einzulösen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von der Gabe des Lebens zur Gegengabe und zur Suche nach Schuld und Schmerz zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, worin die konkrete Gegengabe an das Leben und das Halten seiner Versprechen bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Genuss zugleich als nicht suchbar und als durch Gegengabe bedingt verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung besteht zwischen Lebensgabe, Gegengabe und Zurückweisung des Gratisanspruchs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:MRT5","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen der Behauptung, Genuss solle nicht gesucht werden, und der normativen Anweisung, Schuld und Schmerz zu suchen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung entsteht daraus, dass das Leben als Gabe und zugleich als verpflichtender Gläubiger erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung des Textes, sofern die Schlusswendung nicht als Auflösung, sondern als Umkehrung der Wert- und Suchordnung gelesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T191915147279Z_b81cf2e1","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"5.","source_sha256":"6c476ecff009b7a676e5bbfba1dbd2e4f0ac713d0e5c50697cfcdc1f67a85ff3","sha256":"566bb2c80127a9a0585663a5b36f53188b46426e79d5466c94206afcc32540a3","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:19:15.149662+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:AS1","text":"The central problem is how a noble relation to life can be determined in opposition to the claim to live for nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:AS2","text":"Life is determined as a gift, to which a counter-gift, rather than mere appropriation, ought to correspond.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:AS3","text":"The obligation toward life consists in keeping its promises alive.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:AS4","text":"Enjoyment is bound to the prior gift of enjoyment and at the same time determined as a good not to be sought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:AS5","text":"The positive attitude toward life shifts desire from sought enjoyment and innocence to guilt and pain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:A1","text":"Noble souls want to have nothing for nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:A2","text":"Life is given to noble souls.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:A3","text":"A gift of life demands a counter-gift.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:A4","text":"Life contains promises that must be kept toward it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:A5","text":"Pleasure may not be claimed if one gives no pleasure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:A6","text":"Pleasure should not be sought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:A7","text":"Pleasure and innocence are modest and resist direct pursuit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:A8","text":"Guilt and pain can function as preferable objects of pursuit in relation to pleasure and innocence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:A9","text":"The relation to life differs according to the readiness for a counter-gift.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:A10","text":"The rabble is characterized by the desire to live for nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:NX1","text":"The noble life is not a life available free of charge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:NX2","text":"Life is not a unilateral appropriation of a gift.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:NX3","text":"Pleasure is not an entitlement without a preceding gift of one's own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:NX4","text":"Pleasure is not a good that should be obtained through immediate pursuit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:NX5","text":"Innocence is not a condition that can be intentionally produced or sought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:NX6","text":"The noble attitude is not determined by the desire to live for nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:NX7","text":"Life is not treated as an existence exempted from every obligation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:D1","text":"Whoever acknowledges life as a gift must render a counter-gift.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_2:A2","CH_97E9_5C_2:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:D2","text":"Keeping what life promises becomes the form of the counter-gift.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_2:A3","CH_97E9_5C_2:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:D3","text":"Pleasure becomes legitimate when it is preceded by one's own gift of pleasure.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_2:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:D4","text":"Not seeking pleasure belongs to the appropriate manner of having pleasure.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_2:A6","CH_97E9_5C_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:D5","text":"The non-seekability of innocence shifts active pursuit onto guilt and pain.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_2:A7","CH_97E9_5C_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:D6","text":"The distinction between noble soul and rabble is produced as a difference between counter-gift and free entitlement.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_2:A1","CH_97E9_5C_2:A9","CH_97E9_5C_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:SD1","text":"Life is organized as a reciprocal order of indebtedness, in which existence itself generates a claim to response.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:SD2","text":"The highest form of affirmation of life appears not as the maximization of pleasure, but as the voluntary assumption of obligation, guilt, and pain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:SD3","text":"The text replaces the opposition between life and renunciation with an economy of counter-gift within life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:SD4","text":"The good is stabilized by its non-seekability, while what is burdensome is elevated precisely as actively seekable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:DNX1","text":"Life must not be understood as a self-sufficient possession without a counterclaim.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:DNX2","text":"Freedom from guilt and obligation is not a valid measure of affirmation of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:DNX3","text":"The relation to life must not be reduced to consumption, reception, or pleasure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:DNX4","text":"The immediate pursuit of the pleasant is not regarded as a reliable access to the good.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:DNX5","text":"A morality in which innocence is produced through intentional self-purification is structurally excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:DNX6","text":"The opposition between affirmation of life and the pursuit of pain is not presupposed as necessary.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:SNX1","text":"Excluded is the possibility of a life without a presupposed relation of indebtedness between gift and counter-gift.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:SNX2","text":"Unavailable pleasure constitutes the hidden boundary at which the normative system is organized.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:SNX3","text":"A life that suffices unto itself and need return nothing remains outside the system as an inadmissible form of existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:SNX4","text":"The possibility of directly willing innocence and pleasure is blocked by the structure of willing itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:FGS1","text":"Gift of life → rejection of the claim to gratuity → demand for the counter-gift.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:FGS2","text":"Counter-gift → obligation to keep the promises of life → noble speech.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:FGS3","text":"Gift of enjoyment as the condition of enjoyment → exclusion of one-sided enjoyment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:FGS4","text":"Shamefulness of enjoyment and innocence → prohibition of seeking them → opening of the search for guilt and pain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:FGS5","text":"Order of reciprocity → moral separation of noble soul and rabble → affirmation of life as obligatory self-devotion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:AF1","text":"Free entitlement to life → life as gift → counter-gift as duty → keeping life's promises → pleasure only through counter-gift → non-pursuit of pleasure and innocence → pursuit of guilt and pain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:ME1","text":"Life is remapped from an available good into an obligating gift.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:ME2","text":"Pleasure is reclassified from an end into a derivative consequence of one's own gift.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:ME3","text":"Innocence is shifted from the domain of intentional production into the domain of the unseekable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:ME4","text":"Guilt and pain are recoded from mere negatives into preferred objects of active pursuit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:ME5","text":"The opposition between rabble and noble soul is mapped as the opposition between desire for gratuity and reciprocal obligation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Pleasure, innocence, guilt, and pain are ordered according to their respective seekability and legitimacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** The relation to life is mediated through gift, counter-gift, claim, and guilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Affirmation of life is reframed against passive appropriation and immediate satisfaction of needs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** The life that is given subsequently generates an obligation to fulfill its promises.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from the gift of life to the counter-gift and to the pursuit of guilt and pain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is what the concrete counter-gift to life and the keeping of its promises consist in.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as pleasure is understood both as unseekable and as conditioned by counter-gift.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:MRT4","text":"The strongest connection exists between the gift of life, counter-gift, and the rejection of free entitlement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:MRT5","text":"A tension remains between the assertion that pleasure should not be sought and the normative injunction to seek guilt and pain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:MRT6","text":"A further tension arises from the fact that life appears both as gift and as an obligating creditor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_2:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the text insofar as the concluding turn is read not as a resolution, but as an inversion of the order of value and pursuit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_5C_2@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_5C_2:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On Old and New Tablets","source_section_label":"5.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 5","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","5."],"original_title":"5."}],"source_title_context":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln","source_section_label":"5.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 5","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","5."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 86","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 5","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln · 5"},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2","layer":"CH","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 6","order":87,"parents":["RAW_97E9_6C_2"],"revision":"CH_97E9_6C_2@R001","sha256":"362ca18890d03a05aeea9196bb992691b569a0e056b5a0e5a99e9cb794f318aa","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:AS1","text":"Das zentrale Problem ist die Stellung des „Erstlings“ innerhalb einer von alten Opferordnungen bestimmten Gegenwart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:AS2","text":"Der „Erstling“ wird als dasjenige bestimmt, was gerade aufgrund seiner Neuheit und seines Besten geopfert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:AS3","text":"Die Brüder erkennen sich als kollektiv in geheime Opferhandlungen und in den Dienst alter Götzen gestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:AS4","text":"Die Opferordnung wirkt nicht nur äußerlich, sondern durch einen im Selbst fortbestehenden „alten Götzenpriester“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:AS5","text":"Die bejahte Antwort besteht nicht in Selbsterhaltung, sondern in der Liebe zu den Untergehenden als Übergang über die bestehende Form hinaus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:A1","text":"Der Erstling wird immer geopfert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:A2","text":"Die gegenwärtigen Brüder sind Erstlinge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:A3","text":"Die Erstlinge bluten an verborgenen Opferstätten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:A4","text":"Die Opferhandlung dient weiterhin alten Götzenbildern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:A5","text":"Das Beste der Erstlinge ist jung, zart und noch nicht verhärtet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:A6","text":"Das Junge und Beste reizt die alten Götzenpriester.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:A7","text":"Der alte Götzenpriester wohnt innerhalb der Opfernden selbst fort.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:A8","text":"Die Opferordnung entspricht der eigenen Art der Erstlinge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:A9","text":"Selbsterhaltung ist nicht die höchste Bestimmung des Erstlings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:A10","text":"Die Untergehenden gehen hinüber.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:NX1","text":"Der Erstling ist nicht durch Bewahrung bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:NX2","text":"Das Opfer ist nicht auf sichtbare oder ausdrücklich benannte Altäre beschränkt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:NX3","text":"Die Opfernden sind nicht frei von der alten Opferinstanz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:NX4","text":"Das Beste ist nicht geschützt, nur weil es das Beste ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:NX5","text":"Untergang ist nicht als bloßes Ende bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:D1","text":"Die Identität als Erstling macht Opferbarkeit zur gemeinsamen Lage der Brüder.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_2:A1","CH_97E9_6C_2:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:D2","text":"Die gegenwärtige Gemeinschaft reproduziert die alten Götzen, indem sie ihr Junges und Bestes zum Opfer macht.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_2:A3","CH_97E9_6C_2:A4","CH_97E9_6C_2:A5","CH_97E9_6C_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:D3","text":"Die Opferordnung erhält sich durch eine verinnerlichte Instanz, die im Selbst das eigene Beste zur Speise macht.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_2:A6","CH_97E9_6C_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:D4","text":"Die Opferung ist nicht bloß erlittenes Schicksal, sondern wird als Ausdruck der eigenen Art anerkannt.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_2:A1","CH_97E9_6C_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:D5","text":"Die Verweigerung der Selbsterhaltung wird zur Bedingung des Übergangs.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_2:A9","CH_97E9_6C_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:SD1","text":"Erneuerung erscheint als Prozess, in dem das Neue zunächst von den alten Formen konsumiert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:SD2","text":"Die äußerlich bekämpfte Opferordnung wird durch ihre Verinnerlichung im Subjekt reproduziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:SD3","text":"Der Übergang verlangt nicht die Rettung des gegenwärtigen Selbst, sondern dessen Preisgabe als Erstlingsform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:SD4","text":"Opfer, Selbstüberwindung und Übergang werden in eine einzige generative Bewegung verschaltet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:DNX1","text":"Falsch ist die Annahme, dass das Neue sich durch bloße Neuheit vor den alten Mächten schützen könne.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein vollständig äußerer Gegner; die alte Opferinstanz ist im Subjekt selbst wirksam.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:DNX3","text":"Disqualifiziert ist die Vorstellung, dass das Beste durch Bewahrung erhalten werden müsse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Kontinuität, in der die bestehende Form ohne Opfer, Untergang oder Übergang fortbesteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:SNX1","text":"Unverfügbar ist eine Zukunft, die das Neue unmittelbar außerhalb der alten Opferlogik entstehen lässt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:SNX2","text":"Versperrt ist die Möglichkeit einer reinen Emanzipation vom alten Götzenpriester, solange dieser im Selbst fortlebt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:SNX3","text":"Nicht zulässig ist eine Ethik der Selbsterhaltung als Grundlage des Übergangs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:SNX4","text":"Die verdrängte Abwesenheit eines nicht-opferförmigen Übergangs organisiert die gesamte Argumentation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:FGS1","text":"Erstlingsstatus → grundsätzliche Opferbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:FGS2","text":"Gemeinsamer Erstlingsstatus → kollektive Einordnung in geheime Opferpraktiken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:FGS3","text":"Jugend und Bestheit → Begehrlichkeit für alte Götzenmächte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:FGS4","text":"Äußere Opferordnung + verinnerlichter Götzenpriester → Selbstreproduktion des Opfers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:FGS5","text":"Anerkennung der eigenen Opferart → Aufhebung der bloßen Opferpassivität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:FGS6","text":"Verzicht auf Selbsterhaltung → Untergang als Übergang.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:FGS7","text":"Untergang als Übergang → affirmative Liebe zu den Untergehenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:AF1","text":"Erstlingsstatus → Opfergesetz → kollektive Selbstidentifikation → Verinnerlichung des alten Priesters → Anerkennung der eigenen Opferart → Absage an Selbsterhaltung → Untergang → Hinübergehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:ME1","text":"Das Verhältnis von Täter und Opfer wird neu kartiert: Die Opfernden sind zugleich Träger der alten Opferinstanz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:ME2","text":"Das Beste wird nicht länger als zu bewahrender Besitz, sondern als bevorzugtes Material des Übergangs klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:ME3","text":"Untergang wird vom bloßen Verlust zum Richtungsbegriff des Hinübergehens umcodiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:ME4","text":"Selbsterhaltung und Zukunftsfähigkeit werden als gegensätzliche, nicht als gleichgerichtete Optionen angeordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:ME5","text":"Die Opposition zwischen äußerem Zwang und innerer Freiheit bricht zusammen, weil der Zwang im Selbst fortbesteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:ALT1","text":"Surface — Die Erstlinge werden geopfert, weil ihr junges und bestes Fleisch alte Götzenpriester anzieht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:ALT2","text":"Structural — Eine alte Opferordnung reproduziert sich durch die gemeinschaftliche und innere Zurichtung des Neuen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Widerstand wird nicht als Selbsterhaltung, sondern als Bejahung des Untergangs und des Übergangs gerahmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Das Neue kann nur als zu opfernde Zwischenform erscheinen; seine Zeitlichkeit ist auf ein Hinübergehen über die gegenwärtige Gestalt ausgerichtet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von Erstlingsstatus über Opferung bis zum Hinübergehen zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, worin das „Hinübergehen“ konkret besteht und welche neue Form daraus hervorgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:MRT3","text":"Intern kohärent ist die Struktur, sofern Opferung als notwendige Übergangsbedingung und nicht nur als äußere Gewalt verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Verbindung liegt in der Kopplung von äußerer Opferordnung und innerem Götzenpriester.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:MRT5","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen der Behauptung unvermeidlicher Opferung und der affirmativen Liebe zu den Untergehenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung entsteht daraus, dass die eigene Art die Opferung begründet, obwohl diese zugleich als Wirkung alter Götzenmächte erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, solange sie den Übergang nicht als erreichbares Ziel, sondern als durch Untergang erzeugte Richtung behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T192059262991Z_d9b0b8cc","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"6.","source_sha256":"362ca18890d03a05aeea9196bb992691b569a0e056b5a0e5a99e9cb794f318aa","sha256":"ccc3d6bfa70ffeaef092e723f47ea7147a46c9eea55e2880d45b5ffb4a84e1a2","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:20:59.265580+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:AS1","text":"The central problem is the position of the “firstling” within a present determined by old sacrificial orders.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:AS2","text":"The “firstling” is determined as that which is sacrificed precisely on account of its newness and its being the best.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:AS3","text":"The brothers recognize themselves as collectively placed within secret sacrificial acts and in the service of old idols.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:AS4","text":"The sacrificial order operates not only externally, but through an “old idol-priest” persisting within the self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:AS5","text":"The affirmative response consists not in self-preservation, but in love for those who are perishing as a transition beyond the existing form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:A1","text":"The firstling is always sacrificed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:A2","text":"The present brothers are firstlings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:A3","text":"The firstlings bleed at hidden sites of sacrifice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:A4","text":"The sacrificial act continues to serve old idols.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:A5","text":"What is best in the firstlings is young, tender, and not yet hardened.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:A6","text":"The young and the best entice the old idol-priests.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:A7","text":"The old idol-priest continues to dwell within the sacrificers themselves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:A8","text":"The sacrificial order corresponds to the firstlings’ own kind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:A9","text":"Self-preservation is not the highest determination of the firstling.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:A10","text":"Those who are perishing pass over.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:NX1","text":"The firstling is not determined by preservation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:NX2","text":"Sacrifice is not restricted to visible or expressly named altars.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:NX3","text":"The sacrificers are not free of the old sacrificial instance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:NX4","text":"What is best is not protected merely because it is the best.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:NX5","text":"Perishing is not determined as a mere end.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:D1","text":"Identity as a firstling makes sacrificability the brothers’ shared condition.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_2:A1","CH_97E9_6C_2:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:D2","text":"The present community reproduces the old idols by making its young and best into a sacrifice.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_2:A3","CH_97E9_6C_2:A4","CH_97E9_6C_2:A5","CH_97E9_6C_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:D3","text":"The sacrificial order sustains itself through an internalized instance that within the self makes its own best into food.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_2:A6","CH_97E9_6C_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:D4","text":"Sacrificing is not merely a fate suffered, but is recognized as an expression of one’s own kind.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_2:A1","CH_97E9_6C_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:D5","text":"The refusal of self-preservation becomes a condition of transition.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_2:A9","CH_97E9_6C_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:SD1","text":"Renewal appears as a process in which the new is initially consumed by the old forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:SD2","text":"The sacrificial order combated externally is reproduced through its internalization in the subject.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:SD3","text":"Transition requires not the salvation of the present self, but its relinquishment as a firstling-form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:SD4","text":"Sacrifice, self-overcoming, and transition are interconnected in a single generative movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:DNX1","text":"False is the assumption that the new could protect itself against the old powers through mere newness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:DNX2","text":"A wholly external opponent is excluded; the old sacrificial instance is active within the subject itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:DNX3","text":"Disqualified is the notion that what is best must be preserved through preservation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a continuity in which the existing form persists without sacrifice, perishing, or transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:SNX1","text":"Unavailable is a future that allows the new to emerge immediately outside the old logic of sacrifice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:SNX2","text":"Barred is the possibility of a pure emancipation from the old idol-priest, so long as it lives on within the self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:SNX3","text":"An ethics of self-preservation as the basis of transition is inadmissible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:SNX4","text":"The repressed absence of a non-sacrificial transition organizes the entire argumentation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:FGS1","text":"Firstling status → fundamental sacrificability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:FGS2","text":"Shared firstling status → collective placement within secret sacrificial practices.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:FGS3","text":"Youth and being the best → desirability for old idolatrous powers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:FGS4","text":"External sacrificial order + internalized idol-priest → self-reproduction of sacrifice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:FGS5","text":"Recognition of one’s own sacrificial kind → sublation of mere sacrificial passivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:FGS6","text":"Renunciation of self-preservation → perishing as transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:FGS7","text":"Perishing as transition → affirmative love for those who are perishing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:AF1","text":"Firstling status → law of sacrifice → collective self-identification → internalization of the old priest → recognition of one’s own sacrificial kind → renunciation of self-preservation → perishing → passing over.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:ME1","text":"The relation between perpetrator and victim is remapped: the sacrificers are at the same time bearers of the old sacrificial instance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:ME2","text":"What is best is no longer classified as a possession to be preserved, but as the preferred material of transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:ME3","text":"Perishing is recoded from mere loss into a directional concept of passing over.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:ME4","text":"Self-preservation and capacity for the future are arranged as opposed, rather than as aligned, options.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:ME5","text":"The opposition between external compulsion and inner freedom collapses because the compulsion persists within the self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:ALT1","text":"Surface — The firstlings are sacrificed because their young and best flesh attracts old idol-priests.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:ALT2","text":"Structural — An old sacrificial order reproduces itself through the communal and inner conditioning of the new.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Resistance is framed not as self-preservation, but as affirmation of perishing and transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The new can appear only as an intermediate form to be sacrificed; its temporality is oriented toward a passing over beyond the present shape.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from firstling status through sacrifice to passing over.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is what the “passing over” concretely consists in and what new form emerges from it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as sacrifice is understood as a necessary condition of transition and not merely as external violence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:MRT4","text":"Its strongest connection lies in the coupling of external sacrificial order and inner idol-priest.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:MRT5","text":"A tension remains between the assertion of unavoidable sacrifice and affirmative love for those who are perishing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:MRT6","text":"A further tension arises from the fact that one’s own kind grounds sacrifice, although this simultaneously appears as an effect of old idolatrous powers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_2:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement so long as it treats transition not as an attainable goal, but as a direction generated through perishing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_6C_2@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_6C_2:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On Old and New Tablets","source_section_label":"6.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 6","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","6."],"original_title":"6."}],"source_title_context":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln","source_section_label":"6.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 6","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","6."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 87","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 6","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln · 6"},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2","layer":"CH","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 7","order":88,"parents":["RAW_97E9_7C_2"],"revision":"CH_97E9_7C_2@R001","sha256":"c57722e0d0a58ba3057549d425e5a0e57b45cc1322436799f8f11aeda90a5245","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:AS1","text":"Wahrheitsfähigkeit ist selten und selbst bei den Fähigen nicht notwendig mit Wahrheitswillen verbunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:AS2","text":"Das moralisch Gute wird als Krankheit des Geistes bestimmt, weil es Nachgeben, Gehorsam und den Verlust des Selbsthörens erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:AS3","text":"Wahrheit entsteht nicht aus moralischer Reinheit, sondern aus der Vereinigung der vom Guten verworfenen Kräfte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:AS4","text":"Misstrauen, Wagnis, Verneinung, Überdruss und Verletzung bilden die seltene produktive Konstellation der Wahrheitszeugung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:AS5","text":"Erkenntnis ist historisch an das schlechte Gewissen und an die Zerstörung überlieferter Tafeln gebunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:AS6","text":"Die Bewegung des Arguments verläuft von der Entlarvung des Guten als Wahrheitshemmnis zur genealogischen Bestimmung einer destruktiv erzeugten Wahrheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:A1","text":"Nur Wenige können wahr sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:A2","text":"Wahrheitsfähigkeit und Wahrheitswille fallen nicht notwendig zusammen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:A3","text":"Das moralisch Gute erzeugt Nachgeben, Ergebung und Gehorsam.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:A4","text":"Wer gehorcht, hört sich selbst nicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:A5","text":"Das Gute bezeichnet bestimmte wahrheitsproduktive Kräfte als böse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:A6","text":"Wahrheit wird durch die Vereinigung dieser ausgeschlossenen Kräfte erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:A7","text":"Wagnis, langes Misstrauen, grausames Nein, Überdruss und das Schneiden ins Lebendige sind Bedingungen der Wahrheitszeugung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:A8","text":"Diese Bedingungen treten nur selten gemeinsam auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:A9","text":"Wissen wächst neben dem schlechten Gewissen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:A10","text":"Die alten Tafeln müssen zerbrochen werden, damit Erkenntnis sich gegen überlieferte Wertordnungen eröffnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:NX1","text":"Wahrheit ist nicht das Ergebnis moralischer Güte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:NX2","text":"Wahrheit ist nicht mit Nachgeben, Ergebung oder Gehorsam identisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:NX3","text":"Selbstverlust gilt nicht als Erkenntnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:NX4","text":"Die vom Guten als böse bezeichneten Kräfte sind nicht wahrheitswidrig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:NX5","text":"Überlieferte Tafeln besitzen keine unangreifbare Geltung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:NX6","text":"Wissen entsteht nicht unabhängig vom schlechten Gewissen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:NX7","text":"Die Wahrheit folgt nicht aus einer harmonischen oder schonenden Haltung gegenüber dem Lebendigen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:D1","text":"Die moralisch Guten sind gerade aufgrund ihrer habituellen Unterwerfung besonders ungeeignet, Wahrheit hervorzubringen.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_2:A1","CH_97E9_7C_2:A2","CH_97E9_7C_2:A3","CH_97E9_7C_2:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:D2","text":"Die Wahrheit entsteht aus einer Rekombination dessen, was die bestehende Moral voneinander trennt und als böse disqualifiziert.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_2:A5","CH_97E9_7C_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:D3","text":"Wahrheitsproduktion verlangt eine Haltung, die zugleich riskiert, misstraut, verneint, sich überdrüssig wird und verletzend eingreift.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_2:A6","CH_97E9_7C_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:D4","text":"Die Seltenheit der Wahrheit erklärt sich aus der seltenen Gleichzeitigkeit ihrer widersprüchlich wirkenden Voraussetzungen.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_2:A7","CH_97E9_7C_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:D5","text":"Erkenntnis erscheint als Prozess der Gewissenskrise und der Zerstörung normativer Überlieferung.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_2:A9","CH_97E9_7C_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:SD1","text":"Wahrheit wird als agonistischer Erzeugungsvorgang und nicht als Besitz moralisch vorbildlicher Subjekte bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_2:A1","CH_97E9_7C_2:A5","CH_97E9_7C_2:A6","CH_97E9_7C_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:SD2","text":"Das moralische Ordnungssystem fungiert als epistemische Sperre, indem es die für Wahrheit erforderlichen Kräfte vorab als böse ausschließt.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_2:A3","CH_97E9_7C_2:A5","CH_97E9_7C_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:SD3","text":"Erkenntnis verlangt eine Umkehrung der Wertkartierung: Das Ausgeschlossene wird zur Bedingung, das Anerkannte zum Hindernis.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_2:A5","CH_97E9_7C_2:A6","CH_97E9_7C_2:A9","CH_97E9_7C_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:SD4","text":"Der Bruch mit den alten Tafeln ist nicht bloß eine Korrektur einzelner Werte, sondern eine Neuordnung der Bedingungen, unter denen Wahrheit überhaupt erzeugbar wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_2:A6","CH_97E9_7C_2:A7","CH_97E9_7C_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass Wahrheit aus freiwilliger Anpassung an eine geltende Moral hervorgehen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:DNX2","text":"Es disqualifiziert die Annahme, dass Gehorsam eine gesteigerte Form des Selbstbezugs oder der Selbsterkenntnis sei.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:DNX3","text":"Es verwirft die Vorstellung, dass Erkenntnis durch Schonung, moralische Unschuld oder intakte Überlieferung gesichert werde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:DNX4","text":"Es setzt voraus, dass gesellschaftliche Wertungen die epistemische Funktion von Kräften verkennen können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:DNX5","text":"Es schließt eine Wahrheit aus, die unabhängig von Krise, Schuld, Misstrauen und Wertzerstörung verfügbar wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:SNX1","text":"Die Wahrheit ist um die Abwesenheit eines ungebrochenen, moralisch guten und zugleich selbsthörenden Subjekts organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:SNX2","text":"Die versperrte Möglichkeit einer konfliktfreien Erkenntnis verleiht der destruktiven Konstellation ihre Notwendigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:SNX3","text":"Unzulässig wird eine Welt, in der die bestehenden Tafeln zugleich moralische Ordnung und epistemische Grundlage bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:SNX4","text":"Das Argument benötigt die Abwesenheit einer neutralen Instanz, die Wahrheit ohne Selbstgefährdung, Negation und Bruch hervorbringen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:FGS1","text":"Moralische Güte → Nachgeben und Gehorsam → Verlust des Selbsthörens → Blockierung der Wahrheitsfähigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:FGS2","text":"Moralische Ausschließung des Bösen → Isolierung wahrheitsproduktiver Kräfte → notwendige Rekombination dieser Kräfte → Geburt einer Wahrheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:FGS3","text":"Wagnis + Misstrauen + Nein + Überdruss + Verletzung → seltene Konstellation → Wahrheitszeugung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:FGS4","text":"Schlechtes Gewissen → Erkenntnisbildung neben der Schuld → Bruch mit alten Tafeln → Neuordnung der Wahrheitsbedingungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:FGS5","text":"Umwertung des Guten und Bösen → Verschiebung der epistemischen Funktion → Wahrheit als Produkt wertwidriger Kräfte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:AF1","text":"Seltenheit der Wahrheitsfähigkeit → Entkopplung von Fähigkeit und Wille → Demontage der moralischen Guten → Gehorsam als Selbstverlust → Vereinigung des ausgeschlossenen Bösen → destruktive Wahrheitszeugung → Zerbrechen der alten Tafeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:ME1","text":"Das Gute wird von einer moralischen Eigenschaft zu einem Mechanismus epistemischer Unterwerfung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:ME2","text":"Das Böse wird von einem moralischen Ausschlussbegriff zu einer Sammelbezeichnung für wahrheitsproduktive Kräfte umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:ME3","text":"Wahrheit wird vom Besitz einer Tugend zur seltenen Konstellation widersprüchlicher, selbstgefährdender Operationen umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:ME4","text":"Das schlechte Gewissen wird von einem Defekt moralischer Subjektivität zu einer Bedingung der Erkenntnisbildung verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:ME5","text":"Das Zerbrechen der Tafeln wird von bloßer Negation zur epistemischen Voraussetzung einer neuen Wert- und Wahrheitsordnung transformiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Gegensatz zwischen guten Menschen und wahrheitsfähigen Menschen wird zugespitzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:ALT2","text":"Structural — Moralische Anpassung organisiert Gehorsam, Selbstverlust und den Ausschluss bestimmter Erkenntniskräfte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Erkenntnis wird durch eine Umkehrung der moralischen Wertungen und durch den Bruch mit überlieferten Tafeln strategisch neu eröffnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Wahrheit erscheint als werdendes Erzeugnis einer seltenen Konstellation; Wissen wächst historisch neben dem schlechten Gewissen und gegen alte Tafeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die zentrale Bewegung von moralischer Güte als Hemmung zu destruktiv erzeugter Wahrheit zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie die heterogenen Kräfte praktisch zu einer einzigen Wahrheit zusammenwirken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Wahrheit als Erzeugnis und nicht als vorausliegender Bestand verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung besteht zwischen Gehorsam, Selbstverlust und der epistemischen Sperrfunktion des Guten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:MRT5","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen der Singularität der erzeugten Wahrheit und der Vielheit ihrer konflikthaften Bedingungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung liegt zwischen dem schlechten Gewissen als Erkenntnisbedingung und dem nicht ausgeführten Mechanismus seiner produktiven Wirkung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, sofern die Imperative zum Zerbrechen der Tafeln als Konsequenz der Diagnose und nicht als unabhängige Handlungsanweisung gelesen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T192336360622Z_6724d398","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"7.","source_sha256":"c57722e0d0a58ba3057549d425e5a0e57b45cc1322436799f8f11aeda90a5245","sha256":"1eb48cfe853f8e6604443235252c15b9777d026d849cb54767f9768359951b9d","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:23:36.361548+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:AS1","text":"Capacity for truth is rare and, even among those capable of it, is not necessarily connected with the will to truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:AS2","text":"The morally good is determined as a sickness of the spirit because it produces yielding, obedience, and the loss of self-hearing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:AS3","text":"Truth arises not from moral purity, but from the union of the forces rejected by the good.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:AS4","text":"Distrust, risk, negation, surfeit, and injury constitute the rare productive constellation of truth-generation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:AS5","text":"Knowledge is historically bound to bad conscience and to the destruction of inherited tablets.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:AS6","text":"The movement of the argument proceeds from the unmasking of the good as an impediment to truth to the genealogical determination of a destructively generated truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:A1","text":"Only few can be true.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:A2","text":"Capacity for truth and will to truth do not necessarily coincide.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:A3","text":"The morally good produces yielding, submission, and obedience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:A4","text":"Whoever obeys does not hear himself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:A5","text":"The good designates certain truth-productive forces as evil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:A6","text":"Truth is generated through the union of these excluded forces.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:A7","text":"Risk, long distrust, a cruel No, surfeit, and cutting into the living are conditions of truth-generation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:A8","text":"These conditions occur together only rarely.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:A9","text":"Knowledge grows alongside bad conscience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:A10","text":"The old tablets must be broken so that knowledge may open itself against inherited orders of value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:NX1","text":"Truth is not the result of moral goodness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:NX2","text":"Truth is not identical with yielding, submission, or obedience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:NX3","text":"Loss of self does not count as knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:NX4","text":"The forces designated as evil by the good are not inimical to truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:NX5","text":"Inherited tablets possess no inviolable validity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:NX6","text":"Knowledge does not arise independently of bad conscience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:NX7","text":"Truth does not follow from a harmonious or sparing attitude toward the living.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:D1","text":"Precisely on account of their habitual submission, the morally good are especially unsuited to bring forth truth.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_2:A1","CH_97E9_7C_2:A2","CH_97E9_7C_2:A3","CH_97E9_7C_2:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:D2","text":"Truth arises from a recombination of what existing morality separates from one another and disqualifies as evil.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_2:A5","CH_97E9_7C_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:D3","text":"Truth-production requires an attitude that simultaneously takes risks, distrusts, negates, becomes surfeited, and intervenes injuriously.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_2:A6","CH_97E9_7C_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:D4","text":"The rarity of truth is explained by the rare simultaneity of its apparently contradictory presuppositions.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_2:A7","CH_97E9_7C_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:D5","text":"Knowledge appears as a process of crisis of conscience and the destruction of normative tradition.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_2:A9","CH_97E9_7C_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:SD1","text":"Truth is determined as an agonistic process of generation and not as the possession of morally exemplary subjects.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_2:A1","CH_97E9_7C_2:A5","CH_97E9_7C_2:A6","CH_97E9_7C_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:SD2","text":"The moral order-system functions as an epistemic barrier by preemptively excluding as evil the forces required for truth.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_2:A3","CH_97E9_7C_2:A5","CH_97E9_7C_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:SD3","text":"Knowledge requires a reversal of the mapping of values: the excluded becomes the condition, the recognized becomes the obstacle.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_2:A5","CH_97E9_7C_2:A6","CH_97E9_7C_2:A9","CH_97E9_7C_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:SD4","text":"The break with the old tablets is not merely a correction of individual values, but a reordering of the conditions under which truth can be generated at all.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_2:A6","CH_97E9_7C_2:A7","CH_97E9_7C_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:DNX1","text":"The system excludes the possibility that truth can emerge from voluntary adaptation to a prevailing morality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:DNX2","text":"It disqualifies the assumption that obedience is an intensified form of self-relation or self-knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:DNX3","text":"It rejects the idea that knowledge is secured through sparingness, moral innocence, or intact tradition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:DNX4","text":"It presupposes that social valuations can misrecognize the epistemic function of forces.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:DNX5","text":"It excludes a truth that would be available independently of crisis, guilt, distrust, and the destruction of values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:SNX1","text":"Truth is organized around the absence of an unbroken, morally good, and simultaneously self-hearing subject.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:SNX2","text":"The barred possibility of conflict-free knowledge confers its necessity upon the destructive constellation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:SNX3","text":"A world in which the existing tablets remain at once moral order and epistemic foundation becomes inadmissible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:SNX4","text":"The argument requires the absence of a neutral instance capable of bringing forth truth without self-endangerment, negation, and rupture.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:FGS1","text":"Moral goodness → yielding and obedience → loss of self-hearing → blockage of the capacity for truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:FGS2","text":"Moral exclusion of evil → isolation of truth-productive forces → necessary recombination of these forces → birth of a truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:FGS3","text":"Risk + distrust + No + surfeit + injury → rare constellation → truth-generation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:FGS4","text":"Bad conscience → formation of knowledge alongside guilt → break with old tablets → reordering of the conditions of truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:FGS5","text":"Revaluation of good and evil → displacement of epistemic function → truth as product of forces contrary to value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:AF1","text":"Rarity of the capacity for truth → decoupling of capacity and will → dismantling of the morally good → obedience as loss of self → union of excluded evil → destructive truth-generation → breaking of the old tablets.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:ME1","text":"The good is remapped from a moral quality into a mechanism of epistemic subjugation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:ME2","text":"Evil is reclassified from a moral term of exclusion into a collective designation for truth-productive forces.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:ME3","text":"Truth is remapped from the possession of a virtue into the rare constellation of contradictory, self-endangering operations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:ME4","text":"Bad conscience is displaced from a defect of moral subjectivity into a condition of the formation of knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:ME5","text":"The breaking of the tablets is transformed from mere negation into the epistemic precondition of a new order of value and truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:ALT1","text":"Surface — The opposition between good people and people capable of truth is sharpened.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:ALT2","text":"Structural — Moral adaptation organizes obedience, loss of self, and the exclusion of certain forces of knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Knowledge is strategically reopened through a reversal of moral valuations and through the break with inherited tablets.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Truth appears as the becoming product of a rare constellation; knowledge grows historically alongside bad conscience and against old tablets.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the central movement from moral goodness as impediment to destructively generated truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is how the heterogeneous forces practically work together toward a single truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as truth is understood as a product rather than as a preexisting stock.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:MRT4","text":"The strongest connection lies between obedience, loss of self, and the epistemic barrier-function of the good.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:MRT5","text":"A tension remains between the singularity of the generated truth and the plurality of its conflictual conditions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:MRT6","text":"A further tension lies between bad conscience as a condition of knowledge and the undeveloped mechanism of its productive effect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_2:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement insofar as the imperatives to break the tablets are read as a consequence of the diagnosis and not as an independent instruction for action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_7C_2@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_7C_2:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On Old and New Tablets","source_section_label":"7.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 7","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","7."],"original_title":"7."}],"source_title_context":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln","source_section_label":"7.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 7","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","7."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 88","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 7","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln · 7"},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3","layer":"CH","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 8","order":89,"parents":["RAW_97E9_8C_3"],"revision":"CH_97E9_8C_3@R001","sha256":"49ba204470007e2c640a6bf6b313e2d0309301c72b8ea4a16102d00d8c68004a","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:AS1","text":"Das Problem entsteht aus dem Widerspruch zwischen der Lehre vom ständigen Fluss und der sichtbaren Festigkeit von Balken, Stegen, Geländern und Werten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:AS2","text":"Die scheinbare Festigkeit wird als situationsgebundene Ordnung und nicht als endgültiger Grund der Dinge neu bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:AS3","text":"Der Winter fungiert als Gegenmacht, die den Fluss stillzustellen und jede Veränderung zu suspendieren scheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:AS4","text":"Der Thauwind zerstört die winterliche Fixierung, indem er das Eis bricht und dadurch die getragenen Ordnungen mitreißt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:AS5","text":"Die Bewegung führt von der Wahrnehmung fester Formen über deren zeitliche Suspendierung zu ihrer Auflösung und zur erneuten Freisetzung des Flusses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:A1","text":"Die sichtbare Welt enthält dauerhafte oder dauerhaft erscheinende Formen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:A2","text":"Brücken, Begriffe sowie „Gut“ und „Böse“ werden als über dem Fluss errichtete Ordnungen behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:A3","text":"Die Lehre „Alles ist im Fluss“ wird durch fest erscheinende Gegenstände unmittelbar unglaubwürdig gemacht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:A4","text":"Festigkeit ist keine absolute Eigenschaft, sondern hängt von Bedingungen und Zeiten ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:A5","text":"Der harte Winter erzeugt den Anschein, dass im Grunde alles stillsteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:A6","text":"Die winterliche Stillstellung dient als Trost und als Lehre unfruchtbarer Zeiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:A7","text":"Der Thauwind ist eine zerstörerische Gegenkraft zur winterlichen Fixierung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:A8","text":"Das Brechen des Eises zerstört die Stege, die auf ihm oder an ihm haften.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:A9","text":"Mit dem Einsturz der Stege verlieren auch feste Geländer und Wertordnungen ihre Haltbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:A10","text":"Die erneute Bewegung des Flusses macht die Geltung von „Gut“ und „Böse“ prekär.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:NX1","text":"Der Fluss ist nicht durch die bloße Sichtbarkeit von Balken, Stegen oder Geländern widerlegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:NX2","text":"Festigkeit ist nicht mit einem unveränderlichen Grund der Wirklichkeit gleichzusetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:NX3","text":"Die winterliche Ruhe ist nicht die endgültige Wahrheit über das Sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:NX4","text":"Begriffe und Werte sind nicht unabhängig von den Bedingungen, die sie tragen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:NX5","text":"„Gut“ und „Böse“ sind keine unangreifbaren Geländer gegen Veränderung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:NX6","text":"Der Trost der Stillstellung ist keine Widerlegung der kommenden Bewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:D1","text":"Die scheinbare Widerlegung des Flusses beruht auf der Verwechslung lokaler Festigkeit mit ontologischer Unveränderlichkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_3:A1","CH_97E9_8C_3:A3","CH_97E9_8C_3:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:D2","text":"Der Winter verwandelt eine vorläufige Ordnung in die Vorstellung eines stillstehenden Grundes.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_3:A4","CH_97E9_8C_3:A5","CH_97E9_8C_3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:D3","text":"Der Thauwind macht sichtbar, dass die winterliche Festigkeit von einer reversiblen Bedingung abhängt.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_3:A5","CH_97E9_8C_3:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:D4","text":"Das Brechen des Eises zieht die Zerstörung der darauf beruhenden Übergangsformen nach sich.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_3:A7","CH_97E9_8C_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:D5","text":"Der Zusammenbruch materieller Stege setzt die symbolische Stabilität von Begriffen und Werten außer Kraft.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_3:A2","CH_97E9_8C_3:A8","CH_97E9_8C_3:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:D6","text":"Die Wiederaufnahme des Flusses erzeugt nicht bloß Bewegung, sondern eine Krise der Wertunterscheidungen.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_3:A9","CH_97E9_8C_3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:SD1","text":"Jede Ordnung, die sich als fest erweist, bleibt der Möglichkeit ihrer zeitlichen Umkehr ausgesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:SD2","text":"Stillstand erscheint als saisonale oder affektive Konstruktion und nicht als letzter Zustand der Wirklichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:SD3","text":"Die Zerstörung der tragenden Bedingungen einer Ordnung zerstört zugleich deren begriffliche und normative Selbstverständlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:SD4","text":"Der Fluss wird nicht als kontinuierliche Oberfläche, sondern als wiederkehrende Macht der Entsicherung von Formen bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:SD5","text":"Die Bewegung vom Winter zum Thauwind verwandelt eine ontologische Behauptung in einen Konflikt zwischen konkurrierenden Zuständen und Kräften.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt die Annahme aus, dass sichtbare Dauer den eigentlichen Charakter der Wirklichkeit erschöpft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:DNX2","text":"Es schließt die Gleichsetzung von zeitweiliger Stabilität und ursprünglicher Stillheit aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:DNX3","text":"Es schließt ein Modell aus, in dem Begriffe und Werte unabhängig von materiellen und zeitlichen Trägern bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:DNX4","text":"Es schließt die Vorstellung aus, dass Trost, Gewohnheit oder Überlieferung einer Ordnung ontologische Geltung verleihen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:DNX5","text":"Es schließt eine Opposition aus, in der Bewegung bloß äußerlich und Festigkeit innerlich wahr wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird ein endgültiger Grund, der dem Werden entzogen und durch keine Gegenkraft gefährdet ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Verfügbarkeit eines stabilen normativen Haltepunkts außerhalb der wechselnden Kräfte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Möglichkeit, dass eine Ordnung ihre eigene Tragfähigkeit dauerhaft garantiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:SNX4","text":"Die organisierende Abwesenheit ist ein letzter Halt, an dem weder Fluss noch Zerstörung wirksam werden könnten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:FGS1","text":"Sichtbare Festigkeit → Einwand gegen den Fluss → Reduktion der Festigkeit auf eine bedingte Erscheinung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:FGS2","text":"Winterliche Kälte → Suspension der Bewegung → Verwandlung der Suspension in die Lehre „Im Grunde steht Alles still“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:FGS3","text":"Thauwind → Brechen des Eises → Zerstörung der Stege → Verlust materieller Haltepunkte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:FGS4","text":"Verlust materieller Haltepunkte → Entsicherung von Begriffen und Werten → Krise von „Gut“ und „Böse“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:FGS5","text":"Krise der Werte → Reaktivierung der Flusslogik → Umkehrung des scheinbaren Stillstands.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:AF1","text":"Behauptete Festigkeit → scheinbare Widerlegung des Flusses → winterliche Stillstellung → Thauwind als Gegenmacht → Eisbruch → Einsturz der Stege und Geländer → Entsicherung der Werte → erneute Herrschaft des Flusses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:ME1","text":"Materielle Gegenstände werden von Beweisen gegen den Fluss zu zeitweiligen Konstruktionen innerhalb des Flusses umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:ME2","text":"Winter und Tauwetter werden als konkurrierende Ordnungsregime und nicht bloß als Wetterlagen kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:ME3","text":"Die Trennung zwischen physischer Struktur und begrifflich-normativer Struktur bricht zusammen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:ME4","text":"Werte erscheinen nicht länger als übergeordnete Maßstäbe, sondern als gefährdete Geländer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:ME5","text":"Zerstörung wird von einem bloßen Verlust zu einer Erkenntnisoperation über die Abhängigkeit von Ordnungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:ALT1","text":"Surface: Balken, Stege, Geländer, Eis, Winter und Thauwind bilden die unmittelbare Konfliktfläche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:ALT2","text":"Structural: Zeitweilige physische Träger stabilisieren Wahrnehmungen, Begriffe und Wertordnungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Die Rede vom Fluss wird gegen die rhetorische und psychische Macht der Stillstandslehre neu positioniert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Wirklichkeit wird als wechselndes Kräfteverhältnis bestimmt, in dem Stillstand eine vorläufige Phase und kein letzter Grund ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um den Übergang von scheinbarer Festigkeit über winterliche Stillstellung zur Auflösung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob der Fluss als universales Werden, als zerstörerische Kraft oder als rhetorische Gegenposition zur Stillstandslehre zu verstehen ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Festigkeit als bedingte und reversible Erscheinung behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Verbindung liegt in der Kopplung von Eisbruch, Einsturz der Stege und Krise der Werte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:MRT5","text":"Die Rekonstruktion hängt von der Übertragung materieller Zerstörung auf begriffliche und normative Ordnungen ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:MRT6","text":"Die Spannung zwischen „Alles ist im Fluss“ und der wiederholten Erfahrung von Festigkeit wird nicht aufgehoben, sondern als zeitliche und kraftförmige Oszillation organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T192547970889Z_600b017e","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"8.","source_sha256":"49ba204470007e2c640a6bf6b313e2d0309301c72b8ea4a16102d00d8c68004a","sha256":"7b771497bb1fd2c2866a123a0b36a4575ca647ae8cd2376f17dd33318e4d27ee","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:25:47.972116+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:AS1","text":"The problem arises from the contradiction between the doctrine of perpetual flux and the visible solidity of beams, footbridges, railings, and values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:AS2","text":"Apparent solidity is redefined as a situation-bound order rather than as the ultimate ground of things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:AS3","text":"Winter functions as a counterforce that seems to bring flux to a standstill and suspend every change.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:AS4","text":"The thaw wind destroys the wintry fixation by breaking the ice and thereby sweeping away the orders borne by it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:AS5","text":"The movement leads from the perception of fixed forms, through their temporal suspension, to their dissolution and the renewed release of flux.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:A1","text":"The visible world contains enduring, or enduring-seeming, forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:A2","text":"Bridges, concepts, as well as “Good” and “Evil,” are treated as orders erected above flux.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:A3","text":"The doctrine “Everything is in flux” is rendered immediately implausible by objects that appear fixed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:A4","text":"Solidity is not an absolute property but depends on conditions and times.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:A5","text":"The harsh winter produces the appearance that, fundamentally, everything stands still.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:A6","text":"The wintry immobilization serves as consolation and as a lesson of barren times.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:A7","text":"The thaw wind is a destructive counterforce to wintry fixation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:A8","text":"The breaking of the ice destroys the footbridges that adhere to it or rest upon it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:A9","text":"With the collapse of the footbridges, fixed railings and orders of value also lose their durability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:A10","text":"The renewed movement of flux renders the validity of “Good” and “Evil” precarious.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:NX1","text":"Flux is not refuted by the mere visibility of beams, footbridges, or railings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:NX2","text":"Solidity is not to be equated with an unchanging ground of reality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:NX3","text":"Wintry repose is not the ultimate truth about being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:NX4","text":"Concepts and values are not independent of the conditions that bear them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:NX5","text":"“Good” and “Evil” are not invulnerable railings against change.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:NX6","text":"The consolation of immobilization is not a refutation of the coming movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:D1","text":"The apparent refutation of flux rests on the confusion of local solidity with ontological immutability.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_3:A1","CH_97E9_8C_3:A3","CH_97E9_8C_3:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:D2","text":"Winter transforms a provisional order into the idea of a stationary ground.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_3:A4","CH_97E9_8C_3:A5","CH_97E9_8C_3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:D3","text":"The thaw wind makes visible that wintry solidity depends on a reversible condition.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_3:A5","CH_97E9_8C_3:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:D4","text":"The breaking of the ice entails the destruction of the transitional forms resting upon it.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_3:A7","CH_97E9_8C_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:D5","text":"The collapse of material footbridges invalidates the symbolic stability of concepts and values.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_3:A2","CH_97E9_8C_3:A8","CH_97E9_8C_3:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:D6","text":"The resumption of flux produces not merely movement but a crisis of distinctions of value.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_3:A9","CH_97E9_8C_3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:SD1","text":"Every order that proves fixed remains exposed to the possibility of its temporal reversal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:SD2","text":"Stasis appears as a seasonal or affective construction rather than as the final state of reality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:SD3","text":"The destruction of the supporting conditions of an order simultaneously destroys its conceptual and normative self-evidence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:SD4","text":"Flux is determined not as a continuous surface, but as a recurrent power of destabilizing forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:SD5","text":"The movement from winter to the thaw wind transforms an ontological claim into a conflict between competing states and forces.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:DNX1","text":"The system excludes the assumption that visible duration exhausts the true character of reality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:DNX2","text":"It excludes the equation of temporary stability with original stillness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:DNX3","text":"It excludes a model in which concepts and values exist independently of material and temporal supports.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:DNX4","text":"It excludes the notion that consolation, habit, or the tradition of an order confers ontological validity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:DNX5","text":"It excludes an opposition in which movement would be merely external and solidity internally true.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:SNX1","text":"Excluded is an ultimate ground withdrawn from becoming and endangered by no counterforce.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:SNX2","text":"Excluded is the availability of a stable normative point of support outside the changing forces.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:SNX3","text":"Excluded is the possibility that an order permanently guarantees its own capacity to bear.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:SNX4","text":"The organizing absence is a final hold at which neither flux nor destruction could become effective.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:FGS1","text":"Visible solidity → objection to flux → reduction of solidity to a conditioned appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:FGS2","text":"Wintry cold → suspension of movement → transformation of the suspension into the doctrine “Fundamentally, Everything stands still”.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:FGS3","text":"Thaw wind → breaking of the ice → destruction of the footbridges → loss of material points of support.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:FGS4","text":"Loss of material points of support → destabilization of concepts and values → crisis of “Good” and “Evil”.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:FGS5","text":"Crisis of values → reactivation of the logic of flux → reversal of apparent stasis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:AF1","text":"Asserted solidity → apparent refutation of flux → wintry immobilization → thaw wind as counterforce → breaking of the ice → collapse of footbridges and railings → destabilization of values → renewed dominion of flux.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:ME1","text":"Material objects are reclassified from evidence against flux into temporary constructions within flux.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:ME2","text":"Winter and thaw are mapped as competing regimes of order rather than merely as weather conditions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:ME3","text":"The separation between physical structure and conceptual-normative structure collapses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:ME4","text":"Values no longer appear as superordinate standards, but as endangered railings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:ME5","text":"Destruction changes from a mere loss into an operation of knowledge concerning the dependency of orders.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:ALT1","text":"Surface: Beams, footbridges, railings, ice, winter, and thaw wind form the immediate field of conflict.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:ALT2","text":"Structural: Temporary physical supports stabilize perceptions, concepts, and orders of value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: The discourse of flux is repositioned against the rhetorical and psychic power of the doctrine of stasis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Reality is determined as a changing relation of forces in which stasis is a provisional phase and not an ultimate ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the transition from apparent solidity through wintry immobilization to dissolution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether flux is to be understood as universal becoming, as destructive force, or as a rhetorical counterposition to the doctrine of stasis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as solidity is treated as a conditioned and reversible appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:MRT4","text":"Its strongest connection lies in the coupling of the breaking of the ice, the collapse of the footbridges, and the crisis of values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:MRT5","text":"The reconstruction depends on the transfer of material destruction to conceptual and normative orders.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_3:MRT6","text":"The tension between “Everything is in flux” and the repeated experience of solidity is not resolved but organized as a temporal and force-like oscillation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_3:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_8C_3@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_8C_3:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On Old and New Tablets","source_section_label":"8.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 8","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","8."],"original_title":"8."}],"source_title_context":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln","source_section_label":"8.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 8","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","8."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 89","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 8","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln · 8"},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4","layer":"CH","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 8","order":90,"parents":["RAW_97E9_8C_4"],"revision":"CH_97E9_8C_4@R001","sha256":"96c60988c3438f1e4a7b72dcd73a177095cd75f2d8ed1e38678fb2f2c439786b","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:AS1","text":"Der Text setzt den Gegensatz von Gut und Böse als alten Wahn an.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:AS2","text":"Er bestimmt Wahrsager und Sterndeuter als die Instanz, um die sich dieser Wahn historisch dreht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:AS3","text":"Der Glaube an Wahrsager und Sterndeuter erzeugt die Formel des Schicksals und des Müssen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:AS4","text":"Das Misstrauen gegen Wahrsager und Sterndeuter erzeugt als Gegenformel die Freiheit und das Wollen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:AS5","text":"Die gemeinsame epistemische Grundlage beider Gegenpositionen wird als bloßes Wähnen und nicht als Wissen diagnostiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:A1","text":"Gut und Böse gehören zu einem alten Wahn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:A2","text":"Wahrsager und Sterndeuter bilden den bisherigen Bezugspunkt dieses Wahns.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:A3","text":"Der Glaube an Wahrsager und Sterndeuter führt zur Annahme, dass alles Schicksal ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:A4","text":"Die Annahme des Schicksals wird als Gebot des Müssens formuliert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:A5","text":"Das Misstrauen gegen Wahrsager und Sterndeuter führt zur Annahme, dass alles Freiheit ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:A6","text":"Die Annahme der Freiheit wird als Möglichkeit des Könnens aus dem Wollen formuliert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:A7","text":"Über Sterne und Zukunft ist bisher nur gewähnt und nicht gewusst worden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:A8","text":"Die moralische Unterscheidung von Gut und Böse teilt diesen epistemischen Mangel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:NX1","text":"Gut und Böse sind nicht als gewusst ausgewiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:NX2","text":"Die Aussagen über Sterne und Zukunft sind kein Wissen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:NX3","text":"Das System gründet weder ausschließlich auf der bestätigten Wahrheit des Schicksals noch auf der bestätigten Wahrheit der Freiheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:NX4","text":"Wahrsagerei und Sterndeutung liefern keine gesicherte Erkenntnis über Zukunft oder moralische Ordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:NX5","text":"Die Gegenüberstellung von „du sollst, denn du musst“ und „du kannst, denn du willst“ überschreitet nicht den Horizont des Wahns.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:D1","text":"Schicksalsglaube und Freiheitsglaube sind gegensätzliche Antworten auf denselben vorausgesetzten Deutungshorizont.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_4:A3","CH_97E9_8C_4:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:D2","text":"Der Übergang vom Schicksal zur Freiheit beseitigt den Wahn nicht, sondern ersetzt nur seine Formel.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_4:A3","CH_97E9_8C_4:A5","CH_97E9_8C_4:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:D3","text":"Die moralische Bewertung wird von ungesicherten Annahmen über Zukunft und Kausalität mitgetragen.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_4:A1","CH_97E9_8C_4:A2","CH_97E9_8C_4:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:D4","text":"Die historische Abfolge von Glaube und Misstrauen erzeugt keinen Übergang vom Nichtwissen zum Wissen.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_4:A3","CH_97E9_8C_4:A5","CH_97E9_8C_4:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:SD1","text":"Schicksal und Freiheit erscheinen als zwei moralische Deutungsmaschinen, deren Gegensatz die gemeinsame Ungewissheit verdeckt.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_4:A3","CH_97E9_8C_4:A5","CH_97E9_8C_4:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:SD2","text":"Der Gegensatz von Gut und Böse wird von einer scheinbaren Alternative zwischen Müssen und Wollen getragen, ohne epistemisch begründet zu sein.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_4:A1","CH_97E9_8C_4:A4","CH_97E9_8C_4:A6","CH_97E9_8C_4:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:SD3","text":"Die Kritik verschiebt die Frage nach Gut und Böse von der moralischen Entscheidung auf die Bedingungen ihrer behaupteten Erkenntnis.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_4:A7","CH_97E9_8C_4:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Annahme, dass der Wechsel von Schicksalsglauben zu Freiheitsglauben bereits eine Erkenntnisbewegung darstellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein moralischer Dualismus, der seine eigenen Voraussetzungen als Wissen ausgeben kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die stillschweigende Gleichsetzung von Deutbarkeit der Zukunft und Erkenntnis der Moral.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist, dass der Wille allein die epistemische Geltung der Freiheit begründet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:SNX1","text":"Der Text organisiert sich um die Abwesenheit eines Wissens, das Gut und Böse endgültig begründen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:SNX2","text":"Versperrt bleibt eine dritte, positiv bestimmte Grundlage jenseits von Schicksal und Freiheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:SNX3","text":"Unverfügbar ist eine Zukunftserkenntnis, aus der sich moralische Notwendigkeit oder moralische Verantwortlichkeit ableiten ließe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:SNX4","text":"Die moralische Ordnung bleibt als Wirkung von Deutungen sichtbar, ohne dass ihr wahrer Grund verfügbar wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:FGS1","text":"Ungeprüfte Zukunftsdeutung → Glaube an Wahrsager und Sterndeuter → Schicksalsmodell → „du sollst, denn du musst“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:FGS2","text":"Misstrauen gegen Zukunftsdeutung → Freiheitsmodell → „du kannst, denn du willst“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:FGS3","text":"Gegensätzliche Modelle → gemeinsame Abhängigkeit von nicht gewusstem, sondern gewähntem Zukunftshorizont.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:FGS4","text":"Gemeinsamer epistemischer Mangel → Gut und Böse als moralische Fortsetzung desselben Wahns.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:FGS5","text":"Moralische Kritik → Zurückführung der Begriffe auf die ungesicherte Erkenntnisform, die sie erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:AF1","text":"Alter Wahn → Wahrsagerei und Sterndeutung als Bezugspunkt → Schicksal und Müssen → Freiheit und Wollen → gemeinsamer Status des Wähnens → fehlendes Wissen über Gut und Böse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:ME1","text":"Die moralische Opposition von Gut und Böse wird auf ihre epistemische Herkunft aus Zukunftsdeutungen zurückkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:ME2","text":"Schicksal und Freiheit werden nicht mehr als abschließende Gegensätze, sondern als aufeinanderfolgende Varianten desselben Wahnhorizonts sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:ME3","text":"Der Wechsel von „Müssen“ zu „Wollen“ wird als Austausch einer Deutungsform und nicht als Gewinn von Wissen klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:ME4","text":"Moralische Gewissheit wird von der Frage nach der Wahrheit ihrer kosmologischen und zeitlichen Voraussetzungen abhängig gemacht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Gut und Böse werden als alter Wahn bezeichnet; Schicksal und Freiheit erscheinen als seine gegensätzlichen Formeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Wahrsagerei und Sterndeutung vermitteln die moralische Ordnung über Deutungen von Sternen und Zukunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Die moralische Alternative wird in eine Diagnose ihrer gemeinsamen epistemischen Voraussetzung umgerahmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Schicksal und Freiheit fungieren als konkurrierende Bestimmungen des Verhältnisses von Zukunft, Notwendigkeit und Wollen; keine von beiden wird als gewusst etabliert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von Zukunftsdeutung über Schicksal und Freiheit zur Kritik von Gut und Böse zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, welches positive Wissen oder welche alternative Grundlage an die Stelle des verworfenen Wahns treten könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, weil beide Gegenpositionen über den gemeinsamen Gegensatz von Wähnen und Wissen beurteilt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Operation ist die Auflösung des Gegensatzes von Schicksal und Freiheit in eine gemeinsame epistemische Herkunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:MRT5","text":"Die Rekonstruktion hängt an der vom Text gesetzten, nicht weiter begründeten Gleichordnung von moralischem Wahn und Zukunftswahn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:MRT6","text":"Die tatsächliche Bewegung bleibt erhalten; die positive Neubestimmung nach der Kritik bleibt offen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T192606914877Z_87358a9a","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"8.","source_sha256":"96c60988c3438f1e4a7b72dcd73a177095cd75f2d8ed1e38678fb2f2c439786b","sha256":"86f5b6b4fc968be9a465745c07d917a0904f54e09cb16413590a136129d5c877","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:26:06.917600+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:AS1","text":"The text posits the opposition of good and evil as an old delusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:AS2","text":"It identifies diviners and astrologers as the instance around which this delusion historically revolves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:AS3","text":"Belief in diviners and astrologers generates the formula of fate and having-to.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:AS4","text":"Distrust of diviners and astrologers generates, as a counter-formula, freedom and willing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:AS5","text":"The shared epistemic basis of both opposing positions is diagnosed as mere supposing and not as knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:A1","text":"Good and evil belong to an old delusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:A2","text":"Diviners and astrologers form the hitherto point of reference of this delusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:A3","text":"Belief in diviners and astrologers leads to the assumption that everything is fate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:A4","text":"The assumption of fate is formulated as the command of having-to.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:A5","text":"Distrust of diviners and astrologers leads to the assumption that everything is freedom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:A6","text":"The assumption of freedom is formulated as the possibility of being able to, arising from willing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:A7","text":"Regarding stars and the future, there has hitherto only been supposition and not knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:A8","text":"The moral distinction between good and evil shares this epistemic deficiency.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:NX1","text":"Good and evil are not established as known.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:NX2","text":"The statements about stars and the future are not knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:NX3","text":"The system is founded neither exclusively on the confirmed truth of fate nor on the confirmed truth of freedom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:NX4","text":"Divination and astrological interpretation provide no secure knowledge of the future or of moral order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:NX5","text":"The juxtaposition of „du sollst, denn du musst“ and „du kannst, denn du willst“ does not exceed the horizon of delusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:D1","text":"Belief in fate and belief in freedom are opposing responses to the same presupposed horizon of interpretation.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_4:A3","CH_97E9_8C_4:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:D2","text":"The transition from fate to freedom does not eliminate the delusion, but merely replaces its formula.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_4:A3","CH_97E9_8C_4:A5","CH_97E9_8C_4:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:D3","text":"Moral evaluation is also sustained by unsecured assumptions about the future and causality.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_4:A1","CH_97E9_8C_4:A2","CH_97E9_8C_4:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:D4","text":"The historical sequence of belief and distrust produces no transition from nonknowledge to knowledge.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_4:A3","CH_97E9_8C_4:A5","CH_97E9_8C_4:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:SD1","text":"Fate and freedom appear as two machines of moral interpretation whose opposition conceals their shared uncertainty.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_4:A3","CH_97E9_8C_4:A5","CH_97E9_8C_4:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:SD2","text":"The opposition of good and evil is sustained by an apparent alternative between having-to and willing, without being epistemically grounded.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_4:A1","CH_97E9_8C_4:A4","CH_97E9_8C_4:A6","CH_97E9_8C_4:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:SD3","text":"The critique shifts the question of good and evil from moral decision to the conditions of their claimed knowledge.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_4:A7","CH_97E9_8C_4:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:DNX1","text":"Excluded is the assumption that the change from belief in fate to belief in freedom already constitutes a movement of knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a moral dualism that can pass off its own presuppositions as knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:DNX3","text":"Excluded is the tacit equation of the interpretability of the future with knowledge of morality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:DNX4","text":"Excluded is that willing alone grounds the epistemic validity of freedom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:SNX1","text":"The text organizes itself around the absence of a knowledge that could definitively ground good and evil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:SNX2","text":"A third, positively determined ground beyond fate and freedom remains barred.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:SNX3","text":"Unavailable is a knowledge of the future from which moral necessity or moral responsibility could be derived.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:SNX4","text":"Moral order remains visible as an effect of interpretations, without its true ground becoming available.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:FGS1","text":"Unexamined interpretation of the future → belief in diviners and astrologers → model of fate → „du sollst, denn du musst“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:FGS2","text":"Distrust of interpretation of the future → model of freedom → „du kannst, denn du willst“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:FGS3","text":"Opposing models → shared dependence on a horizon of the future not known but supposed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:FGS4","text":"Shared epistemic deficiency → good and evil as the moral continuation of the same delusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:FGS5","text":"Moral critique → reduction of the concepts to the unsecured form of knowledge that produces them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:AF1","text":"Old delusion → divination and astrological interpretation as point of reference → fate and having-to → freedom and willing → shared status of supposing → absent knowledge of good and evil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:ME1","text":"The moral opposition of good and evil is mapped back to its epistemic origin in interpretations of the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:ME2","text":"Fate and freedom become visible no longer as final oppositions, but as successive variants of the same horizon of delusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:ME3","text":"The shift from „Müssen“ to „Wollen“ is classified as an exchange of a form of interpretation and not as a gain in knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:ME4","text":"Moral certainty is made dependent on the question of the truth of its cosmological and temporal presuppositions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Good and evil are designated as an old delusion; fate and freedom appear as its opposing formulas.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Divination and astrological interpretation mediate moral order through interpretations of stars and the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** The moral alternative is reframed into a diagnosis of its shared epistemic presupposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Fate and freedom function as competing determinations of the relation among future, necessity, and willing; neither is established as known.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from interpretation of the future through fate and freedom to the critique of good and evil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is what positive knowledge or alternative ground could take the place of the rejected delusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent because both opposing positions are judged through the shared opposition between supposing and knowing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:MRT4","text":"Its strongest operation is the dissolution of the opposition between fate and freedom into a shared epistemic origin.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:MRT5","text":"The reconstruction depends on the equation of moral delusion and delusion concerning the future posited by the text and not further grounded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_4:MRT6","text":"The actual movement is retained; the positive redetermination following the critique remains open.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_8C_4@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_8C_4:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On Old and New Tablets","source_section_label":"8.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 8","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","8."],"original_title":"8."}],"source_title_context":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln","source_section_label":"8.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 8","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","8."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 90","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 8","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln · 8"},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2","layer":"CH","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 10","order":91,"parents":["RAW_97E9_10_2"],"revision":"CH_97E9_10_2@R001","sha256":"c6a22cf9b9fe1b2b0e5d1665f54a3af5c5e9af40e7cb86f38679f14c34453db3","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:AS1","text":"Heilige Verbote gegen Rauben und Totschlagen werden als ehemals unangefochtene Normen gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:AS2","text":"Der Sprecher kehrt die sakrale Autorität dieser Verbote durch die Frage nach ihren tatsächlichen Wirkungen um.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:AS3","text":"Leben wird als eine Ordnung bestimmt, in der Rauben und Totschlagen strukturell vorkommen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:AS4","text":"Die Heiligung lebenswidriger Verbote erscheint dadurch als mögliche Tötung der Wahrheit und als Predigt des Todes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:AS5","text":"Die Konsequenz ist der strategische Imperativ, die alten Tafeln zu zerbrechen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:A1","text":"Verbote gegen Rauben und Totschlagen wurden als heilig behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:A2","text":"Das Heilige besitzt normative Autorität über körperliche Unterwerfung und rituelle Ehrfurcht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:A3","text":"Die sakrale Geltung eines Verbots kann an seinen Wirkungen gemessen und dadurch umgekehrt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:A4","text":"Leben enthält Rauben und Totschlagen als konstitutive Vorgänge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:A5","text":"Ein Verbot, das allem Leben widerspricht, kann als lebensfeindliche Norm bestimmt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:A6","text":"Die Heiligung einer lebensfeindlichen Norm kann die Wahrheit selbst töten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:A7","text":"Eine lebensfeindliche Heiligkeit kann als Predigt des Todes fungieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:A8","text":"Die bestehenden heiligen Tafeln sind durch eine entgegengesetzte Wertsetzung zu zerbrechen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:NX1","text":"Heiligkeit ist nicht gleichbedeutend mit lebensbejahender Wahrheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:NX2","text":"Sakrale Verehrung garantiert nicht die moralische oder tatsächliche Überlegenheit eines Verbots.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:NX3","text":"Das Leben ist nicht als Ausschluss von Rauben und Totschlagen definiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:NX4","text":"Ein Gesetz gegen Rauben und Totschlagen ist nicht notwendig eine wahrheitsgemäße Darstellung des Lebens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:NX5","text":"Eine als heilig bezeichnete Norm ist nicht außerhalb der Kritik gestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:NX6","text":"Die alten Tafeln sind nicht als endgültige Wertordnung anzuerkennen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:D1","text":"Die sakrale Autorität der Verbote kann mit der Möglichkeit kollidieren, dass sie lebensfeindliche Wirkungen erzeugen.","refs":["CH_97E9_10_2:A1","CH_97E9_10_2:A2","CH_97E9_10_2:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:D2","text":"Wenn Rauben und Totschlagen zum Leben gehören, kann ein absolutes Verbot dieser Vorgänge nur durch eine Abstraktion vom Leben bestehen.","refs":["CH_97E9_10_2:A4","CH_97E9_10_2:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:D3","text":"Die Heiligung eines lebenswidrigen Verbots verwandelt normative Verehrung in eine mögliche Verneinung der Lebenswahrheit.","refs":["CH_97E9_10_2:A5","CH_97E9_10_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:D4","text":"Die Frage nach den „besseren“ Räubern und Totschlägern verschiebt die Prüfung von der Form des Gesetzes auf seine Erzeugung von Lebensformen.","refs":["CH_97E9_10_2:A1","CH_97E9_10_2:A3","CH_97E9_10_2:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:D5","text":"Die alten Tafeln werden als Hindernis einer neuen Wertsetzung behandelt.","refs":["CH_97E9_10_2:A7","CH_97E9_10_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:SD1","text":"Die Opposition zwischen Gesetz und Leben wird in eine Opposition zwischen lebensbejahender Wahrheit und sakralisierter Todespredigt überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:SD2","text":"Moralische Autorität wird nicht nach ihrer sakralen Herkunft, sondern nach ihrem Verhältnis zur Struktur des Lebens bewertet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:SD3","text":"Die Kritik an den Verboten wird zur genealogischen Umwertung: Das Heilige erscheint als möglicher Träger einer lebensfeindlichen Ordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:SD4","text":"Die Aufhebung der alten Normen wird nicht als bloße Negation, sondern als notwendige Voraussetzung einer neuen Tafelordnung erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt stillschweigend aus, dass überlieferte Heiligkeit und Wahrheit identisch sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:DNX2","text":"Es schließt aus, dass Leben durch eine konfliktfreie, gewaltlose Ordnung angemessen bestimmt werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:DNX3","text":"Es disqualifiziert die Annahme, dass ein universales Verbot seine eigene Lebensgrundlage unproblematisch repräsentiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:DNX4","text":"Es verwirft eine Moral, deren Geltung unabhängig von ihren Wirkungen auf das Leben feststeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:DNX5","text":"Es schließt die Möglichkeit aus, die alten Tafeln lediglich zu bewahren und zugleich die Wahrheit des Lebens zu retten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine sakrale Ordnung, in der das Leben nur durch seine Verneinung geheiligt werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:SNX2","text":"Die versperrte Möglichkeit ist eine nichtlebensfeindliche Wahrheit, die ohne die alten Tafeln auskommen müsste.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:SNX3","text":"Die tiefste Abwesenheit des Systems ist eine positive neue Werttafel; vorhanden ist zunächst nur die Forderung nach Zerstörung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:SNX4","text":"Unzulässig wird die Versöhnung zwischen absolutem Verbot und einer Lebensordnung, die Rauben und Totschlagen als Bestandteile enthält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:FGS1","text":"Sakralisiertes Verbot → normative Unterwerfung → vorausgesetzte moralische Überlegenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:FGS2","text":"Frage nach der Wirkung des Verbots → Umkehrung der sakralen Autorität → Verdacht auf lebensfeindliche Erzeugung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:FGS3","text":"Leben als Rauben und Totschlagen → Widerspruch zum absoluten Verbot → Entlarvung der Norm als lebenswidrig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:FGS4","text":"Lebenswidrige Norm → Tötung der Wahrheit beziehungsweise Predigt des Todes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:FGS5","text":"Todespredigt → Bruch mit den alten Tafeln → Eröffnung einer noch nicht ausgeführten Neuwertung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:AF1","text":"Heilige Verbote → Frage nach ihren Erzeugnissen → Leben als konflikthafte Grundlage → Widerspruch zwischen Leben und Sakralgesetz → Heiligkeit als Todespredigt → Zerbrechen der alten Tafeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:ME1","text":"Das Begriffsfeld verschiebt sich von der Befolgung heiliger Gebote zur Prüfung ihrer Wirkungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:ME2","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen moralischem Verbot und tatsächlichem Leben wird als systemischer Widerspruch sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:ME3","text":"Heiligkeit wird von einer positiven Autoritätskategorie in eine zu prüfende, möglicherweise lebensfeindliche Funktion umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:ME4","text":"Die alten Tafeln erscheinen nicht mehr als Grundlage der Ordnung, sondern als zu zerbrechendes Hindernis einer neuen Wertsetzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — Explizite Verbote gegen Rauben und Totschlagen werden ihrer sakralen Selbstverständlichkeit entkleidet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — Die Norm wird gegen die konfliktive und gewaltsame Struktur des Lebens abgetragen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — Die rhetorische Frage dient als Umkehrungsinstrument: Sie ersetzt Gehorsam durch Prüfung der normativen Erzeugnisse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — Leben wird als vorgängige, nicht durch die alten Tafeln erschöpfte Wirklichkeit gesetzt; die Zukunft verlangt deren Zerbrechen, ohne bereits positiv bestimmt zu sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den Übergang von sakralem Verbot zu lebensfeindlicher Todespredigt zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, was genau unter „Leben“, „Wahrheit“ und „besseren“ Räubern und Totschlägern zu verstehen ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Leben als konflikthafte Ordnung und die Verbote als absolute Gegenordnung gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Operation ist die Umkehrung sakraler Autorität durch den Wirkungsnachweis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:MRT5","text":"Die zentrale Spannung bleibt ungelöst: Das System verurteilt die lebensfeindliche Norm, bestimmt aber keine konkrete positive Norm nach ihrer Zerstörung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die argumentative Bewegung, hängt jedoch an der komprimierten Gleichsetzung von Leben mit Rauben und Totschlagen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T184352185917Z_d72ba040","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"10.","source_sha256":"c6a22cf9b9fe1b2b0e5d1665f54a3af5c5e9af40e7cb86f38679f14c34453db3","sha256":"b43e2b9997f3febb92fb33d095d73750e2618386c75f473329c18d918e276e56","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T18:43:52.188254+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:AS1","text":"Sacred prohibitions against robbery and killing are posited as formerly uncontested norms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:AS2","text":"The speaker reverses the sacred authority of these prohibitions by asking about their actual effects.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:AS3","text":"Life is determined as an order in which robbery and killing occur structurally.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:AS4","text":"The sanctification of prohibitions hostile to life thereby appears as a possible killing of truth and as a preaching of death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:AS5","text":"The consequence is the strategic imperative to break the old tablets.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:A1","text":"Prohibitions against robbery and killing were treated as sacred.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:A2","text":"The sacred possesses normative authority over bodily submission and ritual reverence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:A3","text":"The sacred validity of a prohibition can be measured by its effects and thereby reversed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:A4","text":"Life contains robbery and killing as constitutive processes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:A5","text":"A prohibition that contradicts all life can be determined as a norm hostile to life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:A6","text":"The sanctification of a norm hostile to life can kill truth itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:A7","text":"A holiness hostile to life can function as a preaching of death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:A8","text":"The existing sacred tablets are to be broken by means of an opposing positing of value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:NX1","text":"Holiness is not synonymous with life-affirming truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:NX2","text":"Sacred veneration does not guarantee the moral or actual superiority of a prohibition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:NX3","text":"Life is not defined as the exclusion of robbery and killing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:NX4","text":"A law against robbery and killing is not necessarily a truthful representation of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:NX5","text":"A norm designated as sacred is not placed beyond criticism.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:NX6","text":"The old tablets are not to be acknowledged as a final order of values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:D1","text":"The sacred authority of the prohibitions can collide with the possibility that they produce effects hostile to life.","refs":["CH_97E9_10_2:A1","CH_97E9_10_2:A2","CH_97E9_10_2:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:D2","text":"If robbery and killing belong to life, an absolute prohibition of these processes can exist only through an abstraction from life.","refs":["CH_97E9_10_2:A4","CH_97E9_10_2:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:D3","text":"The sanctification of a prohibition contrary to life transforms normative veneration into a possible negation of the truth of life.","refs":["CH_97E9_10_2:A5","CH_97E9_10_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:D4","text":"The question of the “better” robbers and killers shifts examination from the form of the law to its production of forms of life.","refs":["CH_97E9_10_2:A1","CH_97E9_10_2:A3","CH_97E9_10_2:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:D5","text":"The old tablets are treated as an obstacle to a new positing of values.","refs":["CH_97E9_10_2:A7","CH_97E9_10_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:SD1","text":"The opposition between law and life is transferred into an opposition between life-affirming truth and sacralized preaching of death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:SD2","text":"Moral authority is evaluated not according to its sacred origin, but according to its relation to the structure of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:SD3","text":"The critique of the prohibitions becomes a genealogical revaluation: the sacred appears as a possible bearer of an order hostile to life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:SD4","text":"The abolition of the old norms is produced not as mere negation, but as the necessary precondition of a new order of tablets.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:DNX1","text":"The system tacitly excludes that inherited holiness and truth are identical.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:DNX2","text":"It excludes that life can be adequately determined by a conflict-free, nonviolent order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:DNX3","text":"It disqualifies the assumption that a universal prohibition unproblematically represents its own basis in life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:DNX4","text":"It rejects a morality whose validity is established independently of its effects on life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:DNX5","text":"It excludes the possibility of merely preserving the old tablets while at the same time saving the truth of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a sacred order in which life can be sanctified only through its negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:SNX2","text":"The barred possibility is a truth not hostile to life that would have to manage without the old tablets.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:SNX3","text":"The system's deepest absence is a positive new tablet of values; initially present is only the demand for destruction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:SNX4","text":"Reconciliation between absolute prohibition and an order of life that contains robbery and killing as components becomes impermissible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:FGS1","text":"Sacralized prohibition → normative submission → presupposed moral superiority.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:FGS2","text":"Question concerning the effect of the prohibition → reversal of sacred authority → suspicion of production hostile to life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:FGS3","text":"Life as robbery and killing → contradiction with absolute prohibition → exposure of the norm as contrary to life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:FGS4","text":"Norm contrary to life → killing of truth or preaching of death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:FGS5","text":"Preaching of death → break with the old tablets → opening of a revaluation not yet carried out.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:AF1","text":"Sacred prohibitions → question concerning their products → life as a conflictual foundation → contradiction between life and sacred law → holiness as preaching of death → breaking the old tablets.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:ME1","text":"The conceptual field shifts from compliance with sacred commandments to examination of their effects.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:ME2","text":"The opposition between moral prohibition and actual life becomes visible as a systemic contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:ME3","text":"Holiness is reclassified from a positive category of authority into a function to be examined, possibly hostile to life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:ME4","text":"The old tablets no longer appear as the foundation of order, but as an obstacle to a new positing of values that is to be broken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — Explicit prohibitions against robbery and killing are stripped of their sacred self-evidence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — The norm is worn down against the conflictual and violent structure of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — The rhetorical question serves as an instrument of reversal: it replaces obedience with examination of normative products.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — Life is posited as a prior reality not exhausted by the old tablets; the future demands their breaking without yet being positively determined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the transition from sacred prohibition to preaching of death hostile to life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:MRT2","text":"What exactly is to be understood by “life,” “truth,” and “better” robbers and killers remains underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent, provided that life counts as a conflictual order and the prohibitions as an absolute counter-order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:MRT4","text":"The strongest operation is the reversal of sacred authority through demonstration of effects.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:MRT5","text":"The central tension remains unresolved: the system condemns the norm hostile to life, but determines no concrete positive norm after its destruction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_2:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the argumentative movement, yet depends on the compressed equation of life with robbery and killing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_10_2@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_10_2:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On Old and New Tablets","source_section_label":"10.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 10","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","10."],"original_title":"10."}],"source_title_context":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln","source_section_label":"10.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 10","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","10."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 91","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 10","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln · 10"},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH","layer":"CH","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 11","order":92,"parents":["RAW_97E9_11CH"],"revision":"CH_97E9_11CH@R001","sha256":"d4b0d2f5499b4a3e4176e0be7c590a6ab138de812e278f1addc8c62377327325","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:AS1","text":"Das Vergangene ist jeder kommenden Generation zur Umdeutung preisgegeben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:AS2","text":"Dieselbe Offenheit erzeugt zwei Gefahren: die gewaltsame Totalisierung durch einen Herrscher und die zeitliche Verflachung durch den Pöbel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:AS3","text":"Der Herrscher verwandelt das Vergangene in eine erzwungene teleologische Kette; der Pöbel lässt es im engsten Erinnerungshorizont erstarren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:AS4","text":"Gegen beide Gefahren wird ein neuer Adel als pluraler Gegenpol gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:AS5","text":"Dieser Adel schreibt den Wertbegriff neu und besteht aus vielen verschiedenen Edlen, nicht aus einer einzigen souveränen Instanz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:AS6","text":"Die argumentative Bewegung führt von der Preisgegebenheit der Vergangenheit über ihre doppelte Gefährdung zur aristokratischen Pluralisierung der Wertsetzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:A1","text":"Alles Vergangene ist der Gnade, dem Geiste und dem Wahnsinne kommender Geschlechter preisgegeben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:A2","text":"Kommende Geschlechter deuten alles Vergangene auf ihre eigene Gegenwart hin.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:A3","text":"Eine gewaltherrische Instanz kann das Vergangene in Brücke, Vorzeichen, Herold und Hahnenschrei ihrer eigenen Zukunft verwandeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:A4","text":"Der Pöbel besitzt nur einen begrenzten Erinnerungshorizont.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:A5","text":"Mit dem Großvater endet für den Pöbel die Zeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:A6","text":"Eine Herrschaft des Pöbels kann die gesamte Zeit in seichten Gewässern ertränken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:A7","text":"Die Bewahrung einer nicht verflachten Zeitordnung erfordert einen neuen Adel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:A8","text":"Der neue Adel muss sowohl dem Pöbel als auch dem Gewaltherrischen widersprechen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:A9","text":"Adel entsteht durch das erneute Schreiben von Tafeln und die Neubestimmung dessen, was „edel“ heißt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:A10","text":"Adel verlangt viele Edle und viele Arten von Edlen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:A11","text":"Göttlichkeit besteht in der Vielheit von Göttern ohne einen einzigen Gott.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:NX1","text":"Das Vergangene besitzt keine gegen jede kommende Generation abgeschlossene Bedeutung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:NX2","text":"Geschichte darf nicht zur bloßen Selbstlegitimation eines Gewalt-Herrschers werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:NX3","text":"Zeit darf nicht auf den Erinnerungshorizont des Pöbels reduziert werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:NX4","text":"Adel ist nicht mit Herrschaft durch eine einzige souveräne Instanz identisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:NX5","text":"Göttlichkeit ist nicht die Einheit eines einzigen Gottes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:NX6","text":"Die neue Wertordnung darf nicht aus einer homogenen Menge gleicher Edler bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:D1","text":"Die Offenheit der Vergangenheit macht jede Generation zu einer potentiellen Umdeuterin des gesamten Zeitverlaufs.","refs":["CH_97E9_11CH:A1","CH_97E9_11CH:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:D2","text":"Historische Bedeutung kann entweder als erzwungene Vorzeichenkette oder als verkürzter Erinnerungshorizont produziert werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_11CH:A3","CH_97E9_11CH:A4","CH_97E9_11CH:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:D3","text":"Die beiden Gefahren unterscheiden sich in ihrer Operation, führen aber beide zur Beschädigung der Zeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_11CH:A3","CH_97E9_11CH:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:D4","text":"Der neue Adel erhält seine Bestimmung durch doppelte Opposition statt durch bloße Rangbehauptung.","refs":["CH_97E9_11CH:A7","CH_97E9_11CH:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:D5","text":"Eine gültige Neubestimmung des Adels muss plural, differenziert und wertsetzend sein.","refs":["CH_97E9_11CH:A9","CH_97E9_11CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:D6","text":"Die Vielheit der Edlen fungiert als politische Entsprechung zur Vielheit der Götter.","refs":["CH_97E9_11CH:A10","CH_97E9_11CH:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:SD1","text":"Das zentrale politische Problem ist nicht die Deutung der Vergangenheit an sich, sondern ihre Monopolisierung durch entweder eine tyrannische oder eine nivellierende Instanz.","refs":["CH_97E9_11CH:A1","CH_97E9_11CH:A3","CH_97E9_11CH:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:SD2","text":"Pluraler Adel wird als institutionelle Form einer offenen Zeitordnung erzeugt: Viele Wertsetzer verhindern sowohl die Einheitsdeutung als auch die zeitliche Verarmung.","refs":["CH_97E9_11CH:A7","CH_97E9_11CH:A8","CH_97E9_11CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:SD3","text":"Das System ersetzt die Suche nach einer letzten autoritativen Wertquelle durch eine differenzierte Vielheit wertsetzender Instanzen.","refs":["CH_97E9_11CH:A9","CH_97E9_11CH:A10","CH_97E9_11CH:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:SD4","text":"Zeitliche Kontinuität wird nicht durch Bewahrung des Vergangenen, sondern durch Widerstand gegen seine monopolistische Festlegung gesichert.","refs":["CH_97E9_11CH:A1","CH_97E9_11CH:A3","CH_97E9_11CH:A5","CH_97E9_11CH:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Vorstellung einer neutralen, unvermittelten Vergangenheit, die unabhängig von kommenden Geschlechtern fortbesteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein einheitlicher Maßstab, der die Bedeutung aller vergangenen Ereignisse endgültig festlegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine politische Ordnung, in der zeitliche Orientierung entweder vollständig zentralisiert oder vollständig nivelliert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Annahme, dass Wertordnung durch Gleichförmigkeit, Einzahl oder bloße Mehrheitsmacht entsteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:SNX1","text":"Der Text organisiert sich um die Abwesenheit eines legitimen letzten Interpreten der Vergangenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:SNX2","text":"Unzulässig ist eine Zeitordnung, in der keine konkurrierenden Wertsetzungen und keine geschichtliche Tiefe mehr möglich sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:SNX3","text":"Die versperrte Möglichkeit ist eine plural offene Zukunft, die weder durch den Gewalt-Herrischen vorgeformt noch durch den Pöbel verkürzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:SNX4","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist ein einheitlicher Gott als metaphysisches oder politisches Modell der Ordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:FGS1","text":"Preisgegebenheit der Vergangenheit → generationale Umdeutung → mögliche Monopolisierung durch Gewalt oder Verkürzung durch Pöbelherrschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:FGS2","text":"Monopolisierung oder Verkürzung → Zerstörung geschichtlicher Offenheit → Erfordernis eines Gegenprinzips.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:FGS3","text":"Gegenprinzip → neuer Adel → doppelte Negation von Pöbel und Gewaltherrschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:FGS4","text":"Doppelte Negation → neue Tafeln → Neubestimmung des Edlen durch Vielheit und Verschiedenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:FGS5","text":"Vielheit der Edlen → keine letzte Wertinstanz → politische Entsprechung der Vielheit von Göttern ohne Gott.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:AF1","text":"Preisgegebene Vergangenheit → doppelte Gefährdung durch Gewalt-Herrischen und Pöbel → Beschädigung der Zeit → neuer Adel als Gegenmacht → neue Tafeln des Edlen → Vielheit von Edlen ohne einheitliche Letztinstanz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:ME1","text":"Vergangenheit wird von einem abgeschlossenen Bestand zu einem umkämpften Material kommender Geschlechter umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:ME2","text":"Tyrannei und Pöbelherrschaft werden trotz ihrer Gegensätzlichkeit als parallele Formen zeitlicher Zerstörung klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:ME3","text":"Adel wird von einer festen sozialen Rangordnung zu einer pluralen Praxis der Wertsetzung umgezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:ME4","text":"Einheit von Herrschaft und Einheit von Göttlichkeit werden aus demselben begrifflichen Feld entfernt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:ME5","text":"Die politische Alternative verläuft nicht zwischen Herrschaft und Nichtherrschaft, sondern zwischen monopolistischer und pluraler Wertsetzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Das Vergangene ist der Umdeutung durch kommende Geschlechter ausgesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Gewalt-Herrschaft und Pöbelherrschaft wirken als unterschiedliche Mechanismen der zeitlichen Verformung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Widerstand wird als Aufbau einer pluralen aristokratischen Gegenordnung und nicht als Rückkehr zu einer vergangenen Ordnung gefasst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Zeit erscheint als offene Vielheit von Deutungs- und Wertsetzungsmöglichkeiten ohne letzte einheitliche Instanz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von der Preisgegebenheit der Vergangenheit zur Forderung nach pluralem Adel zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, nach welchen Kriterien die vielen Edlen ausgewählt oder ihre neuen Tafeln legitimiert werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Monopolisierung und Nivellierung als zwei Formen derselben zeitlichen Verarmung gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung besteht zwischen der doppelten Gefahr und der doppelten Opposition des neuen Adels.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:MRT5","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen der Forderung nach neuen Tafeln und der Zurückweisung jeder einheitlichen Letztinstanz bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung liegt darin, dass aristokratische Gegenmacht selbst in gewaltherrische Zentralisierung umschlagen könnte; der Text grenzt diese Möglichkeit normativ ab, formalisiert ihre Verhinderung aber nicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, sofern Vielheit nicht als bloße Anzahl, sondern als strukturelle Verhinderung eines einzigen Gottes, Herrschers oder Zeitdeuters verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T184509705123Z_90edb9f8","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"11.","source_sha256":"d4b0d2f5499b4a3e4176e0be7c590a6ab138de812e278f1addc8c62377327325","sha256":"ab7d62609fc65cd282ebfccbc1ff765dce35ed0e7d18014d7b402b52d34807e5","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T18:45:09.707199+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:AS1","text":"The past is given over to reinterpretation by every coming generation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:AS2","text":"The same openness generates two dangers: violent totalization by a ruler and temporal flattening by the mob.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:AS3","text":"The ruler transforms the past into an enforced teleological chain; the mob lets it congeal within the narrowest horizon of memory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:AS4","text":"Against both dangers, a new nobility is posited as a plural counterpole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:AS5","text":"This nobility rewrites the concept of value and consists of many different nobles, not of a single sovereign instance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:AS6","text":"The argumentative movement leads from the exposure of the past, through its double endangerment, to the aristocratic pluralization of value-positing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:A1","text":"Everything past is given over to the mercy, spirit, and madness of coming generations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:A2","text":"Coming generations interpret everything past in relation to their own present.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:A3","text":"A tyrannical instance can transform the past into bridge, omen, herald, and cockcrow of its own future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:A4","text":"The mob possesses only a limited horizon of memory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:A5","text":"For the mob, time ends with the grandfather.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:A6","text":"A rule of the mob can drown all of time in shallow waters.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:A7","text":"The preservation of a non-flattened temporal order requires a new nobility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:A8","text":"The new nobility must contradict both the mob and the tyrannical.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:A9","text":"Nobility arises through the renewed writing of tablets and the redefinition of what “noble” means.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:A10","text":"Nobility requires many nobles and many kinds of nobles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:A11","text":"Divinity consists in the multiplicity of gods without a single god.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:NX1","text":"The past possesses no meaning closed off against every coming generation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:NX2","text":"History must not become the mere self-legitimation of a violence-ruler.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:NX3","text":"Time must not be reduced to the horizon of memory of the mob.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:NX4","text":"Nobility is not identical with rule by a single sovereign instance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:NX5","text":"Divinity is not the unity of a single god.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:NX6","text":"The new order of values must not consist of a homogeneous mass of identical nobles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:D1","text":"The openness of the past makes every generation a potential reinterpretress of the entire course of time.","refs":["CH_97E9_11CH:A1","CH_97E9_11CH:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:D2","text":"Historical meaning can be produced either as an enforced chain of omens or as a shortened horizon of memory.","refs":["CH_97E9_11CH:A3","CH_97E9_11CH:A4","CH_97E9_11CH:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:D3","text":"The two dangers differ in their operation, but both lead to the impairment of time.","refs":["CH_97E9_11CH:A3","CH_97E9_11CH:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:D4","text":"The new nobility receives its determination through double opposition rather than through the mere assertion of rank.","refs":["CH_97E9_11CH:A7","CH_97E9_11CH:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:D5","text":"A valid redefinition of nobility must be plural, differentiated, and value-positing.","refs":["CH_97E9_11CH:A9","CH_97E9_11CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:D6","text":"The multiplicity of nobles functions as the political counterpart to the multiplicity of gods.","refs":["CH_97E9_11CH:A10","CH_97E9_11CH:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:SD1","text":"The central political problem is not the interpretation of the past as such, but its monopolization by either a tyrannical or a leveling instance.","refs":["CH_97E9_11CH:A1","CH_97E9_11CH:A3","CH_97E9_11CH:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:SD2","text":"Plural nobility is generated as the institutional form of an open temporal order: many value-positers prevent both unitary interpretation and temporal impoverishment.","refs":["CH_97E9_11CH:A7","CH_97E9_11CH:A8","CH_97E9_11CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:SD3","text":"The system replaces the search for a final authoritative source of value with a differentiated multiplicity of value-positing instances.","refs":["CH_97E9_11CH:A9","CH_97E9_11CH:A10","CH_97E9_11CH:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:SD4","text":"Temporal continuity is secured not through preservation of the past, but through resistance to its monopolistic fixation.","refs":["CH_97E9_11CH:A1","CH_97E9_11CH:A3","CH_97E9_11CH:A5","CH_97E9_11CH:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:DNX1","text":"Excluded is the notion of a neutral, unmediated past that persists independently of coming generations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a uniform standard that definitively determines the meaning of all past events.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a political order in which temporal orientation is either completely centralized or completely leveled.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:DNX4","text":"Excluded is the assumption that an order of values arises through uniformity, singularity, or mere majority power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:SNX1","text":"The text organizes itself around the absence of a legitimate final interpreter of the past.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:SNX2","text":"Inadmissible is a temporal order in which no competing value-positings and no historical depth are any longer possible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:SNX3","text":"The blocked possibility is a plurally open future that is neither preformed by the violence-ruler nor shortened by the mob.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:SNX4","text":"Unavailable is a unitary god as a metaphysical or political model of order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:FGS1","text":"Exposure of the past → generational reinterpretation → possible monopolization through violence or shortening through mob rule.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:FGS2","text":"Monopolization or shortening → destruction of historical openness → necessity of a counterprinciple.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:FGS3","text":"Counterprinciple → new nobility → double negation of mob and tyrannical rule.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:FGS4","text":"Double negation → new tablets → redefinition of the noble through multiplicity and difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:FGS5","text":"Multiplicity of nobles → no final value-instance → political counterpart of the multiplicity of gods without god.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:AF1","text":"Exposed past → double endangerment through violence-ruler and mob → impairment of time → new nobility as counterpower → new tablets of the noble → multiplicity of nobles without a unitary final instance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:ME1","text":"The past is remapped from a closed stock into a contested material of coming generations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:ME2","text":"Tyranny and mob rule are classified, despite their opposition, as parallel forms of temporal destruction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:ME3","text":"Nobility is redrawn from a fixed social hierarchy into a plural practice of value-positing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:ME4","text":"Unity of rule and unity of divinity are removed from the same conceptual field.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:ME5","text":"The political alternative does not run between rule and non-rule, but between monopolistic and plural value-positing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** The past is exposed to reinterpretation by coming generations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Violent rule and mob rule act as different mechanisms of temporal deformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Resistance is conceived as the construction of a plural aristocratic counterorder and not as a return to a past order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Time appears as an open multiplicity of possibilities of interpretation and value-positing without a final unitary instance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from the exposure of the past to the demand for plural nobility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined according to which criteria the many nobles are selected or their new tablets legitimized.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as monopolization and leveling count as two forms of the same temporal impoverishment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:MRT4","text":"The strongest connection exists between the double danger and the double opposition of the new nobility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:MRT5","text":"A tension remains between the demand for new tablets and the rejection of every unitary final instance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:MRT6","text":"A further tension lies in the fact that aristocratic counterpower itself could turn into tyrannical centralization; the text normatively demarcates this possibility, but does not formalize its prevention.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11CH:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement insofar as multiplicity is understood not as mere number, but as the structural prevention of a single god, ruler, or interpreter of time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_11CH@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_11CH:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On Old and New Tablets","source_section_label":"11.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 11","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","11."],"original_title":"11."}],"source_title_context":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln","source_section_label":"11.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 11","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","11."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 92","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 11","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln · 11"},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH","layer":"CH","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 12","order":93,"parents":["RAW_97E9_12CH"],"revision":"CH_97E9_12CH@R001","sha256":"a575e9746cff0248f1f56162555cd0d16bcb4c7da9cd399ea045933314780c3d","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:AS1","text":"Das Problem besteht in einer Adelauffassung, die Herkunft, käuflichen Wert, Dienst, Konformität und religiöse Tradition privilegiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:AS2","text":"Adel wird neu bestimmt als Ausrichtung des Willens und des Handelns über das gegenwärtige Selbst hinaus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:AS3","text":"Diese Ausrichtung erhält ihre operative Form in Zeugung, Züchtung und Aussaat einer zukünftigen Menschheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:AS4","text":"Die genealogische Rückbindung an Vater- und Urväterländer wird durch eine zukunftsgerichtete Bindung an das Land der Kinder ersetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:AS5","text":"Die Zukunft soll das Vergangene durch Nachkommenschaft erlösen und eine neue Werttafel über die Gegenwart setzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:A1","text":"Adel wird nicht durch Herkunft, sondern durch Zielrichtung bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:A2","text":"Wert, der käuflich ist, besitzt keinen eigentlichen Adel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:A3","text":"Der über das gegenwärtige Selbst hinausgehende Wille und Schritt konstituieren neue Ehre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:A4","text":"Dienst an Fürsten oder bestehenden Ordnungen begründet keinen Adel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:A5","text":"Höfische Anpassung und passives Verharren sind keine höheren Tugenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:A6","text":"Religiös legitimierte Herkunft und historische Sendung besitzen keinen selbständigen Wert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:A7","text":"Der neue Adel besteht in der Fähigkeit, Zukunft zu zeugen, zu züchten und auszusäen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:A8","text":"Die Zukunft der Kinder bildet den maßgeblichen Horizont des Handelns.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:A9","text":"Die Bindung an Vater- und Urväterländer muss zugunsten einer Bindung an das Land der Kinder aufgegeben werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:A10","text":"Nachkommenschaft kann das Vergangene nachträglich erlösen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:A11","text":"Eine neue Werttafel muss über die gegenwärtige Ordnung gesetzt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:A12","text":"Der Sprecher besitzt die Autorität, diese neue Adelspflicht zu weihen und zuzuweisen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:NX1","text":"Adel ist nicht käuflicher Rang.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:NX2","text":"Adel ist nicht durch Herkunft gegeben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:NX3","text":"Adel ist nicht Dienst an einem Fürsten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:NX4","text":"Adel ist nicht Schutz oder Stabilisierung des Bestehenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:NX5","text":"Adel ist nicht höfische Anpassung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:NX6","text":"Stillstehen und Sitzenkönnen sind keine eigentlichen Verdienste.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:NX7","text":"Adel ist nicht durch die religiöse Führung der Vorfahren begründet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:NX8","text":"Die Vergangenheit ist kein ausreichender Zielhorizont des Adels.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:NX9","text":"Vater- und Urväterländer sind keine verpflichtenden politischen oder ethischen Bezugspunkte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:D1","text":"Ehre wird von der sozialen Herkunft auf die gerichtete Zukunftsbewegung des Subjekts verlagert.","refs":["CH_97E9_12CH:A1","CH_97E9_12CH:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:D2","text":"Eine Ordnung, die Wert über Kauf, Dienst oder Konformität verteilt, kann den neuen Adel nicht hervorbringen.","refs":["CH_97E9_12CH:A2","CH_97E9_12CH:A4","CH_97E9_12CH:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:D3","text":"Der neue Adelige muss sich als Produzent zukünftiger Menschen und Werte verstehen.","refs":["CH_97E9_12CH:A3","CH_97E9_12CH:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:D4","text":"Zukunftsorientierung verlangt eine Loslösung von überlieferten Herkunftsräumen.","refs":["CH_97E9_12CH:A8","CH_97E9_12CH:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:D5","text":"Die Nachkommenschaft wird zum Medium, durch das die Gegenwart ihre belastete Herkunft überschreiten soll.","refs":["CH_97E9_12CH:A8","CH_97E9_12CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:D6","text":"Die neue Wertordnung erhält ihre Geltung nicht aus Überlieferung, sondern aus Setzung.","refs":["CH_97E9_12CH:A6","CH_97E9_12CH:A11","CH_97E9_12CH:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:SD1","text":"Das genealogische Prinzip wird umgekehrt: Nicht die Vorfahren legitimieren die Nachkommen, sondern die Nachkommen sollen die Vorfahren nachträglich rechtfertigen.","refs":["CH_97E9_12CH:A1","CH_97E9_12CH:A8","CH_97E9_12CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:SD2","text":"Adel wird von einem vererbten Status in eine transgenerative Produktionsaufgabe transformiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_12CH:A2","CH_97E9_12CH:A7","CH_97E9_12CH:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:SD3","text":"Die politische Orientierung verschiebt sich von Erhaltung und Dienst zu Ausschiffung, Entdeckung und Erzeugung einer noch nicht verfügbaren Ordnung.","refs":["CH_97E9_12CH:A4","CH_97E9_12CH:A8","CH_97E9_12CH:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:SD4","text":"Die Zukunft fungiert zugleich als Ziel, Bewertungsinstanz und nachträgliche Rechtfertigung der Gegenwart.","refs":["CH_97E9_12CH:A3","CH_97E9_12CH:A8","CH_97E9_12CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass Legitimität aus bloßer Kontinuität mit einer bestehenden Ordnung entstehen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:DNX2","text":"Es schließt aus, dass Herkunft eine eigenständige Quelle von Wert, Ehre oder Verpflichtung ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:DNX3","text":"Es schließt aus, dass politische oder religiöse Institutionen die Zukunft normativ vorgeben dürfen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:DNX4","text":"Es schließt aus, dass der Einzelne sein Ziel innerhalb der Grenzen des gegenwärtigen Selbst finden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:DNX5","text":"Es schließt aus, dass Vergangenheit und Zukunft symmetrische Wertquellen sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:SNX1","text":"Unzulässig ist eine Zukunft, die lediglich die Gegenwart reproduziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:SNX2","text":"Unverfügbar ist ein bereits vorhandener Maßstab, aus dem die neue Werttafel abgeleitet werden könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine nicht-transgressive Form von Zugehörigkeit, die Herkunft bewahrt und dennoch Zukunft erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:SNX4","text":"Der Text organisiert sich um die Abwesenheit eines noch nicht entdeckten Landes, das nur durch gerichtete Erzeugung erreichbar werden soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:FGS1","text":"Überlieferter Status → Ausschluss von Kauf, Herkunft, Dienst, Konformität und religiöser Legitimation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:FGS2","text":"Ausschluss der alten Adelsquellen → Verlagerung des Ehrmaßstabs auf Wille, Schritt und Überschreitung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:FGS3","text":"Überschreitung des Selbst → Definition des Subjekts als Zeuger, Züchter und Säemann der Zukunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:FGS4","text":"Zukunftserzeugung → Auflösung der Bindung an Vater- und Urväterländer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:FGS5","text":"Bindung an das Land der Kinder → Nachkommenschaft als Medium der Erlösung des Vergangenen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:FGS6","text":"Erlösung des Vergangenen → Setzung einer neuen Werttafel über die bestehende Ordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:AF1","text":"Käuflicher und ererbter Adel → Ausschluss von Herkunft, Dienst und Konformität → Zielgerichtete Selbstüberschreitung → Zeugung und Aussaat der Zukunft → Bruch mit den Herkunftsländern → Liebe zum Land der Kinder → Nachträgliche Erlösung des Vergangenen → neue Werttafel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:ME1","text":"Adel wird von einer sozialen Rangordnung in eine zeitliche Orientierungsstruktur umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:ME2","text":"Herkunft und Ziel werden als konkurrierende Quellen von Ehre getrennt; das Ziel erhält Vorrang.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:ME3","text":"Zeugung, Züchtung und Aussaat werden von biologischen oder agrarischen Vorgängen zu politischen und wertsetzenden Operationen erweitert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:ME4","text":"Die Nachkommenschaft wird nicht mehr als Erbe der Vergangenheit, sondern als Produzent ihrer nachträglichen Rechtfertigung klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:ME5","text":"Heimat wird aus einem rückwärts bindenden Herkunftsraum in einen noch unentdeckten Zukunftsraum transformiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der neue Adel soll durch Zukunftszeugung, Zukunftszüchtung und Zukunftsaussaat verwirklicht werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:ALT2","text":"Structural — Das System ersetzt ererbte, käufliche, höfische und religiöse Legitimation durch eine transgenerative Wertproduktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Kampf gegen die alte Ordnung wird nicht als unmittelbare Machtübernahme, sondern als Umrichtung von Ehre, Zugehörigkeit und Zeit organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Das Subjekt wird als Übergangswesen bestimmt, dessen eigentliche Geltung erst durch eine kommende Generation und eine kommende Ordnung entsteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Verschiebung von ererbtem zu zukunftsgerichtetem Adel zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:MRT2","text":"Die Ausschlussstruktur reicht aus, um die alten Legitimationsmodelle als systematisch unzulässig abzubilden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, was genau als „Land der Kinder“, „Züchtung“ und „neue Tafel“ institutionell oder praktisch gelten soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:MRT4","text":"Intern kohärent ist die Bewegung von Herkunftsnegation über Selbstüberschreitung zu transgenerativer Setzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:MRT5","text":"Eine Spannung entsteht daraus, dass der neue Adel gegen Vererbung polemisiert, aber weiterhin über Nachkommenschaft organisiert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung liegt in der autoritativen Zuweisung eines nicht-käuflichen Adels durch den Sprecher selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, solange die Erlösung der Vergangenheit als Zukunftsfunktion und nicht als Versöhnung mit der Herkunft verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T184611702974Z_8a23a783","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"12.","source_sha256":"a575e9746cff0248f1f56162555cd0d16bcb4c7da9cd399ea045933314780c3d","sha256":"2c80f26d982fc58ba9a9f2d4229af228e1451cf54178f9d2466a48f6a6b2efc4","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T18:46:11.705624+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:AS1","text":"The problem consists in a conception of nobility that privileges origin, purchasable value, service, conformity, and religious tradition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:AS2","text":"Nobility is redefined as the orientation of will and action beyond the present self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:AS3","text":"This orientation receives its operative form in the begetting, breeding, and sowing of a future humanity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:AS4","text":"The genealogical attachment to the lands of fathers and forefathers is replaced by a future-oriented attachment to the land of the children.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:AS5","text":"The future is to redeem the past through posterity and place a new table of values above the present.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:A1","text":"Nobility is determined not by origin but by direction toward a goal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:A2","text":"Value that is purchasable possesses no genuine nobility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:A3","text":"The will and step that go beyond the present self constitute new honor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:A4","text":"Service to princes or existing orders establishes no nobility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:A5","text":"Courtly adaptation and passive remaining are not higher virtues.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:A6","text":"Religiously legitimized origin and historical mission possess no independent value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:A7","text":"The new nobility consists in the capacity to beget, breed, and sow the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:A8","text":"The future of the children forms the governing horizon of action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:A9","text":"Attachment to the lands of fathers and forefathers must be relinquished in favor of attachment to the land of the children.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:A10","text":"Posterity can redeem the past retrospectively.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:A11","text":"A new table of values must be placed above the present order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:A12","text":"The speaker possesses the authority to consecrate and assign this new duty of nobility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:NX1","text":"Nobility is not purchasable rank.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:NX2","text":"Nobility is not given through origin.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:NX3","text":"Nobility is not service to a prince.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:NX4","text":"Nobility is not the protection or stabilization of what exists.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:NX5","text":"Nobility is not courtly adaptation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:NX6","text":"Standing still and being able to sit still are no genuine merits.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:NX7","text":"Nobility is not grounded in the religious guidance of the ancestors.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:NX8","text":"The past is not a sufficient horizon of purpose for nobility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:NX9","text":"The lands of fathers and forefathers are not binding political or ethical points of reference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:D1","text":"Honor is shifted from social origin to the subject's directed movement toward the future.","refs":["CH_97E9_12CH:A1","CH_97E9_12CH:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:D2","text":"An order that distributes value through purchase, service, or conformity cannot bring forth the new nobility.","refs":["CH_97E9_12CH:A2","CH_97E9_12CH:A4","CH_97E9_12CH:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:D3","text":"The new noble must understand himself as a producer of future human beings and values.","refs":["CH_97E9_12CH:A3","CH_97E9_12CH:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:D4","text":"Orientation toward the future demands detachment from inherited spaces of origin.","refs":["CH_97E9_12CH:A8","CH_97E9_12CH:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:D5","text":"Posterity becomes the medium through which the present is to transcend its burdened origin.","refs":["CH_97E9_12CH:A8","CH_97E9_12CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:D6","text":"The new order of values receives its validity not from tradition but from positing.","refs":["CH_97E9_12CH:A6","CH_97E9_12CH:A11","CH_97E9_12CH:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:SD1","text":"The genealogical principle is reversed: it is not the ancestors who legitimize the descendants, but the descendants who are to justify the ancestors retrospectively.","refs":["CH_97E9_12CH:A1","CH_97E9_12CH:A8","CH_97E9_12CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:SD2","text":"Nobility is transformed from an inherited status into a transgenerative task of production.","refs":["CH_97E9_12CH:A2","CH_97E9_12CH:A7","CH_97E9_12CH:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:SD3","text":"Political orientation shifts from preservation and service to setting sail, discovery, and the production of an order not yet available.","refs":["CH_97E9_12CH:A4","CH_97E9_12CH:A8","CH_97E9_12CH:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:SD4","text":"The future functions simultaneously as goal, evaluative instance, and retrospective justification of the present.","refs":["CH_97E9_12CH:A3","CH_97E9_12CH:A8","CH_97E9_12CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:DNX1","text":"The system excludes the possibility that legitimacy can arise from mere continuity with an existing order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:DNX2","text":"It excludes the possibility that origin is an autonomous source of value, honor, or obligation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:DNX3","text":"It excludes the possibility that political or religious institutions may normatively prescribe the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:DNX4","text":"It excludes the possibility that the individual can find his goal within the limits of the present self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:DNX5","text":"It excludes the possibility that past and future are symmetrical sources of value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:SNX1","text":"A future that merely reproduces the present is inadmissible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:SNX2","text":"Unavailable is an already existing standard from which the new table of values could be derived.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:SNX3","text":"Excluded is a non-transgressive form of belonging that preserves origin and nevertheless produces the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:SNX4","text":"The text organizes itself around the absence of a land not yet discovered, which is to become attainable only through directed production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:FGS1","text":"Inherited status → exclusion of purchase, origin, service, conformity, and religious legitimation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:FGS2","text":"Exclusion of the old sources of nobility → shifting of the measure of honor to will, step, and transgression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:FGS3","text":"Transcendence of the self → definition of the subject as begetter, breeder, and sower of the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:FGS4","text":"Production of the future → dissolution of attachment to the lands of fathers and forefathers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:FGS5","text":"Attachment to the land of the children → posterity as the medium of redemption of the past.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:FGS6","text":"Redemption of the past → positing of a new table of values above the existing order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:AF1","text":"Purchasable and inherited nobility → exclusion of origin, service, and conformity → goal-directed self-transcendence → begetting and sowing of the future → break with the lands of origin → love of the land of the children → retrospective redemption of the past → new table of values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:ME1","text":"Nobility is remapped from a social hierarchy into a temporal structure of orientation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:ME2","text":"Origin and goal are separated as competing sources of honor; the goal receives priority.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:ME3","text":"Begetting, breeding, and sowing are extended from biological or agrarian processes into political and value-positing operations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:ME4","text":"Posterity is classified no longer as the heir of the past, but as the producer of its retrospective justification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:ME5","text":"Homeland is transformed from a space of origin binding backward into a future space not yet discovered.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:ALT1","text":"Surface — The new nobility is to be realized through the begetting, breeding, and sowing of the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:ALT2","text":"Structural — The system replaces inherited, purchasable, courtly, and religious legitimation with a transgenerative production of value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The struggle against the old order is organized not as an immediate seizure of power, but as a redirection of honor, belonging, and time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The subject is determined as a transitional being whose proper validity arises only through a coming generation and a coming order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the shift from inherited to future-oriented nobility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:MRT2","text":"The structure of exclusion suffices to represent the old models of legitimation as systematically inadmissible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:MRT3","text":"What remains underdetermined is what exactly is to count institutionally or practically as “land of the children,” “breeding,” and “new table.”","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:MRT4","text":"Internally coherent is the movement from the negation of origin through self-transcendence to transgenerative positing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:MRT5","text":"A tension arises from the fact that the new nobility polemicizes against inheritance, yet continues to be organized through posterity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:MRT6","text":"A further tension lies in the authoritative assignment of a non-purchasable nobility by the speaker himself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12CH:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement insofar as the redemption of the past is understood as a function of the future and not as reconciliation with origin.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_12CH@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_12CH:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On Old and New Tablets","source_section_label":"12.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 12","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","12."],"original_title":"12."}],"source_title_context":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln","source_section_label":"12.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 12","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","12."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 93","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 12","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln · 12"},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH","layer":"CH","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 13","order":94,"parents":["RAW_97E9_13CH"],"revision":"CH_97E9_13CH@R001","sha256":"25dbb8125943afddc99e69a4318a2c54ed696ad3a32bd0ed472096c7db6120a1","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:AS1","text":"Der Text problematisiert eine als Weisheit verehrte Rede, die das Leben als eitel, vergeblich und schmerzhaft bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:AS2","text":"Er bestimmt deren Autorität als Effekt von Alter, Moder und überlieferter Ehrfurcht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:AS3","text":"Er entlarvt die lebensverneinende Rede als Ausdruck von Furcht, Kindlichkeit und eigener Unfähigkeit zur Bejahung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:AS4","text":"Er überführt die Klage über das vergebliche Leben in einen Selbstwiderspruch desjenigen, der selbst nichts zum Leben beiträgt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:AS5","text":"Die Gegenposition besteht in der affirmativen Neubewertung von Essen, Trinken, Hunger und Wärme als nicht-eitler Lebensvollzüge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:A1","text":"Alter verleiht einer Rede keine Wahrheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:A2","text":"Überlieferte Weisheit kann aus Furcht vor Schmerz hervorgehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:A3","text":"Die Klage über die Eitelkeit des Lebens setzt eine Bewertung des Lebens voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:A4","text":"Wer das Leben als vergeblich bezeichnet, ohne selbst etwas einzubringen, spricht aus einer Position des Mangels.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:A5","text":"Die Metapher des Strohdraschens bezeichnet eine Tätigkeit ohne fruchtbare Hervorbringung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:A6","text":"Die Unfähigkeit, warm zu werden, wird als Unfähigkeit zur Aneignung von Lebenskraft gelesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:A7","text":"Essen und Trinken können als affirmative, nicht-eitle Lebensvollzüge gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:A8","text":"Eine lebensbejahende Kritik muss die Tafeln der Nimmer-Frohen zerbrechen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:NX1","text":"Weisheit ist nicht deshalb wahr, weil sie alt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:NX2","text":"Das Leben ist nicht notwendig als Eitelkeit oder Vergeblichkeit zu bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:NX3","text":"Leidenserfahrung legitimiert keine allgemeine Verurteilung des Lebens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:NX4","text":"Wer nichts hervorbringt, besitzt keine widerspruchsfreie Grundlage, das Leben als vergeblich zu verurteilen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:NX5","text":"Essen und Trinken sind nicht als niedrige oder geistlose Tätigkeiten ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:NX6","text":"Lebensbejahung ist nicht mit asketischer Entsagung gleichzusetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:D1","text":"Die Ehrung alter Weisheit beruht auf einer Verwechslung von zeitlicher Priorität und Geltung.","refs":["CH_97E9_13CH:A1","CH_97E9_13CH:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:D2","text":"Die Rede von der Eitelkeit des Lebens wird als Symptom einer affektiven Unfähigkeit zur Lebensaneignung lesbar.","refs":["CH_97E9_13CH:A2","CH_97E9_13CH:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:D3","text":"Die Metapher des Strohdraschens kehrt sich gegen ihren Sprecher, sobald dieser selbst keine Frucht hervorbringt.","refs":["CH_97E9_13CH:A4","CH_97E9_13CH:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:D4","text":"Die Verurteilung des Lebens kann als Selbstverurteilung des Urteilenden erscheinen.","refs":["CH_97E9_13CH:A3","CH_97E9_13CH:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:D5","text":"Körperliche Bedürfnisbefriedigung wird aus der Sphäre des Nichtigen in die Sphäre der Lebensbejahung überführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_13CH:A7","CH_97E9_13CH:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:SD1","text":"Der Text ersetzt die Wahrheitsfrage der Weisheitsrede durch eine genealogische Frage nach ihrem affektiven Ursprung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:SD2","text":"Lebensverneinende Allgemeinurteile werden als sekundäre Produkte eines geschwächten Verhältnisses zur eigenen Lebenskraft klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:SD3","text":"Die Wertung des Lebens wird an der Fähigkeit zur Hervorbringung, Aneignung und Erwärmung statt an Alter, Abstraktion oder Entsagung gemessen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass Entbehrung, Kälte oder Schmerz von sich aus epistemische Autorität erzeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:DNX2","text":"Es schließt aus, dass negative Lebensurteile unabhängig von der körperlichen und affektiven Verfassung ihres Sprechers gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:DNX3","text":"Es schließt aus, dass geistige Höhe durch die Verachtung elementarer Lebensvollzüge bewiesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Weisheit, deren Wahrheit gerade in der dauerhaften Unfähigkeit zur Freude, Wärme und Sättigung bestehen soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:SNX2","text":"Unzulässig wird die Vorstellung eines neutralen, körperlosen Standpunkts, von dem aus das Leben als Ganzes verurteilt werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:FGS1","text":"Überlieferte Negativformel → Prüfung ihrer Autorität → Alter wird von Wahrheit getrennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:FGS2","text":"Lebensmetapher des Vergeblichen → Rückführung auf Furcht, Schmerz und mangelnde Erwärmung → Weisheit wird als Symptom reklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:FGS3","text":"Klage über das Nichtige → Prüfung der eigenen Hervorbringung → Selbstwiderspruch des klagenden Subjekts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:FGS4","text":"Abwertung von Essen und Trinken → affirmative Gegenbesetzung körperlicher Vollzüge → Zerbruch der asketischen Werttafeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:AF1","text":"Überlieferte Lebensverneinung → Entwertung ihres Altersprivilegs → Genealogie der Furcht → Selbstwiderspruch des Unproduktiven → Affirmation von Hunger, Essen, Trinken und Wärme → Zurückweisung der asketischen Wertordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:ME1","text":"Alter wird von einem Wahrheitsindikator zu einem möglichen Zeichen von Verfall und Moder umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:ME2","text":"Weisheit wird nicht mehr primär nach ihrem Inhalt, sondern nach der Lebensform und Affektlage ihres Sprechers kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:ME3","text":"Die Opposition zwischen Geistigkeit und Körperlichkeit wird zugunsten einer Prüfung ihrer jeweiligen Lebenswirksamkeit verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:ME4","text":"Essen und Trinken werden von bloßen Bedürfnissen zu Kriterien einer affirmativen Wertordnung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — Eine pessimistische Formel über die Eitelkeit des Lebens wird zurückgewiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — Überlieferung, affektive Disposition und fehlende Hervorbringung organisieren die Autorität des negativen Urteils.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — Der Text verschiebt die Auseinandersetzung von der Widerlegung einzelner Sätze zur Demontage der Werttafel, die sie trägt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — Leben erscheint als körperlich-affektiver Vollzug von Wärme, Nahrung, Sättigung und Hervorbringung; Zeit garantiert keine Wahrheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von der überlieferten Lebensverneinung zur affirmativen Gegenposition zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, worin die positive Grenze zwischen affirmativem Genuss und bloßer Bedürfnisbefriedigung besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern die körperlichen Metaphern als Kriterien affektiver Lebensfähigkeit gelesen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Stelle liegt in der Rückwendung des Urteils über das Leben auf die Lebensfähigkeit des Urteilenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:MRT5","text":"Die Argumentation hängt komprimierend an der Gleichsetzung von Nicht-Hervorbringen, Mangel und unberechtigter Lebensklage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:MRT6","text":"Die Spannung zwischen polemischer Totalverwerfung der alten Weisheit und ihrer möglichen partiellen Geltung wird nicht aufgelöst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, sofern die Schlussposition nicht als bloße Aufforderung zum Genuss, sondern als Umwertung der Lebensbewertung verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T184709378365Z_1b3d5dfc","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"13.","source_sha256":"25dbb8125943afddc99e69a4318a2c54ed696ad3a32bd0ed472096c7db6120a1","sha256":"8389a6708a032f3c6bd4f3417281ef479c2ee7571f844b9c8d5524f527cfc470","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T18:47:09.380792+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:AS1","text":"The text problematizes a discourse revered as wisdom that characterizes life as vain, futile, and painful.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:AS2","text":"It determines its authority as an effect of age, decay, and inherited reverence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:AS3","text":"It exposes life-denying discourse as an expression of fear, childishness, and one's own incapacity for affirmation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:AS4","text":"It turns the complaint about futile life into a self-contradiction of the one who himself contributes nothing to life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:AS5","text":"The counterposition consists in the affirmative revaluation of eating, drinking, hunger, and warmth as non-vain enactments of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:A1","text":"Age confers no truth upon a discourse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:A2","text":"Inherited wisdom can arise from fear of pain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:A3","text":"The complaint about the vanity of life presupposes an evaluation of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:A4","text":"Whoever calls life futile without himself contributing anything speaks from a position of deficiency.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:A5","text":"The metaphor of threshing straw denotes an activity without fruitful production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:A6","text":"The inability to become warm is read as an inability to appropriate vital force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:A7","text":"Eating and drinking can count as affirmative, non-vain enactments of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:A8","text":"A life-affirming critique must shatter the tablets of the never-cheerful.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:NX1","text":"Wisdom is not true because it is old.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:NX2","text":"Life need not be characterized as vanity or futility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:NX3","text":"The experience of suffering does not legitimize a general condemnation of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:NX4","text":"Whoever produces nothing possesses no contradiction-free basis for condemning life as futile.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:NX5","text":"Eating and drinking are not excluded as low or spiritless activities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:NX6","text":"Affirmation of life is not to be equated with ascetic renunciation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:D1","text":"The honoring of old wisdom rests on a confusion of temporal priority and validity.","refs":["CH_97E9_13CH:A1","CH_97E9_13CH:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:D2","text":"Discourse on the vanity of life becomes legible as a symptom of an affective incapacity for appropriating life.","refs":["CH_97E9_13CH:A2","CH_97E9_13CH:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:D3","text":"The metaphor of threshing straw turns against its speaker as soon as he himself produces no fruit.","refs":["CH_97E9_13CH:A4","CH_97E9_13CH:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:D4","text":"The condemnation of life can appear as the self-condemnation of the one judging.","refs":["CH_97E9_13CH:A3","CH_97E9_13CH:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:D5","text":"The satisfaction of bodily needs is transferred from the sphere of the null to the sphere of life-affirmation.","refs":["CH_97E9_13CH:A7","CH_97E9_13CH:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:SD1","text":"The text replaces the question of truth concerning wisdom discourse with a genealogical question regarding its affective origin.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:SD2","text":"Life-denying general judgments are classified as secondary products of a weakened relation to one's own vital force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:SD3","text":"The valuation of life is measured by the capacity for production, appropriation, and warming rather than by age, abstraction, or renunciation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:DNX1","text":"The system excludes the possibility that privation, cold, or pain in themselves generate epistemic authority.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:DNX2","text":"It excludes the possibility that negative judgments on life are valid independently of the bodily and affective condition of their speaker.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:DNX3","text":"It excludes the possibility that spiritual elevation is proved by contempt for elementary enactments of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a wisdom whose truth is supposed to consist precisely in the enduring incapacity for joy, warmth, and satiation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:SNX2","text":"The notion of a neutral, bodiless standpoint from which life as a whole can be condemned becomes inadmissible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:FGS1","text":"Inherited negative formula → examination of its authority → age is separated from truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:FGS2","text":"Life-metaphor of futility → reduction to fear, pain, and deficient warming → wisdom is reclassified as a symptom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:FGS3","text":"Complaint about the null → examination of one's own production → self-contradiction of the complaining subject.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:FGS4","text":"Devaluation of eating and drinking → affirmative counterinvestment of bodily enactments → shattering of the ascetic tablets of values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:AF1","text":"Inherited life-denial → devaluation of its privilege of age → genealogy of fear → self-contradiction of the unproductive → affirmation of hunger, eating, drinking, and warmth → rejection of the ascetic order of values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:ME1","text":"Age is remapped from an indicator of truth into a possible sign of decay and rot.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:ME2","text":"Wisdom is no longer mapped primarily according to its content, but according to the form of life and affective condition of its speaker.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:ME3","text":"The opposition between spirituality and corporeality is displaced in favor of an examination of their respective efficacy for life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:ME4","text":"Eating and drinking are reclassified from mere needs into criteria of an affirmative order of values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — A pessimistic formula concerning the vanity of life is rejected.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — Tradition, affective disposition, and lack of production organize the authority of negative judgment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — The text shifts the confrontation from the refutation of individual propositions to the dismantling of the tablet of values that bears them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — Life appears as a bodily-affective enactment of warmth, nourishment, satiation, and production; time guarantees no truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from inherited life-denial to the affirmative counterposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is wherein the positive boundary between affirmative enjoyment and mere satisfaction of needs consists.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as the bodily metaphors are read as criteria of affective vitality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:MRT4","text":"Its strongest point lies in turning the judgment about life back upon the vitality of the one judging.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:MRT5","text":"The argument depends, in compressed form, on the equation of non-production, deficiency, and illegitimate complaint about life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:MRT6","text":"The tension between the polemical total rejection of old wisdom and its possible partial validity is not resolved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13CH:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement insofar as the concluding position is understood not as a mere exhortation to enjoyment, but as a revaluation of the valuation of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_13CH@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_13CH:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On Old and New Tablets","source_section_label":"13.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 13","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","13."],"original_title":"13."}],"source_title_context":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln","source_section_label":"13.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 13","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","13."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 94","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 13","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln · 13"},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH","layer":"CH","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 14","order":95,"parents":["RAW_97E9_14CH"],"revision":"CH_97E9_14CH@R001","sha256":"7445203a118b1ceec7762d9dffd089be5ddafa411d3fa8b0cbd58fb2a212a6fc","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:AS1","text":"Die Reinheitsbehauptung wird gegen die Beschaffenheit ihres Sprechers zurückgelesen: Nicht alles ist rein, sondern dem Unsauberen erscheint alles als Unsauberkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:AS2","text":"Die Verachtung der Welt wird als Projektion eines unsäuberlichen Geistes bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:AS3","text":"Die Welt wird weder gereinigt noch als Ganzes zum Schmutzmonstrum erklärt, sondern als partiell mit einem „Hintern“ und mit Kot versehen anerkannt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:AS4","text":"Der Ekel wird von einem abschließenden Urteil in eine produktive Erkenntnis- und Überwindungskraft umgewertet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:AS5","text":"Die Weltbejahung entsteht nicht durch Ausschluss des Widerlichen, sondern durch dessen begrenzte Anerkennung und funktionale Umdeutung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:A1","text":"Reinheit ist keine neutrale Eigenschaft der Welt, sondern eine perspektivisch erzeugte Zuschreibung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:A2","text":"Unsauberkeit im Geist prägt die Wahrnehmung der Welt als Ganzes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:A3","text":"Die Welt besitzt einen negativen, körperlich codierten Anteil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:A4","text":"Der negative Anteil der Welt identifiziert die Welt nicht vollständig mit dem Negativen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:A5","text":"Die Existenz von Kot in der Welt ist wahr.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:A6","text":"Ekel kann Erkenntnis und aufsteigende Kräfte hervorbringen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:A7","text":"Auch das Beste enthält einen widerlichen Rest.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:A8","text":"Auch das Beste bleibt überwindbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:A9","text":"Weltbejahung setzt nicht die Abwesenheit des Widerlichen voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:A10","text":"Die Anerkennung des Widerlichen kann Weisheit erzeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:NX1","text":"Die Welt ist nicht als Ganzes ein „kothiges Ungeheuer“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:NX2","text":"Das Vorhandensein von Kot macht die Welt nicht vollständig zu Kot.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:NX3","text":"Die Perspektive des „Reinen“ erzeugt keine allgemeine Wahrheit über die Welt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:NX4","text":"Die „Hinterweltler“ besitzen keinen privilegierten Zugang zur Wirklichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:NX5","text":"Ekel ist kein hinreichender Grund für Weltverwerfung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:NX6","text":"Das Beste ist nicht von jedem widerlichen Rest gereinigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:NX7","text":"Überwindung bedeutet nicht Auslöschung des Negativen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:D1","text":"Die Reinheitsformel kehrt sich gegen ihre Sprecher, weil ihre Reinheitszuschreibung ihre eigene Perspektive offenlegt.","refs":["CH_97E9_14CH:A1","CH_97E9_14CH:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:D2","text":"Die Totalisierung des Ekels ist ein Wahrnehmungsfehler, weil ein partieller Weltaspekt unzulässig auf die Welt als Ganzes ausgedehnt wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_14CH:A3","CH_97E9_14CH:A4","CH_97E9_14CH:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:D3","text":"Die Hinterwelt entsteht als Reaktion auf die Unfähigkeit, den negativen Weltanteil begrenzt anzuerkennen.","refs":["CH_97E9_14CH:A2","CH_97E9_14CH:A3","CH_97E9_14CH:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:D4","text":"Ekel kann den Blick aus der bloßen Abscheu in eine erkenntnisförmige Bewegung überführen.","refs":["CH_97E9_14CH:A5","CH_97E9_14CH:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:D5","text":"Das Beste ist nicht Endpunkt der Bewertung, sondern Material weiterer Überwindung.","refs":["CH_97E9_14CH:A7","CH_97E9_14CH:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:D6","text":"Weisheit entsteht aus der Spannung zwischen der Anerkennung des Ekels und der Verweigerung seiner Totalisierung.","refs":["CH_97E9_14CH:A4","CH_97E9_14CH:A6","CH_97E9_14CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:SD1","text":"Das System ersetzt die Alternative „reine Welt oder schmutzige Welt“ durch eine abgestufte Ontologie partieller Negativität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:SD2","text":"Weltbejahung wird als Fähigkeit konstruiert, den Widerstand der Welt auszuhalten, ohne ihn metaphysisch zu verdoppeln oder totalisierend zu verwerfen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:SD3","text":"Der Ekel fungiert zugleich als Diagnose des Bestehenden, als Antrieb zur Selbst- und Weltüberwindung und als Kriterium gegen falsche Reinheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:SD4","text":"Die höchste Wertposition bleibt intern instabil, weil auch das Beste dem Ekel und der Überwindungsforderung untersteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:SD5","text":"Die Polemik gegen die Hinterweltler verschiebt die Frage von der Beschaffenheit der Welt auf die Qualität der Perspektive, die sie beurteilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:DNX1","text":"Eine vollständig reine Welt muss falsch sein, damit Ekel als Erkenntnisquelle und Überwindungsimpuls funktionieren kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:DNX2","text":"Ein metaphysischer Sinn hinter oder jenseits der Welt wird als unnötige Reaktion auf ihren negativen Anteil ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:DNX3","text":"Eine Perspektive, die sich selbst als rein außerhalb des Bewerteten positioniert, wird strukturell disqualifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:DNX4","text":"Die Identität von Negativität und Ganzheit wird ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:DNX5","text":"Ein endgültiger Wertzustand, der keiner Überwindung mehr bedarf, wird ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:SNX1","text":"Unverfügbare Reinheit bildet die versperrte Möglichkeit, gegen die sich die gesamte Weltbejahung richtet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:SNX2","text":"Die Hinterwelt bezeichnet die abwesende Transzendenz, die der Text nicht zulässt, weil sie den Weltmangel durch einen zweiten Bereich ersetzen würde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:SNX3","text":"Der Text kann den Ekel nicht abschaffen; er kann ihn nur seiner totalisierenden und weltverneinenden Funktion berauben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:SNX4","text":"Die Abwesenheit eines endgültig Guten hält die Bewegung der Überwindung offen, verhindert aber einen stabilen Abschluss des Wertsystems.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:FGS1","text":"Reinheitszuschreibung → Rückführung auf den Sprecher → Diagnose der Perspektive.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:FGS2","text":"Wahrnehmung des Weltnegativen → Totalisierungsversuch → Zurückweisung der Totalisierung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:FGS3","text":"Begrenzte Anerkennung des Ekels → Umwandlung in Erkenntnis- und Aufstiegskraft → strategische Weltbejahung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:FGS4","text":"Einschluss des Besten in den Ekel → Entzug des Endstatus → fortgesetzte Überwindung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:FGS5","text":"Ausschluss reiner Transzendenz + Einschluss partieller Negativität → immanente, nicht-reine Bejahungsordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:AF1","text":"Reinheitsformel → perspektivische Umkehrung → Diagnose der Weltverachtung → Begrenzung des Weltnegativen → produktive Neubestimmung des Ekels → unabschließbare Überwindung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:ME1","text":"Die Opposition von Reinheit und Schmutz wird durch die Unterscheidung zwischen partiellem Weltanteil und totalisierender Perspektive ersetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:ME2","text":"„Hinterwelt“ wird von einer metaphysischen Ortsangabe zu einem Symptom perspektivischer Weltverfehlung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:ME3","text":"Ekel wird von einem Ausschlusskriterium zu einem Übergangsmechanismus zwischen Wahrnehmung, Erkenntnis und Überwindung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:ME4","text":"Das Beste wird aus der Sphäre des Unantastbaren in die Dynamik des Vorläufigen und Überwindbaren versetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:ME5","text":"Weltbejahung wird nicht als Zustimmung zum Ganzen, sondern als Fähigkeit zur nicht-totalisierenden Aufnahme des Negativen kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — Kot, Ekel, Reinheit und die Verwerfung der Welt bilden die explizite Begriffsebene.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — Der Gegensatz wird durch Perspektivstruktur, Totalisierung und die Unterscheidung von Teil und Ganzem organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — Die Polemik entzieht der Weltverachtung ihre Autorität und verwandelt den Ekel in eine Kraft der Selbst- und Wertüberwindung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — Die Welt ist weder rein noch vollständig verdorben; Werte und Subjekte bleiben in einer offenen, unabschließbaren Überwindungszeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Umkehrung der Reinheitsformel, die Zurückweisung der Weltverachtung und die Neubestimmung des Ekels zu erzeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:MRT2","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bleibt unterbestimmt hinsichtlich dessen, was die „aufsteigenden Kräfte“ konkret hervorbringen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern partielle Negativität strikt von totaler Negativität unterschieden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Verbindung liegt zwischen begrenzter Ekelanerkennung und der Kritik metaphysischer Hinterwelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:MRT5","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen der produktiven Funktion des Ekels und seiner fortbestehenden affektiven Abstoßung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung entsteht daraus, dass Überwindung gefordert wird, ohne ein positives Endziel der Überwindung bereitzustellen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung des Textes, sofern sie nicht in eine bloße Verteidigung der Welt oder eine bloße Kritik der Reinheit verkürzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T184752406831Z_0d91e360","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"14.","source_sha256":"7445203a118b1ceec7762d9dffd089be5ddafa411d3fa8b0cbd58fb2a212a6fc","sha256":"2856b3b9836d54068a8fa783d0426f943ff662f8921066db2df122148c52cea3","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T18:47:52.408399+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:AS1","text":"The claim of purity is read back against the constitution of its speaker: not everything is pure; rather, to the unclean, everything appears as uncleanness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:AS2","text":"Contempt for the world is determined as the projection of an unclean spirit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:AS3","text":"The world is neither purified nor declared as a whole to be a filth-monster, but is acknowledged as partially furnished with an “ass” and with excrement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:AS4","text":"Disgust is revalued from a conclusive judgment into a productive force of knowledge and overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:AS5","text":"Affirmation of the world arises not through the exclusion of the repulsive, but through its limited acknowledgment and functional reinterpretation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:A1","text":"Purity is not a neutral property of the world, but a perspectivally produced attribution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:A2","text":"Uncleanness in the spirit shapes the perception of the world as a whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:A3","text":"The world possesses a negative, bodily coded component.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:A4","text":"The negative component of the world does not completely identify the world with the negative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:A5","text":"The existence of excrement in the world is true.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:A6","text":"Disgust can produce knowledge and ascending forces.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:A7","text":"Even the best contains a repulsive remainder.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:A8","text":"Even the best remains capable of being overcome.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:A9","text":"Affirmation of the world does not presuppose the absence of the repulsive.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:A10","text":"The acknowledgment of the repulsive can produce wisdom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:NX1","text":"The world is not as a whole a “shit-like monster”.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:NX2","text":"The presence of excrement does not make the world completely into excrement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:NX3","text":"The perspective of the “pure” produces no general truth about the world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:NX4","text":"The “otherworldly ones” possess no privileged access to reality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:NX5","text":"Disgust is not a sufficient reason for rejecting the world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:NX6","text":"The best is not cleansed of every repulsive remainder.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:NX7","text":"Overcoming does not mean the annihilation of the negative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:D1","text":"The purity formula turns against its speakers because its attribution of purity discloses their own perspective.","refs":["CH_97E9_14CH:A1","CH_97E9_14CH:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:D2","text":"The totalization of disgust is an error of perception because a partial aspect of the world is impermissibly extended to the world as a whole.","refs":["CH_97E9_14CH:A3","CH_97E9_14CH:A4","CH_97E9_14CH:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:D3","text":"The beyond-world arises as a reaction to the inability to acknowledge the negative component of the world in a limited manner.","refs":["CH_97E9_14CH:A2","CH_97E9_14CH:A3","CH_97E9_14CH:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:D4","text":"Disgust can transfer the gaze from mere revulsion into a movement in the form of knowledge.","refs":["CH_97E9_14CH:A5","CH_97E9_14CH:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:D5","text":"The best is not the endpoint of evaluation, but material for further overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_14CH:A7","CH_97E9_14CH:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:D6","text":"Wisdom arises from the tension between acknowledging disgust and refusing its totalization.","refs":["CH_97E9_14CH:A4","CH_97E9_14CH:A6","CH_97E9_14CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:SD1","text":"The system replaces the alternative “pure world or dirty world” with a graded ontology of partial negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:SD2","text":"Affirmation of the world is constructed as the capacity to endure the resistance of the world without metaphysically doubling it or rejecting it in a totalizing manner.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:SD3","text":"Disgust functions at once as a diagnosis of what exists, as an impetus toward self-overcoming and overcoming of the world, and as a criterion against false purity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:SD4","text":"The highest value-position remains internally unstable because even the best is subject to disgust and to the demand for overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:SD5","text":"The polemic against the otherworldly ones shifts the question from the constitution of the world to the quality of the perspective that judges it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:DNX1","text":"A completely pure world must be false for disgust to be able to function as a source of knowledge and an impulse to overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:DNX2","text":"A metaphysical meaning behind or beyond the world is excluded as an unnecessary reaction to its negative component.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:DNX3","text":"A perspective that positions itself as pure outside that which is evaluated is structurally disqualified.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:DNX4","text":"The identity of negativity and totality is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:DNX5","text":"A final state of value that no longer requires overcoming is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:SNX1","text":"Unavailable purity constitutes the blocked possibility against which the entire affirmation of the world is directed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:SNX2","text":"The beyond-world designates the absent transcendence that the text does not permit because it would replace the world's deficiency with a second realm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:SNX3","text":"The text cannot abolish disgust; it can only deprive it of its totalizing and world-denying function.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:SNX4","text":"The absence of a definitively good thing keeps the movement of overcoming open, but prevents a stable closure of the value system.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:FGS1","text":"Attribution of purity → reduction to the speaker → diagnosis of perspective.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:FGS2","text":"Perception of the world's negative → attempt at totalization → rejection of totalization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:FGS3","text":"Limited acknowledgment of disgust → transformation into a force of knowledge and ascent → strategic affirmation of the world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:FGS4","text":"Inclusion of the best within disgust → withdrawal of final status → continued overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:FGS5","text":"Exclusion of pure transcendence + inclusion of partial negativity → immanent, non-pure order of affirmation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:AF1","text":"Purity formula → perspectival reversal → diagnosis of contempt for the world → limitation of the world's negative → productive redetermination of disgust → unfinalizable overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:ME1","text":"The opposition of purity and dirt is replaced by the distinction between a partial component of the world and a totalizing perspective.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:ME2","text":"“Beyond-world” is remapped from a metaphysical indication of place into a symptom of perspectival failure with respect to the world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:ME3","text":"Disgust is reclassified from a criterion of exclusion into a transitional mechanism between perception, knowledge, and overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:ME4","text":"The best is moved from the sphere of the inviolable into the dynamic of the provisional and the capable of being overcome.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:ME5","text":"Affirmation of the world is mapped not as assent to the whole, but as the capacity for a non-totalizing reception of the negative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — Excrement, disgust, purity, and the rejection of the world constitute the explicit conceptual level.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — The opposition is organized through perspectival structure, totalization, and the distinction between part and whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — The polemic deprives contempt for the world of its authority and transforms disgust into a force of self-overcoming and overcoming of values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — The world is neither pure nor completely corrupted; values and subjects remain in an open, unfinalizable time of overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to generate the reversal of the purity formula, the rejection of contempt for the world, and the redetermination of disgust.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction remains underdetermined with regard to what the “ascending forces” concretely produce.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as partial negativity is strictly distinguished from total negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:MRT4","text":"Its strongest connection lies between the limited acknowledgment of disgust and the critique of metaphysical beyond-worlds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:MRT5","text":"A tension remains between the productive function of disgust and its continuing affective repulsion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:MRT6","text":"A further tension arises from the fact that overcoming is demanded without providing a positive final goal of overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14CH:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the text insofar as it is not reduced to a mere defense of the world or a mere critique of purity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_14CH@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_14CH:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On Old and New Tablets","source_section_label":"14.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 14","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","14."],"original_title":"14."}],"source_title_context":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln","source_section_label":"14.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 14","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","14."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 95","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 14","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln · 14"},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH","layer":"CH","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 15","order":96,"parents":["RAW_97E9_15CH"],"revision":"CH_97E9_15CH@R001","sha256":"d84c61e8bc05cb512dfc8245e5248d5674875ed47731c45c8ee8c665f5be03c7","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:AS1","text":"Fromme Hinterweltler legitimieren Weltverleugnung durch scheinbar arglose Gewissenssprüche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:AS2","text":"Die geforderte Enthaltung wird als Nicht-Eingreifen in fremde Gewalt und als Selbstunterwerfung der eigenen Vernunft bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:AS3","text":"Die scheinbare Weltentsagung beruht dadurch auf einer aktiven Verstümmelung von Handlung und Vernunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:AS4","text":"Die Sprüche werden nicht als unschuldige Frömmigkeit, sondern als besonders falsche und schlimme Weltverleumdung diagnostiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:AS5","text":"Die Gegenbewegung besteht im Zerbrechen der alten Tafeln und im Widerlegen der weltverleumderischen Sprüche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:A1","text":"Die frommen Hinterweltler behandeln Weltentsagung als Gewissenspflicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:A2","text":"Das Gebot, die Welt der Welt zu überlassen, schließt jedes eigene Eingreifen aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:A3","text":"Die Enthaltung gilt auch angesichts von Gewalt gegen andere als moralisch geboten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:A4","text":"Weltentsagung wird als Ergebnis der Weigerung dargestellt, Gewalt zu verhindern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:A5","text":"Die eigene Vernunft wird als weltzugehörig und deshalb als etwas dargestellt, das unterdrückt werden müsse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:A6","text":"Die Unterdrückung der eigenen Vernunft soll selbst zur Weltentsagung führen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:A7","text":"Die scheinbare Arglosigkeit dieser Sprüche verdeckt ihre Falschheit und Schädlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:A8","text":"Die alten Tafeln der Frommen tragen die normativen Sprüche der Weltverleugnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:A9","text":"Die Aufhebung dieser Weltverleugnung erfordert einen Bruch mit ihren überlieferten Tafeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:NX1","text":"Weltentsagung wird nicht als bloßes Zurücktreten von der Welt zugelassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:NX2","text":"Nicht-Eingreifen wird angesichts von Würgen, Stechen, Schneiden und Schaben als moralisch neutrale Haltung zurückgewiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:NX3","text":"Die eigene Vernunft darf nicht deshalb unterdrückt werden, weil sie weltzugehörig ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:NX4","text":"Arglosigkeit gilt nicht als Beweis für Wahrheit oder Güte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:NX5","text":"Die Sprüche der Frommen werden nicht als tragfähige Orientierung bewahrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:NX6","text":"Die Weltverleumdung wird nicht durch die Berufung auf Frömmigkeit legitimiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:NX7","text":"Die alten Tafeln werden nicht reformiert, sondern zerbrochen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:D1","text":"Die Forderung nach Nicht-Eingreifen verwandelt passives Verhalten in eine aktive moralische Position.","refs":["CH_97E9_15CH:A2","CH_97E9_15CH:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:D2","text":"Die Hinnahme fremder Gewalt wird als Mittel der eigenen Weltentsagung funktionalisiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_15CH:A3","CH_97E9_15CH:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:D3","text":"Die Verwerfung der Welt setzt eine Selbstverwerfung des weltgebundenen Vernunftvermögens voraus.","refs":["CH_97E9_15CH:A5","CH_97E9_15CH:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:D4","text":"Die scheinbar negative Haltung zur Welt erzeugt konkrete Eingriffe in das Handeln und Denken des Subjekts.","refs":["CH_97E9_15CH:A2","CH_97E9_15CH:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:D5","text":"Die frommen Sprüche reproduzieren Weltverleumdung gerade durch ihre moralische Form.","refs":["CH_97E9_15CH:A1","CH_97E9_15CH:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:D6","text":"Die Kritik muss zugleich die behauptete Arglosigkeit und die normativen Grundlagen der Sprüche angreifen.","refs":["CH_97E9_15CH:A7","CH_97E9_15CH:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:SD1","text":"Die Lehre der Weltentsagung erzeugt ihre Wirkung nicht durch Weltflucht allein, sondern durch die moralische Organisation von Passivität, Gewalt-Duldung und Selbstunterdrückung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:SD2","text":"Die Verleumdung der Welt tarnt sich als Schutz vor Schuld, obwohl sie die Duldung weltlicher Gewalt und die Verstümmelung der Vernunft verlangt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:SD3","text":"Die Opposition zwischen Welt und Frömmigkeit bricht zusammen, weil die Frömmigkeit selbst weltliche Verhaltensweisen und psychische Eingriffe hervorbringt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:SD4","text":"Die geforderte Befreiung ist nicht die Rückkehr zu einer besseren alten Norm, sondern die Zerstörung der normativen Überlieferung, die Weltentsagung erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:DNX1","text":"Das System hängt davon ab, dass Weltzugehörigkeit als Makel und nicht als Bedingung von Vernunft und Handlung gilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:DNX2","text":"Es setzt stillschweigend voraus, dass Nicht-Handeln moralisch unschuldiger sei als Eingreifen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:DNX3","text":"Es disqualifiziert die Möglichkeit, Gewalt durch weltbezogene Handlung zu begrenzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:DNX4","text":"Es schließt eine Vernunft aus, die ihre Weltzugehörigkeit bejaht, anstatt sie zu würgen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:DNX5","text":"Es behandelt die Überlieferung frommer Normen als Autorität, obwohl ihre Wirkung auf Weltverleumdung beruht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine bejahende, eingreifende Beziehung zur Welt, in der Weltzugehörigkeit nicht als Grund der Verwerfung gilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:SNX2","text":"Die zentrale Abwesenheit ist eine nicht-verleumderische Norm, die weder Gewalt hinnimmt noch Vernunft gegen sich selbst richtet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:SNX3","text":"Die Kraft des Gegenarguments entsteht aus der versperrten Möglichkeit, Frömmigkeit, Vernunft und Weltbezug nicht gegeneinander auszuspielen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:SNX4","text":"Als unzulässig wird jede Ordnung behandelt, die ihre eigene Gewalt als Enthaltung und ihre eigene Vernunftfeindschaft als Weltentsagung ausgibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:FGS1","text":"Weltzugehörigkeit der Vernunft → moralische Abwertung der Welt → Gebot der Selbstunterdrückung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:FGS2","text":"Fremde Gewalt → Gebot des Nicht-Eingreifens → Duldung der Gewalt → behauptete Weltentsagung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:FGS3","text":"Scheinbare Arglosigkeit → verdeckte normative Wirkung → Diagnose der Weltverleumdung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:FGS4","text":"Weltverleumdung → Entlarvung ihrer passiven und selbstzerstörerischen Mechanismen → Zurückweisung der alten Tafeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:FGS5","text":"Zurückweisung der Tafeln → Zerbrechen der Sprüche → Eröffnung einer nicht-weltverleumderischen Ordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:AF1","text":"Fromme Gewissheit → scheinbar arglose Sprüche → Gebot der Enthaltung → Duldung fremder Gewalt und Würgen der eigenen Vernunft → Diagnose radikaler Weltverleumdung → Zerbrechen der alten Tafeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:ME1","text":"Passivität wird von einer Abwesenheit des Handelns zu einer normativ organisierten Praxis umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:ME2","text":"Weltentsagung wird von einer spirituellen Haltung zu einem Mechanismus der Gewalt-Duldung und Selbstunterdrückung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:ME3","text":"Vernunft wird nicht als Gegenpol zur Welt, sondern als durch die Weltzugehörigkeit belastete und deshalb bedrohte Fähigkeit sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:ME4","text":"Frömmigkeit und Weltverleumdung werden als funktional verbundene Größen statt als Gegensätze kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:ME5","text":"Kritik wird von der Korrektur einzelner Sätze auf die Zerstörung der normativen Trägerstruktur verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Fromme Sprüche verlangen, die Welt, fremde Gewalt und die eigene Vernunft nicht zu bekämpfen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Die Sprüche organisieren Nicht-Eingreifen, Gewalt-Duldung und Selbstunterdrückung als zusammenhängende moralische Mechanismen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Die Gegenposition ersetzt argumentative Korrektur durch das Zerbrechen der überlieferten normativen Tafeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Welt und Vernunft werden als untrennbar weltzugehörig vorausgesetzt; die Zukunft entsteht nur durch die Aufhebung der alten Werttafeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von frommer Weltentsagung zu ihrer Kritik zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, welche positive Ordnung an die Stelle der zerbrochenen Tafeln treten soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern die Duldung von Gewalt und die Selbstunterdrückung der Vernunft als Wirkungen derselben Weltverleumdung gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung liegt in der Umkehrung: Das scheinbare Nicht-Handeln erweist sich als normativ wirksame Praxis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:MRT5","text":"Eine ungelöste Spannung besteht darin, dass die vollständige Verwerfung alter Tafeln den Maßstab ihrer Verwerfung nur negativ bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, verliert jedoch die polemische Intensität, durch die Arglosigkeit, Falschheit und Schädlichkeit zugleich markiert werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T184849494719Z_d18cc27e","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"15.","source_sha256":"d84c61e8bc05cb512dfc8245e5248d5674875ed47731c45c8ee8c665f5be03c7","sha256":"23e130360bb50a264b16b050a8e043ab733e2ecad065658c060444b38a1dc3a5","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T18:48:49.496073+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:AS1","text":"Pious otherworldly ones legitimize world-denial through seemingly guileless dicta of conscience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:AS2","text":"The demanded abstention is defined as non-intervention in others’ violence and as the self-subjugation of one’s own reason.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:AS3","text":"The apparent renunciation of the world thus rests on an active mutilation of action and reason.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:AS4","text":"The dicta are diagnosed not as innocent piety, but as particularly false and pernicious calumny of the world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:AS5","text":"The counter-movement consists in breaking the old tablets and refuting the world-calumniating dicta.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:A1","text":"The pious otherworldly ones treat renunciation of the world as a duty of conscience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:A2","text":"The command to leave the world to the world excludes any intervention of one’s own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:A3","text":"Abstention is considered morally commanded even in the face of violence against others.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:A4","text":"Renunciation of the world is presented as the result of refusing to prevent violence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:A5","text":"One’s own reason is presented as belonging to the world and therefore as something that must be suppressed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:A6","text":"The suppression of one’s own reason is itself supposed to lead to renunciation of the world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:A7","text":"The apparent guilelessness of these dicta conceals their falsity and harmfulness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:A8","text":"The old tablets of the pious bear the normative dicta of world-denial.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:A9","text":"The abolition of this world-denial requires a break with its inherited tablets.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:NX1","text":"Renunciation of the world is not admitted as mere withdrawal from the world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:NX2","text":"Non-intervention is rejected as a morally neutral stance in the face of choking, stabbing, cutting, and scraping.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:NX3","text":"One’s own reason must not be suppressed on the grounds that it belongs to the world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:NX4","text":"Guilelessness does not count as proof of truth or goodness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:NX5","text":"The dicta of the pious are not preserved as viable orientation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:NX6","text":"The calumny of the world is not legitimized by appeal to piety.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:NX7","text":"The old tablets are not reformed, but broken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:D1","text":"The demand for non-intervention transforms passive behavior into an active moral position.","refs":["CH_97E9_15CH:A2","CH_97E9_15CH:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:D2","text":"The acceptance of others’ violence is functionalized as a means of one’s own renunciation of the world.","refs":["CH_97E9_15CH:A3","CH_97E9_15CH:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:D3","text":"The rejection of the world presupposes a self-rejection of the world-bound faculty of reason.","refs":["CH_97E9_15CH:A5","CH_97E9_15CH:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:D4","text":"The seemingly negative stance toward the world produces concrete interventions in the subject’s action and thought.","refs":["CH_97E9_15CH:A2","CH_97E9_15CH:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:D5","text":"The pious dicta reproduce world-calumny precisely through their moral form.","refs":["CH_97E9_15CH:A1","CH_97E9_15CH:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:D6","text":"The critique must attack both the asserted guilelessness and the normative foundations of the dicta.","refs":["CH_97E9_15CH:A7","CH_97E9_15CH:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:SD1","text":"The doctrine of renunciation of the world produces its effect not through flight from the world alone, but through the moral organization of passivity, tolerance of violence, and self-suppression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:SD2","text":"The calumny of the world disguises itself as protection from guilt, although it demands the tolerance of worldly violence and the mutilation of reason.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:SD3","text":"The opposition between world and piety collapses because piety itself brings forth worldly modes of conduct and psychic interventions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:SD4","text":"The demanded liberation is not the return to a better old norm, but the destruction of the normative tradition that produces renunciation of the world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:DNX1","text":"The system depends on world-belonging counting as a blemish rather than as a condition of reason and action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:DNX2","text":"It tacitly presupposes that non-action is morally more innocent than intervention.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:DNX3","text":"It disqualifies the possibility of limiting violence through world-related action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:DNX4","text":"It excludes a reason that affirms its belonging to the world instead of choking it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:DNX5","text":"It treats the tradition of pious norms as authority, although its effect rests on world-calumny.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:SNX1","text":"Excluded is an affirmative, interventionist relation to the world in which belonging to the world does not count as grounds for rejection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:SNX2","text":"The central absence is a non-calumniating norm that neither tolerates violence nor turns reason against itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:SNX3","text":"The force of the counterargument arises from the blocked possibility of not playing piety, reason, and relation to the world off against one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:SNX4","text":"Every order that passes off its own violence as abstention and its own hostility to reason as renunciation of the world is treated as inadmissible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:FGS1","text":"World-belonging of reason → moral devaluation of the world → command of self-suppression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:FGS2","text":"Others’ violence → command of non-intervention → tolerance of violence → asserted renunciation of the world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:FGS3","text":"Apparent guilelessness → concealed normative effect → diagnosis of world-calumny.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:FGS4","text":"World-calumny → unmasking of its passive and self-destructive mechanisms → rejection of the old tablets.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:FGS5","text":"Rejection of the tablets → breaking of the dicta → opening of a non-world-calumniating order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:AF1","text":"Pious certainty → seemingly guileless dicta → command of abstention → tolerance of others’ violence and choking of one’s own reason → diagnosis of radical world-calumny → breaking of the old tablets.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:ME1","text":"Passivity is remapped from an absence of action into a normatively organized practice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:ME2","text":"Renunciation of the world is reclassified from a spiritual attitude into a mechanism of tolerance of violence and self-suppression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:ME3","text":"Reason becomes visible not as the opposite pole to the world, but as a faculty burdened by belonging to the world and therefore threatened.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:ME4","text":"Piety and world-calumny are mapped as functionally connected magnitudes rather than as opposites.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:ME5","text":"Critique is shifted from the correction of individual sentences to the destruction of the normative supporting structure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Pious dicta demand that one not combat the world, others’ violence, and one’s own reason.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** The dicta organize non-intervention, tolerance of violence, and self-suppression as interconnected moral mechanisms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** The counterposition replaces argumentative correction with the breaking of the inherited normative tablets.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** World and reason are presupposed as inseparably belonging to the world; the future arises only through the abolition of the old tablets of value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from pious renunciation of the world to its critique.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is which positive order is to take the place of the broken tablets.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as the tolerance of violence and the self-suppression of reason count as effects of the same world-calumny.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:MRT4","text":"The strongest connection lies in the reversal: apparent non-action proves to be a normatively effective practice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:MRT5","text":"An unresolved tension consists in the fact that the complete rejection of old tablets determines the criterion of their rejection only negatively.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15CH:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15CH:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement, yet loses the polemical intensity through which guilelessness, falsity, and harmfulness are marked simultaneously.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_15CH@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_15CH:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On Old and New Tablets","source_section_label":"15.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 15","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","15."],"original_title":"15."}],"source_title_context":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln","source_section_label":"15.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 15","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","15."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 96","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 15","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln · 15"},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH","layer":"CH","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 16","order":97,"parents":["RAW_97E9_16CH"],"revision":"CH_97E9_16CH@R001","sha256":"42ec99851ad937600a2888df93d072cfa78f294a440bd52d75772d557267b3ab","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:AS1","text":"Eine verbreitete Lehre identifiziert Lernen und Weisheit mit dem Erlöschen des Begehrens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:AS2","text":"Diese Lehre wird als Symptom der Welt-Müden, Todesprediger und Stockmeister neu bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:AS3","text":"Ihre Grundlage ist ein verdorbener Geist, der wie ein verdorbener Magen alle Lebensquellen vergiftet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:AS4","text":"Der Beweis gegen sie liegt in der Gegenordnung von Erkenntnis, Lust, Wollen und Schaffen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:AS5","text":"Die Bewegung führt von der Diagnose der Müdigkeit zur Aufforderung, die neue Tafel zu zerbrechen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:AS6","text":"Befreiung erfolgt durch die Wiederherstellung des wollenden, schaffenden und gut lernenden Geistes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:A1","text":"Die Lehre des Nicht-Begehrens wird als gegenwärtige Tafel verbreitet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:A2","text":"Die neue Tafel verbindet Lernen und Weisheit mit der Ermüdung des Begehrens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:A3","text":"Welt-Müde, Todesprediger und Stockmeister tragen diese Tafel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:A4","text":"Die Lehre des Nicht-Wollens dient der Knechtschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:A5","text":"Schlechter und zu hastiger Vollzug des Lernens erzeugt einen verdorbenen Magen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:A6","text":"Der Geist ist strukturell als Magen bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:A7","text":"Ein verdorbener Geist deutet das Leben aus der Perspektive des Todes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:A8","text":"Das Leben ist ursprünglich ein Born der Lust.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:A9","text":"Erkennen ist Lust für den Löwen-Willigen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:A10","text":"Müdigkeit verwandelt den Wollenden in einen, der nur noch „gewollt“ wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:A11","text":"Wollen ist Schaffen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:A12","text":"Lernen soll auf Schaffen und auf gutes Lernen ausgerichtet werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:NX1","text":"Lernen ist nicht die systematische Tilgung des Begehrens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:NX2","text":"Weisheit ist nicht die Einsicht, dass sich nichts lohnt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:NX3","text":"Erkenntnis ist nicht Müdigkeit und nicht bloßes Erleiden fremder Bestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:NX4","text":"Das Leben ist nicht von sich aus eine vergiftete Quelle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:NX5","text":"Das Nicht-Wollen ist keine Befreiung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:NX6","text":"Die neue Tafel ist keine neutrale Lehre, sondern eine Predigt zur Knechtschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:NX7","text":"Der schwache Mensch ist nicht das Maß einer gültigen Lebensdeutung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:NX8","text":"Gleichgültigkeit ist nicht das Ergebnis einer gültigen Wegentscheidung, sondern das Endprodukt der Müdigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:D1","text":"Die Verknüpfung von Lernen und Nicht-Begehren verwandelt Bildung in ein Verfahren der Entkräftung.","refs":["CH_97E9_16CH:A1","CH_97E9_16CH:A2","CH_97E9_16CH:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:D2","text":"Die Träger der neuen Tafel erscheinen als Instanzen, die Müdigkeit in eine allgemeine Norm übersetzen.","refs":["CH_97E9_16CH:A1","CH_97E9_16CH:A3","CH_97E9_16CH:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:D3","text":"Schlechte Aufnahme und zu hastige Verarbeitung des Wissens beschädigen die geistige Fähigkeit zur Lebensbejahung.","refs":["CH_97E9_16CH:A5","CH_97E9_16CH:A6","CH_97E9_16CH:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:D4","text":"Die Vergiftung der Quellen liegt nicht im Leben selbst, sondern in der Rede des verdorbenen Geistes.","refs":["CH_97E9_16CH:A6","CH_97E9_16CH:A7","CH_97E9_16CH:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:D5","text":"Erkennen bleibt lustvoll, solange der Wille aktiv und selbstbestimmt ist.","refs":["CH_97E9_16CH:A8","CH_97E9_16CH:A9","CH_97E9_16CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:D6","text":"Müdigkeit erzeugt eine Lage, in der der Mensch nicht mehr handelt, sondern zum Objekt fremder Bewegungen wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_16CH:A9","CH_97E9_16CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:D7","text":"Die Lehre des Nicht-Wollens reproduziert die Schwäche, die sie scheinbar nur beschreibt.","refs":["CH_97E9_16CH:A4","CH_97E9_16CH:A7","CH_97E9_16CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:D8","text":"Gutes Lernen ist nur dann möglich, wenn Lernen auf Schaffen statt auf Entleerung des Begehrens zielt.","refs":["CH_97E9_16CH:A2","CH_97E9_16CH:A11","CH_97E9_16CH:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:SD1","text":"Die neue Tafel ist eine politische Technik, die geistige Müdigkeit als freiwillige Lebensform und als Gehorsam organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:SD2","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Bildung und Begehren wird aufgehoben: Bildung wird entweder als schöpferische Steigerung oder als disziplinierende Entkräftung bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:SD3","text":"Die Diagnose des verdorbenen Magens verbindet Erkenntnistheorie, Affektordnung und Herrschaftsordnung in einem einzigen physiologisch-geistigen Modell.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:SD4","text":"Befreiung verlangt nicht die Abschaffung des Lernens, sondern die Umstellung seines Zwecks von Anpassung auf Schöpfung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:SD5","text":"Der kämpferische Gestus des Zerbrechens wird durch die Behauptung legitimiert, dass die bestehende Lehre ihre eigene Knechtschaft als Weisheit maskiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:DNX1","text":"Der Text schließt stillschweigend aus, dass Begehren primär eine Krankheit oder ein Hindernis der Erkenntnis sei.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:DNX2","text":"Er schließt aus, dass Müdigkeit eine verlässliche epistemische oder moralische Instanz bildet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:DNX3","text":"Er schließt aus, dass Unterwerfung durch bloßen Verzicht auf Wollen überwunden werden könne.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:DNX4","text":"Er schließt aus, dass Geist und Körper getrennte Funktionsbereiche bilden, die unabhängig voneinander bewertet werden können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:DNX5","text":"Er schließt aus, dass Gleichgültigkeit aus einer objektiven Gleichheit aller Wege folgt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:DNX6","text":"Er schließt aus, dass Lernen ohne eine bestimmte Form des Wollens neutral bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:SNX1","text":"Unmöglich wird eine Ordnung, in der Weisheit durch Entleerung, Verzicht und Ermüdung definiert ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:SNX2","text":"Unzulässig wird jede politische oder geistige Befreiung, die das handelnde Wollen beseitigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:SNX3","text":"Abwesend bleibt ein nicht-teleologisches Lernen, das weder der Knechtschaft noch dem Schaffen zugeordnet wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:SNX4","text":"Die tiefste versperrte Möglichkeit ist ein Geist, der Erkenntnis, Begehren und Freiheit voneinander trennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:FGS1","text":"Verbreitete Lehre des Nicht-Begehrens → Identifikation von Lernen mit Entkräftung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:FGS2","text":"Entkräftung → Diagnose von Müdigkeit als geistig-physiologischem Zustand.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:FGS3","text":"Verdorbener Geist/Magen → Todesdeutung des Lebens → Vergiftung seiner Quellen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:FGS4","text":"Todesdeutung → Gleichgültigkeit, Passivität und Überführung des Wollenden in ein Gewolltes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:FGS5","text":"Gegenaxiom des Lebens als Lustquelle → Wiederherstellung des aktiven Erkennens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:FGS6","text":"Aktives Erkennen → Wollen als Schaffen → Lernen als Vorbereitung des Schaffens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:FGS7","text":"Lernen als Schaffen → Zerbrechen der alten Tafel → Öffnung eines befreienden Gegenraums.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:AF1","text":"Nicht-Begehren als Weisheit → Müdigkeit als verborgene Ursache → verdorbener Geist als Vermittlung → Knechtschaft als soziale Funktion → Wollen als Schaffen → Zerbrechen der Tafel und Neulernen des Lernens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:ME1","text":"Bildung wird von einem Mittel der Entbehrung zu einer Praxis schöpferischer Willensbildung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:ME2","text":"Müdigkeit wird von einem privaten Zustand zu einem politisch verbreiteten und herrschaftsfunktionalen Mechanismus umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:ME3","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Geist und Körper wird durch das Modell des Geistes als Magen in eine gemeinsame Verarbeitungsstruktur überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:ME4","text":"Die Opposition zwischen Erkenntnis und Lust bricht zusammen; Erkenntnis erscheint als lustvolle Tätigkeit des starken Willens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:ME5","text":"Gefängnis, Mauer und eingefangener Geist werden als durchdringbare Ordnungen einer möglichen Befreiung kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:ALT1","text":"Surface — Zurückgewiesen wird die Lehre, dass Lernen, Weisheit und Nicht-Begehren zusammenfallen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Lehre erzeugt über geistige Ermüdung Passivität und stabilisiert Knechtschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die angemessene Gegenhandlung besteht im Zerbrechen der Tafel und in der Neuausrichtung des Lernens auf Schaffen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Geist, Körper, Wille und Erkenntnis bilden eine prozessuale Verarbeitungsordnung, in der Verderbnis und Erneuerung unterschiedliche Lebensrichtungen erzeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den Gegensatz zwischen lebensbejahendem Wollen und knechtender Müdigkeit zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:MRT2","text":"Die zentrale argumentative Bewegung von der neuen Tafel zur Gegenlehre des Schaffens bleibt erhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie „gutes Lernen“ praktisch oder institutionell organisiert werden soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:MRT4","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt ferner, ob die Träger der neuen Tafel bewusst herrschen oder selbst Ausdruck ihrer Müdigkeit sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:MRT5","text":"Intern kohärent ist die Maschine dort, wo sie Geist, Magen, Wille und Lernen als eine gemeinsame Lebensökonomie verschaltet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:MRT6","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen der Diagnose struktureller Knechtschaft und der stark individualisierten Forderung nach willentlicher Selbstbefreiung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die formale Logik, komprimiert jedoch die polemische Bildlichkeit, durch die der Text seine Gegenordnung affektiv erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T184928475146Z_ed07c45e","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"16.","source_sha256":"42ec99851ad937600a2888df93d072cfa78f294a440bd52d75772d557267b3ab","sha256":"ebef97ffe887887c7e17db39892693e1468a5e5f5071c6c47817ce8519101214","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T18:49:28.476430+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:AS1","text":"A widespread doctrine identifies learning and wisdom with the extinction of desire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:AS2","text":"This doctrine is redefined as a symptom of the world-weary, preachers of death, and masters of the stick.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:AS3","text":"Its basis is a corrupted spirit that, like a corrupted stomach, poisons all sources of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:AS4","text":"The proof against it lies in the counter-order of knowledge, pleasure, willing, and creating.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:AS5","text":"The movement proceeds from the diagnosis of weariness to the demand to break the new tablet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:AS6","text":"Liberation occurs through the restoration of the willing, creating, and well-learning spirit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:A1","text":"The doctrine of non-desiring is disseminated as the present tablet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:A2","text":"The new tablet links learning and wisdom with the weariness of desire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:A3","text":"The world-weary, preachers of death, and masters of the stick bear this tablet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:A4","text":"The doctrine of non-willing serves servitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:A5","text":"Bad and overly hasty execution of learning produces a corrupted stomach.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:A6","text":"The spirit is structurally determined as a stomach.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:A7","text":"A corrupted spirit interprets life from the perspective of death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:A8","text":"Life is originally a wellspring of pleasure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:A9","text":"Knowing is pleasure for the lion-willed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:A10","text":"Weariness transforms the willing one into one who is only „gewollt“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:A11","text":"Willing is creating.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:A12","text":"Learning is to be directed toward creating and toward good learning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:NX1","text":"Learning is not the systematic eradication of desire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:NX2","text":"Wisdom is not the insight that nothing is worthwhile.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:NX3","text":"Knowledge is neither weariness nor mere suffering of alien determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:NX4","text":"Life is not in itself a poisoned source.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:NX5","text":"Non-willing is no liberation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:NX6","text":"The new tablet is not a neutral doctrine, but a sermon for servitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:NX7","text":"The weak human being is not the measure of a valid interpretation of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:NX8","text":"Indifference is not the result of a valid decision of path, but the end product of weariness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:D1","text":"The linkage of learning and non-desiring transforms education into a procedure of enfeeblement.","refs":["CH_97E9_16CH:A1","CH_97E9_16CH:A2","CH_97E9_16CH:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:D2","text":"The bearers of the new tablet appear as agencies that translate weariness into a general norm.","refs":["CH_97E9_16CH:A1","CH_97E9_16CH:A3","CH_97E9_16CH:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:D3","text":"Poor intake and overly hasty processing of knowledge damage the spiritual capacity for affirmation of life.","refs":["CH_97E9_16CH:A5","CH_97E9_16CH:A6","CH_97E9_16CH:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:D4","text":"The poisoning of the sources lies not in life itself, but in the speech of the corrupted spirit.","refs":["CH_97E9_16CH:A6","CH_97E9_16CH:A7","CH_97E9_16CH:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:D5","text":"Knowing remains pleasurable as long as the will is active and self-determined.","refs":["CH_97E9_16CH:A8","CH_97E9_16CH:A9","CH_97E9_16CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:D6","text":"Weariness produces a condition in which the human being no longer acts, but becomes the object of alien movements.","refs":["CH_97E9_16CH:A9","CH_97E9_16CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:D7","text":"The doctrine of non-willing reproduces the weakness that it apparently merely describes.","refs":["CH_97E9_16CH:A4","CH_97E9_16CH:A7","CH_97E9_16CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:D8","text":"Good learning is possible only when learning aims at creating rather than at the emptying of desire.","refs":["CH_97E9_16CH:A2","CH_97E9_16CH:A11","CH_97E9_16CH:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:SD1","text":"The new tablet is a political technique that organizes spiritual weariness as a voluntary form of life and as obedience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:SD2","text":"The opposition between education and desire is sublated: education is determined either as creative intensification or as disciplining enfeeblement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:SD3","text":"The diagnosis of the corrupted stomach combines epistemology, the ordering of affects, and the order of domination in a single physiological-spiritual model.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:SD4","text":"Liberation does not require the abolition of learning, but the reorientation of its purpose from adaptation to creation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:SD5","text":"The combative gesture of breaking is legitimized by the claim that the existing doctrine masks its own servitude as wisdom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:DNX1","text":"The text tacitly excludes that desire is primarily a disease or an obstacle to knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:DNX2","text":"It excludes that weariness constitutes a reliable epistemic or moral instance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:DNX3","text":"It excludes that subjection could be overcome through mere renunciation of willing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:DNX4","text":"It excludes that spirit and body constitute separate functional domains that can be evaluated independently of one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:DNX5","text":"It excludes that indifference follows from an objective equality of all paths.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:DNX6","text":"It excludes that learning remains neutral without a particular form of willing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:SNX1","text":"Impossible becomes an order in which wisdom is defined through emptying, renunciation, and weariness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:SNX2","text":"Inadmissible becomes every political or spiritual liberation that eliminates acting willing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:SNX3","text":"Absent remains a non-teleological learning that is assigned neither to servitude nor to creating.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:SNX4","text":"The deepest blocked possibility is a spirit that separates knowledge, desire, and freedom from one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:FGS1","text":"Widespread doctrine of non-desiring → identification of learning with enfeeblement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:FGS2","text":"Enfeeblement → diagnosis of weariness as a spiritual-physiological condition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:FGS3","text":"Corrupted spirit/stomach → death-interpretation of life → poisoning of its sources.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:FGS4","text":"Death-interpretation → indifference, passivity, and transformation of the willing one into a willed thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:FGS5","text":"Counter-axiom of life as a source of pleasure → restoration of active knowing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:FGS6","text":"Active knowing → willing as creating → learning as preparation for creating.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:FGS7","text":"Learning as creating → breaking the old tablet → opening of a liberating counter-space.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:AF1","text":"Non-desiring as wisdom → weariness as hidden cause → corrupted spirit as mediation → servitude as social function → willing as creating → breaking the tablet and relearning learning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:ME1","text":"Education is remapped from a means of privation into a practice of creative formation of the will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:ME2","text":"Weariness is reclassified from a private condition into a politically disseminated and domination-functional mechanism.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:ME3","text":"The opposition between spirit and body is transferred into a shared processing structure through the model of the spirit as stomach.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:ME4","text":"The opposition between knowledge and pleasure collapses; knowledge appears as a pleasurable activity of the strong will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:ME5","text":"Prison, wall, and captured spirit are mapped as permeable orders of a possible liberation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:ALT1","text":"Surface — Rejected is the doctrine that learning, wisdom, and non-desiring coincide.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:ALT2","text":"Structural — Through spiritual weariness, the doctrine produces passivity and stabilizes servitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The appropriate counter-action consists in breaking the tablet and reorienting learning toward creating.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Spirit, body, will, and knowledge form a processual order of processing in which corruption and renewal produce different directions of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the opposition between life-affirming willing and enslaving weariness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:MRT2","text":"The central argumentative movement from the new tablet to the counter-doctrine of creating is preserved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:MRT3","text":"It remains underdetermined how “good learning” is to be organized practically or institutionally.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:MRT4","text":"It further remains underdetermined whether the bearers of the new tablet rule consciously or are themselves the expression of their weariness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:MRT5","text":"The machine is internally coherent where it interconnects spirit, stomach, will, and learning as a shared economy of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:MRT6","text":"A tension remains between the diagnosis of structural servitude and the strongly individualized demand for volitional self-liberation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16CH:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16CH:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the formal logic, but compresses the polemical imagery through which the text affectively produces its counter-order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_16CH@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_16CH:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On Old and New Tablets","source_section_label":"16.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 16","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","16."],"original_title":"16."}],"source_title_context":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln","source_section_label":"16.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 16","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","16."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 97","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 16","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln · 16"},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH","layer":"CH","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 17","order":98,"parents":["RAW_97E9_17CH"],"revision":"CH_97E9_17CH@R001","sha256":"0af58cafd608bdf5304001a57f0c6ee5307d506005005b7b0c674e934ced69e4","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:AS1","text":"Die behauptete Weltmüdigkeit wird daran geprüft, ob sie den Eintritt in den Todes-Nachen einschließt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:AS2","text":"Die Verweigerung des Todes-Nachens legt eine fortbestehende Bindung an die Erde offen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:AS3","text":"Diese Bindung erscheint als unerledigter Wunsch, erinnerte Lust und Erdliebe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:AS4","text":"Die Erde wird gegen ihre Verächter durch die Existenz nützlicher und angenehmer Erfindungen rehabilitiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:AS5","text":"Weltmüdigkeit wird von einer metaphysischen Einsicht zu einem Zustand aus Krankheit, Erschöpfung, Faulheit oder verkrochener Lust umgedeutet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:AS6","text":"Auf diese Diagnose folgt keine Heilung, sondern entweder körperliche Reaktivierung durch Zwang oder das Fortfahren in den Tod.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:AS7","text":"Die abschließende Verschiebung bindet den Tod an Mut und stellt dadurch das Ende als schwierigere Handlung denn die Erzeugung neuer Rede dar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:A1","text":"Der Todes-Nachen führt möglicherweise in das große Nichts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:A2","text":"Wer den Todes-Nachen nicht besteigen will, ist nicht konsequent weltmüde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:A3","text":"Fortbestehender Erd-Wunsch und Erd-Lust widerlegen die Behauptung vollständiger Welt- oder Erd-Entrücktheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:A4","text":"Die Erde enthält Erfindungen, die nützlich oder angenehm sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:A5","text":"Nützliche und angenehme Erfindungen begründen einen Grund, die Erde zu lieben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:A6","text":"Weltmüdigkeit kann ein Symptom körperlicher Krankheit oder verbrauchter Existenz sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:A7","text":"Weltmüdigkeit kann ebenso eine Form von Faulheit oder verkrochener Lust sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:A8","text":"Unheilbare sollen nicht weiterhin ärztlich behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:A9","text":"Die Wiederherstellung des Laufens kann durch Zwang und Schmerz betrieben werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:A10","text":"Ein Ende zu machen erfordert mehr Mut als einen neuen Vers zu machen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:NX1","text":"Weltmüdigkeit ist nicht die tatsächliche Bereitschaft, den Todes-Nachen zu besteigen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:NX2","text":"Weltmüdigkeit ist nicht Erd-Entrücktheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:NX3","text":"Weltmüdigkeit ist nicht die Abwesenheit von Erd-Wunsch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:NX4","text":"Weltmüdigkeit ist nicht die Abwesenheit erinnerter Erd-Lust.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:NX5","text":"Die Erde ist nicht ausschließlich unbrauchbar, unerquicklich oder verwerflich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:NX6","text":"Das Verhältnis zur Welt wird nicht als rein geistige oder metaphysische Position anerkannt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:NX7","text":"Die ärztliche Behandlung des Unheilbaren wird ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:NX8","text":"Das bloße Hervorbringen neuer Verse gilt nicht als gleichwertige Mutprobe wie das Beenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:D1","text":"Die behauptete Weltmüdigkeit wird als widersprüchliche Selbstbeschreibung entlarvt.","refs":["CH_97E9_17CH:A1","CH_97E9_17CH:A2","CH_97E9_17CH:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:D2","text":"Sichtbare körperliche und affektive Reste fungieren als Beweise gegen die behauptete Erd-Entrücktheit.","refs":["CH_97E9_17CH:A2","CH_97E9_17CH:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:D3","text":"Erdliebe wird nicht durch abstrakte Weltbejahung, sondern durch konkrete Verbindungen von Nutzen und Lust begründet.","refs":["CH_97E9_17CH:A4","CH_97E9_17CH:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:D4","text":"Der Anspruch auf Weltmüdigkeit wird in eine Diagnose gegenwärtiger Unfähigkeit umcodiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_17CH:A6","CH_97E9_17CH:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:D5","text":"Die angemessene Reaktion auf diese Unfähigkeit ist entweder Wiederbelebung der Bewegung oder Ausschluss aus der fortgesetzten Behandlung.","refs":["CH_97E9_17CH:A8","CH_97E9_17CH:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:D6","text":"Das Ende erscheint als Handlung, nicht bloß als passives Erliegen.","refs":["CH_97E9_17CH:A1","CH_97E9_17CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:SD1","text":"Das System ersetzt die Unterscheidung zwischen Weltverneinung und Weltbejahung durch eine Prüfung der tatsächlichen Bindung an Erde, Lust und Handlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:SD2","text":"Eine behauptete metaphysische Haltung wird in körperliche Symptome, affektive Rückstände und Verhaltensalternativen übersetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:SD3","text":"Die Erde wird als ambivalente Ordnung rekonstruiert, in der Nützlichkeit und Angenehmheit denselben Gegenstand tragen können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:SD4","text":"Die Diagnose erzeugt eine asymmetrische Handlungsordnung: Der Erschöpfte muss entweder zur Bewegung gezwungen oder aus der ärztlichen Ordnung entfernt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:SD5","text":"Der Tod wird zugleich als möglicher Übergang ins Nichts, als Entscheidung und als äußerste Mutprobe bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:DNX1","text":"Eine echte Weltmüdigkeit darf nicht zugleich an Erd-Lust, Erd-Wunsch und Erd-Erfindungen gebunden bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:DNX2","text":"Ein bloß sprachlich oder rhetorisch erzeugter Überdruss besitzt keine ausreichende ontologische Geltung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:DNX3","text":"Krankheit, Faulheit und Lust dürfen nicht als gleichartige Ursachen behandelt werden, wenn zwischen ihnen eine eindeutige Handlungsanweisung gewonnen werden soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:DNX4","text":"Heilung darf nicht als neutraler medizinischer Prozess vorausgesetzt werden, sobald Unheilbarkeit behauptet wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:DNX5","text":"Das Ende darf nicht als bloßes Geschehen ohne Willen, Mut oder Entscheidung gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Möglichkeit einer kohärenten, zugleich erdgebundenen und weltverneinenden Müdigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:SNX2","text":"Versperrt wird eine dritte Position zwischen Wiederbelebung und Dahinfahren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:SNX3","text":"Abwesend bleibt ein Maßstab, der Krankheit, Faulheit, Lust und Unheilbarkeit unabhängig voneinander unterscheiden könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:SNX4","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine Form des Abschieds, die weder als Feigheit noch als mutige Selbstbeendigung klassifiziert werden muss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:SNX5","text":"Der Text umkreist die Unmöglichkeit, das große Nichts zugleich als ungewissen Raum und als normativ gebotenen Ausgang zu behandeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:FGS1","text":"Behauptete Weltmüdigkeit + Verweigerung des Todes-Nachens → Prüfung der tatsächlichen Erd-Bindung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:FGS2","text":"Erd-Bindung + sichtbarer Wunsch/Lust-Rest → Widerlegung der Erd-Entrücktheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:FGS3","text":"Nützliche und angenehme Erfindungen → positive Reklassifikation der Erde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:FGS4","text":"Widerlegte Weltmüdigkeit → Diagnose als Krankheit, Verbrauch, Faulheit oder Lust.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:FGS5","text":"Diagnose der Unheilbarkeit → Ausschluss ärztlicher Behandlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:FGS6","text":"Ausschluss der Behandlung → Zwang zur Bewegung oder Übergang zum Ende.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:FGS7","text":"Übergang zum Ende + Mutkriterium → Tod als aktive, aber ungewisse Grenzhandlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:AF1","text":"Behauptete Weltmüdigkeit → Verweigerung des Todes-Nachens → Aufdeckung von Erd-Wunsch und Erd-Lust → Rehabilitierung der Erde durch Nutzen und Angenehmheit → Diagnose von Krankheit, Faulheit oder Lust → Zwangsreaktivierung oder Dahinfahren → Mutkriterium des Endes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:ME1","text":"„Weltmüdigkeit“ wird von einer weltanschaulichen Position in einen überprüfbaren Widerspruch zwischen Sprache, Körper und Begehren umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:ME2","text":"Die Erde wird nicht mehr als Gegenpol zur Transzendenz, sondern als Feld konkreter Verbindungen von Nutzen und Lust sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:ME3","text":"Krankheit, Faulheit und Lust werden als konkurrierende Klassifikationen desselben Verhaltens geöffnet, ohne abschließend differenziert zu werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:ME4","text":"Die Handlungskarte wird auf zwei Ausgänge verengt: Wiederherstellung des Laufens oder Dahinfahren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:ME5","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Leben und Tod wird durch das Kriterium des Mutes in eine Rangordnung von Handlungen überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:ALT1","text":"Surface — Eine Gruppe behauptet Weltmüdigkeit, verweigert aber den Todes-Nachen und zeigt fortbestehende Erd-Bindung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:ALT2","text":"Structural — Affektive und körperliche Reste werden als diagnostische Mechanismen verwendet, die eine Selbstaussage gegen sich selbst wenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text verschiebt die Auseinandersetzung von Überzeugungen auf Verhaltensprüfung, Zurechtweisung, Reaktivierung und Ausschluss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Das mögliche große Nichts bildet einen ungewissen Grenzraum; das Ende wird zugleich als zukünftige Entscheidung und als gegenwärtig zu bewertende Mutprobe gefasst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von behaupteter Weltmüdigkeit zu entlarvter Erd-Bindung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:MRT2","text":"Die positive Erdbejahung hängt minimal an der Kopplung von Nützlichkeit und Angenehmheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:MRT3","text":"Die Überleitung von Diagnose zu Zwang oder Tod setzt eine nicht weiter begründete Autorität über die Unheilbaren voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:MRT4","text":"Krankheit, Faulheit und verkrochene Lust bleiben als alternative Diagnosen unzureichend auseinandergelegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:MRT5","text":"Die Forderung, das Ende müsse Mut voraussetzen, steht in Spannung zur Ungewissheit des großen Nichts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, sofern die Schlussalternative nicht als logisch vollständig, sondern als rhetorisch erzwungene Schließung verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T185020903553Z_d114706b","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"17.","source_sha256":"0af58cafd608bdf5304001a57f0c6ee5307d506005005b7b0c674e934ced69e4","sha256":"1babadb64c071a6833ec2aa9393ff2e976cdb60e2b0489a270f96d76669b4c31","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T18:50:20.906012+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:AS1","text":"The asserted world-weariness is tested by whether it includes embarking upon the death-boat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:AS2","text":"The refusal of the death-boat reveals a continuing attachment to the earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:AS3","text":"This attachment appears as an unfulfilled wish, remembered pleasure, and love of the earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:AS4","text":"The earth is rehabilitated against its despisers through the existence of useful and pleasant inventions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:AS5","text":"World-weariness is reinterpreted from a metaphysical insight into a condition of illness, exhaustion, laziness, or cowering pleasure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:AS6","text":"This diagnosis is followed not by healing, but either by bodily reactivation through compulsion or by proceeding into death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:AS7","text":"The concluding shift binds death to courage and thereby presents the end as a more difficult action than the production of new speech.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:A1","text":"The death-boat may lead into the great nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:A2","text":"Whoever does not wish to board the death-boat is not consistently world-weary.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:A3","text":"Persisting earth-wish and earth-pleasure refute the claim of complete alienation from the world or earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:A4","text":"The earth contains inventions that are useful or pleasant.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:A5","text":"Useful and pleasant inventions establish a reason to love the earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:A6","text":"World-weariness can be a symptom of bodily illness or exhausted existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:A7","text":"World-weariness can equally be a form of laziness or cowering pleasure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:A8","text":"The incurable should no longer continue to receive medical treatment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:A9","text":"The restoration of walking can be pursued through compulsion and pain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:A10","text":"To make an end requires more courage than to make a new verse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:NX1","text":"World-weariness is not the actual readiness to board the death-boat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:NX2","text":"World-weariness is not alienation from the earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:NX3","text":"World-weariness is not the absence of earth-wish.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:NX4","text":"World-weariness is not the absence of remembered earth-pleasure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:NX5","text":"The earth is not exclusively useless, unpleasant, or reprehensible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:NX6","text":"The relation to the world is not recognized as a purely spiritual or metaphysical position.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:NX7","text":"The medical treatment of the incurable is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:NX8","text":"The mere production of new verses does not count as a trial of courage equivalent to ending.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:D1","text":"The asserted world-weariness is exposed as a contradictory self-description.","refs":["CH_97E9_17CH:A1","CH_97E9_17CH:A2","CH_97E9_17CH:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:D2","text":"Visible bodily and affective remnants function as evidence against the asserted alienation from the earth.","refs":["CH_97E9_17CH:A2","CH_97E9_17CH:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:D3","text":"Love of the earth is grounded not by abstract affirmation of the world, but by concrete connections of usefulness and pleasure.","refs":["CH_97E9_17CH:A4","CH_97E9_17CH:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:D4","text":"The claim to world-weariness is recoded into a diagnosis of present incapacity.","refs":["CH_97E9_17CH:A6","CH_97E9_17CH:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:D5","text":"The appropriate response to this incapacity is either the revival of movement or exclusion from continued treatment.","refs":["CH_97E9_17CH:A8","CH_97E9_17CH:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:D6","text":"The end appears as an action, not merely as passive succumbing.","refs":["CH_97E9_17CH:A1","CH_97E9_17CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:SD1","text":"The system replaces the distinction between negation of the world and affirmation of the world with an examination of the actual attachment to earth, pleasure, and action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:SD2","text":"An asserted metaphysical stance is translated into bodily symptoms, affective residues, and behavioral alternatives.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:SD3","text":"The earth is reconstructed as an ambivalent order in which usefulness and pleasantness can sustain the same object.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:SD4","text":"The diagnosis produces an asymmetrical order of action: the exhausted person must either be compelled into movement or removed from the medical order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:SD5","text":"Death is determined at once as a possible transition into nothing, as a decision, and as the utmost trial of courage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:DNX1","text":"Genuine world-weariness must not remain bound at the same time to earth-pleasure, earth-wish, and earthly inventions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:DNX2","text":"A disgust produced merely linguistically or rhetorically possesses no sufficient ontological validity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:DNX3","text":"Illness, laziness, and pleasure must not be treated as causes of the same kind if an unambiguous instruction for action is to be derived from among them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:DNX4","text":"Healing must not be presupposed as a neutral medical process once incurability is asserted.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:DNX5","text":"The end must not count as a mere event without will, courage, or decision.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:SNX1","text":"Excluded is the possibility of a coherent weariness that is at once earth-bound and world-negating.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:SNX2","text":"A third position between revival and passing away is blocked.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:SNX3","text":"Absent is a criterion that could distinguish illness, laziness, pleasure, and incurability independently from one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:SNX4","text":"Unavailable is a form of farewell that need be classified neither as cowardice nor as courageous self-termination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:SNX5","text":"The text circles around the impossibility of treating the great nothing simultaneously as an uncertain space and as a normatively mandated exit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:FGS1","text":"Asserted world-weariness + refusal of the death-boat → examination of the actual earth-attachment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:FGS2","text":"Earth-attachment + visible remnant of wish/pleasure → refutation of alienation from the earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:FGS3","text":"Useful and pleasant inventions → positive reclassification of the earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:FGS4","text":"Refuted world-weariness → diagnosis as illness, exhaustion, laziness, or pleasure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:FGS5","text":"Diagnosis of incurability → exclusion of medical treatment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:FGS6","text":"Exclusion of treatment → compulsion toward movement or transition to the end.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:FGS7","text":"Transition to the end + criterion of courage → death as an active but uncertain boundary-action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:AF1","text":"Asserted world-weariness → refusal of the death-boat → disclosure of earth-wish and earth-pleasure → rehabilitation of the earth through usefulness and pleasantness → diagnosis of illness, laziness, or pleasure → compulsory reactivation or passing away → criterion of courage for the end.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:ME1","text":"“World-weariness” is remapped from a worldview position into a verifiable contradiction between language, body, and desire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:ME2","text":"The earth becomes visible no longer as the counterpole to transcendence, but as a field of concrete connections of usefulness and pleasure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:ME3","text":"Illness, laziness, and pleasure are opened as competing classifications of the same behavior, without being conclusively differentiated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:ME4","text":"The action-map is narrowed to two outcomes: restoration of walking or passing away.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:ME5","text":"The opposition between life and death is transformed through the criterion of courage into a hierarchy of actions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:ALT1","text":"Surface — A group asserts world-weariness, but refuses the death-boat and displays continuing earth-attachment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:ALT2","text":"Structural — Affective and bodily remnants are used as diagnostic mechanisms that turn a self-statement against itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text shifts the confrontation from convictions to behavioral examination, rebuke, reactivation, and exclusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The possible great nothing forms an uncertain boundary-space; the end is grasped at once as a future decision and as a trial of courage to be evaluated in the present.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from asserted world-weariness to exposed earth-attachment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:MRT2","text":"The positive affirmation of the earth depends minimally on the coupling of usefulness and pleasantness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:MRT3","text":"The transition from diagnosis to compulsion or death presupposes an authority over the incurable that is not further justified.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:MRT4","text":"Illness, laziness, and cowering pleasure remain insufficiently distinguished as alternative diagnoses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:MRT5","text":"The demand that the end must presuppose courage stands in tension with the uncertainty of the great nothing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17CH:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument, provided that the concluding alternative is understood not as logically complete, but as a rhetorically compelled closure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_17CH@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_17CH:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On Old and New Tablets","source_section_label":"17.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 17","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","17."],"original_title":"17."}],"source_title_context":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln","source_section_label":"17.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 17","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","17."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 98","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 17","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln · 17"},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH","layer":"CH","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 18","order":99,"parents":["RAW_97E9_18CH"],"revision":"CH_97E9_18CH@R001","sha256":"c3e8bfeeb5f0f410815997db67e3a56d9d532b0be954b2fd4960ad5ce034c4a1","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:AS1","text":"Der Text problematisiert die Verwechslung von Müdigkeit und Faulheit trotz gleicher sprachlicher Oberfläche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:AS2","text":"Er bestimmt den erschöpften Helden nicht durch sein Ziel, sondern durch den trotzigen Abbruch kurz vor dessen Erreichung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:AS3","text":"Die sichtbare Verweigerung des Weitergehens wird als Folge von Müdigkeit und nicht ohne Weiteres als Feigheit gelesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:AS4","text":"Die angemessene Reaktion besteht nicht im gewaltsamen Weitertransport, sondern im zugelassenen Schlaf und in der selbsttätigen Wiederkehr der Kräfte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:AS5","text":"Die Müdigkeit soll sich selbst widerrufen und zugleich die von ihr erzeugte Belehrung aufheben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:AS6","text":"Erst der Schutz vor den „Gebildeten“ vollendet die Intervention, weil diese sich am Schweiß des Helden bereichern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:A1","text":"Gleichlautende Tafeln können ungleich gehört werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:A2","text":"Müdigkeit und Faulheit erzeugen verschiedene Arten von Tafeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:A3","text":"Der Held befindet sich unmittelbar vor seinem Ziel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:A4","text":"Der Stillstand des Helden ist durch Müdigkeit bedingt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:A5","text":"Müdigkeit kann sich als Trotz gegen das Weitergehen äußern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:A6","text":"Äußerer Zwang kann den erschöpften Helden an sein Ziel bringen, ersetzt aber nicht seine eigene Wiederherstellung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:A7","text":"Schlaf kann als selbsttätige Erholung und als Widerruf der Müdigkeit wirken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:A8","text":"Die von der Müdigkeit erzeugte Lehre soll mit der Wiederherstellung ebenfalls widerrufen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:A9","text":"Die „Gebildeten“ eignen sich den Schweiß des Helden an.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:A10","text":"Der Schutz des Helden vor dieser Aneignung gehört zur angemessenen Behandlung seiner Erschöpfung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:NX1","text":"Der erschöpfte Stillstand ist nicht mit Faulheit gleichzusetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:NX2","text":"Gleiche Rede beweist keine gleiche innere Ursache.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:NX3","text":"Hilfe besteht nicht notwendig darin, den Helden unmittelbar zum Ziel zu zwingen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:NX4","text":"Der Trotz des Helden ist nicht einfach Tapferkeit im erfolgreichen Vollzug.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:NX5","text":"Die „Gebildeten“ erscheinen nicht als neutrale Beobachter oder Helfer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:NX6","text":"Die aus der Müdigkeit hervorgegangene Lehre besitzt keine bleibende Geltung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:D1","text":"Die Unterscheidung zwischen Müdigkeit und Faulheit muss über die sprachliche Oberfläche hinaus auf die Entstehungsweise der jeweiligen Tafel zugreifen.","refs":["CH_97E9_18CH:A1","CH_97E9_18CH:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:D2","text":"Die Nähe zum Ziel verschärft die Müdigkeit, weil der letzte Schritt unter erschöpften Bedingungen als unerträgliche Fortsetzung erscheint.","refs":["CH_97E9_18CH:A3","CH_97E9_18CH:A4","CH_97E9_18CH:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:D3","text":"Der trotzig behauptete Stillstand kann eine deformierte Form des Mutes sein, nicht dessen Gegenteil.","refs":["CH_97E9_18CH:A3","CH_97E9_18CH:A4","CH_97E9_18CH:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:D4","text":"Das erzwungene Erreichen des Ziels wäre gegenüber der inneren Erholung des Helden sekundär.","refs":["CH_97E9_18CH:A6","CH_97E9_18CH:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:D5","text":"Schlaf erhält seine Funktion nur, wenn er nicht als äußerlich auferlegte Unterbrechung, sondern als selbsttätiges Erwachen zur Wiederaufnahme der Kraft eintritt.","refs":["CH_97E9_18CH:A6","CH_97E9_18CH:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:D6","text":"Eine Lehre der Erschöpfung wird als vorläufiger Zustand behandelt, der durch Genesung gegenstandslos werden soll.","refs":["CH_97E9_18CH:A7","CH_97E9_18CH:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:D7","text":"Die soziale Umgebung des Helden kann seine Erschöpfung in fremden Nutzen überführen.","refs":["CH_97E9_18CH:A9","CH_97E9_18CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:SD1","text":"Der Text ersetzt die moralische Bewertung des Stillstands durch eine diagnostische Unterscheidung zwischen erschöpfungsbedingtem Abbruch und fauler Verweigerung.","refs":["CH_97E9_18CH:A1","CH_97E9_18CH:A2","CH_97E9_18CH:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:SD2","text":"Wahre Hilfe wird als nicht-aneignende Unterbrechung konstituiert: Sie lässt den Helden liegen, verhindert jedoch seine soziale Ausbeutung.","refs":["CH_97E9_18CH:A6","CH_97E9_18CH:A7","CH_97E9_18CH:A9","CH_97E9_18CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:SD3","text":"Der Held wird zugleich als autonomer Genesender und als schutzbedürftiges Objekt fremder Intervention konstruiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_18CH:A6","CH_97E9_18CH:A7","CH_97E9_18CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:SD4","text":"Das Argument entwertet eine Kultur, die den heroischen Vollzug nicht hervorbringt, sondern dessen sichtbare Erschöpfungszeichen konsumiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_18CH:A9","CH_97E9_18CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:DNX1","text":"Die bloße sichtbare Form einer Aussage reicht nicht aus, um ihren Ursprung oder ihre Geltung zu bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:DNX2","text":"Erschöpfung darf nicht als moralischer Mangel behandelt werden, ohne ihre Entstehungsbedingungen zu prüfen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:DNX3","text":"Ein Zielerfolg, der durch äußere Gewalt hergestellt wird, gilt nicht als vollständige Lösung der Krise.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:DNX4","text":"Die Interpretation des Helden darf nicht den Interessen derjenigen überlassen werden, die von seiner Erschöpfung profitieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:DNX5","text":"Die aus dem Leid gewonnene Erkenntnis wird nicht als notwendiger Besitz des Genesenen vorausgesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird ein Deutungsregime, in dem jedes Nicht-Weitergehen als Faulheit oder moralische Schuld erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Hilfsordnung, die Rettung mit Besitzergreifung und Zielerreichung mit Heilung verwechselt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Bildung, deren Verhältnis zum Heroischen auf der Verwertung fremder Erschöpfung beruht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:SNX4","text":"Unverfügbar bleibt eine endgültige Lehre aus der Müdigkeit, solange die Müdigkeit selbst widerrufbar ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:FGS1","text":"Gleichlautende Rede + verschiedene Ursprünge → ungleiche Hörbarkeit → notwendige Unterscheidung von Müdigkeit und Faulheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:FGS2","text":"Zielnähe + Erschöpfung → trotziger Stillstand → Fehlinterpretationsgefahr als Faulheit oder Feigheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:FGS3","text":"Fehlinterpretationsgefahr + erschöpfter Held → Zurückweisung unmittelbaren Zwangs → Zulassung des Schlafs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:FGS4","text":"Schlaf + Selbsttätigkeit → Wiedererwachen → Widerruf der Müdigkeit und ihrer Lehre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:FGS5","text":"Sichtbarer Schweiß + fremde „Bildung“ → Aneignung des Helden → notwendige Abwehr der parasitären Umgebung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:FGS6","text":"Nicht-Zwang + Schutz vor Aneignung → interventionelle Minimalform: liegen lassen, bewachen, Erwachen abwarten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:AF1","text":"Gleichlautende Tafeln → verborgene Differenz von Müdigkeit und Faulheit → erschöpfter Held kurz vor dem Ziel → trotziger Stillstand → Zurückweisung des gewaltsamen Weiterziehens → selbsttätiger Schlaf → Widerruf von Müdigkeit und Müdigkeitslehre → Abwehr der „Gebildeten“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:ME1","text":"„Faulheit“ wird von einer unmittelbaren moralischen Zuschreibung zu einer möglichen Fehlklassifikation von Müdigkeit umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:ME2","text":"Hilfe wird von Zielbeschleunigung auf Erholungsbedingung und Schutz vor Aneignung umgestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:ME3","text":"Schlaf wird als aktive zeitliche Operation der Selbstkorrektur klassifiziert, nicht als bloße Passivität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:ME4","text":"Die „Gebildeten“ werden von einer kulturellen Instanz zu einer parasitären Funktion im Verhältnis zum Heroischen umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:ME5","text":"Das Ziel verliert seine Vorrangstellung gegenüber der Wiederherstellung desjenigen, der es erreichen soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:ALT1","text":"Surface — Ein erschöpfter Held verweigert kurz vor dem Ziel den letzten Schritt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die entscheidende Unterscheidung verläuft zwischen unterschiedlichen Erzeugungsbedingungen gleichlautender Rede.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Angemessene Intervention wird als Nicht-Erzwingen, Abwarten und Schutz vor ausbeutender Beobachtung organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Der Zustand der Müdigkeit und die aus ihm hervorgehende Lehre sind vorläufig; Zeit und Selbsttätigkeit ermöglichen ihren Widerruf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die zentrale Differenz zwischen Müdigkeit und Faulheit sowie die daraus folgende Interventionslogik zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, woran die innere Ursache einer Tafel außerhalb der erzählten Szene sicher erkannt werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, solange Müdigkeit als vorübergehender und selbsttätig widerrufbarer Zustand gilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung besteht zwischen Diagnose, Nicht-Zwang und Schutz vor fremder Aneignung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:MRT5","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen dem Gebot, den Helden liegen zu lassen, und der gleichzeitigen Forderung, die Hunde und das Geschmeiß von ihm fernzuhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung entsteht daraus, dass der Held autonom erwachen soll, aber zugleich als jemand erscheint, der vor äußerem Zugriff bewacht werden muss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung des Textes, sofern der Widerruf der Müdigkeitslehre nicht als zusätzliche Lehre, sondern als Aufhebung ihrer Geltung verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T185115445754Z_fbca8485","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"18.","source_sha256":"c3e8bfeeb5f0f410815997db67e3a56d9d532b0be954b2fd4960ad5ce034c4a1","sha256":"57d5f643f1d112bab1d3a118f2f5cac1368de7aaeac3229f78d45f05ac58ec69","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T18:51:15.450363+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:AS1","text":"The text problematizes the confusion of fatigue and laziness despite the same linguistic surface.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:AS2","text":"It defines the exhausted hero not by his goal, but by the defiant breaking-off shortly before its attainment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:AS3","text":"The visible refusal to go on is read as a consequence of fatigue and not straightforwardly as cowardice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:AS4","text":"The appropriate response consists not in forcible further transport, but in permitted sleep and the spontaneous return of strength.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:AS5","text":"Fatigue is to revoke itself and at the same time annul the instruction produced by it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:AS6","text":"Only protection from the “Gebildeten” completes the intervention, because they enrich themselves through the hero's sweat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:A1","text":"Tablets of the same wording can be heard differently.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:A2","text":"Fatigue and laziness produce different kinds of tablets.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:A3","text":"The hero is immediately before his goal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:A4","text":"The hero's standstill is conditioned by fatigue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:A5","text":"Fatigue can manifest itself as defiance against going on.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:A6","text":"External compulsion can bring the exhausted hero to his goal, but does not replace his own restoration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:A7","text":"Sleep can operate as spontaneous recovery and as revocation of fatigue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:A8","text":"The teaching produced by fatigue is likewise to be revoked along with restoration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:A9","text":"The “Gebildeten” appropriate the hero's sweat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:A10","text":"Protecting the hero from this appropriation belongs to the appropriate treatment of his exhaustion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:NX1","text":"The exhausted standstill is not to be equated with laziness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:NX2","text":"Identical speech proves no identical inner cause.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:NX3","text":"Help does not necessarily consist in forcing the hero immediately to the goal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:NX4","text":"The hero's defiance is not simply courage in successful execution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:NX5","text":"The “Gebildeten” do not appear as neutral observers or helpers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:NX6","text":"The teaching that has arisen from fatigue possesses no enduring validity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:D1","text":"The distinction between fatigue and laziness must reach beyond the linguistic surface to the mode of emergence of the respective tablet.","refs":["CH_97E9_18CH:A1","CH_97E9_18CH:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:D2","text":"Proximity to the goal intensifies fatigue, because the final step appears under exhausted conditions as an unbearable continuation.","refs":["CH_97E9_18CH:A3","CH_97E9_18CH:A4","CH_97E9_18CH:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:D3","text":"The defiantly asserted standstill can be a deformed form of courage, not its opposite.","refs":["CH_97E9_18CH:A3","CH_97E9_18CH:A4","CH_97E9_18CH:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:D4","text":"The compelled attainment of the goal would be secondary to the hero's inner recovery.","refs":["CH_97E9_18CH:A6","CH_97E9_18CH:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:D5","text":"Sleep retains its function only if it occurs not as an externally imposed interruption, but as a spontaneous awakening to the resumption of strength.","refs":["CH_97E9_18CH:A6","CH_97E9_18CH:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:D6","text":"A teaching of exhaustion is treated as a provisional condition that is to become irrelevant through recovery.","refs":["CH_97E9_18CH:A7","CH_97E9_18CH:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:D7","text":"The hero's social environment can convert his exhaustion into benefit for others.","refs":["CH_97E9_18CH:A9","CH_97E9_18CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:SD1","text":"The text replaces the moral evaluation of standstill with a diagnostic distinction between exhaustion-induced breaking-off and lazy refusal.","refs":["CH_97E9_18CH:A1","CH_97E9_18CH:A2","CH_97E9_18CH:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:SD2","text":"True help is constituted as non-appropriating interruption: it lets the hero lie, yet prevents his social exploitation.","refs":["CH_97E9_18CH:A6","CH_97E9_18CH:A7","CH_97E9_18CH:A9","CH_97E9_18CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:SD3","text":"The hero is constructed at once as an autonomous convalescent and as an object of foreign intervention in need of protection.","refs":["CH_97E9_18CH:A6","CH_97E9_18CH:A7","CH_97E9_18CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:SD4","text":"The argument devalues a culture that does not produce heroic execution, but consumes its visible signs of exhaustion.","refs":["CH_97E9_18CH:A9","CH_97E9_18CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:DNX1","text":"The merely visible form of a statement is insufficient to determine its origin or its validity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:DNX2","text":"Exhaustion must not be treated as a moral deficiency without examining its conditions of emergence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:DNX3","text":"An achievement of the goal brought about by external force does not count as a complete solution to the crisis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:DNX4","text":"The interpretation of the hero must not be left to the interests of those who profit from his exhaustion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:DNX5","text":"The knowledge gained from suffering is not presupposed as a necessary possession of the convalescent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a regime of interpretation in which every failure to go on appears as laziness or moral guilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:SNX2","text":"Excluded is an order of help that confuses rescue with taking possession and attainment of the goal with healing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:SNX3","text":"Excluded is an education whose relation to the heroic rests on the exploitation of others' exhaustion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:SNX4","text":"A definitive teaching from fatigue remains unavailable so long as fatigue itself is revocable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:FGS1","text":"Speech of the same wording + different origins → unequal hearability → necessary distinction between fatigue and laziness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:FGS2","text":"Proximity to the goal + exhaustion → defiant standstill → danger of misinterpretation as laziness or cowardice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:FGS3","text":"Danger of misinterpretation + exhausted hero → rejection of immediate compulsion → permission of sleep.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:FGS4","text":"Sleep + spontaneity → reawakening → revocation of fatigue and its teaching.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:FGS5","text":"Visible sweat + foreign “Bildung” → appropriation of the hero → necessary defense against the parasitic environment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:FGS6","text":"Non-compulsion + protection from appropriation → minimal form of intervention: let lie, guard, await awakening.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:AF1","text":"Tablets of the same wording → hidden difference between fatigue and laziness → exhausted hero shortly before the goal → defiant standstill → rejection of forcible dragging onward → spontaneous sleep → revocation of fatigue and the teaching of fatigue → defense against the “Gebildeten”.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:ME1","text":"“Faulheit” is remapped from an immediate moral attribution to a possible misclassification of fatigue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:ME2","text":"Help is shifted from acceleration toward the goal to the condition of recovery and protection from appropriation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:ME3","text":"Sleep is classified as an active temporal operation of self-correction, not as mere passivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:ME4","text":"The “Gebildeten” are reclassified from a cultural instance into a parasitic function in relation to the heroic.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:ME5","text":"The goal loses its priority relative to the restoration of the one who is to attain it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:ALT1","text":"Surface — An exhausted hero refuses the final step shortly before the goal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:ALT2","text":"Structural — The decisive distinction runs between differing conditions of production of speech of the same wording.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Appropriate intervention is organized as non-compulsion, waiting, and protection from exploitative observation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The condition of fatigue and the teaching arising from it are provisional; time and spontaneity enable their revocation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the central difference between fatigue and laziness as well as the resulting logic of intervention.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is how the inner cause of a tablet can be reliably recognized outside the narrated scene.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent so long as fatigue counts as a temporary condition that can be spontaneously revoked.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:MRT4","text":"The strongest connection exists between diagnosis, non-compulsion, and protection from foreign appropriation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:MRT5","text":"A tension remains between the injunction to let the hero lie and the simultaneous demand to keep the dogs and vermin away from him.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:MRT6","text":"A further tension arises from the fact that the hero is to awaken autonomously, yet at the same time appears as someone who must be guarded against external access.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18CH:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the text's actual movement, provided that the revocation of the teaching of fatigue is understood not as an additional teaching, but as the annulment of its validity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_18CH@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_18CH:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On Old and New Tablets","source_section_label":"18.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 18","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","18."],"original_title":"18."}],"source_title_context":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln","source_section_label":"18.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 18","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","18."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 99","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 18","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln · 18"},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH","layer":"CH","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 19","order":100,"parents":["RAW_97E9_19CH"],"revision":"CH_97E9_19CH@R001","sha256":"bf68a9a974be22b6da4cd2ba478f2e40fc5d87fd5a56c23c67f9e2041f277e05","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:AS1","text":"Das Argument setzt Selbstbegrenzung und geheiligte Grenzen als Bedingung des Aufstiegs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:AS2","text":"Der Aufstieg erzeugt zugleich exponierte, ermüdende und verletzbare Stellen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:AS3","text":"Der Schmarotzer wird als Instanz bestimmt, die solche Schwächen erkennt und für ihre eigene Vermehrung nutzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:AS4","text":"Die höchste Seele wird nicht durch Abwesenheit von Schmarotzern, sondern durch die größtmögliche Fähigkeit zur Aufnahme von Schmarotzern ausgezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:AS5","text":"Die Bewegung führt von der Grenzziehung über die strukturelle Verwundbarkeit zur paradoxen Kopplung von Höhe, Umfänglichkeit und parasitärer Belastung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:A1","text":"Aufstieg vollzieht sich durch zunehmend geheiligte Grenzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:A2","text":"Aufsteigende Seelen besitzen Stellen der Ermüdung und Verwundbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:A3","text":"Ein Schmarotzer lebt von den kranken oder wunden Winkeln eines anderen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:A4","text":"Der Schmarotzer erkennt aufsteigende Seelen an den Punkten ihrer Erschöpfung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:A5","text":"Gram, Unmut und zarte Scham können als Niststellen parasitärer Kräfte dienen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:A6","text":"Stärke kann mit Schwäche und Größe mit kleinen wunden Winkeln koexistieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:A7","text":"Der Schmarotzer bildet die geringste Art des Seienden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:A8","text":"Die höchste Art ernährt die meisten Schmarotzer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:A9","text":"Die höchste Seele besitzt die längste innere Leiter und die größte Fähigkeit zum tiefen Hinabsteigen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:A10","text":"Die höchste Seele ist umfänglich genug, um weit in sich zu laufen, zu irren und zu schweifen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:A11","text":"Die höchste Seele taucht in das Werden ein und bewegt sich in Wollen und Verlangen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:A12","text":"Die höchste Seele flieht vor sich selbst und holt sich im weitesten Kreis wieder ein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:A13","text":"Die höchste Seele verbindet Weisheit mit der Süße der Narrheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:A14","text":"In der höchsten Seele haben die Dinge ihr Strömen, Wiederströmen, ihre Ebbe und Flut.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:A15","text":"Je umfassender eine Seele ist, desto mehr heterogene Bewegungen und Zugänge enthält sie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:NX1","text":"Der Aufstieg ist nicht durch die bloße Abwesenheit von Schmarotzern definiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:NX2","text":"Heilige Grenzen schließen Verwundbarkeit nicht vollständig aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:NX3","text":"Der Schmarotzer ist nicht die höchste, sondern die geringste Art.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:NX4","text":"Größe bedeutet nicht makellose Unverletzlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:NX5","text":"Schwäche ist nicht auf kleine oder niedrige Seelen beschränkt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:NX6","text":"Die höchste Seele ist keine abgeschlossene, eindimensional reine Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:NX7","text":"Der Schmarotzer wird nicht als gleichrangiger Träger des Aufstiegs anerkannt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:NX8","text":"Die Ausweitung der Seele wird nicht als Befreiung von Zufall, Begehren, Irrtum oder Narrheit bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:D1","text":"Je höher eine Seele steigt, desto mehr strategisch verwertbare Verwundbarkeiten kann sie aufweisen.","refs":["CH_97E9_19CH:A2","CH_97E9_19CH:A4","CH_97E9_19CH:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:D2","text":"Die produktive Größe einer Seele lässt sich an der Zahl der von ihr ernährten Schmarotzer ablesen.","refs":["CH_97E9_19CH:A7","CH_97E9_19CH:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:D3","text":"Innere Tiefe vergrößert zugleich die Reichweite und die Angriffsfläche einer Seele.","refs":["CH_97E9_19CH:A9","CH_97E9_19CH:A10","CH_97E9_19CH:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:D4","text":"Eine Seele, die Werden, Zufall und Verlangen in sich aufnimmt, kann nicht als vollständig immunisierte Ordnung bestehen.","refs":["CH_97E9_19CH:A10","CH_97E9_19CH:A11","CH_97E9_19CH:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:D5","text":"Die vom Schmarotzer ausgenutzte Wunde ist kein äußerlicher Zufall der höchsten Seele, sondern entsteht aus ihrer umfassenden Beweglichkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_19CH:A3","CH_97E9_19CH:A9","CH_97E9_19CH:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:D6","text":"Selbstüberwindung und Selbstwiedergewinnung erzeugen keine lineare Reinheit, sondern eine zirkuläre Offenheit für widersprüchliche Zustände.","refs":["CH_97E9_19CH:A12","CH_97E9_19CH:A13","CH_97E9_19CH:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:SD1","text":"Die höchste Form des Seienden wird als maximale Integrationsfähigkeit bestimmt, nicht als Abwesenheit des Niedrigsten.","refs":["CH_97E9_19CH:A7","CH_97E9_19CH:A8","CH_97E9_19CH:A9","CH_97E9_19CH:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:SD2","text":"Hierarchie und Verwundbarkeit bilden keine Gegensätze; die höchste Position erzeugt gerade durch ihre Umfänglichkeit die größte parasitäre Belastung.","refs":["CH_97E9_19CH:A2","CH_97E9_19CH:A8","CH_97E9_19CH:A10","CH_97E9_19CH:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:SD3","text":"Die Grenze schützt den Aufstieg nur als Abgrenzung nach außen, nicht als Tilgung innerer Bruchstellen.","refs":["CH_97E9_19CH:A1","CH_97E9_19CH:A5","CH_97E9_19CH:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:SD4","text":"Das System verwandelt die Bedrohung durch den Schmarotzer in ein Maß für die Reichweite und Fruchtbarkeit der höchsten Seele.","refs":["CH_97E9_19CH:A3","CH_97E9_19CH:A7","CH_97E9_19CH:A8","CH_97E9_19CH:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:DNX1","text":"Das System setzt voraus, dass Reinheit durch vollständige Abschließung nicht erreichbar ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:DNX2","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass Rang und Unverletzlichkeit proportional zunehmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:DNX3","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass die Seele nur durch Ausschaltung von Zufall, Begehren, Irrtum und Narrheit höchste Form erlangt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:DNX4","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass eine Grenze jede parasitäre Aneignung ihrer inneren Schwachstellen verhindert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:DNX5","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass das Niedrige nur außerhalb des Hohen existiert; es kann sich im höchsten Gebilde einnisten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:DNX6","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass Selbstliebe, Selbstflucht und Selbstwiedergewinnung in eine widerspruchsfreie Identität überführt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:SNX1","text":"Die Möglichkeit einer höchsten Seele ohne jede parasitäre Abhängigkeit bleibt strukturell unzulässig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:SNX2","text":"Eine reine, geschlossene und vollständig selbstgenügsame Höhe wird als nicht verfügbare Form behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:SNX3","text":"Der Text umkreist die Unmöglichkeit, Größe von ihren eigenen Einlassstellen für das Niedrige zu trennen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen bleibt eine Hierarchie, in der das Höhere das Niedere nur beherrscht, ohne es zugleich zu ernähren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:SNX5","text":"Die Abwesenheit vollständiger Immunität bildet die negative Bedingung der behaupteten höchsten Beweglichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:FGS1","text":"Selbstbegrenzung → geheiligter Aufstieg → verbleibende innere Verwundbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:FGS2","text":"Verwundbarkeit → Erkennbarkeit der Ermüdung → parasitäre Nistung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:FGS3","text":"Größere innere Reichweite → größere Aufnahme von Werden, Zufall, Begehren und Widerspruch → größere Angriffsfläche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:FGS4","text":"Größte Angriffsfläche bei höchstem Rang → höchste Seele ernährt die meisten Schmarotzer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:FGS5","text":"Parasitische Belastung → keine Widerlegung der Höhe, sondern deren paradoxes Funktionszeichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:AF1","text":"Grenzziehung → Aufstieg → Erschöpfung und Wunde → parasitäre Aneignung → Umkehrung des Rangmaßstabs → höchste Seele als umfassendste und am stärksten belastete Form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:ME1","text":"Verwundbarkeit wird von einem Gegenbeweis gegen Größe zu einem Indikator ihrer Reichweite umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:ME2","text":"Die Hierarchie des Seienden wird nicht als Immunitätsskala, sondern als Verhältnis von Ernährungsfähigkeit und parasitärer Belastung geordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:ME3","text":"Grenze und Offenheit erscheinen nicht länger als Gegensätze: Die Grenze konstituiert den Aufstieg, während die innere Offenheit seine parasitäre Exponiertheit erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:ME4","text":"Das Niedrige wird als im Höchsten mitproduzierte Belastung neu klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:ME5","text":"Seele wird von einer statischen Substanz zu einem beweglichen Gefüge aus Selbstflucht, Selbstwiedergewinnung, Werden und Strömen kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Aufstieg heiliger Seelen wird durch die Gefahr des Mitschmarotzens begrenzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:ALT2","text":"Structural — Parasitäre Kräfte besetzen systematisch die Ermüdungs-, Scham- und Schwachstellen umfassender Seelen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Schutz des Aufstiegs verlangt nicht die Illusion vollständiger Reinheit, sondern die Kontrolle der eigenen verwundbaren Winkel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Höchstes Sein wird als dynamisches Werden mit wiederkehrenden Bewegungen von Strömen, Ebben, Fluten, Selbstflucht und Selbstwiederkehr bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den Übergang von geheiligter Grenze zu parasitärer Belastung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:MRT2","text":"Die Rangumkehr vom Schmarotzer als niedrigster Art zur höchsten Seele als Ernährerin der meisten Schmarotzer bleibt erhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob der Schmarotzer ausschließlich eine äußere Person, eine innere Kraft oder beide Formen bezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:MRT4","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob „ernähren“ kausal, metaphorisch oder ontologisch gemeint ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:MRT5","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern höchste Form als maximale Umfänglichkeit und nicht als maximale Reinheit verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:MRT6","text":"Die stärkste Spannung liegt zwischen der anfänglichen Heiligung der Grenze und der späteren Anerkennung unvermeidbarer innerer Offenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, weil sie die parasitäre Gefahr nicht als Endwiderlegung, sondern als Folge und Prüfzeichen des Aufstiegs behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T185152845116Z_f3520a96","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"19.","source_sha256":"bf68a9a974be22b6da4cd2ba478f2e40fc5d87fd5a56c23c67f9e2041f277e05","sha256":"c42a4f30374b61200acfeb1ae803ae3c039a85f48f7e1d8095c0627d6909db95","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T18:51:52.846113+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:AS1","text":"The argument posits self-limitation and sanctified boundaries as the condition of ascent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:AS2","text":"Ascent simultaneously produces exposed, exhausting, and vulnerable points.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:AS3","text":"The parasite is determined as an instance that recognizes such weaknesses and uses them for its own multiplication.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:AS4","text":"The highest soul is distinguished not by the absence of parasites, but by the greatest possible capacity to accommodate parasites.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:AS5","text":"The movement leads from boundary-drawing through structural vulnerability to the paradoxical coupling of height, comprehensiveness, and parasitic burden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:A1","text":"Ascent takes place through increasingly sanctified boundaries.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:A2","text":"Ascending souls possess points of exhaustion and vulnerability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:A3","text":"A parasite lives from the sick or sore corners of another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:A4","text":"The parasite recognizes ascending souls at the points of their exhaustion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:A5","text":"Grief, displeasure, and tender shame can serve as nesting places for parasitic forces.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:A6","text":"Strength can coexist with weakness, and greatness with small sore corners.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:A7","text":"The parasite constitutes the lowest kind of being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:A8","text":"The highest kind nourishes the most parasites.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:A9","text":"The highest soul possesses the longest inner ladder and the greatest capacity for deep descent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:A10","text":"The highest soul is comprehensive enough to run far within itself, to err, and to wander.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:A11","text":"The highest soul plunges into becoming and moves in willing and desiring.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:A12","text":"The highest soul flees from itself and catches up with itself again in the widest circle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:A13","text":"The highest soul unites wisdom with the sweetness of folly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:A14","text":"In the highest soul, things have their flowing, reflowing, their ebb and flood.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:A15","text":"The more comprehensive a soul is, the more heterogeneous movements and approaches it contains.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:NX1","text":"Ascent is not defined by the mere absence of parasites.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:NX2","text":"Sacred boundaries do not completely exclude vulnerability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:NX3","text":"The parasite is not the highest but the lowest kind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:NX4","text":"Greatness does not mean flawless invulnerability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:NX5","text":"Weakness is not restricted to small or low souls.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:NX6","text":"The highest soul is not a closed, one-dimensionally pure unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:NX7","text":"The parasite is not acknowledged as an equal-ranking bearer of ascent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:NX8","text":"The expansion of the soul is not determined as liberation from chance, desire, error, or folly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:D1","text":"The higher a soul ascends, the more strategically exploitable vulnerabilities it may display.","refs":["CH_97E9_19CH:A2","CH_97E9_19CH:A4","CH_97E9_19CH:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:D2","text":"The productive greatness of a soul can be read from the number of parasites it nourishes.","refs":["CH_97E9_19CH:A7","CH_97E9_19CH:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:D3","text":"Inner depth simultaneously enlarges a soul's range and its surface of attack.","refs":["CH_97E9_19CH:A9","CH_97E9_19CH:A10","CH_97E9_19CH:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:D4","text":"A soul that takes becoming, chance, and desire into itself cannot subsist as a completely immunized order.","refs":["CH_97E9_19CH:A10","CH_97E9_19CH:A11","CH_97E9_19CH:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:D5","text":"The wound exploited by the parasite is no external contingency of the highest soul, but arises from its comprehensive mobility.","refs":["CH_97E9_19CH:A3","CH_97E9_19CH:A9","CH_97E9_19CH:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:D6","text":"Self-overcoming and self-recovery produce not linear purity, but a circular openness to contradictory states.","refs":["CH_97E9_19CH:A12","CH_97E9_19CH:A13","CH_97E9_19CH:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:SD1","text":"The highest form of being is determined as maximal capacity for integration, not as the absence of the lowest.","refs":["CH_97E9_19CH:A7","CH_97E9_19CH:A8","CH_97E9_19CH:A9","CH_97E9_19CH:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:SD2","text":"Hierarchy and vulnerability do not form opposites; precisely through its comprehensiveness, the highest position produces the greatest parasitic burden.","refs":["CH_97E9_19CH:A2","CH_97E9_19CH:A8","CH_97E9_19CH:A10","CH_97E9_19CH:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:SD3","text":"The boundary protects ascent only as a demarcation outward, not as the eradication of inner points of rupture.","refs":["CH_97E9_19CH:A1","CH_97E9_19CH:A5","CH_97E9_19CH:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:SD4","text":"The system transforms the threat posed by the parasite into a measure of the range and fruitfulness of the highest soul.","refs":["CH_97E9_19CH:A3","CH_97E9_19CH:A7","CH_97E9_19CH:A8","CH_97E9_19CH:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:DNX1","text":"The system presupposes that purity cannot be attained through complete closure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:DNX2","text":"It is excluded that rank and invulnerability increase proportionally.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:DNX3","text":"It is excluded that the soul attains highest form only through the elimination of chance, desire, error, and folly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:DNX4","text":"It is excluded that a boundary prevents every parasitic appropriation of its inner weak points.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:DNX5","text":"It is excluded that the low exists only outside the high; it can nest within the highest structure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:DNX6","text":"It is excluded that self-love, self-flight, and self-recovery are converted into a contradiction-free identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:SNX1","text":"The possibility of a highest soul without any parasitic dependence remains structurally inadmissible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:SNX2","text":"A pure, closed, and completely self-sufficient height is treated as an unavailable form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:SNX3","text":"The text circles around the impossibility of separating greatness from its own points of entry for the low.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:SNX4","text":"Excluded remains a hierarchy in which the higher merely dominates the lower without simultaneously nourishing it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:SNX5","text":"The absence of complete immunity constitutes the negative condition of the asserted highest mobility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:FGS1","text":"Self-limitation → sanctified ascent → remaining inner vulnerability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:FGS2","text":"Vulnerability → recognizability of exhaustion → parasitic nesting.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:FGS3","text":"Greater inner range → greater reception of becoming, chance, desire, and contradiction → greater surface of attack.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:FGS4","text":"Greatest surface of attack at highest rank → highest soul nourishes the most parasites.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:FGS5","text":"Parasitic burden → not a refutation of height, but its paradoxical functional sign.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:AF1","text":"Boundary-drawing → ascent → exhaustion and wound → parasitic appropriation → reversal of the measure of rank → highest soul as the most comprehensive and most heavily burdened form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:ME1","text":"Vulnerability is remapped from a counterproof against greatness into an indicator of its range.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:ME2","text":"The hierarchy of being is ordered not as a scale of immunity, but as a relation of nourishing capacity and parasitic burden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:ME3","text":"Boundary and openness no longer appear as opposites: the boundary constitutes ascent, while inner openness produces its parasitic exposure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:ME4","text":"The low is reclassified as a burden co-produced in the highest.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:ME5","text":"Soul is mapped from a static substance into a mobile configuration of self-flight, self-recovery, becoming, and flowing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:ALT1","text":"Surface — The ascent of holy souls is limited by the danger of co-parasitizing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:ALT2","text":"Structural — Parasitic forces systematically occupy the points of exhaustion, shame, and weakness of comprehensive souls.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The protection of ascent requires not the illusion of complete purity, but the control of one's own vulnerable corners.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Highest being is determined as dynamic becoming with recurrent movements of flowing, ebbing, flooding, self-flight, and self-return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the transition from sanctified boundary to parasitic burden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:MRT2","text":"The reversal of rank from the parasite as the lowest kind to the highest soul as nourisher of the most parasites is preserved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:MRT3","text":"It remains underdetermined whether the parasite denotes exclusively an external person, an inner force, or both forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:MRT4","text":"It remains underdetermined whether “nourish” is meant causally, metaphorically, or ontologically.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:MRT5","text":"The structure is internally coherent provided that highest form is understood as maximal comprehensiveness and not as maximal purity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:MRT6","text":"The strongest tension lies between the initial sanctification of the boundary and the later acknowledgment of unavoidable inner openness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19CH:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement because it treats the parasitic danger not as a final refutation, but as a consequence and test-sign of ascent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_19CH@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_19CH:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On Old and New Tablets","source_section_label":"19.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 19","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","19."],"original_title":"19."}],"source_title_context":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln","source_section_label":"19.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 19","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","19."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 100","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 19","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln · 19"},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH","layer":"CH","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 20","order":101,"parents":["RAW_97E9_20CH"],"revision":"CH_97E9_20CH@R001","sha256":"e7acad27b226b64a2cde1bb32790247cb0760b08960be508e233f1294135cfa4","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:AS1","text":"Das Gegenwärtige wird als bereits fallend und verfallend bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:AS2","text":"Was fällt, soll nicht bewahrt, sondern weitergestoßen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:AS3","text":"Der Fall wird von passivem Verhängnis in eine lustvolle aktive Bewegung überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:AS4","text":"Die Sprecherposition erzeugt sich als Vorspiel und Beispiel für eine kommende Spiel- oder Menschengestalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:AS5","text":"Wo Erhebung nicht gelehrt werden kann, wird die Beschleunigung des Falls als sekundäre Lehre eingesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:A1","text":"Das Gegenwärtige fällt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:A2","text":"Das Gegenwärtige verfällt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:A3","text":"Fallendes soll nicht festgehalten werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:A4","text":"Der Fall kann durch Stoßen intensiviert werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:A5","text":"Die Intensivierung des Falls kann Lust erzeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:A6","text":"Die Menschen der Gegenwart sind in den Fall einbezogen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:A7","text":"Die Sprecherposition verkörpert ein vorausgehendes Beispiel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:A8","text":"Fliegen und Fallen bilden unterschiedliche, hierarchisch geordnete Bewegungsweisen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:A9","text":"Wer das Fliegen nicht lehren kann, kann dennoch ein schnelleres Fallen lehren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:NX1","text":"Das Fallende soll nicht gehalten oder stabilisiert werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:NX2","text":"Der gegenwärtige Zustand wird nicht als bewahrungswürdige Ordnung anerkannt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:NX3","text":"Mitleid wird nicht als leitende Reaktion auf den Fall eingesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:NX4","text":"Der Fall wird nicht als bloß passives Geschehen behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:NX5","text":"Die Lehre beschränkt sich nicht auf die Möglichkeit des Fliegens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:NX6","text":"Die Menschen der Gegenwart erscheinen nicht als autonome Aufsteiger, sondern als bereits fallende Körper.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:D1","text":"Aus dem Fall und dem Verbot seiner Bewahrung folgt, dass Untergang als fortzusetzende Bewegung behandelt wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_20CH:A1","CH_97E9_20CH:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:D2","text":"Aus der Möglichkeit, den Fall zu intensivieren, folgt eine aktive Ethik des Stoßes.","refs":["CH_97E9_20CH:A4","CH_97E9_20CH:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:D3","text":"Aus der Lust am Rollen der Steine wird der Fall als begehrbare Dynamik bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_20CH:A4","CH_97E9_20CH:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:D4","text":"Die Gegenwart wird nicht als Anfang einer Entwicklung, sondern als Material eines beschleunigten Abstiegs klassifiziert.","refs":["CH_97E9_20CH:A1","CH_97E9_20CH:A2","CH_97E9_20CH:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:D5","text":"Die Sprecherposition gewinnt normative Kraft durch die Darstellung ihrer selbst als Beispiel.","refs":["CH_97E9_20CH:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:D6","text":"Das Scheitern der Fluglehre erzeugt keine Handlungsunfähigkeit, sondern eine alternative Pädagogik des schnelleren Falls.","refs":["CH_97E9_20CH:A8","CH_97E9_20CH:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:SD1","text":"Die gewöhnliche Opposition von Hilfe und Gewalt wird in eine Unterscheidung zwischen Bewahrung und produktiver Beschleunigung des Falls umgearbeitet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:SD2","text":"Der Untergang wird von einem zu verhindernden Ereignis zu einer selektierten und gesteigerten Bewegungsform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:SD3","text":"Die Sprecherfigur verbindet Diagnose, Verkörperung und Lehre, indem sie den behaupteten Prozess zugleich beschreibt, vollzieht und vorführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:SD4","text":"Die Verneinung von Grausamkeit bleibt mit einer Praxis des Stoßes verschränkt und erzeugt einen ungelösten Widerspruch zwischen Selbstdeutung und Handlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:SD5","text":"Erhebung wird nicht als einzige Form der Transformation gesetzt; auch die qualitative Steigerung des Falls erhält transformatorischen Wert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:DNX1","text":"Der Fortbestand der gegenwärtigen Ordnung darf nicht als eigenständiger Wert gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:DNX2","text":"Fall und Verfall dürfen nicht als bloß negative oder sinnlose Prozesse verstanden werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:DNX3","text":"Pädagogik darf nicht auf Rettung, Aufrichtung oder allgemeine Hebung reduziert werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:DNX4","text":"Aktivität darf nicht mit Aufbau, Stabilisierung oder Aufstieg gleichgesetzt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:DNX5","text":"Die Sprecherfigur darf nicht von dem Prozess getrennt werden, den sie diagnostiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:DNX6","text":"Eine eindeutige Identität von Grausamkeit und bloßer Schädigung wird ausgeschlossen, ohne dass ein alternatives Kriterium vollständig bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Welt, in der das Fallende durch Festhalten gerettet und dadurch sinnvoll bewahrt werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine neutrale Mitte zwischen Untergang und Aufstieg; die verbleibende Möglichkeit ist die gesteigerte Richtung des bereits eingesetzten Falls.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:SNX3","text":"Abwesend bleibt ein Maßstab, der entscheidet, wann Stoßen Befreiung, Prüfung oder bloße Zerstörung ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:SNX4","text":"Die versperrte Möglichkeit ist eine nichtgewaltsame, zugleich nicht-konservative Form der Transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:SNX5","text":"Der Text organisiert sich um die Abwesenheit einer Lehre, die das Fliegen für alle verfügbar machen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:FGS1","text":"Gegenwart als Fall und Verfall setzen → Bewahrung ausschließen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:FGS2","text":"Bewahrung ausschließen → Stoß als zulässige Gegenbewegung zum passiven Fallen erzeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:FGS3","text":"Stoß mit Lust und Steilheit verbinden → Beschleunigung des Falls positiv codieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:FGS4","text":"Gegenwart als fallende Menschen erfassen → allgemeine Diagnose in eine kollektive Bewegungsordnung überführen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:FGS5","text":"Sprecher als Vorspiel und Beispiel einsetzen → Diagnose in performative Lehre verwandeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:FGS6","text":"Flug als unerreichbare oder nicht universalisierbare Möglichkeit markieren → schnelleres Fallen als Ersatz- und Übergangslehre bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:FGS7","text":"Beschleunigten Fall als aktive Pädagogik schließen → Untergang als gesteigerte Transformation stabilisieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:AF1","text":"Verfallende Gegenwart → Zurückweisung der Bewahrung → aktive Beschleunigung des Falls → Verkörperung als Beispiel → Ersatz der Fluglehre durch Falllehre → gesteigerter Untergang als Endposition","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:ME1","text":"„Fallen“ wird von einem passiven Zustand in eine aktiv steuerbare Bewegungsform umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:ME2","text":"„Stoßen“ wird nicht primär als Schädigung, sondern als Eingriff in eine bereits laufende Zerfallsbewegung klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:ME3","text":"„Lehre“ wird von der Vermittlung des Aufstiegs auf die Organisation des Abstiegs erweitert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:ME4","text":"Die Gegenwart wird von einem zu erhaltenden Bestand in ein zu überwindendes Übergangsmaterial umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:ME5","text":"Die Opposition von Flug und Fall wird asymmetrisch geordnet: Flug bezeichnet die höhere Möglichkeit, schneller Fall die verfügbare Ersatzoperation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:ME6","text":"Die Sprecherfigur wird als Bestandteil der diagnostizierten Dynamik und nicht als äußerer Beobachter kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Sprecher weist das Festhalten des Fallenden zurück und fordert dessen weiteres Stoßen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:ALT2","text":"Structural — Eine fallende Gegenwart wird durch die Unterscheidung von Bewahrung, Stoß und Beschleunigung organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Diagnose wird als Beispiel und Nachahmungsangebot in eine kollektive Handlungs- und Lehrform überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Gegenwart erscheint als bereits verfallender Übergangszustand; Zukunft entsteht nicht aus Erhaltung, sondern aus gesteigerter Bewegung durch den Fall.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um Fall, Stoß, Lust, Beispiel und alternative Pädagogik zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, worauf der Fall ontologisch oder historisch zielt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt ebenfalls, nach welchem Maßstab schnelleres Fallen gegenüber bloßer Zerstörung ausgezeichnet wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:MRT4","text":"Die Struktur ist intern konditional kohärent, solange der Fall als bereits gegebene Grundbewegung akzeptiert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:MRT5","text":"Ihre stärkste Verbindung liegt in der Umwandlung von passivem Verfall in aktive Beschleunigung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:MRT6","text":"Ihre zentrale Bruchlinie liegt zwischen der Zurückweisung von Grausamkeit und der normativen Aufwertung des Stoßes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung vom fallenden Gegenwärtigen über das Beispiel zur Lehre des schnelleren Falls.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T190001107788Z_ca5eb62b","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"20.","source_sha256":"e7acad27b226b64a2cde1bb32790247cb0760b08960be508e233f1294135cfa4","sha256":"70b8c026df22ade74bcda8d2ebd4b582710f276a63214184a9936e8dc74f1820","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:00:01.109003+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:AS1","text":"The present is determined as already falling and decaying.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:AS2","text":"What falls should not be preserved, but pushed further.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:AS3","text":"Falling is transferred from a passive fate into a pleasurable active movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:AS4","text":"The speaker-position generates itself as prelude and example for a coming form of play or human form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:AS5","text":"Where elevation cannot be taught, the acceleration of falling is deployed as a secondary teaching.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:A1","text":"The present falls.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:A2","text":"The present decays.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:A3","text":"What is falling should not be held fast.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:A4","text":"Falling can be intensified by pushing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:A5","text":"The intensification of falling can produce pleasure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:A6","text":"The people of the present are implicated in falling.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:A7","text":"The speaker-position embodies a preceding example.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:A8","text":"Flying and falling constitute distinct, hierarchically ordered modes of movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:A9","text":"Whoever cannot teach flying can nevertheless teach faster falling.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:NX1","text":"What is falling should not be held or stabilized.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:NX2","text":"The present state is not recognized as an order worthy of preservation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:NX3","text":"Pity is not deployed as the guiding response to falling.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:NX4","text":"Falling is not treated as a merely passive occurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:NX5","text":"The teaching is not limited to the possibility of flying.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:NX6","text":"The people of the present appear not as autonomous ascenders, but as bodies already falling.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:D1","text":"From falling and the prohibition of its preservation follows that downfall is treated as a movement to be continued.","refs":["CH_97E9_20CH:A1","CH_97E9_20CH:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:D2","text":"From the possibility of intensifying falling follows an active ethics of pushing.","refs":["CH_97E9_20CH:A4","CH_97E9_20CH:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:D3","text":"From the pleasure in the rolling of stones, falling is determined as a desirable dynamic.","refs":["CH_97E9_20CH:A4","CH_97E9_20CH:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:D4","text":"The present is classified not as the beginning of a development, but as material for an accelerated descent.","refs":["CH_97E9_20CH:A1","CH_97E9_20CH:A2","CH_97E9_20CH:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:D5","text":"The speaker-position gains normative force through the presentation of itself as an example.","refs":["CH_97E9_20CH:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:D6","text":"The failure of the teaching of flight produces not an incapacity to act, but an alternative pedagogy of faster falling.","refs":["CH_97E9_20CH:A8","CH_97E9_20CH:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:SD1","text":"The ordinary opposition between help and violence is reworked into a distinction between preservation and the productive acceleration of falling.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:SD2","text":"Downfall is transformed from an event to be prevented into a selected and intensified form of movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:SD3","text":"The speaker-figure joins diagnosis, embodiment, and teaching by simultaneously describing, enacting, and demonstrating the asserted process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:SD4","text":"The negation of cruelty remains entangled with a practice of pushing and produces an unresolved contradiction between self-interpretation and action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:SD5","text":"Elevation is not posited as the sole form of transformation; the qualitative intensification of falling, too, receives transformative value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:DNX1","text":"The continuance of the present order must not count as an independent value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:DNX2","text":"Falling and decay must not be understood as merely negative or meaningless processes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:DNX3","text":"Pedagogy must not be reduced to rescue, erection, or general elevation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:DNX4","text":"Activity must not be equated with construction, stabilization, or ascent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:DNX5","text":"The speaker-figure must not be separated from the process it diagnoses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:DNX6","text":"An unambiguous identity of cruelty and mere harm is excluded, without an alternative criterion being fully determined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a world in which what is falling can be saved by holding it fast and thereby preserved meaningfully.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:SNX2","text":"Excluded is a neutral middle between downfall and ascent; the remaining possibility is the intensified direction of the fall already set in motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:SNX3","text":"Absent remains a standard that decides when pushing is liberation, testing, or mere destruction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:SNX4","text":"The blocked possibility is a nonviolent yet non-conservative form of transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:SNX5","text":"The text organizes itself around the absence of a teaching that could make flying available to all.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:FGS1","text":"Posit the present as falling and decay → exclude preservation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:FGS2","text":"Exclude preservation → generate pushing as a permissible counter-movement to passive falling.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:FGS3","text":"Connect pushing with pleasure and steepness → positively code the acceleration of falling.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:FGS4","text":"Grasp the present as falling people → transfer general diagnosis into a collective order of movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:FGS5","text":"Deploy the speaker as prelude and example → transform diagnosis into performative teaching.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:FGS6","text":"Mark flight as an unattainable or non-universalizable possibility → determine faster falling as a substitute and transitional teaching.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:FGS7","text":"Conclude accelerated falling as active pedagogy → stabilize downfall as intensified transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:AF1","text":"Decaying present → rejection of preservation → active acceleration of falling → embodiment as example → replacement of the teaching of flight by the teaching of falling → intensified downfall as final position","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:ME1","text":"“Falling” is remapped from a passive state into an actively controllable form of movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:ME2","text":"“Pushing” is classified not primarily as harm, but as intervention in an already ongoing movement of decay.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:ME3","text":"“Teaching” is extended from the mediation of ascent to the organization of descent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:ME4","text":"The present is reclassified from a stock to be preserved into transitional material to be overcome.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:ME5","text":"The opposition between flight and falling is asymmetrically ordered: flight designates the higher possibility, faster falling the available substitute operation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:ME6","text":"The speaker-figure is mapped as a component of the diagnosed dynamic and not as an external observer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:ALT1","text":"Surface — The speaker rejects holding fast what is falling and calls for its further pushing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:ALT2","text":"Structural — A falling present is organized through the distinction between preservation, pushing, and acceleration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Diagnosis is transferred, as example and offer of imitation, into a collective form of action and teaching.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The present appears as an already decaying transitional state; the future emerges not from preservation, but from intensified movement through falling.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct falling, pushing, pleasure, example, and alternative pedagogy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is what falling aims at ontologically or historically.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:MRT3","text":"Also underdetermined is the standard by which faster falling is distinguished from mere destruction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:MRT4","text":"The structure is internally conditionally coherent as long as falling is accepted as an already given fundamental movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:MRT5","text":"Its strongest connection lies in the transformation of passive decay into active acceleration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:MRT6","text":"Its central fracture line lies between the rejection of cruelty and the normative valorization of pushing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20CH:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement from the falling present through the example to the teaching of faster falling.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_20CH@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_20CH:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On Old and New Tablets","source_section_label":"20.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 20","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","20."],"original_title":"20."}],"source_title_context":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln","source_section_label":"20.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 20","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","20."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 101","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 20","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln · 20"},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH","layer":"CH","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 21","order":102,"parents":["RAW_97E9_21CH"],"revision":"CH_97E9_21CH@R001","sha256":"725c5f03e27cb175e2fba1a16939ccc5d93cc7bfdd23731c1164f0335e44a35c","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:AS1","text":"Das zentrale Problem ist die unterschiedslose Verausgabung von Tapferkeit gegen minderwertige Gegner und kollektive Lärmbildung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:AS2","text":"Tapferkeit wird von bloßer Angriffslust auf Zielwahl, Selbstbeherrschung und Aufschub umbestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:AS3","text":"Der würdige Feind wird als notwendige Gegeninstanz des eigenen Vorrangs eingeführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:AS4","text":"Die Auseinandersetzung mit Volk, Völkern und ihren Für-und-Wider-Ordnungen wird als Zorn erzeugende Verstrickung diagnostiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:AS5","text":"Rückzug, Nichtbeachtung und das Ruhenlassen des Schwertes fungieren als strategische Schonung für den besseren Konflikt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:AS6","text":"Die gegenwärtige Volksordnung wird als krämerhafte Herrschaft kleiner Vorteile und als Verlust königlicher Rangordnung bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:AS7","text":"Aus der Herrschaft des Besten folgt die abschließende politische und normative Schließung des Arguments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:A1","text":"Tapferkeit besteht nicht in bloßer Angriffsfähigkeit, sondern in der Bestimmung dessen, wann und gegen wen sie eingesetzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:A2","text":"Selbstbeherrschung und Vorübergehen können tapferer sein als unmittelbares Zuschlagen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:A3","text":"Der angemessene Feind muss hassenswert, aber nicht verachtenswert sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:A4","text":"Ein würdiger Feind begründet eine Rangbeziehung, in der der Gegner trotz Feindschaft Stolz verdient.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:A5","text":"Die eigene Kraft muss für den würdigeren Feind aufgespart werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:A6","text":"Die Auseinandersetzung mit dem Für und Wider von Volk und Völkern erzeugt Zorn statt Klarheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:A7","text":"Bei bestimmten Gegnern fallen Anschauen und Zuschlagen in dieselbe reaktive Bewegung zusammen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:A8","text":"Der Rückzug in die Wälder und das Ruhenlassen des Schwertes dienen der Unterbrechung dieser reaktiven Bewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:A9","text":"Die gegenwärtigen Völker verhalten sich wie Krämer, indem sie kleinste Vorteile gegeneinander berechnen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:A10","text":"Die gegenwärtige Zeit ist nicht mehr die Zeit der Könige.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:A11","text":"Eine Ordnung ist dann legitim, wenn das Beste in ihr herrscht und herrschen will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:A12","text":"Wo eine andere Lehre als die Herrschaft des Besten gilt, fehlt es am Besten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:NX1","text":"Tapferkeit ist nicht identisch mit blindem Drauflosschlagen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:NX2","text":"Der beliebige Gegner ist kein angemessener Adressat der eigenen Kraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:NX3","text":"Verachtung ist keine zulässige Form des Feindverhältnisses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:NX4","text":"Die Teilnahme am Für und Wider der Völker ist keine neutrale Erkenntnishaltung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:NX5","text":"Volk und Völker bilden keine erhabene politische Instanz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:NX6","text":"Die gegenwärtige Nachbarschaft der Völker ist keine echte Solidarität, sondern gegenseitige Vorteilssicherung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:NX7","text":"Die Krämerherrschaft ist keine königliche Ordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:NX8","text":"Gleichrangige politische Vielheit wird nicht als ausreichender Endzustand anerkannt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:D1","text":"Die höchste Form der Tapferkeit besteht in selektiver Zurückhaltung, weil unmittelbares Zuschlagen die Kraft an minderwertige Gegner bindet.","refs":["CH_97E9_21CH:A1","CH_97E9_21CH:A2","CH_97E9_21CH:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:D2","text":"Feindschaft wird als Rangordnung organisiert: Der Feind ist notwendig, sofern er der eigenen Kraft würdig ist.","refs":["CH_97E9_21CH:A3","CH_97E9_21CH:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:D3","text":"Die Beschäftigung mit kollektiven politischen Gegensätzen verwandelt Wahrnehmung in Zorn und Reaktion.","refs":["CH_97E9_21CH:A6","CH_97E9_21CH:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:D4","text":"Rückzug ist keine Aufgabe des Konflikts, sondern dessen zeitliche und qualitative Selektion.","refs":["CH_97E9_21CH:A5","CH_97E9_21CH:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:D5","text":"Die moderne Volksordnung wird als ökonomisierte Konkurrenz um minimale Vorteile klassifiziert.","refs":["CH_97E9_21CH:A9","CH_97E9_21CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:D6","text":"Die Abwesenheit königlicher Herrschaft wird als Symptom des Mangels an überragender Qualität gelesen.","refs":["CH_97E9_21CH:A10","CH_97E9_21CH:A11","CH_97E9_21CH:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:SD1","text":"Das System ersetzt die universelle Mobilisierung durch eine aristokratische Ökonomie der Kraft: Nicht jede Auseinandersetzung verdient Teilnahme.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:SD2","text":"Der Feind fungiert nicht primär als zu vernichtendes Gegenüber, sondern als Prüfstein und Mitkonstituent einer Rangordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:SD3","text":"Der politische Rückzug wird als aktive Erhaltung einer höheren Möglichkeit organisiert, nicht als bloße Flucht vor der Gegenwart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:SD4","text":"Die Kritik an Volk und Völkern mündet in eine Totalisierung des Qualitätsbegriffs: Politische Ordnung wird vollständig nach der Präsenz oder Abwesenheit des Besten beurteilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:SD5","text":"Das Argument verschiebt den Gegensatz von Krieg und Frieden auf den Gegensatz zwischen würdigem Konflikt und entwürdigender Verstrickung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:DNX1","text":"Das System hängt von der Unwahrheit ab, dass jede Form von Aktivität, Intervention oder Kampf bereits wertvoll sei.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:DNX2","text":"Es schließt aus, dass politische Gleichheit oder kollektive Selbstbestimmung eigenständige Legitimationsgründe besitzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:DNX3","text":"Es disqualifiziert eine Ethik, in der Verachtung, Niederlage oder Überlegenheit ohne Rangmaßstab bestimmt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:DNX4","text":"Es setzt voraus, dass die Gegenwart keine ausreichende politische Form des Höheren hervorbringt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:DNX5","text":"Es verwirft die Annahme, dass gegenseitige Vorteilssicherung als gute Nachbarschaft oder politische Tugend gelten könne.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:SNX1","text":"Die Kraft des Arguments beruht auf der Abwesenheit eines gegenwärtig verfügbaren würdigen politischen Gegners.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:SNX2","text":"Um den Begriff des Besten zu erhalten, wird eine gemeinsame politische Welt gleichrangiger Interessen als unzureichend behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:SNX3","text":"Die verlorene Möglichkeit einer königlichen oder vorbildhaften Ordnung strukturiert die Diagnose stärker als jede konkrete politische Alternative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:SNX4","text":"Hoffnung wird nicht als noch offene Zukunft, sondern als versperrte Bedingung höherer politischer Ordnung behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:FGS1","text":"Kraft besitzt Wert nur durch Zielwahl und Maß → unmittelbare Aggression wird von Tapferkeit unterschieden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:FGS2","text":"Zielwahl erfordert Rangordnung → der würdige Feind wird vom verachtenswerten Gegner getrennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:FGS3","text":"Rangordnung erfordert Aufschub → Rückzug und Selbstbeherrschung bewahren Kraft für den höheren Konflikt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:FGS4","text":"Kollektive politische Verstrickung erzeugt Reaktivität → Volk und Völker werden als abzulehnende Konfliktumgebung markiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:FGS5","text":"Die Analyse der Gegenwart als Krämerordnung → Verlust königlicher Qualität → normative Setzung der Herrschaft des Besten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:AF1","text":"Ungezielte Tapferkeit → Unterscheidung von Zuschlagen und Zurückhaltung → Auswahl des würdigen Feindes → Abwendung von Volk und Völkern → Diagnose krämerhafter Gegenwartsordnung → Forderung nach der Herrschaft des Besten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:ME1","text":"Tapferkeit wird von einer Handlungseigenschaft in ein Selektionsvermögen umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:ME2","text":"Der Feind wird von einem bloßen Hindernis zu einer rangbildenden Gegeninstanz umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:ME3","text":"Rückzug wird von Passivität zu strategischer Ressourcensicherung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:ME4","text":"Volk, Völker und Nachbarschaft werden von politischen Kollektiven zu Formen ökonomisierter Reaktivität umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:ME5","text":"Die politische Frage wird von der Verteilung kleiner Vorteile auf die Herrschaft qualitativer Überlegenheit verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Text fordert Tapferkeit, Feindwahl, Zurückhaltung und Distanz gegenüber Volk und Völkern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:ALT2","text":"Structural — Er organisiert Handeln als Hierarchie der Gegner und deutet moderne Kollektivität als Konkurrenz um minimale Vorteile.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Er ersetzt unmittelbare Einmischung durch Aufbewahrung der Kraft für eine höher bewertete Auseinandersetzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Er setzt eine qualitative Ordnung des Seins voraus, in der das Beste herrschen soll, und liest die Gegenwart als Epoche nach dem Verlust des Königtums.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von selektiver Tapferkeit zur Herrschaft des Besten zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, woran das Beste positiv erkannt wird und wer seine Herrschaft ausüben soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern qualitative Rangordnung als oberstes normatives Kriterium akzeptiert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung liegt zwischen Selbstbeherrschung, Feindwahl und strategischem Rückzug.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:MRT5","text":"Die schwächste Stelle ist die Übergangslogik von der Diagnose krämerhafter Völker zur Forderung königlicher Herrschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:MRT6","text":"Ein ungelöster Widerspruch besteht zwischen der Forderung nach einem hassenswerten, aber nicht verachtenswerten Feind und der abwertenden Behandlung des „Gesindels“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, komprimiert jedoch die rhetorische Intensität der Gegenwartsverwerfung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T190039257248Z_3c872d5d","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"21.","source_sha256":"725c5f03e27cb175e2fba1a16939ccc5d93cc7bfdd23731c1164f0335e44a35c","sha256":"1e9a5783c9fff6fa397482e0bd6999ef203c7e9251c922f49fbbb9ff5b3a4ea2","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:00:39.258515+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:AS1","text":"The central problem is the indiscriminate expenditure of courage against inferior opponents and collective noise-making.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:AS2","text":"Courage is redefined from mere lust for attack in terms of choice of target, self-mastery, and postponement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:AS3","text":"The worthy enemy is introduced as the necessary counter-instance to one's own preeminence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:AS4","text":"Engagement with the people, peoples, and their pro-and-con orders is diagnosed as an entanglement that generates anger.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:AS5","text":"Retreat, disregard, and leaving the sword at rest function as strategic preservation for the better conflict.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:AS6","text":"The present order of the people is determined as a petty-tradesman-like rule of small advantages and as the loss of royal hierarchy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:AS7","text":"From the rule of the best follows the concluding political and normative closure of the argument.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:A1","text":"Courage does not consist in mere capacity for attack, but in determining when and against whom it is deployed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:A2","text":"Self-mastery and passing by can be more courageous than striking immediately.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:A3","text":"The appropriate enemy must be worthy of hatred, but not worthy of contempt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:A4","text":"A worthy enemy establishes a relation of rank in which the opponent deserves pride despite enmity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:A5","text":"One's own strength must be reserved for the more worthy enemy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:A6","text":"Engagement with the pros and cons of the people and peoples produces anger rather than clarity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:A7","text":"With certain opponents, looking upon and striking coincide in the same reactive movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:A8","text":"Retreating into the forests and letting the sword rest serve to interrupt this reactive movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:A9","text":"The present-day peoples behave like shopkeepers by calculating the slightest advantages against one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:A10","text":"The present age is no longer the age of kings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:A11","text":"An order is legitimate when the best rules within it and wills to rule.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:A12","text":"Where a doctrine other than the rule of the best prevails, the best is lacking.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:NX1","text":"Courage is not identical with blindly striking out.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:NX2","text":"The arbitrary opponent is not an appropriate addressee of one's own strength.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:NX3","text":"Contempt is not a permissible form of the relation to the enemy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:NX4","text":"Participation in the pros and cons of the peoples is not a neutral epistemic stance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:NX5","text":"The people and peoples do not constitute a sublime political instance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:NX6","text":"The present-day neighborliness of the peoples is not genuine solidarity, but mutual securing of advantages.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:NX7","text":"Shopkeeper rule is not a royal order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:NX8","text":"Political plurality of equal rank is not recognized as an adequate final state.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:D1","text":"The highest form of courage consists in selective restraint, because immediate striking binds strength to inferior opponents.","refs":["CH_97E9_21CH:A1","CH_97E9_21CH:A2","CH_97E9_21CH:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:D2","text":"Enmity is organized as an order of rank: the enemy is necessary insofar as he is worthy of one's own strength.","refs":["CH_97E9_21CH:A3","CH_97E9_21CH:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:D3","text":"Preoccupation with collective political oppositions transforms perception into anger and reaction.","refs":["CH_97E9_21CH:A6","CH_97E9_21CH:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:D4","text":"Retreat is not abandonment of conflict, but its temporal and qualitative selection.","refs":["CH_97E9_21CH:A5","CH_97E9_21CH:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:D5","text":"The modern order of peoples is classified as economized competition for minimal advantages.","refs":["CH_97E9_21CH:A9","CH_97E9_21CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:D6","text":"The absence of royal rule is read as a symptom of the lack of outstanding quality.","refs":["CH_97E9_21CH:A10","CH_97E9_21CH:A11","CH_97E9_21CH:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:SD1","text":"The system replaces universal mobilization with an aristocratic economy of strength: not every conflict merits participation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:SD2","text":"The enemy functions not primarily as an opposite to be annihilated, but as a touchstone and co-constituent of an order of rank.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:SD3","text":"Political retreat is organized as the active preservation of a higher possibility, not as mere flight from the present.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:SD4","text":"The critique of the people and peoples culminates in a totalization of the concept of quality: political order is judged entirely according to the presence or absence of the best.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:SD5","text":"The argument shifts the opposition between war and peace to the opposition between worthy conflict and degrading entanglement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:DNX1","text":"The system depends on the untruth that every form of activity, intervention, or struggle is already valuable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:DNX2","text":"It excludes the possibility that political equality or collective self-determination possess independent grounds of legitimacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:DNX3","text":"It disqualifies an ethics in which contempt, defeat, or superiority are determined without a measure of rank.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:DNX4","text":"It presupposes that the present does not produce an adequate political form of the higher.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:DNX5","text":"It rejects the assumption that mutual securing of advantages could count as good neighborliness or political virtue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:SNX1","text":"The force of the argument rests on the absence of a presently available worthy political opponent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:SNX2","text":"In order to preserve the concept of the best, a shared political world of interests of equal rank is treated as inadequate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:SNX3","text":"The lost possibility of a royal or exemplary order structures the diagnosis more strongly than any concrete political alternative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:SNX4","text":"Hope is treated not as a future still open, but as a blocked condition of higher political order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:FGS1","text":"Strength possesses value only through choice of target and measure → immediate aggression is distinguished from courage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:FGS2","text":"Choice of target requires hierarchy → the worthy enemy is separated from the contemptible opponent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:FGS3","text":"Hierarchy requires postponement → retreat and self-mastery preserve strength for the higher conflict.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:FGS4","text":"Collective political entanglement generates reactivity → the people and peoples are marked as a conflict environment to be rejected.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:FGS5","text":"The analysis of the present as a petty-tradesman order → loss of royal quality → normative positing of the rule of the best.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:AF1","text":"Undirected courage → distinction between striking and restraint → selection of the worthy enemy → turning away from the people and peoples → diagnosis of a shopkeeper-like present order → demand for the rule of the best.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:ME1","text":"Courage is remapped from a property of action into a capacity for selection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:ME2","text":"The enemy is reclassified from a mere obstacle into a counter-instance that forms rank.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:ME3","text":"Retreat is remapped from passivity into strategic preservation of resources.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:ME4","text":"The people, peoples, and neighborliness are reclassified from political collectives into forms of economized reactivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:ME5","text":"The political question is shifted from the distribution of small advantages to the rule of qualitative superiority.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:ALT1","text":"Surface — The text calls for courage, selection of the enemy, restraint, and distance from the people and peoples.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:ALT2","text":"Structural — It organizes action as a hierarchy of opponents and interprets modern collectivity as competition for minimal advantages.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — It replaces immediate intervention with preservation of strength for a more highly valued conflict.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — It presupposes a qualitative order of being in which the best is to rule, and reads the present as an epoch after the loss of kingship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from selective courage to the rule of the best.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is by what positive mark the best is recognized and who is to exercise its rule.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as qualitative order of rank is accepted as the highest normative criterion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:MRT4","text":"The strongest connection lies between self-mastery, selection of the enemy, and strategic retreat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:MRT5","text":"The weakest point is the transitional logic from the diagnosis of shopkeeper-like peoples to the demand for royal rule.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:MRT6","text":"An unresolved contradiction exists between the demand for an enemy worthy of hatred but not of contempt and the derogatory treatment of the „Gesindels“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_21CH:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_21CH:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument, but compresses the rhetorical intensity of the rejection of the present.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_21CH@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_21CH:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On Old and New Tablets","source_section_label":"21.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 21","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","21."],"original_title":"21."}],"source_title_context":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln","source_section_label":"21.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 21","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","21."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 102","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 21","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln · 21"},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH","layer":"CH","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 22","order":103,"parents":["RAW_97E9_22CH"],"revision":"CH_97E9_22CH@R001","sha256":"78fb269c3c793d901c33889006a1b3a3a74af138c6735c556e453aad686b3fe9","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:AS1","text":"Der Text behandelt den menschlichen Unterhalt als eine Form von Beschäftigung, deren Entfall eine existentielle Leerstelle erzeugen würde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:AS2","text":"Er bestimmt Arbeit und Verdienst als verdeckte Formen von Raub und Überlistung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:AS3","text":"Aus dieser Bestimmung folgt, dass menschliche Verbesserung innerhalb der Raublogik und nicht außerhalb von ihr stattfindet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:AS4","text":"Die Überlegenheit des Menschen wird genealogisch aus der Aneignung tierischer Tugenden und aus der durch Schwierigkeit erzeugten Verfeinerung erklärt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:AS5","text":"Die Hierarchie bleibt offen, weil die Vögel über dem Menschen stehen und die Möglichkeit des Fliegens seine Raublust noch steigern würde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:A1","text":"Menschlicher Unterhalt ist zugleich menschliche Unterhaltung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:A2","text":"Der Entfall des Broterwerbs würde den Menschen eine tragende Form seiner Beschäftigung entziehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:A3","text":"Menschliches Arbeiten enthält ein Moment des Raubens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:A4","text":"Menschliches Verdienen enthält ein Moment des Überlistens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:A5","text":"Der Mensch ist ein Raubtier.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:A6","text":"Die Schwierigkeit des menschlichen Daseins erzeugt eine höhere Form des Raubtiers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:A7","text":"Menschliche Verbesserung besteht in größerer Feinheit, Klugheit und Menschenähnlichkeit des Raubens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:A8","text":"Der Mensch ist gegenwärtig das beste Raubtier.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:A9","text":"Der Mensch hat sich die Tugenden anderer Tiere angeeignet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:A10","text":"Die Schwierigkeit des Menschen erklärt seine Aneignungsleistung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:A11","text":"Die Vögel stehen noch über dem Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:A12","text":"Die Fähigkeit des Menschen zu fliegen würde seine Raublust räumlich und quantitativ erweitern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:NX1","text":"Menschlicher Unterhalt ist kein neutraler oder bloß versorgender Vorgang.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:NX2","text":"Arbeit ist keine von Raub getrennte Tätigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:NX3","text":"Verdienst ist keine von Überlistung gereinigte Erwerbsform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:NX4","text":"Menschlichkeit bezeichnet keinen Austritt aus der Tierheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:NX5","text":"Verbesserung bedeutet keine Überwindung der Raublogik.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:NX6","text":"Die menschliche Vorrangstellung ist keine endgültige Stellung in der Tierhierarchie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:NX7","text":"Fliegen wäre keine bloße technische Erweiterung ohne Veränderung der Triebstruktur.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:D1","text":"Die Abschaffung materieller Not würde zugleich die als Unterhaltung fungierende Erwerbsstruktur entleeren.","refs":["CH_97E9_22CH:A1","CH_97E9_22CH:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:D2","text":"Die moralisch oder sozial verdeckten Formen des Erwerbs werden als Fortsetzungen tierischer Raubbewegungen lesbar.","refs":["CH_97E9_22CH:A3","CH_97E9_22CH:A4","CH_97E9_22CH:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:D3","text":"Schwierigkeit wirkt nicht nur als Last, sondern als Selektions- und Verfeinerungsbedingung menschlicher Überlegenheit.","refs":["CH_97E9_22CH:A6","CH_97E9_22CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:D4","text":"Die Aneignung tierischer Tugenden macht menschliche Überlegenheit zu einer zusammengesetzten, nicht ursprünglich eigenen Leistung.","refs":["CH_97E9_22CH:A8","CH_97E9_22CH:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:D5","text":"Die Steigerung menschlicher Fähigkeiten steigert notwendig auch die Reichweite des Raubtriebs.","refs":["CH_97E9_22CH:A7","CH_97E9_22CH:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:D6","text":"Die Rangordnung des Menschen bleibt durch ein noch nicht eingeholtes tierisches Vermögen instabil.","refs":["CH_97E9_22CH:A8","CH_97E9_22CH:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:SD1","text":"Der Text totalisiert Erwerb, Arbeit, Zivilisierung und Selbstverbesserung als unterschiedliche Erscheinungen einer gemeinsamen Raubökonomie.","refs":["CH_97E9_22CH:A1","CH_97E9_22CH:A3","CH_97E9_22CH:A4","CH_97E9_22CH:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:SD2","text":"Menschliche Höherentwicklung wird nicht als Entlastung vom Trieb, sondern als dessen intelligentere, feinere und umfassendere Organisation erzeugt.","refs":["CH_97E9_22CH:A6","CH_97E9_22CH:A7","CH_97E9_22CH:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:SD3","text":"Die menschliche Identität entsteht als nachträgliche Synthese fremder tierischer Fähigkeiten und bleibt dadurch von ihrem tierischen Außen abhängig.","refs":["CH_97E9_22CH:A8","CH_97E9_22CH:A9","CH_97E9_22CH:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:SD4","text":"Jede Erweiterung menschlicher Handlungsmacht vergrößert zugleich das Potential seiner Aneignungs- und Raubbewegung.","refs":["CH_97E9_22CH:A7","CH_97E9_22CH:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:DNX1","text":"Das System hängt von der Unwahrheit ab, dass menschlicher Erwerb durch Arbeit, Recht oder Verdienst aus der Logik des Raubes herausgelöst werden könne.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:DNX2","text":"Es schließt ein selbstgenügsames, nicht angeeignetes menschliches Wesen aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:DNX3","text":"Es disqualifiziert die Annahme, dass Zivilisierung primär Triebhemmung oder Entsagung bedeute.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:DNX4","text":"Es setzt voraus, dass Überlegenheit nicht durch Unschuld, sondern durch effektivere Aneignung entsteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:DNX5","text":"Es schließt eine technische Entwicklung aus, deren Machtzuwachs von ihrer Triebstruktur getrennt bliebe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine menschliche Welt, in der Versorgung ohne Beschäftigungszwang, Kampf und Aneignungsform existiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:SNX2","text":"Abwesend bleibt ein Begriff des Menschen jenseits der Kontinuität von Tierheit, Raub und Überlistung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:SNX3","text":"Versperrt ist die Möglichkeit, menschliche Verbesserung als Befreiung von der Raublust zu denken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:SNX4","text":"Unverfügbar bleibt eine endgültige Hierarchie, in der der Mensch seine Stellung ohne weiteres tierisches Außen sichern könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:FGS1","text":"Materielle Versorgung → Verlust der Erwerbsbeschäftigung → drohende Leere des menschlichen Daseins.","refs":["CH_97E9_22CH:A1","CH_97E9_22CH:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:FGS2","text":"Erwerbstätigkeit → verdeckter Raub und verdeckte Überlistung → anthropologisch notwendige Raubtierbestimmung.","refs":["CH_97E9_22CH:A3","CH_97E9_22CH:A4","CH_97E9_22CH:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:FGS3","text":"Schwierigkeit → Aneignung fremder Tugenden → Verfeinerung und Hierarchisierung des Raubtiers Mensch.","refs":["CH_97E9_22CH:A6","CH_97E9_22CH:A7","CH_97E9_22CH:A9","CH_97E9_22CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:FGS4","text":"Menschliche Vorrangstellung → Vergleich mit den Vögeln → hypothetische Flugfähigkeit → Steigerung der Raublust → offene, nicht abgeschlossene Hierarchie.","refs":["CH_97E9_22CH:A8","CH_97E9_22CH:A11","CH_97E9_22CH:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:AF1","text":"Drohender Entfall des Unterhalts → Entlarvung von Arbeit und Verdienst als Raub → Schwierigkeit als Verfeinerungsbedingung → Mensch als bestes Raubtier → Vogel als überlegene Restinstanz → Flug als hypothetische Expansion der Raublust.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:ME1","text":"Arbeit, Verdienst und Raub werden auf einer gemeinsamen begrifflichen Achse kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:ME2","text":"Schwierigkeit wird von einem bloßen Mangel in ein produktives Kriterium der menschlichen Überlegenheit umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:ME3","text":"Menschlichkeit wird nicht als Gegenbegriff zum Tier, sondern als höchste Verfeinerung tierischer Raubfähigkeit sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:ME4","text":"Technische oder körperliche Erweiterung wird als Verstärkung eines bereits vorhandenen Triebs und nicht als neutrale Kompetenz kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:ME5","text":"Die Hierarchie zwischen Mensch und Tier wird in eine bewegliche Rangordnung mit offenem Überschuss überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — Unterhalt, Arbeit, Verdienst, Rauben, Überlisten und Fliegen bilden die explizite Handlungskette.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — Erwerbsformen fungieren als institutionalisierte und sprachlich maskierte Raubmechanismen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — Der Text verschiebt die Bewertung menschlicher Verbesserung von moralischer Entlastung zu strategischer Effizienz des Aneignens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — Der Mensch ist ein werdendes, aus tierischen Vermögen zusammengesetztes Raubtier; seine Vorrangstellung bleibt zeitlich offen und durch zukünftige Fähigkeiten veränderbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von Unterhalt über Erwerb und Raub bis zur offenen Tierhierarchie zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:MRT2","text":"Die zentrale generative Operation ist die Gleichsetzung von Erwerb, Aneignung und Raub.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob die Raubbestimmung des Menschen deskriptiv, ironisch oder normativ gemeint ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:MRT4","text":"Intern spannungsvoll bleibt die Verbindung von Verachtung des Raubs mit der Steigerung, Verfeinerung und möglichen Ausweitung desselben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:MRT5","text":"Die Gleichsetzung von „besser“, „feiner“, „klüger“ und „menschenähnlicher“ mit effizienterem Rauben ist nicht weiter begründet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die offene Schlussbewegung, in der menschliche Überlegenheit zugleich behauptet und durch die Vögel wieder relativiert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T190122891028Z_413a21bb","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"22.","source_sha256":"78fb269c3c793d901c33889006a1b3a3a74af138c6735c556e453aad686b3fe9","sha256":"8f949015dd2d2abfebbdb7e4c181d531e1db74834388a240f7ce913e6c5d1a18","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:01:22.892792+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:AS1","text":"The text treats human livelihood as a form of occupation whose absence would create an existential void.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:AS2","text":"It determines work and earning as concealed forms of robbery and outwitting.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:AS3","text":"It follows from this determination that human improvement takes place within the logic of robbery and not outside it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:AS4","text":"Human superiority is explained genealogically through the appropriation of animal virtues and through the refinement produced by difficulty.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:AS5","text":"The hierarchy remains open because birds stand above human beings and the possibility of flying would further increase their desire for robbery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:A1","text":"Human livelihood is at the same time human entertainment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:A2","text":"The loss of earning one's bread would deprive human beings of a sustaining form of their occupation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:A3","text":"Human labor contains an element of robbery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:A4","text":"Human earning contains an element of outwitting.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:A5","text":"The human being is a predator.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:A6","text":"The difficulty of human existence produces a higher form of predator.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:A7","text":"Human improvement consists in greater refinement, cleverness, and human-likeness of robbery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:A8","text":"The human being is presently the best predator.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:A9","text":"The human being has appropriated the virtues of other animals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:A10","text":"The human being's difficulty explains its achievement of appropriation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:A11","text":"Birds still stand above human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:A12","text":"The human ability to fly would extend its desire for robbery spatially and quantitatively.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:NX1","text":"Human livelihood is not a neutral or merely provisioning process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:NX2","text":"Work is not an activity separate from robbery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:NX3","text":"Earning is not a form of acquisition purified of outwitting.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:NX4","text":"Humanity does not designate an exit from animality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:NX5","text":"Improvement does not mean an overcoming of the logic of robbery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:NX6","text":"Human primacy is not a final position in the animal hierarchy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:NX7","text":"Flying would not be a merely technical extension without a change in the structure of drives.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:D1","text":"The abolition of material need would at the same time empty the structure of earning that functions as entertainment.","refs":["CH_97E9_22CH:A1","CH_97E9_22CH:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:D2","text":"The morally or socially concealed forms of acquisition become legible as continuations of animal movements of robbery.","refs":["CH_97E9_22CH:A3","CH_97E9_22CH:A4","CH_97E9_22CH:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:D3","text":"Difficulty operates not only as a burden, but as a condition of selection and refinement of human superiority.","refs":["CH_97E9_22CH:A6","CH_97E9_22CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:D4","text":"The appropriation of animal virtues makes human superiority a composite achievement, not one originally its own.","refs":["CH_97E9_22CH:A8","CH_97E9_22CH:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:D5","text":"The enhancement of human capacities necessarily also enhances the scope of the predatory drive.","refs":["CH_97E9_22CH:A7","CH_97E9_22CH:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:D6","text":"The human being's rank remains unstable through an as-yet unattained animal capacity.","refs":["CH_97E9_22CH:A8","CH_97E9_22CH:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:SD1","text":"The text totalizes acquisition, labor, civilization, and self-improvement as different manifestations of a common economy of robbery.","refs":["CH_97E9_22CH:A1","CH_97E9_22CH:A3","CH_97E9_22CH:A4","CH_97E9_22CH:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:SD2","text":"Higher human development is produced not as relief from drive, but as its more intelligent, finer, and more comprehensive organization.","refs":["CH_97E9_22CH:A6","CH_97E9_22CH:A7","CH_97E9_22CH:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:SD3","text":"Human identity emerges as a retrospective synthesis of alien animal capacities and thereby remains dependent on its animal outside.","refs":["CH_97E9_22CH:A8","CH_97E9_22CH:A9","CH_97E9_22CH:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:SD4","text":"Every expansion of human power to act simultaneously enlarges the potential of its movement of appropriation and robbery.","refs":["CH_97E9_22CH:A7","CH_97E9_22CH:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:DNX1","text":"The system depends on the falsity that human acquisition through labor, right, or earning could be detached from the logic of robbery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:DNX2","text":"It excludes a self-sufficient, unappropriated human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:DNX3","text":"It disqualifies the assumption that civilization primarily means the inhibition of drives or renunciation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:DNX4","text":"It presupposes that superiority arises not through innocence, but through more effective appropriation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:DNX5","text":"It excludes a technical development whose increase in power would remain separate from its structure of drives.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a human world in which provision exists without the compulsion to be occupied, struggle, and a form of appropriation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:SNX2","text":"Absent remains a conception of the human being beyond the continuity of animality, robbery, and outwitting.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:SNX3","text":"Blocked is the possibility of thinking human improvement as liberation from the desire for robbery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:SNX4","text":"Unavailable remains a final hierarchy in which the human being could secure its position without any further animal outside.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:FGS1","text":"Material provision → loss of acquisitive occupation → threatening emptiness of human existence.","refs":["CH_97E9_22CH:A1","CH_97E9_22CH:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:FGS2","text":"Gainful activity → concealed robbery and concealed outwitting → anthropologically necessary determination as predator.","refs":["CH_97E9_22CH:A3","CH_97E9_22CH:A4","CH_97E9_22CH:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:FGS3","text":"Difficulty → appropriation of alien virtues → refinement and hierarchization of the predator human being.","refs":["CH_97E9_22CH:A6","CH_97E9_22CH:A7","CH_97E9_22CH:A9","CH_97E9_22CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:FGS4","text":"Human primacy → comparison with birds → hypothetical capacity for flight → increase in the desire for robbery → open, uncompleted hierarchy.","refs":["CH_97E9_22CH:A8","CH_97E9_22CH:A11","CH_97E9_22CH:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:AF1","text":"Threatening loss of livelihood → unmasking of work and earning as robbery → difficulty as a condition of refinement → human being as best predator → bird as superior residual instance → flight as hypothetical expansion of the desire for robbery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:ME1","text":"Work, earning, and robbery are mapped onto a common conceptual axis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:ME2","text":"Difficulty is reclassified from a mere deficiency into a productive criterion of human superiority.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:ME3","text":"Humanity becomes visible not as the counter-concept to the animal, but as the highest refinement of animal predatory capacity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:ME4","text":"Technical or bodily extension is mapped as an intensification of an already existing drive and not as a neutral competence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:ME5","text":"The hierarchy between human being and animal is transferred into a mobile ranking with an open surplus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — Livelihood, work, earning, robbing, outwitting, and flying form the explicit chain of action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — Forms of acquisition function as institutionalized and linguistically masked mechanisms of robbery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — The text shifts the evaluation of human improvement from moral relief to the strategic efficiency of appropriation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — The human being is a becoming predator composed of animal capacities; its primacy remains temporally open and alterable through future capacities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from livelihood through acquisition and robbery to the open animal hierarchy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:MRT2","text":"The central generative operation is the equation of acquisition, appropriation, and robbery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:MRT3","text":"It remains underdetermined whether the determination of the human being as robber is intended descriptively, ironically, or normatively.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:MRT4","text":"The connection between contempt for robbery and its enhancement, refinement, and possible expansion remains internally tension-filled.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:MRT5","text":"The equation of „besser“, „feiner“, „klüger“ and „menschenähnlicher“ with more efficient robbery is not further justified.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_22CH:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the open concluding movement in which human superiority is simultaneously asserted and relativized again by birds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_22CH:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_22CH@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_22CH:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On Old and New Tablets","source_section_label":"22.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 22","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","22."],"original_title":"22."}],"source_title_context":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln","source_section_label":"22.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 22","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","22."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 103","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 22","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln · 22"},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH","layer":"CH","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 23","order":104,"parents":["RAW_97E9_23CH"],"revision":"CH_97E9_23CH@R001","sha256":"ac225a8753fefc2f0e514077f63268aca4de21788764196c3dc590d2321db62b","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:AS1","text":"Der Text entwirft eine geschlechtlich differenzierte Ordnung körperlicher und sozialer Tüchtigkeiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:AS2","text":"Die Differenz der Funktionen wird durch eine gemeinsame Fähigkeit beider Geschlechter zur Bewegung überschritten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:AS3","text":"Tanz fungiert als verbindende Bedingung von Kopf, Beinen und Lebensform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:AS4","text":"Ein Leben ohne mindestens einmaligen Tanz wird als verlorene Zeit bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:AS5","text":"Eine Wahrheit ohne Lachen wird als falsche Wahrheit ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:AS6","text":"Die Argumentbewegung reicht von geschlechtlicher Funktionszuweisung über gemeinsame Verkörperung zu einer positiven Lebens- und Wahrheitsnorm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:A1","text":"Mann und Weib werden als geschlechtlich unterschiedene Träger verschiedener Tüchtigkeiten bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:A2","text":"Der Eine soll kriegstüchtig sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:A3","text":"Das Andre soll gebärtüchtig sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:A4","text":"Beide sollen tanztüchtig sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:A5","text":"Tanztüchtigkeit umfasst Kopf und Beine.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:A6","text":"Ein Tag ohne mindestens einmaligen Tanz gilt als verloren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:A7","text":"Eine Wahrheit ohne Gelächter gilt als falsch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:A8","text":"Lebensgültigkeit und Wahrheitsgültigkeit werden an verkörperte Beweglichkeit und Gelächter gebunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:NX1","text":"Das System verwirft die Gleichsetzung von Mann und Weib mit identischen Tüchtigkeiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:NX2","text":"Es verwirft eine ausschließliche Reduktion des Einen auf Kriegstüchtigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:NX3","text":"Es verwirft eine ausschließliche Reduktion des Andren auf Geburtstüchtigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:NX4","text":"Es verwirft eine Trennung von geistiger und körperlicher Beweglichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:NX5","text":"Es verwirft einen Tag als gültige Lebenszeit, wenn kein Tanz stattfindet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:NX6","text":"Es verwirft Wahrheit, die ohne Gelächter auftritt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:D1","text":"Geschlechtliche Differenz schließt eine gemeinsame grundlegende Lebensfähigkeit nicht aus.","refs":["CH_97E9_23CH:A1","CH_97E9_23CH:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:D2","text":"Die geforderte Lebensform verbindet funktionale Bestimmung mit gemeinsamer Beweglichkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_23CH:A2","CH_97E9_23CH:A3","CH_97E9_23CH:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:D3","text":"Tanz bildet eine Einheit von körperlicher Fortbewegung und geistiger Beweglichkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_23CH:A4","CH_97E9_23CH:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:D4","text":"Das Fehlen des Tanzes wird nicht als neutrales Ereignis, sondern als Verlust von Lebenszeit bewertet.","refs":["CH_97E9_23CH:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:D5","text":"Lachen fungiert als Gültigkeitskriterium von Wahrheit.","refs":["CH_97E9_23CH:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:D6","text":"Wahrheit wird nicht allein durch ihren propositionalen Gehalt, sondern durch ihre affektive Verkörperung bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_23CH:A7","CH_97E9_23CH:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:SD1","text":"Das System ersetzt eine rein funktionale Geschlechterordnung durch eine Ordnung, in der Differenz und gemeinsame Verkörperung zugleich gelten.","refs":["CH_97E9_23CH:A1","CH_97E9_23CH:A2","CH_97E9_23CH:A3","CH_97E9_23CH:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:SD2","text":"Tanz wird zur Totalitätsfigur, die körperliche, geistige und zeitliche Gültigkeit miteinander vermittelt.","refs":["CH_97E9_23CH:A5","CH_97E9_23CH:A6","CH_97E9_23CH:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:SD3","text":"Das System bindet Wahrheit an eine lebensbejahende Affektstruktur und schließt affektlose Wahrheit aus.","refs":["CH_97E9_23CH:A7","CH_97E9_23CH:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:SD4","text":"Die Geltung des Lebens wird durch performative Kriterien erzeugt: Beweglichkeit, Tanz und Gelächter.","refs":["CH_97E9_23CH:A4","CH_97E9_23CH:A6","CH_97E9_23CH:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:DNX1","text":"Das System hängt von der Unwahrheit eines Modells ab, in dem geschlechtliche Differenz vollständige Trennung bedeutet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:DNX2","text":"Es setzt voraus, dass Funktion ohne gemeinsame Beweglichkeit keine hinreichende Lebensform erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:DNX3","text":"Es schließt ein abstraktes Verständnis von Geist aus, das den Kopf von den Beinen trennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:DNX4","text":"Es disqualifiziert eine Wahrheitsordnung, deren Ernsthaftigkeit nicht durch Lachen gebrochen oder geprüft wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:DNX5","text":"Es behandelt Untätigkeit nicht als bloße Abwesenheit von Handlung, sondern als Verlust von Zeit und Leben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Welt, in der Leben ohne verkörperte Überschreitung, Tanz und Lachen gültig sein könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Möglichkeit einer von körperlicher Disposition unabhängigen Wahrheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine geschlechtliche Ordnung, deren Differenzen keine gemeinsame Form der Beweglichkeit zulassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:SNX4","text":"Die verborgene Abwesenheit des Systems ist eine statische, humorlose und rein funktionale Lebensform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:FGS1","text":"Geschlechtliche Differenzierung → Zuordnung spezifischer Tüchtigkeiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:FGS2","text":"Gemeinsame Tanztüchtigkeit → Vermittlung von Kopf und Beinen über die Geschlechterdifferenz hinweg.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:FGS3","text":"Fehlender Tanz → Verlust des Tages; fehlendes Gelächter → Falschheit der Wahrheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:FGS4","text":"Verkörperte Beweglichkeit und affektive Entlastung → Gültigkeit von Lebenszeit und Wahrheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:FGS5","text":"Funktionale Differenz + gemeinsame Beweglichkeit + Gelächterkriterium → normative Lebensform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:AF1","text":"Geschlechtliche Differenz → spezifische Tüchtigkeiten → gemeinsame Tanztüchtigkeit → Einheit von Kopf und Beinen → Tanz als Zeitkriterium → Gelächter als Wahrheitskriterium → lebensbejahende Geltungsordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:ME1","text":"Geschlecht wird zugleich als Differenz der Funktionen und als gemeinsamer Zugang zu verkörperter Beweglichkeit kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:ME2","text":"Tanz wird von einer Aktivität zu einem Kriterium vollständiger menschlicher Verfassung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:ME3","text":"Der Tag wird nicht chronologisch, sondern durch ein Ereignis von Bewegung und Lust bewertet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:ME4","text":"Wahrheit wird aus der Sphäre bloßer Aussage in die Sphäre von Affekt, Körper und Gelächter verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:ME5","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Geist und Körper wird durch die Kopplung von Kopf und Beinen reorganisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:ALT1","text":"Surface — Eine geschlechtlich differenzierte Tüchtigkeitsordnung wird mit der Forderung nach Tanz und Gelächter verbunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:ALT2","text":"Structural — Funktionale Geschlechterdifferenz wird durch eine gemeinsame körperlich-geistige Praxis vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Lebenszeit und Wahrheit werden nicht kontemplativ, sondern durch Bewegung, Überschreitung und Lachen geprüft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Gültiges Sein und gültige Zeit erscheinen als verkörperte, bewegliche und affektiv bejahte Vollzüge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von geschlechtlicher Differenz zu gemeinsamer Tanztüchtigkeit zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:MRT2","text":"Die Verbindung zwischen Kriegstüchtigkeit, Geburtstüchtigkeit und Tanztüchtigkeit bleibt funktional behauptet, nicht weiter begründet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Differenz und gemeinsame Fähigkeit nicht als Gegensätze behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Stelle des Systems liegt in der Kopplung von Tanz, Verkörperung, Zeit und Wahrheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:MRT5","text":"Die größte Spannung liegt zwischen geschlechtlicher Essentialisierung und der gemeinsamen, nicht exklusiv geschlechtlichen Tanztüchtigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung des Textes, bleibt jedoch von der normativen Kraft der Imperative und Werturteile abhängig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T190141423501Z_d6bddcd9","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"23.","source_sha256":"ac225a8753fefc2f0e514077f63268aca4de21788764196c3dc590d2321db62b","sha256":"c2551c169006c5a03a5cdac63303a91cca68a7d69b11404a4de0cbc50ce430d9","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:01:41.424705+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:AS1","text":"The text outlines a gender-differentiated order of bodily and social capacities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:AS2","text":"The difference of functions is surpassed by a shared capacity of both sexes for movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:AS3","text":"Dance functions as the connecting condition of head, legs, and way of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:AS4","text":"A life without dancing at least once is determined as lost time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:AS5","text":"A truth without laughter is excluded as a false truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:AS6","text":"The movement of the argument extends from gendered functional assignment through shared embodiment to a positive norm of life and truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:A1","text":"Man and woman are determined as gender-differentiated bearers of different capacities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:A2","text":"The one shall be fit for war.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:A3","text":"The other shall be fit for bearing children.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:A4","text":"Both shall be fit for dancing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:A5","text":"Fitness for dancing encompasses head and legs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:A6","text":"A day without dancing at least once counts as lost.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:A7","text":"A truth without laughter counts as false.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:A8","text":"The validity of life and the validity of truth are bound to embodied mobility and laughter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:NX1","text":"The system rejects the equation of man and woman with identical capacities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:NX2","text":"It rejects an exclusive reduction of the one to fitness for war.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:NX3","text":"It rejects an exclusive reduction of the other to fitness for childbirth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:NX4","text":"It rejects a separation of mental and bodily mobility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:NX5","text":"It rejects a day as valid lifetime if no dancing takes place.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:NX6","text":"It rejects truth that appears without laughter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:D1","text":"Gender difference does not exclude a shared fundamental capacity for life.","refs":["CH_97E9_23CH:A1","CH_97E9_23CH:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:D2","text":"The required way of life combines functional determination with shared mobility.","refs":["CH_97E9_23CH:A2","CH_97E9_23CH:A3","CH_97E9_23CH:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:D3","text":"Dance forms a unity of bodily locomotion and mental mobility.","refs":["CH_97E9_23CH:A4","CH_97E9_23CH:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:D4","text":"The absence of dance is evaluated not as a neutral event, but as a loss of lifetime.","refs":["CH_97E9_23CH:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:D5","text":"Laughter functions as a criterion of validity for truth.","refs":["CH_97E9_23CH:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:D6","text":"Truth is determined not solely by its propositional content, but by its affective embodiment.","refs":["CH_97E9_23CH:A7","CH_97E9_23CH:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:SD1","text":"The system replaces a purely functional gender order with an order in which difference and shared embodiment hold simultaneously.","refs":["CH_97E9_23CH:A1","CH_97E9_23CH:A2","CH_97E9_23CH:A3","CH_97E9_23CH:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:SD2","text":"Dance becomes a figure of totality that mediates bodily, mental, and temporal validity with one another.","refs":["CH_97E9_23CH:A5","CH_97E9_23CH:A6","CH_97E9_23CH:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:SD3","text":"The system binds truth to a life-affirming affective structure and excludes affectless truth.","refs":["CH_97E9_23CH:A7","CH_97E9_23CH:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:SD4","text":"The validity of life is produced through performative criteria: mobility, dance, and laughter.","refs":["CH_97E9_23CH:A4","CH_97E9_23CH:A6","CH_97E9_23CH:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:DNX1","text":"The system depends on the untruth of a model in which gender difference signifies complete separation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:DNX2","text":"It presupposes that function without shared mobility produces no sufficient way of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:DNX3","text":"It excludes an abstract understanding of mind that separates the head from the legs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:DNX4","text":"It disqualifies an order of truth whose seriousness is not broken or tested by laughter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:DNX5","text":"It treats inactivity not as the mere absence of action, but as a loss of time and life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a world in which life could be valid without embodied transcendence, dance, and laughter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:SNX2","text":"Excluded is the possibility of a truth independent of bodily disposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:SNX3","text":"Excluded is a gender order whose differences permit no shared form of mobility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:SNX4","text":"The system's hidden absence is a static, humorless, and purely functional way of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:FGS1","text":"Gender differentiation → assignment of specific capacities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:FGS2","text":"Shared fitness for dancing → mediation of head and legs across gender difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:FGS3","text":"Absent dance → loss of the day; absent laughter → falsity of truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:FGS4","text":"Embodied mobility and affective relief → validity of lifetime and truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:FGS5","text":"Functional difference + shared mobility + criterion of laughter → normative way of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:AF1","text":"Gender difference → specific capacities → shared fitness for dancing → unity of head and legs → dance as criterion of time → laughter as criterion of truth → life-affirming order of validity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:ME1","text":"Gender is mapped simultaneously as a difference of functions and as shared access to embodied mobility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:ME2","text":"Dance is reclassified from an activity into a criterion of complete human constitution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:ME3","text":"The day is evaluated not chronologically, but through an event of movement and pleasure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:ME4","text":"Truth is shifted from the sphere of mere statement into the sphere of affect, body, and laughter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:ME5","text":"The opposition between mind and body is reorganized through the coupling of head and legs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:ALT1","text":"Surface — A gender-differentiated order of capacities is connected with the demand for dance and laughter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:ALT2","text":"Structural — Functional gender difference is mediated through a shared bodily-mental practice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Lifetime and truth are tested not contemplatively, but through movement, transcendence, and laughter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Valid being and valid time appear as embodied, mobile, and affectively affirmed enactments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from gender difference to shared fitness for dancing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:MRT2","text":"The connection between fitness for war, fitness for childbirth, and fitness for dancing remains functionally asserted, not further grounded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as difference and shared capacity are not treated as opposites.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:MRT4","text":"The system's strongest point lies in the coupling of dance, embodiment, time, and truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:MRT5","text":"The greatest tension lies between gender essentialization and the shared fitness for dancing that is not exclusively gendered.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_23CH:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the text's actual movement, but remains dependent on the normative force of the imperatives and value judgments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_23CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_23CH@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_23CH:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On Old and New Tablets","source_section_label":"23.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 23","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","23."],"original_title":"23."}],"source_title_context":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln","source_section_label":"23.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 23","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","23."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 104","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 23","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln · 23"},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH","layer":"CH","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 24","order":105,"parents":["RAW_97E9_24CH"],"revision":"CH_97E9_24CH@R001","sha256":"2fbdf4d756f8b2b7207e073699145b07d0880602c830f549c7a6e172530f3561","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:AS1","text":"Eine zu schnelle Eheschliessung erzeugt die Gefahr des Ehebrechens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:AS2","text":"Die Ehe wird von einer rechtlichen Verbindung in eine Prüfung gemeinsamer Dauerfähigkeit umbestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:AS3","text":"Wahrhaftigkeit verlangt, dass die Beteiligten ihre Liebe als zu bewahrende Aufgabe und ihr Versprechen als möglicherweise fehlerhaft behandeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:AS4","text":"Misslingt die Verbindung, ist ihr Bruch dem Verbiegen oder Verleugnen der Ehe vorzuziehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:AS5","text":"Die Ehe erhält ihre höchste Rechtfertigung nicht in der Fortpflanzung, sondern darin, den Aufstieg zu einer kommenden, höheren Gestalt des Menschen zu ermöglichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:A1","text":"Eine zu schnelle Eheschliessung ist ein fehlerhaftes Schliessen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:A2","text":"Ein fehlerhaftes Schliessen kann in Ehebrechen übergehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:A3","text":"Eine Ehe kann die an ihr Beteiligten selbst brechen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:A4","text":"Ehebruch kann wahrhaftiger sein als das Verbiegen oder Belügen der Ehe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:A5","text":"Schlecht gepaarte Menschen können ihren gemeinsamen Zustand in Rache gegen die Welt verkehren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:A6","text":"Die Ehe hebt die Gefahr auf, dass die Beteiligten nicht mehr einzeln leben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:A7","text":"Liebe muss als etwas behandelt werden, das erhalten werden soll, nicht als durch das Versprechen bereits Gesichertes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:A8","text":"Ein Eheversprechen kann ein Versehen sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:A9","text":"Eine befristete und kleine Ehe kann als Prüfung der Tauglichkeit für eine grosse Ehe dienen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:A10","text":"Dauerhaftes Zusammensein ist eine grosse und eigens zu prüfende Aufgabe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:A11","text":"Die Ehe soll nicht nur der Fortpflanzung, sondern einer Aufwärtsbewegung dienen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:A12","text":"Die Ehe kann als gestaltender Raum für die Hervorbringung eines Kommenden fungieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:NX1","text":"Ehe ist nicht durch das blosse Schliessen eines Versprechens gerechtfertigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:NX2","text":"Ehe ist nicht durch Schnelligkeit zu begründen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:NX3","text":"Liebe ist nicht mit der Abgabe eines Eheversprechens abgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:NX4","text":"Ehe ist nicht mit Fortpflanzung erschöpft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:NX5","text":"Eine misslingende Ehe soll nicht durch Verbiegen erhalten werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:NX6","text":"Eine misslingende Ehe soll nicht durch Lüge verdeckt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:NX7","text":"Gemeinsames Leben ist nicht ohne die Möglichkeit des Fortbestehens als Einzelne zu bewerten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:NX8","text":"Die Ehe ist nicht automatisch eine geeignete Form des dauernden Zusammenseins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:D1","text":"Weil eine schnelle Eheschliessung fehlerhaft sein kann und Fehler in Ehebrechen übergehen können, muss der Eheschliessung eine Prüfung vorausgehen.","refs":["CH_97E9_24CH:A1","CH_97E9_24CH:A2","CH_97E9_24CH:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:D2","text":"Weil die Ehe die Beteiligten selbst brechen kann, darf die Aufrechterhaltung der Ehe nicht als höherer Wert gelten als die Wahrhaftigkeit der Beteiligten.","refs":["CH_97E9_24CH:A3","CH_97E9_24CH:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:D3","text":"Weil schlecht Gepaarte ihre Verbitterung auf die Welt ausdehnen können, ist die Qualität der Paarung eine soziale und nicht nur private Angelegenheit.","refs":["CH_97E9_24CH:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:D4","text":"Weil Liebe erhalten werden muss und ein Versprechen ein Versehen sein kann, ist das Eheversprechen einer fortlaufenden Revision ausgesetzt.","refs":["CH_97E9_24CH:A7","CH_97E9_24CH:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:D5","text":"Weil dauerhaftes Zusammensein eine grosse Aufgabe ist, bedarf die grosse Ehe einer vorgängigen Erprobung in kleinerer Form.","refs":["CH_97E9_24CH:A9","CH_97E9_24CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:D6","text":"Weil die Ehe über Fortpflanzung hinausweisen soll, wird ihre Legitimität an einer Steigerung und nicht nur an einer biologischen Funktion gemessen.","refs":["CH_97E9_24CH:A11","CH_97E9_24CH:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:SD1","text":"Die Ehe wird von einem einmaligen Rechtsakt in ein zeitlich gestuftes Erkenntnis- und Prüfungsverfahren transformiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_24CH:A1","CH_97E9_24CH:A7","CH_97E9_24CH:A9","CH_97E9_24CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:SD2","text":"Die Möglichkeit des Ehebruchs fungiert als Wahrheitsgrenze gegen eine Institution, die ihre eigene Fortdauer durch Lüge oder Selbstverleugnung sichern will.","refs":["CH_97E9_24CH:A3","CH_97E9_24CH:A4","CH_97E9_24CH:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:SD3","text":"Das Paar wird nicht als Endform, sondern als Mittel zur Hervorbringung einer höheren Zukunft bewertet.","refs":["CH_97E9_24CH:A6","CH_97E9_24CH:A11","CH_97E9_24CH:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:SD4","text":"Die Ehe verbindet eine individualistische Wahrheitsforderung mit einer transindividuellen Zukunftsorientierung.","refs":["CH_97E9_24CH:A6","CH_97E9_24CH:A7","CH_97E9_24CH:A11","CH_97E9_24CH:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:DNX1","text":"Das System setzt die Unwahrheit der Annahme voraus, dass jede geschlossene Ehe erhalten werden müsse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:DNX2","text":"Das System setzt die Unwahrheit der Annahme voraus, dass ein Versprechen seine Gültigkeit allein aus seiner Abgabe beziehe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:DNX3","text":"Das System schliesst aus, dass gemeinsames Leben durch institutionelle Bindung anstelle von fortgesetzter Liebe getragen werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:DNX4","text":"Das System schliesst aus, dass Fortpflanzung bereits die höchste Bestimmung der Ehe darstellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:DNX5","text":"Das System schliesst aus, dass die Aufhebung des Einzelnen im Paar eine gelungene Form des Zusammenseins sei.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Ehe, deren Bestand wichtiger ist als die Wahrhaftigkeit der in ihr Lebenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Möglichkeit, dass ein gemeinsames Leben ohne gemeinsame Aufwärtsbewegung einen positiven Wert besitzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Ehe als abgeschlossene Gegenwart ohne Verpflichtung gegenüber einem Kommenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Vorstellung, dass die Institution selbst die misslungene Paarung in eine gelungene verwandeln könne.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:FGS1","text":"Zu schnelle Entscheidung → fehlerhafte Eheschliessung → Gefahr des Ehebrechens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:FGS2","text":"Ehe kann die Beteiligten brechen → institutionelle Fortdauer wird problematisch → Ehebruch wird als mögliche Wahrheitsbewegung zugelassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:FGS3","text":"Schlechte Paarung → Verlust des Einzelgehens → Rachsucht gegen die Welt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:FGS4","text":"Liebe als zu erhaltende Beziehung + Versprechen als fehlbares Urteil → Prüfung, Befristung und kleine Ehe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:FGS5","text":"Prüfung des gemeinsamen Lebens → Feststellung oder Widerlegung der Tauglichkeit für die grosse Ehe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:FGS6","text":"Ehe als mehr als Fortpflanzung → Gartenfunktion → Aufwärtsbewegung zum Übermenschen und zum Kommenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:AF1","text":"Übereilte Eheschliessung → fehlerhafte Bindung → Ehebruch als mögliche Folge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:AF2","text":"Ehebruch oder Eheverformung → Vorrang der Wahrhaftigkeit vor institutioneller Selbsterhaltung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:AF3","text":"Schlechte Paarung → Rachsucht gegen die Welt → Notwendigkeit redlicher Selbstprüfung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:AF4","text":"Redliche Liebe → Vorbehalt gegenüber dem Versprechen → Frist und kleine Ehe als Test.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:AF5","text":"Erprobtes Zusammensein → grosse Ehe als erworbene Tauglichkeit statt als anfänglicher Anspruch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:AF6","text":"Grosse Ehe → Garten der Ehe → Fortpflanzung überschritten durch Aufstieg zum Kommenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:ME1","text":"Ehe wird von einem singulären Entschluss zu einer sequenziellen Prüfungskonstellation neu kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:ME2","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Ehetreue und Ehebruch wird durch die Unterscheidung zwischen Wahrhaftigkeit und institutioneller Verformung reorganisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:ME3","text":"Das Paar wird zugleich als Gefährdung des Einzelnen und als Instrument einer überindividuellen Zukunft sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:ME4","text":"Fortpflanzung wird von der Endbestimmung zur niedrigeren Funktionsstufe der Ehe herabgesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:ME5","text":"Scheitern wird nicht nur als Verlust, sondern als diagnostischer Beweis mangelnder Paarungstauglichkeit klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:ALT1","text":"Surface — Die Eheschliessung muss gegen Übereilung, Ehebruch, Eheverformung und Ehebelügung bestimmt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Ehe ist eine institutionelle Form, deren Bestand von der Qualität der Paarung, der Erhaltung der Liebe und der Bewahrung des Einzelnen abhängt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Das Argument ersetzt die Norm bedingungsloser Dauer durch eine Strategie der Erprobung, Revision und gegebenenfalls Auflösung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Die Ehe wird auf eine Zukunft hin geöffnet, in der das gegenwärtige Paar Mittel zur Hervorbringung des Übermenschen und von „Allem, was kommen soll“ ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von der übereilten Eheschliessung zur geprüften und zukunftsorientierten Ehe zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleiben die konkreten Kriterien für eine gute Paarung, die Dauer der Frist und die Bedingungen der grossen Ehe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Ehebruch als Ausnahme gegenüber einer verlogenen oder verbogenen Ehe verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung liegt zwischen der Fehlbarkeit des Versprechens, der Notwendigkeit der Erprobung und dem Vorrang der Wahrhaftigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:MRT5","text":"Eine ungelöste Spannung besteht zwischen der Aufwertung des Einzelnen und der Forderung, dauerhaft zu zweit zu sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:MRT6","text":"Eine zweite Spannung besteht zwischen der Ablehnung der Reduktion auf Fortpflanzung und der weiterhin generativen Bestimmung der Ehe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, sofern die Ehe nicht als Endzweck, sondern als prüfbare Form des Aufstiegs behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T190204224577Z_3ec56372","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"24.","source_sha256":"2fbdf4d756f8b2b7207e073699145b07d0880602c830f549c7a6e172530f3561","sha256":"a7e97c5e310065630c711aa3f9e5d527eacbcc52483de8a03c7f1b52385f57a5","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:02:04.226588+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:AS1","text":"Entering into marriage too quickly creates the danger of adultery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:AS2","text":"Marriage is redefined from a legal union into a test of shared capacity for endurance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:AS3","text":"Truthfulness requires that those involved treat their love as a task to be preserved and their promise as potentially erroneous.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:AS4","text":"If the union fails, its dissolution is preferable to the distortion or denial of marriage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:AS5","text":"Marriage receives its highest justification not in procreation, but in enabling the ascent to a coming, higher form of the human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:A1","text":"Entering into marriage too quickly is a faulty conclusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:A2","text":"A faulty conclusion can pass over into adultery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:A3","text":"A marriage can itself break those involved in it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:A4","text":"Adultery can be more truthful than the distortion or lying about marriage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:A5","text":"Poorly matched people can turn their shared condition into vengeance against the world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:A6","text":"Marriage removes the danger that those involved no longer live separately.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:A7","text":"Love must be treated as something that ought to be preserved, not as something already secured by the promise.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:A8","text":"A marriage promise can be a mistake.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:A9","text":"A limited and small marriage can serve as a test of suitability for a great marriage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:A10","text":"Lasting togetherness is a great task that must be examined in its own right.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:A11","text":"Marriage should serve not only procreation, but an upward movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:A12","text":"Marriage can function as a formative space for bringing forth what is to come.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:NX1","text":"Marriage is not justified by the mere making of a promise.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:NX2","text":"Marriage is not to be grounded in speed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:NX3","text":"Love is not concluded with the making of a marriage promise.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:NX4","text":"Marriage is not exhausted by procreation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:NX5","text":"A failing marriage should not be preserved through distortion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:NX6","text":"A failing marriage should not be concealed through lies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:NX7","text":"Living together is not to be evaluated without the possibility of continuing to exist as individuals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:NX8","text":"Marriage is not automatically a suitable form of lasting togetherness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:D1","text":"Because entering into marriage quickly can be faulty and faults can pass over into adultery, marriage must be preceded by a test.","refs":["CH_97E9_24CH:A1","CH_97E9_24CH:A2","CH_97E9_24CH:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:D2","text":"Because marriage can itself break those involved, the maintenance of marriage must not count as a higher value than the truthfulness of those involved.","refs":["CH_97E9_24CH:A3","CH_97E9_24CH:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:D3","text":"Because poorly matched people can extend their bitterness to the world, the quality of the pairing is a social and not merely private matter.","refs":["CH_97E9_24CH:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:D4","text":"Because love must be preserved and a promise can be a mistake, the marriage promise is subject to ongoing revision.","refs":["CH_97E9_24CH:A7","CH_97E9_24CH:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:D5","text":"Because lasting togetherness is a great task, the great marriage requires a prior trial in a smaller form.","refs":["CH_97E9_24CH:A9","CH_97E9_24CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:D6","text":"Because marriage is meant to point beyond procreation, its legitimacy is measured by an enhancement and not merely by a biological function.","refs":["CH_97E9_24CH:A11","CH_97E9_24CH:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:SD1","text":"Marriage is transformed from a one-time legal act into a temporally staged process of knowledge and testing.","refs":["CH_97E9_24CH:A1","CH_97E9_24CH:A7","CH_97E9_24CH:A9","CH_97E9_24CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:SD2","text":"The possibility of adultery functions as a boundary of truth against an institution that seeks to secure its own continuation through lies or self-denial.","refs":["CH_97E9_24CH:A3","CH_97E9_24CH:A4","CH_97E9_24CH:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:SD3","text":"The couple is assessed not as an end-form, but as a means for bringing forth a higher future.","refs":["CH_97E9_24CH:A6","CH_97E9_24CH:A11","CH_97E9_24CH:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:SD4","text":"Marriage combines an individualistic demand for truthfulness with a transindividual orientation toward the future.","refs":["CH_97E9_24CH:A6","CH_97E9_24CH:A7","CH_97E9_24CH:A11","CH_97E9_24CH:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:DNX1","text":"The system presupposes the untruth of the assumption that every concluded marriage must be preserved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:DNX2","text":"The system presupposes the untruth of the assumption that a promise derives its validity solely from its making.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:DNX3","text":"The system excludes the possibility that living together can be sustained by institutional binding in place of continued love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:DNX4","text":"The system excludes the possibility that procreation already constitutes the highest determination of marriage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:DNX5","text":"The system excludes the possibility that the sublation of the individual in the couple is a successful form of togetherness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a marriage whose continuance is more important than the truthfulness of those living in it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:SNX2","text":"Excluded is the possibility that a shared life without a shared upward movement possesses a positive value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:SNX3","text":"Excluded is marriage as a self-contained present without obligation toward what is to come.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:SNX4","text":"Excluded is the notion that the institution itself could transform a failed pairing into a successful one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:FGS1","text":"Decision made too quickly → faulty marriage formation → danger of adultery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:FGS2","text":"Marriage can break those involved → institutional continuation becomes problematic → adultery is admitted as a possible movement of truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:FGS3","text":"Bad pairing → loss of going alone → vengefulness against the world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:FGS4","text":"Love as a relation to be preserved + promise as fallible judgment → testing, limitation, and small marriage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:FGS5","text":"Testing shared life → establishment or refutation of suitability for the great marriage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:FGS6","text":"Marriage as more than procreation → garden function → upward movement toward the Übermensch and toward what is to come.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:AF1","text":"Hasty marriage formation → faulty bond → adultery as a possible consequence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:AF2","text":"Adultery or deformation of marriage → priority of truthfulness over institutional self-preservation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:AF3","text":"Bad pairing → vengefulness against the world → necessity of honest self-examination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:AF4","text":"Honest love → reservation concerning the promise → time limit and small marriage as a test.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:AF5","text":"Tested togetherness → great marriage as acquired suitability rather than as an initial claim.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:AF6","text":"Great marriage → garden of marriage → procreation surpassed through ascent toward what is to come.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:ME1","text":"Marriage is remapped from a singular decision into a sequential constellation of testing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:ME2","text":"The opposition between marital fidelity and adultery is reorganized through the distinction between truthfulness and institutional deformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:ME3","text":"The couple becomes visible simultaneously as a danger to the individual and as an instrument of a supra-individual future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:ME4","text":"Procreation is demoted from final determination to a lower functional level of marriage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:ME5","text":"Failure is classified not only as a loss, but as diagnostic proof of deficient suitability for pairing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:ALT1","text":"Surface — The formation of marriage must be determined against hastiness, adultery, deformation of marriage, and lying about marriage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:ALT2","text":"Structural — Marriage is an institutional form whose continuance depends on the quality of the pairing, the preservation of love, and the safeguarding of the individual.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The argument replaces the norm of unconditional duration with a strategy of testing, revision, and, where necessary, dissolution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Marriage is opened toward a future in which the present couple is a means for bringing forth the Übermensch and “Alles, was kommen soll”.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from hasty marriage formation to tested and future-oriented marriage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:MRT2","text":"The concrete criteria for a good pairing, the duration of the time limit, and the conditions of the great marriage remain underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent provided that adultery is understood as an exception in relation to a mendacious or distorted marriage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:MRT4","text":"The strongest connection lies between the fallibility of the promise, the necessity of testing, and the priority of truthfulness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:MRT5","text":"An unresolved tension exists between the elevation of the individual and the demand to be durably a pair.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:MRT6","text":"A second tension exists between the rejection of reduction to procreation and the still generative determination of marriage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_24CH:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument, provided that marriage is treated not as an end in itself, but as a testable form of ascent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_24CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_24CH@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_24CH:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On Old and New Tablets","source_section_label":"24.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 24","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","24."],"original_title":"24."}],"source_title_context":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln","source_section_label":"24.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 24","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","24."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 105","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 24","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln · 24"},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH","layer":"CH","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 25","order":106,"parents":["RAW_97E9_25CH"],"revision":"CH_97E9_25CH@R001","sha256":"2d0894448c392ebd0a631eb4e566fcced33ee0edbf6ea9325e83ce40cdf10b90","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:AS1","text":"Das Problem besteht darin, dass überlieferte Ursprünge unter dem Druck geschichtlicher Erschütterungen ihre bindende Kraft verlieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:AS2","text":"Die Erschütterung wird als Bedingung sichtbar, unter der verschüttete Kräfte, innere Heimlichkeiten und neue Quellen hervortreten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:AS3","text":"Zukunft wird nicht aus der Bewahrung alter Ursprünge, sondern aus der Hervorbringung neuer Ursprünge gewonnen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:AS4","text":"Eine neue Quelle, ein gemeinsames Herz oder ein gemeinsamer Wille sammelt eine Vielheit von Versuchenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:AS5","text":"Gesellschaft erscheint dadurch als langwieriger Versuch der Erprobung von Befehl und Gehorsam.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:AS6","text":"Die Bewegung endet in der Zurückweisung des Vertrags als gesellschaftlicher Grundlage und in der Suche nach dem Befehlenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:A1","text":"Die Einsicht in alte Ursprünge führt zur Suche nach zukünftigen Quellen und neuen Ursprüngen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:A2","text":"Erschütterungen verschütten bestehende Quellen und erzeugen dadurch Mangel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:A3","text":"Erschütterungen legen verborgene Kräfte und Heimlichkeiten frei.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:A4","text":"Im Erdbeben alter Völker können neue Quellen hervorbrechen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:A5","text":"Eine gemeinsame Quelle, ein gemeinsames Herz oder ein gemeinsamer Wille kann eine Vielheit sammeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:A6","text":"Die gesammelte Vielheit besteht aus Versuchenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:A7","text":"Befehl und Gehorsam werden durch langwieriges Suchen, Raten, Missraten, Lernen und Neuversuchen erprobt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:A8","text":"Menschengesellschaft ist ein Versuch und ein langes Suchen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:A9","text":"Das gesellschaftliche Suchen richtet sich auf den Befehlenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:A10","text":"Der Vertrag ist keine zureichende Grundlage der Menschengesellschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:A11","text":"Der Vertrag wird als Ausdruck von Weichherzigkeit und Halbheit abgewertet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:NX1","text":"Gesellschaft ist nicht die bloße Fortsetzung alter Ursprünge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:NX2","text":"Neue gesellschaftliche Ordnung entsteht nicht ohne Erschütterung, Mangel und Freilegung verborgener Kräfte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:NX3","text":"Gesellschaft ist kein bereits abgeschlossenes und nicht weiter zu erprobendes Gefüge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:NX4","text":"Gesellschaft gründet nicht im Vertrag.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:NX5","text":"Gesellschaft gründet nicht in der Gleichsetzung von Befehlendem und Gehorchendem.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:NX6","text":"Die Vielheit wird nicht als selbstgenügsame Ordnung behandelt, sondern als auf Sammlung und Leitung angewiesene Versuchsgemeinschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:D1","text":"Der Verlust oder die Verschüttung alter Quellen erzeugt nicht bloß Leere, sondern eine Suchbewegung nach zukünftigen Ursprüngen.","refs":["CH_97E9_25CH:A1","CH_97E9_25CH:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:D2","text":"Mangel fungiert als produktive Bedingung, weil er verborgene Kräfte zur Hervorbringung neuer Quellen zwingt.","refs":["CH_97E9_25CH:A2","CH_97E9_25CH:A3","CH_97E9_25CH:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:D3","text":"Eine neue Quelle erhält gesellschaftliche Wirksamkeit erst dadurch, dass sie Durstige, Sehnsüchtige und Werkzeuge um ein gemeinsames Zentrum sammelt.","refs":["CH_97E9_25CH:A5","CH_97E9_25CH:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:D4","text":"Die Gesellschaft besitzt ihre Form nicht von Anfang an, sondern gewinnt sie durch wiederholte Erprobung von Herrschaftsverhältnissen.","refs":["CH_97E9_25CH:A7","CH_97E9_25CH:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:D5","text":"Die gesellschaftliche Suchbewegung ist asymmetrisch ausgerichtet, weil sie nicht allgemein nach Übereinkunft, sondern spezifisch nach dem Befehlenden sucht.","refs":["CH_97E9_25CH:A8","CH_97E9_25CH:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:D6","text":"Die Zurückweisung des Vertrags verschiebt die Begründung gesellschaftlicher Ordnung von Zustimmung auf Erprobung und Befehl.","refs":["CH_97E9_25CH:A7","CH_97E9_25CH:A9","CH_97E9_25CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:SD1","text":"Gesellschaftliche Ordnung wird als hervorgebrachte und prüfbare Formation bestimmt, nicht als ursprünglicher Besitz oder fertige Vereinbarung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:SD2","text":"Die Zerstörung überlieferter Quellen wird zur positiven Voraussetzung historischer Neubildung umcodiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:SD3","text":"Die Vielheit der Versuchenden erhält ihre politische Einheit durch die Konzentration auf eine Quelle, ein Herz, einen Willen oder einen Befehlenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:SD4","text":"Die Legitimität gesellschaftlicher Form wird aus dem Prozess ihrer Erprobung und nicht aus einem vorausgesetzten Konsens gewonnen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:SD5","text":"Das System verbindet offene experimentelle Entstehung mit der perspektivischen Schließung auf ein hierarchisches Befehlszentrum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:DNX1","text":"Falsch ist die Annahme, dass gesellschaftliche Ordnung durch Berufung auf einen gemeinsamen Vertrag ausreichend begründet werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:DNX2","text":"Falsch ist die Annahme, dass überlieferte Ursprünge die Zukunft normativ erschöpfen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:DNX3","text":"Falsch ist die Annahme, dass Zerstörung lediglich Verlust und nicht zugleich Freilegung und Neubildung bedeutet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:DNX4","text":"Falsch ist die Annahme, dass eine Gesellschaft ohne dauernde Versuche, Irrtümer und Neuansätze bereits über ihre gültige Form verfügt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:DNX5","text":"Falsch ist die Annahme, dass politische Einheit aus der bloßen Koexistenz einer Vielheit entsteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:DNX6","text":"Falsch ist die Annahme, dass Befehl und Gehorsam durch symmetrische Zustimmung ersetzt werden können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Gesellschaft ohne Gründungsbruch, in der Herkunft, Gegenwart und Zukunft kontinuierlich zusammenfallen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Möglichkeit, dass Vertrag, Gleichheit und Zustimmung die primären Träger gesellschaftlicher Einheit bilden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Vielheit, die ihre Einheit selbst hervorbringt, ohne sich um Quelle, Herz, Willen oder Befehl zu sammeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:SNX4","text":"Unverfügbar bleibt eine gesellschaftliche Ordnung, deren Experimentation nicht in die Frage nach dem Befehlenden übergeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:FGS1","text":"Überlieferter Ursprung → historische Erschütterung → Verschüttung bestehender Quellen und Erzeugung von Mangel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:FGS2","text":"Mangel → Freilegung verborgener Kräfte → Hervorbrechen neuer Quellen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:FGS3","text":"Neue Quelle / gemeinsames Herz / gemeinsamer Wille → Sammlung einer Vielheit von Versuchenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:FGS4","text":"Gesammelte Vielheit → Erprobung von Befehl und Gehorsam → Lernen durch Missrat und Neuversuch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:FGS5","text":"Erprobte Gesellschaft → Suche nach dem Befehlenden → Zurückweisung des Vertrags als Gründungsmodell.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:FGS6","text":"Die Maschine erzeugt politische Form, indem sie genealogischen Bruch in soziale Sammlung und soziale Sammlung in hierarchische Auswahl überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:AF1","text":"Alte Ursprünge verlieren ihre Zukunftskraft → Erdbeben verschütten Quellen und erzeugen Mangel → verborgene Kräfte werden sichtbar → neue Quellen brechen hervor → eine Vielheit sammelt sich um Quelle, Herz oder Willen → Befehl und Gehorsam werden erprobt → Gesellschaft sucht den Befehlenden → Vertrag wird als Grundlage verworfen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:ME1","text":"Zerstörung wird von einem negativen Ereignis in eine produktive Bedingung der Quellenbildung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:ME2","text":"Gesellschaft wird von einem Vertragsverhältnis in einen experimentellen Prozess der Herrschaftsbildung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:ME3","text":"Politische Einheit wird nicht mehr primär als Zustimmung, sondern als Sammlung um ein Zentrum sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:ME4","text":"Die Opposition zwischen Vielheit und Einheit wird durch die Figur der gesammelten Versuchenden neu geordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:ME5","text":"Zukunft erscheint nicht als Fortsetzung der Herkunft, sondern als Ergebnis eines Bruchs mit überlieferten Quellen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — Der Text behauptet das Hervorbrechen neuer Quellen im Erdbeben alter Völker und die Suche der Gesellschaft nach dem Befehlenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — Historische Erschütterung, Mangel, Freilegung, Sammlung und Erprobung bilden den Mechanismus gesellschaftlicher Neubildung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — Der Text ersetzt die Strategie des Vertrags und der Versöhnung durch eine Strategie des Versuchs, der Auswahl und der hierarchischen Ausrichtung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — Sein und Zukunft gesellschaftlicher Formen werden als Werden aus Bruch, Versuch und Neubeginn bestimmt; Ursprung ist nachträglich und zukunftsgerichtet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von alten Ursprüngen über Erschütterung und Quellenbildung zur Suche nach dem Befehlenden zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, nach welchen Kriterien ein Befehlender ausgewählt oder als solcher erkannt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt ebenfalls, wie die Versuchenden zwischen gelungenem Versuch, Missrat und bloßer Unterwerfung unterscheiden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:MRT4","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Gesellschaft als experimentelle und nicht als vertragliche Formation angesetzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung besteht zwischen Erschütterung, Freilegung verborgener Kräfte und Hervorbringung neuer Ursprünge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:MRT6","text":"Die schwächste Verbindung liegt im Übergang von offener Erprobung zur normativen Vorrangstellung des Befehlenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung des Textes, sofern der Vertrag als prinzipiell ausgeschlossene Alternative und nicht nur als ein historisches Modell behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T190224944850Z_6f85e8fa","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"25.","source_sha256":"2d0894448c392ebd0a631eb4e566fcced33ee0edbf6ea9325e83ce40cdf10b90","sha256":"2fe022048d4a043d83969544fb72900b7477ad7a1e5ff7bca22024b0a24ad7e7","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:02:24.947194+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:AS1","text":"The problem consists in the fact that inherited origins lose their binding force under the pressure of historical upheavals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:AS2","text":"The upheaval becomes visible as the condition under which buried forces, inner secrets, and new sources emerge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:AS3","text":"The future is gained not from the preservation of old origins, but from the production of new origins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:AS4","text":"A new source, a common heart, or a common will gathers a multiplicity of experimenters.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:AS5","text":"Society thereby appears as a protracted attempt at the testing of command and obedience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:AS6","text":"The movement ends in the rejection of the contract as a social foundation and in the search for the one who commands.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:A1","text":"Insight into old origins leads to the search for future sources and new origins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:A2","text":"Upheavals bury existing sources and thereby produce lack.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:A3","text":"Upheavals lay bare hidden forces and secrets.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:A4","text":"In the earthquake of old peoples, new sources can break forth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:A5","text":"A common source, a common heart, or a common will can gather a multiplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:A6","text":"The gathered multiplicity consists of experimenters.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:A7","text":"Command and obedience are tested through protracted seeking, guessing, failure, learning, and trying anew.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:A8","text":"Human society is an experiment and a long search.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:A9","text":"The social search is directed toward the one who commands.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:A10","text":"The contract is not an adequate foundation of human society.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:A11","text":"The contract is devalued as an expression of soft-heartedness and half-measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:NX1","text":"Society is not the mere continuation of old origins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:NX2","text":"New social order does not arise without upheaval, lack, and the laying bare of hidden forces.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:NX3","text":"Society is not an already completed structure that is no longer to be tested.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:NX4","text":"Society is not founded in the contract.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:NX5","text":"Society is not founded in the equation of the one who commands and the one who obeys.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:NX6","text":"The multiplicity is not treated as a self-sufficient order, but as a community of experimenters dependent on gathering and guidance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:D1","text":"The loss or burial of old sources produces not mere emptiness, but a movement of search for future origins.","refs":["CH_97E9_25CH:A1","CH_97E9_25CH:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:D2","text":"Lack functions as a productive condition because it compels hidden forces to produce new sources.","refs":["CH_97E9_25CH:A2","CH_97E9_25CH:A3","CH_97E9_25CH:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:D3","text":"A new source acquires social efficacy only by gathering the thirsty, the longing, and the tools around a common center.","refs":["CH_97E9_25CH:A5","CH_97E9_25CH:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:D4","text":"Society does not possess its form from the outset, but gains it through repeated testing of relations of domination.","refs":["CH_97E9_25CH:A7","CH_97E9_25CH:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:D5","text":"The social movement of search is asymmetrically oriented, because it seeks not agreement in general, but specifically the one who commands.","refs":["CH_97E9_25CH:A8","CH_97E9_25CH:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:D6","text":"The rejection of the contract shifts the grounding of social order from consent to testing and command.","refs":["CH_97E9_25CH:A7","CH_97E9_25CH:A9","CH_97E9_25CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:SD1","text":"Social order is determined as a produced and testable formation, not as an original possession or a completed agreement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:SD2","text":"The destruction of inherited sources is recoded as the positive precondition of historical reformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:SD3","text":"The multiplicity of experimenters receives its political unity through concentration upon a source, a heart, a will, or one who commands.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:SD4","text":"The legitimacy of social form is gained from the process of its testing and not from a presupposed consensus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:SD5","text":"The system combines open experimental emergence with the perspectival closure upon a hierarchical center of command.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:DNX1","text":"False is the assumption that social order can be adequately grounded by appeal to a common contract.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:DNX2","text":"False is the assumption that inherited origins normatively exhaust the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:DNX3","text":"False is the assumption that destruction means merely loss and not at the same time disclosure and reformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:DNX4","text":"False is the assumption that a society without enduring attempts, errors, and new beginnings already possesses its valid form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:DNX5","text":"False is the assumption that political unity arises from the mere coexistence of a multiplicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:DNX6","text":"False is the assumption that command and obedience can be replaced by symmetrical consent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a society without a founding rupture, in which origin, present, and future continuously coincide.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:SNX2","text":"Excluded is the possibility that contract, equality, and consent constitute the primary bearers of social unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:SNX3","text":"Excluded is a multiplicity that produces its own unity without gathering itself around source, heart, will, or command.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:SNX4","text":"Unavailable remains a social order whose experimentation does not pass over into the question of the one who commands.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:FGS1","text":"Inherited origin → historical upheaval → burial of existing sources and production of lack.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:FGS2","text":"Lack → laying bare of hidden forces → breaking forth of new sources.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:FGS3","text":"New source / common heart / common will → gathering of a multiplicity of experimenters.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:FGS4","text":"Gathered multiplicity → testing of command and obedience → learning through failure and trying anew.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:FGS5","text":"Tested society → search for the one who commands → rejection of the contract as a founding model.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:FGS6","text":"The machine produces political form by transferring genealogical rupture into social gathering and social gathering into hierarchical selection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:AF1","text":"Old origins lose their power for the future → earthquakes bury sources and produce lack → hidden forces become visible → new sources break forth → a multiplicity gathers around source, heart, or will → command and obedience are tested → society seeks the one who commands → the contract is rejected as a foundation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:ME1","text":"Destruction is reclassified from a negative event into a productive condition of source formation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:ME2","text":"Society is remapped from a contractual relation into an experimental process of the formation of domination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:ME3","text":"Political unity becomes visible no longer primarily as consent, but as gathering around a center.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:ME4","text":"The opposition between multiplicity and unity is reordered through the figure of the gathered experimenters.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:ME5","text":"The future appears not as a continuation of origin, but as the result of a rupture with inherited sources.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — The text asserts the breaking forth of new sources in the earthquake of old peoples and society's search for the one who commands.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — Historical upheaval, lack, disclosure, gathering, and testing constitute the mechanism of social reformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — The text replaces the strategy of contract and reconciliation with a strategy of experiment, selection, and hierarchical orientation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — The being and future of social forms are determined as becoming from rupture, experiment, and new beginning; origin is retrospective and future-oriented.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from old origins through upheaval and source formation to the search for the one who commands.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined according to which criteria one who commands is selected or recognized as such.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:MRT3","text":"It likewise remains underdetermined how the experimenters distinguish between a successful attempt, failure, and mere subjection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:MRT4","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as society is posited as an experimental and not as a contractual formation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:MRT5","text":"The strongest connection exists between upheaval, the laying bare of hidden forces, and the production of new origins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:MRT6","text":"The weakest connection lies in the transition from open testing to the normative precedence of the one who commands.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_25CH:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the text insofar as the contract is treated as an alternative excluded in principle and not merely as a historical model.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_25CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_25CH@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_25CH:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On Old and New Tablets","source_section_label":"25.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 25","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","25."],"original_title":"25."}],"source_title_context":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln","source_section_label":"25.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 25","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","25."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 106","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 25","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln · 25"},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH","layer":"CH","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 26","order":107,"parents":["RAW_97E9_26CH"],"revision":"CH_97E9_26CH@R001","sha256":"63ea42cfff36f6e8576d75f49e009afcf81003000993916cf511622aa5cb1f02","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:AS1","text":"Der Text verlagert die grösste Gefahr für die Zukunft der Menschen von den Bösen auf die Guten und Gerechten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:AS2","text":"Die Guten und Gerechten werden nicht als Besitzer, sondern als Verwalter einer vermeintlich bereits erkannten Wahrheit bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:AS3","text":"Ihr gutes Gewissen bindet ihren Geist an die bestehenden Werte und verhindert die Anerkennung fremder Tugend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:AS4","text":"Die Unfähigkeit zur eigenen Wertschöpfung erzeugt Hass gegen den Schaffenden und den Brecher alter Werttafeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:AS5","text":"Die Kreuzigung des Werteschaffenden verwandelt moralische Selbstgewissheit in eine gegen die Zukunft gerichtete Macht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:AS6","text":"Die Guten und Gerechten erscheinen dadurch als Anfang des Endes, weil ihre Tugend die Entstehung neuer Werte verhindert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:A1","text":"Die grösste Gefahr für die Zukunft der Menschen kann von den Guten und Gerechten ausgehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:A2","text":"Die Guten und Gerechten beanspruchen, bereits zu wissen, was gut und gerecht ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:A3","text":"Der Anspruch auf fertige Wahrheit schliesst die weitere Suche nach Gutem und Gerechtem aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:A4","text":"Das gute Gewissen fängt den Geist der Guten und Gerechten ein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:A5","text":"Die Guten und Gerechten müssen als Pharisäer erscheinen, weil ihre moralische Stellung keine andere Reaktion zulässt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:A6","text":"Die Guten und Gerechten müssen denjenigen kreuzigen, der seine eigene Tugend erfindet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:A7","text":"Der Hass der Guten und Gerechten richtet sich am stärksten gegen den Schaffenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:A8","text":"Der Schaffende bricht alte Werttafeln und schreibt neue Werte auf neue Tafeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:A9","text":"Die Guten und Gerechten können keine neuen Werte schaffen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:A10","text":"Die Verfolgung des Werteschaffenden richtet sich gegen die Zukunft aller Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:A11","text":"Die Guten und Gerechten bilden den Anfang des Endes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:NX1","text":"Die grösste Gefahr wird nicht primär den Bösen zugeschrieben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:NX2","text":"Moralische Güte wird nicht mit schöpferischer Fähigkeit gleichgesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:NX3","text":"Ein gutes Gewissen gilt nicht als Zugang zu Wahrheit, sondern als Gefangenschaft des Geistes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:NX4","text":"Die bestehenden Werte gelten nicht als neutrale oder endgültige Ordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:NX5","text":"Der Brecher alter Werttafeln wird nicht als gewöhnlicher Verbrecher anerkannt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:NX6","text":"Die Guten und Gerechten werden nicht als zukunftserhaltende Kraft bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:NX7","text":"Die Verteidigung des Guten wird nicht als unschädliche moralische Handlung behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:NX8","text":"Die Kreuzigung des Werteschaffenden wird nicht als gerechte Bestrafung begriffen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:D1","text":"Die Behauptung, das Gute und Gerechte bereits zu besitzen, verwandelt moralische Gewissheit in einen Ausschluss weiterer Wertsuche.","refs":["CH_97E9_26CH:A2","CH_97E9_26CH:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:D2","text":"Das gute Gewissen stabilisiert die Unfähigkeit, die eigene Tugend als Erfindung einer anderen Instanz anzuerkennen.","refs":["CH_97E9_26CH:A4","CH_97E9_26CH:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:D3","text":"Die Guten und Gerechten müssen den Werteschaffenden als Verbrecher klassifizieren, weil sein Werteschaffen ihre Wertordnung negiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_26CH:A6","CH_97E9_26CH:A7","CH_97E9_26CH:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:D4","text":"Die Unfähigkeit zur Wertschöpfung erzeugt eine reaktive Bindung an alte Tafeln.","refs":["CH_97E9_26CH:A8","CH_97E9_26CH:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:D5","text":"Die moralische Verfolgung des Schaffenden wird zur Zerstörung einer möglichen menschlichen Zukunft.","refs":["CH_97E9_26CH:A6","CH_97E9_26CH:A8","CH_97E9_26CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:D6","text":"Die Guten und Gerechten können als Anfang des Endes erscheinen, weil ihre Ordnung die Zukunft durch Wiederholung der alten Werte blockiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_26CH:A9","CH_97E9_26CH:A10","CH_97E9_26CH:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:SD1","text":"Moralische Selbstgewissheit wird als strukturelle Gegenmacht zur Wertschöpfung lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:SD2","text":"Die Verteidigung des Guten reproduziert gerade dadurch den Schaden, den sie den Bösen und Welt-Verleumdern zuschreibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:SD3","text":"Das moralische Subjekt erhält seine Identität durch die Verfolgung dessen, was seine eigene Wertordnung überschreitet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:SD4","text":"Zukunft wird im System nicht durch offene Gewalt allein, sondern durch die Sakralisierung bestehender Werte verhindert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:SD5","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Guten und Bösen wird in einen Gegensatz zwischen Wertbewahrern und Werteschaffenden umcodiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:DNX1","text":"Das System hängt davon ab, dass moralische Gewissheit keine schöpferische Erkenntnis garantiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:DNX2","text":"Es setzt voraus, dass bestehende Werte nicht aus sich selbst heraus endgültige Geltung besitzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:DNX3","text":"Es schliesst aus, dass die Guten und Gerechten ihre eigene Ordnung kritisch überschreiten können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:DNX4","text":"Es verwirft die Annahme, dass die Verurteilung des Werteschaffenden aus einem unabhängigen Begriff der Gerechtigkeit hervorgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:DNX5","text":"Es behandelt moralische Dummheit als mit sich selbst vereinbare Form strategischer Klugheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:DNX6","text":"Es setzt voraus, dass die Zukunft von der Fähigkeit zur Hervorbringung neuer Werte abhängt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Zukunft, in der moralische Ordnung und Werteschöpfung ohne Konflikt zusammenfallen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:SNX2","text":"Unzulässig wird die Möglichkeit, dass die Guten und Gerechten zugleich Bewahrer ihrer Werte und Schöpfer neuer Werte sein könnten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:SNX3","text":"Die verdrängte Möglichkeit des Systems ist eine Tugend, die nicht auf fertiger Gewissheit, sondern auf eigener Erfindung beruht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:SNX4","text":"Die tiefste Abwesenheit ist eine nicht-reaktive Moral, die den Werteschaffenden nicht zum Feind erklären muss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:FGS1","text":"Anspruch auf fertige Wahrheit + Ausschluss weiterer Suche → moralische Selbstschliessung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:FGS2","text":"Moralische Selbstschliessung + gutes Gewissen → Gefangenschaft des Geistes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:FGS3","text":"Gefangenschaft des Geistes + Unfähigkeit zur Wertschöpfung → Bindung an alte Werttafeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:FGS4","text":"Neue Wertschöpfung → Bruch mit alten Tafeln → Klassifikation des Schaffenden als Verbrecher.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:FGS5","text":"Klassifikation als Verbrecher → Kreuzigung des Werteschaffenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:FGS6","text":"Kreuzigung des Werteschaffenden → Opferung der Zukunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:FGS7","text":"Opferung der Zukunft → Bestimmung der Guten und Gerechten als Anfang des Endes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:FGS8","text":"Reframing der Gefahr: böse Handlung → moralische Bewahrung → Blockade neuer Werte → Zukunftsschaden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:AF1","text":"Behauptete moralische Gewissheit → Ausschluss der Suche → Gefangenschaft im guten Gewissen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:AF2","text":"Gefangenschaft im guten Gewissen → Unfähigkeit zur Wertschöpfung → Hass auf den Schaffenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:AF3","text":"Bruch alter Werttafeln → Umbenennung des Schaffenden zum Verbrecher → Kreuzigung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:AF4","text":"Kreuzigung des Schaffenden → Opferung der Zukunft → Guten und Gerechten als Anfang des Endes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:AF5","text":"Gute und Gerechte als scheinbare Ordnungsmacht → Gute und Gerechte als grösste Zukunftsgefahr.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:ME1","text":"Die moralische Opposition zwischen Gut und Böse wird durch die strukturelle Opposition zwischen Wertbewahrung und Werteschöpfung ersetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:ME2","text":"Das gute Gewissen wird von einem moralischen Beweiszeichen zu einem Mechanismus geistiger Einschliessung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:ME3","text":"Der Verbrecherbegriff wird als Reaktion der bestehenden Werteordnung auf ihre Überschreitung klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:ME4","text":"Der Schaden wird nicht mehr nach der Absicht einer Handlung, sondern nach ihrer Wirkung auf die Möglichkeit zukünftiger Werte bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:ME5","text":"Die Guten und Gerechten werden von einer normativen Instanz zu einer historischen Endbewegung neu klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Der Text behauptet, dass die Guten und Gerechten der Menschheitszukunft grösseren Schaden zufügen können als die Bösen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Der Mechanismus besteht aus moralischer Selbstgewissheit, geistiger Gefangenschaft, Wertunfähigkeit und Verfolgung des Schaffenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Der moralische Gegner wird nicht über seine erklärte Absicht, sondern über die von seiner Wertverteidigung erzeugte Zukunftsblockade bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Menschliche Zukunft setzt die Hervorbringung neuer Werte voraus; ihre Verhinderung macht die Gegenwart zur Anfangsform des Endes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von moralischer Gewissheit zu Zukunftsschädigung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:MRT2","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bleibt unterbestimmt hinsichtlich dessen, was eine eigene Tugend positiv auszeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:MRT3","text":"Die interne Logik ist geschlossen, sofern die Unfähigkeit der Guten zur Wertschöpfung als notwendige Bedingung gesetzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung besteht zwischen Wertbewahrung, Verfolgung des Schaffenden und Opferung der Zukunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:MRT5","text":"Die grösste Spannung liegt darin, dass die Guten als zwangsläufige Pharisäer bestimmt werden, ohne die Möglichkeit abweichender guter Subjekte auszuarbeiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:MRT6","text":"Die Gleichsetzung von moralischer Güte, Wertunfähigkeit und Zukunftsfeindschaft beruht auf einer nicht weiter begründeten Totalisierung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, sofern der zentrale Gegensatz nicht Gut gegen Böse, sondern alte gegen neue Wertschöpfung lautet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T190245394024Z_93f1e933","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"26.","source_sha256":"63ea42cfff36f6e8576d75f49e009afcf81003000993916cf511622aa5cb1f02","sha256":"98eb92ca754ddf3534480661410aba8292cef2a5139363c61a0dff561b0bcfeb","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:02:45.396791+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:AS1","text":"The text shifts the greatest danger to the future of humankind from the evil to the good and just.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:AS2","text":"The good and just are defined not as possessors but as administrators of a truth allegedly already recognized.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:AS3","text":"Their good conscience binds their spirit to the existing values and prevents the recognition of another's virtue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:AS4","text":"The inability to create values produces hatred against the creator and the breaker of old tablets of values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:AS5","text":"The crucifixion of the creator of values transforms moral self-certainty into a power directed against the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:AS6","text":"The good and just thus appear as the beginning of the end, because their virtue prevents the emergence of new values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:A1","text":"The greatest danger to the future of humankind can come from the good and just.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:A2","text":"The good and just claim already to know what is good and just.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:A3","text":"The claim to completed truth excludes the further search for the good and just.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:A4","text":"Good conscience ensnares the spirit of the good and just.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:A5","text":"The good and just must appear as Pharisees, because their moral position permits no other reaction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:A6","text":"The good and just must crucify the one who invents his own virtue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:A7","text":"The hatred of the good and just is directed most strongly against the creator.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:A8","text":"The creator breaks old tablets of values and writes new values upon new tablets.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:A9","text":"The good and just cannot create new values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:A10","text":"The persecution of the creator of values is directed against the future of all human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:A11","text":"The good and just form the beginning of the end.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:NX1","text":"The greatest danger is not attributed primarily to the evil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:NX2","text":"Moral goodness is not equated with creative capacity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:NX3","text":"A good conscience does not count as access to truth, but as imprisonment of the spirit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:NX4","text":"The existing values do not count as a neutral or final order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:NX5","text":"The breaker of old tablets of values is not recognized as an ordinary criminal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:NX6","text":"The good and just are not defined as a force preserving the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:NX7","text":"The defense of the good is not treated as a harmless moral act.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:NX8","text":"The crucifixion of the creator of values is not understood as just punishment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:D1","text":"The assertion of already possessing the good and just transforms moral certainty into an exclusion of further value-seeking.","refs":["CH_97E9_26CH:A2","CH_97E9_26CH:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:D2","text":"Good conscience stabilizes the inability to recognize one's own virtue as the invention of another instance.","refs":["CH_97E9_26CH:A4","CH_97E9_26CH:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:D3","text":"The good and just must classify the creator of values as a criminal, because his creation of values negates their order of values.","refs":["CH_97E9_26CH:A6","CH_97E9_26CH:A7","CH_97E9_26CH:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:D4","text":"The inability to create values produces a reactive attachment to old tablets.","refs":["CH_97E9_26CH:A8","CH_97E9_26CH:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:D5","text":"The moral persecution of the creator becomes the destruction of a possible human future.","refs":["CH_97E9_26CH:A6","CH_97E9_26CH:A8","CH_97E9_26CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:D6","text":"The good and just can appear as the beginning of the end, because their order blocks the future through repetition of the old values.","refs":["CH_97E9_26CH:A9","CH_97E9_26CH:A10","CH_97E9_26CH:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:SD1","text":"Moral self-certainty becomes legible as a structural counterforce to the creation of values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:SD2","text":"The defense of the good thereby reproduces precisely the harm that it attributes to the evil and the slanderers of the world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:SD3","text":"The moral subject receives its identity through the persecution of that which exceeds its own order of values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:SD4","text":"In the system, the future is prevented not by open violence alone, but by the sacralization of existing values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:SD5","text":"The opposition between good and evil is recoded into an opposition between preservers of values and creators of values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:DNX1","text":"The system depends on moral certainty not guaranteeing creative knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:DNX2","text":"It presupposes that existing values do not possess final validity from themselves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:DNX3","text":"It excludes the possibility that the good and just can critically transcend their own order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:DNX4","text":"It rejects the assumption that the condemnation of the creator of values proceeds from an independent concept of justice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:DNX5","text":"It treats moral stupidity as a form of strategic cleverness compatible with itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:DNX6","text":"It presupposes that the future depends on the capacity to bring forth new values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a future in which moral order and the creation of values coincide without conflict.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:SNX2","text":"Impermissible is the possibility that the good and just could simultaneously be preservers of their values and creators of new values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:SNX3","text":"The system's repressed possibility is a virtue based not on completed certainty but on its own invention.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:SNX4","text":"The deepest absence is a non-reactive morality that need not declare the creator of values an enemy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:FGS1","text":"Claim to completed truth + exclusion of further seeking → moral self-closure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:FGS2","text":"Moral self-closure + good conscience → imprisonment of the spirit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:FGS3","text":"Imprisonment of the spirit + inability to create values → attachment to old tablets of values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:FGS4","text":"New creation of values → break with old tablets → classification of the creator as a criminal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:FGS5","text":"Classification as a criminal → crucifixion of the creator of values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:FGS6","text":"Crucifixion of the creator of values → sacrifice of the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:FGS7","text":"Sacrifice of the future → definition of the good and just as the beginning of the end.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:FGS8","text":"Reframing of danger: evil action → moral preservation → blockage of new values → harm to the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:AF1","text":"Claimed moral certainty → exclusion of seeking → imprisonment in good conscience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:AF2","text":"Imprisonment in good conscience → inability to create values → hatred of the creator.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:AF3","text":"Breaking of old tablets of values → renaming of the creator as a criminal → crucifixion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:AF4","text":"Crucifixion of the creator → sacrifice of the future → the good and just as the beginning of the end.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:AF5","text":"Good and just as apparent ordering power → good and just as greatest danger to the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:ME1","text":"The moral opposition between good and evil is replaced by the structural opposition between preservation of values and creation of values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:ME2","text":"Good conscience is remapped from a moral sign of proof into a mechanism of spiritual enclosure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:ME3","text":"The concept of the criminal is classified as a reaction of the existing order of values to its transgression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:ME4","text":"Harm is no longer determined by the intention of an action, but by its effect on the possibility of future values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:ME5","text":"The good and just are reclassified from a normative instance into a historical movement toward the end.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** The text asserts that the good and just can inflict greater harm on the future of humanity than the evil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** The mechanism consists of moral self-certainty, spiritual imprisonment, incapacity for values, and persecution of the creator.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** The moral adversary is determined not by his declared intention, but by the blockage of the future produced by his defense of values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Human future presupposes the bringing forth of new values; preventing it makes the present the initial form of the end.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from moral certainty to harm to the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:MRT2","text":"The reconstruction remains underdetermined with regard to what positively distinguishes a virtue of one's own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:MRT3","text":"The internal logic is closed, provided that the inability of the good to create values is posited as a necessary condition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:MRT4","text":"The strongest connection exists between preservation of values, persecution of the creator, and sacrifice of the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:MRT5","text":"The greatest tension lies in the fact that the good are defined as inevitable Pharisees without elaborating the possibility of divergent good subjects.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:MRT6","text":"The equation of moral goodness, incapacity for values, and hostility to the future rests on an otherwise ungrounded totalization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_26CH:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument, provided that the central opposition is not good against evil but old against new creation of values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_26CH:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_26CH@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_26CH:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On Old and New Tablets","source_section_label":"26.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 26","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","26."],"original_title":"26."}],"source_title_context":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln","source_section_label":"26.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 26","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","26."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 107","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 26","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln · 26"},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH","layer":"CH","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 27","order":108,"parents":["RAW_97E9_27CH"],"revision":"CH_97E9_27CH@R001","sha256":"57d734ee7bb5dec60ca6791d9e6b5e29cba16c47d31b4f8211e93f07618eff4f","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:AS1","text":"Das Problem ist, dass die Zukunft des Menschen durch eine Instanz bedroht sein kann, die als gut und gerecht gilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:AS2","text":"Der zuvor eingeführte „letzte Mensch“ fungiert als notwendiger Referenzpunkt der erneuten Prüfung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:AS3","text":"Die moralisch positiv bewerteten Figuren werden als möglicher Ort der größten Gefahr neu bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:AS4","text":"Die Frageform überführt eine moralische Gewissheit in einen Verdacht gegen ihre eigene Trägerschicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:AS5","text":"Die Diagnose mündet nicht in Vermittlung, sondern in den Imperativ, die Guten und Gerechten zu zerbrechen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:AS6","text":"Das Argument bewegt sich von erinnerter Rede über enthüllte Gefahr zu destruktiver Neurahmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:A1","text":"Die Zukunft des Menschen ist durch gegenwärtige menschliche Ordnungen gefährdbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:A2","text":"Der „letzte Mensch“ bezeichnet eine für die Zukunft des Menschen relevante Möglichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:A3","text":"Die größte Gefahr kann bei denjenigen liegen, die als gut und gerecht gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:A4","text":"Moralische Anerkennung schließt Gefährlichkeit nicht aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:A5","text":"Die Guten und Gerechten bilden eine zu zerbrechende Formation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:A6","text":"Das Erkennen dieser Gefahr setzt ein erneutes Verstehen der vorausgehenden Rede voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:A7","text":"Die Aufhebung der Gefahr wird als Zerbrechen und nicht als bloße Korrektur dieser Formation gedacht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:NX1","text":"Die Gefahr der Menschenzukunft liegt nicht ausschließlich bei den offen Bösen oder Ungerechten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:NX2","text":"Das Gute und Gerechte ist nicht mit Ungefährlichkeit gleichzusetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:NX3","text":"Moralische Selbstgewissheit gilt nicht als ausreichende Legitimation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:NX4","text":"Die vorausgehende Rede über den „letzten Menschen“ darf nicht als erledigt oder verstanden vorausgesetzt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:NX5","text":"Die problematische Formation wird nicht durch behutsame Verbesserung bestätigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:NX6","text":"Die geforderte Antwort besteht nicht in Versöhnung mit den Guten und Gerechten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:D1","text":"Die moralische Gegenüberstellung von Gut und Böse reicht zur Bestimmung der Zukunftsgefahr nicht aus.","refs":["CH_97E9_27CH:A1","CH_97E9_27CH:A3","CH_97E9_27CH:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:D2","text":"Die Träger moralischer Ordnung können zugleich Träger einer zukunftsgefährdenden Fixierung sein.","refs":["CH_97E9_27CH:A3","CH_97E9_27CH:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:D3","text":"Die Erinnerung an den „letzten Menschen“ wird zur Prüfung der moralischen Gegenwart eingesetzt.","refs":["CH_97E9_27CH:A2","CH_97E9_27CH:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:D4","text":"Die geforderte Kritik richtet sich gegen eine Formation und nicht bloß gegen einzelne moralische Fehlhandlungen.","refs":["CH_97E9_27CH:A5","CH_97E9_27CH:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:D5","text":"Verstehen bedeutet hier, die verborgene Gefährlichkeit des moralisch Anerkannten zu erfassen.","refs":["CH_97E9_27CH:A3","CH_97E9_27CH:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:SD1","text":"Die Zukunftsfrage wird von einer Prüfung des moralisch Abweichenden zu einer Prüfung des moralisch Normierenden verschoben.","refs":["CH_97E9_27CH:A1","CH_97E9_27CH:A3","CH_97E9_27CH:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:SD2","text":"Das moralisch Gute erscheint als mögliche Reproduktionsform einer zukunftsfeindlichen Ordnung.","refs":["CH_97E9_27CH:A1","CH_97E9_27CH:A3","CH_97E9_27CH:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:SD3","text":"Die Kritik nimmt eine antinomische Form an: Was als Schutz der Zukunft gilt, wird als ihre größte Gefahr markiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_27CH:A1","CH_97E9_27CH:A3","CH_97E9_27CH:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:SD4","text":"Das Verständnis der Rede wird selbst zum Selektionsmechanismus zwischen affirmierter Moral und geforderter Zerstörung ihrer Formation.","refs":["CH_97E9_27CH:A5","CH_97E9_27CH:A6","CH_97E9_27CH:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:DNX1","text":"Falsch ist die Annahme, dass die Zukunft primär durch moralisch negative Kräfte bedroht werde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:DNX2","text":"Falsch ist die Gleichsetzung von moralischer Güte mit lebens- oder zukunftsfördernder Wirkung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:DNX3","text":"Falsch ist ein Modell, in dem die bestehende moralische Formation als endgültiger Maßstab des Menschlichen gilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:DNX4","text":"Falsch ist die Vorstellung, dass die Gefahr durch bloße moralische Läuterung innerhalb derselben Formation aufgehoben werden könne.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:DNX5","text":"Falsch ist eine Zukunftslogik, die den „letzten Menschen“ unabhängig von den Guten und Gerechten behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Zukunft, in der das moralisch Anerkannte ohne strukturelle Prüfung als menschheitserhaltend gelten darf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Möglichkeit, dass die Zukunft durch Bewahrung der Guten und Gerechten gesichert werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:SNX3","text":"Die versperrte Möglichkeit ist eine nichtmoralische oder transmorale Neubestimmung dessen, was Zukunft eröffnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:SNX4","text":"Der Diskurs organisiert sich um die Abwesenheit einer positiv bestimmten Nachfolgeformation nach dem Zerbrechen der Guten und Gerechten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:FGS1","text":"Erinnerte Rede über den „letzten Menschen“ → erneute Verstehensforderung → Öffnung der Zukunftsfrage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:FGS2","text":"Zukunftsgefährdung → Suche nach ihrem Träger → Verlagerung vom moralisch Negativen zum moralisch Positiven.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:FGS3","text":"Gute und Gerechte als moralische Formation → Entkopplung von Güte und Ungefährlichkeit → Enthüllung ihrer möglichen Gefährlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:FGS4","text":"Enthüllte Gefährlichkeit → Verwerfung bloßer Bewahrung oder Korrektur → Imperativ des Zerbrechens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:FGS5","text":"Zerbrechen der Formation → negative Öffnung der Zukunft → keine positive Nachfolgeordnung innerhalb des gegebenen Textes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:AF1","text":"Ungeklärtes Verstehen → Rückbindung an den „letzten Menschen“ → Zukunft als Gefahrenfeld → Verlagerung der Gefahr auf die Guten und Gerechten → Imperativ des Zerbrechens → unbestimmte Öffnung einer anderen Zukunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:ME1","text":"Die moralische Karte wird invertiert: Die Guten und Gerechten erscheinen nicht mehr nur als Gegenstand der Bewertung, sondern als mögliche Ursache der Zukunftsgefahr.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:ME2","text":"Der Gegensatz gut/böse verliert seine Funktion als hinreichende Karte der historischen oder menschheitlichen Gefahr.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:ME3","text":"„Zerbrechen“ wird als strukturelle Operation gegen eine moralische Formation und nicht als bloße Sanktion einzelner Personen klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:ME4","text":"Der „letzte Mensch“ wird aus einer isolierten Zukunftsfigur in eine Prüfung gegenwärtiger moralischer Ordnungen überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:ME5","text":"Zukunft wird nicht als automatische Fortsetzung des Guten, sondern als Ergebnis eines Bruchs mit einer bestehenden Wertordnung kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:ALT1","text":"Surface — Eine an die „Brüder“ gerichtete Frage verbindet den „letzten Menschen“ mit der Gefahr durch die Guten und Gerechten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:ALT2","text":"Structural — Eine moralisch legitimierte Formation wird als reproduzierender Träger einer zukunftsgefährdenden Ordnung bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Verstehen wird zur Voraussetzung einer gegen die moralische Mehrheit gerichteten Handlung des Zerbrechens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Das Menschliche ist nicht als stabiler moralischer Zustand, sondern als gefährdete und durch Bruch neu zu eröffnende Zukunft gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von der Zukunftsgefahr zur Kritik der Guten und Gerechten zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, was der „letzte Mensch“ genau bezeichnet und wie er kausal mit den Guten und Gerechten verbunden ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt ferner, ob „zerbrechen“ Personen, Werte, Institutionen oder eine moralische Selbstinterpretation bezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:MRT4","text":"Intern kohärent ist die Umkehrung des moralischen Gefahrenmodells.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Stelle liegt in der Entkopplung von moralischer Anerkennung und Zukunftsförderlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:MRT6","text":"Die Struktur hängt von der vorausgesetzten, aber nicht ausgeführten Bedeutung des „letzten Menschen“ ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:MRT7","text":"Der Übergang von Diagnose zu Zerbrechensimperativ bleibt logisch nicht vollständig vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, sofern die offene Nachfolgeordnung und die Mehrdeutigkeit des Zerbrechens nicht ergänzt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T190305192286Z_0799c6bb","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"27.","source_sha256":"57d734ee7bb5dec60ca6791d9e6b5e29cba16c47d31b4f8211e93f07618eff4f","sha256":"d81289afe9eae627cc827a62ac3fd8360a19957ad8b4b280170098dbfdaba0de","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:03:05.194039+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:AS1","text":"The problem is that the future of humanity may be threatened by an instance regarded as good and just.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:AS2","text":"The previously introduced “last human” functions as a necessary point of reference for renewed examination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:AS3","text":"The morally positively assessed figures are newly determined as the possible locus of the greatest danger.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:AS4","text":"The interrogative form transforms a moral certainty into a suspicion directed against its own bearer stratum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:AS5","text":"The diagnosis culminates not in mediation, but in the imperative to break the good and the just.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:AS6","text":"The argument moves from recalled speech through revealed danger to destructive reframing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:A1","text":"The future of humanity can be endangered by present human orders.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:A2","text":"The “last human” designates a possibility relevant to the future of humanity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:A3","text":"The greatest danger may lie with those regarded as good and just.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:A4","text":"Moral recognition does not exclude dangerousness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:A5","text":"The good and the just constitute a formation that must be broken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:A6","text":"Recognizing this danger presupposes a renewed understanding of the preceding speech.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:A7","text":"The removal of the danger is conceived as breaking, rather than as mere correction, of this formation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:NX1","text":"The danger to humanity's future lies not exclusively with the openly evil or unjust.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:NX2","text":"The good and the just are not to be equated with harmlessness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:NX3","text":"Moral self-certainty does not count as sufficient legitimation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:NX4","text":"The preceding speech concerning the “last human” must not be presupposed as settled or understood.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:NX5","text":"The problematic formation is not affirmed through cautious improvement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:NX6","text":"The demanded response does not consist in reconciliation with the good and the just.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:D1","text":"The moral opposition between good and evil is insufficient for determining the danger to the future.","refs":["CH_97E9_27CH:A1","CH_97E9_27CH:A3","CH_97E9_27CH:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:D2","text":"The bearers of moral order can at the same time be bearers of a fixation that endangers the future.","refs":["CH_97E9_27CH:A3","CH_97E9_27CH:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:D3","text":"The recollection of the “last human” is deployed to examine the moral present.","refs":["CH_97E9_27CH:A2","CH_97E9_27CH:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:D4","text":"The demanded critique is directed against a formation and not merely against individual moral misdeeds.","refs":["CH_97E9_27CH:A5","CH_97E9_27CH:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:D5","text":"Here, understanding means grasping the hidden dangerousness of what is morally recognized.","refs":["CH_97E9_27CH:A3","CH_97E9_27CH:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:SD1","text":"The question of the future is shifted from an examination of the morally deviant to an examination of the morally norm-setting.","refs":["CH_97E9_27CH:A1","CH_97E9_27CH:A3","CH_97E9_27CH:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:SD2","text":"The morally good appears as a possible reproductive form of an order hostile to the future.","refs":["CH_97E9_27CH:A1","CH_97E9_27CH:A3","CH_97E9_27CH:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:SD3","text":"The critique assumes an antinomic form: what counts as the protection of the future is marked as its greatest danger.","refs":["CH_97E9_27CH:A1","CH_97E9_27CH:A3","CH_97E9_27CH:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:SD4","text":"The understanding of the speech itself becomes a mechanism of selection between affirmed morality and the demanded destruction of its formation.","refs":["CH_97E9_27CH:A5","CH_97E9_27CH:A6","CH_97E9_27CH:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:DNX1","text":"False is the assumption that the future is primarily threatened by morally negative forces.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:DNX2","text":"False is the equation of moral goodness with a life-promoting or future-promoting effect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:DNX3","text":"False is a model in which the existing moral formation counts as the definitive standard of the human.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:DNX4","text":"False is the notion that the danger could be removed through mere moral purification within the same formation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:DNX5","text":"False is a logic of the future that treats the “last human” independently of the good and the just.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a future in which what is morally recognized may count as preserving humanity without structural examination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:SNX2","text":"Excluded is the possibility that the future can be secured through preservation of the good and the just.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:SNX3","text":"The blocked possibility is a nonmoral or trans-moral redefinition of that which opens the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:SNX4","text":"The discourse organizes itself around the absence of a positively determined successor formation after the breaking of the good and the just.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:FGS1","text":"Recalled speech concerning the “last human” → renewed demand for understanding → opening of the question of the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:FGS2","text":"Endangerment of the future → search for its bearer → shift from the morally negative to the morally positive.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:FGS3","text":"The good and the just as moral formation → decoupling of goodness and harmlessness → revelation of their possible dangerousness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:FGS4","text":"Revealed dangerousness → rejection of mere preservation or correction → imperative of breaking.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:FGS5","text":"Breaking of the formation → negative opening of the future → no positive successor order within the given text.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:AF1","text":"Unclarified understanding → reconnection to the “last human” → the future as a field of danger → displacement of danger onto the good and the just → imperative of breaking → indeterminate opening of another future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:ME1","text":"The moral map is inverted: the good and the just no longer appear merely as objects of evaluation, but as a possible cause of danger to the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:ME2","text":"The opposition good/evil loses its function as a sufficient map of historical or humanity-wide danger.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:ME3","text":"“Breaking” is classified as a structural operation against a moral formation and not as a mere sanction of individual persons.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:ME4","text":"The “last human” is transformed from an isolated future figure into an examination of present moral orders.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:ME5","text":"The future is mapped not as the automatic continuation of the good, but as the result of a break with an existing order of values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:ALT1","text":"Surface — A question addressed to the “brothers” connects the “last human” with the danger posed by the good and the just.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:ALT2","text":"Structural — A morally legitimized formation is determined as the reproductive bearer of an order that endangers the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Understanding becomes the precondition for an act of breaking directed against the moral majority.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The human is posited not as a stable moral state, but as a future endangered and to be newly opened through rupture.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from danger to the future to the critique of the good and the just.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined what precisely the “last human” designates and how it is causally connected with the good and the just.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:MRT3","text":"It further remains underdetermined whether “breaking” designates persons, values, institutions, or a moral self-interpretation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:MRT4","text":"The inversion of the moral danger model is internally coherent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:MRT5","text":"The strongest point lies in the decoupling of moral recognition and future-promotingness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:MRT6","text":"The structure depends on the presupposed but unexplicated meaning of the “last human.”","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:MRT7","text":"The transition from diagnosis to the imperative of breaking remains not fully logically mediated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_27CH:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement, provided that the open successor order and the ambiguity of breaking are not supplemented.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_27CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_27CH@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_27CH:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On Old and New Tablets","source_section_label":"27.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 27","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","27."],"original_title":"27."}],"source_title_context":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln","source_section_label":"27.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 27","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","27."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 108","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 27","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln · 27"},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH","layer":"CH","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 28","order":109,"parents":["RAW_97E9_28CH"],"revision":"CH_97E9_28CH@R001","sha256":"b9baa6fd30cda2a5ee1467fdd48b9854669a513240d435f1a8fed60bb3d95d62","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:AS1","text":"Der Sprecher konfrontiert die Angesprochenen mit dem Schrecken, der durch die Zerstörung ihrer bisherigen Werte entsteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:AS2","text":"Die Zerstörung der „Guten“ und ihrer Tafeln setzt den Menschen einer offenen, ungesicherten Zukunft aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:AS3","text":"Krankheit, Ekel und Orientierungslosigkeit erscheinen als notwendige Übergangszustände nach dem Verlust falscher Sicherheiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:AS4","text":"Die Entdeckung des Menschen erzeugt zugleich die Entdeckung der Menschen-Zukunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:AS5","text":"Aus der Krise folgt die Forderung, als geduldige Seefahrer eine unbekannte Zukunft zu steuern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:AS6","text":"Die Endbewegung führt vom Vaterland weg zum Kinder-Land und verwandelt Sehnsucht in gerichtete Zukunftsbewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:A1","text":"Die überlieferten „Guten“ haben die bisherigen Werttafeln geprägt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:A2","text":"Die Werttafeln der „Guten“ müssen zerbrochen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:A3","text":"Die bisherigen Sicherheiten beruhen auf falschen Küsten und Lügen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:A4","text":"Die etablierte Ordnung hat das Land „Mensch“ verlogen und verbogen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:A5","text":"Die Zerstörung der alten Ordnung erzeugt Schrecken, Orientierungslosigkeit, Krankheit und Ekel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:A6","text":"Die Krise ist nicht bloß ein Verlust, sondern die Einschiffung des Menschen auf eine offene See.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:A7","text":"Die Entdeckung des Menschen schließt die Entdeckung einer Menschen-Zukunft ein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:A8","text":"Die Menschen-Zukunft verlangt eine neue Haltung des Aufrechtgehens und der Geduld.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:A9","text":"Die offene Zukunft ist stürmisch und nicht durch bestehende Sicherheiten kontrollierbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:A10","text":"Zukunftsorientierung richtet das Steuer auf das Kinder-Land statt auf das Vaterland.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:A11","text":"Sehnsucht kann als Kraft einer entschlossenen Zukunftsbewegung organisiert werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:A12","text":"Die Angesprochenen sollen die Rolle von Seefahrern übernehmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:NX1","text":"Die Zukunft ist nicht durch die alten Tafeln der „Guten“ gesichert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:NX2","text":"Die überlieferten Werte sind keine verlässliche Orientierung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:NX3","text":"Die bisherigen Küsten sind keine wirklichen Ankunftsorte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:NX4","text":"Geborgenheit in der bestehenden moralischen Ordnung ist eine Lüge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:NX5","text":"Der Mensch darf nicht länger als abgeschlossene oder gesicherte Gestalt verstanden werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:NX6","text":"Die offene See ist nicht durch Ruhe, Landfestigkeit oder Stabilität charakterisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:NX7","text":"Das Vaterland ist nicht das Ziel der geschichtlichen Steuerung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:NX8","text":"Die neue Zukunft entsteht nicht durch Rückkehr zu den alten Sicherheiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:D1","text":"Das Zerbrechen der alten Tafeln macht die Krise des Menschen sichtbar.","refs":["CH_97E9_28CH:A2","CH_97E9_28CH:A4","CH_97E9_28CH:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:D2","text":"Schrecken, Ekel und Seekrankheit bezeichnen den Übergang von moralischer Geborgenheit zu existenzieller Offenheit.","refs":["CH_97E9_28CH:A3","CH_97E9_28CH:A5","CH_97E9_28CH:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:D3","text":"Die Orientierungslosigkeit ist ein Indikator dafür, dass die alten Koordinaten ihre Geltung verloren haben.","refs":["CH_97E9_28CH:A3","CH_97E9_28CH:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:D4","text":"Die Entdeckung des Menschen wird in eine Aufgabe der Zukunftsbildung überführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_28CH:A6","CH_97E9_28CH:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:D5","text":"Aufrechtgehen fungiert als Disziplin gegen die Rückkehr zu den zusammenbrechenden Sicherheiten.","refs":["CH_97E9_28CH:A8","CH_97E9_28CH:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:D6","text":"Die Angesprochenen werden von Betroffenen der Krise zu Trägern einer zukünftigen Bewegung umgebildet.","refs":["CH_97E9_28CH:A5","CH_97E9_28CH:A8","CH_97E9_28CH:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:D7","text":"Die Zukunft erhält eine räumliche Richtung, indem das Kinder-Land an die Stelle des Vaterlands tritt.","refs":["CH_97E9_28CH:A10","CH_97E9_28CH:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:SD1","text":"Die Zerstörung der alten Werte erzeugt keine wertfreie Leere, sondern eine neue normative Ausrichtung auf zukünftige Menschwerdung.","refs":["CH_97E9_28CH:A2","CH_97E9_28CH:A7","CH_97E9_28CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:SD2","text":"Krise wird als Selektionsmechanismus zwischen Rückkehr zur Sicherheit und Teilnahme an einer offenen Zukunft organisiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_28CH:A5","CH_97E9_28CH:A9","CH_97E9_28CH:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:SD3","text":"Die politische und moralische Orientierung verschiebt sich von Herkunft und Besitz zu Zeugung, Kindheit und Kommendem.","refs":["CH_97E9_28CH:A1","CH_97E9_28CH:A7","CH_97E9_28CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:SD4","text":"Der Mensch wird als Übergangsfigur konstruiert, deren angemessene Existenzform die Navigation statt die Ansiedlung ist.","refs":["CH_97E9_28CH:A6","CH_97E9_28CH:A7","CH_97E9_28CH:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:SD5","text":"Die gemeinsame Zukunft entsteht nicht aus geteilter Sicherheit, sondern aus gemeinsam ertragener Unsicherheit und gerichteter Sehnsucht.","refs":["CH_97E9_28CH:A8","CH_97E9_28CH:A9","CH_97E9_28CH:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:DNX1","text":"Das System setzt voraus, dass moralische Überlieferung keine autonome Wahrheitsquelle bildet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:DNX2","text":"Es setzt voraus, dass Sicherheit den Menschen nicht bewahrt, sondern deformiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:DNX3","text":"Es schließt aus, dass Orientierung notwendig an festen Orten, Grenzen oder Ursprüngen gewonnen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:DNX4","text":"Es disqualifiziert die Vorstellung, der Mensch habe seine gültige Gestalt bereits erreicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:DNX5","text":"Es schließt eine Zukunft aus, die lediglich eine verbesserte Wiederholung der Vergangenheit wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:DNX6","text":"Es behandelt die Rückkehr zur alten Ordnung als Reaktion auf Angst, nicht als Lösung der Krise.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:SNX1","text":"Die Möglichkeit einer endgültigen moralischen Heimat wird strukturell versperrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:SNX2","text":"Eine nicht gefährdete, nicht stürmische Zukunft steht dem Argument nicht zur Verfügung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:SNX3","text":"Das System kann den Menschen nicht als fertiges Subjekt anerkennen, ohne seine eigene Zukunftslogik aufzuheben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:SNX4","text":"Eine Versöhnung mit den alten Tafeln bleibt ausgeschlossen, weil jede Rückkehr die Entdeckung der Zukunft annullieren würde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:SNX5","text":"Die Abwesenheit eines erreichbaren Landes erzeugt die Notwendigkeit, Bewegung selbst zum Modus der Existenz zu machen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:FGS1","text":"Falsche moralische Sicherung → Zerbrechen der alten Tafeln → Freilegung der Verlogenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:FGS2","text":"Freilegung der Verlogenheit → Schrecken, Ekel und Orientierungslosigkeit → Erfahrung der offenen See.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:FGS3","text":"Offene See → Entdeckung des Menschen als Übergangsfigur → Entdeckung der Menschen-Zukunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:FGS4","text":"Menschen-Zukunft → Forderung nach Aufrechtgehen, Geduld und Seefahrertum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:FGS5","text":"Seefahrertum → Ablösung des Vaterlands durch das Kinder-Land als Zielrichtung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:FGS6","text":"Gerichtete Sehnsucht + stürmische See → gemeinsame Vorwärtsbewegung ohne Rückkehr zu alten Sicherheiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:AF1","text":"Falsche moralische Geborgenheit → Zerstörung der alten Tafeln → existentielle Seekrankheit → Einschiffung auf die offene See → Entdeckung der Menschen-Zukunft → Einübung des Seefahrertums → Steuerung auf das Kinder-Land.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:ME1","text":"„Gute“ und ihre Tafeln werden von normativen Fundamenten zu historischen Hindernissen umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:ME2","text":"Krankheit und Schrecken werden von bloßen Zuständen zu Übergangssignalen einer neuen Orientierung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:ME3","text":"Der Mensch wird vom geschützten Bewohner eines moralischen Landes zur navigierenden Übergangsfigur.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:ME4","text":"Zukunft wird nicht länger als Zielpunkt, sondern als offene See und praktische Steuerungsaufgabe kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:ME5","text":"Vaterland und Kinder-Land werden als gegenläufige Zeitordnungen unterschieden: Herkunft gegen Hervorbringung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:ME6","text":"Sehnsucht wird aus einer passiven Empfindung in eine kollektive Bewegungs- und Richtungsfunktion überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:ALT1","text":"Surface: Der Sprecher fordert die Erschrockenen auf, die Krise auszuhalten und sich als Seefahrer zu verhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:ALT2","text":"Structural: Die überlieferte Moral erzeugt falsche Sicherheiten; ihr Zusammenbruch eröffnet einen ungesicherten Übergangsraum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Der Verlust gemeinsamer Orientierung wird in eine kollektive Zukunftsdisziplin und eine neue Steuerungsrichtung umgerahmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Der Mensch ist kein fertiger Endpunkt, sondern ein zeitlich offenes Werden zwischen vergangener Herkunft und zukünftiger Hervorbringung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von der moralischen Sicherung zur Zukunftsnavigation zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie die neuen Werte des Kinder-Lands konkret bestimmt oder institutionell verwirklicht werden sollen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern die Krise als notwendige Folge der Wertzerstörung und als Zugang zur Zukunft verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung liegt zwischen falscher Sicherheit, notwendiger Desorientierung und neuer Zukunftsrichtung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:MRT5","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen der vollständigen Zurückweisung fester Sicherheiten und der normativen Forderung nach Aufrechtgehen, Geduld und gemeinsamer Steuerung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, solange die Zukunft nicht als fertiges Ziel, sondern als riskante Navigation ohne garantierte Küste behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T190325871978Z_358f9d6e","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"28.","source_sha256":"b9baa6fd30cda2a5ee1467fdd48b9854669a513240d435f1a8fed60bb3d95d62","sha256":"eddb6720d108f50289c9f8a29b00a9c1a7fa18cf6a2e273ae147a934797df2f0","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:03:25.874588+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:AS1","text":"The speaker confronts those addressed with the terror arising from the destruction of their previous values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:AS2","text":"The destruction of the “Good” and their tables exposes the human being to an open, unsecured future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:AS3","text":"Illness, disgust, and disorientation appear as necessary transitional states after the loss of false securities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:AS4","text":"The discovery of the human being simultaneously produces the discovery of the human future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:AS5","text":"From the crisis follows the demand to steer an unknown future as patient seafarers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:AS6","text":"The final movement leads away from the fatherland toward the child-land and transforms longing into directed movement toward the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:A1","text":"The inherited “Good” have shaped the previous tables of values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:A2","text":"The tables of values of the “Good” must be broken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:A3","text":"The previous securities rest upon false coasts and lies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:A4","text":"The established order has falsified and distorted the land “human being.”","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:A5","text":"The destruction of the old order produces terror, disorientation, illness, and disgust.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:A6","text":"The crisis is not merely a loss, but the embarkation of the human being upon an open sea.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:A7","text":"The discovery of the human being includes the discovery of a human future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:A8","text":"The human future demands a new posture of walking upright and patience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:A9","text":"The open future is stormy and cannot be controlled through existing securities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:A10","text":"Orientation toward the future directs the helm toward the child-land rather than the fatherland.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:A11","text":"Longing can be organized as the force of a resolute movement toward the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:A12","text":"Those addressed are to assume the role of seafarers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:NX1","text":"The future is not secured by the old tables of the “Good.”","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:NX2","text":"The inherited values are not reliable orientation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:NX3","text":"The previous coasts are not actual places of arrival.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:NX4","text":"Security within the existing moral order is a lie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:NX5","text":"The human being may no longer be understood as a completed or secured form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:NX6","text":"The open sea is not characterized by calm, firmness of land, or stability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:NX7","text":"The fatherland is not the goal of historical steering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:NX8","text":"The new future does not arise through return to the old securities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:D1","text":"The breaking of the old tables makes the crisis of the human being visible.","refs":["CH_97E9_28CH:A2","CH_97E9_28CH:A4","CH_97E9_28CH:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:D2","text":"Terror, disgust, and seasickness designate the transition from moral security to existential openness.","refs":["CH_97E9_28CH:A3","CH_97E9_28CH:A5","CH_97E9_28CH:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:D3","text":"Disorientation is an indicator that the old coordinates have lost their validity.","refs":["CH_97E9_28CH:A3","CH_97E9_28CH:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:D4","text":"The discovery of the human being is transformed into a task of forming the future.","refs":["CH_97E9_28CH:A6","CH_97E9_28CH:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:D5","text":"Walking upright functions as a discipline against return to the collapsing securities.","refs":["CH_97E9_28CH:A8","CH_97E9_28CH:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:D6","text":"Those addressed are transformed from persons affected by the crisis into bearers of a future movement.","refs":["CH_97E9_28CH:A5","CH_97E9_28CH:A8","CH_97E9_28CH:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:D7","text":"The future receives a spatial direction in that the child-land takes the place of the fatherland.","refs":["CH_97E9_28CH:A10","CH_97E9_28CH:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:SD1","text":"The destruction of the old values produces not a value-free void, but a new normative orientation toward future becoming-human.","refs":["CH_97E9_28CH:A2","CH_97E9_28CH:A7","CH_97E9_28CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:SD2","text":"Crisis is organized as a mechanism of selection between return to security and participation in an open future.","refs":["CH_97E9_28CH:A5","CH_97E9_28CH:A9","CH_97E9_28CH:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:SD3","text":"Political and moral orientation shifts from origin and possession to procreation, childhood, and what is to come.","refs":["CH_97E9_28CH:A1","CH_97E9_28CH:A7","CH_97E9_28CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:SD4","text":"The human being is constructed as a transitional figure whose appropriate form of existence is navigation rather than settlement.","refs":["CH_97E9_28CH:A6","CH_97E9_28CH:A7","CH_97E9_28CH:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:SD5","text":"The shared future arises not from shared security, but from jointly endured insecurity and directed longing.","refs":["CH_97E9_28CH:A8","CH_97E9_28CH:A9","CH_97E9_28CH:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:DNX1","text":"The system presupposes that moral tradition constitutes no autonomous source of truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:DNX2","text":"It presupposes that security does not preserve the human being, but deforms it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:DNX3","text":"It excludes that orientation is necessarily gained from fixed places, boundaries, or origins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:DNX4","text":"It disqualifies the notion that the human being has already attained its valid form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:DNX5","text":"It excludes a future that would merely be an improved repetition of the past.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:DNX6","text":"It treats the return to the old order as a reaction to fear, not as a solution to the crisis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:SNX1","text":"The possibility of a final moral homeland is structurally blocked.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:SNX2","text":"A future that is neither endangered nor stormy is unavailable to the argument.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:SNX3","text":"The system cannot recognize the human being as a finished subject without suspending its own logic of the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:SNX4","text":"A reconciliation with the old tables remains excluded, because every return would annul the discovery of the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:SNX5","text":"The absence of an attainable land generates the necessity of making movement itself the mode of existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:FGS1","text":"False moral security → breaking of the old tables → exposure of falsity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:FGS2","text":"Exposure of falsity → terror, disgust, and disorientation → experience of the open sea.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:FGS3","text":"Open sea → discovery of the human being as a transitional figure → discovery of the human future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:FGS4","text":"Human future → demand for walking upright, patience, and seafaring.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:FGS5","text":"Seafaring → replacement of the fatherland by the child-land as the direction of the goal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:FGS6","text":"Directed longing + stormy sea → shared forward movement without return to old securities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:AF1","text":"False moral security → destruction of the old tables → existential seasickness → embarkation upon the open sea → discovery of the human future → practice of seafaring → steering toward the child-land.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:ME1","text":"The “Good” and their tables are remapped from normative foundations into historical obstacles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:ME2","text":"Illness and terror are reclassified from mere states into transitional signals of a new orientation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:ME3","text":"The human being is transformed from the protected inhabitant of a moral land into a navigating transitional figure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:ME4","text":"The future is no longer mapped as an endpoint, but as an open sea and a practical task of steering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:ME5","text":"Fatherland and child-land are distinguished as opposing temporal orders: origin against production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:ME6","text":"Longing is transformed from a passive feeling into a collective function of movement and direction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:ALT1","text":"Surface: The speaker calls upon those who are terrified to endure the crisis and to conduct themselves as seafarers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:ALT2","text":"Structural: Inherited morality produces false securities; its collapse opens an unsecured transitional space.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: The loss of shared orientation is reframed into a collective discipline of the future and a new direction of steering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: The human being is not a finished endpoint, but a temporally open becoming between past origin and future production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from moral security to navigation of the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined how the new values of the child-land are to be concretely determined or institutionally realized.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent, provided that the crisis is understood as a necessary consequence of the destruction of values and as access to the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:MRT4","text":"The strongest connection lies between false security, necessary disorientation, and a new direction toward the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:MRT5","text":"A tension remains between the complete rejection of fixed securities and the normative demand for walking upright, patience, and collective steering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_28CH:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement so long as the future is treated not as a finished goal, but as risky navigation without a guaranteed coast.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_28CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_28CH@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_28CH:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On Old and New Tablets","source_section_label":"28.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 28","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","28."],"original_title":"28."}],"source_title_context":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln","source_section_label":"28.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 28","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","28."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 109","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 28","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln · 28"},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH","layer":"CH","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 29","order":110,"parents":["RAW_97E9_29CH"],"revision":"CH_97E9_29CH@R001","sha256":"6d888b0f17ac9e40534dd71c70fce97697a7c7b9574fe5b328f31748ba9a8105","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:AS1","text":"Eine scheinbare Verwandtschaft zwischen Weichem und Hartem wird als unzureichende Bestimmung des schöpferischen Subjekts zurückgewiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:AS2","text":"Die Weichheit der Angeredeten wird als Nachgeben, Leugnung und Mangel an Schicksalsfähigkeit diagnostiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:AS3","text":"Sieg setzt Unerbittlichkeit und die Fähigkeit voraus, ein Schicksal zu werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:AS4","text":"Schöpfung setzt die Fähigkeit voraus, zu blitzen, zu scheiden, zu zerschneiden und Widerstand zu erzeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:AS5","text":"Dauerhafte Schöpfung wird als harte Einschreibung eines Willens in die Zeit bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:AS6","text":"Die Diagnose mündet in die imperative Neurahmung der Angeredeten als künftig Hartwerdende.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:A1","text":"Verwandtschaft begründet keine Gleichheit der Form oder Funktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:A2","text":"Weichheit ist Nachgeben gegenüber Widerstand und kein schöpferischer Vorzug.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:A3","text":"Leugnung und Verleugnung zeigen einen Mangel an entschlossenem Willen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:A4","text":"Schicksalsfähigkeit erfordert Unerbittlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:A5","text":"Sieg erfordert Härte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:A6","text":"Schöpfung erfordert die Fähigkeit zur Trennung und Zerschneidung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:A7","text":"Die Schaffenden sind hart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:A8","text":"Dauer besitzt schöpferischen Wert, wenn ein Wille sich über Jahrtausende erhält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:A9","text":"Einschreibung in Wachs, Erz und den Willen der Jahrtausende ist ein Modell schöpferischer Wirksamkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:A10","text":"Das Edelste ist durch äußerste Härte bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:A11","text":"Die Angeredeten können durch eine neue Tafel normativ neu geformt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:NX1","text":"Weichheit wird als unzureichende Grundlage des Sieges ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:NX2","text":"Nachgeben wird als unvereinbar mit schöpferischer Wirksamkeit ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:NX3","text":"Leugnung und Verleugnung werden als Formen innerer Unentschlossenheit ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:NX4","text":"Ein Blick ohne Schicksalscharakter wird als unzureichend ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:NX5","text":"Ungeteilte Verwandtschaft wird als Rechtfertigung gemeinsamer Leistungsfähigkeit ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:NX6","text":"Schöpfung ohne Scheidung, Zerschneidung und Widerstand wird ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:NX7","text":"Ein Wille ohne dauerhafte Einschreibung wird als unzureichend ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:D1","text":"Die Angeredeten können nicht siegen, solange ihre Weichheit als Nachgeben fortbesteht.","refs":["CH_97E9_29CH:A2","CH_97E9_29CH:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:D2","text":"Die Angeredeten können kein Schicksal werden, solange ihnen Unerbittlichkeit fehlt.","refs":["CH_97E9_29CH:A3","CH_97E9_29CH:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:D3","text":"Schöpferische Tätigkeit verlangt nicht bloß Hervorbringung, sondern aktive Trennung und Zerschneidung.","refs":["CH_97E9_29CH:A6","CH_97E9_29CH:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:D4","text":"Ein schöpferischer Wille muss sich gegen die Vergänglichkeit durchsetzen.","refs":["CH_97E9_29CH:A8","CH_97E9_29CH:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:D5","text":"Härte wird vom instrumentellen Mittel zur Bedingung des Höchsten.","refs":["CH_97E9_29CH:A5","CH_97E9_29CH:A7","CH_97E9_29CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:D6","text":"Die neue Tafel fungiert als normatives Instrument zur Herstellung der geforderten Härte.","refs":["CH_97E9_29CH:A9","CH_97E9_29CH:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:SD1","text":"Das Subjekt wird nicht durch Herkunft oder Verwandtschaft, sondern durch seine Fähigkeit zur harten, dauerhaften Willenseinschreibung bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_29CH:A1","CH_97E9_29CH:A7","CH_97E9_29CH:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:SD2","text":"Sieg und Schöpfung bilden eine gemeinsame Logik der Überwindung, Trennung und Formgebung.","refs":["CH_97E9_29CH:A5","CH_97E9_29CH:A6","CH_97E9_29CH:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:SD3","text":"Zukunft wird als Material behandelt, das durch einen gegenwärtigen Willen dauerhaft geprägt werden soll.","refs":["CH_97E9_29CH:A8","CH_97E9_29CH:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:SD4","text":"Die Anrede der Brüder erzeugt eine gemeinschaftliche Norm, deren Zugehörigkeit erst durch Härte erfüllt wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_29CH:A1","CH_97E9_29CH:A10","CH_97E9_29CH:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:SD5","text":"Die imperative Forderung nach Härte verwandelt eine Diagnose individueller Schwäche in ein kollektiv verbindliches Programm.","refs":["CH_97E9_29CH:A3","CH_97E9_29CH:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass Sanftheit, Empfänglichkeit oder Nachgiebigkeit eigenständige Formen schöpferischer Kraft sein können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:DNX2","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass Schicksal empfangen oder erlitten werden kann, ohne selbst als unerbittliche Form aufzutreten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:DNX3","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass Schöpfung ohne Gewalt der Auswahl, Trennung und Ausschließung möglich ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:DNX4","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass zeitliche Dauer durch Bewahrung, Pflege oder Anpassung statt durch harte Einschreibung entsteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:DNX5","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass gemeinsame Herkunft eine gemeinsame Rangordnung oder schöpferische Fähigkeit garantiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:SNX1","text":"Abwesend bleibt ein Modell der Schöpfung, das nicht auf Härte, Durchsetzung und Verletzung beruht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:SNX2","text":"Abwesend bleibt eine nicht-dominierende Form von Gemeinschaft, in der Brüderlichkeit nicht durch Selbstüberwindung in Härte bewiesen werden muss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:SNX3","text":"Abwesend bleibt eine Zeitordnung, in der Zukunft nicht als formbares Material eines gegenwärtigen Willens behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:SNX4","text":"Abwesend bleibt eine Alternative zur Gleichsetzung des Edelsten mit dem Härtesten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:SNX5","text":"Abwesend bleibt die Möglichkeit, dass Verweigerung oder Nachgiebigkeit produktive statt defizitäre Kräfte sein könnten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:FGS1","text":"Verwandtschaftsbehauptung → Unterscheidung von Herkunft und Fähigkeit → Ausschluss der bloßen Verwandtschaft als Begründung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:FGS2","text":"Weichheit → Nachgeben, Leugnen und fehlendes Schicksal → Unfähigkeit zum Sieg.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:FGS3","text":"Unerbittlichkeit → Selbstwerdung als Schicksal → Möglichkeit des Sieges.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:FGS4","text":"Härte → Scheidung und Zerschneidung → Möglichkeit der Schöpfung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:FGS5","text":"Schöpfung → Einschreibung in Wachs, Erz und Jahrtausende → Dauerhafte Willensmacht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:FGS6","text":"Dauerhafte Willensmacht → Vorrang des Harten vor dem Weichen → Neubestimmung des Edelsten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:FGS7","text":"Neubestimmung des Edelsten → neue Tafel → kollektiver Imperativ des Hartwerdens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:AF1","text":"Behauptete Nahverwandtschaft → Aufhebung der Verwandtschaft als ausreichendes Kriterium → Diagnose der Weichheit → Unfähigkeit zu Sieg und Schöpfung → Härte als Bedingung der Willenseinschreibung → normative Neuschreibung der Brüder → Imperativ des Hartwerdens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:ME1","text":"Verwandtschaft wird von einer ontologischen Gleichheitsbehauptung zu einer Prüfung der schöpferischen Leistungsfähigkeit umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:ME2","text":"Weichheit wird von einer möglichen Tugend zu einem strukturellen Defizit der Handlungsmacht umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:ME3","text":"Schöpfung wird nicht als Hervorbringung allein, sondern als Trennung, Zerschneidung und dauerhafte Formgebung sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:ME4","text":"Zeit wird als formbares Widerstandsmaterial des Willens kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:ME5","text":"Gemeinschaft wird als hierarchisch-normatives Verhältnis neu gezeichnet, in dem Zugehörigkeit Härte voraussetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:ME6","text":"Das Edelste wird aus dem Bereich des bloß Wertvollen in den Bereich maximaler Widerstandsfähigkeit verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:ALT1","text":"Surface: Eine Anrede an „meine Brüder“ fordert die Überwindung von Weichheit und Nachgiebigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:ALT2","text":"Structural: Sieg und Schöpfung werden durch Härte, Trennung, Zerschneidung und dauerhafte Einschreibung vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Eine gemeinschaftliche Identität wird durch eine gemeinsame Disziplin der Unerbittlichkeit erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Wirklichkeit erscheint als widerständiges Material, in das ein harter Wille sich über Jahrtausende einschreibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:ALT5","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Ein Subjekt gilt nicht als gegeben, sondern als durch Härte und Schicksalsfähigkeit herzustellende Form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um den Übergang von Verwandtschaft über Weichheitsdiagnose zur Forderung nach Härte zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:MRT2","text":"Die zentrale Bewegungslogik von Sieg, Schöpfung und dauerhafter Einschreibung bleibt erhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob Härte als physische, psychische, ethische oder politische Eigenschaft zu verstehen ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:MRT4","text":"Ebenfalls unterbestimmt bleibt, wie die geforderte Härte praktisch erzeugt werden soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:MRT5","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Härte als einheitliche Bedingung von Sieg, Schöpfung und Wert gesetzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:MRT6","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung besteht zwischen Trennung, Formgebung und dauerhafter Willenseinschreibung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:MRT7","text":"Die größte Spannung liegt in der Verbindung von brüderlicher Gemeinschaft mit einer Norm, die Zugehörigkeit durch Ausschluss des Weichen bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, solange die Gleichsetzung von Härte, Edelheit und schöpferischer Dauer nicht abgeschwächt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T190346738282Z_328927dd","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"29.","source_sha256":"6d888b0f17ac9e40534dd71c70fce97697a7c7b9574fe5b328f31748ba9a8105","sha256":"b602b418f9114ef485e3bf8ef16c4139e7be8364e2cdd9e59fc68d0a143ad091","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:03:46.740944+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:AS1","text":"An apparent kinship between the soft and the hard is rejected as an insufficient determination of the creative subject.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:AS2","text":"The softness of those addressed is diagnosed as yielding, denial, and a lack of capacity for fate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:AS3","text":"Victory presupposes relentlessness and the capacity to become a fate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:AS4","text":"Creation presupposes the capacity to flash, to separate, to cut apart, and to generate resistance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:AS5","text":"Enduring creation is determined as the hard inscription of a will into time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:AS6","text":"The diagnosis culminates in the imperative reframing of those addressed as those who will become hard.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:A1","text":"Kinship does not establish equality of form or function.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:A2","text":"Softness is yielding before resistance and not a creative advantage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:A3","text":"Denial and disavowal reveal a lack of resolute will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:A4","text":"Capacity for fate requires relentlessness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:A5","text":"Victory requires hardness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:A6","text":"Creation requires the capacity for separation and cutting apart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:A7","text":"Those who create are hard.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:A8","text":"Duration possesses creative value when a will endures over millennia.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:A9","text":"Inscription into wax, bronze, and the will of millennia is a model of creative efficacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:A10","text":"The noblest is determined by extreme hardness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:A11","text":"Those addressed can be normatively reshaped by means of a new tablet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:NX1","text":"Softness is excluded as an insufficient basis for victory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:NX2","text":"Yielding is excluded as incompatible with creative efficacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:NX3","text":"Denial and disavowal are excluded as forms of inner irresolution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:NX4","text":"A gaze without the character of fate is excluded as insufficient.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:NX5","text":"Undivided kinship is excluded as a justification for shared capability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:NX6","text":"Creation without separation, cutting apart, and resistance is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:NX7","text":"A will without enduring inscription is excluded as insufficient.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:D1","text":"Those addressed cannot be victorious so long as their softness persists as yielding.","refs":["CH_97E9_29CH:A2","CH_97E9_29CH:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:D2","text":"Those addressed cannot become a fate so long as they lack relentlessness.","refs":["CH_97E9_29CH:A3","CH_97E9_29CH:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:D3","text":"Creative activity demands not merely production, but active separation and cutting apart.","refs":["CH_97E9_29CH:A6","CH_97E9_29CH:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:D4","text":"A creative will must prevail against transience.","refs":["CH_97E9_29CH:A8","CH_97E9_29CH:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:D5","text":"Hardness is transformed from an instrumental means into a condition of the highest.","refs":["CH_97E9_29CH:A5","CH_97E9_29CH:A7","CH_97E9_29CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:D6","text":"The new tablet functions as a normative instrument for producing the demanded hardness.","refs":["CH_97E9_29CH:A9","CH_97E9_29CH:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:SD1","text":"The subject is determined not by origin or kinship, but by its capacity for hard, enduring inscription of will.","refs":["CH_97E9_29CH:A1","CH_97E9_29CH:A7","CH_97E9_29CH:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:SD2","text":"Victory and creation form a shared logic of overcoming, separation, and shaping.","refs":["CH_97E9_29CH:A5","CH_97E9_29CH:A6","CH_97E9_29CH:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:SD3","text":"The future is treated as material that is to be enduringly impressed by a present will.","refs":["CH_97E9_29CH:A8","CH_97E9_29CH:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:SD4","text":"The address to the brothers generates a communal norm whose membership is fulfilled only through hardness.","refs":["CH_97E9_29CH:A1","CH_97E9_29CH:A10","CH_97E9_29CH:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:SD5","text":"The imperative demand for hardness transforms a diagnosis of individual weakness into a collectively binding program.","refs":["CH_97E9_29CH:A3","CH_97E9_29CH:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:DNX1","text":"The system excludes the possibility that gentleness, receptivity, or yieldingness can be autonomous forms of creative force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:DNX2","text":"The system excludes the possibility that fate can be received or suffered without itself appearing as a relentless form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:DNX3","text":"The system excludes the possibility that creation is possible without the violence of selection, separation, and exclusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:DNX4","text":"The system excludes the possibility that temporal duration arises through preservation, care, or adaptation rather than through hard inscription.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:DNX5","text":"The system excludes the possibility that common origin guarantees a common rank order or creative capacity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:SNX1","text":"Absent is a model of creation that is not based on hardness, assertion, and injury.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:SNX2","text":"Absent is a non-dominating form of community in which brotherhood need not be proven through self-overcoming into hardness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:SNX3","text":"Absent is a temporal order in which the future is not treated as malleable material of a present will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:SNX4","text":"Absent is an alternative to the equation of the noblest with the hardest.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:SNX5","text":"Absent is the possibility that refusal or yieldingness could be productive rather than deficient forces.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:FGS1","text":"Claim of kinship → distinction between origin and capacity → exclusion of mere kinship as justification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:FGS2","text":"Softness → yielding, denying, and lacking fate → incapacity for victory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:FGS3","text":"Relentlessness → self-becoming as fate → possibility of victory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:FGS4","text":"Hardness → separation and cutting apart → possibility of creation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:FGS5","text":"Creation → inscription into wax, bronze, and millennia → enduring power of will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:FGS6","text":"Enduring power of will → primacy of the hard over the soft → redefinition of the noblest.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:FGS7","text":"Redefinition of the noblest → new tablet → collective imperative of becoming hard.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:AF1","text":"Claimed close kinship → suspension of kinship as a sufficient criterion → diagnosis of softness → incapacity for victory and creation → hardness as a condition of the inscription of will → normative rewriting of the brothers → imperative of becoming hard.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:ME1","text":"Kinship is remapped from an ontological claim of equality into a test of creative capability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:ME2","text":"Softness is reclassified from a possible virtue into a structural deficit of agency.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:ME3","text":"Creation becomes visible not as production alone, but as separation, cutting apart, and enduring shaping.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:ME4","text":"Time is mapped as malleable material of resistance for the will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:ME5","text":"Community is redrawn as a hierarchical-normative relation in which membership presupposes hardness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:ME6","text":"The noblest is displaced from the realm of the merely valuable into the realm of maximal resistance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:ALT1","text":"Surface: An address to “my brothers” demands the overcoming of softness and yieldingness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:ALT2","text":"Structural: Victory and creation are mediated through hardness, separation, cutting apart, and enduring inscription.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: A communal identity is produced through a shared discipline of relentlessness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Reality appears as resistant material into which a hard will inscribes itself over millennia.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:ALT5","text":"Ontological/Temporal: A subject is regarded not as given, but as a form to be produced through hardness and capacity for fate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the transition from kinship through the diagnosis of softness to the demand for hardness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:MRT2","text":"The central logic of movement of victory, creation, and enduring inscription is preserved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:MRT3","text":"It remains underdetermined whether hardness is to be understood as a physical, psychological, ethical, or political quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:MRT4","text":"It likewise remains underdetermined how the demanded hardness is to be practically produced.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:MRT5","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as hardness is posited as the unified condition of victory, creation, and value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:MRT6","text":"The strongest connection lies between separation, shaping, and enduring inscription of will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:MRT7","text":"The greatest tension lies in the connection of brotherly community with a norm that determines membership through exclusion of the soft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_29CH:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement so long as the equation of hardness, nobility, and creative duration is not weakened.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_29CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_29CH@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_29CH:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On Old and New Tablets","source_section_label":"29.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 29","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","29."],"original_title":"29."}],"source_title_context":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln","source_section_label":"29.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 29","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","29."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 110","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 29","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln · 29"},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH","layer":"CH","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 30","order":111,"parents":["RAW_97E9_30CH"],"revision":"CH_97E9_30CH@R001","sha256":"d04273edabc73691fb1b3c855767b45a44b89e8d779232685f8dacf27d3950f9","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:AS1","text":"Der Wille soll die Not nicht durch beliebige Entscheidung, sondern durch eine eigene Notwendigkeit wenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:AS2","text":"Kleine Siege gefährden den Willen, weil der Sieg selbst zur Niederlage in Trunkenheit, Verdunkelung und Standverlust werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:AS3","text":"Der Wille muss für ein großes Schicksal und einen letzten Sieg aufgespart werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:AS4","text":"Diese Aufsparung führt über Reifung zur Bereitschaft für den verborgenen eigenen Willen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:AS5","text":"Im großen Sieg fällt die höchste Form des Willens mit einer unerbittlichen, vernichtenden Sonnenmacht zusammen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:A1","text":"Der Wille kann die Not wenden, indem er selbst als Notwendigkeit wirksam wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:A2","text":"Das eigene Schicksal erscheint als eine im Subjekt wirkende und es übersteigende Schickung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:A3","text":"Kleine Siege bedrohen die Erhaltung und Steigerung des Willens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:A4","text":"Der Sieg kann den Sieger überwältigen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:A5","text":"Der Wille besitzt eine letzte Größe, die nicht vorzeitig verbraucht werden darf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:A6","text":"Ein großes Schicksal verlangt zeitliche Aufsparung und Vorbereitung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:A7","text":"Reife besteht in der Bereitschaft zu sich selbst und zum verborgensten eigenen Willen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:A8","text":"Der eigene Wille ist auf ein außerhalb seiner liegendes Ziel ausgerichtet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:A9","text":"Die höchste Reife ist mittägliche, glühende und spannungsgeladene Bereitschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:A10","text":"Der große Sieg vollendet sich als unerbittlicher Wille zur Vernichtung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:NX1","text":"Der maßgebliche Wille ist nicht mit kleinen Siegen zufrieden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:NX2","text":"Der Sieg ist nicht ohne Weiteres ein Beweis gelingender Selbstbehauptung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:NX3","text":"Der Wille darf seine letzte Größe nicht vorzeitig einsetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:NX4","text":"Reife ist nicht gegenwärtige Sättigung oder abgeschlossene Erfüllung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:NX5","text":"Der eigene Wille ist nicht vollständig gegenwärtig und durchsichtig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:NX6","text":"Das große Schicksal ist nicht durch bloße Verfügung des Subjekts verfügbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:NX7","text":"Der große Sieg ist nicht bloße Behauptung, Besitznahme oder Bestandserhaltung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:D1","text":"Der Wille muss sich gegen unmittelbare Erfolgserlebnisse abschirmen, um seine höchste Wirksamkeit zu bewahren.","refs":["CH_97E9_30CH:A3","CH_97E9_30CH:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:D2","text":"Der Sieg wird zu einer Prüfung des Siegers, weil sein Vollzug den Willen verdunkeln und den Stand des Siegers aufheben kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_30CH:A4","CH_97E9_30CH:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:D3","text":"Die verlangte Verzögerung ist keine Passivität, sondern eine aktive Konservierung und Verdichtung des Willens.","refs":["CH_97E9_30CH:A5","CH_97E9_30CH:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:D4","text":"Selbstwerdung setzt voraus, dass der Wille sich auf einen noch nicht eingelösten eigenen Zielpunkt hin spannt.","refs":["CH_97E9_30CH:A7","CH_97E9_30CH:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:D5","text":"Das Ziel des Willens wird erst in der extremen Bereitschaft sichtbar, nicht in einer gegenwärtigen Identität.","refs":["CH_97E9_30CH:A7","CH_97E9_30CH:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:D6","text":"Der höchste Sieg überschreitet die Logik des bloßen Erfolgs und nimmt die Form einer vernichtenden Selbstüberschreitung an.","refs":["CH_97E9_30CH:A9","CH_97E9_30CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:SD1","text":"Das System verwandelt den Willen von einem Instrument zur Erlangung von Zielen in eine zeitlich gestufte Macht der Selbstformung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:SD2","text":"Erfolg wird strukturell ambivalent: Er bestätigt den Willen nur dann, wenn er ihn nicht erschöpft, sondern auf einen größeren Vollzug hin offenhält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:SD3","text":"Das Schicksal ist weder bloße äußere Determination noch freie Setzung, sondern die Verschränkung eines inneren Willens mit einer ihn übersteigenden Notwendigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:SD4","text":"Die höchste Form der Selbstwerdung wird als Bereitschaft zu einer Macht bestimmt, die das erreichte Selbst zugleich vernichtet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:DNX1","text":"Der Wille darf nicht als spontane Wahlmacht verstanden werden, die ihre Bestimmung jederzeit unmittelbar hervorbringt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:DNX2","text":"Das Schicksal darf nicht als bloß äußerer Zwang vom inneren Willen getrennt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:DNX3","text":"Entwicklung darf nicht als lineare Anhäufung kleiner Erfolge organisiert sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:DNX4","text":"Selbstwerdung darf nicht auf Selbsterhaltung, Identitätsstabilität oder unversehrte Kontinuität hinauslaufen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:DNX5","text":"Der Sieg darf nicht als abschließender Zustand gedacht werden, in dem keine weitere Spannung erforderlich ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:DNX6","text":"Das Ziel des Willens darf nicht vollständig vom gegenwärtigen Bewusstsein vorweggenommen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Welt, in der der Wille durch sofortige Verwirklichung zu sich selbst kommt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Versöhnung, in der großer Sieg, Selbsterhaltung und Unversehrtheit zugleich bestehen bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein letzter Besitz des eigenen Wesens; der Wille bleibt auf einen Zielpunkt hin geöffnet, der ihn im Vollzug überschreitet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:SNX4","text":"Die verborgene Unmöglichkeit des Systems ist ein Sieg ohne Selbstverlust.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:FGS1","text":"Notwendigkeit im Willen + Schicksal als innere und übersteigende Schickung → Umdeutung des Willens als schicksalsfähige Macht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:FGS2","text":"Kleine Siege + Gefahr des Überwältigtwerdens → Zurückhaltung der letzten Willensgröße.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:FGS3","text":"Aufsparung + zeitliche Reifung → Bereitschaft zu sich selbst und zum verborgenen Willen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:FGS4","text":"Bereitschaft + gerichtete Spannung auf ein Ziel → Pfeil-Stern-Struktur des Willens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:FGS5","text":"Zielgerichtete Reife + mittägliche Intensität → Sonnenförmiger Wille.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:FGS6","text":"Sonnenförmiger Wille + großer Sieg → vernichtende Selbstüberschreitung als höchste Vollendung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:AF1","text":"Not als zu wendende Notwendigkeit → Wille als Schickung → Ausschluss kleiner Siege → Aufsparung der letzten Größe → Reifung zur Selbstbereitschaft → Zielspannung auf den Stern → großer Sieg als vernichtender Sonnen-Wille.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:ME1","text":"Sieg wird von einem Endzustand in eine gefährliche Übergangsform der Willenssteigerung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:ME2","text":"Schicksal wird von äußerem Verhängnis in eine Verbindung von innerem Willen und überindividueller Notwendigkeit umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:ME3","text":"Warten und Aufsparung werden als produktive Verdichtung statt als Mangel an Handlung sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:ME4","text":"Selbstwerdung wird von Identitätsbehauptung auf gespannte Bereitschaft und mögliche Selbstvernichtung verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:ME5","text":"Wille und Vernichtung erscheinen nicht mehr als Gegensätze, sondern als aufeinander zulaufende Stufen derselben Vollendung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Sprecher fleht den eigenen Willen um Bewahrung vor kleinen Siegen und um Aufsparung für einen großen Sieg an.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:ALT2","text":"Structural — Der Wille wird durch Verzögerung, Reifung, Zielspannung und die Gefahr des Sieges organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Das Argument ersetzt unmittelbare Erfolgsorientierung durch eine Strategie der Konservierung, Konzentration und späteren Totalisierung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Das Subjekt wird als werdende, von einem verborgenen Ziel her gespannte Macht bestimmt; Zeit erscheint als Reifungs- und Aufsparungsstruktur.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von Wille, Notwendigkeit, Aufsparung, Reifung und großem Sieg zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob der große Sieg ein tatsächliches Ereignis, ein innerer Zustand oder eine symbolische Endfigur ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:MRT3","text":"Intern kohärent ist die Umwertung des Sieges in eine Gefahr und der Verzögerung in eine Steigerungsbedingung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung besteht zwischen der Kritik kleiner Siege und der Forderung nach zeitlicher Willenskonzentration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:MRT5","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen dem Gebot, den Willen zu bewahren, und seiner Bestimmung zur Vernichtung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung besteht zwischen dem verborgenen eigenen Willen und seiner Ausrichtung auf einen außerhalb seiner liegenden Stern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, sofern der große Sieg nicht als stabile Besitzposition, sondern als selbstüberschreitender Vollzug gelesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T191212668926Z_8897f36f","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"30.","source_sha256":"d04273edabc73691fb1b3c855767b45a44b89e8d779232685f8dacf27d3950f9","sha256":"e985389dc4efdb0a1b94ee35c48f60a6e55993fb1729e3f913eb21a56bbc0153","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:12:12.670353+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:AS1","text":"The will is to turn distress not through arbitrary decision, but through a necessity of its own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:AS2","text":"Small victories endanger the will, because victory itself can become defeat in intoxication, obscuration, and loss of standing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:AS3","text":"The will must be reserved for a great destiny and a final victory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:AS4","text":"This reservation leads, by way of maturation, to readiness for the hidden will of one's own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:AS5","text":"In the great victory, the highest form of the will coincides with an implacable, annihilating solar power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:A1","text":"The will can turn distress by itself becoming effective as necessity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:A2","text":"One's own destiny appears as a dispensation effective within the subject and surpassing it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:A3","text":"Small victories threaten the preservation and intensification of the will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:A4","text":"Victory can overwhelm the victor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:A5","text":"The will possesses an ultimate magnitude that must not be expended prematurely.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:A6","text":"A great destiny demands temporal reservation and preparation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:A7","text":"Maturity consists in readiness for oneself and for the most hidden will of one's own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:A8","text":"One's own will is directed toward a goal lying outside it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:A9","text":"The highest maturity is noonday, glowing, and tension-charged readiness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:A10","text":"The great victory consummates itself as an implacable will to annihilation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:NX1","text":"The decisive will is not satisfied with small victories.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:NX2","text":"Victory is not straightforwardly proof of successful self-assertion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:NX3","text":"The will must not deploy its ultimate magnitude prematurely.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:NX4","text":"Maturity is not present satiation or completed fulfillment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:NX5","text":"One's own will is not fully present and transparent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:NX6","text":"The great destiny is not available through the subject's mere disposal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:NX7","text":"The great victory is not mere assertion, appropriation, or preservation of existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:D1","text":"The will must shield itself against immediate experiences of success in order to preserve its highest efficacy.","refs":["CH_97E9_30CH:A3","CH_97E9_30CH:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:D2","text":"Victory becomes a test of the victor because its enactment can obscure the will and annul the victor's standing.","refs":["CH_97E9_30CH:A4","CH_97E9_30CH:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:D3","text":"The required delay is not passivity, but an active preservation and concentration of the will.","refs":["CH_97E9_30CH:A5","CH_97E9_30CH:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:D4","text":"Becoming oneself presupposes that the will strains toward a goal-point of its own not yet realized.","refs":["CH_97E9_30CH:A7","CH_97E9_30CH:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:D5","text":"The goal of the will becomes visible only in extreme readiness, not in a present identity.","refs":["CH_97E9_30CH:A7","CH_97E9_30CH:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:D6","text":"The highest victory surpasses the logic of mere success and assumes the form of an annihilating self-transcendence.","refs":["CH_97E9_30CH:A9","CH_97E9_30CH:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:SD1","text":"The system transforms the will from an instrument for attaining goals into a temporally graduated power of self-formation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:SD2","text":"Success becomes structurally ambivalent: it confirms the will only when it does not exhaust it, but keeps it open toward a greater enactment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:SD3","text":"Destiny is neither mere external determination nor free positing, but the interweaving of an inner will with a necessity that surpasses it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:SD4","text":"The highest form of becoming oneself is determined as readiness for a power that at once annihilates the attained self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:DNX1","text":"The will must not be understood as a spontaneous power of choice that immediately brings forth its determination at any time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:DNX2","text":"Destiny must not be separated from the inner will as mere external compulsion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:DNX3","text":"Development must not be organized as a linear accumulation of small successes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:DNX4","text":"Becoming oneself must not culminate in self-preservation, identity stability, or intact continuity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:DNX5","text":"Victory must not be conceived as a final state in which no further tension is required.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:DNX6","text":"The goal of the will must not be fully anticipated by present consciousness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a world in which the will comes to itself through immediate realization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:SNX2","text":"Excluded is a reconciliation in which great victory, self-preservation, and intactness remain together.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:SNX3","text":"Excluded is a final possession of one's own essence; the will remains open toward a goal-point that surpasses it in enactment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:SNX4","text":"The hidden impossibility of the system is a victory without loss of self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:FGS1","text":"Necessity in the will + destiny as inner and surpassing dispensation → reinterpretation of the will as a power capable of destiny.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:FGS2","text":"Small victories + danger of being overwhelmed → restraint of the ultimate magnitude of the will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:FGS3","text":"Reservation + temporal maturation → readiness for oneself and for the hidden will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:FGS4","text":"Readiness + directed tension toward a goal → arrow-star structure of the will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:FGS5","text":"Goal-directed maturity + noonday intensity → solar will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:FGS6","text":"Solar will + great victory → annihilating self-transcendence as highest consummation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:AF1","text":"Distress as necessity to be turned → will as dispensation → exclusion of small victories → reservation of the ultimate magnitude → maturation into self-readiness → goal-tension toward the star → great victory as annihilating solar will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:ME1","text":"Victory is remapped from an end state into a dangerous transitional form of intensification of the will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:ME2","text":"Destiny is reclassified from external doom into a connection between inner will and supra-individual necessity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:ME3","text":"Waiting and reservation become visible as productive concentration rather than as a lack of action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:ME4","text":"Becoming oneself is shifted from assertion of identity to tense readiness and possible self-annihilation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:ME5","text":"Will and annihilation no longer appear as opposites, but as converging stages of the same consummation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:ALT1","text":"Surface — The speaker implores the will of his own for preservation from small victories and for reservation for a great victory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:ALT2","text":"Structural — The will is organized through delay, maturation, goal-tension, and the danger of victory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The argument replaces immediate orientation toward success with a strategy of preservation, concentration, and later totalization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The subject is determined as a becoming power strained from the direction of a hidden goal; time appears as a structure of maturation and reservation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement of will, necessity, reservation, maturation, and great victory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether the great victory is an actual event, an inner state, or a symbolic final figure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:MRT3","text":"Internally coherent is the revaluation of victory into a danger and of delay into a condition of intensification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:MRT4","text":"The strongest connection exists between the critique of small victories and the demand for temporal concentration of the will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:MRT5","text":"A tension remains between the injunction to preserve the will and its determination toward annihilation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:MRT6","text":"A further tension exists between the hidden will of one's own and its orientation toward a star lying outside it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_30CH:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement insofar as the great victory is read not as a stable position of possession, but as a self-transcending enactment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_30CH:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_30CH@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_30CH:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On Old and New Tablets","source_section_label":"30.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 30","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","30."],"original_title":"30."}],"source_title_context":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln","source_section_label":"30.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"On Old and New Tablets · 30","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","On Old and New Tablets","30."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 111","title":"On Old and New Tablets · 30","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Von alten und neuen Tafeln · 30"},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9","layer":"CH","title":"The Convalescent · 1","order":112,"parents":["RAW_97E9_1C_9"],"revision":"CH_97E9_1C_9@R001","sha256":"68b1380c019958d7d6dc3721b7481db7d072ff6048f98798be0b9ec1b59ab3dd","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:AS1","text":"Eine latente Tiefe tritt als „abgründlicher Gedanke“ an die Schwelle des Erwachens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:AS2","text":"Zarathustra bestimmt seine Stimme als instrumentelle Macht des Weckens, Hörbarmachens und Sichtbarwerdens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:AS3","text":"Der Gedanke soll nicht bloß erwachen, sondern dauerhaft wach bleiben und aus dem Röcheln ins Reden übergehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:AS4","text":"Zarathustra legitimiert den Ruf durch seine Stellung als Fürsprecher des Lebens, des Leidens und des Kreises.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:AS5","text":"Die geweckte Tiefe tritt tatsächlich hervor und macht sich als Rede des Abgrunds bemerkbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:AS6","text":"Die Hervorkehrung der letzten Tiefe erzeugt keine abschließende Versöhnung, sondern Ekel und Zurückweichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:A1","text":"Ein abgründiger Gedanke ist in Zarathustras Tiefe latent vorhanden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:A2","text":"Zarathustras Stimme kann das Latente zum Erwachen bringen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:A3","text":"Erwachen verlangt die Lösung der Fessel des Hörens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:A4","text":"Erwachen umfasst die Überwindung von Schlaf, Blödheit und Blindheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:A5","text":"Das Erwachte soll dauerhaft wach bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:A6","text":"Das Erwachte soll reden, statt bloß zu röcheln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:A7","text":"Zarathustra spricht als Gottloser und als Fürsprecher des Lebens, des Leidens und des Kreises.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:A8","text":"Die letzte Tiefe kann ans Licht gestülpt werden und als Abgrund sprechen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:A9","text":"Die Erscheinung des abgründigen Gedankens ist von Ekel begleitet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:NX1","text":"Der abgründige Gedanke darf nicht im Schlaf verbleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:NX2","text":"Erwachen darf nicht mit Blödheit oder Blindheit verbunden bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:NX3","text":"Das Erwachte darf nicht im Röcheln verharren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:NX4","text":"Die verlangte Wachheit ist kein erneutes Weiterschlafen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:NX5","text":"Die Stimme ist nicht auf bloß akustisches Hören begrenzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:NX6","text":"Zarathustras Fürsprache gründet nicht in einer Anrufung Gottes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:NX7","text":"Die ans Licht gebrachte Tiefe erscheint nicht als unmittelbar begehrenswerte oder harmonische Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:D1","text":"Der Ruf verwandelt eine verborgene Tiefe in einen ansprechbaren und antwortfähigen Gegenstand.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_9:A1","CH_97E9_1C_9:A2","CH_97E9_1C_9:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:D2","text":"Erwachen bezeichnet eine gleichzeitige Öffnung von Hören, Sehen und Sprechen.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_9:A3","CH_97E9_1C_9:A4","CH_97E9_1C_9:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:D3","text":"Die Anrufung zielt nicht auf einen vorübergehenden Zustand, sondern auf dauerhafte Wachheit.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_9:A2","CH_97E9_1C_9:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:D4","text":"Die Stimme fungiert zugleich als Weckruf, Wahrnehmungsmedium und Heilmittel.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_9:A2","CH_97E9_1C_9:A3","CH_97E9_1C_9:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:D5","text":"Der abgründige Gedanke wird durch seine Rede als wirkliche innere Instanz markiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_9:A6","CH_97E9_1C_9:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:D6","text":"Die Hervorbringung des Gedankens führt unmittelbar in eine affektive Krise.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_9:A8","CH_97E9_1C_9:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:SD1","text":"Innere Tiefe wird nicht durch Kontemplation, sondern durch eine aggressive Operation der Anrufung und Entbergung aktualisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:SD2","text":"Das Erwachen organisiert eine Totalisierung der Wahrnehmung, in der Hören, Sehen, Sprechen und Wachsein ineinandergreifen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:SD3","text":"Zarathustras Autorität entsteht aus der paradoxen Verbindung von gottloser Anrufung und fürsprechender Bejahung von Leben, Leiden und Kreis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:SD4","text":"Die erfolgreiche Hervorbringung des tiefsten Gedankens hebt den Gegensatz zwischen Erweckung und Abwehr nicht auf, sondern produziert ihn erst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:SD5","text":"Die letzte Tiefe erscheint als etwas, das zur Sprache gebracht werden muss, dessen Erscheinung aber nicht ohne Weiteres ertragen oder angeeignet werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt eine Tiefe aus, die als passiver, stummer und unberührbarer Innenrest bestehen bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:DNX2","text":"Es schließt ein Erwachen aus, das nur partielle Wahrnehmung erzeugt und nicht in Sprache übergeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:DNX3","text":"Es schließt eine dauerhafte Stabilisierung des Erwachten als beruhigte Identität aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:DNX4","text":"Es schließt die Annahme aus, dass Sichtbarwerden bereits Zustimmung, Heilung oder Versöhnung bedeutet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:DNX5","text":"Es schließt eine Trennung von Lebensbejahung und Leidensbejahung aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:SNX1","text":"Die Möglichkeit einer harmonischen Einverleibung des Abgrunds bleibt versperrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:SNX2","text":"Der Text organisiert sich um die Abwesenheit einer Form, in der die letzte Tiefe zugleich vollständig offenbar und affektiv problemlos bewohnbar wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:SNX3","text":"Die Anrufung kann den Abgrund verfügbar machen, aber nicht seine Fremdheit beseitigen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:SNX4","text":"Eine endgültige Auflösung des Verhältnisses zwischen Rufendem und Gerufenem wird nicht bereitgestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:FGS1","text":"Verborgene Tiefe → Anrufung durch die Stimme → Lösung von Hören, Sehen und Schlaf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:FGS2","text":"Wahrnehmungsöffnung → dauerhafte Wachheit → Übergang vom Röcheln zur Rede.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:FGS3","text":"Gottlose Fürsprache für Leben, Leiden und Kreis → Legitimation der Anrufung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:FGS4","text":"Hervorkehrung der letzten Tiefe → Selbstmanifestation des Abgrunds als Stimme.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:FGS5","text":"Selbstmanifestation → affektive Überforderung → Ekel und Rückzug.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:FGS6","text":"Erfolgreiche Entbergung → keine Synthese, sondern Stabilisierung einer offenen Spannung zwischen Hervorrufung und Abwehr.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:AF1","text":"Latenter Abgrund → Weckruf → umfassende Wahrnehmungsöffnung → dauerhafte Wachheit → sprachliche Manifestation → Hervorkehrung der letzten Tiefe → Ekel und Zurückweichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:ME1","text":"Das Innere wird von einem passiven Verborgenen zu einer anrufbaren, antwortenden Instanz umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:ME2","text":"Erwachen wird von einem psychischen Zustand zu einer gekoppelten Operation von Hören, Sehen, Sprechen und Dauerwachheit umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:ME3","text":"Die Stimme wird nicht mehr nur als Ausdruck, sondern als produzierendes Medium von Wahrnehmung und Entbergung bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:ME4","text":"Ekel wird nicht als Gegenbeweis der Anrufung, sondern als Folge ihrer erfolgreichen Durchführung kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:ME5","text":"Fürsprache für Leben und Leiden wird als gemeinsame Legitimationsstruktur eines nicht-theistischen Wahrheitszugangs positioniert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:ALT1","text":"Surface: Ein Sprecher ruft einen schlafenden, abgründigen Gedanken zum Erwachen, Sprechen und Erscheinen auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:ALT2","text":"Structural: Stimme, Wahrnehmung und Sprache bilden eine operative Kette, durch die verborgene Tiefe manifest wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Der Text ersetzt passive Innerlichkeit durch eine aggressive Strategie der Anrufung und macht die resultierende Abwehr zum Bestandteil des Vorgangs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Tiefe wird als latente, zeitlich erweckbare und dauerhaft wachzuhaltende Realität behandelt; ihre Offenbarung bleibt affektiv nicht stabilisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den Übergang von latenter Tiefe zu angerufener Rede zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:MRT2","text":"Die Struktur bewahrt den Wechsel von Weckimperativ, Manifestation und Ekel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, was der „abgründliche Gedanke“ inhaltlich jenseits seiner Tiefe und Kreisförmigkeit ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:MRT4","text":"Ebenfalls offen bleibt, ob der Ekel dem Gedanken selbst, seiner Sichtbarkeit oder der Reaktion Zarathustras gilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:MRT5","text":"Intern kohärent ist die Sequenz als Entbergungsmaschine; spannungsvoll bleibt die Verbindung von Heilmittelbehauptung und Ekelreaktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, sofern sie die Hervorbringung des Abgrunds nicht mit seiner Aneignung gleichsetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T185510543746Z_005733f3","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"1.","source_sha256":"68b1380c019958d7d6dc3721b7481db7d072ff6048f98798be0b9ec1b59ab3dd","sha256":"5dd73be4dace7b0f6d8ad50392788197b21db19f90a043ef710a80573f0430d3","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T18:55:10.544669+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:AS1","text":"A latent depth emerges at the threshold of awakening as an “abyssal thought”.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:AS2","text":"Zarathustra determines his voice as an instrumental power of awakening, making audible, and becoming visible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:AS3","text":"The thought is not merely to awaken, but to remain awake permanently and to pass from rattling to speaking.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:AS4","text":"Zarathustra legitimates the call through his position as advocate of life, suffering, and the circle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:AS5","text":"The awakened depth actually emerges and makes itself noticeable as the speech of the abyss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:AS6","text":"The bringing-forth of the ultimate depth produces no final reconciliation, but rather disgust and recoil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:A1","text":"An abyssal thought is latently present in Zarathustra's depth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:A2","text":"Zarathustra's voice can bring the latent to awakening.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:A3","text":"Awakening requires the release of the fetter of hearing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:A4","text":"Awakening comprises the overcoming of sleep, stupidity, and blindness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:A5","text":"What has awakened is to remain awake permanently.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:A6","text":"What has awakened is to speak rather than merely rattle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:A7","text":"Zarathustra speaks as one godless and as advocate of life, suffering, and the circle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:A8","text":"The ultimate depth can be turned inside out into the light and speak as abyss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:A9","text":"The appearance of the abyssal thought is accompanied by disgust.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:NX1","text":"The abyssal thought must not remain in sleep.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:NX2","text":"Awakening must not remain bound up with stupidity or blindness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:NX3","text":"What has awakened must not persist in rattling.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:NX4","text":"The wakefulness demanded is not a renewed continuation of sleep.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:NX5","text":"The voice is not limited to merely acoustic hearing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:NX6","text":"Zarathustra's advocacy is not grounded in an invocation of God.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:NX7","text":"The depth brought to light does not appear as an immediately desirable or harmonious unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:D1","text":"The call transforms a hidden depth into an object that can be addressed and can respond.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_9:A1","CH_97E9_1C_9:A2","CH_97E9_1C_9:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:D2","text":"Awakening designates a simultaneous opening of hearing, seeing, and speaking.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_9:A3","CH_97E9_1C_9:A4","CH_97E9_1C_9:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:D3","text":"The invocation aims not at a temporary state, but at permanent wakefulness.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_9:A2","CH_97E9_1C_9:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:D4","text":"The voice functions simultaneously as wake-up call, medium of perception, and remedy.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_9:A2","CH_97E9_1C_9:A3","CH_97E9_1C_9:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:D5","text":"Through its speech, the abyssal thought is marked as a real inner instance.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_9:A6","CH_97E9_1C_9:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:D6","text":"The production of the thought leads directly into an affective crisis.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_9:A8","CH_97E9_1C_9:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:SD1","text":"Inner depth is actualized not through contemplation, but through an aggressive operation of invocation and unconcealment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:SD2","text":"Awakening organizes a totalization of perception in which hearing, seeing, speaking, and being awake interlock.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:SD3","text":"Zarathustra's authority arises from the paradoxical connection between godless invocation and advocative affirmation of life, suffering, and circle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:SD4","text":"The successful production of the deepest thought does not abolish the opposition between awakening and defense, but first produces it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:SD5","text":"The ultimate depth appears as something that must be brought to speech, but whose appearance cannot straightforwardly be endured or appropriated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:DNX1","text":"The system excludes a depth that remains as a passive, mute, and untouchable inner remainder.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:DNX2","text":"It excludes an awakening that produces only partial perception and does not pass into language.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:DNX3","text":"It excludes a permanent stabilization of what has awakened as a pacified identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:DNX4","text":"It excludes the assumption that becoming visible already means assent, healing, or reconciliation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:DNX5","text":"It excludes a separation of the affirmation of life from the affirmation of suffering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:SNX1","text":"The possibility of a harmonious incorporation of the abyss remains barred.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:SNX2","text":"The text organizes itself around the absence of a form in which the ultimate depth would be at once fully revealed and affectively unproblematically habitable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:SNX3","text":"Invocation can make the abyss available, but cannot eliminate its strangeness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:SNX4","text":"No final resolution of the relation between caller and called is provided.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:FGS1","text":"Hidden depth → invocation through the voice → release of hearing, seeing, and sleep.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:FGS2","text":"Opening of perception → permanent wakefulness → transition from rattling to speech.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:FGS3","text":"Godless advocacy for life, suffering, and circle → legitimation of invocation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:FGS4","text":"Bringing-forth of the ultimate depth → self-manifestation of the abyss as voice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:FGS5","text":"Self-manifestation → affective overload → disgust and withdrawal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:FGS6","text":"Successful unconcealment → no synthesis, but stabilization of an open tension between evocation and defense.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:AF1","text":"Latent abyss → wake-up call → comprehensive opening of perception → permanent wakefulness → linguistic manifestation → bringing-forth of the ultimate depth → disgust and recoil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:ME1","text":"The inner is remapped from a passive hiddenness into an addressable, responding instance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:ME2","text":"Awakening is reclassified from a psychic state into a coupled operation of hearing, seeing, speaking, and enduring wakefulness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:ME3","text":"The voice is determined no longer merely as expression, but as a productive medium of perception and unconcealment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:ME4","text":"Disgust is mapped not as counterevidence to invocation, but as a consequence of its successful execution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:ME5","text":"Advocacy for life and suffering is positioned as the shared legitimating structure of a non-theistic access to truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:ALT1","text":"Surface: A speaker calls a sleeping, abyssal thought to awaken, speak, and appear.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:ALT2","text":"Structural: Voice, perception, and language form an operative chain through which hidden depth becomes manifest.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: The text replaces passive inwardness with an aggressive strategy of invocation and makes the resulting defense a component of the process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Depth is treated as a latent reality that can be awakened temporally and must be kept permanently awake; its revelation remains affectively unstabilized.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the transition from latent depth to invoked speech.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:MRT2","text":"The structure preserves the alternation of awakening imperative, manifestation, and disgust.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:MRT3","text":"What remains underdetermined is what the “abyssal thought” is in content beyond its depth and circularity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:MRT4","text":"It likewise remains open whether the disgust concerns the thought itself, its visibility, or Zarathustra's reaction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:MRT5","text":"The sequence is internally coherent as a machine of unconcealment; the connection between the claim of remedy and the reaction of disgust remains tension-filled.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1C_9:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement insofar as it does not equate the production of the abyss with its appropriation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_1C_9@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_1C_9:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"The Convalescent","source_section_label":"1.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"The Convalescent · 1","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","The Convalescent","1."],"original_title":"1."}],"source_title_context":"Der Genesende","source_section_label":"1.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"The Convalescent · 1","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","The Convalescent","1."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 112","title":"The Convalescent · 1","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Der Genesende · 1"},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9","layer":"CH","title":"The Convalescent · 2","order":113,"parents":["RAW_97E9_2C_9"],"revision":"CH_97E9_2C_9@R001","sha256":"b6523ca579ab19837c2e9cc97e0277e9caf7f50d7d5a00727ad5bb104f89b842","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:AS1","text":"Der Zusammenbruch entsteht aus der Vorstellung, dass der kleine Mensch ebenso ewig wiederkehrt wie alles andere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0037","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:AS2","text":"Sprache und Klang machen die unaufhebbare Getrenntheit der Seelen bewohnbar, indem sie sie ästhetisch überbrücken und zugleich vergessen lassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:AS3","text":"Die moralische Anklage des Menschen wird durch eine Diagnose seiner Lust an Grausamkeit, Selbstanklage und Leiden ersetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:AS4","text":"Das Böse wird nicht als zu eliminierender Rest, sondern als notwendiges Material einer Steigerung des Menschen bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:AS5","text":"Die Genesung verlangt keine Widerlegung der Wiederkunft, sondern eine neue künstlerische Form, die ihre Last tragen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0048","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:AS6","text":"Die Tiere schließen die Genesung in eine Lehre, ein Schicksal und einen Untergang ein; Zarathustras Schweigen unterbricht ihre abschließende Festlegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0063","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:A1","text":"Jede Seele ist von jeder anderen Seele durch eine eigene Welt getrennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:A2","text":"Worte und Töne fungieren als scheinbare Brücken über eine unaufhebbare Trennung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:A3","text":"Ein Außen jenseits des Selbst ist nicht verfügbar; Sprache ermöglicht das Vergessen dieser Unverfügbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:A4","text":"Die Tiere formulieren die ewige Wiederkunft als vollständige Wiederkehr desselben im Größten und Kleinsten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0051","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0052","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0053","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:A5","text":"Zarathustras Ekel richtet sich auf die ewige Wiederkehr des kleinen Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0037","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:A6","text":"Der Mensch gewinnt Lust aus dem Leiden anderer und aus der eigenen moralisierten Selbstquälung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:A7","text":"Das Böseste des Menschen ist für sein Bestes notwendig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:A8","text":"Die Krankheit entsteht nicht aus der bloßen Bosheit des Menschen, sondern aus der Geringfügigkeit seines Besten und Bösesten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:A9","text":"Genesung verlangt neue Lieder und neue Instrumente; das Lied des Genesenden darf nicht bloß Wiederholung sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0043","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0045","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0046","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0047","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:A10","text":"Die Tiere bestimmen Zarathustra als Lehrer der ewigen Wiederkunft und dieses Lehren als Gefahr seines Schicksals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0049","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0050","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:A11","text":"Die Tiere verbinden den Tod des Einzelnen mit der Wiederkehr des kausalen Knotens, der ihn erneut hervorbringt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0056","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0057","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:A12","text":"Zarathustra bestätigt die Lehre der Tiere nicht ausdrücklich, weil er am Ende schweigt und sich mit seiner Seele unterredet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0063","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:NX1","text":"Die Welt ist nicht als ein dem Selbst äußerlich gegenüberstehender Bereich verfügbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:NX2","text":"Sprache ist keine wahrheitsgetreue Übertragung zwischen getrennten Seelen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:NX3","text":"Nähe zwischen Ähnlichen hebt ihre Trennung nicht auf, sondern verschärft das Problem ihrer Überbrückung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:NX4","text":"Ewige Wiederkunft ist keine Wiederkehr zu einem neuen, besseren oder nur ähnlichen Leben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0058","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0059","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:NX5","text":"Leiden, Mitleid, Buße und Selbstanklage sind nicht von Lust und Grausamkeit gereinigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:NX6","text":"Die Anklage des Menschen ist nicht selbst schon Überwindung des Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:NX7","text":"Das Böse ist nicht als bloßer moralischer Defekt aus dem Menschen auszuscheiden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:NX8","text":"Die Wiederkunft darf nicht als fertiges Leierlied oder als tröstende Formel behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0045","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0047","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:NX9","text":"Der Tod garantiert keine persönliche Fortdauer einer unsterblichen Seele.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0056","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0057","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:D1","text":"Die bewohnbare Welt entsteht nicht durch unmittelbaren Zugang zum Anderen, sondern durch die ästhetische Vermittlung von Namen, Tönen und Vergessen.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_9:A1","CH_97E9_2C_9:A2","CH_97E9_2C_9:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:D2","text":"Die Täuschung der Sprache ist nicht bloß Mangel, sondern die Bedingung dafür, dass Getrenntheit nicht unerträglich bleibt.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_9:A1","CH_97E9_2C_9:A2","CH_97E9_2C_9:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:D3","text":"Die Wiederkunft wird zur existenziellen Krankheit, weil sie die Unzulänglichkeit des Menschen nicht vorübergehend, sondern unendlich reproduziert.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_9:A4","CH_97E9_2C_9:A5","CH_97E9_2C_9:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:D4","text":"Die Kritik des Menschen verlangt keine moralische Reinigung, sondern eine Steigerung seiner Fähigkeit zum Guten und Bösen.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_9:A6","CH_97E9_2C_9:A7","CH_97E9_2C_9:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:D5","text":"Die Wiederkunft kann nur bejaht werden, wenn ihre Wiederholung nicht in die Wiederholung einer unveränderten Ausdrucksform übergeht.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_9:A4","CH_97E9_2C_9:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0045","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0047","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:D6","text":"Genesung besteht in der Umformung einer Last in Gesang, nicht in der Beseitigung dessen, was die Last verursacht.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_9:A5","CH_97E9_2C_9:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0048","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:D7","text":"Die Lehre bindet ihren Lehrer an dasjenige Wiederkehren, das er verkündet, und macht sein Verkündigen zur Selbstgefährdung.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_9:A4","CH_97E9_2C_9:A10","CH_97E9_2C_9:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0061","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0062","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:D8","text":"Die Schlussstille verhindert, dass die kosmologische Fassung der Wiederkunft als Zarathustras endgültige, ungebrochene Position gilt.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_9:A10","CH_97E9_2C_9:A11","CH_97E9_2C_9:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0061","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0063","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:SD1","text":"Das System ersetzt eine Ontologie äußerer Gegenstände durch eine Ontologie vermittelter Beziehungen, in der Sprache zugleich Täuschung und Weltbedingung ist.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_9:A1","CH_97E9_2C_9:A2","CH_97E9_2C_9:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:SD2","text":"Die Wiederkunft fungiert als Selektionsdruck auf jede menschliche Gestalt: Unerträglich wird nicht das Dasein überhaupt, sondern dessen unendliche Reproduktion im kleinen Maßstab.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_9:A4","CH_97E9_2C_9:A5","CH_97E9_2C_9:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:SD3","text":"Die Umwertung des Bösen hebt moralische Begrenzung nicht einfach auf, sondern verlagert die Frage auf das Maß, in dem destruktive Kraft schöpferisch transformiert werden kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_9:A6","CH_97E9_2C_9:A7","CH_97E9_2C_9:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:SD4","text":"Die Lehre bedroht ihre eigene Vermittlung, weil sie als Wiederholungssatz gerade jene Leierhaftigkeit erzeugen kann, die neue Lieder überwinden sollen.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_9:A4","CH_97E9_2C_9:A9","CH_97E9_2C_9:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0045","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0047","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:SD5","text":"Das Schicksal des Lehrers besteht darin, dass seine Selbstüberwindung nicht außerhalb der Wiederkunft steht, sondern als wiederkehrender Untergang in sie eingeschlossen wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_9:A4","CH_97E9_2C_9:A10","CH_97E9_2C_9:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0059","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0061","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0062","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:DNX1","text":"Ein transparenter Zugang von Seele zu Seele muss falsch sein, damit Sprache als notwendige Scheinbrücke fungieren kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:DNX2","text":"Eine transzendente Außeninstanz muss ausgeschlossen sein, damit das Fehlen eines Außen nicht bloß erkenntnistheoretische Begrenzung bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:DNX3","text":"Eine lineare Zeit des Fortschritts muss ausgeschlossen sein, damit die Wiederkehr des Kleinen zur entscheidenden Bedrohung wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0052","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:DNX4","text":"Eine Erlösung durch moralische Reinheit muss ausgeschlossen sein, damit das Böseste als Bedingung des Besten gelten kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:DNX5","text":"Eine vom Leib unabhängige personale Unsterblichkeit muss ausgeschlossen sein, damit Wiederkehr kausal statt seelisch gedacht wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0056","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0057","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:DNX6","text":"Eine abschließende Identität zwischen Zarathustra und der Lehre seiner Tiere muss ausgeschlossen sein, damit sein Schweigen strukturelle Bedeutung besitzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0049","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0063","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:SNX1","text":"Ein endgültiger Standort außerhalb der Wiederkunft ist nicht verfügbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0059","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:SNX2","text":"Eine Bejahung der Wiederkunft ohne sprachliche und künstlerische Vermittlung ist nicht verfügbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0048","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:SNX3","text":"Ein bereits verwirklichter großer Mensch ist nicht verfügbar; sichtbar ist nur die Wiederkehr seiner unzureichenden Gestalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0038","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0039","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:SNX4","text":"Eine Genesung, die nicht erneut durch dieselbe Lehre gefährdet werden kann, ist nicht verfügbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:FGS1","text":"Getrenntheit der Seelen → Sprachschein und Klang → Vergessen des fehlenden Außen → bewohnbare Welt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:FGS2","text":"Ewige Wiederkehr → Wiederkehr des kleinen Menschen → Überdruss und Ekel → Zusammenbruch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:FGS3","text":"Diagnose der Grausamkeitslust → Entwertung moralischer Anklage → Böses als Kraftmaterial → Forderung nach Steigerung des Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:FGS4","text":"Krankheit durch Wiederkehr → Bedarf neuer Lieder → ästhetische Selbstheilung → vorläufige Tragbarkeit des Schicksals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0048","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:FGS5","text":"Tierische Kosmologie → Lehrerrolle → kausale Wiedererschaffung → Untergang als Vollzug der Lehre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0049","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0057","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0061","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0062","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:FGS6","text":"Tierische Schließung → Zarathustras Schweigen → Aussetzung endgültiger doctrinärer Bestätigung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0062","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0063","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:AF1","text":"Zusammenbruch an der Wiederkehr des kleinen Menschen → Sprach- und Klangtheorie der vermittelten Welt → Diagnose von Grausamkeit und moralischer Lust → Umwertung des Bösen als Steigerungsmaterial → neue Lieder als Genesungsform → tierische Fixierung auf Wiederkunftslehre und Untergang → schweigende Offenhaltung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0048","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0049","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0061","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0063","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:ME1","text":"Sprache wird von einem Instrument der Mitteilung zu einer produktiven Täuschung umklassifiziert, ohne die keine gemeinsame Welt bewohnbar wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:ME2","text":"Ewige Wiederkunft wird von einer bloßen kosmologischen Behauptung zu einer Prüfung des menschlichen Maßes umgeordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0053","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:ME3","text":"Grausamkeit, Mitleid, Buße und Lebensanklage erscheinen als zusammenhängende Ökonomie von Lust und Selbstverletzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:ME4","text":"Das Böse wird nicht dem Guten entgegengesetzt, sondern als dessen mögliche Kraftquelle kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:ME5","text":"Genesung wird nicht als Rückkehr zur Normalität, sondern als Produktion einer neuen Ausdrucksform bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0048","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:ME6","text":"Lehre und Lehrer werden als rekursiv verschränkt sichtbar: Der Verkündiger ist dem Inhalt seiner Verkündigung unterworfen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0061","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:ALT1","text":"Surface — Zarathustra erwacht nach einer Krankheit, spricht mit seinen Tieren und verweigert am Ende eine Antwort.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0063","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:ALT2","text":"Structural — Sprache vermittelt unvereinbare Seelenwelten, während moralische Praxis Lust an Grausamkeit institutionell und psychisch verdeckt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Überwindung des Menschen wird von Anklage und Reinigung auf Steigerung, künstlerische Umformung und Tragfähigkeit verlagert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0048","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Es gibt kein verfügbares Außen und keinen linearen Fortschritt, sondern Wiederkehr, Kausalverflechtung und die Reproduktion desselben Lebens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0052","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0057","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0058","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den Übergang von Getrenntheit über Sprachschein, Wiederkehrsekel und Umwertung bis zur unvollendeten Genesung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0048","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0063","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt der ontologische Status der Wiederkunft, weil ihre vollständig ausgearbeitete Fassung den Tieren zugeschrieben wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0049","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0051","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0052","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0053","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob Zarathustras Schweigen Zustimmung, Erschöpfung, innere Prüfung oder Abstandnahme bedeutet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:MRT4","text":"Die Struktur ist kohärent, sofern die Differenz zwischen Zarathustras Erfahrung und der doktrinären Artikulation seiner Tiere erhalten bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0063","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung liegt in der Kopplung von Wiederkehr, anthropologischem Maßproblem und ästhetischer Genesung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0048","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:MRT6","text":"Die zentrale Bruchlinie liegt zwischen der Forderung nach neuen Liedern und der Wiederholung einer Lehre, die selbst zur Leier werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0045","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0047","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die Argumentbewegung nur, wenn der Schluss nicht als bestätigte Doktrin, sondern als suspendierte Schließung behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0049","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0061","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0063","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T190747380988Z_45824de0","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"2.","source_sha256":"b6523ca579ab19837c2e9cc97e0277e9caf7f50d7d5a00727ad5bb104f89b842","sha256":"308fd9199a72082475f8e0fb25b1e9b6ae9b4d53923174d8a305e2a2732b354b","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:07:47.383174+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:AS1","text":"The collapse arises from the idea that the little man returns eternally just like everything else.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0037","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:AS2","text":"Language and sound make the irrevocable separateness of souls inhabitable by aesthetically bridging it and at the same time making it forgotten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:AS3","text":"The moral indictment of the human being is replaced by a diagnosis of his pleasure in cruelty, self-accusation, and suffering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:AS4","text":"Evil is determined not as a residue to be eliminated, but as necessary material for an enhancement of the human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:AS5","text":"Recovery requires no refutation of recurrence, but a new artistic form capable of bearing its burden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0048","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:AS6","text":"The animals enclose recovery within a doctrine, a destiny, and a downfall; Zarathustra's silence interrupts their conclusive determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0063","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:A1","text":"Every soul is separated from every other soul by a world of its own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:A2","text":"Words and tones function as apparent bridges across an irrevocable separation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:A3","text":"An outside beyond the self is unavailable; language enables the forgetting of this unavailability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:A4","text":"The animals formulate eternal recurrence as the complete return of the same in the greatest and the smallest.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0051","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0052","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0053","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:A5","text":"Zarathustra's disgust is directed at the eternal return of the little man.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0037","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:A6","text":"The human being derives pleasure from the suffering of others and from his own moralized self-torment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:A7","text":"What is most evil in the human being is necessary for what is best in him.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:A8","text":"The illness arises not from the mere wickedness of the human being, but from the insignificance of his best and worst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:A9","text":"Recovery requires new songs and new instruments; the song of the convalescent must not be mere repetition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0043","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0045","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0046","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0047","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:A10","text":"The animals determine Zarathustra as the teacher of eternal recurrence and this teaching as the danger of his destiny.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0049","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0050","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:A11","text":"The animals connect the death of the individual with the return of the causal knot that brings him forth anew.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0056","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0057","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:A12","text":"Zarathustra does not explicitly affirm the doctrine of the animals because in the end he falls silent and converses with his soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0063","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:NX1","text":"The world is not available as a domain externally confronting the self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:NX2","text":"Language is not a faithful transmission between separated souls.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:NX3","text":"Proximity between similar beings does not abolish their separation, but intensifies the problem of bridging it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:NX4","text":"Eternal recurrence is not a return to a new, better, or merely similar life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0058","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0059","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:NX5","text":"Suffering, compassion, penance, and self-accusation are not purified of pleasure and cruelty.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:NX6","text":"The indictment of the human being is not itself already the overcoming of the human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:NX7","text":"Evil is not to be excised from the human being as a mere moral defect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:NX8","text":"Recurrence must not be treated as a finished hurdy-gurdy song or as a consoling formula.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0045","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0047","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:NX9","text":"Death guarantees no personal continuance of an immortal soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0056","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0057","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:D1","text":"The inhabitable world arises not through immediate access to the other, but through the aesthetic mediation of names, tones, and forgetting.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_9:A1","CH_97E9_2C_9:A2","CH_97E9_2C_9:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:D2","text":"The deception of language is not merely a deficiency, but the condition under which separateness does not remain unbearable.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_9:A1","CH_97E9_2C_9:A2","CH_97E9_2C_9:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:D3","text":"Recurrence becomes an existential illness because it reproduces the inadequacy of the human being not temporarily, but infinitely.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_9:A4","CH_97E9_2C_9:A5","CH_97E9_2C_9:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:D4","text":"The critique of the human being requires no moral purification, but an enhancement of his capacity for good and evil.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_9:A6","CH_97E9_2C_9:A7","CH_97E9_2C_9:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:D5","text":"Recurrence can be affirmed only if its repetition does not turn into the repetition of an unchanged form of expression.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_9:A4","CH_97E9_2C_9:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0045","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0047","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:D6","text":"Recovery consists in transforming a burden into song, not in eliminating what causes the burden.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_9:A5","CH_97E9_2C_9:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0048","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:D7","text":"The doctrine binds its teacher to that which returns and which he proclaims, and makes his proclamation self-endangerment.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_9:A4","CH_97E9_2C_9:A10","CH_97E9_2C_9:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0061","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0062","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:D8","text":"The final silence prevents the cosmological version of recurrence from counting as Zarathustra's definitive, unbroken position.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_9:A10","CH_97E9_2C_9:A11","CH_97E9_2C_9:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0061","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0063","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:SD1","text":"The system replaces an ontology of external objects with an ontology of mediated relations, in which language is at once deception and condition of the world.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_9:A1","CH_97E9_2C_9:A2","CH_97E9_2C_9:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:SD2","text":"Recurrence functions as selective pressure upon every human form: what becomes unbearable is not existence as such, but its infinite reproduction on a small scale.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_9:A4","CH_97E9_2C_9:A5","CH_97E9_2C_9:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:SD3","text":"The revaluation of evil does not simply abolish moral limitation, but shifts the question to the degree in which destructive force can be creatively transformed.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_9:A6","CH_97E9_2C_9:A7","CH_97E9_2C_9:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:SD4","text":"The doctrine threatens its own mediation because, as a proposition of repetition, it can produce precisely the hurdy-gurdy quality that new songs are meant to overcome.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_9:A4","CH_97E9_2C_9:A9","CH_97E9_2C_9:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0045","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0047","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:SD5","text":"The destiny of the teacher consists in the fact that his self-overcoming does not stand outside recurrence, but is enclosed within it as recurring downfall.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_9:A4","CH_97E9_2C_9:A10","CH_97E9_2C_9:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0059","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0061","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0062","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:DNX1","text":"A transparent access from soul to soul must be false in order that language may function as a necessary apparent bridge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:DNX2","text":"A transcendent external instance must be excluded so that the absence of an outside does not remain merely an epistemological limitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:DNX3","text":"A linear time of progress must be excluded so that the return of the small becomes the decisive threat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0052","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:DNX4","text":"A redemption through moral purity must be excluded so that what is most evil may count as the condition of what is best.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:DNX5","text":"A personal immortality independent of the body must be excluded so that recurrence is thought causally rather than spiritually.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0056","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0057","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:DNX6","text":"A conclusive identity between Zarathustra and the doctrine of his animals must be excluded so that his silence possesses structural significance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0049","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0063","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:SNX1","text":"A final standpoint outside recurrence is unavailable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0059","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:SNX2","text":"An affirmation of recurrence without linguistic and artistic mediation is unavailable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0048","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:SNX3","text":"An already realized great human being is unavailable; visible is only the recurrence of his inadequate forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0038","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0039","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:SNX4","text":"A recovery that cannot again be endangered by the same doctrine is unavailable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:FGS1","text":"Separateness of souls → linguistic appearance and sound → forgetting of the absent outside → inhabitable world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:FGS2","text":"Eternal recurrence → return of the little man → satiety and disgust → collapse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:FGS3","text":"Diagnosis of the pleasure in cruelty → devaluation of moral indictment → evil as force-material → demand for the enhancement of the human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:FGS4","text":"Illness through recurrence → need for new songs → aesthetic self-healing → provisional bearability of destiny.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0048","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:FGS5","text":"Animal cosmology → teacher role → causal re-creation → downfall as enactment of the doctrine.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0049","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0057","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0061","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0062","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:FGS6","text":"Animal closure → Zarathustra's silence → suspension of definitive doctrinal affirmation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0062","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0063","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:AF1","text":"Collapse at the return of the little man → theory of language and sound of the mediated world → diagnosis of cruelty and moral pleasure → revaluation of evil as material for enhancement → new songs as a form of recovery → animal fixation on the doctrine of recurrence and downfall → silent openness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0048","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0049","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0061","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0063","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:ME1","text":"Language is reclassified from an instrument of communication into a productive deception without which no shared world would be inhabitable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:ME2","text":"Eternal recurrence is reordered from a mere cosmological assertion into a test of the human measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0053","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:ME3","text":"Cruelty, compassion, penance, and the indictment of life appear as a connected economy of pleasure and self-injury.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:ME4","text":"Evil is not opposed to good, but mapped as its possible source of force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:ME5","text":"Recovery is determined not as a return to normality, but as the production of a new form of expression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0048","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:ME6","text":"Doctrine and teacher become visible as recursively intertwined: the proclaimer is subject to the content of his proclamation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0061","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:ALT1","text":"Surface — Zarathustra awakens after an illness, speaks with his animals, and at the end refuses an answer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0063","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:ALT2","text":"Structural — Language mediates incompatible soul-worlds, while moral practice institutionally and psychically conceals pleasure in cruelty.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The overcoming of the human being is shifted from indictment and purification to enhancement, artistic transformation, and bearability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0048","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — There is no available outside and no linear progress, but recurrence, causal entanglement, and the reproduction of the same life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0052","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0057","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0058","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the transition from separateness through linguistic appearance, disgust at recurrence, and revaluation to incomplete recovery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0048","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0063","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:MRT2","text":"The ontological status of recurrence remains underdetermined because its fully elaborated version is attributed to the animals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0049","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0051","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0052","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0053","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:MRT3","text":"It remains underdetermined whether Zarathustra's silence signifies assent, exhaustion, inner examination, or dissociation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:MRT4","text":"The structure is coherent insofar as the difference between Zarathustra's experience and the doctrinal articulation of his animals is preserved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0063","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:MRT5","text":"The strongest connection lies in the coupling of recurrence, the anthropological problem of measure, and aesthetic recovery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0048","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:MRT6","text":"The central fault line lies between the demand for new songs and the repetition of a doctrine that can itself become a hurdy-gurdy tune.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0045","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0047","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2C_9:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the movement of the argument only if the conclusion is treated not as affirmed doctrine, but as suspended closure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0049","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0061","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2C_9:P0063","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_2C_9@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_2C_9:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"The Convalescent","source_section_label":"2.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"The Convalescent · 2","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","The Convalescent","2."],"original_title":"2."}],"source_title_context":"Der Genesende","source_section_label":"2.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"The Convalescent · 2","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","The Convalescent","2."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 113","title":"The Convalescent · 2","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Der Genesende · 2"},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS","layer":"CH","title":"On the Great Longing","order":114,"parents":["RAW_97E9_VDGS"],"revision":"CH_97E9_VDGS@R001","sha256":"71a5cc408fc39e837ae82a912f74303e4f9052928ac231d7705121c8e46bea4d","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:AS1","text":"Eine eingeschlossene Seele wird durch Entwinkelung, Entschämung, Entsündigung und Entgehorsamung neu bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:AS2","text":"Die Befreiung wird als gleichzeitige Fähigkeit zum Nein und zum Ja organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:AS3","text":"Freiheit wird durch Selbstbenennung, Selbstüberredung und die Aneignung der Notwendigkeit in Schicksal stabilisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:AS4","text":"Die vollständige Aufnahme von Weisheit, Zeit, Nacht, Schweigen und Sehnsucht erzeugt Über-Fülle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:AS5","text":"Über-Fülle hebt die einfache Ordnung von Geber und Nehmendem auf und verwandelt sich in neue Sehnsucht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:AS6","text":"Weil Klage als Anklage ausgeschlossen wird, muss das überschüssige Leid in Gesang und zukünftige Benennung übergehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:A1","text":"Die Seele ist durch Anrede, Lehre und Gabe umbildbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:A2","text":"Räumliche und zeitliche Fixierungen sind überschreitbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:A3","text":"Scham, Winkel-Tugend, Sünde und Gehorsam bilden hemmende Innenordnungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:A4","text":"Der als Geist bezeichnete Sturm kann hemmende Ordnungen zerstreuen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:A5","text":"Freiheit umfasst die Fähigkeit zum Nein und zum Ja.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:A6","text":"Diese Freiheit erstreckt sich auf Erschaffenes, Unerschaffenes und Zukünftiges.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:A7","text":"Verachten kann als liebende und nicht ressentimentale Wertung wirken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:A8","text":"Die Seele kann ihre eigenen Gründe überreden, statt ihnen zu gehorchen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:A9","text":"Benennung kann Notwendigkeit in eine selbstgetragene Schicksalsform verwandeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:A10","text":"Sonne, Nacht, Schweigen, Sehnsucht und Weisheit können in der Seele zur Nahrung werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:A11","text":"Angesammelte Erfahrung wächst zu überreicher, weintragender Fülle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:A12","text":"Über-Fülle erzeugt eine nach außen gerichtete Sehnsucht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:A13","text":"Geben und Nehmen sind wechselseitig konstituiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:A14","text":"Nehmen kann als Erbarmen des Nehmenden gegenüber dem Gebenden erscheinen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:A15","text":"Klagen wird als Anklagen bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:A16","text":"Nicht ausgeweintes Leid muss in Gesang übergehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:A17","text":"Zukünftige Gesänge können dem Namenlosen erst einen Namen geben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:NX1","text":"Die Seele ist nicht durch Winkel, Staub, Spinnen und Zwielicht definiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:NX2","text":"Befreiung ist nicht die kleine Scham und nicht die Winkel-Tugend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:NX3","text":"Geistige Reinigung ist nicht die Fortsetzung der Sünde als innerer Würgerin.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:NX4","text":"Freiheit ist nicht Gehorchen, Kniebeugen oder Herr-Sagen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:NX5","text":"Verachten ist nicht wurmartiger Frass.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:NX6","text":"Freiheit ist weder ausschließliche Verneinung noch ausschließliche Bejahung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:NX7","text":"Gründe sind keine unverfügbaren äußeren Herren der Seele.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:NX8","text":"Die Seele ist nicht auf einen einzigen Namen oder eine einzige Identität festgelegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:NX9","text":"Geben ist keine einseitige Übertragung vom souveränen Geber zum passiven Empfänger.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:NX10","text":"Über-Fülle ist kein abgeschlossener Besitzstand.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:NX11","text":"Leid wird nicht als unschuldige Klage entäußert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:NX12","text":"Der zukünftige Löser ist nicht bereits unter einem endgültigen Namen verfügbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:D1","text":"Die Aufhebung räumlicher, moralischer und zeitlicher Winkel macht die Seele für eine umfassende Bewegung durch Vergangenheit, Gegenwart und Zukunft frei.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDGS:A2","CH_97E9_VDGS:A3","CH_97E9_VDGS:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:D2","text":"Die Verbindung von Nein und Ja erzeugt eine durch verneinende Stürme hindurchgehende statt statische Freiheit.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDGS:A5","CH_97E9_VDGS:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:D3","text":"Selbstüberredung und Selbstbenennung verwandeln Notwendigkeit von einer auferlegten Grenze in eine eigene Schicksalsform.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDGS:A8","CH_97E9_VDGS:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:D4","text":"Die Aufnahme heterogener Zeiten, Affekte und Wissensformen lässt die Seele zu einer organisch anwachsenden Fülle werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDGS:A10","CH_97E9_VDGS:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:D5","text":"Die überreiche Seele kehrt die Richtung der Gabe um, weil ihr Reichtum den Empfangenden und den Gebenden wechselseitig verpflichtet.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDGS:A11","CH_97E9_VDGS:A13","CH_97E9_VDGS:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:D6","text":"Die gesteigerte Fülle erscheint nicht als Ruhe, sondern als sehnendes Ausgreifen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDGS:A11","CH_97E9_VDGS:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:D7","text":"Die Gleichsetzung von Klage und Anklage blockiert die unmittelbare Entladung der Schwermuth.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDGS:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:D8","text":"Der blockierte Ausbruch des Leids wird in Gesang als alternative Form der Entäußerung überführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDGS:A15","CH_97E9_VDGS:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:D9","text":"Der Gesang richtet die gegenwärtige Schwermuth auf eine Zukunft aus, deren Gestalten und Namen noch nicht festliegen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDGS:A16","CH_97E9_VDGS:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:SD1","text":"Befreiung erzeugt keine Leere, sondern eine gesteigerte Fähigkeit zur Aufnahme, Umwandlung und Hervorbringung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDGS:A2","CH_97E9_VDGS:A4","CH_97E9_VDGS:A5","CH_97E9_VDGS:A10","CH_97E9_VDGS:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:SD2","text":"Die höchste Fülle hebt Autarkie auf, weil sie sich notwendig in Sehnsucht, Gabe und Erwartung nach außen wendet.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDGS:A11","CH_97E9_VDGS:A12","CH_97E9_VDGS:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:SD3","text":"Die Gabe vollendet sich erst durch die Umkehrung, in der der Gebende dem Nehmenden danken muss.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDGS:A13","CH_97E9_VDGS:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:SD4","text":"Die Überwindung der Negation erfolgt nicht durch ihre Abschaffung, sondern durch ihre Verbindung mit Bejahung, Schöpfung und Gesang.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDGS:A5","CH_97E9_VDGS:A7","CH_97E9_VDGS:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:SD5","text":"Die zeitliche Überschreitung führt nicht in Zeitlosigkeit, sondern in eine verdichtete Zukunftserwartung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDGS:A2","CH_97E9_VDGS:A6","CH_97E9_VDGS:A12","CH_97E9_VDGS:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:SD6","text":"Der höchste Löser kann erst durch zukünftige Gesänge bestimmt werden und bleibt deshalb im gegenwärtigen System strukturell namenlos.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDGS:A12","CH_97E9_VDGS:A16","CH_97E9_VDGS:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt eine Befreiung aus, die in bloßer Entfernung von Welt, Körper, Affekt und Überfluss bestünde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:DNX2","text":"Das System schließt eine rein autonome Entstehung der Freiheit aus, weil die Seele durch vorgängige Ansprache, Lehre und Gabe freigesetzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:DNX3","text":"Das System schließt statische Vollendung aus, weil jede erreichte Fülle neue Sehnsucht hervorbringt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:DNX4","text":"Das System schließt Besitz als ausreichende Form des Reichtums aus, weil Überfluss nach Weitergabe und Empfang verlangt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:DNX5","text":"Das System schließt eine eindeutige Trennung von Geber und Empfänger aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:DNX6","text":"Das System schließt eine unmittelbare, sprachlich neutrale Mitteilung des Leids aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:DNX7","text":"Das System schließt eine endgültige Benennung des zukünftigen Erlösers im Voraus aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:SNX1","text":"Unmöglich ist eine in sich geschlossene Über-Fülle, die nichts mehr sucht, empfängt oder hervorbringt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:SNX2","text":"Unmöglich ist eine Gegenwart, in der die Zukunft bereits vollständig anwesend und benannt wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:SNX3","text":"Unmöglich ist ein Geschenkverhältnis ohne Umkehrung der Rollen und ohne Abhängigkeit vom Empfangenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:SNX4","text":"Unzulässig ist eine reine Verneinung, die nicht in Bejahung, Schöpfung oder Gesang übergeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:SNX5","text":"Versperrt bleibt eine Erlösung, die als fertige Identität oder als gegenwärtig verfügbarer Name auftreten könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:SNX6","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine endgültige Auflösung der Schwermuth; sie bleibt als Bedingung des zukünftigen Gesangs erhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:FGS1","text":"Verschlossene Innenordnung → geistige Sturmbewegung → Entfernung von Scham, Sünde und Gehorsam.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:FGS2","text":"Entfernung der hemmenden Ordnungen → gleichzeitiges Nein und Ja → bewegliche Freiheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:FGS3","text":"Bewegliche Freiheit → Selbstüberredung und neue Namen → Aneignung der Notwendigkeit als Schicksal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:FGS4","text":"Aneignung von Zeit, Wissen, Schweigen und Sehnsucht → organisches Wachstum → Über-Fülle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:FGS5","text":"Über-Fülle → nach außen greifende Sehnsucht → Umkehrung von Geben und Nehmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:FGS6","text":"Übervolle Schwermuth + Ausschluss der Klage → Gesang → Stillwerden der Meere und Öffnung auf zukünftige Gesänge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:FGS7","text":"Zukünftiger Gesang → Benennung des Namenlosen → Rückkehr der Gabe als Bitte um Gesang und als Dank des Gebenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:AF1","text":"Eingeschlossene Seele → Entwinkelung und Entschämung → Entsündigung und Entgehorsamung → Nein-und-Ja-Freiheit → Selbstbenennung der Notwendigkeit → Weisheitsaufnahme → Über-Fülle → Sehnsucht → Umkehrung der Gabe → Ausschluss der Klage → Gesang → zukünftige Benennung des namenlosen Lösers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:AF2","text":"Letzte Gabe des Singen-Lehrens → Aufforderung zum eigenen Gesang → Dank des Gebenden → erneute Konstitution der Beziehung zwischen Seele und Lehrendem.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:ME1","text":"Zeit und Raum werden von festen Koordinaten zu übertanzbaren Bewegungsfeldern umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:ME2","text":"Moralische Gegensätze werden durch eine dynamische Ordnung aus liebendem Verachten, Nein und Ja ersetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:ME3","text":"Notwendigkeit wird von äußerem Zwang zu einer durch Benennung und Selbstüberredung getragenen Schicksalsform umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:ME4","text":"Reichtum wird nicht mehr als Besitz, sondern als relationale Über-Fülle sichtbar, die nach Empfang und Weitergabe verlangt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:ME5","text":"Klage und Gesang werden als konkurrierende Formen der Affektentäußerung getrennt; der Gesang erhält die strategische Funktion der Umwandlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:ME6","text":"Die Zukunft wird nicht als fertiges Ziel, sondern als Instanz künftiger Benennung und Hervorbringung kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:ALT1","text":"Surface — Die Oberfläche inszeniert eine direkte Ansprache, in der die Umwandlung der Seele als Folge von Lehren, Reinigungen, Gaben und Gesängen erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die strukturelle Ebene organisiert Befreiung als Abbau von Innenordnungen und als Aufbau einer reziproken Ökonomie von Fülle, Sehnsucht und Gabe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die metastrategische Ebene ersetzt Gehorsam, Klage und passive Erlösung durch Selbstüberredung, doppelte Wertung, Gesang und zukünftige Hervorbringung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Die ontologisch-zeitliche Ebene setzt eine Realität voraus, in der Vergangenheit und Zukunft verdichtet zusammenrücken, ohne dass die Zukunft aufhört, offen und namenlos zu bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von der eingeschlossenen Seele zur singenden Über-Fülle zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:MRT2","text":"Die Struktur bleibt hinsichtlich des ontologischen Status des Winzers, des goldenen Wunders und des namenlosen Lösers unterbestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:MRT3","text":"Das System ist intern kohärent, sofern Befreiung, Fülle, Sehnsucht und Gesang als ein einziger Umwandlungskreislauf gelesen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:MRT4","text":"Seine stärkste Verbindung liegt in der Umwandlung von Negation in produktive Bejahung und von Gabe in reziproken Dank.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:MRT5","text":"Eine ungelöste Spannung besteht darin, dass die Seele als selbstbestimmt erscheint, ihre Freiheit aber durch die vorgängige Intervention des sprechenden Lehrenden erzeugt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:MRT6","text":"Eine zweite Spannung besteht darin, dass die Seele alles empfangen hat und überreich ist, dennoch aber wartet, sucht und leidet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:MRT7","text":"Eine dritte Spannung besteht darin, dass die letzte Gabe als Vollendung erscheint, zugleich aber eine neue Abhängigkeit vom Gesang der Seele eröffnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0032","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, solange die metaphorischen Bilder nicht als bloße Ausschmückung, sondern als Operatoren der Umkehrung behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T194302359216Z_be580b1c","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"On the Great Longing","source_sha256":"71a5cc408fc39e837ae82a912f74303e4f9052928ac231d7705121c8e46bea4d","sha256":"0d5876361eafec92190b61f969ba0868d39845c84362311e803d9af9ff0a04e3","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:43:02.360412+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:AS1","text":"An enclosed soul is redefined through de-cornering, de-shaming, de-sinning, and de-obediencing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:AS2","text":"Liberation is organized as the simultaneous capacity for No and Yes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:AS3","text":"Freedom is stabilized through self-naming, self-persuasion, and the appropriation of necessity into fate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:AS4","text":"The complete intake of wisdom, time, night, silence, and longing produces over-abundance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:AS5","text":"Over-abundance suspends the simple order of giver and receiver and transforms itself into new longing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:AS6","text":"Because lamentation is excluded as accusation, the surplus suffering must pass into song and future naming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:A1","text":"The soul is transformable through address, teaching, and gift.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:A2","text":"Spatial and temporal fixations are surpassable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:A3","text":"Shame, corner-virtue, sin, and obedience form inhibiting inner orders.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:A4","text":"The storm called spirit can disperse inhibiting orders.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:A5","text":"Freedom includes the capacity for No and Yes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:A6","text":"This freedom extends to the created, the uncreated, and the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:A7","text":"Despising can operate as a loving and non-resentful valuation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:A8","text":"The soul can persuade its own reasons rather than obeying them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:A9","text":"Naming can transform necessity into a self-sustained form of fate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:A10","text":"Sun, night, silence, longing, and wisdom can become nourishment in the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:A11","text":"Accumulated experience grows into over-rich, wine-bearing plenitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:A12","text":"Over-abundance produces an outward-directed longing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:A13","text":"Giving and receiving are reciprocally constituted.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:A14","text":"Receiving can appear as the receiver's mercy toward the giver.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:A15","text":"Lamenting is determined as accusing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:A16","text":"Suffering not wept out must pass into song.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:A17","text":"Future songs can first give a name to the nameless.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:NX1","text":"The soul is not defined by corners, dust, spiders, and twilight.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:NX2","text":"Liberation is not petty shame and not corner-virtue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:NX3","text":"Spiritual purification is not the continuation of sin as an inner strangler.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:NX4","text":"Freedom is not obeying, kneeling, or saying Lord.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:NX5","text":"Despising is not worm-like gnawing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:NX6","text":"Freedom is neither exclusive negation nor exclusive affirmation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:NX7","text":"Reasons are not unavailable external masters of the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:NX8","text":"The soul is not fixed upon a single name or a single identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:NX9","text":"Giving is not a one-sided transfer from the sovereign giver to the passive recipient.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:NX10","text":"Over-abundance is not an enclosed state of possession.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:NX11","text":"Suffering is not externalized as innocent lamentation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:NX12","text":"The future redeemer is not already available under a final name.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:D1","text":"The suspension of spatial, moral, and temporal corners frees the soul for a comprehensive movement through past, present, and future.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDGS:A2","CH_97E9_VDGS:A3","CH_97E9_VDGS:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:D2","text":"The conjunction of No and Yes produces a freedom passing through negating storms rather than a static freedom.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDGS:A5","CH_97E9_VDGS:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:D3","text":"Self-persuasion and self-naming transform necessity from an imposed limit into one's own form of fate.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDGS:A8","CH_97E9_VDGS:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:D4","text":"The intake of heterogeneous times, affects, and forms of knowledge allows the soul to become an organically growing plenitude.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDGS:A10","CH_97E9_VDGS:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:D5","text":"The over-rich soul reverses the direction of the gift because its wealth reciprocally obligates the receiver and the giver.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDGS:A11","CH_97E9_VDGS:A13","CH_97E9_VDGS:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:D6","text":"Intensified plenitude appears not as repose but as longing outreach.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDGS:A11","CH_97E9_VDGS:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:D7","text":"The equation of lamentation and accusation blocks the immediate discharge of melancholy.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDGS:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:D8","text":"The blocked outbreak of suffering is transferred into song as an alternative form of externalization.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDGS:A15","CH_97E9_VDGS:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:D9","text":"Song directs present melancholy toward a future whose forms and names are not yet fixed.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDGS:A16","CH_97E9_VDGS:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:SD1","text":"Liberation produces not emptiness but an intensified capacity for intake, transformation, and production.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDGS:A2","CH_97E9_VDGS:A4","CH_97E9_VDGS:A5","CH_97E9_VDGS:A10","CH_97E9_VDGS:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:SD2","text":"The highest plenitude suspends autarky because it necessarily turns outward into longing, gift, and expectation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDGS:A11","CH_97E9_VDGS:A12","CH_97E9_VDGS:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:SD3","text":"The gift is completed only through the reversal in which the giver must thank the receiver.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDGS:A13","CH_97E9_VDGS:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:SD4","text":"The overcoming of negation occurs not through its abolition but through its conjunction with affirmation, creation, and song.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDGS:A5","CH_97E9_VDGS:A7","CH_97E9_VDGS:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:SD5","text":"Temporal surpassing leads not into timelessness but into a condensed expectation of the future.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDGS:A2","CH_97E9_VDGS:A6","CH_97E9_VDGS:A12","CH_97E9_VDGS:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:SD6","text":"The highest redeemer can only be determined through future songs and therefore remains structurally nameless in the present system.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDGS:A12","CH_97E9_VDGS:A16","CH_97E9_VDGS:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:DNX1","text":"The system excludes a liberation consisting in mere removal from world, body, affect, and abundance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:DNX2","text":"The system excludes a purely autonomous emergence of freedom because the soul is set free through prior address, teaching, and gift.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:DNX3","text":"The system excludes static completion because every attained plenitude produces new longing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:DNX4","text":"The system excludes possession as a sufficient form of wealth because abundance demands passing on and receiving.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:DNX5","text":"The system excludes an unambiguous separation of giver and recipient.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:DNX6","text":"The system excludes an immediate, linguistically neutral communication of suffering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:DNX7","text":"The system excludes an advance final naming of the future savior.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:SNX1","text":"Impossible is a self-enclosed over-abundance that no longer seeks, receives, or produces anything.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:SNX2","text":"Impossible is a present in which the future would already be fully present and named.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:SNX3","text":"Impossible is a gift relation without reversal of roles and without dependence on the recipient.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:SNX4","text":"Impermissible is a pure negation that does not pass into affirmation, creation, or song.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:SNX5","text":"Barred remains a redemption that could appear as a finished identity or as a presently available name.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:SNX6","text":"Excluded is a final dissolution of melancholy; it remains preserved as the condition of future song.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:FGS1","text":"Closed inner order → spiritual storm-movement → removal of shame, sin, and obedience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:FGS2","text":"Removal of inhibiting orders → simultaneous No and Yes → mobile freedom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:FGS3","text":"Mobile freedom → self-persuasion and new names → appropriation of necessity as fate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:FGS4","text":"Appropriation of time, knowledge, silence, and longing → organic growth → over-abundance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:FGS5","text":"Over-abundance → outward-reaching longing → reversal of giving and receiving.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:FGS6","text":"Overfull melancholy + exclusion of lamentation → song → stilling of the seas and opening toward future songs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:FGS7","text":"Future song → naming of the nameless → return of the gift as a request for song and as the giver's thanks.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:AF1","text":"Enclosed soul → de-cornering and de-shaming → de-sinning and de-obediencing → No-and-Yes freedom → self-naming of necessity → intake of wisdom → over-abundance → longing → reversal of the gift → exclusion of lamentation → song → future naming of the nameless redeemer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:AF2","text":"Final gift of teaching singing → summons to one's own song → thanks of the giver → renewed constitution of the relation between soul and teacher.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:ME1","text":"Time and space are remapped from fixed coordinates into fields of movement that can be danced across.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:ME2","text":"Moral oppositions are replaced by a dynamic order of loving despising, No, and Yes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:ME3","text":"Necessity is reclassified from external compulsion into a form of fate borne by naming and self-persuasion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:ME4","text":"Wealth becomes visible no longer as possession but as relational over-abundance that demands receiving and passing on.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:ME5","text":"Lamentation and song are separated as competing forms of affective externalization; song receives the strategic function of transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:ME6","text":"The future is mapped not as a finished goal but as the instance of future naming and production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:ALT1","text":"Surface — The surface stages a direct address in which the transformation of the soul appears as the consequence of teachings, purifications, gifts, and songs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:ALT2","text":"Structural — The structural level organizes liberation as the dismantling of inner orders and as the construction of a reciprocal economy of plenitude, longing, and gift.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The metastrategic level replaces obedience, lamentation, and passive redemption with self-persuasion, double valuation, song, and future production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The ontological-temporal level presupposes a reality in which past and future draw together in condensed form, without the future ceasing to remain open and nameless.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from the enclosed soul to singing over-abundance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:MRT2","text":"The structure remains underdetermined with regard to the ontological status of the vintner, the golden wonder, and the nameless redeemer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:MRT3","text":"The system is internally coherent insofar as liberation, plenitude, longing, and song are read as a single cycle of transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:MRT4","text":"Its strongest connection lies in the transformation of negation into productive affirmation and of gift into reciprocal thanks.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:MRT5","text":"An unresolved tension consists in the fact that the soul appears self-determined, yet its freedom is produced through the prior intervention of the speaking teacher.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:MRT6","text":"A second tension consists in the fact that the soul has received everything and is over-rich, yet nevertheless waits, seeks, and suffers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:MRT7","text":"A third tension consists in the fact that the final gift appears as completion while at the same time opening a new dependence on the song of the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0031","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0032","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDGS:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual argumentative movement so long as the metaphorical images are treated not as mere embellishment but as operators of reversal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDGS:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_VDGS@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_VDGS:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 114","title":"On the Great Longing","context":"Chapter 114","original_title":"Von der grossen Sehnsucht","original_context":"Chapter 114"},"original_title":"Von der grossen Sehnsucht","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10","layer":"CH","title":"The Other Dance Song · 1","order":115,"parents":["RAW_97E9_1_10"],"revision":"CH_97E9_1_10@R001","sha256":"22d0b76c8c2454fb21c6fb1090335e5a0c0633174eb29d5a6381e31fb4b2f96c","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:AS1","text":"Das zentrale Problem ist die Erfassung eines begehrten Gegenübers, das sich nur durch Flucht, Distanz und wechselnde Gestalt zeigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:AS2","text":"Das Gegenüber wird nicht als ruhiger Besitz, sondern als bewegende, widersprüchliche und entziehende Kraft bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:AS3","text":"Begehren erzeugt eine Jagdbewegung, in der Annäherung Flucht und Flucht erneute Annäherung hervorbringt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:AS4","text":"Die Erkenntnis des Gegenübers erfolgt körperlich-rhythmisch über Tanz, Sprung, Fuß, Zehen, Blick und Takt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:AS5","text":"Die Jagd verschiebt die Rollen von Liebendem, Tänzer, Jäger, Hund, Gemse und Schäfer fortlaufend ineinander.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:AS6","text":"Die spielerische Verfolgung kippt in Erschöpfung, Sturz, Fürsorge und schließlich in den Versuch gewaltsamer Taktgebung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:AS7","text":"Die Schlussbewegung legt offen, dass die Beziehung ihre Spannung nicht auflöst, sondern in eine prekäre Herrschaftsform überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:A1","text":"Das Leben erscheint als begehrenswertes, personifiziertes und bewegliches Gegenüber.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:A2","text":"Das Gegenüber ist grundsätzlich nicht verfügbar und entzieht sich direkter Aneignung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:A3","text":"Distanz steigert das Begehren, während Nähe Furcht und Instabilität erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:A4","text":"Flucht und Verfolgung bilden eine wechselseitige Erzeugungsstruktur.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:A5","text":"Körperliche Bewegung fungiert als Erkenntnis- und Verständigungsmedium.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:A6","text":"Der Rhythmus des Gegenübers setzt den Rhythmus des Verfolgers in Bewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:A7","text":"Das Gegenüber ist zugleich lockend, bindend, verführend und widerständig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:A8","text":"Das Gegenüber besitzt keine stabile Identität, sondern erscheint in wechselnden Tier-, Hexen-, Kind- und Geliebtenbildern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:A9","text":"Die Beziehung erzeugt ihre Rollen durch wechselnde Positionen von Nähe, Flucht, Führung und Unterwerfung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:A10","text":"Die Jagd kann jederzeit in ein Spiel von Herrschaft und Gehorsam umschlagen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:A11","text":"Erschöpfung unterbricht die reine Bewegungslogik, ohne das Begehren zu beenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:A12","text":"Die Peitsche markiert den Übergang von geteilter Bewegung zu erzwungener Taktordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:NX1","text":"Das Gegenüber ist nicht als statisches Objekt des Besitzes bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:NX2","text":"Begehren ist nicht von Distanz und Gefahr ablösbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:NX3","text":"Erkenntnis erfolgt nicht durch begriffliche Fixierung allein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:NX4","text":"Nähe bedeutet nicht Vereinigung oder Sicherheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:NX5","text":"Flucht ist nicht bloße Verweigerung, sondern Teil der Bindung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:NX6","text":"Liebe und Feindschaft bilden keine stabil getrennten Zustände.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:NX7","text":"Das Gegenüber bleibt keiner einzigen Rollenbezeichnung untergeordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:NX8","text":"Tanz bedeutet nicht freie Harmonie ohne Zwang.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:NX9","text":"Fürsorge hebt die asymmetrische Beziehung nicht auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:NX10","text":"Die abschließende Taktgebung ist nicht mehr bloß spielerische Gegenseitigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:D1","text":"Weil das Gegenüber nicht verfügbar ist und Distanz das Begehren steigert, wird Flucht zum wirksamsten Bindungsmittel.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_10:A2","CH_97E9_1_10:A3","CH_97E9_1_10:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:D2","text":"Weil Flucht und Verfolgung einander erzeugen, wird jede Annäherung in eine neue Entfernung übersetzt.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_10:A3","CH_97E9_1_10:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:D3","text":"Weil der Körper das Erkenntnismedium ist, wird der Fuß zum hörenden und verstehenden Organ des Tänzers.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_10:A5","CH_97E9_1_10:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:D4","text":"Weil das Gegenüber wechselnde Gestalten annimmt, wird die Verfolgung zu einer fortgesetzten Neuklassifikation seiner Identität.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_10:A7","CH_97E9_1_10:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:D5","text":"Weil die Rollen durch Bewegung erzeugt werden, kann der Verfolger zugleich Liebender, Tänzer, Jäger, Hund und Schäfer sein.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_10:A5","CH_97E9_1_10:A8","CH_97E9_1_10:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:D6","text":"Weil die Jagd Erschöpfung hervorbringt, erscheint Fürsorge als temporäre Unterbrechung der Verfolgung.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_10:A9","CH_97E9_1_10:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:D7","text":"Weil die Gegenseitigkeit instabil bleibt, wird die Peitsche als Versuch eingesetzt, den gemeinsamen Rhythmus durch äußeren Zwang zu sichern.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_10:A10","CH_97E9_1_10:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:SD1","text":"Das Gegenüber bindet den Verfolger gerade dadurch, dass es sich einer endgültigen Bestimmung entzieht.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_10:A2","CH_97E9_1_10:A3","CH_97E9_1_10:A7","CH_97E9_1_10:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:SD2","text":"Bewegung ersetzt Besitz als primäre Form der Beziehung und macht das Begehren zu einer rekursiven Verfolgungsmaschine.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_10:A2","CH_97E9_1_10:A4","CH_97E9_1_10:A5","CH_97E9_1_10:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:SD3","text":"Die scheinbare Gegenseitigkeit erzeugt zugleich Erkenntnis, Lust, Furcht und Herrschaft.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_10:A3","CH_97E9_1_10:A5","CH_97E9_1_10:A7","CH_97E9_1_10:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:SD4","text":"Die wechselnden Tier- und Geschlechterrollen machen Identität zu einer Funktion des jeweiligen Bewegungs- und Machtverhältnisses.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_10:A8","CH_97E9_1_10:A9","CH_97E9_1_10:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:SD5","text":"Der Übergang zur Peitsche zeigt, dass die gemeinsame Tanzordnung ihre Stabilität nur durch eine asymmetrische Setzung von Befehl und Gehorsam gewinnen kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_10:A6","CH_97E9_1_10:A10","CH_97E9_1_10:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:DNX1","text":"Das System setzt voraus, dass ein dauerhaftes Ankommen den produktiven Charakter des Begehrens zerstören würde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:DNX2","text":"Es schließt ein Gegenüber aus, das unabhängig von der Verfolgung eindeutig und stabil gegeben wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:DNX3","text":"Es disqualifiziert eine reine Trennung von körperlicher Erkenntnis und begrifflichem Verstehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:DNX4","text":"Es schließt eine symmetrische Beziehung aus, in der keine Seite Rhythmus, Richtung oder Rolle bestimmen müsste.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:DNX5","text":"Es behandelt Gewalt nicht als äußerlichen Bruch, sondern als latente Möglichkeit jeder spielerischen Gegenseitigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:DNX6","text":"Es verwirft die Annahme, Fürsorge könne die zuvor erzeugte Machtasymmetrie neutralisieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:SNX1","text":"Die versperrte Möglichkeit einer stabilen Vereinigung hält die gesamte Bewegungs- und Begehrensordnung in Gang.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confide