gnment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:FGS6","text":"Erschöpfung und Sturz → Bitte um mildere Wege → vorläufige Fürsorge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:FGS7","text":"Fortbestehende Asymmetrie → Verlust geteilter Taktgebung → Einführung der Peitsche als äußerer Rhythmus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:FGS8","text":"Äußerer Zwang → Fixierung des Gegenübers als Gehorchende → Offenlegung des Herrschaftskerns der Verfolgung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:AF1","text":"Entziehendes Leben → begehrende Wahrnehmung → körperliche Antwort → wechselseitige Verfolgung → instabile Rollen → Erschöpfung und Fürsorge → Peitsche als erzwungene Taktgebung → ungelöste Herrschaftsbeziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:ME1","text":"Das Gegenüber wird von einem zu erfassenden Wesen zu einer relationalen Bewegungsfunktion umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:ME2","text":"Nähe und Distanz werden nicht mehr als Gegensätze, sondern als komplementäre Bedingungen des Begehrens lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:ME3","text":"Körperliche Reaktion wird als Erkenntnisform neben oder vor begrifflicher Erkenntnis sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:ME4","text":"Tier-, Liebes-, Jagd- und Herrschaftsbilder werden als wechselnde Positionen einer einzigen Beziehungsmaschine klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:ME5","text":"Das Spiel wird als Vorform von Zwang lesbar, ohne dass seine spielerische Dimension vollständig verschwindet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:ME6","text":"Die scheinbare Verfolgung eines Gegenübers wird als Selbstproduktion des Verfolgers durch dessen Entzug kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:ALT1","text":"Surface — Ein Sprecher verfolgt ein fliehendes, lockendes und wechselgestaltiges Gegenüber durch Tanz, Sprünge, Dickichte und unterschiedliche Rollen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Beziehung wird durch eine rekursive Kopplung von Entzug, Begehren, Verfolgung, Gegenflucht und erneuter Bindung organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text verschiebt die Frage von der Erlangung des Gegenübers auf die Aufrechterhaltung einer beweglichen Spannung und zeigt deren Umschlag in Zwang.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Sein erscheint als Werden-in-Beziehung; Identität und Macht entstehen sukzessiv aus wechselnden Rhythmen, Abständen und Positionen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um Entzug, Begehren, Tanz, Rollenwechsel und den Übergang zur Peitsche zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob das Gegenüber als Leben, Geliebte, Selbstbild oder eigenständige Figur ontologisch gelesen werden soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, weil jede Annäherung systematisch neue Distanz und jede Distanz neue Verfolgung erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Stelle ist die Verbindung von körperlicher Erkenntnis, Begehren und relationaler Macht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:MRT5","text":"Ihre zentrale Spannung liegt im Übergang von Gegenseitigkeit zu Zwang, der nicht vollständig als Bruch oder Konsequenz entschieden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0023","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, sofern die Schlussgewalt nicht als bloße Metapher, sondern als strukturelle Endform der Tanzordnung behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T185606088911Z_496149c3","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"1.","source_sha256":"22d0b76c8c2454fb21c6fb1090335e5a0c0633174eb29d5a6381e31fb4b2f96c","sha256":"e6baba102eeb8b31b4b6f1ba708858e6a1c37a05031b00fcf1f9388bb0a58906","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T18:56:06.097207+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:AS1","text":"The central problem is the apprehension of a desired counterpart that reveals itself only through flight, distance, and changing form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:AS2","text":"The counterpart is determined not as tranquil possession, but as a moving, contradictory, and withdrawing force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:AS3","text":"Desire generates a movement of pursuit in which approach brings forth flight and flight renewed approach.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:AS4","text":"Knowledge of the counterpart occurs bodily-rhythmically through dance, leap, foot, toes, gaze, and beat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:AS5","text":"The pursuit continually shifts the roles of lover, dancer, hunter, dog, chamois, and shepherd into one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:AS6","text":"Playful pursuit tips into exhaustion, fall, care, and finally into the attempt at violent imposition of rhythm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:AS7","text":"The final movement reveals that the relationship does not resolve its tension, but transfers it into a precarious form of domination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:A1","text":"Life appears as a desirable, personified, and mobile counterpart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:A2","text":"The counterpart is fundamentally unavailable and eludes direct appropriation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:A3","text":"Distance intensifies desire, whereas proximity produces fear and instability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:A4","text":"Flight and pursuit form a structure of reciprocal generation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:A5","text":"Bodily movement functions as a medium of knowledge and understanding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:A6","text":"The rhythm of the counterpart sets the rhythm of the pursuer in motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:A7","text":"The counterpart is at once alluring, binding, seductive, and resistant.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:A8","text":"The counterpart possesses no stable identity, but appears in changing images of animals, witches, children, and beloveds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:A9","text":"The relationship generates its roles through changing positions of proximity, flight, guidance, and submission.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:A10","text":"The pursuit can at any time turn into a game of domination and obedience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:A11","text":"Exhaustion interrupts the pure logic of movement without ending desire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:A12","text":"The whip marks the transition from shared movement to an enforced ordering of rhythm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:NX1","text":"The counterpart is not determined as a static object of possession.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:NX2","text":"Desire cannot be detached from distance and danger.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:NX3","text":"Knowledge does not occur through conceptual fixation alone.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:NX4","text":"Proximity does not mean union or security.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:NX5","text":"Flight is not mere refusal, but part of the bond.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:NX6","text":"Love and enmity do not form stably separate states.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:NX7","text":"The counterpart remains subordinate to no single role designation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:NX8","text":"Dance does not mean free harmony without coercion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:NX9","text":"Care does not abolish the asymmetrical relationship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:NX10","text":"The concluding imposition of rhythm is no longer mere playful reciprocity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:D1","text":"Because the counterpart is unavailable and distance intensifies desire, flight becomes the most effective means of binding.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_10:A2","CH_97E9_1_10:A3","CH_97E9_1_10:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:D2","text":"Because flight and pursuit generate one another, every approach is translated into a new distancing.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_10:A3","CH_97E9_1_10:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:D3","text":"Because the body is the medium of knowledge, the foot becomes the dancer's organ of hearing and understanding.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_10:A5","CH_97E9_1_10:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:D4","text":"Because the counterpart assumes changing forms, pursuit becomes a continued reclassification of its identity.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_10:A7","CH_97E9_1_10:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:D5","text":"Because the roles are generated through movement, the pursuer can simultaneously be lover, dancer, hunter, dog, and shepherd.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_10:A5","CH_97E9_1_10:A8","CH_97E9_1_10:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:D6","text":"Because pursuit produces exhaustion, care appears as a temporary interruption of pursuit.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_10:A9","CH_97E9_1_10:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:D7","text":"Because reciprocity remains unstable, the whip is deployed as an attempt to secure the shared rhythm through external coercion.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_10:A10","CH_97E9_1_10:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:SD1","text":"The counterpart binds the pursuer precisely by withdrawing from definitive determination.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_10:A2","CH_97E9_1_10:A3","CH_97E9_1_10:A7","CH_97E9_1_10:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:SD2","text":"Movement replaces possession as the primary form of relationship and makes desire into a recursive machine of pursuit.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_10:A2","CH_97E9_1_10:A4","CH_97E9_1_10:A5","CH_97E9_1_10:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:SD3","text":"Apparent reciprocity produces knowledge, pleasure, fear, and domination at once.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_10:A3","CH_97E9_1_10:A5","CH_97E9_1_10:A7","CH_97E9_1_10:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:SD4","text":"The changing animal and gender roles make identity a function of the respective relation of movement and power.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_10:A8","CH_97E9_1_10:A9","CH_97E9_1_10:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:SD5","text":"The transition to the whip shows that the shared order of dance can gain its stability only through an asymmetrical positing of command and obedience.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_10:A6","CH_97E9_1_10:A10","CH_97E9_1_10:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:DNX1","text":"The system presupposes that a lasting arrival would destroy the productive character of desire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:DNX2","text":"It excludes a counterpart that would be unambiguously and stably given independently of pursuit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:DNX3","text":"It disqualifies a pure separation of bodily knowledge and conceptual understanding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:DNX4","text":"It excludes a symmetrical relationship in which neither side would have to determine rhythm, direction, or role.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:DNX5","text":"It treats violence not as an external rupture, but as a latent possibility of every playful reciprocity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:DNX6","text":"It rejects the assumption that care could neutralize the previously generated asymmetry of power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:SNX1","text":"The blocked possibility of stable union keeps the entire order of movement and desire in motion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:SNX2","text":"The absence of an independent, unchanging counterpart structures the continued production of changing roles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:SNX3","text":"A non-hierarchical reciprocity remains effective behind the dance as an unrealized possibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:SNX4","text":"The impossibility of durably ordering movement without coercion brings forth the final turn to the whip.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:FGS1","text":"Withdrawal of the counterpart → intensification of desire → initiation of pursuit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:FGS2","text":"Pursuit → counter-flight → renewed binding through distance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:FGS3","text":"Rhythmic sign of the counterpart → bodily response → knowledge through movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:FGS4","text":"Changing form → unstable attribution → continued reconfiguration of roles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:FGS5","text":"Reconfiguration of roles → reciprocal order of pursuit → superimposition of love, fear, mockery, and domination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:FGS6","text":"Exhaustion and fall → request for gentler paths → provisional care.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:FGS7","text":"Persisting asymmetry → loss of shared imposition of rhythm → introduction of the whip as external rhythm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:FGS8","text":"External coercion → fixation of the counterpart as one who obeys → disclosure of the core of domination in pursuit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:AF1","text":"Withdrawing life → desirous perception → bodily response → reciprocal pursuit → unstable roles → exhaustion and care → whip as enforced imposition of rhythm → unresolved relation of domination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:ME1","text":"The counterpart is remapped from a being to be apprehended into a relational function of movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:ME2","text":"Proximity and distance become legible no longer as opposites, but as complementary conditions of desire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:ME3","text":"Bodily reaction becomes visible as a form of knowledge alongside or prior to conceptual knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:ME4","text":"Images of animals, love, pursuit, and domination are classified as changing positions of a single relational machine.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:ME5","text":"The game becomes legible as a preliminary form of coercion, without its playful dimension disappearing completely.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:ME6","text":"The apparent pursuit of a counterpart is mapped as the self-production of the pursuer through its withdrawal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:ALT1","text":"Surface — A speaker pursues a fleeing, alluring, and shape-shifting counterpart through dance, leaps, thickets, and different roles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:ALT2","text":"Structural — The relationship is organized through a recursive coupling of withdrawal, desire, pursuit, counter-flight, and renewed binding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text shifts the question from attaining the counterpart to maintaining a mobile tension and shows its turn into coercion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Being appears as becoming-in-relation; identity and power arise successively from changing rhythms, distances, and positions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct withdrawal, desire, dance, changes of role, and the transition to the whip.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is whether the counterpart should be read ontologically as life, beloved, self-image, or autonomous figure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent because every approach systematically generates new distance and every distance new pursuit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:MRT4","text":"Its strongest point is the connection of bodily knowledge, desire, and relational power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:MRT5","text":"Its central tension lies in the transition from reciprocity to coercion, which is not fully decided as either rupture or consequence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0023","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_10:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement insofar as the concluding violence is treated not as a mere metaphor, but as the structural final form of the order of dance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_10:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_1_10@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_1_10:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"The Other Dance Song","source_section_label":"1.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"The Other Dance Song · 1","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","The Other Dance Song","1."],"original_title":"1."}],"source_title_context":"Das andere Tanzlied","source_section_label":"1.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"The Other Dance Song · 1","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","The Other Dance Song","1."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 115","title":"The Other Dance Song · 1","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Das andere Tanzlied · 1"},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10","layer":"CH","title":"The Other Dance Song · 2","order":116,"parents":["RAW_97E9_2_10"],"revision":"CH_97E9_2_10@R001","sha256":"2622e0b8026259dc372c79f22343006817249e434546eaebad4dded06a6cf3cf","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:AS1","text":"Das Leben unterbricht den Lärm, weil Lärm zärtliche Gedanken zerstört.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:AS2","text":"Leben und Zarathustra bestimmen ihre Gemeinschaft jenseits von Gut und Böse als wechselseitige Gutheit zweier weder guter noch böser Wesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:AS3","text":"Ihre Beziehung beruht nicht auf grundsätzlicher Liebe, sondern auf der Möglichkeit, ohne solche Liebe einander nicht gram zu sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:AS4","text":"Das Leben ist Zarathustra wegen seiner Weisheit zugetan, bleibt aber von dieser Weisheit eifersüchtig abhängig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:AS5","text":"Die nächtliche Glocke macht Zarathustras bevorstehenden Abschied als verdrängten Gedanken hörbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:AS6","text":"Die gegenseitige Erkenntnis der bevorstehenden Trennung führt nicht zur Auflösung, sondern zu gemeinsamem Weinen und zu einer vorübergehenden Vorrangigkeit des Lebens vor der Weisheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:A1","text":"Lärm tötet Gedanken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:A2","text":"Zärtliche Gedanken benötigen eine nichtlärmende Beziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:A3","text":"Leben und Zarathustra stehen jenseits der Unterscheidung von Gut und Böse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:A4","text":"Ihre Beziehung kann ohne grundsätzliche Liebe bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:A5","text":"Das Leben ist Zarathustra wegen seiner Weisheit zugetan.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:A6","text":"Die Weisheit besitzt die Möglichkeit, sich von Zarathustra zu entfernen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:A7","text":"Mit dem Verlust der Weisheit droht zugleich der Verlust der Liebe des Lebens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:A8","text":"Zarathustra beabsichtigt, das Leben zu verlassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:A9","text":"Die Mitternachtsglocke aktiviert in Zarathustra den Gedanken an seinen Abschied.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:A10","text":"Das Leben erkennt Zarathustras Untreue und seinen bevorstehenden Abschied.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:A11","text":"Gemeinsames Erkennen der Trennung kann in gemeinsames Weinen übergehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:A12","text":"In der Situation des Abschieds kann das Leben der Weisheit vorgeordnet werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:NX1","text":"Die Beziehung ist keine grundsätzliche Liebe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:NX2","text":"Leben und Zarathustra sind weder gut noch böse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:NX3","text":"Die Gemeinschaft beruht nicht auf dauerhafter Treue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:NX4","text":"Zarathustras Rede über seine Beziehung zum Leben entspricht nicht vollständig seiner tatsächlichen Bindung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:NX5","text":"Das Leben ist nicht unabhängig von Zarathustras Weisheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:NX6","text":"Weisheit garantiert nicht die Bewahrung der Liebe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:NX7","text":"Der Abschied wird nicht durch die gemeinsame grüne Wiese aufgehoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:D1","text":"Die gemeinsame Sphäre des Lebens und Zarathustras wird durch die Außerkraftsetzung moralischer Gegensätze konstituiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_10:A3","CH_97E9_2_10:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:D2","text":"Die Beziehung kann trotz fehlender grundsätzlicher Liebe als wechselseitige Schonung fortbestehen.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_10:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:D3","text":"Zarathustras Weisheit ist zugleich Grundlage seiner Nähe zum Leben und Bedingung ihrer Gefährdung.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_10:A5","CH_97E9_2_10:A6","CH_97E9_2_10:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:D4","text":"Die Mitternachtsglocke vermittelt zwischen äußerem Zeitzeichen und innerem Abschiedsgedanken.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_10:A8","CH_97E9_2_10:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:D5","text":"Die vom Leben behauptete Untreue bezeichnet eine Differenz zwischen Zarathustras sprachlicher Selbstdeutung und seiner tatsächlichen Zukunftsorientierung.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_10:A8","CH_97E9_2_10:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:D6","text":"Der bevorstehende Abschied erzeugt eine gemeinsame affektive Erkenntnis, ohne die Trennung zu verhindern.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_10:A10","CH_97E9_2_10:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:D7","text":"Die unmittelbare Bindung an das Leben kann die höhere Orientierung an der Weisheit zeitweise überwiegen.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_10:A11","CH_97E9_2_10:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:SD1","text":"Das Verhältnis von Leben und Weisheit ist kein stabiles Rangverhältnis, sondern ein reversibles Abhängigkeitsgefüge, in dem Weisheit Liebe ermöglicht und zugleich deren Verlust bewirkt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:SD2","text":"Die Überschreitung von Gut und Böse erzeugt keine harmonische Einheit, sondern eine vorläufige Gemeinschaft unter Bedingungen unvollständiger Liebe und drohender Trennung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:SD3","text":"Der Abschied macht sichtbar, dass Zarathustras Bindung an das Leben nicht durch Treue, sondern durch den Konflikt zwischen Zukunftsbewegung und gegenwärtiger Nähe strukturiert ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:SD4","text":"Die Weisheit wird als konkurrierende Macht des Lebens entlarvt, obwohl sie zugleich dessen bevorzugter Grund für Zuneigung ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:DNX1","text":"Das Verhältnis von Leben und Weisheit ist keine versöhnte Einheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:DNX2","text":"Die Überschreitung moralischer Kategorien führt nicht zu einer positiven gemeinsamen Norm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:DNX3","text":"Erkenntnis des Abschieds besitzt keine rettende oder bindende Kraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:DNX4","text":"Zarathustras Weisheit ist keine souveräne, von affektiver Abhängigkeit gelöste Instanz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:DNX5","text":"Die Liebe des Lebens ist nicht unbedingt, sondern an Zarathustras Verhältnis zur Weisheit gebunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:DNX6","text":"Das gemeinsame Weinen hebt die strukturelle Asymmetrie zwischen Bleiben und Verlassen nicht auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen bleibt eine dauerhafte Synthese von Leben, Weisheit und Treue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:SNX2","text":"Die versperrte Möglichkeit einer zugleich freien, weisen und bleibenden Liebe organisiert die Spannung des gesamten Verhältnisses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:SNX3","text":"Das Leben kann Zarathustra nicht vollständig besitzen, weil seine Weisheit auf einen Ort jenseits des gegenwärtigen Lebens verweist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:SNX4","text":"Die Gemeinschaft bleibt an die Abwesenheit eines gemeinsamen Grundes gebunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:FGS1","text":"Lärm → Zerstörung zärtlicher Gedanken → Forderung nach gedämpfter Beziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:FGS2","text":"Außerkraftsetzung von Gut und Böse → gemeinsame Außenseiterposition → gegenseitige Gutheit ohne moralische Begründung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:FGS3","text":"Fehlende grundsätzliche Liebe → Verzicht auf Feindschaft → prekäre Koexistenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:FGS4","text":"Weisheit als Zuneigungsgrund → Weisheit als mögliche Fluchtinstanz → Abhängigkeit der Liebe von der Weisheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:FGS5","text":"Mitternachtsglocke → Erinnerung an den Abschied → Offenlegung von Zarathustras Untreue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:FGS6","text":"Gegenseitige Erkenntnis der Trennung → gemeinsames Weinen → zeitweilige Priorisierung des Lebens vor der Weisheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:FGS7","text":"Vorübergehende affektive Vorrangigkeit des Lebens → keine Aufhebung des Abschieds → fortbestehende Spannung zwischen Bindung und Überschreitung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:AF1","text":"Lärm → Schutz zärtlicher Gedanken → gemeinsame Sphäre jenseits von Gut und Böse → Liebe ohne Grundsätzlichkeit → Weisheit als Bindungsgrund und Gefährdung → Glocke als Aktivierung des Abschieds → gemeinsame Trauer → Vorrang des Lebens vor der Weisheit im Augenblick der Trennung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:ME1","text":"Die Beziehung wird nicht als moralische Gemeinschaft, sondern als nachmoralische Koexistenz kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:ME2","text":"Weisheit wird zugleich als Ressource der Liebe und als konkurrierende Fluchtbewegung klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:ME3","text":"Der Abschied erscheint nicht als äußerer Einschnitt, sondern als bereits im Denken und im Zeitrhythmus wirksame Struktur.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:ME4","text":"Das Gegensatzpaar Liebe versus Nichtliebe wird durch die Zwischenform einer nichtgrundsätzlichen, dennoch nichtfeindlichen Bindung reorganisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:ME5","text":"Das gemeinsame Weinen verschiebt die Ordnung von Weisheit und Leben vom dauerhaften Vorrang zur situativen Umkehrbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Ein Gespräch zwischen Zarathustra und personifiziertem Leben über Lärm, Liebe, Weisheit, Untreue und Abschied.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Eine Beziehung wird durch moralische Entgrenzung, affektive Unvollständigkeit und asymmetrische Zukunftsorientierung organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Der Text verschiebt die Frage von der Rechtfertigung der Beziehung auf die Bedingungen ihrer prekären Fortdauer und ihres bevorstehenden Endes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Leben und Weisheit erscheinen als konkurrierende Existenzorientierungen; die Zeit wird durch die Glocke als Wiederkehr des noch nicht vollzogenen Abschieds strukturiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von der gedämpften Rede über die prekäre Gemeinschaft zur Abschiedstrauer zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob Zarathustras Abschied endgültig, notwendig oder nur beabsichtigt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Liebe nicht als grundsätzliche Einheit, sondern als gefährdete Bindung verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Verbindung liegt in der Kopplung von Weisheit, Untreue und Abschied.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:MRT5","text":"Die Rekonstruktion hängt von der Personifikation des Lebens und der symbolischen Funktion der Mitternachtsglocke ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:MRT6","text":"Die gemeinsame Trauer bewahrt die affektive Gegenwart des Lebens, löst aber den grundlegenden Widerspruch zwischen Bindung und Verlassen nicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T190804688158Z_56bf2841","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"2.","source_sha256":"2622e0b8026259dc372c79f22343006817249e434546eaebad4dded06a6cf3cf","sha256":"7facfd9e75b8e014c57017768dd7a61a3d8dcf0ae9cafd5f84908740b9042864","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:08:04.690475+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:AS1","text":"Life interrupts the noise because noise destroys tender thoughts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:AS2","text":"Life and Zarathustra define their community beyond good and evil as the mutual goodness of two beings who are neither good nor evil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:AS3","text":"Their relationship is based not on fundamental love, but on the possibility of not bearing each other a grudge without such love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:AS4","text":"Life is fond of Zarathustra because of his wisdom, but remains jealously dependent on this wisdom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:AS5","text":"The nocturnal bell makes Zarathustra's impending departure audible as a repressed thought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:AS6","text":"The mutual recognition of the impending separation leads not to dissolution, but to shared weeping and to a temporary priority of life over wisdom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:A1","text":"Noise kills thoughts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:A2","text":"Tender thoughts require a non-noisy relationship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:A3","text":"Life and Zarathustra stand beyond the distinction between good and evil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:A4","text":"Their relationship can exist without fundamental love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:A5","text":"Life is fond of Zarathustra because of his wisdom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:A6","text":"Wisdom possesses the possibility of withdrawing from Zarathustra.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:A7","text":"With the loss of wisdom, the loss of Life's love also threatens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:A8","text":"Zarathustra intends to leave Life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:A9","text":"The midnight bell activates in Zarathustra the thought of his departure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:A10","text":"Life recognizes Zarathustra's unfaithfulness and his impending departure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:A11","text":"Shared recognition of the separation can turn into shared weeping.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:A12","text":"In the situation of departure, Life can be ranked above wisdom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:NX1","text":"The relationship is not a fundamental love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:NX2","text":"Life and Zarathustra are neither good nor evil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:NX3","text":"The community is not based on enduring fidelity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:NX4","text":"Zarathustra's speech about his relationship to Life does not fully correspond to his actual attachment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:NX5","text":"Life is not independent of Zarathustra's wisdom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:NX6","text":"Wisdom does not guarantee the preservation of love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:NX7","text":"The departure is not annulled by the shared green meadow.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:D1","text":"The shared sphere of Life and Zarathustra is constituted by the suspension of moral oppositions.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_10:A3","CH_97E9_2_10:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:D2","text":"Despite the absence of fundamental love, the relationship can continue as mutual forbearance.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_10:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:D3","text":"Zarathustra's wisdom is at once the basis of his closeness to Life and the condition of its endangerment.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_10:A5","CH_97E9_2_10:A6","CH_97E9_2_10:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:D4","text":"The midnight bell mediates between an external sign of time and an inner thought of departure.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_10:A8","CH_97E9_2_10:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:D5","text":"The unfaithfulness asserted by Life denotes a difference between Zarathustra's linguistic self-interpretation and his actual orientation toward the future.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_10:A8","CH_97E9_2_10:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:D6","text":"The impending departure produces a shared affective recognition without preventing the separation.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_10:A10","CH_97E9_2_10:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:D7","text":"The immediate attachment to Life can temporarily outweigh the higher orientation toward wisdom.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_10:A11","CH_97E9_2_10:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:SD1","text":"The relation between Life and wisdom is not a stable hierarchical relation, but a reversible configuration of dependency in which wisdom enables love and at the same time brings about its loss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:SD2","text":"The transgression of good and evil produces no harmonious unity, but a provisional community under conditions of incomplete love and impending separation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:SD3","text":"The departure makes visible that Zarathustra's attachment to Life is structured not by fidelity, but by the conflict between movement toward the future and present closeness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:SD4","text":"Wisdom is exposed as a power competing with Life, although it is at the same time Life's preferred ground for affection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:DNX1","text":"The relation between Life and wisdom is not a reconciled unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:DNX2","text":"The transgression of moral categories does not lead to a positive shared norm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:DNX3","text":"Recognition of departure possesses no saving or binding force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:DNX4","text":"Zarathustra's wisdom is not a sovereign instance detached from affective dependency.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:DNX5","text":"Life's love is not unconditional, but bound to Zarathustra's relation to wisdom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:DNX6","text":"The shared weeping does not annul the structural asymmetry between staying and leaving.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:SNX1","text":"A lasting synthesis of Life, wisdom, and fidelity remains excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:SNX2","text":"The blocked possibility of a love that is at once free, wise, and enduring organizes the tension of the entire relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:SNX3","text":"Life cannot fully possess Zarathustra, because his wisdom points to a place beyond present life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:SNX4","text":"The community remains bound to the absence of a shared ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:FGS1","text":"Noise → destruction of tender thoughts → demand for a muted relationship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:FGS2","text":"Suspension of good and evil → shared outsider position → mutual goodness without moral grounding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:FGS3","text":"Lack of fundamental love → renunciation of enmity → precarious coexistence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:FGS4","text":"Wisdom as the ground of affection → wisdom as a possible avenue of escape → dependence of love on wisdom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:FGS5","text":"Midnight bell → remembrance of the departure → disclosure of Zarathustra's infidelity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:FGS6","text":"Mutual recognition of the separation → shared weeping → temporary prioritization of life over wisdom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:FGS7","text":"Temporary affective priority of life → no cancellation of the departure → continuing tension between attachment and transgression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:AF1","text":"Noise → protection of tender thoughts → shared sphere beyond good and evil → love without fundamentality → wisdom as ground of attachment and endangerment → bell as activation of departure → shared mourning → primacy of Life over wisdom at the moment of separation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:ME1","text":"The relationship is mapped not as a moral community, but as post-moral coexistence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:ME2","text":"Wisdom is classified at once as a resource of love and as a competing movement of flight.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:ME3","text":"The departure appears not as an external rupture, but as a structure already operative in thought and in temporal rhythm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:ME4","text":"The opposition between love and non-love is reorganized through the intermediate form of a non-fundamental yet non-hostile attachment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:ME5","text":"The shared weeping shifts the order of wisdom and Life from enduring primacy to situational reversibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** A conversation between Zarathustra and personified Life about noise, love, wisdom, unfaithfulness, and departure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** A relationship is organized through moral de-limitation, affective incompleteness, and asymmetric orientation toward the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** The text shifts the question from the justification of the relationship to the conditions of its precarious continuation and its impending end.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Life and wisdom appear as competing existential orientations; time is structured by the bell as the recurrence of the not-yet-executed departure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from subdued speech through precarious community to the mourning of departure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether Zarathustra's departure is final, necessary, or merely intended.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent provided that love is understood not as fundamental unity, but as endangered attachment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:MRT4","text":"Its strongest connection lies in the coupling of wisdom, unfaithfulness, and departure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:MRT5","text":"The reconstruction depends on the personification of Life and the symbolic function of the midnight bell.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_10:MRT6","text":"The shared mourning preserves the affective presence of Life, but does not resolve the fundamental contradiction between attachment and leaving.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_10:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_2_10@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_2_10:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"The Other Dance Song","source_section_label":"2.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"The Other Dance Song · 2","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","The Other Dance Song","2."],"original_title":"2."}],"source_title_context":"Das andere Tanzlied","source_section_label":"2.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"The Other Dance Song · 2","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","The Other Dance Song","2."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 116","title":"The Other Dance Song · 2","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Das andere Tanzlied · 2"},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5","layer":"CH","title":"The Other Dance Song · 3","order":117,"parents":["RAW_97E9_3C_5"],"revision":"CH_97E9_3C_5@R001","sha256":"b4b9179a3604b3ad7e33ab716d48cb78a7eb19d0d70ef103fd7934ccd42ef2a3","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:AS1","text":"Eine gezählte Anrufung eröffnet einen Übergang vom menschlichen Hören zur Stimme der tiefen Mitternacht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:AS2","text":"Die Mitternacht bestimmt Erwachen als Hervortreten aus tiefem Schlaf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:AS3","text":"Die erwachte Stimme setzt die Tiefe der Welt gegen die begrenzte Vorstellung des Tages.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:AS4","text":"In dieser Tiefe erscheinen Weh und Lust als verschränkte, aber nicht gleichrangige Kräfte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:AS5","text":"Das Weh spricht den Verfall aus, während die Lust über das Weh hinaus auf Ewigkeit zielt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:AS6","text":"Die Argumentbewegung führt von zeitlicher Anrufung über ontologische Tiefe zu einem Willen der Lust auf unendliche Dauer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:A1","text":"Die Rede ist durch die Folge von Eins bis Zwölf temporal und formal gerahmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:A2","text":"Die tiefe Mitternacht besitzt eine eigene sprechende Instanz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:A3","text":"Schlaf und Erwachen bilden einen Übergang zwischen verborgenem Zustand und artikulierter Erkenntnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:A4","text":"Die Welt ist tief.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:A5","text":"Die Tiefe der Welt übersteigt das, was der Tag denkt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:A6","text":"Das Weh gehört zur Tiefe der Welt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:A7","text":"Die Lust reicht tiefer als das Herzeleid.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:A8","text":"Das Weh spricht den Imperativ des Vergehens aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:A9","text":"Die Lust will Ewigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:A10","text":"Der Wille der Lust auf Ewigkeit wird durch Wiederholung intensiviert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:NX1","text":"Die Welt ist nicht auf die Perspektive des Tages begrenzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:NX2","text":"Die Tiefe der Welt ist nicht vollständig durch gewöhnliches Denken verfügbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:NX3","text":"Die Lust ist nicht bloß eine abgeschwächte Form des Herzeleids.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:NX4","text":"Die Welt ist nicht durch das Weh erschöpft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:NX5","text":"Die Lust ist nicht auf Vergehen reduzierbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:NX6","text":"Die Mitternacht ist nicht bloß ein Zeitpunkt ohne eigene Aussagekraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:D1","text":"Das Erwachen eröffnet keinen Rückzug aus der Tiefe, sondern einen Zugang zu ihr.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_5:A2","CH_97E9_3C_5:A3","CH_97E9_3C_5:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:D2","text":"Die Wahrheit der Welt liegt jenseits der begrifflichen Reichweite des Tagesbewusstseins.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_5:A4","CH_97E9_3C_5:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:D3","text":"Das Weh bezeichnet eine Kraft des Vergehens innerhalb der Weltentiefe.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_5:A6","CH_97E9_3C_5:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:D4","text":"Die Lust erhält gegenüber dem Weh einen Vorrang der Tiefe.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_5:A6","CH_97E9_3C_5:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:D5","text":"Die Lust widerspricht dem Vergehensspruch des Wehs durch ihren Willen zur Ewigkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_5:A8","CH_97E9_3C_5:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:D6","text":"Die Wiederholung von „tiefe“ macht Ewigkeit als gesteigerte und nicht bloß quantitative Dauer hörbar.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_5:A9","CH_97E9_3C_5:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:SD1","text":"Die ontologische Tiefe der Welt wird durch eine zeitliche und affektive Dramaturgie erzeugt: Mitternacht, Schlaf, Erwachen, Weh und Lust bilden abgestufte Zugänge zu ihr.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_5:A2","CH_97E9_3C_5:A3","CH_97E9_3C_5:A4","CH_97E9_3C_5:A6","CH_97E9_3C_5:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:SD2","text":"Das Gedicht verschiebt den Maßstab der Wirklichkeit vom Tagesdenken auf die tiefere Logik der Lust.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_5:A5","CH_97E9_3C_5:A7","CH_97E9_3C_5:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:SD3","text":"Der Gegensatz von Vergehen und Ewigkeit wird nicht durch eine äußere Auflösung, sondern durch die Rangordnung von Weh und Lust organisiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_5:A7","CH_97E9_3C_5:A8","CH_97E9_3C_5:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:SD4","text":"Die Lust erscheint als affirmative Gegenmacht, deren Anspruch auf Ewigkeit die zeitliche Endlichkeit nicht beseitigt, sondern überbietet.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_5:A8","CH_97E9_3C_5:A9","CH_97E9_3C_5:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:DNX1","text":"Das Tagesbewusstsein ist als hinreichender Maßstab für Welt, Wahrheit und Tiefe ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:DNX2","text":"Ein Modell, in dem Lust lediglich aus der Abwesenheit von Schmerz besteht, ist ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:DNX3","text":"Ein Modell, in dem das Weh die letzte Aussage über die Welt bildet, ist ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:DNX4","text":"Ein Verständnis der Zeit als bloßem linearem Vergehen reicht für die Lust nicht aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:DNX5","text":"Erkenntnis wird nicht als vollständig wacher, tagesförmiger Zugriff vorausgesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Welt, deren letzte Tiefe in sichtbarer Gegenwart, rationaler Tagesklarheit oder endlichem Vergehen aufgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Versöhnung von Weh und Lust durch Gleichsetzung; ihre Spannung bleibt die Bedingung der Schlussbewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen bleibt eine vollständig ausgesprochene Begründung dafür, warum die Lust Ewigkeit will; ihr Wille fungiert als letzte Setzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:SNX4","text":"Versperrt bleibt eine neutrale Position außerhalb von Tiefe, Weh, Lust, Vergehen und Ewigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:FGS1","text":"Zählrahmen → Anrufung des Menschen → Übergabe der Rede an die Mitternacht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:FGS2","text":"Mitternacht → Schlaf → Erwachen → Hervortreten einer verborgenen Weltstimme.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:FGS3","text":"Welt → Tiefe → Überschreitung des Tagesdenkens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:FGS4","text":"Tiefe → Weh und Lust → affektive Binnenstruktur der Welt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:FGS5","text":"Weh → „Vergeh!“; Lust → Ewigkeit → Gegenüberstellung von Negation und Affirmation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:FGS6","text":"Wiederholung der Tiefe → Intensivierung des Ewigkeitswillens → terminale Schließung ohne begriffliche Begründung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:AF1","text":"Menschliche Aufmerksamkeit → Stimme der Mitternacht → Erwachen aus tiefem Schlaf → Welt jenseits des Tagesdenkens → Weh als Vergehensspruch → Lust als tiefere Gegenkraft → Wille zur tiefen Ewigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:ME1","text":"Die begriffliche Karte verschiebt sich von der Tagesperspektive auf eine nächtliche Tiefenordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:ME2","text":"Weh und Lust werden nicht als einfache Gegensätze, sondern als hierarchisch verschränkte Kräfte klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:ME3","text":"Ewigkeit erscheint nicht als abstrakte Zeitdefinition, sondern als von der Lust hervorgebrachter Wille.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:ME4","text":"Das Verhältnis von Endlichkeit und Dauer wird von der Aussage des Wehs zur Gegenbehauptung der Lust umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:ALT1","text":"Surface — Eine gezählte Mitternachtsrede artikuliert Schlaf, Erwachen, Welt, Weh, Lust und Ewigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Rede organisiert eine Rangordnung von Tagesdenken, Weltentiefe, Weh und Lust.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Zugang zur Wahrheit wird vom wachen Tagesbewusstsein auf eine nächtliche, affektiv vermittelte Stimme verlagert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Die Welt wird als tiefer als das gedachte Tagesmaß gesetzt, während die Lust eine nicht vergehende Zeitdimension verlangt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von der Mitternachtsanrufung zur Ewigkeit der Lust zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:MRT2","text":"Die formale Funktion der Zwölfzahl ist als Rahmen bestimmt, bleibt jedoch in ihrer symbolischen Bedeutung unterbestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, weil die Lust als tiefere Gegenkraft zum Vergehensspruch des Wehs eingesetzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung des Systems liegt in der Kette Tiefe → Lust → Ewigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:MRT5","text":"Unaufgelöst bleibt, ob Ewigkeit ontologisch besteht oder ausschließlich als Wille der Lust erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:MRT6","text":"Unaufgelöst bleibt ferner, wie der Satz des Wehs, „Vergeh!“, mit dem Ewigkeitswillen der Lust innerhalb derselben Weltentiefe vermittelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, sofern sie die Schlusssetzung der Ewigkeit nicht in einen begrifflichen Beweis umwandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T191403874003Z_a6ffd6e6","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"3.","source_sha256":"b4b9179a3604b3ad7e33ab716d48cb78a7eb19d0d70ef103fd7934ccd42ef2a3","sha256":"d83f69081340a335e529b1caa320d6ded8029f45ac7450307e1c91a715172183","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:14:03.875522+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:AS1","text":"A counted invocation opens a transition from human hearing to the voice of deep midnight.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:AS2","text":"Midnight determines awakening as emergence from deep sleep.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:AS3","text":"The awakened voice sets the depth of the world against the limited conception of day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:AS4","text":"In this depth, woe and pleasure appear as intertwined, yet not coequal, forces.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:AS5","text":"Woe pronounces decay, whereas pleasure aims beyond woe at eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:AS6","text":"The movement of the argument leads from temporal invocation through ontological depth to a will of pleasure for infinite duration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:A1","text":"The discourse is temporally and formally framed by the sequence from One to Twelve.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:A2","text":"Deep midnight possesses its own speaking instance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:A3","text":"Sleep and awakening form a transition between a hidden state and articulated knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:A4","text":"The world is deep.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:A5","text":"The depth of the world exceeds what the day thinks.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:A6","text":"Woe belongs to the depth of the world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:A7","text":"Pleasure reaches deeper than heartache.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:A8","text":"Woe pronounces the imperative of passing away.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:A9","text":"Pleasure wants eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:A10","text":"Pleasure's will to eternity is intensified through repetition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:NX1","text":"The world is not limited to the perspective of the day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:NX2","text":"The depth of the world is not fully available through ordinary thinking.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:NX3","text":"Pleasure is not merely an attenuated form of heartache.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:NX4","text":"The world is not exhausted by woe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:NX5","text":"Pleasure is not reducible to passing away.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:NX6","text":"Midnight is not merely a point in time without any expressive force of its own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:D1","text":"Awakening opens not a retreat from depth, but an access to it.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_5:A2","CH_97E9_3C_5:A3","CH_97E9_3C_5:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:D2","text":"The truth of the world lies beyond the conceptual reach of daytime consciousness.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_5:A4","CH_97E9_3C_5:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:D3","text":"Woe designates a force of passing away within the depth of the world.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_5:A6","CH_97E9_3C_5:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:D4","text":"Pleasure is accorded a priority of depth over woe.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_5:A6","CH_97E9_3C_5:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:D5","text":"Pleasure contradicts woe's pronouncement of passing away through its will to eternity.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_5:A8","CH_97E9_3C_5:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:D6","text":"The repetition of „tiefe“ makes eternity audible as intensified rather than merely quantitative duration.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_5:A9","CH_97E9_3C_5:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:SD1","text":"The ontological depth of the world is generated through a temporal and affective dramaturgy: midnight, sleep, awakening, woe, and pleasure form graduated accesses to it.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_5:A2","CH_97E9_3C_5:A3","CH_97E9_3C_5:A4","CH_97E9_3C_5:A6","CH_97E9_3C_5:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:SD2","text":"The poem shifts the measure of reality from daytime thinking to the deeper logic of pleasure.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_5:A5","CH_97E9_3C_5:A7","CH_97E9_3C_5:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:SD3","text":"The opposition between passing away and eternity is organized not through an external resolution, but through the ordering of woe and pleasure.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_5:A7","CH_97E9_3C_5:A8","CH_97E9_3C_5:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:SD4","text":"Pleasure appears as an affirmative counterforce whose claim to eternity does not abolish temporal finitude, but surpasses it.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_5:A8","CH_97E9_3C_5:A9","CH_97E9_3C_5:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:DNX1","text":"Daytime consciousness is excluded as a sufficient measure for world, truth, and depth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:DNX2","text":"A model in which pleasure consists merely in the absence of pain is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:DNX3","text":"A model in which woe constitutes the final statement about the world is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:DNX4","text":"An understanding of time as mere linear passing away is insufficient for pleasure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:DNX5","text":"Knowledge is not presupposed as a fully awake, day-shaped grasp.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a world whose ultimate depth is exhausted in visible presence, rational daytime clarity, or finite passing away.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:SNX2","text":"Excluded is the reconciliation of woe and pleasure through their equation; their tension remains the condition of the concluding movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:SNX3","text":"What remains excluded is a fully articulated grounding of why pleasure wants eternity; its will functions as the final positing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:SNX4","text":"A neutral position outside depth, woe, pleasure, passing away, and eternity remains barred.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:FGS1","text":"Counting frame → invocation of the human being → transfer of speech to midnight.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:FGS2","text":"Midnight → sleep → awakening → emergence of a hidden world-voice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:FGS3","text":"World → depth → transcendence of daytime thinking.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:FGS4","text":"Depth → woe and pleasure → affective inner structure of the world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:FGS5","text":"Woe → „Vergeh!“; pleasure → eternity → juxtaposition of negation and affirmation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:FGS6","text":"Repetition of depth → intensification of the will to eternity → terminal closure without conceptual justification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:AF1","text":"Human attention → voice of midnight → awakening from deep sleep → world beyond daytime thinking → woe as pronouncement of passing away → pleasure as deeper counterforce → will to deep eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:ME1","text":"The conceptual map shifts from the daytime perspective to a nocturnal order of depth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:ME2","text":"Woe and pleasure are classified not as simple opposites, but as hierarchically interwoven forces.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:ME3","text":"Eternity appears not as an abstract definition of time, but as a will brought forth by pleasure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:ME4","text":"The relation between finitude and duration is remapped from the statement of woe to the counter-assertion of pleasure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:ALT1","text":"Surface — A counted midnight discourse articulates sleep, awakening, world, woe, pleasure, and eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:ALT2","text":"Structural — The discourse organizes an ordering of daytime thinking, world-depth, woe, and pleasure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Access to truth is displaced from awake daytime consciousness to a nocturnal voice mediated by affect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The world is posited as deeper than the conceived daytime measure, while pleasure demands a non-perishing temporal dimension.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from the invocation of midnight to the eternity of pleasure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:MRT2","text":"The formal function of the number twelve is determined as a frame, yet remains underdetermined in its symbolic significance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent because pleasure is deployed as a deeper counterforce to woe's pronouncement of passing away.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:MRT4","text":"The system's strongest connection lies in the chain depth → pleasure → eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:MRT5","text":"It remains unresolved whether eternity exists ontologically or appears exclusively as the will of pleasure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:MRT6","text":"It further remains unresolved how the saying of woe, „Vergeh!“, is mediated with pleasure's will to eternity within the same depth of the world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_5:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual argumentative movement insofar as it does not transform the concluding positing of eternity into a conceptual proof.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_3C_5@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_3C_5:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"The Other Dance Song","source_section_label":"3.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"The Other Dance Song · 3","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","The Other Dance Song","3."],"original_title":"3."}],"source_title_context":"Das andere Tanzlied","source_section_label":"3.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"The Other Dance Song · 3","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","The Other Dance Song","3."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 117","title":"The Other Dance Song · 3","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Das andere Tanzlied · 3"},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11","layer":"CH","title":"The Seven Seals · 1","order":118,"parents":["RAW_97E9_1_11"],"revision":"CH_97E9_1_11@R001","sha256":"28bd2bc06159bc89b7e646bc5133f90ed63e2e4d23382ba30d179c1334052e07","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:AS1","text":"Das zentrale Problem ist die Vermittlung zwischen Vergangenem und Zukünftigem angesichts einer erschöpften, nicht sterben könnenden Gegenwart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:AS2","text":"Der Sprecher bestimmt den Wahrsager als Schwellenfigur zwischen zwei Zeiten und als Träger einer noch nicht entladenen Zukunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:AS3","text":"Zukunft wird nicht als bloße Erwartung, sondern als gewaltsam bevorstehender Blitz und als erlösendes Licht begriffen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:AS4","text":"Die bejahende Zukunft erhält ihre höchste Form in der Ewigkeit und im Ring der Wiederkunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:AS5","text":"Die Bewegung führt von zeitlicher Spannung und schwerem Tragen zur erotisch-metaphysischen Bejahung der Ewigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:A1","text":"Der Wahrsager bewegt sich zwischen Vergangenheit und Zukunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:A2","text":"Die Gegenwart der müden Niederungen ist dem Wahrsager feindlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:A3","text":"Zukunft ist als im dunklen Inneren aufgestaute Blitzkraft gegenwärtig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:A4","text":"Der Blitz besitzt eine bejahende und erlösende Funktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:A5","text":"Die Hervorbringung zukünftigen Lichts verlangt langes, schweres Ausharren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:A6","text":"Die Ewigkeit ist das begehrte Ziel der brünstigen Bewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:A7","text":"Der Ring der Wiederkunft ist die Gestalt der Ewigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:A8","text":"Liebe zur Ewigkeit ersetzt die Suche nach einem menschlichen weiblichen Gegenüber.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:A9","text":"Die Ewigkeit wird als geliebtes und zeugungsfähiges Gegenüber behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:NX1","text":"Der Wahrsager gehört weder ausschließlich der Vergangenheit noch ausschließlich der Zukunft an.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:NX2","text":"Die prophetische Existenz ist nicht in den müden Niederungen der Gegenwart beheimatet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:NX3","text":"Zukunft ist nicht passives Warten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:NX4","text":"Das ersehnte Weib ist nicht das notwendige Gegenüber der Zeugung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:NX5","text":"Ewigkeit ist nicht lineare Fortsetzung der Zeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:NX6","text":"Wiederkunft ist nicht einmalige Erlösung oder endgültiger Abschluss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:D1","text":"Die Schwellenposition des Wahrsagers erzeugt eine gespannte Zeitlichkeit, in der Vergangenheit und Zukunft zugleich präsent sind.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_11:A1","CH_97E9_1_11:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:D2","text":"Die Ablehnung der müden Gegenwart verwandelt Zukunft in eine antagonistische Kraft.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_11:A2","CH_97E9_1_11:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:D3","text":"Das aufgestaute Zukünftige wird durch den Blitz in sichtbare und erlösende Bejahung überführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_11:A3","CH_97E9_1_11:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:D4","text":"Das zukünftige Licht kann nur aus einer langen Phase des Tragens und der Verdichtung hervorgehen.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_11:A4","CH_97E9_1_11:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:D5","text":"Die Bejahung erreicht ihre höchste Form, wenn Zukunft nicht als Neues, sondern als Wiederkunft der Ewigkeit gedacht wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_11:A6","CH_97E9_1_11:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:D6","text":"Die erotische Sprache macht die Ewigkeit zum Objekt von Liebe, Verlangen und möglicher Zeugung.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_11:A8","CH_97E9_1_11:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:SD1","text":"Zeitliche Vermittlung, prophetische Spannung und Blitzmetaphorik bilden eine Ontologie, in der Zukunft als bereits körperlich geladene Kraft erscheint.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_11:A1","CH_97E9_1_11:A3","CH_97E9_1_11:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:SD2","text":"Erlösung wird nicht durch Entkommen aus der Zeit, sondern durch die Bejahung ihrer ewigen Wiederkehr erzeugt.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_11:A4","CH_97E9_1_11:A6","CH_97E9_1_11:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:SD3","text":"Das schöpferische Subjekt wird weniger durch menschliche Fortpflanzung als durch seine Liebesbeziehung zur Ewigkeit bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_11:A8","CH_97E9_1_11:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:SD4","text":"Das Ja erhält seine Kraft aus der vorherigen Konfrontation mit Müdigkeit, Unfruchtbarkeit und zeitlicher Erschöpfung.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_11:A2","CH_97E9_1_11:A4","CH_97E9_1_11:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:DNX1","text":"Das System hängt davon ab, dass eine erschöpfte Gegenwart keine hinreichende Form des Lebens und der Zeit darstellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:DNX2","text":"Es muss falsch sein, dass Zukunft durch kontinuierliche, ruhige Entwicklung entsteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:DNX3","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass Erlösung in einem endgültigen zukünftigen Zustand liegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:DNX4","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass Zeugung ausschließlich an ein menschliches Gegenüber und eine lineare Nachkommenschaft gebunden ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:DNX5","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass Bejahung ohne vorherige Last, Spannung und Verdichtung möglich ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Zeitordnung, in der Vergangenheit, Gegenwart und Zukunft stabil voneinander getrennt bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Erlösung, die den Kreislauf der Wiederkunft beendet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Lebensmodell, dessen schöpferische Zukunft auf Fortsetzung statt auf ewiger Wiederkehr beruht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:SNX4","text":"Abwesend bleibt eine eigenständige positive Bestimmung der Gegenwart; sie erscheint nur als das, was überwunden oder entladen werden muss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:FGS1","text":"Zeitliche Zwischenstellung → Konfrontation mit müder Gegenwart → Aufstauung zukünftiger Kraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:FGS2","text":"Aufstauung → Verdichtung im dunklen Inneren → Blitzbereitschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:FGS3","text":"Blitzbereitschaft → bejahender Lichtstrahl → Erlösung durch Sichtbarwerden der Zukunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:FGS4","text":"Erlösende Bejahung → Übergang von linearer Zukunft zu Ewigkeit → Ring der Wiederkunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:FGS5","text":"Ring der Wiederkunft → erotische Identifikation der Ewigkeit → Ersetzung menschlicher Zeugung durch Liebe zur Ewigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:AF1","text":"Müde Gegenwart → zeitliche Schwellenposition → aufgestaute Zukunft → Blitz und erlösendes Licht → Ewigkeit → Ring der Wiederkunft → erotische Bejahung der Ewigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:ME1","text":"Zukunft wird von einem noch nicht vorhandenen Zeitpunkt in eine gegenwärtig verkörperte und aufgeladene Kraft umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:ME2","text":"Erlösung wird von einem Ausweg aus der Zeit auf die Bejahung zyklischer Zeit verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:ME3","text":"Zeugung wird von biologischer oder zwischenmenschlicher Fortsetzung auf eine metaphysische Beziehung zur Ewigkeit umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:ME4","text":"Gegensatzpaare wie Dunkelheit und Licht sowie Last und Erlösung werden als aufeinander angewiesene Phasen eines einzigen Prozesses kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:ME5","text":"Das prophetische Subjekt wird nicht als Beobachter der Zukunft, sondern als deren schwangere Trägerinstanz bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Sprecher bekennt sein Verlangen nach Ewigkeit und Wiederkunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Aussage organisiert eine Zeitstruktur aus Schwelle, Last, Verdichtung, Entladung und Wiederkehr.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Bejahung wird als aktive Hervorbringung gegen Müdigkeit und lineare Erlösung positioniert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Wirklichkeit wird als zyklische Zeitordnung bestimmt, in der Zukunft als Wiederkunft der Ewigkeit erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von prophetischer Schwellenzeit zu Ewigkeit und Wiederkunft zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob die Wahrsagerrede als Selbstbeschreibung, Vision oder allgemeine ontologische Aussage gilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Wiederkunft als höchste Form der Bejahung und nicht als Aufhebung der Zeit verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung besteht zwischen zeitlicher Last, Blitzmetaphorik und bejahender Entladung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:MRT5","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen dem Zukunftscharakter des Lichts und der Identifikation des höchsten Ziels mit ewiger Wiederkehr bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:MRT6","text":"Die erotische Zeugungsmetaphorik erweitert die Zeitontologie, löst aber das Verhältnis zwischen menschlicher Liebe und Ewigkeit nicht vollständig auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung des Textes, sofern das abschließende Ja als Ergebnis einer vorherigen negativen Abgrenzung gelesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T185624337806Z_2b9b61d0","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"1.","source_sha256":"28bd2bc06159bc89b7e646bc5133f90ed63e2e4d23382ba30d179c1334052e07","sha256":"60e9eb24502f4a2826ff2f34b2577efe979d0109ae06888f62e6daaf3989cba0","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T18:56:24.338803+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:AS1","text":"The central problem is mediation between the past and the future in the face of an exhausted present incapable of dying.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:AS2","text":"The speaker defines the soothsayer as a threshold figure between two times and as the bearer of a future not yet discharged.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:AS3","text":"The future is understood not as mere expectation, but as a violently impending lightning bolt and as redeeming light.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:AS4","text":"The affirmative future receives its highest form in eternity and in the ring of recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:AS5","text":"The movement leads from temporal tension and heavy bearing toward the erotic-metaphysical affirmation of eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:A1","text":"The soothsayer moves between past and future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:A2","text":"The present of the weary lowlands is hostile to the soothsayer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:A3","text":"The future is present as lightning-force dammed up in the dark interior.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:A4","text":"Lightning possesses an affirmative and redeeming function.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:A5","text":"The production of future light demands prolonged, arduous endurance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:A6","text":"Eternity is the desired goal of the ardent movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:A7","text":"The ring of recurrence is the form of eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:A8","text":"Love of eternity replaces the search for a human female counterpart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:A9","text":"Eternity is treated as a beloved and procreative counterpart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:NX1","text":"The soothsayer belongs neither exclusively to the past nor exclusively to the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:NX2","text":"Prophetic existence is not at home in the weary lowlands of the present.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:NX3","text":"The future is not passive waiting.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:NX4","text":"The desired woman is not the necessary counterpart of procreation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:NX5","text":"Eternity is not the linear continuation of time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:NX6","text":"Recurrence is not one-time redemption or definitive completion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:D1","text":"The threshold position of the soothsayer produces a tense temporality in which past and future are simultaneously present.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_11:A1","CH_97E9_1_11:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:D2","text":"The rejection of the weary present transforms the future into an antagonistic force.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_11:A2","CH_97E9_1_11:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:D3","text":"The dammed-up future is transferred through lightning into visible and redeeming affirmation.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_11:A3","CH_97E9_1_11:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:D4","text":"Future light can emerge only from a long phase of bearing and condensation.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_11:A4","CH_97E9_1_11:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:D5","text":"Affirmation reaches its highest form when the future is thought not as the new, but as the recurrence of eternity.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_11:A6","CH_97E9_1_11:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:D6","text":"Erotic language makes eternity the object of love, desire, and possible procreation.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_11:A8","CH_97E9_1_11:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:SD1","text":"Temporal mediation, prophetic tension, and lightning metaphorics form an ontology in which the future appears as a force already corporeally charged.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_11:A1","CH_97E9_1_11:A3","CH_97E9_1_11:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:SD2","text":"Redemption is produced not through escape from time, but through the affirmation of its eternal recurrence.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_11:A4","CH_97E9_1_11:A6","CH_97E9_1_11:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:SD3","text":"The creative subject is determined less by human reproduction than by its love relationship to eternity.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_11:A8","CH_97E9_1_11:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:SD4","text":"The Yes derives its force from the prior confrontation with weariness, infertility, and temporal exhaustion.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_11:A2","CH_97E9_1_11:A4","CH_97E9_1_11:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:DNX1","text":"The system depends on an exhausted present not constituting a sufficient form of life and time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:DNX2","text":"It must be false that the future arises through continuous, tranquil development.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:DNX3","text":"It is excluded that redemption lies in a definitive future state.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:DNX4","text":"It is excluded that procreation is bound exclusively to a human counterpart and linear descent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:DNX5","text":"It is excluded that affirmation is possible without prior burden, tension, and condensation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a temporal order in which past, present, and future remain stably separated from one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:SNX2","text":"Excluded is a redemption that ends the cycle of recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:SNX3","text":"Excluded is a model of life whose creative future rests on continuation rather than on eternal recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:SNX4","text":"Absent remains an autonomous positive determination of the present; it appears only as that which must be overcome or discharged.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:FGS1","text":"Temporal in-betweenness → confrontation with the weary present → damming-up of future force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:FGS2","text":"Damming-up → condensation in the dark interior → readiness for lightning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:FGS3","text":"Readiness for lightning → affirmative ray of light → redemption through the becoming-visible of the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:FGS4","text":"Redeeming affirmation → transition from linear future to eternity → ring of recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:FGS5","text":"Ring of recurrence → erotic identification of eternity → replacement of human procreation by love of eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:AF1","text":"Weary present → temporal threshold position → dammed-up future → lightning and redeeming light → eternity → ring of recurrence → erotic affirmation of eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:ME1","text":"The future is remapped from a point in time not yet present into a force presently embodied and charged.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:ME2","text":"Redemption is shifted from an exit from time to the affirmation of cyclical time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:ME3","text":"Procreation is reclassified from biological or interpersonal continuation to a metaphysical relation to eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:ME4","text":"Pairs of opposites such as darkness and light, as well as burden and redemption, are mapped as mutually dependent phases of a single process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:ME5","text":"The prophetic subject is defined not as an observer of the future, but as its pregnant bearer-instance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:ALT1","text":"Surface — The speaker avows his desire for eternity and recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:ALT2","text":"Structural — The statement organizes a temporal structure of threshold, burden, condensation, discharge, and recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Affirmation is positioned as active production against weariness and linear redemption.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Reality is defined as a cyclical temporal order in which the future appears as the recurrence of eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from prophetic threshold-time to eternity and recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether the soothsayer's speech holds as self-description, vision, or general ontological statement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent provided recurrence is understood as the highest form of affirmation and not as the abolition of time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:MRT4","text":"The strongest connection exists between temporal burden, lightning metaphorics, and affirmative discharge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:MRT5","text":"A tension remains between the future-character of light and the identification of the highest goal with eternal recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:MRT6","text":"The erotic metaphorics of procreation expands the ontology of time, but does not fully resolve the relation between human love and eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_11:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the text's actual movement, provided the concluding Yes is read as the result of a prior negative demarcation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_11:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_1_11@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_1_11:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"The Seven Seals","source_section_label":"1.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"The Seven Seals · 1","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","The Seven Seals","1."],"original_title":"1."}],"source_title_context":"Die sieben Siegel","source_section_label":"1.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"The Seven Seals · 1","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","The Seven Seals","1."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 118","title":"The Seven Seals · 1","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Die sieben Siegel · 1"},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11","layer":"CH","title":"The Seven Seals · 2","order":119,"parents":["RAW_97E9_2_11"],"revision":"CH_97E9_2_11@R001","sha256":"e2e97675c470f175aae713fac405fe58859e4910bfcea5d15bdb0da1087d3902","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:AS1","text":"Der Text setzt zerstörerischen Zorn und Hohn als Kräfte ein, die Gräber, Grenzsteine, Tafeln, Worte und verdumpfte Grabkammern auflösen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:AS2","text":"Die Zerstörung richtet sich gegen überlieferte Ordnungen, alte Götter, Weltverleumder und kirchliche Grabstätten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:AS3","text":"Zerstörung wird nicht als bloße Verneinung, sondern als Öffnung für einen reinen Blick des Himmels und für neues Leben bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:AS4","text":"Aus der Bejahung zerbrochener Überlieferungen entsteht das brünstige Verlangen nach Ewigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:AS5","text":"Die Ewigkeit wird als geliebtes Weib und als hochzeitlicher Ring der Wiederkunft personifiziert; die Bewegung reicht von Auflösung über Öffnung zu ewiger Wiederkehr.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:A1","text":"Zorn kann Gräber aufbrechen, Grenzsteine verrücken und alte Tafeln zerbrechen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:A2","text":"Hohn kann vermoderte Worte zerblähen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:A3","text":"Die Reinigung verdumpfter Grabkammern ist eine legitime Funktion des Zorns und des Hohns.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:A4","text":"Alte Götter und Weltverleumder gehören einer zu überwindenden alten Welt an.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:A5","text":"Zerbrochene Kirchen können den Himmel für einen reinen Blick öffnen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:A6","text":"Zerbrochene Kirchen können zugleich Orte von Gras, rotem Mohn, Freude und Verweilen sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:A7","text":"Die Liebe zur Ewigkeit kann die Liebe zu einem Weib und den Wunsch nach Kindern begründen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:A8","text":"Die Ewigkeit erscheint als Ring der Wiederkunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:A9","text":"Liebe zur Ewigkeit erlaubt die Bejahung von Zerstörung und Wiederholung in derselben Ordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:NX1","text":"Die alten Gräber werden nicht als unantastbare Grenzen anerkannt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:NX2","text":"Grenzsteine gelten nicht als endgültige Fixierungen der Weltordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:NX3","text":"Alte Tafeln besitzen keine letztgültige normative Autorität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:NX4","text":"Vermoderte Worte werden nicht als lebendige Wahrheit behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:NX5","text":"Alte Götter und Weltverleumder werden nicht als bewahrenswerte Fundamente bestätigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:NX6","text":"Eine Kirche wird nicht als unzerbrechlicher oder abgeschlossener Sakralraum vorausgesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:NX7","text":"Ewigkeit wird nicht als bloße lineare Verlängerung der Zeit bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:D1","text":"Die Auflösung alter Grenzziehungen macht eine neue Sichtbarkeit des Himmels möglich.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_11:A1","CH_97E9_2_11:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:D2","text":"Zerstörung wird zur Reinigung, wenn sie veraltete und erstarrte Formen ihrer Abschließung beraubt.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_11:A2","CH_97E9_2_11:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:D3","text":"Die zerbrochene Kirche verliert ihre Funktion als Grab und gewinnt die Funktion eines offenen Lebensraums.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_11:A4","CH_97E9_2_11:A5","CH_97E9_2_11:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:D4","text":"Die Bejahung des Zerfalls erzeugt keine bloße Leere, sondern eine positive Ausrichtung auf Ewigkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_11:A5","CH_97E9_2_11:A6","CH_97E9_2_11:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:D5","text":"Der Kinderwunsch wird aus der Liebe zu einer spezifisch geliebten Gestalt in die Liebe zur Ewigkeit verschoben.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_11:A7","CH_97E9_2_11:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:SD1","text":"Überlieferte Ordnung wird nicht durch eine neue Doktrin ersetzt, sondern durch ihre Zerbrechung in einen offenen Erfahrungsraum überführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_11:A1","CH_97E9_2_11:A4","CH_97E9_2_11:A5","CH_97E9_2_11:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:SD2","text":"Die höchste Bejahung entsteht aus der Verbindung von Vernichtung des Alten und Bindung an eine nicht abschließbare Wiederkehr.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_11:A1","CH_97E9_2_11:A2","CH_97E9_2_11:A8","CH_97E9_2_11:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:SD3","text":"Die Ewigkeit fungiert als affektive Einheit von Liebe, Zeugung, Hochzeit und Wiederholung.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_11:A7","CH_97E9_2_11:A8","CH_97E9_2_11:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:SD4","text":"Der Text verwandelt sakrale Zerstörung in eine weltbejahende Form der Transzendenz.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_11:A4","CH_97E9_2_11:A5","CH_97E9_2_11:A6","CH_97E9_2_11:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:DNX1","text":"Der Text hängt davon ab, dass Dauer, Alter und Überlieferung keinen eigenen Wahrheitsanspruch garantieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:DNX2","text":"Er schließt ein Modell aus, in dem Zerstörung notwendig Nihilismus oder Verlust von Welt bedeutet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:DNX3","text":"Er schließt eine Sakralität aus, die auf Unversehrtheit, Abgeschlossenheit und Unzugänglichkeit beruht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:DNX4","text":"Er schließt eine Zukunft aus, die nur als Fortschritt über eine vergangene Welt hinaus gedacht werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:DNX5","text":"Er schließt die Trennung von Lebensbejahung und Kritik an bestehenden Formen aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:SNX1","text":"Unzulässig wird eine Welt, deren Sinn in der Unberührbarkeit ihrer Gräber, Grenzen und Tafeln liegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:SNX2","text":"Unverfügbar bleibt eine endgültige Befreiung, die mit der Vergangenheit vollständig abschließt; an ihre Stelle tritt Wiederkunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:SNX3","text":"Die stille Gegenmöglichkeit des Textes ist eine Ewigkeit ohne Leib, Liebe, Zeugung und Wiederholung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:SNX4","text":"Der Text verweigert eine reine Transzendenz außerhalb der Welt und bindet Ewigkeit an die weltliche Szene zerbrochener Formen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:FGS1","text":"Erstarrte Überlieferung → Zorn und Hohn → Aufbrechen, Verrücken, Zerblasen, Zerbrechen.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_11:A1","CH_97E9_2_11:A2","CH_97E9_2_11:A3","CH_97E9_2_11:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:FGS2","text":"Zerbrochene Begrenzung → Öffnung des sakralen Raums → Eintritt des reinen Himmelsblicks.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_11:A5","CH_97E9_2_11:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:FGS3","text":"Öffnung und neue Lebendigkeit → affektive Bejahung → Verlangen nach Ewigkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_11:A6","CH_97E9_2_11:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:FGS4","text":"Verlangen nach Ewigkeit → Personifikation als geliebtes Weib → Hochzeitssymbolik → Ring der Wiederkunft.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_11:A7","CH_97E9_2_11:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:FGS5","text":"Wiederkunft → Rückbindung der Zukunft an wiederkehrende Welt → Aufhebung des Gegensatzes von Zerstörung und Bejahung.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_11:A8","CH_97E9_2_11:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:AF1","text":"Erstarrte Gräber, Grenzen und Tafeln → zerstörerische Reinigung → zerbrochene Sakralität → Öffnung für Himmel und Leben → brünstige Ewigkeit → Ring der Wiederkunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:ME1","text":"Gräber werden von endgültigen Speicherorten der Vergangenheit zu durchbrechbaren Hindernissen umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:ME2","text":"Zerstörung und Erneuerung werden nicht mehr als Gegensätze, sondern als aufeinander bezogene Operationen sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:ME3","text":"Die Kirche wird vom geschlossenen Monument zum offenen, von Leben durchwachsenen Raum neu kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:ME4","text":"Ewigkeit wird von statischer Unendlichkeit auf zyklische Wiederkunft umgestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:ME5","text":"Liebe, Zeugung und Zeit werden in einer gemeinsamen Figur des Rings verbunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:ALT1","text":"Surface: Der Sprecher bejaht das Aufbrechen alter Gräber, Kirchen, Tafeln und Worte und erklärt seine Liebe zur Ewigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:ALT2","text":"Structural: Überlieferte Ordnung wird durch Grenzauflösung in einen offenen Erfahrungs- und Lebensraum transformiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Kritik gewinnt ihre produktive Kraft nicht durch institutionelle Ersetzung, sondern durch das Freilegen dessen, was unter erstarrten Formen wieder sichtbar werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Zeit wird als Wiederkunft gedacht; Ewigkeit ist keine Außenposition, sondern die bejahte Wiederholung weltlicher Existenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von der Zerstörung alter Formen zur Bejahung der Wiederkunft zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob die Zerstörung als tatsächliche Handlung, dichterische Selbstbeschreibung oder bedingte Möglichkeit gilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Zerbrechen als Öffnung und nicht als endgültige Vernichtung verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung liegt zwischen zerbrochener Sakralität, neuem Blick und weltbejahender Ewigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:MRT5","text":"Eine ungelöste Spannung besteht zwischen der radikalen Zerstörung des Alten und der positiven Bindung an ewige Wiederholung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, solange die erotische Personifikation der Ewigkeit nicht auf eine bloße Metapher reduziert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T190828666273Z_6fa7abc9","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"2.","source_sha256":"e2e97675c470f175aae713fac405fe58859e4910bfcea5d15bdb0da1087d3902","sha256":"b79ec65e8fdeb52d60c5821fcb03eeea8d28cf7844d3c081bf5f42849635a6e8","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:08:28.668347+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumentative Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:AS1","text":"The text deploys destructive wrath and mockery as forces that dissolve graves, boundary stones, tablets, words, and stultified burial chambers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:AS2","text":"The destruction is directed against inherited orders, old gods, slanderers of the world, and ecclesiastical burial sites.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:AS3","text":"Destruction is determined not as mere negation, but as an opening for a pure gaze of the sky and for new life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:AS4","text":"From the affirmation of shattered traditions arises the ardent desire for eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:AS5","text":"Eternity is personified as a beloved woman and as the nuptial ring of recurrence; the movement extends from dissolution through opening to eternal recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:A1","text":"Wrath can break open graves, displace boundary stones, and shatter old tablets.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:A2","text":"Mockery can inflate rotten words.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:A3","text":"The cleansing of stultified burial chambers is a legitimate function of wrath and mockery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:A4","text":"Old gods and slanderers of the world belong to an old world that must be overcome.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:A5","text":"Shattered churches can open the sky to a pure gaze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:A6","text":"Shattered churches can at the same time be places of grass, red poppies, joy, and lingering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:A7","text":"Love of eternity can ground love for a woman and the desire for children.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:A8","text":"Eternity appears as the ring of recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:A9","text":"Love of eternity permits the affirmation of destruction and repetition within the same order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:NX1","text":"The old graves are not acknowledged as inviolable boundaries.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:NX2","text":"Boundary stones do not count as definitive fixations of the world order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:NX3","text":"Old tablets possess no ultimately valid normative authority.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:NX4","text":"Rotten words are not treated as living truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:NX5","text":"Old gods and slanderers of the world are not affirmed as foundations worthy of preservation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:NX6","text":"A church is not presupposed as an unbreakable or closed sacred space.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:NX7","text":"Eternity is not determined as a mere linear extension of time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:D1","text":"The dissolution of old demarcations makes a new visibility of the sky possible.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_11:A1","CH_97E9_2_11:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:D2","text":"Destruction becomes cleansing when it deprives outdated and rigid forms of their closure.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_11:A2","CH_97E9_2_11:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:D3","text":"The shattered church loses its function as a grave and gains the function of an open living space.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_11:A4","CH_97E9_2_11:A5","CH_97E9_2_11:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:D4","text":"The affirmation of decay produces not mere emptiness, but a positive orientation toward eternity.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_11:A5","CH_97E9_2_11:A6","CH_97E9_2_11:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:D5","text":"The desire for children is shifted from love for a specifically beloved figure into love of eternity.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_11:A7","CH_97E9_2_11:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:SD1","text":"Inherited order is not replaced by a new doctrine, but transferred through its shattering into an open space of experience.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_11:A1","CH_97E9_2_11:A4","CH_97E9_2_11:A5","CH_97E9_2_11:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:SD2","text":"The highest affirmation arises from the conjunction of the annihilation of the old and attachment to a recurrence that cannot be brought to closure.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_11:A1","CH_97E9_2_11:A2","CH_97E9_2_11:A8","CH_97E9_2_11:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:SD3","text":"Eternity functions as an affective unity of love, procreation, wedding, and repetition.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_11:A7","CH_97E9_2_11:A8","CH_97E9_2_11:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:SD4","text":"The text transforms sacred destruction into a world-affirming form of transcendence.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_11:A4","CH_97E9_2_11:A5","CH_97E9_2_11:A6","CH_97E9_2_11:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:DNX1","text":"The text depends on duration, age, and tradition guaranteeing no truth-claim of their own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:DNX2","text":"It excludes a model in which destruction necessarily means nihilism or loss of world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:DNX3","text":"It excludes a sacredness based on intactness, closure, and inaccessibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:DNX4","text":"It excludes a future that can be conceived only as progress beyond a past world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:DNX5","text":"It excludes the separation of affirmation of life from critique of existing forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:SNX1","text":"A world whose meaning lies in the inviolability of its graves, boundaries, and tablets becomes inadmissible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:SNX2","text":"A definitive liberation that completely concludes with the past remains unavailable; recurrence takes its place.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:SNX3","text":"The text's silent counter-possibility is an eternity without body, love, procreation, and repetition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:SNX4","text":"The text refuses a pure transcendence outside the world and binds eternity to the worldly scene of shattered forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:FGS1","text":"Rigidified tradition → wrath and mockery → breaking open, displacing, inflating, shattering.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_11:A1","CH_97E9_2_11:A2","CH_97E9_2_11:A3","CH_97E9_2_11:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:FGS2","text":"Shattered limitation → opening of sacred space → entrance of the pure gaze of the sky.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_11:A5","CH_97E9_2_11:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:FGS3","text":"Opening and new vitality → affective affirmation → desire for eternity.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_11:A6","CH_97E9_2_11:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:FGS4","text":"Desire for eternity → personification as beloved woman → wedding symbolism → ring of recurrence.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_11:A7","CH_97E9_2_11:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:FGS5","text":"Recurrence → reconnection of the future to the recurring world → abolition of the opposition between destruction and affirmation.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_11:A8","CH_97E9_2_11:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:AF1","text":"Rigidified graves, boundaries, and tablets → destructive cleansing → shattered sacredness → opening for sky and life → ardent eternity → ring of recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:ME1","text":"Graves are reclassified from definitive repositories of the past into obstacles that can be broken through.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:ME2","text":"Destruction and renewal become visible no longer as opposites, but as operations related to one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:ME3","text":"The church is remapped from a closed monument into an open space overgrown with life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:ME4","text":"Eternity is shifted from static infinity to cyclical recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:ME5","text":"Love, procreation, and time are joined in a common figure of the ring.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:ALT1","text":"Surface: The speaker affirms the breaking open of old graves, churches, tablets, and words, and declares his love of eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:ALT2","text":"Structural: Inherited order is transformed through the dissolution of boundaries into an open space of experience and life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Critique gains its productive force not through institutional replacement, but through laying bare what can become visible again beneath rigidified forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Time is conceived as recurrence; eternity is not an external position, but the affirmed repetition of worldly existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from the destruction of old forms to the affirmation of recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether destruction counts as actual action, poetic self-description, or conditional possibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent, provided that shattering is understood as opening and not as definitive annihilation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:MRT4","text":"The strongest connection lies between shattered sacredness, new gaze, and world-affirming eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:MRT5","text":"An unresolved tension exists between the radical destruction of the old and the positive attachment to eternal repetition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_11:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement so long as the erotic personification of eternity is not reduced to a mere metaphor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_11:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_2_11@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_2_11:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"The Seven Seals","source_section_label":"2.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"The Seven Seals · 2","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","The Seven Seals","2."],"original_title":"2."}],"source_title_context":"Die sieben Siegel","source_section_label":"2.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"The Seven Seals · 2","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","The Seven Seals","2."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 119","title":"The Seven Seals · 2","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Die sieben Siegel · 2"},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6","layer":"CH","title":"The Seven Seals · 3","order":120,"parents":["RAW_97E9_3C_6"],"revision":"CH_97E9_3C_6@R001","sha256":"399ebd249e40772214b3f27849b61aa8d480f287a047ca76d4fb72e1365a2e0c","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:AS1","text":"Das sprechende Ich setzt schöpferische Eingebung und himmlische Notwendigkeit als Kräfte, die Zufälle in kosmische Ordnung überführen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:AS2","text":"Das schöpferische Lachen wird als Blitz gesetzt, dessen Wirkung als gehorsamer Donner der Tat folgt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:AS3","text":"Die Erde wird als Göttertisch bestimmt, auf dem schöpferisches Würfeln reale Erschütterung, Bruch und Feuer erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:AS4","text":"Aus der Identität von Schöpfung, Spiel und kosmischer Wirksamkeit folgt das brennende Verlangen nach Ewigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:AS5","text":"Die Ewigkeit wird als hochzeitlicher Ring der Ringe und als Wiederkunft neu bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:AS6","text":"Die fehlende reproduktive Beziehung zur Frau wird durch die Liebe zur personifizierten Ewigkeit ersetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:A1","text":"Schöpferischer Hauch kann dem sprechenden Ich widerfahren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:A2","text":"Himmlische Notwendigkeit kann Zufälle zur Ordnung zwingen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:A3","text":"Schöpferisches Lachen erzeugt eine wirksame Folge von Tat und Donner.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:A4","text":"Die Erde ist ein Göttertisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:A5","text":"Götter können auf der Erde würfeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:A6","text":"Schöpferische Würfe erzeugen kosmische Erschütterung und Feuer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:A7","text":"Die Ewigkeit ist als Ring der Wiederkunft strukturiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:A8","text":"Die Ewigkeit kann Gegenstand einer persönlichen, brünstigen Liebe sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:A9","text":"Die Liebe zur Ewigkeit kann die Funktion einer begehrten Fortpflanzungsbeziehung übernehmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:NX1","text":"Schöpfung ist nicht bloß passives Empfangen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:NX2","text":"Zufall ist nicht autonom, sondern einer höheren Notwendigkeit unterworfen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:NX3","text":"Lachen ist nicht folgenlos, sondern geht in Tat und Wirkung über.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:NX4","text":"Die Erde ist nicht bloß Schauplatz, sondern aktiver Ort göttlichen Spiels.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:NX5","text":"Der Götterwurf ist nicht folgenloses Spiel, sondern erzeugt materielle Katastrophe und Produktivität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:NX6","text":"Ewigkeit ist nicht statische Dauer, sondern Wiederkehr.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:NX7","text":"Das Weibliche wird nicht als beliebige biologische Ergänzung akzeptiert, sondern an eine spezifische Liebesbindung gebunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:D1","text":"Kosmische Ordnung entsteht aus der Verbindung von Zufall und Zwang.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_6:A1","CH_97E9_3C_6:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:D2","text":"Schöpferische Affekte besitzen eine nachfolgende Handlungsmacht.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_6:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:D3","text":"Die Erde wird zum Medium, in dem göttliche Kreativität sichtbar und gewaltsam wirksam wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_6:A4","CH_97E9_3C_6:A5","CH_97E9_3C_6:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:D4","text":"Das kosmische Spiel erzeugt den Übergang von schöpferischer Erfahrung zu metaphysischem Begehren.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_6:A6","CH_97E9_3C_6:A7","CH_97E9_3C_6:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:D5","text":"Die Wiederkunft wird als dauerhaft bindende Form der Ewigkeit begehrbar.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_6:A7","CH_97E9_3C_6:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:D6","text":"Die Liebe zur Ewigkeit wird als alternative Genealogie des Ichs eingesetzt.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_6:A8","CH_97E9_3C_6:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:SD1","text":"Das System verschmilzt Kontingenz, Notwendigkeit und göttliche Kreativität zu einer einzigen kosmischen Produktionslogik.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:SD2","text":"Zerstörung erscheint nicht als Gegensatz zur Schöpfung, sondern als deren materielle Austragungsform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:SD3","text":"Das schöpferische Subjekt konstituiert sich durch die Fähigkeit, kosmische Ereignisse spielend hervorzubringen und ihre Wiederkehr zu bejahen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:SD4","text":"Die Ewigkeit wird von einer Zeitform zu einer geliebten Gegenfigur und damit zu einer personalisierten Bedingung des Fortbestehens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:SD5","text":"Reproduktion wird aus der biologisch-sozialen Ordnung in eine metaphysische Beziehung zur Wiederkunft verlagert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:DNX1","text":"Eine von Notwendigkeit unberührte Kontingenz muss ausgeschlossen sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:DNX2","text":"Eine Schöpfung ohne körperliche, geologische oder kosmische Wirkung muss ausgeschlossen sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:DNX3","text":"Eine lineare Zeit ohne Wiederkehr darf nicht die maßgebliche Zeitstruktur sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:DNX4","text":"Endlichkeit darf nicht die letzte Form des Begehrens bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:DNX5","text":"Fortpflanzung darf nicht ausschließlich an eine konkrete menschliche Paarbeziehung gebunden bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:DNX6","text":"Schöpfung darf nicht als planbare, nichtspielerische Herstellung modelliert werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Welt, in der Zufall und Notwendigkeit getrennte, inkompatible Ordnungen bilden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Welt, in der schöpferische Kraft ohne Zerstörung, Risiko und Erschütterung wirksam wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Zukunft, deren Wert in einmaliger Erfüllung statt in ewiger Wiederholung liegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Genealogie, die ausschließlich durch menschliche Zeugung und nicht durch metaphysische Bejahung bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:FGS1","text":"Schöpferischer Hauch + himmlische Notwendigkeit → Unterwerfung des Zufalls unter kosmische Ordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:FGS2","text":"Schöpferisches Lachen → Blitz → Donner der Tat → wirksame Hervorbringung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:FGS3","text":"Erde als Göttertisch + göttliches Würfeln → Beben + Bruch + Feuer → materielle Manifestation des Schöpferischen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:FGS4","text":"Schöpferische Totalerfahrung → Verlangen nach Dauer → Ewigkeit als Wiederkunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:FGS5","text":"Ewigkeit als Ring → Personifizierung als geliebtes Weib → Ersatz der menschlichen Genealogie durch metaphysische Wiederkehr.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:FGS6","text":"Kosmisches Spiel und ewige Wiederholung → affirmatives Subjekt, das Entstehung und Wiederkehr zugleich bejaht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:AF1","text":"Schöpferische Eingebung → Zwang des Zufalls → schöpferische Tat → Götterspiel auf der Erde → kosmische Erschütterung → Begehren nach Wiederkunft → Ewigkeit als geliebte Genealogie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:ME1","text":"Zufall wird von einem Gegenbegriff der Ordnung zu deren hervorgebrachtem Bestandteil umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:ME2","text":"Zerstörung wird von einem negativen Ereignis zu einer Form schöpferischer Produktivität umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:ME3","text":"Die Erde wird vom passiven Lebensraum zum operativen Spielfeld göttlicher Kräfte umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:ME4","text":"Ewigkeit wird von bloßer Dauer zur zyklischen, begehrten Wiederkunft umbestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:ME5","text":"Genealogie wird von biologischer Zeugung auf die metaphysische Hervorbringung und Bejahung der Wiederkehr verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:ME6","text":"Das Weibliche wird zugleich als menschliche Reproduktionsfigur verfehlt und als kosmisch-metaphysische Geliebte absolut gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:ALT1","text":"Surface: Das sprechende Ich bekennt seine Liebe zur Ewigkeit und zur Wiederkunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:ALT2","text":"Structural: Schöpferische Kräfte verbinden Zufall, Notwendigkeit, Spiel und materielle Erschütterung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Das Leben wird nicht durch Kontrolle, sondern durch Würfelspiel, Risiko und vorbehaltlose Wiederkunftsbejahung affirmiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Wirklichkeit ist als schöpferisch erzeugte, zerstörerisch wirksame und zyklisch wiederkehrende Ordnung vorausgesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von schöpferischer Erfahrung über kosmische Wirksamkeit zur Liebe der Wiederkunft zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob die „himmlische Noth“ als metaphysische Macht, innere Notwendigkeit oder poetische Personifikation zu verstehen ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Zufall und Notwendigkeit als verbundene Momente derselben Schöpfungslogik gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung besteht zwischen Götterspiel, materieller Erschütterung und Wiederkunftsbegehren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:MRT5","text":"Eine ungelöste Spannung liegt zwischen dem Ausschluss einer gefundenen menschlichen Frau und der unmittelbaren Personifizierung der Ewigkeit als geliebtes Weib.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung entsteht daraus, dass der Würfel zugleich Kontingenz bezeichnet und durch die himmlische Notwendigkeit funktional determiniert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, sofern die Schlusswendung nicht als bloße Liebeserklärung, sondern als metaphysische Umleitung von Zeugung in Wiederkunft gelesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T191420750094Z_df84474b","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"3.","source_sha256":"399ebd249e40772214b3f27849b61aa8d480f287a047ca76d4fb72e1365a2e0c","sha256":"4eaba84e7bda0973d9676ac27a6ad0c411922d9164ae91828dde8766db32aa4f","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:14:20.752160+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:AS1","text":"The speaking I posits creative inspiration and celestial necessity as forces that transform contingencies into cosmic order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:AS2","text":"Creative laughter is posited as lightning, whose effect follows as the obedient thunder of action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:AS3","text":"The earth is determined as a table of the gods, upon which creative dice-throwing produces real tremor, fracture, and fire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:AS4","text":"From the identity of creation, play, and cosmic efficacy follows the burning desire for eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:AS5","text":"Eternity is newly determined as the wedding ring of rings and as recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:AS6","text":"The absent reproductive relation to woman is replaced by love for personified eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:A1","text":"Creative breath can befall the speaking I.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:A2","text":"Heavenly necessity can compel chance into order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:A3","text":"Creative laughter produces an effective sequence of deed and thunder.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:A4","text":"The earth is a table of the gods.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:A5","text":"Gods can throw dice on the earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:A6","text":"Creative throws produce cosmic upheaval and fire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:A7","text":"Eternity is structured as a ring of recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:A8","text":"Eternity can be the object of a personal, ardent love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:A9","text":"Love for eternity can assume the function of a desired procreative relationship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:NX1","text":"Creation is not merely passive reception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:NX2","text":"Chance is not autonomous, but subject to a higher necessity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:NX3","text":"Laughter is not without consequences, but passes into deed and effect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:NX4","text":"The earth is not merely a stage, but an active site of divine play.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:NX5","text":"The throw of the gods is not consequence-free play, but produces material catastrophe and productivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:NX6","text":"Eternity is not static duration, but recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:NX7","text":"The feminine is not accepted as an arbitrary biological complement, but bound to a specific bond of love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:D1","text":"Cosmic order arises from the conjunction of chance and compulsion.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_6:A1","CH_97E9_3C_6:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:D2","text":"Creative affects possess a subsequent power of action.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_6:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:D3","text":"The earth becomes the medium in which divine creativity becomes visible and violently effective.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_6:A4","CH_97E9_3C_6:A5","CH_97E9_3C_6:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:D4","text":"Cosmic play produces the transition from creative experience to metaphysical desire.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_6:A6","CH_97E9_3C_6:A7","CH_97E9_3C_6:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:D5","text":"Recurrence becomes desirable as a durably binding form of eternity.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_6:A7","CH_97E9_3C_6:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:D6","text":"Love for eternity is deployed as an alternative genealogy of the I.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_6:A8","CH_97E9_3C_6:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:SD1","text":"The system fuses contingency, necessity, and divine creativity into a single logic of cosmic production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:SD2","text":"Destruction appears not as the opposite of creation, but as its material form of enactment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:SD3","text":"The creative subject constitutes itself through the capacity playfully to bring forth cosmic events and to affirm their recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:SD4","text":"Eternity is transformed from a temporal form into a beloved counterpart and thus into a personalized condition of persistence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:SD5","text":"Reproduction is shifted from the biological-social order into a metaphysical relation to recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:DNX1","text":"A contingency untouched by necessity must be excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:DNX2","text":"A creation without bodily, geological, or cosmic effect must be excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:DNX3","text":"A linear time without recurrence must not be the determining temporal structure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:DNX4","text":"Finitude must not determine the ultimate form of desire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:DNX5","text":"Procreation must not remain bound exclusively to a concrete human pair relationship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:DNX6","text":"Creation must not be modeled as planned, non-playful production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a world in which chance and necessity form separate, incompatible orders.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:SNX2","text":"Excluded is a world in which creative force would be effective without destruction, risk, and upheaval.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:SNX3","text":"Excluded is a future whose value lies in singular fulfillment rather than in eternal repetition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:SNX4","text":"Excluded is a genealogy determined exclusively by human procreation and not by metaphysical affirmation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:FGS1","text":"Creative breath + celestial necessity → subjection of contingency to cosmic order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:FGS2","text":"Creative laughter → lightning → thunder of action → efficacious production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:FGS3","text":"Earth as table of the gods + divine dice-throwing → tremor + fracture + fire → material manifestation of the creative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:FGS4","text":"Creative total experience → desire for duration → eternity as recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:FGS5","text":"Eternity as ring → personification as beloved woman → replacement of human genealogy by metaphysical recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:FGS6","text":"Cosmic play and eternal repetition → affirmative subject that affirms emergence and recurrence simultaneously.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:AF1","text":"Creative inspiration → compulsion of chance → creative deed → play of the gods on earth → cosmic upheaval → desire for recurrence → eternity as beloved genealogy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:ME1","text":"Chance is remapped from a counterconcept of order to a generated component of it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:ME2","text":"Destruction is reclassified from a negative event into a form of creative productivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:ME3","text":"The earth is remapped from a passive habitat into the operative playing field of divine forces.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:ME4","text":"Eternity is redefined from mere duration into cyclical, desired recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:ME5","text":"Genealogy is shifted from biological procreation to the metaphysical bringing-forth and affirmation of recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:ME6","text":"The feminine is at once missed as a figure of human reproduction and absolutized as a cosmic-metaphysical beloved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:ALT1","text":"Surface: The speaking I professes its love for eternity and for recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:ALT2","text":"Structural: Creative forces conjoin chance, necessity, play, and material upheaval.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Life is affirmed not through control, but through dice play, risk, and unconditional affirmation of recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Reality is presupposed as an order creatively produced, destructively effective, and cyclically recurring.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from creative experience through cosmic efficacy to love of recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether the „himmlische Noth“ is to be understood as metaphysical power, inner necessity, or poetic personification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as chance and necessity count as connected moments of the same logic of creation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:MRT4","text":"The strongest connection exists between play of the gods, material upheaval, and desire for recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:MRT5","text":"An unresolved tension lies between the exclusion of a found human woman and the immediate personification of eternity as beloved woman.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:MRT6","text":"A further tension arises from the fact that the die signifies contingency while at the same time being functionally determined by heavenly necessity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_6:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement insofar as the concluding turn is read not as a mere declaration of love, but as a metaphysical redirection of procreation into recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_3C_6@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_3C_6:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"The Seven Seals","source_section_label":"3.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"The Seven Seals · 3","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","The Seven Seals","3."],"original_title":"3."}],"source_title_context":"Die sieben Siegel","source_section_label":"3.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"The Seven Seals · 3","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","The Seven Seals","3."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 120","title":"The Seven Seals · 3","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Die sieben Siegel · 3"},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3","layer":"CH","title":"The Seven Seals · 4","order":121,"parents":["RAW_97E9_4C_3"],"revision":"CH_97E9_4C_3@R001","sha256":"9337cb02dd9e5549bd665b26f4c8fd0e816017f0039e6507240cc248e20ce559","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:AS1","text":"Der Text setzt die vollständige Aufnahme einer Welt voraus, in der Gegensätze in einem gemeinsamen Mischverhältnis stehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:AS2","text":"Die zentrale Neubestimmung besteht darin, Fernes und Nahes, Feuer und Geist, Lust und Leid sowie Schlimmstes und Gütigstes als verbindbare Stoffe zu behandeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:AS3","text":"Diese Verbindung wird durch ein Salz ermöglicht, das Gutes und Böses bindet und auch das Böseste als würz- und überschäumungsfähig einschließt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:AS4","text":"Das sprechende Subjekt erkennt sich selbst als Bestandteil dieses erlösenden Mischprozesses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:AS5","text":"Aus der Selbstintegration in die Mischung entsteht das Begehren nach Ewigkeit und nach dem Ring der Wiederkunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:AS6","text":"Die Ewigkeit wird als geliebte, weiblich angeredete Gestalt an die Stelle einer endlichen ehelichen und reproduktiven Erfüllung gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:A1","text":"Alle Dinge können in einem gemeinsamen Mischgefäß miteinander verbunden werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:A2","text":"Gegensätze wie Fernes und Nahes, Feuer und Geist sowie Lust und Leid sind miteinander vermischbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:A3","text":"Gutes und Böses können durch ein gemeinsames Salz gebunden werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:A4","text":"Auch das Böseste besitzt innerhalb der Mischung einen würzenden und steigernden Wert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:A5","text":"Das sprechende Subjekt kann selbst Bestandteil des verbindenden Salzes sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:A6","text":"Die Mischung der Gegensätze besitzt erlösende Kraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:A7","text":"Die Anerkennung dieser Mischung erzeugt ein brennendes Verlangen nach Ewigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:A8","text":"Die Ewigkeit wird als Wiederkunft und als „hochzeitlicher Ring der Ringe“ bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:A9","text":"Endliche Ehe und Kinderzeugung bilden nicht die letzte Form der vom Subjekt begehrten Bindung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:A10","text":"Die geliebte Ewigkeit kann die Funktion der begehrten Frau und der möglichen Mutterschaft übernehmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:NX1","text":"Erlösung wird nicht durch die Trennung des Guten vom Bösen definiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:NX2","text":"Das Böseste wird nicht als unbrauchbarer oder auszuschließender Rest behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:NX3","text":"Lust und Leid werden nicht als strikt getrennte Wertbereiche behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:NX4","text":"Geist wird nicht gegen Feuer als dessen reines Gegenteil isoliert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:NX5","text":"Die gewünschte Bindung wird nicht in der bloßen endlichen Ehe abgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:NX6","text":"Die Wiederkunft wird nicht als einmalige lineare Erlösung bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:NX7","text":"Das Subjekt steht nicht außerhalb des Mischprozesses als dessen unbeteiligter Beobachter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:D1","text":"Die Möglichkeit der Erlösung hängt von der Integration gegensätzlicher Elemente statt von ihrer Reinigung ab.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_3:A1","CH_97E9_4C_3:A2","CH_97E9_4C_3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:D2","text":"Das Negative gewinnt seinen Wert nicht trotz, sondern durch seine Einbindung in die Mischung.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_3:A3","CH_97E9_4C_3:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:D3","text":"Selbstteilhabe an der Mischung verwandelt kosmologische Verbindung in eine persönliche Erfahrung.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_3:A5","CH_97E9_4C_3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:D4","text":"Das Verlangen nach Ewigkeit folgt aus der bejahten Totalität der Verbindungen und nicht aus der Flucht vor der Welt.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_3:A1","CH_97E9_4C_3:A6","CH_97E9_4C_3:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:D5","text":"Der Ring der Wiederkunft bezeichnet die Dauerform einer Welt, deren Gegensätze immer wieder verbunden werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_3:A2","CH_97E9_4C_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:D6","text":"Die Sprache der Liebe überführt die Wiederkunft aus einer kosmologischen Formel in eine begehrte Beziehung.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_3:A7","CH_97E9_4C_3:A8","CH_97E9_4C_3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:SD1","text":"Das System macht Erlösung von der Fähigkeit abhängig, die gesamte Wertspannung der Welt zu bejahen, einschließlich ihres äußersten Negativen.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_3:A3","CH_97E9_4C_3:A4","CH_97E9_4C_3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:SD2","text":"Die Wiederkunft erscheint als ontologische Totalisierung der Mischung: Nichts darf aus dem Kreislauf der Bindung ausgeschlossen werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_3:A1","CH_97E9_4C_3:A2","CH_97E9_4C_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:SD3","text":"Das Ich wird nicht durch Selbstüberschreitung aus der Welt gelöst, sondern durch seine Aufnahme in deren verbindende Struktur transformiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_3:A5","CH_97E9_4C_3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:SD4","text":"Die erotische Anrede macht Ewigkeit zur affektiven Gestalt einer Welt, deren Wiederholung bejaht werden kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_3:A7","CH_97E9_4C_3:A8","CH_97E9_4C_3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:SD5","text":"Endliche Fortpflanzung wird durch eine symbolische Vereinigung mit der Ewigkeit überboten, ohne dass die Sprache der Zeugung vollständig verschwindet.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_3:A9","CH_97E9_4C_3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:DNX1","text":"Das System hängt davon ab, dass Reinheit kein höheres Erlösungsprinzip als Mischung besitzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:DNX2","text":"Es setzt voraus, dass moralische Gegensätze nicht ontologisch endgültig sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:DNX3","text":"Es schließt eine Erlösung aus, die durch Entfernung des Leidens, des Bösen oder des Widersprüchlichen erreicht würde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:DNX4","text":"Es disqualifiziert eine Subjektform, die sich als getrennte Instanz außerhalb der Weltverbindungen erhält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:DNX5","text":"Es setzt voraus, dass Ewigkeit nicht bloß dauerhafte Fortsetzung, sondern wiederholte Bindung des Ganzen bedeutet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:DNX6","text":"Es behandelt die endliche soziale Ordnung der Ehe als unzureichend für die umfassendste Form der Vereinigung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Erlösung, die einen Rest der Welt als unverbindbar, unwert oder nicht würdig der Wiederkehr zurücklässt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Ewigkeit ohne Wiederholung, ohne Bindung der Gegensätze und ohne affektive Zustimmung zu ihrem Fortbestand.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Identität, die nur durch Abgrenzung vom Bösen, vom Leid oder vom Niedrigsten Bestand gewinnt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:SNX4","text":"Die tiefste versperrte Möglichkeit ist eine Welt, in der das Negative nicht verwandelt, sondern endgültig entfernt werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:FGS1","text":"Verschiedenheit → gemeinsame Mischbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:FGS2","text":"Mischbarkeit → Bindung von Gutem und Bösem.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:FGS3","text":"Bindung des Negativen → Würde und Funktion des Bösesten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:FGS4","text":"Einbindung des Subjekts → Selbstwerdung als Bestandteil des verbindenden Salzes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:FGS5","text":"Erlösende Mischung → Begehren nach einer umfassenden Dauerform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:FGS6","text":"Dauerform → Wiederkunft als Ring der Ringe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:FGS7","text":"Wiederkunft → erotische Personifikation der Ewigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:FGS8","text":"Personifizierte Ewigkeit → Ersetzung der endlichen Fortpflanzungsbindung durch kosmische Vereinigung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:AF1","text":"Getrennte Gegensätze → Mischgefäß als gemeinsame Struktur → Salz als Bindungsoperator → Integration des Bösesten → Selbstaufnahme des Sprechenden → Erlösungswirkung → Verlangen nach Ewigkeit → Wiederkunft als Ring → Ewigkeit als geliebte Frau.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:AF2","text":"Unzureichende endliche Ehe → kosmische Neubestimmung der Vereinigung → Wiederkunft als höchste Bindungsform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:ME1","text":"Gut und Böse werden von exklusiven moralischen Polen zu verbindbaren Bestandteilen eines gemeinsamen Wirkgefüges umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:ME2","text":"Das Böseste wird von einem auszuschließenden Rest zu einem funktionalen Geschmacks- und Steigerungsmoment klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:ME3","text":"Erlösung wird von der Entlastung von Welt und Widerspruch auf deren vollständige Einbindung verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:ME4","text":"Wiederkunft wird von einer abstrakten Zeitstruktur zu einer begehrten Beziehung und Bindung umgezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:ME5","text":"Ehe und Kinderzeugung werden aus der Position letzter Vereinigung verdrängt und auf eine endliche Ordnungsebene zurückgesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Sprecher bekennt die Liebe zur Ewigkeit und zum Ring der Wiederkunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:ALT2","text":"Structural — Ein Misch- und Bindungsmechanismus integriert räumliche, geistige, affektive und moralische Gegensätze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Zustimmung zur Wiederkunft wird durch die Umwandlung des Bösesten in einen notwendigen Bestandteil der Totalität ermöglicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Sein erscheint als wiederkehrende Mischung, deren Dauer nicht außerhalb, sondern innerhalb der Bindung aller Gegensätze liegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den Übergang von der Mischung der Gegensätze zum Begehren nach Ewigkeit zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:MRT2","text":"Die Funktion des Salzes ist als verbindender Operator notwendig, bleibt jedoch metaphorisch und nicht begrifflich vollständig bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:MRT3","text":"Die Identität von Ewigkeit, Frau, Ehe und Wiederkunft wird behauptet, aber nicht systematisch vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:MRT4","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Erlösung als umfassende Einbindung und nicht als Entfernung des Negativen verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung des Systems liegt in der Kopplung von moralischer Transvaluation, Selbstintegration und Wiederkunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:MRT6","text":"Die ungelöste Spannung liegt zwischen der Überbietung endlicher Fortpflanzung und der fortbestehenden Verwendung von Ehe-, Frauen- und Kindersemantik.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die argumentative Bewegung, lässt jedoch offen, ob die Ewigkeit ontologisch, erotisch oder ausschließlich dichterisch bestimmt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T191756802674Z_9e833bde","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"4.","source_sha256":"9337cb02dd9e5549bd665b26f4c8fd0e816017f0039e6507240cc248e20ce559","sha256":"d6b1ea12d5dabcff46c4a02521323b0ec954cfb244f0c7b5367ab83f68bf4202","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:17:56.804978+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:AS1","text":"The text presupposes the complete acceptance of a world in which opposites stand in a common relation of mixture.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:AS2","text":"The central redefinition consists in treating what is distant and what is near, fire and spirit, pleasure and suffering, as well as the worst and the most good, as connectable materials.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:AS3","text":"This connection is made possible by a salt that binds good and evil and also includes even the most evil as capable of seasoning and overflowing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:AS4","text":"The speaking subject recognizes itself as a constituent of this redemptive process of mixture.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:AS5","text":"From self-integration into the mixture arises the desire for eternity and for the ring of recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:AS6","text":"Eternity is installed, as a beloved figure addressed as female, in place of a finite marital and reproductive fulfillment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:A1","text":"All things can be connected with one another in a common vessel of mixture.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:A2","text":"Opposites such as what is distant and what is near, fire and spirit, as well as pleasure and suffering, are mixable with one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:A3","text":"Good and evil can be bound by a common salt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:A4","text":"Even the most evil possesses, within the mixture, a seasoning and intensifying value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:A5","text":"The speaking subject can itself be a constituent of the binding salt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:A6","text":"The mixture of opposites possesses redemptive power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:A7","text":"The recognition of this mixture generates a burning desire for eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:A8","text":"Eternity is determined as recurrence and as the “nuptial ring of rings.”","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:A9","text":"Finite marriage and procreation do not constitute the ultimate form of the bond desired by the subject.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:A10","text":"Beloved eternity can assume the function of the desired woman and possible motherhood.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:NX1","text":"Redemption is not defined through the separation of good from evil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:NX2","text":"The most evil is not treated as a useless or excludable remainder.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:NX3","text":"Pleasure and suffering are not treated as strictly separate domains of value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:NX4","text":"Spirit is not isolated against fire as its pure opposite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:NX5","text":"The desired bond is not consummated in mere finite marriage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:NX6","text":"Recurrence is not determined as a singular linear redemption.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:NX7","text":"The subject does not stand outside the process of mixture as its uninvolved observer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:D1","text":"The possibility of redemption depends on the integration of opposing elements rather than on their purification.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_3:A1","CH_97E9_4C_3:A2","CH_97E9_4C_3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:D2","text":"The negative gains its value not despite, but through its incorporation into the mixture.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_3:A3","CH_97E9_4C_3:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:D3","text":"Self-participation in the mixture transforms cosmological connection into a personal experience.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_3:A5","CH_97E9_4C_3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:D4","text":"The desire for eternity follows from the affirmed totality of connections and not from flight from the world.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_3:A1","CH_97E9_4C_3:A6","CH_97E9_4C_3:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:D5","text":"The ring of recurrence denotes the enduring form of a world whose opposites are bound together again and again.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_3:A2","CH_97E9_4C_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:D6","text":"The language of love transfers recurrence from a cosmological formula into a desired relationship.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_3:A7","CH_97E9_4C_3:A8","CH_97E9_4C_3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:SD1","text":"The system makes redemption dependent on the capacity to affirm the entire tension of values in the world, including its extreme negative.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_3:A3","CH_97E9_4C_3:A4","CH_97E9_4C_3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:SD2","text":"Recurrence appears as an ontological totalization of the mixture: nothing may be excluded from the cycle of binding.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_3:A1","CH_97E9_4C_3:A2","CH_97E9_4C_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:SD3","text":"The I is not released from the world through self-transcendence, but transformed through its incorporation into the world's binding structure.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_3:A5","CH_97E9_4C_3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:SD4","text":"The erotic address makes eternity into the affective figure of a world whose repetition can be affirmed.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_3:A7","CH_97E9_4C_3:A8","CH_97E9_4C_3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:SD5","text":"Finite reproduction is surpassed by a symbolic union with eternity, without the language of procreation disappearing entirely.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_3:A9","CH_97E9_4C_3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:DNX1","text":"The system depends on purity possessing no higher principle of redemption than mixture.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:DNX2","text":"It presupposes that moral opposites are not ontologically final.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:DNX3","text":"It excludes a redemption that would be attained through the removal of suffering, evil, or the contradictory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:DNX4","text":"It disqualifies a form of subjectivity that preserves itself as a separate instance outside worldly connections.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:DNX5","text":"It presupposes that eternity means not merely enduring continuation, but repeated binding of the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:DNX6","text":"It treats the finite social order of marriage as insufficient for the most comprehensive form of union.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a redemption that leaves behind a remainder of the world as unconnectable, valueless, or unworthy of recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:SNX2","text":"Excluded is an eternity without repetition, without the binding of opposites, and without affective assent to their continuance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:SNX3","text":"Excluded is an identity that gains stability only through demarcation from evil, suffering, or the lowest.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:SNX4","text":"The deepest blocked possibility is a world in which the negative can be not transformed, but definitively removed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:FGS1","text":"Difference → common mixability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:FGS2","text":"Mixability → binding of good and evil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:FGS3","text":"Binding of the negative → dignity and function of the most evil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:FGS4","text":"Incorporation of the subject → self-becoming as a constituent of the binding salt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:FGS5","text":"Redemptive mixture → desire for a comprehensive enduring form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:FGS6","text":"Enduring form → recurrence as ring of rings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:FGS7","text":"Recurrence → erotic personification of eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:FGS8","text":"Personified eternity → replacement of the finite reproductive bond by cosmic union.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:AF1","text":"Separate opposites → vessel of mixture as common structure → salt as binding operator → integration of the most evil → self-incorporation of the speaker → redemptive effect → desire for eternity → recurrence as ring → eternity as beloved woman.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:AF2","text":"Insufficient finite marriage → cosmological redefinition of union → recurrence as the highest form of binding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:ME1","text":"Good and evil are remapped from exclusive moral poles into connectable constituents of a shared nexus of effects.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:ME2","text":"The most evil is classified from an excludable remainder into a functional moment of flavor and intensification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:ME3","text":"Redemption is shifted from relief from world and contradiction to their complete incorporation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:ME4","text":"Recurrence is redrawn from an abstract temporal structure into a desired relationship and bond.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:ME5","text":"Marriage and procreation are displaced from the position of ultimate union and relegated to a finite level of order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:ALT1","text":"Surface — The speaker professes love for eternity and for the ring of recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:ALT2","text":"Structural — A mechanism of mixture and binding integrates spatial, spiritual, affective, and moral opposites.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Assent to recurrence is made possible through the transformation of the most evil into a necessary constituent of totality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Being appears as recurrent mixture, whose duration lies not outside but within the binding of all opposites.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the transition from the mixture of opposites to the desire for eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:MRT2","text":"The function of salt is necessary as a binding operator, yet remains metaphorical and not fully conceptually determined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:MRT3","text":"The identity of eternity, woman, marriage, and recurrence is asserted, but not systematically mediated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:MRT4","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as redemption is understood as comprehensive incorporation rather than as removal of the negative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:MRT5","text":"The system's strongest connection lies in the coupling of moral transvaluation, self-integration, and recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:MRT6","text":"The unresolved tension lies between the surpassing of finite reproduction and the continuing use of the semantics of marriage, women, and children.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_3:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the argumentative movement, but leaves open whether eternity is determined ontologically, erotically, or exclusively poetically.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_4C_3@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_4C_3:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"The Seven Seals","source_section_label":"4.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"The Seven Seals · 4","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","The Seven Seals","4."],"original_title":"4."}],"source_title_context":"Die sieben Siegel","source_section_label":"4.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"The Seven Seals · 4","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","The Seven Seals","4."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 121","title":"The Seven Seals · 4","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Die sieben Siegel · 4"},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3","layer":"CH","title":"The Seven Seals · 5","order":122,"parents":["RAW_97E9_5C_3"],"revision":"CH_97E9_5C_3@R001","sha256":"73030934a03aee068b826347fa3fc82ef300188dc6d2c2d29a32e20c60ce933c","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:AS1","text":"Das Meer und alles Meeresartige werden als bevorzugte Gegenmacht des sprechenden Ichs gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:AS2","text":"Suchende Lust verwandelt Unentdecktes in Antrieb und Seefahrt in eine Form der Lust.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:AS3","text":"Das Verschwinden der Küste und der Abfall der letzten Kette eröffnen einen grenzenlosen Raum von Zeit und Raum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:AS4","text":"Die entgrenzte Bewegung erzeugt brünstiges Verlangen nach Ewigkeit und nach dem Ring der Wiederkunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:AS5","text":"Die nicht gefundene zeugungsfähige Frau wird durch die geliebte Ewigkeit ersetzt, wodurch Ewigkeit als einzig geliebtes Gegenüber erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:A1","text":"Das Meeresartige ist eine bevorzugte Form des Gegenüberstehenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:A2","text":"Widerspruch steigert die Zuneigung des sprechenden Ichs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:A3","text":"Unentdecktes erzeugt suchende und seefahrerische Lust.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:A4","text":"Das Verschwinden der Küste markiert den Verlust einer letzten Grenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:A5","text":"Der Verlust der Grenze wird als Abfall einer Kette erfahren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:A6","text":"Grenzenlosigkeit eröffnet eine Weite, in der Raum und Zeit glänzend erfahren werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:A7","text":"Die Erfahrung der Grenzenlosigkeit erzeugt das Verlangen nach Ewigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:A8","text":"Der Ring der Wiederkunft ist die hochzeitliche Form der Ewigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:A9","text":"Die zeugungsfähige Frau bleibt als menschliches Gegenüber unentdeckt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:A10","text":"Ewigkeit kann die Stelle des geliebten weiblichen Gegenübers einnehmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:A11","text":"Liebe zur Ewigkeit verbindet Begehren, Bindung und Wiederkunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:NX1","text":"Die bevorzugte Gegenmacht ist nicht ein widerstandsloses oder vollständig verfügbares Gegenüber.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:NX2","text":"Die suchende Lust ist nicht auf Bekanntes oder bereits Entdecktes gerichtet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:NX3","text":"Die entscheidende Bewegung findet nicht innerhalb einer dauerhaft sichtbaren Küste statt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:NX4","text":"Die Befreiung setzt die Abwesenheit einer letzten verbleibenden Kette voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:NX5","text":"Die eröffnete Weite ist nicht durch eine abschließende räumliche oder zeitliche Grenze bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:NX6","text":"Ewigkeit ist nicht bloß lineare Fortdauer, sondern wird als Ring der Wiederkunft bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:NX7","text":"Das geliebte Gegenüber wird nicht in einer gefundenen menschlichen Frau verwirklicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:D1","text":"Je stärker das Gegenüber widerspricht, desto intensiver kann es als geliebte Gegenmacht erscheinen.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_3:A1","CH_97E9_5C_3:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:D2","text":"Unentdecktes wird nicht als Mangel, sondern als Antrieb der Bewegung konstituiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_3:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:D3","text":"Das Verschwinden der Küste wird als Übergang von gebundener zu entgrenzter Existenz erzeugt.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_3:A4","CH_97E9_5C_3:A5","CH_97E9_5C_3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:D4","text":"Die Entgrenzung von Raum und Zeit wird in ein Verlangen nach Ewigkeit überführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_3:A6","CH_97E9_5C_3:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:D5","text":"Die Ewigkeit erhält durch den Ring der Wiederkunft eine zyklische und bindende Form.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_3:A7","CH_97E9_5C_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:D6","text":"Das Ausbleiben der menschlichen Frau verschiebt die Liebesfähigkeit des Ichs auf die Ewigkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_3:A9","CH_97E9_5C_3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:SD1","text":"Befreiung von Grenze und Bindung wird nicht als Auflösung jeder Bindung vollendet, sondern als Bindung an die Wiederkunft neu organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:SD2","text":"Das Meer fungiert als Übergangsmaschine, die Widerspruch in Bewegung, Bewegung in Entgrenzung und Entgrenzung in metaphysisches Begehren transformiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:SD3","text":"Ewigkeit wird als geliebtes Gegenüber totalisiert, weil das menschliche Gegenüber nicht gefunden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:SD4","text":"Die zyklische Zeit der Wiederkunft ersetzt die lineare Erwartung von Entdeckung, Besitz und Nachkommenschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:DNX1","text":"Das System hängt davon ab, dass Freiheit nicht als dauerhafte Ankunft an einer neuen Grenze verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:DNX2","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass Widerspruch primär als Störung, Niederlage oder Trennungsgrund gilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:DNX3","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass das Unentdeckte durch Entdeckung seinen generativen Wert verliert und in Besitz übergeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:DNX4","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass menschliche Zeugung das höchste Modell von Zukunft und Erfüllung bildet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:DNX5","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass Zeit als unumkehrbare Abfolge die maßgebliche Form des Daseins ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:SNX1","text":"Die Möglichkeit einer endgültigen Küste, eines letzten Ortes der Ankunft, bleibt strukturell versperrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:SNX2","text":"Die Möglichkeit einer erfüllten menschlichen Paarbeziehung mit Kindern wird durch die Ersetzung des Weibes durch Ewigkeit suspendiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:SNX3","text":"Die Möglichkeit einer Befreiung ohne neue metaphysische Bindung wird nicht zugelassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:SNX4","text":"Die Möglichkeit einer außerhalb des Wiederkunftsrings liegenden Zukunft wird unbenannt und unzugänglich gemacht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:FGS1","text":"Gegenmacht + gesteigerter Widerspruch → bevorzugte Zuneigung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:FGS2","text":"Unentdecktes + suchende Lust → seefahrerische Bewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:FGS3","text":"Seefahrerische Bewegung → Verschiebung der Küste → Abfall der letzten Kette.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:FGS4","text":"Abfall der Grenze → grenzenlose Raum-Zeit-Erfahrung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:FGS5","text":"Grenzenlose Raum-Zeit-Erfahrung → Verlangen nach Ewigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:FGS6","text":"Ewigkeit + Ringmetapher → Wiederkunft als zyklische Bindungsform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:FGS7","text":"Ausbleiben der menschlichen Frau → Übertragung der Liebe auf Ewigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:FGS8","text":"Liebe zur Ewigkeit → nachträgliche Totalisierung von Wiederkunft, Bindung und Zukunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:AF1","text":"Widerspruch des Meeres → gesteigerte Zuneigung → suchende Lust → Entdeckung als Bewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:AF2","text":"Verschwindende Küste → fallende letzte Kette → grenzenloser Raum und Zeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:AF3","text":"Grenzenlosigkeit → Verlangen nach Ewigkeit → Ring der Wiederkunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:AF4","text":"Nicht gefundene Frau → geliebte Ewigkeit → Ewigkeit als Gegenüber und Zukunftsform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:ME1","text":"Widerspruch wird von einem negativen Hindernis zu einer Intensivierungsbedingung der Liebe umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:ME2","text":"Grenze wird von einer räumlichen Gegebenheit zu einer abwerfbaren Kette umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:ME3","text":"Seefahrt wird von Fortbewegung zu einer ontologischen Öffnung auf Raum, Zeit und Ewigkeit erweitert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:ME4","text":"Ewigkeit wird nicht als abstrakte Dauer, sondern als ringförmige Wiederkunft und hochzeitliche Bindung kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:ME5","text":"Die menschliche Frau und die Ewigkeit werden als konkurrierende Formen des geliebten Gegenübers angeordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:ALT1","text":"Surface — Das sprechende Ich bekundet seine Liebe zum Meer, seine Lust am Aufbruch und seine Liebe zur Ewigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:ALT2","text":"Structural — Widerspruch, Unentdecktheit, Grenzverlust und Entgrenzung erzeugen eine gerichtete Transformationskette.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Das Ich bewertet nicht Ankunft und Besitz, sondern Aufbruch, Widerstand und fortgesetzte Öffnung als produktive Zustände.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Wirklichkeit wird als grenzenlose Raum-Zeit erfahren und Zeit als Wiederkunft statt als lineare Zukunft bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von Meeresgegenmacht über Entgrenzung zur Ewigkeit zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:MRT2","text":"Die Ersetzung der menschlichen Frau durch Ewigkeit bleibt als metaphorische und ontologische Verschiebung zugleich unterbestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:MRT3","text":"Die Wiederkunft erscheint als leidenschaftlich bejahte Form, nicht als deduktiv bewiesene Lehre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:MRT4","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Befreiung und neue Bindung nicht als Gegensätze behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung liegt in der Folge Widerspruch → Bewegung → Grenzverlust → Ewigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:MRT6","text":"Die zentrale Bruchlinie liegt zwischen dem Abwerfen der letzten Kette und der Bindung an den Ring der Wiederkunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, sofern die Liebe zur Ewigkeit als erzeugte Endposition und nicht als bloße Beschreibung gelesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T191937100340Z_d20d58c1","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"5.","source_sha256":"73030934a03aee068b826347fa3fc82ef300188dc6d2c2d29a32e20c60ce933c","sha256":"5afdc3782eaac4c45b2bdc3fb46f14fd2395067c9dbedd9769f110353d9f897e","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:19:37.102688+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:AS1","text":"The sea and everything sea-like are posited as the preferred counterforce of the speaking I.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:AS2","text":"Seeking pleasure transforms the undiscovered into impetus and seafaring into a form of pleasure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:AS3","text":"The disappearance of the coast and the falling away of the last chain open up a boundless space of time and space.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:AS4","text":"Unbounded movement generates ardent desire for eternity and for the ring of recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:AS5","text":"The unfound procreative woman is replaced by beloved eternity, whereby eternity appears as the only beloved counterpart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:A1","text":"That which is sea-like is a preferred form of that which stands opposite.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:A2","text":"Contradiction intensifies the affection of the speaking I.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:A3","text":"The undiscovered generates seeking and seafaring pleasure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:A4","text":"The disappearance of the coast marks the loss of a final boundary.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:A5","text":"The loss of the boundary is experienced as the falling away of a chain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:A6","text":"Boundlessness opens a vastness in which space and time are experienced as shining.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:A7","text":"The experience of boundlessness generates desire for eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:A8","text":"The ring of recurrence is the nuptial form of eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:A9","text":"The procreative woman remains undiscovered as a human counterpart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:A10","text":"Eternity can take the place of the beloved female counterpart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:A11","text":"Love of eternity connects desire, bond, and recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:NX1","text":"The preferred counterforce is not a counterpart without resistance or one that is wholly available.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:NX2","text":"Seeking pleasure is not directed toward what is known or already discovered.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:NX3","text":"The decisive movement does not take place within a permanently visible coast.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:NX4","text":"Liberation presupposes the absence of a final remaining chain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:NX5","text":"The opened vastness is not determined by a conclusive spatial or temporal boundary.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:NX6","text":"Eternity is not merely linear duration, but is determined as the ring of recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:NX7","text":"The beloved counterpart is not realized in a found human woman.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:D1","text":"The more strongly the counterpart contradicts, the more intensely it can appear as a beloved counterforce.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_3:A1","CH_97E9_5C_3:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:D2","text":"The undiscovered is constituted not as lack, but as the impetus of movement.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_3:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:D3","text":"The disappearance of the coast is produced as a transition from bound to unbounded existence.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_3:A4","CH_97E9_5C_3:A5","CH_97E9_5C_3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:D4","text":"The unbounding of space and time is transferred into a desire for eternity.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_3:A6","CH_97E9_5C_3:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:D5","text":"Through the ring of recurrence, eternity acquires a cyclical and binding form.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_3:A7","CH_97E9_5C_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:D6","text":"The absence of the human woman displaces the I's capacity for love onto eternity.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_3:A9","CH_97E9_5C_3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:SD1","text":"Liberation from boundary and bond is not completed as the dissolution of every bond, but is reorganized as a bond to recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:SD2","text":"The sea functions as a transition machine that transforms contradiction into movement, movement into unbounding, and unbounding into metaphysical desire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:SD3","text":"Eternity is totalized as beloved counterpart because the human counterpart is not found.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:SD4","text":"The cyclical time of recurrence replaces the linear expectation of discovery, possession, and progeny.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:DNX1","text":"The system depends on freedom not being understood as permanent arrival at a new boundary.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:DNX2","text":"It is excluded that contradiction counts primarily as disturbance, defeat, or grounds for separation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:DNX3","text":"It is excluded that the undiscovered loses its generative value through discovery and passes into possession.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:DNX4","text":"It is excluded that human procreation constitutes the highest model of future and fulfillment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:DNX5","text":"It is excluded that time as irreversible sequence is the determinative form of existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:SNX1","text":"The possibility of a final coast, a last place of arrival, remains structurally blocked.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:SNX2","text":"The possibility of a fulfilled human pair relationship with children is suspended by the replacement of the woman with eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:SNX3","text":"The possibility of liberation without a new metaphysical bond is not admitted.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:SNX4","text":"The possibility of a future lying outside the ring of recurrence is rendered unnamed and inaccessible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:FGS1","text":"Counterforce + intensified contradiction → preferred affection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:FGS2","text":"Undiscovered + seeking pleasure → seafaring movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:FGS3","text":"Seafaring movement → displacement of the coast → falling away of the last chain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:FGS4","text":"Falling away of the boundary → boundless space-time experience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:FGS5","text":"Boundless space-time experience → desire for eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:FGS6","text":"Eternity + ring metaphor → recurrence as a cyclical form of binding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:FGS7","text":"Absence of the human woman → transference of love onto eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:FGS8","text":"Love of eternity → retrospective totalization of recurrence, bond, and future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:AF1","text":"Contradiction of the sea → intensified affection → seeking pleasure → discovery as movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:AF2","text":"Disappearing coast → falling last chain → boundless space and time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:AF3","text":"Boundlessness → desire for eternity → ring of recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:AF4","text":"Unfound woman → beloved eternity → eternity as counterpart and form of the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:ME1","text":"Contradiction is remapped from a negative obstacle into a condition for the intensification of love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:ME2","text":"Boundary is reclassified from a spatial given into a chain that can be cast off.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:ME3","text":"Seafaring is expanded from locomotion into an ontological opening onto space, time, and eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:ME4","text":"Eternity is mapped not as abstract duration, but as ring-shaped recurrence and nuptial bond.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:ME5","text":"The human woman and eternity are arranged as competing forms of the beloved counterpart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:ALT1","text":"Surface — The speaking I declares its love for the sea, its pleasure in setting out, and its love for eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:ALT2","text":"Structural — Contradiction, undiscoveredness, loss of boundary, and unbounding generate a directed chain of transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The I values not arrival and possession, but setting out, resistance, and continued opening as productive states.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Reality is experienced as boundless space-time, and time is determined as recurrence rather than as linear future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from the sea's counterforce through unbounding to eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:MRT2","text":"The replacement of the human woman by eternity remains underdetermined both as a metaphorical and as an ontological displacement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:MRT3","text":"Recurrence appears as a passionately affirmed form, not as a deductively proven doctrine.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:MRT4","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as liberation and new bond are not treated as opposites.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:MRT5","text":"The strongest connection lies in the sequence contradiction → movement → loss of boundary → eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:MRT6","text":"The central fault line lies between casting off the last chain and binding to the ring of recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_3:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual argumentative movement insofar as love of eternity is read as a generated final position and not as a mere description.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_5C_3@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_5C_3:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"The Seven Seals","source_section_label":"5.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"The Seven Seals · 5","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","The Seven Seals","5."],"original_title":"5."}],"source_title_context":"Die sieben Siegel","source_section_label":"5.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"The Seven Seals · 5","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","The Seven Seals","5."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 122","title":"The Seven Seals · 5","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Die sieben Siegel · 5"},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3","layer":"CH","title":"The Seven Seals · 6","order":123,"parents":["RAW_97E9_6C_3"],"revision":"CH_97E9_6C_3@R001","sha256":"f8b7fdb3f1a14cb12a81cbfaf974a89c0a7a5e6549ccd11b47500c601463fa31","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:AS1","text":"Eine tanzende Tugend und eine lachende Bosheit werden als Bedingungen einer bejahenden Existenz gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:AS2","text":"Das Lachen entlastet das Böse von seiner Verurteilung, indem es dieses durch eigene Seligkeit heiligt und losspricht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:AS3","text":"Die oberste Umwertung verwandelt Schwere in Leichtigkeit, den Leib in Tanz und den Geist in Vogelhaftigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:AS4","text":"Aus dieser Umwertung entsteht das brünstige Verlangen nach Ewigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:AS5","text":"Die Ewigkeit wird als geliebter hochzeitlicher Ring der Wiederkunft bestimmt, während Fortpflanzung an diese Liebe gebunden bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:A1","text":"Tugend kann als Tanz bestimmt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:A2","text":"Das Springen in gold-smaragdenes Entzücken verkörpert die tanzende Tugend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:A3","text":"Bosheit kann als lachende, lebensnahe Bosheit erscheinen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:A4","text":"Im Lachen versammelt sich das Böse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:A5","text":"Das Böse wird durch die ihm eigene Seligkeit geheiligt und losgesprochen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:A6","text":"Das oberste Prinzip besteht darin, alles Schwere leicht, allen Leib tänzerisch und allen Geist vogelhaft werden zu lassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:A7","text":"Die vollzogene Leichtigkeit erzeugt ein brünstiges Verlangen nach Ewigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:A8","text":"Die Ewigkeit erscheint als hochzeitlicher Ring der Wiederkunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:A9","text":"Der Wunsch nach Kindern aus einer Frau setzt Liebe zu dieser Frau voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:A10","text":"Die Ewigkeit wird als geliebtes Gegenüber angeredet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:NX1","text":"Tugend wird nicht als Schwere, Askese oder bloße moralische Pflichterfüllung zugelassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:NX2","text":"Bosheit wird nicht als ausschließlich zu verurteilende Negativität behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:NX3","text":"Das Lachen wird nicht auf Unterhaltung oder bloße Heiterkeit begrenzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:NX4","text":"Der Leib wird nicht als Last fixiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:NX5","text":"Der Geist wird nicht als unbewegliche, erdgebundene Instanz bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:NX6","text":"Ewigkeit wird nicht als bloße endlose Dauer bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:NX7","text":"Die Wiederkunft wird nicht als einmaliger Abschluss oder lineares Ziel gefasst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:NX8","text":"Fortpflanzung wird nicht als von Liebe unabhängige biologische Funktion gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:D1","text":"Die tanzende Tugend macht körperliche Ekstase zu einem Träger des Guten.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_3:A1","CH_97E9_6C_3:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:D2","text":"Die lachende Bosheit verwandelt die Unterscheidung zwischen moralischer Verwerfung und bejahter Lebensfülle.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_3:A3","CH_97E9_6C_3:A4","CH_97E9_6C_3:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:D3","text":"Die eigene Seligkeit fungiert als Instanz der Lossprechung.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_3:A4","CH_97E9_6C_3:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:D4","text":"Die Umwandlung von Schwere in Leichtigkeit verbindet Leib und Geist in einer gemeinsamen Bewegungsform.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:D5","text":"Ewigkeit wird nicht entdeckt, sondern aus der gesteigerten Bewegungs- und Bejahungsform heraus begehrt.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_3:A6","CH_97E9_6C_3:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:D6","text":"Der Ring der Wiederkunft macht Ewigkeit zu einer zyklischen, erotisch bejahten Zeitgestalt.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_3:A7","CH_97E9_6C_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:D7","text":"Die Möglichkeit von Kindern wird durch die vorgängige affektive Bindung begrenzt.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_3:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:D8","text":"Die Ewigkeit übernimmt die Stelle des geliebten Gegenübers, an dem sich Begehren und Generativität ausrichten.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_3:A9","CH_97E9_6C_3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:SD1","text":"Das System erzeugt eine Existenzform, in der moralische Entlastung, körperliche Beweglichkeit und metaphysische Bejahung dieselbe Operation bilden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:SD2","text":"Die höchste Bejahung entsteht nicht durch Entfernung vom Leiblichen, sondern durch dessen tänzerische Umcodierung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:SD3","text":"Ewigkeit wird zur totalisierten Form einer Lebensbejahung, die zugleich erotisch, körperlich und zeitlich organisiert ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:SD4","text":"Die Wiederkunft bindet die intensivste Lebensform an eine zyklische Zeit, sodass Bejahung nicht auf Erlösung durch Ende angewiesen ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:SD5","text":"Die Generativität des Textes verschiebt sich von einer konkreten Frau auf die geliebte Ewigkeit als übergeordnetes Gegenüber.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:DNX1","text":"Das System hängt davon ab, dass moralische Kategorien nicht als letztgültige, unveränderliche Gegensätze bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:DNX2","text":"Es setzt voraus, dass Schwere keine ontologische Eigenschaft des Leibes und Ernst keine notwendige Eigenschaft des Geistes ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:DNX3","text":"Es schließt eine Erlösung aus, die durch Entkörperlichung, Entsinnlichung oder Flucht aus der Welt erreicht wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:DNX4","text":"Es schließt eine lineare Zeitordnung aus, in der Erfüllung durch einen endgültigen zukünftigen Zustand erreicht wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:DNX5","text":"Es disqualifiziert eine Fortpflanzung, die ohne Liebe als hinreichende Lebensbejahung gelten könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:DNX6","text":"Es setzt voraus, dass das Individuum seine höchste Beziehung nicht in einer gewöhnlichen sozialen Verbindung finden muss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Welt, in der das Gute nur durch Verneinung, Belastung und Selbstüberwindung des Leibes erreichbar wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine endgültige Entlastung durch ein außerhalb der Welt liegendes Jenseits.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:SNX3","text":"Unverfügbar bleibt ein unschuldiges, nicht widersprüchliches Verhältnis zwischen moralischer Bosheit und bejahter Seligkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:SNX4","text":"Versperrt ist eine Zukunft, die von der Wiederholung des bereits Bejahten unabhängig wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:SNX5","text":"Die nicht gefundene konkrete Frau strukturiert die Rede von Liebe, Ehe und Kindern als eine Abwesenheit, die erst durch die Ewigkeit besetzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:FGS1","text":"Körperliche Ekstase → Tanzfigur → Neubestimmung der Tugend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:FGS2","text":"Lachen → Zusammenfassung des Bösen → Seligkeit als immanente Lossprechung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:FGS3","text":"Aufhebung der Schwere → tänzerischer Leib und vogelhafter Geist → oberstes Lebensprinzip.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:FGS4","text":"Vollzogene Leichtigkeit → brünstiges Begehren → Ewigkeit als begehrtes Gegenüber.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:FGS5","text":"Ewigkeit → hochzeitlicher Ring → Wiederkunft als zyklische Zeitform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:FGS6","text":"Liebe als Bedingung der Generativität → konkrete Frau bleibt unbestimmt → Ewigkeit wird als geliebte Instanz der Fortsetzung eingesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:AF1","text":"Tanzende Tugend → lachende Bosheit → immanente Lossprechung → Aufhebung der Schwere → Ewigkeit als Ring der Wiederkunft → Liebe zur Ewigkeit als Bedingung generativer Bejahung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:ME1","text":"Tugend und Tanz werden auf derselben begrifflichen Karte verortet; moralische Höhe erscheint als Beweglichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:ME2","text":"Das Böse wird von einer rein negativen Kategorie in eine durch Lachen transformierbare Lebensspannung überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:ME3","text":"Leib und Geist werden nicht länger als gegensätzliche Sphären kartiert, sondern als gemeinsam zu erleichternde Bewegungsformen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:ME4","text":"Ewigkeit wird von abstrakter Dauer in eine erotische und zyklische Zeitfigur umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:ME5","text":"Fortpflanzung wird aus dem biologischen Bereich in eine Ordnung der Liebe und metaphysischen Bindung verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:ME6","text":"Die konkrete Geschlechterbeziehung wird zugunsten einer umfassenderen Beziehung zur Ewigkeit dezentriert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:ALT1","text":"Surface: Das sprechende Ich beschreibt Tanz, Lachen, Leichtigkeit, Ewigkeit, Liebe und Kinderbegehren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:ALT2","text":"Structural: Körperliche Bewegungsformen organisieren die Neubestimmung von Tugend, Bosheit und Geist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Der Text ersetzt moralische Verurteilung und asketische Schwere durch Lachen, Bejahung und tänzerische Umwertung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Wirklichkeit wird als bejahbare Wiederkunftsordnung vorausgesetzt, in der Ewigkeit zyklisch und erotisch strukturiert ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von Tanz und Lachen zur Ewigkeit und Wiederkunft zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob die Ewigkeit metaphorisch, ontologisch oder als konkrete Liebesfigur zu verstehen ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, solange die Umwertung moralischer Kategorien und die zyklische Zeitordnung gemeinsam vorausgesetzt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung besteht zwischen körperlicher Leichtigkeit, Lebensbejahung und Ewigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:MRT5","text":"Die zentrale Bruchlinie liegt zwischen der Benennung des Bösen und seiner gleichzeitigen Heiligung und Lossprechung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung entsteht daraus, dass der Ring der Wiederkunft zyklische Wiederholung behauptet, während Kinder und Generativität eine gerichtete Fortsetzung nahelegen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, sofern die geliebte Ewigkeit nicht vorschnell mit einer konkreten Frau identifiziert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T192208526368Z_2080542d","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"6.","source_sha256":"f8b7fdb3f1a14cb12a81cbfaf974a89c0a7a5e6549ccd11b47500c601463fa31","sha256":"be58033bbb995b4098521c50364db8d562a2a867a47a6a073d3ae1f72fae54bb","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:22:08.527521+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:AS1","text":"A dancing virtue and a laughing wickedness are posited as conditions of an affirmative existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:AS2","text":"Laughter relieves evil of its condemnation by sanctifying and absolving it through its own bliss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:AS3","text":"The highest revaluation transforms heaviness into lightness, the body into dance, and the spirit into birdlikeness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:AS4","text":"From this revaluation arises the fervent desire for eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:AS5","text":"Eternity is determined as the beloved nuptial ring of recurrence, while procreation remains bound to this love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:A1","text":"Virtue can be determined as dance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:A2","text":"Leaping into golden-emerald delight embodies dancing virtue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:A3","text":"Wickedness can appear as laughing, life-near wickedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:A4","text":"In laughter, evil gathers itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:A5","text":"Evil is sanctified and absolved through the bliss proper to it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:A6","text":"The highest principle consists in making everything heavy light, every body dance-like, and every spirit bird-like.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:A7","text":"Accomplished lightness produces a fervent desire for eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:A8","text":"Eternity appears as the nuptial ring of recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:A9","text":"The wish for children from a woman presupposes love for this woman.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:A10","text":"Eternity is addressed as a beloved counterpart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:NX1","text":"Virtue is not admitted as heaviness, asceticism, or mere fulfillment of moral duty.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:NX2","text":"Wickedness is not treated as negativity that is exclusively to be condemned.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:NX3","text":"Laughter is not limited to entertainment or mere cheerfulness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:NX4","text":"The body is not fixed as a burden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:NX5","text":"The spirit is not determined as an immobile, earthbound instance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:NX6","text":"Eternity is not determined as mere endless duration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:NX7","text":"Recurrence is not conceived as a singular conclusion or linear goal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:NX8","text":"Procreation is not posited as a biological function independent of love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:D1","text":"Dancing virtue makes bodily ecstasy a bearer of the good.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_3:A1","CH_97E9_6C_3:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:D2","text":"Laughing wickedness transforms the distinction between moral condemnation and affirmed fullness of life.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_3:A3","CH_97E9_6C_3:A4","CH_97E9_6C_3:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:D3","text":"One's own bliss functions as an instance of absolution.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_3:A4","CH_97E9_6C_3:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:D4","text":"The transformation of heaviness into lightness joins body and spirit in a shared form of movement.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:D5","text":"Eternity is not discovered, but desired out of the intensified form of movement and affirmation.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_3:A6","CH_97E9_6C_3:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:D6","text":"The ring of recurrence makes eternity into a cyclical, erotically affirmed temporal form.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_3:A7","CH_97E9_6C_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:D7","text":"The possibility of children is limited by prior affective attachment.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_3:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:D8","text":"Eternity takes the place of the beloved counterpart toward which desire and generativity are oriented.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_3:A9","CH_97E9_6C_3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:SD1","text":"The system produces a form of existence in which moral relief, bodily mobility, and metaphysical affirmation constitute the same operation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:SD2","text":"The highest affirmation arises not through removal from the bodily, but through its dance-like recoding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:SD3","text":"Eternity becomes the totalized form of an affirmation of life that is at once erotically, bodily, and temporally organized.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:SD4","text":"Recurrence binds the most intensive form of life to cyclical time, such that affirmation does not depend on redemption through an end.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:SD5","text":"The generativity of the text shifts from a concrete woman to beloved eternity as a superordinate counterpart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:DNX1","text":"The system depends on moral categories not existing as ultimately valid, unchangeable oppositions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:DNX2","text":"It presupposes that heaviness is not an ontological property of the body and seriousness not a necessary property of the spirit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:DNX3","text":"It excludes a redemption achieved through disembodiment, desensualization, or flight from the world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:DNX4","text":"It excludes a linear temporal order in which fulfillment is achieved through a final future state.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:DNX5","text":"It disqualifies a procreation that could count as sufficient affirmation of life without love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:DNX6","text":"It presupposes that the individual need not find his highest relation in an ordinary social connection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a world in which the good would be attainable only through negation, burden, and self-overcoming of the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:SNX2","text":"Excluded is a final relief through a beyond situated outside the world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:SNX3","text":"An innocent, non-contradictory relation between moral wickedness and affirmed bliss remains unavailable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:SNX4","text":"Barred is a future that would be independent of the repetition of what has already been affirmed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:SNX5","text":"The concrete woman not found structures the discourse of love, marriage, and children as an absence occupied only by eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:FGS1","text":"Bodily ecstasy → dance figure → redefinition of virtue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:FGS2","text":"Laughter → gathering of evil → bliss as immanent absolution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:FGS3","text":"Abolition of heaviness → dancing body and bird-like spirit → highest principle of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:FGS4","text":"Accomplished lightness → fervent desire → eternity as desired counterpart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:FGS5","text":"Eternity → nuptial ring → recurrence as cyclical temporal form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:FGS6","text":"Love as condition of generativity → concrete woman remains indeterminate → eternity is installed as the beloved instance of continuation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:AF1","text":"Dancing virtue → laughing wickedness → immanent absolution → abolition of heaviness → eternity as ring of recurrence → love for eternity as condition of generative affirmation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:ME1","text":"Virtue and dance are situated on the same conceptual map; moral elevation appears as mobility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:ME2","text":"Evil is transferred from a purely negative category into a tension of life transformable through laughter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:ME3","text":"Body and spirit are no longer mapped as opposed spheres, but as forms of movement to be lightened together.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:ME4","text":"Eternity is reclassified from abstract duration into an erotic and cyclical temporal figure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:ME5","text":"Procreation is displaced from the biological domain into an order of love and metaphysical attachment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:ME6","text":"The concrete gender relation is decentered in favor of a more comprehensive relation to eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:ALT1","text":"Surface: The speaking I describes dance, laughter, lightness, eternity, love, and the desire for children.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:ALT2","text":"Structural: Bodily forms of movement organize the redefinition of virtue, wickedness, and spirit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: The text replaces moral condemnation and ascetic heaviness with laughter, affirmation, and dance-like revaluation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Reality is presupposed as an affirmable order of recurrence in which eternity is structured cyclically and erotically.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from dance and laughter to eternity and recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether eternity is to be understood metaphorically, ontologically, or as a concrete figure of love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent so long as the revaluation of moral categories and the cyclical temporal order are jointly presupposed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:MRT4","text":"The strongest connection lies between bodily lightness, affirmation of life, and eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:MRT5","text":"The central fault line lies between the naming of evil and its simultaneous sanctification and absolution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:MRT6","text":"A further tension arises from the fact that the ring of recurrence asserts cyclical repetition, while children and generativity suggest a directed continuation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_3:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument provided that beloved eternity is not prematurely identified with a concrete woman.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_6C_3@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_6C_3:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"The Seven Seals","source_section_label":"6.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"The Seven Seals · 6","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","The Seven Seals","6."],"original_title":"6."}],"source_title_context":"Die sieben Siegel","source_section_label":"6.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"The Seven Seals · 6","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","The Seven Seals","6."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 123","title":"The Seven Seals · 6","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Die sieben Siegel · 6"},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3","layer":"CH","title":"The Seven Seals · 7","order":124,"parents":["RAW_97E9_7C_3"],"revision":"CH_97E9_7C_3@R001","sha256":"f78becb604ea8c6a9aad05c03a316880c250086d9605a44bd0981e7cd5ad6e27","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:AS1","text":"Eine imaginierte Bewegung durch eigene Himmel setzt Freiheit als Selbstüberschreitung und Leichtigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:AS2","text":"Die Vogel-Weisheit bestimmt diese Freiheit durch die Aufhebung von Oben und Unten neu.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:AS3","text":"Weil Worte den Schweren gehören und dem Leichten zur Lüge werden, wird Sprechen zugunsten des Singens suspendiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:AS4","text":"Die gewonnene Leichtigkeit erzeugt kein bloßes Entkommen, sondern ein brennendes Verlangen nach Ewigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:AS5","text":"Ewigkeit erhält ihre bestimmte Form als hochzeitlicher Ring der Wiederkunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:AS6","text":"Die nicht erfüllte Fortpflanzungsbeziehung wird durch die Liebesbeziehung zur Ewigkeit ersetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:A1","text":"Das Subjekt kann eigene Himmel ausspannen und sich mit eigenen Flügeln in ihnen bewegen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:A2","text":"Freiheit erscheint als Vogel-Weisheit und als Leichtigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:A3","text":"Für die Vogel-Weisheit gibt es kein Oben und kein Unten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:A4","text":"Worte sind für die Schweren gemacht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:A5","text":"Worte werden dem Leichten zu Lügen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:A6","text":"Die angemessene Äußerungsform der Leichtigkeit ist Singen statt Sprechen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:A7","text":"Leichtigkeit erzeugt ein brünstiges Verlangen nach Ewigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:A8","text":"Die Ewigkeit erscheint als Ring der Wiederkunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:A9","text":"Die gewöhnliche Beziehung zwischen Liebe, Frau und Kindern erfüllt sich im Text nicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:A10","text":"Ewigkeit kann an die Stelle des geliebten Weibes als Objekt der Liebe treten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:NX1","text":"Ein hierarchischer Raum mit Oben und Unten wird zurückgewiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:NX2","text":"Die sprachliche Ordnung der Schweren wird als ungeeignet für die Leichten ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:NX3","text":"Sprechen wird zugunsten des Singens suspendiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:NX4","text":"Die Ehe- und Fortpflanzungsordnung wird nicht als erfüllte Endform der Liebe bestätigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:NX5","text":"Eine lineare Zukunft, die sich in Kindern fortsetzt, wird durch die Wiederkunft verdrängt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:D1","text":"Die Aufhebung von Oben und Unten verwandelt Freiheit in richtungsungebundene Beweglichkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_3:A2","CH_97E9_7C_3:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:D2","text":"Die Unvereinbarkeit von Leichtigkeit und gewöhnlicher Sprache macht Schweigen oder Gesang zur notwendigen Ausdrucksform.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_3:A4","CH_97E9_7C_3:A5","CH_97E9_7C_3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:D3","text":"Die Negation räumlicher Hierarchie führt nicht zur Orientierungslosigkeit, sondern zur Erfahrung freier Bewegung.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_3:A1","CH_97E9_7C_3:A2","CH_97E9_7C_3:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:D4","text":"Die Erfahrung der Freiheit wird zeitlich auf Ewigkeit zugespitzt.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_3:A2","CH_97E9_7C_3:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:D5","text":"Die Ewigkeit wird als zyklische und nicht als bloß endlose Zeit bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_3:A7","CH_97E9_7C_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:D6","text":"Die ausbleibende Fortpflanzungsbeziehung wird durch eine metaphysische Liebesbindung kompensiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_3:A9","CH_97E9_7C_3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:SD1","text":"Die Befreiung von räumlicher Hierarchie, diskursiver Schwere und linearer Zukunft bildet ein einheitliches Modell radikaler Leichtigkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_3:A3","CH_97E9_7C_3:A5","CH_97E9_7C_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:SD2","text":"Das Subjekt wird nicht durch Besitz, Fortpflanzung oder feste Orientierung konstituiert, sondern durch die Fähigkeit, Wiederkunft zu lieben.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_3:A1","CH_97E9_7C_3:A8","CH_97E9_7C_3:A9","CH_97E9_7C_3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:SD3","text":"Die Kritik der Sprache erzeugt eine paradoxe poetische Form, in der Sprechen die eigene Unzulänglichkeit ausspricht.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_3:A4","CH_97E9_7C_3:A5","CH_97E9_7C_3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:SD4","text":"Die Wiederkunft fungiert als metaphysische Umcodierung von Ehe, Zeugung und Zukunft in einen ewigen Ring.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_3:A8","CH_97E9_7C_3:A9","CH_97E9_7C_3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:DNX1","text":"Eine transzendente Ordnung, in der Freiheit durch Aufstieg zu einem höheren Oben gewonnen wird, ist strukturell ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:DNX2","text":"Ein sprachliches Medium, das unabhängig von körperlicher oder existenzieller Schwere gültig wäre, wird ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:DNX3","text":"Eine lineare Erlösung durch Fortschritt, Entwicklung oder Nachkommenschaft bleibt unzulässig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:DNX4","text":"Ein Liebesmodell, dessen Erfüllung an ein bestimmtes menschliches Gegenüber gebunden ist, wird zugunsten der Ewigkeit entwertet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:SNX1","text":"Der Text organisiert sich um die Abwesenheit einer verbindlichen vertikalen Weltordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:SNX2","text":"Der Text setzt die Nichtverfügbarkeit einer Sprache voraus, die das Leichte ohne Verfälschung ausdrücken könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:SNX3","text":"Der Text umkreist die Abwesenheit einer erfüllten menschlichen Fortsetzung und ersetzt sie durch ewige Wiederholung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen bleibt eine Zukunft, die vom Vergangenen wegführt; verfügbar ist nur die Rückkehr desselben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:FGS1","text":"Selbstbewegung durch eigene Himmel → Verkörperung von Freiheit als Leichtigkeit → Aufhebung von Oben und Unten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:FGS2","text":"Aufhebung räumlicher Hierarchie → Unbrauchbarkeit gewöhnlicher Sprache → Ersetzung des Sprechens durch Singen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:FGS3","text":"Leichtigkeit und sprachliche Entlastung → Verlangen nach Ewigkeit → Formierung der Ewigkeit als Ring der Wiederkunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:FGS4","text":"Ausfall von Frau und Kindern als Erfüllungsmodell → Verschiebung der Liebe auf die Ewigkeit → metaphysische Reproduktion durch Wiederkunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:AF1","text":"Selbstüberschreitung → Leichtigkeit → Aufhebung der Vertikale → Ausschluss gewöhnlicher Sprache → Gesang → Verlangen nach Ewigkeit → Ring der Wiederkunft → Ersetzung menschlicher Fortpflanzung durch Liebe zur Ewigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:ME1","text":"Raum wird nicht mehr als vertikale Hierarchie, sondern als frei durchquerbares Feld kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:ME2","text":"Sprache wird nach dem Gewicht ihres Trägers unterschieden: Sie gehört den Schweren und versagt beim Leichten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:ME3","text":"Singen wird als nicht-begriffliche Ausdrucksform gegenüber dem diskursiven Sprechen privilegiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:ME4","text":"Zeit wird von einer linearen Fortpflanzungsachse auf eine ringförmige Wiederkehr umgestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:ME5","text":"Liebe wird von der menschlichen Zweierbeziehung auf ein kosmisch-zeitliches Prinzip verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:ALT1","text":"Surface — Fliegen, Schweben, Singen, Schweigen, Begehren und Lieben bilden die unmittelbaren Operationen des Textes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:ALT2","text":"Structural — Räumliche Hierarchie, sprachliche Schwere und reproduktive Zukunft werden durch Leichtigkeit, Gesang und Wiederkunft neu organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text ersetzt begriffliche Behauptung durch eine performative Form, die ihre eigene sprachliche Unzulänglichkeit markiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Wirklichkeit wird als nichtvertikal und Zeit als zyklisch wiederkehrend vorausgesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von Freiheit über Leichtigkeit und Sprachkritik zur Wiederkunft zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob die Vogel-Weisheit eine autonome Instanz, eine innere Stimme oder eine poetische Metapher ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern räumliche Entgrenzung und zyklische Zeit als zusammengehörige Formen der Leichtigkeit gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung liegt in der Umwandlung von Freiheit in Wiederkunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:MRT5","text":"Die zentrale Spannung besteht darin, dass der Text das Sprechen zurückweist und diese Zurückweisung dennoch sprechend vollzieht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung liegt zwischen der behaupteten Richtungsfreiheit und dem gerichteten brünstigen Verlangen nach Ewigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, solange die Ersetzung menschlicher Fortpflanzung durch metaphysische Wiederkunft nicht als bloßes Gleichnis reduziert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T192401874606Z_59f5abea","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"7.","source_sha256":"f78becb604ea8c6a9aad05c03a316880c250086d9605a44bd0981e7cd5ad6e27","sha256":"175e43daedf83d319dfb589af7e751649b99816308d4b00f6742bcdb60ba112f","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:24:01.877277+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:AS1","text":"An imagined movement through one's own heavens presupposes freedom as self-transcendence and lightness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:AS2","text":"Bird-wisdom redefines this freedom through the abolition of above and below.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:AS3","text":"Because words belong to the heavy and become lies for the light, speaking is suspended in favor of singing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:AS4","text":"The lightness attained produces not mere escape, but a burning desire for eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:AS5","text":"Eternity receives its determinate form as the nuptial ring of recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:AS6","text":"The unfulfilled reproductive relation is replaced by the love relation to eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:A1","text":"The subject can stretch out its own heavens and move within them with its own wings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:A2","text":"Freedom appears as bird-wisdom and as lightness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:A3","text":"For bird-wisdom, there is no above and no below.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:A4","text":"Words are made for the heavy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:A5","text":"Words become lies for the light.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:A6","text":"The appropriate form of expression of lightness is singing instead of speaking.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:A7","text":"Lightness produces an ardent desire for eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:A8","text":"Eternity appears as the ring of recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:A9","text":"The ordinary relation between love, woman, and children is not fulfilled in the text.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:A10","text":"Eternity can take the place of the beloved woman as the object of love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:NX1","text":"A hierarchical space with above and below is rejected.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:NX2","text":"The linguistic order of the heavy is excluded as unsuitable for the light.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:NX3","text":"Speaking is suspended in favor of singing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:NX4","text":"The order of marriage and reproduction is not affirmed as the fulfilled final form of love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:NX5","text":"A linear future continuing in children is displaced by recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:D1","text":"The abolition of above and below transforms freedom into direction-unbound mobility.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_3:A2","CH_97E9_7C_3:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:D2","text":"The incompatibility of lightness and ordinary language makes silence or song the necessary form of expression.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_3:A4","CH_97E9_7C_3:A5","CH_97E9_7C_3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:D3","text":"The negation of spatial hierarchy leads not to disorientation, but to the experience of free movement.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_3:A1","CH_97E9_7C_3:A2","CH_97E9_7C_3:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:D4","text":"The experience of freedom is temporally intensified into eternity.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_3:A2","CH_97E9_7C_3:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:D5","text":"Eternity is determined as cyclical rather than as merely endless time.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_3:A7","CH_97E9_7C_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:D6","text":"The absent reproductive relation is compensated for by a metaphysical bond of love.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_3:A9","CH_97E9_7C_3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:SD1","text":"Liberation from spatial hierarchy, discursive heaviness, and linear future forms a unified model of radical lightness.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_3:A3","CH_97E9_7C_3:A5","CH_97E9_7C_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:SD2","text":"The subject is constituted not by possession, reproduction, or fixed orientation, but by the capacity to love recurrence.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_3:A1","CH_97E9_7C_3:A8","CH_97E9_7C_3:A9","CH_97E9_7C_3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:SD3","text":"The critique of language produces a paradoxical poetic form in which speaking articulates its own inadequacy.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_3:A4","CH_97E9_7C_3:A5","CH_97E9_7C_3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:SD4","text":"Recurrence functions as a metaphysical recoding of marriage, procreation, and future into an eternal ring.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_3:A8","CH_97E9_7C_3:A9","CH_97E9_7C_3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:DNX1","text":"A transcendent order in which freedom is gained through ascent to a higher above is structurally excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:DNX2","text":"A linguistic medium that would be valid independently of bodily or existential heaviness is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:DNX3","text":"A linear redemption through progress, development, or posterity remains inadmissible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:DNX4","text":"A model of love whose fulfillment is bound to a particular human counterpart is devalued in favor of eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:SNX1","text":"The text organizes itself around the absence of a binding vertical world order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:SNX2","text":"The text presupposes the unavailability of a language that could express the light without distortion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:SNX3","text":"The text circles around the absence of a fulfilled human continuation and replaces it with eternal repetition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:SNX4","text":"Excluded is a future that leads away from what has been; available is only the return of the same.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:FGS1","text":"Self-movement through one's own heavens → embodiment of freedom as lightness → abolition of above and below.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:FGS2","text":"Abolition of spatial hierarchy → unusability of ordinary language → replacement of speaking by singing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:FGS3","text":"Lightness and linguistic relief → desire for eternity → formation of eternity as the ring of recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:FGS4","text":"Failure of woman and children as a model of fulfillment → displacement of love onto eternity → metaphysical reproduction through recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:AF1","text":"Self-transcendence → lightness → abolition of the vertical → exclusion of ordinary language → song → desire for eternity → ring of recurrence → replacement of human reproduction by love of eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:ME1","text":"Space is no longer mapped as a vertical hierarchy, but as a freely traversable field.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:ME2","text":"Language is distinguished according to the weight of its bearer: it belongs to the heavy and fails with the light.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:ME3","text":"Singing is privileged as a non-conceptual form of expression over discursive speaking.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:ME4","text":"Time is shifted from a linear axis of reproduction to a ring-shaped return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:ME5","text":"Love is shifted from the human relation between two persons to a cosmic-temporal principle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:ALT1","text":"Surface — Flying, hovering, singing, silence, desiring, and loving constitute the text's immediate operations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:ALT2","text":"Structural — Spatial hierarchy, linguistic heaviness, and reproductive future are reorganized through lightness, song, and recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text replaces conceptual assertion with a performative form that marks its own linguistic inadequacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Reality is presupposed as non-vertical and time as cyclically recurring.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from freedom through lightness and critique of language to recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether bird-wisdom is an autonomous instance, an inner voice, or a poetic metaphor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent provided that spatial delimitationlessness and cyclical time are regarded as belonging together as forms of lightness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:MRT4","text":"The strongest connection lies in the transformation of freedom into recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:MRT5","text":"The central tension consists in the fact that the text rejects speaking and nevertheless carries out this rejection by speaking.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:MRT6","text":"A further tension lies between the asserted freedom of direction and the directed ardent desire for eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_3:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument so long as the replacement of human reproduction by metaphysical recurrence is not reduced to a mere simile.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_7C_3@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_7C_3:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"The Seven Seals","source_section_label":"7.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Three"],"reading_title":"The Seven Seals · 7","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","The Seven Seals","7."],"original_title":"7."}],"source_title_context":"Die sieben Siegel","source_section_label":"7.","source_title_hierarchy":["Dritter Theil"],"reading_title":"The Seven Seals · 7","reading_title_context":"Part Three","reading_heading_titles":["Part Three","The Seven Seals","7."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 124","title":"The Seven Seals · 7","context":"Part Three","original_context":"Dritter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Die sieben Siegel · 7"},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT","layer":"CH","title":"Part Four and Last","order":125,"parents":["RAW_97E9_VULT"],"revision":"CH_97E9_VULT@R001","sha256":"a57ae9160b0d5aa29f2626a250374d3d9e98c71770806452ecccfee57dbae0a1","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:AS1","text":"Das Argument problematisiert Mitleid als Quelle nicht nur individueller, sondern weltstiftender Torheit und Leidensvermehrung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:AS2","text":"Mitleid wird neu bestimmt, indem ihm ohne eine übergeordnete Höhe die Fähigkeit zur tragfähigen Liebe abgesprochen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:AS3","text":"Die Diagnose wird auf die Gottesvorstellung übertragen: Gottes Liebe zu den Menschen erzeugt seine eigene Hölle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:AS4","text":"Die zugespitzte Folgerung lautet, dass Gott an seinem Mitleid mit den Menschen gestorben ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:AS5","text":"Die Bewegung verläuft von der Torheit des Mitleids über dessen strukturelle Ursache zur theologischen Selbstzerstörung des mitleidenden Gottes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:A1","text":"Mitleidige handeln unter bestimmten Bedingungen töricht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:A2","text":"Die Torheiten der Mitleidigen können mehr Leid stiften als andere menschliche Handlungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:A3","text":"Liebe ohne eine über dem Mitleid liegende Höhe ist unzureichend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:A4","text":"Eine höhere Position über dem Mitleid ermöglicht eine nicht-destruktive Form der Liebe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:A5","text":"Gottes Liebe zu den Menschen ist als mitleidende Beziehung bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:A6","text":"Eine auf Mitleid gegründete göttliche Beziehung erzeugt eine Hölle für Gott selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:A7","text":"Das Fortbestehen Gottes hängt von einer Überwindung seines Mitleids mit den Menschen ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:A8","text":"Die Rede vom Tod Gottes bezeichnet die Selbstaufhebung Gottes durch sein Mitleid.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:NX1","text":"Mitleid ist keine verlässliche Quelle von Weisheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:NX2","text":"Mitleid ist keine harmlose oder notwendig gute Handlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:NX3","text":"Liebe darf nicht mit bloßer Teilnahme am Leiden gleichgesetzt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:NX4","text":"Eine Liebe ohne übergeordnete Höhe ist keine vollgültige Liebe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:NX5","text":"Göttlichkeit ist nicht mit ungebrochener Mitleidsfähigkeit vereinbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:NX6","text":"Das Leiden der Menschen wird nicht als hinreichende Grundlage göttlicher Liebe anerkannt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:D1","text":"Mitleid kann die Absicht, Leid zu lindern, in eine Quelle zusätzlichen Leids verkehren.","refs":["CH_97E9_VULT:A1","CH_97E9_VULT:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:D2","text":"Die moralische Bewertung einer Handlung ergibt sich nicht aus ihrer mitleidigen Motivation allein.","refs":["CH_97E9_VULT:A1","CH_97E9_VULT:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:D3","text":"Liebe benötigt eine asymmetrische Distanz, die sie über das unmittelbare Leiden erhebt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VULT:A3","CH_97E9_VULT:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:D4","text":"Ein Gott, der ausschließlich durch Mitleid mit den Menschen bestimmt ist, wird zum Leidtragenden seiner eigenen Beziehung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VULT:A5","CH_97E9_VULT:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:D5","text":"Die Aufhebung Gottes wird als Konsequenz einer fehlgeleiteten Beziehungsform und nicht als äußerer Angriff konstruiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VULT:A6","CH_97E9_VULT:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:SD1","text":"Das System verschiebt die Achse der Bewertung von der mitleidigen Intention auf die erzeugte Leidensstruktur.","refs":["CH_97E9_VULT:A1","CH_97E9_VULT:A2","CH_97E9_VULT:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:SD2","text":"Menschliche Bedürftigkeit wird nicht als normativer Anspruch auf Mitleid, sondern als Auslöser einer möglichen Selbstzerstörung des Liebenden kartiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VULT:A3","CH_97E9_VULT:A5","CH_97E9_VULT:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:SD3","text":"Die theologische Figur des toten Gottes totalisiert die Kritik am Mitleid: Was beim Menschen Torheit erzeugt, hebt im Göttlichen den Träger der Liebe selbst auf.","refs":["CH_97E9_VULT:A1","CH_97E9_VULT:A6","CH_97E9_VULT:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:SD4","text":"Eine gültige Liebe wird als transformierende Überlegenheit gegenüber dem Leiden und nicht als dessen unmittelbare Spiegelung bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VULT:A3","CH_97E9_VULT:A4","CH_97E9_VULT:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:DNX1","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass moralische Güte aus der bloßen Nähe zum Leiden folgt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:DNX2","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass die Bedürftigkeit des Menschen den Liebenden zur grenzenlosen Anteilnahme verpflichtet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:DNX3","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass ein Gott durch Mitleid mit den Menschen seine Göttlichkeit bewahren kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:DNX4","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass Liebe ohne Rangordnung, Distanz oder Überhöhung stabil bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:DNX5","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass die Selbstaufhebung Gottes außerhalb seiner eigenen Liebesbeziehung erklärt werden muss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:SNX1","text":"Unmöglich wird eine Ordnung, in der das Leiden des Menschen automatisch die höchste moralische Instanz bildet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:SNX2","text":"Unverfügbar wird eine versöhnende Gottesbeziehung, solange sie auf mitleidiger Identifikation statt auf Überwindung beruht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Möglichkeit, Liebe als reine Nähe ohne zerstörerische Rückwirkung zu denken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:SNX4","text":"Die verborgene Abwesenheit ist eine Form der Liebe, die das Leiden verwandelt, ohne selbst von ihm beherrscht zu werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:FGS1","text":"Mitleidige Motivation → törichtes Handeln → vermehrtes Leid.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:FGS2","text":"Fehlende Höhe über dem Mitleid → unzureichende Liebe → strukturelle Selbstverstrickung des Liebenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:FGS3","text":"Gottesliebe als Mitleid → menschliches Leiden als Beziehungsgrund → göttliche Hölle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:FGS4","text":"Göttliche Selbstverstrickung → Selbstaufhebung der göttlichen Instanz → Tod Gottes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:FGS5","text":"Kritik des Mitleids → Einführung einer übergeordneten Höhe → Neudefinition gültiger Liebe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:AF1","text":"Torheit der Mitleidigen → Erzeugung zusätzlichen Leids → Forderung einer Höhe über dem Mitleid → Übertragung auf Gottes Liebe → göttliche Hölle → Tod Gottes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:ME1","text":"Mitleid wird von einer moralischen Tugend zu einem potenziellen Leidensproduktionsmechanismus umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:ME2","text":"Liebe und Mitleid werden als inkommensurable Formen getrennt, sofern Liebe keine übergeordnete Höhe besitzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:ME3","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen menschlichem Leiden und göttlicher Liebe wird in eine gemeinsame Struktur der Selbstzerstörung überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:ME4","text":"Der Tod Gottes wird nicht als metaphysischer Ausnahmefall, sondern als Konsequenz einer bestimmten Beziehungslogik lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:ME5","text":"Die moralische Landschaft wird von der Absichtsebene auf die Folgen- und Positionsstruktur verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:ALT1","text":"Surface — Mitleidige Torheit erzeugt Leid; Gottes Mitleid führt zu seiner Hölle und seinem Tod.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:ALT2","text":"Structural — Eine Beziehung, die im unmittelbaren Leiden gründet, reproduziert Leid und verzehrt ihren Träger.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Das Argument fordert eine Distanzierung vom Mitleid und ersetzt affektive Identifikation durch übergeordnete Gestaltungsmacht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Gott wird als eine durch seine Beziehung zu den Menschen bedingte und dadurch sterbliche Instanz konstruiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von der Kritik des Mitleids zum Tod Gottes zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, worin die geforderte Höhe über dem Mitleid konkret besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:MRT3","text":"Ebenfalls offen bleibt, ob der Tod Gottes metaphorisch, genealogisch oder ontologisch gemeint ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:MRT4","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Mitleid als selbstzerstörerische Beziehungsform und Höhe als notwendige Gegeninstanz akzeptiert werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung besteht zwischen mitleidiger Motivation und unbeabsichtigter Leidensproduktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:MRT6","text":"Die Schlussbewegung vom menschlichen Mitleid zur göttlichen Selbstaufhebung hängt von einer nicht vollständig explizierten Übertragungsebene ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T195425083887Z_de23ddcd","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Fourth and Final Part","source_sha256":"a57ae9160b0d5aa29f2626a250374d3d9e98c71770806452ecccfee57dbae0a1","sha256":"1acd0be54c1181f21ab2de76728aa72a2ce3d99b9b00c746b811058d2e3067dd","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:54:25.086594+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:AS1","text":"The argument problematizes compassion as a source not only of individual but of world-creating folly and the multiplication of suffering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:AS2","text":"Compassion is redefined by denying it, without a higher elevation, the capacity for sustaining love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:AS3","text":"The diagnosis is transferred to the conception of God: God's love for human beings produces his own hell.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:AS4","text":"The sharpened conclusion is that God died of his compassion for human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:AS5","text":"The movement proceeds from the folly of compassion through its structural cause to the theological self-destruction of the compassionate God.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:A1","text":"Compassionate persons act foolishly under certain conditions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:A2","text":"The follies of the compassionate can produce more suffering than other human actions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:A3","text":"Love without an elevation above compassion is insufficient.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:A4","text":"A higher position above compassion enables a non-destructive form of love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:A5","text":"God's love for human beings is determined as a compassionate relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:A6","text":"A divine relation founded on compassion produces a hell for God himself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:A7","text":"God's continued existence depends on an overcoming of his compassion for human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:A8","text":"The talk of the death of God designates God's self-sublation through his compassion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:NX1","text":"Compassion is not a reliable source of wisdom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:NX2","text":"Compassion is not a harmless or necessarily good action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:NX3","text":"Love must not be equated with mere participation in suffering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:NX4","text":"A love without a higher elevation is not fully valid love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:NX5","text":"Divinity is not compatible with an unbroken capacity for compassion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:NX6","text":"Human suffering is not recognized as a sufficient foundation of divine love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:D1","text":"Compassion can turn the intention to alleviate suffering into a source of additional suffering.","refs":["CH_97E9_VULT:A1","CH_97E9_VULT:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:D2","text":"The moral evaluation of an action does not result from its compassionate motivation alone.","refs":["CH_97E9_VULT:A1","CH_97E9_VULT:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:D3","text":"Love requires an asymmetrical distance that elevates it above immediate suffering.","refs":["CH_97E9_VULT:A3","CH_97E9_VULT:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:D4","text":"A God determined exclusively by compassion for human beings becomes the sufferer of his own relation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VULT:A5","CH_97E9_VULT:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:D5","text":"The sublation of God is constructed as a consequence of a misguided form of relation and not as an external attack.","refs":["CH_97E9_VULT:A6","CH_97E9_VULT:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:SD1","text":"The system shifts the axis of evaluation from compassionate intention to the structure of suffering produced.","refs":["CH_97E9_VULT:A1","CH_97E9_VULT:A2","CH_97E9_VULT:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:SD2","text":"Human neediness is mapped not as a normative claim to compassion, but as the trigger of a possible self-destruction of the lover.","refs":["CH_97E9_VULT:A3","CH_97E9_VULT:A5","CH_97E9_VULT:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:SD3","text":"The theological figure of the dead God totalizes the critique of compassion: what produces folly in the human being sublates, in the divine, the bearer of love itself.","refs":["CH_97E9_VULT:A1","CH_97E9_VULT:A6","CH_97E9_VULT:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:SD4","text":"Valid love is determined as transformative superiority over suffering and not as its immediate mirroring.","refs":["CH_97E9_VULT:A3","CH_97E9_VULT:A4","CH_97E9_VULT:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:DNX1","text":"It is excluded that moral goodness follows from mere proximity to suffering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:DNX2","text":"It is excluded that human neediness obligates the lover to boundless participation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:DNX3","text":"It is excluded that a God can preserve his divinity through compassion for human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:DNX4","text":"It is excluded that love remains stable without hierarchy, distance, or elevation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:DNX5","text":"It is excluded that God's self-sublation must be explained outside his own relation of love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:SNX1","text":"An order in which human suffering automatically constitutes the highest moral authority becomes impossible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:SNX2","text":"A reconciling relation to God becomes unavailable so long as it rests on compassionate identification rather than overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:SNX3","text":"The possibility of conceiving love as pure proximity without destructive repercussion is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:SNX4","text":"Hidden absence is a form of love that transforms suffering without itself being dominated by it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:FGS1","text":"Compassionate motivation → foolish action → increased suffering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:FGS2","text":"Lack of elevation above compassion → insufficient love → structural self-entanglement of the lover.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:FGS3","text":"God's love as compassion → human suffering as the ground of relation → divine hell.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:FGS4","text":"Divine self-entanglement → self-sublation of the divine instance → death of God.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:FGS5","text":"Critique of compassion → introduction of a higher elevation → redefinition of valid love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:AF1","text":"Folly of the compassionate → production of additional suffering → demand for an elevation above compassion → transfer to God's love → divine hell → death of God.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:ME1","text":"Compassion is reclassified from a moral virtue into a potential mechanism for the production of suffering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:ME2","text":"Love and compassion are separated as incommensurable forms, insofar as love possesses no higher elevation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:ME3","text":"The opposition between human suffering and divine love is transferred into a common structure of self-destruction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:ME4","text":"The death of God becomes legible not as a metaphysical exceptional case, but as the consequence of a specific logic of relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:ME5","text":"The moral landscape is shifted from the level of intention to the structure of consequences and positions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:ALT1","text":"Surface — Compassionate folly produces suffering; God's compassion leads to his hell and his death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:ALT2","text":"Structural — A relation grounded in immediate suffering reproduces suffering and consumes its bearer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The argument demands a distancing from compassion and replaces affective identification with higher formative power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — God is constructed as an instance conditioned by his relation to human beings and thereby mortal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from the critique of compassion to the death of God.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined what, concretely, constitutes the required elevation above compassion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:MRT3","text":"It likewise remains open whether the death of God is meant metaphorically, genealogically, or ontologically.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:MRT4","text":"The structure is internally coherent, provided that compassion is accepted as a self-destructive form of relation and elevation as a necessary counter-instance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:MRT5","text":"The strongest connection consists between compassionate motivation and unintended production of suffering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VULT:MRT6","text":"The concluding movement from human compassion to divine self-sublation depends on a level of transfer that is not fully explicated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VULT:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_VULT@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_VULT:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 125","title":"Part Four and Last","context":"Chapter 125","original_title":"Vierter und letzter Theil","original_context":"Chapter 125"},"original_title":"Vierter und letzter Theil","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0","layer":"CH","title":"The Honey Sacrifice","order":126,"parents":["RAW_97E9_DHO0"],"revision":"CH_97E9_DHO0@R001","sha256":"504e636b48fd2e5c162af7e6a7b1d5b5360b011914254eb5177da6e41261b198","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:AS1","text":"Zarathustra bestimmt sein schweres Glück nicht als Besitz, sondern als reife Überfülle, die nach Werk und Ausströmung verlangt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:AS2","text":"Das angekündigte Honig-Opfer wird als rhetorische List enthüllt: Der Honig dient nicht der Hingabe, sondern der Anlockung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:AS3","text":"Die Menschenwelt wird als abgründliches, reiches Meer konstruiert, aus dem auswählbare Menschen durch Glück als Köder heraufgezogen werden können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:AS4","text":"Zarathustra legitimiert seine Rolle als Zieher, Züchter und Zuchtmeister durch den Imperativ der Selbstwerdung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:AS5","text":"Die gegenwärtige Nicht-Niederkunft wird als strategisches Warten auf Zeichen und als Gehorsam gegenüber einer überzeitlichen Zukunft bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:AS6","text":"Die Ferne eines notwendigen Menschen-Reichs begründet eine Gegenwart, deren Tätigkeit im Locken, Herausfischen und Heraufziehen besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:A1","text":"Glück kann als reife, schwere und überschüssige Kraft auftreten, die nicht bewahrt werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:A2","text":"Was Zarathustra empfängt, verwirklicht sich als Verschwendung und nicht als Opfer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:A3","text":"Öffentliche Rede kann eine nützliche List sein, wenn ihre offene Bedeutung ihre operative Funktion verdeckt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:A4","text":"Honig bezeichnet operativ einen Köder, der Begehren bindet und Bewegung erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:A5","text":"Die Menschenwelt ist ein abgründlicher Bereich, dessen Einzelne durch Lockung erfasst und nach oben gezogen werden können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:A6","text":"Zarathustras Verhältnis zu Menschen ist wesentlich asymmetrisch: Er zieht, züchtet und diszipliniert sie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:A7","text":"Die Niederkunft zu den Menschen darf erst nach dem Erscheinen bestimmter Zeichen erfolgen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:A8","text":"Das Schicksal gewährt Zeit, weil die entscheidende Zukunft notwendig kommen muss, ohne zeitlich verfügbar zu sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:A9","text":"Ungeduldige, zornige und drohende Intervention verfehlt die angemessene Form geschichtlichen Handelns.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:A10","text":"Was Zarathustra als sein Eigenes in allen Dingen beansprucht, muss erst aus der Tiefe hervorgebracht werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:NX1","text":"Glück ist nicht flüssige Leichtigkeit, privates Wohlergehen oder ruhender Besitz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:NX2","text":"Das Honig-Opfer ist keine Hingabe eines wertvollen Gutes an eine höhere Instanz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:NX3","text":"Honig ist nicht primär Nahrung, sondern ein Instrument der Verführung und Erfassung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:NX4","text":"Zarathustras Warten ist weder bloße Geduld noch resignative Untätigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:NX5","text":"Die Niederkunft ist nicht als sofortige populäre Ansprache oder als Zwangsintervention legitimiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:NX6","text":"Zorn, Drohung und lärmende Forderung nach unmittelbarer Entscheidung sind keine Formen wahrer geschichtlicher Wirksamkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:NX7","text":"Die Menschenwelt ist nicht leer, abgeschlossen oder dem Zugriff des Lockenden entzogen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:D1","text":"Glück wird von einem inneren Zustand in eine selektive Anziehungs- und Rekrutierungskraft überführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_DHO0:A1","CH_97E9_DHO0:A4","CH_97E9_DHO0:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:D2","text":"Verschwendung und Fang bilden keine Gegensätze, weil die ausgestreute Gabe gerade als Köder zurückwirkende Bindung erzeugt.","refs":["CH_97E9_DHO0:A2","CH_97E9_DHO0:A4","CH_97E9_DHO0:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:D3","text":"Die Formung anderer Menschen setzt ihre Bewegung zur Höhe voraus und vollzieht sich nicht auf gleicher Ebene.","refs":["CH_97E9_DHO0:A5","CH_97E9_DHO0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:D4","text":"Selbstwerdung wird zur Legitimation fremder Züchtung, weil der Zieher sich als Vollzug eines vorgegebenen Werdens bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_DHO0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:D5","text":"Strategisches Warten ist aktiv, weil es die gegenwärtige Zeit für Lockung, Auswahl und Vorbereitung der Niederkunft nutzt.","refs":["CH_97E9_DHO0:A4","CH_97E9_DHO0:A7","CH_97E9_DHO0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:D6","text":"Die notwendige Zukunft entwertet unmittelbaren Aktivismus nicht durch Passivität, sondern durch seine Unterordnung unter ein ferneres Zeitmaß.","refs":["CH_97E9_DHO0:A7","CH_97E9_DHO0:A8","CH_97E9_DHO0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:D7","text":"Der Anspruch auf ein Eigenes in allen Dingen bleibt unvollzogen, solange das Eigene nicht aus der Welt herausgefischt ist.","refs":["CH_97E9_DHO0:A5","CH_97E9_DHO0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:SD1","text":"Das System verwandelt Gabe in eine Technologie der Asymmetrie: Was ausgestreut wird, erzeugt keine Gleichheit, sondern die Erfassbarkeit der Empfangenden.","refs":["CH_97E9_DHO0:A2","CH_97E9_DHO0:A4","CH_97E9_DHO0:A5","CH_97E9_DHO0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:SD2","text":"Die Gegenwart wird als Selektionsraum organisiert, in dem Menschen nicht allgemein angesprochen, sondern als herauszuziehende Ausnahmen behandelt werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_DHO0:A4","CH_97E9_DHO0:A5","CH_97E9_DHO0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:SD3","text":"Die Zukunft besitzt zugleich unbedingte Gewissheit und unbestimmte zeitliche Distanz; diese Verbindung stabilisiert ein dauerhaftes Vorbereitungsregime.","refs":["CH_97E9_DHO0:A7","CH_97E9_DHO0:A8","CH_97E9_DHO0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:SD4","text":"Das behauptete Eigentum an allen Dingen ist kein statischer Besitzanspruch, sondern ein Programm ihrer Aneignung durch Heraushebung aus der Tiefe.","refs":["CH_97E9_DHO0:A5","CH_97E9_DHO0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:SD5","text":"Die Höhe fungiert als strategische Distanz: Sie erlaubt die Umcodierung des Menschenmeers in ein Feld von Sichtbarkeit, Köderwirkung und Zugriff.","refs":["CH_97E9_DHO0:A3","CH_97E9_DHO0:A4","CH_97E9_DHO0:A5","CH_97E9_DHO0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt ein reziprokes Verhältnis zwischen Zarathustra und den Menschen aus; ihre Begegnung ist als Fang, Aufstieg und Zucht strukturiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:DNX2","text":"Das System schließt die Transparenz seiner eigenen Rede aus; die wirksame Rede muss ihren Ködercharakter zunächst verbergen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:DNX3","text":"Das System schließt eine Gegenwart aus, in der Zukunft bereits unmittelbar verfügbar wäre; ihre Notwendigkeit darf nicht in Terminierbarkeit übergehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:DNX4","text":"Das System schließt die Gleichsetzung von geschichtlicher Dringlichkeit und geschichtlicher Wahrheit aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:DNX5","text":"Das System schließt eine Welt aus, deren Sinn ohne aktives Herausziehen bereits offen zugänglich wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Möglichkeit, dass Menschen sich ohne Köder, Haken und hierarchische Führung zu Zarathustra bewegen könnten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Möglichkeit einer gegenwärtig vollziehbaren Versöhnung zwischen Zarathustra und der Menschenwelt; die Niederkunft bleibt aufgeschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Zukunft, die weder notwendig noch verfügbar wäre; das System benötigt gerade ihre paradoxe Verbindung aus Gewissheit und Ferne.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine nicht-aneignende Beziehung zur Welt, weil alles Eigene erst als zu bergender Bestand des Abgrunds erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:FGS1","text":"Reifung des Glücks → Verdichtung der inneren Kraft → Unmöglichkeit des bloßen Besitzes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:FGS2","text":"Überschuss → rhetorische Maskierung als Opfer → operative Umwandlung des Honigs in Köder.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:FGS3","text":"Köder → Öffnung des Menschen-Abgrunds → Anbeißen an verborgene Haken → Heraufziehen zur Höhe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:FGS4","text":"Heraufziehen → Zucht und Selbstwerdung → Vorbereitung einer noch nicht vollzogenen Niederkunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:FGS5","text":"Fernes notwendiges Reich → Überzeitliches Warten → Ablehnung unmittelbarer Zornpolitik → fortgesetzte selektive Anlockung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:FGS6","text":"Anspruch auf das Eigene in allen Dingen → Herausfischen aus der Tiefe → Aneignung der Welt durch Erfassung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:AF1","text":"Schweres Glück → Werkzwang → Verschwendung statt Opfer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:AF2","text":"Scheinbares Honig-Opfer → Enthüllung der Redelist → Honig als Köder.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:AF3","text":"Menschenmeer → Fangbewegung → Aufstieg der ausgewählten Menschen zur Höhe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:AF4","text":"Selbstwerdung des Ziehers → Zuchtauftrag → Aufschub der Niederkunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:AF5","text":"Fernes notwendiges Menschen-Reich → strategische Zeitlichkeit → Zurückweisung ungeduldiger Gegenwartsgewalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:AF6","text":"Abgründliche Welt → Auswurf des Glücks → Bergung des beanspruchten Eigenen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:ME1","text":"Opfer und Verschwendung werden getrennt: Das eine verzichtet, das andere streut aus, um Wirkungen und Bindungen zu erzeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:ME2","text":"Glück wird als operative Ressource sichtbar, die Menschen anzieht, auswählt und einer vertikalen Bewegung unterwirft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:ME3","text":"Warten wird von Passivität in eine Form langfristiger strategischer Aktivität überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:ME4","text":"Die Menschenwelt erscheint nicht mehr als moralische Gemeinschaft, sondern als Meer von Tiefenwesen, die durch Lockung und Fang zugänglich werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:ME5","text":"Die Opposition zwischen Gegenwart und Zukunft wird durch eine Zeitordnung ersetzt, in der die Gegenwart nur Vorbereitung auf eine notwendige Ferne ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:ME6","text":"Das Verhältnis zur Welt wird von Betrachtung in Aneignung transformiert: Sichtbar wird nur, was aus dem Abgrund heraufgeführt werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:ALT1","text":"Surface — Zarathustra steigt auf einen Berg, kündigt ein Honig-Opfer an und enthüllt dort dessen täuschenden Charakter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:ALT2","text":"Structural — Überfluss wird in ein asymmetrisches Verfahren der Verlockung, Auswahl, Erhebung und Disziplinierung von Menschen überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Wirksame Rede muss ihre operative Absicht verbergen; wirksames Handeln muss zwischen sofortiger Intervention und bloßem Warten vermittelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Die Welt ist abgründlich und erst durch Bergung verfügbar; die Zukunft ist notwendig, aber ihrer Zeit nach entzogen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von schwerem Glück über Köder und Fang bis zur aufgeschobenen Niederkunft zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, nach welchen Kriterien die herausgefischten Menschen ausgewählt werden und worin ihre Zucht konkret besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist kohärent, sofern Glück zugleich als Überfluss und als instrumentell einsetzbare Lockkraft gelten kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Kopplung liegt zwischen Zukunftsgewissheit, strategischem Warten und der Ablehnung unmittelbarer zorniger Intervention.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:MRT5","text":"Eine zentrale Bruchlinie liegt zwischen der Selbstbeschreibung als Verschwender und der tatsächlichen Logik des Fangs, der Rückbindung und Aneignung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Bruchlinie liegt zwischen der behaupteten Notwendigkeit des fernen Reichs und dem Fehlen eines bestimmbaren Zeitpunkts oder prüfbaren Zeichens seiner Ankunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, wenn rhetorische List, vertikale Menschenformung und aufgeschobene Zukunft als untrennbare Operationen behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T193406361651Z_e396bee1","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"The Honey Sacrifice","source_sha256":"504e636b48fd2e5c162af7e6a7b1d5b5360b011914254eb5177da6e41261b198","sha256":"d975a18697237149966545d2efcfd164cfd11d621b0ecaa3d1fb5b72b73b06bd","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:34:06.362621+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:AS1","text":"Zarathustra determines his heavy happiness not as possession, but as mature abundance that demands work and outpouring.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:AS2","text":"The announced honey sacrifice is revealed as a rhetorical ruse: the honey serves not as an offering, but as an enticement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:AS3","text":"The human world is constructed as an abyssal, rich sea, from which selectable human beings can be drawn up by means of happiness as bait.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:AS4","text":"Zarathustra legitimates his role as drawer, breeder, and disciplinarian through the imperative of self-becoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:AS5","text":"The present non-descent is determined as strategic waiting for signs and as obedience to a supratemporal future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:AS6","text":"The remoteness of a necessary realm of human beings grounds a present whose activity consists in enticing, fishing out, and drawing up.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:A1","text":"Happiness can appear as a mature, heavy, and excessive force that cannot be preserved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:A2","text":"What Zarathustra receives realizes itself as squandering and not as sacrifice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:A3","text":"Public speech can be a useful ruse when its overt meaning conceals its operative function.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:A4","text":"Honey operationally denotes a bait that binds desire and produces movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:A5","text":"The human world is an abyssal domain whose individuals can be seized through enticement and drawn upward.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:A6","text":"Zarathustra's relation to human beings is essentially asymmetrical: he draws, breeds, and disciplines them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:A7","text":"The descent to human beings may occur only after the appearance of particular signs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:A8","text":"Fate grants time because the decisive future must necessarily come without being temporally available.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:A9","text":"Impatient, angry, and threatening intervention misses the appropriate form of historical action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:A10","text":"What Zarathustra claims as his own in all things must first be brought forth from the depths.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:NX1","text":"Happiness is not fluid lightness, private well-being, or settled possession.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:NX2","text":"The honey sacrifice is not the offering of a valuable good to a higher instance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:NX3","text":"Honey is not primarily nourishment, but an instrument of seduction and seizure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:NX4","text":"Zarathustra's waiting is neither mere patience nor resigned inactivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:NX5","text":"The descent is not legitimated as immediate popular address or as coercive intervention.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:NX6","text":"Anger, threat, and the clamorous demand for immediate decision are not forms of true historical efficacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:NX7","text":"The human world is not empty, closed, or withdrawn from the access of the one who entices.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:D1","text":"Happiness is shifted from an inner state into a selective force of attraction and recruitment.","refs":["CH_97E9_DHO0:A1","CH_97E9_DHO0:A4","CH_97E9_DHO0:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:D2","text":"Squandering and capture do not form opposites, because the scattered gift produces binding in return precisely as bait.","refs":["CH_97E9_DHO0:A2","CH_97E9_DHO0:A4","CH_97E9_DHO0:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:D3","text":"The formation of other human beings presupposes their movement toward height and does not take place on the same level.","refs":["CH_97E9_DHO0:A5","CH_97E9_DHO0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:D4","text":"Self-becoming becomes the legitimation of breeding others, because the drawer determines himself as the enactment of a pre-given becoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_DHO0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:D5","text":"Strategic waiting is active because it uses the present time for enticement, selection, and preparation of the descent.","refs":["CH_97E9_DHO0:A4","CH_97E9_DHO0:A7","CH_97E9_DHO0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:D6","text":"The necessary future devalues immediate activism not through passivity, but through its subordination to a more distant measure of time.","refs":["CH_97E9_DHO0:A7","CH_97E9_DHO0:A8","CH_97E9_DHO0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:D7","text":"The claim to something one's own in all things remains unrealized so long as what is one's own has not been fished out of the world.","refs":["CH_97E9_DHO0:A5","CH_97E9_DHO0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:SD1","text":"The system transforms the gift into a technology of asymmetry: what is scattered produces not equality, but the capturability of the recipients.","refs":["CH_97E9_DHO0:A2","CH_97E9_DHO0:A4","CH_97E9_DHO0:A5","CH_97E9_DHO0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:SD2","text":"The present is organized as a space of selection in which human beings are not addressed generally, but treated as exceptions to be drawn out.","refs":["CH_97E9_DHO0:A4","CH_97E9_DHO0:A5","CH_97E9_DHO0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:SD3","text":"The future possesses at once unconditional certainty and indeterminate temporal distance; this conjunction stabilizes a permanent regime of preparation.","refs":["CH_97E9_DHO0:A7","CH_97E9_DHO0:A8","CH_97E9_DHO0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:SD4","text":"The asserted ownership of all things is not a static claim of possession, but a program of their appropriation through elevation from the depths.","refs":["CH_97E9_DHO0:A5","CH_97E9_DHO0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:SD5","text":"Height functions as strategic distance: it permits the recoding of the sea of human beings into a field of visibility, bait-effect, and access.","refs":["CH_97E9_DHO0:A3","CH_97E9_DHO0:A4","CH_97E9_DHO0:A5","CH_97E9_DHO0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:DNX1","text":"The system excludes a reciprocal relation between Zarathustra and human beings; their encounter is structured as capture, ascent, and breeding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:DNX2","text":"The system excludes the transparency of its own speech; effective speech must initially conceal its character as bait.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:DNX3","text":"The system excludes a present in which the future would already be immediately available; its necessity must not pass over into schedulability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:DNX4","text":"The system excludes the equation of historical urgency with historical truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:DNX5","text":"The system excludes a world whose meaning would already be openly accessible without active drawing-out.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:SNX1","text":"Excluded is the possibility that human beings could move toward Zarathustra without bait, hooks, and hierarchical guidance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:SNX2","text":"Excluded is the possibility of a presently enactable reconciliation between Zarathustra and the human world; the descent remains deferred.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:SNX3","text":"Excluded is a future that would be neither necessary nor available; the system requires precisely its paradoxical conjunction of certainty and remoteness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:SNX4","text":"Excluded is a non-appropriative relation to the world, because everything one's own first appears as a stock to be salvaged from the abyss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:FGS1","text":"Maturation of happiness → condensation of inner force → impossibility of mere possession.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:FGS2","text":"Excess → rhetorical masking as sacrifice → operative transformation of honey into bait.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:FGS3","text":"Bait → opening of the human abyss → biting on hidden hooks → drawing up toward height.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:FGS4","text":"Drawing up → breeding and self-becoming → preparation of a descent not yet enacted.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:FGS5","text":"Distant necessary realm → supratemporal waiting → rejection of immediate politics of anger → continued selective enticement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:FGS6","text":"Claim to one's own in all things → fishing out from the depths → appropriation of the world through seizure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:AF1","text":"Heavy happiness → compulsion to work → squandering instead of sacrifice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:AF2","text":"Apparent honey sacrifice → revelation of the rhetorical ruse → honey as bait.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:AF3","text":"Sea of human beings → movement of capture → ascent of the selected human beings toward height.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:AF4","text":"Self-becoming of the drawer → mandate to breed → deferral of the descent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:AF5","text":"Distant necessary realm of human beings → strategic temporality → rejection of impatient violence of the present.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:AF6","text":"Abyssal world → casting out of happiness → salvaging of the claimed own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:ME1","text":"Sacrifice and squandering are separated: the one renounces, the other scatters in order to produce effects and bindings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:ME2","text":"Happiness becomes visible as an operative resource that attracts, selects, and subjects human beings to a vertical movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:ME3","text":"Waiting is shifted from passivity into a form of long-term strategic activity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:ME4","text":"The human world no longer appears as a moral community, but as a sea of beings of the depths that become accessible through enticement and capture.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:ME5","text":"The opposition between present and future is replaced by a temporal order in which the present is only preparation for a necessary remoteness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:ME6","text":"The relation to the world is transformed from contemplation into appropriation: visible is only what can be brought up from the abyss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:ALT1","text":"Surface — Zarathustra ascends a mountain, announces a honey sacrifice, and there reveals its deceptive character.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:ALT2","text":"Structural — Abundance is transferred into an asymmetrical procedure of enticing, selecting, elevating, and disciplining human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Effective speech must conceal its operative intention; effective action must mediate between immediate intervention and mere waiting.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The world is abyssal and available only through salvage; the future is necessary, but withdrawn with respect to its time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from heavy happiness through bait and capture to the deferred descent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined according to which criteria the human beings fished out are selected and in what their breeding concretely consists.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:MRT3","text":"The structure is coherent insofar as happiness can count at once as abundance and as an instrumentally deployable force of enticement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:MRT4","text":"The strongest coupling lies between certainty of the future, strategic waiting, and the rejection of immediate angry intervention.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:MRT5","text":"A central fault line lies between the self-description as squanderer and the actual logic of capture, rebinding, and appropriation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:MRT6","text":"A further fault line lies between the asserted necessity of the distant realm and the absence of a determinable point in time or verifiable sign of its arrival.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHO0:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement if rhetorical ruse, vertical formation of human beings, and deferred future are treated as inseparable operations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHO0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_DHO0@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_DHO0:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 126","title":"The Honey Sacrifice","context":"Chapter 126","original_title":"Das Honig-Opfer","original_context":"Chapter 126"},"original_title":"Das Honig-Opfer","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN","layer":"CH","title":"The Cry of Distress","order":127,"parents":["RAW_97E9_DERN"],"revision":"CH_97E9_DERN@R001","sha256":"bda9686169bdda468d96c714d3bed5b52a7d2b4ca5aca571ca865be9310fdd34","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:AS1","text":"Der Nothschrei aus der Tiefe konfrontiert Zarathustra mit einer Menschen-Noth, die seine bisherige Absonderung nicht mehr ignorieren kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:AS2","text":"Der Wahrsager übersetzt den Schrei in eine Versuchung zum Mitleiden und bindet ihn an die Ankunft des höheren Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:AS3","text":"Die Bedrohung besteht nicht nur in fremder Not, sondern in der Rückkehr der grossen Müdigkeit als nihilistische Deutung der Welt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:AS4","text":"Zarathustra beantwortet die nihilistische Diagnose nicht durch Widerlegung im Beweisverfahren, sondern durch erneute Setzung einer noch möglichen Glücks- und Zukunftszone.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:AS5","text":"Die affirmative Setzung wird unmittelbar in Bewegung überführt: Zarathustra sucht den höheren Menschen auf und übernimmt dessen Schutz innerhalb seines Bereichs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:AS6","text":"Der Wahrsager bleibt als Gast in Zarathustras Höhle zurück, sodass die überwundene Müdigkeit nicht verschwindet, sondern als eingelagerter Gegner fortbesteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:A1","text":"Die grosse Müdigkeit deutet Welt, Wissen, Suchen und Glück als gleichermaßen sinnlos.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:A2","text":"Menschen-Noth kann als Anspruch auftreten, der den Angerufenen persönlich adressiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:A3","text":"Der höhere Mensch ist für Zarathustra zugleich Gegenstand des Grauens und Gegenstand einer nicht verweigerbaren Begegnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:A4","text":"Mitleiden ist für Zarathustra keine unschuldige Reaktion, sondern seine letzte und gefährlichste Versuchung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:A5","text":"Affirmation setzt die reale oder notwendige Möglichkeit von Glück gegen die Totalisierung der Hoffnungslosigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:A6","text":"Die Bejahung von Glück verlangt eine aktive Loslösung von lähmender Trübsal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:A7","text":"Zarathustras Bereich ist kein sicherer Rückzugsraum, sondern ein Bereich, in dem Gefährdung, Tiere, Gäste und der höhere Mensch koexistieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:A8","text":"Der Wahrsager besitzt kein Monopol auf Zukunftsdeutung; Zarathustra beansprucht selbst die Stellung eines Wahrsagers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:NX1","text":"Das System gründet nicht auf der Annahme, dass alles gleich, sinnlos und erfolglos sei.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:NX2","text":"Glück wird nicht als endgültig verschwundene oder nur noch geographisch unerreichbare Möglichkeit bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:NX3","text":"Zarathustras Absonderung ist nicht als Immunität gegen Menschen-Noth bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:NX4","text":"Die Antwort auf Not ist nicht mit Mitleiden identisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:NX5","text":"Der höhere Mensch ist nicht als bereits integrierter Gefährte Zarathustras bestimmt, sondern als fremde, erschreckende und gefährdete Ankunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:NX6","text":"Die nihilistische Stimme wird nicht durch Ausschluss aus Zarathustras Raum beseitigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:D1","text":"Die grosse Müdigkeit erzeugt ihre Wirkung, indem sie aus einer Notlage den Beweis für die Totalität der Sinnlosigkeit macht.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERN:A1","CH_97E9_DERN:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:D2","text":"Der Nothschrei verwandelt das Problem der Menschen-Noth in ein Problem der Selbstbindung Zarathustras.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERN:A2","CH_97E9_DERN:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:D3","text":"Zarathustras Suche nach dem höheren Menschen ist eine Handlung gegen Versteinerung, ohne dass sie als mitleidige Rettung begründet wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERN:A3","CH_97E9_DERN:A4","CH_97E9_DERN:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:D4","text":"Die Behauptung glückseliger Inseln fungiert als notwendige Gegenprämisse gegen die Schließung aller Zukunft durch die grosse Müdigkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERN:A1","CH_97E9_DERN:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:D5","text":"Zarathustras Höhle wird zur Szene einer unaufhebbaren Koexistenz von Affirmation und Nihilismus.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERN:A6","CH_97E9_DERN:A7","CH_97E9_DERN:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:SD1","text":"Die Zukunft wird als umkämpfte Deutungsordnung konstruiert: Der Wahrsager prognostiziert Untergang und Erschöpfung, Zarathustra behauptet fortbestehende Möglichkeiten der Bejahung.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERN:A1","CH_97E9_DERN:A5","CH_97E9_DERN:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:SD2","text":"Der höhere Mensch wird als Übergangsfigur erzeugt, an der sich entscheidet, ob Not in Mitleiden, Nihilismus oder eine andersartige Verantwortung übersetzt wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERN:A2","CH_97E9_DERN:A3","CH_97E9_DERN:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:SD3","text":"Affirmation erscheint nicht als Besitz eines stabilen Glücks, sondern als Vollzug der Wiedereröffnung von Möglichkeit unter Bedingungen fortdauernder Trübsal.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERN:A1","CH_97E9_DERN:A5","CH_97E9_DERN:A6","CH_97E9_DERN:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:SD4","text":"Der Rückzugsort wird in ein internes Konfliktfeld verwandelt, weil das Abgewiesene als Gast aufgenommen und damit nicht endgültig externalisiert wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERN:A6","CH_97E9_DERN:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:DNX1","text":"Das Argument setzt voraus, dass Not keinen zureichenden Beweis für die Wahrheit des Nihilismus liefert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:DNX2","text":"Das Argument setzt voraus, dass Zukunft nicht aus gegenwärtiger Erschöpfung erschlossen werden darf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:DNX3","text":"Das Argument setzt voraus, dass eine Begegnung mit dem höheren Menschen nicht im Schema der Barmherzigkeit begriffen werden darf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:DNX4","text":"Das Argument setzt voraus, dass Absonderung keine legitime endgültige Form der Selbstbewahrung ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Möglichkeit eines endgültig gesicherten Außenraums, in dem Zarathustra weder von Not noch von Nihilismus noch vom höheren Menschen erreicht werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine reine Affirmation, die nicht durch Angst, Trübsal, Versuchung und verbleibende Gegenstimme hindurchgehen müsste.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine abschließende Versöhnung zwischen Mitleiden und Zarathustras bejahender Aufgabe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:FGS1","text":"Nihilistische Deutung der Welt → Erwartung einer kommenden allgemeinen Not → Nothschrei als Evidenzschein für diese Deutung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:FGS2","text":"Persönliche Adressierung durch den Schrei → Benennung des höheren Menschen → Aktivierung von Angst und Mitleid als Versuchungsstruktur.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:FGS3","text":"Zurückweisung der nihilistischen Totalisierung → Setzung fortbestehender Glücksmöglichkeit → körperliche und räumliche Distanzierung von der Trübsal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:FGS4","text":"Suche nach dem höheren Menschen → Umcodierung der Not in Schutz- und Bereichsverantwortung → Vermeidung einer ausdrücklichen mitleidigen Begründung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:FGS5","text":"Aufnahme des Wahrsagers als Gast → Persistenz der Gegenstimme im eigenen Raum → Konkurrenz zweier prophetischer Zukunftsordnungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:AF1","text":"Große Müdigkeit **→** akustische Erscheinung der Not **→** persönliche Anrufung Zarathustras.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:AF2","text":"Persönliche Anrufung **→** Enthüllung des höheren Menschen **→** Angst und Versuchung zum Mitleiden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:AF3","text":"Versuchung zum Mitleiden **→** nihilistische Behauptung vom Ende des Glücks **→** dreifache Zurückweisung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:AF4","text":"Zurückweisung **→** Behauptung verbleibender glückseliger Inseln **→** Abwendung von der Trübsal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:AF5","text":"Abwendung **→** Suche und Schutz des höheren Menschen **→** Rückkehr des Wahrsagers als interner Gast und Gegenprophet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:ME1","text":"Menschen-Noth wird von einem allgemeinen moralischen Gegenstand zu einem Prüfmechanismus für die Selbstbindung Zarathustras umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:ME2","text":"Mitleiden und Hilfe werden auseinandergezogen: Der Text erlaubt eine Bewegung zum Gefährdeten, ohne sie als mitleidige Erlösung zu legitimieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:ME3","text":"Die Höhle wird von einem Ort der Einsiedlerautarkie zu einem Raum unaufhebbarer ideologischer Gastlichkeit umgezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:ME4","text":"Prophetie wird von einer einheitlichen Wahrheitssprache zu einem Konflikt zweier inkompatibler Zukunftsproduktionen umgeordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:ME5","text":"Glück wird nicht als gegenwärtiger Zustand, sondern als Gegenmacht gegen die Schließung von Zukunft sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:ALT1","text":"Surface — Ein Wahrsager meldet einen Schrei des höheren Menschen; Zarathustra weist seine nihilistische Deutung zurück und bricht zur Suche auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:ALT2","text":"Structural — Menschen-Noth, Mitleiden, Nihilismus, Glück und Schutz werden als konkurrierende Übersetzungen derselben Krisensituation organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Antwort auf den Nihilismus besteht nicht in dessen Ausschluss, sondern in der Eröffnung einer Gegenbewegung, die den Gegner im eigenen Raum mitführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Zukunft ist nicht als lineare Folge gegenwärtiger Müdigkeit festgelegt, sondern als Feld widerstreitender prophetischer Setzungen offen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Grundoperation zu rekonstruieren: Not wird als Versuchung zur nihilistischen und mitleidigen Schließung verarbeitet, gegen die Zarathustra Möglichkeit und Bewegung setzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, nach welchem positiven Kriterium Zarathustra zwischen verwerflichem Mitleiden und zulässigem Schutz des höheren Menschen unterscheidet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist kohärent, sofern Affirmation als fortgesetzte Gegenpraxis und nicht als Zustand ungestörter Heiterkeit verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Operation besteht in der Trennung von Notwahrnehmung und nihilistischer Interpretation der Not.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Bruchlinie liegt darin, dass Zarathustra den höheren Menschen zugleich abwehrt, fürchtet, sucht und schützen will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die Bewegung des Textes nur, wenn die Anwesenheit des Wahrsagers als ungelöste interne Persistenz der grossen Müdigkeit erhalten bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T193211929720Z_c8e519d2","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"The Cry of Distress","source_sha256":"bda9686169bdda468d96c714d3bed5b52a7d2b4ca5aca571ca865be9310fdd34","sha256":"8344a0e39901f589de105a9a83d80dc5f58db5581667f67fe103f66f46ca285a","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:32:11.930736+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:AS1","text":"The cry of distress from the depths confronts Zarathustra with a human distress that his previous separation can no longer ignore.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:AS2","text":"The soothsayer translates the cry into a temptation to pity and binds it to the arrival of the higher man.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:AS3","text":"The threat consists not only in another's distress, but in the return of the great weariness as a nihilistic interpretation of the world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:AS4","text":"Zarathustra answers the nihilistic diagnosis not through refutation in a procedure of proof, but through the renewed positing of a still possible zone of happiness and future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:AS5","text":"The affirmative positing is immediately transferred into movement: Zarathustra seeks out the higher man and assumes his protection within his domain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:AS6","text":"The soothsayer remains behind as a guest in Zarathustra's cave, so that the overcome weariness does not disappear, but persists as an embedded adversary.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:A1","text":"The great weariness interprets world, knowledge, seeking, and happiness as equally meaningless.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:A2","text":"Human distress can appear as a claim that personally addresses the one summoned.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:A3","text":"For Zarathustra, the higher man is at once an object of horror and the object of an encounter that cannot be refused.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:A4","text":"For Zarathustra, pity is not an innocent reaction, but his last and most dangerous temptation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:A5","text":"Affirmation posits the real or necessary possibility of happiness against the totalization of hopelessness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:A6","text":"The affirmation of happiness requires an active detachment from paralyzing melancholy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:A7","text":"Zarathustra's domain is not a secure retreat, but a domain in which danger, animals, guests, and the higher man coexist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:A8","text":"The soothsayer possesses no monopoly on the interpretation of the future; Zarathustra himself lays claim to the position of a soothsayer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:NX1","text":"The system is not founded on the assumption that everything is equal, meaningless, and futile.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:NX2","text":"Happiness is not determined as a possibility that has definitively disappeared or is only geographically unreachable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:NX3","text":"Zarathustra's separation is not determined as immunity against human distress.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:NX4","text":"The response to distress is not identical with pity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:NX5","text":"The higher man is not determined as Zarathustra's already integrated companion, but as a foreign, frightening, and endangered arrival.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:NX6","text":"The nihilistic voice is not eliminated by exclusion from Zarathustra's space.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:D1","text":"The great weariness produces its effect by making a situation of distress into proof of the totality of meaninglessness.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERN:A1","CH_97E9_DERN:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:D2","text":"The cry of distress transforms the problem of human distress into a problem of Zarathustra's self-binding.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERN:A2","CH_97E9_DERN:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:D3","text":"Zarathustra's search for the higher man is an action against petrification, without being grounded as a pitying rescue.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERN:A3","CH_97E9_DERN:A4","CH_97E9_DERN:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:D4","text":"The assertion of blessed isles functions as a necessary counter-premise against the closure of all future by the great weariness.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERN:A1","CH_97E9_DERN:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:D5","text":"Zarathustra's cave becomes the scene of an irreducible coexistence of affirmation and nihilism.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERN:A6","CH_97E9_DERN:A7","CH_97E9_DERN:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:SD1","text":"The future is constructed as a contested order of interpretation: the soothsayer prognosticates downfall and exhaustion, while Zarathustra asserts continuing possibilities of affirmation.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERN:A1","CH_97E9_DERN:A5","CH_97E9_DERN:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:SD2","text":"The higher man is produced as a transitional figure upon whom it is decided whether distress is translated into pity, nihilism, or another kind of responsibility.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERN:A2","CH_97E9_DERN:A3","CH_97E9_DERN:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:SD3","text":"Affirmation appears not as possession of a stable happiness, but as the enactment of the reopening of possibility under conditions of continuing melancholy.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERN:A1","CH_97E9_DERN:A5","CH_97E9_DERN:A6","CH_97E9_DERN:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:SD4","text":"The place of retreat is transformed into an internal field of conflict because what has been rejected is received as a guest and is thereby not definitively externalized.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERN:A6","CH_97E9_DERN:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:DNX1","text":"The argument presupposes that distress provides no sufficient proof for the truth of nihilism.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:DNX2","text":"The argument presupposes that the future may not be inferred from present exhaustion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:DNX3","text":"The argument presupposes that an encounter with the higher man may not be conceived within the schema of mercy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:DNX4","text":"The argument presupposes that separation is not a legitimate final form of self-preservation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:SNX1","text":"Excluded is the possibility of a definitively secured external space in which Zarathustra can be reached neither by distress nor by nihilism nor by the higher man.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:SNX2","text":"Excluded is a pure affirmation that would not have to pass through fear, melancholy, temptation, and a remaining counter-voice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:SNX3","text":"Excluded is a conclusive reconciliation between pity and Zarathustra's affirmative task.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:FGS1","text":"Nihilistic interpretation of the world → expectation of a coming general distress → cry of distress as an appearance of evidence for this interpretation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:FGS2","text":"Personal address through the cry → naming of the higher man → activation of fear and pity as a structure of temptation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:FGS3","text":"Rejection of nihilistic totalization → positing of continuing possibility of happiness → bodily and spatial distancing from melancholy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:FGS4","text":"Search for the higher man → recoding of distress into responsibility for protection and domain → avoidance of an explicit pitying justification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:FGS5","text":"Reception of the soothsayer as guest → persistence of the counter-voice in one's own space → competition between two prophetic orders of the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:AF1","text":"Great weariness **→** acoustic appearance of distress **→** personal summons of Zarathustra.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:AF2","text":"Personal summons **→** revelation of the higher man **→** fear and temptation to pity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:AF3","text":"Temptation to pity **→** nihilistic assertion of the end of happiness **→** threefold rejection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:AF4","text":"Rejection **→** assertion of remaining blessed isles **→** turning away from melancholy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:AF5","text":"Turning away **→** search for and protection of the higher man **→** return of the soothsayer as internal guest and counter-prophet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:ME1","text":"Human distress is reclassified from a general moral object into a testing mechanism for Zarathustra's self-binding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:ME2","text":"Pity and help are pulled apart: the text permits a movement toward the endangered person without legitimating it as pitying redemption.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:ME3","text":"The cave is redrawn from a place of hermit autarky into a space of irreducible ideological hospitality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:ME4","text":"Prophecy is reordered from a unitary language of truth into a conflict between two incompatible productions of the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:ME5","text":"Happiness becomes visible not as a present state, but as a counterforce against the closure of the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:ALT1","text":"Surface — A soothsayer reports a cry of the higher man; Zarathustra rejects his nihilistic interpretation and sets out to search.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:ALT2","text":"Structural — Human distress, pity, nihilism, happiness, and protection are organized as competing translations of the same crisis situation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The response to nihilism consists not in its exclusion, but in the opening of a counter-movement that carries the adversary along within its own space.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The future is not fixed as the linear consequence of present weariness, but open as a field of conflicting prophetic positings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the basic operation: distress is processed as a temptation toward nihilistic and pitying closure, against which Zarathustra posits possibility and movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined by what positive criterion Zarathustra distinguishes between reprehensible pity and permissible protection of the higher man.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:MRT3","text":"The structure is coherent insofar as affirmation is understood as a continuing counter-practice and not as a state of undisturbed cheerfulness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:MRT4","text":"The strongest operation consists in the separation of the perception of distress from the nihilistic interpretation of distress.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:MRT5","text":"The strongest line of rupture lies in the fact that Zarathustra simultaneously repels, fears, seeks, and wishes to protect the higher man.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERN:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the movement of the text only if the presence of the soothsayer remains preserved as the unresolved internal persistence of the great weariness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERN:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_DERN@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_DERN:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 127","title":"The Cry of Distress","context":"Chapter 127","original_title":"Der Nothschrei","original_context":"Chapter 127"},"original_title":"Der Nothschrei","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12","layer":"CH","title":"Conversation with the Kings · 1","order":128,"parents":["RAW_97E9_1_12"],"revision":"CH_97E9_1_12@R001","sha256":"0bb0903780da1c1ea0541d35e1c517aebd19485f4cce881d88e998f513c0a6c7","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:AS1","text":"Die Szene stellt zwei sichtbare Könige der faktischen Führung eines einzigen Esels gegenüber und erzeugt damit eine Diskrepanz zwischen Rangzeichen und wirklicher Stellung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:AS2","text":"Die Äußerung eines Außenstehenden macht aus einem unausgesprochenen königlichen Unbehagen eine öffentlich hörbare Diagnose.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:AS3","text":"Die Kritik an guter Gesellschaft, Adel und Pöbel schlägt in die Selbsterkenntnis um, dass die Könige selbst falsch, verkleidet und zur bloßen Darstellung von Vorrang gezwungen sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:AS4","text":"Aus dem Zusammenbruch der bestehenden Rangordnung entsteht die Suche nach einem Menschen, dessen menschliche Höhe die politische Herrschaft erst legitimieren könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:AS5","text":"Zarathustra nimmt die Selbstentlarvung der Könige auf, verlagert die Frage von bestehender Macht auf den höheren Menschen und macht sein eigenes Reich zum Ort dieser Wertsuche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:AS6","text":"Der Eselslaut und die abschließende Sibyllenrede verdichten den Vorgang zur satirischen Bewegung vom Königtum über Tierwerdung bis zum geschichtlichen und religiösen Verfall.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:A1","text":"Die beiden Könige erscheinen mit Kronen und Purpurgürteln, führen jedoch nur einen einzigen beladenen Esel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:A2","text":"Eine Stimme außerhalb der königlichen Gesellschaft kann aussprechen, was die Könige untereinander nur unausgesprochen denken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:A3","text":"Der rechte König behandelt „gute Sitten“ und „gute Gesellschaft“ nicht als gültige Norm, sondern als dasjenige, dem die Könige ausweichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:A4","text":"Der rechte König beschreibt den gegenwärtigen Adel als falsch und faul, durch ererbten Prunk verkleidet und durch Handel mit der Macht korrumpiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:A5","text":"Der rechte König bezeichnet den Pöbel als „Mischmasch“, in dem „Heiliger und Hallunke und Junker und Jude und jeglich Vieh aus der Arche Noäh“ unterschiedslos vermengt sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:A6","text":"Der rechte König erklärt den gesunden, bäuerlichen Typus zum Besten und Vornehmsten und fordert, dass Bauern-Art herrschen solle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:A7","text":"Die Könige sind nach eigener Aussage nicht die Ersten und müssen dennoch bedeuten, die Ersten zu sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:A8","text":"Der Ekel der Könige richtet sich sowohl gegen das Gesindel als auch gegen die eigene Stellung, unter diesem Gesindel die Ersten bedeuten zu müssen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:A9","text":"Zarathustra bestimmt sein Reich und seine Herrschaft als den Ort, an dem der höhere Mensch gesucht wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:A10","text":"Die Könige erklären, sie seien unterwegs, um einen Menschen zu finden, der höher als sie selbst sei, und führen ihm den Esel zu.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:A11","text":"Wenn die Mächtigen nicht zugleich die ersten Menschen sind, wird nach der Rede der Könige alles falsch, schief und ungeheuer; wenn sie mehr Vieh als Mensch sind, steigt die Pöbel-Tugend zur alleinigen Tugend auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:A12","text":"Zarathustra stellt seine frühere Frage „Was liegt noch an Königen!“ neben seine gegenwärtige Freude darüber, dass die Könige selbst fragen, was an ihnen liege.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:A13","text":"Der Esel erhält innerhalb der Szene eine eigene Stimme und antwortet mit dem lautmalerischen „I-A“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:A14","text":"Die abschließende Sibyllenrede formuliert den Niedergang als Reimfolge: „Rom sank zur Hure und zur Huren-Bude, Rom’s Caesar sank zum Vieh, Gott selbst—ward Jude!“","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:NX1","text":"Gute Sitten und gute Gesellschaft gelten nicht als verlässliche Grundlage von Ordnung oder Wert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:NX2","text":"Ererbter Adel, königlicher Prunk und vergoldete Rangzeichen beweisen keine wirkliche Vornehmheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:NX3","text":"Königlicher Rang garantiert weder menschliche Höhe noch tatsächliche Erstheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:NX4","text":"Die bestehende Gesellschaft bildet keine klare Rangordnung, sondern einen als Pöbel bezeichneten Mischzustand.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:NX5","text":"Der Rückzug vor dem Pöbel erzeugt keine legitime Überlegenheit, solange die Könige selbst nur dessen erste Darsteller bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:NX6","text":"Die königliche Selbstdeutung kann nicht dauerhaft im privaten oder unausgesprochenen Raum verborgen bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:NX7","text":"Die höchste Herrschaft darf nicht einfach mit der vorhandenen Macht gleichgesetzt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:NX8","text":"Menschliche Überlegenheit kann die Möglichkeit der Tierwerdung nicht aus sich ausschließen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:D1","text":"Die Gegenüberstellung von zwei Königen und einem Esel entwertet die sichtbare Rangordnung als ausreichenden Beweis von Vorrang.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_12:A1","CH_97E9_1_12:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:D2","text":"Die Zurückweisung der guten Gesellschaft wird zur Selbstkritik der Könige, weil ihre eigene Herrschaft durch dieselben falschen Zeichen getragen wird, die sie verachten.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_12:A3","CH_97E9_1_12:A4","CH_97E9_1_12:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:D3","text":"Das Lob des Bauern entsteht als Gegenmodell zur erblich und repräsentativ legitimierten Elite.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_12:A4","CH_97E9_1_12:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:D4","text":"Der Ekel vor der gegenwärtigen Herrschaft erzeugt die Suche nach einem noch nicht gegebenen Maßstab des Herrschens.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_12:A7","CH_97E9_1_12:A8","CH_97E9_1_12:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:D5","text":"Die Legitimität der Herrschaft wird von der formalen Stellung auf die menschliche Höhe des Herrschenden verschoben.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_12:A9","CH_97E9_1_12:A10","CH_97E9_1_12:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:D6","text":"Die Unfähigkeit der Mächtigen, erste Menschen zu sein, lässt den Pöbel nicht verschwinden, sondern ermöglicht ihm, seine eigene Tugend zu verabsolutieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_12:A5","CH_97E9_1_12:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:D7","text":"Zarathustra verwandelt das belauschte königliche Geständnis in eine ausdrücklich anerkannte Suche nach dem höheren Menschen.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_12:A2","CH_97E9_1_12:A9","CH_97E9_1_12:A10","CH_97E9_1_12:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:D8","text":"Der Eselslaut macht die zuvor metaphorisch behauptete Nähe von Königtum und Tierheit zu einem akustischen Ereignis.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_12:A1","CH_97E9_1_12:A11","CH_97E9_1_12:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:D9","text":"Die Sibyllenrede überführt die lokale Krise der Könige in eine umfassendere Formel geschichtlichen Verfalls.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_12:A11","CH_97E9_1_12:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:SD1","text":"Die Szene hebt Hierarchie nicht auf, sondern ersetzt ihre ererbte Begründung durch die Forderung nach einer menschlich höheren Instanz.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_12:A4","CH_97E9_1_12:A9","CH_97E9_1_12:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:SD2","text":"Die Opposition zwischen Königtum und Pöbel zerfällt, weil die Könige den Pöbel verachten, zugleich aber dessen Vermischung und Tierheit in sich selbst sichtbar machen.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_12:A5","CH_97E9_1_12:A8","CH_97E9_1_12:A11","CH_97E9_1_12:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:SD3","text":"Der höhere Mensch fungiert als abwesender Legitimationspunkt, der die bestehende Machtordnung zugleich entwertet und eine neue Rangordnung ermöglicht.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_12:A7","CH_97E9_1_12:A9","CH_97E9_1_12:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:SD4","text":"Die Kritik an der Herrschaft führt nicht zur Abschaffung von Herrschaft, sondern zur Forderung, dass Herrschaft an eine noch nicht verwirklichte menschliche Qualität gebunden werden müsse.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_12:A6","CH_97E9_1_12:A9","CH_97E9_1_12:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:SD5","text":"Die satirische Schlussbewegung totalisiert den Verfall, indem sie politische Entwürdigung, Tierwerdung und religiös-geschichtliche Degeneration in einer einzigen Abstiegsskala verbindet.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_12:A11","CH_97E9_1_12:A13","CH_97E9_1_12:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:DNX1","text":"Das System hängt von der Unwahrheit ab, dass soziale Rangzeichen einen zuverlässigen Zugang zu menschlicher Höhe darstellen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:DNX2","text":"Das System schließt stillschweigend aus, dass die bestehende Elite und der Pöbel klar voneinander getrennte, in sich reine Ordnungen bilden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:DNX3","text":"Das System kann nur bestehen, wenn die bloße Darstellung von Erstheit von wirklicher Erstheit unterschieden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:DNX4","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass Macht aus sich selbst den höheren Menschen hervorbringt oder ihre eigene Legitimität erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:DNX5","text":"Die Möglichkeit einer stabilen Grenze zwischen Menschlichem und Tierischem wird strukturell unterlaufen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:DNX6","text":"Die Gegenwart verfügt über keinen bereits anerkannten Maßstab, anhand dessen der höchste Mensch bestimmt werden könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:SNX1","text":"Der eigentliche Gegenstand der Suche, der höhere Mensch, bleibt abwesend; seine Abwesenheit organisiert die gesamte Bewegung der Szene.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:SNX2","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine Herrschaftsform, in der Rang, Darstellung, Macht und menschliche Überlegenheit bereits zusammenfallen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:SNX3","text":"Versperrt ist eine stabile Ordnung, die zugleich aristokratische Unterscheidung bewahrt und die gegenwärtigen Könige legitimiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:SNX4","text":"Eine positive Wiederherstellung der politischen Ordnung wird nicht bereitgestellt; an ihre Stelle treten Suche, Selbstentlarvung, Eselslaut und Reim.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:FGS1","text":"Sichtbare Königszeichen plus die Führung eines einzigen Esels erzeugen eine Diskrepanz zwischen repräsentiertem Rang und faktischer Stellung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:FGS2","text":"Die von außen kommende Stimme macht die Diskrepanz hörbar und zwingt die Könige, ihre unterdrückte Wahrnehmung zu bestätigen oder abzuwehren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:FGS3","text":"Die Abwehr führt in die Selbstdiagnose: gute Gesellschaft, Adel, Macht und königliche Erstheit erscheinen als falsche Darstellung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:FGS4","text":"Der Zusammenbruch der bestehenden Rangordnung erzeugt einen fehlenden Legitimationspunkt, der im höheren Menschen gesucht wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:FGS5","text":"Zarathustras Auftreten vermittelt die private Selbstverachtung der Könige in eine öffentliche, zielgerichtete Suche nach neuer menschlicher Höhe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:FGS6","text":"Die neue Rangordnung wird durch die Forderung erzeugt, dass der höchste Mensch auch der höchste Herr sein müsse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:FGS7","text":"Der Eselslaut unterbricht diese Reorganisation, indem er die tierische Reststruktur der Herrschaft akustisch markiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:FGS8","text":"Die Sibyllenrede hebt den lokalen Vorgang auf eine historische Totalformel des Abstiegs und schließt die Maschine durch satirische Verdichtung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:AF1","text":"Zwei Könige mit einem Esel → sichtbare Entkopplung von Rang und Wirklichkeit → unausgesprochene königliche Kritik → Selbstentlarvung von Adel und Herrschaft → Abwesenheit eines legitimen Maßstabs → Suche nach dem höheren Menschen → Neubegründung von Herrschaft durch menschliche Höhe → Eselslaut → historische Verfallsformel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:ME1","text":"Königtum wird von einer gegebenen sozialen Stellung in ein problematisches Verhältnis zwischen Zeichen, Darstellung und menschlicher Qualität umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:ME2","text":"Vornehmheit wird vom Erb- und Prunkzeichen auf Gesundheit, Widerstandsfähigkeit und eine noch zu bestimmende menschliche Höhe verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:ME3","text":"Der Gegensatz von Elite und Pöbel zerfällt, weil die Herrschenden selbst als vermischt, verkleidet und tiernah sichtbar werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:ME4","text":"Politische Kritik wird in eine Suchbewegung nach einem nicht anwesenden Subjekt und damit in eine zukünftige Rangordnung überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:ME5","text":"Der Esel wird von einem Lasttier zu einem Störzentrum der politischen Semantik: Er trägt, spricht und spiegelt die Entwürdigung der Könige.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:ME6","text":"Die einzelne Herrschaftskrise wird mit einer geschichtlichen Abstiegskarte verbunden, in der Imperium, Caesar, Tierheit und Religion aufeinander bezogen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — Zwei Könige führen einen Esel; ihre Rede offenbart Ekel vor Gesellschaft, Adel und eigener Herrschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — Die Szene untersucht die Entkopplung von Rangrepräsentation, tatsächlicher menschlicher Qualität und politischer Legitimität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — Eine zunächst verborgene und private Kritik wird durch Zarathustras Zuhören öffentlich gemacht und in eine Suche nach einem neuen Maßstab umgelenkt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — Menschsein erscheint als gestufte Bewegung zwischen höherem Menschen, letztem Menschen, Tierheit und geschichtlichem Verfall.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:MRT1","text":"Die extrahierten Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von der szenischen Rangdifferenz über die königliche Selbstdiagnose bis zur Suche nach dem höheren Menschen zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob Zarathustra die Wertungen des rechten Königs vollständig übernimmt oder primär deren enthüllende Funktion bestätigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob der Esel den künftigen höheren Menschen symbolisiert, ihn lediglich begleitet oder die königliche Rede verspottet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0023","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0028","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:MRT4","text":"Die Verbindung von Bauern-Art, höherem Menschen und höchstem Herrn bleibt hierarchisch produktiv, aber begrifflich nicht vollständig geklärt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:MRT5","text":"Die Kritik an Macht und die gleichzeitige Forderung, der höchste Mensch müsse der höchste Herr sein, erzeugen eine ungelöste Spannung zwischen Herrschaftskritik und Herrschaftsneubegründung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0023","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:MRT6","text":"Die Unterscheidung zwischen Königen und Pöbel wird durch die eigene Tier- und Mischgestalt der Könige unterlaufen, ohne dass eine neue soziale Klassifikation ausgearbeitet wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0028","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:MRT7","text":"Die Schlussformel bewahrt die rhetorische Kraft der Totalisierung, vermittelt den Übergang von der königlichen Szene zur religiös-geschichtlichen Abstiegsskala jedoch nicht argumentativ aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung des Textes, sofern sie die Stimmenkonkurrenz, die Selbstentlarvung und die offene Abwesenheit des höheren Menschen nicht zu einer geschlossenen Lehre vereinfacht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T185653712787Z_01c77772","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"1.","source_sha256":"0bb0903780da1c1ea0541d35e1c517aebd19485f4cce881d88e998f513c0a6c7","sha256":"f54c7d67b12ca6d1270fe3b1702405fc32a06039a2ecfcdc06164c1f25d5b632","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T18:56:53.715089+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:AS1","text":"The scene juxtaposes two visible kings with the factual leadership of a single donkey, thereby producing a discrepancy between insignia of rank and actual position.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:AS2","text":"The utterance of an outsider turns an unspoken royal unease into a publicly audible diagnosis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:AS3","text":"The critique of good society, nobility, and rabble turns into the self-recognition that the kings themselves are false, disguised, and compelled to the mere representation of precedence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:AS4","text":"From the collapse of the existing hierarchy arises the search for a human being whose human height could first legitimize political rule.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:AS5","text":"Zarathustra takes up the kings' self-unmasking, shifts the question from existing power to the higher human being, and makes his own realm the site of this search for value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:AS6","text":"The donkey's bray and the concluding Sibylline speech condense the process into a satirical movement from kingship through becoming-animal to historical and religious decay.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:A1","text":"The two kings appear with crowns and purple girdles, yet lead only a single laden donkey.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:A2","text":"A voice outside royal society can articulate what the kings think among themselves only unspoken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:A3","text":"The king on the right treats „gute Sitten“ and „gute Gesellschaft“ not as valid norms, but as that which the kings evade.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:A4","text":"The king on the right describes the present nobility as false and lazy, disguised by inherited splendor and corrupted by trade in power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:A5","text":"The king on the right calls the rabble a „Mischmasch“, in which „Heiliger und Hallunke und Junker und Jude und jeglich Vieh aus der Arche Noäh“ are indiscriminately mingled.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:A6","text":"The king on the right declares the healthy, peasant type to be the best and most distinguished, and demands that Bauern-Art should rule.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:A7","text":"By their own account, the kings are not the first and yet must signify that they are the first.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:A8","text":"The kings' disgust is directed both against the rabble and against their own position of having to signify the first among this rabble.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:A9","text":"Zarathustra determines his realm and his rule as the place where the higher human being is sought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:A10","text":"The kings declare that they are on their way to find a human being higher than themselves, and lead the donkey to him.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:A11","text":"If the powerful are not at the same time the first human beings, then, according to the kings' speech, everything becomes false, crooked, and monstrous; if they are more beast than human, rabble-virtue rises to become the sole virtue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:A12","text":"Zarathustra places his earlier question „Was liegt noch an Königen!“ alongside his present joy that the kings themselves ask what matters about them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:A13","text":"Within the scene, the donkey receives a voice of its own and answers with the onomatopoeic „I-A“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:A14","text":"The concluding Sibylline speech formulates decline as a sequence of rhymes: „Rom sank zur Hure und zur Huren-Bude, Rom’s Caesar sank zum Vieh, Gott selbst—ward Jude!“","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:NX1","text":"Good manners and good society do not count as a reliable foundation of order or value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:NX2","text":"Inherited nobility, royal splendor, and gilded insignia of rank prove no genuine distinction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:NX3","text":"Royal rank guarantees neither human height nor actual firstness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:NX4","text":"Existing society does not form a clear hierarchy, but rather a mixed condition designated as rabble.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:NX5","text":"Withdrawal from the rabble produces no legitimate superiority so long as the kings themselves remain only its foremost representatives.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:NX6","text":"Royal self-interpretation cannot remain permanently concealed in the private or unspoken sphere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:NX7","text":"The highest rule must not simply be equated with existing power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:NX8","text":"Human superiority cannot exclude from itself the possibility of becoming-animal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:D1","text":"The juxtaposition of two kings and one donkey devalues visible hierarchy as sufficient proof of precedence.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_12:A1","CH_97E9_1_12:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:D2","text":"The rejection of good society becomes the kings' self-critique, because their own rule is sustained by the same false signs they despise.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_12:A3","CH_97E9_1_12:A4","CH_97E9_1_12:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:D3","text":"The praise of the peasant arises as a countermodel to the elite legitimated hereditarily and representationally.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_12:A4","CH_97E9_1_12:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:D4","text":"Disgust with present rule produces the search for a not-yet-given standard of ruling.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_12:A7","CH_97E9_1_12:A8","CH_97E9_1_12:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:D5","text":"The legitimacy of rule is shifted from formal position to the human height of the ruler.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_12:A9","CH_97E9_1_12:A10","CH_97E9_1_12:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:D6","text":"The inability of the powerful to be first human beings does not make the rabble disappear, but enables it to absolutize its own virtue.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_12:A5","CH_97E9_1_12:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:D7","text":"Zarathustra transforms the overheard royal confession into an explicitly acknowledged search for the higher human being.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_12:A2","CH_97E9_1_12:A9","CH_97E9_1_12:A10","CH_97E9_1_12:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:D8","text":"The donkey's bray turns the previously metaphorically asserted proximity of kingship and animality into an acoustic event.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_12:A1","CH_97E9_1_12:A11","CH_97E9_1_12:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:D9","text":"The Sibylline speech transfers the local crisis of the kings into a more comprehensive formula of historical decline.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_12:A11","CH_97E9_1_12:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:SD1","text":"The scene does not abolish hierarchy, but replaces its inherited justification with the demand for a humanly higher instance.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_12:A4","CH_97E9_1_12:A9","CH_97E9_1_12:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:SD2","text":"The opposition between kingship and rabble disintegrates, because the kings despise the rabble while at the same time making its mixture and animality visible in themselves.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_12:A5","CH_97E9_1_12:A8","CH_97E9_1_12:A11","CH_97E9_1_12:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:SD3","text":"The higher human being functions as an absent point of legitimation that simultaneously devalues the existing order of power and enables a new hierarchy.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_12:A7","CH_97E9_1_12:A9","CH_97E9_1_12:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:SD4","text":"The critique of rule does not lead to the abolition of rule, but to the demand that rule must be bound to a human quality not yet realized.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_12:A6","CH_97E9_1_12:A9","CH_97E9_1_12:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:SD5","text":"The satirical concluding movement totalizes decline by joining political degradation, becoming-animal, and religious-historical degeneration in a single scale of descent.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_12:A11","CH_97E9_1_12:A13","CH_97E9_1_12:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:DNX1","text":"The system depends on the untruth that social insignia of rank provide reliable access to human height.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:DNX2","text":"The system tacitly excludes the possibility that the existing elite and the rabble form orders clearly separated from one another and pure in themselves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:DNX3","text":"The system can endure only if the mere representation of firstness is distinguished from actual firstness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:DNX4","text":"It is excluded that power, by itself, brings forth the higher human being or generates its own legitimacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:DNX5","text":"The possibility of a stable boundary between the human and the animal is structurally undermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:DNX6","text":"The present possesses no already recognized standard by which the highest human being could be determined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:SNX1","text":"The actual object of the search, the higher human being, remains absent; its absence organizes the entire movement of the scene.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:SNX2","text":"Unavailable is a form of rule in which rank, representation, power, and human superiority already coincide.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:SNX3","text":"Barred is a stable order that both preserves aristocratic distinction and legitimates the present kings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:SNX4","text":"A positive restoration of political order is not provided; search, self-unmasking, the donkey's bray, and rhyme take its place.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:FGS1","text":"Visible royal insignia plus the leading of a single donkey produce a discrepancy between represented rank and actual position.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:FGS2","text":"The voice coming from outside makes the discrepancy audible and compels the kings to confirm or ward off their suppressed perception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:FGS3","text":"The defense leads into self-diagnosis: good society, nobility, power, and royal firstness appear as false representation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:FGS4","text":"The collapse of the existing hierarchy produces a missing point of legitimation, sought in the higher human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:FGS5","text":"Zarathustra's appearance mediates the kings' private self-contempt into a public, purposive search for new human height.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:FGS6","text":"The new hierarchy is generated by the demand that the highest human being must also be the highest lord.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:FGS7","text":"The donkey's bray interrupts this reorganization by acoustically marking the residual animal structure of rule.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:FGS8","text":"The Sibylline speech raises the local process to a historical total formula of descent and closes the machine through satirical condensation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:AF1","text":"Two kings with one donkey → visible decoupling of rank and reality → unspoken royal critique → self-unmasking of nobility and rule → absence of a legitimate standard → search for the higher human being → refoundation of rule through human height → donkey's bray → historical formula of decline.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:ME1","text":"Kingship is remapped from a given social position into a problematic relation among sign, representation, and human quality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:ME2","text":"Distinction is shifted from hereditary and splendid insignia to health, resilience, and a human height yet to be determined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:ME3","text":"The opposition between elite and rabble disintegrates because the rulers themselves become visible as mixed, disguised, and close to animality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:ME4","text":"Political critique is transferred into a movement of search for an absent subject and thus into a future hierarchy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:ME5","text":"The donkey is transformed from a beast of burden into a center of disturbance in political semantics: it carries, speaks, and mirrors the degradation of the kings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:ME6","text":"The individual crisis of rule is connected with a historical map of descent in which empire, Caesar, animality, and religion are brought into relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — Two kings lead a donkey; their speech reveals disgust with society, nobility, and their own rule.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — The scene examines the decoupling of the representation of rank, actual human quality, and political legitimacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — A criticism initially hidden and private is made public through Zarathustra's listening and redirected into a search for a new standard.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — Being human appears as a graduated movement between the higher human being, the last human being, animality, and historical decline.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:MRT1","text":"The extracted axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from the scenic difference in rank through royal self-diagnosis to the search for the higher human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether Zarathustra fully adopts the evaluations of the king on the right or primarily confirms their revealing function.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:MRT3","text":"It remains underdetermined whether the donkey symbolizes the future higher human being, merely accompanies him, or mocks the royal speech.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0023","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0028","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:MRT4","text":"The connection among Bauern-Art, the higher human being, and the highest lord remains hierarchically productive, but conceptually not fully clarified.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:MRT5","text":"The critique of power and the simultaneous demand that the highest human being must be the highest lord produce an unresolved tension between critique of rule and the refoundation of rule.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0023","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:MRT6","text":"The distinction between kings and rabble is undermined by the kings' own animal and mixed form, without a new social classification being elaborated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0028","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:MRT7","text":"The concluding formula preserves the rhetorical force of totalization, but does not argue out the transition from the royal scene to the religious-historical scale of descent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_12:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the text's actual movement insofar as it does not simplify the competition of voices, self-unmasking, and the open absence of the higher human being into a closed doctrine.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_12:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_1_12@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_1_12:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"Conversation with the Kings","source_section_label":"1.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Four and Last"],"reading_title":"Conversation with the Kings · 1","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","Conversation with the Kings","1."],"original_title":"1."}],"source_title_context":"Gespräch mit den Königen","source_section_label":"1.","source_title_hierarchy":["Vierter und letzter Theil"],"reading_title":"Conversation with the Kings · 1","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","Conversation with the Kings","1."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 128","title":"Conversation with the Kings · 1","context":"Part Four and Last","original_context":"Vierter und letzter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Gespräch mit den Königen · 1"},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12","layer":"CH","title":"Conversation with the Kings · 2","order":129,"parents":["RAW_97E9_2_12"],"revision":"CH_97E9_2_12@R001","sha256":"49b5e51066d0d34ed614e26e4d68cfdfda25939e5ee197d961a321cffa5e5752","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:AS1","text":"Die Könige gelangen über ein feindlich verzerrtes Bild zu Zarathustra, müssen jedoch dessen Rede gegen den äußeren Eindruck prüfen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:AS2","text":"Zarathustras Lehre bestimmt Frieden nicht als Endzustand, sondern als Mittel und Zwischenraum für neue Kriege.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:AS3","text":"Krieg wird durch Tapferkeit, Blut, Schwert und väterliche Erinnerung als lebenssteigernde Macht legitimiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:AS4","text":"Die Könige identifizieren sich mit dieser Kriegsrede über eine körperlich aktivierte Genealogie, obwohl sie selbst friedfertig erscheinen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:AS5","text":"Zarathustra erkennt die Diskrepanz zwischen kriegerischer Rhetorik und gegenwärtiger Friedfertigkeit, unterlässt jedoch den Spott.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:AS6","text":"Die Höhle wird als aufgeschobener Zielort gesetzt; an die Stelle unmittelbarer Teilnahme tritt das Warten als letzte verbliebene königliche Tugend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:A1","text":"Ein von Feinden vermitteltes Bild kann die Erscheinung Zarathustras verfälschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:A2","text":"Zarathustras Rede besitzt größere Überzeugungskraft als sein äußerer Anblick.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:A3","text":"Frieden ist als Mittel zu neuen Kriegen funktional bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:A4","text":"Der kurze Frieden ist dem langen Frieden vorzuziehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:A5","text":"Tapferkeit gilt als Gut.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:A6","text":"Der gute Krieg heiligt jede Sache.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:A7","text":"Krieg aktiviert eine leiblich-genealogische Erinnerung an die Väter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:A8","text":"Langer Frieden erscheint als Schwächung, Scham und Verlust von Lebensintensität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:A9","text":"Das Schwert ist als auf Blut gerichtetes und nach Blut verlangendes Instrument symbolisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:A10","text":"Die gegenwärtigen Könige sind friedfertig, obwohl sie die kriegerische Vergangenheit ihrer Väter enthusiastisch bejahen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:A11","text":"Die Höhle Zarathustras ist ein geehrter, aber nicht unmittelbar verfügbarer Ort.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:A12","text":"Wartenkönnen ist die den Königen verbliebene Tugend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:NX1","text":"Zarathustra ist nicht durch das feindliche Spiegelbild als teuflische Fratze bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:NX2","text":"Die Wahrheit seiner Lehre hängt nicht von seinem äußeren Aussehen ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:NX3","text":"Frieden ist nicht der höchste oder endgültige politische Wert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:NX4","text":"Langer Frieden ist nicht als dauerhafte Steigerung des Lebens zugelassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:NX5","text":"Krieg ist nicht bloß Zerstörung oder moralischer Ausnahmezustand.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:NX6","text":"Die Könige verkörpern nicht ungebrochen die kriegerische Tugend, die sie preisen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:NX7","text":"Die Höhle ist nicht sofort erreichbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:NX8","text":"Königliche Tugend besteht nicht mehr in unmittelbarer Kriegshandlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:D1","text":"Die Beurteilung Zarathustras wird von visueller Feindpropaganda auf hörbare Lehre umgestellt.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_12:A1","CH_97E9_2_12:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:D2","text":"Frieden erhält seinen Wert nur durch seine Funktion als Vorbereitung eines erneuten Konflikts.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_12:A3","CH_97E9_2_12:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:D3","text":"Der gute Krieg kann jede Sache nachträglich rechtfertigen, weil seine moralische Bewertung aus seiner Funktion als Lebenssteigerung bezogen wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_12:A5","CH_97E9_2_12:A6","CH_97E9_2_12:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:D4","text":"Die Berufung auf die Väter verwandelt Krieg aus einer äußeren Handlung in eine leiblich erinnerte Lebensform.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_12:A7","CH_97E9_2_12:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:D5","text":"Die enthusiastische Kriegsrede der Könige fungiert als Ersatz für die gegenwärtig fehlende Kriegspraxis.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_12:A7","CH_97E9_2_12:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:D6","text":"Zarathustras Zurückhaltung bewahrt die Differenz zwischen der Selbstbeschreibung der Könige und ihrer tatsächlichen Friedfertigkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_12:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:D7","text":"Die Verzögerung des Höhlenzugangs verschiebt die Könige von handelnden Subjekten zu wartenden Anwärtern.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_12:A11","CH_97E9_2_12:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:SD1","text":"Das System ersetzt die Gegenüberstellung von Krieg und Frieden durch eine Hierarchie, in der Frieden nur als taktische Unterbrechung des Krieges gilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:SD2","text":"Kriegerische Identität wird nicht durch gegenwärtige Handlung, sondern durch genealogische Erinnerung, körperliche Erregung und rhetorische Wiederholung reproduziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:SD3","text":"Die Könige erscheinen als historische Nachbilder einer unterbrochenen Lebensform: Sie bewahren deren Sprache, aber nicht deren Handlungsmacht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:SD4","text":"Zarathustras Lehre erzeugt eine Spannung zwischen der Norm des guten Krieges und der faktischen Unfähigkeit ihrer Träger, diesen Krieg zu führen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:SD5","text":"Warten wird zugleich als Rest königlicher Tugend und als Zeichen politischer Entleerung bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass Frieden einen eigenständigen, nicht instrumentellen Wert besitzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:DNX2","text":"Es schließt aus, dass moralische Bewertung unabhängig von Vitalität, Tapferkeit und Konfliktintensität erfolgen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:DNX3","text":"Es schließt aus, dass genealogische Erinnerung bloß historische Kenntnis ohne gegenwärtige körperliche Wirkung ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:DNX4","text":"Es schließt aus, dass die Könige ihre kriegerische Rede unmittelbar politisch verwirklichen können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:DNX5","text":"Es schließt aus, dass Zarathustras Wahrheit durch stabile Erscheinung, soziale Anerkennung oder unmittelbare Verfügbarkeit gesichert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:DNX6","text":"Es schließt aus, dass Verzögerung neutral ist; Warten wird als Ausdruck einer geschichtlichen Schwäche lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen bleibt ein Frieden, der nicht auf zukünftige Feindschaft zurückverweist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen bleibt eine gegenwärtige Königsgewalt, die ihre behauptete Kriegstugend noch als Praxis besitzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen bleibt eine Versöhnung von kriegerischem Ideal und friedfertiger Existenz ohne Verlust ihrer inneren Spannung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:SNX4","text":"Die strukturbildende Abwesenheit ist der reale Krieg, der in Sprache, Erinnerung und Symbolen weiterwirkt, aber im gegenwärtigen Körper der Könige fehlt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:SNX5","text":"Unverfügbar bleibt eine unmittelbare Ankunft bei Zarathustra; der Zugang zur neuen Ordnung ist nur über Aufschub und Warten eröffnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:FGS1","text":"Feindliches Bild → falsche Erscheinungszuschreibung → Vorrang der Rede vor dem Bild.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:FGS2","text":"Rede über Frieden als Kriegsmittel → Umkehrung des Friedensbegriffs → Vorrang des kurzen vor dem langen Frieden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:FGS3","text":"Tapferkeit + guter Krieg → moralische Sakralisierung des Konflikts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:FGS4","text":"Kriegssymbolik + väterliches Blut → leibliche Genealogisierung der Kriegsbejahung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:FGS5","text":"Kriegsbejahung der Väter → Abwertung des langen Friedens → Sehnsucht nach Blut und Schwert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:FGS6","text":"Kriegerische Rede der Könige + ihre faktische Friedfertigkeit → diagnostische Diskrepanz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:FGS7","text":"Erkannte Diskrepanz + unterlassener Spott → Verschiebung von Konfrontation zu Aufschub.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:FGS8","text":"Verzögerter Höhlenzugang → Warten als verbleibende Tugend und als Form politischer Entmächtigung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:AF1","text":"Feindliches Spiegelbild → Prüfung durch die Rede → Frieden als Mittel des Krieges → Krieg als Lebens- und Wertinstanz → genealogische Erregung → friedfertige Könige als widersprüchliche Träger → Zurückhaltung Zarathustras → Höhle und Warten als verschobene Ankunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:ME1","text":"Die Opposition von Erscheinung und Wahrheit wird zugunsten einer Opposition von Bild und wirksamer Rede neu kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:ME2","text":"Die Opposition von Krieg und Frieden wird in die funktionale Relation Krieg / vorbereitender Frieden überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:ME3","text":"Die Könige werden von souveränen politischen Akteuren zu Trägern einer nachwirkenden, aber nicht mehr vollzugsfähigen Genealogie umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:ME4","text":"Warten wird aus einer bloßen Untätigkeit in eine ambivalente politische Kategorie zwischen Resttugend und Entmächtigung verwandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:ME5","text":"Zarathustras Spott wird durch seine Unterlassung als kontrollierte Diagnose statt als offene Polemik sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:ALT1","text":"Surface — Die Könige preisen die Kriegsrede Zarathustras und berichten von der kriegerischen Lebensbejahung ihrer Väter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:ALT2","text":"Structural — Eine kriegerische Wertordnung organisiert Frieden als Zwischenmittel, Krieg als Sakralisierung und Genealogie als Übertragungsmechanismus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Rede verschiebt die politische Lage von gegenwärtigem Handeln auf rhetorische Selbstidentifikation, Verzögerung und erwartete Ankunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Leben erscheint als Intensivierung durch Konflikt; Zeit wird als kurzer Frieden, langer Frieden und aufgeschobene Höhlenankunft strukturiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von der feindlichen Darstellung zur Priorität der Rede zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:MRT2","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um Frieden als taktische Unterbrechung und Krieg als Lebenssteigerung abzuleiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:MRT3","text":"Die Differenz zwischen väterlicher Kriegsbejahung und gegenwärtiger Friedfertigkeit bleibt als zentrale Spannung erhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:MRT4","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob die Könige ihre Kriegsrede ernsthaft politisch vertreten oder nur genealogisch-rhetorisch wiederholen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:MRT5","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt ferner, ob das Warten eine Übergangstugend, eine Ironisierung der Könige oder beides zugleich ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:MRT6","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, solange der Widerspruch zwischen Kriegsnorm und Friedfertigkeit nicht aufgelöst, sondern als diagnostischer Befund behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, weil sie die Ankunft bei Zarathustra nicht als Abschluss, sondern als aufgeschobene Konsequenz des Systems fasst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T190853781229Z_9dccbcb3","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"2.","source_sha256":"49b5e51066d0d34ed614e26e4d68cfdfda25939e5ee197d961a321cffa5e5752","sha256":"d20bc0f21b484136e80fd75cbfd178a4b02d078e998c334c707470c1f2cd116e","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:08:53.783244+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:AS1","text":"The kings arrive at Zarathustra by way of a hostile distorted image, but must test his speech against the external impression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:AS2","text":"Zarathustra's teaching determines peace not as a final state, but as a means and interval for new wars.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:AS3","text":"War is legitimized as a life-enhancing power through courage, blood, sword, and paternal remembrance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:AS4","text":"The kings identify with this discourse of war through a bodily activated genealogy, although they themselves appear peaceable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:AS5","text":"Zarathustra recognizes the discrepancy between warlike rhetoric and present peaceableness, but refrains from mockery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:AS6","text":"The cave is posited as a deferred destination; waiting takes the place of immediate participation as the last remaining royal virtue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:A1","text":"An image mediated by enemies can distort Zarathustra's appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:A2","text":"Zarathustra's speech possesses greater persuasive force than his external appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:A3","text":"Peace is functionally determined as a means to new wars.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:A4","text":"Short peace is preferable to long peace.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:A5","text":"Courage counts as a good.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:A6","text":"Good war sanctifies every cause.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:A7","text":"War activates a bodily-genealogical remembrance of the fathers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:A8","text":"Long peace appears as weakening, shame, and loss of intensity of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:A9","text":"The sword is symbolized as an instrument directed toward blood and demanding blood.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:A10","text":"The present kings are peaceable, although they enthusiastically affirm the warlike past of their fathers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:A11","text":"Zarathustra's cave is an honored but not immediately available place.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:A12","text":"The capacity to wait is the virtue remaining to the kings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:NX1","text":"Zarathustra is not determined by the hostile mirror-image as a devilish grimace.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:NX2","text":"The truth of his teaching does not depend on his external appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:NX3","text":"Peace is not the highest or final political value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:NX4","text":"Long peace is not admitted as a lasting enhancement of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:NX5","text":"War is not mere destruction or a moral state of exception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:NX6","text":"The kings do not embody without rupture the warlike virtue they praise.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:NX7","text":"The cave is not immediately accessible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:NX8","text":"Royal virtue no longer consists in immediate warlike action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:D1","text":"The assessment of Zarathustra is shifted from visual enemy propaganda to audible teaching.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_12:A1","CH_97E9_2_12:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:D2","text":"Peace receives its value only through its function as preparation for renewed conflict.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_12:A3","CH_97E9_2_12:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:D3","text":"Good war can retrospectively justify every cause, because its moral evaluation is derived from its function as enhancement of life.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_12:A5","CH_97E9_2_12:A6","CH_97E9_2_12:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:D4","text":"The invocation of the fathers transforms war from an external action into a bodily remembered form of life.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_12:A7","CH_97E9_2_12:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:D5","text":"The kings' enthusiastic discourse of war functions as a substitute for the presently absent practice of war.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_12:A7","CH_97E9_2_12:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:D6","text":"Zarathustra's restraint preserves the difference between the kings' self-description and their actual peaceableness.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_12:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:D7","text":"The delay of access to the cave shifts the kings from acting subjects to waiting aspirants.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_12:A11","CH_97E9_2_12:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:SD1","text":"The system replaces the opposition between war and peace with a hierarchy in which peace counts only as a tactical interruption of war.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:SD2","text":"Warlike identity is reproduced not through present action, but through genealogical remembrance, bodily excitation, and rhetorical repetition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:SD3","text":"The kings appear as historical afterimages of an interrupted form of life: they preserve its language, but not its capacity to act.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:SD4","text":"Zarathustra's teaching produces a tension between the norm of good war and the factual inability of its bearers to wage this war.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:SD5","text":"Waiting is determined simultaneously as the remnant of royal virtue and as a sign of political emptying.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:DNX1","text":"The system excludes the possibility that peace possesses an autonomous, non-instrumental value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:DNX2","text":"It excludes the possibility that moral evaluation can occur independently of vitality, courage, and intensity of conflict.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:DNX3","text":"It excludes the possibility that genealogical remembrance is merely historical knowledge without present bodily effect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:DNX4","text":"It excludes the possibility that the kings can directly realize their warlike discourse politically.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:DNX5","text":"It excludes the possibility that Zarathustra's truth is secured by stable appearance, social recognition, or immediate availability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:DNX6","text":"It excludes the possibility that delay is neutral; waiting becomes legible as the expression of a historical weakness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:SNX1","text":"Excluded remains a peace that does not refer back to future enmity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:SNX2","text":"Excluded remains a present kingship that still possesses its asserted virtue of war as a practice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:SNX3","text":"Excluded remains a reconciliation of warlike ideal and peaceable existence without loss of their inner tension.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:SNX4","text":"The structure-forming absence is real war, which continues to operate in language, remembrance, and symbols, but is absent in the present body of the kings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:SNX5","text":"Immediate arrival at Zarathustra remains unavailable; access to the new order is opened only through postponement and waiting.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:FGS1","text":"Hostile image → false attribution of appearance → priority of speech over image.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:FGS2","text":"Discourse on peace as a means of war → reversal of the concept of peace → priority of short over long peace.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:FGS3","text":"Courage + good war → moral sacralization of conflict.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:FGS4","text":"War symbolism + paternal blood → bodily genealogization of the affirmation of war.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:FGS5","text":"Fathers' affirmation of war → devaluation of long peace → longing for blood and sword.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:FGS6","text":"Warlike discourse of the kings + their factual peaceableness → diagnostic discrepancy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:FGS7","text":"Recognized discrepancy + refrained mockery → shift from confrontation to postponement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:FGS8","text":"Delayed access to the cave → waiting as remaining virtue and as a form of political disempowerment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:AF1","text":"Hostile mirror-image → testing through speech → peace as a means of war → war as an instance of life and value → genealogical excitation → peaceable kings as contradictory bearers → Zarathustra's restraint → cave and waiting as deferred arrival.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:ME1","text":"The opposition of appearance and truth is remapped in favor of an opposition between image and efficacious speech.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:ME2","text":"The opposition of war and peace is transferred into the functional relation of war / preparatory peace.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:ME3","text":"The kings are reclassified from sovereign political actors into bearers of a genealogy that continues to have effects but is no longer capable of enactment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:ME4","text":"Waiting is transformed from mere inactivity into an ambivalent political category between residual virtue and disempowerment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:ME5","text":"Through its omission, Zarathustra's mockery becomes visible as a controlled diagnosis rather than open polemic.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:ALT1","text":"Surface — The kings praise Zarathustra's discourse of war and recount the warlike affirmation of life of their fathers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:ALT2","text":"Structural — A warlike order of values organizes peace as an intermediate means, war as sacralization, and genealogy as a mechanism of transmission.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The discourse shifts the political situation from present action to rhetorical self-identification, delay, and expected arrival.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Life appears as intensification through conflict; time is structured as short peace, long peace, and deferred arrival at the cave.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from hostile representation to the priority of speech.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:MRT2","text":"The axioms suffice to derive peace as tactical interruption and war as enhancement of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:MRT3","text":"The difference between the fathers' affirmation of war and present peaceableness remains preserved as the central tension.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:MRT4","text":"It remains underdetermined whether the kings seriously advocate their discourse of war politically or merely repeat it genealogically and rhetorically.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:MRT5","text":"It further remains underdetermined whether waiting is a transitional virtue, an ironic treatment of the kings, or both at once.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:MRT6","text":"The structure is internally coherent so long as the contradiction between the norm of war and peaceableness is not resolved, but treated as a diagnostic finding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_12:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement because it grasps arrival at Zarathustra not as a conclusion, but as a deferred consequence of the system.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_12:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_2_12@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_2_12:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"Conversation with the Kings","source_section_label":"2.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Four and Last"],"reading_title":"Conversation with the Kings · 2","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","Conversation with the Kings","2."],"original_title":"2."}],"source_title_context":"Gespräch mit den Königen","source_section_label":"2.","source_title_hierarchy":["Vierter und letzter Theil"],"reading_title":"Conversation with the Kings · 2","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","Conversation with the Kings","2."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 129","title":"Conversation with the Kings · 2","context":"Part Four and Last","original_context":"Vierter und letzter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Gespräch mit den Königen · 2"},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB","layer":"CH","title":"The Leech","order":130,"parents":["RAW_97E9_DERB"],"revision":"CH_97E9_DERB@R001","sha256":"1e118eb2ce7286aa6b4eecf0d222941d4b4b00dff23c4b4b81b97e1db89f1f78","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:AS1","text":"Tiefes Nachdenken führt zu einer unbeabsichtigten Berührung, die vor jeder Erkenntnis in Gewalt umschlägt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:AS2","text":"Der Zusammenstoß zweier Einsamer wird zunächst als Feindschaft und anschließend als mögliche Nähe gedeutet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:AS3","text":"Das Gleichnis der gemeinsamen Einsamkeit scheitert, weil es den Getretenen auf ein fremdes Bild reduziert und dadurch erneut verletzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:AS4","text":"Aus der Zurückweisung des Gleichnisses entsteht die Selbstbestimmung eines Geistes, der Wahrheit durch äußerste Begrenzung seines Wissens gewinnt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:AS5","text":"Das Wissen über den Blutegel wird als körperlich erkaufte, blutige und lebensschneidende Praxis ausgewiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:AS6","text":"Die Passage bewegt sich diagnostisch von Unfall und Reflexgewalt über misslingende Vermittlung und epistemische Selbstbegrenzung zu einer nur angekündigten, nicht vollzogenen Reparatur.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:A1","text":"Tiefes Nachdenken macht für die unmittelbare Umgebung unaufmerksam.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:A2","text":"Die unerwartete Berührung zweier Einsamer erzeugt gegenseitigen Schrecken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:A3","text":"Der Schrecken kann vor jeder Besinnung reflexhafte Gewalt auslösen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:A4","text":"Die erkannte Torheit der Gewalt eröffnet die Möglichkeit von Entschuldigung und bildlicher Vermittlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:A5","text":"Gemeinsame Einsamkeit kann Feindschaft in die Möglichkeit beinahe zärtlicher Nähe umdeuten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:A6","text":"Eine solche Analogie kann die Eigenart des Gegenübers tilgen und dadurch als zweite Verletzung wirken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:A7","text":"Der Verletzte kann das auferlegte Bild zurückweisen und seine eigene Identität sowie sein eigenes Gebiet behaupten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:A8","text":"Die Nennung Zarathustras verändert die affektive Bewertung des Geschehens und macht aus dem Gegner einen verehrten Bezugspunkt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:A9","text":"Das Gewissen des Geistes privilegiert strenges, enges und hartes Wissen gegenüber halbiertem oder diffus schwebendem Wissen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:A10","text":"Wahres Wissen verlangt einen begrenzten wirklichen Grund; seine Größe ist gegenüber seiner Bodenhaftigkeit unerheblich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:A11","text":"Die eigentliche Meisterschaft des Getretenen besteht nicht in der Erkenntnis des Blutegels insgesamt, sondern in der Erkenntnis seines Hirns.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:A12","text":"Die Konzentration auf einen einzigen Gegenstand macht alles Übrige gleichgültig und erzeugt neben dem Wissen ein bewusst getragenes Nichtwissen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:A13","text":"In diesem Erkenntnismodell wird Wissen durch den eigenen Körper und das eigene Blut erworben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:A14","text":"Zarathustras Verhältnis zum Getretenen verbindet Verletzung, Schutz, Einladung und versprochene Wiedergutmachung, ohne diese Wiedergutmachung abzuschließen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:NX1","text":"Der Getretene ist kein Hund und darf nicht durch Zarathustras Gleichnis als solcher fixiert werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:NX2","text":"Der Zusammenstoß ist keine unmittelbare Liebkosung und keine harmlose Begegnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:NX3","text":"Die Einsamkeit des Gegenübers hebt seine Singularität nicht auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:NX4","text":"Das eigene Gebiet des Getretenen ist nicht unangefochten; Zarathustra beansprucht es als sein Reich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:NX5","text":"Strenges Wissen ist kein umfassendes Wissen über alle letzten Gründe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:NX6","text":"Wirkliche Erkenntnis besteht nicht in Vielheit, Weite oder vollständiger Weltkenntnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:NX7","text":"Halbwisserei, geistige Unschärfe, Schweben und Schwärmerei werden als unzulässige Erkenntnisformen ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:NX8","text":"Jenseits der Grenze der eigenen Redlichkeit wird keine scheinbare Kenntnis aufrechterhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:NX9","text":"Zarathustra ist nicht ausschließlich Heiler; er ist zugleich derjenige, der den Getretenen verletzt hat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0034","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:NX10","text":"Die angebotene Versöhnung ist nicht gegenwärtig vollzogen, sondern bleibt an eine spätere Handlung gebunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:D1","text":"Die anfängliche Feindschaft entsteht aus dem Zusammenprall isolierter Existenzen und nicht aus einem vorgängigen Willen zur Feindschaft.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERB:A1","CH_97E9_DERB:A2","CH_97E9_DERB:A3","CH_97E9_DERB:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:D2","text":"Die Entschuldigung kann die Gewalt nicht einfach aufheben, weil ihr Gleichnis die Eigenart des Verletzten erneut verfehlt.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERB:A4","CH_97E9_DERB:A5","CH_97E9_DERB:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:D3","text":"Die Selbstbehauptung des Getretenen verschiebt die Begegnung von einer allgemeinen Beziehung der Einsamen zu einer singulären Erkenntnisposition.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERB:A6","CH_97E9_DERB:A7","CH_97E9_DERB:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:D4","text":"Die Nennung Zarathustras fungiert als Umschlagpunkt, an dem Verletzung in Verehrung und Feindschaft in erkenntnisbezogene Bindung übergeht.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERB:A7","CH_97E9_DERB:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:D5","text":"Die Beschränkung auf das Hirn des Blutegels macht einen einzigen Gegenstand zur vollständigen Welt des Gewissenhaften.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERB:A9","CH_97E9_DERB:A10","CH_97E9_DERB:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:D6","text":"Die epistemische Spezialisierung erzeugt ihre eigene Grenze, indem sie alles außerhalb des Gegenstands preisgibt und als schwarzes Unwissen neben dem Wissen bestehen lässt.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERB:A11","CH_97E9_DERB:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:D7","text":"Die blutenden Wunden dienen als sichtbarer Beweis dafür, dass das Wissen nicht abstrakt, sondern körperlich und selbstkostspielig gewonnen wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERB:A10","CH_97E9_DERB:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:D8","text":"Zarathustra wird gleichzeitig als Ursache des Schadens, als Gegenstand des Wissens, als Schutzmacht und als möglicher Reparateur bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERB:A8","CH_97E9_DERB:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:SD1","text":"Erkenntnisstrenge und körperliche Verletzung folgen derselben Struktur: Beide dringen durch Begrenzung, Schnitt und Entzug zu einem endlichen Grund vor.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERB:A9","CH_97E9_DERB:A10","CH_97E9_DERB:A11","CH_97E9_DERB:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:SD2","text":"Heimat bezeichnet nicht primär einen Ort, sondern einen durch exklusive Meisterschaft gebildeten Wissensbereich, dessen Souveränität von Zarathustra bestritten wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERB:A7","CH_97E9_DERB:A10","CH_97E9_DERB:A11","CH_97E9_DERB:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:SD3","text":"Die Transformation durch Benennung hebt die Gewalt nicht auf, sondern überführt sie in eine asymmetrische Ordnung von Verehrung, Erfassung und Schutz.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERB:A3","CH_97E9_DERB:A6","CH_97E9_DERB:A8","CH_97E9_DERB:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:SD4","text":"Die Behauptung einer umfassenden Welt entsteht gerade aus radikaler Verengung auf einen einzigen Gegenstand.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERB:A9","CH_97E9_DERB:A10","CH_97E9_DERB:A11","CH_97E9_DERB:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:SD5","text":"Die Versöhnung bleibt strukturell unvollständig, weil Zarathustra zugleich Deuter, Verursacher der Wunde, Gegenstand der Verehrung und versprochener Ausgleichender ist.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERB:A4","CH_97E9_DERB:A8","CH_97E9_DERB:A13","CH_97E9_DERB:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird ein Wissen, das zugleich grenzenlos, vollständig und ohne Selbstbegrenzung wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Erkenntnis, die ohne körperliche Beteiligung, Verwundbarkeit und Kosten auskommt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine reine Gegenseitigkeit ohne Aneignung, Benennung oder Herrschaft über den Deutungsrahmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Identität, die ohne Abgrenzung gegen ein Nichtwissen und ohne Zurückweisung fremder Bilder bestehen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird ein privates Gebiet, das gegenüber fremden Ansprüchen dauerhaft abgeschlossen bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:DNX6","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Heilung, die den ursprünglichen Akt der Fehlbenennung und Verletzung nicht weiter bearbeitet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:SNX1","text":"Unvermittelte Wahrheit ohne Auswahl, Ausschluss und Verletzung ist innerhalb des Systems nicht verfügbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:SNX2","text":"Ein vollständiger Geist ohne schwarzes Unwissen bleibt unmöglich, weil seine Genauigkeit auf einer Grenze beruht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:SNX3","text":"Eine reine Nähe ohne Asymmetrie bleibt versperrt, weil selbst die versöhnende Analogie das Gegenüber unter ein fremdes Bild zwingt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:SNX4","text":"Endgültige Reparatur bleibt abwesend, weil die Begegnung durch einen neuen Nothruf vor ihrer Auflösung abgebrochen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:FGS1","text":"Tiefenreflexion → Unaufmerksamkeit für das Nahe → unbeabsichtigte Berührung → gegenseitiger Schrecken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:FGS2","text":"Gegenseitiger Schrecken → reflexhafte Gewalt → nachträgliche Besinnung → Entschuldigung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:FGS3","text":"Entschuldigung → Gleichnis gemeinsamer Einsamkeit → angebotene Nähe → Tilgung der Singularität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:FGS4","text":"Tilgung der Singularität → Zurückweisung des Gleichnisses → Behauptung eigener Identität und eigenen Gebiets.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:FGS5","text":"Blutende Verletzung → Anspruch auf Schutz und Herrschaft → konkurrierende Bestimmung des Reichs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:FGS6","text":"Nennung Zarathustras → affektiver Umschlag → Umcodierung des Verletzers zum verehrten Gewissens-Blutegel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:FGS7","text":"Verehrung → Selbstdefinition des Gewissenhaften → strenge Begrenzung auf einen Gegenstand.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:FGS8","text":"Begrenzung auf das Blutegelhirn → Ausschluss des Übrigen → schwarzes Unwissen als Bedingung des Wissens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:FGS9","text":"Geist als lebensschneidende Kraft → eigenes Blut als Erkenntniskosten → Körperwunde als sichtbare Evidenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:FGS10","text":"Sichtbare Evidenz → Einladung und versprochene Wiedergutmachung → äußerer Nothruf → vertagte Versöhnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:AF1","text":"Nachdenkliche Tiefe → unbeabsichtigtes Treten → Schreckensgewalt → erkannte Torheit → Gleichnis gemeinsamer Einsamkeit → erneute Verletzung durch falsche Gleichsetzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:AF2","text":"Zurückweisung des Gleichnisses → konkurrierende Gebietsansprüche → Benennung Zarathustras → Verehrung des Verletzers → Bekenntnis radikaler Wissensbegrenzung → blutige Evidenz → angekündigte, aber unterbrochene Reparatur.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:ME1","text":"Der Unfall wird von einem bloßen Übergriff zu einer fehlgeleiteten Begegnung zweier isolierter Wesen umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:ME2","text":"Das Gleichnis verliert seine Funktion als Versöhnungsinstrument und wird als potenzielle Form erneuter Gewalt sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:ME3","text":"„Heimat“ wird von räumlicher Zugehörigkeit auf einen durch Wissen konstituierten und politisch umkämpften Herrschaftsbereich verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:ME4","text":"Wissen wird nicht mehr nach Umfang, sondern nach Bodenhaftigkeit, Begrenzung und Redlichkeit klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:ME5","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Körper und Geist bricht zusammen, weil Erkenntnis als körperliche Verwundung sichtbar wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:ME6","text":"Zarathustra wird aus der Rolle des bloßen Gesprächspartners in die zusammengesetzte Position von Täter, Lehrer, Beute, Schutzmacht und möglichem Heiler versetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Ein unbeabsichtigter Tritt, ein blutender Arm, ein Streit, eine Entschuldigung und eine unterbrochene Einladung organisieren die sichtbare Handlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Die Handlung beruht auf der Verbindung von Einsamkeit, Fehlbenennung, konkurrierender Souveränität und radikaler Wissensspezialisierung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Der Text rahmt genaue Erkenntnis als strategische Selbstbegrenzung und zeigt zugleich, dass jede Deutung des Anderen in Aneignung umschlagen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Geist ist eine lebensschneidende Tätigkeit; Wissen entsteht in endlicher Körperzeit, während die versprochene Wiederherstellung auf einen nicht eingelösten späteren Zeitpunkt verschoben wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den Übergang von unbeabsichtigter Berührung über misslingende Analogie und epistemische Selbstbegrenzung bis zur vertagten Reparatur zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob die Strenge des Gewissenhaften primär bestätigt, ironisiert oder zugleich bewundert und problematisiert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0029","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0032","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Wissen als begrenzte, körperliche und ausschließende Praxis verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Verbindung liegt zwischen dem begrenzten Grund, dem Blut des Körpers und dem lebensschneidenden Geist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:MRT5","text":"Die Rekonstruktion hängt von der Überlagerung der Bilder Hund, Blutegel, Schröpfkopf und Wunde ab; eine vollständige begriffliche Vereinheitlichung würde die Spannung des Textes tilgen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:MRT6","text":"Die zentrale ungelöste Bruchlinie liegt zwischen gemeinsamer Einsamkeit und singulärer Selbstbehauptung sowie zwischen Schutz und Herrschaft Zarathustras.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:MRT7","text":"Die tatsächliche Bewegungsform des Textes bleibt erhalten, solange die Reparatur nicht als vollzogen, sondern als durch den Nothruf unterbrochene Möglichkeit rekonstruiert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T193148194770Z_c26ad7a5","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"The Leech","source_sha256":"1e118eb2ce7286aa6b4eecf0d222941d4b4b00dff23c4b4b81b97e1db89f1f78","sha256":"e67c10183089a421faad9eccd76bce8c31872cf59859b9285eeb8a69ef4987bd","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:31:48.195787+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:AS1","text":"Deep reflection leads to an unintended touch that turns into violence before any recognition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:AS2","text":"The collision of two solitary individuals is interpreted first as enmity and then as possible closeness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:AS3","text":"The parable of shared solitude fails because it reduces the one who was stepped on to a foreign image and thereby injures him again.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:AS4","text":"From the rejection of the parable emerges the self-determination of a spirit that gains truth through the utmost limitation of its knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:AS5","text":"Knowledge of the leech is shown to be a practice purchased physically, bloody, and cutting into life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:AS6","text":"Diagnostically, the passage moves from accident and reflexive violence through failed mediation and epistemic self-limitation to a repair that is only announced, not carried out.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:A1","text":"Deep reflection makes one inattentive to the immediate surroundings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:A2","text":"The unexpected touch of two solitary individuals produces mutual fright.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:A3","text":"Fright can trigger reflexive violence before any reflection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:A4","text":"The recognized folly of violence opens the possibility of apology and figurative mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:A5","text":"Shared solitude can reinterpret enmity as the possibility of almost tender closeness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:A6","text":"Such an analogy can efface the other's distinctiveness and thereby act as a second injury.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:A7","text":"The injured person can reject the imposed image and assert his own identity as well as his own territory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:A8","text":"The naming of Zarathustra changes the affective evaluation of events and turns the opponent into a revered point of reference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:A9","text":"The conscience of the spirit privileges strict, narrow, and hard knowledge over halved or diffusely floating knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:A10","text":"True knowledge requires a limited real ground; its magnitude is irrelevant in comparison with its groundedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:A11","text":"The true mastery of the one stepped on consists not in knowledge of the leech as a whole, but in knowledge of its brain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:A12","text":"Concentration on a single object renders everything else indifferent and produces, alongside knowledge, a consciously borne not-knowing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:A13","text":"In this model of knowledge, knowledge is acquired through one's own body and one's own blood.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:A14","text":"Zarathustra's relation to the one stepped on combines injury, protection, invitation, and promised restitution, without completing that restitution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:NX1","text":"The one stepped on is not a dog and must not be fixed as such by Zarathustra's parable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:NX2","text":"The collision is not an immediate caress and not a harmless encounter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:NX3","text":"The other's solitude does not abolish his singularity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:NX4","text":"The one stepped on's own territory is not uncontested; Zarathustra claims it as his realm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:NX5","text":"Strict knowledge is not comprehensive knowledge of all ultimate grounds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:NX6","text":"Real knowledge does not consist in multiplicity, breadth, or complete knowledge of the world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:NX7","text":"Half-knowledge, mental vagueness, floating, and enthusiasm are excluded as inadmissible forms of knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:NX8","text":"Beyond the boundary of one's own probity, no apparent knowledge is maintained.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:NX9","text":"Zarathustra is not exclusively a healer; he is also the one who injured the one stepped on.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0034","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:NX10","text":"The offered reconciliation is not enacted in the present, but remains bound to a later action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:D1","text":"The initial enmity arises from the collision of isolated existences and not from a prior will to enmity.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERB:A1","CH_97E9_DERB:A2","CH_97E9_DERB:A3","CH_97E9_DERB:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:D2","text":"The apology cannot simply undo the violence, because its parable again fails to grasp the injured person's distinctiveness.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERB:A4","CH_97E9_DERB:A5","CH_97E9_DERB:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:D3","text":"The self-assertion of the one stepped on shifts the encounter from a general relation of solitary individuals to a singular epistemic position.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERB:A6","CH_97E9_DERB:A7","CH_97E9_DERB:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:D4","text":"The naming of Zarathustra functions as a turning point at which injury passes into veneration and enmity into an epistemically related bond.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERB:A7","CH_97E9_DERB:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:D5","text":"The restriction to the leech's brain makes a single object the complete world of the conscientious one.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERB:A9","CH_97E9_DERB:A10","CH_97E9_DERB:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:D6","text":"Epistemic specialization produces its own boundary by relinquishing everything outside the object and allowing it to remain as black ignorance alongside knowledge.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERB:A11","CH_97E9_DERB:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:D7","text":"The bleeding wounds serve as visible proof that knowledge is gained not abstractly, but bodily and at one's own cost.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERB:A10","CH_97E9_DERB:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:D8","text":"Zarathustra is determined simultaneously as the cause of the harm, as the object of knowledge, as a protective power, and as a possible repairer.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERB:A8","CH_97E9_DERB:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:SD1","text":"Epistemic rigor and bodily injury follow the same structure: both penetrate, through limitation, cutting, and deprivation, toward a finite ground.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERB:A9","CH_97E9_DERB:A10","CH_97E9_DERB:A11","CH_97E9_DERB:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:SD2","text":"Homeland denotes not primarily a place, but a domain of knowledge formed through exclusive mastery, whose sovereignty is contested by Zarathustra.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERB:A7","CH_97E9_DERB:A10","CH_97E9_DERB:A11","CH_97E9_DERB:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:SD3","text":"Transformation through naming does not abolish violence, but transfers it into an asymmetrical order of veneration, apprehension, and protection.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERB:A3","CH_97E9_DERB:A6","CH_97E9_DERB:A8","CH_97E9_DERB:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:SD4","text":"The assertion of a comprehensive world arises precisely from radical narrowing onto a single object.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERB:A9","CH_97E9_DERB:A10","CH_97E9_DERB:A11","CH_97E9_DERB:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:SD5","text":"Reconciliation remains structurally incomplete because Zarathustra is at once interpreter, cause of the wound, object of veneration, and promised compensator.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERB:A4","CH_97E9_DERB:A8","CH_97E9_DERB:A13","CH_97E9_DERB:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:DNX1","text":"Excluded is a knowledge that would be at once limitless, complete, and without self-limitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a cognition that manages without bodily participation, vulnerability, and cost.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a pure reciprocity without appropriation, naming, or dominion over the interpretive framework.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:DNX4","text":"Excluded is an identity that could exist without demarcation against a not-knowing and without rejection of foreign images.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:DNX5","text":"Excluded is a private territory that remains permanently closed against foreign claims.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:DNX6","text":"Excluded is a healing that does not further work through the original act of misnaming and injury.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:SNX1","text":"Unmediated truth without selection, exclusion, and injury is unavailable within the system.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:SNX2","text":"A complete spirit without black ignorance remains impossible, because its precision rests on a boundary.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:SNX3","text":"A pure closeness without asymmetry remains barred, because even the reconciling analogy forces the other beneath a foreign image.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:SNX4","text":"Final repair remains absent because the encounter is interrupted by a new cry for help before its resolution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:FGS1","text":"Deep reflection → inattention to what is near → unintended touch → mutual fright.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:FGS2","text":"Mutual fright → reflexive violence → subsequent reflection → apology.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:FGS3","text":"Apology → parable of shared solitude → offered closeness → effacement of singularity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:FGS4","text":"Effacement of singularity → rejection of the parable → assertion of one's own identity and one's own territory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:FGS5","text":"Bleeding injury → claim to protection and dominion → competing determination of the realm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:FGS6","text":"Naming of Zarathustra → affective reversal → recoding of the injurer as the revered conscience-leech.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:FGS7","text":"Veneration → self-definition of the conscientious one → strict limitation to a single object.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:FGS8","text":"Limitation to the leech's brain → exclusion of everything else → black ignorance as a condition of knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:FGS9","text":"Spirit as life-cutting force → one's own blood as the cost of knowledge → bodily wound as visible evidence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:FGS10","text":"Visible evidence → invitation and promised restitution → external cry for help → deferred reconciliation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:AF1","text":"Reflective depth → unintended stepping → violence of fright → recognized folly → parable of shared solitude → renewed injury through false equation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:AF2","text":"Rejection of the parable → competing territorial claims → naming of Zarathustra → veneration of the injurer → confession of radical limitation of knowledge → bloody evidence → announced but interrupted repair.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:ME1","text":"The accident is remapped from a mere assault into a misdirected encounter between two isolated beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:ME2","text":"The parable loses its function as an instrument of reconciliation and becomes visible as a potential form of renewed violence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:ME3","text":"“Homeland” is shifted from spatial belonging to a domain of dominion constituted by knowledge and politically contested.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:ME4","text":"Knowledge is no longer classified by extent, but by groundedness, limitation, and probity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:ME5","text":"The opposition between body and spirit collapses because cognition becomes visible as bodily wounding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:ME6","text":"Zarathustra is moved from the role of mere interlocutor into the composite position of perpetrator, teacher, prey, protective power, and possible healer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** An unintended step, a bleeding arm, a dispute, an apology, and an interrupted invitation organize the visible action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** The action rests on the conjunction of solitude, misnaming, competing sovereignty, and radical specialization of knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** The text frames exact cognition as strategic self-limitation and at the same time shows that every interpretation of the other can turn into appropriation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Spirit is an activity that cuts into life; knowledge arises in finite bodily time, while the promised restoration is deferred to an unredeemed later moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the transition from unintended touch through failed analogy and epistemic self-limitation to deferred repair.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is whether the conscientious one's rigor is primarily affirmed, ironized, or at once admired and problematized.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0029","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0032","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as knowledge is understood as a limited, bodily, and excluding practice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:MRT4","text":"Its strongest connection lies between the limited ground, the blood of the body, and the spirit that cuts into life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:MRT5","text":"The reconstruction depends on the superimposition of the images dog, leech, cupping glass, and wound; a complete conceptual unification would efface the text's tension.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:MRT6","text":"The central unresolved fault line lies between shared solitude and singular self-assertion, as well as between Zarathustra's protection and dominion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERB:MRT7","text":"The text's actual form of movement is preserved so long as repair is reconstructed not as accomplished, but as a possibility interrupted by the cry for help.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERB:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_DERB@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_DERB:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 130","title":"The Leech","context":"Chapter 130","original_title":"Der Blutegel","original_context":"Chapter 130"},"original_title":"Der Blutegel","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13","layer":"CH","title":"The Magician · 1","order":131,"parents":["RAW_97E9_1_13"],"revision":"CH_97E9_1_13@R001","sha256":"973a25cd7ffdeca47454543314ce435c1c984ee397b700f431047ef8dfd08c22","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:AS1","text":"Zarathustra deutet einen Nothschrei als mögliches Zeichen des höheren Menschen und setzt zur Hilfe an.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:AS2","text":"Die erwartete Erhöhung wird als zitternder, unzugänglicher Zusammenbruch eines alten Mannes sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:AS3","text":"Die misslingende Hilfe überführt den körperlichen Zusammenbruch in eine existentielle Struktur der Verlassenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:AS4","text":"Die Klage externalisiert den namenlosen Gedanken als verborgenen Jäger und unbekannten Gott, der nicht tötet, sondern quält und eindringt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:AS5","text":"Der Sprecher widersteht der Unterwerfung und verlangt zugleich Wärme, Liebe, Lösegeld und die vollständige Beziehung zum Peiniger.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:AS6","text":"Der Rückzug des Peinigers verwandelt den Feind in den letzten einzigen Gefährten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:AS7","text":"Das diagnostisch-metaphysische Argument bewegt sich von der fehlgeleiteten Rettung über die innere Verfolgung zur Identität von Schmerz, letzter Einsamkeit und letztem Glück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:A1","text":"Zarathustra deutet den Nothschrei als Hinweis auf einen höheren Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:A2","text":"Die angetroffene Figur ist kein souveräner Erhöhter, sondern ein zitternder alter Mann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:A3","text":"Der Zusammengebrochene nimmt die Anwesenheit des Helfers nicht auf und kann durch äußere Hilfe nicht aufgerichtet werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:A4","text":"Die Klage verschränkt einen unbenannten Gedanken mit einem verhüllten, unbekannten Gott.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:A5","text":"Dieser Gedanke-Gott erscheint als Jäger, der quält, in das Herz eindringt und die geheimsten Gedanken erhorchen will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:A6","text":"Die verfolgende Instanz zielt auf fortgesetzte Marter und nicht auf den Tod des Sprechers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:A7","text":"Der Sprecher weist die hundeartige Unterwerfung zurück und bewahrt seinen Stolz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:A8","text":"Derselbe Sprecher verlangt nach heißen Händen, Liebe und einem wärmenden Gegenüber.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:A9","text":"Das mögliche Lösegeld wird auf die vollständige Person des Sprechers zugespitzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:A10","text":"Der Sprecher bezeichnet sich zugleich als Wild, Gefangenen, Gegner und Opfer des unbekannten Gottes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:A11","text":"Der Rückzug des Peinigers erzeugt nicht Befreiung, sondern den Wunsch nach seiner Rückkehr.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:A12","text":"Der unbekannte Gott wird am Ende als Schmerz und letztes Glück bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:NX1","text":"Der Titel des höheren Menschen garantiert keine Erhöhung, Selbstbeherrschung oder Rettungsfähigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:NX2","text":"Äußere Hilfe genügt nicht, um den Zusammengebrochenen wieder auf die Beine zu stellen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:NX3","text":"Der Gegner bleibt unbenannt und unbekannt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:NX4","text":"Die Verfolgung ist nicht auf Tötung oder endgültige Beendigung gerichtet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:NX5","text":"Die Beziehung ist keine einfache Feindschaft, weil der Sprecher die Rückkehr des Feindes verlangt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:NX6","text":"Die gewünschte Nähe ist keine vorbehaltlose Unterwerfung wie die eines Hundes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:NX7","text":"Der Gott ist nicht als tröstende, benennbare oder versöhnende Instanz verfügbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:NX8","text":"Einsamkeit wird nicht durch gewöhnliche menschliche Anwesenheit aufgehoben, sondern an den Peiniger gebunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:D1","text":"Die erste Deutung des Nothschreis als Zeichen höherer Existenz wird durch die Erscheinung des alten Mannes in eine Fehlidentifikation überführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_13:A1","CH_97E9_1_13:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:D2","text":"Das Scheitern der Hilfe zeigt, dass der Zusammenbruch nicht als bloß körperlicher Zustand behandelt werden kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_13:A2","CH_97E9_1_13:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:D3","text":"Der unbekannte Gott fungiert für den Sprecher als verfolgende Gestalt eines Gedankens, nicht als stabil bestimmbares metaphysisches Gegenüber.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_13:A4","CH_97E9_1_13:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:D4","text":"Die Marter dient der Aufrechterhaltung einer Beziehung, weil sie weder durch Tod noch durch Erlösung beendet werden soll.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_13:A5","CH_97E9_1_13:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:D5","text":"Der Stolz hebt die Abhängigkeit nicht auf, sondern bestimmt ihre Form als widerständige Feindschaft.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_13:A7","CH_97E9_1_13:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:D6","text":"Die Forderung nach dem ganzen Selbst macht die Verfolgung zu einem Anspruch auf totale Aneignung.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_13:A5","CH_97E9_1_13:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:D7","text":"Die Selbstbeschreibung als Wild und Gefangener verbindet Widerstand, Ausgeliefertsein und Bindung in einer einzigen Subjektposition.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_13:A7","CH_97E9_1_13:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:D8","text":"Der Weggang des Gegners wird als Verlust erfahren und erzeugt die Bitte um erneute Qual.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_13:A10","CH_97E9_1_13:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:D9","text":"Schmerz kann als Glück erscheinen, sobald er die letzte verfügbare Verbindung zum unbekannten Gegenüber bildet.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_13:A11","CH_97E9_1_13:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:SD1","text":"Die Figur des höheren Menschen wird vom positiven Ideal zur Krisenform umkartiert, in der Erhöhung nur als äußerste Ausgesetztheit erscheint.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_13:A1","CH_97E9_1_13:A2","CH_97E9_1_13:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:SD2","text":"Der unbekannte Gott bildet eine relationale Struktur aus Verfolgung, Eindringen, Anspruch und Rückzug, durch die der Sprecher erst als Subjekt seiner Klage bestimmt wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_13:A4","CH_97E9_1_13:A5","CH_97E9_1_13:A9","CH_97E9_1_13:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:SD3","text":"Der Stolz ist nicht das Gegenprinzip der Abhängigkeit, sondern das Verfahren, in dem Abhängigkeit als Forderung, Herausforderung und Verweigerung artikuliert wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_13:A7","CH_97E9_1_13:A8","CH_97E9_1_13:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:SD4","text":"Feindschaft wird zur Bedingung von Gesellschaft, weil der Peiniger als einziger Gefährte gerade durch seine Grausamkeit unverzichtbar wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_13:A6","CH_97E9_1_13:A10","CH_97E9_1_13:A11","CH_97E9_1_13:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:SD5","text":"Die innerste Subjektivität erscheint nicht als geschützter Innenraum, sondern als umkämpftes Gebiet, dessen Durchdringung zugleich Verletzung und Bindung erzeugt.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_13:A4","CH_97E9_1_13:A5","CH_97E9_1_13:A9","CH_97E9_1_13:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt die Möglichkeit aus, dass ein äußerer Helfer den Zusammenbruch durch bloße Wiederherstellung beheben kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:DNX2","text":"Es schließt eine Auflösung aus, die im Tod, in der Heilung oder in einem abschließenden Ende der Marter bestünde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:DNX3","text":"Es schließt einen eindeutig benennbaren, wohlwollenden und nichtverfolgenden Gott aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:DNX4","text":"Es schließt eine klare Trennung zwischen innerem Gedanken und äußerem Gegner aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:DNX5","text":"Es schließt Liebe als von Schmerz, Feindschaft und totalem Anspruch unabhängige Beziehung aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:DNX6","text":"Es schließt ein autonomes Subjekt aus, das seine Identität außerhalb der Verfolgungsbeziehung sichern könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:SNX1","text":"Eine versöhnte Transzendenz, die den Antagonismus beendet und den Sprecher endgültig befreit, ist nicht verfügbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:SNX2","text":"Eine Form von Einsamkeit, die durch Unabhängigkeit überwunden werden könnte, ist ausgeschlossen; verfügbar bleibt nur die Bindung an den Peiniger.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:SNX3","text":"Die stabile Unterscheidung zwischen Gedanke, Gott, Feind, Gefährte, Schmerz und Glück wird strukturell unhaltbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:SNX4","text":"Das System umkreist die Unmöglichkeit, dass Nähe ohne Verletzung und Abwesenheit ohne Verlust existiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:FGS1","text":"Nothschrei → Zuschreibung des höheren Menschen → Annäherung zur Rettung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:FGS2","text":"Annäherung → Enthüllung des alten Mannes → Scheitern der Aufrichtung → Diagnose der Verlassenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:FGS3","text":"Verlassenheit → Externalisierung des unbenannten Gedankens → Jäger-, Folterer- und Gottesfigur.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:FGS4","text":"Verfolgung → Eindringen in Herz und Gedanken → Frage nach Zweck, Begehren und Lösegeld.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:FGS5","text":"Lösegeldfrage → Forderung nach dem ganzen Selbst → Verschärfung des totalen Anspruchs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:FGS6","text":"Totaler Anspruch → Wechsel von Stolz, Widerstand, Unterwerfungsangebot und Selbstbehauptung → Identität als Wild und Gefangener.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:FGS7","text":"Rückzug des Peinigers → Entzug der einzigen Beziehung → Umkehr von Feindschaft in Sehnsucht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:FGS8","text":"Sehnsucht nach der Rückkehr → Requalifikation der Marter als Schmerz und letztes Glück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:AF1","text":"Nothschrei → Fehlidentifikation als höherer Mensch → Konfrontation mit hilflosem alten Mann → Scheitern äußerer Hilfe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:AF2","text":"Scheitern der Hilfe → Verlassenheit → verborgener Gedanke-Gott → invasive Verfolgung → Forderung nach totaler Preisgabe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:AF3","text":"Stolze Verweigerung der Unterwerfung → Anerkennung als Wild und Gefangener → Flucht des Feindes → Bitte um Rückkehr → Schmerz als letztes Glück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:ME1","text":"Der „höhere Mensch“ wird von einer Rang- und Idealbezeichnung zu einer diagnostischen Krisenkategorie umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:ME2","text":"Der Gegensatz von äußerem Gott und innerem Gedanken bricht zusammen; beide werden als eine unbestimmbare Verfolgungsinstanz lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:ME3","text":"Der Gegensatz von Feindschaft und Liebe wird als simultane Struktur derselben Beziehung neu klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:ME4","text":"Einsamkeit erscheint nicht mehr als bloße Abwesenheit, sondern als Abhängigkeit von der einzigen verfügbaren Gegenmacht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:ME5","text":"Schmerz wird vom bloßen negativen Zustand zum Medium von Anwesenheit, Bindung und Glück umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:ME6","text":"Stolz und Unterwerfung werden nicht als getrennte Haltungen, sondern als gegensätzliche Bewegungen innerhalb desselben Begehrens sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Ein alter Mann liegt zitternd am Boden und richtet eine wechselnde Anklage und Bitte an einen unbekannten Gott.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Die Szene organisiert eine nicht behebbare Beziehung aus Verfolgung, innerem Eindringen, Stolz, Bedürftigkeit und Entzug.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Die anfängliche Rettungsperspektive wird in eine Diagnose umgedreht, in der Widerstand die Bindung an den Gegner nicht beendet, sondern intensiviert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Sein und Beziehung werden durch wiederholte Annäherung, Marter und Rückkehr konstituiert; der unbekannte Gott bleibt zugleich verborgen, intim, feindlich und glücksstiftend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von der Fehlidentifikation über die Verfolgungsstruktur zur Umkehr von Schmerz in Glück zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob der unbekannte Gott als wirkliche Gottheit, als Gedanke, als psychische Instanz oder als unentscheidbare Verschmelzung dieser Ebenen zu verstehen ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:MRT3","text":"Ebenfalls offen bleibt, ob „höherer Mensch“ eine ironisch entwertete Kategorie oder eine durch Leiden neu bestimmte Kategorie bezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:MRT4","text":"Die interne Kohärenz liegt in der relationalen Umkehr: Der Peiniger ist nur als Feind Gefährte, und sein Entzug wird als Verlust erfahren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Spannung besteht zwischen der Zurückweisung hundeartiger Unterwerfung und dem Wunsch nach vollständiger Nähe, Wärme und Rückkehr.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere ungelöste Spannung besteht darin, dass der Gott unbekannt bleiben soll, während ihm zugleich intimste Kenntnis und vollständiger Zugriff zugeschrieben werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, sofern sie die lyrische Wiederholung nicht als bloße Ausschmückung, sondern als Erzeugung der rekursiven Bindung behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T185719817668Z_b80b6280","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"1.","source_sha256":"973a25cd7ffdeca47454543314ce435c1c984ee397b700f431047ef8dfd08c22","sha256":"08f1c5efe75bee030524b66b991048ab4592d8dc27040dc26261e36e4e3c07db","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T18:57:19.819683+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:AS1","text":"Zarathustra interprets a cry of distress as a possible sign of the higher human being and sets out to help.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:AS2","text":"The expected elevation becomes visible as the trembling, inaccessible collapse of an old man.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:AS3","text":"The failed assistance transforms the physical collapse into an existential structure of abandonment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:AS4","text":"The lament externalizes the nameless thought as a hidden hunter and unknown god, who does not kill but tortures and penetrates.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:AS5","text":"The speaker resists submission while at the same time demanding warmth, love, ransom, and a complete relationship with the tormentor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:AS6","text":"The tormentor's withdrawal transforms the enemy into the last and only companion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:AS7","text":"The diagnostic-metaphysical argument moves from misguided rescue through inner persecution to the identity of pain, ultimate loneliness, and ultimate happiness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:A1","text":"Zarathustra interprets the cry of distress as an indication of a higher human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:A2","text":"The figure encountered is not a sovereign elevated one, but a trembling old man.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:A3","text":"The collapsed man does not register the helper's presence and cannot be raised up through external help.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:A4","text":"The lament intertwines an unnamed thought with a veiled, unknown god.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:A5","text":"This thought-god appears as a hunter who tortures, penetrates the heart, and wishes to overhear the most secret thoughts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:A6","text":"The persecuting instance aims at continued torment rather than at the speaker's death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:A7","text":"The speaker rejects dog-like submission and preserves his pride.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:A8","text":"The same speaker longs for hot hands, love, and a warming counterpart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:A9","text":"The possible ransom is sharpened into the speaker's complete person.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:A10","text":"The speaker describes himself simultaneously as game, prisoner, adversary, and victim of the unknown god.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:A11","text":"The tormentor's withdrawal produces not liberation but the wish for his return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:A12","text":"At the end, the unknown god is determined as pain and ultimate happiness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:NX1","text":"The title of the higher human being guarantees neither elevation, self-mastery, nor capacity for salvation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:NX2","text":"External help is insufficient to set the collapsed man back on his feet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:NX3","text":"The adversary remains unnamed and unknown.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:NX4","text":"The persecution is not directed toward killing or definitive termination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:NX5","text":"The relation is not simple enmity, because the speaker demands the enemy's return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:NX6","text":"The desired proximity is not unconditional submission like that of a dog.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:NX7","text":"The god is not available as a consoling, nameable, or reconciling instance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:NX8","text":"Loneliness is not abolished by ordinary human presence but is bound to the tormentor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:D1","text":"The initial interpretation of the cry of distress as a sign of higher existence is converted into a misidentification by the appearance of the old man.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_13:A1","CH_97E9_1_13:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:D2","text":"The failure of assistance shows that the collapse cannot be treated as a merely physical condition.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_13:A2","CH_97E9_1_13:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:D3","text":"For the speaker, the unknown god functions as the persecuting figure of a thought, not as a stably determinable metaphysical counterpart.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_13:A4","CH_97E9_1_13:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:D4","text":"The torment serves to sustain a relationship because it is not to be ended by either death or redemption.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_13:A5","CH_97E9_1_13:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:D5","text":"Pride does not abolish dependence but determines its form as resistant enmity.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_13:A7","CH_97E9_1_13:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:D6","text":"The demand for the whole self makes the persecution into a claim to total appropriation.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_13:A5","CH_97E9_1_13:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:D7","text":"The self-description as game and prisoner combines resistance, helpless exposure, and binding in a single subject-position.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_13:A7","CH_97E9_1_13:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:D8","text":"The adversary's departure is experienced as loss and produces the plea for renewed torment.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_13:A10","CH_97E9_1_13:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:D9","text":"Pain can appear as happiness once it constitutes the last available connection to the unknown counterpart.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_13:A11","CH_97E9_1_13:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:SD1","text":"The figure of the higher human being is remapped from a positive ideal to a form of crisis in which elevation appears only as extreme exposure.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_13:A1","CH_97E9_1_13:A2","CH_97E9_1_13:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:SD2","text":"The unknown god forms a relational structure of persecution, penetration, claim, and withdrawal, through which the speaker is first determined as the subject of his lament.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_13:A4","CH_97E9_1_13:A5","CH_97E9_1_13:A9","CH_97E9_1_13:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:SD3","text":"Pride is not the counter-principle of dependence but the procedure in which dependence is articulated as demand, challenge, and refusal.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_13:A7","CH_97E9_1_13:A8","CH_97E9_1_13:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:SD4","text":"Enmity becomes the condition of companionship because the tormentor becomes indispensable as the only companion precisely through his cruelty.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_13:A6","CH_97E9_1_13:A10","CH_97E9_1_13:A11","CH_97E9_1_13:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:SD5","text":"The innermost subjectivity appears not as a protected interior space but as contested territory, whose penetration simultaneously produces injury and binding.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_13:A4","CH_97E9_1_13:A5","CH_97E9_1_13:A9","CH_97E9_1_13:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:DNX1","text":"The system excludes the possibility that an external helper can remedy the collapse through mere restoration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:DNX2","text":"It excludes a resolution consisting in death, healing, or a conclusive end to the torment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:DNX3","text":"It excludes an unambiguously nameable, benevolent, and non-persecuting god.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:DNX4","text":"It excludes a clear separation between inner thought and external adversary.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:DNX5","text":"It excludes love as a relationship independent of pain, enmity, and total claim.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:DNX6","text":"It excludes an autonomous subject that could secure its identity outside the relationship of persecution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:SNX1","text":"A reconciled transcendence that ends antagonism and definitively liberates the speaker is not available.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:SNX2","text":"A form of loneliness that could be overcome through independence is excluded; only the bond to the tormentor remains available.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:SNX3","text":"The stable distinction between thought, god, enemy, companion, pain, and happiness becomes structurally untenable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:SNX4","text":"The system circles around the impossibility that proximity exists without injury and absence without loss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:FGS1","text":"Cry of distress → attribution of the higher human being → approach for rescue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:FGS2","text":"Approach → revelation of the old man → failure of raising up → diagnosis of abandonment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:FGS3","text":"Abandonment → externalization of the unnamed thought → figure of hunter, torturer, and god.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:FGS4","text":"Persecution → penetration into heart and thoughts → question of purpose, desire, and ransom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:FGS5","text":"Question of ransom → demand for the whole self → intensification of the total claim.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:FGS6","text":"Total claim → alternation of pride, resistance, offer of submission, and self-assertion → identity as game and prisoner.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:FGS7","text":"Withdrawal of the tormentor → deprivation of the only relationship → reversal of enmity into longing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:FGS8","text":"Longing for return → requalification of torment as pain and ultimate happiness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:AF1","text":"Cry of distress → misidentification as higher human being → confrontation with helpless old man → failure of external help.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:AF2","text":"Failure of assistance → abandonment → hidden thought-god → invasive persecution → demand for total surrender.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:AF3","text":"Proud refusal of submission → recognition as game and prisoner → flight of the enemy → plea for return → pain as ultimate happiness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:ME1","text":"The “higher human being” is remapped from a designation of rank and ideal into a diagnostic category of crisis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:ME2","text":"The opposition between external god and inner thought collapses; both become legible as one indeterminate persecuting instance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:ME3","text":"The opposition between enmity and love is reclassified as a simultaneous structure of the same relationship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:ME4","text":"Loneliness no longer appears as mere absence but as dependence on the only available counterforce.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:ME5","text":"Pain is remapped from a merely negative state into a medium of presence, binding, and happiness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:ME6","text":"Pride and submission become visible not as separate attitudes but as opposing movements within the same desire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** An old man lies trembling on the ground and addresses an alternating accusation and plea to an unknown god.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** The scene organizes an irreparable relationship of persecution, inner penetration, pride, neediness, and withdrawal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** The initial perspective of rescue is reversed into a diagnosis in which resistance does not end the bond to the adversary but intensifies it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Being and relationship are constituted through repeated approach, torment, and return; the unknown god remains at once hidden, intimate, hostile, and productive of happiness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from misidentification through the structure of persecution to the reversal of pain into happiness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether the unknown god is to be understood as an actual deity, as a thought, as a psychic instance, or as an undecidable fusion of these levels.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:MRT3","text":"Likewise unresolved is whether “higher human being” designates an ironically devalued category or a category newly determined through suffering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:MRT4","text":"The internal coherence lies in the relational reversal: the tormentor is a companion only as an enemy, and his withdrawal is experienced as loss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:MRT5","text":"The strongest tension consists between the rejection of dog-like submission and the desire for complete proximity, warmth, and return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:MRT6","text":"A further unresolved tension consists in the fact that the god is to remain unknown while at the same time the most intimate knowledge and complete access are ascribed to him.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_13:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument insofar as it treats lyrical repetition not as mere ornamentation but as the production of recursive binding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_13:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_1_13@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_1_13:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"The Magician","source_section_label":"1.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Four and Last"],"reading_title":"The Magician · 1","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","The Magician","1."],"original_title":"1."}],"source_title_context":"Der Zauberer","source_section_label":"1.","source_title_hierarchy":["Vierter und letzter Theil"],"reading_title":"The Magician · 1","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","The Magician","1."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 131","title":"The Magician · 1","context":"Part Four and Last","original_context":"Vierter und letzter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Der Zauberer · 1"},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13","layer":"CH","title":"The Magician · 2","order":132,"parents":["RAW_97E9_2_13"],"revision":"CH_97E9_2_13@R001","sha256":"ba5ebd683f68ae0aeb0fcfea5755435d2fc3aa5435b959420055c3b92743475a","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:AS1","text":"Eine gespielte Not erzeugt das Problem, Wahrheit und Täuschung nicht mehr unmittelbar unterscheiden zu können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:AS2","text":"Zarathustra bestimmt die Notdarstellung als Prüfung und Betrug und beantwortet sie durch gewaltsame Entlarvung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:AS3","text":"Unter dem Zwang der Entlarvung zerfällt die Täuschung nicht vollständig, sondern gibt eine Mischung aus Spiel, Ernst, Erschöpfung und Selbstverneinung frei.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:AS4","text":"Authentizität erscheint nur als kurzer Einbruch innerhalb der Lüge: im Ekel und im Eingeständnis, nicht groß zu sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:AS5","text":"Die Prüfung kehrt sich um, weil der Zauberer nun einen echten, eindeutigen großen Menschen sucht und Zarathustra selbst als mögliches Ziel benennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:AS6","text":"Zarathustra bestätigt diese Identifikation nicht, verweist die Suche in seine Höhle und erklärt die Gegenwart als eine Ordnung, in der der Pöbel Größe durch Aufblähung ersetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:A1","text":"Eine Darstellung von Not kann als absichtlich gesetzte Prüfung eines anderen dienen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:A2","text":"Die Kunst des alten Zauberers besteht in Täuschung, Mehrdeutigkeit und inszenierter Selbstverstellung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:A3","text":"Die Täuschung des Zauberers enthält zugleich Spiel und Ernst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:A4","text":"Zarathustra begegnet der Täuschung ohne Vorsicht und erzwingt durch Härte eine Offenlegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:A5","text":"Der Zauberer hat einen großen Menschen dargestellt, ohne die dafür erforderliche Größe zu besitzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:A6","text":"Der Zauberer ist seiner eigenen Künste müde und gegen sich selbst nicht mehr vollständig zur Lüge fähig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:A7","text":"Ekel und das Eingeständnis, nicht groß zu sein, bilden die authentischsten Äußerungen des Zauberers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:A8","text":"Diese Authentizität ist nur für einen Augenblick gegeben und bildet keine stabile Identität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:A9","text":"Der Zauberer sucht einen echten, einfachen, eindeutigen und redlichen großen Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:A10","text":"Der Zauberer richtet diese Suche auf Zarathustra.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:A11","text":"Zarathustra hat nach eigener Aussage noch keinen großen Menschen gesehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:A12","text":"Die Gegenwart wird als Reich des Pöbels bestimmt, dessen Urteil zwischen Größe und Kleinheit nicht zuverlässig unterscheidet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:A13","text":"Öffentliche Größe erscheint als Aufblähung, die bei näherer Prüfung in sich zusammenfällt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:A14","text":"In einer solchen Gegenwart gelingt die Suche nach Größe scheinbar nur dem Narren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0037","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:NX1","text":"Gespielte Not ist kein unmittelbarer Beweis wirklicher Not.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:NX2","text":"Die Erklärung, alles sei nur Spiel gewesen, beseitigt den Ernst der Handlung nicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:NX3","text":"Der Zauberer ist kein eindeutiger Wahrheitsredner, sondern bleibt Schauspieler und Falschmünzer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:NX4","text":"Der Zauberer ist nicht groß.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:NX5","text":"Kein Wort des Zauberers gilt uneingeschränkt als echt; als verbleibende Wahrheit bleibt der Ekel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:NX6","text":"Öffentliche Anerkennung, Aufblähung und äußerer Eindruck sind keine gültigen Kriterien für Größe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:NX7","text":"Zarathustra behauptet nicht, bereits einen großen Menschen gefunden zu haben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:NX8","text":"Die gegenwärtige Ordnung stellt keinen verlässlichen sozialen Ort bereit, an dem Größe erkannt werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:D1","text":"Die dargestellte Not wird von einem Wahrheitsanspruch in eine Prüfungstechnik umklassifiziert.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_13:A1","CH_97E9_2_13:A2","CH_97E9_2_13:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:D2","text":"Die gewaltsame Entlarvung erzeugt keine reine Wahrheit, sondern ein Eingeständnis, in dem Täuschung und Ernst ineinanderstehen.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_13:A3","CH_97E9_2_13:A4","CH_97E9_2_13:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:D3","text":"Das Eingeständnis, nicht groß zu sein, wird als die ehrlichste Leistung des Zauberers bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_13:A5","CH_97E9_2_13:A6","CH_97E9_2_13:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:D4","text":"Authentizität erscheint als begrenzter Augenblick der Selbstentzauberung und nicht als dauerhafte Beschaffenheit des Subjekts.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_13:A6","CH_97E9_2_13:A7","CH_97E9_2_13:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:D5","text":"Die ursprüngliche Prüfung Zarathustras verwandelt sich in eine Suche des Prüfers nach Zarathustra.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_13:A1","CH_97E9_2_13:A9","CH_97E9_2_13:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:D6","text":"Zarathustras Verweisung auf die Höhle und die Tiere verschiebt die Identifikation des großen Menschen, ohne sie zu bestätigen.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_13:A10","CH_97E9_2_13:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:D7","text":"Die öffentliche Zuschreibung von Größe wird als Prozess der Aufblähung und anschließenden Entleerung bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_13:A12","CH_97E9_2_13:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:D8","text":"Die Suche nach Größe bleibt offen, weil weder der soziale Maßstab noch Zarathustras eigene Stellung einen abschließenden Beweis liefern.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_13:A10","CH_97E9_2_13:A11","CH_97E9_2_13:A12","CH_97E9_2_13:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:SD1","text":"Wahrheit entsteht nicht außerhalb der Täuschung, sondern als Bruch innerhalb einer Täuschung, die ihre eigene Grenze eingesteht.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_13:A2","CH_97E9_2_13:A3","CH_97E9_2_13:A6","CH_97E9_2_13:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:SD2","text":"Die Prüfung ist wechselseitig: Der Zauberer prüft Zarathustra durch Inszenierung, Zarathustra prüft den Zauberer durch Gewalt, und beide legen dabei ihre eigene Form der Verstellung offen.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_13:A1","CH_97E9_2_13:A2","CH_97E9_2_13:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:SD3","text":"Größe wird weder durch Selbstinszenierung noch durch öffentliche Anerkennung gesichert, sondern zunächst durch die Negation von Verstellung, Aufblähung und Selbstüberschätzung bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_13:A5","CH_97E9_2_13:A9","CH_97E9_2_13:A12","CH_97E9_2_13:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:SD4","text":"Die Gegenwart macht Größe nicht nur selten, sondern strukturell schwer erkennbar, weil ihr Maßstab selbst aus der Masse hervorgeht.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_13:A11","CH_97E9_2_13:A12","CH_97E9_2_13:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:SD5","text":"Zarathustra wird zum möglichen Gegenstand der Suche, ohne als deren erfülltes Ergebnis aufzutreten; seine Autorität beruht daher auf der Aufrechterhaltung der Unentschiedenheit.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_13:A9","CH_97E9_2_13:A10","CH_97E9_2_13:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt eine stabile Trennung zwischen Wahrheit und Lüge aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:DNX2","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass ein Subjekt durch Selbstbeschreibung oder öffentliche Darstellung seine Größe beweisen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:DNX3","text":"Das System schließt ein Leiden als privilegierten Zugang zur Wahrheit aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:DNX4","text":"Das System schließt ein unabhängiges soziales Kriterium der Größe aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:DNX5","text":"Das System schließt eine vollständige, dauerhafte Selbsttransparenz des Zauberers aus, obwohl es einen begrenzten Moment der Selbstentzauberung zulässt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:DNX6","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass die gesuchte Größe bereits durch ihre Benennung oder durch Zarathustras Gegenwart garantiert ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:SNX1","text":"Es fehlt ein stabiler Maßstab, durch den ein großer Mensch sicher identifiziert werden könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:SNX2","text":"Es fehlt eine reine Authentizität außerhalb von Darstellung, Rolle und sprachlicher Verstellung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:SNX3","text":"Es fehlt eine abschließende Entscheidung darüber, ob Zarathustra der gesuchte große Mensch ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:SNX4","text":"Es fehlt eine Gegenwart, in der Größe als solche sozial sichtbar und anerkennbar wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:SNX5","text":"Die Kraft des Arguments beruht auf der versperrten Möglichkeit, dass Wahrheit, Größe und Eindeutigkeit in einer einzigen stabilen Gestalt zusammenfallen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:FGS1","text":"Inszenierte Not → affektive Erfassung → körperliche Gegenwehr.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:FGS2","text":"Körperliche Gegenwehr → Entlarvung als Schauspiel und Falschmünzerei → Eingeständnis einer Prüfung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:FGS3","text":"Eingeständnis der Prüfung → Auflösung der reinen Spielbehauptung → Koexistenz von Lüge und Ernst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:FGS4","text":"Koexistenz von Lüge und Ernst → Diagnose der Selbstverstellung → Restwahrheit als Ekel und Eingeständnis der Nicht-Größe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:FGS5","text":"Restwahrheit → begrenzte Selbstentzauberung → Suche nach einem echten, eindeutigen großen Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:FGS6","text":"Suche nach dem großen Menschen → Benennung Zarathustras → Rollenwechsel vom Prüfer zum möglichen Prüfobjekt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:FGS7","text":"Benennung Zarathustras → Verweisung in Höhle und Tierordnung → Aussetzung der Selbstidentifikation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:FGS8","text":"Aussetzung der Selbstidentifikation → Kritik des pöbelhaften Maßstabs → Größe als sozial verdeckte und nicht abschließend verfügbare Möglichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:FGS9","text":"Verdeckte Möglichkeit → offener Suchprozess → Zarathustras getrösteter und lachender Abgang.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:AF1","text":"Gespielte Not → Prüfung → gewaltsame Entlarvung → erzwungene Teilwahrheit → Selbstdiagnose des Zauberers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:AF2","text":"Selbstdiagnose → Eingeständnis der Nicht-Größe → Suche nach einer echten Gestalt → Zarathustra als Suchobjekt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:AF3","text":"Zarathustra als Suchobjekt → Verweisung in die Höhle → Entzug der Selbstbestätigung → Demontage des öffentlichen Größenmaßstabs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:AF4","text":"Demontage des Maßstabs → Unentscheidbarkeit der Größe → offener Suchraum → lachende Fortsetzung Zarathustras.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:ME1","text":"Leidensdarstellung wird von einem Wahrheitsindiz zu einer prüfenden und manipulativen Technik umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:ME2","text":"Wahrheit und Lüge erscheinen nicht länger als ausschließende Gegensätze, sondern als verschränkte Schichten derselben Äußerung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:ME3","text":"Authentizität wird von einer festen Eigenschaft zu einem kurzzeitigen Ereignis der Selbstbegrenzung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:ME4","text":"Größe wird vom öffentlichen Eindruck auf die Negation von Aufblähung, Selbsttäuschung und Mehrdeutigkeit verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:ME5","text":"Der Prüfer und der Geprüfte werden als wechselseitig exponierte Rollen sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:ME6","text":"Zarathustra wird zugleich als möglicher Gipfel der Suche und als nicht bestätigter Gegenstand dieser Suche kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:ME7","text":"Die Masse wird nicht bloß als falsches Publikum, sondern als Produktionsapparat eines falschen Größenbegriffs klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:ALT1","text":"Surface: Ein alter Zauberer simuliert Not, wird geschlagen, gesteht seine Täuschung und sucht anschließend Zarathustra.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:ALT2","text":"Structural: Schauspiel, Prüfung, Gewalt, Selbstentzauberung und öffentliche Anerkennung bilden einen Mechanismus, in dem Wahrheit nur unter Störung der Darstellung hervortritt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Zarathustra beantwortet die Prüfung nicht durch vorsichtige Interpretation, sondern durch eine Gegenprüfung, die den Anspruch auf Größe in ein Eingeständnis der Nicht-Größe umkehrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Authentizität besitzt keine stabile Dauer; sie erscheint als Augenblick, während Größe in der Gegenwart sozial verdeckt und zeitlich nicht verfügbar ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von der gespielten Not über die Entlarvung bis zur offenen Größensuche zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob Zarathustra selbst groß ist und ob die Höhle eine tatsächliche Lösung oder nur eine weitere Verschiebung darstellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, wenn Authentizität als episodischer Bruch und nicht als dauerhafte Eigenschaft verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:MRT4","text":"Am stärksten ist das System in der Umkehrung von gespieltem Leiden, Prüfung und erzwungener Selbstoffenbarung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:MRT5","text":"Die Rekonstruktion hängt von der rhetorischen Kraft der Beschimpfungen, des Ekels und der Bilder von Aufblähung und Zerplatzen ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:MRT6","text":"Ungelöst bleiben das Verhältnis von Gewalt und Wahrheit sowie das Fehlen eines positiven Kriteriums für Größe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:MRT7","text":"Die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung bleibt erhalten: Täuschung wird nicht einfach beseitigt, sondern in eine begrenzte Wahrheit, eine umgekehrte Prüfung und eine nicht abschließbare Suche überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T190920183220Z_93d5b0b4","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"2.","source_sha256":"ba5ebd683f68ae0aeb0fcfea5755435d2fc3aa5435b959420055c3b92743475a","sha256":"50fe83cb98df9d7bb3eeb1aed6fc88f0f5099b0cdc6b80c448799f99b7fab4a2","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:09:20.185406+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:AS1","text":"A feigned distress creates the problem of no longer being able to distinguish truth and deception directly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:AS2","text":"Zarathustra determines the representation of distress as a test and deception and answers it through violent unmasking.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:AS3","text":"Under the compulsion of unmasking, the deception does not fully disintegrate, but releases a mixture of play, seriousness, exhaustion, and self-negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:AS4","text":"Authenticity appears only as a brief irruption within the lie: in disgust and in the admission of not being great.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:AS5","text":"The test reverses itself because the magician now seeks a genuine, unequivocal great human being and names Zarathustra himself as a possible goal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:AS6","text":"Zarathustra does not confirm this identification, directs the search to his cave, and explains the present as an order in which the rabble replaces greatness with inflation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:A1","text":"A representation of distress can serve as an intentionally set test of another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:A2","text":"The art of the old magician consists in deception, ambiguity, and staged self-disguise.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:A3","text":"The magician's deception contains both play and seriousness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:A4","text":"Zarathustra confronts the deception without caution and compels disclosure through harshness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:A5","text":"The magician has portrayed a great human being without possessing the greatness required for it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:A6","text":"The magician is weary of his own arts and is no longer fully capable of lying to himself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:A7","text":"Disgust and the admission of not being great constitute the magician's most authentic utterances.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:A8","text":"This authenticity is given only for a moment and does not constitute a stable identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:A9","text":"The magician seeks a genuine, simple, unequivocal, and honest great human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:A10","text":"The magician directs this search toward Zarathustra.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:A11","text":"According to his own statement, Zarathustra has not yet seen a great human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:A12","text":"The present is determined as the realm of the rabble, whose judgment does not reliably distinguish between greatness and smallness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:A13","text":"Public greatness appears as inflation that, upon closer examination, collapses into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:A14","text":"In such a present, the search for greatness seemingly succeeds only for the fool.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0037","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:NX1","text":"Feigned distress is no immediate proof of real distress.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:NX2","text":"The declaration that everything was only play does not eliminate the seriousness of the action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:NX3","text":"The magician is not an unequivocal speaker of truth, but remains an actor and counterfeiter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:NX4","text":"The magician is not great.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:NX5","text":"No word of the magician counts unconditionally as genuine; disgust remains as the residual truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:NX6","text":"Public recognition, inflation, and outward appearance are not valid criteria for greatness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:NX7","text":"Zarathustra does not claim to have already found a great human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:NX8","text":"The present order provides no reliable social place in which greatness can be recognized.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:D1","text":"The represented distress is reclassified from a claim to truth into a technique of testing.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_13:A1","CH_97E9_2_13:A2","CH_97E9_2_13:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:D2","text":"Violent unmasking produces no pure truth, but an admission in which deception and seriousness coexist.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_13:A3","CH_97E9_2_13:A4","CH_97E9_2_13:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:D3","text":"The admission of not being great is determined as the magician's most honest achievement.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_13:A5","CH_97E9_2_13:A6","CH_97E9_2_13:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:D4","text":"Authenticity appears as a limited moment of self-disenchantment and not as a lasting constitution of the subject.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_13:A6","CH_97E9_2_13:A7","CH_97E9_2_13:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:D5","text":"The original testing of Zarathustra transforms itself into a search by the tester for Zarathustra.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_13:A1","CH_97E9_2_13:A9","CH_97E9_2_13:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:D6","text":"Zarathustra's reference to the cave and the animals displaces the identification of the great human being without confirming it.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_13:A10","CH_97E9_2_13:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:D7","text":"The public attribution of greatness is determined as a process of inflation and subsequent deflation.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_13:A12","CH_97E9_2_13:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:D8","text":"The search for greatness remains open because neither the social standard nor Zarathustra's own position provides conclusive proof.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_13:A10","CH_97E9_2_13:A11","CH_97E9_2_13:A12","CH_97E9_2_13:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:SD1","text":"Truth arises not outside deception, but as a rupture within a deception that admits its own limit.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_13:A2","CH_97E9_2_13:A3","CH_97E9_2_13:A6","CH_97E9_2_13:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:SD2","text":"The test is reciprocal: the magician tests Zarathustra through staging, Zarathustra tests the magician through violence, and both thereby disclose their own form of disguise.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_13:A1","CH_97E9_2_13:A2","CH_97E9_2_13:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:SD3","text":"Greatness is secured neither through self-staging nor through public recognition, but is initially determined through the negation of disguise, inflation, and self-overestimation.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_13:A5","CH_97E9_2_13:A9","CH_97E9_2_13:A12","CH_97E9_2_13:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:SD4","text":"The present makes greatness not only rare but structurally difficult to recognize, because its standard itself arises from the mass.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_13:A11","CH_97E9_2_13:A12","CH_97E9_2_13:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:SD5","text":"Zarathustra becomes a possible object of the search without appearing as its fulfilled result; his authority therefore rests on maintaining undecidability.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_13:A9","CH_97E9_2_13:A10","CH_97E9_2_13:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:DNX1","text":"The system excludes a stable separation between truth and lie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:DNX2","text":"The system excludes that a subject can prove its greatness through self-description or public representation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:DNX3","text":"The system excludes suffering as a privileged access to truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:DNX4","text":"The system excludes an independent social criterion of greatness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:DNX5","text":"The system excludes a complete, lasting self-transparency of the magician, although it permits a limited moment of self-disenchantment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:DNX6","text":"The system excludes that the greatness sought is already guaranteed by its naming or by Zarathustra's presence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:SNX1","text":"A stable standard is lacking by which a great human being could be securely identified.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:SNX2","text":"A pure authenticity outside representation, role, and linguistic disguise is lacking.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:SNX3","text":"A conclusive decision as to whether Zarathustra is the sought great human being is lacking.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:SNX4","text":"A present is lacking in which greatness as such would be socially visible and recognizable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:SNX5","text":"The force of the argument rests on the blocked possibility that truth, greatness, and unequivocalness coincide in a single stable form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:FGS1","text":"Staged distress → affective apprehension → bodily resistance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:FGS2","text":"Bodily resistance → unmasking as acting and counterfeiting → admission of a test.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:FGS3","text":"Admission of the test → dissolution of the claim of pure play → coexistence of lie and seriousness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:FGS4","text":"Coexistence of lie and seriousness → diagnosis of self-disguise → residual truth as disgust and admission of non-greatness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:FGS5","text":"Residual truth → limited self-disenchantment → search for a genuine, unequivocal great human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:FGS6","text":"Search for the great human being → naming of Zarathustra → reversal of roles from tester to possible object of testing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:FGS7","text":"Naming of Zarathustra → reference to cave and animal order → suspension of self-identification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:FGS8","text":"Suspension of self-identification → critique of the rabble's standard → greatness as a socially concealed and not conclusively available possibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:FGS9","text":"Concealed possibility → open process of searching → Zarathustra's comforted and laughing departure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:AF1","text":"Feigned distress → test → violent unmasking → compelled partial truth → self-diagnosis of the magician.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:AF2","text":"Self-diagnosis → admission of non-greatness → search for a genuine form → Zarathustra as object of search.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:AF3","text":"Zarathustra as object of search → reference to the cave → withdrawal of self-confirmation → dismantling of the public standard of greatness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:AF4","text":"Dismantling of the standard → undecidability of greatness → open field of search → Zarathustra's laughing continuation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:ME1","text":"The representation of suffering is remapped from an indication of truth into a testing and manipulative technique.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:ME2","text":"Truth and lie no longer appear as mutually exclusive opposites, but as intertwined layers of the same utterance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:ME3","text":"Authenticity is reclassified from a fixed property into a temporary event of self-limitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:ME4","text":"Greatness is shifted from public impression to the negation of inflation, self-deception, and ambiguity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:ME5","text":"The tester and the tested become visible as mutually exposed roles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:ME6","text":"Zarathustra is mapped simultaneously as a possible summit of the search and as an unconfirmed object of this search.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:ME7","text":"The mass is classified not merely as a false audience, but as a production apparatus of a false concept of greatness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:ALT1","text":"Surface: An old magician simulates distress, is beaten, admits his deception, and subsequently seeks Zarathustra.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:ALT2","text":"Structural: Acting, testing, violence, self-disenchantment, and public recognition form a mechanism in which truth emerges only through disturbance of representation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0035","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Zarathustra answers the test not through cautious interpretation, but through a counter-test that reverses the claim to greatness into an admission of non-greatness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Authenticity has no stable duration; it appears as a moment, while greatness is socially concealed in the present and temporally unavailable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from feigned distress through unmasking to the open search for greatness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether Zarathustra himself is great and whether the cave represents an actual solution or only a further displacement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent if authenticity is understood as an episodic rupture and not as a lasting property.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:MRT4","text":"The system is strongest in the reversal of feigned suffering, testing, and compelled self-disclosure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:MRT5","text":"The reconstruction depends on the rhetorical force of the insults, disgust, and the images of inflation and bursting.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:MRT6","text":"The relation between violence and truth, as well as the absence of a positive criterion for greatness, remain unresolved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_13:MRT7","text":"The actual argumentative movement is preserved: deception is not simply eliminated, but transferred into a limited truth, a reversed test, and an unclosable search.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_13:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_2_13@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_2_13:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"The Magician","source_section_label":"2.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Four and Last"],"reading_title":"The Magician · 2","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","The Magician","2."],"original_title":"2."}],"source_title_context":"Der Zauberer","source_section_label":"2.","source_title_hierarchy":["Vierter und letzter Theil"],"reading_title":"The Magician · 2","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","The Magician","2."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 132","title":"The Magician · 2","context":"Part Four and Last","original_context":"Vierter und letzter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Der Zauberer · 2"},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD","layer":"CH","title":"Out of Service","order":133,"parents":["RAW_97E9_AUSD"],"revision":"CH_97E9_AUSD@R001","sha256":"7e7b4c982d91e2580490e4725658339724c8623ed84a6f0861b6d79f541c1afa","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:AS1","text":"Der Tod Gottes erzeugt nicht Freiheit, sondern einen Diener ohne Herrn, dessen Dienstform als erinnerungsgebundene Unfreiheit fortbesteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:AS2","text":"Die Begegnung verschiebt den Gottesverlust von einer theologischen Behauptung zu einer Diagnose verschiedener Formen von Gottlosigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:AS3","text":"Der alte Gott wird durch die Rekonstruktion seiner inneren Widersprüche delegitimiert: Liebe, Gericht, Rache, Verborgenheit und Mitleid sind unvereinbar verschränkt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:AS4","text":"Zarathustra ersetzt die Frage nach der wahren Todesursache Gottes durch die normative Feststellung seiner endgültigen Unverfügbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:AS5","text":"Die verbleibende Frömmigkeit wird als Segens-, Schutz- und Aufrichtungsfähigkeit umcodiert, ohne den toten Gott wiederherzustellen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0048","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:A1","text":"Der Tod Gottes ist innerhalb des Textes endgültig und nicht durch Erinnerung, Frömmigkeit oder Warten reversibel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0050","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:A2","text":"Die Aufhebung eines Herrn hebt die subjektive Struktur des Dienens nicht automatisch auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:A3","text":"Der Verlust eines Gottes trifft dessen Liebende und Besitzende am stärksten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:A4","text":"Gottesvorstellungen können durch die Unvereinbarkeit ihrer zugeschriebenen Eigenschaften zerfallen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:A5","text":"Liebe ist mit Lohn, Vergeltung und richtender Sanktion unvereinbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:A6","text":"Ein Gott, der seine Geschöpfe für ihr Missraten bestraft, wird als fehlgeleiteter Schöpfer entlarvt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0039","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:A7","text":"Göttliche Rede, die sich nicht rein verständlich macht, kann ihre Adressaten nicht für ihr Missverstehen verantwortlich machen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:A8","text":"Gottlosigkeit kann aus einer gesteigerten Redlichkeit und Frömmigkeit hervorgehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0042","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:A9","text":"Nach dem Tod Gottes bleibt die Fähigkeit zu segnen als nichttheistische Praxis bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0043","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:A10","text":"Zarathustras Zuständigkeit gilt dem Schutz und der Aufrichtung der Leidenden, nicht der Wiederbelebung verlorener Gottesbeziehungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0048","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:A11","text":"Die Selbstbestimmung des Schicksals setzt die Ablehnung eines unzulänglichen Gottes voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:NX1","text":"Freiheit ist nicht die bloße Abwesenheit eines Herrn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:NX2","text":"Der Gott der Liebe ist nicht zugleich ein Gott des Gerichts, der Hölle und der Vergeltung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:NX3","text":"Frömmigkeit ist nicht identisch mit Glauben an Gott.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0042","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:NX4","text":"Gottlosigkeit ist nicht notwendig Befreiung von Bindung, Erinnerung oder Trauer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:NX5","text":"Der Tod Gottes ist nicht als einheitliches, beweisbares Ereignis mit einer einzigen Ursache verfügbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:NX6","text":"Ein unverständlicher Gott ist nicht berechtigt, die Unzulänglichkeit seiner Hörer zu bestrafen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:NX7","text":"Zarathustras Fürsorge ist nicht therapeutische Wiederherstellung des verlorenen Gottes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0048","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0049","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0050","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:D1","text":"Der alte Papst verkörpert eine nachtheistische Dienstsubjektivität, weil der verschwundene Herr die Bindungsform des Dieners überdauert.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUSD:A1","CH_97E9_AUSD:A2","CH_97E9_AUSD:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:D2","text":"Der Verlust Gottes transformiert Frömmigkeit in Trauerarbeit, weil die affektive Investition fortbesteht, obwohl ihr Gegenstand endgültig verloren ist.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUSD:A1","CH_97E9_AUSD:A3","CH_97E9_AUSD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:D3","text":"Die Kritik Gottes ist strukturell keine bloße Gottesleugnung, weil sie aus den unvereinbaren Ansprüchen des Gottesbegriffs selbst hervorgeht.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUSD:A4","CH_97E9_AUSD:A5","CH_97E9_AUSD:A6","CH_97E9_AUSD:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:D4","text":"Der Tod Gottes entlastet die Geschöpfe von einer Schöpfer-Schuldordnung, weil das Missraten der Geschöpfe auf die Unzulänglichkeit des Schöpfers zurückverweist.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUSD:A6","CH_97E9_AUSD:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0039","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:D5","text":"Nichttheistische Frömmigkeit erscheint als bejahende Praxis ohne transzendenten Garanten.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUSD:A8","CH_97E9_AUSD:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:D6","text":"Zarathustras praktische Antwort auf Gottesverlust ist begrenzte diesseitige Fürsorge statt metaphysischer Kompensation.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUSD:A1","CH_97E9_AUSD:A9","CH_97E9_AUSD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0048","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:SD1","text":"Der Text verlegt das Problem des Nihilismus von der Frage nach Gottes Existenz auf die Frage nach den fortlebenden Formen von Abhängigkeit nach dem Verlust des Gottes.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUSD:A1","CH_97E9_AUSD:A2","CH_97E9_AUSD:A3","CH_97E9_AUSD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:SD2","text":"Die Delegitimierung Gottes erfolgt zugleich ethisch, ästhetisch und epistemisch: Der Gott scheitert an Liebe, Geschmack und Verständlichkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUSD:A5","CH_97E9_AUSD:A6","CH_97E9_AUSD:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:SD3","text":"Der Text erzeugt eine säkulare Sakralität, in der Segen, Gastfreundschaft und Schutz fortbestehen, während ihr theologischer Ursprung verworfen wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUSD:A1","CH_97E9_AUSD:A8","CH_97E9_AUSD:A9","CH_97E9_AUSD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0048","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:SD4","text":"Selbstbestimmung wird nur negativ eröffnet: Sie entsteht zunächst als Abweisung eines unzulänglichen Gottes, nicht als vollständig ausgearbeitete positive Ordnung.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUSD:A1","CH_97E9_AUSD:A6","CH_97E9_AUSD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Annahme, dass der Tod Gottes von selbst ein freies Subjekt hervorbringt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Annahme, dass ein moralisch verwerflicher oder begrifflich widersprüchlicher Gott durch Loyalität rehabilitiert werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Annahme, dass Frömmigkeit notwendig eine metaphysische Adresse benötigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0041","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0042","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Annahme, dass Leid durch Wiedergewinnung einer vergangenen Gottesordnung endgültig heilbar sei.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0049","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0050","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:SNX1","text":"Unverfügbar wird ein souveräner Garant, der Liebe, Gerechtigkeit, Sinngebung und Rettung widerspruchsfrei vereinigen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:SNX2","text":"Unmöglich wird die Rückkehr zu einer Frömmigkeit, deren Geltung vom Fortbestand ihres Gottes abhängt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0050","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:SNX3","text":"Versperrt bleibt eine vollständige Überwindung der alten religiösen Affekt- und Dienstformen durch bloße Ungläubigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0044","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:FGS1","text":"Gottesverlust → Fortbestand der Dienstbindung → Unfreiheit ohne Herrn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:FGS2","text":"Fortdauernde Bindung → Suche nach einem neuen Objekt der Frömmigkeit → Begegnung mit Zarathustra.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:FGS3","text":"Gottesbegriff → Analyse seiner widersprüchlichen Prädikate → ethisch-ästhetisch-epistemische Delegitimierung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:FGS4","text":"Delegitimierung des Gottes → Anerkennung seines endgültigen Verschwindens → Sperre gegen Wiederbelebung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:FGS5","text":"Gotteslosigkeit → Umdeutung als Frömmigkeit und Redlichkeit → Erhalt nichttheistischer Segensfähigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:FGS6","text":"Nichttheistische Segensfähigkeit → begrenzte Schutzpraxis → keine Kompensation des metaphysischen Verlusts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0048","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:AF1","text":"Tod Gottes → dienende Restbindung → Suche nach einer letzten Frömmigkeit → Kritik des widersprüchlichen Gottesbegriffs → endgültige Verabschiedung Gottes → Umcodierung der Gottlosigkeit → diesseitige, begrenzte Fürsorge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0048","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:ME1","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Frömmigkeit und Gottlosigkeit wird aufgehoben; Frömmigkeit kann als Intensivform des Unglaubens erscheinen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:ME2","text":"Der Tod Gottes wird von einem Ereignis der Weltanschauung zu einem Problem fortwirkender Subjektformationen verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:ME3","text":"Das Geschöpf wird nicht mehr primär als schuldhaftes Misslingen, sondern als Objekt eines fehlgeleiteten Schöpfers sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0039","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:ME4","text":"Gottes Kritik wird nicht als äußerer Atheismus, sondern als im Gottesbegriff selbst ausgelöste Selbstzersetzung kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:ME5","text":"Fürsorge wird von Erlösung getrennt: Schutz und Aufrichtung bleiben möglich, die Rückgabe eines verlorenen Gottes nicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0048","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:ALT1","text":"Surface — Ein ehemaliger Papst sucht nach dem Tod Gottes Zarathustra und bittet um Aufnahme.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Figur des Priesters zeigt, dass institutionelle und affektive Dienstformen ihren transzendenten Herrn überleben können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text ersetzt die Wiederherstellung religiöser Ordnung durch die Anerkennung ihrer Unwiederbringlichkeit und durch begrenzte diesseitige Praxis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0048","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Gott ist nicht als stabile ewige Instanz behandelt, sondern als sterbliches Gebilde mit Geschichte, Alterung und irreversibler Vergangenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den Übergang vom Tod Gottes zur fortbestehenden Unfreiheit des ehemaligen Dieners zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:MRT2","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Delegitimierung des Gottesbegriffs über Liebe, Gericht, Rache, Verständlichkeit und Schöpfungsverantwortung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wodurch die Dienstbindung nach dem Verlust des Herrn konkret reproduziert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:MRT4","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie die nichttheistische Segensfähigkeit institutionell oder sozial dauerhaft organisiert werden könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:MRT5","text":"Die Struktur ist kohärent, sofern Gottes Tod als irreversibel und Frömmigkeit als vom Gottesglauben ablösbar gesetzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0050","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:MRT6","text":"Die stärkste Spannung liegt zwischen der radikalen Verabschiedung Gottes und der fortbestehenden sakralen Sprache von Segen, Weihung und Frömmigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0043","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0044","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0050","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die Bewegung des Textes, sofern sie die begrenzte Fürsorge Zarathustras nicht als Ersatzreligion, sondern als nichtkompensierende Praxis behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0048","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T192900022402Z_98685b85","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Out of Service","source_sha256":"7e7b4c982d91e2580490e4725658339724c8623ed84a6f0861b6d79f541c1afa","sha256":"c990194450d3163fdcab37bbc8749f4e83ddf49f3b560ecd4dd6c66fda83d7c6","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:29:00.026698+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:AS1","text":"The death of God produces not freedom, but a servant without a master, whose form of service endures as memory-bound unfreedom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:AS2","text":"The encounter shifts the loss of God from a theological assertion to a diagnosis of different forms of godlessness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:AS3","text":"The old God is delegitimized through the reconstruction of his inner contradictions: love, judgment, vengeance, hiddenness, and compassion are incompatibly entangled.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:AS4","text":"Zarathustra replaces the question of the true cause of God's death with the normative determination of his definitive unavailability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:AS5","text":"The remaining piety is recoded as the capacity to bless, protect, and uplift, without restoring the dead God.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0048","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:A1","text":"Within the text, the death of God is definitive and irreversible through memory, piety, or waiting.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0050","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:A2","text":"The abolition of a master does not automatically abolish the subjective structure of serving.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:A3","text":"The loss of a God affects most strongly those who love and possess him.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:A4","text":"Conceptions of God can collapse through the incompatibility of the properties attributed to them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:A5","text":"Love is incompatible with reward, retribution, and judging sanction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:A6","text":"A God who punishes his creatures for their failure is exposed as a misguided creator.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0039","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:A7","text":"Divine speech that does not make itself purely intelligible cannot hold its addressees responsible for misunderstanding it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:A8","text":"Godlessness can arise from an intensified probity and piety.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0042","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:A9","text":"After the death of God, the capacity to bless remains as a nontheistic practice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0043","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:A10","text":"Zarathustra's responsibility concerns the protection and uplifting of the suffering, not the revival of lost relationships with God.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0048","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:A11","text":"The self-determination of fate presupposes the rejection of an inadequate God.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:NX1","text":"Freedom is not the mere absence of a master.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:NX2","text":"The God of love is not at the same time a God of judgment, hell, and retribution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:NX3","text":"Piety is not identical with belief in God.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0042","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:NX4","text":"Godlessness is not necessarily liberation from attachment, memory, or mourning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:NX5","text":"The death of God is not available as a uniform, demonstrable event with a single cause.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:NX6","text":"An unintelligible God is not entitled to punish the inadequacy of his hearers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:NX7","text":"Zarathustra's care is not the therapeutic restoration of the lost God.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0048","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0049","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0050","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:D1","text":"The old Pope embodies a post-theistic service-subjectivity, because the vanished master outlives the servant's form of attachment.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUSD:A1","CH_97E9_AUSD:A2","CH_97E9_AUSD:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:D2","text":"The loss of God transforms piety into mourning work, because affective investment endures although its object is definitively lost.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUSD:A1","CH_97E9_AUSD:A3","CH_97E9_AUSD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:D3","text":"Structurally, the critique of God is not mere denial of God, because it arises from the incompatible claims of the concept of God itself.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUSD:A4","CH_97E9_AUSD:A5","CH_97E9_AUSD:A6","CH_97E9_AUSD:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:D4","text":"The death of God relieves creatures of a creator-guilt order, because the creatures' failure refers back to the inadequacy of the creator.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUSD:A6","CH_97E9_AUSD:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0039","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:D5","text":"Nontheistic piety appears as an affirmative practice without a transcendent guarantor.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUSD:A8","CH_97E9_AUSD:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:D6","text":"Zarathustra's practical response to the loss of God is limited worldly care rather than metaphysical compensation.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUSD:A1","CH_97E9_AUSD:A9","CH_97E9_AUSD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0048","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:SD1","text":"The text relocates the problem of nihilism from the question of God's existence to the question of the surviving forms of dependency after the loss of God.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUSD:A1","CH_97E9_AUSD:A2","CH_97E9_AUSD:A3","CH_97E9_AUSD:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:SD2","text":"The delegitimization of God takes place ethically, aesthetically, and epistemically at once: God fails in respect of love, taste, and intelligibility.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUSD:A5","CH_97E9_AUSD:A6","CH_97E9_AUSD:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:SD3","text":"The text produces a secular sacrality in which blessing, hospitality, and protection endure while their theological origin is rejected.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUSD:A1","CH_97E9_AUSD:A8","CH_97E9_AUSD:A9","CH_97E9_AUSD:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0048","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:SD4","text":"Self-determination is opened only negatively: it initially arises as a rejection of an inadequate God, not as a fully elaborated positive order.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUSD:A1","CH_97E9_AUSD:A6","CH_97E9_AUSD:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:DNX1","text":"Excluded is the assumption that the death of God of itself produces a free subject.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:DNX2","text":"Excluded is the assumption that a morally reprehensible or conceptually contradictory God can be rehabilitated through loyalty.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:DNX3","text":"Excluded is the assumption that piety necessarily requires a metaphysical addressee.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0041","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0042","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:DNX4","text":"Excluded is the assumption that suffering could be definitively healed by regaining a past divine order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0049","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0050","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:SNX1","text":"Unavailable becomes a sovereign guarantor who could unite love, justice, the bestowal of meaning, and salvation without contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0033","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:SNX2","text":"Impossible becomes the return to a piety whose validity depends on the continued existence of its God.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0050","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:SNX3","text":"Blocked remains a complete overcoming of the old religious forms of affect and service through mere unbelief.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0044","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:FGS1","text":"Loss of God → persistence of service attachment → unfreedom without a master.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:FGS2","text":"Enduring attachment → search for a new object of piety → encounter with Zarathustra.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:FGS3","text":"Concept of God → analysis of its contradictory predicates → ethical-aesthetic-epistemic delegitimization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:FGS4","text":"Delegitimization of God → recognition of his definitive disappearance → block against revival.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0026","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:FGS5","text":"Godlessness → reinterpretation as piety and probity → preservation of nontheistic capacity to bless.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:FGS6","text":"Nontheistic capacity to bless → limited practice of protection → no compensation for metaphysical loss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0048","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:AF1","text":"Death of God → residual serving attachment → search for a final piety → critique of the contradictory concept of God → definitive farewell to God → recoding of godlessness → worldly, limited care.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0048","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:ME1","text":"The opposition between piety and godlessness is abolished; piety can appear as an intensified form of unbelief.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:ME2","text":"The death of God is shifted from an event of worldview to a problem of continuing formations of subjectivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:ME3","text":"The creature becomes visible no longer primarily as culpable failure, but as the object of a misguided creator.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0039","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:ME4","text":"The critique of God is mapped not as external atheism, but as self-disintegration triggered within the concept of God itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:ME5","text":"Care is separated from redemption: protection and uplifting remain possible, but the return of a lost God does not.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0048","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:ALT1","text":"Surface — A former Pope seeks Zarathustra after the death of God and asks to be received.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:ALT2","text":"Structural — The figure of the priest shows that institutional and affective forms of service can outlive their transcendent master.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text replaces the restoration of religious order with the recognition of its irretrievability and with limited worldly practice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0048","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — God is treated not as a stable eternal instance, but as a mortal formation with history, aging, and an irreversible past.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the transition from the death of God to the enduring unfreedom of the former servant.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:MRT2","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the delegitimization of the concept of God through love, judgment, vengeance, intelligibility, and responsibility for creation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:MRT3","text":"What remains underdetermined is how the service attachment is concretely reproduced after the loss of the master.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:MRT4","text":"What remains underdetermined is how the nontheistic capacity to bless could be durably organized institutionally or socially.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:MRT5","text":"The structure is coherent provided that God's death is posited as irreversible and piety as detachable from belief in God.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0042","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0050","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:MRT6","text":"The strongest tension lies between the radical farewell to God and the continuing sacred language of blessing, consecration, and piety.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0043","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0044","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0050","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_AUSD:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the movement of the text provided that it treats Zarathustra's limited care not as a replacement religion, but as a noncompensatory practice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0048","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_AUSD:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_AUSD@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_AUSD:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 133","title":"Out of Service","context":"Chapter 133","original_title":"Ausser Dienst","original_context":"Chapter 133"},"original_title":"Ausser Dienst","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM","layer":"CH","title":"The Ugliest Man","order":134,"parents":["RAW_97E9_DHSM"],"revision":"CH_97E9_DHSM@R001","sha256":"cccba59ca9dcbabb79d2898cc978a9c32b84c37494253b2aa2349149d4c8b17f","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:AS1","text":"Die Suche nach dem großen Leidenden führt in eine Todeslandschaft, in der Leiden als radikale Scham und Unaussprechlichkeit erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:AS2","text":"Das Rätsel des hässlichsten Menschen bestimmt den Mord an Gott als Rache gegen einen Zeugen, dessen allsehendes Mitleiden die verborgene Schmach unerträglich macht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:AS3","text":"Mitleid wird von einer Hilfeleistung in eine zudringliche Verletzung der Scham umbestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:AS4","text":"Zarathustras Abwendung und Erröten werden als einzige nicht-demütigende Anerkennung des Ausgestoßenen lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:AS5","text":"Die Kritik am Mitleid weitet sich zur Kritik einer sozialen Ordnung aus, in der kleine Leute Macht, Tugend und Wahrheit definieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:AS6","text":"Der Ausweg besteht nicht in Versöhnung, sondern in einer selektiven Zuflucht außerhalb menschlicher Mitleidsökonomie und in der Ausrichtung auf Überwindung des Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0052","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:A1","text":"Große Scham entsteht dort, wo verborgenes Leiden einem totalen Blick ausgesetzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0038","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:A2","text":"Ein Zeuge, der den Menschen vollständig durchschaut, wird für den Beschämten zur unerträglichen Instanz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:A3","text":"Der hässlichste Mensch deutet den Mord an Gott als Rache gegen den allsehenden Zeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:A4","text":"Mitleid verletzt Scham, weil es sich dem Leidenden ohne dessen Maß und Zustimmung nähert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:A5","text":"Nicht-Helfen kann Würde stärker achten als eine Hilfe, die sich selbst als Tugend versteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:A6","text":"Die soziale Aufwertung des Mitleids verschafft den kleinen Leuten Deutungsmacht über Gut und Wahrheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:A7","text":"Zarathustras Scham vor der Hässlichkeit des Anderen verweigert dessen Klassifikation als bloßes Objekt des Mitleids.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:A8","text":"Anerkennung des radikal Ausgestoßenen verlangt Distanz, Schutz vor öffentlicher Sichtbarkeit und Verzicht auf moralische Besitzergreifung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:A9","text":"Selbstliebe kann mit tiefster Selbstverachtung zusammenfallen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0049","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0050","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:A10","text":"Große Verachtung kann als Höhe erscheinen, ohne schon eindeutig Überlegenheit oder Befreiung zu beweisen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0051","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:A11","text":"Der Mensch ist nicht Endzweck, sondern etwas zu Überwindendes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0052","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:NX1","text":"Der hässlichste Mensch flieht nicht vor Hass, Verfolgung oder Strafe, sondern vor Mitleid.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:NX2","text":"Der hässlichste Mensch ist kein Bettler, dessen Leiden durch Almosen oder Trost angemessen beantwortet werden könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:NX3","text":"Der Mord an Gott wird nicht als Kampf gegen bloße Herrschaft, sondern als Vernichtung eines unerträglichen Zeugen bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:NX4","text":"Mitleid ist nicht schlechthin Tugend und Hilfe ist nicht schlechthin vornehm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:NX5","text":"Zarathustras Mitleidskritik ist kein allgemeines Gebot zur Gefühllosigkeit, sondern eine Warnung an ihn selbst und an seine Art.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:NX6","text":"Große Selbstverachtung ist nicht identisch mit bloßer Niedrigkeit oder bloßem Selbsthass.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0049","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0050","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0051","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:D1","text":"Die göttliche Allwissenheit erscheint innerhalb der Selbstdeutung des hässlichsten Menschen als eine gewaltsame Form der Intimität.","refs":["CH_97E9_DHSM:A1","CH_97E9_DHSM:A2","CH_97E9_DHSM:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:D2","text":"Das Mitleid reproduziert die Struktur des allsehenden Zeugen, indem es fremdes Elend sichtbar macht und moralisch vereinnahmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_DHSM:A2","CH_97E9_DHSM:A4","CH_97E9_DHSM:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:D3","text":"Zarathustras Abwendung ist keine Verkennung des Leidens, sondern eine Form von Anerkennung ohne Zugriff.","refs":["CH_97E9_DHSM:A4","CH_97E9_DHSM:A7","CH_97E9_DHSM:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:D4","text":"Die Macht der kleinen Leute beruht nicht nur auf Zahl, sondern auf der Institutionalisierung ihrer moralischen Wertungen als Wahrheit.","refs":["CH_97E9_DHSM:A5","CH_97E9_DHSM:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:D5","text":"Das Selbstverhältnis des hässlichsten Menschen ist zugleich Bindung an sich und Urteil gegen sich.","refs":["CH_97E9_DHSM:A9","CH_97E9_DHSM:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0049","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0050","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:D6","text":"Die Zuflucht bei Zarathustra verschiebt das Problem von sozialer Integration zu einer selektiven Ordnung des Verstecks und der Beratung.","refs":["CH_97E9_DHSM:A8","CH_97E9_DHSM:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:SD1","text":"Der Text koppelt die Kritik an Gott, Mitleid und öffentlicher Moral an dieselbe Grundstruktur: die illegitime Verfügung über das verborgene Innere des Anderen.","refs":["CH_97E9_DHSM:A1","CH_97E9_DHSM:A2","CH_97E9_DHSM:A4","CH_97E9_DHSM:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:SD2","text":"Würde wird nicht als soziale Anerkennung durch allgemeine Fürsorge bestimmt, sondern als Schutz der Scham gegen universalisierten Zugriff.","refs":["CH_97E9_DHSM:A4","CH_97E9_DHSM:A5","CH_97E9_DHSM:A7","CH_97E9_DHSM:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:SD3","text":"Die moralische Hegemonie der kleinen Leute verwandelt Verletzlichkeit in ein Mittel der Deutungsmacht, weil das Mitleid bestimmt, wer als gut, wahr und hilfsbedürftig gilt.","refs":["CH_97E9_DHSM:A4","CH_97E9_DHSM:A5","CH_97E9_DHSM:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:SD4","text":"Der höhere Mensch wird nicht durch Reinheit oder moralische Güte bestimmt, sondern durch die unentschiedene Möglichkeit, dass große Selbstverachtung über den gegebenen Menschen hinausweist.","refs":["CH_97E9_DHSM:A9","CH_97E9_DHSM:A10","CH_97E9_DHSM:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0049","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0051","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0052","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:DNX1","text":"Das System setzt voraus, dass vollständige Transparenz keine höchste Form von Erkenntnis oder Liebe ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0041","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:DNX2","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass jedes Leiden einen legitimen Anspruch auf Sichtbarkeit, Hilfe und öffentliche Anerkennung begründet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:DNX3","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass moralische Gleichheit die Differenz zwischen großer und kleiner Hässlichkeit angemessen erfassen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:DNX4","text":"Das System setzt voraus, dass eine durch Mitleid vermittelte Gemeinschaft radikales Missraten nicht tragen kann, ohne es zu entwürdigen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:SNX1","text":"Unverfügbares Leiden darf weder vollständig gesehen noch vollständig geheilt werden, ohne seine Scham zu zerstören.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:SNX2","text":"Eine universale moralische Gemeinschaft bleibt versperrt, weil ihre zentrale Tugend den Ausgestoßenen erneut zum Gegenstand macht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:SNX3","text":"Die Unterscheidung zwischen schöpferischer Selbstverachtung und selbstzerstörerischer Verneinung bleibt unformalisiert und daher nicht endgültig entscheidbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0051","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:FGS1","text":"Verborgene Scham + totaler Blick → Unerträglichkeit des Bezeugtwerdens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:FGS2","text":"Unerträglichkeit des Bezeugtwerdens + Racheimpuls → Vernichtung des Zeugen als Selbstbehauptung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:FGS3","text":"Mitleid + soziale Tugendgeltung → Wiederholung des zudringlichen Blicks in moralischer Form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:FGS4","text":"Schamvolle Abwendung + Verzicht auf Hilfe → Anerkennung ohne Aneignung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:FGS5","text":"Anerkennung ohne Aneignung + Schutzraum außerhalb der Menge → selektive Zuflucht statt Versöhnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:FGS6","text":"Selbstliebe + Selbstverachtung + Überwindungsimperativ → Möglichkeit einer Höhe, deren Status ungeklärt bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0049","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0051","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0052","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:AF1","text":"Die Suche nach dem großen Leidenden führt zur Begegnung mit dem Unaussprechlichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:AF2","text":"Die Begegnung mit dem Unaussprechlichen führt zur Frage nach der Rache am Zeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:AF3","text":"Die Frage nach dem Zeugen führt zur Deutung des Gottesmords als Abwehr totaler Einsicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:AF4","text":"Die Deutung totaler Einsicht führt zur Umwertung des Mitleids als Angriff auf Scham.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:AF5","text":"Die Umwertung des Mitleids führt zur Kritik der kleinen Leute als moralischer Wahrheitsmacht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:AF6","text":"Die Kritik der Mitleidsordnung führt zur Zuflucht, zur Selbstbefragung und zur Forderung nach Überwindung des Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0052","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:ME1","text":"Der Gottesmord wird von einem metaphysischen oder moralischen Ereignis in eine Reaktion auf epistemische und affektive Übergriffigkeit umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:ME2","text":"Mitleid wird nicht mehr dem Gegensatz von Grausamkeit gegenübergestellt, sondern dem Gegensatz von schamachtender Distanz und zudringlichem Zugriff.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:ME3","text":"Der Ausgestoßene erscheint nicht als bloßes Opfer, sondern zugleich als Täter, Richter seiner selbst und Träger einer extremen Selbstbeziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:ME4","text":"Wahrheit erscheint nicht als neutrale Erkenntnis, sondern als gesellschaftlich durch Tugend, Mehrheit und moralische Deutungsmacht regulierte Kategorie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:ME5","text":"Höhe wird von moralischer Vollkommenheit auf das Spannungsverhältnis von großer Verachtung, Selbstüberwindung und ungelöster Gefährdung verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0050","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0051","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0052","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:ALT1","text":"Surface — Zarathustra begegnet dem hässlichsten Menschen, erkennt ihn als Mörder Gottes und weist ihm einen Zufluchtsort zu.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:ALT2","text":"Structural — Mitleid, Öffentlichkeit und moralische Wahrheit bilden eine Ordnung, die Scham sichtbar macht und Ausgestoßene erneut unterwirft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der angemessene Umgang mit radikalem Leiden verlangt nicht universale Hilfe, sondern selektive Anerkennung, Distanz und Schutz vor Zugriff.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Der Tod des allsehenden Gottes eröffnet keinen versöhnten Zustand, sondern verschiebt die Frage nach dem Menschen auf seine mögliche Überwindung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0052","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Umdeutung des Gottesmords, die Mitleidskritik und die abschließende Überwindungsbewegung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0052","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob der hässlichste Mensch tatsächlich als höherer Mensch gilt oder nur als dessen deformierte Grenzfigur erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0051","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:MRT3","text":"Das System ist kohärent, sofern Mitleid als Struktur des beschämenden Zugriffs und nicht als bloßes Gefühl behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:MRT4","text":"Seine stärkste Verbindung liegt in der strukturellen Gleichsetzung von göttlichem Allsehen, mitleidigem Eindringen und sozialer Moralherrschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:MRT5","text":"Seine stärkste Bruchlinie liegt darin, dass der Gottesmord zugleich als unerträgliche Reaktion und als verständliche Selbstbehauptung lesbar wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0040","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0041","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung liegt darin, dass Zarathustra Scham schützt, den hässlichsten Menschen jedoch in einen abgesonderten Versteckraum verweist statt eine nicht-ausstoßende Beziehung zu formalisieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0044","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0045","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die Bewegung von radikalem Leiden über die Kritik des Blicks und des Mitleids bis zur unentschiedenen Figur der Selbstüberwindung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0052","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T193429098495Z_c55412c6","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"The Ugliest Man","source_sha256":"cccba59ca9dcbabb79d2898cc978a9c32b84c37494253b2aa2349149d4c8b17f","sha256":"bbb58a1901dde0c38c37db5183dcebd4183db5500f1b8b9d674ba50eb7c0c65b","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:34:29.100702+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:AS1","text":"The search for the great sufferer leads into a landscape of death, in which suffering appears as radical shame and unspeakability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:AS2","text":"The riddle of the ugliest man construes the murder of God as revenge against a witness whose all-seeing compassion makes hidden disgrace unbearable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:AS3","text":"Compassion is redefined from an act of assistance into an intrusive injury to shame.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:AS4","text":"Zarathustra's turning away and blushing become legible as the only non-humiliating recognition of the outcast.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:AS5","text":"The critique of compassion expands into a critique of a social order in which little people define power, virtue, and truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:AS6","text":"The way out consists not in reconciliation, but in a selective refuge outside the human economy of compassion and in orientation toward the overcoming of man.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0052","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:A1","text":"Great shame arises where hidden suffering is exposed to a total gaze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0038","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:A2","text":"A witness who sees through the human being completely becomes an unbearable instance for the shamed one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:A3","text":"The ugliest man construes the murder of God as revenge against the all-seeing witness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:A4","text":"Compassion injures shame because it approaches the sufferer without regard for his measure and consent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:A5","text":"Not helping can respect dignity more strongly than assistance that understands itself as virtue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:A6","text":"The social elevation of compassion grants little people interpretive power over the good and truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:A7","text":"Zarathustra's shame before the ugliness of the other refuses to classify him as a mere object of compassion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:A8","text":"Recognition of the radically outcast requires distance, protection from public visibility, and renunciation of moral appropriation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:A9","text":"Self-love can coincide with the deepest self-contempt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0049","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0050","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:A10","text":"Great contempt can appear as height without thereby already unequivocally proving superiority or liberation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0051","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:A11","text":"The human being is not an end in itself, but something to be overcome.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0052","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:NX1","text":"The ugliest man flees not from hatred, persecution, or punishment, but from compassion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:NX2","text":"The ugliest man is not a beggar whose suffering could be adequately answered by alms or consolation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:NX3","text":"The murder of God is determined not as a struggle against mere domination, but as the annihilation of an unbearable witness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:NX4","text":"Compassion is not virtue simply as such, and help is not noble simply as such.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:NX5","text":"Zarathustra's critique of compassion is not a general command to insensibility, but a warning to himself and to his kind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0032","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0033","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:NX6","text":"Great self-contempt is not identical with mere baseness or mere self-hatred.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0049","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0050","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0051","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:D1","text":"Within the ugliest man's self-interpretation, divine omniscience appears as a violent form of intimacy.","refs":["CH_97E9_DHSM:A1","CH_97E9_DHSM:A2","CH_97E9_DHSM:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0041","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:D2","text":"Compassion reproduces the structure of the all-seeing witness by making another's misery visible and morally appropriating it.","refs":["CH_97E9_DHSM:A2","CH_97E9_DHSM:A4","CH_97E9_DHSM:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:D3","text":"Zarathustra's turning away is not a failure to recognize suffering, but a form of recognition without seizure.","refs":["CH_97E9_DHSM:A4","CH_97E9_DHSM:A7","CH_97E9_DHSM:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:D4","text":"The power of little people rests not only on number, but on the institutionalization of their moral valuations as truth.","refs":["CH_97E9_DHSM:A5","CH_97E9_DHSM:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:D5","text":"The ugliest man's relation to himself is at once attachment to himself and judgment against himself.","refs":["CH_97E9_DHSM:A9","CH_97E9_DHSM:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0049","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0050","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:D6","text":"Refuge with Zarathustra shifts the problem from social integration to a selective order of hiding place and counsel.","refs":["CH_97E9_DHSM:A8","CH_97E9_DHSM:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:SD1","text":"The text links the critique of God, compassion, and public morality to the same basic structure: the illegitimate disposal over the other's hidden interior.","refs":["CH_97E9_DHSM:A1","CH_97E9_DHSM:A2","CH_97E9_DHSM:A4","CH_97E9_DHSM:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:SD2","text":"Dignity is determined not as social recognition through general care, but as the protection of shame against universalized seizure.","refs":["CH_97E9_DHSM:A4","CH_97E9_DHSM:A5","CH_97E9_DHSM:A7","CH_97E9_DHSM:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:SD3","text":"The moral hegemony of little people transforms vulnerability into a means of interpretive power, because compassion determines who counts as good, true, and in need of help.","refs":["CH_97E9_DHSM:A4","CH_97E9_DHSM:A5","CH_97E9_DHSM:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:SD4","text":"The higher human being is determined not by purity or moral goodness, but by the undecided possibility that great self-contempt points beyond the given human being.","refs":["CH_97E9_DHSM:A9","CH_97E9_DHSM:A10","CH_97E9_DHSM:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0049","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0051","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0052","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:DNX1","text":"The system presupposes that complete transparency is not the highest form of knowledge or love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0041","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:DNX2","text":"The system excludes that every suffering grounds a legitimate claim to visibility, help, and public recognition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:DNX3","text":"The system excludes that moral equality can adequately grasp the difference between great and small ugliness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:DNX4","text":"The system presupposes that a community mediated by compassion cannot bear radical failure without degrading it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:SNX1","text":"Suffering beyond disposal must neither be completely seen nor completely healed without destroying its shame.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:SNX2","text":"A universal moral community remains barred, because its central virtue once again makes the outcast into an object.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:SNX3","text":"The distinction between creative self-contempt and self-destructive negation remains unformalized and is therefore not conclusively decidable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0051","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:FGS1","text":"Hidden shame + total gaze → unbearable nature of being witnessed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:FGS2","text":"Unbearable nature of being witnessed + impulse of revenge → annihilation of the witness as self-assertion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:FGS3","text":"Compassion + social validity as virtue → repetition of the intrusive gaze in moral form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:FGS4","text":"Shameful turning away + renunciation of help → recognition without appropriation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:FGS5","text":"Recognition without appropriation + protected space outside the crowd → selective refuge instead of reconciliation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0044","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:FGS6","text":"Self-love + self-contempt + imperative of overcoming → possibility of a height whose status remains unresolved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0049","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0051","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0052","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:AF1","text":"The search for the great sufferer leads to the encounter with the unspeakable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:AF2","text":"The encounter with the unspeakable leads to the question of revenge against the witness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:AF3","text":"The question of the witness leads to the interpretation of the murder of God as defense against total insight.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:AF4","text":"The interpretation of total insight leads to the revaluation of compassion as an attack upon shame.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:AF5","text":"The revaluation of compassion leads to the critique of little people as a moral power of truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:AF6","text":"The critique of the order of compassion leads to refuge, self-questioning, and the demand for the overcoming of man.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0052","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:ME1","text":"The murder of God is remapped from a metaphysical or moral event into a reaction to epistemic and affective intrusiveness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:ME2","text":"Compassion is no longer set against cruelty, but against the opposition between shame-honoring distance and intrusive seizure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:ME3","text":"The outcast appears not as a mere victim, but at once as perpetrator, judge of himself, and bearer of an extreme relation to himself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0037","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:ME4","text":"Truth appears not as neutral knowledge, but as a category socially regulated through virtue, majority, and moral interpretive power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:ME5","text":"Height is shifted from moral perfection to the relation of tension between great contempt, self-overcoming, and unresolved endangerment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0050","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0051","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0052","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:ALT1","text":"Surface — Zarathustra encounters the ugliest man, recognizes him as the murderer of God, and assigns him a place of refuge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0043","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:ALT2","text":"Structural — Compassion, publicity, and moral truth form an order that renders shame visible and subjugates outcasts anew.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The appropriate treatment of radical suffering requires not universal help, but selective recognition, distance, and protection from seizure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The death of the all-seeing God opens no reconciled state, but shifts the question of the human being toward its possible overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0052","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the reinterpretation of the murder of God, the critique of compassion, and the concluding movement of overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0043","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0052","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether the ugliest man in fact counts as a higher human being or appears only as its deformed limit-figure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0051","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:MRT3","text":"The system is coherent insofar as compassion is treated as a structure of shaming seizure and not as a mere feeling.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0039","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:MRT4","text":"Its strongest connection lies in the structural equation of divine all-seeing, compassionate intrusion, and social moral domination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:MRT5","text":"Its strongest line of rupture lies in the fact that the murder of God becomes legible both as an unbearable reaction and as intelligible self-assertion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0040","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0041","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:MRT6","text":"A further tension lies in the fact that Zarathustra protects shame, yet refers the ugliest man to a segregated hiding space rather than formalizing a non-excluding relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0025","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0044","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0045","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DHSM:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the movement from radical suffering through the critique of the gaze and compassion to the undecided figure of self-overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0039","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0044","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DHSM:P0052","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_DHSM@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_DHSM:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 134","title":"The Ugliest Man","context":"Chapter 134","original_title":"Der hässlichste Mensch","original_context":"Chapter 134"},"original_title":"Der hässlichste Mensch","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0","layer":"CH","title":"The Voluntary Beggar","order":135,"parents":["RAW_97E9_DFB0"],"revision":"CH_97E9_DFB0@R001","sha256":"0c4e8016529badc00c0c4dd81bdd744db96153a6f6f9beac047d486d7fe3770b","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:AS1","text":"Der Text prüft, ob Einsamkeit und Ekel durch eine Abkehr von menschlich-sozialen Verhältnissen in eine tierische Form des Glücks überwunden werden können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:AS2","text":"Die anfängliche Wärme stammt nicht aus menschlicher Gemeinschaft, sondern aus der körperlichen Nähe der Kühe und verschiebt damit die Suche nach Trost aus dem Sozialen ins Animalische.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:AS3","text":"Der freiwillige Bettler bestimmt das Glück als Wiederkäuen, körperliche Genügsamkeit und Enthaltung von den Gedanken, die das Herz belasten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:AS4","text":"Seine Flucht zu den Kühen folgt aus dem Scheitern des Schenkens an die Armen und aus seiner Verachtung sowohl der Reichen als auch der Armen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:AS5","text":"Zarathustra trennt die Einsicht in die Schwierigkeit des richtigen Gebens von der zornigen Sozialdiagnose des Bettlers, indem er dessen Härte als widernatürliche Selbstgewalt deutet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:AS6","text":"Die Szene endet ohne endgültige Bestätigung der Kuh-Lehre: Zarathustra verweist den Bettler vorläufig an seine Tiere, entzieht sich aber sowohl dessen Lob als auch einer abschließenden Gemeinschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:A1","text":"Körperliche Nähe zu lebendigen Tieren kann Einsamkeit und Kälte affektiv unterbrechen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:A2","text":"Der freiwillige Bettler setzt irdisches Glück mit dem Lernen des Wiederkäuens und der Rückkehr zu einer kuhähnlichen Existenz gleich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:A3","text":"Der Bettler behandelt Ekel als die gegenwärtige Grundtrübsal des Menschen und schwere Gedanken als deren Verstärker.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:A4","text":"Der Versuch, Reichtum in Gabe und Güte zu überführen, begründet keine Annahme durch die Armen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:A5","text":"Richtiges Geben ist nicht die Umkehrung des Nehmens, sondern eine eigenständige und schwierigere Kunst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:A6","text":"Der Bettler deutet die Gegenwart so, dass Wohltun die Niedrigen beleidigt und sozialen Widerstand hervorruft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:A7","text":"Der Bettler behandelt Reichtum nicht als Gegenbild des Pöbels, sondern ordnet Reiche und Arme derselben verachteten Sozialform zu.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:A8","text":"Die aggressive Sozialkritik des Bettlers widerspricht seiner sanften leiblich-affektiven Disposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:A9","text":"Zarathustra akzeptiert weder die Vereinnahmung durch Lob noch die endgültige Fixierung des Bettlers bei den Kühen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0039","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:NX1","text":"Glück besteht nicht im Gewinn der ganzen Welt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:NX2","text":"Das Himmelreich ist im Modell des Bettlers kein jenseitiger Lohn, sondern eine tierische Praxis der Wiederholung und Bedürfnisbegrenzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:NX3","text":"Armut ist nicht identisch mit moralischer Reinheit oder Seligkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:NX4","text":"Reichtum ist nicht identisch mit sozialer Überlegenheit, Gabe oder legitimer Güte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:NX5","text":"Geben ist nicht automatisch wohltätig, weil seine Wirkung durch die Stellung und Reaktion des Empfangenden bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:NX6","text":"Zornige Verachtung ist nicht ohne Weiteres die authentische Stimme eines sanften, friedfertigen Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:NX7","text":"Schmeichelhafte Anerkennung begründet keine gültige Nähe zu Zarathustra.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:D1","text":"Glück wird aus einer sozialen und besitzbezogenen Kategorie in eine leiblich-zeitliche Technik des Wiederkäuens, Ruhens und Nicht-Belastetwerdens überführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_DFB0:A1","CH_97E9_DFB0:A2","CH_97E9_DFB0:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:D2","text":"Die Gabe erzeugt unter den beschriebenen Gegenwartsbedingungen eine Kette aus Überfluss, Angebot, Zurückweisung und Rückzug.","refs":["CH_97E9_DFB0:A4","CH_97E9_DFB0:A5","CH_97E9_DFB0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:D3","text":"Die Unterscheidung von Arm und Reich verliert für den Bettler ihre Fähigkeit, moralische oder politische Orientierung zu geben.","refs":["CH_97E9_DFB0:A6","CH_97E9_DFB0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:D4","text":"Der Ekel wird von einer individuellen Befindlichkeit in eine totalisierende Sozialdiagnose überführt, die keine menschliche Position mehr unbelastet lässt.","refs":["CH_97E9_DFB0:A3","CH_97E9_DFB0:A4","CH_97E9_DFB0:A6","CH_97E9_DFB0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:D5","text":"Zarathustra relativiert die politische Rede des Bettlers, indem er ihren Wahrheitsanspruch an dessen leiblich-affektive Verfassung rückbindet.","refs":["CH_97E9_DFB0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:D6","text":"Die Tiere werden als mögliche Lehrmeister anerkannt, aber von der ressentimentgeladenen Begründung des Bettlers getrennt.","refs":["CH_97E9_DFB0:A1","CH_97E9_DFB0:A2","CH_97E9_DFB0:A8","CH_97E9_DFB0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:D7","text":"Zarathustras Ablehnung der Schmeichelei verhindert, dass die Begegnung in eine hierarchische Verehrungsbeziehung übergeht.","refs":["CH_97E9_DFB0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0039","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:SD1","text":"Der Ekel fungiert zugleich als Diagnose sozialer Korruption und als Antrieb zur Flucht aus dem Sozialen; seine Kritik erzeugt damit die Bedingungen ihrer eigenen Entpolitisierung.","refs":["CH_97E9_DFB0:A3","CH_97E9_DFB0:A4","CH_97E9_DFB0:A6","CH_97E9_DFB0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:SD2","text":"Die Gabe kann keine stabile moralische Hierarchie begründen, weil weder Überfluss noch Bedürftigkeit die Kunst des rechten Gebens garantieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_DFB0:A4","CH_97E9_DFB0:A5","CH_97E9_DFB0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:SD3","text":"Das Tierische wird zur Grenzform eines Glücks, das affektive Entlastung ermöglicht, aber Denken, soziale Konflikte und wechselseitige Anerkennung suspendiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_DFB0:A1","CH_97E9_DFB0:A2","CH_97E9_DFB0:A3","CH_97E9_DFB0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:SD4","text":"Die Szene unterstellt, dass die Geltung einer Kritik nicht allein von ihrem Gegenstand, sondern auch von der affektiven und leiblichen Stimmigkeit ihres Sprechers abhängt.","refs":["CH_97E9_DFB0:A7","CH_97E9_DFB0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:SD5","text":"Zarathustra erscheint als Instanz der Selektion: Er bestätigt die Schwierigkeit des Gebens, verweigert aber dem Bettler die Deutungshoheit über Glück, Armut und Ekel.","refs":["CH_97E9_DFB0:A5","CH_97E9_DFB0:A8","CH_97E9_DFB0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:DNX1","text":"Das System setzt voraus, dass keine soziale Klasse eine von Ressentiment, Gier, Neid oder Demütigung freie moralische Stellung garantiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:DNX2","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass Reichtum durch freiwillige Selbstentäußerung unmittelbar in anerkannte Güte übersetzt werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:DNX3","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass sozialer Ekel durch bloße Umverteilung, Wohltätigkeit oder Parteinahme für die Armen verschwindet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:DNX4","text":"Das System setzt voraus, dass polemische Härte kein autonomes Erkenntnisinstrument ist, sondern durch die Konstitution des Sprechenden kompromittiert werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:DNX5","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass menschliche Gesellschaft notwendig der primäre Ort von Wärme, Trost oder Glück ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:SNX1","text":"Eine ungebrochene soziale Güte, die weder beschämt noch zurückgewiesen wird, bleibt im Text nicht verfügbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:SNX2","text":"Eine menschliche Gemeinschaft jenseits von Überfluss, Bedürftigkeit, Schmeichelei und Ressentiment wird nicht positiv bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:SNX3","text":"Eine endgültige Versöhnung von kontemplativer Entlastung und verantwortlicher sozialer Handlung bleibt ausgespart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:FGS1","text":"Einsamkeit und Kälte → unerwartete tierische Wärme → Verlagerung des Trostproblems von menschlicher Gesellschaft auf leibliche Nähe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:FGS2","text":"Tierische Nähe → Entdeckung des Bettlers → Formulierung einer Glückslehre des Wiederkäuens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:FGS3","text":"Wiederkäuen und Nicht-Denken → Gegenmittel gegen Ekel → Bestimmung des Tieres als Modell affektiver Entlastung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:FGS4","text":"Gescheiterte Gabe an die Armen → ressentimentgeleitete Sozialdiagnose → Auflösung der moralischen Opposition von Arm und Reich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:FGS5","text":"Polemische Sozialkritik → Diagnose ihrer leiblich-affektiven Unstimmigkeit → Entwertung des Bettlers als souveräner Kritiker.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:FGS6","text":"Vorläufige Überweisung an Zarathustras Tiere → Zurückweisung der Schmeichelei → Unterbrechung durch den Notschrei statt endgültiger Lehre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:AF1","text":"Einsamkeit und Kälte → Wahrnehmung tierischer Wärme.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:AF2","text":"Tierische Wärme → Begegnung mit dem freiwilligen Bettler.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:AF3","text":"Begegnung → Kuh-Lehre gegen Ekel und schwere Gedanken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:AF4","text":"Kuh-Lehre → Erzählung des gescheiterten Schenkens und der Flucht aus der sozialen Ordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:AF5","text":"Sozialer Ekel → Gleichsetzung von Pöbel oben und Pöbel unten → Verlust der Arm-Reich-Orientierung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:AF6","text":"Zarathustras Diagnose der Unstimmigkeit → provisorische Tiergemeinschaft → Abbruch durch Distanzierung und Notschrei.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:ME1","text":"Reichtum und Armut werden nicht mehr als gegensätzliche moralische Positionen, sondern als mögliche Varianten derselben sozialen Verfallenheit kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:ME2","text":"Die Gabe wird von einer evidenten Tugend in eine riskante Beziehungstechnik überführt, deren Gelingen nicht durch guten Willen gesichert ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:ME3","text":"Ekel erscheint nicht mehr bloß als individuelles Gefühl, sondern als Mechanismus, der soziale Totalisierung und sozialen Rückzug zugleich erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:ME4","text":"Das Tier wird von einem passiven Naturgegenstand zu einem Lehrmodell für Zeitlichkeit, Bedürfnisregulation und Gedankenentlastung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:ME5","text":"Die Autorität einer sozialen Kritik wird an die psychophysische Stimmigkeit ihres Sprechers und nicht nur an die Schärfe ihrer Aussagen gebunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:ALT1","text":"Surface — Zarathustra begegnet einem freiwilligen Bettler, der unter Kühen Zuflucht gesucht hat und von ihnen das Glück lernen will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Szene untersucht das Scheitern einer Gabe, die soziale Stellung nicht aufhebt, sondern Zurückweisung, Demütigung und Ressentiment verschärfen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text unterscheidet zwischen einer tragfähigen Einsicht über das Geben und einer Kritikform, die durch den Affekt ihres Sprechers ihre eigene Geltung beschädigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Die Gegenwart erscheint als Zeit des Ekels, in der das Tierische eine zyklische, wiederkäuende und nicht-teleologische Gegenzeit zum menschlichen sozialen Konflikt anbietet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von Einsamkeit über tierische Entlastung, gescheiterte Gabe und soziale Totalverachtung bis zur Unterbrechung der Szene zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob Zarathustra die Kuh-Lehre selbst bejaht, nur duldet oder als begrenzte Therapie behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0036","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0037","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0038","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0040","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob die Sozialdiagnose des Bettlers als Diagnose der Gegenwart oder als Symptom seiner eigenen Verletzung gelten soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0027","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0028","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0029","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:MRT4","text":"Die Struktur ist kohärent, sofern die Kuh-Lehre als affektive Entlastung und nicht als vollständige soziale oder politische Lösung gelesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung liegt zwischen dem Scheitern der Gabe, der Erzeugung von Ekel und dem Rückzug in ein nichtmenschliches Glücksmodell.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:MRT6","text":"Die stärkste Bruchlinie liegt darin, dass der Bettler das Denken als Last zurückweist, während seine eigene Rede eine umfassende, zornige Sozialtheorie produziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0034","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0027","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0028","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0029","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:MRT7","text":"Eine Rekonstruktion bewahrt die argumentative Bewegung nur dann, wenn Zarathustras Einladung zu den Tieren als vorläufige Umlenkung und nicht als abschließende Bestätigung des Rückzugs verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T193342997086Z_3645b4df","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"The Voluntary Beggar","source_sha256":"0c4e8016529badc00c0c4dd81bdd744db96153a6f6f9beac047d486d7fe3770b","sha256":"967a890d3b82dd996c2380ab1ef3570f1486cf9044d0e8066a2cf4c6b49eed2c","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:33:42.998941+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:AS1","text":"The text examines whether loneliness and disgust can be overcome through a turning away from human-social relations toward an animal form of happiness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:AS2","text":"The initial warmth derives not from human community, but from the physical proximity of the cows, thereby shifting the search for consolation from the social to the animal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:AS3","text":"The voluntary beggar defines happiness as rumination, bodily sufficiency, and abstention from thoughts that burden the heart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:AS4","text":"His flight to the cows follows from the failure of giving to the poor and from his contempt for both the rich and the poor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:AS5","text":"Zarathustra separates the insight into the difficulty of giving rightly from the beggar's angry social diagnosis by interpreting the latter's harshness as unnatural violence against himself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:AS6","text":"The scene ends without final confirmation of the cow-doctrine: Zarathustra provisionally directs the beggar to his animals, but withdraws from both his praise and any conclusive community.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:A1","text":"Physical proximity to living animals can affectively interrupt loneliness and coldness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:A2","text":"The voluntary beggar equates earthly happiness with learning rumination and returning to a cow-like existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:A3","text":"The beggar treats disgust as the present fundamental melancholy of humanity and heavy thoughts as its intensifiers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:A4","text":"The attempt to transform wealth into gift and goodness does not establish acceptance by the poor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:A5","text":"Giving rightly is not the reversal of taking, but an independent and more difficult art.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:A6","text":"The beggar interprets the present such that doing good insults the lowly and elicits social resistance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:A7","text":"The beggar treats wealth not as the opposite of the rabble, but assigns the rich and the poor to the same despised social form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:A8","text":"The beggar's aggressive social criticism contradicts his gentle bodily-affective disposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:A9","text":"Zarathustra accepts neither appropriation through praise nor the beggar's final fixation among the cows.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0039","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:NX1","text":"Happiness does not consist in gaining the whole world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:NX2","text":"In the beggar's model, the kingdom of heaven is not a transcendent reward, but an animal practice of repetition and limitation of needs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:NX3","text":"Poverty is not identical with moral purity or blessedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:NX4","text":"Wealth is not identical with social superiority, gift, or legitimate goodness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:NX5","text":"Giving is not automatically beneficent, because its effect is determined by the position and reaction of the recipient.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:NX6","text":"Angry contempt is not straightforwardly the authentic voice of a gentle, peaceable human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:NX7","text":"Flattering recognition establishes no valid closeness to Zarathustra.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0039","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:D1","text":"Happiness is transferred from a social and possession-related category into a bodily-temporal technique of rumination, resting, and not being burdened.","refs":["CH_97E9_DFB0:A1","CH_97E9_DFB0:A2","CH_97E9_DFB0:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:D2","text":"Under the described present conditions, the gift produces a chain of abundance, offer, rejection, and withdrawal.","refs":["CH_97E9_DFB0:A4","CH_97E9_DFB0:A5","CH_97E9_DFB0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:D3","text":"For the beggar, the distinction between poor and rich loses its capacity to provide moral or political orientation.","refs":["CH_97E9_DFB0:A6","CH_97E9_DFB0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:D4","text":"Disgust is transferred from an individual condition into a totalizing social diagnosis that leaves no human position unburdened.","refs":["CH_97E9_DFB0:A3","CH_97E9_DFB0:A4","CH_97E9_DFB0:A6","CH_97E9_DFB0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:D5","text":"Zarathustra relativizes the beggar's political discourse by binding its claim to truth back to his bodily-affective condition.","refs":["CH_97E9_DFB0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:D6","text":"The animals are acknowledged as possible teachers, but separated from the beggar's ressentiment-laden justification.","refs":["CH_97E9_DFB0:A1","CH_97E9_DFB0:A2","CH_97E9_DFB0:A8","CH_97E9_DFB0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:D7","text":"Zarathustra's rejection of flattery prevents the encounter from passing into a hierarchical relation of veneration.","refs":["CH_97E9_DFB0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0039","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:SD1","text":"Disgust functions both as a diagnosis of social corruption and as an impetus to flee the social; its critique thereby produces the conditions of its own depoliticization.","refs":["CH_97E9_DFB0:A3","CH_97E9_DFB0:A4","CH_97E9_DFB0:A6","CH_97E9_DFB0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:SD2","text":"The gift cannot establish a stable moral hierarchy, because neither abundance nor neediness guarantees the art of giving rightly.","refs":["CH_97E9_DFB0:A4","CH_97E9_DFB0:A5","CH_97E9_DFB0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:SD3","text":"The animal becomes the limiting form of a happiness that enables affective relief but suspends thinking, social conflicts, and reciprocal recognition.","refs":["CH_97E9_DFB0:A1","CH_97E9_DFB0:A2","CH_97E9_DFB0:A3","CH_97E9_DFB0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:SD4","text":"The scene presupposes that the validity of a critique depends not only on its object, but also on the affective and bodily congruence of its speaker.","refs":["CH_97E9_DFB0:A7","CH_97E9_DFB0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:SD5","text":"Zarathustra appears as an instance of selection: he confirms the difficulty of giving, but denies the beggar interpretive sovereignty over happiness, poverty, and disgust.","refs":["CH_97E9_DFB0:A5","CH_97E9_DFB0:A8","CH_97E9_DFB0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:DNX1","text":"The system presupposes that no social class guarantees a moral position free from ressentiment, greed, envy, or humiliation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:DNX2","text":"The system excludes the possibility that wealth can be translated directly into recognized goodness through voluntary self-renunciation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:DNX3","text":"The system excludes the possibility that social disgust disappears through mere redistribution, charity, or taking the side of the poor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:DNX4","text":"The system presupposes that polemical harshness is not an autonomous instrument of knowledge, but can be compromised by the constitution of the speaker.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:DNX5","text":"The system excludes the possibility that human society is necessarily the primary site of warmth, consolation, or happiness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:SNX1","text":"An unbroken social goodness that neither shames nor is rejected remains unavailable in the text.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:SNX2","text":"A human community beyond abundance, neediness, flattery, and ressentiment is not positively determined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:SNX3","text":"A final reconciliation of contemplative relief and responsible social action remains omitted.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0036","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:FGS1","text":"Loneliness and coldness → unexpected animal warmth → displacement of the problem of consolation from human society to bodily proximity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:FGS2","text":"Animal proximity → discovery of the beggar → formulation of a doctrine of happiness through rumination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:FGS3","text":"Rumination and non-thinking → antidote to disgust → determination of the animal as a model of affective relief.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:FGS4","text":"Failed gift to the poor → ressentiment-guided social diagnosis → dissolution of the moral opposition between poor and rich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:FGS5","text":"Polemical social criticism → diagnosis of its bodily-affective incongruity → devaluation of the beggar as a sovereign critic.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:FGS6","text":"Provisional referral to Zarathustra's animals → rejection of flattery → interruption by the cry of distress instead of final doctrine.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0041","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:AF1","text":"Loneliness and coldness → perception of animal warmth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:AF2","text":"Animal warmth → encounter with the voluntary beggar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:AF3","text":"Encounter → cow-doctrine against disgust and heavy thoughts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:AF4","text":"Cow-doctrine → account of failed giving and flight from the social order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:AF5","text":"Social disgust → equation of rabble above and rabble below → loss of poor-rich orientation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0027","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:AF6","text":"Zarathustra's diagnosis of incongruity → provisional animal community → termination through distancing and the cry of distress.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:ME1","text":"Wealth and poverty are no longer mapped as opposing moral positions, but as possible variants of the same social degeneracy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:ME2","text":"The gift is transferred from an evident virtue into a risky technique of relation, whose success is not secured by good will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:ME3","text":"Disgust no longer appears merely as an individual feeling, but as a mechanism that simultaneously produces social totalization and social withdrawal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:ME4","text":"The animal is reclassified from a passive object of nature into a teaching model for temporality, regulation of needs, and relief from thoughts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:ME5","text":"The authority of a social critique is bound to the psychophysical congruence of its speaker and not merely to the sharpness of its statements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:ALT1","text":"Surface — Zarathustra encounters a voluntary beggar who has sought refuge among cows and wishes to learn happiness from them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:ALT2","text":"Structural — The scene examines the failure of a gift that does not abolish social position, but can intensify rejection, humiliation, and ressentiment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text distinguishes between a viable insight concerning giving and a form of critique that damages its own validity through the affect of its speaker.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The present appears as an age of disgust, in which the animal offers a cyclical, ruminative, and non-teleological counter-time to human social conflict.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from loneliness through animal relief, failed gift, and total social contempt to the interruption of the scene.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether Zarathustra himself affirms the cow-doctrine, merely tolerates it, or treats it as a limited therapy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0036","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0037","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0038","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0040","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:MRT3","text":"It remains underdetermined whether the beggar's social diagnosis is to count as a diagnosis of the present or as a symptom of his own injury.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0027","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0028","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0029","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:MRT4","text":"The structure is coherent insofar as the cow-doctrine is read as affective relief and not as a complete social or political solution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:MRT5","text":"The strongest connection lies between the failure of the gift, the production of disgust, and withdrawal into a nonhuman model of happiness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:MRT6","text":"The strongest fault line lies in the fact that the beggar rejects thinking as a burden, while his own discourse produces a comprehensive, angry social theory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0034","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0027","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0028","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0029","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DFB0:MRT7","text":"A reconstruction preserves the argumentative movement only if Zarathustra's invitation to the animals is understood as a provisional redirection and not as a final confirmation of withdrawal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0038","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DFB0:P0040","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_DFB0@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_DFB0:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 135","title":"The Voluntary Beggar","context":"Chapter 135","original_title":"Der freiwillige Bettler","original_context":"Chapter 135"},"original_title":"Der freiwillige Bettler","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS","layer":"CH","title":"The Shadow","order":136,"parents":["RAW_97E9_DERS"],"revision":"CH_97E9_DERS@R001","sha256":"327f06d6bfa911c3f29696a0ebb88adafc166b9c1e6ceb45b5cb67933b61347b","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:AS1","text":"Zarathustras Einsamkeit wird durch die ihm nachfolgenden Figuren in eine bedrängte, nicht mehr selbstbestimmte Sphäre verwandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:AS2","text":"Die Flucht vor dem Schatten wird als törichte Abwehr erkannt, weil der Schatten nicht durch bloße Distanzierung verschwindet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:AS3","text":"Der Schatten exponiert eine Existenz, deren radikale Entwertung von Verboten, Werten und Glaubensformen in Ziellosigkeit, Heimatlosigkeit und Erschöpfung umschlägt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:AS4","text":"Zarathustra diagnostiziert den Verlust des Ziels als Verlust des Weges und damit als strukturelle Gefährdung durch kompensatorische Bindung an Enge, Glauben und Gefängnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:AS5","text":"Die Antwort besteht in begrenzter Zuflucht für den Schatten und erneuter Herstellung von Distanz, Beweglichkeit und heiterer Selbstbejahung für Zarathustra.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:A1","text":"Ein Schatten ist eine an eine Person gebundene Folgegestalt, die ihr nachfolgt, ohne mit ihr identisch zu sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:A2","text":"Einsamkeit setzt eine Grenze gegen dauernden Zudrang und Nachfolge voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:A3","text":"Die Aufhebung von Verboten, Grenzsteinen, Bildern, Werten und großen Namen zerstört bestehende normative Orientierungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:A4","text":"Die Zerstörung vorhandener Orientierungen erzeugt nicht von selbst Ziel, Heim, Weg oder Richtung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:A5","text":"Ein Ziel bestimmt erst, welcher Weg und welcher Wind für ein Leben gut sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:A6","text":"Entgrenzende Wahrheits- und Klärungsbewegung kann Bindung, Liebe, Scham, Glauben und Selbstbejahung erschöpfen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:A7","text":"Ziellosigkeit und Erschöpfung machen Festigkeit, Enge und Gefangenschaft als Ersatzsicherheit attraktiv.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:A8","text":"Eine begrenzte Zuflucht kann gegeben werden, ohne die Differenz zwischen dem Ermüdeten und dem Schenkenden aufzuheben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:A9","text":"Zarathustras Helligkeit setzt fortgesetzte Bewegung, Einsamkeit und bejahende Körperlichkeit voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:NX1","text":"Freiheit ist nicht identisch mit fortgesetzter Überschreitung jedes Verbots.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0028","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:NX2","text":"Die Entwertung aller Werte ist nicht selbst schon eine tragfähige Wertsetzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:NX3","text":"Wahrheit und Aufklärung sind nicht notwendig Quellen von Liebe, Orientierung oder Selbstbejahung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:NX4","text":"Heimat ist nicht mit universeller Beweglichkeit oder räumlicher Allgegenwart identisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:NX5","text":"Gefängnis, enger Glaube und harter Wahn sind keine wirklichen Lösungen der Ziellosigkeit, auch wenn sie Sicherheit versprechen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:NX6","text":"Gastfreundschaft ist nicht Verschmelzung mit dem Schatten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:D1","text":"Die absolute Negation vorhandener Bindungen schlägt in nihilistische Heimat- und Ziellosigkeit um.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERS:A3","CH_97E9_DERS:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:D2","text":"Ohne Ziel kann weder Richtung gewählt noch ein günstiger Umstand als günstig erkannt werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERS:A4","CH_97E9_DERS:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:D3","text":"Erschöpfte Freiheit ist strukturell anfällig für den Wunsch nach dogmatischer Begrenzung.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERS:A6","CH_97E9_DERS:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:D4","text":"Der Schatten verkörpert eine aus Zarathustras eigener Bewegung hervorgehende, aber von ihm nicht zu übernehmende Folgeform.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERS:A1","CH_97E9_DERS:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:D5","text":"Die Höhle fungiert als temporäre Unterbrechung des Zerfalls, nicht als endgültige Wiederherstellung eines Heims.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERS:A4","CH_97E9_DERS:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0034","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0035","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:SD1","text":"Eine Befreiungsbewegung, die nur zerstört und keine positive Richtung erzeugt, reproduziert ihre eigene Gegenbewegung im Verlangen nach Zwang.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERS:A3","CH_97E9_DERS:A4","CH_97E9_DERS:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:SD2","text":"Der Verlust von Ziel und Heim transformiert Freiheit von einer Möglichkeit der Selbstführung in eine Last unaufhörlicher Bewegung.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERS:A4","CH_97E9_DERS:A5","CH_97E9_DERS:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:SD3","text":"Zarathustras Verhältnis zum Schatten verlangt zugleich Verantwortung für dessen Not und Verweigerung seiner dauerhaften Integration.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERS:A1","CH_97E9_DERS:A8","CH_97E9_DERS:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0034","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0035","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0036","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:SD4","text":"Das Tanzen markiert eine Gegenform zur fixierenden Sicherheit: bejahte Form ohne Gefängnischarakter.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERS:A7","CH_97E9_DERS:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0032","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0036","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:DNX1","text":"Das System setzt voraus, dass reine Negation keine hinreichende Grundlage eines bewohnbaren Lebens ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:DNX2","text":"Das System setzt voraus, dass Wahrheit keinen autonomen normativen Vorrang besitzt, wenn sie alle lebensfähigen Bindungen verzehrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:DNX3","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass unbegrenzte Beweglichkeit bereits Freiheit im affirmativen Sinn sei.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:DNX4","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass Sicherheit als solche einen legitimen Maßstab bildet, weil ihre extremen Formen in Glaubenszwang und Gefangenschaft münden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:SNX1","text":"Auslöschende Kritik darf nicht die letzte Instanz bleiben, weil sie weder Ziel noch Weg noch Heimat bereitstellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:SNX2","text":"Die vollständige Identifikation Zarathustras mit seinem Schatten ist unzulässig, weil sie Zarathustras eigene Bedingung der Helligkeit zerstören würde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0029","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0036","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:SNX3","text":"Eine endgültige Rückkehr zu ungebrochener Unschuld, festem Glauben oder vorgegebener Heimat wird nicht verfügbar gemacht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:FGS1","text":"Einsamkeit + Zudrang von Nachfolgern → Erfahrung des Verlusts eines eigenen Reiches → Fluchtbewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:FGS2","text":"Begegnung mit dem Schatten → Umdeutung des Verfolgers als Folgegestalt → Prüfung seines existenziellen Zustands.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:FGS3","text":"Entgrenzung von Verboten und Werten → Verlust von Bindung und Ziel → Heimatlosigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:FGS4","text":"Zielverlust → Wegverlust → Unfähigkeit zur Bewertung von Richtung und Umständen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:FGS5","text":"Erschöpfung ohne Richtung → Attraktivität starrer Sicherheit → Gefahr dogmatischer Gefangenschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:FGS6","text":"Begrenzte Rast + erneute Distanzierung → Schutz des Schattens ohne Aufgabe zarathustrischer Einsamkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:AF1","text":"Verlust der Einsamkeit → Abwehr des Schattens → Einsicht in die Unangemessenheit bloßer Flucht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:AF2","text":"Selbstbeschreibung des Schattens → Entgrenzung aller Werte → Verlust von Ziel, Weg und Heim.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:AF3","text":"Diagnose der Gefängnisgefahr → temporäre Zuflucht → Wiederherstellung zarathustrischer Distanz und Helligkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:ME1","text":"Der Schatten wird von einer bloß lästigen Verfolgerfigur in die Folgegestalt einer entgrenzenden geistigen Praxis umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:ME2","text":"Das Begriffsfeld trennt Ziel und Weg von starrer Norm: Orientierung wird benötigt, aber enger Glaube bleibt eine Gefahr.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0032","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0033","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:ME3","text":"Heimat wird von einem bloßen Ort in eine Bedingung gerichteter Existenz transformiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:ME4","text":"Freiheit wird in zwei Formen gespalten: erschöpfende Entgrenzung und bejahende Beweglichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0036","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:ME5","text":"Führung wird als asymmetrische Beziehung kartiert, in der Hilfe möglich ist, aber dauernde Nachfolge zurückgewiesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:ALT1","text":"Surface — Zarathustra begegnet seinem erschöpften Schatten, der nach fortgesetztem Wandern ohne Ziel und Heim sucht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Auflösung normativer Grenzen erzeugt einen Orientierungsverlust, der in kompensatorische Sehnsucht nach Festigkeit umschlagen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Zarathustra beantwortet die Krise nicht durch Rückkehr zu dogmatischer Sicherheit, sondern durch begrenzte Hilfe und wiederhergestellte Distanz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Das Selbst erscheint als bewegliche, von seinen Zielen und Bindungen abhängige Form, die ohne Richtung in unendliche Gegenwart des Überall und Nirgendwo zerfällt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von bedrängter Einsamkeit über die Diagnose des Schattens bis zur distanzierten Zuflucht zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, worin ein positives Ziel besteht und nach welchem Maßstab ein Ziel von einem engen Glauben unterschieden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist kohärent, sofern Zielgerichtetheit als notwendig und dogmatische Fixierung als pathologisch behandelt werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste generative Kette lautet: Entgrenzung zerstört Orientierung, Orientierungslosigkeit erzeugt Erschöpfung, Erschöpfung öffnet für Gefangenschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:MRT5","text":"Die zentrale Spannung liegt darin, dass der Schatten aus Zarathustras Weg hervorgeht, während Zarathustra dessen Endzustand zugleich abweist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0029","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0036","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die argumentative Bewegung, kann aber nicht entscheiden, ob Tanz eine positive Lösung oder nur Zarathustras Gegenhaltung zur Erschöpfung bezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0034","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0035","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0036","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T193233215517Z_391d294b","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"The Shadow","source_sha256":"327f06d6bfa911c3f29696a0ebb88adafc166b9c1e6ceb45b5cb67933b61347b","sha256":"af1794b945df031851c6a4d3fcb548ded1a7b5ada916e22a75ad54c33d9b5235","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:32:33.217635+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:AS1","text":"Zarathustra's solitude is transformed by the figures following him into a beleaguered sphere no longer determined by himself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:AS2","text":"Flight from the shadow is recognized as foolish defense, because the shadow does not disappear through mere distancing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:AS3","text":"The shadow exposes an existence whose radical devaluation of prohibitions, values, and forms of belief turns into aimlessness, homelessness, and exhaustion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:AS4","text":"Zarathustra diagnoses the loss of the goal as loss of the way and thus as a structural endangerment through compensatory attachment to narrowness, belief, and prison.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:AS5","text":"The response consists in limited refuge for the shadow and the renewed production of distance, mobility, and cheerful self-affirmation for Zarathustra.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:A1","text":"A shadow is a derivative figure bound to a person, which follows that person without being identical with them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:A2","text":"Solitude presupposes a boundary against continual pressure and following.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:A3","text":"The abolition of prohibitions, boundary markers, images, values, and great names destroys existing normative orientations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:A4","text":"The destruction of existing orientations does not by itself produce goal, home, way, or direction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:A5","text":"Only a goal determines which way and which wind are good for a life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:A6","text":"Boundary-dissolving movement of truth and clarification can exhaust attachment, love, shame, belief, and self-affirmation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:A7","text":"Aimlessness and exhaustion make firmness, narrowness, and captivity attractive as substitute security.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:A8","text":"A limited refuge can be given without abolishing the difference between the weary one and the giver.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:A9","text":"Zarathustra's brightness presupposes continued movement, solitude, and affirmative corporeality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0036","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:NX1","text":"Freedom is not identical with the continued transgression of every prohibition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0028","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:NX2","text":"The devaluation of all values is not itself already a sustainable positing of values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:NX3","text":"Truth and enlightenment are not necessarily sources of love, orientation, or self-affirmation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:NX4","text":"Home is not identical with universal mobility or spatial omnipresence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:NX5","text":"Prison, narrow belief, and hard delusion are not real solutions to aimlessness, even if they promise security.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:NX6","text":"Hospitality is not fusion with the shadow.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0035","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:D1","text":"The absolute negation of existing attachments turns into nihilistic homelessness and aimlessness.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERS:A3","CH_97E9_DERS:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:D2","text":"Without a goal, neither can a direction be chosen nor a favorable circumstance be recognized as favorable.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERS:A4","CH_97E9_DERS:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0025","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:D3","text":"Exhausted freedom is structurally susceptible to the desire for dogmatic limitation.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERS:A6","CH_97E9_DERS:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:D4","text":"The shadow embodies a derivative form arising from Zarathustra's own movement, yet one not to be assumed by him.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERS:A1","CH_97E9_DERS:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:D5","text":"The cave functions as a temporary interruption of disintegration, not as a final restoration of a home.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERS:A4","CH_97E9_DERS:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0034","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0035","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:SD1","text":"A movement of liberation that only destroys and generates no positive direction reproduces its own counter-movement in the desire for compulsion.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERS:A3","CH_97E9_DERS:A4","CH_97E9_DERS:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:SD2","text":"The loss of goal and home transforms freedom from a possibility of self-guidance into a burden of incessant movement.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERS:A4","CH_97E9_DERS:A5","CH_97E9_DERS:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:SD3","text":"Zarathustra's relation to the shadow demands both responsibility for its distress and refusal of its permanent integration.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERS:A1","CH_97E9_DERS:A8","CH_97E9_DERS:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0034","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0035","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0036","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:SD4","text":"Dancing marks a counter-form to fixating security: affirmed form without the character of prison.","refs":["CH_97E9_DERS:A7","CH_97E9_DERS:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0032","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0036","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:DNX1","text":"The system presupposes that pure negation is not a sufficient foundation for an inhabitable life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:DNX2","text":"The system presupposes that truth possesses no autonomous normative priority when it consumes all viable attachments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:DNX3","text":"The system excludes that unlimited mobility already constitutes freedom in the affirmative sense.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:DNX4","text":"The system excludes that security as such constitutes a legitimate criterion, because its extreme forms culminate in coercion of belief and captivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0032","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:SNX1","text":"Annihilating critique must not remain the final authority, because it provides neither goal nor way nor home.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:SNX2","text":"The complete identification of Zarathustra with his shadow is impermissible, because it would destroy Zarathustra's own condition of brightness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0029","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0036","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:SNX3","text":"A final return to unbroken innocence, firm belief, or pre-given home is not made available.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:FGS1","text":"Solitude + pressure from followers → experience of the loss of one's own realm → movement of flight.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:FGS2","text":"Encounter with the shadow → reinterpretation of the persecutor as derivative figure → examination of its existential condition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:FGS3","text":"Dissolution of the boundaries of prohibitions and values → loss of attachment and goal → homelessness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:FGS4","text":"Loss of goal → loss of way → inability to evaluate direction and circumstances.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0033","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:FGS5","text":"Exhaustion without direction → attractiveness of rigid security → danger of dogmatic captivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:FGS6","text":"Limited rest + renewed distancing → protection of the shadow without surrendering Zarathustrian solitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0035","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:AF1","text":"Loss of solitude → defense against the shadow → insight into the inadequacy of mere flight.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:AF2","text":"Self-description of the shadow → dissolution of the boundaries of all values → loss of goal, way, and home.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:AF3","text":"Diagnosis of the danger of prison → temporary refuge → restoration of Zarathustrian distance and brightness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:ME1","text":"The shadow is reclassified from a merely troublesome persecutor figure into the derivative figure of a boundary-dissolving spiritual practice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:ME2","text":"The conceptual field separates goal and way from rigid norm: orientation is needed, but narrow belief remains a danger.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0032","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0033","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:ME3","text":"Home is transformed from a mere place into a condition of directed existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0028","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:ME4","text":"Freedom is divided into two forms: exhausting boundary-dissolution and affirmative mobility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0036","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:ME5","text":"Guidance is mapped as an asymmetrical relation in which help is possible, but permanent following is rejected.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0035","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:ALT1","text":"Surface — Zarathustra encounters his exhausted shadow, which seeks after continued wandering without goal and home.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:ALT2","text":"Structural — The dissolution of normative boundaries produces a loss of orientation that can turn into compensatory longing for firmness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Zarathustra answers the crisis not by returning to dogmatic security, but through limited help and restored distance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0036","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The self appears as a mobile form dependent on its goals and attachments, which without direction disintegrates into the endless present of everywhere and nowhere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from beleaguered solitude through the diagnosis of the shadow to distanced refuge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is what a positive goal consists in and by what criterion a goal is distinguished from a narrow belief.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0025","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0032","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:MRT3","text":"The structure is coherent insofar as goal-directedness can be treated as necessary and dogmatic fixation as pathological.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0032","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0036","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:MRT4","text":"The strongest generative chain reads: boundary-dissolution destroys orientation, disorientation generates exhaustion, exhaustion opens one to captivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:MRT5","text":"The central tension lies in the fact that the shadow arises from Zarathustra's way, while Zarathustra simultaneously rejects its final state.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0029","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0036","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DERS:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the argumentative movement, but cannot decide whether dancing denotes a positive solution or only Zarathustra's counter-attitude to exhaustion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0034","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0035","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DERS:P0036","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_DERS@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_DERS:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 136","title":"The Shadow","context":"Chapter 136","original_title":"Der Schatten","original_context":"Chapter 136"},"original_title":"Der Schatten","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT","layer":"CH","title":"At Noon","order":137,"parents":["RAW_97E9_MITT"],"revision":"CH_97E9_MITT@R001","sha256":"2899af4dc3e9c9edaecb731f41f2b6d1be8d27ba962a7eb7bbd8076aa85c3813","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:AS1","text":"Zarathustras Einsamkeit schlägt in Selbstgenuss und erneute Selbstbegegnung um.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:AS2","text":"Am vollkommenen Mittag verdrängt das Verlangen nach Schlaf das Verlangen nach der Traube.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:AS3","text":"Der Schlaf schließt die Wahrnehmung nicht, sondern zwingt die Seele zu einer wachen Ausstreckung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:AS4","text":"Die Sättigung am Guten erzeugt Müdigkeit, goldene Traurigkeit und vertrauensvolle Erdverbundenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:AS5","text":"Die vollkommene Welt fordert Schweigen; das geringste und leiseste Ereignis erzeugt die höchste Glückserfahrung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:AS6","text":"Der Versuch des Erwachens scheitert an der widerständigen Seele, bis der Sonnenstrahl die Erfahrung in eine Frage nach Ewigkeit und Einverleibung überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:A1","text":"Zarathustras Alleinsein wird als genießbare Selbstgegenwart erfahren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:A2","text":"Das Verlangen nach Schlaf wird stärker als der kleine Durst nach der Traube.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:A3","text":"Der Schlaf lässt die Augen offen und die Seele wahrnehmungsfähig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:A4","text":"Der Schlaf wirkt leicht, aber zwingend auf die Seele ein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:A5","text":"Die Fülle guter und reifer Dinge erzeugt Ermüdung und goldene Traurigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:A6","text":"Die Erde erscheint verlässlicher als die ungewissen Meere; eine minimale Bindung genügt für den Halt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:A7","text":"Die vollkommene Welt verlangt Stille statt Gesang, Flötenspiel oder sprachlicher Mitteilung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:A8","text":"Das beste Glück zeigt sich im Geringsten, Leisesten und Leichtesten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:A9","text":"Die Mittagsstunde kann als Abend eines siebenten Tages und als Fall in den Brunnen der Ewigkeit erfahren werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:A10","text":"Zarathustras Seele kann dem Befehl zum Erwachen widersprechen und in den Schlaf zurückkehren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:A11","text":"Der Sonnenstrahl eröffnet die Frage, wann Himmel, Ewigkeit oder Mittagsabgrund die Seele in sich aufnehmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:A12","text":"Nach dem Schlaf steht die Sonne weiterhin über Zarathustras Haupt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:NX1","text":"Die Einsamkeit wird nicht als bloßer Mangel an Anderen zugelassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:NX2","text":"Der Schlaf wird nicht als Schließung der Augen oder Ausschaltung der Seele bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:NX3","text":"Die vollkommene Mittagswelt schließt Gesang, Flüstern und äußere Mitteilung aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:NX4","text":"Die Erdverbundenheit verlangt kein starkes Seil und keine gewaltsame Befestigung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:NX5","text":"Das Glück wird nicht durch Menge, Intensität oder akkumulierten Besitz definiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:NX6","text":"Der Erwachensbefehl führt nicht unmittelbar zur Beendigung des Schlafes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:NX7","text":"Die innere Ewigkeitserfahrung wird nicht durch eine lange äußere Schlafdauer bestätigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:NX8","text":"Die Seele bleibt nicht mit dem sprechenden Ich identisch und widerspruchslos verfügbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:D1","text":"Die Verschiebung vom Durst zum Schlaf macht Bedürfnisordnung zu einer hierarchischen Entscheidung zugunsten des Ruhens.","refs":["CH_97E9_MITT:A2","CH_97E9_MITT:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:D2","text":"Der Schlaf verwandelt Rückzug in fortgesetzte Wahrnehmung, weil die offene Seele Baum und Weinstock weiterhin sieht und preist.","refs":["CH_97E9_MITT:A3","CH_97E9_MITT:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:D3","text":"Die Fülle des Guten führt nicht zu weiterer Aktivität, sondern zu Dehnung, Müdigkeit und Ruhebedürfnis.","refs":["CH_97E9_MITT:A4","CH_97E9_MITT:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:D4","text":"Vertrauen zur Erde wird durch die schwächste wirksame Bindung hergestellt.","refs":["CH_97E9_MITT:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:D5","text":"Erst die Unterdrückung der Ausdrucksbewegung macht die geringsten Wahrnehmungsreize als Glücksträger wirksam.","refs":["CH_97E9_MITT:A7","CH_97E9_MITT:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:D6","text":"Der vollkommene Mittag verschiebt die Zeitwahrnehmung vom Tagesablauf in eine paradoxe Ewigkeitserfahrung.","refs":["CH_97E9_MITT:A8","CH_97E9_MITT:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:D7","text":"Das Erwachen erscheint als Konflikt zwischen dem befehlenden Zarathustra und der sich entziehenden Seele.","refs":["CH_97E9_MITT:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:D8","text":"Die unveränderte Sonnenstellung trennt die innere Zeitdehnung von der äußeren Zeitmessung.","refs":["CH_97E9_MITT:A9","CH_97E9_MITT:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:SD1","text":"Vollkommenheit wird als Zustand maximaler Ruhe, nicht als Steigerung von Handlung oder Besitz erzeugt.","refs":["CH_97E9_MITT:A2","CH_97E9_MITT:A7","CH_97E9_MITT:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:SD2","text":"Glück wird durch Reduktion organisiert: Je weniger Reiz, Bewegung und Ausdruck zugelassen werden, desto vollständiger erscheint die Erfahrung.","refs":["CH_97E9_MITT:A7","CH_97E9_MITT:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:SD3","text":"Das Subjekt zerfällt in eine befehlende Stimme und eine autonome Seele, wodurch Ruhe als ausgehandelter Widerstand erscheint.","refs":["CH_97E9_MITT:A4","CH_97E9_MITT:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:SD4","text":"Die Zeitstruktur verschränkt Mittag, Abend, Schlaf und Ewigkeit, ohne die äußere Sonnenordnung aufzuheben.","refs":["CH_97E9_MITT:A9","CH_97E9_MITT:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:SD5","text":"Die lokale Erdberührung öffnet keinen Gegensatz zur kosmischen Tiefe, sondern führt über minimale Bindung zur Frage nach vollständiger Aufnahme in die Ewigkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_MITT:A6","CH_97E9_MITT:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:SD6","text":"Das Glück bleibt an eine ungelöste Spannung gebunden: Es wird als vollkommen erfahren und zugleich als schmerzhafter Stich im Herzen registriert.","refs":["CH_97E9_MITT:A5","CH_97E9_MITT:A8","CH_97E9_MITT:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0029","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt die Annahme aus, Glück entstehe primär durch Vermehrung, Besitz oder Steigerung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:DNX2","text":"Das System schließt die Annahme aus, Bewusstsein setze aktive Wachheit, geschlossene Augen oder kontrollierte Aufmerksamkeit voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:DNX3","text":"Das System schließt die Annahme aus, innere Zeit und äußere Dauer bildeten eine identische Ordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:DNX4","text":"Das System schließt die Annahme eines einheitlichen, souveränen und widerspruchslos verfügbaren Selbst aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:DNX5","text":"Das System schließt die Annahme aus, eine vollkommene Welt müsse durch Sprache, Gesang oder öffentliche Bestätigung bekräftigt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:DNX6","text":"Das System schließt die Annahme aus, Erwachen sei die souveräne Rückkehr des Ichs aus einem passiven Zustand.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:SNX1","text":"Die vollständige Mitteilbarkeit der Vollkommenheit bleibt ausgeschlossen; ihre Intensität verlangt die Stilllegung des Ausdrucks.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:SNX2","text":"Die Rückkehr zur gewöhnlichen Bedürfnis- und Handlungsordnung bleibt versperrt, weil weder die Traube genommen noch das Erwachen dauerhaft vollzogen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:SNX3","text":"Eine endgültige Grenze zwischen Erde und Ewigkeit bleibt ungesichert; die Frage nach dem Aufnehmen der Seele wird nicht beantwortet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:SNX4","text":"Eine abgeschlossene Identität der Seele bleibt abwesend; sie erscheint nur als etwas, das sich ausdehnt, widersteht und möglicherweise aufgenommen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:FGS1","text":"Einsamkeit → Selbstgenuss → erhöhte Empfänglichkeit für eine nichtsoziale Welt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:FGS2","text":"Traube als unmittelbares Bedürfnisobjekt → konkurrierendes Schlafverlangen → Aussetzung des Konsums.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:FGS3","text":"Schlaf → offene Augen und wache Seele → Wahrnehmung ohne aktive Bewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:FGS4","text":"Überfülle des Guten → Ermüdung und goldene Traurigkeit → Anlehnung an die Erde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:FGS5","text":"Vollkommener Mittag → Schweigegebot → minimale Reize → gesteigertes Glück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:FGS6","text":"Gesteigertes Glück → Zeitentgrenzung → Herzschmerz und Ewigkeitsschacht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:FGS7","text":"Erwachensbefehl → Widerstand der Seele → erneuter Schlaf → Sonnenstrahl als Unterbrechung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:FGS8","text":"Sonnenstrahl → Frage nach himmlischer Aufnahme → Erwachen bei unverändertem äußeren Mittag.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:AF1","text":"Einsamkeit → Selbstgenuss → Traube als Anlass → Schlaf statt Trinken → offene Wahrnehmung → Sättigung am Guten → Erdanschluss → Schweigen → minimales Glück → Ewigkeitserfahrung → Herzstich → gescheiterter Erwachensbefehl → erneuter Schlaf → Sonnenstrahl → Frage nach der Aufnahme der Seele → Erwachen im unveränderten Mittag.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:ME1","text":"Einsamkeit wird von einem sozialen Defizit in eine produktive Form der Selbstgegenwart umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:ME2","text":"Schlaf wird von Bewusstlosigkeit in eine wache, erzwungene und wahrnehmende Rezeptivität umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:ME3","text":"Glück wird von quantitativer Fülle auf minimale Reizintensität und lautlose Wahrnehmung umgestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:ME4","text":"Mittag wird von einem Zeitpunkt in eine Schwelle zwischen Tagesordnung, Sabbatabend und Ewigkeit umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:ME5","text":"Erwachen wird nicht mehr als Rückkehr, sondern als Konflikt zwischen Ich-Befehl und Seelenwiderstand lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:ME6","text":"Erdliche Nähe und kosmische Tiefe werden als zusammenhängende Pole derselben Ruhebewegung sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:ALT1","text":"Surface — Ein Wanderer schläft unter einem von einem Weinstock umarmten Baum, spricht im Einschlafen zu seiner Seele und erwacht nach wiederholtem Zurücksinken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:ALT2","text":"Structural — Eine Hierarchie der Bedürfnisse, eine Ökonomie minimaler Bindung und ein Schweigegebot erzeugen die Erfahrung des vollkommenen Glücks.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text verschiebt die maßgebliche Operation von Handlung und Ausdruck auf Empfänglichkeit, Unterlassung und den Widerstand gegen das Erwachen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Weltvollkommenheit, Ewigkeit, Seele und Sonnenstand werden in eine Ordnung gebracht, in der innere Zeitentgrenzung und äußere Zeitkontinuität zugleich gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von Einsamkeit über Schlaf und Glück bis zum verzögerten Erwachen zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob die Vollkommenheit eine ontologische Eigenschaft der Welt oder eine ekstatische Wahrnehmungsform Zarathustras ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:MRT3","text":"Intern spannungsvoll bleibt die Umwertung des Satzes, dass wenig zum Glück genüge: Die Formel erscheint zunächst als Lästerung, während die Erfahrung gerade das Geringste privilegiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:MRT4","text":"Nicht vollständig aufgelöst werden die Gegensätze zwischen Schlaf und Zwang, Vollkommenheit und Herzschmerz sowie Ewigkeitserfahrung und unveränderter Sonnenzeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:MRT5","text":"Die Rekonstruktion ist am stärksten bei der Ableitung von Ruhe, Schweigen, Minimalreiz und gespaltenem Subjekt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:MRT6","text":"Sie hängt dort von Kompression ab, wo Bildbewegungen von Schiff, Faden, Tropfen, Ball und Brunnen in strukturelle Funktionen überführt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:MRT7","text":"Die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung bleibt erhalten, sofern die widersprechende Stimme der Seele und die ungelöste Endfrage nach ihrer Aufnahme nicht beseitigt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T193652493177Z_ed83a770","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Noon","source_sha256":"2899af4dc3e9c9edaecb731f41f2b6d1be8d27ba962a7eb7bbd8076aa85c3813","sha256":"75cc8bb881a281e43308bac7c4fcbe8c854608b2a00330b7efd84c9c3e1f954a","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:36:52.495104+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:AS1","text":"Zarathustra's solitude turns into self-enjoyment and renewed encounter with himself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:AS2","text":"At perfect noon, the desire for sleep displaces the desire for the grape.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:AS3","text":"Sleep does not close perception, but compels the soul to a wakeful stretching-out.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:AS4","text":"Satiety with the good produces weariness, golden sadness, and trusting attachment to the earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:AS5","text":"The perfect world demands silence; the smallest and quietest event produces the highest experience of happiness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:AS6","text":"The attempt to awaken fails because of the resistant soul, until the sunbeam transforms the experience into a question of eternity and incorporation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:A1","text":"Zarathustra's being alone is experienced as enjoyable self-presence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:A2","text":"The desire for sleep becomes stronger than the small thirst for the grape.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:A3","text":"Sleep leaves the eyes open and the soul capable of perception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:A4","text":"Sleep acts lightly, yet compellingly, upon the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:A5","text":"The abundance of good and ripe things produces fatigue and golden sadness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:A6","text":"The earth appears more reliable than the uncertain seas; a minimal bond suffices for support.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:A7","text":"The perfect world demands silence rather than song, flute-playing, or linguistic communication.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:A8","text":"The best happiness manifests itself in the smallest, quietest, and lightest.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:A9","text":"The hour of noon can be experienced as the evening of a seventh day and as a fall into the well of eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:A10","text":"Zarathustra's soul can contradict the command to awaken and return to sleep.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:A11","text":"The sunbeam opens the question of when heaven, eternity, or the abyss of noon will take the soul into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0027","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:A12","text":"After sleep, the sun still stands above Zarathustra's head.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:NX1","text":"Solitude is not admitted as a mere lack of others.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:NX2","text":"Sleep is not determined as the closing of the eyes or the deactivation of the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:NX3","text":"The perfect noonday world excludes song, whispering, and external communication.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:NX4","text":"Attachment to the earth requires neither a strong rope nor violent fastening.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:NX5","text":"Happiness is not defined by quantity, intensity, or accumulated possession.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:NX6","text":"The command to awaken does not lead immediately to the ending of sleep.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:NX7","text":"The inner experience of eternity is not confirmed by a long external duration of sleep.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:NX8","text":"The soul does not remain identical with the speaking I and available without contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:D1","text":"The shift from thirst to sleep makes the ordering of needs into a hierarchical decision in favor of rest.","refs":["CH_97E9_MITT:A2","CH_97E9_MITT:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:D2","text":"Sleep transforms withdrawal into continued perception, because the open soul continues to see and praise tree and vine.","refs":["CH_97E9_MITT:A3","CH_97E9_MITT:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:D3","text":"The abundance of the good leads not to further activity, but to stretching-out, weariness, and the need for rest.","refs":["CH_97E9_MITT:A4","CH_97E9_MITT:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:D4","text":"Trust in the earth is established through the weakest effective bond.","refs":["CH_97E9_MITT:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:D5","text":"Only the suppression of the movement of expression makes the slightest perceptual stimuli effective as bearers of happiness.","refs":["CH_97E9_MITT:A7","CH_97E9_MITT:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:D6","text":"Perfect noon shifts the perception of time from the course of the day into a paradoxical experience of eternity.","refs":["CH_97E9_MITT:A8","CH_97E9_MITT:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:D7","text":"Awakening appears as a conflict between the commanding Zarathustra and the withdrawing soul.","refs":["CH_97E9_MITT:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:D8","text":"The unchanged position of the sun separates inner temporal dilation from external time measurement.","refs":["CH_97E9_MITT:A9","CH_97E9_MITT:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:SD1","text":"Perfection is produced as a state of maximal rest, not as an increase in action or possession.","refs":["CH_97E9_MITT:A2","CH_97E9_MITT:A7","CH_97E9_MITT:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:SD2","text":"Happiness is organized through reduction: the fewer stimuli, movements, and expressions are admitted, the more complete the experience appears.","refs":["CH_97E9_MITT:A7","CH_97E9_MITT:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:SD3","text":"The subject disintegrates into a commanding voice and an autonomous soul, whereby rest appears as negotiated resistance.","refs":["CH_97E9_MITT:A4","CH_97E9_MITT:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:SD4","text":"The temporal structure interweaves noon, evening, sleep, and eternity without abolishing the external order of the sun.","refs":["CH_97E9_MITT:A9","CH_97E9_MITT:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:SD5","text":"Local contact with the earth opens no opposition to cosmic depth, but leads through minimal attachment to the question of complete incorporation into eternity.","refs":["CH_97E9_MITT:A6","CH_97E9_MITT:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:SD6","text":"Happiness remains bound to an unresolved tension: it is experienced as perfect and at the same time registered as a painful stab in the heart.","refs":["CH_97E9_MITT:A5","CH_97E9_MITT:A8","CH_97E9_MITT:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0029","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:DNX1","text":"The system excludes the assumption that happiness arises primarily through increase, possession, or intensification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:DNX2","text":"The system excludes the assumption that consciousness presupposes active wakefulness, closed eyes, or controlled attention.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:DNX3","text":"The system excludes the assumption that inner time and external duration form an identical order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:DNX4","text":"The system excludes the assumption of a unified, sovereign, and uncontradictorily available self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0026","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:DNX5","text":"The system excludes the assumption that a perfect world must be affirmed through language, song, or public confirmation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:DNX6","text":"The system excludes the assumption that awakening is the sovereign return of the I from a passive state.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:SNX1","text":"The complete communicability of perfection remains excluded; its intensity demands the suspension of expression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:SNX2","text":"The return to the ordinary order of needs and action remains barred, because neither is the grape taken nor is awakening carried out permanently.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:SNX3","text":"A definitive boundary between earth and eternity remains unsecured; the question of the soul's incorporation is not answered.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:SNX4","text":"A closed identity of the soul remains absent; it appears only as something that stretches out, resists, and may possibly be incorporated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:FGS1","text":"Solitude → self-enjoyment → heightened receptivity to a non-social world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:FGS2","text":"Grape as immediate object of need → competing desire for sleep → suspension of consumption.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:FGS3","text":"Sleep → open eyes and wakeful soul → perception without active movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:FGS4","text":"Overabundance of the good → weariness and golden sadness → leaning upon the earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:FGS5","text":"Perfect noon → command to be silent → minimal stimuli → intensified happiness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:FGS6","text":"Intensified happiness → dissolution of temporal bounds → heartache and shaft of eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:FGS7","text":"Command to awaken → resistance of the soul → renewed sleep → sunbeam as interruption.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:FGS8","text":"Sunbeam → question of heavenly incorporation → awakening amid unchanged external noon.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:AF1","text":"Solitude → self-enjoyment → grape as occasion → sleep instead of drinking → open perception → satiety with the good → connection to the earth → silence → minimal happiness → experience of eternity → stab in the heart → failed command to awaken → renewed sleep → sunbeam → question of the soul's incorporation → awakening in unchanged noon.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0026","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:ME1","text":"Solitude is remapped from a social deficit into a productive form of self-presence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:ME2","text":"Sleep is reclassified from unconsciousness into a wakeful, compelled, and perceptive receptivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:ME3","text":"Happiness is shifted from quantitative abundance to minimal stimulus intensity and soundless perception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:ME4","text":"Noon is remapped from a point in time into a threshold between the order of the day, Sabbath evening, and eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:ME5","text":"Awakening becomes legible no longer as return, but as conflict between command of the I and resistance of the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:ME6","text":"Earthly proximity and cosmic depth become visible as connected poles of the same movement of rest.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:ALT1","text":"Surface — A wanderer sleeps beneath a tree embraced by a vine, speaks to his soul as he falls asleep, and awakens after repeatedly sinking back.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:ALT2","text":"Structural — A hierarchy of needs, an economy of minimal attachment, and a command to be silent produce the experience of perfect happiness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text shifts the decisive operation from action and expression to receptivity, omission, and resistance to awakening.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — World-perfection, eternity, soul, and the position of the sun are brought into an order in which inner dissolution of temporal bounds and external temporal continuity apply simultaneously.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from solitude through sleep and happiness to delayed awakening.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is whether perfection is an ontological property of the world or an ecstatic mode of Zarathustra's perception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:MRT3","text":"The revaluation of the proposition that little suffices for happiness remains internally tense: the formula initially appears as blasphemy, while the experience privileges precisely the least.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:MRT4","text":"The oppositions between sleep and compulsion, perfection and heartache, as well as experience of eternity and unchanged solar time, are not completely resolved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:MRT5","text":"The reconstruction is strongest in the derivation of rest, silence, minimal stimulus, and the divided subject.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:MRT6","text":"It depends on compression where the image-movements of ship, thread, drop, ball, and well are transferred into structural functions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_MITT:MRT7","text":"The actual argumentative movement remains preserved provided that the contradicting voice of the soul and the unresolved final question of its incorporation are not eliminated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_MITT:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_MITT@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_MITT:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 137","title":"At Noon","context":"Chapter 137","original_title":"Mittags","original_context":"Chapter 137"},"original_title":"Mittags","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0","layer":"CH","title":"The Greeting","order":138,"parents":["RAW_97E9_DBS0"],"revision":"CH_97E9_DBS0@R001","sha256":"f230342ce67c1bf99b4b0917924f9246410c37fc66afcbeb2198c7339bf6f308","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:AS1","text":"Die vergebliche Suche nach dem höheren Menschen endet, als der vielstimmige Notschrei dessen Anwesenheit in Zarathustras eigener Höhle enthüllt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:AS2","text":"Die Argumentation operiert als dramatische Selektionsdiagnostik: Sammlung, Aufnahme, Erhebung, Prüfung, Ausschluss und Aufschub.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0047","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:AS3","text":"Zarathustra verwandelt die Verzweifelten durch Gastlichkeit und Schutz vorläufig aus Hilfsbedürftigen in Gäste.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:AS4","text":"Der König deutet diese Verwandlung als Beweis einer stärkenden Herrschaft und als Vorzeichen eines allgemeinen Aufstiegs zu Zarathustra.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:AS5","text":"Zarathustra verwirft diese Deutung, indem er zwischen dem vorhandenen höheren Menschen und den für seine Aufgabe erforderlichen Höheren unterscheidet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0037","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:AS6","text":"Die Gäste werden nicht als Gefährten, Erben oder Vollendung bestimmt, sondern als Brücken und Stufen für eine noch ausstehende Art.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0045","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0046","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:AS7","text":"Die Bewegung endet nicht in der Konstituierung einer Gemeinschaft, sondern in der durch Abwesenheit verstärkten Erwartung von Kindern, Erben und lachenden Löwen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0047","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0049","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0050","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0054","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:A1","text":"Der Notschrei erscheint als ein einzelner Laut, besteht jedoch aus vielen verzweifelten Stimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:A2","text":"Der höhere Mensch ist durch Zarathustras Lockrufe und Honig-Opfer in dessen Höhle versammelt worden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:A3","text":"Der Anblick von Verzweifelnden erzeugt bei Zarathustra Mut und muthwillige Stärke.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:A4","text":"Zarathustras Gastlichkeit bietet Schutz, Ruhe, Anteilnahme und die Öffnung seines Eigenen an.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:A5","text":"Die Bezeichnung höherer Mensch genügt nicht für Zugehörigkeit zu Zarathustras Aufgabe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0037","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:A6","text":"Zarathustras Kampf verlangt Wesen, die weder geschont werden wollen noch durch Härte, Lärm oder Gefahr zerbrechen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0039","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:A7","text":"Die Lehre verlangt ein reines und glattes Spiegelverhältnis, damit ihr Bild nicht verzerrt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0042","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:A8","text":"Lasten, Erinnerungen, verborgene Niedrigkeit und Missgestalt der Gäste verzerren dieses Spiegelverhältnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0042","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0043","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0044","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:A9","text":"Die gegenwärtigen höheren Menschen sind Brücken und Stufen, nicht Zarathustras rechter Arm, Erbe oder endgültige Gefolgschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0038","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0045","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:A10","text":"Zarathustras Kinder sind als lebendige Pflanzung seines Willens und seiner höchsten Hoffnung bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0053","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0054","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:A11","text":"Die Erwarteten müssen höher, stärker, sieghafter, wohlgemuther und an Leib und Seele rechtwinklig gebaut sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0050","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:A12","text":"Zarathustra verweigert den letzten Abstieg, solange die Erwarteten nicht erschienen sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0047","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:NX1","text":"Der vielstimmige Notschrei ist nicht die Stimme eines einheitlichen Subjekts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:NX2","text":"Die Höhle ist nicht länger ausschließlich Ort der Einsamkeit, sondern wird zum Ort der Prüfung versammelter Bedürftigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:NX3","text":"Gastlichkeit ist nicht Gleichstellung mit dem Gastgeber.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:NX4","text":"Verzweiflung ist nicht Unfähigkeit zur vorläufigen Erhebung, aber auch nicht Qualifikation für Zarathustras Krieg.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:NX5","text":"Höhersein ist nicht identisch mit Höhe, Stärke oder Sieghaftigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0050","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:NX6","text":"Nähe zu Zarathustra ist nicht Zugehörigkeit zu seinem rechten Arm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:NX7","text":"Die Gäste sind nicht die Kinder, Erben oder Endgestalten von Zarathustras Willen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0045","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0046","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0051","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:NX8","text":"Die Menschen der großen Sehnsucht, des großen Ekels und des großen Überdrusses sind nicht die von Zarathustra Erwarteten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0047","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0048","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:NX9","text":"Der Überrest Gottes unter Menschen ist nicht die Quelle der großen Hoffnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0048","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:D1","text":"Die von Zarathustra herbeigeführte Versammlung erfüllt seine Suche nur äußerlich, weil das Gefundene die Bedingungen des Gesuchten nicht erfüllt.","refs":["CH_97E9_DBS0:A2","CH_97E9_DBS0:A5","CH_97E9_DBS0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:D2","text":"Die Begrüssung fungiert als temporäre Sicherung der Gäste, ohne ihre hierarchische Unterordnung aufzuheben.","refs":["CH_97E9_DBS0:A3","CH_97E9_DBS0:A4","CH_97E9_DBS0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:D3","text":"Die Not der Gäste kann Zarathustras Macht sichtbar machen, ohne die Gäste selbst zu Trägern dieser Macht zu machen.","refs":["CH_97E9_DBS0:A3","CH_97E9_DBS0:A5","CH_97E9_DBS0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:D4","text":"Die königliche Erfahrung von Erhebung begründet keine gültige Identifikation zwischen ermutigter Hoffnung und notwendiger Zukunftsgestalt.","refs":["CH_97E9_DBS0:A4","CH_97E9_DBS0:A5","CH_97E9_DBS0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0034","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0050","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:D5","text":"Die Gegenwart der höheren Menschen erhält ihren Wert nur als vermittelnde Durchgangsform zu einer zukünftigen Erbschaft.","refs":["CH_97E9_DBS0:A9","CH_97E9_DBS0:A10","CH_97E9_DBS0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0054","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:D6","text":"Die Lehre wird nicht als allgemein anschlussfähiger Inhalt behandelt, sondern als Bild, dessen Wahrheit von der Beschaffenheit seines Trägers abhängt.","refs":["CH_97E9_DBS0:A7","CH_97E9_DBS0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0042","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0043","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:D7","text":"Der letzte Abstieg wird zur bedingten Zukunftshandlung und nicht zur Konsequenz der bereits versammelten Anhängerschaft.","refs":["CH_97E9_DBS0:A9","CH_97E9_DBS0:A10","CH_97E9_DBS0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0047","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:SD1","text":"Das System erzeugt eine zeitliche Hierarchie, in der die Gegenwart nicht als Vollendung, sondern als Material, Schwelle und Übergang der Zukunft fungiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_DBS0:A9","CH_97E9_DBS0:A10","CH_97E9_DBS0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0046","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0054","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:SD2","text":"Die Begegnung mit den höheren Menschen ist zugleich Aufnahmeverfahren und Ausschlussverfahren: Sie gewährt Schutz, um danach ihre Unzulänglichkeit zu bestimmen.","refs":["CH_97E9_DBS0:A4","CH_97E9_DBS0:A5","CH_97E9_DBS0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:SD3","text":"Die gesuchte Zukunftsfigur verbindet militärische Härte, ästhetische Form, lehrfähige Spiegelung und affirmative Heiterkeit zu einem einzigen Selektionskriterium.","refs":["CH_97E9_DBS0:A6","CH_97E9_DBS0:A7","CH_97E9_DBS0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:SD4","text":"Hoffnung wird nicht aus der Beseitigung der Verzweiflung gewonnen, sondern aus der Umordnung der Verzweifelten zu Vorzeichen einer ihnen übergeordneten Möglichkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_DBS0:A3","CH_97E9_DBS0:A9","CH_97E9_DBS0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0054","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:DNX1","text":"Es muss falsch sein, dass moralische, geistige oder leidensgeprägte Erhöhung bereits die für Schöpfung und Kampf erforderliche Höhe darstellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0050","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:DNX2","text":"Es muss falsch sein, dass gemeinsame Bedürftigkeit eine tragfähige Gemeinschaft begründet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0045","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:DNX3","text":"Es muss falsch sein, dass die vorhandenen Suchenden durch Annäherung an Zarathustra zu dessen legitimen Erben werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0046","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:DNX4","text":"Es muss falsch sein, dass Lehre unabhängig von der Form und Kraft ihrer Empfänger unverzerrt fortbestehen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0042","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0043","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0044","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:DNX5","text":"Es muss falsch sein, dass die Wiederkehr religiöser Hoffnung als Rest Gottes die gesuchte Zukunft eröffnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0047","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0048","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:SNX1","text":"Die legitime Vollendung der Menschheit ist im gegenwärtig Versammelten nicht verfügbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0047","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0049","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:SNX2","text":"Das erwartete Subjekt der Zukunft kann nicht durch Trost, Schutz oder Anerkennung aus den vorhandenen Gästen erzeugt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0046","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0051","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:SNX3","text":"Der letzte Abstieg bleibt versperrt, weil seine geschichtliche Berechtigung von einem abwesenden Erbe abhängt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0047","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0049","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:SNX4","text":"Die große Hoffnung erhält ihre operative Kraft gerade aus der Nichtgegenwart dessen, worauf sie wartet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0049","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0050","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0054","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:FGS1","text":"Vergebliche Suche + vielstimmiger Notschrei → Lokalisierung des höheren Menschen im Eigenen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:FGS2","text":"Lokalisierung + Gastrecht → vorläufige Entschärfung der Verzweiflung und Sichtbarkeit von Zarathustras Stärke.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:FGS3","text":"Erhebung der Gäste + königliche Deutung → Versuch, die Versammlung als erfüllte Erwartung zu lesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:FGS4","text":"Prüfung an Kampf, Spiegelung, Form und Erbfähigkeit → Disqualifikation der vorhandenen höheren Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:FGS5","text":"Disqualifikation + Brückenfunktion → Umwandlung der Gegenwart in Übergangsmaterial.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0045","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0046","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:FGS6","text":"Abwesende Kinder + verweigerter letzter Abstieg → offene, aufgeschobene Zukunftsposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:AF1","text":"Vergebliche Suche → Notschrei aus der Höhle → Versammlung der höheren Menschen → gastliche Sicherung → königliche Hoffnungsdeutung → zarathustrische Zurückweisung → Brückenstatus → Erwartung der Kinder → Aufschub des letzten Abstiegs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0047","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:ME1","text":"Der höhere Mensch wird von einer scheinbaren Endstufe in eine intern differenzierte Übergangskategorie verwandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0046","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:ME2","text":"Gastlichkeit wird von einer Ethik der Gleichheit in eine Technik der temporären Sicherung bei fortbestehender Hierarchie umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:ME3","text":"Verzweiflung wird nicht bloß als Mangel, sondern als Material für die Selbststeigerung des Gastgeberwillens sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:ME4","text":"Erbschaft wird nicht biologisch oder institutionell, sondern als Selektionsproblem von Form, Kraft, Spiegelung und Willen gezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:ME5","text":"Zukunft wird nicht als Fortschreibung der vorhandenen Gemeinschaft, sondern als Ankunft einer qualitativ anderen Gestalt kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0046","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0049","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:ALT1","text":"Surface — Zarathustra kehrt zu seiner Höhle zurück, empfängt versammelte Verzweifelte und erklärt sie für unzureichend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Szene organisiert eine Hierarchie von Schutzbedürftigen, Brückenfiguren, Kämpfern, Erben und abwesenden Kindern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0050","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Aufnahme dient nicht der Integration, sondern der Prüfung, Funktionszuweisung und Selektion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Gegenwart erhält nur vorläufigen Sinn; die maßgebliche Gestalt bleibt zukünftig, abwesend und als Bedingung des Handelns wirksam.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0047","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0049","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0054","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von Fund, Aufnahme, Prüfung, Ausschluss und Erwartung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0047","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wodurch die erwarteten Kinder tatsächlich hervorgebracht werden und nach welchem Verfahren ihre Ankunft erkannt würde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:MRT3","text":"Das System ist intern kohärent, sofern Schutz als vorläufige Verfügung und nicht als Anerkennung von Gleichrangigkeit gelesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:MRT4","text":"Seine stärkste Operation liegt in der Trennung zwischen bereits erhöhtem Menschen und einer noch ausstehenden, erb- und kampffähigen Zukunftsgestalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0050","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:MRT5","text":"Seine Selektionskriterien bleiben normativ verdichtet, weil Stärke, Schönheit, Rechtwinkligkeit und reine Spiegelung nicht operational bestimmt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:MRT6","text":"Die zentrale Spannung besteht darin, dass Zarathustras Stärke aus dem Anblick der Verzweifelten gewinnt, während er dieselben Verzweifelten als unbrauchbar für seinen Kampf verwirft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0040","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:MRT7","text":"Eine Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung nur, wenn die Gastlichkeit als Durchgang zur Distanzierung und nicht als Endposition behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0047","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T193122213975Z_e5fe73e6","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"The Greeting","source_sha256":"f230342ce67c1bf99b4b0917924f9246410c37fc66afcbeb2198c7339bf6f308","sha256":"1ffb80c068b9419634edc855fa7115cb42a14a1fe0b07981b7f4f40f79664d71","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:31:22.215702+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:AS1","text":"The futile search for the higher human being ends when the many-voiced cry of distress reveals their presence in Zarathustra's own cave.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:AS2","text":"The argument operates as a dramatic diagnostic of selection: gathering, reception, elevation, testing, exclusion, and postponement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0047","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:AS3","text":"Through hospitality and protection, Zarathustra provisionally transforms the desperate from persons in need of help into guests.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:AS4","text":"The king interprets this transformation as proof of a strengthening rule and as an omen of a general ascent toward Zarathustra.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:AS5","text":"Zarathustra rejects this interpretation by distinguishing between the existing higher human being and the higher ones required for his task.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0037","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:AS6","text":"The guests are defined not as companions, heirs, or fulfilment, but as bridges and steps for a kind yet to come.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0045","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0046","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:AS7","text":"The movement ends not in the constitution of a community, but in the expectation, intensified by absence, of children, heirs, and laughing lions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0047","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0049","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0050","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0054","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:A1","text":"The cry of distress appears as a single sound, yet consists of many desperate voices.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:A2","text":"The higher human being has been gathered in Zarathustra's cave through his calls and honey-sacrifices.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:A3","text":"The sight of desperate persons produces courage and wanton strength in Zarathustra.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:A4","text":"Zarathustra's hospitality offers protection, rest, sympathy, and the opening of what is his own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:A5","text":"The designation higher human being is insufficient for belonging to Zarathustra's task.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0034","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0037","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:A6","text":"Zarathustra's struggle demands beings who neither wish to be spared nor break under hardness, noise, or danger.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0039","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0040","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0041","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:A7","text":"The teaching requires a pure and smooth mirror relation so that its image is not distorted.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0042","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:A8","text":"The guests' burdens, memories, concealed baseness, and deformity distort this mirror relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0042","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0043","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0044","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:A9","text":"The present higher human beings are bridges and steps, not Zarathustra's right arm, heir, or final following.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0038","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0045","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:A10","text":"Zarathustra's children are defined as the living planting of his will and his highest hope.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0053","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0054","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:A11","text":"Those awaited must be higher, stronger, more victorious, more cheerful, and built at right angles in body and soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0050","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:A12","text":"Zarathustra refuses the final descent so long as those awaited have not appeared.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0047","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:NX1","text":"The many-voiced cry of distress is not the voice of a unified subject.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:NX2","text":"The cave is no longer exclusively a place of solitude, but becomes a place for testing gathered neediness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:NX3","text":"Hospitality is not equality with the host.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:NX4","text":"Despair is not incapacity for provisional elevation, but neither is it a qualification for Zarathustra's war.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:NX5","text":"Being higher is not identical with height, strength, or victoriousness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0050","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:NX6","text":"Proximity to Zarathustra is not belonging to his right arm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:NX7","text":"The guests are not the children, heirs, or final forms of Zarathustra's will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0045","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0046","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0051","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:NX8","text":"The human beings of great longing, great disgust, and great weariness are not those awaited by Zarathustra.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0047","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0048","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:NX9","text":"The remnant of God among human beings is not the source of great hope.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0048","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:D1","text":"The gathering brought about by Zarathustra fulfils his search only externally, because what is found does not fulfil the conditions of what is sought.","refs":["CH_97E9_DBS0:A2","CH_97E9_DBS0:A5","CH_97E9_DBS0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0034","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:D2","text":"The greeting functions as a temporary securing of the guests without abolishing their hierarchical subordination.","refs":["CH_97E9_DBS0:A3","CH_97E9_DBS0:A4","CH_97E9_DBS0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:D3","text":"The guests' distress can make Zarathustra's power visible without making the guests themselves bearers of this power.","refs":["CH_97E9_DBS0:A3","CH_97E9_DBS0:A5","CH_97E9_DBS0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:D4","text":"The royal experience of elevation does not ground a valid identification between encouraged hope and the necessary figure of the future.","refs":["CH_97E9_DBS0:A4","CH_97E9_DBS0:A5","CH_97E9_DBS0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0034","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0050","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:D5","text":"The presence of the higher human beings receives its value only as a mediating transitional form toward a future inheritance.","refs":["CH_97E9_DBS0:A9","CH_97E9_DBS0:A10","CH_97E9_DBS0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0054","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:D6","text":"The teaching is treated not as content capable of general uptake, but as an image whose truth depends on the constitution of its bearer.","refs":["CH_97E9_DBS0:A7","CH_97E9_DBS0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0042","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0043","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:D7","text":"The final descent becomes a conditional future action and not a consequence of the following already gathered.","refs":["CH_97E9_DBS0:A9","CH_97E9_DBS0:A10","CH_97E9_DBS0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0047","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:SD1","text":"The system produces a temporal hierarchy in which the present functions not as fulfilment, but as material, threshold, and transition of the future.","refs":["CH_97E9_DBS0:A9","CH_97E9_DBS0:A10","CH_97E9_DBS0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0046","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0054","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:SD2","text":"The encounter with the higher human beings is at once an admission procedure and an exclusion procedure: it grants protection in order thereafter to determine their inadequacy.","refs":["CH_97E9_DBS0:A4","CH_97E9_DBS0:A5","CH_97E9_DBS0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:SD3","text":"The sought figure of the future combines military hardness, aesthetic form, teachable mirroring, and affirmative cheerfulness into a single criterion of selection.","refs":["CH_97E9_DBS0:A6","CH_97E9_DBS0:A7","CH_97E9_DBS0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:SD4","text":"Hope is gained not from the removal of despair, but from the reordering of the desperate into signs of a possibility superior to them.","refs":["CH_97E9_DBS0:A3","CH_97E9_DBS0:A9","CH_97E9_DBS0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0054","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:DNX1","text":"It must be false that moral, spiritual, or suffering-marked elevation already constitutes the height required for creation and struggle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0037","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0040","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0050","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:DNX2","text":"It must be false that shared neediness grounds a viable community.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0045","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:DNX3","text":"It must be false that the existing seekers become Zarathustra's legitimate heirs through approaching him.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0038","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0046","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:DNX4","text":"It must be false that teaching can persist undistorted independently of the form and strength of its recipients.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0042","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0043","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0044","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:DNX5","text":"It must be false that the return of religious hope as a remnant of God opens the sought future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0047","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0048","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:SNX1","text":"The legitimate fulfilment of humanity is not available in what is presently gathered.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0034","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0047","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0049","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:SNX2","text":"The awaited subject of the future cannot be produced from the existing guests through consolation, protection, or recognition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0046","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0051","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:SNX3","text":"The final descent remains barred because its historical justification depends on an absent heir.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0047","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0049","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:SNX4","text":"Great hope derives its operative force precisely from the non-presence of that for which it waits.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0049","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0050","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0054","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:FGS1","text":"Futile search + many-voiced cry of distress → localization of the higher human being within what is one's own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:FGS2","text":"Localization + right of hospitality → provisional defusing of despair and visibility of Zarathustra's strength.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:FGS3","text":"Elevation of the guests + royal interpretation → attempt to read the gathering as fulfilled expectation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:FGS4","text":"Testing against struggle, mirroring, form, and capacity for inheritance → disqualification of the existing higher human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0040","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0046","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:FGS5","text":"Disqualification + bridge function → transformation of the present into transitional material.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0045","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0046","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:FGS6","text":"Absent children + refused final descent → open, postponed position of the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0049","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0051","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:AF1","text":"Futile search → cry of distress from the cave → gathering of the higher human beings → hospitable securing → royal interpretation of hope → Zarathustrian rejection → bridge status → expectation of the children → postponement of the final descent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0047","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:ME1","text":"The higher human being is transformed from an apparent final stage into an internally differentiated transitional category.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0046","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:ME2","text":"Hospitality is reclassified from an ethics of equality into a technique of temporary securing under persisting hierarchy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:ME3","text":"Despair becomes visible not merely as a lack, but as material for the self-enhancement of the host's will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:ME4","text":"Inheritance is depicted not biologically or institutionally, but as a problem of selection involving form, strength, mirroring, and will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0042","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0050","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:ME5","text":"The future is mapped not as the continuation of the existing community, but as the arrival of a qualitatively different figure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0046","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0049","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:ALT1","text":"Surface — Zarathustra returns to his cave, receives gathered desperate persons, and declares them insufficient.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:ALT2","text":"Structural — The scene organizes a hierarchy of persons in need of protection, bridge figures, fighters, heirs, and absent children.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0050","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Reception serves not integration, but testing, assignment of function, and selection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0033","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The present receives only provisional meaning; the decisive figure remains future, absent, and effective as a condition of action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0047","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0049","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0051","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0054","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement of finding, reception, testing, exclusion, and expectation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0034","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0047","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is how the awaited children are actually brought forth and by what procedure their arrival would be recognized.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:MRT3","text":"The system is internally coherent insofar as protection is read as a provisional disposition and not as recognition of equality of rank.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0038","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:MRT4","text":"Its strongest operation lies in the separation between the human being already elevated and a future figure yet to come, capable of inheritance and struggle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0037","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0045","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0050","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:MRT5","text":"Its criteria of selection remain normatively condensed because strength, beauty, right-angularity, and pure mirroring are not operationally determined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:MRT6","text":"The central tension consists in the fact that Zarathustra gains strength from the sight of the desperate, while rejecting those same desperate persons as unusable for his struggle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0040","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DBS0:MRT7","text":"A reconstruction preserves the actual movement only if hospitality is treated as a passage toward distancing and not as a final position.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0045","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DBS0:P0047","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_DBS0@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_DBS0:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 138","title":"The Greeting","context":"Chapter 138","original_title":"Die Begrüssung","original_context":"Chapter 138"},"original_title":"Die Begrüssung","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA","layer":"CH","title":"The Last Supper","order":139,"parents":["RAW_97E9_DASA"],"revision":"CH_97E9_DASA@R001","sha256":"a36b0b7857998809ebf56ef9c5939d3989dcb7fd0723d724099127ec4b46819e","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:AS1","text":"Eine zeremonielle Begrüßung und Weisheitsrede werden durch akute körperliche Not unterbrochen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:AS2","text":"Das zentrale Problem ist, wie eine versammelte, erschöpfte Gemeinschaft ihre Bedürfnisse jenseits bloßer Rede organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:AS3","text":"Der Text argumentiert diagnostisch und strategisch, indem er körperliche Versorgung zur Bedingung weiterer Rede macht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:AS4","text":"Die Mahlzeit wird durch differenzierte Bedürfnisse, verteilte Vorräte und gemeinsame Arbeit erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:AS5","text":"Zarathustras Norm wird als partikulares Gesetz der Zugehörigen von einer allgemeinen Vorschrift getrennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:AS6","text":"Die materiell organisierte Mahlzeit bildet den sozialen Schauplatz, auf dem die Rede vom höheren Menschen fortgesetzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:A1","text":"Notwendigkeiten sind hierarchisch geordnet; eine Sache kann gegenüber allen anderen Vorrang besitzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:A2","text":"Eine versammelte Gemeinschaft kann durch Hunger und Durst in eine akute körperliche Notlage geraten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:A3","text":"Rede und Weisheit ersetzen keine körperliche Nahrung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:A4","text":"Die angemessene Nahrung hängt von körperlicher Verfassung, Gewöhnung und individueller Lebensform ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:A5","text":"Der Wahrsager setzt Wein für Müde und Verwelkte gegen Wasser als plötzlich genesende Nahrung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:A6","text":"Die für das Mahl nötigen Vorräte sind ungleich verteilt und müssen zusammengeführt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:A7","text":"Wer mitessen will, muss an der Zubereitung mitwirken; königlicher Rang hebt diese Bedingung nicht auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:A8","text":"Zarathustras Gesetz gilt nur für die Seinen und nicht für alle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:A9","text":"Die Zugehörigen Zarathustras sollen körperlich stark, beweglich, fröhlich, gesund und für Schwerstes wie für Feste bereit sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:A10","text":"Den Zugehörigen steht das Beste zu; wird es nicht gegeben, dürfen sie es nehmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:A11","text":"Die eigene genügsame Lebensform des freiwilligen Bettlers bleibt zulässig, sofern sie ihn fröhlich macht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:A12","text":"Die Mahlzeit wird als soziale Einheit hergestellt, in deren Verlauf die Rede auf den höheren Menschen konzentriert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:NX1","text":"Das Mahl darf nicht durch Reden über Weisheit ersetzt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:NX2","text":"Wasser ist keine allgemein angemessene Nahrung für erschöpfte oder verwelkte Körper.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:NX3","text":"Brot allein genügt nicht als vollständige Lebensgrundlage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:NX4","text":"Zarathustras Ernährungs- und Lebensgesetz ist keine allgemeine Norm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:NX5","text":"Königlicher Status berechtigt nicht zur passiven Teilnahme.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:NX6","text":"Die Zugehörigkeit zu Zarathustra verlangt keine erzwungene Konformität von Außenstehenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:NX7","text":"Eine höhere Lebensform wird nicht durch Fleisch, Wein, Gewürze oder Festlichkeit ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:NX8","text":"Das, was gegeben wird, begrenzt nicht notwendig den Anspruch auf das Beste.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:NX9","text":"Die Mahlzeit ist kein rein privater Konsumakt, sondern setzt kollektive Herstellung voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:D1","text":"Die körperliche Not unterbricht die zeremonielle Rede, weil Versorgung gegenüber Begrüßung und Weisheitsrede priorisiert wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASA:A1","CH_97E9_DASA:A2","CH_97E9_DASA:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:D2","text":"Die Diagnose unterschiedlicher körperlicher Bedürfnisse erzeugt keine einheitliche, sondern eine differenzierte Ernährungsordnung.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASA:A4","CH_97E9_DASA:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:D3","text":"Die ungleich verteilten Vorräte werden durch gemeinsames Kombinieren und Zubereiten in eine funktionsfähige Mahlzeit überführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASA:A6","CH_97E9_DASA:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:D4","text":"Die Mahlzeit verwandelt soziale Rangordnung in eine operative Arbeitsteilung, in der auch Könige als Köche auftreten.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASA:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:D5","text":"Das System verbindet eine partikular geltende Norm mit der fortbestehenden Eigenpraxis des freiwilligen Bettlers.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASA:A8","CH_97E9_DASA:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:D6","text":"Die Zugehörigkeit wird nicht durch gemeinsame Bedürfnislosigkeit, sondern durch gemeinsame Stärke, Beweglichkeit, Festfähigkeit und Anspruchsbereitschaft bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASA:A9","CH_97E9_DASA:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:D7","text":"Die Mahlzeit wird zur materiellen und sozialen Voraussetzung für die anschließende Konzentration auf den höheren Menschen.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASA:A7","CH_97E9_DASA:A8","CH_97E9_DASA:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:SD1","text":"Körperliche Bedürftigkeit bestimmt nicht nur den Inhalt, sondern auch den Zeitpunkt und die Legitimität von Weisheitsrede.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASA:A1","CH_97E9_DASA:A2","CH_97E9_DASA:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:SD2","text":"Das System hebt den Gegensatz zwischen Askese und Genuss auf, indem es Entbehrungsfähigkeit und Festfähigkeit innerhalb eines Gesundheitsideals verbindet.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASA:A4","CH_97E9_DASA:A9","CH_97E9_DASA:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:SD3","text":"Allgemeine Moral wird durch eine gestufte Ordnung ersetzt, die zwischen den Seinen, den Fremden und individuellen Gegenpraktiken unterscheidet.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASA:A8","CH_97E9_DASA:A9","CH_97E9_DASA:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:SD4","text":"Hierarchie wird nicht abgeschafft, sondern in Teilnahme, Dienst und Zugriff auf das Beste neu organisiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASA:A7","CH_97E9_DASA:A9","CH_97E9_DASA:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:SD5","text":"Die Rede vom höheren Menschen erhält ihre Geltung nicht als abgelöste Lehre, sondern als Schlussform einer körperlich und sozial hergestellten Gemeinschaft.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASA:A3","CH_97E9_DASA:A7","CH_97E9_DASA:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Weisheit, die unabhängig von Hunger, Durst, Erschöpfung und Versorgung operiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein universales Gesetz, das unterschiedliche Körper, Lebensformen und Grade der Zugehörigkeit nivelliert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine stabile Trennung von körperlicher Bedürftigkeit und geistiger Höhe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Rangmodell, in dem Status von Arbeit und materieller Beteiligung entbindet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine neutrale Verteilungsordnung, in der das Beste ausschließlich durch Gabe und Zustimmung zugänglich wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:SNX1","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine für alle gleichermaßen gültige Lebens- und Ernährungsnorm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:SNX2","text":"Nicht erzeugbar ist eine Gemeinschaft ohne Grenze zwischen den Zugehörigen und den Nichtzugehörigen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:SNX3","text":"Versperrt bleibt eine vollständig versöhnte Verbindung von Nichtzwang, partikularer Gesetzgebung und dem Nehmen des Nichtgegebenen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:SNX4","text":"Unzulässig bleibt die Vorstellung, dass Wahrheit, Weisheit oder höhere Menschlichkeit ohne materielle Verkörperung und zeitliche Dringlichkeit bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:FGS1","text":"Versammlung + körperliche Not → Unterbrechung der zeremoniellen Rede.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:FGS2","text":"Vorrang des Notwendigen + Unzulänglichkeit der Rede → Vorrang von Essen und Trinken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:FGS3","text":"Differenzierte Körperzustände + unterschiedliche Lebensformen → differenzierte Nahrung und partikulare Geltung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:FGS4","text":"Ungleich verteilte Vorräte + Teilnahmebedingung → gemeinsame Zubereitung unter Einschluss der Könige.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:FGS5","text":"Partikulares Gesetz + zugelassene Eigenpraxis → normative Pluralität ohne allgemeine Gleichmachung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:FGS6","text":"Zugehörigkeit + Anspruch auf das Beste + Verweigerung der Gabe → legitimierter Zugriff.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:FGS7","text":"Materiell hergestellte Gemeinschaft → historisch bezeichnete Mahlzeit → konzentrierte Rede vom höheren Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:AF1","text":"Zeremonielle Begrüßung → Unterbrechung durch Hunger und Durst → Vorrang körperlicher Versorgung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:AF2","text":"Versorgungslücke → differenzierte Nahrung → verteilte Vorräte → gemeinsame Arbeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:AF3","text":"Gemeinsame Mahlzeit → partikulares Gesetz der Zugehörigen → Anspruch auf das Beste → Rede vom höheren Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:ME1","text":"Weisheit wird von einer autonomen Redeform zu einer Praxis mit körperlichen und zeitlichen Voraussetzungen umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:ME2","text":"Königtum wird von einem Privileg des Empfangens zu einer Funktion innerhalb der materiellen Herstellung verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:ME3","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Askese und Schlemmen zerfällt zugunsten einer nach Körper, Freude und Zugehörigkeit differenzierten Lebensform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:ME4","text":"Gemeinschaft wird nicht als universale Gleichheit, sondern als selektive Ordnung der Zugehörigen und zugelassenen Eigenformen sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:ME5","text":"Der höhere Mensch wird nicht als abstraktes Lehrziel, sondern als Gesprächsgegenstand einer leiblich erzeugten Gemeinschaft klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:ALT1","text":"Surface: Eine hungernde und durstige Versammlung fordert statt weiterer Rede eine Mahlzeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:ALT2","text":"Structural: Bedürfnisse, Vorräte, Arbeit, Rang und Zugehörigkeit werden zu einer sozialen Versorgungsordnung verbunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Der Text verlagert die Priorität von Lehre und allgemeinem Gesetz auf Zeitpunkt, Körper, Teilnahme und partikularen Anspruch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Menschliche Höhe erscheint als verkörperte, gesundheitsfähige und zeitlich situierte Existenz, deren Wahrheit nicht vom Leib abgelöst wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von der Unterbrechung der Rede zur Herstellung der Mahlzeit und zur anschließenden Rede vom höheren Menschen zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleiben die genaue Bedeutung des höheren Menschen, die Funktion des Eselsrufs und der Status der historischen Bezeichnung „das Abendmahl“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:MRT3","text":"Intern kohärent ist die Verbindung von körperlicher Dringlichkeit, gemeinsamer Arbeit und partikularer Normsetzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Stelle liegt in der Umordnung von Weisheit durch körperliche Not und materielle Teilnahme.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:MRT5","text":"Die größte Bruchlinie liegt zwischen der Zulassung fremder Eigenpraxis und dem exklusiven Anspruch der Zugehörigen auf das Beste.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung entsteht zwischen gemeinsamer Mahlzeit und der Ermächtigung, das Nichtgegebene zu nehmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die generative Bewegung, verliert jedoch die satirische und dialogische Mehrdeutigkeit der Szene.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T192922621710Z_216570df","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"The Last Supper","source_sha256":"a36b0b7857998809ebf56ef9c5939d3989dcb7fd0723d724099127ec4b46819e","sha256":"9d03cba92106da4a20109eff3cd91340af359135c955d709bd9fe1e2bcdd1db3","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:29:22.624196+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:AS1","text":"A ceremonial greeting and discourse on wisdom are interrupted by acute bodily distress.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:AS2","text":"The central problem is how an assembled, exhausted community organizes its needs beyond mere speech.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:AS3","text":"The text argues diagnostically and strategically by making bodily provision the condition of further speech.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:AS4","text":"The meal is produced through differentiated needs, distributed provisions, and shared labor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:AS5","text":"Zarathustra's norm is separated, as a particular law of the adherents, from a general prescription.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:AS6","text":"The materially organized meal forms the social scene upon which the discourse on the higher man is continued.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:A1","text":"Necessities are hierarchically ordered; one thing can take precedence over all others.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:A2","text":"An assembled community can fall into an acute bodily emergency through hunger and thirst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:A3","text":"Speech and wisdom do not replace bodily nourishment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:A4","text":"Appropriate nourishment depends on bodily condition, habituation, and individual way of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:A5","text":"The soothsayer opposes wine for the weary and withered to water as suddenly restorative nourishment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:A6","text":"The provisions necessary for the meal are unequally distributed and must be brought together.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:A7","text":"Whoever wishes to eat must participate in the preparation; royal rank does not suspend this condition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:A8","text":"Zarathustra's law applies only to his own and not to everyone.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:A9","text":"Zarathustra's adherents are to be bodily strong, mobile, cheerful, healthy, and ready for the heaviest things as well as for festivals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:A10","text":"The best belongs to the adherents; if it is not given, they may take it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:A11","text":"The voluntary beggar's own frugal way of life remains permissible, provided that it makes him cheerful.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:A12","text":"The meal is produced as a social unity, in the course of which the discourse is concentrated on the higher man.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:NX1","text":"The meal must not be replaced by talk about wisdom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:NX2","text":"Water is not universally appropriate nourishment for exhausted or withered bodies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:NX3","text":"Bread alone does not suffice as a complete basis of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:NX4","text":"Zarathustra's dietary and life-law is not a general norm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:NX5","text":"Royal status does not entitle one to passive participation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:NX6","text":"Belonging to Zarathustra does not require the coerced conformity of outsiders.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:NX7","text":"A higher form of life is not excluded by meat, wine, spices, or festivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:NX8","text":"What is given does not necessarily limit the claim to the best.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:NX9","text":"The meal is not a purely private act of consumption, but presupposes collective production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:D1","text":"Bodily distress interrupts ceremonial speech because provision is prioritized over greeting and discourse on wisdom.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASA:A1","CH_97E9_DASA:A2","CH_97E9_DASA:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:D2","text":"The diagnosis of different bodily needs produces not a uniform but a differentiated nutritional order.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASA:A4","CH_97E9_DASA:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:D3","text":"The unequally distributed provisions are transformed into a functional meal through joint combination and preparation.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASA:A6","CH_97E9_DASA:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:D4","text":"The meal transforms social hierarchy into an operational division of labor in which kings too appear as cooks.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASA:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:D5","text":"The system combines a particularly valid norm with the continuing self-practice of the voluntary beggar.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASA:A8","CH_97E9_DASA:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:D6","text":"Belonging is determined not by shared lack of needs, but by shared strength, mobility, capacity for festivity, and readiness to claim.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASA:A9","CH_97E9_DASA:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:D7","text":"The meal becomes the material and social precondition for the subsequent concentration on the higher man.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASA:A7","CH_97E9_DASA:A8","CH_97E9_DASA:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:SD1","text":"Bodily need determines not only the content but also the timing and legitimacy of discourse on wisdom.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASA:A1","CH_97E9_DASA:A2","CH_97E9_DASA:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:SD2","text":"The system abolishes the opposition between asceticism and enjoyment by combining the capacity for privation and the capacity for festivity within an ideal of health.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASA:A4","CH_97E9_DASA:A9","CH_97E9_DASA:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:SD3","text":"General morality is replaced by a graduated order that distinguishes between one's own, strangers, and individual counter-practices.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASA:A8","CH_97E9_DASA:A9","CH_97E9_DASA:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:SD4","text":"Hierarchy is not abolished, but reorganized in participation, service, and access to the best.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASA:A7","CH_97E9_DASA:A9","CH_97E9_DASA:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:SD5","text":"The discourse on the higher man receives its validity not as a detached doctrine, but as the concluding form of a bodily and socially produced community.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASA:A3","CH_97E9_DASA:A7","CH_97E9_DASA:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:DNX1","text":"Excluded is a wisdom that operates independently of hunger, thirst, exhaustion, and provision.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:DNX2","text":"Excluded is a universal law that levels different bodies, ways of life, and degrees of belonging.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a stable separation of bodily neediness and spiritual elevation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:DNX4","text":"Excluded is a model of rank in which status exempts one from work and material participation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:DNX5","text":"Excluded is a neutral order of distribution in which the best becomes accessible exclusively through gift and consent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:SNX1","text":"Unavailable is a norm of life and nourishment equally valid for all.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:SNX2","text":"A community without a boundary between adherents and non-adherents cannot be produced.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:SNX3","text":"A fully reconciled connection of non-coercion, particular legislation, and taking what has not been given remains blocked.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:SNX4","text":"Inadmissible remains the notion that truth, wisdom, or higher humanity exist without material embodiment and temporal urgency.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:FGS1","text":"Assembly + bodily distress → interruption of ceremonial speech.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:FGS2","text":"Priority of the necessary + insufficiency of speech → priority of eating and drinking.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:FGS3","text":"Differentiated bodily states + different ways of life → differentiated nourishment and particular validity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:FGS4","text":"Unequally distributed provisions + condition of participation → joint preparation including the kings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:FGS5","text":"Particular law + permitted self-practice → normative plurality without general leveling.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:FGS6","text":"Belonging + claim to the best + refusal of the gift → legitimized access.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:FGS7","text":"Materially produced community → historically designated meal → concentrated discourse on the higher man.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:AF1","text":"Ceremonial greeting → interruption through hunger and thirst → priority of bodily provision.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:AF2","text":"Gap in provision → differentiated nourishment → distributed provisions → shared labor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:AF3","text":"Shared meal → particular law of the adherents → claim to the best → discourse on the higher man.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:ME1","text":"Wisdom is remapped from an autonomous form of speech to a practice with bodily and temporal preconditions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:ME2","text":"Kingship is displaced from a privilege of receiving to a function within material production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:ME3","text":"The opposition between asceticism and feasting disintegrates in favor of a way of life differentiated according to body, joy, and belonging.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:ME4","text":"Community becomes visible not as universal equality, but as a selective order of adherents and permitted self-forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:ME5","text":"The higher man is classified not as an abstract doctrinal aim, but as the subject of discussion of a bodily produced community.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:ALT1","text":"Surface: An assembly hungry and thirsty demands a meal rather than further speech.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:ALT2","text":"Structural: Needs, provisions, labor, rank, and belonging are joined into a social order of provision.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: The text shifts priority from doctrine and general law to timing, body, participation, and particular claim.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Human elevation appears as an embodied existence capable of health and temporally situated, whose truth is not detached from the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from the interruption of speech to the production of the meal and to the subsequent discourse on the higher man.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:MRT2","text":"The precise meaning of the higher man, the function of the ass's cry, and the status of the historical designation „das Abendmahl“ remain underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:MRT3","text":"The connection of bodily urgency, shared labor, and particular norm-setting is internally coherent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:MRT4","text":"The strongest point lies in the reordering of wisdom through bodily distress and material participation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:MRT5","text":"The greatest fault line lies between the permission of foreign self-practice and the exclusive claim of the adherents to the best.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:MRT6","text":"A further tension arises between the shared meal and the authorization to take what has not been given.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASA:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the generative movement, but loses the satirical and dialogical ambiguity of the scene.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASA:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_DASA@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_DASA:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 139","title":"The Last Supper","context":"Chapter 139","original_title":"Das Abendmahl","original_context":"Chapter 139"},"original_title":"Das Abendmahl","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14","layer":"CH","title":"On the Higher Man · 1","order":140,"parents":["RAW_97E9_1_14"],"revision":"CH_97E9_1_14@R001","sha256":"58afc4f9b51e4e5936aa9db44eff3ce5def339e8f4f76eda1f46ed4811a892b6","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:AS1","text":"Der Versuch, die Menschen auf dem Markt unmittelbar anzusprechen, erzeugt keine gemeinsame Verständigung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:AS2","text":"Die öffentliche Menge verwandelt die Anrede des Höheren in eine Gleichheitsbehauptung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:AS3","text":"Die Gleichheitsbehauptung stützt sich auf die Berufung auf Gott.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:AS4","text":"Mit dem Tod Gottes verliert diese Berufung ihre letzte begründende Instanz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:AS5","text":"Die Aufhebung der göttlichen Gleichheitsbegründung hebt die Gleichheitsforderung des Pöbels nicht unmittelbar auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:AS6","text":"Die höheren Menschen müssen den Markt verlassen, weil ihre Anerkennung dort strukturell ausgeschlossen ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:A1","text":"Eine an alle gerichtete Rede kann ohne gemeinsame Aufnahmefähigkeit an niemanden gelangen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:A2","text":"Der Markt fungiert als Raum der öffentlichen Menge und des Pöbel-Lärms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:A3","text":"Der Pöbel erkennt keine Rangordnung höherer Menschen an.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:A4","text":"Der Pöbel setzt die Gleichheit aller Menschen als seine grundlegende Überzeugung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:A5","text":"Die Gleichheit aller Menschen wird im Pöbeldiskurs vor Gott begründet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:A6","text":"Gott ist gestorben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:A7","text":"Die höheren Menschen dürfen ihre Ungleichheit gegenüber dem Pöbel bejahen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:A8","text":"Der Markt ist kein geeigneter Ort für die Rede und Selbstbehauptung höherer Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:NX1","text":"Die Rede auf dem Markt ist keine wirksame Verständigung mit allen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:NX2","text":"Der Markt ist kein Ort, an dem höhere Menschen als solche anerkannt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:NX3","text":"Menschliche Verschiedenheit wird vom Pöbel nicht als legitime Rangordnung zugelassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:NX4","text":"Die Gleichheit vor Gott kann nach dem Tod Gottes nicht unverändert als gültige Begründung fortbestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:NX5","text":"Die höheren Menschen sind nicht verpflichtet, sich dem Gleichheitsmaß des Marktes zu unterwerfen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:NX6","text":"Der Pöbel-Lärm ist keine höhere Form des Sprechens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:D1","text":"Die unmittelbare Öffentlichkeit produziert nicht Gemeinschaft, sondern die Erfahrung des Sprechens zu niemandem.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_14:A1","CH_97E9_1_14:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:D2","text":"Wer auf dem Markt als höherer Mensch sprechen will, gerät in einen Raum, der seine Voraussetzung bestreitet.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_14:A2","CH_97E9_1_14:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:D3","text":"Die Formel „Mensch ist Mensch“ tilgt im Pöbeldiskurs die Unterscheidung zwischen höheren und nicht höheren Menschen.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_14:A3","CH_97E9_1_14:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:D4","text":"Die öffentliche Gleichheitsforderung besitzt im Text eine religiöse Herkunft, obwohl ihr religiöser Garant gestorben ist.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_14:A5","CH_97E9_1_14:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:D5","text":"Der Tod Gottes eröffnet die Möglichkeit, die Gleichheit vor Gott und die Gleichheit vor dem Pöbel auseinanderzutreten.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_14:A5","CH_97E9_1_14:A6","CH_97E9_1_14:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:D6","text":"Der Rückzug vom Markt wird zur notwendigen sozialen Konsequenz der Bejahung höherer Verschiedenheit.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_14:A3","CH_97E9_1_14:A7","CH_97E9_1_14:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:SD1","text":"Die öffentliche Gleichheit erscheint als fortwirkende Ordnung, deren transzendente Begründung bereits entfallen ist.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_14:A4","CH_97E9_1_14:A5","CH_97E9_1_14:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:SD2","text":"Der Tod Gottes beseitigt nicht automatisch die sozialen Formen, die aus der Gottesordnung hervorgegangen sind.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_14:A5","CH_97E9_1_14:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:SD3","text":"Der Markt wird vom Ort misslungener Verkündigung zum institutionellen Gegenraum der höheren Menschen.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_14:A2","CH_97E9_1_14:A3","CH_97E9_1_14:A7","CH_97E9_1_14:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:SD4","text":"Die Lehre von den höheren Menschen verlangt nicht primär Überzeugung der Menge, sondern räumliche und kommunikative Distanz zu ihr.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_14:A1","CH_97E9_1_14:A3","CH_97E9_1_14:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:DNX1","text":"Das System kann nicht auf der Annahme beruhen, dass öffentliche Sichtbarkeit automatisch Anerkennung erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:DNX2","text":"Es kann nicht voraussetzen, dass Gleichheit und höhere Rangordnung innerhalb desselben normativen Maßstabs versöhnt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:DNX3","text":"Es kann nicht voraussetzen, dass der Tod Gottes die religiös geprägte Gleichheitsordnung unmittelbar auflöst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:DNX4","text":"Es kann nicht auf einer Verständigung zwischen höherem Menschen und Pöbel beruhen, solange der Pöbel die Möglichkeit von Rangordnung bestreitet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:DNX5","text":"Es schließt eine politische Strategie aus, die auf der Zustimmung der anonymen Menge gründet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine gemeinsame Öffentlichkeit, in der Gleichheit und qualitative Überlegenheit ohne Rest nebeneinander bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine nachmetaphysische Ordnung, die ihre alten Gleichheitsformen bereits vollständig überwunden hätte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Möglichkeit, dass der Markt zum Ort einer höheren Gemeinschaft wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:SNX4","text":"Die unaufgelöste Abwesenheit einer neuen Begründung der Ungleichheit strukturiert den Rückzug der höheren Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:FGS1","text":"Anrede an alle → fehlende Aufnahme → Rede zu niemandem.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:FGS2","text":"Öffentlicher Markt → Verallgemeinerung durch den Pöbel → Tilgung höherer Differenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:FGS3","text":"Gleichheitsbehauptung → Berufung auf Gott → transzendente Legitimation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:FGS4","text":"Tod Gottes → Entfall des Garanten → Fortbestand der sozialen Gleichheitsform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:FGS5","text":"Fortbestehende Gleichheitsform + bejahte höhere Differenz → Trennung vom Markt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:FGS6","text":"Misslungene Verkündigung → Diagnose struktureller Unvereinbarkeit → strategischer Rückzug.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:AF1","text":"Einsiedlerische Isolation → öffentliche Anrede → kommunikatives Scheitern → Gleichheitsreaktion des Pöbels → religiöse Begründung → Tod Gottes → Zurückweisung der Gleichheit vor dem Pöbel → Rückzug der höheren Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:ME1","text":"Der Markt wird von einem möglichen Ort der Verkündigung zu einem Selektionsraum, der höhere Differenz ausschließt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:ME2","text":"Die Gleichheit vor Gott und die Gleichheit vor dem Pöbel werden als historisch verbundene, aber nicht identische Ebenen getrennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:ME3","text":"Kommunikationsmisserfolg wird nicht als individuelles Versagen, sondern als Struktur des Publikums kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:ME4","text":"Öffentlichkeit und Gemeinschaft fallen auseinander: Sichtbarkeit erhöht nicht die Möglichkeit der Verständigung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:ME5","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Einsiedelei und Markt wird durch eine dritte Position ersetzt: selektive Distanz der höheren Menschen zur Menge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:ALT1","text":"Surface — Eine Rede auf dem Markt scheitert an der Reaktion des Pöbels.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:ALT2","text":"Structural — Der Markt organisiert Gleichheit als Ausschluss jeder anerkannten Rangordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die angemessene Praxis höherer Menschen besteht nicht in öffentlicher Überredung, sondern im Verlassen des Marktes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Der Tod Gottes markiert einen Bruch der Begründung, ohne die aus ihr hervorgegangene Gleichheitsordnung zeitgleich zu beseitigen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um das Scheitern der Marktansprache und die Forderung nach Rückzug zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wodurch die höheren Menschen positiv bestimmt oder wodurch ihre Höhe gerechtfertigt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern der Tod Gottes als Ende einer Begründungsinstanz und nicht als sofortiges Ende ihrer sozialen Wirkungen verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung besteht zwischen öffentlicher Gleichheitslogik, fehlender Anerkennung und strategischer Distanz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:MRT5","text":"Die Spannung zwischen der Anrede „ihr höheren Menschen“ und der Forderung, den Markt zu verlassen, bleibt funktional, aber nicht vollständig aufgelöst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die Bewegung von misslungener Verkündigung über genealogische Diagnose zu räumlicher Absonderung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T185735964782Z_7431c28c","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"1.","source_sha256":"58afc4f9b51e4e5936aa9db44eff3ce5def339e8f4f76eda1f46ed4811a892b6","sha256":"16bb18464a94e10f33c7f46f903d2c812d03a02bba5662bcce5d0b61a60278fe","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T18:57:35.967182+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:AS1","text":"The attempt to address people directly in the marketplace produces no mutual understanding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:AS2","text":"The public multitude transforms the address of the higher person into an assertion of equality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:AS3","text":"The assertion of equality rests on the appeal to God.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:AS4","text":"With the death of God, this appeal loses its ultimate grounding instance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:AS5","text":"The abolition of the divine grounding of equality does not immediately abolish the rabble's demand for equality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:AS6","text":"The higher human beings must leave the marketplace because their recognition there is structurally excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:A1","text":"A speech addressed to all can reach no one without a shared capacity for reception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:A2","text":"The marketplace functions as the space of the public multitude and rabble-noise.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:A3","text":"The rabble recognizes no hierarchy of higher human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:A4","text":"The rabble posits the equality of all human beings as its fundamental conviction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:A5","text":"In rabble discourse, the equality of all human beings is grounded before God.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:A6","text":"God is dead.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:A7","text":"The higher human beings may affirm their inequality in relation to the rabble.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:A8","text":"The marketplace is not a suitable place for the speech and self-assertion of higher human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:NX1","text":"Speech in the marketplace is not effective communication with everyone.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:NX2","text":"The marketplace is not a place in which higher human beings are recognized as such.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:NX3","text":"Human difference is not admitted by the rabble as a legitimate hierarchy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:NX4","text":"After the death of God, equality before God cannot persist unchanged as a valid ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:NX5","text":"The higher human beings are not obliged to submit to the standard of equality of the marketplace.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:NX6","text":"Rabble-noise is not a higher form of speaking.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:D1","text":"Immediate publicness produces not community, but the experience of speaking to no one.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_14:A1","CH_97E9_1_14:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:D2","text":"Whoever wishes to speak in the marketplace as a higher human being enters a space that denies that person's presupposition.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_14:A2","CH_97E9_1_14:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:D3","text":"The formula „Mensch ist Mensch“ effaces, in rabble discourse, the distinction between higher and non-higher human beings.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_14:A3","CH_97E9_1_14:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:D4","text":"In the text, the public demand for equality has a religious origin, although its religious guarantor is dead.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_14:A5","CH_97E9_1_14:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:D5","text":"The death of God opens the possibility for equality before God and equality before the rabble to diverge.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_14:A5","CH_97E9_1_14:A6","CH_97E9_1_14:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:D6","text":"Withdrawal from the marketplace becomes the necessary social consequence of affirming higher difference.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_14:A3","CH_97E9_1_14:A7","CH_97E9_1_14:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:SD1","text":"Public equality appears as a persisting order whose transcendent grounding has already fallen away.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_14:A4","CH_97E9_1_14:A5","CH_97E9_1_14:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:SD2","text":"The death of God does not automatically eliminate the social forms that emerged from the order of God.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_14:A5","CH_97E9_1_14:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:SD3","text":"The marketplace changes from the site of failed proclamation into the institutional counter-space of higher human beings.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_14:A2","CH_97E9_1_14:A3","CH_97E9_1_14:A7","CH_97E9_1_14:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:SD4","text":"The doctrine of higher human beings demands not primarily the persuasion of the multitude, but spatial and communicative distance from it.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_14:A1","CH_97E9_1_14:A3","CH_97E9_1_14:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:DNX1","text":"The system cannot rest on the assumption that public visibility automatically produces recognition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:DNX2","text":"It cannot presuppose that equality and higher hierarchy can be reconciled within the same normative standard.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:DNX3","text":"It cannot presuppose that the death of God immediately dissolves the religiously shaped order of equality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:DNX4","text":"It cannot rest on an understanding between higher human being and rabble so long as the rabble denies the possibility of hierarchy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:DNX5","text":"It excludes a political strategy grounded in the assent of the anonymous multitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a shared public sphere in which equality and qualitative superiority coexist without remainder.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:SNX2","text":"Excluded is a post-metaphysical order that would already have completely overcome its old forms of equality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:SNX3","text":"Excluded is the possibility that the marketplace becomes the site of a higher community.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:SNX4","text":"The unresolved absence of a new grounding of inequality structures the withdrawal of higher human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:FGS1","text":"Address to all → lack of reception → speech to no one.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:FGS2","text":"Public marketplace → universalization by the rabble → erasure of higher difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:FGS3","text":"Assertion of equality → appeal to God → transcendent legitimation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:FGS4","text":"Death of God → loss of the guarantor → persistence of the social form of equality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:FGS5","text":"Persisting form of equality + affirmed higher difference → separation from the marketplace.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:FGS6","text":"Failed proclamation → diagnosis of structural incompatibility → strategic withdrawal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:AF1","text":"Hermit-like isolation → public address → communicative failure → egalitarian reaction of the rabble → religious grounding → death of God → rejection of equality before the rabble → withdrawal of higher human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:ME1","text":"The marketplace changes from a possible site of proclamation into a space of selection that excludes higher difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:ME2","text":"Equality before God and equality before the rabble are separated as historically connected, but non-identical, levels.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:ME3","text":"Communicative failure is mapped not as individual failure, but as a structure of the audience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:ME4","text":"Publicness and community come apart: visibility does not increase the possibility of understanding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:ME5","text":"The opposition between hermitage and marketplace is replaced by a third position: the selective distance of higher human beings from the multitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:ALT1","text":"Surface — A speech in the marketplace fails because of the reaction of the rabble.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:ALT2","text":"Structural — The marketplace organizes equality as the exclusion of every recognized hierarchy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The appropriate practice of higher human beings consists not in public persuasion, but in leaving the marketplace.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The death of God marks a rupture in grounding without simultaneously eliminating the order of equality that emerged from it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the failure of the address in the marketplace and the demand for withdrawal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is how the higher human beings are positively determined or how their height is justified.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent, provided that the death of God is understood as the end of an instance of grounding and not as the immediate end of its social effects.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:MRT4","text":"The strongest connection exists between public logic of equality, lack of recognition, and strategic distance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:MRT5","text":"The tension between the address „ihr höheren Menschen“ and the demand to leave the marketplace remains functional, but not fully resolved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_14:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the movement from failed proclamation through genealogical diagnosis to spatial separation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_14:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_1_14@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_1_14:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On the Higher Man","source_section_label":"1.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Four and Last"],"reading_title":"On the Higher Man · 1","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","On the Higher Man","1."],"original_title":"1."}],"source_title_context":"Vom höheren Menschen","source_section_label":"1.","source_title_hierarchy":["Vierter und letzter Theil"],"reading_title":"On the Higher Man · 1","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","On the Higher Man","1."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 140","title":"On the Higher Man · 1","context":"Part Four and Last","original_context":"Vierter und letzter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Vom höheren Menschen · 1"},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14","layer":"CH","title":"On the Higher Man · 2","order":141,"parents":["RAW_97E9_2_14"],"revision":"CH_97E9_2_14@R001","sha256":"f8448e63d8d30e58f8c5dd488d3eda729868e5fbfa7ce2092c8fffbd252be1cc","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:AS1","text":"Die göttliche Instanz wird als größte Gefahr für die höheren Menschen bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:AS2","text":"Der Tod dieser Instanz hebt die höheren Menschen aus einer zuvor blockierten Lage in eine neue Möglichkeit des Menschseins.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:AS3","text":"Die eröffnete Möglichkeit erzeugt nicht unmittelbar Herrschaft, sondern Erschrecken, Schwindel und den Abgrund der Orientierungslosigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:AS4","text":"Diese Krise wird als Übergang zum „grossen Mittag“ und zur Zukunft des Menschen umgedeutet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:AS5","text":"Aus dem Tod Gottes folgt als Zielsetzung der Wille, dass der Übermensch lebe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:A1","text":"Gott ist tot.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:A2","text":"Gott war die grösste Gefahr der höheren Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:A3","text":"Der Tod Gottes ermöglicht die Auferstehung der höheren Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:A4","text":"Die höheren Menschen sind durch diese neue Lage erschreckt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:A5","text":"Die neue Lage enthält einen Abgrund und die Möglichkeit des Höllenhundes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:A6","text":"Der Tod Gottes eröffnet den „grossen Mittag“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:A7","text":"Mit dem Tod Gottes kreisst der Berg der Menschen-Zukunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:A8","text":"Die höheren Menschen sollen wollen, dass der Übermensch lebt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:A9","text":"Die höheren Menschen und der Übermensch sind nicht identisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:NX1","text":"Die Zukunft des Menschen gründet nicht mehr auf der fortbestehenden göttlichen Instanz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:NX2","text":"Die höheren Menschen sind nicht länger durch Gottes Fortbestand definiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:NX3","text":"Die Auferstehung der höheren Menschen ist keine Rückkehr zur alten Ordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:NX4","text":"Der „grosse Mittag“ ist nicht die Fortsetzung der bisherigen Zeitordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:NX5","text":"Der Übermensch ist nicht bereits verwirklicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:NX6","text":"Die neue Freiheit ist nicht frei von Schwindel, Abgrund und Bedrohung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:D1","text":"Der Tod Gottes fungiert zugleich als Befreiungsbedingung und als Auslöser einer existenziellen Erschütterung.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_14:A1","CH_97E9_2_14:A3","CH_97E9_2_14:A4","CH_97E9_2_14:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:D2","text":"Die höheren Menschen gewinnen ihre neue Stellung erst durch den Wegfall der Instanz, die sie zuvor begrenzte.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_14:A2","CH_97E9_2_14:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:D3","text":"Die Krise der höheren Menschen ist ein Übergangszustand zwischen der göttlichen Ordnung und der Möglichkeit des Übermenschen.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_14:A4","CH_97E9_2_14:A8","CH_97E9_2_14:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:D4","text":"Die Zukunft des Menschen wird als werdende, noch nicht abgeschlossene Formation dargestellt.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_14:A6","CH_97E9_2_14:A7","CH_97E9_2_14:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:D5","text":"Die höhere Stellung wird nicht als Endzustand, sondern als Verpflichtung zur Hervorbringung des Übermenschen bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_14:A3","CH_97E9_2_14:A8","CH_97E9_2_14:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:SD1","text":"Die Aufhebung der transzendenten Ordnung erzeugt keine fertige Souveränität, sondern eine offene und gefährliche Selbstüberschreitung.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_14:A1","CH_97E9_2_14:A4","CH_97E9_2_14:A5","CH_97E9_2_14:A8","CH_97E9_2_14:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:SD2","text":"Der Mensch wird als Übergangsfigur zwischen dem toten Gott und dem noch ausstehenden Übermenschen reorganisiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_14:A1","CH_97E9_2_14:A7","CH_97E9_2_14:A8","CH_97E9_2_14:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:SD3","text":"Die Krise der Orientierung wird nicht beseitigt, sondern als notwendige Schwelle der Menschen-Zukunft funktionalisiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_14:A4","CH_97E9_2_14:A5","CH_97E9_2_14:A6","CH_97E9_2_14:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:SD4","text":"Die höheren Menschen erhalten ihre geschichtliche Funktion dadurch, dass sie den Übermenschen wollen, ohne selbst schon dessen Gestalt zu besitzen.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_14:A3","CH_97E9_2_14:A8","CH_97E9_2_14:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:DNX1","text":"Das System setzt voraus, dass eine göttliche Ordnung die menschliche Zukunft nicht mehr legitimieren oder tragen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:DNX2","text":"Es setzt voraus, dass Befreiung nicht mit Sicherheit, Stabilität oder unmittelbarer Herrschaft gleichzusetzen ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:DNX3","text":"Es schließt aus, dass die höheren Menschen selbst den letzten Zielpunkt der menschlichen Entwicklung bilden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:DNX4","text":"Es schließt eine statische Auffassung der Menschheit als abgeschlossener Form aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Zukunft, in der der Mensch seine Richtung aus einer übermenschlichen oder transzendenten Autorität empfängt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Vollendung ohne Durchgang durch Abgrund, Gefahr und Orientierungskrise.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Identität von gegenwärtiger Erhebung und zukünftiger Überwindung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:SNX4","text":"Die versperrte Möglichkeit einer Rückkehr zur göttlichen Ordnung strukturiert den Übergang zur selbst gesetzten Zukunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:FGS1","text":"Transzendente Gefahr → Tod Gottes → Freisetzung der höheren Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:FGS2","text":"Freisetzung → Erschrecken und Abgrund → Übergangskrise.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:FGS3","text":"Übergangskrise → „grosser Mittag“ → Sichtbarkeit einer neuen Zeitordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:FGS4","text":"Neue Zeitordnung → kreisende Menschen-Zukunft → offene menschliche Hervorbringung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:FGS5","text":"Offene Zukunft + Nichtidentität von höheren Menschen und Übermensch → Wille zum Leben des Übermenschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:FGS6","text":"Der Wegfall Gottes beseitigt nicht die Gefahr, sondern transformiert sie von äußerer Herrschaft in innere Zukunftsaufgabe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:AF1","text":"Gottes Tod → Wegfall der grössten Gefahr → Auferstehung der höheren Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:AF2","text":"Auferstehung → Erschrecken, Schwindel und Abgrund → Krise der neuen Freiheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:AF3","text":"Krise → „grosser Mittag“ → Neubestimmung der Zeit als Menschen-Zukunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:AF4","text":"Menschen-Zukunft → Nichtvollendung der höheren Menschen → Wille zum Übermenschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:AF5","text":"Endposition: Der Tod Gottes wird zur Bedingung dafür, dass der Übermensch leben soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:ME1","text":"Göttlicher Tod wird von einem Endpunkt in eine produktive Anfangsbedingung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:ME2","text":"Erschrecken und Abgrund werden von bloßen Gefahren zu strukturellen Übergangssignalen umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:ME3","text":"Die höheren Menschen werden von einer Zielgestalt zu einer vermittelnden Übergangsinstanz umbestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:ME4","text":"Zukunft wird nicht als erwartete Gegebenheit, sondern als hervorzubringende Menschen-Zukunft kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:ME5","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Tod und Leben wird in eine Folge von Entmächtigung, Auferstehung und Überwindung überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:ALT1","text":"Surface: Der Tod Gottes, die Erschütterung der höheren Menschen und der Wille zum Übermenschen werden als unmittelbare Behauptungen gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:ALT2","text":"Structural: Der Wegfall einer transzendenten Instanz erzeugt eine Übergangsstruktur aus Freisetzung, Orientierungskrise und Zukunftsproduktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Die höheren Menschen werden aus der passiven Reaktion auf Gottes Tod in die aktive Hervorbringung einer neuen Menschengestalt gedrängt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Menschsein erscheint als nicht abgeschlossene Übergangsform zwischen dem toten Gott und dem möglichen Übermenschen; Zeit wird als „grosser Mittag“ zur Schwelle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von Gottes Tod zur Forderung nach dem Übermenschen zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wodurch der Übermensch konkret bestimmt oder hervorgebracht werden soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern der Tod Gottes zugleich als Befreiung und als Krise behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Verbindung liegt in der funktionalen Kette von Gefahr, Tod, Auferstehung, Abgrund und Zukunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:MRT5","text":"Die Spannung zwischen „Herr“-Werden der höheren Menschen und ihrem bloßen Wollen des Übermenschen bleibt ungelöst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, solange die Zukunft als offene Aufgabe und nicht als bereits erreichte Herrschaft gefasst wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T190938052259Z_3f8c7ff9","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"2.","source_sha256":"f8448e63d8d30e58f8c5dd488d3eda729868e5fbfa7ce2092c8fffbd252be1cc","sha256":"d26f684ab016604a97f6a8d432cc0133a7e841845e8ac6b6ae7bf9a5b0ba9c1d","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:09:38.054529+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:AS1","text":"The divine instance is determined as the greatest danger to the higher human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:AS2","text":"The death of this instance lifts the higher human beings from a previously blocked situation into a new possibility of being human.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:AS3","text":"The possibility thus opened does not immediately produce dominion, but rather terror, vertigo, and the abyss of disorientation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:AS4","text":"This crisis is reinterpreted as a transition to the “great noon” and to the future of humanity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:AS5","text":"From the death of God follows, as an aim, the will that the Overman live.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:A1","text":"God is dead.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:A2","text":"God was the greatest danger to the higher human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:A3","text":"The death of God makes possible the resurrection of the higher human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:A4","text":"The higher human beings are terrified by this new situation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:A5","text":"The new situation contains an abyss and the possibility of the hellhound.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:A6","text":"The death of God opens the “great noon”.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:A7","text":"With the death of God, the mountain of humanity's future revolves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:A8","text":"The higher human beings should will that the Overman lives.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:A9","text":"The higher human beings and the Overman are not identical.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:NX1","text":"The future of humanity is no longer grounded in the continuing divine instance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:NX2","text":"The higher human beings are no longer defined by God's continuance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:NX3","text":"The resurrection of the higher human beings is not a return to the old order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:NX4","text":"The “great noon” is not the continuation of the previous temporal order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:NX5","text":"The Overman is not already realized.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:NX6","text":"The new freedom is not free of vertigo, abyss, and threat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:D1","text":"The death of God functions at once as a condition of liberation and as the trigger of an existential upheaval.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_14:A1","CH_97E9_2_14:A3","CH_97E9_2_14:A4","CH_97E9_2_14:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:D2","text":"The higher human beings acquire their new position only through the removal of the instance that had previously limited them.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_14:A2","CH_97E9_2_14:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:D3","text":"The crisis of the higher human beings is a transitional state between the divine order and the possibility of the Overman.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_14:A4","CH_97E9_2_14:A8","CH_97E9_2_14:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:D4","text":"The future of humanity is presented as an emergent, not yet completed formation.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_14:A6","CH_97E9_2_14:A7","CH_97E9_2_14:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:D5","text":"The higher position is determined not as a final state, but as an obligation to bring forth the Overman.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_14:A3","CH_97E9_2_14:A8","CH_97E9_2_14:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:SD1","text":"The abolition of the transcendent order produces no finished sovereignty, but rather an open and dangerous self-overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_14:A1","CH_97E9_2_14:A4","CH_97E9_2_14:A5","CH_97E9_2_14:A8","CH_97E9_2_14:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:SD2","text":"The human being is reorganized as a transitional figure between the dead God and the Overman still to come.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_14:A1","CH_97E9_2_14:A7","CH_97E9_2_14:A8","CH_97E9_2_14:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:SD3","text":"The crisis of orientation is not eliminated, but functionalized as a necessary threshold of humanity's future.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_14:A4","CH_97E9_2_14:A5","CH_97E9_2_14:A6","CH_97E9_2_14:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:SD4","text":"The higher human beings receive their historical function by willing the Overman without themselves yet possessing his form.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_14:A3","CH_97E9_2_14:A8","CH_97E9_2_14:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:DNX1","text":"The system presupposes that a divine order can no longer legitimate or sustain the human future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:DNX2","text":"It presupposes that liberation is not to be equated with security, stability, or immediate dominion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:DNX3","text":"It excludes the possibility that the higher human beings themselves constitute the final end-point of human development.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:DNX4","text":"It excludes a static conception of humanity as a completed form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a future in which the human being receives its direction from a superhuman or transcendent authority.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:SNX2","text":"Excluded is a completion without passage through abyss, danger, and crisis of orientation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:SNX3","text":"Excluded is the identity of present elevation and future overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:SNX4","text":"The blocked possibility of a return to the divine order structures the transition to the self-set future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:FGS1","text":"Transcendent danger → death of God → liberation of the higher human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:FGS2","text":"Liberation → terror and abyss → transitional crisis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:FGS3","text":"Transitional crisis → “great noon” → visibility of a new temporal order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:FGS4","text":"New temporal order → revolving humanity's future → open human bringing-forth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:FGS5","text":"Open future + non-identity of higher human beings and Overman → will toward the life of the Overman.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:FGS6","text":"The removal of God does not eliminate danger, but transforms it from external dominion into an inner task of the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:AF1","text":"God's death → removal of the greatest danger → resurrection of the higher human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:AF2","text":"Resurrection → terror, vertigo, and abyss → crisis of the new freedom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:AF3","text":"Crisis → “great noon” → redetermination of time as humanity's future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:AF4","text":"Humanity's future → incompletion of the higher human beings → will to the Overman.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:AF5","text":"Final position: The death of God becomes the condition for the Overman to live.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:ME1","text":"Divine death is remapped from an endpoint into a productive initial condition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:ME2","text":"Terror and abyss are reclassified from mere dangers into structural signals of transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:ME3","text":"The higher human beings are redefined from a final form into a mediating transitional instance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:ME4","text":"The future is mapped not as an expected given, but as a humanity's future to be brought forth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:ME5","text":"The opposition between death and life is transferred into a sequence of disempowerment, resurrection, and overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:ALT1","text":"Surface: The death of God, the upheaval of the higher human beings, and the will to the Overman are posited as immediate assertions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:ALT2","text":"Structural: The removal of a transcendent instance produces a transitional structure of liberation, crisis of orientation, and production of the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: The higher human beings are pressed from passive reaction to God's death into the active bringing-forth of a new human form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Being human appears as an unfinished transitional form between the dead God and the possible Overman; time becomes a threshold as “great noon”.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from God's death to the demand for the Overman.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined by what means the Overman is to be concretely determined or brought forth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as the death of God is treated simultaneously as liberation and as crisis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:MRT4","text":"Its strongest connection lies in the functional chain of danger, death, resurrection, abyss, and future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:MRT5","text":"The tension between the higher human beings' becoming “masters” and their merely willing the Overman remains unresolved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_14:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement so long as the future is conceived as an open task and not as dominion already attained.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_14:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_2_14@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_2_14:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On the Higher Man","source_section_label":"2.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Four and Last"],"reading_title":"On the Higher Man · 2","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","On the Higher Man","2."],"original_title":"2."}],"source_title_context":"Vom höheren Menschen","source_section_label":"2.","source_title_hierarchy":["Vierter und letzter Theil"],"reading_title":"On the Higher Man · 2","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","On the Higher Man","2."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 141","title":"On the Higher Man · 2","context":"Part Four and Last","original_context":"Vierter und letzter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Vom höheren Menschen · 2"},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7","layer":"CH","title":"On the Higher Man · 3","order":142,"parents":["RAW_97E9_3C_7"],"revision":"CH_97E9_3C_7@R001","sha256":"5638eeefd7a96e4e23eb18b8423567c91d49f5e135be9ca2d0f2d327144fd7a3","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:AS1","text":"Der Text verwirft die Frage nach der bloßen Erhaltung des Menschen als leitende Frage und setzt ihr die Frage nach seiner Überwindung entgegen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:AS2","text":"Der Mensch wird nicht als Ziel, sondern als Übergang und Untergang bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:AS3","text":"Der Übermensch bildet den ausschließlichen Zielpunkt der Wertordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:AS4","text":"Die Herrschaft der kleinen Leute wird als Herrschaft von Erhaltungs-, Anpassungs- und Behaglichkeitstugenden diagnostiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:AS5","text":"Die Verachtung und Verzweiflung der höheren Menschen werden als Anzeichen einer noch nicht vollzogenen Ergebung gelesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:AS6","text":"Die Bewegung des Arguments führt von der Kritik der Selbsterhaltung über die Diagnose der gegenwärtigen Herrschaft zur Forderung nach Überwindung der kleinen Tugenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:A1","text":"Die Erhaltung des Menschen ist nicht sein höchster Zweck.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:A2","text":"Die Überwindung des Menschen ist die maßgebliche Zukunftsfrage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:A3","text":"Der Übermensch ist der primäre und ausschließliche Bezugspunkt der dargestellten Wertordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:A4","text":"Der Mensch ist ein Übergang und ein Untergang.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:A5","text":"Die gegenwärtige Ordnung wird von den kleinen Leuten beherrscht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:A6","text":"Die Herrschaft der kleinen Leute gründet auf Ergebung, Bescheidung, Klugheit, Fleiß, Rücksicht und dauerhaftem Fortgang des Bestehenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:A7","text":"Die Frage nach möglichst langer, angenehmer und allgemeiner menschlicher Erhaltung legitimiert die gegenwärtigen Herren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:A8","text":"Die kleinen Tugenden und kleinen Klugheiten verkörpern eine Gefahr für den Übermenschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:A9","text":"Die Verachtung der höheren Menschen zeigt eine Distanz zur herrschenden Ordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:A10","text":"Die Verzweiflung der höheren Menschen zeigt, dass sie die vollständige Ergebung noch nicht gelernt haben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:A11","text":"Verzweiflung ist der Ergebung vorzuziehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:A12","text":"Die höheren Menschen sollen die kleinen Tugenden, die kleinen Klugheiten und das allgemeine Behagen überwinden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:NX1","text":"Der Mensch ist nicht das letzte Ziel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:NX2","text":"Der Nächste, der Ärmste, der Leidende und der Beste bilden nicht den höchsten Maßstab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:NX3","text":"Menschliche Selbsterhaltung ist nicht identisch mit menschlicher Überwindung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:NX4","text":"Die Herrschaft der Mehrheit ist kein gültiger Beweis für höheren Wert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:NX5","text":"Ergebung und Bescheidung sind keine höheren Tugenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:NX6","text":"Kleine Klugheit, Rücksicht und Behaglichkeit sind keine neutralen Lebensformen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:NX7","text":"Das „Glück der Meisten“ ist kein abschließendes Ziel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:NX8","text":"Die gegenwärtigen Herren repräsentieren nicht die Überwindung des Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:D1","text":"Wenn der Mensch Übergang und Untergang ist, kann seine Erhaltung nicht als endgültige normative Aufgabe gelten.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_7:A1","CH_97E9_3C_7:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:D2","text":"Wenn der Übermensch den primären Wertbezug bildet, werden alle Ordnungen, die den Menschen als Endpunkt setzen, als entgegenstehend klassifiziert.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_7:A2","CH_97E9_3C_7:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:D3","text":"Die Herrschaft der kleinen Leute erscheint als institutionalisierte Vorherrschaft der Selbsterhaltung über die Überwindung.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_7:A5","CH_97E9_3C_7:A6","CH_97E9_3C_7:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:D4","text":"Die kleinen Tugenden werden von privaten Verhaltensweisen zu politischen Herrschaftsformen umcodiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_7:A5","CH_97E9_3C_7:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:D5","text":"Die Verachtung der höheren Menschen wird als Ressource der Überwindung interpretiert, nicht als bloße Negation.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_7:A8","CH_97E9_3C_7:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:D6","text":"Die Verzweiflung der höheren Menschen gilt als unvollständige, aber ehrenhafte Abwehr der Ergebung.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_7:A10","CH_97E9_3C_7:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:D7","text":"Die höheren Menschen werden aufgefordert, ihre eigene Unfähigkeit zum gegenwärtigen Leben als bessere Lebensbedingung zu bewahren.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_7:A10","CH_97E9_3C_7:A11","CH_97E9_3C_7:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:SD1","text":"Das System ersetzt eine auf Erhaltung gerichtete Zeitordnung durch eine Übergangsordnung, in der der gegenwärtige Mensch nur als Material einer zukünftigen Überwindung erscheint.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_7:A1","CH_97E9_3C_7:A2","CH_97E9_3C_7:A3","CH_97E9_3C_7:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:SD2","text":"Das politisch Vorherrschende wird nicht durch seine Macht, sondern durch die Verarmung seines Wertmaßstabs bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_7:A5","CH_97E9_3C_7:A6","CH_97E9_3C_7:A7","CH_97E9_3C_7:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:SD3","text":"Widerstand gegen die herrschende Ordnung wird nicht als sofortige positive Lebensform, sondern als Verweigerung der Ergebung organisiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_7:A9","CH_97E9_3C_7:A10","CH_97E9_3C_7:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:SD4","text":"Das Argument macht die Fähigkeit zur Verachtung und Verzweiflung zum vorläufigen Selektionskriterium für eine mögliche Überwindung des Menschen.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_7:A2","CH_97E9_3C_7:A8","CH_97E9_3C_7:A9","CH_97E9_3C_7:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass Fortbestand, Dauer und angenehme Lebensführung den Wert einer Ordnung begründen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:DNX2","text":"Es schließt aus, dass moralische Allgemeinheit, Rücksicht und Mehrheitsglück den Übergang zu einer höheren Gestalt vermitteln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:DNX3","text":"Es schließt aus, dass politische Herrschaft und menschliche Höherentwicklung zusammenfallen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:DNX4","text":"Es schließt aus, dass die Beseitigung von Verzweiflung bereits eine Verbesserung des Menschen darstellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:DNX5","text":"Es schließt aus, dass eine positive Zielgestalt unmittelbar aus dem bestehenden Menschen hervorgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:SNX1","text":"Der Text organisiert sich um die Abwesenheit einer gegenwärtig verfügbaren Gestalt des Übermenschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:SNX2","text":"Die Möglichkeit einer affirmativen Zukunft bleibt versperrt, solange der Mensch seine Erhaltung zum obersten Maßstab macht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine politische Versöhnung zwischen dem Glück der Meisten und der Überwindung des Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:SNX4","text":"Unzulässig wird eine Lebensform, die ihre Legitimität ausschließlich aus Dauer, Anpassung und allgemeiner Verträglichkeit bezieht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:FGS1","text":"Die Selbsterhaltungsfrage setzt den Menschen als zu bewahrendes Zentrum und erzeugt damit die zu überwindende Perspektive.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_7:A1","CH_97E9_3C_7:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:FGS2","text":"Die Bestimmung des Menschen als Übergang verschiebt den normativen Bezug vom Bestehenden auf eine noch nicht verwirklichte Überwindung.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_7:A2","CH_97E9_3C_7:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:FGS3","text":"Die Herrschaft der kleinen Leute verkörpert die institutionelle Fixierung auf Erhaltung, Bescheidung und Behagen.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_7:A5","CH_97E9_3C_7:A6","CH_97E9_3C_7:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:FGS4","text":"Die kleinen Tugenden werden dadurch als Hindernisse der Überwindung sichtbar und als Gefahr für den Übermenschen bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_7:A3","CH_97E9_3C_7:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:FGS5","text":"Verachtung und Verzweiflung werden als negative Vorstufen eines Widerstands gegen die Herrschaft der Ergebung eingesetzt.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_7:A9","CH_97E9_3C_7:A10","CH_97E9_3C_7:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:FGS6","text":"Die formale Schlussoperation lautet: Selbsterhaltung zurückweisen, Überwindung setzen, kleine Tugenden identifizieren, Ergebung verweigern.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_7:FGS1","CH_97E9_3C_7:FGS2","CH_97E9_3C_7:FGS3","CH_97E9_3C_7:FGS4","CH_97E9_3C_7:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:AF1","text":"Frage nach menschlicher Erhaltung → Gegenfrage nach menschlicher Überwindung → Bestimmung des Menschen als Übergang und Untergang → Diagnose der Herrschaft kleiner Tugenden → Aktivierung von Verachtung und Verzweiflung → Forderung nach Überwindung der Ergebung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:AF2","text":"Mensch als Endzweck → Mensch als Durchgangsform → Erhaltungsordnung → Herrschaft der kleinen Leute → Gefahr für den Übermenschen → negative Vorbereitung der Überwindung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:AF3","text":"Gegenwärtiges Behagen wird als Herrschaftsmechanismus entlarvt, Widerstand dagegen jedoch nur als unvollständige Vorbedingung einer noch nicht gegebenen höheren Gestalt zugelassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:ME1","text":"Die Unterscheidung zwischen Erhaltung und Überwindung ersetzt die Unterscheidung zwischen gewöhnlich gutem und gewöhnlich schlechtem menschlichem Leben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:ME2","text":"Kleine Tugenden werden von moralischen Einzelhaltungen zu einer umfassenden gesellschaftlichen Herrschaftsform neu klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:ME3","text":"Verachtung und Verzweiflung werden aus dem Bereich des bloß Negativen in den Bereich strategisch notwendiger Vorbedingungen verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:ME4","text":"Das Glück der Mehrheit erscheint nicht mehr als universale Norm, sondern als Ausdruck einer partikularen Erhaltungsordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:ME5","text":"Die höheren Menschen werden nicht nach gegenwärtiger Lebensfähigkeit, sondern nach ihrem Verhältnis zur Ergebung bewertet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Der Text stellt die Frage nach dem Erhalt des Menschen der Forderung nach seiner Überwindung gegenüber.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Er ordnet Erhaltungstugenden einer Herrschaftsformation der kleinen Leute zu.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Er verwandelt Verachtung und Verzweiflung in Kampfmittel gegen Ergebung und Behagen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Er bestimmt den Menschen als vorläufige Übergangsform zwischen gegenwärtigem Untergang und möglicher Übermenschlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von der Erhaltungsfrage zur Überwindungsforderung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:MRT2","text":"Die Konstruktion des Übermenschen bleibt inhaltlich unterbestimmt; seine Funktion ist primär negativ und richtungsgebend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:MRT3","text":"Die Diagnose der kleinen Leute ist strukturell kohärent, solange Selbsterhaltung als Gegenprinzip der Überwindung gesetzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Stelle des Systems liegt in der Verbindung von Wertkritik, Herrschaftsdiagnose und Zeitbestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:MRT5","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen der Verwerfung des gegenwärtigen Lebens und der Behauptung, gerade dadurch werde besser gelebt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung entsteht daraus, dass Verachtung und Verzweiflung als notwendige Vorstufen gelten, ohne selbst eine positive Gestalt der Überwindung zu liefern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, sofern der Übermensch als regulativer Zielpunkt und nicht als ausgearbeitete Ontologie behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T191443668812Z_ae11d616","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"3.","source_sha256":"5638eeefd7a96e4e23eb18b8423567c91d49f5e135be9ca2d0f2d327144fd7a3","sha256":"c857b8b738bfae2f5a7c0dd2a9f314e576bd1edb9e915869025557749023686d","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:14:43.671267+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:AS1","text":"The text rejects the question of the mere preservation of the human being as the guiding question and opposes to it the question of his overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:AS2","text":"The human being is determined not as an end, but as a transition and a going-under.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:AS3","text":"The Overman forms the exclusive focal point of the order of values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:AS4","text":"The rule of the little people is diagnosed as the rule of virtues of preservation, adaptation, and comfort.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:AS5","text":"The contempt and despair of the higher human beings are read as signs of a resignation not yet carried out.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:AS6","text":"The movement of the argument leads from the critique of self-preservation, through the diagnosis of present rule, to the demand for overcoming the small virtues.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:A1","text":"The preservation of the human being is not his highest purpose.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:A2","text":"The overcoming of the human being is the decisive question of the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:A3","text":"The Overman is the primary and exclusive point of reference of the presented order of values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:A4","text":"The human being is a transition and a going-under.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:A5","text":"The present order is ruled by the little people.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:A6","text":"The rule of the little people is grounded in resignation, modesty, prudence, diligence, consideration, and the enduring continuation of what exists.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:A7","text":"The question of the longest possible, pleasant, and universal human preservation legitimates the present rulers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:A8","text":"The small virtues and small prudences embody a danger to the Overman.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:A9","text":"The contempt of the higher human beings shows a distance from the ruling order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:A10","text":"The despair of the higher human beings shows that they have not yet learned complete resignation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:A11","text":"Despair is preferable to resignation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:A12","text":"The higher human beings are to overcome the small virtues, the small prudences, and general comfort.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:NX1","text":"The human being is not the final end.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:NX2","text":"The neighbor, the poorest, the suffering, and the best do not form the highest standard.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:NX3","text":"Human self-preservation is not identical with human overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:NX4","text":"The rule of the majority is no valid proof of higher value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:NX5","text":"Resignation and modesty are not higher virtues.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:NX6","text":"Small prudence, consideration, and comfort are not neutral forms of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:NX7","text":"The “happiness of the greatest number” is not a final goal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:NX8","text":"The present rulers do not represent the overcoming of the human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:D1","text":"If the human being is transition and going-under, his preservation cannot count as a final normative task.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_7:A1","CH_97E9_3C_7:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:D2","text":"If the Overman forms the primary reference of value, all orders that posit the human being as an endpoint are classified as opposed to it.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_7:A2","CH_97E9_3C_7:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:D3","text":"The rule of the little people appears as the institutionalized predominance of self-preservation over overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_7:A5","CH_97E9_3C_7:A6","CH_97E9_3C_7:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:D4","text":"The small virtues are recoded from private modes of conduct into political forms of rule.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_7:A5","CH_97E9_3C_7:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:D5","text":"The contempt of the higher human beings is interpreted as a resource of overcoming, not as mere negation.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_7:A8","CH_97E9_3C_7:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:D6","text":"The despair of the higher human beings counts as an incomplete but honorable defense against resignation.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_7:A10","CH_97E9_3C_7:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:D7","text":"The higher human beings are called upon to preserve their own incapacity for present life as a better condition of life.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_7:A10","CH_97E9_3C_7:A11","CH_97E9_3C_7:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:SD1","text":"The system replaces a temporal order directed toward preservation with an order of transition, in which the present human being appears only as material for a future overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_7:A1","CH_97E9_3C_7:A2","CH_97E9_3C_7:A3","CH_97E9_3C_7:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:SD2","text":"What is politically predominant is determined not by its power, but by the impoverishment of its standard of value.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_7:A5","CH_97E9_3C_7:A6","CH_97E9_3C_7:A7","CH_97E9_3C_7:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:SD3","text":"Resistance to the ruling order is organized not as an immediate positive form of life, but as refusal of resignation.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_7:A9","CH_97E9_3C_7:A10","CH_97E9_3C_7:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:SD4","text":"The argument makes the capacity for contempt and despair into the provisional criterion of selection for a possible overcoming of the human being.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_7:A2","CH_97E9_3C_7:A8","CH_97E9_3C_7:A9","CH_97E9_3C_7:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:DNX1","text":"The system excludes the possibility that continuance, duration, and pleasant conduct of life ground the value of an order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:DNX2","text":"It excludes the possibility that moral universality, consideration, and the happiness of the majority mediate the transition to a higher form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:DNX3","text":"It excludes the possibility that political rule and the higher development of the human being coincide.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:DNX4","text":"It excludes the possibility that the elimination of despair already constitutes an improvement of the human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:DNX5","text":"It excludes the possibility that a positive goal-form emerges directly from the existing human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:SNX1","text":"The text organizes itself around the absence of a presently available form of the Overman.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:SNX2","text":"The possibility of an affirmative future remains barred so long as the human being makes his preservation the highest standard.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:SNX3","text":"A political reconciliation between the happiness of the greatest number and the overcoming of the human being is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:SNX4","text":"A form of life that derives its legitimacy exclusively from duration, adaptation, and general compatibility becomes inadmissible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:FGS1","text":"The question of self-preservation posits the human being as a center to be preserved and thereby produces the perspective to be overcome.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_7:A1","CH_97E9_3C_7:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:FGS2","text":"The determination of the human being as transition shifts the normative reference from what exists to an overcoming not yet realized.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_7:A2","CH_97E9_3C_7:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:FGS3","text":"The rule of the little people embodies the institutional fixation on preservation, modesty, and comfort.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_7:A5","CH_97E9_3C_7:A6","CH_97E9_3C_7:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:FGS4","text":"The small virtues thereby become visible as obstacles to overcoming and are determined as a danger to the Overman.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_7:A3","CH_97E9_3C_7:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:FGS5","text":"Contempt and despair are deployed as negative preliminary stages of a resistance against the rule of resignation.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_7:A9","CH_97E9_3C_7:A10","CH_97E9_3C_7:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:FGS6","text":"The formal concluding operation is: reject self-preservation, posit overcoming, identify small virtues, refuse resignation.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_7:FGS1","CH_97E9_3C_7:FGS2","CH_97E9_3C_7:FGS3","CH_97E9_3C_7:FGS4","CH_97E9_3C_7:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:AF1","text":"Question of human preservation → counter-question of human overcoming → determination of the human being as transition and going-under → diagnosis of the rule of small virtues → activation of contempt and despair → demand for overcoming resignation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:AF2","text":"Human being as final end → human being as transitional form → order of preservation → rule of the little people → danger to the Overman → negative preparation for overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:AF3","text":"Present comfort is exposed as a mechanism of rule, but resistance to it is admitted only as an incomplete precondition of a higher form not yet given.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:ME1","text":"The distinction between preservation and overcoming replaces the distinction between ordinarily good and ordinarily bad human life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:ME2","text":"Small virtues are reclassified from individual moral attitudes into a comprehensive social form of rule.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:ME3","text":"Contempt and despair are shifted from the realm of the merely negative into the realm of strategically necessary preconditions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:ME4","text":"The happiness of the majority no longer appears as a universal norm, but as the expression of a particular order of preservation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:ME5","text":"The higher human beings are evaluated not according to present viability, but according to their relation to resignation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** The text sets the question of preserving the human being against the demand for his overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** It assigns virtues of preservation to a formation of rule of the little people.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** It transforms contempt and despair into weapons against resignation and comfort.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** It determines the human being as a provisional transitional form between present going-under and possible Overmanhood.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from the question of preservation to the demand for overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:MRT2","text":"The construction of the Overman remains materially underdetermined; its function is primarily negative and direction-giving.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:MRT3","text":"The diagnosis of the little people is structurally coherent so long as self-preservation is posited as the counter-principle of overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:MRT4","text":"The strongest point of the system lies in the connection of critique of values, diagnosis of rule, and temporal determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:MRT5","text":"A tension remains between the rejection of present life and the assertion that precisely thereby one lives better.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:MRT6","text":"A further tension arises from the fact that contempt and despair count as necessary preliminary stages without themselves supplying a positive form of overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_7:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument insofar as the Overman is treated as a regulative focal point rather than as an elaborated ontology.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_7:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_3C_7@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_3C_7:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On the Higher Man","source_section_label":"3.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Four and Last"],"reading_title":"On the Higher Man · 3","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","On the Higher Man","3."],"original_title":"3."}],"source_title_context":"Vom höheren Menschen","source_section_label":"3.","source_title_hierarchy":["Vierter und letzter Theil"],"reading_title":"On the Higher Man · 3","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","On the Higher Man","3."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 142","title":"On the Higher Man · 3","context":"Part Four and Last","original_context":"Vierter und letzter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Vom höheren Menschen · 3"},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4","layer":"CH","title":"On the Higher Man · 4","order":143,"parents":["RAW_97E9_4C_4"],"revision":"CH_97E9_4C_4@R001","sha256":"be7735f5794607729f8c2c26c56d7e46119e4a5487268940b3af54696f83418c","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:AS1","text":"Der Text prüft Mut nicht an öffentlicher Bewährung, sondern an einsamer Selbstbezeugung ohne göttlichen Zuschauer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:AS2","text":"Mut wird gegen Zustände der Kälte, Blindheit, Trunkenheit und bloßen Unempfindlichkeit abgegrenzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:AS3","text":"Furcht ist keine Widerlegung des Mutes, sondern dessen notwendige Voraussetzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:AS4","text":"Mut entsteht, wenn Furcht angesichts des Abgrunds gezwungen und der Abgrund stolz wahrgenommen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:AS5","text":"Die höchste Form des Mutes verbindet Adlersicht mit dem krallenartigen Ergreifen des Abgrunds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:A1","text":"Mut muss auch ohne Zeugen bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:A2","text":"Göttliche Beobachtung ist keine notwendige Grundlage des Mutes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:A3","text":"Unempfindlichkeit gegenüber Gefahr ist kein Mut.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:A4","text":"Wahrer Mut setzt die Kenntnis der Furcht voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:A5","text":"Mut besteht darin, die Furcht zu zwingen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:A6","text":"Der Abgrund ist die entscheidende Prüfungssituation des Mutes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:A7","text":"Der Abgrund muss mit Stolz gesehen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:A8","text":"Vollendeter Mut verbindet distanzierende Klarheit mit aktivem Zugriff.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:NX1","text":"Mut ist nicht Mut vor Zeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:NX2","text":"Mut ist nicht die Erwartung göttlicher Anerkennung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:NX3","text":"Mut ist nicht Kälte gegenüber der Gefahr.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:NX4","text":"Mut ist nicht Blindheit gegenüber dem Abgrund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:NX5","text":"Mut ist nicht Trunkenheit oder betäubte Wahrnehmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:NX6","text":"Mut ist nicht die Abwesenheit von Furcht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:D1","text":"Der Wert einer mutigen Handlung hängt nicht von ihrer Sichtbarkeit oder Anerkennung ab.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_4:A1","CH_97E9_4C_4:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:D2","text":"Furcht wird vom Gegenbeweis des Mutes zu seinem Prüfstoff.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_4:A4","CH_97E9_4C_4:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:D3","text":"Der Abgrund verlangt zugleich Erkenntnis seiner Realität und aktive Beherrschung der eigenen Reaktion.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_4:A5","CH_97E9_4C_4:A6","CH_97E9_4C_4:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:D4","text":"Wahrnehmung allein genügt nicht; Mut vollendet sich erst im Zugriff auf das Wahrgenommene.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_4:A6","CH_97E9_4C_4:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:SD1","text":"Mut wird von einer moralisch bezeugten Tugend in eine einsame Form der Selbstkonstitution überführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_4:A1","CH_97E9_4C_4:A2","CH_97E9_4C_4:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:SD2","text":"Der Abgrund erzeugt keinen Rückzug aus der Realität, sondern eine doppelte Operation aus gesteigerter Sicht und erzwungener Handlung.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_4:A5","CH_97E9_4C_4:A6","CH_97E9_4C_4:A7","CH_97E9_4C_4:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:SD3","text":"Das System ersetzt die Opposition von Furcht und Mut durch eine Hierarchie, in der Mut die bewusste Überordnung über die Furcht bezeichnet.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_4:A4","CH_97E9_4C_4:A5","CH_97E9_4C_4:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:DNX1","text":"Das System kann nur bestehen, wenn Mut nicht als angeborene Furchtlosigkeit verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:DNX2","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass soziale Sichtbarkeit den Wert einer Handlung begründet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:DNX3","text":"Das System disqualifiziert jede Bewältigung des Abgrunds durch Bewusstlosigkeit, Verkennung oder Betäubung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:DNX4","text":"Das System setzt voraus, dass Anerkennung durch Gott oder Öffentlichkeit die Prüfung des Mutes verfälscht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Welt, in der Mut durch äußere Beglaubigung verfügbar wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Möglichkeit, den Abgrund entweder durch Unwissenheit oder durch bloße Betrachtung zu überwinden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:SNX3","text":"Abwesend ist jede transzendente Instanz, die den einsamen Mut bestätigt, garantiert oder ersetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:FGS1","text":"Öffentliche Prüfung und göttliche Beobachtung werden entfernt → Mut wird als unbezeugte Leistung isoliert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:FGS2","text":"Kälte, Blindheit und Trunkenheit werden ausgeschlossen → bloße Unempfindlichkeit wird vom Mut getrennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:FGS3","text":"Furcht wird zugelassen → Mut erhält einen inneren Widerstand.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:FGS4","text":"Furcht wird gezwungen → Widerstand wird in Selbstüberwindung transformiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:FGS5","text":"Der Abgrund wird erkannt und stolz gesehen → Wahrnehmung wird zur existenziellen Prüfung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:FGS6","text":"Adlersicht und Adlerkrallen werden gekoppelt → Distanzierung und Zugriff erzeugen die Definition des Mutes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:AF1","text":"Öffentliche und göttliche Bezeugung → einsame Prüfung → Ausschluss der Betäubung → Anerkennung der Furcht → Zwang der Furcht → stolze Sicht des Abgrunds → erkennender und zugreifender Mut.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:ME1","text":"Mut wird von der sozialen Bühne in den unbezeugten Innenraum verlagert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:ME2","text":"Die falsche Opposition „Furcht oder Mut“ wird durch die Relation „Furcht als Material des Mutes“ ersetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:ME3","text":"Wahrnehmung und Handlung werden als zwei notwendige Modi desselben Mutes kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:ME4","text":"Kälte, Blindheit und Trunkenheit werden von scheinbarer Unerschrockenheit zu Formen defizitärer Wahrnehmung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Text fragt nach dem Kriterium echten Mutes angesichts von Furcht und Abgrund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:ALT2","text":"Structural — Mut wird durch die Relation von Furcht, Wahrnehmung, Zwang und Zugriff erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Prüfung wird von fremder Anerkennung auf einsame Selbstbehauptung umgestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Der Abgrund fungiert als Grenzrealität, an der sich ein Subjekt durch bewusste Überordnung über die Furcht konstituiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Definition des Mutes aus Furcht, Abgrund, Wahrnehmung und Zugriff zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, was der Abgrund ontologisch bezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:MRT3","text":"Ebenfalls unterbestimmt bleibt, ob das „Zwingen“ der Furcht psychische Selbstbeherrschung oder eine weitergehende Selbstüberwindung meint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:MRT4","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Mut nicht mit Furchtlosigkeit gleichgesetzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:MRT5","text":"Ihre stärkste Operation ist die Umwandlung der Furcht vom Defizit in die notwendige Bedingung des Mutes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:MRT6","text":"Eine ungelöste Spannung bleibt zwischen dem Sehen des Abgrunds und seinem Ergreifen: Kontemplation und Zugriff werden verbunden, aber nicht vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die Argumentbewegung von der Verwerfung äußerer Beglaubigung zur einsamen, furchtbewussten und zugreifenden Selbstbehauptung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T191813418859Z_efc7484a","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"4.","source_sha256":"be7735f5794607729f8c2c26c56d7e46119e4a5487268940b3af54696f83418c","sha256":"3fceee9eebe7956f3536fbc5f5ade9c61bbc405eafdfaf9da767343579ea8f7b","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:18:13.421435+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:AS1","text":"The text tests courage not in public proof, but in solitary self-attestation without a divine spectator.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:AS2","text":"Courage is distinguished from states of coldness, blindness, drunkenness, and mere insensibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:AS3","text":"Fear is not a refutation of courage, but its necessary precondition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:AS4","text":"Courage arises when fear is compelled in the face of the abyss and the abyss is perceived proudly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:AS5","text":"The highest form of courage combines eagle vision with a claw-like grasping of the abyss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:A1","text":"Courage must endure even without witnesses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:A2","text":"Divine observation is not a necessary basis of courage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:A3","text":"Insensibility to danger is not courage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:A4","text":"True courage presupposes knowledge of fear.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:A5","text":"Courage consists in compelling fear.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:A6","text":"The abyss is the decisive testing situation of courage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:A7","text":"The abyss must be seen with pride.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:A8","text":"Consummate courage combines distancing clarity with active grasp.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:NX1","text":"Courage is not courage before witnesses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:NX2","text":"Courage is not the expectation of divine recognition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:NX3","text":"Courage is not coldness toward danger.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:NX4","text":"Courage is not blindness toward the abyss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:NX5","text":"Courage is not drunkenness or numbed perception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:NX6","text":"Courage is not the absence of fear.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:D1","text":"The value of a courageous action does not depend on its visibility or recognition.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_4:A1","CH_97E9_4C_4:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:D2","text":"Fear is transformed from the counterproof of courage into its material of testing.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_4:A4","CH_97E9_4C_4:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:D3","text":"The abyss demands both recognition of its reality and active mastery of one's own reaction.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_4:A5","CH_97E9_4C_4:A6","CH_97E9_4C_4:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:D4","text":"Perception alone does not suffice; courage is consummated only in grasping what is perceived.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_4:A6","CH_97E9_4C_4:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:SD1","text":"Courage is transferred from a morally attested virtue into a solitary form of self-constitution.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_4:A1","CH_97E9_4C_4:A2","CH_97E9_4C_4:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:SD2","text":"The abyss produces not a retreat from reality, but a double operation of heightened vision and compelled action.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_4:A5","CH_97E9_4C_4:A6","CH_97E9_4C_4:A7","CH_97E9_4C_4:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:SD3","text":"The system replaces the opposition between fear and courage with a hierarchy in which courage denotes conscious superordination over fear.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_4:A4","CH_97E9_4C_4:A5","CH_97E9_4C_4:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:DNX1","text":"The system can endure only if courage is not understood as innate fearlessness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:DNX2","text":"The system excludes the notion that social visibility grounds the value of an action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:DNX3","text":"The system disqualifies every overcoming of the abyss through unconsciousness, misrecognition, or numbing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:DNX4","text":"The system presupposes that recognition by God or the public falsifies the test of courage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a world in which courage becomes available through external authentication.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:SNX2","text":"Excluded is the possibility of overcoming the abyss either through ignorance or through mere contemplation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:SNX3","text":"Absent is every transcendent instance that confirms, guarantees, or replaces solitary courage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:FGS1","text":"Public testing and divine observation are removed → courage is isolated as an unattested achievement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:FGS2","text":"Coldness, blindness, and drunkenness are excluded → mere insensibility is separated from courage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:FGS3","text":"Fear is admitted → courage acquires an inner resistance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:FGS4","text":"Fear is compelled → resistance is transformed into self-overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:FGS5","text":"The abyss is recognized and proudly seen → perception becomes an existential test.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:FGS6","text":"Eagle vision and eagle claws are coupled → distancing and grasp produce the definition of courage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:AF1","text":"Public and divine attestation → solitary test → exclusion of numbing → recognition of fear → compulsion of fear → proud vision of the abyss → cognizant and grasping courage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:ME1","text":"Courage is displaced from the social stage into the unattested interior.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:ME2","text":"The false opposition “fear or courage” is replaced by the relation “fear as material of courage.”","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:ME3","text":"Perception and action are mapped as two necessary modes of the same courage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:ME4","text":"Coldness, blindness, and drunkenness are reclassified from apparent fearlessness into forms of deficient perception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:ALT1","text":"Surface — The text asks after the criterion of genuine courage in the face of fear and the abyss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:ALT2","text":"Structural — Courage is generated through the relation of fear, perception, compulsion, and grasp.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The test is shifted from external recognition to solitary self-assertion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The abyss functions as a boundary reality at which a subject constitutes itself through conscious superordination over fear.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the definition of courage from fear, abyss, perception, and grasp.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:MRT2","text":"What the abyss designates ontologically remains underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:MRT3","text":"Likewise underdetermined is whether the “compelling” of fear means psychic self-mastery or a more far-reaching self-overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:MRT4","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as courage is not equated with fearlessness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:MRT5","text":"Its strongest operation is the transformation of fear from deficit into the necessary condition of courage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:MRT6","text":"An unresolved tension remains between seeing the abyss and grasping it: contemplation and grasp are conjoined, but not mediated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_4:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the argumentative movement from the rejection of external authentication to solitary, fear-conscious, and grasping self-assertion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_4C_4@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_4C_4:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On the Higher Man","source_section_label":"4.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Four and Last"],"reading_title":"On the Higher Man · 4","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","On the Higher Man","4."],"original_title":"4."}],"source_title_context":"Vom höheren Menschen","source_section_label":"4.","source_title_hierarchy":["Vierter und letzter Theil"],"reading_title":"On the Higher Man · 4","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","On the Higher Man","4."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 143","title":"On the Higher Man · 4","context":"Part Four and Last","original_context":"Vierter und letzter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Vom höheren Menschen · 4"},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4","layer":"CH","title":"On the Higher Man · 5","order":144,"parents":["RAW_97E9_5C_4"],"revision":"CH_97E9_5C_4@R001","sha256":"4ab15df3a9458ce60e1194c6e7af461a3830c84bff8f2886ee8126bec46391ca","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:AS1","text":"Eine überlieferte Weisheit erklärt den Menschen für böse und macht diese Erklärung zur tröstenden Deutung menschlicher Existenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:AS2","text":"Die Rede verschiebt das Böse aus der Sphäre des bloßen Mangels in die Sphäre menschlicher Kraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:AS3","text":"Der Mensch wird als zugleich besser und böser werdendes Übergangswesen bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:AS4","text":"Das Äußerste des Bösen wird zur notwendigen Bedingung des Besten im Übermenschen erklärt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:AS5","text":"Die asketische Verarbeitung menschlicher Schuld wird gegen eine bejahende Aneignung der großen Sünde abgegrenzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:AS6","text":"Die gewonnene Umwertung wird durch eine hierarchische Beschränkung ihrer Mitteilbarkeit geschützt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:A1","text":"Die Weisesten lehren, dass der Mensch böse ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:A2","text":"Die Wahrheit des menschlichen Bösen ist für den Sprecher nur noch bedingt oder im Verfall begriffen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:A3","text":"Das Böse ist des Menschen beste Kraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:A4","text":"Der Mensch muss besser und böser werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:A5","text":"Das Böseste ist für das Beste des Übermenschen notwendig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:A6","text":"Der Prediger der kleinen Leute verarbeitet die menschliche Sünde durch Leiden und Ertragen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:A7","text":"Der Sprecher findet Trost in der großen Sünde, nicht in ihrer leidenden Übernahme.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:A8","text":"Die maßgeblichen Wahrheiten der Rede sind nicht für jedes Ohr und nicht für jeden Mund bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:A9","text":"Die bezeichneten Dinge gehören einer fernen, feinen Ordnung an, zu der Schafs-Klauen keinen legitimen Zugriff haben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:NX1","text":"Das Böse wird nicht als bloßer moralischer Defekt des Menschen behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:NX2","text":"Die menschliche Verbesserung wird nicht von einer Verschärfung des Bösen getrennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:NX3","text":"Die menschliche Sünde wird nicht durch bloßes Leiden und Ertragen erschöpft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:NX4","text":"Die große Sünde wird nicht als ausschließlich zu tilgende Schuld bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:NX5","text":"Die Rede wird nicht als allgemein zugängliche Lehre behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:NX6","text":"Die Weisheit wird nicht dem Zugriff der „Schafs-Klauen“ überlassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:D1","text":"Die Umwertung des Bösen verwandelt es von einer zu ertragenden Last in eine produktive menschliche Potenz.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_4:A2","CH_97E9_5C_4:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:D2","text":"Menschliche Steigerung verlangt eine doppelte Bewegung, in der Verbesserung und Verschärfung gemeinsam auftreten.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_4:A3","CH_97E9_5C_4:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:D3","text":"Der Übermensch setzt nicht die Abschaffung des Bösen, sondern dessen äußerste Intensivierung voraus.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_4:A4","CH_97E9_5C_4:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:D4","text":"Die große Sünde erhält ihren tröstenden Wert durch ihre Funktion als Bedingung zukünftiger Übermenschlichkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_4:A5","CH_97E9_5C_4:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:D5","text":"Zwischen dem Prediger der kleinen Leute und dem Sprecher besteht ein Gegensatz der Sündenbehandlung: asketische Lastübernahme steht affirmativer Aneignung gegenüber.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_4:A6","CH_97E9_5C_4:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:D6","text":"Die Geltung der Lehre wird durch eine Zugangsschranke der Hör- und Sprechfähigkeit begrenzt.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_4:A8","CH_97E9_5C_4:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:SD1","text":"Das System erzeugt eine Entwicklungslogik, in der moralische Verschlechterung als Material höherer Selbstüberschreitung fungiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_4:A3","CH_97E9_5C_4:A4","CH_97E9_5C_4:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:SD2","text":"Das Böse wird ontologisch aufgewertet, indem es zugleich als menschliche Grundkraft, als Entwicklungsanforderung und als Vorbedingung des Übermenschen erscheint.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_4:A3","CH_97E9_5C_4:A4","CH_97E9_5C_4:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:SD3","text":"Die Umwertung erzeugt eine epistemische Rangordnung zwischen denen, die die ferne Wahrheit tragen können, und denen, deren Zugriff sie entwürdigt.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_4:A8","CH_97E9_5C_4:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:SD4","text":"Der Trost wird von der Erlösung durch Schuld auf die Bejahung der zerstörerischen Potenz verlagert.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_4:A6","CH_97E9_5C_4:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:DNX1","text":"Das System hängt davon ab, dass moralische Verbesserung ohne Steigerung von Kraft, Härte oder Gefährlichkeit unzureichend ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:DNX2","text":"Es setzt voraus, dass das Böse nicht vollständig durch Schuld, Leiden oder Sühne erklärt werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:DNX3","text":"Es schließt ein Modell aus, in dem der Übermensch durch Reinheit, Unschuld oder bloße Entlastung vom Bösen entsteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:DNX4","text":"Es disqualifiziert die Annahme, dass eine Wahrheit durch allgemeine Verständlichkeit oder allgemeine Mitteilbarkeit legitimiert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Moral, in der das Gute durch die endgültige Beseitigung des Bösen entsteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine gemeinsame menschliche Ordnung, in der jeder Sprecher und jedes Ohr denselben Zugang zur höchsten Wahrheit besitzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen bleibt die Möglichkeit, dass die große Sünde ohne Rest in eine versöhnte oder allgemein vermittelbare Ordnung überführt werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:FGS1","text":"Überlieferte Diagnose des Menschen → bedingte Wiederaufnahme der Diagnose → Umwertung des Bösen zur Kraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:FGS2","text":"Umwertung des Bösen → Kopplung von „besser“ und „böser“ → Entwicklungsnotwendigkeit des Äußersten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:FGS3","text":"Notwendigkeit des Äußersten → Übermensch als Zielpol → große Sünde als Trost und produktive Bedingung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:FGS4","text":"Abgrenzung von asketischer Sündenübernahme → privilegierte Sprecherposition → Einschränkung der Mitteilbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:AF1","text":"Überlieferte Lehre vom bösen Menschen → Zweifel an ihrer gegenwärtigen Geltung → Böses als beste Kraft → gleichzeitiges Besser- und Böserwerden → Bösestes als Bedingung des Übermenschen → große Sünde als Trost → hierarchische Sperrung des Zugangs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:ME1","text":"„Böse“ wird von einer negativen moralischen Kategorie in eine produktive Kraftkategorie überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:ME2","text":"„Besser“ und „böser“ werden nicht länger als Gegensätze, sondern als gekoppelte Steigerungsrichtungen kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:ME3","text":"Die Sünde wird von einem Gegenstand der Entlastung zu einem Medium zukünftiger Übermenschlichkeit umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:ME4","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Schuld und Trost wird durch die Unterscheidung zwischen ertragener und bejahter Sünde neu geordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:ME5","text":"Wahrheit wird als ranggebundener Zugang und nicht als universell verteilbarer Inhalt kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:ALT1","text":"Surface: Der Mensch, das Böse, die Sünde, der Übermensch und die Begrenzung des Hörens bilden die expliziten Gegenstände.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:ALT2","text":"Structural: Das Argument verschaltet moralische Wertung, Kraftsteigerung, Entwicklung und soziale Zugangshierarchie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Der Sprecher ersetzt die asketische Bearbeitung der Schuld durch eine selektive Bejahung des Gefährlichen und kontrolliert zugleich dessen Verbreitung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Der Mensch erscheint als Übergangswesen, dessen gegenwärtige Negativität in eine zukünftige Übermenschlichkeit umschlagen soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Umwertung des Bösen und die Entwicklungslogik des Übermenschen zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wodurch das „Bessere“ des Menschen inhaltlich bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:MRT3","text":"Ebenfalls unterbestimmt bleibt, wer über die legitime Fähigkeit verfügt, die ferne Wahrheit zu hören oder auszusprechen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:MRT4","text":"Intern kohärent ist die Kopplung von Bösem, Kraft und Übermenschlichkeit; spannungsvoll bleibt die gleichzeitige Berufung auf menschliches Bösesein und dessen mögliche Überwindung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Operation besteht in der Umkehrung der moralischen Valenz des Bösen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:MRT6","text":"Die Struktur hängt von der nicht vollständig aufgelösten Spannung ab, dass das Böseste notwendig sein soll, ohne selbst als endgültiges Ziel zu gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung von tradierter Diagnose über Umwertung und Entwicklungszwang bis zur epistemischen Ausschließung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T191957225207Z_85f9394a","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"5.","source_sha256":"4ab15df3a9458ce60e1194c6e7af461a3830c84bff8f2886ee8126bec46391ca","sha256":"2e2ee5bfd1aa7b72a7043a60e569d297da91602b80048bc64c31e4bc5fed0f62","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:19:57.227817+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:AS1","text":"A received wisdom declares the human being to be evil and makes this declaration into a consoling interpretation of human existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:AS2","text":"The discourse shifts evil from the sphere of mere deficiency into the sphere of human strength.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:AS3","text":"The human being is determined as a transitional being becoming at once better and more evil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:AS4","text":"The utmost of evil is declared to be the necessary condition of the best in the overman.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:AS5","text":"The ascetic processing of human guilt is distinguished from an affirmative appropriation of great sin.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:AS6","text":"The revaluation thus attained is protected by a hierarchical restriction of its communicability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:A1","text":"The wisest teach that the human being is evil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:A2","text":"For the speaker, the truth of human evil is only conditional or in decline.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:A3","text":"Evil is the human being's best strength.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:A4","text":"The human being must become better and more evil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:A5","text":"The most evil is necessary for the best of the overman.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:A6","text":"The preacher of the little people processes human sin through suffering and endurance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:A7","text":"The speaker finds consolation in great sin, not in its suffering assumption.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:A8","text":"The authoritative truths of the discourse are not intended for every ear and not for every mouth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:A9","text":"The designated things belong to a distant, refined order to which sheep-claws have no legitimate access.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:NX1","text":"Evil is not treated as a mere moral defect of the human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:NX2","text":"Human improvement is not separated from an intensification of evil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:NX3","text":"Human sin is not exhausted by mere suffering and endurance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:NX4","text":"Great sin is not determined as guilt to be expiated exclusively.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:NX5","text":"The discourse is not treated as a doctrine generally accessible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:NX6","text":"Wisdom is not surrendered to the grasp of the “sheep-claws.”","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:D1","text":"The revaluation of evil transforms it from a burden to be endured into a productive human potency.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_4:A2","CH_97E9_5C_4:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:D2","text":"Human enhancement requires a double movement in which improvement and intensification occur together.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_4:A3","CH_97E9_5C_4:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:D3","text":"The overman presupposes not the abolition of evil, but its utmost intensification.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_4:A4","CH_97E9_5C_4:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:D4","text":"Great sin receives its consoling value through its function as the condition of future overmanhood.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_4:A5","CH_97E9_5C_4:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:D5","text":"Between the preacher of the little people and the speaker there is an opposition in the treatment of sin: ascetic assumption of burden stands opposed to affirmative appropriation.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_4:A6","CH_97E9_5C_4:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:D6","text":"The validity of the doctrine is delimited by an access barrier of the capacity to hear and speak.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_4:A8","CH_97E9_5C_4:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:SD1","text":"The system generates a logic of development in which moral deterioration functions as material for higher self-overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_4:A3","CH_97E9_5C_4:A4","CH_97E9_5C_4:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:SD2","text":"Evil is ontologically revalued by appearing at once as a fundamental human force, as a developmental requirement, and as a precondition of the overman.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_4:A3","CH_97E9_5C_4:A4","CH_97E9_5C_4:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:SD3","text":"The revaluation generates an epistemic hierarchy between those who can bear the distant truth and those whose grasp debases it.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_4:A8","CH_97E9_5C_4:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:SD4","text":"Consolation is shifted from redemption through guilt to the affirmation of destructive potency.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_4:A6","CH_97E9_5C_4:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:DNX1","text":"The system depends on moral improvement without an increase in strength, hardness, or dangerousness being insufficient.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:DNX2","text":"It presupposes that evil cannot be fully explained by guilt, suffering, or expiation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:DNX3","text":"It excludes a model in which the overman arises through purity, innocence, or mere relief from evil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:DNX4","text":"It disqualifies the assumption that a truth is legitimized through general comprehensibility or general communicability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a morality in which the good arises through the final elimination of evil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:SNX2","text":"Excluded is a shared human order in which every speaker and every ear possesses the same access to the highest truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:SNX3","text":"Excluded remains the possibility that great sin can be transferred without remainder into a reconciled or generally communicable order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:FGS1","text":"Received diagnosis of the human being → conditional resumption of the diagnosis → revaluation of evil into strength.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:FGS2","text":"Revaluation of evil → coupling of “better” and “more evil” → developmental necessity of the utmost.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:FGS3","text":"Necessity of the utmost → overman as the pole of the goal → great sin as consolation and productive condition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:FGS4","text":"Distinction from ascetic assumption of sin → privileged speaker position → restriction of communicability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:AF1","text":"Received doctrine of the evil human being → doubt concerning its present validity → evil as best strength → simultaneous becoming-better and becoming-more-evil → the most evil as condition of the overman → great sin as consolation → hierarchical closure of access.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:ME1","text":"“Evil” is transferred from a negative moral category into a productive category of force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:ME2","text":"“Better” and “more evil” are no longer mapped as opposites, but as coupled directions of intensification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:ME3","text":"Sin is reclassified from an object of relief into a medium of future overmanhood.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:ME4","text":"The opposition between guilt and consolation is reordered through the distinction between endured and affirmed sin.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:ME5","text":"Truth is mapped as rank-bound access and not as universally distributable content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:ALT1","text":"Surface: The human being, evil, sin, the overman, and the limitation of hearing constitute the explicit objects.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:ALT2","text":"Structural: The argument interconnects moral valuation, increase of strength, development, and social hierarchy of access.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: The speaker replaces the ascetic treatment of guilt with a selective affirmation of the dangerous and simultaneously controls its dissemination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: The human being appears as a transitional being whose present negativity is to turn into a future overmanhood.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the revaluation of evil and the developmental logic of the overman.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is how the “better” of the human being is determined in content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:MRT3","text":"Likewise underdetermined remains who possesses the legitimate capacity to hear or pronounce the distant truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:MRT4","text":"Internally coherent is the coupling of evil, strength, and overmanhood; tension remains in the simultaneous appeal to human evilness and its possible overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:MRT5","text":"The strongest operation consists in the reversal of the moral valence of evil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:MRT6","text":"The structure depends on the not fully resolved tension that the most evil is supposed to be necessary without itself counting as the final goal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_4:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement from inherited diagnosis through revaluation and developmental compulsion to epistemic exclusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_5C_4@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_5C_4:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On the Higher Man","source_section_label":"5.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Four and Last"],"reading_title":"On the Higher Man · 5","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","On the Higher Man","5."],"original_title":"5."}],"source_title_context":"Vom höheren Menschen","source_section_label":"5.","source_title_hierarchy":["Vierter und letzter Theil"],"reading_title":"On the Higher Man · 5","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","On the Higher Man","5."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 144","title":"On the Higher Man · 5","context":"Part Four and Last","original_context":"Vierter und letzter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Vom höheren Menschen · 5"},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4","layer":"CH","title":"On the Higher Man · 6","order":145,"parents":["RAW_97E9_6C_4"],"revision":"CH_97E9_6C_4@R001","sha256":"6bf5a3ec027d48b848a486ea70301ad6c5fdd24da2d047550a0412083f0ad1e8","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:AS1","text":"Das Argument weist die Erwartung zurück, menschliches Leiden durch Verbesserung, Bequemlichkeit oder Orientierung zu vermindern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:AS2","text":"Es bestimmt gesteigertes Leiden und verschärfte Bedingungen als Voraussetzung menschlicher Höherentwicklung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:AS3","text":"Es setzt Wachstum einer Zerstörungsgefahr aus, statt es als Stabilisierung oder Rettung zu begreifen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:AS4","text":"Es verschiebt den Maßstab vom kleinen, vielfachen und kurzen Elend auf eine lange, ferne und umfassende Zielrichtung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:AS5","text":"Es diagnostiziert das gegenwärtige Leiden als auf das eigene Selbst begrenzt und daher als unzureichend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:AS6","text":"Die Bewegung ist polemisch und diagnostisch: zurückgewiesene Linderung → verschärfte Bedingungen → gefährdete Erhöhung → Kritik des unzureichenden Leidens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:A1","text":"Menschliche Entwicklung wird nicht durch Erleichterung, sondern durch Verschärfung ihrer Bedingungen erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:A2","text":"Ein höherer Mensch entsteht nur unter Bedingungen, die Leiden vergrößern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:A3","text":"Die Vermehrung besserer menschlicher Arten setzt den Untergang vieler voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:A4","text":"Höhe und Zerstörbarkeit gehören strukturell zusammen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:A5","text":"Die Möglichkeit menschlicher Höhe bemisst sich an der Fähigkeit, dem „Blitz“ ausgesetzt zu sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:A6","text":"Kleine, vielfache und kurze Leiden besitzen gegenüber langen und fernen Zielrichtungen nachgeordnete Bedeutung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:A7","text":"Leiden am eigenen Selbst ist vom Leiden am Menschen unterschieden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:A8","text":"Das gegenwärtige Leiden der Angesprochenen erreicht noch nicht die für menschliche Überschreitung erforderliche Intensität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:A9","text":"Die behauptete Selbstauskunft der Leidenden über ihr Leiden kann als Lüge erscheinen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:A10","text":"Der Sprecher misst fremdes Leiden an einer eigenen, nicht mitteilbaren Leidensdimension.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:NX1","text":"Die Aufgabe des Sprechers besteht nicht darin, das Schlechte gutzumachen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:NX2","text":"Der Sprecher will Leidende nicht bequemer betten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:NX3","text":"Er will Unsteten, Verirrten und Verkletterten keine leichteren Wege bereitstellen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:NX4","text":"Menschliche Erhöhung ist nicht mit Schonung vereinbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:NX5","text":"Das kleine, vielfache und kurze Elend bildet keinen zureichenden Maßstab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:NX6","text":"Leiden am eigenen Selbst ist nicht gleichbedeutend mit Leiden am Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:NX7","text":"Die Versicherung, bereits am Menschen zu leiden, wird als möglicherweise unwahr ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:D1","text":"Erleichterung würde die Bedingungen beseitigen, unter denen menschliche Höhe entsteht.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_4:A1","CH_97E9_6C_4:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:D2","text":"Die Förderung höherer Menschen verlangt nicht die Erhaltung aller, sondern den Untergang vieler und die Hervorbringung besserer Arten.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_4:A2","CH_97E9_6C_4:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:D3","text":"Die Erhöhung des Menschen ist ein Prozess, in dem Gewinn und Zerbrechen zugleich auftreten.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_4:A4","CH_97E9_6C_4:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:D4","text":"Eine Orientierung auf Ferne und Dauer entwertet die unmittelbare Forderung nach Linderung.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_4:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:D5","text":"Das Leiden der Angesprochenen gilt als selbstbezogen und erreicht deshalb nicht die ontologische Ebene des Menschen.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_4:A7","CH_97E9_6C_4:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:D6","text":"Der Sprecher beansprucht eine asymmetrische Erkenntnisposition gegenüber dem Leiden der Angesprochenen.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_4:A9","CH_97E9_6C_4:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:SD1","text":"Das System ersetzt die Ethik der Leidensminderung durch eine Selektionslogik, in der Leiden als Produktionsbedingung höherer Menschlichkeit fungiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:SD2","text":"Menschliche Höhe wird als Grenzexistenz konstruiert: Je höher das Ziel, desto notwendiger werden Gefahr, Härte und mögliche Vernichtung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:SD3","text":"Der Wert gegenwärtiger Individuen wird einer übergeordneten, auf bessere menschliche Arten gerichteten Zukunftsordnung unterstellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:SD4","text":"Der Sprecher monopolisiert die Bestimmung dessen, welches Leiden wahr, zureichend und menschenbezogen ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:SD5","text":"Die Zurückweisung von Trost erzeugt eine Totalisierung, in der jede Forderung nach Schonung als Hindernis der Höherentwicklung erscheinen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass menschliche Verbesserung primär durch Fürsorge, Komfort oder Zugänglichkeit erzeugt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:DNX2","text":"Es schließt aus, dass die Erhaltung vieler Menschen ein oberstes Ziel menschlicher Entwicklung ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:DNX3","text":"Es schließt aus, dass Leiden durch subjektive Selbstbeschreibung abschließend bestimmt werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:DNX4","text":"Es schließt aus, dass Höhe ohne Gefahr, Zerbrechen und Verlust erreichbar ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:DNX5","text":"Es schließt aus, dass unmittelbares Leiden gegenüber einer fernen Menschheitssteigerung den Vorrang besitzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:DNX6","text":"Es schließt aus, dass alle Menschen bereits an derselben Gegenstandsebene leiden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen bleibt eine Ordnung, in der menschliche Größe durch universelle Schonung, Leidensminderung und Erhaltung erzeugt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen bleibt ein gemeinsamer Maßstab des Leidens, der Sprecher und Angesprochene epistemisch gleichstellen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen bleibt die Möglichkeit, dass das gegenwärtige menschliche Leiden bereits sein maximales oder entscheidendes Maß erreicht hat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen bleibt eine Zukunft, in der Höherentwicklung ohne Opfer, Untergang und radikale Ungleichverteilung des Leidens denkbar ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:FGS1","text":"Erleichterung wird als Hemmung der Entwicklung gesetzt: Linderung → Abschwächung der Bedingung → Verhinderung der Höhe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:FGS2","text":"Verschärfung wird als Selektionsbedingung gesetzt: größeres Leiden → Untergang vieler → Hervortreten besserer Arten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:FGS3","text":"Höhe wird durch ihre Gefährdung definiert: Höhe → Aussetzung an den Blitz → mögliches Zerbrechen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:FGS4","text":"Der Maßstab wird temporal und ontologisch verschoben: kleines gegenwärtiges Elend → lange und ferne Zielrichtung → Abwertung unmittelbarer Linderung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:FGS5","text":"Die Leidensdiagnose wird hierarchisiert: Leiden am Selbst → unzureichende Leidensform → Leiden am Menschen als fehlende Schwelle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:FGS6","text":"Die Schlussposition entsteht durch epistemische Asymmetrie: fremde Selbstauskunft → Verdacht der Lüge → Vorrang der Sprecherdiagnose.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:AF1","text":"Erwartung von Verbesserung und Schonung → polemische Zurückweisung → Verschärfung der Bedingungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:AF2","text":"Verschärfung der Bedingungen → Untergang vieler und Hervortreten besserer Arten → menschliche Höhe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:AF3","text":"Menschliche Höhe → Aussetzung an Zerstörung → Möglichkeit des Zerbrechens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:AF4","text":"Ferne und lange Zielrichtung → Entwertung kleinen, vielfachen und kurzen Elends.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:AF5","text":"Entwertung des gegenwärtigen Elends → Unterscheidung zwischen Selbstleiden und Menschenleiden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:AF6","text":"Unterscheidung der Leidensformen → Diagnose unzureichenden Leidens → Zurückweisung der Selbstauskunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:ME1","text":"Leiden wird von einem zu verringernden Übel in ein generatives Medium menschlicher Höherentwicklung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:ME2","text":"Fürsorge, Komfort und Orientierung werden von Hilfen zu möglichen Entwicklungshemmnissen umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:ME3","text":"Untergang wird nicht mehr ausschließlich als Verlust, sondern als Bedingung der Hervorbringung besserer Arten sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:ME4","text":"Menschliche Höhe wird nicht als Schutzraum, sondern als exponierte und zerstörbare Grenzlage kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:ME5","text":"Die Unterscheidung zwischen Leiden am Selbst und Leiden am Menschen erzeugt eine Hierarchie der Leidensgegenstände.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:ME6","text":"Der Konflikt verschiebt sich von der Frage nach Leidensminderung zur Frage, welches Leiden als wahr und entwicklungsrelevant gilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:ALT1","text":"Surface: Der Sprecher weist konkrete Angebote von Verbesserung, Bequemlichkeit und leichteren Wegen zurück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:ALT2","text":"Structural: Ein System der Höherentwicklung wird durch Verschärfung, Untergang, Selektion und Gefährdung organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Der Sprecher entzieht den Angesprochenen die Definitionsmacht über ihr eigenes Leiden und ersetzt sie durch eine antagonistische Diagnose.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Der Mensch erscheint als noch nicht vollendete, auf ferne Höhe gerichtete und durch Zerstörung hervorgebrachte Möglichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Zurückweisung von Linderung, die Forderung nach Härte und die Diagnose unzureichenden Leidens zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, was genau eine „bessere Art“ des Menschen konstituiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt ebenfalls, worin das Leiden am Menschen gegenüber dem Leiden am Selbst positiv besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:MRT4","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Höherentwicklung notwendig durch Härte und Verlust vermittelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:MRT5","text":"Ihre stärkste Verbindung liegt in der Kopplung von Höhe, Gefahr und Zerbrechen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:MRT6","text":"Die zentrale Spannung liegt zwischen der behaupteten Produktion höherer Menschen und der fehlenden Bestimmung dessen, wer über deren Wert und Auswahl entscheidet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die argumentative Bewegung, hängt jedoch an der rhetorisch gesetzten Asymmetrie zwischen dem Sprecher und den Leidenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T192231196272Z_850bdbf4","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"6.","source_sha256":"6bf5a3ec027d48b848a486ea70301ad6c5fdd24da2d047550a0412083f0ad1e8","sha256":"895acc1b3749b85da4f45728534a37ec9d41bc04646ca35b111d4dc1672f272b","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:22:31.199265+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:AS1","text":"The argument rejects the expectation of diminishing human suffering through improvement, comfort, or orientation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:AS2","text":"It determines intensified suffering and sharpened conditions as prerequisites of human higher development.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:AS3","text":"It exposes growth to a danger of destruction, rather than understanding it as stabilization or salvation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:AS4","text":"It shifts the standard from small, manifold, and brief misery to a long, distant, and comprehensive orientation toward an end.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:AS5","text":"It diagnoses present suffering as limited to one's own self and therefore as insufficient.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:AS6","text":"The movement is polemical and diagnostic: rejected alleviation → sharpened conditions → endangered elevation → critique of insufficient suffering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:A1","text":"Human development is produced not through alleviation but through the sharpening of its conditions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:A2","text":"A higher human being arises only under conditions that increase suffering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:A3","text":"The multiplication of better human types presupposes the downfall of many.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:A4","text":"Height and destructibility structurally belong together.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:A5","text":"The possibility of human height is measured by the capacity to be exposed to the “lightning bolt.”","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:A6","text":"Small, manifold, and brief sufferings possess subordinate significance in relation to long and distant orientations toward an end.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:A7","text":"Suffering over one's own self is distinguished from suffering over humanity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:A8","text":"The present suffering of those addressed does not yet attain the intensity required for human self-transcendence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:A9","text":"The sufferers' asserted self-report concerning their suffering can appear as a lie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:A10","text":"The speaker measures others' suffering against a personal, incommunicable dimension of suffering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:NX1","text":"The speaker's task does not consist in making good what is bad.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:NX2","text":"The speaker does not wish to make sufferers more comfortable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:NX3","text":"He does not wish to provide easier paths for the restless, the strayed, and those who have climbed astray.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:NX4","text":"Human elevation is incompatible with sparing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:NX5","text":"Small, manifold, and brief misery does not constitute a sufficient standard.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:NX6","text":"Suffering over one's own self is not synonymous with suffering over humanity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:NX7","text":"The assurance of already suffering over humanity is rejected as possibly untrue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:D1","text":"Alleviation would eliminate the conditions under which human height arises.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_4:A1","CH_97E9_6C_4:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:D2","text":"The promotion of higher human beings requires not the preservation of all, but the downfall of many and the production of better types.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_4:A2","CH_97E9_6C_4:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:D3","text":"The elevation of the human being is a process in which gain and breaking occur simultaneously.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_4:A4","CH_97E9_6C_4:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:D4","text":"An orientation toward distance and duration devalues the immediate demand for alleviation.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_4:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:D5","text":"The suffering of those addressed is regarded as self-referential and therefore does not attain the ontological level of the human being.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_4:A7","CH_97E9_6C_4:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:D6","text":"The speaker claims an asymmetrical epistemic position in relation to the suffering of those addressed.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_4:A9","CH_97E9_6C_4:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:SD1","text":"The system replaces the ethics of suffering reduction with a logic of selection in which suffering functions as a condition for producing higher humanity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:SD2","text":"Human height is constructed as a borderline existence: the higher the goal, the more necessary danger, hardness, and possible annihilation become.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:SD3","text":"The value of present individuals is subordinated to a higher-order future order directed toward better human types.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:SD4","text":"The speaker monopolizes the determination of which suffering is true, sufficient, and human-related.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:SD5","text":"The rejection of consolation produces a totalization in which every demand for sparing can appear as an obstacle to higher development.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:DNX1","text":"The system excludes the possibility that human improvement is produced primarily through care, comfort, or accessibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:DNX2","text":"It excludes the possibility that the preservation of many human beings is a supreme goal of human development.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:DNX3","text":"It excludes the possibility that suffering can be conclusively determined through subjective self-description.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:DNX4","text":"It excludes the possibility that height is attainable without danger, breaking, and loss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:DNX5","text":"It excludes the possibility that immediate suffering takes precedence over a distant enhancement of humanity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:DNX6","text":"It excludes the possibility that all human beings already suffer at the same level of object.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:SNX1","text":"Excluded remains an order in which human greatness is produced through universal sparing, suffering reduction, and preservation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:SNX2","text":"Excluded remains a shared standard of suffering that could place the speaker and those addressed on an epistemically equal footing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:SNX3","text":"Excluded remains the possibility that present human suffering has already reached its maximal or decisive measure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:SNX4","text":"Excluded remains a future in which higher development is conceivable without sacrifice, downfall, and radically unequal distribution of suffering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:FGS1","text":"Alleviation is posited as an inhibition of development: alleviation → weakening of the condition → prevention of height.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:FGS2","text":"Sharpening is posited as a condition of selection: greater suffering → downfall of many → emergence of better types.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:FGS3","text":"Height is defined through its endangerment: height → exposure to the lightning bolt → possible breaking.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:FGS4","text":"The standard is displaced temporally and ontologically: small present misery → long and distant orientation toward an end → devaluation of immediate alleviation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:FGS5","text":"The diagnosis of suffering is hierarchized: suffering over the self → insufficient form of suffering → suffering over humanity as the missing threshold.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:FGS6","text":"The concluding position arises through epistemic asymmetry: another's self-report → suspicion of lying → primacy of the speaker's diagnosis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:AF1","text":"Expectation of improvement and sparing → polemical rejection → sharpening of conditions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:AF2","text":"Sharpening of conditions → downfall of many and emergence of better types → human height.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:AF3","text":"Human height → exposure to destruction → possibility of breaking.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:AF4","text":"Distant and long orientation toward an end → devaluation of small, manifold, and brief misery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:AF5","text":"Devaluation of present misery → distinction between suffering over the self and suffering over humanity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:AF6","text":"Distinction among forms of suffering → diagnosis of insufficient suffering → rejection of self-report.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:ME1","text":"Suffering is reclassified from an evil to be diminished into a generative medium of human higher development.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:ME2","text":"Care, comfort, and orientation are remapped from aids into possible inhibitions of development.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:ME3","text":"Downfall becomes visible no longer exclusively as loss, but as a condition for producing better types.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:ME4","text":"Human height is mapped not as a protected space, but as an exposed and destructible borderline condition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:ME5","text":"The distinction between suffering over the self and suffering over humanity produces a hierarchy of objects of suffering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:ME6","text":"The conflict shifts from the question of suffering reduction to the question of which suffering counts as true and relevant to development.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:ALT1","text":"Surface: The speaker rejects concrete offers of improvement, comfort, and easier paths.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:ALT2","text":"Structural: A system of higher development is organized through sharpening, downfall, selection, and endangerment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: The speaker deprives those addressed of the power to define their own suffering and replaces it with an antagonistic diagnosis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: The human being appears as a possibility not yet completed, directed toward distant height, and produced through destruction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the rejection of alleviation, the demand for hardness, and the diagnosis of insufficient suffering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:MRT2","text":"What precisely constitutes a “better type” of the human being remains underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:MRT3","text":"Likewise underdetermined is what suffering over humanity positively consists in as distinct from suffering over the self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:MRT4","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as higher development is necessarily mediated through hardness and loss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:MRT5","text":"Its strongest connection lies in the coupling of height, danger, and breaking.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:MRT6","text":"The central tension lies between the asserted production of higher human beings and the absent determination of who decides over their value and selection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_4:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the argumentative movement, but depends on the rhetorically posited asymmetry between the speaker and the sufferers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_6C_4@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_6C_4:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On the Higher Man","source_section_label":"6.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Four and Last"],"reading_title":"On the Higher Man · 6","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","On the Higher Man","6."],"original_title":"6."}],"source_title_context":"Vom höheren Menschen","source_section_label":"6.","source_title_hierarchy":["Vierter und letzter Theil"],"reading_title":"On the Higher Man · 6","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","On the Higher Man","6."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 145","title":"On the Higher Man · 6","context":"Part Four and Last","original_context":"Vierter und letzter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Vom höheren Menschen · 6"},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4","layer":"CH","title":"On the Higher Man · 7","order":146,"parents":["RAW_97E9_7C_4"],"revision":"CH_97E9_7C_4@R001","sha256":"d83bc98c2da531f37b090a8662cf9314534e9a382ef03b764e7a8ed1e8f333ff","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:AS1","text":"Der bloße Entzug des Schadens genügt dem Sprecher nicht als Bestimmung des Blitzes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:AS2","text":"Der Blitz wird von einem abzuleitenden Ereignis in eine für den Sprecher arbeitende Kraft umbestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:AS3","text":"Weisheit wird als lang andauernde Ansammlung und Verdichtung einer künftigen Blitzentladung konstruiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:AS4","text":"Die Verdichtung der Weisheit verläuft über zunehmende Stille und Dunkelheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:AS5","text":"Gegenüber den Menschen der Gegenwart wird Weisheit nicht als Beleuchtung, sondern als Blendung eingesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:AS6","text":"Die Argumentbewegung führt von der Zurückweisung harmloser Erkenntnis über latente Verdichtung zur offensiven, augenzerstörenden Wirkung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:A1","text":"Eine bloß unschädliche Kraft erfüllt ihre Bestimmung nicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:A2","text":"Der Blitz soll nicht aus äußerer Erklärung oder Ableitung hervorgehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:A3","text":"Der Blitz soll für den Sprecher arbeiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:A4","text":"Weisheit kann sich über lange Zeit ansammeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:A5","text":"Ansammlung von Weisheit erzeugt zunehmende Stille und Dunkelheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:A6","text":"Verdichtete Weisheit kann einen Blitz hervorbringen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:A7","text":"Die Menschen der Gegenwart sind nicht das legitime Ziel einer erhellenden Weisheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:A8","text":"Gegenüber den Menschen der Gegenwart kann Weisheit als Blendung wirken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:A9","text":"Die äußerste Wirkung dieser Blendung ist der Entzug des Sehens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:NX1","text":"Der Blitz ist nicht dadurch bestimmt, dass er keinen Schaden mehr verursacht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:NX2","text":"Der Blitz ist nicht als bloßer Gegenstand einer Ableitung verfügbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:NX3","text":"Weisheit ist nicht unmittelbare Helligkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:NX4","text":"Weisheit ist nicht als offene, bereits entladene Präsenz bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:NX5","text":"Der Sprecher ist nicht dazu bestimmt, den Menschen der Gegenwart Licht zu sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:NX6","text":"Die Wirkung auf die Menschen der Gegenwart ist nicht Aufklärung, Erhellung oder Orientierung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:NX7","text":"Der Blitz ist nicht neutral gegenüber den Augen der anderen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:D1","text":"Die Wirksamkeit des Blitzes besteht in einer arbeitsförmigen, instrumentellen Funktion für den Sprecher.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_4:A1","CH_97E9_7C_4:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:D2","text":"Die Nichtableitbarkeit des Blitzes verlagert seine Genese auf eine innere, zeitlich anwachsende Verdichtung.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_4:A2","CH_97E9_7C_4:A4","CH_97E9_7C_4:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:D3","text":"Die Dunkelheit der Weisheit bezeichnet keine Abwesenheit von Kraft, sondern die Latenz einer bevorstehenden Entladung.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_4:A5","CH_97E9_7C_4:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:D4","text":"Die Bestimmung der Weisheit durch den kommenden Blitz schließt eine primär belehrende Funktion aus.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_4:A6","CH_97E9_7C_4:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:D5","text":"Die Blendung der Menschen der Gegenwart wird als aktive Wirkung und nicht als misslungene Erhellung erzeugt.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_4:A7","CH_97E9_7C_4:A8","CH_97E9_7C_4:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:SD1","text":"Das System ersetzt das Modell der Erkenntnis als Licht durch ein Modell der Erkenntnis als verdunkelte, gespeicherte und schädigend entladbare Energie.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_4:A4","CH_97E9_7C_4:A5","CH_97E9_7C_4:A6","CH_97E9_7C_4:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:SD2","text":"Erkenntnis wird nicht auf Mitteilung, sondern auf instrumentelle Wirksamkeit und asymmetrische Verfügung ausgerichtet.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_4:A1","CH_97E9_7C_4:A3","CH_97E9_7C_4:A8","CH_97E9_7C_4:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:SD3","text":"Zeit fungiert als Produktionsbedingung der Kraft: Die verzögerte Verdichtung legitimiert die spätere Intensität der Entladung.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_4:A4","CH_97E9_7C_4:A5","CH_97E9_7C_4:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:SD4","text":"Die Gegenwart wird als epistemisch unempfängliche oder zu überwältigende Instanz konstituiert, gegenüber der Weisheit nur als Übermaß Wirkung gewinnt.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_4:A7","CH_97E9_7C_4:A8","CH_97E9_7C_4:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass Erkenntnis ihren Wert primär durch Harmlosigkeit erhält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:DNX2","text":"Es schließt aus, dass Wahrheit durch transparente Herleitung und begriffliche Verfügbarkeit konstituiert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:DNX3","text":"Es schließt aus, dass Weisheit notwendig in sichtbarer oder verständlicher Form auftreten muss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:DNX4","text":"Es schließt aus, dass ein zeitgenössisches Publikum der natürliche Empfänger oder Maßstab der Weisheit ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:SNX1","text":"Abwesend ist ein Erkenntnismodell, in dem Weisheit ohne Machtgefälle, Schädigung oder Überwältigung vermittelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:SNX2","text":"Versperrt ist die Möglichkeit, dass Gegenwart und Weisheit in einer gemeinsamen Sichtbarkeit zusammentreten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:SNX3","text":"Das System organisiert sich um die Unmöglichkeit, den anderen zugleich zu erhellen und in seiner bisherigen Sichtbarkeit zu belassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:FGS1","text":"Unzureichende Harmlosigkeit → Zurückweisung des bloßen Nichtschadens als Ziel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:FGS2","text":"Zurückweisung äußerer Ableitung → Umstellung des Blitzes auf eigengesetzliche, für den Sprecher arbeitende Wirksamkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:FGS3","text":"Zeitliche Ansammlung → Stille und Dunkelheit → Verdichtung der Weisheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:FGS4","text":"Verdichtung → Blitz als eruptive Aktualisierung latenter Weisheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:FGS5","text":"Gegenwartsdiagnose → Ausschluss der Beleuchtung → Blendung und Entzug des Sehens als strategische Endwirkung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:AF1","text":"Unzureichender Nichtschaden → funktionale Neubestimmung des Blitzes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:AF2","text":"Ableitungsverweigerung → eigengesetzliche Arbeitskraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:AF3","text":"Langsame Ansammlung → stille und dunkle Weisheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:AF4","text":"Verdichtete Weisheit → hervorbrechender Blitz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:AF5","text":"Menschen der Gegenwart → Ausschluss des Lichts → Blendung und Erblindung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:ME1","text":"Licht wird von einem positiven Erkenntnismedium zu einer zurückgewiesenen Wirkungsform umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:ME2","text":"Dunkelheit wird von bloßem Mangel in eine produktive Latenzform der Weisheit umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:ME3","text":"Der Blitz wird vom Naturereignis zur instrumentellen Tätigkeit einer personifizierten Weisheit umgeordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:ME4","text":"Das Publikum wird vom möglichen Empfänger zum Widerstandskörper der Erkenntniswirkung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:ME5","text":"Erkennen und Schädigen werden nicht als Gegensätze, sondern als aufeinander bezogene Wirkungsstufen gefasst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Sprecher weist harmlose Wirkung und erhellende Ansprache zurück und fordert eine blendende Blitzwirkung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:ALT2","text":"Structural — Weisheit wird als zeitlich akkumulierte, verdunkelte Energie organisiert, die sich in einer Entladung aktualisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Sprecher verschiebt die Aufgabe von Vermittlung und Belehrung zu instrumenteller Überwältigung eines Gegenübers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Kraft entsteht nicht als fertige Präsenz, sondern durch lange Verdichtung, deren Wahrheit sich erst in der Entladung zeigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von der Zurückweisung des Nichtschadens zur blendenden Blitzwirkung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:MRT2","text":"Die zeitliche Funktion der Ansammlung und die operative Funktion der Dunkelheit bleiben auf die Bildlogik von Wolke und Blitz angewiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:MRT3","text":"Das System ist intern kohärent, sofern Blendung als intendierte Wirksamkeit und nicht als Scheitern von Aufklärung gilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:MRT4","text":"Seine stärkste Verbindung liegt in der Kette Verdichtung → Blitz → Blendung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:MRT5","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen dem Anspruch eigengesetzlicher Nichtableitbarkeit und der funktionalen Unterordnung des Blitzes unter den Sprecher bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, solange Weisheit nicht als Inhalt, sondern als latent anwachsende und schließlich schädigend wirksame Kraft behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T192422296668Z_e3ad5ac3","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"7.","source_sha256":"d83bc98c2da531f37b090a8662cf9314534e9a382ef03b764e7a8ed1e8f333ff","sha256":"d20e58c16622bbe90437ba2bdeed23f658938199fa8b4a61b0aa8728c571449d","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:24:22.297674+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:AS1","text":"The mere removal of harm does not suffice for the speaker as a determination of lightning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:AS2","text":"Lightning is redefined from an event to be derived into a force working for the speaker.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:AS3","text":"Wisdom is constructed as the long-lasting accumulation and condensation of a future lightning discharge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:AS4","text":"The condensation of wisdom proceeds through increasing silence and darkness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:AS5","text":"In relation to the people of the present, wisdom is deployed not as illumination but as dazzling.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:AS6","text":"The movement of the argument leads from the rejection of harmless knowledge, through latent condensation, to an offensive, eye-destroying effect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:A1","text":"A merely harmless force does not fulfill its determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:A2","text":"Lightning is not to proceed from external explanation or derivation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:A3","text":"Lightning is to work for the speaker.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:A4","text":"Wisdom can accumulate over a long period.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:A5","text":"The accumulation of wisdom produces increasing silence and darkness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:A6","text":"Condensed wisdom can bring forth lightning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:A7","text":"The people of the present are not the legitimate target of an illuminating wisdom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:A8","text":"In relation to the people of the present, wisdom can act as dazzling.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:A9","text":"The utmost effect of this dazzling is the deprivation of sight.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:NX1","text":"Lightning is not determined by the fact that it no longer causes harm.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:NX2","text":"Lightning is not available as a mere object of derivation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:NX3","text":"Wisdom is not immediate brightness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:NX4","text":"Wisdom is not determined as an open, already discharged presence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:NX5","text":"The speaker is not determined to be light to the people of the present.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:NX6","text":"The effect on the people of the present is not enlightenment, illumination, or orientation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:NX7","text":"Lightning is not neutral toward the eyes of others.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:D1","text":"The efficacy of lightning consists in a work-like, instrumental function for the speaker.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_4:A1","CH_97E9_7C_4:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:D2","text":"The non-derivability of lightning shifts its genesis to an internal, temporally growing condensation.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_4:A2","CH_97E9_7C_4:A4","CH_97E9_7C_4:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:D3","text":"The darkness of wisdom designates not an absence of force, but the latency of an impending discharge.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_4:A5","CH_97E9_7C_4:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:D4","text":"The determination of wisdom by the coming lightning excludes a primarily instructive function.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_4:A6","CH_97E9_7C_4:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:D5","text":"The dazzling of the people of the present is produced as an active effect and not as failed illumination.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_4:A7","CH_97E9_7C_4:A8","CH_97E9_7C_4:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:SD1","text":"The system replaces the model of knowledge as light with a model of knowledge as darkened, stored, and harmfully dischargeable energy.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_4:A4","CH_97E9_7C_4:A5","CH_97E9_7C_4:A6","CH_97E9_7C_4:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:SD2","text":"Knowledge is oriented not toward communication, but toward instrumental efficacy and asymmetric disposal.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_4:A1","CH_97E9_7C_4:A3","CH_97E9_7C_4:A8","CH_97E9_7C_4:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:SD3","text":"Time functions as a condition of the production of force: delayed condensation legitimates the later intensity of the discharge.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_4:A4","CH_97E9_7C_4:A5","CH_97E9_7C_4:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:SD4","text":"The present is constituted as an epistemically unreceptive or to-be-overwhelmed instance, in relation to which wisdom gains efficacy only as excess.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_4:A7","CH_97E9_7C_4:A8","CH_97E9_7C_4:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:DNX1","text":"The system excludes the possibility that knowledge receives its value primarily through harmlessness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:DNX2","text":"It excludes the possibility that truth is constituted through transparent derivation and conceptual availability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:DNX3","text":"It excludes the possibility that wisdom must necessarily appear in visible or comprehensible form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:DNX4","text":"It excludes the possibility that a contemporary audience is the natural recipient or standard of wisdom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:SNX1","text":"Absent is a model of knowledge in which wisdom is conveyed without power differential, harm, or overwhelming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:SNX2","text":"Blocked is the possibility that the present and wisdom may come together in a shared visibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:SNX3","text":"The system organizes itself around the impossibility of illuminating the other while at the same time leaving the other in its previous visibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:FGS1","text":"Insufficient harmlessness → rejection of mere non-harm as the goal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:FGS2","text":"Rejection of external derivation → conversion of lightning into self-legislating efficacy working for the speaker.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:FGS3","text":"Temporal accumulation → silence and darkness → condensation of wisdom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:FGS4","text":"Condensation → lightning as eruptive actualization of latent wisdom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:FGS5","text":"Diagnosis of the present → exclusion of illumination → dazzling and deprivation of sight as strategic final effect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:AF1","text":"Insufficient non-harm → functional redefinition of lightning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:AF2","text":"Refusal of derivation → self-legislating working force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:AF3","text":"Slow accumulation → silent and dark wisdom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:AF4","text":"Condensed wisdom → erupting lightning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:AF5","text":"People of the present → exclusion of light → dazzling and blindness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:ME1","text":"Light is remapped from a positive medium of knowledge into a rejected mode of effect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:ME2","text":"Darkness is reclassified from mere deficiency into a productive form of latency of wisdom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:ME3","text":"Lightning is reassigned from a natural event to the instrumental activity of a personified wisdom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:ME4","text":"The audience is remapped from a possible recipient into a body of resistance to the effect of knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:ME5","text":"Knowing and harming are conceived not as opposites, but as interrelated stages of effect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:ALT1","text":"Surface — The speaker rejects harmless effect and illuminating address and demands a dazzling lightning effect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:ALT2","text":"Structural — Wisdom is organized as temporally accumulated, darkened energy that actualizes itself in a discharge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The speaker shifts the task from mediation and instruction to the instrumental overwhelming of an interlocutor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Force does not arise as a finished presence, but through long condensation, whose truth shows itself only in the discharge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from the rejection of non-harm to the dazzling lightning effect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:MRT2","text":"The temporal function of accumulation and the operative function of darkness remain dependent on the image-logic of cloud and lightning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:MRT3","text":"The system is internally coherent provided that dazzling counts as intended efficacy and not as the failure of enlightenment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:MRT4","text":"Its strongest connection lies in the chain condensation → lightning → dazzling.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:MRT5","text":"A tension remains between the claim of self-legislating non-derivability and the functional subordination of lightning to the speaker.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_4:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement so long as wisdom is treated not as content, but as a latently growing force that ultimately becomes efficacious in a harmful manner.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_7C_4@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_7C_4:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On the Higher Man","source_section_label":"7.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Four and Last"],"reading_title":"On the Higher Man · 7","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","On the Higher Man","7."],"original_title":"7."}],"source_title_context":"Vom höheren Menschen","source_section_label":"7.","source_title_hierarchy":["Vierter und letzter Theil"],"reading_title":"On the Higher Man · 7","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","On the Higher Man","7."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 146","title":"On the Higher Man · 7","context":"Part Four and Last","original_context":"Vierter und letzter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Vom höheren Menschen · 7"},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5","layer":"CH","title":"On the Higher Man · 8","order":147,"parents":["RAW_97E9_8C_5"],"revision":"CH_97E9_8C_5@R001","sha256":"b0afe415a794c16496f52ed3c45a1186ba6d2096a8f6ddae5c3edd060104584a","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:AS1","text":"Der Text bearbeitet die Diskrepanz zwischen gewollter Größe und tatsächlichem Vermögen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:AS2","text":"Er bestimmt das Wollen über das eigene Vermögen hinaus als Ursprung einer verhängnisvollen Falschheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:AS3","text":"Diese Falschheit wird als Darstellung, Selbsttäuschung und moralische Bemäntelung sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:AS4","text":"Die demonstrative Berufung auf große Dinge erzeugt Misstrauen gegenüber dem Großen selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:AS5","text":"Als Gegenprinzip wird Redlichkeit gegen falsche Tugend, starke Worte und glänzende Werke gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:AS6","text":"Die abschließende Gegenüberstellung von höheren Menschen und Pöbel verlagert die Wahrheitsfrage in eine Rangordnung der Urteilskraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:A1","text":"Das Wollen kann über das tatsächliche Vermögen eines Menschen hinausgehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:A2","text":"Ein Wollen über das eigene Vermögen erzeugt Falschheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:A3","text":"Der Anspruch auf große Dinge ist besonders anfällig für diese Falschheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:A4","text":"Falschheit kann durch starke Worte, öffentliche Tugenden und glänzende Werke verdeckt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:A5","text":"Verdeckte Falschheit schlägt in Selbsttäuschung um.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:A6","text":"Die Darstellung nicht eingelöster Größe erzeugt Misstrauen gegenüber großen Dingen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:A7","text":"Redlichkeit besitzt höheren Wert als rhetorische oder öffentliche Größe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:A8","text":"Der Pöbel verfügt nicht über eine verlässliche Unterscheidung von Größe, Kleinheit, Geradheit und Redlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:A9","text":"Die Unfähigkeit des Pöbels zur Geradheit erscheint als zugleich unschuldig und lügnerisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:NX1","text":"Größe darf nicht durch ein Wollen beansprucht werden, das über das Vermögen hinausgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:NX2","text":"Große Dinge dürfen nicht durch bloße Selbstdarstellung beglaubigt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:NX3","text":"Starke Worte gelten nicht als Beweis innerer Größe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:NX4","text":"Öffentliche Tugenden gelten nicht als Beweis von Redlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:NX5","text":"Glänzende Werke schließen Falschheit nicht aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:NX6","text":"Das Urteil des Pöbels ist kein gültiger Maßstab für Größe oder Redlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:D1","text":"Wer über sein Vermögen hinaus will, muss seine Unzulänglichkeit durch Darstellung kompensieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_5:A1","CH_97E9_8C_5:A2","CH_97E9_8C_5:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:D2","text":"Je größer der Anspruch, desto stärker wird die Gefahr, dass die Darstellung den Mangel verdeckt.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_5:A3","CH_97E9_8C_5:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:D3","text":"Die Verdeckung der Falschheit verhindert nicht ihre Wirkung, sondern führt zur Selbstverfälschung.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_5:A4","CH_97E9_8C_5:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:D4","text":"Der äußere Schein großer Leistung kann die Anerkennung des Großen insgesamt beschädigen.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_5:A3","CH_97E9_8C_5:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:D5","text":"Redlichkeit wird als Fähigkeit bestimmt, Anspruch und Vermögen nicht auseinanderfallen zu lassen.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_5:A1","CH_97E9_8C_5:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:D6","text":"Eine Menge, die Größe und Geradheit nicht unterscheiden kann, reproduziert Falschheit ohne notwendige bewusste Absicht.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_5:A8","CH_97E9_8C_5:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:SD1","text":"Das System verwandelt die Frage nach Größe in eine Prüfung der Übereinstimmung von Vermögen, Wollen und Erscheinung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:SD2","text":"Öffentliche Sichtbarkeit wird ambivalent: Sie kann Größe anzeigen, dient aber ebenso als Medium ihrer Fälschung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:SD3","text":"Die soziale Zirkulation großer Ansprüche erzeugt einen allgemeinen Vertrauensverlust gegenüber dem Großen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:SD4","text":"Redlichkeit fungiert als negative Selektionsregel, die Ansprüche ausscheidet, deren Darstellung ihr Vermögen übersteigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:SD5","text":"Die Unterscheidung zwischen höheren Menschen und Pöbel wird über unterschiedliche Fähigkeiten zur Wert- und Wahrheitsunterscheidung erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass Größe primär durch Absicht, Anspruch oder öffentliche Anerkennung konstituiert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:DNX2","text":"Es schließt aus, dass sichtbare Tugend mit innerer Redlichkeit identisch ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:DNX3","text":"Es schließt aus, dass Selbsttäuschung erst durch bewusste Täuschungsabsicht entsteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:DNX4","text":"Es schließt aus, dass die Masse durch bloße Teilnahme an öffentlichen Wertungen ein gültiges Urteil über Größe gewinnt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:DNX5","text":"Es schließt aus, dass gelungene Werke den Mangel an entsprechendem Vermögen rückwirkend aufheben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:SNX1","text":"Unzugänglich bleibt eine Größe, die sich vollständig von Darstellung, Rangbehauptung und sozialer Beglaubigung lösen ließe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:SNX2","text":"Versperrt bleibt ein gemeinsamer Maßstab, an dem Pöbel und höhere Menschen dieselben Werte auf gleiche Weise erkennen könnten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:SNX3","text":"Abwesend ist eine Form öffentlicher Sichtbarkeit, die nicht zugleich den Verdacht der Fälschung hervorruft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:SNX4","text":"Das System behandelt die unmittelbare Einheit von innerem Vermögen, äußerem Werk und fremder Anerkennung als nicht verfügbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:FGS1","text":"Vermögen < Wollen → Anspruchsüberschreitung → Falschheit.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_5:A1","CH_97E9_8C_5:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:FGS2","text":"Falschheit → rhetorische und moralische Bemäntelung → Selbsttäuschung.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_5:A4","CH_97E9_8C_5:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:FGS3","text":"Bemäntelter Großanspruch → öffentliche Wahrnehmung als Schauspiel → Misstrauen gegenüber dem Großen.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_5:A3","CH_97E9_8C_5:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:FGS4","text":"Misstrauen gegenüber äußerer Größe → Vorrang der Redlichkeit als Gegenmaßstab.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_5:A6","CH_97E9_8C_5:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:FGS5","text":"Fehlende Unterscheidungskraft → unschuldige Krummheit → dauerhafte Lüge des Pöbels.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_5:A8","CH_97E9_8C_5:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:AF1","text":"Übersteigertes Wollen → Falschheit → Bemäntelung → Selbstverfälschung → Misstrauen gegenüber großer Größe → Vorrang der Redlichkeit → Ausschluss des pöbelhaften Maßstabs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:ME1","text":"Größe wird von einem Ziel oder Anspruch in ein Verhältnis zwischen Vermögen und Wollen umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:ME2","text":"Moralische Tugend wird von öffentlicher Sichtbarkeit auf Redlichkeit als Nicht-Überschreitung des eigenen Vermögens verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:ME3","text":"Glänzende Werke, starke Worte und Tugendaushänge werden von Beweisen zu möglichen Tarnformen umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:ME4","text":"Das Problem der Lüge wird von bewusster Täuschung auf strukturelle Selbstverfälschung erweitert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:ME5","text":"Die soziale Menge wird nicht als neutraler Resonanzraum, sondern als Produzentin und Verstärkerin falscher Wertungen kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:ALT1","text":"Surface: Ein Mensch soll nichts über sein Vermögen hinaus wollen; falsche Größe soll misstrauisch machen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:ALT2","text":"Structural: Die Differenz zwischen Vermögen, Anspruch, Darstellung und Urteil erzeugt Falschheit und Vertrauensverlust.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Die Warnung richtet sich an diejenigen, die als „höhere Menschen“ eine eigene Praxis der Vorsicht und Unterscheidung bilden sollen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Redlichkeit erscheint als seltene Gegenwartstugend, während der Pöbel in einer dauerhaft „krummen“ Wahrnehmungs- und Sprachordnung verbleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von Anspruchsüberschreitung zu Falschheit und Misstrauen zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, worin das konkrete Vermögen besteht und wie Größe unabhängig von sozialer Wahrnehmung erkannt werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Redlichkeit als Übereinstimmung von Vermögen und Wollen verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung besteht zwischen übersteigertem Wollen, kompensatorischer Darstellung und Selbsttäuschung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:MRT5","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen der Warnung vor äußerer Beglaubigung und der eigenen rangbildenden Anrufung der „höheren Menschen“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung liegt darin, dass der Pöbel als unschuldig und zugleich als immer lügend bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung des Textes, sofern die abschließende Rangordnung als Konsequenz der epistemischen Unterscheidungskraft gelesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T192627781793Z_64c29f8a","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"8.","source_sha256":"b0afe415a794c16496f52ed3c45a1186ba6d2096a8f6ddae5c3edd060104584a","sha256":"406f017c60f3f25de00eefb93fb3e05634ffbb42bda4aa6d3f1c124548d99e94","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:26:27.783008+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:AS1","text":"The text addresses the discrepancy between desired greatness and actual capacity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:AS2","text":"It determines willing beyond one's own capacity as the origin of a fateful falsity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:AS3","text":"This falsity becomes visible as presentation, self-deception, and moral cloaking.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:AS4","text":"The demonstrative invocation of great things produces mistrust toward greatness itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:AS5","text":"As a counter-principle, probity is set against false virtue, strong words, and splendid works.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:AS6","text":"The concluding contrast between higher human beings and the rabble shifts the question of truth into a hierarchy of judgment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:A1","text":"Willing can extend beyond a person's actual capacity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:A2","text":"A willing beyond one's own capacity produces falsity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:A3","text":"The claim to great things is especially susceptible to this falsity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:A4","text":"Falsity can be concealed by strong words, public virtues, and splendid works.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:A5","text":"Concealed falsity turns into self-deception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:A6","text":"The presentation of unrealized greatness produces mistrust toward great things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:A7","text":"Probity has greater value than rhetorical or public greatness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:A8","text":"The rabble does not possess a reliable distinction between greatness, smallness, straightness, and probity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:A9","text":"The rabble's incapacity for straightness appears as at once innocent and lying.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:NX1","text":"Greatness must not be claimed through a willing that exceeds capacity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:NX2","text":"Great things must not be authenticated by mere self-presentation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:NX3","text":"Strong words do not count as proof of inner greatness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:NX4","text":"Public virtues do not count as proof of probity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:NX5","text":"Splendid works do not exclude falsity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:NX6","text":"The judgment of the rabble is not a valid standard for greatness or probity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:D1","text":"Whoever wills beyond their capacity must compensate for their inadequacy through presentation.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_5:A1","CH_97E9_8C_5:A2","CH_97E9_8C_5:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:D2","text":"The greater the claim, the greater the danger that presentation conceals the deficiency.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_5:A3","CH_97E9_8C_5:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:D3","text":"The concealment of falsity does not prevent its effect, but leads to self-falsification.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_5:A4","CH_97E9_8C_5:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:D4","text":"The outward appearance of great achievement can damage the recognition of greatness as such.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_5:A3","CH_97E9_8C_5:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:D5","text":"Probity is determined as the capacity not to let claim and capacity diverge.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_5:A1","CH_97E9_8C_5:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:D6","text":"A multitude that cannot distinguish greatness and straightness reproduces falsity without necessarily conscious intention.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_5:A8","CH_97E9_8C_5:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:SD1","text":"The system transforms the question of greatness into an examination of the correspondence of capacity, willing, and appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:SD2","text":"Public visibility becomes ambivalent: it can indicate greatness, but equally serves as a medium of its falsification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:SD3","text":"The social circulation of great claims produces a general loss of trust in greatness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:SD4","text":"Probity functions as a negative rule of selection that eliminates claims whose presentation exceeds their capacity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:SD5","text":"The distinction between higher human beings and the rabble is produced through differing capacities for distinguishing value and truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:DNX1","text":"The system excludes that greatness is constituted primarily by intention, claim, or public recognition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:DNX2","text":"It excludes that visible virtue is identical with inner probity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:DNX3","text":"It excludes that self-deception arises only through a conscious intention to deceive.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:DNX4","text":"It excludes that the masses gain a valid judgment of greatness through mere participation in public valuations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:DNX5","text":"It excludes that successful works retroactively annul the lack of corresponding capacity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:SNX1","text":"Inaccessible remains a greatness that could detach itself completely from presentation, assertions of rank, and social authentication.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:SNX2","text":"Blocked remains a common standard by which the rabble and higher human beings could recognize the same values in the same way.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:SNX3","text":"Absent is a form of public visibility that does not at the same time arouse the suspicion of falsification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:SNX4","text":"The system treats the immediate unity of inner capacity, outer work, and others' recognition as unavailable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:FGS1","text":"Capacity < willing → exceeding of claim → falsity.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_5:A1","CH_97E9_8C_5:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:FGS2","text":"Falsity → rhetorical and moral cloaking → self-deception.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_5:A4","CH_97E9_8C_5:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:FGS3","text":"Cloaked grand claim → public perception as spectacle → mistrust toward greatness.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_5:A3","CH_97E9_8C_5:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:FGS4","text":"Mistrust toward outward greatness → priority of probity as counter-standard.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_5:A6","CH_97E9_8C_5:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:FGS5","text":"Lack of discriminative capacity → innocent crookedness → enduring lie of the rabble.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_5:A8","CH_97E9_8C_5:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:AF1","text":"Excessive willing → falsity → cloaking → self-falsification → mistrust toward great greatness → priority of probity → exclusion of the rabble's standard.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:ME1","text":"Greatness is remapped from a goal or claim into a relation between capacity and willing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:ME2","text":"Moral virtue is shifted from public visibility to probity as non-exceeding of one's own capacity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:ME3","text":"Splendid works, strong words, and displays of virtue are reclassified from proofs into possible forms of camouflage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:ME4","text":"The problem of lying is expanded from conscious deception to structural self-falsification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:ME5","text":"The social multitude is mapped not as a neutral space of resonance, but as a producer and amplifier of false valuations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:ALT1","text":"Surface: A person should will nothing beyond their capacity; false greatness should make one mistrustful.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:ALT2","text":"Structural: The difference between capacity, claim, presentation, and judgment produces falsity and loss of trust.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: The warning is directed at those who, as “higher human beings,” are to form a practice of caution and discrimination of their own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Probity appears as a rare present virtue, while the rabble remains in a permanently “crooked” order of perception and language.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from exceeding the claim to falsity and mistrust.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is wherein concrete capacity consists and how greatness can be recognized independently of social perception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as probity is understood as correspondence between capacity and willing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:MRT4","text":"The strongest connection exists between excessive willing, compensatory presentation, and self-deception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:MRT5","text":"A tension remains between the warning against outward authentication and the text's own rank-forming invocation of the “higher human beings.”","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:MRT6","text":"A further tension lies in the fact that the rabble is determined as innocent and at the same time as always lying.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_5:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the text insofar as the concluding hierarchy is read as a consequence of epistemic discriminative capacity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_8C_5@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_8C_5:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On the Higher Man","source_section_label":"8.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Four and Last"],"reading_title":"On the Higher Man · 8","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","On the Higher Man","8."],"original_title":"8."}],"source_title_context":"Vom höheren Menschen","source_section_label":"8.","source_title_hierarchy":["Vierter und letzter Theil"],"reading_title":"On the Higher Man · 8","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","On the Higher Man","8."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 147","title":"On the Higher Man · 8","context":"Part Four and Last","original_context":"Vierter und letzter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Vom höheren Menschen · 8"},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6","layer":"CH","title":"On the Higher Man · 8","order":148,"parents":["RAW_97E9_8C_6"],"revision":"CH_97E9_8C_6@R001","sha256":"49b619d27c653ef193e50c28547ee658b71984e0a0c5b5e7d24f2446926b8a45","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:AS1","text":"Das zentrale Problem ist die Unterscheidung zwischen öffentlicher Überzeugung, begründeter Erkenntnis und wahrheitsfähigem Irrtum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:AS2","text":"Der Text bestimmt das gegenwärtige Zeitalter als Herrschaft des Pöbels, in dem Gründe nicht überzeugen, sondern Misstrauen erzeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:AS3","text":"Er verschiebt die Prüfung der Wahrheit von ihrem Sieg auf die Stärke des Irrtums, der für sie gekämpft hat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:AS4","text":"Er unterstellt den Gelehrten eine sterile, entlebendigende Erkenntnishaltung und trennt Wahrheitsliebe von bloßer Wahrhaftigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:AS5","text":"Die Bewegung führt von öffentlicher Überzeugung durch Misstrauen gegenüber Gründen und Gelehrsamkeit zu einer agonalen, nicht-neutralen Bestimmung von Wahrheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:A1","text":"Das Heute ist durch die Herrschaft des Pöbels bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:A2","text":"Überzeugungen, die der Pöbel ohne Gründe angenommen hat, lassen sich nicht durch Gründe umwerfen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:A3","text":"Auf dem Markt überzeugen Gebärden stärker als Gründe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:A4","text":"Gründe erzeugen beim Pöbel Misstrauen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:A5","text":"Der Sieg einer Wahrheit kann durch einen starken Irrtum ermöglicht werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:A6","text":"Gelehrte stehen den höheren Menschen feindlich gegenüber.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:A7","text":"Gelehrsamkeit kann mit Unfruchtbarkeit, Kälte und einer entlebendigenden Betrachtungsweise verbunden sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:A8","text":"Die Unfähigkeit zu lügen ist nicht identisch mit Liebe zur Wahrheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:A9","text":"Freiheit von Fieber ist nicht identisch mit Erkenntnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:A10","text":"Wer nicht lügen kann, weiß deshalb nicht, was Wahrheit ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:NX1","text":"Wahrheit ist nicht durch ihren öffentlichen Sieg ausgewiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:NX2","text":"Gründe sind kein verlässliches Mittel zur Umstimmung des Pöbels.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:NX3","text":"Marktgängige Überzeugung beruht nicht primär auf rationaler Begründung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:NX4","text":"Wahrhaftigkeit besteht nicht schon in der Abwesenheit von Lüge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:NX5","text":"Erkenntnis besteht nicht schon in der Abwesenheit von Fieber oder Erregung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:NX6","text":"Gelehrsamkeit garantiert weder Fruchtbarkeit noch Wahrheitserkenntnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:D1","text":"Die öffentliche Durchsetzung einer Überzeugung ist epistemisch verdächtig, weil sie von nicht-rationalen Kräften getragen sein kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_6:A2","CH_97E9_8C_6:A3","CH_97E9_8C_6:A4","CH_97E9_8C_6:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:D2","text":"Die Stärke einer Überzeugung kann aus der Stärke des Irrtums stammen, der sie vermittelt.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_6:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:D3","text":"Die Geheimhaltung der Gründe wird als Schutz vor einer Öffentlichkeit erforderlich, deren Misstrauen durch Gründe aktiviert wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_6:A1","CH_97E9_8C_6:A2","CH_97E9_8C_6:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:D4","text":"Die Behauptung, nicht zu lügen, besitzt keinen hinreichenden Wahrheitswert.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_6:A8","CH_97E9_8C_6:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:D5","text":"Nüchternheit oder emotionale Abkühlung kann Erkenntnis verfehlen.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_6:A9","CH_97E9_8C_6:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:D6","text":"Der Gelehrte erscheint nicht als neutraler Wahrheitsverwalter, sondern als möglicher Produzent von Entlebendigung.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_6:A6","CH_97E9_8C_6:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:SD1","text":"Das System ersetzt die Gleichsetzung von Wahrheit und rationaler Begründbarkeit durch eine Prüfung der Kräfte, Affekte und Irrtümer, die eine Überzeugung durchsetzen.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_6:A2","CH_97E9_8C_6:A3","CH_97E9_8C_6:A4","CH_97E9_8C_6:A5","CH_97E9_8C_6:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:SD2","text":"Erkenntnis wird nicht als Zustand affektiver Neutralität, sondern als Fähigkeit zur Unterscheidung von Lüge, Wahrheit, Irrtum und bloßer Unempfindlichkeit bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_6:A5","CH_97E9_8C_6:A8","CH_97E9_8C_6:A9","CH_97E9_8C_6:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:SD3","text":"Die öffentliche Sphäre und die gelehrte Sphäre erscheinen als zwei verschiedene Formen epistemischer Entstellung: die eine durch Gebärde und Pöbelwirkung, die andere durch sterile Kälte.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_6:A1","CH_97E9_8C_6:A3","CH_97E9_8C_6:A6","CH_97E9_8C_6:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:SD4","text":"Wahrheit wird als agonale Errungenschaft konzipiert, deren Geltung durch den Kampf mit einem wirksamen Irrtum hindurch bestimmt wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_6:A5","CH_97E9_8C_6:A8","CH_97E9_8C_6:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt stillschweigend aus, dass Wahrheit durch argumentative Transparenz allein hergestellt oder bewahrt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:DNX2","text":"Es schließt aus, dass gesellschaftliche Zustimmung ein Indikator epistemischer Geltung ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:DNX3","text":"Es schließt aus, dass der Gegensatz zwischen Lüge und Wahrheit durch bloße Regelbefolgung erschöpft ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:DNX4","text":"Es schließt aus, dass Kühle, Sachlichkeit oder Gelehrsamkeit einen privilegierten Zugang zur Wahrheit sichern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:DNX5","text":"Es schließt aus, dass Erkenntnis ohne affektive, agonale oder produktive Beteiligung möglich ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:SNX1","text":"Die Abwesenheit eines neutralen Wahrheitsverfahrens strukturiert das gesamte Argument.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:SNX2","text":"Versperrt ist die Möglichkeit, Wahrheit zugleich öffentlich wirksam, rational transparent und von Irrtum unabhängig zu denken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:SNX3","text":"Unzulässig wird eine Erkenntnisordnung, in der weder Pöbelwirkung noch Gelehrtenkälte die Wahrheit deformieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:SNX4","text":"Der Text organisiert sich um die Abwesenheit eines positiven Kriteriums, das Wahrheit unabhängig von ihren Kämpfen, Trägern und Affekten garantieren könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:FGS1","text":"Pöbelherrschaft → grundlose Überzeugung → Unwirksamkeit von Gründen → Vorrang der Gebärde → Erzeugung öffentlichen Misstrauens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:FGS2","text":"Öffentlicher Wahrheits­sieg → Rückfrage nach dem kämpfenden Irrtum → Entkopplung von Erfolg und Wahrheit → genealogische Prüfung der Geltung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:FGS3","text":"Gelehrsamkeit → Sterilität und Entlebendigung → Zurückweisung bloßer Wahrhaftigkeit → Unterscheidung von Nicht-Lügen und Wahrheitserkenntnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:FGS4","text":"Abwesenheit von Fieber → bloße Abkühlung → keine Erkenntnisgarantie → Forderung nach einer nicht-neutralistischen Wahrheitsfähigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:FGS5","text":"Nicht-rationale Durchsetzung + sterile Rationalisierung → Ausschluss eines neutralen Erkenntnismodells → Wahrheit als umkämpfte, affektiv vermittelte Unterscheidung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:AF1","text":"Pöbelherrschaft → Unwirksamkeit von Gründen → Vorrang von Gebärden → Misstrauen gegenüber öffentlicher Überzeugung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:AF2","text":"Sieg der Wahrheit → Verdacht auf den kämpfenden Irrtum → Entkopplung von Erfolg und Geltung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:AF3","text":"Gelehrtenkälte → Kritik der bloßen Wahrhaftigkeit → Kritik der bloßen Nüchternheit → nicht-neutralistische Erkenntnisforderung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:ME1","text":"Der Gegenstand der Wahrheitsprüfung verschiebt sich von der siegreichen Aussage auf die Kräfte, die ihren Sieg ermöglicht haben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:ME2","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Wahrheit und Lüge wird durch die zusätzliche Unterscheidung zwischen Nicht-Lügen, Wahrheitsliebe und Wahrheitserkenntnis aufgespalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:ME3","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Erregung und Vernunft wird als falsche Alternative reorganisiert, weil sowohl Fieber als auch Kälte Erkenntnis verfehlen können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:ME4","text":"Pöbel und Gelehrte werden nicht als bloße soziale Gegensätze, sondern als komplementäre Fehlformen des Verhältnisses zur Wahrheit kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:ME5","text":"Öffentliche Überzeugung wird von epistemischer Geltung getrennt und als Effekt von Gebärde, Irrtum und Kampf klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Text fordert Misstrauen gegenüber Pöbel, Gründen, Gelehrten, Wahrhaftigkeit und Kälte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:ALT2","text":"Structural — Überzeugung wird durch soziale Formen der Durchsetzung, affektive Reaktionen und institutionelle Erkenntnishaltungen organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der höhere Mensch soll Gründe verbergen, Siege misstrauisch prüfen und sich weder dem Markt noch den Gelehrten als Wahrheitsinstanzen unterwerfen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Wahrheit erscheint als nicht-neutraler Vorgang, der sich zeitlich durch den Kampf mit Irrtum und nicht durch einen statischen Zustand der Nüchternheit konstituiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von Pöbelherrschaft über Wahrheitsmisstrauen bis zur Kritik der Gelehrsamkeit zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, worin die positive Fähigkeit zur Wahrheit jenseits von Lüge, Kälte und Gebärde besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Wahrheit nicht mit öffentlichem Erfolg, Begründung, Wahrhaftigkeit oder Nüchternheit gleichgesetzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Stelle liegt in der systematischen Trennung von Wahrheitsgeltung und ihren sozialen oder psychologischen Durchsetzungsbedingungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:MRT5","text":"Eine Spannung entsteht daraus, dass der Text Gründe verwirft, während er selbst begriffliche Unterscheidungen als normative Zurückweisung einsetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung entsteht daraus, dass die Wahrheit durch Kampf und Irrtum bestimmt wird, ohne ein unabhängiges Kriterium ihrer Unterscheidung bereitzustellen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung des Textes, muss jedoch seine positive Erkenntnistheorie als offen oder nur negativ bestimmt behandeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T192647709538Z_84ba76e6","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"8.","source_sha256":"49b619d27c653ef193e50c28547ee658b71984e0a0c5b5e7d24f2446926b8a45","sha256":"de51c1ef7ac7bc859c2440451f83cf33b00d5906dc502414b349b072c5037164","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:26:47.712151+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:AS1","text":"The central problem is the distinction between public conviction, justified knowledge, and truth-capable error.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:AS2","text":"The text characterizes the present age as the rule of the mob, in which reasons do not convince but generate distrust.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:AS3","text":"It shifts the examination of truth from its victory to the strength of the error that fought for it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:AS4","text":"It imputes to the scholar a sterile, life-denying attitude toward knowledge and separates love of truth from mere truthfulness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:AS5","text":"The movement proceeds from public conviction, through distrust of reasons and scholarship, to an agonistic, non-neutral determination of truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:A1","text":"The present is determined by the rule of the mob.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:A2","text":"Convictions that the mob has adopted without reasons cannot be overturned by reasons.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:A3","text":"In the marketplace, gestures convince more strongly than reasons.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:A4","text":"Reasons generate distrust in the mob.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:A5","text":"The victory of a truth can be made possible by a strong error.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:A6","text":"Scholars stand hostile toward higher human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:A7","text":"Scholarship can be associated with sterility, coldness, and a life-denying mode of contemplation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:A8","text":"The inability to lie is not identical with love of truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:A9","text":"Freedom from fever is not identical with knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:A10","text":"Whoever cannot lie therefore does not know what truth is.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:NX1","text":"Truth is not attested by its public victory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:NX2","text":"Reasons are not a reliable means of changing the mob's mind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:NX3","text":"Marketable conviction does not rest primarily on rational justification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:NX4","text":"Truthfulness does not consist merely in the absence of lying.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:NX5","text":"Knowledge does not consist merely in the absence of fever or excitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:NX6","text":"Scholarship guarantees neither fruitfulness nor knowledge of truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:D1","text":"The public ascendancy of a conviction is epistemically suspect because it can be borne by non-rational forces.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_6:A2","CH_97E9_8C_6:A3","CH_97E9_8C_6:A4","CH_97E9_8C_6:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:D2","text":"The strength of a conviction can stem from the strength of the error that conveys it.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_6:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:D3","text":"The concealment of reasons becomes necessary as protection against a public whose distrust is activated by reasons.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_6:A1","CH_97E9_8C_6:A2","CH_97E9_8C_6:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:D4","text":"The assertion that one does not lie possesses no sufficient truth-value.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_6:A8","CH_97E9_8C_6:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:D5","text":"Sobriety or emotional cooling can fail to attain knowledge.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_6:A9","CH_97E9_8C_6:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:D6","text":"The scholar appears not as a neutral administrator of truth, but as a possible producer of life-denial.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_6:A6","CH_97E9_8C_6:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:SD1","text":"The system replaces the equation of truth with rational justifiability by an examination of the forces, affects, and errors that establish a conviction.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_6:A2","CH_97E9_8C_6:A3","CH_97E9_8C_6:A4","CH_97E9_8C_6:A5","CH_97E9_8C_6:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:SD2","text":"Knowledge is determined not as a state of affective neutrality, but as the capacity to distinguish lying, truth, error, and mere insensitivity.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_6:A5","CH_97E9_8C_6:A8","CH_97E9_8C_6:A9","CH_97E9_8C_6:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:SD3","text":"The public sphere and the scholarly sphere appear as two different forms of epistemic distortion: the one through gesture and mob-effect, the other through sterile coldness.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_6:A1","CH_97E9_8C_6:A3","CH_97E9_8C_6:A6","CH_97E9_8C_6:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:SD4","text":"Truth is conceived as an agonistic achievement whose validity is determined through the struggle with an effective error.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_6:A5","CH_97E9_8C_6:A8","CH_97E9_8C_6:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:DNX1","text":"The system tacitly excludes the possibility that truth is produced or preserved by argumentative transparency alone.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:DNX2","text":"It excludes the possibility that social assent is an indicator of epistemic validity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:DNX3","text":"It excludes the possibility that the opposition between lying and truth is exhausted by mere rule-following.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:DNX4","text":"It excludes the possibility that coolness, objectivity, or scholarship secure a privileged access to truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:DNX5","text":"It excludes the possibility that knowledge is possible without affective, agonistic, or productive involvement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:SNX1","text":"The absence of a neutral procedure of truth structures the entire argument.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:SNX2","text":"Foreclosed is the possibility of conceiving truth as at once publicly effective, rationally transparent, and independent of error.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:SNX3","text":"An order of knowledge in which neither mob-effect nor scholarly coldness deforms truth becomes inadmissible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:SNX4","text":"The text is organized around the absence of a positive criterion that could guarantee truth independently of its struggles, bearers, and affects.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:FGS1","text":"Rule of the mob → groundless conviction → ineffectiveness of reasons → primacy of gesture → production of public distrust.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:FGS2","text":"Public victory of truth → inquiry into the error that fought → decoupling of success and truth → genealogical examination of validity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:FGS3","text":"Scholarship → sterility and life-denial → rejection of mere truthfulness → distinction between not lying and knowledge of truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:FGS4","text":"Absence of fever → mere cooling → no guarantee of knowledge → demand for a non-neutralist capacity for truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:FGS5","text":"Non-rational establishment + sterile rationalization → exclusion of a neutral model of knowledge → truth as a contested, affectively mediated distinction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:AF1","text":"Rule of the mob → ineffectiveness of reasons → primacy of gestures → distrust of public conviction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:AF2","text":"Victory of truth → suspicion of the error that fought → decoupling of success and validity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:AF3","text":"Scholarly coldness → critique of mere truthfulness → critique of mere sobriety → non-neutralist demand for knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:ME1","text":"The object of the examination of truth shifts from the victorious statement to the forces that made its victory possible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:ME2","text":"The opposition between truth and lying is split by the additional distinction between not lying, love of truth, and knowledge of truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:ME3","text":"The opposition between excitation and reason is reorganized as a false alternative, because both fever and coldness can fail to attain knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:ME4","text":"The mob and scholars are mapped not as mere social opposites, but as complementary erroneous forms of the relation to truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:ME5","text":"Public conviction is separated from epistemic validity and classified as an effect of gesture, error, and struggle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:ALT1","text":"Surface — The text demands distrust toward the mob, reasons, scholars, truthfulness, and coldness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:ALT2","text":"Structural — Conviction is organized through social forms of establishment, affective reactions, and institutional attitudes toward knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The higher human being should conceal reasons, examine victories distrustfully, and submit neither to the marketplace nor to scholars as authorities of truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Truth appears as a non-neutral process that constitutes itself temporally through struggle with error rather than through a static state of sobriety.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from the rule of the mob through distrust of truth to the critique of scholarship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is what the positive capacity for truth consists in beyond lying, coldness, and gesture.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as truth is not equated with public success, justification, truthfulness, or sobriety.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:MRT4","text":"The strongest point lies in the systematic separation of truth-validity from its social or psychological conditions of establishment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:MRT5","text":"A tension arises from the fact that the text rejects reasons while itself deploying conceptual distinctions as normative rejection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:MRT6","text":"A further tension arises from the fact that truth is determined through struggle and error without providing an independent criterion for distinguishing it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_6:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the text's actual movement, but must treat its positive epistemology as open or determined only negatively.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_6:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_8C_6@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_8C_6:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On the Higher Man","source_section_label":"8.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Four and Last"],"reading_title":"On the Higher Man · 8","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","On the Higher Man","8."],"original_title":"8."}],"source_title_context":"Vom höheren Menschen","source_section_label":"8.","source_title_hierarchy":["Vierter und letzter Theil"],"reading_title":"On the Higher Man · 8","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","On the Higher Man","8."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 148","title":"On the Higher Man · 8","context":"Part Four and Last","original_context":"Vierter und letzter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Vom höheren Menschen · 8"},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3","layer":"CH","title":"On the Higher Man · 10","order":149,"parents":["RAW_97E9_10_3"],"revision":"CH_97E9_10_3@R001","sha256":"bb3ed879cbda6d81d7e0ac5b7763e214fe25745a814e625f4750d4493de90769","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:AS1","text":"Das zentrale Problem ist der Aufstieg ohne eigene Tragfähigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:AS2","text":"Der Text bestimmt Höhe nicht durch Fortbewegung, sondern durch die Fähigkeit, sich selbst zu tragen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:AS3","text":"Fremde Träger ermöglichen beschleunigten Aufstieg, bewahren jedoch die eigene Schwäche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:AS4","text":"Der Beweis der Unzulänglichkeit erfolgt beim Verlassen des Trägers am erreichten Ziel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:AS5","text":"Die Argumentbewegung verläuft von fremder Erhebung über verdeckte Schwäche zur Entlarvung durch den Abstiegs- beziehungsweise Standmoment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:A1","text":"Eigenständige Höhe setzt eigene Beine voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:A2","text":"Fremde Träger können einen Menschen emporheben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:A3","text":"Fremdes Tragen ersetzt nicht die eigene Geh- oder Standfähigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:A4","text":"Beschleunigter Aufstieg kann mit fortbestehender eigener Schwäche vereinbar sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:A5","text":"Das erreichte Ziel kann die Abhängigkeit vom Träger verdecken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:A6","text":"Beim Abspringen vom Träger wird die eigene Tragfähigkeit unmittelbar geprüft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:A7","text":"Fehlende eigene Tragfähigkeit erscheint als Stolpern auf der erreichten Höhe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:A8","text":"Höhe ist erst dann eigen, wenn sie ohne fremde Rücken oder Köpfe bestanden werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:NX1","text":"Höhe ist nicht bloß ein Emporgetragenwerden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:NX2","text":"Aufstieg auf fremden Rücken oder Köpfen ist keine eigene Leistung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:NX3","text":"Schnelle Bewegung zum Ziel beweist keine eigene Stärke.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:NX4","text":"Das Reiten beseitigt den lahmen Fuß nicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:NX5","text":"Das Erreichen des Ziels garantiert keinen sicheren Stand.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:NX6","text":"Die Bezeichnung als „höherer Mensch“ hebt die körperliche beziehungsweise existentielle Unfähigkeit nicht auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:D1","text":"Fremde Unterstützung erzeugt äußeren Aufstieg, aber keine innere Selbstständigkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_10_3:A1","CH_97E9_10_3:A2","CH_97E9_10_3:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:D2","text":"Die Geschwindigkeit des Aufstiegs kann das Fortbestehen der Schwäche bis zum Ziel verschleiern.","refs":["CH_97E9_10_3:A3","CH_97E9_10_3:A4","CH_97E9_10_3:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:D3","text":"Der entscheidende Test der Höhe liegt nicht im Hinaufgelangen, sondern im selbstständigen Stehen danach.","refs":["CH_97E9_10_3:A5","CH_97E9_10_3:A6","CH_97E9_10_3:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:D4","text":"Die fremde Reitbewegung macht die eigene Lahmheit nicht sichtbar, sondern transportiert sie mit.","refs":["CH_97E9_10_3:A2","CH_97E9_10_3:A3","CH_97E9_10_3:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:SD1","text":"Ein äußerer Erfolg kann gerade deshalb die innere Unfähigkeit verdecken, weil er die notwendige Prüfung des eigenen Standes aufschiebt.","refs":["CH_97E9_10_3:A3","CH_97E9_10_3:A4","CH_97E9_10_3:A5","CH_97E9_10_3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:SD2","text":"Der Aufstieg fungiert als Erfassungsmechanismus: Er hebt die Abhängigkeit an, ohne sie aufzuheben.","refs":["CH_97E9_10_3:A2","CH_97E9_10_3:A3","CH_97E9_10_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:SD3","text":"Die erreichte Höhe kehrt sich gegen den Abhängigen, sobald der Träger als Bedingung des Erfolgs verlassen werden muss.","refs":["CH_97E9_10_3:A5","CH_97E9_10_3:A6","CH_97E9_10_3:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:SD4","text":"Fremde Vermittlung verwandelt den Erfolg in eine nachträgliche Prüfung der nicht erworbenen Eigenständigkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_10_3:A1","CH_97E9_10_3:A2","CH_97E9_10_3:A6","CH_97E9_10_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass ein erreichtes Ziel die Mittel seines Erreichens nachträglich legitimiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:DNX2","text":"Es schließt aus, dass äußere Mobilität als Beweis innerer Kraft gelten kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:DNX3","text":"Es schließt aus, dass Abhängigkeit durch bloße Erhöhung verschwindet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:DNX4","text":"Es schließt aus, dass eine fremde Trägerschaft in eigene Fähigkeit umschlägt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:DNX5","text":"Es schließt aus, dass die Schwäche erst dort entsteht, wo sie sichtbar wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:SNX1","text":"Unmöglich ist eine Höhe, die nicht in selbstständiges Stehen überführt werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Verfügbarkeit eines Erfolgs, dessen Trägerbedingung unsichtbar bleiben soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:SNX3","text":"Die versperrte Möglichkeit ist ein fremd ermöglichtes Oben ohne nachträgliche Entlarvung der eigenen Lahmheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:SNX4","text":"Der Text organisiert sich um die Abwesenheit eines garantiert tragfähigen Übergangs vom Getragenwerden zum Eigenstand.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:FGS1","text":"Eigenes Zielstreben + eigene Beine → mögliche selbstständige Höhe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:FGS2","text":"Fremder Rücken oder Kopf → beschleunigter Aufstieg bei fortbestehender eigener Schwäche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:FGS3","text":"Aufstieg mit Träger → Zielerreichung ohne Prüfung der Eigenständigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:FGS4","text":"Absprung vom Träger → unmittelbare Konfrontation mit der eigenen Tragfähigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:FGS5","text":"Fehlende Tragfähigkeit → Stolpern auf der erreichten Höhe → Rücknahme des Anspruchs auf eigene Höhe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:FGS6","text":"Der Träger ermöglicht die Bewegung, aber gerade sein Wegfall erzeugt die Wahrheit über den Aufsteiger.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:AF1","text":"Anspruch auf Höhe → Forderung eigener Beine → Ausschluss fremder Trägerschaft als Eigenleistung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:AF2","text":"Reiten → schnelle Zielbewegung → Mittransport des lahmen Fußes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:AF3","text":"Zielerreichung → Absprung vom Pferd → Prüfung des Eigenstands → Stolpern auf der Höhe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:AF4","text":"Äußere Erhebung → aufgeschobene Schwäche → Entlarvung durch Selbstständigkeitserfordernis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:ME1","text":"Aufstieg wird von der bloßen Ortsveränderung auf die Quelle der Tragfähigkeit umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:ME2","text":"Erfolg und Fähigkeit werden getrennt: Das Ziel kann erreicht sein, ohne dass Eigenständigkeit erworben wurde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:ME3","text":"Unterstützung wird in zwei Funktionen unterschieden: Sie kann Bewegung ermöglichen, aber keine eigene Standfähigkeit erzeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:ME4","text":"Der Zielpunkt wird vom Endbeweis zum Prüfpunkt der vorausgesetzten Eigenkraft umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:ME5","text":"Das Scheitern wird vom Aufstiegsmoment auf den Übergang vom getragenen zum eigenen Zustand verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:ALT1","text":"Surface — Empfohlen wird der Aufstieg mit eigenen Beinen; fremdes Tragen wird zurückgewiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:ALT2","text":"Structural — Ein Träger erzeugt Fortbewegung, während die eigene Schwäche unverändert fortbesteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Bewertung eines Aufstiegs wird vom Erreichen des Ziels auf die Bewährung nach dem Verlassen des Hilfsmittels verlagert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Eigenständigkeit ist keine nachträgliche Eigenschaft des erreichten Ortes, sondern eine vorher beziehungsweise im Übergang erwiesene Fähigkeit des Subjekts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von fremder Erhebung zu eigener Bewährungsprobe zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob jede Form fremder Hilfe ausgeschlossen oder nur stellvertretendes Tragen kritisiert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern „eigene Höhe“ als selbstständige Tragfähigkeit verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung liegt zwischen dem Mittransport der Lahmheit und ihrer Sichtbarwerdung beim Absprung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:MRT5","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen der kategorischen Zurückweisung fremder Träger und der bloß bedingten Zulassung des Reitens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, sofern das Stolpern nicht als zufälliger Unfall, sondern als strukturelle Folge der Abhängigkeit gelesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T184411303613Z_77b213fc","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"10.","source_sha256":"bb3ed879cbda6d81d7e0ac5b7763e214fe25745a814e625f4750d4493de90769","sha256":"c4676179278444860efbe468720fcea3505aa0de0928578285fef551bf48317f","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T18:44:11.306084+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:AS1","text":"The central problem is ascent without self-sustaining capacity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:AS2","text":"The text defines height not through locomotion, but through the capacity to sustain oneself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:AS3","text":"Other bearers enable accelerated ascent, yet preserve one's own weakness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:AS4","text":"The proof of inadequacy occurs upon leaving the bearer at the attained goal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:AS5","text":"The movement of the argument proceeds from elevation by others through concealed weakness to unmasking by the moment of descent or standing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:A1","text":"Independent height presupposes one's own legs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:A2","text":"Other bearers can lift a person up.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:A3","text":"Being borne by others does not replace one's own capacity to walk or stand.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:A4","text":"Accelerated ascent can be compatible with the persistence of one's own weakness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:A5","text":"The attained goal can conceal dependence on the bearer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:A6","text":"When jumping off the bearer, one's own capacity to sustain oneself is directly tested.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:A7","text":"The lack of one's own sustaining capacity appears as stumbling at the attained height.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:A8","text":"Height is one's own only when it can be maintained without the backs or heads of others.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:NX1","text":"Height is not merely being carried upward.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:NX2","text":"Ascent on the backs or heads of others is not one's own achievement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:NX3","text":"Rapid movement toward the goal proves no strength of one's own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:NX4","text":"Riding does not eliminate the lame foot.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:NX5","text":"Reaching the goal guarantees no secure footing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:NX6","text":"The designation as a “higher human being” does not annul bodily or existential incapacity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:D1","text":"Support from others produces external ascent, but no inner independence.","refs":["CH_97E9_10_3:A1","CH_97E9_10_3:A2","CH_97E9_10_3:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:D2","text":"The speed of ascent can conceal the persistence of weakness until the goal is reached.","refs":["CH_97E9_10_3:A3","CH_97E9_10_3:A4","CH_97E9_10_3:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:D3","text":"The decisive test of height lies not in getting up there, but in standing independently afterward.","refs":["CH_97E9_10_3:A5","CH_97E9_10_3:A6","CH_97E9_10_3:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:D4","text":"The movement of riding provided by another does not make one's own lameness visible, but transports it along.","refs":["CH_97E9_10_3:A2","CH_97E9_10_3:A3","CH_97E9_10_3:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:SD1","text":"An external success can conceal inner incapacity precisely because it postpones the necessary test of one's own footing.","refs":["CH_97E9_10_3:A3","CH_97E9_10_3:A4","CH_97E9_10_3:A5","CH_97E9_10_3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:SD2","text":"Ascent functions as a mechanism of capture: it elevates dependence without abolishing it.","refs":["CH_97E9_10_3:A2","CH_97E9_10_3:A3","CH_97E9_10_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:SD3","text":"The attained height turns against the dependent person as soon as the bearer, as a condition of success, must be left behind.","refs":["CH_97E9_10_3:A5","CH_97E9_10_3:A6","CH_97E9_10_3:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:SD4","text":"Mediation by others transforms success into a subsequent test of independence that has not been acquired.","refs":["CH_97E9_10_3:A1","CH_97E9_10_3:A2","CH_97E9_10_3:A6","CH_97E9_10_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:DNX1","text":"The system excludes the possibility that an attained goal retrospectively legitimates the means of attaining it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:DNX2","text":"It excludes the possibility that external mobility can count as proof of inner strength.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:DNX3","text":"It excludes the possibility that dependence disappears through mere elevation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:DNX4","text":"It excludes the possibility that being borne by another turns into one's own capacity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:DNX5","text":"It excludes the possibility that weakness arises only where it becomes visible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:SNX1","text":"Impossible is a height that cannot be converted into independent standing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:SNX2","text":"Excluded is the availability of a success whose condition of being borne is supposed to remain invisible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:SNX3","text":"The barred possibility is an externally enabled state of being above without the subsequent unmasking of one's own lameness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:SNX4","text":"The text is organized around the absence of a guaranteed self-sustaining transition from being borne to standing on one's own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:FGS1","text":"One's own striving toward the goal + one's own legs → possible independent height.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:FGS2","text":"Another's back or head → accelerated ascent with the persistence of one's own weakness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:FGS3","text":"Ascent with a bearer → attainment of the goal without a test of independence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:FGS4","text":"Jumping off the bearer → direct confrontation with one's own sustaining capacity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:FGS5","text":"Lack of sustaining capacity → stumbling at the attained height → withdrawal of the claim to one's own height.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:FGS6","text":"The bearer enables the movement, but it is precisely the bearer's absence that produces the truth about the one ascending.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:AF1","text":"Claim to height → demand for one's own legs → exclusion of being borne by others as one's own achievement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:AF2","text":"Riding → rapid movement toward the goal → transportation along of the lame foot.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:AF3","text":"Attainment of the goal → jumping off the horse → test of independent standing → stumbling at the height.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:AF4","text":"External elevation → deferred weakness → unmasking through the requirement of independence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:ME1","text":"Ascent is remapped from mere change of location to the source of sustaining capacity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:ME2","text":"Success and capacity are separated: the goal may have been attained without independence having been acquired.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:ME3","text":"Support is differentiated into two functions: it can enable movement, but cannot produce one's own capacity to stand.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:ME4","text":"The endpoint is reclassified from final proof to testing point of the presupposed strength of one's own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:ME5","text":"Failure is shifted from the moment of ascent to the transition from the borne state to one's own state.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:ALT1","text":"Surface — Ascent with one's own legs is recommended; being borne by others is rejected.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:ALT2","text":"Structural — A bearer produces locomotion while one's own weakness continues unchanged.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The evaluation of an ascent is shifted from reaching the goal to proving oneself after leaving the aid behind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Independence is not a retrospective property of the attained place, but a capacity of the subject demonstrated beforehand or in the transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from elevation by others to one's own test of proving oneself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether every form of help from others is excluded or only vicarious bearing is criticized.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent, provided that “one's own height” is understood as independent sustaining capacity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:MRT4","text":"The strongest connection lies between transporting lameness along and its becoming visible when jumping off.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:MRT5","text":"A tension remains between the categorical rejection of other bearers and the merely conditional allowance of riding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_3:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument, provided that stumbling is read not as an accidental mishap, but as a structural consequence of dependence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_10_3@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_10_3:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On the Higher Man","source_section_label":"10.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Four and Last"],"reading_title":"On the Higher Man · 10","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","On the Higher Man","10."],"original_title":"10."}],"source_title_context":"Vom höheren Menschen","source_section_label":"10.","source_title_hierarchy":["Vierter und letzter Theil"],"reading_title":"On the Higher Man · 10","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","On the Higher Man","10."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 149","title":"On the Higher Man · 10","context":"Part Four and Last","original_context":"Vierter und letzter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Vom höheren Menschen · 10"},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2","layer":"CH","title":"On the Higher Man · 11","order":150,"parents":["RAW_97E9_11_2"],"revision":"CH_97E9_11_2@R001","sha256":"e42642ce97368be6994ad5525ad3395d791427ae9ab1ce04f71703914352b314","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:AS1","text":"Der Text behandelt die Frage, worauf das Schaffen der „höheren Menschen“ tatsächlich ausgerichtet ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:AS2","text":"Er bestimmt schöpferische Tätigkeit neu als Hervorbringung des eigenen Kindes, Werks, Willens oder Werts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:AS3","text":"Die Berufung auf den Nächsten wird als fremde Rechtfertigung und als Moral der kleinen Gegenseitigkeit zurückgewiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:AS4","text":"Die eigennützige Orientierung des Schaffenden wird nicht als Mangel, sondern als Schutz- und Erhaltungsbedingung der noch nicht sichtbaren Frucht bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:AS5","text":"Die Argumentbewegung führt von der Demontage altruistischer Zweckformeln zur Identifikation des eigenen Werks als einzigem legitimen Nächsten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:A1","text":"Schaffende sind auf die Hervorbringung eines eigenen Kindes ausgerichtet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:A2","text":"Das eigene Kind bezeichnet die noch nicht sichtbare Frucht des Schaffens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:A3","text":"Schöpferisches Handeln wird nicht durch den Nutzen für einen Nächsten bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:A4","text":"Die Formel „für den Nächsten“ gehört zur Moral der kleinen Leute.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:A5","text":"Die Moral der kleinen Leute beruht auf Gleichheit und reziproker Vorteilserwartung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:A6","text":"Die Tugend des Schaffenden verlangt die Zurückweisung der Rechtfertigungsformeln „für“, „um“ und „weil“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:A7","text":"Der Eigennutz des Schaffenden schützt, schont und nährt die entstehende Frucht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:A8","text":"Das Werk und der Wille des Schaffenden fungieren als sein eigentlicher Nächster.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:A9","text":"Die gesamte Tugend des Schaffenden konzentriert sich dort, wo seine gesamte Liebe konzentriert ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:A10","text":"Vorgegebene Werte können die schöpferische Wertsetzung des Schaffenden verfälschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:NX1","text":"Schaffen ist nicht primär Handeln zugunsten des Nächsten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:NX2","text":"Die schöpferische Tugend ist nicht durch altruistische Zweckangaben zu rechtfertigen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:NX3","text":"Der Nächste ist nicht notwendig die nächststehende Bezugsgröße des Schaffenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:NX4","text":"Der Eigennutz des Schaffenden ist nicht mit der kleinen Reziprozitätsmoral gleichzusetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:NX5","text":"Vorgegebene Werte besitzen keine unbedingte Autorität über das eigene Werk und den eigenen Willen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:NX6","text":"Die Tugend des Schaffenden ist nicht aus Gleichheit und gegenseitigem Tausch ableitbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:D1","text":"Die Ablehnung des Nächsten als Zweck verschiebt den Maßstab schöpferischer Legitimität vom sozialen Nutzen auf die eigene Hervorbringung.","refs":["CH_97E9_11_2:A3","CH_97E9_11_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:D2","text":"Die Zurückweisung von „für“, „um“ und „weil“ entzieht dem Schaffen seine konventionelle äußere Rechtfertigung.","refs":["CH_97E9_11_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:D3","text":"Die Moral der kleinen Leute erscheint als System symmetrischer Austauschbarkeit und nicht als Maßstab höherer Schöpfung.","refs":["CH_97E9_11_2:A4","CH_97E9_11_2:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:D4","text":"Der Eigennutz erhält eine produktive Funktion, weil er die ungesicherte Frucht gegen vorzeitige Preisgabe abschirmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_11_2:A2","CH_97E9_11_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:D5","text":"Die Einheit von Liebe, Tugend, Werk und Wille ersetzt die Trennung zwischen persönlichem Interesse und schöpferischer Pflicht.","refs":["CH_97E9_11_2:A7","CH_97E9_11_2:A8","CH_97E9_11_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:D6","text":"Der Schaffende wird zum Ursprung eigener Werte, statt bereits geltende Werte für andere zu verwirklichen.","refs":["CH_97E9_11_2:A8","CH_97E9_11_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:SD1","text":"Schöpferische Existenz wird als selbstbezogene Generativität organisiert, deren Selbstbezug gerade die Bedingung ihrer Hervorbringung bildet.","refs":["CH_97E9_11_2:A1","CH_97E9_11_2:A2","CH_97E9_11_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:SD2","text":"Der Text ersetzt die soziale Ethik der Gegenseitigkeit durch eine produktive Ethik der Einseitigkeit: Das Werk schuldet seine Entstehung keinem äußeren Adressaten.","refs":["CH_97E9_11_2:A3","CH_97E9_11_2:A4","CH_97E9_11_2:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:SD3","text":"Der Begriff des Nächsten wird ontologisch umcodiert: Nähe bezeichnet nicht soziale Nachbarschaft, sondern die Identität von Schaffendem, Werk und Wille.","refs":["CH_97E9_11_2:A8","CH_97E9_11_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:SD4","text":"Die Abwehr fremder Wertvorgaben macht schöpferische Autonomie zur Voraussetzung dafür, dass überhaupt neue Werte entstehen können.","refs":["CH_97E9_11_2:A6","CH_97E9_11_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:DNX1","text":"Das Schaffen darf nicht von einem bereits normativ bestimmten Gemeinwohl abhängig sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:DNX2","text":"Der Wert einer Hervorbringung darf nicht aus ihrer Anerkennung durch andere abgeleitet werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:DNX3","text":"Das Verhältnis zum Werk darf nicht durch Tausch, Dankbarkeit oder soziale Schuld strukturiert sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:DNX4","text":"Der Schaffende darf nicht als bloßer Vollstrecker fremder Werte verstanden werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:DNX5","text":"Die noch nicht sichtbare Frucht darf nicht dem Maßstab des unmittelbar Sichtbaren unterworfen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Welt, in der Schöpfung nur als Dienst an bereits vorhandenen Bedürfnissen legitim ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Verfügbarkeit des Schaffenden für eine universelle Moral des „Für-jemanden“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Möglichkeit, neue Werte aus einer vorausgesetzten Gleichheit der Wertenden zu erzeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen bleibt eine positive Bestimmung des Kindes selbst; strukturell wirksam ist vor allem seine Funktion als noch nicht einlösbare Zukunft der Schöpfung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:FGS1","text":"Vorgegebene Nächstenmoral → Zuschreibung eines äußeren Zwecks an das Schaffen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:FGS2","text":"Äußerer Zweck → Reduktion des Schaffens auf Gleichheit, Tausch und gegenseitigen Nutzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:FGS3","text":"Zurückweisung von „für“, „um“ und „weil“ → Entfernung äußerer Rechtfertigungsinstanzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:FGS4","text":"Entfernung äußerer Rechtfertigungsinstanzen → Freilegung des Eigennutzes als innerer Schutzfunktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:FGS5","text":"Eigennützige Schutzfunktion → Bewahrung der unsichtbaren Frucht vor fremder Verfügung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:FGS6","text":"Bewahrte Frucht → Identifikation von Werk und Wille als eigentlichem Nächsten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:FGS7","text":"Werk und Wille als Nächster → Konzentration der Tugend auf selbstgesetzte Hervorbringung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:AF1","text":"Fremde Einrede → Zurückweisung des Nächsten als Zweck → Kritik der kleinen Reziprozität → Freilegung des schöpferischen Eigennutzes → Schutz der unsichtbaren Frucht → Werk und Wille als eigentlicher Nächster → Selbstgesetzte Tugend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:ME1","text":"„Nächster“ wird von einer sozialen Person auf das eigene Werk und den eigenen Willen umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:ME2","text":"„Eigennutz“ wird von einem moralischen Defizit in eine generative und konservierende Funktion umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:ME3","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Selbstinteresse und Tugend bricht zusammen, weil Selbstinteresse als Bedingung schöpferischer Tugend erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:ME4","text":"Die Opposition zwischen Individualität und Fürsorge wird durch die Unterscheidung zwischen äußerer Sozialpflicht und innerer Fruchtpflege neu geordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:ME5","text":"Das unmittelbar Sichtbare verliert seine Vorrangstellung gegenüber einer noch nicht sichtbaren, aber handlungsleitenden Zukunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — Der Schaffende soll nicht für den Nächsten, sondern für sein eigenes Kind, Werk und seinen eigenen Willen schaffen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — Das Argument ersetzt reziproke Sozialmoral durch eine asymmetrische Produktionsstruktur, in der die Frucht Schutz vor äußerer Verfügung benötigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — Der Schaffende soll sprachliche und moralische Einreden abwehren, die sein Handeln auf fremden Nutzen zurückführen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — Das eigentliche Sein des Schaffenden liegt in einer zukünftigen, noch unsichtbaren Hervorbringung, die gegen die Gegenwart abgeschirmt werden muss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von der Nächstenmoral zur schöpferischen Selbstbezogenheit zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, was das „eigene Kind“ konkret hervorbringt und nach welchem Maßstab es sich bewähren soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Eigennutz als Schutz der Hervorbringung und nicht als bloßer Vorteil verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Verbindung liegt in der funktionalen Einheit von unsichtbarer Frucht, Eigennutz, Werk und Tugend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:MRT5","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen der Zurückweisung zweckhafter „Für“-Strukturen und der starken Ausrichtung des Schaffens auf das eigene Kind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:MRT6","text":"Eine zweite Spannung entsteht dadurch, dass der Text Tugend bewahrt, während er ihre soziale und reziproke Begründung verwirft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, solange der Begriff des Eigennutzes als generative Notwendigkeit und nicht als ökonomische Nutzenmaximierung gelesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T184530236578Z_aab2c84f","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"11.","source_sha256":"e42642ce97368be6994ad5525ad3395d791427ae9ab1ce04f71703914352b314","sha256":"0ae75e2a5d2517d92f6965ce1f1c2486d419708340159ea7809fbcbf8745a04c","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T18:45:30.237769+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:AS1","text":"The text addresses the question of what the creating of the “higher humans” is actually directed toward.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:AS2","text":"It redefines creative activity as the bringing forth of one's own child, work, will, or value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:AS3","text":"The appeal to the neighbor is rejected as an alien justification and as the morality of petty reciprocity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:AS4","text":"The self-interested orientation of the creator is determined not as a deficiency, but as a condition of protection and preservation for the fruit not yet visible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:AS5","text":"The movement of the argument leads from the dismantling of altruistic formulas of purpose to the identification of one's own work as the sole legitimate neighbor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:A1","text":"Creators are directed toward bringing forth a child of their own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:A2","text":"One's own child designates the fruit of creation that is not yet visible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:A3","text":"Creative action is not determined by benefit to a neighbor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:A4","text":"The formula “for the neighbor” belongs to the morality of petty people.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:A5","text":"The morality of petty people rests on equality and the expectation of reciprocal advantage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:A6","text":"The virtue of the creator demands the rejection of the justificatory formulas “for,” “in order to,” and “because.”","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:A7","text":"The creator's self-interest protects, preserves, and nourishes the emerging fruit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:A8","text":"The creator's work and will function as the creator's actual neighbor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:A9","text":"The creator's entire virtue is concentrated where the creator's entire love is concentrated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:A10","text":"Predetermined values can falsify the creator's creative positing of values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:NX1","text":"Creating is not primarily action for the benefit of the neighbor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:NX2","text":"Creative virtue is not to be justified by altruistic statements of purpose.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:NX3","text":"The neighbor is not necessarily the creator's closest point of reference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:NX4","text":"The creator's self-interest is not to be equated with petty morality of reciprocity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:NX5","text":"Predetermined values possess no unconditional authority over one's own work and will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:NX6","text":"The creator's virtue cannot be derived from equality and mutual exchange.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:D1","text":"The rejection of the neighbor as purpose shifts the criterion of creative legitimacy from social utility to one's own bringing forth.","refs":["CH_97E9_11_2:A3","CH_97E9_11_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:D2","text":"The rejection of “for,” “in order to,” and “because” deprives creating of its conventional external justification.","refs":["CH_97E9_11_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:D3","text":"The morality of petty people appears as a system of symmetrical interchangeability and not as a criterion of higher creation.","refs":["CH_97E9_11_2:A4","CH_97E9_11_2:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:D4","text":"Self-interest acquires a productive function because it shields the unsecured fruit against premature surrender.","refs":["CH_97E9_11_2:A2","CH_97E9_11_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:D5","text":"The unity of love, virtue, work, and will replaces the separation between personal interest and creative duty.","refs":["CH_97E9_11_2:A7","CH_97E9_11_2:A8","CH_97E9_11_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:D6","text":"The creator becomes the origin of the creator's own values, instead of realizing already valid values for others.","refs":["CH_97E9_11_2:A8","CH_97E9_11_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:SD1","text":"Creative existence is organized as self-referential generativity, whose self-reference precisely constitutes the condition of its bringing forth.","refs":["CH_97E9_11_2:A1","CH_97E9_11_2:A2","CH_97E9_11_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:SD2","text":"The text replaces the social ethics of reciprocity with a productive ethics of one-sidedness: the work owes its emergence to no external addressee.","refs":["CH_97E9_11_2:A3","CH_97E9_11_2:A4","CH_97E9_11_2:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:SD3","text":"The concept of the neighbor is ontologically recoded: proximity designates not social neighborhood, but the identity of creator, work, and will.","refs":["CH_97E9_11_2:A8","CH_97E9_11_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:SD4","text":"The defense against alien prescriptions of value makes creative autonomy the precondition for new values being able to arise at all.","refs":["CH_97E9_11_2:A6","CH_97E9_11_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:DNX1","text":"Creating must not be dependent on a common good already normatively determined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:DNX2","text":"The value of a bringing forth must not be derived from its recognition by others.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:DNX3","text":"The relation to the work must not be structured by exchange, gratitude, or social debt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:DNX4","text":"The creator must not be understood as the mere executor of alien values.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:DNX5","text":"The fruit not yet visible must not be subjected to the criterion of the immediately visible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a world in which creation is legitimate only as service to needs already present.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:SNX2","text":"Excluded is the availability of the creator for a universal morality of “for-someone.”","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:SNX3","text":"Excluded is the possibility of generating new values from a presupposed equality of those who value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:SNX4","text":"A positive determination of the child itself remains excluded; structurally effective above all is its function as the not-yet-redeemable future of creation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:FGS1","text":"Predetermined morality of the neighbor → attribution of an external purpose to creating.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:FGS2","text":"External purpose → reduction of creating to equality, exchange, and mutual benefit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:FGS3","text":"Rejection of “for,” “in order to,” and “because” → removal of external instances of justification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:FGS4","text":"Removal of external instances of justification → disclosure of self-interest as an inner protective function.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:FGS5","text":"Self-interested protective function → preservation of the invisible fruit against alien disposal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:FGS6","text":"Preserved fruit → identification of work and will as the actual neighbor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:FGS7","text":"Work and will as neighbor → concentration of virtue on self-posited bringing forth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:AF1","text":"Alien objection → rejection of the neighbor as purpose → critique of petty reciprocity → disclosure of creative self-interest → protection of the invisible fruit → work and will as actual neighbor → self-posited virtue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:ME1","text":"“Neighbor” is remapped from a social person onto one's own work and will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:ME2","text":"“Self-interest” is reclassified from a moral deficit into a generative and preservative function.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:ME3","text":"The opposition between self-interest and virtue collapses because self-interest appears as a condition of creative virtue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:ME4","text":"The opposition between individuality and care is reordered through the distinction between external social duty and inner cultivation of the fruit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:ME5","text":"The immediately visible loses its priority in relation to a future not yet visible but guiding action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — The creator should create not for the neighbor, but for the creator's own child, work, and will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — The argument replaces reciprocal social morality with an asymmetrical structure of production in which the fruit requires protection from external disposal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — The creator should ward off linguistic and moral objections that reduce the creator's action to alien benefit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — The creator's actual being lies in a future bringing forth still invisible, which must be shielded against the present.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from the morality of the neighbor to creative self-reference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is what the “own child” concretely brings forth and by what criterion it is to prove itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as self-interest is understood as protection of the bringing forth and not as mere advantage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:MRT4","text":"Its strongest connection lies in the functional unity of invisible fruit, self-interest, work, and virtue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:MRT5","text":"A tension remains between the rejection of purposive “for”-structures and the strong orientation of creating toward one's own child.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:MRT6","text":"A second tension arises from the fact that the text preserves virtue while rejecting its social and reciprocal grounding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_2:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument so long as the concept of self-interest is read as generative necessity and not as economic maximization of utility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_11_2@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_11_2:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On the Higher Man","source_section_label":"11.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Four and Last"],"reading_title":"On the Higher Man · 11","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","On the Higher Man","11."],"original_title":"11."}],"source_title_context":"Vom höheren Menschen","source_section_label":"11.","source_title_hierarchy":["Vierter und letzter Theil"],"reading_title":"On the Higher Man · 11","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","On the Higher Man","11."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 150","title":"On the Higher Man · 11","context":"Part Four and Last","original_context":"Vierter und letzter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Vom höheren Menschen · 11"},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2","layer":"CH","title":"On the Higher Man · 12","order":151,"parents":["RAW_97E9_12_2"],"revision":"CH_97E9_12_2@R001","sha256":"2829dba7affe4d1489aed2e740c568aa25f8dee79eaeba734728cd9c28410145","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:AS1","text":"Das Problem besteht darin, dass schöpferische Hervorbringung zugleich als notwendige Leistung und als Verunreinigung erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:AS2","text":"Schöpfung wird durch die Analogie zur Geburt neu bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:AS3","text":"Schmerz fungiert als produktive Ursache von Ausdruck und Hervorbringung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:AS4","text":"Die Hervorbringung eines Neuen erzeugt nicht nur ein Kind, sondern auch neue Unreinheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:AS5","text":"Der Schaffende muss sich nach der Hervorbringung von dem von ihm Erzeugten entfernen und sich reinigen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:A1","text":"Schaffen ist eine Form des Gebärens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:A2","text":"Gebären setzt den Gebärenden einer Krankheit oder Belastung aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:A3","text":"Das Hervorgebrachte macht den Hervorbringenden unrein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:A4","text":"Geburt geschieht nicht aus bloßem Vergnügen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:A5","text":"Schmerz erzeugt Ausdruck.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:A6","text":"Schöpferische Hervorbringung ist mit mütterlicher Funktion verbunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:A7","text":"Jedes neue Kind bringt neue Unreinheit hervor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:A8","text":"Nach der Hervorbringung ist eine Reinigung der Seele erforderlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:A9","text":"Reinigung verlangt Distanz vom Erzeugten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:A10","text":"Der Status des höheren Menschen schließt schöpferische Verpflichtung ein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:NX1","text":"Schöpfung ist nicht reine, unbeschwerte Selbstverwirklichung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:NX2","text":"Geburt ist nicht lustförmige Produktion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:NX3","text":"Schmerz ist nicht bloß passives Leiden, sondern wird als Erzeugungsbedingung gegen seine Reduktion auf bloße Negativität abgegrenzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:NX4","text":"Das Neue ist nicht automatisch rein, erlösend oder ordnend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:NX5","text":"Der Schaffende bleibt nicht durch die Reinheit seiner Absicht unbefleckt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:NX6","text":"Mutterschaft wird nicht als harmonische oder affirmativ unbelastete Funktion dargestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:NX7","text":"Hervorbringung berechtigt nicht zur dauerhaften Nähe zum Hervorgebrachten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:NX8","text":"Die schöpferische Aufgabe endet nicht mit der Geburt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:D1","text":"Schöpfung erzeugt eine doppelte Belastung: den Schmerz des Hervorbringens und die Unreinheit des Hervorgebrachten.","refs":["CH_97E9_12_2:A1","CH_97E9_12_2:A2","CH_97E9_12_2:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:D2","text":"Ausdruck entsteht dort, wo Hervorbringung durch Schmerz vermittelt wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_12_2:A4","CH_97E9_12_2:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:D3","text":"Dichterisches und tierisches Gackern werden als gleichartige Reaktionsformen auf geburtsförmigen Schmerz eingeordnet.","refs":["CH_97E9_12_2:A1","CH_97E9_12_2:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:D4","text":"Der Schaffende kann seine schöpferische Position nicht von der mütterlichen Position abtrennen.","refs":["CH_97E9_12_2:A6","CH_97E9_12_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:D5","text":"Jedes Hervorgebrachte erweitert den Reinigungsbedarf über die ursprüngliche Belastung hinaus.","refs":["CH_97E9_12_2:A3","CH_97E9_12_2:A7","CH_97E9_12_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:D6","text":"Nach der Geburt wird Trennung zu einer Bedingung seelischer Reintegration.","refs":["CH_97E9_12_2:A8","CH_97E9_12_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:SD1","text":"Das System definiert Schöpfung als kontaminierende Transformation: Der Schaffende erzeugt Neues und verliert dadurch seine ursprüngliche Reinheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:SD2","text":"Die Produktivität des Schmerzes legitimiert die Hervorbringung, hebt aber ihre Verunreinigung nicht auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:SD3","text":"Der höhere Mensch wird nicht durch makellose Autonomie, sondern durch die Fähigkeit bestimmt, die Folgen eigener Hervorbringung zu tragen und sich von ihnen wieder zu lösen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:SD4","text":"Die schöpferische Bewegung bildet einen rekursiven Zyklus aus Zeugung, Kontamination, Distanzierung und Reinigung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:SD5","text":"Das Neue erscheint zugleich als Ziel der Schöpfung und als Quelle einer erneuten Unordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:DNX1","text":"Das System setzt voraus, dass schöpferische Leistung nicht aus sich selbst heraus rein bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:DNX2","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass das Neue den Schaffenden von seiner eigenen Belastung erlöst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:DNX3","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass Nähe zum Erzeugten die angemessene Vollendung der Schöpfung darstellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:DNX4","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass Schmerz durch seine produktive Funktion aufgehoben oder nachträglich neutralisiert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:DNX5","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass Schöpferidentität ohne das Moment der Mutterschaft oder der mütterlichen Belastung begriffen werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:SNX1","text":"Die versperrte Möglichkeit einer reinen, schuldlosen und folgenlosen Schöpfung organisiert die gesamte Argumentation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:SNX2","text":"Unmöglich ist eine Hervorbringung, die das Hervorgebrachte vollständig integriert, ohne neue Unreinheit zu erzeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:SNX3","text":"Abwesend bleibt ein Modell, in dem Geburt, Schöpfung und Beziehung ohne Trennung oder Reinigung auskommen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:SNX4","text":"Der Text behandelt die dauerhafte Identifikation des Schaffenden mit seinem Werk als unzulässige Bindung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:FGS1","text":"Schöpferstatus → Geburtsanalogie → notwendige Belastung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:FGS2","text":"Belastung → Schmerz → Ausdruck und Hervorbringung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:FGS3","text":"Hervorbringung → neues Kind → zusätzliche Unreinheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:FGS4","text":"Unreinheit → notwendige seelische Reinigung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:FGS5","text":"Reinigung → Rückzug vom Erzeugten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:FGS6","text":"Rückzug → Erhaltung der Möglichkeit weiterer Schöpfung trotz bleibender Kontamination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:AF1","text":"Höherer Mensch als Schaffender → Schöpfung als Geburt → Geburt als schmerzhafte Belastung → Schmerz als Quelle des Ausdrucks → neues Kind als neue Unreinheit → Reinigung und Distanzierung als abschließende Forderung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:ME1","text":"Schöpfung wird von einer rein affirmativen Leistung in einen Prozess aus Produktion und Kontamination umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:ME2","text":"Schmerz wird von einem Gegenpol zur Produktivität in deren Erzeugungsmedium umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:ME3","text":"Das Neue wird nicht als Lösung, sondern als erneute Quelle von Unordnung sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:ME4","text":"Der Schaffende wird nicht primär als souveräner Urheber, sondern als belastete und reinigungsbedürftige Trägerfigur kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:ME5","text":"Distanz zum eigenen Werk wird von Entfremdung in eine notwendige Form schöpferischer Selbstbewahrung umgedeutet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:ALT1","text":"Surface: Gebären, Schmerz, Unreinheit, Reinigung und Rückzug werden als unmittelbare Handlungsfolge gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:ALT2","text":"Structural: Die Hervorbringung erzeugt zugleich ein Produkt und eine Belastung des Produzenten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Schöpferische Selbstbehauptung wird an die Fähigkeit gebunden, das eigene Erzeugnis nicht dauerhaft zu besetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Jede Geburt eröffnet eine neue Welt und reproduziert dadurch die Bedingung weiterer Unreinheit; Reinigung folgt notwendig nachträglich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von Schöpfung über Schmerz und Unreinheit zu Reinigung und Distanzierung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob „Geburt“ biologisch, poetisch, geistig oder ausschließlich metaphorisch gemeint ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Schöpfung gleichzeitig als notwendige Leistung und als kontaminierender Vorgang gilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Stelle ist die Kopplung von Produktivität, Schmerz und nachträglicher Reinigung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:MRT5","text":"Eine ungelöste Spannung besteht darin, dass Schöpfung gefordert wird, obwohl jedes Ergebnis als neue Unreinheit erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung entsteht zwischen der Aufwertung des höheren Schaffenden und der Reduktion seiner schöpferischen Lage auf Krankheit, Mutterschaft und Reinigungspflicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die Argumentbewegung, verliert jedoch die expressive Verdichtung und die nicht auflösbare Geschlechtermetaphorik der Ausgangsform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T184630504436Z_62f33d3a","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"12.","source_sha256":"2829dba7affe4d1489aed2e740c568aa25f8dee79eaeba734728cd9c28410145","sha256":"8a59eb5fb6acc5929290f9165c941cbdca028342a7d57c91e73886bd533978d0","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T18:46:30.506943+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:AS1","text":"The problem consists in the fact that creative production appears at once as a necessary achievement and as contamination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:AS2","text":"Creation is redefined through the analogy to birth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:AS3","text":"Pain functions as a productive cause of expression and production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:AS4","text":"The production of something new generates not only a child, but also new impurity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:AS5","text":"After production, the creator must withdraw from what they have produced and purify themselves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:A1","text":"Creating is a form of giving birth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:A2","text":"Giving birth exposes the one giving birth to illness or burden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:A3","text":"What is produced renders its producer impure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:A4","text":"Birth does not occur from mere pleasure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:A5","text":"Pain produces expression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:A6","text":"Creative production is connected with maternal function.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:A7","text":"Every new child produces new impurity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:A8","text":"After production, purification of the soul is necessary.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:A9","text":"Purification demands distance from what has been produced.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:A10","text":"The status of the higher human being includes a creative obligation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:NX1","text":"Creation is not pure, untroubled self-realization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:NX2","text":"Birth is not pleasure-shaped production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:NX3","text":"Pain is not merely passive suffering, but is distinguished, as a condition of production, from its reduction to mere negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:NX4","text":"The new is not automatically pure, redemptive, or ordering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:NX5","text":"The creator does not remain unstained through the purity of their intention.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:NX6","text":"Motherhood is not presented as a harmonious function or one unburdened by affirmation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:NX7","text":"Production does not entitle one to enduring proximity to what has been produced.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:NX8","text":"The creative task does not end with birth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:D1","text":"Creation produces a double burden: the pain of production and the impurity of what has been produced.","refs":["CH_97E9_12_2:A1","CH_97E9_12_2:A2","CH_97E9_12_2:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:D2","text":"Expression arises where production is mediated by pain.","refs":["CH_97E9_12_2:A4","CH_97E9_12_2:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:D3","text":"Poetic and animal cackling are classified as analogous forms of reaction to birth-like pain.","refs":["CH_97E9_12_2:A1","CH_97E9_12_2:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:D4","text":"The creator cannot separate their creative position from the maternal position.","refs":["CH_97E9_12_2:A6","CH_97E9_12_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:D5","text":"Everything produced extends the need for purification beyond the original burden.","refs":["CH_97E9_12_2:A3","CH_97E9_12_2:A7","CH_97E9_12_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:D6","text":"After birth, separation becomes a condition of psychic reintegration.","refs":["CH_97E9_12_2:A8","CH_97E9_12_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:SD1","text":"The system defines creation as contaminating transformation: the creator produces something new and thereby loses their original purity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:SD2","text":"The productivity of pain legitimates production but does not annul its contamination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:SD3","text":"The higher human being is determined not by flawless autonomy, but by the capacity to bear the consequences of their own production and to detach themselves from them again.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:SD4","text":"The creative movement forms a recursive cycle of procreation, contamination, distancing, and purification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:SD5","text":"The new appears simultaneously as the goal of creation and as the source of renewed disorder.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:DNX1","text":"The system presupposes that creative achievement does not remain pure of itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:DNX2","text":"It is excluded that the new redeems the creator from their own burden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:DNX3","text":"It is excluded that proximity to what has been produced constitutes the appropriate completion of creation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:DNX4","text":"It is excluded that pain is annulled or subsequently neutralized by its productive function.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:DNX5","text":"It is excluded that creative identity can be conceived without the moment of motherhood or maternal burden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:SNX1","text":"The barred possibility of a pure, guiltless, and consequence-free creation organizes the entire argumentation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:SNX2","text":"Impossible is a production that fully integrates what has been produced without generating new impurity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:SNX3","text":"Absent remains a model in which birth, creation, and relation can manage without separation or purification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:SNX4","text":"The text treats the creator's enduring identification with their work as an impermissible attachment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:FGS1","text":"Creative status → birth analogy → necessary burden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:FGS2","text":"Burden → pain → expression and production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:FGS3","text":"Production → new child → additional impurity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:FGS4","text":"Impurity → necessary purification of the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:FGS5","text":"Purification → withdrawal from what has been produced.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:FGS6","text":"Withdrawal → preservation of the possibility of further creation despite enduring contamination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:AF1","text":"Higher human being as creator → creation as birth → birth as painful burden → pain as source of expression → new child as new impurity → purification and distancing as final demand.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:ME1","text":"Creation is remapped from a purely affirmative achievement into a process of production and contamination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:ME2","text":"Pain is reclassified from an opposite of productivity into its medium of production.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:ME3","text":"The new becomes visible not as a solution, but as a renewed source of disorder.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:ME4","text":"The creator is mapped not primarily as a sovereign author, but as a burdened figure in need of purification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:ME5","text":"Distance from one's own work is reinterpreted from alienation into a necessary form of creative self-preservation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:ALT1","text":"Surface: Giving birth, pain, impurity, purification, and withdrawal are posited as an immediate sequence of actions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:ALT2","text":"Structural: Production simultaneously generates a product and a burden upon the producer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Creative self-assertion is bound to the capacity not to occupy one's own product permanently.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Every birth opens a new world and thereby reproduces the condition of further impurity; purification necessarily follows afterward.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from creation through pain and impurity to purification and distancing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether “birth” is meant biologically, poetically, spiritually, or exclusively metaphorically.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as creation is regarded simultaneously as a necessary achievement and as a contaminating process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:MRT4","text":"Its strongest point is the coupling of productivity, pain, and subsequent purification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:MRT5","text":"An unresolved tension consists in the fact that creation is demanded although every result appears as new impurity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:MRT6","text":"A further tension arises between the elevation of the higher creator and the reduction of their creative situation to illness, motherhood, and the obligation of purification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_2:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_2:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the argumentative movement, but loses the expressive condensation and the irresolvable gender metaphoricity of the original form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_12_2@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_12_2:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On the Higher Man","source_section_label":"12.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Four and Last"],"reading_title":"On the Higher Man · 12","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","On the Higher Man","12."],"original_title":"12."}],"source_title_context":"Vom höheren Menschen","source_section_label":"12.","source_title_hierarchy":["Vierter und letzter Theil"],"reading_title":"On the Higher Man · 12","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","On the Higher Man","12."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 151","title":"On the Higher Man · 12","context":"Part Four and Last","original_context":"Vierter und letzter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Vom höheren Menschen · 12"},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2","layer":"CH","title":"On the Higher Man · 13","order":152,"parents":["RAW_97E9_13_2"],"revision":"CH_97E9_13_2@R001","sha256":"706c89683213503eeb1057564ecb1393452559a3e0764247d3619d5078e028c6","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:AS1","text":"Das zentrale Problem ist der Anspruch, die eigene Lebensform gegen die überlieferten Kräfte, Tugenden und Laster zu bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:AS2","text":"Der Text bestimmt Tugend als Maß an den gegebenen Kräften und an der väterlichen Genealogie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:AS3","text":"Ein Bruch mit der Herkunft wird als wahrscheinlichkeitswidrige Selbsttäuschung behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:AS4","text":"Der Anspruch auf Erstlingschaft erzeugt die Gefahr eines Umschlags in den entgegengesetzten Status.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:AS5","text":"Askese und Heiligkeit werden gegen ihre genealogisch und triebhaft bedingten Voraussetzungen geprüft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:AS6","text":"Die Einsamkeit wird nicht als Reinigung, sondern als Verstärkung des bereits Eingebrachten bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:AS7","text":"Der Argumentgang führt von genealogischer Begrenzung über die Demontage asketischer Selbststilisierung zur Diagnose innerer Verunreinigung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:A1","text":"Die eigenen Kräfte setzen der Tugend einen Maßstab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:A2","text":"Das Wahrscheinliche begrenzt legitime Selbstansprüche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:A3","text":"Die Tugend der Väter bildet eine wirksame Spur für die Nachkommen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:A4","text":"Der Wille der Väter stellt eine Bedingung des Aufstiegs der Nachkommen dar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:A5","text":"Der Anspruch auf Erstlingschaft kann in den Status des Letztlings umschlagen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:A6","text":"Die Laster der Väter bleiben für die Selbstbestimmung der Nachkommen relevant.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:A7","text":"Ein asketischer Anspruch widerspricht den eigenen Voraussetzungen, wenn diese durch starke sinnliche Triebe bestimmt sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:A8","text":"Institutionelle Zeichen der Heiligkeit verändern nicht notwendig die zugrunde liegenden Triebe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:A9","text":"Selbst auferlegte Zucht- und Fluchträume garantieren keine innere Umwandlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:A10","text":"Einsamkeit verstärkt, was ein Mensch in sie hineinträgt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:A11","text":"Das in der Einsamkeit Verstärkte kann als „inneres Vieh“ erscheinen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:A12","text":"Die äußere Gestalt des Wüstenheiligen kann mit innerer Unreinheit koexistieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:NX1","text":"Tugend ist nicht die Überschreitung der eigenen Kräfte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:NX2","text":"Selbstbestimmung ist nicht der Wille gegen die Wahrscheinlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:NX3","text":"Aufstieg ist nicht die vollständige Ablösung vom väterlichen Willen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:NX4","text":"Erstlingschaft ist nicht durch bloße Selbstbehauptung gesichert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:NX5","text":"Heiligkeit ist nicht die Verleugnung der väterlichen Laster.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:NX6","text":"Keuschheit ist nicht unabhängig von der sinnlichen Herkunft legitimiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:NX7","text":"Ein Kloster oder ein heiliger Name erzeugt keinen heiligen Weg.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:NX8","text":"Selbstdisziplin und Flucht aus der Welt sind keine Beweise innerer Läuterung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:NX9","text":"Einsamkeit ist nicht notwendig Reinigung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:NX10","text":"Wüstenheiligkeit ist nicht notwendig Abwesenheit von Teufel und Schwein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:D1","text":"Ein Tugendanspruch, der die eigenen Kräfte überschreitet, wird als Unwahrscheinlichkeit und damit als Narrheit klassifiziert.","refs":["CH_97E9_13_2:A1","CH_97E9_13_2:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:D2","text":"Der genealogische Wille fungiert als Bedingung dafür, dass ein Nachkomme überhaupt höher steigen kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_13_2:A3","CH_97E9_13_2:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:D3","text":"Die Verleugnung ererbter Laster erzeugt keine Heiligkeit, sondern eine diskrepante Selbststilisierung.","refs":["CH_97E9_13_2:A5","CH_97E9_13_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:D4","text":"Der Anspruch auf Keuschheit wird bei stark sinnlich geprägter Herkunft als Widerspruch zwischen Selbstbild und Triebgrund gelesen.","refs":["CH_97E9_13_2:A6","CH_97E9_13_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:D5","text":"Die Stiftung eines Klosters kann den Widerspruch zwischen asketischem Zeichen und sinnlicher Voraussetzung institutionell verkleiden.","refs":["CH_97E9_13_2:A7","CH_97E9_13_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:D6","text":"Ein selbst errichteter Zucht- und Fluchtraum bleibt hinsichtlich seiner inneren Wirkung unbelegt.","refs":["CH_97E9_13_2:A8","CH_97E9_13_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:D7","text":"Einsamkeit verschärft die vorhandene Disposition, statt sie automatisch aufzuheben.","refs":["CH_97E9_13_2:A10","CH_97E9_13_2:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:D8","text":"Die Figur des Wüstenheiligen wird zur Bezeichnung einer äußerlichen Heiligkeit bei fortbestehender innerer Animalität.","refs":["CH_97E9_13_2:A10","CH_97E9_13_2:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:SD1","text":"Das System ersetzt das Ideal autonomer Selbsterschaffung durch eine Genealogie der Kräfte, Triebe und Wahrscheinlichkeiten.","refs":["CH_97E9_13_2:A1","CH_97E9_13_2:A2","CH_97E9_13_2:A3","CH_97E9_13_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:SD2","text":"Asketische Institutionen werden als sekundäre Formen behandelt, die eine nicht transformierte Triebgrundlage symbolisch überdecken können.","refs":["CH_97E9_13_2:A7","CH_97E9_13_2:A8","CH_97E9_13_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:SD3","text":"Rückzug aus der Welt wird in eine Prüfung der inneren Materialität des Subjekts umcodiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_13_2:A9","CH_97E9_13_2:A10","CH_97E9_13_2:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:SD4","text":"Heiligkeit erscheint als problematische Oberflächenkategorie, sobald Herkunft, Trieb und institutionelle Selbstbeschreibung gemeinsam kartiert werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_13_2:A6","CH_97E9_13_2:A8","CH_97E9_13_2:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt ein vollständig autonomes Subjekt aus, das sich unabhängig von Herkunft und Kraftgrundlage neu erzeugen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:DNX2","text":"Es schließt eine Tugend aus, die nur als abstraktes Ideal und nicht als Ausdruck vorhandener Kräfte bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:DNX3","text":"Es schließt die Annahme aus, dass institutionelle Askese Triebe durch bloße Formgebung transformiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:DNX4","text":"Es schließt die Gleichsetzung von Einsamkeit und Läuterung aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:DNX5","text":"Es schließt eine scharfe Trennung zwischen äußerem Heiligenschein und innerer Animalität aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:SNX1","text":"Abwesend ist die Möglichkeit einer Selbstüberschreitung, die nicht aus geerbten oder bereits vorhandenen Kräften hervorgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:SNX2","text":"Abwesend ist ein reiner Innenraum, in dem das Subjekt ohne mitgebrachte Triebe neu beginnen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:SNX3","text":"Abwesend ist eine Heiligkeit, deren Zeichen mit ihrer inneren Wirklichkeit identisch wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:SNX4","text":"Abwesend ist eine asketische Transformation, die nicht durch den Fortbestand des animalischen Grundes gefährdet bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:FGS1","text":"Gegebene Kräfte und Genealogie → Maßstab des Wahrscheinlichen → Begrenzung des Tugendanspruchs.","refs":["CH_97E9_13_2:A1","CH_97E9_13_2:A2","CH_97E9_13_2:A3","CH_97E9_13_2:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:FGS2","text":"Ererbte Laster und sinnliche Triebe → Anspruch auf gegenteilige Heiligkeit → Widerspruch zwischen Triebgrund und Selbstbild.","refs":["CH_97E9_13_2:A6","CH_97E9_13_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:FGS3","text":"Institutionelles Heiligkeitszeichen → symbolische Verdeckung des Widerspruchs → keine gesicherte innere Transformation.","refs":["CH_97E9_13_2:A8","CH_97E9_13_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:FGS4","text":"Einsamkeit als Verstärkungsmedium → Vergrößerung des Eingebrachten → Sichtbarwerden des „inneren Viehs“.","refs":["CH_97E9_13_2:A10","CH_97E9_13_2:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:FGS5","text":"Äußere Heiligkeitsform plus fortbestehende Animalität → Demontage der Reinheitskategorie → Diagnose des Wüstenheiligen.","refs":["CH_97E9_13_2:A8","CH_97E9_13_2:A11","CH_97E9_13_2:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:AF1","text":"Übersteigerter Tugendanspruch → Rückbindung an Kräfte und Wahrscheinlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:AF2","text":"Rückbindung an die Herkunft → Genealogische Bedingung des Aufstiegs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:AF3","text":"Genealogische Laster → Widerspruch gegen selbstverordnete Heiligkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:AF4","text":"Heiligkeitsinstitution → Entlarvung des Zeichens als unzureichende Transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:AF5","text":"Einsamkeit → Verstärkung des Eingebrachten → Sichtbarwerden innerer Animalität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:AF6","text":"Äußere Wüstenheiligkeit → Zusammenbruch der Reinheitsbehauptung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:ME1","text":"Tugend wird von einer normativen Höhe auf die Ebene von Kraft, Herkunft und Wahrscheinlichkeit verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:ME2","text":"Genealogie wird von Hintergrund oder Schicksal zu einem operativen Kriterium der Selbstbewertung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:ME3","text":"Askese wird nicht nach ihrer Institution, sondern nach ihrer Fähigkeit zur Triebtransformation klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:ME4","text":"Einsamkeit wird von einem Reinheitsraum zu einem Verstärker bereits vorhandener Dispositionen umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:ME5","text":"Heiligkeit und Unreinheit werden nicht mehr als Gegensätze, sondern als gleichzeitig auftretende Schichten derselben Figur lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Text richtet sich gegen übertriebene Tugend-, Keuschheits- und Heiligkeitsansprüche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:ALT2","text":"Structural — Genealogie, Triebgrund, institutionelle Form und Einsamkeit bestimmen die Reichweite solcher Ansprüche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text ersetzt moralische Selbstverordnung durch eine Prüfung der Bedingungen, unter denen Selbstüberschreitung glaubwürdig oder widersprüchlich wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Das Subjekt erscheint als zeitlich und genealogisch sedimentierte Kraftkonstellation, nicht als voraussetzungsloser Ursprung seiner selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von genealogischer Begrenzung zu asketischer Demontage und Einsamkeitsdiagnose zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob ererbte Kräfte lediglich Bedingungen setzen oder die Möglichkeit wirklicher Transformation grundsätzlich begrenzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Heiligkeit als Anspruch und nicht als tatsächlich mögliche Transformation behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Operation ist die Umkehrung äußerer Reinheitszeichen in Indikatoren möglicher innerer Verdrängung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:MRT5","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen der Aufforderung zur Selbstbegrenzung und der vorausgesetzten Möglichkeit, die väterliche Tugend weiterzuführen oder zu steigern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung besteht zwischen der Behauptung, Einsamkeit verstärke das Vorgefundene, und der impliziten Frage, ob Einsamkeit dennoch eine Umformung ermöglichen könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, sofern die polemische Bildsprache als Klassifikationsinstrument und nicht als eigenständige Beweisführung gelesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T184732604247Z_80f40290","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"13.","source_sha256":"706c89683213503eeb1057564ecb1393452559a3e0764247d3619d5078e028c6","sha256":"2e6b07f0ce9c869d87f85f3445118bf59f2b592a582dd81b5622aecea487ed38","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T18:47:32.605300+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:AS1","text":"The central problem is the claim to determine one's own form of life against inherited forces, virtues, and vices.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:AS2","text":"The text determines virtue as a measure of the given forces and of paternal genealogy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:AS3","text":"A break with one's origin is treated as self-deception contrary to probability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:AS4","text":"The claim to primacy generates the danger of a reversal into the opposite status.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:AS5","text":"Asceticism and holiness are tested against their genealogically and instinctually conditioned presuppositions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:AS6","text":"Solitude is determined not as purification, but as an intensification of what has already been brought into it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:AS7","text":"The course of the argument leads from genealogical limitation through the dismantling of ascetic self-stylization to the diagnosis of inner impurity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:A1","text":"One's own forces set a standard for virtue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:A2","text":"The probable limits legitimate claims about oneself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:A3","text":"The virtue of the fathers constitutes an effective trace for their descendants.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:A4","text":"The will of the fathers constitutes a condition for the ascent of their descendants.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:A5","text":"The claim to primacy can reverse into the status of the last.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:A6","text":"The vices of the fathers remain relevant to the self-determination of their descendants.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:A7","text":"An ascetic claim contradicts its own presuppositions when these are determined by strong sensual drives.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:A8","text":"Institutional signs of holiness do not necessarily alter the underlying drives.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:A9","text":"Self-imposed spaces of discipline and flight guarantee no inner transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:A10","text":"Solitude intensifies what a person brings into it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:A11","text":"What is intensified in solitude can appear as “inner beast.”","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:A12","text":"The external form of the desert saint can coexist with inner impurity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:NX1","text":"Virtue is not the surpassing of one's own forces.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:NX2","text":"Self-determination is not will against probability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:NX3","text":"Ascent is not complete detachment from the paternal will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:NX4","text":"Primacy is not secured through mere self-assertion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:NX5","text":"Holiness is not the denial of paternal vices.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:NX6","text":"Chastity is not legitimized independently of sensual origin.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:NX7","text":"A monastery or a holy name does not produce a holy path.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:NX8","text":"Self-discipline and flight from the world are not proofs of inner purification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:NX9","text":"Solitude is not necessarily purification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:NX10","text":"Desert sanctity is not necessarily the absence of devil and pig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:D1","text":"A claim to virtue that exceeds one's own forces is classified as improbability and thus as folly.","refs":["CH_97E9_13_2:A1","CH_97E9_13_2:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:D2","text":"Genealogical will functions as a condition enabling a descendant to rise higher at all.","refs":["CH_97E9_13_2:A3","CH_97E9_13_2:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:D3","text":"The denial of inherited vices produces not holiness but a discrepant self-stylization.","refs":["CH_97E9_13_2:A5","CH_97E9_13_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:D4","text":"Where origin is strongly marked by sensuality, the claim to chastity is read as a contradiction between self-image and instinctual ground.","refs":["CH_97E9_13_2:A6","CH_97E9_13_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:D5","text":"The founding of a monastery can institutionally conceal the contradiction between ascetic sign and sensual presupposition.","refs":["CH_97E9_13_2:A7","CH_97E9_13_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:D6","text":"A self-erected space of discipline and flight remains unproven with regard to its inner effect.","refs":["CH_97E9_13_2:A8","CH_97E9_13_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:D7","text":"Solitude intensifies the existing disposition instead of automatically suspending it.","refs":["CH_97E9_13_2:A10","CH_97E9_13_2:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:D8","text":"The figure of the desert saint becomes the designation of an external holiness amid persisting inner animality.","refs":["CH_97E9_13_2:A10","CH_97E9_13_2:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:SD1","text":"The system replaces the ideal of autonomous self-creation with a genealogy of forces, drives, and probabilities.","refs":["CH_97E9_13_2:A1","CH_97E9_13_2:A2","CH_97E9_13_2:A3","CH_97E9_13_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:SD2","text":"Ascetic institutions are treated as secondary forms that can symbolically cover over an untransformed instinctual ground.","refs":["CH_97E9_13_2:A7","CH_97E9_13_2:A8","CH_97E9_13_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:SD3","text":"Withdrawal from the world is recoded into a test of the subject's inner materiality.","refs":["CH_97E9_13_2:A9","CH_97E9_13_2:A10","CH_97E9_13_2:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:SD4","text":"Holiness appears as a problematic surface category once origin, drive, and institutional self-description are jointly mapped.","refs":["CH_97E9_13_2:A6","CH_97E9_13_2:A8","CH_97E9_13_2:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:DNX1","text":"The system excludes a fully autonomous subject capable of recreating itself independently of origin and its basis in forces.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:DNX2","text":"It excludes a virtue determined solely as an abstract ideal and not as an expression of existing forces.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:DNX3","text":"It excludes the assumption that institutional asceticism transforms drives through mere formal shaping.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:DNX4","text":"It excludes the equation of solitude and purification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:DNX5","text":"It excludes a sharp separation between outward halo and inner animality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:SNX1","text":"Absent is the possibility of a self-surpassing that does not proceed from inherited or already existing forces.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:SNX2","text":"Absent is a pure inner space in which the subject could begin anew without brought-along drives.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:SNX3","text":"Absent is a holiness whose signs would be identical with its inner reality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:SNX4","text":"Absent is an ascetic transformation that does not remain endangered by the persistence of the animal ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:FGS1","text":"Given forces and genealogy → standard of the probable → limitation of the claim to virtue.","refs":["CH_97E9_13_2:A1","CH_97E9_13_2:A2","CH_97E9_13_2:A3","CH_97E9_13_2:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:FGS2","text":"Inherited vices and sensual drives → claim to contrary holiness → contradiction between instinctual ground and self-image.","refs":["CH_97E9_13_2:A6","CH_97E9_13_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:FGS3","text":"Institutional sign of holiness → symbolic concealment of the contradiction → no secured inner transformation.","refs":["CH_97E9_13_2:A8","CH_97E9_13_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:FGS4","text":"Solitude as a medium of intensification → enlargement of what is brought into it → emergence of the “inner beast.”","refs":["CH_97E9_13_2:A10","CH_97E9_13_2:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:FGS5","text":"External form of holiness plus persisting animality → dismantling of the category of purity → diagnosis of the desert saint.","refs":["CH_97E9_13_2:A8","CH_97E9_13_2:A11","CH_97E9_13_2:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:AF1","text":"Excessive claim to virtue → reattachment to forces and probability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:AF2","text":"Reattachment to origin → genealogical condition of ascent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:AF3","text":"Genealogical vices → contradiction of self-prescribed holiness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:AF4","text":"Institution of holiness → exposure of the sign as inadequate transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:AF5","text":"Solitude → intensification of what is brought into it → emergence of inner animality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:AF6","text":"External desert sanctity → collapse of the claim to purity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:ME1","text":"Virtue is displaced from a normative height to the level of force, origin, and probability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:ME2","text":"Genealogy is transformed from background or fate into an operative criterion of self-evaluation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:ME3","text":"Asceticism is classified not according to its institution, but according to its capacity for drive-transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:ME4","text":"Solitude is remapped from a space of purity into an amplifier of already existing dispositions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:ME5","text":"Holiness and impurity become legible no longer as opposites, but as simultaneously occurring layers of the same figure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:ALT1","text":"Surface — The text is directed against excessive claims to virtue, chastity, and holiness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:ALT2","text":"Structural — Genealogy, instinctual ground, institutional form, and solitude determine the scope of such claims.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text replaces moral self-prescription with an examination of the conditions under which self-surpassing becomes credible or contradictory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The subject appears as a temporally and genealogically sedimented constellation of forces, not as an origin of itself without presuppositions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from genealogical limitation to ascetic dismantling and the diagnosis of solitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether inherited forces merely set conditions or fundamentally limit the possibility of genuine transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as holiness is treated as a claim and not as an actually possible transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:MRT4","text":"Its strongest operation is the reversal of external signs of purity into indicators of possible inner repression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:MRT5","text":"A tension remains between the call for self-limitation and the presupposed possibility of continuing or augmenting paternal virtue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:MRT6","text":"A further tension exists between the claim that solitude intensifies what is found and the implicit question whether solitude might nevertheless make transformation possible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_13_2:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument insofar as the polemical imagery is read as an instrument of classification and not as an independent demonstration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_13_2:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_13_2@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_13_2:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On the Higher Man","source_section_label":"13.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Four and Last"],"reading_title":"On the Higher Man · 13","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","On the Higher Man","13."],"original_title":"13."}],"source_title_context":"Vom höheren Menschen","source_section_label":"13.","source_title_hierarchy":["Vierter und letzter Theil"],"reading_title":"On the Higher Man · 13","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","On the Higher Man","13."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 152","title":"On the Higher Man · 13","context":"Part Four and Last","original_context":"Vierter und letzter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Vom höheren Menschen · 13"},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2","layer":"CH","title":"On the Higher Man · 14","order":153,"parents":["RAW_97E9_14_2"],"revision":"CH_97E9_14_2@R001","sha256":"cd6a3ddd3001982fd3a607e110f149943b6f87b37e99a9152b3d2ecc38515527","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:AS1","text":"Das zentrale Problem ist die Identifikation eines misslungenen Wurfs mit dem Scheitern des Spielers, des Menschen oder der Menschheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:AS2","text":"Die beschämte Reaktion der „höheren Menschen“ wird als Folge einer misslungenen Selbstdeutung bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:AS3","text":"Der Text ersetzt die moralische Logik des Misslingens durch die spielerische Logik von Wurf, Spott und Wiederaufnahme.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:AS4","text":"Ein misslungenes Großes wird von der Identität des Handelnden und vom Status des Menschen unterschieden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:AS5","text":"Die entscheidende Fähigkeit besteht nicht im ununterbrochenen Gelingen, sondern im Erlernen einer angemessenen Reaktion auf das Misslingen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:AS6","text":"Die Argumentbewegung führt vom misslungenen Wurf über die Entkopplung von Ereignis und Identität zur Aufforderung, erneut aufzustehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:A1","text":"Ein großer Versuch kann misslingen, ohne dass daraus unmittelbar das Scheitern seines Urhebers folgt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:A2","text":"Das Scheitern eines Urhebers ist nicht identisch mit dem Scheitern des Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:A3","text":"Misslingen erzeugt bei den „höheren Menschen“ Scheu, Scham und Ungeschicklichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:A4","text":"Diese Reaktion beruht auf einer unzureichenden Fähigkeit, mit Misslingen spielerisch umzugehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:A5","text":"Das menschliche Dasein wird als großer Tisch von Spiel und Spott gerahmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:A6","text":"Spiel und Spott sind erlernbare Formen des Umgangs mit misslungenen Würfen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:A7","text":"Die Bewertung eines misslungenen Wurfs darf nicht die gesamte Identität des Spielers bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:A8","text":"Selbst ein mögliches Scheitern des Menschen eröffnet noch die Möglichkeit des Aufstehens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:A9","text":"Der Wert des Spielers hängt nicht ausschließlich vom Gelingen einzelner Würfe ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:A10","text":"Aufstehen ist die angemessene operative Antwort auf die Feststellung menschlichen Misslingens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:NX1","text":"Ein misslungener großer Wurf ist nicht gleichbedeutend mit einem misslungenen Spieler.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:NX2","text":"Ein misslungener Spieler ist nicht gleichbedeutend mit einem misslungenen Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:NX3","text":"Scham ist kein gültiger Beweis für endgültiges Scheitern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:NX4","text":"Das Misslingen wird nicht als abschließendes Urteil behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:NX5","text":"Der Mensch wird nicht auf den Erfolg einer einzelnen Handlung reduziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:NX6","text":"Das Scheitern eines Menschen hebt die Möglichkeit weiterer Bewegung nicht auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:NX7","text":"Die Unfähigkeit zu spotten und zu spielen wird nicht als notwendige Folge des Misslingens akzeptiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:NX8","text":"Das Misslingen wird nicht in eine unveränderliche Identität überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:D1","text":"Der misslungene Wurf erzeugt nur dann eine umfassende Niederlage, wenn er identitär interpretiert wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_14_2:A1","CH_97E9_14_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:D2","text":"Scham bezeichnet nicht die objektive Größe des Scheiterns, sondern die fehlende Beherrschung seiner spielerischen Verarbeitung.","refs":["CH_97E9_14_2:A3","CH_97E9_14_2:A4","CH_97E9_14_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:D3","text":"Der gemeinsame Spieltisch verwandelt individuelles Misslingen in eine allgemeine Bedingung menschlicher Existenz.","refs":["CH_97E9_14_2:A5","CH_97E9_14_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:D4","text":"Die Frage nach dem Scheitern des Menschen wird durch die Unterscheidung zwischen Ereignis, Spieler und Mensch entkräftet.","refs":["CH_97E9_14_2:A1","CH_97E9_14_2:A2","CH_97E9_14_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:D5","text":"Die angemessene Reaktion auf Misslingen ist nicht Rückzug, sondern die Wiederaufnahme der Teilnahme.","refs":["CH_97E9_14_2:A5","CH_97E9_14_2:A6","CH_97E9_14_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:D6","text":"Die Möglichkeit des Aufstehens bleibt selbst dort erhalten, wo das menschliche Scheitern hypothetisch zugestanden wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_14_2:A8","CH_97E9_14_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:SD1","text":"Das System ersetzt eine vertikale Moral des Erfolgs und der Scham durch eine rekursive Praxis des Spielens, Scheiterns und erneuten Spielens.","refs":["CH_97E9_14_2:A1","CH_97E9_14_2:A4","CH_97E9_14_2:A5","CH_97E9_14_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:SD2","text":"Identität wird als nicht abschließend durch einzelne Handlungen bestimmt konstruiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_14_2:A1","CH_97E9_14_2:A2","CH_97E9_14_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:SD3","text":"Der Text macht die Fähigkeit zur Verarbeitung des Scheiterns zum eigentlichen Kriterium höherer menschlicher Existenz.","refs":["CH_97E9_14_2:A3","CH_97E9_14_2:A4","CH_97E9_14_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:SD4","text":"Die Anerkennung eines möglichen menschlichen Misslingens wird in eine nicht-resignative Bewegungsform überführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_14_2:A2","CH_97E9_14_2:A8","CH_97E9_14_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:DNX1","text":"Falsch ist die Annahme, dass der Wert eines Menschen durch die Bilanz seiner gelungenen Würfe abschließend bestimmbar sei.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:DNX2","text":"Falsch ist die Annahme, dass Scham eine notwendige oder angemessene Konsequenz des Misslingens darstellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird ein Modell, in dem der Mensch durch eine einzelne Niederlage ontologisch fixiert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Ordnung, in der das Misslingen den Abbruch weiterer Versuche rechtfertigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Trennung zwischen spielerischer Selbstrelativierung und ernsthafter menschlicher Existenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:DNX6","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Erfolgsordnung, die nur das Gelingen, nicht aber den Umgang mit dem Misslingen bewertet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:SNX1","text":"Der Text organisiert sich um die Abwesenheit eines endgültigen Urteils über den Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:SNX2","text":"Unzulässig wird eine Welt, in der ein misslungener Wurf keine Wiederaufnahme des Spiels mehr erlaubt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:SNX3","text":"Verneint wird die Möglichkeit, Scheitern ohne Rest in eine stabile Identität zu übersetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:SNX4","text":"Die versperrte Möglichkeit ist eine Existenz, deren Sinn vollständig vom Erfolg abhängt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:SNX5","text":"Die tiefste Negation richtet sich gegen die Vorstellung, dass menschliches Misslingen das letzte Wort besitzen könne.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:FGS1","text":"Misslungener großer Wurf → Scheu und Scham → Identifikation des Ereignisses mit dem Spieler.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:FGS2","text":"Identifikation des Ereignisses mit dem Spieler → drohende Identifikation des Spielers mit dem Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:FGS3","text":"Identifikationskette → Unterbrechung durch die Unterscheidung von Wurf, Spieler und Mensch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:FGS4","text":"Unterbrechung → Rahmung des menschlichen Daseins als Spiel- und Spottordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:FGS5","text":"Spiel- und Spottordnung → Forderung nach erlernter Selbstrelativierung gegenüber dem Misslingen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:FGS6","text":"Anerkanntes mögliches Menschenscheitern → imperative Wiederaufnahme der Bewegung: Aufstehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:AF1","text":"Misslungener Wurf → beschämter Rückzug → falsche Identifikation von Wurf und Spieler → falsche Identifikation von Spieler und Mensch → spielerische Neurahmung → Entkopplung von Misslingen und Endurteil → Aufstehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:ME1","text":"Der Gegensatz von Erfolg und Scheitern wird durch die Unterscheidung zwischen Wurf und Spieler reorganisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:ME2","text":"Scham wird von einem Wahrheitsindikator zu einem Symptom mangelnder Spielkompetenz umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:ME3","text":"Der einzelne misslungene Akt wird aus der individuellen Sphäre in eine allgemeine menschliche Spielordnung überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:ME4","text":"Die Kategorie des Scheiterns wird von einem Endzustand zu einer Phase innerhalb einer wiederaufnehmbaren Praxis umgezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:ME5","text":"Das Verhältnis von Ernst und Spott wird nicht als Gegensatz, sondern als operative Einheit der Krisenbewältigung kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:ME6","text":"„Höherer Mensch“ bezeichnet weniger eine Erfolgsgestalt als eine Figur, an der sich die Unfähigkeit zur Verarbeitung des Misslingens zeigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:ALT1","text":"Surface — Ein misslungener Sprung oder Wurf führt zu Scheu, Scham und Rückzug.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:ALT2","text":"Structural — Das System unterscheidet zwischen Handlung, Handelndem und der Gattung „Mensch“, um eine Kaskade identitärer Verallgemeinerungen zu blockieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Umgang mit Niederlage wird vom passiven Erleiden auf das Erlernen von Spiel, Spott und erneuter Teilnahme umgestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Menschliches Scheitern ist kein endgültiger Seinszustand; es bleibt in eine offene Folge möglicher Bewegungen eingebettet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die zentrale Entkopplung von misslungenem Wurf, Spieler und Mensch zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:MRT2","text":"Die Axiome erklären die Umwandlung von Scham in eine Frage der Spielkompetenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, was genau „höhere Menschen“ gegenüber gewöhnlichen Menschen auszeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:MRT4","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt ebenfalls, ob „Spott“ Selbstironie, soziale Entlastung oder eine umfassendere Existenzform bezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:MRT5","text":"Intern kohärent ist die Struktur in der Zurückweisung einer identitären Scheiternslogik.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:MRT6","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen der Relativierung des Scheiterns und der uneingeschränkten Imperativform des Aufstehens bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die Bewegung des Textes, sofern das abschließende „wohlauf“ als operative Öffnung und nicht als Beweis für bereits erfolgte Überwindung gelesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T184811479157Z_638e0ba5","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"14.","source_sha256":"cd6a3ddd3001982fd3a607e110f149943b6f87b37e99a9152b3d2ecc38515527","sha256":"1763ba9415e72377f87f3048c9bbee6ffb519a5e11faa7ab5a0064a5b17b3476","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T18:48:11.482165+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:AS1","text":"The central problem is the identification of a failed throw with the failure of the player, the human being, or humanity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:AS2","text":"The ashamed reaction of the “higher human beings” is determined as the consequence of a failed self-interpretation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:AS3","text":"The text replaces the moral logic of failure with the playful logic of throw, mockery, and resumption.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:AS4","text":"A failed great act is distinguished from the identity of the agent and from the status of the human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:AS5","text":"The decisive capacity consists not in uninterrupted success, but in learning an appropriate response to failure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:AS6","text":"The movement of the argument leads from the failed throw, through the decoupling of event and identity, to the summons to rise again.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:A1","text":"A great attempt can fail without this immediately entailing the failure of its author.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:A2","text":"The failure of an author is not identical with the failure of the human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:A3","text":"Failure produces reserve, shame, and awkwardness in the “higher human beings”.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:A4","text":"This reaction rests on an insufficient capacity to deal playfully with failure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:A5","text":"Human existence is framed as a great table of play and mockery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:A6","text":"Play and mockery are learnable forms of dealing with failed throws.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:A7","text":"The assessment of a failed throw must not determine the entire identity of the player.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:A8","text":"Even a possible failure of the human being still opens the possibility of rising.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:A9","text":"The value of the player does not depend exclusively on the success of individual throws.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:A10","text":"Rising is the appropriate operative response to the determination of human failure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:NX1","text":"A failed great throw is not equivalent to a failed player.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:NX2","text":"A failed player is not equivalent to a failed human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:NX3","text":"Shame is not a valid proof of definitive failure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:NX4","text":"Failure is not treated as a final judgment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:NX5","text":"The human being is not reduced to the success of a single action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:NX6","text":"The failure of a human being does not abolish the possibility of further movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:NX7","text":"The inability to mock and to play is not accepted as a necessary consequence of failure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:NX8","text":"Failure is not converted into an unchangeable identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:D1","text":"The failed throw produces a comprehensive defeat only when it is interpreted identitarily.","refs":["CH_97E9_14_2:A1","CH_97E9_14_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:D2","text":"Shame does not designate the objective magnitude of failure, but the lacking mastery of its playful processing.","refs":["CH_97E9_14_2:A3","CH_97E9_14_2:A4","CH_97E9_14_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:D3","text":"The shared gaming table transforms individual failure into a general condition of human existence.","refs":["CH_97E9_14_2:A5","CH_97E9_14_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:D4","text":"The question of the failure of the human being is weakened by the distinction between event, player, and human being.","refs":["CH_97E9_14_2:A1","CH_97E9_14_2:A2","CH_97E9_14_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:D5","text":"The appropriate reaction to failure is not withdrawal, but the resumption of participation.","refs":["CH_97E9_14_2:A5","CH_97E9_14_2:A6","CH_97E9_14_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:D6","text":"The possibility of rising remains preserved even where human failure is hypothetically conceded.","refs":["CH_97E9_14_2:A8","CH_97E9_14_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:SD1","text":"The system replaces a vertical morality of success and shame with a recursive practice of playing, failing, and playing anew.","refs":["CH_97E9_14_2:A1","CH_97E9_14_2:A4","CH_97E9_14_2:A5","CH_97E9_14_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:SD2","text":"Identity is constructed as not conclusively determined by individual actions.","refs":["CH_97E9_14_2:A1","CH_97E9_14_2:A2","CH_97E9_14_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:SD3","text":"The text makes the capacity to process failure the actual criterion of higher human existence.","refs":["CH_97E9_14_2:A3","CH_97E9_14_2:A4","CH_97E9_14_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:SD4","text":"The acknowledgment of a possible human failure is transferred into a non-resigned form of movement.","refs":["CH_97E9_14_2:A2","CH_97E9_14_2:A8","CH_97E9_14_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:DNX1","text":"False is the assumption that the value of a human being can be conclusively determined by the balance sheet of his successful throws.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:DNX2","text":"False is the assumption that shame constitutes a necessary or appropriate consequence of failure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a model in which the human being is ontologically fixed by a single defeat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:DNX4","text":"Excluded is an order in which failure justifies abandoning further attempts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:DNX5","text":"Excluded is the separation between playful self-relativization and serious human existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:DNX6","text":"Excluded is an order of success that evaluates only success, but not the handling of failure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:SNX1","text":"The text organizes itself around the absence of a final judgment upon the human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:SNX2","text":"A world in which a failed throw no longer permits the resumption of play becomes inadmissible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:SNX3","text":"The possibility of translating failure without remainder into a stable identity is negated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:SNX4","text":"The barred possibility is an existence whose meaning depends entirely on success.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:SNX5","text":"The deepest negation is directed against the idea that human failure could have the last word.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:FGS1","text":"Failed great throw → reserve and shame → identification of the event with the player.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:FGS2","text":"Identification of the event with the player → impending identification of the player with the human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:FGS3","text":"Chain of identification → interruption through the distinction between throw, player, and human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:FGS4","text":"Interruption → framing of human existence as an order of play and mockery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:FGS5","text":"Order of play and mockery → demand for learned self-relativization with respect to failure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:FGS6","text":"Acknowledged possible failure of the human being → imperative resumption of movement: rise.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:AF1","text":"Failed throw → ashamed withdrawal → false identification of throw and player → false identification of player and human being → playful reframing → decoupling of failure and final judgment → rising.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:ME1","text":"The opposition of success and failure is reorganized through the distinction between throw and player.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:ME2","text":"Shame is reclassified from an indicator of truth into a symptom of deficient competence in play.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:ME3","text":"The individual failed act is transferred from the individual sphere into a general human order of play.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:ME4","text":"The category of failure is redrawn from a final state into a phase within a resumable practice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:ME5","text":"The relation between seriousness and mockery is mapped not as an opposition, but as an operative unity of crisis management.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:ME6","text":"“Higher human being” designates less a figure of success than a figure in which the inability to process failure becomes manifest.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:ALT1","text":"Surface — A failed leap or throw leads to reserve, shame, and withdrawal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:ALT2","text":"Structural — The system distinguishes between action, agent, and the species “human being” in order to block a cascade of identitary generalizations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The handling of defeat is shifted from passive suffering to the learning of play, mockery, and renewed participation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Human failure is not a final state of being; it remains embedded in an open sequence of possible movements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the central decoupling of failed throw, player, and human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:MRT2","text":"The axioms explain the transformation of shame into a question of competence in play.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:MRT3","text":"What precisely distinguishes “higher human beings” from ordinary human beings remains underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:MRT4","text":"Likewise underdetermined is whether “mockery” designates self-irony, social relief, or a more comprehensive form of existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:MRT5","text":"The structure is internally coherent in its rejection of an identitary logic of failure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:MRT6","text":"A tension remains between the relativization of failure and the unrestricted imperative form of rising.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_14_2:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the movement of the text insofar as the concluding “wohlauf” is read as an operative opening and not as proof of an already accomplished overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_14_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_14_2@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_14_2:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On the Higher Man","source_section_label":"14.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Four and Last"],"reading_title":"On the Higher Man · 14","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","On the Higher Man","14."],"original_title":"14."}],"source_title_context":"Vom höheren Menschen","source_section_label":"14.","source_title_hierarchy":["Vierter und letzter Theil"],"reading_title":"On the Higher Man · 14","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","On the Higher Man","14."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 153","title":"On the Higher Man · 14","context":"Part Four and Last","original_context":"Vierter und letzter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Vom höheren Menschen · 14"},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2","layer":"CH","title":"On the Higher Man · 15","order":154,"parents":["RAW_97E9_15_2"],"revision":"CH_97E9_15_2@R001","sha256":"18108eff184bb2985db87c768e1f727e89b9233790aca568f153250b67eba762","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:AS1","text":"Die Steigerung der Art vermindert ihre Häufigkeit und erzeugt die Figur des seltenen höheren Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:AS2","text":"Der höhere Mensch erscheint als missgeraten, halb geraten und halb zerbrochen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:AS3","text":"Diese Unvollkommenheit wird nicht als endgültige Verfehlung, sondern als Zusammenstoß noch möglicher Kräfte bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:AS4","text":"Die im Menschen drängenden Zukunftskräfte können einander so stark widerstreiten, dass ihre Einheit zerbricht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:AS5","text":"Die angemessene Haltung zu diesem Zerbrechen ist heiterer Mut und das Erlernen des Lachens über sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:AS6","text":"Die Existenz kleiner, guter und vollkommener Dinge liefert eine lokale Form gelungener Gestalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:AS7","text":"Durch die Umstellung solcher Vollkommenheiten wird Unvollkommenheit nicht aufgehoben, aber in Hoffnung und Heilung überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:A1","text":"Je höher die Art, desto seltener ist das Ding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:A2","text":"Die höheren Menschen sind nicht vollständig geraten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:A3","text":"Im höheren Menschen bestehen weiterhin zahlreiche Möglichkeiten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:A4","text":"In ihm stoßen Zukunft, Tiefe, Ferne, Höhe und Kraft gegeneinander.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:A5","text":"Eine übermäßige innere Spannung kann die tragende Einheit zerbrechen lassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:A6","text":"Über sich selbst zu lachen ist eine notwendige Antwort auf die eigene Unvollkommenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:A7","text":"Die Erde enthält kleine, gute und vollkommene Dinge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:A8","text":"Vollkommenheit heilt das Herz und lehrt hoffen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:A9","text":"Das Missgeratene bleibt trotz seines Bruchs zukunftsoffen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:NX1","text":"Der höhere Mensch ist nicht als bereits vollendetes Wesen definiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:NX2","text":"Missgeratenheit ist nicht mit endgültiger Unmöglichkeit gleichgesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:NX3","text":"Innere Vielheit ist nicht als harmonische Einheit vorausgesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:NX4","text":"Zerbrechen ist nicht der Beweis völliger Wertlosigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:NX5","text":"Hoffnung entsteht nicht aus der Abwesenheit von Mangel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:NX6","text":"Vollkommenheit wird nicht als ausschließlich großmaßstäbliche oder totale Gestalt verstanden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:NX7","text":"Die angemessene Reaktion ist nicht Klage, Resignation oder Selbstverurteilung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:D1","text":"Die Seltenheit des Höheren macht seine Unvollkommenheit erwartbar, ohne sie dadurch zu rechtfertigen.","refs":["CH_97E9_15_2:A1","CH_97E9_15_2:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:D2","text":"Die Unvollkommenheit des höheren Menschen bezeichnet ein Übermaß konkurrierender Möglichkeiten und nicht bloß einen Mangel an Fähigkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_15_2:A3","CH_97E9_15_2:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:D3","text":"Das Zerbrechen ist eine mögliche Folge innerer Überfülle.","refs":["CH_97E9_15_2:A4","CH_97E9_15_2:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:D4","text":"Lachen verwandelt die Wahrnehmung des eigenen Missratens von einer Anklage in eine tragbare Distanz.","refs":["CH_97E9_15_2:A2","CH_97E9_15_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:D5","text":"Kleine vollkommene Dinge fungieren als erreichbare Gegenformen zur gebrochenen Ganzheit des höheren Menschen.","refs":["CH_97E9_15_2:A2","CH_97E9_15_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:D6","text":"Hoffnung wird durch vorhandene partielle Vollkommenheit erzeugt, nicht durch die Behauptung bereits verwirklichter menschlicher Vollkommenheit.","refs":["CH_97E9_15_2:A7","CH_97E9_15_2:A8","CH_97E9_15_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:SD1","text":"Das höhere Menschliche wird als instabile Übergangsform zwischen Überfülle und Gestalt bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_15_2:A1","CH_97E9_15_2:A2","CH_97E9_15_2:A3","CH_97E9_15_2:A4","CH_97E9_15_2:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:SD2","text":"Der Bruch erhält eine doppelte Funktion: Er bezeichnet die Gefährdung des Höheren und bewahrt zugleich dessen Möglichkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_15_2:A5","CH_97E9_15_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:SD3","text":"Selbstlachen und das Umstellen kleiner Vollkommenheiten bilden zusammen eine Strategie, die innere Zersplitterung in Zukunftsfähigkeit überführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_15_2:A6","CH_97E9_15_2:A7","CH_97E9_15_2:A8","CH_97E9_15_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:SD4","text":"Die globale Überforderung des Menschen wird durch lokale Formen des Gelingens beantwortet.","refs":["CH_97E9_15_2:A4","CH_97E9_15_2:A7","CH_97E9_15_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:SD5","text":"Das System ersetzt die Forderung nach vollendeter Ganzheit durch eine Anordnung begrenzter Vollkommenheiten.","refs":["CH_97E9_15_2:A2","CH_97E9_15_2:A7","CH_97E9_15_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass menschliche Größe durch bereits erreichte Geschlossenheit bestimmt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:DNX2","text":"Es schließt aus, dass Zukunft aus konfliktloser innerer Ordnung hervorgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:DNX3","text":"Es schließt aus, dass ein zerbrochenes Gefäß nur als unbrauchbarer Rest gelesen werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:DNX4","text":"Es schließt aus, dass Hoffnung eine vollständige Lösung der menschlichen Spannung voraussetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:DNX5","text":"Es schließt aus, dass Vollkommenheit nur im Maßstab des Ganzen oder des Außergewöhnlichen vorkommt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:DNX6","text":"Es schließt aus, dass Selbsternst die angemessene Form höherer Selbstbeziehung ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:SNX1","text":"Abwesend bleibt ein stabiler höherer Mensch, der seine Kräfte ohne Bruch vereinigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:SNX2","text":"Unverfügbar bleibt eine Zukunft, die ohne Reibung, Überforderung und Selbstumbildung entsteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0005","trace_type":"Struct