[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der höhere Mensch wird als selten, missgeraten, halb geraten und halb zerbrochen angesprochen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die innere Überlagerung verschiedener Kräfte erzeugt Spannung, Instabilität und mögliche Desintegration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Selbstlachen und die Anordnung kleiner Vollkommenheiten bilden die vorgeschlagene Praxis des Umgangs mit dieser Instabilität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Menschliche Identität erscheint als unvollständiger Übergang, dessen Zukunft aus der Spannung zwischen noch nicht vereinigten Möglichkeiten hervorgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den Übergang von Seltenheit über Missgeratenheit und Zerbrechen zu Hoffnung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie die kleinen vollkommenen Dinge konkret beschaffen sind und wie ihre Anordnung praktisch erfolgt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:MRT3","text":"Intern kohärent ist die Struktur dort, wo Missgeratenheit als offene, nicht endgültige Gestalt behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung besteht zwischen innerer Überfülle, Zerbrechlichkeit und Zukunftsoffenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:MRT5","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen der Forderung nach Selbstlachen und der normativen Aufforderung, vollkommene Dinge um sich zu stellen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:MRT6","text":"Eine zweite Spannung bleibt zwischen der Diagnose des höheren Menschen als zerbrochenem Gefäß und der Erwartung, dass gerade diese Figur Zukunft trägt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, sofern sie Vollkommenheit nicht als Aufhebung des Bruchs, sondern als lokale Bedingung der Hoffnung behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T184908074057Z_d1c469a2","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"15.","source_sha256":"18108eff184bb2985db87c768e1f727e89b9233790aca568f153250b67eba762","sha256":"922b508154134e58ef23d04afcc48a74c1ba827926fcc679f43ec94793a2238a","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T18:49:08.075133+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:AS1","text":"The elevation of the type diminishes its frequency and produces the figure of the rare higher human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:AS2","text":"The higher human being appears as malformed, half well-formed and half broken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:AS3","text":"This imperfection is determined not as definitive failure, but as a collision of still-possible forces.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:AS4","text":"The forces of the future pressing within the human being can oppose one another so strongly that their unity breaks apart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:AS5","text":"The appropriate attitude toward this breaking apart is cheerful courage and learning to laugh at oneself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:AS6","text":"The existence of small, good, and perfect things provides a local form of successful formation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:AS7","text":"Through the arrangement of such perfections, imperfection is not abolished, but transformed into hope and healing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:A1","text":"The higher the type, the rarer the thing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:A2","text":"The higher human beings are not completely well-formed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:A3","text":"Numerous possibilities continue to exist in the higher human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:A4","text":"Within him, future, depth, distance, height, and force collide with one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:A5","text":"An excessive inner tension can cause the supporting unity to break apart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:A6","text":"Laughing at oneself is a necessary response to one's own imperfection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:A7","text":"The earth contains small, good, and perfect things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:A8","text":"Perfection heals the heart and teaches hope.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:A9","text":"The malformed remains open to the future despite its break.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:NX1","text":"The higher human being is not defined as an already completed being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:NX2","text":"Malformedness is not equated with definitive impossibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:NX3","text":"Inner multiplicity is not presupposed as a harmonious unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:NX4","text":"Breaking apart is not proof of complete worthlessness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:NX5","text":"Hope does not arise from the absence of deficiency.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:NX6","text":"Perfection is not understood as an exclusively large-scale or total form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:NX7","text":"The appropriate reaction is not lamentation, resignation, or self-condemnation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:D1","text":"The rarity of the higher makes its imperfection expectable, without thereby justifying it.","refs":["CH_97E9_15_2:A1","CH_97E9_15_2:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:D2","text":"The imperfection of the higher human being denotes an excess of competing possibilities and not merely a lack of ability.","refs":["CH_97E9_15_2:A3","CH_97E9_15_2:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:D3","text":"Breaking apart is a possible consequence of inner plenitude.","refs":["CH_97E9_15_2:A4","CH_97E9_15_2:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:D4","text":"Laughter transforms the perception of one's own malformedness from an accusation into a bearable distance.","refs":["CH_97E9_15_2:A2","CH_97E9_15_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:D5","text":"Small perfect things function as attainable counter-forms to the broken wholeness of the higher human being.","refs":["CH_97E9_15_2:A2","CH_97E9_15_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:D6","text":"Hope is generated by existing partial perfection, not by the assertion of already actualized human perfection.","refs":["CH_97E9_15_2:A7","CH_97E9_15_2:A8","CH_97E9_15_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:SD1","text":"The higher human is determined as an unstable transitional form between plenitude and form.","refs":["CH_97E9_15_2:A1","CH_97E9_15_2:A2","CH_97E9_15_2:A3","CH_97E9_15_2:A4","CH_97E9_15_2:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:SD2","text":"The break receives a double function: it designates the endangerment of the higher and at the same time preserves its possibility.","refs":["CH_97E9_15_2:A5","CH_97E9_15_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:SD3","text":"Self-laughter and the arrangement of small perfections together constitute a strategy that transforms inner fragmentation into capacity for the future.","refs":["CH_97E9_15_2:A6","CH_97E9_15_2:A7","CH_97E9_15_2:A8","CH_97E9_15_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:SD4","text":"The human being's global overburdening is answered through local forms of success.","refs":["CH_97E9_15_2:A4","CH_97E9_15_2:A7","CH_97E9_15_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:SD5","text":"The system replaces the demand for completed wholeness with an arrangement of limited perfections.","refs":["CH_97E9_15_2:A2","CH_97E9_15_2:A7","CH_97E9_15_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:DNX1","text":"The system excludes the determination of human greatness through already attained closure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:DNX2","text":"It excludes the emergence of the future from a conflict-free inner order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:DNX3","text":"It excludes the possibility that a broken vessel can be read only as an unusable remnant.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:DNX4","text":"It excludes the presupposition that hope requires a complete solution to human tension.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:DNX5","text":"It excludes the occurrence of perfection only at the scale of the whole or the extraordinary.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:DNX6","text":"It excludes self-seriousness as the appropriate form of higher self-relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:SNX1","text":"Absent remains a stable higher human being who unites his forces without break.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:SNX2","text":"Unavailable remains a future that arises without friction, overburdening, and self-transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:SNX3","text":"The expectation of a definitive total human form becomes impermissible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:SNX4","text":"The possibility of a purely negative diagnosis of malformedness is blocked.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:SNX5","text":"The text organizes itself around the absence of a great perfection and replaces it with dispersed, attainable perfections.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:FGS1","text":"Rarity of the higher → malformedness of the higher human being → persistence of numerous possibilities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:FGS2","text":"Superimposition of distance, depth, future, height, and force → inner collision → possibility of breaking apart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:FGS3","text":"Fragility → self-laughter instead of self-condemnation → preservation of courage and mobility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:FGS4","text":"Existing small perfections → external arrangement around the higher human being → healing of the heart and generation of hope.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:FGS5","text":"No abolition of tension → local stabilization through perfection → keeping the human future open.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:AF1","text":"Rarity of the higher → diagnosis of malformedness → redefinition of the break as an excess of colliding possibilities → laughter as operative distance → small perfections as counter-order → hope for further formation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:ME1","text":"Malformedness is remapped from a final judgment into a transitional diagnosis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:ME2","text":"Breaking apart is classified at once as endangerment and as an indication of excessive future possibilities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:ME3","text":"Perfection is shifted from a total human property into a local, concrete, and surrounding form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:ME4","text":"Laughter becomes visible as a structural technique of self-relief and preservation of the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:ME5","text":"Hope is bound not to the elimination of the break, but to the presence of limited successful forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:ME6","text":"The opposition between imperfection and perfection is replaced by a gradation: broken human being, small perfect things, open future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:ALT1","text":"Surface — The higher human being is addressed as rare, malformed, half well-formed, and half broken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:ALT2","text":"Structural — The inner superimposition of different forces produces tension, instability, and possible disintegration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Self-laughter and the arrangement of small perfections constitute the proposed practice for dealing with this instability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Human identity appears as an incomplete transition whose future emerges from the tension between possibilities not yet united.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the transition from rarity through malformedness and breaking apart to hope.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is the concrete constitution of the small perfect things and how their arrangement occurs in practice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent where malformedness is treated as an open, non-definitive form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:MRT4","text":"The strongest connection exists between inner plenitude, fragility, and openness to the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:MRT5","text":"A tension remains between the demand for self-laughter and the normative injunction to place perfect things around oneself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:MRT6","text":"A second tension remains between the diagnosis of the higher human being as a broken vessel and the expectation that precisely this figure bears the future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_15_2:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement insofar as it treats perfection not as the abolition of the break, but as a local condition of hope.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_15_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_15_2@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_15_2:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On the Higher Man","source_section_label":"15.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Four and Last"],"reading_title":"On the Higher Man · 15","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","On the Higher Man","15."],"original_title":"15."}],"source_title_context":"Vom höheren Menschen","source_section_label":"15.","source_title_hierarchy":["Vierter und letzter Theil"],"reading_title":"On the Higher Man · 15","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","On the Higher Man","15."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 154","title":"On the Higher Man · 15","context":"Part Four and Last","original_context":"Vierter und letzter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Vom höheren Menschen · 15"},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2","layer":"CH","title":"On the Higher Man · 16","order":155,"parents":["RAW_97E9_16_2"],"revision":"CH_97E9_16_2@R001","sha256":"4b5641cf36a683d71d2128eecf2510c488dbe5e7cf52e0d8ec6331b5f8337f9c","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:AS1","text":"Der Text problematisiert die Verurteilung des irdischen Lachens als vermeintlich größte Sünde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:AS2","text":"Die Verurteilung wird von einer behaupteten Gottesrede zu einem Symptom unzureichender Liebe umbestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:AS3","text":"Die Abwertung des Lebens erscheint als Folge von Hass, Zorn und gekränktem Anspruch auf Gegenliebe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:AS4","text":"Der moralische Absolutismus wird als plebejische, kranke und lebensfeindliche Haltung diagnostiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:AS5","text":"Aus der Diagnose folgt die strategische Bewegung, allen Unbedingten auszuweichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:AS6","text":"Leichtigkeit, Tanzfähigkeit und das Auffinden irdischer Gründe zum Lachen bilden den impliziten Gegenmaßstab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:A1","text":"Das irdische Lachen ist kein hinreichender Grund für Verdammung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:A2","text":"Wer auf Erden keine Gründe zum Lachen findet, sucht schlecht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:A3","text":"Unzureichende Liebe zeigt sich als Hass gegenüber den Lachenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:A4","text":"Der Fluch gegen die Nichtgeliebten entspringt einem Anspruch auf Gegenliebe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:A5","text":"Unbedingtheit verbindet moralische Verurteilung mit plebejischer Perspektive.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:A6","text":"Die Abwertung des Lachens ist eine Abwertung der Erde und des Lebens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:A7","text":"Gekränkter Zorn über ausbleibende Liebe widerspricht großer Liebe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:A8","text":"Große Liebe verlangt mehr als bloße Erwiderung von Liebe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:A9","text":"Schwere Füße und schwüle Herzen bezeichnen eine Unfähigkeit zum Tanz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:A10","text":"Ein Kind kann auf der Erde noch Gründe zum Lachen finden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:A11","text":"Tanzfähigkeit bezeichnet eine leichtere, lebensbejahende Beziehung zur Erde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:A12","text":"Unbedingte Lebensverneinung rechtfertigt Abstand und Vermeidung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:NX1","text":"Das Lachen auf der Erde ist nicht als größte Sünde zugelassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:NX2","text":"Mangelnde Liebe wird nicht als Rechtfertigung für Fluch und Verdammung anerkannt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:NX3","text":"Unbedingtheit gilt nicht als Zeichen höherer moralischer Wahrheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:NX4","text":"Die Nicht-Erwiderung von Liebe darf nicht in Hass gegen die Nichtliebenden umschlagen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:NX5","text":"Die Erde darf nicht unter einem bösen Blick als verwerflich erscheinen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:NX6","text":"Schwere und Schwüle gelten nicht als ausreichende Grundlage für den Umgang mit dem Leben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:NX7","text":"Moralische Strenge wird nicht mit großer Liebe gleichgesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:NX8","text":"Das Unbedingte wird nicht als tragfähige Lebensform behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:D1","text":"Die Verurteilung des Lachens fungiert als Indikator eines misslungenen Suchens nach Lebensgründen.","refs":["CH_97E9_16_2:A1","CH_97E9_16_2:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:D2","text":"Die Verdammung der Lachenden enthüllt einen Mangel an Liebe statt eine höhere Form von Liebe.","refs":["CH_97E9_16_2:A3","CH_97E9_16_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:D3","text":"Der Fluch gegen die Nichtliebenden verwandelt persönliche Kränkung in allgemeine moralische Drohung.","refs":["CH_97E9_16_2:A4","CH_97E9_16_2:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:D4","text":"Der böse Blick auf die Erde ist die weltanschauliche Form eines affektiven Defizits.","refs":["CH_97E9_16_2:A3","CH_97E9_16_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:D5","text":"Unbedingtheit erzeugt eine Haltung, die Gegenliebe erzwingen will, obwohl sie große Liebe beansprucht.","refs":["CH_97E9_16_2:A4","CH_97E9_16_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:D6","text":"Tanzfähigkeit fungiert als negatives Diagnosekriterium gegenüber Schwere und Lebensfeindschaft.","refs":["CH_97E9_16_2:A9","CH_97E9_16_2:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:D7","text":"Die kindliche Fähigkeit zum Lachen widerlegt die Behauptung, die Erde biete keine Gründe zur Freude.","refs":["CH_97E9_16_2:A2","CH_97E9_16_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:D8","text":"Aus der Diagnose des Unbedingten folgt keine Bekehrung, sondern die Vorschrift des Aus-dem-Wege-Gehens.","refs":["CH_97E9_16_2:A5","CH_97E9_16_2:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:SD1","text":"Moralische Verdammung wird als Kompensation für fehlende Lebensbejahung und verweigerte Gegenliebe lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:SD2","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Lachen und Verdammung wird in einen Gegensatz zwischen Tanzfähigkeit und affektiver Schwere überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:SD3","text":"Die beanspruchte Universalität des Unbedingten entlarvt sich als partikularer Ausdruck des Pöbels.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:SD4","text":"Lebensfeindschaft erscheint nicht primär als Irrtum über die Erde, sondern als körperlich-affektive Unfähigkeit, sie leicht zu nehmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:SD5","text":"Die angemessene Gegenstrategie besteht in Distanzierung statt in argumentativer Widerlegung oder Versöhnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:DNX1","text":"Der Text schließt stillschweigend aus, dass moralische Absolutheit aus einer höheren Erkenntnisquelle stammen muss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:DNX2","text":"Er schließt aus, dass fehlende Gegenliebe den Hass auf andere legitimiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:DNX3","text":"Er disqualifiziert die Gleichsetzung von Leiden, Ernst und Wahrheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:DNX4","text":"Er verwirft ein Menschenbild, in dem die Erde erst durch ihre Verneinung moralisch geordnet wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:DNX5","text":"Er schließt aus, dass die Unbedingtheit eines Urteils dessen Rang garantiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:DNX6","text":"Er behandelt die Unfähigkeit zum Lachen als strukturelles Defizit und nicht als bloße Geschmacksfrage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Moral, deren Wahrheitsanspruch auf der Abschaffung irdischer Freude beruht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:SNX2","text":"Versperrt wird die Möglichkeit, Hass und Fluch als Formen gesteigerter Liebe auszugeben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:SNX3","text":"Abwesend bleibt ein versöhnendes Modell zwischen dem Unbedingten und dem Leben; an seine Stelle tritt Vermeidung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:SNX4","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine transzendente Rechtfertigung der Erdverachtung, die den affektiven Ursprung des Urteils übersteigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:SNX5","text":"Die terminale Unmöglichkeit des Systems besteht darin, zugleich Gegenliebe zu verlangen und große Liebe zu verkörpern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:FGS1","text":"Fehlende Gründe zum Lachen → Behauptung der Verwerflichkeit des Lachens → moralische Verdammung der Lachenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:FGS2","text":"Verdammung der Lachenden → Diagnose unzureichender Liebe → Umkehrung des moralischen Wahrheitsanspruchs in ein affektives Defizit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:FGS3","text":"Affektives Defizit → gekränkter Anspruch auf Gegenliebe → Hass, Fluch und böser Blick auf die Erde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:FGS4","text":"Hass, Fluch und Erdverachtung → Klassifikation als plebejische Unbedingtheit → Ausschluss aus der positiven Lebensordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:FGS5","text":"Plebejische Unbedingtheit → Schwere, Schwüle und Tanzunfähigkeit → strategische Distanzierung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:FGS6","text":"Kindliches Lachen und Tanzfähigkeit → Gegenbeweis gegen Erdverneinung → Maßstab der Leichtigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:AF1","text":"Verdammung des irdischen Lachens → Prüfung der behaupteten Lebensgründe → Diagnose schlechten Suchens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:AF2","text":"Diagnose schlechten Suchens → Entlarvung unzureichender Liebe → Erklärung von Hass und Fluch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:AF3","text":"Hass und Fluch → Klassifikation als Unbedingtheit und Pöbelart → Verwerfung der Erdverachtung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:AF4","text":"Erdverachtung → Schwere und Tanzunfähigkeit → Aufforderung zum Aus-dem-Wege-Gehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:AF5","text":"Kindliches Lachen und Tanzfähigkeit → positive Gegenkartierung der Erde als leicht zugänglicher Lebensraum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:ME1","text":"Ein religiös-moralisches Urteil wird in eine Diagnose von Affekt, Geschmack und Suchfähigkeit umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:ME2","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Glauben und Unglauben wird durch den Gegensatz zwischen Erdverachtung und Tanzfähigkeit ersetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:ME3","text":"Der Anspruch auf moralische Höhe wird als plebejische Reaktionsform neu klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:ME4","text":"Lachen wird vom Zeichen der Sünde zum Prüfstein gelingender Erdbeziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:ME5","text":"Kritik wird nicht auf Widerlegung, sondern auf soziale und affektive Distanzierung ausgerichtet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:ME6","text":"Das Kind fungiert als Gegenfigur zur autoritativen Verdammung und als elementarer Beleg für verfügbare Lebensfreude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:ALT1","text":"Surface — Verurteilt wird das Lachen der Menschen auf der Erde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Verurteilung wird als Mechanismus aus Liebesmangel, Kränkung, Fluch und Erdverachtung rekonstruiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Gegen das Unbedingte wird nicht argumentativ vermittelt, sondern durch Vermeidung und Distanz Stellung bezogen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Die Erde erscheint als grundsätzlich zugänglicher Ort von Leichtigkeit; Lebensbejahung wird als körperliche Fähigkeit des Tanzens zeitlich gegen die fortwirkende Moral der Verdammung gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von der Verdammung des Lachens zur Diagnose der Lebensfeindschaft zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob die angegriffene Rede als göttliche Lehre, als Sprecherposition oder als exemplarische Moralfigur gilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:MRT3","text":"Intern kohärent ist die Kette aus Liebesmangel, gekränkter Gegenliebe, Fluch und Erdverachtung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Stelle liegt in der Umkehrung des moralischen Urteils in eine Diagnose seines affektiven Ursprungs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:MRT5","text":"Die Gegenposition der Leichtigkeit bleibt stärker bildlich als begrifflich bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:MRT6","text":"Eine Spannung besteht zwischen der Verwerfung des Unbedingten und der selbst unbedingt formulierten Aufforderung, allen Unbedingten aus dem Wege zu gehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:MRT7","text":"Eine weitere Spannung liegt zwischen der Kritik an gekränktem Liebesanspruch und der pauschalen Charakterisierung aller entsprechenden Figuren als Pöbelart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, sofern die Polemik als Diagnose und anschließende Exklusionsstrategie behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T184958198978Z_73ce6a3c","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"16.","source_sha256":"4b5641cf36a683d71d2128eecf2510c488dbe5e7cf52e0d8ec6331b5f8337f9c","sha256":"2b8bd4205bb5556ac3c5baee2cb2185f31c02550f64025197dcc6b8c11ed6812","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T18:49:58.199993+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:AS1","text":"The text problematizes the condemnation of earthly laughter as the supposedly greatest sin.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:AS2","text":"The condemnation is redefined from an alleged discourse of God into a symptom of inadequate love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:AS3","text":"The devaluation of life appears as a consequence of hatred, anger, and a wounded claim to love in return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:AS4","text":"Moral absolutism is diagnosed as a plebeian, sick, and life-hostile attitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:AS5","text":"From the diagnosis follows the strategic movement of avoiding all unconditional ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:AS6","text":"Lightness, the capacity for dance, and the finding of earthly reasons for laughter form the implicit countermeasure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:A1","text":"Earthly laughter is not a sufficient reason for damnation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:A2","text":"Whoever finds no reasons for laughter on earth seeks badly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:A3","text":"Inadequate love manifests itself as hatred toward those who laugh.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:A4","text":"The curse against the unloved springs from a claim to love in return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:A5","text":"Unconditionality connects moral condemnation with a plebeian perspective.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:A6","text":"The devaluation of laughter is a devaluation of the earth and of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:A7","text":"Wounded anger over absent love contradicts great love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:A8","text":"Great love demands more than the mere reciprocation of love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:A9","text":"Heavy feet and sultry hearts designate an incapacity for dance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:A10","text":"A child can still find reasons for laughter on earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:A11","text":"The capacity for dance designates a lighter, life-affirming relation to the earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:A12","text":"Unconditional negation of life justifies distance and avoidance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:NX1","text":"Laughter on earth is not admitted as the greatest sin.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:NX2","text":"Deficient love is not recognized as a justification for curse and damnation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:NX3","text":"Unconditionality does not count as a sign of higher moral truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:NX4","text":"The non-reciprocation of love must not turn into hatred against those who do not love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:NX5","text":"The earth must not appear reprehensible under an evil gaze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:NX6","text":"Heaviness and sultriness do not count as a sufficient basis for dealing with life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:NX7","text":"Moral severity is not equated with great love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:NX8","text":"The unconditional is not treated as a viable form of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:D1","text":"The condemnation of laughter functions as an indicator of a failed search for reasons for life.","refs":["CH_97E9_16_2:A1","CH_97E9_16_2:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:D2","text":"The damnation of those who laugh reveals a lack of love rather than a higher form of love.","refs":["CH_97E9_16_2:A3","CH_97E9_16_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:D3","text":"The curse against those who do not love transforms personal woundedness into a general moral threat.","refs":["CH_97E9_16_2:A4","CH_97E9_16_2:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:D4","text":"The evil gaze upon the earth is the worldview-form of an affective deficit.","refs":["CH_97E9_16_2:A3","CH_97E9_16_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:D5","text":"Unconditionality generates an attitude that seeks to compel love in return, although it lays claim to great love.","refs":["CH_97E9_16_2:A4","CH_97E9_16_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:D6","text":"The capacity for dance functions as a negative diagnostic criterion in relation to heaviness and hostility to life.","refs":["CH_97E9_16_2:A9","CH_97E9_16_2:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:D7","text":"The child's capacity for laughter refutes the assertion that the earth offers no reasons for joy.","refs":["CH_97E9_16_2:A2","CH_97E9_16_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:D8","text":"From the diagnosis of the unconditional follows not conversion, but the prescription of getting out of its way.","refs":["CH_97E9_16_2:A5","CH_97E9_16_2:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:SD1","text":"Moral damnation becomes legible as compensation for absent affirmation of life and refused love in return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:SD2","text":"The opposition between laughter and damnation is transferred into an opposition between the capacity for dance and affective heaviness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:SD3","text":"The claimed universality of the unconditional unmasks itself as a particular expression of the rabble.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:SD4","text":"Hostility to life appears not primarily as an error about the earth, but as a bodily-affective incapacity to take it lightly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:SD5","text":"The appropriate counterstrategy consists in distancing rather than in argumentative refutation or reconciliation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:DNX1","text":"The text tacitly excludes that moral absoluteness must stem from a higher source of knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:DNX2","text":"It excludes that absent love in return legitimates hatred of others.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:DNX3","text":"It disqualifies the equation of suffering, seriousness, and truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:DNX4","text":"It rejects an image of humanity in which the earth is morally ordered only through its negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:DNX5","text":"It excludes that the unconditionality of a judgment guarantees its rank.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:DNX6","text":"It treats the incapacity for laughter as a structural deficit and not as a mere matter of taste.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a morality whose claim to truth rests on the abolition of earthly joy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:SNX2","text":"The possibility of presenting hatred and curse as forms of intensified love is blocked.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:SNX3","text":"Absent remains a reconciling model between the unconditional and life; avoidance takes its place.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:SNX4","text":"Unavailable is a transcendent justification of contempt for the earth that surpasses the affective origin of the judgment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:SNX5","text":"The terminal impossibility of the system consists in demanding love in return while simultaneously embodying great love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:FGS1","text":"Absent reasons for laughter → assertion of the reprehensibility of laughter → moral damnation of those who laugh.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:FGS2","text":"Damnation of those who laugh → diagnosis of inadequate love → reversal of the moral claim to truth into an affective deficit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:FGS3","text":"Affective deficit → wounded claim to love in return → hatred, curse, and evil gaze upon the earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:FGS4","text":"Hatred, curse, and contempt for the earth → classification as plebeian unconditionality → exclusion from the positive order of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:FGS5","text":"Plebeian unconditionality → heaviness, sultriness, and incapacity for dance → strategic distancing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:FGS6","text":"Childlike laughter and the capacity for dance → counterproof against negation of the earth → criterion of lightness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:AF1","text":"Damnation of earthly laughter → examination of the alleged reasons for life → diagnosis of bad seeking.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:AF2","text":"Diagnosis of bad seeking → unmasking of inadequate love → explanation of hatred and curse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:AF3","text":"Hatred and curse → classification as unconditionality and rabble-type → rejection of contempt for the earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:AF4","text":"Contempt for the earth → heaviness and incapacity for dance → injunction to get out of the way.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:AF5","text":"Childlike laughter and the capacity for dance → positive counter-mapping of the earth as an easily accessible living space.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:ME1","text":"A religious-moral judgment is remapped into a diagnosis of affect, taste, and capacity for seeking.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:ME2","text":"The opposition between belief and unbelief is replaced by the opposition between contempt for the earth and the capacity for dance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:ME3","text":"The claim to moral elevation is reclassified as a plebeian reactive form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:ME4","text":"Laughter is transformed from the sign of sin into the touchstone of a successful relation to the earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:ME5","text":"Critique is oriented not toward refutation, but toward social and affective distancing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:ME6","text":"The child functions as a counterfigure to authoritative damnation and as elementary evidence for available joy in life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:ALT1","text":"Surface — What is condemned is the laughter of human beings on earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:ALT2","text":"Structural — The condemnation is reconstructed as a mechanism of lack of love, woundedness, curse, and contempt for the earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — A position against the unconditional is not taken through argumentative mediation, but through avoidance and distance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The earth appears as a fundamentally accessible place of lightness; affirmation of life is set temporally, as the bodily capacity for dancing, against the enduring morality of damnation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from the damnation of laughter to the diagnosis of hostility to life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether the attacked discourse counts as divine doctrine, as a speaker-position, or as an exemplary moral figure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:MRT3","text":"The chain of lack of love, wounded love in return, curse, and contempt for the earth is internally coherent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:MRT4","text":"The strongest point lies in the reversal of the moral judgment into a diagnosis of its affective origin.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:MRT5","text":"The counterposition of lightness remains determined more imagistically than conceptually.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:MRT6","text":"A tension exists between the rejection of the unconditional and the itself unconditionally formulated injunction to get out of the way of all unconditional ones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:MRT7","text":"A further tension lies between the critique of a wounded claim to love and the blanket characterization of all corresponding figures as a rabble-type.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_16_2:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement insofar as the polemic is treated as a diagnosis and subsequent strategy of exclusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_16_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_16_2@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_16_2:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On the Higher Man","source_section_label":"16.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Four and Last"],"reading_title":"On the Higher Man · 16","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","On the Higher Man","16."],"original_title":"16."}],"source_title_context":"Vom höheren Menschen","source_section_label":"16.","source_title_hierarchy":["Vierter und letzter Theil"],"reading_title":"On the Higher Man · 16","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","On the Higher Man","16."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 155","title":"On the Higher Man · 16","context":"Part Four and Last","original_context":"Vierter und letzter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Vom höheren Menschen · 16"},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2","layer":"CH","title":"On the Higher Man · 17","order":156,"parents":["RAW_97E9_17_2"],"revision":"CH_97E9_17_2@R001","sha256":"2e1f0a2621b8e00e3117bce8bff13010fecc5c5493f414e7dc26a9ea0e2f9f5e","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:AS1","text":"Das zentrale Problem ist, wie sich die Annäherung an ein Ziel in einer Bewegungsform zeigt, ohne in Stillstand überzugehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:AS2","text":"Das Ziel wird als Zustand gesteigerter Beweglichkeit, Leichtigkeit und körperlich vermittelter Freude neu bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:AS3","text":"Die Form des Gangs beweist, ob ein Wesen tatsächlich auf seiner Bahn fortschreitet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:AS4","text":"Zielnähe erzeugt nicht Versteinerung, sondern Tanz, Lachen und beschleunigte Bewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:AS5","text":"Schwere, Trübsal und Schlamm werden nicht beseitigt, sondern durch leichte Füße beweglich durchquert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:AS6","text":"Die abschließende Bewegung steigert sich von innerer Erhebung über körperliche Aktivierung zur Umkehrung der gewöhnlichen Oben-Unten-Ordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:A1","text":"Gute Dinge nähern sich ihrem Ziel in gekrümmter, nicht geradliniger Bewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:A2","text":"Zielnähe äußert sich als innere Freude und als Lachen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:A3","text":"Der Schritt macht den tatsächlichen Stand eines Wesens auf seiner Bahn sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:A4","text":"Die Annäherung an das Ziel verwandelt das Gehen in Tanzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:A5","text":"Zielerreichung ist nicht mit Erstarrung, Stumpfheit oder Versteinerung identisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:A6","text":"Geschwindes Laufen bewahrt die Bewegung gegen die Tendenz zum Standbild.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:A7","text":"Erdliche Schwere und Trübsal bilden ein widerständiges Bewegungsmilieu.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:A8","text":"Leichte Füße ermöglichen die Überquerung des Schlamms, ohne dessen Existenz aufzuheben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:A9","text":"Erhebung umfasst Herz und Beine zugleich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:A10","text":"Die höchste Bewegungsform kann in der Umkehrung der gewöhnlichen Körperordnung bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:NX1","text":"Zielnähe ist keine geradlinige, spannungslose Annäherung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:NX2","text":"Fortschritt ist kein bloßes Voranschreiten in aufrechter Linearität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:NX3","text":"Zielerreichung ist kein Stillstand im Standbild.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:NX4","text":"Vollendung ist weder Stumpfheit noch steinerne Dauer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:NX5","text":"Erhebung ist keine Abtrennung des Herzens von den Beinen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:NX6","text":"Leichtigkeit bedeutet nicht die Abwesenheit von Moor, Schlamm oder Trübsal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:NX7","text":"Tanz ist keine Flucht aus der Welt durch Aufhebung des Bodens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:D1","text":"Die Krümmung der Bewegung wird zum positiven Zeichen ihrer Zielgerichtetheit.","refs":["CH_97E9_17_2:A1","CH_97E9_17_2:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:D2","text":"Freude erscheint als diagnostischer Indikator einer erreichten Zielnähe.","refs":["CH_97E9_17_2:A2","CH_97E9_17_2:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:D3","text":"Die angemessene Form des Fortschritts ist eine gesteigerte Bewegungsintensität statt einer Reduktion auf Ankunft.","refs":["CH_97E9_17_2:A4","CH_97E9_17_2:A5","CH_97E9_17_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:D4","text":"Schwere wird nicht durch Negation, sondern durch eine veränderte Bewegungsqualität überwunden.","refs":["CH_97E9_17_2:A7","CH_97E9_17_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:D5","text":"Körperliche Beweglichkeit wird zur Bedingung geistiger Erhebung.","refs":["CH_97E9_17_2:A8","CH_97E9_17_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:D6","text":"Die Umkehrung der Körperordnung wird als gesteigerte, nicht als verlorene Orientierung lesbar.","refs":["CH_97E9_17_2:A9","CH_97E9_17_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:SD1","text":"Das System ersetzt das Modell der Vollendung durch ein Modell dauernder, lustvoller Beweglichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:SD2","text":"Zielgerichtete Bewegung wird nicht an Geradheit, sondern an ihrer Fähigkeit gemessen, Widerstand in Tanz zu transformieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:SD3","text":"Der Körper fungiert zugleich als Erkenntnisinstrument, Bewegungsmedium und Ort der Erhebung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:SD4","text":"Die höchste Form der Orientierung entsteht durch eine kontrollierte Umkehrung konventioneller Hierarchien.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:SD5","text":"Das System totalisiert Leichtigkeit als operative Kraft, ohne die Schwere der Welt ontologisch zu beseitigen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:DNX1","text":"Wahrer Fortschritt darf nicht an einer geraden Linie, einem festen Mittelpunkt oder einer stabilen Endposition gemessen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:DNX2","text":"Ein Ziel darf nicht als Zustand gedacht werden, in dem Bewegung ihren Sinn verliert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:DNX3","text":"Geistige Erhöhung darf nicht auf Kosten körperlicher Bewegungsfähigkeit erfolgen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:DNX4","text":"Widerstand darf nicht als Beweis des Scheiterns gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:DNX5","text":"Ordnung darf nicht mit aufrechter Körperstellung, Schwere oder Unbeweglichkeit gleichgesetzt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Möglichkeit einer Vollendung, deren Wahrheit in der Beendigung jeder Bewegung liegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Transzendenz, die den Körper, den Boden und die Beine als niedrige Sphären zurücklässt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Weltdeutung, in der Schlamm und Trübsal die letzte Macht über Bewegung besitzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Vorstellung, dass Orientierung nur durch stabile Vertikalität und unverkehrbare Ordnung möglich ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:FGS1","text":"Zielnähe + nichtlineare Bewegung → sichtbarer Schritt → diagnostizierte Bahnzugehörigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:FGS2","text":"Zielnähe + innere Freude → Lachen → affektive Bestätigung der Bewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:FGS3","text":"drohende Erstarrung → geschwindes Laufen → Erhalt der Bewegungsform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:FGS4","text":"Schlamm und Trübsal + leichte Füße → Überquerung des Widerstands → Tanz statt Untergang.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:FGS5","text":"Erhebung des Herzens + Erhebung der Beine → körperlich-geistige Einheit → Umkehrung der Körperordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:FGS6","text":"Zielgerichtete Bewegung → Widerstandsdurchquerung → Tanz → invertierte Orientierung als höchste Bewegungsform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:AF1","text":"Zielnähe → gekrümmte Bewegung → sichtbarer Schritt → Tanz statt Stillstand → Leichtigkeit im Schlamm → körperlich-geistige Erhebung → Kopfstand als Umkehrung der Ordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:ME1","text":"Geradlinigkeit wird von der privilegierten Form des Fortschritts zur bloßen Möglichkeit unter anderen herabgestuft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:ME2","text":"Der Schritt wird vom Fortbewegungsmittel zum Erkenntnissignal über den Zustand eines Wesens umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:ME3","text":"Zielerreichung wird von Stillstand auf beschleunigte, tanzende Beweglichkeit umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:ME4","text":"Schwere wird nicht mehr als absolute Grenze, sondern als Medium sichtbar, an dem sich Leichtigkeit bewährt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:ME5","text":"Geistige Erhebung und körperliche Aktivität werden als einheitlicher Vorgang statt als Gegensatz kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:ME6","text":"Der Kopfstand klassifiziert Umkehrung nicht als Orientierungsverlust, sondern als mögliche Steigerung der Orientierung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Eine sprechende Instanz beschreibt Zielnähe durch Buckeln, Schnurren, Lachen, Gehen, Tanzen und Kopfstand.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Bewegungsform, Körperhaltung und Bodenwiderstand bestimmen, ob Zielgerichtetheit als lebendige Praxis erhalten bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Der Text verschiebt die Bewertung von Fortschritt von Ankunft und Geradheit auf Beweglichkeit, Widerstandsfähigkeit und Umkehrungsfähigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Sein wird als bewegliches Werden gefasst; das Ziel markiert eine Intensivierung der Bewegung und keinen endgültigen Zustand außerhalb der Zeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Sequenz von Zielnähe, Bewegung, Leichtigkeit und Umkehrung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, was das Ziel und was genau unter „guten Dingen“ zu verstehen ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Zielerreichung als Bewegungssteigerung und nicht als Endzustand gelesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Verbindung liegt in der Kopplung von diagnostischem Schritt, Tanz und körperlicher Erhebung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:MRT5","text":"Die Konstruktion hängt von der nicht weiter begründeten Gleichsetzung von Leichtigkeit mit Überwindung ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:MRT6","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen der Nähe zu einem Ziel und der fortgesetzten Verweigerung endgültiger Stillstellung bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:MRT7","text":"Eine zweite Spannung liegt zwischen der behaupteten Leichtigkeit und der nur funktional, nicht materiell aufgehobenen Schwere der Welt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung des Textes, sofern die Imperative als Steigerung einer bereits diagnostizierten Bewegungslogik behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T185042234067Z_4010a4c4","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"17.","source_sha256":"2e1f0a2621b8e00e3117bce8bff13010fecc5c5493f414e7dc26a9ea0e2f9f5e","sha256":"63c50707fe5516948cd134c1c88afbbe7cff427dbc41ee09c56b7e30c60b25a8","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T18:50:42.235739+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:AS1","text":"The central problem is how the approach to a goal manifests itself in a form of movement without passing over into standstill.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:AS2","text":"The goal is redefined as a state of increased mobility, lightness, and bodily mediated joy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:AS3","text":"The form of gait proves whether a being is in fact progressing along its path.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:AS4","text":"Proximity to the goal produces not petrification, but dance, laughter, and accelerated movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:AS5","text":"Heaviness, gloom, and mud are not eliminated, but traversed in motion by light feet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:AS6","text":"The concluding movement intensifies from inner elevation through bodily activation to the reversal of the customary above-below order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:A1","text":"Good things approach their goal in curved, not rectilinear movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:A2","text":"Proximity to the goal expresses itself as inner joy and as laughter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:A3","text":"The step makes visible a being's actual position on its path.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:A4","text":"The approach to the goal transforms walking into dancing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:A5","text":"Attainment of the goal is not identical with rigidity, dullness, or petrification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:A6","text":"Swift running preserves movement against the tendency toward the static image.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:A7","text":"Earthly heaviness and gloom constitute a resistant milieu of movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:A8","text":"Light feet make possible the crossing of the mud without abolishing its existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:A9","text":"Elevation encompasses heart and legs at once.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:A10","text":"The highest form of movement can consist in the reversal of the customary bodily order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:NX1","text":"Proximity to the goal is not a rectilinear, tensionless approach.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:NX2","text":"Progress is not mere advancement in upright linearity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:NX3","text":"Attainment of the goal is not standstill in the static image.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:NX4","text":"Completion is neither dullness nor stony duration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:NX5","text":"Elevation is not a separation of the heart from the legs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:NX6","text":"Lightness does not mean the absence of bog, mud, or gloom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:NX7","text":"Dance is not an escape from the world through the abolition of the ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:D1","text":"The curvature of movement becomes the positive sign of its goal-directedness.","refs":["CH_97E9_17_2:A1","CH_97E9_17_2:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:D2","text":"Joy appears as a diagnostic indicator of an achieved proximity to the goal.","refs":["CH_97E9_17_2:A2","CH_97E9_17_2:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:D3","text":"The appropriate form of progress is an increased intensity of movement rather than a reduction to arrival.","refs":["CH_97E9_17_2:A4","CH_97E9_17_2:A5","CH_97E9_17_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:D4","text":"Heaviness is overcome not through negation, but through an altered quality of movement.","refs":["CH_97E9_17_2:A7","CH_97E9_17_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:D5","text":"Bodily mobility becomes the condition of spiritual elevation.","refs":["CH_97E9_17_2:A8","CH_97E9_17_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:D6","text":"The reversal of bodily order becomes legible as heightened, not as lost, orientation.","refs":["CH_97E9_17_2:A9","CH_97E9_17_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:SD1","text":"The system replaces the model of completion with a model of enduring, pleasurable mobility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:SD2","text":"Goal-directed movement is measured not by straightness, but by its capacity to transform resistance into dance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:SD3","text":"The body functions simultaneously as an instrument of knowledge, a medium of movement, and a site of elevation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:SD4","text":"The highest form of orientation arises through a controlled reversal of conventional hierarchies.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:SD5","text":"The system totalizes lightness as an operative force without ontologically abolishing the heaviness of the world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:DNX1","text":"True progress must not be measured by a straight line, a fixed center, or a stable final position.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:DNX2","text":"A goal must not be conceived as a state in which movement loses its meaning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:DNX3","text":"Spiritual elevation must not occur at the expense of bodily capacity for movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:DNX4","text":"Resistance must not count as proof of failure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:DNX5","text":"Order must not be equated with upright bodily posture, heaviness, or immobility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:SNX1","text":"Excluded is the possibility of a completion whose truth lies in the ending of all movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:SNX2","text":"Excluded is a transcendence that leaves behind the body, the ground, and the legs as low spheres.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:SNX3","text":"Excluded is an interpretation of the world in which mud and gloom possess the final power over movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:SNX4","text":"Excluded is the notion that orientation is possible only through stable verticality and irreversible order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:FGS1","text":"Proximity to the goal + nonlinear movement → visible step → diagnosed belonging to the path.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:FGS2","text":"Proximity to the goal + inner joy → laughter → affective confirmation of movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:FGS3","text":"threatening rigidity → swift running → preservation of the form of movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:FGS4","text":"Mud and gloom + light feet → crossing of resistance → dance instead of downfall.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:FGS5","text":"Elevation of the heart + elevation of the legs → bodily-spiritual unity → reversal of bodily order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:FGS6","text":"Goal-directed movement → traversal of resistance → dance → inverted orientation as the highest form of movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:AF1","text":"Proximity to the goal → curved movement → visible step → dance instead of standstill → lightness in mud → bodily-spiritual elevation → headstand as reversal of order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:ME1","text":"Straightness is downgraded from the privileged form of progress to a mere possibility among others.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:ME2","text":"The step is reclassified from a means of locomotion into a signal of knowledge concerning the state of a being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:ME3","text":"Attainment of the goal is remapped from standstill onto accelerated, dancing mobility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:ME4","text":"Heaviness becomes visible no longer as an absolute limit, but as a medium in which lightness proves itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:ME5","text":"Spiritual elevation and bodily activity are mapped as a unified process rather than as opposites.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:ME6","text":"The headstand classifies reversal not as a loss of orientation, but as a possible intensification of orientation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** A speaking instance describes proximity to the goal through hunching, purring, laughing, walking, dancing, and headstand.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Form of movement, bodily posture, and resistance of the ground determine whether goal-directedness is preserved as a living practice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** The text shifts the evaluation of progress from arrival and straightness to mobility, resilience, and capacity for reversal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Being is conceived as mobile becoming; the goal marks an intensification of movement and not a final state outside time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the sequence of proximity to the goal, movement, lightness, and reversal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:MRT2","text":"What remains underdetermined is what the goal is and what exactly is to be understood by “good things.”","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent, provided that attainment of the goal is read as an intensification of movement and not as a final state.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:MRT4","text":"Its strongest connection lies in the coupling of diagnostic step, dance, and bodily elevation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:MRT5","text":"The construction depends on the unsubstantiated equation of lightness with overcoming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:MRT6","text":"A tension remains between proximity to a goal and the continued refusal of final immobilization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:MRT7","text":"A second tension lies between the asserted lightness and the heaviness of the world, suspended only functionally and not materially.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_17_2:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the text's actual movement, provided that the imperatives are treated as an intensification of an already diagnosed logic of movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_17_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_17_2@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_17_2:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On the Higher Man","source_section_label":"17.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Four and Last"],"reading_title":"On the Higher Man · 17","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","On the Higher Man","17."],"original_title":"17."}],"source_title_context":"Vom höheren Menschen","source_section_label":"17.","source_title_hierarchy":["Vierter und letzter Theil"],"reading_title":"On the Higher Man · 17","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","On the Higher Man","17."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 156","title":"On the Higher Man · 17","context":"Part Four and Last","original_context":"Vierter und letzter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Vom höheren Menschen · 17"},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2","layer":"CH","title":"On the Higher Man · 18","order":157,"parents":["RAW_97E9_18_2"],"revision":"CH_97E9_18_2@R001","sha256":"ea3a43a6c47fc314fb43a32cb6af601e88f35f1a23da8b1123367a1cde2fa955","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:AS1","text":"Das Problem fehlender äußerer Autorisierung wird durch Selbstsetzung der Krone beantwortet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:AS2","text":"Das eigene Gelächter wird durch einen performativen Akt geheiligt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:AS3","text":"Stärke, Leichtigkeit, Tanz und Sprung werden zu einer einheitlichen Existenzform verbunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:AS4","text":"Wahrsprechen wird mit Wahrlachen gekoppelt und dadurch gegen Ungeduld und Unbedingtheit abgegrenzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:AS5","text":"Die Autorität des Sprechers entsteht nicht aus einem Anderen, sondern aus selbst vollzogener Setzung und beweglicher Selbstüberschreitung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:A1","text":"Die Krone wird vom Sprecher selbst gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:A2","text":"Das eigene Gelächter wird vom Sprecher selbst geheiligt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:A3","text":"Kein Anderer wird als stark genug für diese Setzung anerkannt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:A4","text":"Der Sprecher verkörpert eine tänzerische und leichte Existenzform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:A5","text":"Leichtigkeit wird als Flugbereitschaft und Zuwendung zu den Vögeln dargestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:A6","text":"Wahrsagen und Wahrlachen bilden zusammen eine Erkenntnis- und Ausdrucksform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:A7","text":"Diese Existenzform ist weder ungeduldig noch unbedingt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:A8","text":"Sprünge und Seitensprünge gehören zu ihrer bevorzugten Bewegungsweise.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:NX1","text":"Die Krone wird nicht durch einen Anderen verliehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:NX2","text":"Die Heiligung des Gelächters beruht nicht auf fremder Beglaubigung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:NX3","text":"Die beschriebene Stärke ist keine starre oder ausschließlich gewichtige Stärke.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:NX4","text":"Die Wahrheitsgestalt ist nicht ungeduldig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:NX5","text":"Die Wahrheitsgestalt ist nicht unbedingt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:NX6","text":"Die Bewegung folgt keiner geradlinigen oder ausschließlich vorwärts gerichteten Ordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:D1","text":"Autorität wird als selbst vollzogene Setzung statt als verliehene Würde erzeugt.","refs":["CH_97E9_18_2:A1","CH_97E9_18_2:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:D2","text":"Gelächter wird zu einer sakralisierten Form eigener Geltung transformiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_18_2:A2","CH_97E9_18_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:D3","text":"Leichtigkeit bezeichnet keine Schwäche, sondern die Fähigkeit zu Flug, Tanz und Beweglichkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_18_2:A4","CH_97E9_18_2:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:D4","text":"Wahrheit erscheint als bewegliche Verbindung von Weissagung und Lachen.","refs":["CH_97E9_18_2:A6","CH_97E9_18_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:D5","text":"Die bevorzugte Bewegung des Sprechers besteht in Abweichung, Sprung und Seitensprung.","refs":["CH_97E9_18_2:A7","CH_97E9_18_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:SD1","text":"Das System ersetzt transzendente Legitimation durch performative Selbstautorisierung.","refs":["CH_97E9_18_2:A1","CH_97E9_18_2:A2","CH_97E9_18_2:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:SD2","text":"Erkenntnis, Wahrheit und Sakralität werden in einer körperlich bewegten Form des Lachens gebündelt.","refs":["CH_97E9_18_2:A2","CH_97E9_18_2:A4","CH_97E9_18_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:SD3","text":"Die zentrale Stärke des Systems liegt in der gleichzeitigen Behauptung von Erhabenheit und Leichtigkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_18_2:A1","CH_97E9_18_2:A4","CH_97E9_18_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:SD4","text":"Die normative Bewegungsform des Systems ist nicht Bindung, sondern kontrollierte Unbedingtheitsvermeidung durch Sprung und Seitensprung.","refs":["CH_97E9_18_2:A7","CH_97E9_18_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:DNX1","text":"Geltung darf nicht von einer vorgängigen äußeren Instanz abhängen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:DNX2","text":"Wahrheit darf nicht mit Ernst, Ungeduld oder Unbedingtheit gleichgesetzt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:DNX3","text":"Stärke darf nicht als Schwere, Fixierung oder Unbeweglichkeit organisiert sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:DNX4","text":"Sakralität darf nicht ausschließlich durch dogmatische oder fremdgesetzte Autorität entstehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Welt, in der Anerkennung vor der Selbstsetzung liegen muss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Wahrheitsordnung, die nur durch Ernsthaftigkeit, Endgültigkeit oder Zwang Bestand hat.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die stabile Identität, die ihre Geltung durch Stillstand statt durch Selbstbewegung erhält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:FGS1","text":"Fehlende äußere Autorisierung → Selbstsetzung der Krone → Erzeugung eigener Geltung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:FGS2","text":"Eigenes Gelächter → Selbstheiligung → Sakralisierung einer nicht-ernsten Ausdrucksform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:FGS3","text":"Stärke → Leichtigkeit → Tanz, Flugbereitschaft und Beweglichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:FGS4","text":"Wahrsprechen → Wahrlachen → Wahrheit ohne Ungeduld und Unbedingtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:FGS5","text":"Abgrenzung von äußerer Beglaubigung und starrer Wahrheit → Sprung und Seitensprung als operative Bewegungsform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:FGS6","text":"Selbstautorisierung + sakralisiertes Gelächter + bewegliche Wahrheit → eine autonom gesetzte, leichte und nicht-endgültige Existenzform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:AF1","text":"Fehlende fremde Stärke → Selbstsetzung der Krone → Heiligung des eigenen Gelächters → Verbindung von Wahrheit und Lachen → Ausschluss von Ungeduld und Unbedingtheit → bewegliche Selbstautorisierung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:ME1","text":"Autorität wird von einer verliehenen Würde in einen selbst erzeugten Vollzug umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:ME2","text":"Lachen wird vom Gegenpol zur Wahrheit in deren Wahrnehmungs- und Ausdrucksmedium umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:ME3","text":"Leichtigkeit wird von mangelnder Ernsthaftigkeit in eine Form von Stärke und Flugfähigkeit transformiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:ME4","text":"Abweichung und Seitensprung werden von bloßer Zerstreuung in zentrale Bewegungsformen des Wahrheitsverhältnisses überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:ALT1","text":"Surface — Der Sprecher setzt sich selbst eine Krone und heiligt sein eigenes Gelächter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:ALT2","text":"Structural — Geltung wird durch Selbstautorisierung, Beweglichkeit und den Ausschluss fremder Beglaubigung organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text verschiebt die Bedingungen von Stärke und Wahrheit von Ernst, Endgültigkeit und äußerer Anerkennung zu Lachen, Tanz und Sprung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Das privilegierte Subjekt ist ein werdendes, springendes und seitlich ausweichendes Subjekt, dessen Geltung nicht auf endgültiger Festlegung beruht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um Selbstkrönung, Selbstheiligung und die Zurückweisung äußerer Autorisierung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:MRT2","text":"Die Verbindung von Wahrsprechen und Wahrlachen bleibt als begriffliche Identität vorausgesetzt, nicht weiter begründet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:MRT3","text":"Die Beziehung zwischen Krone, Rosenkranz und Gelächter bleibt symbolisch verdichtet und semantisch unterbestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:MRT4","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Leichtigkeit als Stärke und nicht als deren Negation gelesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Operation ist die Ersetzung fremder Legitimation durch performative Selbstsetzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die Bewegung von Autorisierung über Sakralisierung zu beweglicher Wahrheit, ohne die poetische Mehrdeutigkeit vollständig aufzulösen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T185131942743Z_dd1fbcc1","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"18.","source_sha256":"ea3a43a6c47fc314fb43a32cb6af601e88f35f1a23da8b1123367a1cde2fa955","sha256":"2fe46f394d40a6fceac2ed9745abd8278489efc798488e912489a4dbfdbf22c9","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T18:51:31.944210+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:AS1","text":"The problem of lacking external authorization is answered through the self-positing of the crown.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:AS2","text":"One's own laughter is sanctified through a performative act.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:AS3","text":"Strength, lightness, dance, and leap are joined into a unified mode of existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:AS4","text":"Truth-speaking is coupled with truth-laughing and thereby distinguished from impatience and unconditionality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:AS5","text":"The speaker's authority arises not from an Other, but from self-effected positing and mobile self-transcendence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:A1","text":"The crown is posited by the speaker himself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:A2","text":"The speaker's own laughter is sanctified by the speaker himself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:A3","text":"No Other is recognized as strong enough for this positing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:A4","text":"The speaker embodies a dancing and light mode of existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:A5","text":"Lightness is represented as readiness for flight and an orientation toward birds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:A6","text":"Prophecy and truth-laughing together form a mode of cognition and expression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:A7","text":"This mode of existence is neither impatient nor unconditional.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:A8","text":"Leaps and sidesteps belong to its preferred mode of movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:NX1","text":"The crown is not conferred by an Other.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:NX2","text":"The sanctification of laughter does not rest on external authentication.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:NX3","text":"The strength described is not a rigid or exclusively weighty strength.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:NX4","text":"The form of truth is not impatient.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:NX5","text":"The form of truth is not unconditional.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:NX6","text":"Movement follows no linear or exclusively forward-directed order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:D1","text":"Authority is generated as self-effected positing rather than as conferred dignity.","refs":["CH_97E9_18_2:A1","CH_97E9_18_2:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:D2","text":"Laughter is transformed into a sacralized form of one's own validity.","refs":["CH_97E9_18_2:A2","CH_97E9_18_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:D3","text":"Lightness does not denote weakness, but rather the capacity for flight, dance, and mobility.","refs":["CH_97E9_18_2:A4","CH_97E9_18_2:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:D4","text":"Truth appears as a mobile conjunction of prophecy and laughter.","refs":["CH_97E9_18_2:A6","CH_97E9_18_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:D5","text":"The speaker's preferred movement consists in deviation, leap, and sidestep.","refs":["CH_97E9_18_2:A7","CH_97E9_18_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:SD1","text":"The system replaces transcendent legitimation with performative self-authorization.","refs":["CH_97E9_18_2:A1","CH_97E9_18_2:A2","CH_97E9_18_2:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:SD2","text":"Cognition, truth, and sacrality are concentrated in a bodily animated form of laughter.","refs":["CH_97E9_18_2:A2","CH_97E9_18_2:A4","CH_97E9_18_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:SD3","text":"The system's central strength lies in the simultaneous assertion of sublimity and lightness.","refs":["CH_97E9_18_2:A1","CH_97E9_18_2:A4","CH_97E9_18_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:SD4","text":"The system's normative form of movement is not attachment, but the controlled avoidance of unconditionality through leap and sidestep.","refs":["CH_97E9_18_2:A7","CH_97E9_18_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:DNX1","text":"Validity must not depend on a prior external instance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:DNX2","text":"Truth must not be equated with seriousness, impatience, or unconditionality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:DNX3","text":"Strength must not be organized as heaviness, fixation, or immobility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:DNX4","text":"Sacrality must not arise exclusively through dogmatic or externally imposed authority.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a world in which recognition must precede self-positing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:SNX2","text":"Excluded is an order of truth that persists only through seriousness, finality, or coercion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:SNX3","text":"Excluded is the stable identity that receives its validity through stasis rather than through self-movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:FGS1","text":"Lacking external authorization → self-positing of the crown → generation of one's own validity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:FGS2","text":"One's own laughter → self-sanctification → sacralization of a non-serious form of expression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:FGS3","text":"Strength → lightness → dance, readiness for flight, and mobility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:FGS4","text":"Truth-speaking → truth-laughing → truth without impatience and unconditionality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:FGS5","text":"Distinction from external authentication and rigid truth → leap and sidestep as an operative form of movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:FGS6","text":"Self-authorization + sacralized laughter + mobile truth → an autonomously posited, light, and non-final mode of existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:AF1","text":"Lack of alien strength → self-positing of the crown → sanctification of one's own laughter → conjunction of truth and laughter → exclusion of impatience and unconditionality → mobile self-authorization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:ME1","text":"Authority is remapped from conferred dignity into a self-generated enactment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:ME2","text":"Laughter is reclassified from truth's opposite pole into its medium of perception and expression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:ME3","text":"Lightness is transformed from a lack of seriousness into a form of strength and capacity for flight.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:ME4","text":"Deviation and sidestep are transferred from mere distraction into central forms of movement within the relation to truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:ALT1","text":"Surface — The speaker places a crown upon himself and sanctifies his own laughter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:ALT2","text":"Structural — Validity is organized through self-authorization, mobility, and the exclusion of external authentication.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text shifts the conditions of strength and truth from seriousness, finality, and external recognition to laughter, dance, and leap.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The privileged subject is a becoming, leaping, and laterally evading subject whose validity does not rest on final determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct self-coronation, self-sanctification, and the rejection of external authorization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:MRT2","text":"The conjunction of truth-speaking and truth-laughing remains presupposed as a conceptual identity and is not further grounded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:MRT3","text":"The relation between crown, rosary, and laughter remains symbolically condensed and semantically underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:MRT4","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as lightness is read as strength and not as its negation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:MRT5","text":"The strongest operation is the replacement of external legitimation with performative self-positing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_18_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_18_2:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the movement from authorization through sacralization to mobile truth, without fully resolving the poetic ambiguity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_18_2@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_18_2:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On the Higher Man","source_section_label":"18.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Four and Last"],"reading_title":"On the Higher Man · 18","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","On the Higher Man","18."],"original_title":"18."}],"source_title_context":"Vom höheren Menschen","source_section_label":"18.","source_title_hierarchy":["Vierter und letzter Theil"],"reading_title":"On the Higher Man · 18","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","On the Higher Man","18."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 157","title":"On the Higher Man · 18","context":"Part Four and Last","original_context":"Vierter und letzter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Vom höheren Menschen · 18"},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2","layer":"CH","title":"On the Higher Man · 19","order":158,"parents":["RAW_97E9_19_2"],"revision":"CH_97E9_19_2@R001","sha256":"ce38c74cf82b5177dfbbd096868e0adedaffac83a24af603ae4c38036ee1fdb8","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:AS1","text":"Das Problem ist die schwere, unbeholfene und traurige Haltung des Menschen im Glück wie im Unglück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:AS2","text":"Die gewöhnliche Aufrichtung des Herzens genügt nicht; auch die Beine und damit der ganze Körper müssen in die Bewegung einbezogen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:AS3","text":"Plumpheit wird nicht als endgültige Unfähigkeit, sondern als noch unvollständige Tanzbewegung neu bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:AS4","text":"Glück soll die Torheit in Tanz verwandeln, statt die durch Unglück erzeugte Torheit zu reproduzieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:AS5","text":"Die höhere Haltung entsteht durch Selbstaufrichtung, Überwindung der Trübsal und Abkehr von der volkstümlichen Trauer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:A1","text":"Erhebung des Herzens ist ohne Erhebung der Beine unvollständig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:A2","text":"Körperliche Haltung ist Ausdruck und Bedingung geistiger Haltung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:A3","text":"Schwere und Plumpheit können auch im Glück fortbestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:A4","text":"Unglück erzeugt eine eigene Form der Torheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:A5","text":"Glück kann eine andere, produktivere Form der Torheit erzeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:A6","text":"Plumpes Tanzen ist der lahmen Fortbewegung vorzuziehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:A7","text":"Das Schlimmste enthält mehrere gegenläufige Möglichkeiten zur Umkehr.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:A8","text":"Selbstaufrichtung auf die eigenen rechten Beine ist eine Aufgabe der höheren Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:A9","text":"Trübsal und volkstümliche Trauer verhindern die geforderte Selbstaufrichtung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:A10","text":"Das gegenwärtige Heute gehört dem Volk und markiert damit eine noch nicht überwundene Ordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:NX1","text":"Höhere Haltung ist nicht bloße Erhebung des Herzens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:NX2","text":"Glück ist nicht automatisch Leichtigkeit oder Beweglichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:NX3","text":"Plumpheit ist nicht gleichbedeutend mit endgültigem Scheitern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:NX4","text":"Torheit vor Glück ist nicht dieselbe Torheit wie Torheit vor Unglück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:NX5","text":"Aufrechtgehen ist nicht die höchste Form der Bewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:NX6","text":"Das Schlimmste ist nicht eindimensional negativ.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:NX7","text":"Volkstümliche Trauer ist nicht als maßgebliche geistige Haltung anerkannt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:D1","text":"Eine einseitige Erhebung des Geistes reproduziert die körperliche und geistige Schwere, die sie überwinden will.","refs":["CH_97E9_19_2:A1","CH_97E9_19_2:A2","CH_97E9_19_2:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:D2","text":"Glück muss in eine körperliche Praxis übersetzt werden, damit es die Schwere tatsächlich verändert.","refs":["CH_97E9_19_2:A2","CH_97E9_19_2:A5","CH_97E9_19_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:D3","text":"Die Umwertung des Schweren erfolgt nicht durch seine Abschaffung, sondern durch seine Verwandlung in Tanz.","refs":["CH_97E9_19_2:A3","CH_97E9_19_2:A6","CH_97E9_19_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:D4","text":"Die entscheidende Unterscheidung verläuft zwischen lähmender und beweglich machender Torheit.","refs":["CH_97E9_19_2:A4","CH_97E9_19_2:A5","CH_97E9_19_2:NX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:D5","text":"Selbstüberwindung verlangt eine neue körperliche Grundstellung und nicht nur eine neue Überzeugung.","refs":["CH_97E9_19_2:A2","CH_97E9_19_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:D6","text":"Die Kritik der Volkstrauer ist zugleich eine Kritik der gegenwärtigen sozialen Ordnung.","refs":["CH_97E9_19_2:A9","CH_97E9_19_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:SD1","text":"Der Text ersetzt die vertikale Opposition von Erhebung und Niedergang durch eine umfassende Bewegungslogik, in der Denken, Körper und Glück gemeinsam transformiert werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_19_2:A1","CH_97E9_19_2:A2","CH_97E9_19_2:A6","CH_97E9_19_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:SD2","text":"Negative Zustände werden nicht beseitigt, sondern hinsichtlich ihrer möglichen Bewegungsrichtung neu klassifiziert.","refs":["CH_97E9_19_2:A3","CH_97E9_19_2:A4","CH_97E9_19_2:A5","CH_97E9_19_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:SD3","text":"Die Figur des höheren Menschen bezeichnet eine Übergangsform, die ihre bisherige Schwere noch trägt, aber bereits deren Umwandlung in Tanz vollzieht.","refs":["CH_97E9_19_2:A3","CH_97E9_19_2:A6","CH_97E9_19_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:SD4","text":"Das Volk erscheint als zeitliche und affektive Gegenordnung, deren Trauer die Gegenwart besetzt, während die höhere Bewegung auf ihre Überschreitung zielt.","refs":["CH_97E9_19_2:A9","CH_97E9_19_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:DNX1","text":"Der Text schließt ein Menschenbild aus, in dem geistige Erhebung unabhängig von körperlicher Praxis möglich ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:DNX2","text":"Er schließt ein Glücksmodell aus, das Schwere lediglich verdeckt, statt sie in Beweglichkeit umzuwandeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:DNX3","text":"Er schließt die Gleichsetzung von Ernst, Trauer und geistiger Tiefe aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:DNX4","text":"Er schließt ein statisches Ideal der Vollkommenheit aus, das keine Übergangsformen und keine produktive Plumpheit zulässt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:DNX5","text":"Er schließt eine politische oder soziale Ordnung aus, deren affektive Einheit auf gemeinsamer Trauer beruht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:SNX1","text":"Die Möglichkeit einer endgültig stabilen, von Schwere gereinigten höheren Existenz bleibt versperrt; die höhere Form entsteht nur als fortgesetzte Umstellung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:SNX2","text":"Der Text verweigert eine Versöhnung zwischen höherer Selbstaufrichtung und dem weiterhin herrschenden Heute des Volkes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Welt, in der Glück lediglich Besitz oder Zustand ist und nicht als riskante körperliche Bewegung erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:SNX4","text":"Die verdrängte Möglichkeit einer nicht-traurigen kollektiven Gegenwart strukturiert die Abgrenzung vom Volk.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:FGS1","text":"Unvollständige geistige Erhebung + fortbestehende körperliche Schwere → Erfordernis der Ganzkörperbewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:FGS2","text":"Schwere im Glück → Unterscheidung zwischen lähmender und beweglicher Torheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:FGS3","text":"Schlimmstes Ding mit gegenläufigen Möglichkeiten → Umwandlung des Negativen in Tanzbewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:FGS4","text":"Plumpheit + Bewegungsfähigkeit → vorläufige Überlegenheit gegenüber Lahmheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:FGS5","text":"Selbstaufrichtung + Verlernen der Trübsal → Konstitution des höheren Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:FGS6","text":"Volkstrauer + Besitz des Heute → soziale Gegenfolie der höheren Bewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:AF1","text":"Einseitige Erhebung → fortbestehende Schwere → Einbezug der Beine → Tanz statt bloßem Gehen → Umwertung der Torheit → Selbstaufrichtung der höheren Menschen → Abkehr von der Volkstrauer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:ME1","text":"Die Begriffslandschaft verschiebt sich von Geist versus Körper zu einer untrennbaren Einheit von Haltung, Bewegung und Denken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:ME2","text":"Das Gegensatzpaar Glück/Unglück wird durch die Unterscheidung beweglicher und lähmender Torheit reorganisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:ME3","text":"Plumpheit wird aus der Kategorie des bloßen Mangels in die Kategorie einer noch unvollständigen, aber produktiven Bewegung überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:ME4","text":"Tanz wird vom dekorativen Ausdruck zur erkenntnis- und selbstkonstituierenden Praxis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:ME5","text":"Volkstrauer wird von einer allgemeinen menschlichen Stimmung zu einem Merkmal einer bestimmten sozialen und zeitlichen Ordnung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:ME6","text":"Das Schlimmste wird nicht als Endpunkt, sondern als ambivalenter Umschlagpunkt möglicher Umwertung kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:ALT1","text":"Surface — Aufforderung zur Erhebung von Herz, Beinen und Körper bis zur kopfstehenden Tanzbewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:ALT2","text":"Structural — Geistige und soziale Haltungen werden durch körperliche Bewegungsformen organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Überwindung erfolgt nicht durch Vermeidung des Schweren, sondern durch seine Umfunktionierung in Beweglichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Der höhere Mensch ist eine werdende, nicht abgeschlossene Existenz; das volkstümliche Heute bezeichnet die noch herrschende Gegenzeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von geistiger Erhebung zu körperlicher Selbstaufrichtung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:MRT2","text":"Die Unterscheidung zwischen Glücks- und Unglückstorheit bleibt auf die vom Text gesetzte affektive Wertung angewiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:MRT3","text":"Die Funktion des Kopfstehens bleibt absichtlich spannungsvoll zwischen Umkehrung, Spiel und möglicher neuer Instabilität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:MRT4","text":"Die Opposition zwischen höheren Menschen und Volk wird strukturell erzeugt, aber sozial nicht weiter bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:MRT5","text":"Das System ist intern kohärent, solange Tanz als operative Umwandlung von Schwere und nicht als bloßes Bild verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung: unvollständige Erhebung → körperliche Einbeziehung → Umwertung der Torheit → Selbstaufrichtung → Abgrenzung von der Volkstrauer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T185221167456Z_779ea09d","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"19.","source_sha256":"ce38c74cf82b5177dfbbd096868e0adedaffac83a24af603ae4c38036ee1fdb8","sha256":"734e2db0b6694ec0ea2ec78e60fb0d0a7f90c3f7a79b44c43acaa0d03c1f0a3b","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T18:52:21.169237+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:AS1","text":"The problem is the human being's heavy, awkward, and sad bearing in happiness as in misfortune.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:AS2","text":"The ordinary raising of the heart does not suffice; the legs as well, and thus the whole body, must be included in the movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:AS3","text":"Clumsiness is redefined not as final incapacity, but as still incomplete dance movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:AS4","text":"Happiness is to transform folly into dance, rather than reproduce the folly generated by misfortune.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:AS5","text":"The higher bearing arises through self-uprighting, the overcoming of dejection, and turning away from popular mourning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:A1","text":"The elevation of the heart is incomplete without the elevation of the legs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:A2","text":"Bodily bearing is expression and condition of spiritual bearing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:A3","text":"Heaviness and clumsiness can persist even in happiness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:A4","text":"Misfortune generates its own form of folly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:A5","text":"Happiness can generate another, more productive form of folly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:A6","text":"Clumsy dancing is preferable to lame locomotion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:A7","text":"The worst contains several opposing possibilities of reversal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:A8","text":"Self-uprighting onto one's own legs is a task of the higher human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:A9","text":"Dejection and popular mourning prevent the demanded self-uprighting.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:A10","text":"The present today belongs to the people and thereby marks an order not yet overcome.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:NX1","text":"Higher bearing is not mere elevation of the heart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:NX2","text":"Happiness is not automatically lightness or mobility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:NX3","text":"Clumsiness is not synonymous with final failure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:NX4","text":"Folly before happiness is not the same folly as folly before misfortune.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:NX5","text":"Walking upright is not the highest form of movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:NX6","text":"The worst is not one-dimensionally negative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:NX7","text":"Popular mourning is not recognized as an authoritative spiritual bearing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:D1","text":"A one-sided elevation of the spirit reproduces the bodily and spiritual heaviness it seeks to overcome.","refs":["CH_97E9_19_2:A1","CH_97E9_19_2:A2","CH_97E9_19_2:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:D2","text":"Happiness must be translated into a bodily practice so that it actually transforms heaviness.","refs":["CH_97E9_19_2:A2","CH_97E9_19_2:A5","CH_97E9_19_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:D3","text":"The revaluation of the heavy occurs not through its abolition, but through its transformation into dance.","refs":["CH_97E9_19_2:A3","CH_97E9_19_2:A6","CH_97E9_19_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:D4","text":"The decisive distinction runs between paralyzing and mobility-producing folly.","refs":["CH_97E9_19_2:A4","CH_97E9_19_2:A5","CH_97E9_19_2:NX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:D5","text":"Self-overcoming requires a new basic bodily posture and not merely a new conviction.","refs":["CH_97E9_19_2:A2","CH_97E9_19_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:D6","text":"The critique of popular mourning is at once a critique of the present social order.","refs":["CH_97E9_19_2:A9","CH_97E9_19_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:SD1","text":"The text replaces the vertical opposition of elevation and decline with a comprehensive logic of movement in which thought, body, and happiness are transformed together.","refs":["CH_97E9_19_2:A1","CH_97E9_19_2:A2","CH_97E9_19_2:A6","CH_97E9_19_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:SD2","text":"Negative states are not eliminated, but reclassified with respect to their possible direction of movement.","refs":["CH_97E9_19_2:A3","CH_97E9_19_2:A4","CH_97E9_19_2:A5","CH_97E9_19_2:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:SD3","text":"The figure of the higher human being denotes a transitional form that still bears its previous heaviness, but already effects its transformation into dance.","refs":["CH_97E9_19_2:A3","CH_97E9_19_2:A6","CH_97E9_19_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:SD4","text":"The people appear as a temporal and affective counter-order whose mourning occupies the present, while the higher movement aims at its surpassing.","refs":["CH_97E9_19_2:A9","CH_97E9_19_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:DNX1","text":"The text excludes an image of the human being in which spiritual elevation is possible independently of bodily practice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:DNX2","text":"It excludes a model of happiness that merely conceals heaviness instead of transforming it into mobility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:DNX3","text":"It excludes the equation of seriousness, mourning, and spiritual depth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:DNX4","text":"It excludes a static ideal of perfection that permits neither transitional forms nor productive clumsiness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:DNX5","text":"It excludes a political or social order whose affective unity rests on shared mourning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:SNX1","text":"The possibility of a definitively stable higher existence cleansed of heaviness remains barred; the higher form arises only as continued reconfiguration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:SNX2","text":"The text refuses a reconciliation between higher self-uprighting and the still prevailing today of the people.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:SNX3","text":"Excluded is a world in which happiness is merely possession or state and does not appear as risky bodily movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:SNX4","text":"The repressed possibility of a non-sorrowful collective present structures the demarcation from the people.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:FGS1","text":"Incomplete spiritual elevation + persisting bodily heaviness → requirement of whole-body movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:FGS2","text":"Heaviness in happiness → distinction between paralyzing and mobile folly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:FGS3","text":"Worst thing with opposing possibilities → transformation of the negative into dance movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:FGS4","text":"Clumsiness + capacity for movement → provisional superiority over lameness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:FGS5","text":"Self-uprighting + unlearning dejection → constitution of the higher human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:FGS6","text":"Popular mourning + possession of today → social counterfoil of the higher movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:AF1","text":"One-sided elevation → persisting heaviness → inclusion of the legs → dance instead of mere walking → revaluation of folly → self-uprighting of the higher human beings → turning away from popular mourning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:ME1","text":"The conceptual landscape shifts from spirit versus body to an inseparable unity of bearing, movement, and thought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:ME2","text":"The opposition happiness/misfortune is reorganized through the distinction between mobile and paralyzing folly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:ME3","text":"Clumsiness is transferred from the category of mere deficiency into the category of a still incomplete, yet productive movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:ME4","text":"Dance is transformed from decorative expression into a cognitive and self-constituting practice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:ME5","text":"Popular mourning is reclassified from a general human mood into a characteristic of a specific social and temporal order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:ME6","text":"The worst is mapped not as an endpoint, but as an ambivalent turning point of possible revaluation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:ALT1","text":"Surface — Call for the elevation of heart, legs, and body up to upside-down dance movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:ALT2","text":"Structural — Spiritual and social bearings are organized through bodily forms of movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Overcoming occurs not through avoidance of the heavy, but through its repurposing into mobility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The higher human being is a becoming, unfinished existence; the popular today denotes the still prevailing counter-time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from spiritual elevation to bodily self-uprighting.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:MRT2","text":"The distinction between happiness-folly and misfortune-folly remains dependent on the affective valuation posited by the text.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:MRT3","text":"The function of standing on one's head remains intentionally tension-filled between reversal, play, and possible new instability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:MRT4","text":"The opposition between higher human beings and the people is structurally generated, but not further socially determined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:MRT5","text":"The system is internally coherent as long as dance is understood as an operative transformation of heaviness and not as a mere image.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_19_2:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual argumental movement: incomplete elevation → bodily inclusion → revaluation of folly → self-uprighting → demarcation from popular mourning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_19_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_19_2@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_19_2:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On the Higher Man","source_section_label":"19.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Four and Last"],"reading_title":"On the Higher Man · 19","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","On the Higher Man","19."],"original_title":"19."}],"source_title_context":"Vom höheren Menschen","source_section_label":"19.","source_title_hierarchy":["Vierter und letzter Theil"],"reading_title":"On the Higher Man · 19","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","On the Higher Man","19."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 158","title":"On the Higher Man · 19","context":"Part Four and Last","original_context":"Vierter und letzter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Vom höheren Menschen · 19"},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2","layer":"CH","title":"On the Higher Man · 20","order":159,"parents":["RAW_97E9_20_2"],"revision":"CH_97E9_20_2@R001","sha256":"b85cabb549d9b6314afd245e0dfe6b5372a6d44c0bf9bdbf73095b769187f9c7","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:AS1","text":"Der Text setzt den Sturm als selbstgesetzte, ungebundene Bewegungsform gegen das erstarrte Heute und den Pöbel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:AS2","text":"Diese Bewegungsform wird durch Tanz, Lachen und freie Geistigkeit bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:AS3","text":"Die höheren Menschen verfehlen ihre Möglichkeit, weil sie die erforderliche Form des Tanzens über sich selbst nicht erlernt haben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:AS4","text":"Ihr Missraten wird nicht als endgültige Unfähigkeit, sondern als überwindbare Zwischenlage behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:AS5","text":"Die Überwindung erfolgt durch Selbstüberschreitung, erhobene Herzen und heiliggesprochenes Lachen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:AS6","text":"Die Krone des Lachens wird als symbolische Übergabe einer neuen Haltung an die höheren Menschen vollzogen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:A1","text":"Der Sturm folgt seiner eigenen Pfeife.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:A2","text":"Der Sturm bringt die Meere unter seine Bewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:A3","text":"Der freie Geist steht gegen das Heute und den Pöbel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:A4","text":"Der freie Geist vernichtet Erstarrung, Dürre und Verfall.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:A5","text":"Der freie Geist verbindet Wildheit mit Güte und Freiheit mit Lachen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:A6","text":"Der freie Geist bewegt sich über widrige Zustände hinweg, ohne von ihnen bestimmt zu werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:A7","text":"Die höheren Menschen haben die erforderliche Form des Tanzens nicht gelernt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:A8","text":"Über sich selbst hinweg zu tanzen bezeichnet eine notwendige Form der Selbstüberschreitung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:A9","text":"Das Missraten der höheren Menschen hebt ihre weitere Möglichkeit nicht auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:A10","text":"Lachen kann eine heilige und krönende Funktion übernehmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:A11","text":"Die Krone des Lachens kann den höheren Menschen als Verpflichtung und Möglichkeit übertragen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:NX1","text":"Der freie Geist ist nicht an die eigene Herkunft, an das Heute oder an den Pöbel gebunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:NX2","text":"Der freie Geist ist nicht mit welkender, dorniger oder unkrauthafter Existenz vereinbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:NX3","text":"Der freie Geist ist nicht schwermütig, schwarzsichtig oder schwärsüchtig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:NX4","text":"Freiheit ist nicht starre Selbstbehauptung, sondern bewegliche Selbstüberschreitung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:NX5","text":"Die höheren Menschen sind nicht bereits verwirklichte höhere Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:NX6","text":"Missraten ist nicht gleichbedeutend mit Unmöglichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:NX7","text":"Das Lachen ist nicht bloße Zerstreuung oder bloße Heiterkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:NX8","text":"Die Krone bezeichnet keine Herrschaft durch Schwere, Ernst oder moralische Selbstanklage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:D1","text":"Eigenbewegung erzeugt eine Kraft, die äußere Ordnungen erschüttert.","refs":["CH_97E9_20_2:A1","CH_97E9_20_2:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:D2","text":"Der freie Geist erscheint als positive Gegenkraft zu Verfall, Pöbelmentalität und Erstarrung.","refs":["CH_97E9_20_2:A3","CH_97E9_20_2:A4","CH_97E9_20_2:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:D3","text":"Widrige Lebenslagen verlieren ihre bestimmende Macht, sobald sie als tanzbarer Raum behandelt werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_20_2:A5","CH_97E9_20_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:D4","text":"Die mangelnde Tanzfähigkeit der höheren Menschen bezeichnet einen Mangel an Selbsttransformation.","refs":["CH_97E9_20_2:A7","CH_97E9_20_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:D5","text":"Das Eingeständnis des Missratens wird zur Voraussetzung weiterer Verwandlung.","refs":["CH_97E9_20_2:A8","CH_97E9_20_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:D6","text":"Lachen wird zum Vollzug der Selbstüberschreitung, nicht zu ihrem nachträglichen Ausdruck.","refs":["CH_97E9_20_2:A8","CH_97E9_20_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:D7","text":"Die Übergabe der Krone verwandelt eine individuelle Haltung in eine kollektive Aufgabe der Angesprochenen.","refs":["CH_97E9_20_2:A10","CH_97E9_20_2:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:SD1","text":"Das System ersetzt die vertikale Überlegenheit der höheren Menschen durch eine dynamische Fähigkeit zur Selbstüberschreitung.","refs":["CH_97E9_20_2:A3","CH_97E9_20_2:A7","CH_97E9_20_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:SD2","text":"Kritik an der bestehenden Welt wird in eine körperlich-affektive Praxis von Sturm, Tanz und Lachen überführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_20_2:A4","CH_97E9_20_2:A6","CH_97E9_20_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:SD3","text":"Das Negative wird nicht durch Rückzug, sondern durch eine gesteigerte Bewegungsform überwunden.","refs":["CH_97E9_20_2:A4","CH_97E9_20_2:A5","CH_97E9_20_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:SD4","text":"Die neue Rangordnung beruht auf der Fähigkeit, über die eigene missratene Gestalt hinwegzugehen und dennoch zu lachen.","refs":["CH_97E9_20_2:A7","CH_97E9_20_2:A9","CH_97E9_20_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass Befreiung durch Anpassung an das bestehende Heute erreicht werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:DNX2","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass Erkenntnis ohne körperliche und affektive Verwandlung genügt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:DNX3","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass Ernst, Schwermut oder Ressentiment tragfähige Formen höherer Existenz sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:DNX4","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass Selbstüberschreitung ohne Preisgabe der bisherigen Selbstform möglich ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:DNX5","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass eine einmalige Auszeichnung die höheren Menschen bereits zu ihrer Aufgabe befähigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine statische Vollendung des höheren Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Befreiung, die ohne Erschütterung, Risiko und Verwandlung der bestehenden Ordnung auskommt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Gemeinschaft, deren Einheit auf gleicher Schwere, gleicher Niedergeschlagenheit oder gleicher Anpassung beruht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:SNX4","text":"Abwesend bleibt ein Verfahren, das die selektive Grenze zwischen höherem Menschen und Pöbel begründet, obwohl diese Grenze die gesamte Wertung organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:FGS1","text":"Selbstgesetzte Bewegung + äußere Erschütterung → Modell des freien Geistes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:FGS2","text":"Freier Geist + Ausschluss von Verfall und Schwermut → positive Gegenfigur zum Heute und zum Pöbel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:FGS3","text":"Übertragung der Gegenfigur auf die höheren Menschen → Diagnose ihrer fehlenden Tanzfähigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:FGS4","text":"Diagnose des Missratens + Offenheit weiterer Möglichkeit → Aufforderung zur Selbstüberschreitung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:FGS5","text":"Selbstüberschreitung + Lachen → sakrale Neubestimmung der Haltung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:FGS6","text":"Sakralisiertes Lachen + Übergabe der Krone → Verpflichtung der höheren Menschen auf eine neue Existenzform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:AF1","text":"Erstarrtes Heute und Pöbel → Sturm als Gegenbewegung → freier Geist als bewegliche Wertfigur → fehlende Tanzfähigkeit der höheren Menschen → Selbstüberschreitung → heiliges Lachen → Übergabe der Lachenskrone.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:ME1","text":"Überlegenheit wird von einem statischen Rang in eine dynamische Fähigkeit zur Selbstüberschreitung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:ME2","text":"Widrigkeit wird vom Hindernis zum Bewegungsraum des freien Geistes umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:ME3","text":"Lachen wird vom affektiven Nebenphänomen zur höchsten normativen Praxis aufgewertet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:ME4","text":"Das Missraten wird von einem abschließenden Urteil in eine noch offene Transformationslage umgewandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:ME5","text":"Opposition gegen das Bestehende wird nicht als bloße Verneinung, sondern als gesteigerte Lebensbewegung kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:ALT1","text":"Surface — Sturm, Tanz und Lachen fungieren als unmittelbar sichtbare Bewegungs- und Affektbilder.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die höhere Existenz wird durch die Differenz zwischen Selbstbewegung und Erstarrung organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text ersetzt Selbstanklage und Schwermut durch eine Praxis des Über-sich-Hinwegtanzens und Lachens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Das Subjekt ist kein fertiger Zustand, sondern eine werdende Gestalt, die sich durch Selbstüberschreitung gegen das Heute konstituiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung vom Sturm als Modell zur Krone des Lachens zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, nach welchen Kriterien der „Pöbel“ und die „höheren Menschen“ voneinander abgegrenzt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Tanz, Lachen und Sturm als Varianten derselben Bewegungslogik gelesen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Verbindung ist die von Missraten, Möglichkeit und Selbstüberschreitung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:MRT5","text":"Eine Spannung entsteht zwischen der behaupteten Freiheit des Geistes und der normativen Anweisung, wie die höheren Menschen tanzen und lachen müssen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:MRT6","text":"Eine zweite Spannung entsteht zwischen der Auflösung statischer Rangordnung und der fortbestehenden Ausschließung des Pöbels.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, sofern die sakrale Krönung als Übergang von Bildsprache zu Verpflichtung verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T190020948485Z_4a55e021","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"20.","source_sha256":"b85cabb549d9b6314afd245e0dfe6b5372a6d44c0bf9bdbf73095b769187f9c7","sha256":"104ebcb1fc64e13006d64e7c9997d2dbcee52aa89b2a350503c22c83785ed6c5","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:00:20.950629+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:AS1","text":"The text sets the storm, as a self-positing, unbound form of movement, against the congealed present and the rabble.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:AS2","text":"This form of movement is determined by dance, laughter, and free-spiritedness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:AS3","text":"The higher human beings fail to realize their possibility because they have not learned the requisite form of dancing over themselves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:AS4","text":"Their failure is treated not as definitive incapacity, but as an intermediate condition that can be overcome.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:AS5","text":"Overcoming takes place through self-transcendence, uplifted hearts, and sanctified laughter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:AS6","text":"The crown of laughter is enacted as the symbolic bestowal of a new attitude upon the higher human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:A1","text":"The storm follows its own pipe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:A2","text":"The storm brings the seas under its movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:A3","text":"The free spirit stands against the present and the rabble.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:A4","text":"The free spirit destroys rigidity, drought, and decay.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:A5","text":"The free spirit joins wildness with goodness and freedom with laughter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:A6","text":"The free spirit moves beyond adverse conditions without being determined by them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:A7","text":"The higher human beings have not learned the requisite form of dancing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:A8","text":"Dancing over oneself designates a necessary form of self-transcendence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:A9","text":"The failure of the higher human beings does not annul their further possibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:A10","text":"Laughter can assume a sacred and crowning function.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:A11","text":"The crown of laughter can be conferred upon the higher human beings as obligation and possibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:NX1","text":"The free spirit is not bound to its own origin, to the present, or to the rabble.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:NX2","text":"The free spirit is not compatible with a withering, thorny, or weed-like existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:NX3","text":"The free spirit is not melancholic, black-sighted, or fanatical.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:NX4","text":"Freedom is not rigid self-assertion, but mobile self-transcendence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:NX5","text":"The higher human beings are not already realized higher human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:NX6","text":"Failure is not synonymous with impossibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:NX7","text":"Laughter is not mere diversion or mere cheerfulness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:NX8","text":"The crown designates no rule through heaviness, seriousness, or moral self-accusation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:D1","text":"Self-movement generates a force that shakes external orders.","refs":["CH_97E9_20_2:A1","CH_97E9_20_2:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:D2","text":"The free spirit appears as a positive counterforce to decay, rabble mentality, and rigidity.","refs":["CH_97E9_20_2:A3","CH_97E9_20_2:A4","CH_97E9_20_2:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:D3","text":"Adverse circumstances of life lose their determining power as soon as they are treated as a space in which one can dance.","refs":["CH_97E9_20_2:A5","CH_97E9_20_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:D4","text":"The deficient capacity for dance of the higher human beings designates a lack of self-transformation.","refs":["CH_97E9_20_2:A7","CH_97E9_20_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:D5","text":"The admission of failure becomes the precondition of further transformation.","refs":["CH_97E9_20_2:A8","CH_97E9_20_2:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:D6","text":"Laughter becomes the enactment of self-transcendence, not its subsequent expression.","refs":["CH_97E9_20_2:A8","CH_97E9_20_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:D7","text":"The bestowal of the crown transforms an individual attitude into a collective task of those addressed.","refs":["CH_97E9_20_2:A10","CH_97E9_20_2:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:SD1","text":"The system replaces the vertical superiority of the higher human beings with a dynamic capacity for self-transcendence.","refs":["CH_97E9_20_2:A3","CH_97E9_20_2:A7","CH_97E9_20_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:SD2","text":"Critique of the existing world is transformed into a corporeal-affective practice of storm, dance, and laughter.","refs":["CH_97E9_20_2:A4","CH_97E9_20_2:A6","CH_97E9_20_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:SD3","text":"The negative is overcome not through withdrawal, but through an intensified form of movement.","refs":["CH_97E9_20_2:A4","CH_97E9_20_2:A5","CH_97E9_20_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:SD4","text":"The new hierarchy rests on the capacity to move beyond one's own failed form and nevertheless to laugh.","refs":["CH_97E9_20_2:A7","CH_97E9_20_2:A9","CH_97E9_20_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:DNX1","text":"The system excludes the possibility that liberation can be achieved through adaptation to the existing present.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:DNX2","text":"The system excludes the possibility that knowledge suffices without corporeal and affective transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:DNX3","text":"The system excludes the possibility that seriousness, melancholy, or ressentiment are viable forms of higher existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:DNX4","text":"The system excludes the possibility that self-transcendence is possible without relinquishing the previous form of the self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:DNX5","text":"The system excludes the possibility that a one-time distinction already enables the higher human beings for their task.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a static completion of the higher human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:SNX2","text":"Excluded is a liberation that can do without upheaval, risk, and transformation of the existing order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:SNX3","text":"Excluded is a community whose unity rests on the same heaviness, the same dejection, or the same adaptation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:SNX4","text":"Absent remains a procedure that grounds the selective boundary between the higher human being and the rabble, although this boundary organizes the entire evaluation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:FGS1","text":"Self-positing movement + external upheaval → model of the free spirit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:FGS2","text":"Free spirit + exclusion of decay and melancholy → positive counterfigure to the present and the rabble.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:FGS3","text":"Transfer of the counterfigure to the higher human beings → diagnosis of their lacking capacity for dance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:FGS4","text":"Diagnosis of failure + openness of further possibility → call to self-transcendence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:FGS5","text":"Self-transcendence + laughter → sacred redefinition of the attitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:FGS6","text":"Sacralized laughter + bestowal of the crown → obligation of the higher human beings to a new form of existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:AF1","text":"Congealed present and rabble → storm as countermovement → free spirit as mobile value-figure → lacking capacity for dance of the higher human beings → self-transcendence → sacred laughter → bestowal of the crown of laughter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:ME1","text":"Superiority is remapped from a static rank into a dynamic capacity for self-transcendence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:ME2","text":"Adversity is reclassified from an obstacle into the space of movement of the free spirit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:ME3","text":"Laughter is elevated from an affective ancillary phenomenon to the highest normative practice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:ME4","text":"Failure is transformed from a conclusive judgment into a still-open situation of transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:ME5","text":"Opposition to what exists is mapped not as mere negation, but as intensified life-movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:ALT1","text":"Surface — Storm, dance, and laughter function as immediately visible images of movement and affect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:ALT2","text":"Structural — Higher existence is organized through the difference between self-movement and rigidity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text replaces self-accusation and melancholy with a practice of dancing beyond oneself and laughing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — The subject is not a completed state, but a becoming form that constitutes itself through self-transcendence against the present.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from the storm as model to the crown of laughter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined according to which criteria the „Pöbel“ and the „higher human beings“ are demarcated from one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent, provided that dance, laughter, and storm are read as variants of the same logic of movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:MRT4","text":"Its strongest connection is that of failure, possibility, and self-transcendence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:MRT5","text":"A tension arises between the asserted freedom of the spirit and the normative instruction concerning how the higher human beings must dance and laugh.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:MRT6","text":"A second tension arises between the dissolution of static hierarchy and the continuing exclusion of the rabble.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_20_2:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement, provided that the sacred crowning is understood as a transition from imagery to obligation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_20_2:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_20_2@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_20_2:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"On the Higher Man","source_section_label":"20.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Four and Last"],"reading_title":"On the Higher Man · 20","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","On the Higher Man","20."],"original_title":"20."}],"source_title_context":"Vom höheren Menschen","source_section_label":"20.","source_title_hierarchy":["Vierter und letzter Theil"],"reading_title":"On the Higher Man · 20","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","On the Higher Man","20."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 159","title":"On the Higher Man · 20","context":"Part Four and Last","original_context":"Vierter und letzter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Vom höheren Menschen · 20"},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15","layer":"CH","title":"The Song of Melancholy · 1","order":160,"parents":["RAW_97E9_1_15"],"revision":"CH_97E9_1_15@R001","sha256":"3062a81e52509ab70670a2fe9a2ec2f866c793765cc31125720ede5c6d85f810","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:AS1","text":"Die Nähe zu den höheren Menschen erzeugt eine atmosphärische und olfaktorische Belastung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:AS2","text":"Zarathustra entzieht sich dieser sozialen Nähe durch den Übergang ins Freie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:AS3","text":"Die äußere Luft wird als reine, stille und bessere Gegenwelt zur Sphäre der höheren Menschen bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:AS4","text":"Die Tiere fungieren als gesuchte Gegeninstanz und als unmittelbare Adressaten der affektiven Rückwendung Zarathustras.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:AS5","text":"Die gemeinsame, sprachlose Aufnahme der guten Luft stabilisiert die Liebe zu den Tieren und die Distanz zu den höheren Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:A1","text":"Zarathustra befindet sich an der Schwelle zwischen Höhle und Außenraum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:A2","text":"Zarathustra entzieht sich seinen Gästen und flieht vorübergehend ins Freie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:A3","text":"Die Luft außerhalb der Höhle ist besser als die Luft bei den höheren Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:A4","text":"Reiner Geruch und selige Stille kennzeichnen den Außenraum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:A5","text":"Zarathustra sucht seinen Adler und seine Schlange als seine Tiere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:A6","text":"Zarathustra bringt den Geruch der höheren Menschen als mögliche Geruchsverfehlung zur Sprache.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:A7","text":"Zarathustra erklärt seine Liebe zu den Tieren ausdrücklich und wiederholt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:A8","text":"Adler und Schlange nähern sich Zarathustra und reagieren auf seine Liebeserklärung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:A9","text":"Zarathustra, Adler und Schlange bilden eine stille Dreiergemeinschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:A10","text":"Die Dreiergemeinschaft nimmt die gute Luft gemeinsam durch Schnüffeln und Schlürfen auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:NX1","text":"Der Außenraum ist nicht die soziale Sphäre der Gäste.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:NX2","text":"Die gute Luft ist nicht die Luft bei den höheren Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:NX3","text":"Die selige Stille ist nicht die Redeordnung der vorausgegangenen Versammlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:NX4","text":"Die Tiere sind nicht Teil der geruchlich problematisierten Gruppe der höheren Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:NX5","text":"Die Beziehung zu den Tieren wird nicht durch argumentative Antwort, sondern durch körperliche Annäherung hergestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:NX6","text":"Die höhere Stellung der Menschen garantiert keine Reinheit, Verträglichkeit oder gute Atmosphäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:D1","text":"Der räumliche Austritt aus der Versammlung wird zur Prüfung ihrer atmosphärischen Qualität.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_15:A2","CH_97E9_1_15:A3","CH_97E9_1_15:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:D2","text":"Die höheren Menschen werden nicht primär durch ihre Aussagen, sondern durch ihre vermutete Geruchsqualität negativ bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_15:A3","CH_97E9_1_15:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:D3","text":"Die Tiere bilden für Zarathustra eine affektive Gegenordnung zur belastenden Menschengruppe.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_15:A5","CH_97E9_1_15:A7","CH_97E9_1_15:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:D4","text":"Die Liebe zu den Tieren wird durch räumliche Nähe und gemeinsame körperliche Wahrnehmung bestätigt.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_15:A7","CH_97E9_1_15:A8","CH_97E9_1_15:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:D5","text":"Schweigen fungiert als Form gelingender Gemeinschaft, sobald die belastende soziale Rede verlassen ist.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_15:A2","CH_97E9_1_15:A4","CH_97E9_1_15:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:SD1","text":"Die Wertordnung des Textes wird über atmosphärische Verträglichkeit statt über soziale Rangordnung organisiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_15:A3","CH_97E9_1_15:A6","CH_97E9_1_15:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:SD2","text":"Die Flucht ins Freie verwandelt eine bloße Ortsveränderung in eine epistemische und affektive Neubewertung der Menschen.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_15:A2","CH_97E9_1_15:A3","CH_97E9_1_15:A4","CH_97E9_1_15:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:SD3","text":"Die Tiere werden zu einer nichtsprachlichen Instanz, an der sich Zugehörigkeit, Liebe und Reinheit konkretisieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_15:A5","CH_97E9_1_15:A7","CH_97E9_1_15:A8","CH_97E9_1_15:A9","CH_97E9_1_15:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:SD4","text":"Die vermeintlich höheren Menschen erscheinen als eine Gruppe, deren soziale Erhöhung mit atmosphärischer Entfremdung kollidiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_15:A3","CH_97E9_1_15:A6","CH_97E9_1_15:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:DNX1","text":"Menschliche Höherstellung wird als hinreichender Maßstab für Wert, Nähe oder Reinheit ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:DNX2","text":"Gemeinschaft wird nicht als Ergebnis gemeinsamer Rede oder gemeinsamer sozialer Stellung vorausgesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:DNX3","text":"Erkenntnis wird nicht auf diskursive Erklärung beschränkt, sondern kann durch Geruch, Luft und körperliche Wahrnehmung erzeugt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:DNX4","text":"Die Höhle und ihre Gäste werden nicht als endgültiger Ort von Wahrheit, Sammlung oder Zugehörigkeit behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Welt, in der soziale Erhöhung automatisch atmosphärische oder ethische Überlegenheit bedeutet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Gemeinschaft, deren Einheit allein durch Sprache, Rang und Versammlung hergestellt werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen bleibt die Möglichkeit, dass Zarathustras Liebe innerhalb der menschlichen Versammlung ihre angemessene Bestätigung findet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:SNX4","text":"Die abwesende Reinheit der höheren Menschen strukturiert die gesamte Rückwendung zu Luft, Tieren und Schweigen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:FGS1","text":"Soziale Nähe zu den höheren Menschen → olfaktorische Belastung → räumlicher Austritt ins Freie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:FGS2","text":"Außenraum → reine Luft und Stille → Neubestimmung der menschlichen Gruppe als geruchlich problematisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:FGS3","text":"Abwesenheit der Tiere → Ruf nach Adler und Schlange → Wiederherstellung einer bevorzugten Beziehung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:FGS4","text":"Liebeserklärung → tierische Annäherung → stille Dreiergemeinschaft → gemeinsame körperliche Bestätigung der guten Luft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:FGS5","text":"Atmosphärischer Gegensatz → affektive Umkehrung → Tiere als positive Gegenordnung, höhere Menschen als negative Grenzfigur.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:AF1","text":"Versammlung der höheren Menschen → Entzug Zarathustras → reine Außenluft → Geruchsverdacht gegen die höheren Menschen → Ruf nach den Tieren → Liebeserklärung → tierische Annäherung → stille gemeinsame Einverleibung der guten Luft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:ME1","text":"Die soziale Rangordnung wird in eine atmosphärische Rangordnung übersetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:ME2","text":"Der Gegensatz Mensch/Tier wird durch den Gegensatz belastete Nähe/reine Gemeinschaft überlagert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:ME3","text":"Der Außenraum wird vom bloßen Schauplatz zur wertenden Instanz gegenüber der menschlichen Versammlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:ME4","text":"Schweigen wird von einem Mangel an Kommunikation zu einer positiven Form gemeinsamer Präsenz umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:ME5","text":"Geruch wird als Instrument der sozialen und affektiven Klassifikation eingesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:ALT1","text":"Surface — Zarathustra verlässt seine Gäste, ruft seine Tiere und atmet mit ihnen die gute Luft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:ALT2","text":"Structural — Außenraum, Luft, Geruch und Stille bilden ein Ordnungssystem, das die höheren Menschen negativ von den Tieren abgrenzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text ersetzt argumentative Auseinandersetzung durch Entzug, Wahrnehmung und affektive Reorientierung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Zugehörigkeit entsteht als gegenwärtige leibliche Ko-Präsenz; die nur vorübergehende Flucht erzeugt keine endgültige Trennung, sondern eine erneuerte Bindung an die Tiere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um den Übergang von der Versammlung zur tierischen Dreiergemeinschaft zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob der schlechte Geruch der höheren Menschen wörtlich, metaphorisch oder unentscheidbar zwischen beiden Ebenen angesiedelt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, weil räumliche, olfaktorische und affektive Gegensätze dieselbe Umkehrung tragen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Achse ist die Umwertung menschlicher Höhe durch atmosphärische Wahrnehmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:MRT5","text":"Die Rekonstruktion hängt von der Gleichsetzung von reiner Luft, Tieren, Schweigen und gelingender Nähe ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:MRT6","text":"Die Argumentbewegung bleibt erhalten, sofern die tierische Annäherung als Bestätigung und nicht lediglich als begleitende Szene behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T185755029281Z_f1257ab9","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"1.","source_sha256":"3062a81e52509ab70670a2fe9a2ec2f866c793765cc31125720ede5c6d85f810","sha256":"ae8c67543a32a79b1bbbb7ae3194b32a48402d2a5e8f68a88adcbbcddd499929","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T18:57:55.031448+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:AS1","text":"Proximity to the higher men produces an atmospheric and olfactory burden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:AS2","text":"Zarathustra withdraws from this social proximity by moving outdoors.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:AS3","text":"The outer air is determined as a pure, silent, and better counterworld to the sphere of the higher men.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:AS4","text":"The animals function as the sought counter-instance and as the immediate addressees of Zarathustra's affective turning-back.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:AS5","text":"The shared, speechless intake of the good air stabilizes the love of the animals and the distance from the higher men.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:A1","text":"Zarathustra stands at the threshold between the cave and the outdoor space.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:A2","text":"Zarathustra withdraws from his guests and temporarily flees outdoors.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:A3","text":"The air outside the cave is better than the air among the higher men.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:A4","text":"Pure scent and blissful silence characterize the outdoor space.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:A5","text":"Zarathustra seeks his eagle and his serpent as his animals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:A6","text":"Zarathustra raises the scent of the higher men as a possible olfactory failing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:A7","text":"Zarathustra explicitly and repeatedly declares his love for the animals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:A8","text":"Eagle and serpent approach Zarathustra and respond to his declaration of love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:A9","text":"Zarathustra, eagle, and serpent form a silent community of three.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:A10","text":"The community of three jointly takes in the good air by sniffing and slurping.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:NX1","text":"The outdoor space is not the social sphere of the guests.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:NX2","text":"The good air is not the air among the higher men.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:NX3","text":"Blissful silence is not the order of speech of the preceding assembly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:NX4","text":"The animals are not part of the group of higher men problematized in terms of scent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:NX5","text":"The relationship to the animals is established not through argumentative response, but through bodily approach.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:NX6","text":"The higher status of human beings guarantees neither purity, compatibility, nor a good atmosphere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:D1","text":"The spatial exit from the assembly becomes a test of its atmospheric quality.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_15:A2","CH_97E9_1_15:A3","CH_97E9_1_15:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:D2","text":"The higher men are negatively determined not primarily by their statements, but by their presumed olfactory quality.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_15:A3","CH_97E9_1_15:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:D3","text":"For Zarathustra, the animals form an affective counter-order to the burdensome human group.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_15:A5","CH_97E9_1_15:A7","CH_97E9_1_15:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:D4","text":"Love for the animals is confirmed through spatial proximity and shared bodily perception.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_15:A7","CH_97E9_1_15:A8","CH_97E9_1_15:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:D5","text":"Silence functions as a form of successful community once burdensome social speech has been left behind.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_15:A2","CH_97E9_1_15:A4","CH_97E9_1_15:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:SD1","text":"The text's order of value is organized through atmospheric compatibility rather than through social hierarchy.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_15:A3","CH_97E9_1_15:A6","CH_97E9_1_15:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:SD2","text":"The flight outdoors transforms a mere change of place into an epistemic and affective revaluation of human beings.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_15:A2","CH_97E9_1_15:A3","CH_97E9_1_15:A4","CH_97E9_1_15:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:SD3","text":"The animals become a non-linguistic instance in which belonging, love, and purity are concretized.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_15:A5","CH_97E9_1_15:A7","CH_97E9_1_15:A8","CH_97E9_1_15:A9","CH_97E9_1_15:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:SD4","text":"The allegedly higher men appear as a group whose social elevation collides with atmospheric alienation.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_15:A3","CH_97E9_1_15:A6","CH_97E9_1_15:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:DNX1","text":"Human elevation is excluded as a sufficient measure of value, proximity, or purity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:DNX2","text":"Community is not presupposed as the result of shared speech or shared social status.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:DNX3","text":"Knowledge is not restricted to discursive explanation, but can be produced through scent, air, and bodily perception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:DNX4","text":"The cave and its guests are not treated as the final place of truth, gathering, or belonging.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a world in which social elevation automatically means atmospheric or ethical superiority.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:SNX2","text":"Excluded is a community whose unity can be produced solely through language, rank, and assembly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:SNX3","text":"Excluded remains the possibility that Zarathustra's love finds its appropriate confirmation within the human assembly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:SNX4","text":"The absent purity of the higher men structures the entire turning-back toward air, animals, and silence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:FGS1","text":"Social proximity to the higher men → olfactory burden → spatial exit outdoors.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:FGS2","text":"Outdoor space → pure air and silence → redefinition of the human group as olfactorily problematic.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:FGS3","text":"Absence of the animals → call for eagle and serpent → restoration of a preferred relationship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:FGS4","text":"Declaration of love → animal approach → silent community of three → shared bodily confirmation of the good air.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:FGS5","text":"Atmospheric opposition → affective reversal → animals as positive counter-order, higher men as negative limiting figure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:AF1","text":"Assembly of the higher men → Zarathustra's withdrawal → pure outer air → suspicion of scent against the higher men → call for the animals → declaration of love → animal approach → silent shared incorporation of the good air.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:ME1","text":"The social hierarchy is translated into an atmospheric hierarchy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:ME2","text":"The human/animal opposition is overlaid by the opposition between burdensome proximity and pure community.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:ME3","text":"The outdoor space becomes, from a mere setting, an evaluative instance vis-à-vis the human assembly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:ME4","text":"Silence is reclassified from a lack of communication into a positive form of shared presence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:ME5","text":"Scent is deployed as an instrument of social and affective classification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:ALT1","text":"Surface — Zarathustra leaves his guests, calls his animals, and breathes the good air with them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:ALT2","text":"Structural — Outdoor space, air, scent, and silence form an ordering system that negatively demarcates the higher men from the animals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text replaces argumentative confrontation with withdrawal, perception, and affective reorientation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Belonging arises as present embodied co-presence; the merely temporary flight produces no final separation, but rather a renewed bond with the animals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the transition from the assembly to the animal community of three.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether the bad scent of the higher men is to be situated literally, metaphorically, or undecidably between the two levels.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent because spatial, olfactory, and affective oppositions sustain the same reversal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:MRT4","text":"Its strongest axis is the revaluation of human height through atmospheric perception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:MRT5","text":"The reconstruction depends on the equation of pure air, animals, silence, and successful proximity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_15:MRT6","text":"The argumentative movement is preserved provided that the animal approach is treated as confirmation and not merely as an accompanying scene.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_15:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_1_15@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_1_15:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"The Song of Melancholy","source_section_label":"1.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Four and Last"],"reading_title":"The Song of Melancholy · 1","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","The Song of Melancholy","1."],"original_title":"1."}],"source_title_context":"Das Lied der Schwermuth","source_section_label":"1.","source_title_hierarchy":["Vierter und letzter Theil"],"reading_title":"The Song of Melancholy · 1","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","The Song of Melancholy","1."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 160","title":"The Song of Melancholy · 1","context":"Part Four and Last","original_context":"Vierter und letzter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Das Lied der Schwermuth · 1"},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15","layer":"CH","title":"The Song of Melancholy · 2","order":161,"parents":["RAW_97E9_2_15"],"revision":"CH_97E9_2_15@R001","sha256":"d6a6e149f7480d6b8c323f626e3d6c7b1705281e74aa3c16c9c619525c8e88a0","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:AS1","text":"Zarathustras Verlassen der Höhle eröffnet dem alten Zauberer den Raum für eine beschwörende Rede.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:AS2","text":"Der Zauberer bestimmt die höheren Menschen nicht durch ihre Selbsttitel, sondern durch den gemeinsamen Zustand des großen Ekels nach dem Tod des alten Gottes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:AS3","text":"Dieser Zustand macht sie für den schwermütigen Geist empfänglich, der zugleich Zarathustras grundsätzlicher Widersacher und sein unwillkommen geliebter Bestandteil ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:AS4","text":"Zarathustra wird als Erscheinungsmaske eines fremden Zaubergeistes neu gerahmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:AS5","text":"Die Rede steigert diese Rahmung zur angekündigten Entblößung eines noch unbestimmten, möglicherweise männlichen oder weiblichen Abend-Teufels.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:AS6","text":"Das Argument bewegt sich von der Abwesenheit Zarathustras über die Enthüllung der gemeinsamen Schwermut zur bevorstehenden Manifestation des nicht eindeutig bestimmbaren Geistes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:A1","text":"Zarathustras Ausgang ermöglicht dem alten Zauberer, die höheren Menschen unmittelbar zu adressieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:A2","text":"Die Bezeichnungen „freie Geister“, „Wahrhaftige“, „Büsser des Geistes“, „Entfesselte“ und „grosse Sehnsüchtige“ fungieren als Ehren- und Schmeichelnamen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:A3","text":"Die höheren Menschen teilen mit dem Zauberer den Zustand des großen Ekels.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:A4","text":"Der alte Gott ist gestorben, ohne dass ein neuer Gott entstanden ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:A5","text":"Der schwermütige Geist ist Zarathustra aus dem Grunde ein Widersacher.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:A6","text":"Der schwermütige Geist ergreift und zwingt den Zauberer gegen dessen Willen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:A7","text":"Zarathustra kann als schöne Heiligen-Larve oder neuer Mummenschanze erscheinen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:A8","text":"Der Zaubergeist gefällt sich in der Gestalt Zarathustras und vermittelt dadurch seine Erscheinung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:A9","text":"Der Zauberer behauptet, die höheren Menschen, Zarathustra und den Unhold zu kennen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:A10","text":"Der Geist verlangt nach einer nackten, noch nicht geschlechtlich bestimmten Erscheinung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:A11","text":"Der Abend bringt allen Dingen, auch den besten, ein Abklingen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:A12","text":"Die Manifestation des Geistes verlangt von den höheren Menschen gesteigerte Aufmerksamkeit ihrer Augen und Sinne.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:NX1","text":"Die Selbstbezeichnungen der höheren Menschen begründen ihre Freiheit, Wahrhaftigkeit oder Entfesselung nicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:NX2","text":"Der Tod des alten Gottes wird nicht durch die Geburt eines neuen Gottes aufgehoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:NX3","text":"Der Zauberer besitzt keine souveräne Verfügung über seinen eigenen Geist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:NX4","text":"Zarathustra erscheint nicht als unvermittelte, eindeutige Gestalt, sondern als Larve und Mummenschanze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:NX5","text":"Der angekündigte Teufel ist weder eindeutig männlich noch eindeutig weiblich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:NX6","text":"Auch das Beste entzieht sich dem Abend und bleibt nicht außerhalb des Verfalls.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:D1","text":"Die Ehrennamen der höheren Menschen verdecken ihren gemeinsamen affektiven Grundzustand.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_15:A2","CH_97E9_2_15:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:D2","text":"Die religiöse Leerstelle nach dem Tod des alten Gottes erzeugt keine Befreiung, sondern eine offene Empfänglichkeit für den schwermütigen Geist.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_15:A3","CH_97E9_2_15:A4","CH_97E9_2_15:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:D3","text":"Zarathustras Erscheinung kann als Träger einer Macht gelesen werden, die ihm zugleich widerspricht und sich seiner Gestalt bedient.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_15:A5","CH_97E9_2_15:A7","CH_97E9_2_15:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:D4","text":"Die behauptete Kenntnis des Zauberers bleibt in eine Szene der Verstellung, des Zaubers und der Selbsttäuschung eingebunden.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_15:A6","CH_97E9_2_15:A7","CH_97E9_2_15:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:D5","text":"Die angekündigte Entblößung bezeichnet keine abschließende Identitätsbestimmung, sondern die Sichtbarwerdung einer weiterhin unbestimmten Macht.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_15:A10","CH_97E9_2_15:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:D6","text":"Der Übergang zum Abend verwandelt die Rede von einer bloßen Beschreibung in eine Schwellen- und Erscheinungsszene.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_15:A1","CH_97E9_2_15:A11","CH_97E9_2_15:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:SD1","text":"Der Text ersetzt die positive Selbstbeschreibung der höheren Menschen durch eine negative Genealogie aus Ekel, Gottesverlust und geistiger Empfänglichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:SD2","text":"Zarathustra wird als instabile Vermittlungsfigur totalisiert: Er ist zugleich Widersacher des Geistes, dessen geliebte Maske und Medium seiner möglichen Erscheinung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:SD3","text":"Erkenntnis wird als ambivalente Beteiligung an Verstellung organisiert: Der Zauberer behauptet vollständige Kenntnis, während seine Rede die Identität des Geistes weiter verschiebt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:SD4","text":"Die angekündigte Entblößung erzeugt keine positive Wahrheit, sondern eine gesteigerte Sichtbarkeit des Unbestimmten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:SD5","text":"Der Abend fungiert als ontologische Grenze, an der selbst höchste Werte in den Prozess des Abklingens einbezogen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:DNX1","text":"Das System setzt voraus, dass die Selbsttitel der höheren Menschen ihre tatsächliche Verfassung nicht ausdrücken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:DNX2","text":"Es setzt voraus, dass nach dem Zusammenbruch einer obersten religiösen Ordnung keine unmittelbar verfügbare neue Ordnung bereitsteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:DNX3","text":"Es schließt ein souveränes, mit sich identisches Subjekt des Zaubers aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:DNX4","text":"Es schließt eine eindeutige Trennung zwischen Zarathustra und dem Geist aus, der ihm widerspricht und sich zugleich in ihm gefällt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:DNX5","text":"Es schließt die Möglichkeit aus, dass Enthüllung mit endgültiger Bestimmung zusammenfällt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:SNX1","text":"Abwesend bleibt eine positive Instanz, die nach dem Tod des alten Gottes den Sinn, die Identität und die Richtung der höheren Menschen garantieren könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:SNX2","text":"Versperrt bleibt eine unvermittelte Gestalt Zarathustras jenseits von Larve, Maske und fremder Besetzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:SNX3","text":"Unverfügbar bleibt die eindeutige Gestalt des Geistes; selbst seine geschlechtliche Bestimmung wird als offene Möglichkeit behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:SNX4","text":"Unzulässig wird die Annahme, dass das Erscheinen des Verborgenen dessen Widersprüchlichkeit beendet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:FGS1","text":"Abwesenheit Zarathustras → Freisetzung der Zaubererrede → direkte Anrufung der höheren Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:FGS2","text":"Ehrennamen → Rückführung auf gemeinsamen Ekel → Offenlegung des Gottesverlusts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:FGS3","text":"Gottesverlust + Ekel → Empfänglichkeit für den schwermütigen Geist → Unterwerfung des Zauberers unter dessen Zwang.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:FGS4","text":"Geistiger Widerspruch zu Zarathustra + Gefallen an seiner Gestalt → Zarathustra als Larve und Mummenschanze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:FGS5","text":"Abendliches Abklingen → Forderung nach gesteigerter Wahrnehmung → angekündigte nackte, aber unbestimmte Erscheinung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:FGS6","text":"Erscheinung → keine Identitätsauflösung, sondern Intensivierung der Ambivalenz zwischen Enthüllung, Verstellung und Zwang.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:AF1","text":"Zarathustras Ausgang → Redeermächtigung des Zauberers → Entwertung der Ehrentitel → gemeinsamer Ekel und Gottesverlust → Einbruch des schwermütigen Geistes → Zarathustra als Maske des Widersachers → angekündigte unbestimmte Entblößung → abendliche Schwellenerscheinung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:ME1","text":"Die höheren Menschen werden von einer Gruppe selbsternannter geistiger Typen zu einer affektiv und religiös bestimmten Krisengemeinschaft umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:ME2","text":"Zarathustra wird von einer eigenständigen Autoritätsfigur zu einem umkämpften Erscheinungsmedium des Geistes umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:ME3","text":"Enthüllung und Verbergung werden nicht mehr als Gegensätze, sondern als ko-produzierende Funktionen derselben Zauberszene kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:ME4","text":"Der Abend wird von einer zeitlichen Tagesphase zu einem allgemeinen Mechanismus des Abklingens aller Werte und Gestalten erweitert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:ME5","text":"Geschlechtliche Bestimmung wird von einer vorausgesetzten Eigenschaft zu einer im Erscheinen suspendierten Möglichkeit umgezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:ALT1","text":"Surface — Ein Zauberer spricht nach Zarathustras Fortgang zu den höheren Menschen und kündigt das Erscheinen eines Geistes an.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:ALT2","text":"Structural — Schmeichelnamen, Ekel, Gottesverlust, Zwang und Maskierung bilden die Mechanik der geistigen Szene.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Rede verschiebt die Aufmerksamkeit von den Selbstansprüchen der höheren Menschen auf ihre unbewusste Empfänglichkeit und fordert sensorische Wachsamkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Identität erscheint als maskierte und geschlechtlich unbestimmte Erscheinung; Zeit wirkt als universelles Abklingen auch des Besten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von Zarathustras Abwesenheit zur angekündigten Geistererscheinung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob der schwermütige Geist eine eigenständige Macht, eine psychische Projektion oder eine theatrale Funktion des Zauberers ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern spannungsvoll, weil der Geist Zarathustra widerspricht, sich in seiner Gestalt gefällt und durch ihn erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung besteht zwischen Gottesverlust, großem Ekel und der Empfänglichkeit für den Geist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:MRT5","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die ungelöste Spannung zwischen behaupteter Kenntnis und fortbestehender Unbestimmtheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion hängt von der Kompression der metaphorischen Figuren in die Funktionen von Maske, Zwang, Schwelle und Erscheinung ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T191014571367Z_df8262d2","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"2.","source_sha256":"d6a6e149f7480d6b8c323f626e3d6c7b1705281e74aa3c16c9c619525c8e88a0","sha256":"0f458eb3f79d94ce3a8a06bf005c0ff7cc291e3c43a01a93cbe4c43b5ce951ca","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:10:14.572849+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:AS1","text":"Zarathustra's departure from the cave opens the space for the old magician to deliver an incantatory speech.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:AS2","text":"The magician defines the higher men not by their self-titles, but by the shared condition of great disgust after the death of the old god.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:AS3","text":"This condition makes them receptive to the melancholy spirit, which is at once Zarathustra's fundamental adversary and his unwelcome beloved component.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:AS4","text":"Zarathustra is reframed as the appearance-mask of an alien magical spirit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:AS5","text":"The speech intensifies this framing into the announced uncovering of a still indeterminate, possibly male or female evening-devil.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:AS6","text":"The argument moves from Zarathustra's absence through the revelation of shared melancholy to the imminent manifestation of the spirit that cannot be unambiguously determined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:A1","text":"Zarathustra's departure enables the old magician to address the higher men directly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:A2","text":"The designations “free spirits,” “truthful ones,” “penitents of the spirit,” “unfettered ones,” and “great yearning ones” function as honorific and flattering names.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:A3","text":"The higher men share with the magician the condition of great disgust.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:A4","text":"The old god has died without a new god having arisen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:A5","text":"The melancholy spirit is Zarathustra's adversary for that very reason.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:A6","text":"The melancholy spirit seizes and compels the magician against his will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0009","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:A7","text":"Zarathustra can appear as a beautiful saint-mask or new mummers' redoubt (Mummenschanze).","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:A8","text":"The magical spirit delights in Zarathustra's form and thereby conveys its appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:A9","text":"The magician claims to know the higher men, Zarathustra, and the monster.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:A10","text":"The spirit demands a naked appearance not yet sexually determined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:A11","text":"Evening brings a dying-away to all things, including the best.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:A12","text":"The manifestation of the spirit demands heightened attention of the higher men's eyes and senses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:NX1","text":"The higher men's self-designations do not establish their freedom, truthfulness, or unfetteredness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:NX2","text":"The death of the old god is not annulled by the birth of a new god.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:NX3","text":"The magician does not possess sovereign command over his own spirit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:NX4","text":"Zarathustra does not appear as an unmediated, unambiguous figure, but as a mask and mummers' redoubt (Mummenschanze).","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:NX5","text":"The announced devil is neither unambiguously male nor unambiguously female.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:NX6","text":"Even the best does not escape evening and does not remain outside decay.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:D1","text":"The honorific names of the higher men conceal their shared fundamental affective condition.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_15:A2","CH_97E9_2_15:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:D2","text":"The religious void after the death of the old god produces not liberation, but an open receptivity to the melancholy spirit.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_15:A3","CH_97E9_2_15:A4","CH_97E9_2_15:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:D3","text":"Zarathustra's appearance can be read as the bearer of a power that at once contradicts him and makes use of his form.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_15:A5","CH_97E9_2_15:A7","CH_97E9_2_15:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:D4","text":"The magician's claimed knowledge remains embedded in a scene of dissimulation, magic, and self-deception.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_15:A6","CH_97E9_2_15:A7","CH_97E9_2_15:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:D5","text":"The announced uncovering signifies not a conclusive determination of identity, but the becoming-visible of a power that remains indeterminate.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_15:A10","CH_97E9_2_15:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:D6","text":"The transition to evening transforms the speech from a mere description into a threshold and appearance scene.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_15:A1","CH_97E9_2_15:A11","CH_97E9_2_15:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:SD1","text":"The text replaces the positive self-description of the higher men with a negative genealogy of disgust, loss of god, and spiritual receptivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:SD2","text":"Zarathustra is totalized as an unstable mediating figure: he is at once the spirit's adversary, its beloved mask, and the medium of its possible appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:SD3","text":"Knowledge is organized as ambivalent participation in dissimulation: the magician claims complete knowledge, while his speech further displaces the identity of the spirit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:SD4","text":"The announced uncovering produces no positive truth, but a heightened visibility of the indeterminate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:SD5","text":"Evening functions as an ontological boundary at which even the highest values are drawn into the process of dying-away.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:DNX1","text":"The system presupposes that the higher men's self-titles do not express their actual condition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:DNX2","text":"It presupposes that after the collapse of a supreme religious order, no immediately available new order stands ready.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:DNX3","text":"It excludes a sovereign, self-identical subject of magic.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:DNX4","text":"It excludes an unambiguous separation between Zarathustra and the spirit that contradicts him while simultaneously delighting in him.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:DNX5","text":"It excludes the possibility that revelation coincides with final determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:SNX1","text":"Absent is a positive instance that, after the death of the old god, could guarantee the meaning, identity, and direction of the higher men.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:SNX2","text":"Foreclosed is an unmediated figure of Zarathustra beyond mask, disguise, and alien occupation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:SNX3","text":"The unambiguous form of the spirit remains unavailable; even its sexual determination is treated as an open possibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:SNX4","text":"The assumption that the appearance of what is hidden ends its contradictoriness becomes inadmissible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:FGS1","text":"Zarathustra's absence → release of the magician's speech → direct address to the higher men.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:FGS2","text":"Honorific names → reduction to shared disgust → disclosure of the loss of god.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:FGS3","text":"Loss of god + disgust → receptivity to the melancholy spirit → subjection of the magician to its compulsion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:FGS4","text":"Spiritual contradiction of Zarathustra + delight in his form → Zarathustra as mask and mummers' redoubt (Mummenschanze).","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:FGS5","text":"Evening dying-away → demand for heightened perception → announced naked yet indeterminate appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:FGS6","text":"Appearance → no resolution of identity, but intensification of the ambivalence between revelation, dissimulation, and compulsion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:AF1","text":"Zarathustra's departure → the magician's empowerment to speak → devaluation of the honorific titles → shared disgust and loss of god → irruption of the melancholy spirit → Zarathustra as the adversary's mask → announced indeterminate uncovering → evening threshold appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:ME1","text":"The higher men are remapped from a group of self-proclaimed spiritual types into an affectively and religiously determined community of crisis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:ME2","text":"Zarathustra is reclassified from an independent figure of authority into a contested medium of the spirit's appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:ME3","text":"Revelation and concealment are mapped no longer as opposites, but as co-producing functions of the same magical scene.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:ME4","text":"Evening is expanded from a temporal phase of the day into a general mechanism of the dying-away of all values and forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:ME5","text":"Sexual determination is redrawn from a presupposed property into a possibility suspended in appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:ALT1","text":"Surface — A magician speaks to the higher men after Zarathustra's departure and announces the appearance of a spirit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:ALT2","text":"Structural — Flattering names, disgust, loss of god, compulsion, and masking constitute the mechanics of the spiritual scene.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The speech shifts attention from the higher men's self-claims to their unconscious receptivity and demands sensory vigilance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Identity appears as masked and sexually indeterminate appearance; time operates as a universal dying-away, even of the best.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from Zarathustra's absence to the announced appearance of the spirit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether the melancholy spirit is an independent power, a psychic projection, or a theatrical function of the magician.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally tension-filled because the spirit contradicts Zarathustra, delights in his form, and appears through him.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:MRT4","text":"The strongest connection exists between loss of god, great disgust, and receptivity to the spirit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:MRT5","text":"The reconstruction preserves the unresolved tension between claimed knowledge and continuing indeterminacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_15:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction depends on the compression of the metaphorical figures into the functions of mask, compulsion, threshold, and appearance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_15:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_2_15@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_2_15:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"The Song of Melancholy","source_section_label":"2.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Four and Last"],"reading_title":"The Song of Melancholy · 2","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","The Song of Melancholy","2."],"original_title":"2."}],"source_title_context":"Das Lied der Schwermuth","source_section_label":"2.","source_title_hierarchy":["Vierter und letzter Theil"],"reading_title":"The Song of Melancholy · 2","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","The Song of Melancholy","2."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 161","title":"The Song of Melancholy · 2","context":"Part Four and Last","original_context":"Vierter und letzter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Das Lied der Schwermuth · 2"},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8","layer":"CH","title":"The Song of Melancholy · 3","order":162,"parents":["RAW_97E9_3C_8"],"revision":"CH_97E9_3C_8@R001","sha256":"b73ae6f8ea69eb7c0a4fde2518c06cfca492484fcdb96afb11389908e25b6377","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:AS1","text":"Ein nach Wahrheit dürstendes Subjekt wird von einer höhnischen Anrede als Dichter, Narr und raubendes Tier neu bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:AS2","text":"Wahrheit wird nicht als stilles, starres und sakral fixiertes Standbild, sondern als bewegliche, maskierte und wilde Beziehung entworfen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:AS3","text":"Die dichterische Wahrnehmung dringt in Abgründe ein und schlägt von der vertikalen Selbstversenkung in raubartige Aggression um.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:AS4","text":"Das menschliche und göttliche Maß wird durch die Zerreißung des Schafhaften im Menschen und des Schafes im Gott umgekehrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:AS5","text":"Die so erzeugte Seligkeit beruht auf der Verbindung von Pantherhaftigkeit, Adlerhaftigkeit, Maskierung, Lüge und Grausamkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:AS6","text":"Nach der Erschöpfung am Licht und an einer einzigen Wahrheit sinkt das Subjekt in Abend, Schatten, Tau und eine Verbannung von aller Wahrheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:A1","text":"Das Subjekt ist von einem intensiven Durst nach Wahrheit und himmlischen Tränen bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:A2","text":"Die Wahrheitssuche erzeugt keine endgültige Wahrheitsruhe, sondern eine gesteigerte Bedürftigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:A3","text":"Der Dichter ist durch Masken, Vieldeutigkeit und absichtliche Lüge konstituiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:A4","text":"Das Subjekt ist zugleich Jäger, Beute und eigene Larve.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:A5","text":"Wahrheit darf nicht als unbewegliches, glattes und sakral aufgestelltes Objekt bestimmt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:A6","text":"Das eigentliche Wahrnehmungsfeld liegt in Wildnis, Zufall, Abgrund und wechselnden Perspektiven.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:A7","text":"Die dichterische Sehnsucht besitzt eine doppelte Bewegung aus abgründigem Blick und plötzlichem Angriff.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:A8","text":"Das Schafhafte bezeichnet eine Form von Wohlwollen, Blicklosigkeit, Angepasstheit und passiver Unschuld.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:A9","text":"Die Auflösung des Schafhaften verlangt eine aggressive Umkehrung menschlicher und göttlicher Gestalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:A10","text":"Licht, Tag und eine einzige Wahrheit können das Subjekt verbrennen und zur Abwärtsbewegung zwingen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:NX1","text":"Wahrheit ist nicht die Position eines stillen, starren, glatten und kalten Standbildes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:NX2","text":"Wahrheit ist nicht die sakrale Bewachung eines Gottes vor einem Tempel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:NX3","text":"Der Dichter ist nicht der unmaskierte und geradlinige Freier der Wahrheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:NX4","text":"Dichtung ist nicht auf eine einzige Sprache, einen einzigen Himmel oder eine einzige Erde reduzierbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:NX5","text":"Die Wildnis ist nicht aus dem Wahrheitsbereich ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:NX6","text":"Das Menschliche ist nicht durch schafhafte Sanftheit und Wohlwollen erschöpfend bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:NX7","text":"Seligkeit ist nicht mit moralischer Unschuld, Friedfertigkeit oder Wahrheitsruhe identisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:NX8","text":"Der Abstieg aus der Wahrheit ist nicht bloß ein Verlust, sondern eine eigene Form der Bewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:D1","text":"Die Wahrheitssuche verwandelt sich in eine Praxis wechselnder Maskierung und perspektivischer Rede.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_8:A1","CH_97E9_3C_8:A2","CH_97E9_3C_8:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:D2","text":"Wer Wahrheit sucht, wird zugleich zum Verfolger, zur Beute und zum Produzenten seiner eigenen Verstellung.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_8:A3","CH_97E9_3C_8:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:D3","text":"Die Ablehnung des Wahrheitsstandbildes verlagert Erkenntnis von sakraler Fixierung in Wildnis, Zufall und Abgrund.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_8:A5","CH_97E9_3C_8:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:D4","text":"Der abgründige Blick erhält seine operative Ergänzung im plötzlichen Raubzug gegen das Schafhafte.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_8:A6","CH_97E9_3C_8:A7","CH_97E9_3C_8:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:D5","text":"Die Zerreißung des Schafhaften macht die Umkehr von Mensch und Gott zur Quelle dichterischer Seligkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_8:A8","CH_97E9_3C_8:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:D6","text":"Die Verbannung von der Wahrheit wird als notwendige Folge der Erschöpfung an Licht und Wahrheitsanspruch erzeugt.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_8:A1","CH_97E9_3C_8:A2","CH_97E9_3C_8:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:SD1","text":"Das System ersetzt Wahrheitsbesitz durch eine oszillierende Existenz aus Durst, Maskierung, Abgrund und Angriff.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_8:A1","CH_97E9_3C_8:A3","CH_97E9_3C_8:A6","CH_97E9_3C_8:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:SD2","text":"Erkenntnis wird nicht als Besitz eines Gegenstands, sondern als riskante Teilnahme an wechselnden und räuberischen Perspektiven organisiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_8:A4","CH_97E9_3C_8:A5","CH_97E9_3C_8:A6","CH_97E9_3C_8:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:SD3","text":"Die dichterische Seligkeit entsteht aus der systematischen Entwertung des Schafhaften als epistemischer, religiöser und sozialer Norm.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_8:A8","CH_97E9_3C_8:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:SD4","text":"Der Abstieg in Abend und Schatten wird zur Gegenbewegung gegen die totalisierende Herrschaft von Licht und einer einzigen Wahrheit.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_8:A2","CH_97E9_3C_8:A5","CH_97E9_3C_8:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass Wahrheit außerhalb ihrer sprachlichen, tierischen und perspektivischen Verstellungen verfügbar ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:DNX2","text":"Es schließt aus, dass Erkenntnis ohne Begehren, Gefahr, Täuschung und Gewalt stabil bestehen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:DNX3","text":"Es disqualifiziert die Annahme, dass religiöse Erhabenheit und menschliche Güte ungebrochene Orientierungsnormen bilden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:DNX4","text":"Es schließt aus, dass der Verlust einer einheitlichen Wahrheit durch Rückkehr zu einer neuen Einheit aufgehoben werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Wahrheit, die sich als endgültige, unmaskierte und unbewegte Gegenwart besitzen lässt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:SNX2","text":"Unverfügbar bleibt eine Versöhnung zwischen Wahrheitsdurst und Wahrheitsbesitz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:SNX3","text":"Die Abwesenheit einer nicht-räuberischen und nicht-schafhaften Seligkeit strukturiert die gesamte Gegenbewegung des Textes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:FGS1","text":"Wahrheitsdurst → Erschöpfung an Licht und Einheit → gesteigerte Bedürftigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:FGS2","text":"Gesteigerte Bedürftigkeit → Maskierung, Lüge und Selbstverfolgung → Auflösung des geradlinigen Wahrheitsfreiers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:FGS3","text":"Auflösung des Wahrheitsfreiers → Verlagerung in Wildnis, Zufall und Abgrund → perspektivische Beweglichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:FGS4","text":"Perspektivische Beweglichkeit → Adlerblick und Pantherangriff → Zerreißung des Schafhaften.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:FGS5","text":"Zerreißung des Schafhaften → Umkehr von Gott und Mensch → dichterische Seligkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:FGS6","text":"Seligkeit und Erschöpfung → Abend, Schatten, Tau und Verbannung von einer einzigen Wahrheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:AF1","text":"Wahrheitsdurst → höhnische Entlarvung als Dichter und Narr → Ausschluss des Wahrheitsstandbildes → Wildnis und Abgrund → Raub gegen das Schafhafte → Umkehr von Gott und Mensch → Seligkeit → Abstieg aus der Wahrheitsbesessenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:ME1","text":"Der Gegensatz Wahrheit/Lüge wird in ein bewegliches Feld aus Masken, Larven, Perspektiven und Selbstverfolgung umgezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:ME2","text":"Der Gegensatz Erkenntnis/Verblendung wird durch die Gleichzeitigkeit von Abgrundblick und räuberischem Begehren destabilisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:ME3","text":"Das Schafhafte wird von einer positiven Tugend zu einer angreifbaren Form von Passivität, Wohlwollen und Blicklosigkeit umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:ME4","text":"Der Gegensatz Aufstieg/Abstieg wird aufgehoben: Der Abstieg in Abend und Schatten wird zur notwendigen Gegenbewegung gegen die Wahrheitsfixierung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:ME5","text":"Göttlichkeit und Menschlichkeit werden als ineinander verschränkte, zerreißbare Gestalten statt als stabile Hierarchie kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:ALT1","text":"Surface: Ein erschöpftes, wahrheitsdürstendes Subjekt wird als Dichter, Narr, Adler und Panther angesprochen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:ALT2","text":"Structural: Erkenntnis wird durch Maskierung, Wildnis, Abgrund, Raub und die Ausschaltung des Schafhaften organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Der Text verschiebt die Strategie vom Wahrheitsbesitz zur produktiven Selbstentlarvung, Perspektivenbewegung und Gegenaggression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Realität erscheint als wechselnde, tierisch codierte und abgründige Bewegung zwischen Tag, Licht, Abend, Schatten und Nacht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von Wahrheitsdurst über Maskierung und Wildnis zur Seligkeit des Raubs zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob die höhnische Anrede als Selbstgespräch, fremde Stimme oder innere Spaltung des Subjekts zu lesen ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:MRT3","text":"Das System ist intern kohärent, sofern Wahrheit nicht als Besitz, sondern als spannungsvolle Bewegung verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung liegt zwischen der Negation des Wahrheitsstandbildes und der Verlagerung in Wildnis, Maske und Abgrund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:MRT5","text":"Der zentrale ungelöste Widerspruch besteht darin, dass der Wahrheitsdurst fortbesteht, obwohl jede stabile Wahrheit ausgeschlossen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, sofern Seligkeit nicht als Auflösung, sondern als vorläufige Intensivierung des Widerspruchs behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T191504504725Z_91829db1","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"3.","source_sha256":"b73ae6f8ea69eb7c0a4fde2518c06cfca492484fcdb96afb11389908e25b6377","sha256":"2b38708b9bde5a7c4e2ad2ee3f6b3accc89a05d61edd6197368d7bca391563c6","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:15:04.506855+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:AS1","text":"A subject thirsting for truth is redefined by a mocking address as poet, fool, and predatory animal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:AS2","text":"Truth is conceived not as a silent, rigid, and sacralized statue, but as a mobile, masked, and wild relation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:AS3","text":"Poetic perception penetrates abysses and shifts from vertical self-immersion into predatory aggression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:AS4","text":"The human and divine measure is inverted through the tearing apart of the sheep-like in the human being and of the sheep in God.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:AS5","text":"The bliss thus produced rests on the conjunction of panther-like quality, eagle-like quality, masking, lying, and cruelty.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:AS6","text":"After exhaustion by light and by a single truth, the subject sinks into evening, shadow, dew, and an exile from all truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:A1","text":"The subject is determined by an intense thirst for truth and heavenly tears.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:A2","text":"The search for truth produces no final repose in truth, but rather an intensified neediness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:A3","text":"The poet is constituted by masks, ambiguity, and deliberate lying.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:A4","text":"The subject is at once hunter, prey, and its own larva.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:A5","text":"Truth must not be determined as an immobile, smooth, and sacralized object.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:A6","text":"The proper field of perception lies in wilderness, chance, abyss, and shifting perspectives.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:A7","text":"Poetic longing possesses a double movement of abyssal gaze and sudden attack.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:A8","text":"The sheep-like denotes a form of benevolence, lack of vision, conformity, and passive innocence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:A9","text":"The dissolution of the sheep-like requires an aggressive inversion of human and divine figures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:A10","text":"Light, day, and a single truth can burn the subject and compel it toward downward movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:NX1","text":"Truth is not the position of a silent, rigid, smooth, and cold statue.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:NX2","text":"Truth is not the sacral guarding of a god before a temple.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:NX3","text":"The poet is not the unmasked and straightforward suitor of truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:NX4","text":"Poetry cannot be reduced to a single language, a single heaven, or a single earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:NX5","text":"The wilderness is not excluded from the domain of truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:NX6","text":"The human is not exhaustively determined by sheep-like gentleness and benevolence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:NX7","text":"Bliss is not identical with moral innocence, peacefulness, or repose in truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:NX8","text":"The descent from truth is not merely a loss, but a form of movement in its own right.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0010","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:D1","text":"The search for truth transforms itself into a practice of shifting masking and perspectival speech.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_8:A1","CH_97E9_3C_8:A2","CH_97E9_3C_8:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:D2","text":"Whoever seeks truth becomes at once pursuer, prey, and producer of his own dissimulation.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_8:A3","CH_97E9_3C_8:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:D3","text":"The rejection of the truth-statue displaces cognition from sacral fixation into wilderness, chance, and abyss.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_8:A5","CH_97E9_3C_8:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:D4","text":"The abyssal gaze receives its operative complement in the sudden predatory raid against the sheep-like.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_8:A6","CH_97E9_3C_8:A7","CH_97E9_3C_8:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:D5","text":"The tearing apart of the sheep-like makes the inversion of human being and God the source of poetic bliss.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_8:A8","CH_97E9_3C_8:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:D6","text":"Exile from truth is produced as the necessary consequence of exhaustion by light and the claim to truth.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_8:A1","CH_97E9_3C_8:A2","CH_97E9_3C_8:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:SD1","text":"The system replaces possession of truth with an oscillating existence composed of thirst, masking, abyss, and attack.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_8:A1","CH_97E9_3C_8:A3","CH_97E9_3C_8:A6","CH_97E9_3C_8:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:SD2","text":"Cognition is organized not as possession of an object, but as risky participation in shifting and predatory perspectives.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_8:A4","CH_97E9_3C_8:A5","CH_97E9_3C_8:A6","CH_97E9_3C_8:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:SD3","text":"Poetic bliss arises from the systematic devaluation of the sheep-like as an epistemic, religious, and social norm.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_8:A8","CH_97E9_3C_8:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:SD4","text":"The descent into evening and shadow becomes a counter-movement against the totalizing rule of light and a single truth.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_8:A2","CH_97E9_3C_8:A5","CH_97E9_3C_8:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:DNX1","text":"The system excludes the possibility that truth is available outside its linguistic, animal, and perspectival dissimulations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:DNX2","text":"It excludes the possibility that cognition can stably subsist without desire, danger, deception, and violence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:DNX3","text":"It disqualifies the assumption that religious sublimity and human goodness constitute unbroken norms of orientation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:DNX4","text":"It excludes the possibility that the loss of a unified truth can be aufgehoben through return to a new unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a truth that can be possessed as a final, unmasked, and unmoved presence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:SNX2","text":"A reconciliation between thirst for truth and possession of truth remains unavailable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:SNX3","text":"The absence of a non-predatory and non-sheep-like bliss structures the entire counter-movement of the text.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:FGS1","text":"Thirst for truth → exhaustion by light and unity → intensified neediness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:FGS2","text":"Intensified neediness → masking, lying, and self-pursuit → dissolution of the straightforward suitor of truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:FGS3","text":"Dissolution of the suitor of truth → displacement into wilderness, chance, and abyss → perspectival mobility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:FGS4","text":"Perspectival mobility → eagle gaze and panther attack → tearing apart of the sheep-like.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:FGS5","text":"Tearing apart of the sheep-like → inversion of God and human being → poetic bliss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:FGS6","text":"Bliss and exhaustion → evening, shadow, dew, and exile from a single truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:AF1","text":"Thirst for truth → mocking unmasking as poet and fool → exclusion of the truth-statue → wilderness and abyss → predation against the sheep-like → inversion of God and human being → bliss → descent from obsession with truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:ME1","text":"The opposition truth/lie is redrawn into a mobile field of masks, larvae, perspectives, and self-pursuit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:ME2","text":"The opposition cognition/delusion is destabilized by the simultaneity of abyssal gaze and predatory desire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:ME3","text":"The sheep-like is reclassified from a positive virtue into an attackable form of passivity, benevolence, and lack of vision.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:ME4","text":"The opposition ascent/descent is aufgehoben: descent into evening and shadow becomes the necessary counter-movement against fixation upon truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:ME5","text":"Divinity and humanity are mapped as interwoven, tearable figures rather than as a stable hierarchy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:ALT1","text":"Surface: An exhausted subject thirsting for truth is addressed as poet, fool, eagle, and panther.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:ALT2","text":"Structural: Cognition is organized through masking, wilderness, abyss, predation, and the elimination of the sheep-like.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: The text shifts the strategy from possession of truth to productive self-unmasking, movement of perspectives, and counter-aggression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Reality appears as a shifting, animal-coded, and abyssal movement between day, light, evening, shadow, and night.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from thirst for truth through masking and wilderness to the bliss of predation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether the mocking address is to be read as self-dialogue, an alien voice, or an inner division of the subject.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:MRT3","text":"The system is internally coherent, provided that truth is understood not as possession but as a tension-filled movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:MRT4","text":"The strongest connection lies between the negation of the truth-statue and the displacement into wilderness, mask, and abyss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:MRT5","text":"The central unresolved contradiction consists in the fact that thirst for truth persists although every stable truth is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_8:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of argument, provided that bliss is treated not as resolution but as a provisional intensification of the contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_8:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_3C_8@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_3C_8:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"The Song of Melancholy","source_section_label":"3.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Four and Last"],"reading_title":"The Song of Melancholy · 3","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","The Song of Melancholy","3."],"original_title":"3."}],"source_title_context":"Das Lied der Schwermuth","source_section_label":"3.","source_title_hierarchy":["Vierter und letzter Theil"],"reading_title":"The Song of Melancholy · 3","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","The Song of Melancholy","3."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 162","title":"The Song of Melancholy · 3","context":"Part Four and Last","original_context":"Vierter und letzter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Das Lied der Schwermuth · 3"},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0","layer":"CH","title":"On Science","order":163,"parents":["RAW_97E9_VDW0"],"revision":"CH_97E9_VDW0@R001","sha256":"a455458e44cec0b1a1ea205c0364f65e2c2c5c109d968a7ddeb80e575bd473cd","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:AS1","text":"Das Lied des Zauberers verwandelt die versammelten höheren Menschen in ein affektiv gefangenes Kollektiv.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:AS2","text":"Der Gewissenhafte unterbricht diese Verführung, indem er die Höhle als schwüle, giftige und freiheitswidrige Umgebung bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:AS3","text":"Die Szene verschiebt sich von der Kritik der Verführung zu einer genealogischen Kontroverse über Wissenschaft, Furcht, Sicherheit, Mut und Gefahr.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:AS4","text":"Zarathustra kehrt die Furchtgenealogie um und setzt Mut, Abenteuer und Ungewissheit als ursprüngliche Kräfte der Menschwerdung ein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:AS5","text":"Die kollektive Reaktion und die Gegenrede des Zauberers fangen auch diese Umkehr wieder in Gelächter, Deutungshoheit und sozialer Zustimmung ein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:AS6","text":"Der erneute Drang nach Luft und Tieren erzeugt keinen vollendeten Ausbruch, sondern einen offenen Übergang aus der Höhle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:A1","text":"Der Zauberer kann durch Gesang die Versammelten affektiv erfassen und in wollüstige Schwermut versetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:A2","text":"Der Gewissenhafte erkennt die Höhle als eine Atmosphäre, die Freiheit in Enge und Giftigkeit überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:A3","text":"Die Rede von Wahrheit und Wesen kann als Lockmittel für verborgene Begierden fungieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:A4","text":"Der Gewissenhafte sucht Sicherheit angesichts einer wankenden Welt und verbindet diese Suche mit Zarathustra.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:A5","text":"Der Gewissenhafte schreibt den höheren Menschen ein Begehren nach Unsicherheit, Gefahr und wildem Leben zu.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:A6","text":"Der Gewissenhafte bestimmt Furcht als Erb- und Grundgefühl des Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:A7","text":"Der Gewissenhafte leitet aus verfeinerter Furcht die Tugend der Wissenschaft ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:A8","text":"Die Furcht vor dem wilden Tier umfasst auch die Furcht vor dem inneren Tier des Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:A9","text":"Zarathustra bestimmt Furcht als Ausnahme und Mut, Abenteuer sowie Lust am Ungewissen als menschliche Vorgeschichte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:A10","text":"Menschwerdung entsteht für Zarathustra durch Aneignung der Tugenden wilder Tiere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:A11","text":"Der verfeinerte Menschenmut mit Adlerflügeln und Schlangenklugheit erhält den Namen Zarathustra.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:A12","text":"Das kollektive Gelächter macht die Umkehrung Zarathustras zu einem neuen sozialen Ereignis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:A13","text":"Der Zauberer kann Zarathustra als Betrüger und Lug- und Truggeist umdeuten und dadurch seine eigene Stellung behaupten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:A14","text":"Zarathustras Liebe zu den Feinden bleibt mit einer Rache an den Freunden verschränkt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:A15","text":"Luft außerhalb der Höhle und die Tiere üben auf Zarathustra einen erneuten Auszugsimpuls aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:NX1","text":"Wahrheitsrede ist kein Beweis für Wahrheit, wenn sie als Lockpfeife der Begierde funktioniert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:NX2","text":"Freie Geister sind nicht allein durch die Behauptung ihrer Freiheit vor Verführung geschützt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:NX3","text":"Wissenschaft erscheint in der Rede des Gewissenhaften nicht als furchtfreie Erkenntnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:NX4","text":"Die menschliche Grundbestimmung lässt sich nach Zarathustra nicht abschließend aus der Furcht erklären.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:NX5","text":"Das Begehren nach gefährlichem Leben beweist noch nicht dessen wirkliche Möglichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:NX6","text":"Die höheren Menschen bilden trotz ihrer behaupteten Freiheit keine affektiv souveräne Gemeinschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:NX7","text":"Zarathustra ist nicht gegen die Zuschreibung von Täuschung und Verführung immun.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:NX8","text":"Liebe und Versöhnung bezeichnen bei Zarathustra keine einfache Aufhebung von Feindschaft und Rache.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:D1","text":"Das Lied wirkt nicht bloß als Ausdruck, sondern als Verfahren kollektiver Gefangennahme.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDW0:A1","CH_97E9_VDW0:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:D2","text":"Die Forderung nach guter Luft bestimmt Befreiung als Unterbrechung einer affektiv vergifteten Umgebung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDW0:A2","CH_97E9_VDW0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:D3","text":"Wissenschaft wird innerhalb der Rede des Gewissenhaften genealogisch als verfeinerte und vergeistigte Furcht erzeugt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDW0:A6","CH_97E9_VDW0:A7","CH_97E9_VDW0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:D4","text":"Die Kontroverse besteht aus zwei konkurrierenden Genealogien des Menschen: Furcht erzeugt Wissenschaft, Mut erzeugt Zarathustra.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDW0:A6","CH_97E9_VDW0:A7","CH_97E9_VDW0:A9","CH_97E9_VDW0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:D5","text":"Zarathustras Gegenmodell verlagert Menschwerdung von der Einhegung des Tiers auf die Aneignung tierischer Kraft.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDW0:A9","CH_97E9_VDW0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:D6","text":"Die höheren Menschen erscheinen zugleich als Suchende nach Gefahr und als empfängliche Objekte der Verzauberung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDW0:A1","CH_97E9_VDW0:A5","CH_97E9_VDW0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:D7","text":"Der Zauberer gewinnt Deutungshoheit zurück, indem er Zarathustras Umkehr in eine weitere Form von Täuschung übersetzt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDW0:A12","CH_97E9_VDW0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:D8","text":"Die soziale Wiederannäherung in der Höhle hebt den Gegensatz nicht auf, sondern bringt ihn in Gestalt von Liebe, Beifall und Rache erneut hervor.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDW0:A13","CH_97E9_VDW0:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:D9","text":"Zarathustras Drang nach draußen zeigt, dass die gemeinsame Szene trotz ihrer scheinbaren Versöhnung nicht stabil abgeschlossen ist.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDW0:A12","CH_97E9_VDW0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:SD1","text":"Wissenschaft und Zarathustra fungieren als gegensätzliche affektive Genealogien und nicht als bloß verschiedene Antworten auf dieselbe Frage.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDW0:A6","CH_97E9_VDW0:A7","CH_97E9_VDW0:A9","CH_97E9_VDW0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:SD2","text":"Freiheit wird als prekäre Widerstandsfähigkeit gegen affektive Erfassung bestimmt und nicht als bereits besessener Zustand.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDW0:A1","CH_97E9_VDW0:A2","CH_97E9_VDW0:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:SD3","text":"Die Höhle verschmilzt atmosphärische Enge, erotische Verführung, Wahrheitsrede und soziale Autorität zu einem einzigen Erfassungsmechanismus.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDW0:A1","CH_97E9_VDW0:A2","CH_97E9_VDW0:A3","CH_97E9_VDW0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:SD4","text":"Die Kritik der Verzauberung wird durch dieselben performativen Mittel gefährdet, gegen die sie sich richtet: Stimme, Affekt, Gelächter und kollektive Zustimmung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDW0:A1","CH_97E9_VDW0:A12","CH_97E9_VDW0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:SD5","text":"Das Kollektiv der höheren Menschen erweist sich nicht als einheitliches Subjekt, sondern als instabile Zuschauerformation zwischen Freiheit, Lust, Gefahr und Gefangenschaft.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDW0:A5","CH_97E9_VDW0:A6","CH_97E9_VDW0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:SD6","text":"Die Szene lässt die Spannung zwischen Sicherheitswissenschaft und gefährlichem Mut bestehen, weil keine der beiden Genealogien die andere endgültig widerlegt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDW0:A4","CH_97E9_VDW0:A7","CH_97E9_VDW0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:DNX1","text":"Das System setzt die Unwahrheit einer affektneutralen Wissenschaft voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:DNX2","text":"Das System schließt ein selbstbeglaubigtes und gegen Verführung immunes Freiheitssubjekt aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:DNX3","text":"Das System kann keine einzige, unangefochtene Genealogie der Menschheit zulassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:DNX4","text":"Das System schließt eine stabile Grenze zwischen Befreier und Verführer aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:DNX5","text":"Das System behandelt kollektiven Beifall und gemeinsames Gelächter nicht als Wahrheitskriterium.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:DNX6","text":"Das System schließt eine endgültige Identität von Sicherheit, Wahrheit und Freiheit aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:SNX1","text":"Unverfügbar bleibt die Möglichkeit einer Freiheit, die der Verführung ausgesetzt ist, ohne in ihr affektiv umgeschrieben zu werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:SNX2","text":"Unverfügbar bleibt eine abschließende Entscheidung zwischen Furcht und Mut als Ursprung des Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:SNX3","text":"Unverfügbar bleibt ein vollständig reiner Außenraum: Die gute Luft wird begehrt, aber der Ausbruch wird nicht vollzogen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0029","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:SNX4","text":"Unaufgehoben bleibt die Möglichkeit, dass auch die Befreiungsrede selbst eine neue Form der Verführung erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0023","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:FGS1","text":"Liedliche Verführung → affektive Ansteckung → kollektive Gefangenschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:FGS2","text":"Gewissenhafte Gegenstimme → Entzug der Harfe → Forderung nach Luft → Sichtbarkeit des Gefängnismechanismus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:FGS3","text":"Sicherheitsbedürfnis → Furchtgenealogie → vergeistigte Furcht → Wissenschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:FGS4","text":"Gefahrenbegehren → Zurückweisung der Furchtgenealogie → Mutgenealogie → Zarathustra.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:FGS5","text":"Gegenumkehr → kollektives Gelächter → Wiederaufnahme der Szene unter der Deutung des Zauberers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:FGS6","text":"Restaffekt der Enge → Drang nach Luft und Tieren → unvollendeter Ausgang aus der Höhle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:AF1","text":"Zauberische Verführung → kollektive affektive Gefangenschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:AF2","text":"Gewissenhafte Unterbrechung → Höhle als giftige Gefängnisatmosphäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:AF3","text":"Sicherheit und Wissenschaft → Furcht als genealogischer Grund.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:AF4","text":"Zarathustras Umkehr → Mut, Tieraneignung und Ungewissheit als menschliche Vorgeschichte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:AF5","text":"Gelächter und Zaubererdeutung → erneute soziale Erfassung der Gegenrede.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:AF6","text":"Drang nach Außenluft → offener, nicht abgeschlossener Auszugsimpuls.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:ME1","text":"Wissenschaft wird von einer Erkenntnisform in eine affektive Genealogie der Furcht umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:ME2","text":"Freiheit wird von einem Besitzstand in eine ständig gefährdete Fähigkeit zur Abwehr von Verführung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:ME3","text":"Menschheitsgeschichte wird zwischen einer Furchtgeschichte und einer Mutgeschichte aufgespalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:ME4","text":"Die höheren Menschen werden von autonomen Subjekten zu einer schwankenden, verführbaren Zuschauerformation umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:ME5","text":"Die Höhle wird zugleich als sozialer Raum, affektive Atmosphäre und epistemische Gefangenschaft sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:ME6","text":"Befreiung wird nicht als endgültige Position, sondern als unvollendete Bewegung aus einer wiederholbaren Erfassung bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:ALT1","text":"Surface: Ein Zauberlied erfasst eine Gruppe; eine Gegenstimme entreißt dem Zauberer die Harfe; Zarathustra widerspricht der Furchtdeutung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:ALT2","text":"Structural: Gesang, Höhlenatmosphäre, Wahrheitsrede, Begehren und kollektive Zustimmung bilden einen Mechanismus affektiver Erfassung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Der Text rahmt Freiheit als Kampf um Deutungshoheit und zeigt, dass Gegenrede durch theatrale und soziale Mittel zurückerfasst werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Menschsein wird genealogisch als Übergang von ursprünglicher Furcht oder ursprünglichem Mut zu einer verfeinerten geistigen Form bestimmt; der Ausgang bleibt zeitlich unabgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um Verführung, Furchtgenealogie, Zarathustras Umkehr und den offenen Auszugsimpuls zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob die Furchtgenealogie, die Mutgenealogie oder nur ihr Konflikt die maßgebliche Wahrheit des Menschen bezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist als dramatisierte Gegenüberstellung kohärent, nicht als widerspruchsfreie Anthropologie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Verbindung besteht zwischen Affekt, Wahrheitsrede, Freiheit und sozialer Erfassung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:MRT5","text":"Die Rekonstruktion hängt davon ab, die Aussagen des Gewissenhaften, Zarathustras und des Zauberers getrennt zu halten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:MRT6","text":"Die zentrale Bruchlinie zwischen Sicherheitswissenschaft und gefährlichem Mut bleibt ebenso ungelöst wie die Nähe zwischen Befreiungsrede und neuer Verführung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0023","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:MRT7","text":"Die tatsächliche Bewegung bleibt erhalten, sofern die Rückerfassung durch Gelächter und der nicht vollzogene Ausgang nicht als Auflösung missverstanden werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T194903928890Z_711c9a15","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"On Science","source_sha256":"a455458e44cec0b1a1ea205c0364f65e2c2c5c109d968a7ddeb80e575bd473cd","sha256":"acc8c4b080ebade5d6a1887fc89aa9e86aab6c286d858bdcbe66450f24f6459e","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:49:03.930857+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:AS1","text":"The magician's song transforms the assembled higher men into an affectively captive collective.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:AS2","text":"The conscientious one interrupts this seduction by determining the cave as a sultry, poisonous, and freedom-opposed environment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:AS3","text":"The scene shifts from the critique of seduction to a genealogical controversy over science, fear, security, courage, and danger.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:AS4","text":"Zarathustra reverses the genealogy of fear and posits courage, adventure, and uncertainty as original forces of becoming human.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:AS5","text":"The collective reaction and the magician's rejoinder also recapture this reversal in laughter, interpretive authority, and social assent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:AS6","text":"The renewed urge for air and animals produces not a completed escape, but an open transition out of the cave.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:A1","text":"Through song, the magician can affectively seize those assembled and plunge them into voluptuous melancholy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:A2","text":"The conscientious one recognizes the cave as an atmosphere that transforms freedom into confinement and toxicity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:A3","text":"Talk of truth and essence can function as a lure for hidden desires.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:A4","text":"The conscientious one seeks security in the face of a wavering world and connects this search with Zarathustra.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:A5","text":"The conscientious one ascribes to the higher men a desire for uncertainty, danger, and wild life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:A6","text":"The conscientious one determines fear as humanity's inherited and fundamental feeling.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:A7","text":"The conscientious one derives the virtue of science from refined fear.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:A8","text":"Fear of the wild beast also encompasses fear of the human being's inner beast.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:A9","text":"Zarathustra determines fear as an exception, and courage, adventure, and delight in the uncertain as humanity's prehistory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:A10","text":"For Zarathustra, becoming human arises through the appropriation of the virtues of wild animals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:A11","text":"Refined human courage with eagle wings and serpent cunning bears the name Zarathustra.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:A12","text":"Collective laughter makes Zarathustra's reversal into a new social event.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:A13","text":"The magician can reinterpret Zarathustra as a deceiver and spirit of lies and deception, thereby maintaining his own position.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:A14","text":"Zarathustra's love for his enemies remains entangled with a revenge upon his friends.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0028","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:A15","text":"Air outside the cave and the animals exert upon Zarathustra a renewed impulse to depart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:NX1","text":"Talk of truth is no proof of truth when it functions as a decoy whistle of desire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:NX2","text":"Free spirits are not protected from seduction merely by asserting their freedom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:NX3","text":"In the conscientious one's speech, science does not appear as fear-free knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:NX4","text":"According to Zarathustra, the fundamental determination of the human cannot be conclusively explained by fear.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:NX5","text":"The desire for dangerous life does not yet prove its actual possibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:NX6","text":"Despite their asserted freedom, the higher men do not constitute an affectively sovereign community.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:NX7","text":"Zarathustra is not immune to the ascription of deception and seduction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:NX8","text":"For Zarathustra, love and reconciliation do not designate a simple overcoming of enmity and revenge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0027","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0028","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:D1","text":"The song operates not merely as expression, but as a procedure of collective capture.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDW0:A1","CH_97E9_VDW0:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:D2","text":"The demand for good air determines liberation as the interruption of an affectively poisoned environment.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDW0:A2","CH_97E9_VDW0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:D3","text":"Within the conscientious one's speech, science is genealogically generated as refined and spiritualized fear.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDW0:A6","CH_97E9_VDW0:A7","CH_97E9_VDW0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:D4","text":"The controversy consists of two competing genealogies of the human: fear generates science, courage generates Zarathustra.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDW0:A6","CH_97E9_VDW0:A7","CH_97E9_VDW0:A9","CH_97E9_VDW0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:D5","text":"Zarathustra's countermodel shifts becoming human from the containment of the animal to the appropriation of animal force.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDW0:A9","CH_97E9_VDW0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:D6","text":"The higher men appear both as seekers of danger and as receptive objects of enchantment.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDW0:A1","CH_97E9_VDW0:A5","CH_97E9_VDW0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:D7","text":"The magician regains interpretive authority by translating Zarathustra's reversal into a further form of deception.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDW0:A12","CH_97E9_VDW0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:D8","text":"The social rapprochement in the cave does not overcome the opposition, but reproduces it in the form of love, applause, and revenge.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDW0:A13","CH_97E9_VDW0:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0027","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:D9","text":"Zarathustra's urge to go outside shows that the shared scene, despite its apparent reconciliation, is not stably concluded.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDW0:A12","CH_97E9_VDW0:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:SD1","text":"Science and Zarathustra function as opposing affective genealogies, and not merely as different answers to the same question.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDW0:A6","CH_97E9_VDW0:A7","CH_97E9_VDW0:A9","CH_97E9_VDW0:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:SD2","text":"Freedom is determined as a precarious capacity for resistance against affective capture, and not as an already possessed state.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDW0:A1","CH_97E9_VDW0:A2","CH_97E9_VDW0:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:SD3","text":"The cave fuses atmospheric confinement, erotic seduction, talk of truth, and social authority into a single mechanism of capture.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDW0:A1","CH_97E9_VDW0:A2","CH_97E9_VDW0:A3","CH_97E9_VDW0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:SD4","text":"The critique of enchantment is endangered by the same performative means against which it is directed: voice, affect, laughter, and collective assent.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDW0:A1","CH_97E9_VDW0:A12","CH_97E9_VDW0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:SD5","text":"The collective of higher men proves to be not a unified subject, but an unstable spectator formation between freedom, pleasure, danger, and captivity.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDW0:A5","CH_97E9_VDW0:A6","CH_97E9_VDW0:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:SD6","text":"The scene sustains the tension between the science of security and dangerous courage, because neither genealogy conclusively refutes the other.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDW0:A4","CH_97E9_VDW0:A7","CH_97E9_VDW0:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:DNX1","text":"The system presupposes the untruth of an affectively neutral science.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:DNX2","text":"The system excludes a freedom-subject that is self-authenticating and immune to seduction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:DNX3","text":"The system cannot permit a single, unchallenged genealogy of humanity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:DNX4","text":"The system excludes a stable boundary between liberator and seducer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:DNX5","text":"The system does not treat collective applause and shared laughter as a criterion of truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:DNX6","text":"The system excludes a definitive identity of security, truth, and freedom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:SNX1","text":"Unavailable remains the possibility of a freedom exposed to seduction without being affectively rewritten by it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:SNX2","text":"Unavailable remains a conclusive decision between fear and courage as the origin of the human.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:SNX3","text":"Unavailable remains a completely pure exterior space: good air is desired, but the escape is not carried out.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0029","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:SNX4","text":"Unresolved remains the possibility that the discourse of liberation itself also produces a new form of seduction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0019","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0023","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:FGS1","text":"Songlike seduction → affective contagion → collective captivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:FGS2","text":"Conscientious countervoice → removal of the harp → demand for air → visibility of the prison mechanism.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:FGS3","text":"Need for security → genealogy of fear → spiritualized fear → science.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:FGS4","text":"Desire for danger → rejection of the genealogy of fear → genealogy of courage → Zarathustra.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:FGS5","text":"Counter-reversal → collective laughter → resumption of the scene under the magician's interpretation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:FGS6","text":"Residual affect of confinement → urge for air and animals → uncompleted exit from the cave.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:AF1","text":"Magical seduction → collective affective captivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:AF2","text":"Conscientious interruption → cave as poisonous prison atmosphere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:AF3","text":"Security and science → fear as genealogical ground.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:AF4","text":"Zarathustra's reversal → courage, animal appropriation, and uncertainty as humanity's prehistory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:AF5","text":"Laughter and magical interpretation → renewed social capture of the rejoinder.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:AF6","text":"Urge for outside air → open, uncompleted impulse to depart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:ME1","text":"Science is remapped from a form of knowledge into an affective genealogy of fear.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:ME2","text":"Freedom is reclassified from a possession into a constantly endangered capacity to ward off seduction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:ME3","text":"Human history is split between a history of fear and a history of courage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:ME4","text":"The higher men are remapped from autonomous subjects into a wavering, seducible spectator formation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:ME5","text":"The cave becomes visible at once as social space, affective atmosphere, and epistemic captivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:ME6","text":"Liberation is determined not as a final position, but as an uncompleted movement out of a repeatable capture.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:ALT1","text":"Surface: A magic song seizes a group; a countervoice wrests the harp from the magician; Zarathustra contradicts the interpretation of fear.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:ALT2","text":"Structural: Song, cave atmosphere, talk of truth, desire, and collective assent form a mechanism of affective capture.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: The text frames freedom as a struggle for interpretive authority and shows that rejoinder can be recaptured through theatrical and social means.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Being human is genealogically determined as a transition from original fear or original courage to a refined spiritual form; the exit remains temporally uncompleted.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct seduction, the genealogy of fear, Zarathustra's reversal, and the open impulse to depart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether the genealogy of fear, the genealogy of courage, or only their conflict designates the decisive truth of the human.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:MRT3","text":"The structure is coherent as a dramatized juxtaposition, not as a contradiction-free anthropology.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:MRT4","text":"Its strongest connection lies between affect, talk of truth, freedom, and social capture.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:MRT5","text":"The reconstruction depends on keeping the statements of the conscientious one, Zarathustra, and the magician separate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:MRT6","text":"The central fault line between the science of security and dangerous courage remains as unresolved as the proximity between the discourse of liberation and new seduction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0016","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0020","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0023","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0024","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_VDW0:MRT7","text":"The actual movement is preserved provided that the recapture through laughter and the unexecuted exit are not misunderstood as a resolution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_VDW0:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_VDW0@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_VDW0:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 163","title":"On Science","context":"Chapter 163","original_title":"Von der Wissenschaft","original_context":"Chapter 163"},"original_title":"Von der Wissenschaft","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16","layer":"CH","title":"Among Daughters of the Desert · 1","order":164,"parents":["RAW_97E9_1_16"],"revision":"CH_97E9_1_16@R001","sha256":"1bfaabed8d5e043caaabd2a7eae1e7d6050d009dba4b9037c7c94f4b0a094feb","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:AS1","text":"Die Abwesenheit Zarathustras droht die verborgene Trübsal der Anwesenden erneut freizusetzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:AS2","text":"Die sichtbare Heiterkeit der Könige wird als erlernte Darstellung und nicht als aufgehobene Schwermut bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:AS3","text":"Zarathustras Gegenwart wird als Erzeugung einer starken, klaren und atmosphärisch entlastenden Luft behauptet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:AS4","text":"Gegen diese Entlastung wird das wolkige, feuchte und schwermütige Alt-Europa als Gegenraum gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:AS5","text":"Der Wanderer und Schatten verschiebt die Bitte um Rettung in eine Erinnerung an ein orientalisiertes Gegenbild ohne Wolken und Gedanken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:AS6","text":"Die Rede geht in eine musikalische Darbietung über, ohne die zugrunde liegende Schwermut aufzulösen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:A1","text":"Die Anwesenden sind von einer wiederkehrenden dumpfen Trübsal bedroht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:A2","text":"Der alte Zauberer kann Schwermut nicht beseitigen, sondern verstärkt oder enthüllt sie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:A3","text":"Der Papst ist trotz seiner frommen Stellung in das Meer der Schwermut zurückgefallen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:A4","text":"Die Könige können Heiterkeit darstellen, ohne ihre innere Schwermut zu überwinden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:A5","text":"Die Abwesenheit von Zeugen ermöglicht das Wiederauftreten des verborgenen bösen Spiels.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:A6","text":"Zarathustras Gegenwart erzeugt eine starke und klare Atmosphäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:A7","text":"Atmosphärische Bedingungen werden als Träger und Auslöser psychischer Zustände behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:A8","text":"Das orientalische Gegenbild wird als helle, wolkenlose und gedankenfreie Sphäre erinnert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:A9","text":"Die erinnerten Mädchen erscheinen als fremde Rätsel, die sich dennoch erraten lassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:A10","text":"Die Rede kann in Gesang überführt werden, bevor ihre Spannung begrifflich gelöst ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:NX1","text":"Die sichtbare gute Miene der Könige ist keine verlässliche Aufhebung der Schwermut.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:NX2","text":"Frömmigkeit schützt nicht vor dem Rückfall in Trübsal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:NX3","text":"Die Gegenwart des alten Zauberers stellt keine stabile Heilung dar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:NX4","text":"Die Schwermut ist nicht bloß ein individuelles Innenereignis, sondern an Luft, Wolken, Abend und Landschaft gebunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:NX5","text":"Das europäische Klima wird nicht als neutraler Erfahrungsraum behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:NX6","text":"Die erinnerten Morgenland-Mädchen werden nicht als komplexe Subjekte, sondern als wolkenlose Rätsel konstruiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:NX7","text":"Das Lied beendet die Schwermut nicht, sondern setzt ihre Darstellung fort.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:D1","text":"Die drohende Abreise Zarathustras macht die psychische Abhängigkeit der Anwesenden von seiner Gegenwart sichtbar.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_16:A1","CH_97E9_1_16:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:D2","text":"Die Heiterkeit der Könige fungiert als soziale Oberfläche, deren Stabilität an die Anwesenheit von Zeugen gebunden ist.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_16:A4","CH_97E9_1_16:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:D3","text":"Das „böse Spiel“ bezeichnet eine wiederkehrende Verkettung von Wetterbildern, Schwermut und kollektivem Notheschrei.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_16:A1","CH_97E9_1_16:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:D4","text":"Zarathustra wird nicht nur als Sprecher, sondern als atmosphärisches Medium der Entlastung positioniert.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_16:A6","CH_97E9_1_16:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:D5","text":"Die Opposition zwischen Morgenland und Alt-Europa wird als Opposition zwischen klarer Luft und feuchter Schwermut organisiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_16:A7","CH_97E9_1_16:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:D6","text":"Die Erinnerung an das orientalische Gegenbild erzeugt eine neue ästhetische Form der Schwermut: das Lied.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_16:A8","CH_97E9_1_16:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:D7","text":"Der Übergang zum Gesang ersetzt die ausbleibende Antwort der Gruppe durch performative Selbstfortsetzung.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_16:A9","CH_97E9_1_16:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:SD1","text":"Die Gruppe kann ihre Schwermut nicht autonom überwinden; sie benötigt Zarathustras Präsenz als äußere atmosphärische Regulation.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_16:A1","CH_97E9_1_16:A5","CH_97E9_1_16:A6","CH_97E9_1_16:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:SD2","text":"Die soziale Ordnung der Anwesenden beruht auf einer instabilen Differenz zwischen öffentlicher Darstellung und privatem Rückfall.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_16:A4","CH_97E9_1_16:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:SD3","text":"Das Argument verwandelt psychische Zustände in kartierbare Räume und Wetterlagen.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_16:A1","CH_97E9_1_16:A7","CH_97E9_1_16:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:SD4","text":"Die Suche nach einer Gegenatmosphäre reproduziert zugleich die Abhängigkeit von mythischen und kulturell vereinfachten Gegenbildern.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_16:A6","CH_97E9_1_16:A8","CH_97E9_1_16:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:SD5","text":"Die musikalische Form bewahrt die ungelöste Spannung, indem sie Schwermut nicht beseitigt, sondern in Aufführung überführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_16:A1","CH_97E9_1_16:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:DNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Annahme, dass kollektive Heiterkeit bereits eine kollektive Befreiung bezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:DNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine innere Autonomie der Könige, des Papstes und der übrigen Anwesenden gegenüber der Schwermut.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:DNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird ein neutraler Zusammenhang zwischen psychischem Zustand und räumlich-atmosphärischer Umgebung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:DNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine nicht vermittelte, nicht erinnerte und nicht ästhetisierte Form des orientalischen Gegenraums.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:DNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Auflösung des Problems durch bloße Rede; die Rede muss in eine andere Darstellungsform kippen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:SNX1","text":"Unmöglich ist eine dauerhafte Entlastung, die nicht von Zarathustras Gegenwart oder einer Ersatzform seiner Wirkung getragen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:SNX2","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist ein Zustand, in dem die verborgene Schwermut ohne theatrale, atmosphärische oder musikalische Vermittlung unmittelbar verschwindet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:SNX3","text":"Versperrt bleibt ein Gegenraum, der zugleich kulturell fremd, psychisch klar und frei von Projektion wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:SNX4","text":"Unstatthaft bleibt die Trennung von innerem Leiden, sozialer Maskierung und äußerer Atmosphäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:FGS1","text":"Wiederkehrende Trübsal + drohende Abwesenheit Zarathustras → Bitte um Verbleib.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:FGS2","text":"Öffentliche gute Miene + Abhängigkeit von Zeugen → Entlarvung der Heiterkeit als soziale Darstellung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:FGS3","text":"Verborgene Schwermut + Wetter- und Luftmetaphorik → Psychischer Zustand als Atmosphäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:FGS4","text":"Zarathustras starke Luft + europäische Schwermut → Gegenüberstellung von regulierender Gegenwart und krankmachendem Raum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:FGS5","text":"Erinnerung an das Morgenland + Ausschluss von Wolken und Gedanken → Konstruktion eines wolkenlosen Gegenbilds.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:FGS6","text":"Unaufgelöste Spannung + ausbleibende Antwort → Übergang von Rede zu Gesang.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:FGS7","text":"Gesang + fortbestehende Ambivalenz → ästhetische Fortsetzung statt begrifflicher Schließung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:AF1","text":"Drohender Rückfall in Trübsal → Bitte um Verbleib Zarathustras → Entlarvung öffentlicher Heiterkeit → Atmosphäre als psychischer Mechanismus → Morgenland als Gegenraum → Erinnerung als ästhetische Projektion → Gesang als unaufgelöste Fortsetzung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:ME1","text":"Psychische Schwermut wird von einem inneren Zustand in eine kollektiv geteilte Atmosphäre umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:ME2","text":"Öffentliche Heiterkeit wird von einem Zeichen innerer Gesundheit zu einer zeugenabhängigen sozialen Maske umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:ME3","text":"Zarathustra wird vom bloßen Gesprächspartner zum atmosphärischen Regulator der Gruppe umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:ME4","text":"Europa und Morgenland werden als gegensätzliche affektive Klimazonen organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:ME5","text":"Die Opposition von Wahrheit und Schein wird durch die Opposition von Luft, Wolke, Feuchtigkeit und Klarheit vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:ME6","text":"Das Lied erscheint nicht als dekorativer Abschluss, sondern als operative Form der nicht abgeschlossenen Transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:ALT1","text":"Surface — Eine Gruppe bittet Zarathustra, nicht fortzugehen, weil mit seiner Abwesenheit die Schwermut zurückkehren könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:ALT2","text":"Structural — Soziale Heiterkeit, politische Würde und religiöse Stellung erweisen sich als instabile Oberflächen über wiederkehrendem Leiden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text verschiebt die Diagnose von individueller Gemütslage auf atmosphärische Bedingungen und ersetzt Antwort durch performative Darstellung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Zustände erscheinen als zyklische Wiederholungen, die durch Gegenwart, Abwesenheit, Erinnerung und räumliche Klimata modulierbar sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den Übergang von der drohenden Schwermut zur Bitte um Zarathustras Verbleib zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:MRT2","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Unterscheidung zwischen öffentlicher Heiterkeit und verborgenem Rückfall zu erzeugen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:MRT3","text":"Die atmosphärische Logik und die Gegenüberstellung von Europa und Morgenland sind hinreichend erfasst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:MRT4","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob Zarathustras Wirkung tatsächlich heilend oder nur temporär kompensatorisch ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:MRT5","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob das orientalische Gegenbild als Erinnerung, Projektion, Ironie oder ernsthafte Alternative fungiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:MRT6","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, solange Gesang als Fortsetzung der Spannung und nicht als deren Lösung verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:MRT7","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung besteht zwischen sozialer Maskierung, atmosphärischer Schwermut und der Abhängigkeit von Zarathustras Gegenwart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung von der Bitte über die Diagnose zur musikalischen Selbstfortsetzung, komprimiert jedoch die rhetorische und kulturelle Mehrdeutigkeit der Erinnerungsbilder.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T185816616025Z_35e09660","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"1.","source_sha256":"1bfaabed8d5e043caaabd2a7eae1e7d6050d009dba4b9037c7c94f4b0a094feb","sha256":"06533c8888f32a13d3c4d6268449d350d3f963deff1cee43f0fd438ef4bd95a6","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T18:58:16.617365+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:AS1","text":"Zarathustra's absence threatens to release anew the hidden melancholy of those present.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:AS2","text":"The visible cheerfulness of the kings is determined as a learned performance and not as melancholy that has been overcome.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:AS3","text":"Zarathustra's presence is asserted as producing a strong, clear, and atmospherically relieving air.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:AS4","text":"Against this relief, cloudy, damp, and melancholy Old Europe is set as a counter-space.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:AS5","text":"The Wanderer and Shadow shifts the plea for rescue into a memory of an orientalized counter-image without clouds and thoughts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:AS6","text":"The speech passes into a musical performance without resolving the underlying melancholy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:A1","text":"Those present are threatened by a recurrent dull melancholy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:A2","text":"The old magician cannot eliminate melancholy, but intensifies or reveals it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:A3","text":"Despite his pious position, the Pope has fallen back into the sea of melancholy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:A4","text":"The kings can perform cheerfulness without overcoming their inner melancholy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:A5","text":"The absence of witnesses enables the reappearance of the hidden evil game.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:A6","text":"Zarathustra's presence produces a strong and clear atmosphere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:A7","text":"Atmospheric conditions are treated as carriers and triggers of psychic states.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:A8","text":"The Oriental counter-image is remembered as a bright, cloudless, and thought-free sphere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:A9","text":"The remembered girls appear as alien riddles that can nevertheless be guessed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:A10","text":"Speech can be transformed into song before its tension is conceptually resolved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:NX1","text":"The kings' visible good cheer is not a reliable overcoming of melancholy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:NX2","text":"Piety does not protect against relapse into melancholy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:NX3","text":"The presence of the old magician does not constitute a stable cure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:NX4","text":"Melancholy is not merely an individual inner event, but is bound to air, clouds, evening, and landscape.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:NX5","text":"The European climate is not treated as a neutral space of experience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:NX6","text":"The remembered girls of the Orient are constructed not as complex subjects, but as cloudless riddles.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:NX7","text":"The song does not end melancholy, but continues its presentation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:D1","text":"Zarathustra's impending departure makes visible the psychic dependence of those present on his presence.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_16:A1","CH_97E9_1_16:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:D2","text":"The cheerfulness of the kings functions as a social surface whose stability is bound to the presence of witnesses.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_16:A4","CH_97E9_1_16:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:D3","text":"The “evil game” denotes a recurring concatenation of weather-images, melancholy, and collective cries of distress.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_16:A1","CH_97E9_1_16:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:D4","text":"Zarathustra is positioned not only as a speaker, but as an atmospheric medium of relief.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_16:A6","CH_97E9_1_16:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:D5","text":"The opposition between the Orient and Old Europe is organized as an opposition between clear air and damp melancholy.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_16:A7","CH_97E9_1_16:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:D6","text":"The memory of the Oriental counter-image produces a new aesthetic form of melancholy: the song.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_16:A8","CH_97E9_1_16:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:D7","text":"The transition to song replaces the group's absent answer with performative self-continuation.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_16:A9","CH_97E9_1_16:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:SD1","text":"The group cannot overcome its melancholy autonomously; it requires Zarathustra's presence as external atmospheric regulation.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_16:A1","CH_97E9_1_16:A5","CH_97E9_1_16:A6","CH_97E9_1_16:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:SD2","text":"The social order of those present rests on an unstable difference between public performance and private relapse.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_16:A4","CH_97E9_1_16:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:SD3","text":"The argument transforms psychic states into mappable spaces and weather conditions.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_16:A1","CH_97E9_1_16:A7","CH_97E9_1_16:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:SD4","text":"The search for a counter-atmosphere simultaneously reproduces dependence on mythical and culturally simplified counter-images.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_16:A6","CH_97E9_1_16:A8","CH_97E9_1_16:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:SD5","text":"The musical form preserves the unresolved tension by not eliminating melancholy, but transforming it into performance.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_16:A1","CH_97E9_1_16:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:DNX1","text":"Excluded is the assumption that collective cheerfulness already signifies collective liberation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:DNX2","text":"Excluded is an inner autonomy of the kings, the Pope, and the other persons present vis-à-vis melancholy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:DNX3","text":"Excluded is a neutral relation between psychic state and spatial-atmospheric environment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:DNX4","text":"Excluded is an unmediated, unremembered, and unaestheticized form of the Oriental counter-space.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:DNX5","text":"Excluded is a resolution of the problem through mere speech; speech must tip into another form of presentation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:SNX1","text":"Impossible is a lasting relief that is not sustained by Zarathustra's presence or by a substitute form of his effect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:SNX2","text":"Unavailable is a state in which hidden melancholy immediately disappears without theatrical, atmospheric, or musical mediation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:SNX3","text":"Foreclosed remains a counter-space that would be at once culturally alien, psychically clear, and free of projection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:SNX4","text":"The separation of inner suffering, social masking, and external atmosphere remains inadmissible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:FGS1","text":"Recurrent melancholy + Zarathustra's impending absence → plea for him to remain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:FGS2","text":"Public good cheer + dependence on witnesses → exposure of cheerfulness as social performance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:FGS3","text":"Hidden melancholy + weather and air metaphorics → psychic state as atmosphere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:FGS4","text":"Zarathustra's strong air + European melancholy → juxtaposition of regulating presence and pathogenic space.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:FGS5","text":"Memory of the Orient + exclusion of clouds and thoughts → construction of a cloudless counter-image.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:FGS6","text":"Unresolved tension + absent answer → transition from speech to song.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:FGS7","text":"Song + persisting ambivalence → aesthetic continuation instead of conceptual closure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:AF1","text":"Threatened relapse into melancholy → plea for Zarathustra to remain → exposure of public cheerfulness → atmosphere as psychic mechanism → the Orient as counter-space → memory as aesthetic projection → song as unresolved continuation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:ME1","text":"Psychic melancholy is remapped from an inner state into a collectively shared atmosphere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:ME2","text":"Public cheerfulness is reclassified from a sign of inner health into a witness-dependent social mask.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:ME3","text":"Zarathustra is remapped from a mere interlocutor into the atmospheric regulator of the group.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:ME4","text":"Europe and the Orient are organized as opposing affective climate zones.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:ME5","text":"The opposition of truth and appearance is mediated through the opposition of air, cloud, dampness, and clarity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:ME6","text":"The song appears not as a decorative conclusion, but as an operative form of unfinished transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:ALT1","text":"Surface — A group asks Zarathustra not to depart because melancholy might return with his absence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:ALT2","text":"Structural — Social cheerfulness, political dignity, and religious position prove to be unstable surfaces over recurring suffering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text shifts the diagnosis from individual mood to atmospheric conditions and replaces answer with performative presentation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — States appear as cyclical repetitions modifiable through presence, absence, memory, and spatial climates.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the transition from threatened melancholy to the plea for Zarathustra's remaining.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:MRT2","text":"The axioms suffice to produce the distinction between public cheerfulness and hidden relapse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:MRT3","text":"The atmospheric logic and the juxtaposition of Europe and the Orient are sufficiently captured.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:MRT4","text":"It remains underdetermined whether Zarathustra's effect is truly curative or merely temporarily compensatory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0015","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:MRT5","text":"It remains underdetermined whether the Oriental counter-image functions as memory, projection, irony, or serious alternative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:MRT6","text":"The structure is internally coherent so long as song is understood as a continuation of tension and not as its resolution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:MRT7","text":"The strongest connection exists between social masking, atmospheric melancholy, and dependence on Zarathustra's presence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_16:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement from plea through diagnosis to musical self-continuation, but compresses the rhetorical and cultural ambiguity of the images of memory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_16:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_1_16@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_1_16:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"Among Daughters of the Desert","source_section_label":"1.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Four and Last"],"reading_title":"Among Daughters of the Desert · 1","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","Among Daughters of the Desert","1."],"original_title":"1."}],"source_title_context":"Unter Töchtern der Wüste","source_section_label":"1.","source_title_hierarchy":["Vierter und letzter Theil"],"reading_title":"Among Daughters of the Desert · 1","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","Among Daughters of the Desert","1."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 164","title":"Among Daughters of the Desert · 1","context":"Part Four and Last","original_context":"Vierter und letzter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Unter Töchtern der Wüste · 1"},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16","layer":"CH","title":"Among Daughters of the Desert · 2","order":165,"parents":["RAW_97E9_2_16"],"revision":"CH_97E9_2_16@R001","sha256":"21ae153fba4105dd74a5e9bcaa0ee571d6eb822680853ffc5f9a85839042c023","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:AS1","text":"Das zentrale Problem besteht darin, dass die Wüste nicht nur außerhalb des Subjekts liegt, sondern von ihm getragen werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:AS2","text":"Die kleinste Oase gewährt Distanz zur Wüste, indem sie den Sprecher zugleich einschließt und verschluckt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:AS3","text":"Sinnliche Gegenwart, erotische Umgebung und Luft erzeugen eine paradiesische Unterbrechung von Zukunft und Erinnerung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:AS4","text":"Europäische Zweifel unterbrechen jede mythische oder poetische Gewissheit und machen auch das Paradies prekär.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:AS5","text":"Aus sinnlicher Verwundbarkeit, Verlust und Bedürfnis nach Stärkung wird eine performative europäische Tugend-Würde erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:AS6","text":"Die Wiederholung der Wüstenformel bindet die Oase an die fortbestehende Wüste zurück und verhindert eine endgültige Erlösung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:A1","text":"Die Wüste kann im Subjekt verborgen sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:A2","text":"Eine Oase kann den Sprecher aufnehmen und zugleich von der Wüste distanzieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:A3","text":"Sinnliche Intensität kann Zukunft und Erinnerung suspendieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:A4","text":"Europa ist durch Zweifel und Zweifelssucht gekennzeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:A5","text":"Die Oase wird durch weiblich codierte, stumme und vom Sprecher interpretierte Gestalten vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:A6","text":"Die Palme erscheint als Tänzerin, deren fehlendes zweites Bein eine Form von Verlust erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:A7","text":"Eine feierliche Tugendformel kann als Mittel der inneren Stärkung eingesetzt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:A8","text":"Europäische Identität wird im moralischen Brüllen performativ hergestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:A9","text":"Die wiederholte Wüstenformel rahmt und begrenzt die Oasenerfahrung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:NX1","text":"Die Oase ist keine vollständige Aufhebung der Wüste.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:NX2","text":"Das Paradies ist keine reine Unschuld, sondern enthält Verschlucken, Begehren, Gefahr und Verlust.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:NX3","text":"Die poetische Überlieferung liefert keine unangefochtene Wahrheit über die Herkunft oder Qualität der Oasenluft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:NX4","text":"Die Oasengegenwart ist ohne Zukunft und ohne Erinnerungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:NX5","text":"Sinnliche Behaglichkeit genügt nicht als abschließende Selbstbestimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:NX6","text":"Die sichtbare Gestalt ist nicht vollständig oder symmetrisch; das zweite Bein bleibt abwesend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:NX7","text":"Europäische Würde erscheint nicht als ruhige Eigenschaft, sondern als gegen Zweifel und Schwäche gerichtete Aufführung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:D1","text":"Die Oase erzeugt keine Befreiung von der Wüste, sondern eine vorläufige räumliche und sinnliche Einhegung ihrer Wirkung.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_16:A1","CH_97E9_2_16:A2","CH_97E9_2_16:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:D2","text":"Die Ausschaltung von Zukunft und Erinnerung verwandelt die Oase in einen isolierten Gegenwartsraum.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_16:A2","CH_97E9_2_16:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:D3","text":"Europäische Zweifel verhindern, dass sinnliche oder mythische Deutungen als endgültige Erklärung gelten.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_16:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:D4","text":"Die erotische Oasenszene wird durch das Motiv des fehlenden Beins in eine Szene von Mangel und möglicher Zerstörung umcodiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_16:A5","CH_97E9_2_16:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:D5","text":"Das Bedürfnis nach Stärkung verschiebt die Rede von sinnlicher Aufnahme zu moralischer Selbstbehauptung.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_16:A3","CH_97E9_2_16:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:D6","text":"Das moralische Brüllen übersetzt die europäische Zweifelshaltung in eine demonstrative Tugendgebärde.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_16:A4","CH_97E9_2_16:A7","CH_97E9_2_16:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:D7","text":"Die Schlusswiederholung macht die Oase zu einer Unterbrechung innerhalb eines weiterhin wirksamen Wüstenzustands.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_16:A1","CH_97E9_2_16:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:SD1","text":"Der Rückzug in die Oase ist eine Form vorläufiger Erfassung, nicht die Überwindung der Wüste.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:SD2","text":"Das System verwandelt sinnliche Abhängigkeit, Zweifel und Verlust in eine europäische Moral der demonstrativen Selbstverstärkung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:SD3","text":"Die Oase wird zugleich als paradiesischer Schutzraum und als verschlingende, gefährdete Körperordnung konstruiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:SD4","text":"Feierlichkeit wird zunächst verspottet und anschließend als Instrument der Selbstkonstitution eingesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:SD5","text":"Die zeitlose Gegenwart der Oase bleibt auf kulturelle Erinnerung, europäische Selbstbeschreibung und mythische Rückbezüge angewiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:SD6","text":"Die wiederkehrende Wüstenformel totalisiert die Szene, indem sie jede lokale Rettung in einen übergeordneten Verfalls- oder Dürrezustand zurückführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:DNX1","text":"Das System setzt voraus, dass keine Oase dauerhaft außerhalb der Wüstenlogik bestehen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:DNX2","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass Sinnlichkeit allein eine tragfähige Form von Identität oder Rettung bildet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:DNX3","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass mythische Überlieferung, poetische Erklärung oder religiöse Formel Gewissheit herstellen können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:DNX4","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass europäische Identität ohne Zweifel, Übertreibung und moralische Aufführung stabil bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:DNX5","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass Körper, Landschaft und Begehren als ungebrochene Ganzheiten erscheinen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:DNX6","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass Sprache die Vielzahl der Gefühle ohne Verkürzung oder Sprachsünde bewahrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:SNX1","text":"Die Möglichkeit einer dauerhaften Flucht aus der inneren Wüste bleibt unzugänglich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:SNX2","text":"Eine autonome Stimme der Oasenbewohnerinnen bleibt strukturell abwesend; die Oase wird durch die Rede und Projektion des europäischen Sprechers organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:SNX3","text":"Eine nicht-moralische und nicht-europäische Form der Selbstbehauptung wird nicht verfügbar gemacht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:SNX4","text":"Eine widerspruchsfreie Verbindung von Paradies, Zweifel, Körper und Würde wird als unmögliche Endposition behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:FGS1","text":"Getragene Wüste → Suche oder Eintritt in die kleinste Oase → räumliche Distanz bei fortbestehender Bedingung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:FGS2","text":"Verschlucken durch die Oase → sinnliche Einschließung → Suspendierung von Zukunft und Erinnerung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:FGS3","text":"Paradiesische Luft und erotische Umgebung → poetische Überhöhung → europäische Skepsis gegenüber jeder Gewissheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:FGS4","text":"Tanzende Palme → fehlendes zweites Bein → Umwandlung von Schönheit in Verlust, Gefahr und Mitleid.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:FGS5","text":"Bedürfnis nach Herzstärkung → Anrufung von Tugend und Würde → moralisches Brüllen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:FGS6","text":"Moralisches Brüllen → performative Herstellung des Europäers → Rückkehr der Wüstenformel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:FGS7","text":"Rückkehr der Wüstenformel → Schließung des Rahmens → Oase als begrenzte Unterbrechung ohne Aufhebung der Wüste.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:AF1","text":"Getragene Wüste → minimale Oase → Verschlucken und Distanzierung → sinnliche Gegenwart ohne Zukunft und Erinnerung → Zweifel an poetischer Gewissheit → Verlustfigur der Palme → Bedürfnis nach Stärkung → europäische Tugend-Würde → moralisches Brüllen → erneute Wüstenformel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:ME1","text":"Die Wüste wird vom äußeren Landschaftsbild in eine innere, tragbare Bedingung des Subjekts verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:ME2","text":"Die Oase wird nicht mehr als bloßer Gegenraum, sondern als ambivalente Einschließungs- und Verschlingungsstruktur sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:ME3","text":"Sinnliche Erholung, erotische Projektion und moralische Selbstbehauptung werden als aufeinanderfolgende Funktionen desselben Raums kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:ME4","text":"Die fehlende Körperhälfte macht aus der Opposition von Schönheit und Gefahr eine zusammenhängende Ordnung von Begehren und Verlust.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:ME5","text":"Europa wird zugleich als skeptische Herkunft und als moralische Lautstärke klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:ME6","text":"Anfang und Ende werden als rekursive Rahmung lesbar, in der jede Oasenerfahrung an den Ausgangszustand zurückgebunden bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Eine europäische Sprecherfigur sitzt in einer kleinen Oase, spricht zu weiblich codierten Gestalten und betrachtet die Palme als Tänzerin.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Die Oase organisiert Einschließung, zeitliche Suspendierung, Projektion, Verlust und den Übergang von Sinnlichkeit zu Moral.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Der Sprecher beantwortet Zweifel und Verwundbarkeit nicht durch Auflösung, sondern durch die performative Steigerung zu Tugend, Würde und Brüllen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Die Gegenwart wird als erinnerungs- und zukunftslose Insel konstruiert, bleibt jedoch von der wiederkehrenden Wüstenbedingung und kulturellen Rückbezügen abhängig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um den Übergang von getragener Wüste über Oaseneinschließung und sinnliche Suspendierung zur moralischen Selbstaufführung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:MRT2","text":"Die Struktur bleibt unterbestimmt hinsichtlich der genauen Funktion der weiblichen Anreden und ihrer individuellen Namen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:MRT3","text":"Die Maschine ist intern kohärent, weil die Schlussformel die Oase ausdrücklich als begrenzte Unterbrechung schließt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Verbindung liegt zwischen Wüstenformel, Oasenszene und performativer europäischer Würde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:MRT5","text":"Die Rekonstruktion hängt von der Kompression der erotischen, mythologischen und moralischen Bildschichten in wenige Funktionsübergänge ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:MRT6","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt ungelöst zwischen der behaupteten erinnerungs- und zukunftslosen Gegenwart und ihrer Erzeugung durch europäische Erinnerung, Zweifel und Überlieferung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:MRT7","text":"Eine weitere Spannung besteht darin, dass Feierlichkeit und moralisches Brüllen zugleich verspottet und als notwendige Selbstform eingesetzt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:MRT8","text":"Die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung bleibt erhalten, sofern die Oase nicht als Lösung, sondern als vorübergehende Umschaltung innerhalb der Wüstenlogik rekonstruiert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T191042490218Z_ad11ce6d","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"2.","source_sha256":"21ae153fba4105dd74a5e9bcaa0ee571d6eb822680853ffc5f9a85839042c023","sha256":"d08d3f064e69b7561023ad703430ab9d80ad66194e3ec4822f9825dea7b5a45c","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:10:42.491071+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:AS1","text":"The central problem consists in the fact that the desert lies not only outside the subject, but can be borne by it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:AS2","text":"The smallest oasis grants distance from the desert by simultaneously enclosing and swallowing the speaker.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:AS3","text":"Sensuous presence, erotic surroundings, and air produce a paradisiacal interruption of future and memory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:AS4","text":"European doubts interrupt every mythical or poetic certainty and render paradise precarious as well.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:AS5","text":"From sensuous vulnerability, loss, and the need for strengthening, a performative European virtue-dignity is produced.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:AS6","text":"The repetition of the desert formula binds the oasis back to the persisting desert and prevents final redemption.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:A1","text":"The desert can be hidden within the subject.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:A2","text":"An oasis can receive the speaker and at the same time distance him from the desert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:A3","text":"Sensuous intensity can suspend future and memory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:A4","text":"Europe is characterized by doubt and an addiction to doubt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:A5","text":"The oasis is mediated through female-coded, mute figures interpreted by the speaker.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:A6","text":"The palm appears as a dancer whose missing second leg produces a form of loss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:A7","text":"A solemn formula of virtue can be employed as a means of inner strengthening.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:A8","text":"European identity is performatively produced in moral roaring.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:A9","text":"The repeated desert formula frames and delimits the oasis experience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:NX1","text":"The oasis is not a complete abolition of the desert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:NX2","text":"Paradise is not pure innocence, but contains swallowing, desire, danger, and loss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:NX3","text":"Poetic tradition provides no unchallenged truth about the origin or quality of the oasis air.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:NX4","text":"The oasis present is without future and without memories.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:NX5","text":"Sensuous comfort does not suffice as conclusive self-determination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:NX6","text":"The visible figure is neither complete nor symmetrical; the second leg remains absent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:NX7","text":"European dignity appears not as a calm quality, but as a performance directed against doubt and weakness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:D1","text":"The oasis produces no liberation from the desert, but rather a provisional spatial and sensuous containment of its effect.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_16:A1","CH_97E9_2_16:A2","CH_97E9_2_16:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:D2","text":"The elimination of future and memory transforms the oasis into an isolated space of presence.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_16:A2","CH_97E9_2_16:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:D3","text":"European doubts prevent sensuous or mythical interpretations from counting as a final explanation.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_16:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:D4","text":"The erotic oasis scene is recoded into a scene of lack and possible destruction through the motif of the missing leg.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_16:A5","CH_97E9_2_16:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:D5","text":"The need for strengthening shifts the discourse from sensuous reception to moral self-assertion.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_16:A3","CH_97E9_2_16:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:D6","text":"Moral roaring translates the European attitude of doubt into a demonstrative gesture of virtue.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_16:A4","CH_97E9_2_16:A7","CH_97E9_2_16:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:D7","text":"The concluding repetition makes the oasis an interruption within a desert condition that remains effective.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_16:A1","CH_97E9_2_16:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:SD1","text":"The retreat into the oasis is a form of provisional capture, not the overcoming of the desert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:SD2","text":"The system transforms sensuous dependency, doubt, and loss into a European morality of demonstrative self-strengthening.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:SD3","text":"The oasis is constructed simultaneously as a paradisiacal refuge and as a devouring, endangered bodily order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:SD4","text":"Solemnity is first mocked and subsequently employed as an instrument of self-constitution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:SD5","text":"The timeless presence of the oasis remains dependent on cultural memory, European self-description, and mythical references back.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:SD6","text":"The recurring desert formula totalizes the scene by referring every local rescue back to an overarching condition of decay or drought.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:DNX1","text":"The system presupposes that no oasis can permanently exist outside the logic of the desert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:DNX2","text":"It is excluded that sensuality alone constitutes a viable form of identity or salvation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:DNX3","text":"It is excluded that mythical tradition, poetic explanation, or religious formula can produce certainty.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:DNX4","text":"It is excluded that European identity remains stable without doubt, exaggeration, and moral performance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:DNX5","text":"It is excluded that body, landscape, and desire appear as unbroken wholes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:DNX6","text":"It is excluded that language preserves the multiplicity of feelings without abbreviation or sin against language.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:SNX1","text":"The possibility of a permanent escape from the inner desert remains inaccessible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:SNX2","text":"An autonomous voice of the female inhabitants of the oasis remains structurally absent; the oasis is organized through the speech and projection of the European speaker.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:SNX3","text":"A non-moral and non-European form of self-assertion is not made available.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:SNX4","text":"A contradiction-free connection of paradise, doubt, body, and dignity is treated as an impossible final position.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:FGS1","text":"Borne desert → search for or entry into the smallest oasis → spatial distance under a persisting condition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:FGS2","text":"Swallowing by the oasis → sensuous enclosure → suspension of future and memory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:FGS3","text":"Paradisiacal air and erotic surroundings → poetic elevation → European skepticism toward every certainty.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:FGS4","text":"Dancing palm → missing second leg → transformation of beauty into loss, danger, and pity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:FGS5","text":"Need for strengthening of the heart → invocation of virtue and dignity → moral roaring.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:FGS6","text":"Moral roaring → performative production of the European → return of the desert formula.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:FGS7","text":"Return of the desert formula → closure of the frame → oasis as a limited interruption without abolition of the desert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:AF1","text":"Borne desert → minimal oasis → swallowing and distancing → sensuous presence without future and memory → doubt concerning poetic certainty → loss-figure of the palm → need for strengthening → European virtue-dignity → moral roaring → renewed desert formula.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:ME1","text":"The desert is shifted from an external landscape image into an inner, portable condition of the subject.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:ME2","text":"The oasis becomes visible no longer as a mere counterspace, but as an ambivalent structure of enclosure and devouring.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:ME3","text":"Sensuous recovery, erotic projection, and moral self-assertion are mapped as successive functions of the same space.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:ME4","text":"The missing half of the body turns the opposition of beauty and danger into a connected order of desire and loss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:ME5","text":"Europe is classified simultaneously as skeptical origin and as moral loudness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:ME6","text":"Beginning and end become legible as recursive framing in which every oasis experience remains bound back to the initial condition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** A European speaker figure sits in a small oasis, speaks to female-coded figures, and contemplates the palm as a dancer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** The oasis organizes enclosure, temporal suspension, projection, loss, and the transition from sensuality to morality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** The speaker answers doubt and vulnerability not through dissolution, but through performative intensification into virtue, dignity, and roaring.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** The present is constructed as an island without memory and future, yet remains dependent on the recurring desert condition and cultural references back.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the transition from borne desert through oasis enclosure and sensuous suspension to moral self-performance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:MRT2","text":"The structure remains underdetermined with regard to the precise function of the female addresses and their individual names.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:MRT3","text":"The machine is internally coherent because the concluding formula explicitly closes the oasis as a limited interruption.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:MRT4","text":"Its strongest connection lies between the desert formula, the oasis scene, and performative European dignity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:MRT5","text":"The reconstruction depends on the compression of the erotic, mythological, and moral layers of imagery into a few functional transitions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:MRT6","text":"A tension remains unresolved between the asserted present without memory and future and its production through European memory, doubt, and tradition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:MRT7","text":"A further tension consists in the fact that solemnity and moral roaring are simultaneously mocked and employed as a necessary form of self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0011","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_16:MRT8","text":"The actual movement of the argument remains preserved provided that the oasis is reconstructed not as a solution, but as a temporary switching within the logic of the desert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_16:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_2_16@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_2_16:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"Among Daughters of the Desert","source_section_label":"2.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Four and Last"],"reading_title":"Among Daughters of the Desert · 2","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","Among Daughters of the Desert","2."],"original_title":"2."}],"source_title_context":"Unter Töchtern der Wüste","source_section_label":"2.","source_title_hierarchy":["Vierter und letzter Theil"],"reading_title":"Among Daughters of the Desert · 2","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","Among Daughters of the Desert","2."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 165","title":"Among Daughters of the Desert · 2","context":"Part Four and Last","original_context":"Vierter und letzter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Unter Töchtern der Wüste · 2"},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17","layer":"CH","title":"The Awakening · 1","order":166,"parents":["RAW_97E9_1_17"],"revision":"CH_97E9_1_17@R001","sha256":"4aa4e87c0691e78eabffcfb6b6d5fb5134c6b1a7d99a482cf5e895fea89fab21","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:AS1","text":"Die versammelten höheren Menschen müssen von ihrer Noth und vom Geist der Schwere gelöst werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:AS2","text":"Ihr Lärmen und Lachen wird als sichtbares Zeichen einer begonnenen Genesung neu bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:AS3","text":"Zarathustras Einfluss wirkt als Köder, Nahrung und Kraftspruch, der neue Begierden und Hoffnungen erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:AS4","text":"Die Genesung zeigt sich in Selbstlachen, der Auflösung des Ekels, enthemmter Herzensäußerung und erneuter Dankbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:AS5","text":"Der vorläufige Sieg besteht im Weichen des Geistes der Schwere und in der Umwandlung der Kranken in Feiernde und Erinnernde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:A1","text":"Die höheren Menschen befinden sich zunächst unter der Herrschaft von Noth, Ekel und Geist der Schwere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:A2","text":"Lachen kann als Zeichen körperlicher und geistiger Genesung fungieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:A3","text":"Die Genesung der höheren Menschen vollzieht sich auf ihre eigene Weise.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:A4","text":"Zarathustras Einfluss erzeugt neue Begierden und neue Hoffnungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:A5","text":"Zarathustras Lehre wird als Krieger- und Eroberer-Kost und nicht als beschwichtigende Nahrung dargestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:A6","text":"Selbstlachen schwächt den Geist der Schwere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:A7","text":"Das Weichen von Ekel und dummer Scham gehört zur Genesung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:A8","text":"Die Genesung äußert sich in erneuter Herzensäußerung, Feier und Wiederholung guter Stunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:A9","text":"Dankbarkeit gilt als stärkstes Zeichen der erreichten Genesung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:A10","text":"Die Wirkung Zarathustras ist nicht mit seinem eigenen Lachen identisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:A11","text":"Der Geist der Schwere ist Zarathustras dauerhafter Gegenspieler.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:A12","text":"Die Genesung führt von der stummen oder schreienden Noth zu artikulierten Worten, Mutwillen und Festen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:NX1","text":"Genesung ist nicht die vollständige Aufhebung des Schreiens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:NX2","text":"Das Lachen der höheren Menschen ist nicht Zarathustras eigenes Lachen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:NX3","text":"Zarathustras Kost ist keine beruhigende oder kindgerechte Nahrung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:NX4","text":"Zarathustra beansprucht nicht, Arzt und Lehrer für sehnsüchtige alte und junge Weibchen zu sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:NX5","text":"Die Genesung besteht nicht in stiller Anpassung, sondern in Lärm, Enthemmung und gesteigerter Begierde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:NX6","text":"Die höheren Menschen sind nicht durch die Übernahme von Zarathustras persönlichem Lachen geheilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:NX7","text":"Die neue Fröhlichkeit wird nicht als reine Selbstlosigkeit bestimmt, da sie möglicherweise auf Kosten ihres Wirthes geht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:D1","text":"Das gleichzeitige Lärmen und Lachen zeigt, dass die Noth ihre beherrschende Stellung verloren hat.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_17:A1","CH_97E9_1_17:A2","CH_97E9_1_17:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:D2","text":"Zarathustra kann die höhere Menschen beeinflussen, ohne ihre Reaktion vollständig zu kontrollieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_17:A3","CH_97E9_1_17:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:D3","text":"Neue Begierden und Hoffnungen erweitern die affektive und körperliche Beweglichkeit der höheren Menschen.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_17:A4","CH_97E9_1_17:A5","CH_97E9_1_17:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:D4","text":"Selbstlachen verwandelt die frühere Schwere in eine Form von Selbstenthemmung.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_17:A6","CH_97E9_1_17:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:D5","text":"Die Auflösung von Ekel und Scham ermöglicht die Rückkehr des Herzens in den Ausdruck.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_17:A7","CH_97E9_1_17:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:D6","text":"Dankbarkeit zeigt an, dass die Genesung über einen bloßen momentanen Affekt hinausgeht.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_17:A8","CH_97E9_1_17:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:D7","text":"Aus der Genesung entstehen die Voraussetzungen für Feste und Denkmale vergangener Freuden.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_17:A8","CH_97E9_1_17:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:SD1","text":"Zarathustras Intervention verändert nicht nur den Zustand der höheren Menschen, sondern die Form, in der sie ihre eigene Vergangenheit bewerten und erinnernd organisieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:SD2","text":"Genesung bezeichnet eine Übergangsordnung, in der die alten Symptome noch hörbar sind, aber ihre Herrschaft über das Verhalten verlieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:SD3","text":"Die Befreiung vom Geist der Schwere wird durch gesteigerte Vitalität, nicht durch Ruhe, Askese oder Verstummen erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:SD4","text":"Zarathustras Erfolg ist strukturell vermittelt: Seine Lehre wirkt, indem sie fremde, eigensinnige Reaktionen hervorbringt, die nicht mit seiner eigenen Ausdrucksform identisch sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass Genesung durch die Rückkehr zur früheren Stille oder durch die Unterdrückung des Ausdrucks erreicht wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:DNX2","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass eine einheitliche, für alle Subjekte gültige Heilungsform existiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:DNX3","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass neue Begierden und Hoffnungen eine bloße Fortsetzung der alten Bedürftigkeit darstellen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:DNX4","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass der Lehrer die Wirkung seiner Lehre als identische Nachahmung seiner selbst kontrolliert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:DNX5","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass Dankbarkeit aus bloßer Unterwerfung oder passiver Abhängigkeit besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:SNX1","text":"Der Text organisiert sich um die Abwesenheit einer endgültig abgeschlossenen Heilung: Das Schreien bleibt möglich, obwohl die Noth ihre zentrale Macht verliert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Genesung ohne Rest, ohne Lärm und ohne widersprüchliche Übergangsformen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:SNX3","text":"Versperrt bleibt die Möglichkeit, Zarathustras Sieg als vollständige Identifikation der höheren Menschen mit Zarathustra zu verstehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:SNX4","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist ein allgemeines Heilungsmodell, das die Unterschiede zwischen den Genesenden und die Grenzen von Zarathustras Lehre aufhebt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:FGS1","text":"Ausgangsnoth + Geist der Schwere → Lärmen, Schreien und Ekel als Symptome.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:FGS2","text":"Zarathustras Krieger-Kost → neue Begierden + neue Hoffnungen → gesteigerte vitale Beweglichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:FGS3","text":"Gesteigerte Beweglichkeit → Selbstlachen + Auflösung von Ekel und Scham → Herzensäußerung und Feier.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:FGS4","text":"Feier + Wiederkehr guter Stunden → Dankbarkeit → Feste und Denkmale → vorläufige Bestätigung der Genesung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:FGS5","text":"Nicht-identische Wirkung Zarathustras → eigensinnige Fröhlichkeit der Anderen → Sieg ohne vollständige Kontrolle oder Gleichförmigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:AF1","text":"Noth und Geist der Schwere → Lärmendes Gegenzeichen → Zarathustras Einfluss → neue Begierden und Hoffnungen → Selbstlachen und Enthemmung → Dankbarkeit → Feste und Erinnerungszeichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:AF2","text":"Fremde Fröhlichkeit → Anerkennung ihrer Unvollkommenheit → Deutung als Genesung → Feststellung eines vorläufigen Sieges über den Geist der Schwere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:ME1","text":"Lärm und Lachen werden von bloßen Störungen zu diagnostischen Zeichen der Genesung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:ME2","text":"Die Opposition von Krankheit und Gesundheit wird durch eine Übergangszone ersetzt, in der Schreien und Genesung gleichzeitig bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:ME3","text":"Lehre wird nicht als Übertragung einer festen Identität, sondern als Erzeugung fremder Begierden und Hoffnungen kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:ME4","text":"Dankbarkeit wird von einer moralischen Haltung zu einem strukturellen Beweis der affektiven Wiedergewinnung gemacht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:ME5","text":"Erinnerung wird als produktive Fortsetzung der Genesung klassifiziert, da aus vergangenen Freuden Feste und Denkmale hervorgehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Die höheren Menschen lachen, lärmen, schreien, feiern und zeigen Dankbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Zarathustras Nahrung transformiert eine von Noth und Schwere bestimmte Affektordnung in eine Ordnung neuer Begierden, Hoffnungen und Ausdrucksformen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Sieg wird nicht an vollständiger Nachahmung, sondern am Weichen des Gegners und an der selbständigen Reaktion der Anderen gemessen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Genesung erscheint als zeitlicher Übergang mit Resten der alten Krankheit; ihre Zukunft stabilisiert sich durch Feste, Dankbarkeit und Denkmale.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von Noth und Schwere zu Lachen, Dankbarkeit und Festlichkeit zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:MRT2","text":"Die zentrale Unterscheidung zwischen Zarathustras eigenem Lachen und der Fröhlichkeit der höheren Menschen bleibt für die Rekonstruktion notwendig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob die Fröhlichkeit dauerhaft ist oder nur eine vorläufige Genesungsphase bezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:MRT4","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, solange Genesung als nicht abgeschlossener Übergang und nicht als symptomfreie Endlage verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung besteht zwischen Selbstlachen, dem Weichen des Geistes der Schwere und der Auflösung von Ekel und Scham.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:MRT6","text":"Die größte Spannung liegt darin, dass Zarathustra einen Sieg beansprucht, obwohl die Wirkung nicht sein eigenes Lachen hervorbringt und das Schreien nicht vollständig verschwindet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, sofern der Sieg als funktionale Wirkung und nicht als vollständige Herrschaft über die Genesenden gefasst wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T185840757412Z_3947911a","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"1.","source_sha256":"4aa4e87c0691e78eabffcfb6b6d5fb5134c6b1a7d99a482cf5e895fea89fab21","sha256":"3ce4c36296d968a2a616c9235514d3edcba058e79d75216800712316ef326830","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T18:58:40.759725+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:AS1","text":"The assembled higher men must be released from their distress and from the spirit of gravity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:AS2","text":"Their noise and laughter are newly determined as a visible sign of a recovery that has begun.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:AS3","text":"Zarathustra's influence works as bait, nourishment, and a strengthening saying that produces new desires and hopes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:AS4","text":"Recovery manifests itself in laughing at oneself, the dissolution of disgust, uninhibited expression of the heart, and renewed gratitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:AS5","text":"The provisional victory consists in the retreat of the spirit of gravity and in the transformation of the sick into celebrants and rememberers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:A1","text":"The higher men are initially under the rule of distress, disgust, and the spirit of gravity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:A2","text":"Laughter can function as a sign of physical and spiritual recovery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:A3","text":"The recovery of the higher men takes place in their own way.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:A4","text":"Zarathustra's influence produces new desires and new hopes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:A5","text":"Zarathustra's teaching is presented as the fare of warriors and conquerors, and not as soothing nourishment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:A6","text":"Laughing at oneself weakens the spirit of gravity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:A7","text":"The retreat of disgust and foolish shame belongs to recovery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:A8","text":"Recovery expresses itself in renewed expression of the heart, celebration, and repetition of good hours.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:A9","text":"Gratitude counts as the strongest sign of recovery attained.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:A10","text":"Zarathustra's effect is not identical with his own laughter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:A11","text":"The spirit of gravity is Zarathustra's enduring adversary.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:A12","text":"Recovery leads from mute or screaming distress to articulated words, high spirits, and festivals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:NX1","text":"Recovery is not the complete abolition of screaming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:NX2","text":"The laughter of the higher men is not Zarathustra's own laughter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:NX3","text":"Zarathustra's fare is not soothing or child-appropriate nourishment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:NX4","text":"Zarathustra does not claim to be physician and teacher for yearning old and young females.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:NX5","text":"Recovery does not consist in quiet adaptation, but in noise, disinhibition, and intensified desire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:NX6","text":"The higher men are not healed through adopting Zarathustra's personal laughter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:NX7","text":"The new cheerfulness is not determined as pure selflessness, since it may come at the expense of their host.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:D1","text":"The simultaneous making of noise and laughing shows that distress has lost its dominating position.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_17:A1","CH_97E9_1_17:A2","CH_97E9_1_17:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:D2","text":"Zarathustra can influence the higher men without completely controlling their reaction.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_17:A3","CH_97E9_1_17:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:D3","text":"New desires and hopes expand the affective and bodily mobility of the higher men.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_17:A4","CH_97E9_1_17:A5","CH_97E9_1_17:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:D4","text":"Laughing at oneself transforms former gravity into a form of self-disinhibition.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_17:A6","CH_97E9_1_17:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:D5","text":"The dissolution of disgust and shame enables the return of the heart into expression.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_17:A7","CH_97E9_1_17:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:D6","text":"Gratitude indicates that recovery goes beyond a merely momentary affect.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_17:A8","CH_97E9_1_17:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:D7","text":"From recovery arise the conditions for festivals and monuments to past joys.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_17:A8","CH_97E9_1_17:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:SD1","text":"Zarathustra's intervention changes not only the condition of the higher men, but also the form in which they evaluate and organize their own past in remembrance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:SD2","text":"Recovery designates a transitional order in which the old symptoms are still audible but lose their dominion over behavior.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:SD3","text":"Liberation from the spirit of gravity is produced through intensified vitality, not through rest, asceticism, or falling silent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:SD4","text":"Zarathustra's success is structurally mediated: his teaching works by bringing forth alien, self-willed reactions that are not identical with his own form of expression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:DNX1","text":"The system excludes the possibility that recovery is achieved through a return to former silence or through the suppression of expression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:DNX2","text":"It is excluded that a uniform form of healing valid for all subjects exists.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:DNX3","text":"It is excluded that new desires and hopes constitute a mere continuation of old neediness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:DNX4","text":"It is excluded that the teacher controls the effect of his teaching as identical imitation of himself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:DNX5","text":"It is excluded that gratitude consists of mere submission or passive dependence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:SNX1","text":"The text organizes itself around the absence of a definitively completed healing: screaming remains possible although distress loses its central power.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:SNX2","text":"Excluded is a recovery without remainder, without noise, and without contradictory transitional forms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:SNX3","text":"Foreclosed remains the possibility of understanding Zarathustra's victory as the complete identification of the higher men with Zarathustra.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:SNX4","text":"Unavailable is a general model of healing that abolishes the differences among those recovering and the limits of Zarathustra's teaching.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:FGS1","text":"Initial distress + spirit of gravity → noise, screaming, and disgust as symptoms.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:FGS2","text":"Zarathustra's warrior-fare → new desires + new hopes → intensified vital mobility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:FGS3","text":"Intensified mobility → laughing at oneself + dissolution of disgust and shame → expression of the heart and celebration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:FGS4","text":"Celebration + return of good hours → gratitude → festivals and monuments → provisional confirmation of recovery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:FGS5","text":"Non-identical effect of Zarathustra → self-willed cheerfulness of the others → victory without complete control or uniformity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:AF1","text":"Distress and spirit of gravity → noisy counter-sign → Zarathustra's influence → new desires and hopes → laughing at oneself and disinhibition → gratitude → festivals and signs of remembrance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:AF2","text":"Alien cheerfulness → recognition of its imperfection → interpretation as recovery → determination of a provisional victory over the spirit of gravity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:ME1","text":"Noise and laughter are reclassified from mere disturbances into diagnostic signs of recovery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:ME2","text":"The opposition between illness and health is replaced by a transitional zone in which screaming and recovery coexist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:ME3","text":"Teaching is mapped not as the transmission of a fixed identity, but as the production of alien desires and hopes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:ME4","text":"Gratitude is made from a moral attitude into a structural proof of affective recovery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:ME5","text":"Remembrance is classified as a productive continuation of recovery, since festivals and monuments arise from past joys.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** The higher men laugh, make noise, scream, celebrate, and show gratitude.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Zarathustra's nourishment transforms an affective order determined by distress and gravity into an order of new desires, hopes, and forms of expression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Victory is measured not by complete imitation, but by the retreat of the adversary and by the independent reaction of the others.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Recovery appears as a temporal transition with remnants of the old illness; its future stabilizes itself through festivals, gratitude, and monuments.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from distress and gravity to laughter, gratitude, and festivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:MRT2","text":"The central distinction between Zarathustra's own laughter and the cheerfulness of the higher men remains necessary for the reconstruction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:MRT3","text":"It remains underdetermined whether the cheerfulness is enduring or designates only a provisional phase of recovery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0018","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:MRT4","text":"The structure is internally coherent so long as recovery is understood as an uncompleted transition and not as a symptom-free final state.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:MRT5","text":"The strongest connection exists between laughing at oneself, the retreat of the spirit of gravity, and the dissolution of disgust and shame.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:MRT6","text":"The greatest tension lies in the fact that Zarathustra claims a victory although the effect does not produce his own laughter and screaming does not completely disappear.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_17:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual argumentative movement insofar as victory is conceived as a functional effect and not as complete dominion over those recovering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_17:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_1_17@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_1_17:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"The Awakening","source_section_label":"1.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Four and Last"],"reading_title":"The Awakening · 1","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","The Awakening","1."],"original_title":"1."}],"source_title_context":"Die Erweckung","source_section_label":"1.","source_title_hierarchy":["Vierter und letzter Theil"],"reading_title":"The Awakening · 1","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","The Awakening","1."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 166","title":"The Awakening · 1","context":"Part Four and Last","original_context":"Vierter und letzter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Die Erweckung · 1"},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17","layer":"CH","title":"The Awakening · 2","order":167,"parents":["RAW_97E9_2_17"],"revision":"CH_97E9_2_17@R001","sha256":"f2ab06ac75138c14b0437c8639cb995d2e3451c0853904a7dec1eb70f41b3f5c","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:AS1","text":"Die ausgelassene Gemeinschaft der höheren Menschen kippt unvermittelt in eine religiöse Zeremonie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:AS2","text":"Das verehrte Objekt wird nicht als erhabene Gottheit, sondern als Esel sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:AS3","text":"Eine Litanei verwandelt Lasttragen, Geduld, Schweigen, Duldung und instinktive Bedürfnisbefriedigung in göttliche Eigenschaften.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:AS4","text":"Das wiederholte „I-A“ fungiert zugleich als liturgische Antwort und als akustische Entleerung des religiösen Sinns.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:AS5","text":"Die Szene erzeugt eine Satire der Frömmigkeit, deren Ziel nicht bloß der Esel, sondern das Bedürfnis nach einem widerspruchslosen Gott ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:A1","text":"Die Höhle der höheren Menschen kann von Lärm und Gelächter in vollkommene Stille übergehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:A2","text":"Zarathustra nimmt gegenüber der Versammlung die Position des beobachtenden Außenstehenden ein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:A3","text":"Die höheren Menschen knien gemeinsam vor einem Esel nieder und behandeln ihn als Gott.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:A4","text":"Die religiöse Handlung wird durch Weihrauch, Gebet, Litanei und Lobpreis formalisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:A5","text":"Die Litanei schreibt dem Esel Lasttragen, Knechtsgestalt, Geduld und unbedingtes Ja-Sagen zu.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:A6","text":"Das Schweigen des Esels wird als Weisheit, Unfehlbarkeit oder Vermeidung des Irrtums gedeutet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:A7","text":"Das Eselhafte wird als unscheinbare, graue und geistverbergende Tugendordnung dargestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:A8","text":"Der Esel stößt weder Bettler noch Könige zurück und wird dadurch als universell zugänglich konstruiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:A9","text":"Das wiederholte „I-A“ ersetzt die sprachliche Antwort des Gottes und bestätigt dennoch jede Strophe der Litanei.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:A10","text":"Körperliche Bedürftigkeit und einfache Lust werden als Bestandteile göttlicher Weisheit sakralisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:A11","text":"Die Eselverehrung verbindet religiöse Erhabenheit mit Dummheit, Bedürfnis und mechanischer Zustimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:NX1","text":"Die Verehrung gründet nicht auf einer erkennbaren transzendenten Offenbarung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:NX2","text":"Der angebetete Gott spricht keine begrifflich artikulierte Wahrheit aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:NX3","text":"Der religiöse Wert wird nicht durch Widerspruch, Prüfung oder Urteil bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:NX4","text":"Das göttliche Prinzip ist nicht auf Erhabenheit, Reinheit oder geistige Überlegenheit angewiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:NX5","text":"Die Litanei schließt ein aktives Nein, eine Zurückweisung oder eine selektive Entscheidung des Gottes aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:NX6","text":"Die versammelten Menschen werden nicht durch aufgeklärte Distanz oder kritische Selbstkontrolle organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:NX7","text":"Die Szene verweigert der Frömmigkeit eine eindeutige Trennung zwischen Ernst und Groteske.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:D1","text":"Wenn das Schweigen des Esels als Weisheit gilt, kann die Abwesenheit von Aussage als Schutz vor Irrtum erscheinen.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_17:A6","CH_97E9_2_17:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:D2","text":"Wenn der Esel niemals Nein sagt, wird Zustimmung zum primären Kriterium seiner Göttlichkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_17:A5","CH_97E9_2_17:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:D3","text":"Wenn der Esel jede soziale Figur aufnimmt, wird religiöse Universalität als unterschiedslose Duldung modelliert.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_17:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:D4","text":"Wenn Lasttragen und Knechtsgestalt gelobt werden, wird Unterordnung in eine Tugend des Göttlichen umcodiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_17:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:D5","text":"Wenn das „I-A“ jede Strophe begleitet, wird die Litanei durch eine nichtsprachliche Wiederholungsform zugleich bestätigt und entwertet.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_17:A4","CH_97E9_2_17:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:D6","text":"Wenn Bedürfnis und einfache Lust als Weisheit gelten, wird Göttlichkeit an körperliche Unmittelbarkeit statt an geistige Vermittlung gebunden.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_17:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:D7","text":"Wenn die höheren Menschen den Esel als Gott verehren, wird ihre religiöse Bedürftigkeit als Rückfall in kindliche und formelhafte Frömmigkeit sichtbar.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_17:A2","CH_97E9_2_17:A3","CH_97E9_2_17:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:SD1","text":"Die Szene erzeugt ein Gottesmodell, dessen höchste Qualität nicht Wahrheit, sondern widerspruchslose Bestätigung der vorhandenen Welt ist.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_17:A5","CH_97E9_2_17:A6","CH_97E9_2_17:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:SD2","text":"Die religiöse Form verwandelt Passivität, Dienstbarkeit und Urteilslosigkeit in scheinbare metaphysische Vollkommenheit.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_17:A5","CH_97E9_2_17:A7","CH_97E9_2_17:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:SD3","text":"Die mechanische Antwort des Esels legt offen, dass die Litanei ihre Bedeutung unabhängig von einem verstehenden oder sprechenden Gott produziert.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_17:A4","CH_97E9_2_17:A9","CH_97E9_2_17:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:SD4","text":"Die höheren Menschen suchen in der Eselverehrung eine Form von Transzendenz, die ihre Bedürftigkeit nicht übersteigt, sondern bestätigt.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_17:A3","CH_97E9_2_17:A8","CH_97E9_2_17:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:SD5","text":"Die Satire richtet sich auf die strukturelle Erzeugung von Heiligkeit aus beliebigen, gerade wegen ihrer Niedrigkeit geeigneten Eigenschaften.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_17:A3","CH_97E9_2_17:A5","CH_97E9_2_17:A10","CH_97E9_2_17:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:DNX1","text":"Das System setzt stillschweigend voraus, dass ein Gott ohne Nein, Urteil und Widerstand als überlegen gelten kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:DNX2","text":"Es schließt aus, dass Wahrheit durch begriffliche Rede, Prüfung oder Widerspruch entstehen muss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:DNX3","text":"Es disqualifiziert die Annahme, dass Göttlichkeit eine Distanz zum Körperlichen, Bedürftigen und Lächerlichen erfordert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:DNX4","text":"Es behandelt kritische Autonomie als weniger bindungsfähig als gemeinsame Unterwerfung unter ein affirmatives Symbol.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:DNX5","text":"Es schließt eine Religion aus, deren Gott die Welt nicht bloß bestätigt, sondern sie beurteilt und verändert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Möglichkeit einer Transzendenz, die nicht in der Wiederholung des bereits Gegebenen aufgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:SNX2","text":"Abwesend bleibt ein Gott, der antwortet, widerspricht, unterscheidet oder Verantwortung auferlegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:SNX3","text":"Versperrt ist eine Gemeinschaft, die ihre Einheit nicht aus gemeinsamer Regression und gemeinsamer Anbetung gewinnt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:SNX4","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine positive Bestimmung des Heiligen jenseits der Umkehrung und Übersteigerung niedriger Eigenschaften.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:FGS1","text":"Gemeinsamer Lärm → abrupte Stille → verdeckte Beobachtung durch Zarathustra.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:FGS2","text":"Weihrauch und Gebetsform → sakrale Rahmung eines profanen Tieres.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:FGS3","text":"Esel als Objekt → Übertragung von Last, Geduld, Schweigen und Duldung in göttliche Prädikate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:FGS4","text":"Litanei → fortlaufende Totalisierung des bedingungslosen Ja.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:FGS5","text":"„I-A“ → nichtsprachliche Bestätigung → gleichzeitige Erfüllung und Demontage der Liturgie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:FGS6","text":"Sakralisierung des Niedrigen → Sichtbarkeit einer Religion, die Bedürftigkeit als Transzendenz organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:FGS7","text":"Beobachtung des Rituals → Umschlag von religiöser Feier in groteske Diagnose menschlicher Gottesbedürftigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:AF1","text":"Lärmende Gemeinschaft → plötzliche Stille → geheime Beobachtung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:AF2","text":"Verdecktes Ritual → Entdeckung der Eselanbetung → Umkehrung religiöser Erhabenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:AF3","text":"Eselhafte Eigenschaften → liturgische Überhöhung → Konstruktion eines affirmativen Gottes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:AF4","text":"Wiederholtes „I-A“ → Bestätigung ohne Sprache → Offenlegung mechanischer Frömmigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:AF5","text":"Gemeinsame Verehrung → Regression der höheren Menschen → Satire des Bedürfnisses nach widerspruchsloser Transzendenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:ME1","text":"Göttlichkeit wird von geistiger Höhe auf Lasttragen, Duldung, Schweigen und Bedürfnis herab- beziehungsweise umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:ME2","text":"Schweigen erscheint nicht mehr als bloße Sprachlosigkeit, sondern als vermeintliche Quelle von Weisheit und Unfehlbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:ME3","text":"Das Ja wird aus einer sprachlichen Antwort in ein ontologisches Prinzip der Weltbestätigung verwandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:ME4","text":"Die Grenze zwischen religiösem Ernst und grotesker Nachahmung wird als strukturell instabil sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:ME5","text":"Die höheren Menschen werden nicht als religionslose Kritiker, sondern als Träger eines weiterhin wirksamen Frömmigkeitsbedürfnisses kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:ME6","text":"Universalität wird nicht durch Erkenntnis oder Freiheit, sondern durch unterschiedslose Aufnahmefähigkeit definiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:ALT1","text":"Surface — Eine Gruppe höherer Menschen betet unter Weihrauch und Litanei einen Esel an.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:ALT2","text":"Structural — Eine religiöse Ordnung erhebt Passivität, Dienstbarkeit, Schweigen und unterschiedslose Duldung zu Tugenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Szene verschiebt die Kritik von einzelnen Glaubensinhalten auf die Form eines Bedürfnisses nach einem widerspruchslosen Gott.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Weltbejahung wird als unbedingtes, immer wiederholtes Ja gesetzt; Veränderung durch Nein, Urteil oder Negation bleibt ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um Ritual, Esel, Litanei und „I-A“ als zusammenhängende Erzeugungsstruktur zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:MRT2","text":"Die zentrale Bewegungsform von ausgelassener Gemeinschaft zu regressiver Frömmigkeit bleibt erhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob die höheren Menschen den Esel bewusst als Parodie oder unbewusst als Gott verehren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:MRT4","text":"Nicht vollständig aufgelöst wird die Spannung zwischen echter religiöser Bedürftigkeit und ihrer grotesken Entlarvung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:MRT5","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, weil jede Lobpreisung das Prinzip des bedingungslosen Ja weiter verdichtet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:MRT6","text":"Die stärkste Stelle ist die Kopplung von liturgischer Form und mechanischem Tierlaut.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion hängt an der satirischen Gleichzeitigkeit von Sakralisierung und Entwertung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T191105562767Z_8870ccea","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"2.","source_sha256":"f2ab06ac75138c14b0437c8639cb995d2e3451c0853904a7dec1eb70f41b3f5c","sha256":"ef007dcefdce523175013801ed98cf54667cb9eeab1ce41cf448d6b980ff5bd3","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:11:05.565665+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:AS1","text":"The exuberant fellowship of the higher human beings abruptly turns into a religious ceremony.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:AS2","text":"The object of veneration becomes visible not as a sublime deity, but as a donkey.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:AS3","text":"A litany transforms bearing burdens, patience, silence, tolerance, and instinctive satisfaction of needs into divine qualities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:AS4","text":"The repeated “I-A” functions simultaneously as a liturgical response and as an acoustic emptying of religious meaning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:AS5","text":"The scene produces a satire of piety, whose target is not merely the donkey, but the need for a God without contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:A1","text":"The cave of the higher human beings can pass from noise and laughter into complete silence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:A2","text":"Zarathustra occupies the position of an observing outsider in relation to the assembly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:A3","text":"The higher human beings kneel together before a donkey and treat it as God.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:A4","text":"The religious act is formalized through incense, prayer, litany, and praise.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:A5","text":"The litany ascribes to the donkey the bearing of burdens, the form of a servant, patience, and unconditional saying-yes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:A6","text":"The donkey's silence is interpreted as wisdom, infallibility, or avoidance of error.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:A7","text":"The asinine is presented as an inconspicuous, gray, and spirit-concealing order of virtues.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0011","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:A8","text":"The donkey rejects neither beggars nor kings and is thereby constructed as universally accessible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:A9","text":"The repeated “I-A” replaces the God's verbal response and nevertheless confirms every stanza of the litany.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:A10","text":"Bodily neediness and simple pleasure are sacralized as components of divine wisdom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:A11","text":"Donkey worship combines religious sublimity with stupidity, need, and mechanical assent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:NX1","text":"Veneration is not grounded in a recognizable transcendent revelation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:NX2","text":"The worshipped God utters no conceptually articulated truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:NX3","text":"Religious value is not determined through contradiction, examination, or judgment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:NX4","text":"The divine principle does not depend on sublimity, purity, or spiritual superiority.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:NX5","text":"The litany excludes an active no, a rejection, or a selective decision on the part of God.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:NX6","text":"The assembled human beings are not organized through enlightened distance or critical self-control.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:NX7","text":"The scene denies piety an unambiguous separation between seriousness and grotesquerie.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:D1","text":"If the donkey's silence counts as wisdom, the absence of statement can appear as protection against error.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_17:A6","CH_97E9_2_17:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:D2","text":"If the donkey never says no, assent becomes the primary criterion of its divinity.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_17:A5","CH_97E9_2_17:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:D3","text":"If the donkey receives every social figure, religious universality is modeled as indiscriminate tolerance.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_17:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:D4","text":"If bearing burdens and the form of a servant are praised, subordination is recoded into a virtue of the divine.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_17:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:D5","text":"If “I-A” accompanies every stanza, the litany is simultaneously confirmed and devalued by a nonverbal form of repetition.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_17:A4","CH_97E9_2_17:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:D6","text":"If need and simple pleasure count as wisdom, divinity is bound to bodily immediacy rather than spiritual mediation.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_17:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:D7","text":"If the higher human beings worship the donkey as God, their religious neediness becomes visible as a relapse into childish and formulaic piety.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_17:A2","CH_97E9_2_17:A3","CH_97E9_2_17:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:SD1","text":"The scene produces a model of God whose highest quality is not truth, but contradiction-free confirmation of the existing world.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_17:A5","CH_97E9_2_17:A6","CH_97E9_2_17:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:SD2","text":"The religious form transforms passivity, servility, and absence of judgment into apparent metaphysical perfection.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_17:A5","CH_97E9_2_17:A7","CH_97E9_2_17:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:SD3","text":"The donkey's mechanical response reveals that the litany produces its meaning independently of a God who understands or speaks.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_17:A4","CH_97E9_2_17:A9","CH_97E9_2_17:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:SD4","text":"In donkey worship, the higher human beings seek a form of transcendence that does not surpass their neediness, but confirms it.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_17:A3","CH_97E9_2_17:A8","CH_97E9_2_17:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:SD5","text":"The satire is directed at the structural production of holiness from arbitrary qualities suitable precisely because of their lowness.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_17:A3","CH_97E9_2_17:A5","CH_97E9_2_17:A10","CH_97E9_2_17:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:DNX1","text":"The system tacitly presupposes that a God without no, judgment, and resistance can count as superior.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:DNX2","text":"It excludes that truth must arise through conceptual speech, examination, or contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:DNX3","text":"It disqualifies the assumption that divinity requires a distance from the bodily, the needy, and the ridiculous.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:DNX4","text":"It treats critical autonomy as less capable of binding than shared submission to an affirmative symbol.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0017","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:DNX5","text":"It excludes a religion whose God does not merely confirm the world, but judges and changes it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:SNX1","text":"Excluded is the possibility of a transcendence that is not exhausted in the repetition of what is already given.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:SNX2","text":"Absent remains a God who responds, contradicts, distinguishes, or imposes responsibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:SNX3","text":"Foreclosed is a community that does not derive its unity from shared regression and shared worship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:SNX4","text":"Unavailable is a positive determination of the sacred beyond the inversion and intensification of low qualities.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0011","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:FGS1","text":"Shared noise → abrupt silence → concealed observation by Zarathustra.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:FGS2","text":"Incense and prayer form → sacred framing of a profane animal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:FGS3","text":"Donkey as object → transfer of burden, patience, silence, and tolerance into divine predicates.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0011","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:FGS4","text":"Litany → ongoing totalization of the unconditional yes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:FGS5","text":"“I-A” → nonverbal confirmation → simultaneous fulfillment and dismantling of the liturgy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:FGS6","text":"Sacralization of the low → visibility of a religion that organizes neediness as transcendence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:FGS7","text":"Observation of the ritual → transformation of religious celebration into a grotesque diagnosis of the human need for God.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:AF1","text":"Noisy community → sudden silence → secret observation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:AF2","text":"Concealed ritual → discovery of donkey worship → inversion of religious sublimity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:AF3","text":"Asinine qualities → liturgical elevation → construction of an affirmative God.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:AF4","text":"Repeated “I-A” → confirmation without language → disclosure of mechanical piety.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0010","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:AF5","text":"Shared worship → regression of the higher human beings → satire of the need for contradiction-free transcendence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:ME1","text":"Divinity is remapped downward, or alternatively remapped, from spiritual height onto bearing burdens, tolerance, silence, and need.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:ME2","text":"Silence no longer appears as mere speechlessness, but as a purported source of wisdom and infallibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:ME3","text":"Yes is transformed from a verbal response into an ontological principle of world-affirmation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:ME4","text":"The boundary between religious seriousness and grotesque imitation becomes visible as structurally unstable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:ME5","text":"The higher human beings are mapped not as irreligious critics, but as bearers of a still-effective need for piety.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:ME6","text":"Universality is defined not through knowledge or freedom, but through indiscriminate receptivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:ALT1","text":"Surface — A group of higher human beings worships a donkey amid incense and litany.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:ALT2","text":"Structural — A religious order elevates passivity, servility, silence, and indiscriminate tolerance into virtues.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0011","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The scene shifts criticism from individual contents of belief to the form of a need for a God without contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — World-affirmation is posited as an unconditional, ever-repeated yes; change through no, judgment, or negation remains excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct ritual, donkey, litany, and “I-A” as a coherent generative structure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:MRT2","text":"The central movement from exuberant community to regressive piety is preserved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:MRT3","text":"It remains underdetermined whether the higher human beings consciously venerate the donkey as a parody or unconsciously as God.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:MRT4","text":"The tension between genuine religious neediness and its grotesque exposure is not fully resolved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:MRT5","text":"The structure is internally coherent because every act of praise further condenses the principle of the unconditional yes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:MRT6","text":"The strongest point is the coupling of liturgical form and mechanical animal sound.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_17:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction depends on the satirical simultaneity of sacralization and devaluation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_17:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_2_17@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_2_17:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"The Awakening","source_section_label":"2.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Four and Last"],"reading_title":"The Awakening · 2","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","The Awakening","2."],"original_title":"2."}],"source_title_context":"Die Erweckung","source_section_label":"2.","source_title_hierarchy":["Vierter und letzter Theil"],"reading_title":"The Awakening · 2","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","The Awakening","2."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 167","title":"The Awakening · 2","context":"Part Four and Last","original_context":"Vierter und letzter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Die Erweckung · 2"},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18","layer":"CH","title":"The Ass Festival · 1","order":168,"parents":["RAW_97E9_1_18"],"revision":"CH_97E9_1_18@R001","sha256":"7d742bce73151a8e73d49a57fda9e90005d696c5cd9498406da86c61bdfb3f2d","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:AS1","text":"Die Szene problematisiert die Rückkehr religiöser Anbetung in einer als frei verstandenen Zeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:AS2","text":"Zarathustra bestimmt die Eselanbetung als Blasphemie und Dummheit, wird durch sein eigenes I-A jedoch in die Szene hineingezogen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:AS3","text":"Der Papst verschiebt die Frage von der Wahrheit der Gottesgestalt auf die Notwendigkeit irgendeiner Gestalt für den Glauben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:AS4","text":"Die Stimmen der Gäste verkehren die Gegensätze von Glaube und Unglaube, Freiheit und Pfaffendienst sowie Klugheit und Dummheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:AS5","text":"Die Eselgestalt wird zugleich als Rückfall, als glaubwürdigste Gottesform und als mögliche Gestalt übermäßiger Weisheit lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:AS6","text":"Die Bewegung endet nicht mit der Feststellung von Gottes Tod, sondern mit einer unentschiedenen Relation von Wiederbelebung, Tötung und Lachen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:A1","text":"Die Gäste beten einen Esel als Gott an.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:A2","text":"Zarathustra beurteilt diese Anbetung als Gotteslästerung und Dummheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:A3","text":"Zarathustra schreit selbst I-A und springt unter die Anbetenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:A4","text":"Der Papst setzt die Anbetung Gottes in irgendeiner Gestalt gegen die Anbetung Gottes in gar keiner Gestalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:A5","text":"Der Papst deutet die Formel „Gott ist ein Geist“ als einen entscheidenden Schritt zum Unglauben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:A6","text":"Der Wanderer und Schatten behauptet, der alte Gott sei durch den hässlichsten Menschen wieder auferweckt worden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:A7","text":"Der kluge Zauberer erkennt seine Gottesverehrung als Dummheit an, ohne dadurch aus ihr herauszutreten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:A8","text":"Der Gewissenhafte des Geistes hält Gott in der Eselgestalt für am glaubwürdigsten und verbindet Langsamkeit sowie Dummheit mit großer zeitlicher Wirksamkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:A9","text":"Der Gewissenhafte erklärt, übermäßiger Geist und vollkommene Weisheit könnten in Esel- oder Narrheit umschlagen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:A10","text":"Der hässlichste Mensch erklärt Gottes Lebens- oder Todesstatus für unentscheidbar und erinnert an Zarathustras Lehre, dass man durch Lachen und nicht durch Zorn töte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:NX1","text":"Eine Gottesverehrung ohne jede Gestalt wird als religiös unzureichend zurückgewiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:NX2","text":"Ein rein geistiger Gottesbegriff wird als kein verlässlicher Schutz vor dem Unglauben behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:NX3","text":"Die Selbstbezeichnung als freier Geist schließt Götzen- und Pfaffendienst nicht aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:NX4","text":"Klugheit schließt Dummheit und religiösen Rückfall nicht aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:NX5","text":"Geistige Reinlichkeit und Gewissenhaftigkeit verhindern die Zustimmung zur Eselanbetung nicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:NX6","text":"Der Tod eines Gottes wird nicht als endgültig feststehender Zustand anerkannt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:NX7","text":"Zarathustra bleibt nicht als äußerer Richter von der dargestellten religiösen Dynamik getrennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:NX8","text":"Zorn wird als notwendige oder höchste Form des Tötens ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:D1","text":"Im päpstlichen Argument wird die konkrete Gestalt zur Bedingung dafür, dass Gottesverehrung den Unglauben überdauert.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_18:A4","CH_97E9_1_18:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:D2","text":"Die Wiederkehr des alten Gottes erscheint als Folge einer erneuten Verkörperung und nicht als Ergebnis einer begrifflichen Widerlegung des Atheismus.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_18:A1","CH_97E9_1_18:A4","CH_97E9_1_18:A5","CH_97E9_1_18:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:D3","text":"Die religiöse Handlung widerlegt die stabilen Selbstbilder der Beteiligten als freie, kluge oder geistig reine Subjekte.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_18:A1","CH_97E9_1_18:A7","CH_97E9_1_18:A8","CH_97E9_1_18:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:D4","text":"Die Eselgestalt erhält ihre Glaubwürdigkeit gerade durch die Eigenschaften, die höhere Geistigkeit gewöhnlich ausschließen soll: Langsamkeit, Dummheit und Narrheit.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_18:A8","CH_97E9_1_18:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:D5","text":"Zarathustras Kritik wird reflexiv, weil seine eigene Weisheit als möglicher Ursprung derselben Eselwerdung benannt wird, die er verurteilt.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_18:A2","CH_97E9_1_18:A3","CH_97E9_1_18:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:D6","text":"Die Frage nach Gottes Tod wird in eine unentscheidbare Abfolge von Töten, Wiederbeleben und erneutem Leben überführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_18:A6","CH_97E9_1_18:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:D7","text":"Lachen wird als wirksame Zerstörung bestimmt, ohne dass dadurch der ontologische Status des Getöteten abschließend geklärt wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_18:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:SD1","text":"Die Szene erzeugt religiöse Rückkehr aus dem Scheitern abstrakter Transzendenz: Wo der geistige Gott den Unglauben steigert, stabilisiert die Gestalt den Glauben.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_18:A4","CH_97E9_1_18:A5","CH_97E9_1_18:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:SD2","text":"Die Kategorien freier Geist, Klugheit und Gewissenhaftigkeit erweisen sich nicht als Gegenpositionen zur Religion, sondern als Formen, in denen religiöse Regression auftreten kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_18:A6","CH_97E9_1_18:A7","CH_97E9_1_18:A8","CH_97E9_1_18:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:SD3","text":"Die antireligiöse Kritik wird in ihr eigenes Objekt verwickelt: Zarathustra verurteilt die Anbetung, nimmt körperlich an ihr teil und wird als möglicher Esel bezeichnet.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_18:A2","CH_97E9_1_18:A3","CH_97E9_1_18:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:SD4","text":"Gottes Tod wird von einem abgeschlossenen Ereignis in einen reversiblen Vorgang auslösendem Töten, Wiederkehr und erneuter Vernichtung verwandelt.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_18:A5","CH_97E9_1_18:A6","CH_97E9_1_18:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:SD5","text":"Lachen fungiert zugleich als Zerstörungsmittel, als Distanzierung vom Zorn und als Verfahren, durch das der Kritiker selbst in die religiöse Szene zurückkehrt.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_18:A3","CH_97E9_1_18:A9","CH_97E9_1_18:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt die Möglichkeit aus, dass ein Gott ohne sinnlich oder symbolisch verfügbare Gestalt dauerhaft verehrt werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:DNX2","text":"Es schließt eine endgültige Säkularisierung aus, in der der Tod Gottes nicht in Wiederkehr umschlagen kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:DNX3","text":"Es schließt ein Subjekt aus, dessen Vernunft, Klugheit oder Geistigkeit es dauerhaft vor Dummheit und Kult schützt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:DNX4","text":"Es schließt eine reine Trennung zwischen dem religionskritischen Beobachter und dem religiösen Objekt aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:DNX5","text":"Es schließt eine eindeutige Zuschreibung der religiösen Wiederkehr an einen einzelnen Urheber aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:DNX6","text":"Es schließt eine Tötung aus, deren Wirkung in Zorn, Absicht und endgültigem Abschluss aufgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:SNX1","text":"Unmöglich wird eine endgültige Überwindung der Religion, die weder Gestalt noch Wiederholung noch Rückfall hervorbringt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:SNX2","text":"Unmöglich wird eine stabile Identität, deren Selbstbeschreibung ihre Handlungen abschließend bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:SNX3","text":"Unmöglich wird eine Kritik, die außerhalb der von ihr kritisierten religiösen Affekte und Formen stehen bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:SNX4","text":"Unmöglich wird die vollständige Entscheidung zwischen Gottes Tod, Gottes Wiederkehr und der bloßen Fortdauer eines Vorurteils.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0029","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:FGS1","text":"Abstrakter Gottesbegriff → Verlust der Glaubwürdigkeit → Vorrang irgendeiner Gestalt vor gestaltloser Verehrung.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_18:A4","CH_97E9_1_18:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:FGS2","text":"Eselgestalt → sinnliche Glaubwürdigkeit → erneute Anbetung → Behauptung der Wiederkehr des alten Gottes.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_18:A1","CH_97E9_1_18:A6","CH_97E9_1_18:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:FGS3","text":"Erneute Anbetung → Widerspruch zwischen Handlung und Selbstbeschreibung → Auflösung der Gegensätze von freiem Geist, Klugheit, Gewissen und Pfaffendienst.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_18:A6","CH_97E9_1_18:A7","CH_97E9_1_18:A8","CH_97E9_1_18:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:FGS4","text":"Zarathustras Anklage → körperliche und begriffliche Selbstverwicklung → mögliche Eselwerdung des Kritikers.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_18:A2","CH_97E9_1_18:A3","CH_97E9_1_18:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:FGS5","text":"Lachen statt Zorn → wirksame Tötung ohne ontologische Endgültigkeit → Offenhaltung von Tod, Wiederkehr und weiterer Verwandlung.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_18:A6","CH_97E9_1_18:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:AF1","text":"Eselanbetung → Zarathustras Unterbrechung → päpstliche Verteidigung der Gestalt → Verknüpfung von Geistabstraktion und Unglauben → Behauptung der Wiederkehr des alten Gottes → Zerfall der Selbstbilder von Freiheit, Klugheit und Reinheit → Verwicklung Zarathustras → Lachen als nicht-zornige Tötung → ungelöster Status von Tod und Leben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:ME1","text":"Gottesgestalt wird von einem bloßen Gegenstand der Anbetung zu einer Bedingung der Möglichkeit von Glauben umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:ME2","text":"Die Opposition von freiem Geist und religiösem Dienst bricht zusammen, weil der freie Geist als Träger des Dienstes erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:ME3","text":"Klugheit, Gewissen und Weisheit werden nicht länger als Gegenkräfte der Dummheit, sondern als mögliche Übergangsformen zu ihr kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:ME4","text":"Gottes Tod wird von einem binären Zustand in eine zeitliche Schleife aus Tötung, Wiederkehr und erneuter Tötbarkeit transformiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:ME5","text":"Zarathustras Position verschiebt sich vom äußeren Richter zum mitbetroffenen Bestandteil des religiösen Vorgangs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:ME6","text":"Lachen wird von einer Reaktion zu einer operativen Kraft der Vernichtung und Umkehr klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — Die unmittelbare Szene zeigt die Anbetung eines Esels, Zarathustras Empörung und die Verteidigungsreden der Gäste.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — Die Szene organisiert ein Verhältnis von Gestalt und Abstraktion, Handlung und Selbstbeschreibung sowie Weisheit und Dummheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — Die Kritik wird durch Selbstbeteiligung und Rückwendung neutralisiert; Lachen ersetzt die direkte Konfrontation durch eine indirekte Form der Vernichtung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — Gottes Sein wird als reversibel und zeitlich instabil behandelt; Tod, Wiederkehr und Gestalt bleiben ineinander verschränkt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:MRT1","text":"Die extrahierten Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von der Eselanbetung zur reflexiven Verwicklung Zarathustras zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob der alte Gott tatsächlich lebt, wiederlebt oder grundsätzlich tot ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt außerdem, ob der hässlichste Mensch die Wiederkehr verursacht oder nur ihre Deutung liefert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:MRT4","text":"Die Struktur ist als dramatische Umkehrbewegung kohärent, nicht als widerspruchsfreie Gotteslehre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:MRT5","text":"Ihre stärkste Verbindung liegt in der Kopplung von Gestalt, Glaubwürdigkeit und Wiederkehr.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:MRT6","text":"Ihre zentrale ungelöste Spannung besteht darin, dass Zarathustra die Anbetung zurückweist und zugleich deren körperliche und begriffliche Bedingungen verkörpert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion hängt davon ab, die unterschiedlichen Sprecherpositionen getrennt zu halten; eine Einebnung würde die produktiven Widersprüche fälschlich auflösen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:MRT8","text":"Die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung bleibt erhalten: Unterbrechung → Verteidigung der Gestalt → Wiederkehr → Identitätsbruch → Selbstverwicklung → ontologische Offenheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T185908586896Z_4dd31339","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"1.","source_sha256":"7d742bce73151a8e73d49a57fda9e90005d696c5cd9498406da86c61bdfb3f2d","sha256":"a0055e8eb72efd9572ba05749384de12891bb6dea7efaae3cbbd208bf54a8e13","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T18:59:08.589434+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:AS1","text":"The scene problematizes the return of religious worship in an age understood as free.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:AS2","text":"Zarathustra defines donkey worship as blasphemy and stupidity, yet is drawn into the scene by his own I-A.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:AS3","text":"The Pope shifts the question from the truth of God's form to the necessity of some form for faith.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:AS4","text":"The voices of the guests invert the oppositions between faith and unbelief, freedom and priestly service, as well as cleverness and stupidity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:AS5","text":"The donkey form becomes readable simultaneously as regression, as the most credible form of God, and as a possible form of excessive wisdom.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:AS6","text":"The movement ends not with the assertion of God's death, but with an undecided relation of revival, killing, and laughter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:A1","text":"The guests worship a donkey as God.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:A2","text":"Zarathustra judges this worship to be blasphemy and stupidity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:A3","text":"Zarathustra himself cries I-A and leaps among the worshippers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:A4","text":"The Pope sets the worship of God in some form against the worship of God in no form at all.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:A5","text":"The Pope interprets the formula “God is a spirit” as a decisive step toward unbelief.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:A6","text":"The Wanderer and Shadow claims that the old God has been resurrected by the ugliest man.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:A7","text":"The clever magician acknowledges his veneration of God as stupidity, without thereby stepping out of it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0015","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:A8","text":"The Conscientious One of the Spirit considers God most credible in the donkey form and links slowness and stupidity with great temporal efficacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0019","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0020","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:A9","text":"The Conscientious One declares that excessive spirit and perfect wisdom could turn into donkeyhood or folly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:A10","text":"The ugliest man declares God's status as living or dead undecidable and recalls Zarathustra's teaching that one kills through laughter and not through anger.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:NX1","text":"A veneration of God without any form whatsoever is rejected as religiously insufficient.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:NX2","text":"A purely spiritual concept of God is treated as no reliable protection against unbelief.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:NX3","text":"Self-designation as a free spirit does not exclude idolatry and priestly service.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:NX4","text":"Cleverness does not exclude stupidity and religious regression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:NX5","text":"Spiritual cleanliness and conscientiousness do not prevent assent to donkey worship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0017","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0018","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0019","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:NX6","text":"The death of a god is not recognized as a definitively established state.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:NX7","text":"Zarathustra does not remain separated, as an external judge, from the religious dynamic depicted.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:NX8","text":"Anger is excluded as a necessary or highest form of killing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:D1","text":"In the papal argument, concrete form becomes the condition under which veneration of God outlasts unbelief.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_18:A4","CH_97E9_1_18:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:D2","text":"The return of the old God appears as the consequence of a renewed embodiment and not as the result of a conceptual refutation of atheism.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_18:A1","CH_97E9_1_18:A4","CH_97E9_1_18:A5","CH_97E9_1_18:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:D3","text":"The religious act refutes the stable self-images of the participants as free, clever, or spiritually pure subjects.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_18:A1","CH_97E9_1_18:A7","CH_97E9_1_18:A8","CH_97E9_1_18:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0015","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:D4","text":"The donkey form acquires its credibility precisely through the qualities that are ordinarily supposed to exclude higher spirituality: slowness, stupidity, and folly.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_18:A8","CH_97E9_1_18:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0020","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:D5","text":"Zarathustra's critique becomes reflexive because his own wisdom is named as a possible origin of the very becoming-donkey that he condemns.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_18:A2","CH_97E9_1_18:A3","CH_97E9_1_18:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:D6","text":"The question of God's death is transferred into an undecidable sequence of killing, reviving, and renewed life.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_18:A6","CH_97E9_1_18:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0026","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:D7","text":"Laughter is determined as effective destruction without thereby conclusively clarifying the ontological status of what is killed.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_18:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:SD1","text":"The scene generates religious return from the failure of abstract transcendence: where the spiritual God intensifies unbelief, form stabilizes faith.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_18:A4","CH_97E9_1_18:A5","CH_97E9_1_18:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:SD2","text":"The categories of free spirit, cleverness, and conscientiousness prove to be not counterpositions to religion, but forms in which religious regression can occur.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_18:A6","CH_97E9_1_18:A7","CH_97E9_1_18:A8","CH_97E9_1_18:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:SD3","text":"Anti-religious critique becomes entangled in its own object: Zarathustra condemns worship, participates physically in it, and is described as a possible donkey.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_18:A2","CH_97E9_1_18:A3","CH_97E9_1_18:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:SD4","text":"God's death is transformed from a completed event into a reversible process of initiating killing, return, and renewed destruction.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_18:A5","CH_97E9_1_18:A6","CH_97E9_1_18:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:SD5","text":"Laughter functions at once as a means of destruction, as a distancing from anger, and as a procedure through which the critic himself returns to the religious scene.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_18:A3","CH_97E9_1_18:A9","CH_97E9_1_18:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:DNX1","text":"The system excludes the possibility that a god without a sensuously or symbolically available form can be permanently worshipped.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:DNX2","text":"It excludes a final secularization in which the death of God cannot turn into return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0012","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:DNX3","text":"It excludes a subject whose reason, cleverness, or spirituality permanently protects it from stupidity and cult.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0010","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0015","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:DNX4","text":"It excludes a pure separation between the observer critical of religion and the religious object.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:DNX5","text":"It excludes an unambiguous attribution of religious return to a single originator.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:DNX6","text":"It excludes a killing whose effect is exhausted in anger, intention, and final completion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0029","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0030","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0031","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:SNX1","text":"Impossible is a final overcoming of religion that produces neither form, nor repetition, nor regression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:SNX2","text":"Impossible is a stable identity whose self-description conclusively determines its actions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0017","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:SNX3","text":"Impossible is a critique that remains outside the religious affects and forms it criticizes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:SNX4","text":"Impossible is the complete decision between God's death, God's return, and the mere persistence of a prejudice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0012","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0029","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0030","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:FGS1","text":"Abstract concept of God → loss of credibility → primacy of some form over formless worship.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_18:A4","CH_97E9_1_18:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:FGS2","text":"Donkey form → sensuous credibility → renewed worship → assertion of the return of the old God.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_18:A1","CH_97E9_1_18:A6","CH_97E9_1_18:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:FGS3","text":"Renewed worship → contradiction between action and self-description → dissolution of the oppositions between free spirit, cleverness, conscience, and priestly service.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_18:A6","CH_97E9_1_18:A7","CH_97E9_1_18:A8","CH_97E9_1_18:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:FGS4","text":"Zarathustra's accusation → bodily and conceptual self-entanglement → possible becoming-donkey of the critic.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_18:A2","CH_97E9_1_18:A3","CH_97E9_1_18:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:FGS5","text":"Laughter instead of anger → effective killing without ontological finality → keeping open death, return, and further transformation.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_18:A6","CH_97E9_1_18:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0029","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0030","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0031","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:AF1","text":"Donkey worship → Zarathustra's interruption → papal defense of form → linkage of spiritual abstraction and unbelief → assertion of the return of the old God → collapse of the self-images of freedom, cleverness, and purity → Zarathustra's entanglement → laughter as non-angry killing → unresolved status of death and life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:ME1","text":"God's form is remapped from a mere object of worship into a condition of the possibility of faith.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:ME2","text":"The opposition between free spirit and religious service collapses because the free spirit appears as the bearer of service.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0010","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:ME3","text":"Cleverness, conscience, and wisdom are no longer mapped as counterforces to stupidity, but as possible transitional forms into it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:ME4","text":"God's death is transformed from a binary state into a temporal loop of killing, return, and renewed killability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:ME5","text":"Zarathustra's position shifts from external judge to co-affected component of the religious process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:ME6","text":"Laughter is classified from a reaction into an operative force of destruction and reversal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0030","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0031","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — The immediate scene shows the worship of a donkey, Zarathustra's indignation, and the guests' speeches of defense.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — The scene organizes a relation between form and abstraction, action and self-description, as well as wisdom and stupidity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0010","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0019","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — Critique is neutralized through self-participation and reflexive return; laughter replaces direct confrontation with an indirect form of destruction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — God's being is treated as reversible and temporally unstable; death, return, and form remain intertwined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0031","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:MRT1","text":"The extracted axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from donkey worship to Zarathustra's reflexive entanglement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether the old God actually lives, lives again, or is fundamentally dead.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0029","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:MRT3","text":"It also remains underdetermined whether the ugliest man causes the return or merely supplies its interpretation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0026","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:MRT4","text":"The structure is coherent as a dramatic movement of reversal, not as a contradiction-free doctrine of God.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:MRT5","text":"Its strongest connection lies in the coupling of form, credibility, and return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0019","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:MRT6","text":"Its central unresolved tension consists in the fact that Zarathustra rejects worship while simultaneously embodying its bodily and conceptual conditions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0022","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction depends on keeping the different speaker positions separate; a leveling would falsely dissolve the productive contradictions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0016","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0018","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0028","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_18:MRT8","text":"The actual movement of argument remains preserved: interruption → defense of form → return → rupture of identity → self-entanglement → ontological openness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0015","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0029","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_18:P0030","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_1_18@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_1_18:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"The Ass Festival","source_section_label":"1.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Four and Last"],"reading_title":"The Ass Festival · 1","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","The Ass Festival","1."],"original_title":"1."}],"source_title_context":"Das Eselsfest","source_section_label":"1.","source_title_hierarchy":["Vierter und letzter Theil"],"reading_title":"The Ass Festival · 1","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","The Ass Festival","1."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 168","title":"The Ass Festival · 1","context":"Part Four and Last","original_context":"Vierter und letzter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Das Eselsfest · 1"},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18","layer":"CH","title":"The Ass Festival · 2","order":169,"parents":["RAW_97E9_2_18"],"revision":"CH_97E9_2_18@R001","sha256":"9784facb92a4b5d0f163626d46e81b1ac01700913d774fb598c3083a1b8b5827","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:AS1","text":"Die Gäste verbergen ihre Lust und Bosheit hinter schelmischen Antworten und kindlicher Frömmigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:AS2","text":"Ihr Beten, Händefalten und Anrufen Gottes werden als Rückfall in kindliches Verhalten bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:AS3","text":"Zarathustras Höhle wird dadurch zur vorübergehenden Kinderstube und zum Ort der versammelten Kinderei.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:AS4","text":"Die kindliche Erregung soll aus der Höhle in den Außenraum verwiesen und dort abgekühlt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:AS5","text":"Das Himmelreich bleibt an das Kindwerden gebunden, wird aber als Ziel zurückgewiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:AS6","text":"An die Stelle des Himmelreichs tritt das Erdenreich als Selbstbestimmung erwachsener Männer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:A1","text":"Die Gäste verbergen sich vor Zarathustra.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:A2","text":"Ihre Verborgenheit schützt Lust und Bosheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:A3","text":"Kindliches Verhalten umfasst Frömmigkeit, Beten, Händefalten und das Anrufen Gottes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:A4","text":"Das kindliche Verhalten der Gäste ist ein wiedergewonnener Zustand.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:A5","text":"Zarathustras Höhle ist zum Ort der Kinderei geworden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:A6","text":"Der kindliche Übermut und der Herzenslärm sollen aus der Höhle hinausgewiesen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:A7","text":"Der Zugang zum Himmelreich setzt voraus, wie ein Kind zu werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:A8","text":"Die Männer wollen nicht das Himmelreich, sondern das Erdenreich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:A9","text":"Die Selbstbestimmung der Männer wird durch den Gegensatz von Himmelreich und Erdenreich artikuliert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:NX1","text":"Die Gäste sind nicht offenherzige Fromme, sondern verbergen ihre Affekte hinter Schalk und Possenspiel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:NX2","text":"Die Kindlichkeit ist nicht unschuldige Harmlosigkeit, sondern mit Lust und Bosheit verbunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:NX3","text":"Zarathustras Höhle soll keine dauerhafte Kinderstube sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:NX4","text":"Kindlicher Übermut und Herzenslärm dürfen den Innenraum der Höhle nicht dauerhaft bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:NX5","text":"Das Himmelreich ist kein angestrebtes Ziel der Männer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:NX6","text":"Die Rückkehr zur Kindlichkeit wird nicht als endgültige Lebensform bestätigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:NX7","text":"Das Erdenreich wird nicht über den Weg kindlicher Frömmigkeit begründet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:D1","text":"Die religiöse Geste fungiert als Maske für gegenläufige Affekte.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_18:A1","CH_97E9_2_18:A2","CH_97E9_2_18:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:D2","text":"Die sichtbare Kindlichkeit der Gäste enthält eine verborgene Ambivalenz aus Frömmigkeit, Lust und Bosheit.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_18:A2","CH_97E9_2_18:A3","CH_97E9_2_18:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:D3","text":"Die Höhle wird durch das Verhalten der Gäste vorübergehend von einem Erkenntnis- oder Aufenthaltsort in einen Raum der Kinderei verwandelt.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_18:A4","CH_97E9_2_18:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:D4","text":"Die räumliche Bewegung nach außen entspricht der Zurückweisung kindlicher Affektüberschüsse.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_18:A5","CH_97E9_2_18:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:D5","text":"Die Bedingung des Himmelreichs wird ausgesprochen, um zugleich die Entscheidung gegen das Himmelreich zu profilieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_18:A7","CH_97E9_2_18:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:D6","text":"Das Erdenreich erscheint als Gegenposition zu einer durch Kindwerdung vermittelten Transzendenz.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_18:A7","CH_97E9_2_18:A8","CH_97E9_2_18:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:SD1","text":"Das religiöse Schauspiel der Gäste wird nicht primär als Glaubensinhalt, sondern als affektive Regression und Verstellung lesbar.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_18:A1","CH_97E9_2_18:A2","CH_97E9_2_18:A3","CH_97E9_2_18:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:SD2","text":"Zarathustra ordnet die räumliche Grenze seiner Höhle als Grenze zwischen geduldeter Versammlung und ausgeschlossener Kindlichkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_18:A5","CH_97E9_2_18:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:SD3","text":"Das Argument verwandelt eine religiöse Heilsbedingung in eine negative Folie für die Bejahung der Erde.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_18:A7","CH_97E9_2_18:A8","CH_97E9_2_18:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:SD4","text":"Männlichkeit wird als Abkehr vom Himmelreich und als Bindung an das Erdenreich konstruiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_18:A8","CH_97E9_2_18:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:DNX1","text":"Der Text setzt voraus, dass religiöse Frömmigkeit keine transparente Äußerung innerer Wahrheit ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:DNX2","text":"Der Text schließt aus, dass Kindlichkeit und erwachsene Selbstbestimmung ohne Rang- oder Richtungswechsel identisch sein können.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"tra