:[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:ME5","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen kindlicher Frömmigkeit und männlicher Erdorientierung ersetzt die Frage nach einer Versöhnung beider Zustände.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:ALT1","text":"Surface — Gäste beten, falten die Hände und rufen „lieber Gott“; Zarathustra weist ihre Kinderei zurück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:ALT2","text":"Structural — Verstellung, affektive Ambivalenz und räumliche Grenzziehung organisieren die Szene.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Das Himmelreich wird als fremde Zielsetzung markiert, damit die Entscheidung für das Erdenreich strategisch geschlossen werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Kindlichkeit erscheint als wiedergewonnener früherer Zustand, während Männlichkeit als nachträgliche Selbstpositionierung gegen diese Rückkehr gesetzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um Verstellung, Kindlichkeit, Höhlenordnung und die Gegenüberstellung von Himmelreich und Erdenreich zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob die Gäste tatsächlich glauben oder lediglich eine religiöse Rolle spielen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt ferner, ob die Kindlichkeit vollständig verworfen oder nur aus der Höhle entfernt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:MRT4","text":"Die Struktur ist intern geschlossen in der Bewegung von Enthüllung über Ausweisung zu Erdbejahung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:MRT5","text":"Ihre stärkste Verbindung liegt in der Umkehrung der Himmelreich-Bedingung in eine Begründung des Erdenreichs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:MRT6","text":"Ihre schwächste Stelle ist der ungelöste Übergang von kindlicher Frömmigkeit zu männlicher Erdorientierung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, sofern die Ambivalenz von Kindlichkeit nicht auf bloße Unschuld oder bloße Täuschung reduziert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T191127577078Z_826d06f4","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"2.","source_sha256":"9784facb92a4b5d0f163626d46e81b1ac01700913d774fb598c3083a1b8b5827","sha256":"5bc41cbb49038ef0532945a6b1f39236f78739792a37297dcb90b8ac2ba8e251","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:11:27.578057+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:AS1","text":"The guests conceal their pleasure and malice behind roguish answers and childish piety.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:AS2","text":"Their praying, folding of hands, and invocation of God are determined as a relapse into childish behavior.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:AS3","text":"Zarathustra's cave thereby becomes a temporary nursery and the site of assembled childishness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:AS4","text":"The childish excitation is to be banished from the cave into the outer space and cooled there.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:AS5","text":"The kingdom of heaven remains bound to becoming a child, but is rejected as a goal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:AS6","text":"In place of the kingdom of heaven comes the kingdom of earth as the self-determination of adult men.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:A1","text":"The guests conceal themselves from Zarathustra.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:A2","text":"Their concealment protects pleasure and malice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:A3","text":"Childish behavior encompasses piety, praying, folding of hands, and the invocation of God.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:A4","text":"The guests' childish behavior is a recovered state.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:A5","text":"Zarathustra's cave has become a site of childishness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:A6","text":"Childish high spirits and the clamor of the heart are to be banished from the cave.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:A7","text":"Access to the kingdom of heaven presupposes becoming like a child.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:A8","text":"The men do not want the kingdom of heaven, but the kingdom of earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:A9","text":"The men's self-determination is articulated through the opposition between the kingdom of heaven and the kingdom of earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:NX1","text":"The guests are not open-hearted pious people, but conceal their affects behind roguishness and buffoonery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:NX2","text":"Childishness is not innocent harmlessness, but is connected with pleasure and malice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:NX3","text":"Zarathustra's cave is not to be a permanent nursery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:NX4","text":"Childish high spirits and the clamor of the heart may not permanently determine the interior of the cave.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:NX5","text":"The kingdom of heaven is not a goal sought by the men.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:NX6","text":"The return to childishness is not affirmed as a final form of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:NX7","text":"The kingdom of earth is not grounded by way of childish piety.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:D1","text":"The religious gesture functions as a mask for contrary affects.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_18:A1","CH_97E9_2_18:A2","CH_97E9_2_18:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:D2","text":"The guests' visible childishness contains a hidden ambivalence of piety, pleasure, and malice.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_18:A2","CH_97E9_2_18:A3","CH_97E9_2_18:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:D3","text":"Through the guests' behavior, the cave is temporarily transformed from a place of knowledge or abode into a space of childishness.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_18:A4","CH_97E9_2_18:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:D4","text":"The spatial movement outward corresponds to the rejection of childish affective excesses.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_18:A5","CH_97E9_2_18:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:D5","text":"The condition of the kingdom of heaven is articulated in order simultaneously to sharpen the decision against the kingdom of heaven.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_18:A7","CH_97E9_2_18:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:D6","text":"The kingdom of earth appears as a counterposition to a transcendence mediated through becoming a child.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_18:A7","CH_97E9_2_18:A8","CH_97E9_2_18:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:SD1","text":"The guests' religious spectacle becomes legible not primarily as an article of faith, but as affective regression and dissimulation.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_18:A1","CH_97E9_2_18:A2","CH_97E9_2_18:A3","CH_97E9_2_18:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:SD2","text":"Zarathustra orders the spatial boundary of his cave as a boundary between tolerated assembly and excluded childishness.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_18:A5","CH_97E9_2_18:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:SD3","text":"The argument transforms a religious condition of salvation into a negative foil for the affirmation of the earth.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_18:A7","CH_97E9_2_18:A8","CH_97E9_2_18:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:SD4","text":"Masculinity is constructed as a turning away from the kingdom of heaven and as attachment to the kingdom of earth.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_18:A8","CH_97E9_2_18:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:DNX1","text":"The text presupposes that religious piety is not a transparent expression of inner truth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:DNX2","text":"The text excludes the possibility that childishness and adult self-determination can be identical without a change of rank or direction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:DNX3","text":"The text disqualifies the kingdom of heaven as the ultimate normative order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:DNX4","text":"The text permits no permanent fusion of Zarathustra's cave and a community of childish piety.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:DNX5","text":"The text excludes an unbroken continuity between religious gesture and affirmed earthly existence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a world order in which transcendence, becoming a child, and salvation constitute the highest goal of men.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:SNX2","text":"Excluded is an unproblematic concept of the child that could separate innocence, piety, and hidden malice from one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:SNX3","text":"The blocked possibility is a simultaneous affirmation of the kingdom of heaven and the kingdom of earth without a decision between them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:SNX4","text":"The absence of a reconciled transition from the childish to the masculine structures the concluding movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:FGS1","text":"Dissimulation of the guests → becoming visible of hidden pleasure and malice → childishness is determined as affective regression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:FGS2","text":"Religious gestures → spatial occupation of the cave → cave becomes a nursery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:FGS3","text":"Cave as nursery → demarcation by Zarathustra's call → childishness is banished into the outer space.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:FGS4","text":"Condition of the kingdom of heaven: becoming a child → rejection of the kingdom of heaven → primacy of the kingdom of earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:FGS5","text":"Childishness as recovered piety → exposure of its ambivalence → adult self-positioning as men.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:AF1","text":"Roguish answers → revelation of dissimulation → childish piety as a form of pleasure and malice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:AF2","text":"Childish gestures → transformation of the cave into a nursery → spatial expulsion of childish high spirits.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:AF3","text":"Kingdom of heaven as a childish threshold of access → conscious refusal of the kingdom of heaven → decision for the kingdom of earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:AF4","text":"Religious regression → demarcation → masculine affirmation of the earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:ME1","text":"Piety is remapped from an expression of truth into a masking affective practice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:ME2","text":"Childishness is classified simultaneously as a religious prerequisite, affective excess, and an interior state to be excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:ME3","text":"The cave becomes legible as a dynamic boundary between temporary admission and normative expulsion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:ME4","text":"Heaven and earth are mapped not as mere places, but as competing orders of ends of becoming a child and masculinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:ME5","text":"The opposition between childish piety and masculine orientation toward the earth replaces the question of a reconciliation of both states.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:ALT1","text":"Surface — The guests pray, fold their hands, and invoke “dear God”; Zarathustra rejects their childishness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:ALT2","text":"Structural — Dissimulation, affective ambivalence, and spatial demarcation organize the scene.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The kingdom of heaven is marked as an alien orientation toward an end, so that the decision for the kingdom of earth can be strategically closed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Childishness appears as a recovered earlier state, while masculinity is posited as a subsequent self-positioning against this return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct dissimulation, childishness, the order of the cave, and the juxtaposition of the kingdom of heaven and the kingdom of earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether the guests actually believe or merely play a religious role.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:MRT3","text":"It further remains underdetermined whether childishness is completely rejected or only removed from the cave.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:MRT4","text":"The structure is internally closed in the movement from revelation through expulsion to affirmation of the earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:MRT5","text":"Its strongest connection lies in the reversal of the condition of the kingdom of heaven into a grounding of the kingdom of earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:MRT6","text":"Its weakest point is the unresolved transition from childish piety to masculine orientation toward the earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_18:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement insofar as the ambivalence of childishness is not reduced to mere innocence or mere deception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_18:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_2_18@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_2_18:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"The Ass Festival","source_section_label":"2.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Four and Last"],"reading_title":"The Ass Festival · 2","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","The Ass Festival","2."],"original_title":"2."}],"source_title_context":"Das Eselsfest","source_section_label":"2.","source_title_hierarchy":["Vierter und letzter Theil"],"reading_title":"The Ass Festival · 2","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","The Ass Festival","2."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 169","title":"The Ass Festival · 2","context":"Part Four and Last","original_context":"Vierter und letzter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Das Eselsfest · 2"},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9","layer":"CH","title":"The Ass Festival · 3","order":170,"parents":["RAW_97E9_3C_9"],"revision":"CH_97E9_3C_9@R001","sha256":"9677db45b2a231fd9609381b31b38103b85705b523c7fdbb965508e3311b00d7","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:AS1","text":"Der Text setzt die wiedergewonnene Fröhlichkeit der „höheren Menschen“ als Problem einer nachträglichen Deutung ein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:AS2","text":"Ihre sichtbare Aufblühung wird als Zeichen eines Genesungsprozesses neu bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:AS3","text":"Die von ihnen erfundene Festform fungiert als Beweiszeichen dieser Genesung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:AS4","text":"Genesung wird durch eine Verbindung von Unsinn, Gottesdienst, Eselsfest und ausgelassener Bewegung praktisch erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:AS5","text":"Die festliche Praxis soll wiederholt und zugleich an Zarathustra gebunden erinnert werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:A1","text":"Die „höheren Menschen“ waren zuvor durch eine Nacht- oder Krisenerfahrung bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:A2","text":"Ihre erneute Fröhlichkeit ist eine wahrnehmbare Veränderung ihres Zustands.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:A3","text":"Sichtbares Aufblühen kann als Ausdruck von Genesung gelesen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:A4","text":"Genesende vermögen neue Feste zu erfinden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:A5","text":"Ein Fest kann durch kontrollierten Unsinn seelische Helligkeit hervorbringen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:A6","text":"Das Eselsfest ist eine von den höheren Menschen erfundene Praxis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:A7","text":"Die Erfindung des Eselsfests gilt Zarathustra als gutes Wahrzeichen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:A8","text":"Das Fest besitzt eine doppelte Adressierung: Es soll den Feiernden und Zarathustra zugutekommen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:A9","text":"Erinnerung an die Nacht und Wiederholung des Fests können gleichzeitig bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:A10","text":"Zarathustras Gedächtnis soll durch die Wiederholung des Fests fortbestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:NX1","text":"Die Genesung wird nicht als bloße Rückkehr zu einem früheren Zustand definiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:NX2","text":"Das Fest wird nicht als nüchterne oder rein vernünftige Veranstaltung bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:NX3","text":"Die Fröhlichkeit wird nicht als Vergessen der vorausgehenden Nacht zugelassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:NX4","text":"Der Gottesdienst wird nicht aus dem Bereich des Festlichen ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:NX5","text":"Zarathustra beansprucht die Erfindung des Eselsfests nicht vollständig für sich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:NX6","text":"Die Erinnerung an Zarathustra wird nicht von der Praxis des Festes getrennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:D1","text":"Das Eselsfest wird als performativer Ausdruck kollektiver Genesung lesbar.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_9:A2","CH_97E9_3C_9:A3","CH_97E9_3C_9:A6","CH_97E9_3C_9:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:D2","text":"Die Erfindung einer ausgelassenen Ritualform dient als Indikator dafür, dass die Krise nicht mehr ausschließlich passiv erlitten wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_9:A1","CH_97E9_3C_9:A4","CH_97E9_3C_9:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:D3","text":"Der „tapfere Unsinn“ erhält eine therapeutische Funktion, weil er die Seelenhelligkeit der Feiernden hervorbringen soll.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_9:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:D4","text":"Die Wiederholung des Fests verwandelt ein einmaliges Ereignis in eine fortsetzbare Praxis.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_9:A6","CH_97E9_3C_9:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:D5","text":"Zarathustras Gedächtnis wird an eine von der Gruppe selbst erzeugte Handlung gekoppelt.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_9:A7","CH_97E9_3C_9:A8","CH_97E9_3C_9:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:SD1","text":"Genesung erscheint als selbsttätige Umwandlung erlittener Nacht in erfundene Festlichkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_9:A1","CH_97E9_3C_9:A4","CH_97E9_3C_9:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:SD2","text":"Das Ritual stabilisiert eine Gemeinschaft, indem es gemeinsame Fröhlichkeit, religiöse Form, Unsinn und Erinnerung in einer einzigen Praxis verschränkt.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_9:A5","CH_97E9_3C_9:A8","CH_97E9_3C_9:A9","CH_97E9_3C_9:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:SD3","text":"Zarathustras Autorität entsteht nicht durch alleinige Stiftung, sondern durch die nachträgliche Anerkennung einer kollektiven Erfindung als Wahrzeichen.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_9:A6","CH_97E9_3C_9:A7","CH_97E9_3C_9:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:SD4","text":"Die Befreiung von der Nacht bleibt an ihre erinnernde Wiederholung gebunden und wird dadurch nicht vollständig von der Krise gelöst.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_9:A1","CH_97E9_3C_9:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:DNX1","text":"Das System hängt davon ab, dass Genesung nicht durch reine Ernsthaftigkeit, rationale Selbstkontrolle oder dogmatische Ordnung erreicht wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:DNX2","text":"Es setzt voraus, dass eine Krise nicht durch Vergessen, sondern nur durch ihre rituelle Umformung bearbeitet werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:DNX3","text":"Es schließt ein Modell aus, in dem die höheren Menschen lediglich Empfänger von Zarathustras Heilung wären.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:DNX4","text":"Es disqualifiziert eine Trennung zwischen religiösem Ritual und nichtreligiösem Spiel als für die Genesung unbrauchbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:SNX1","text":"Unvermittelte, rein individuelle Heilung ist als Möglichkeit abwesend; Genesung benötigt eine gemeinsam erfundene Form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:SNX2","text":"Eine dauerhafte Befreiung von der Vergangenheit ist unzulässig; die Nacht bleibt als notwendiger Erinnerungsgrund erhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:SNX3","text":"Eine Autorität außerhalb der gemeinschaftlichen Praxis steht nicht zur Verfügung; Zarathustras Fortleben hängt von deren Wiederholung ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:SNX4","text":"Das System lässt keine scharfe Grenze zwischen Heilung und neuer Abhängigkeit erkennen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:FGS1","text":"Krise/Nacht → wiedergewonnene Fröhlichkeit der höheren Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:FGS2","text":"Wiedergewonnene Fröhlichkeit → Wahrnehmung des Aufblühens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:FGS3","text":"Aufblühen → Deutung als Genesung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:FGS4","text":"Genesung → Fähigkeit zur Erfindung eines neuen Fests.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:FGS5","text":"Fest → Verbindung von Unsinn, Gottesdienst, Eselsgestalt und seelischer Aufhellung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:FGS6","text":"Erfundene Festform → Wahrzeichen der Genesung und Anerkennung Zarathustras.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:FGS7","text":"Erinnerung an die Nacht + Wiederholung des Fests → ritualisierte Fortsetzung und Gedächtnis Zarathustras.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:AF1","text":"Nacht/Krise → wiedergewonnene Fröhlichkeit → Aufblühen → Deutung als Genesung → erfundenes Eselsfest → Wahrzeichen → Wiederholung für Feiernde, Zarathustra und sein Gedächtnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:ME1","text":"Fröhlichkeit wird von einem bloßen Affekt zu einem diagnostischen Zeichen der Genesung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:ME2","text":"Unsinn wird von bloßer Abweichung zu einer funktionalen Praxis seelischer Aufhellung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:ME3","text":"Das Fest wird zugleich als religiöses Ritual, kollektive Erfindung und Gedächtnismedium sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:ME4","text":"Zarathustras Autorität wird von unmittelbarer Führung auf nachträgliche Anerkennung und Wiederholung verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:ME5","text":"Genesung und Erinnerung werden nicht mehr als Gegensätze, sondern als miteinander gekoppelte Operationen kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:ALT1","text":"Surface: Die höheren Menschen werden nach ihrer Rückkehr zur Fröhlichkeit angesprochen und zur erneuten Feier aufgefordert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:ALT2","text":"Structural: Eine kollektiv erfundene Ritualform vermittelt zwischen Krise, Genesung und sozialer Kontinuität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Zarathustra verwandelt die spontane Praxis der Gruppe in ein Zeichen seiner eigenen fortdauernden Wirkung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Genesung ist ein zeitlicher Umschlag, der die Nacht nicht beseitigt, sondern in erinnerte Wiederholung überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von Krise über Fröhlichkeit und Genesung zur Wiederholung des Fests zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob das Eselsfest primär religiös, satirisch, therapeutisch oder gemeinschaftsstiftend verstanden werden soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, solange Unsinn als funktionale Genesungspraxis und Erinnerung als Fortsetzung der Heilung gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung besteht zwischen kollektiver Erfindung und dem Wahrzeichencharakter des Fests.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:MRT5","text":"Die zentrale Spannung liegt darin, dass Zarathustra die Eigenleistung der höheren Menschen anerkennt und sie zugleich seinem eigenen Gedächtnis unterordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung bleibt zwischen dem Gebot, die Nacht nicht zu vergessen, und der Forderung nach erneuter Fröhlichkeit bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, sofern das Fest nicht als bloße Feier, sondern als Beweis, Mittel und Gedächtnisform behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T191524556085Z_1087776b","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"3.","source_sha256":"9677db45b2a231fd9609381b31b38103b85705b523c7fdbb965508e3311b00d7","sha256":"0296ee386035c0b4c60de0bb7a4a9500a351b0d46eb0bb63189c9bda5ea0be26","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:15:24.557213+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:AS1","text":"The text introduces the regained cheerfulness of the “higher human beings” as a problem of retrospective interpretation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:AS2","text":"Their visible flourishing is redefined as a sign of a process of recovery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:AS3","text":"The festival form invented by them functions as evidentiary sign of this recovery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:AS4","text":"Recovery is practically produced through a conjunction of nonsense, worship service, Ass Festival, and exuberant movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:AS5","text":"The festive practice is to be repeated and, at the same time, remembered as bound to Zarathustra.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:A1","text":"The “higher human beings” were previously defined by an experience of night or crisis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:A2","text":"Their renewed cheerfulness is a perceptible change in their condition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:A3","text":"Visible flourishing can be read as an expression of recovery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:A4","text":"Those recovering are capable of inventing new festivals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:A5","text":"A festival can produce brightness of soul through controlled nonsense.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:A6","text":"The Ass Festival is a practice invented by the higher human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:A7","text":"Zarathustra regards the invention of the Ass Festival as a good emblem.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:A8","text":"The festival possesses a double address: it is to benefit the celebrants and Zarathustra.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:A9","text":"Remembrance of the night and repetition of the festival can coexist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:A10","text":"Zarathustra’s memory is to endure through the repetition of the festival.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:NX1","text":"Recovery is not defined as a mere return to an earlier state.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:NX2","text":"The festival is not defined as a sober or purely rational event.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:NX3","text":"Cheerfulness is not permitted as a forgetting of the preceding night.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:NX4","text":"The worship service is not excluded from the realm of the festive.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:NX5","text":"Zarathustra does not claim the invention of the Ass Festival entirely for himself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:NX6","text":"Remembrance of Zarathustra is not separated from the practice of the festival.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:D1","text":"The Ass Festival becomes legible as a performative expression of collective recovery.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_9:A2","CH_97E9_3C_9:A3","CH_97E9_3C_9:A6","CH_97E9_3C_9:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:D2","text":"The invention of an exuberant ritual form serves as an indicator that the crisis is no longer suffered exclusively passively.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_9:A1","CH_97E9_3C_9:A4","CH_97E9_3C_9:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:D3","text":"“Brave nonsense” acquires a therapeutic function because it is intended to produce the brightness of soul of the celebrants.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_9:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:D4","text":"The repetition of the festival transforms a singular event into a continuable practice.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_9:A6","CH_97E9_3C_9:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:D5","text":"Zarathustra’s memory is coupled to an action produced by the group itself.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_9:A7","CH_97E9_3C_9:A8","CH_97E9_3C_9:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:SD1","text":"Recovery appears as the self-active transformation of suffered night into invented festivity.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_9:A1","CH_97E9_3C_9:A4","CH_97E9_3C_9:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:SD2","text":"The ritual stabilizes a community by interweaving shared cheerfulness, religious form, nonsense, and remembrance in a single practice.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_9:A5","CH_97E9_3C_9:A8","CH_97E9_3C_9:A9","CH_97E9_3C_9:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:SD3","text":"Zarathustra’s authority arises not through sole foundation, but through the retrospective recognition of a collective invention as an emblem.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_9:A6","CH_97E9_3C_9:A7","CH_97E9_3C_9:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:SD4","text":"Liberation from the night remains bound to its commemorative repetition and is thereby not fully detached from the crisis.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_9:A1","CH_97E9_3C_9:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:DNX1","text":"The system depends on recovery not being attained through pure seriousness, rational self-control, or dogmatic order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:DNX2","text":"It presupposes that a crisis can be worked through not by forgetting, but only through its ritual transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:DNX3","text":"It excludes a model in which the higher human beings would be merely recipients of Zarathustra’s healing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:DNX4","text":"It disqualifies as unusable for recovery a separation between religious ritual and nonreligious play.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:SNX1","text":"Unmediated, purely individual healing is absent as a possibility; recovery requires a jointly invented form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:SNX2","text":"An enduring liberation from the past is impermissible; the night remains preserved as a necessary ground of remembrance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:SNX3","text":"No authority outside communal practice is available; Zarathustra’s continued existence depends on its repetition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:SNX4","text":"The system reveals no sharp boundary between healing and new dependency.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:FGS1","text":"Crisis/night → regained cheerfulness of the higher human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:FGS2","text":"Regained cheerfulness → perception of flourishing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:FGS3","text":"Flourishing → interpretation as recovery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:FGS4","text":"Recovery → capacity to invent a new festival.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:FGS5","text":"Festival → conjunction of nonsense, worship service, ass-form, and brightening of the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:FGS6","text":"Invented festival form → emblem of recovery and recognition of Zarathustra.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:FGS7","text":"Remembrance of the night + repetition of the festival → ritualized continuation and memory of Zarathustra.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:AF1","text":"Night/crisis → regained cheerfulness → flourishing → interpretation as recovery → invented Ass Festival → emblem → repetition for celebrants, Zarathustra, and his memory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:ME1","text":"Cheerfulness is remapped from a mere affect into a diagnostic sign of recovery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:ME2","text":"Nonsense is reclassified from mere deviation into a functional practice of brightening the soul.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:ME3","text":"The festival becomes visible simultaneously as religious ritual, collective invention, and medium of memory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:ME4","text":"Zarathustra’s authority is shifted from immediate leadership to retrospective recognition and repetition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:ME5","text":"Recovery and remembrance are mapped no longer as opposites, but as operations coupled with one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:ALT1","text":"Surface: The higher human beings are addressed after their return to cheerfulness and called upon to celebrate anew.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:ALT2","text":"Structural: A collectively invented ritual form mediates between crisis, recovery, and social continuity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Zarathustra transforms the group’s spontaneous practice into a sign of his own continuing effect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Recovery is a temporal reversal that does not eliminate the night, but transfers it into commemorative repetition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from crisis through cheerfulness and recovery to the repetition of the festival.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether the Ass Festival is to be understood primarily as religious, satirical, therapeutic, or community-forming.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent so long as nonsense counts as a functional practice of recovery and remembrance as a continuation of healing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:MRT4","text":"The strongest connection exists between collective invention and the emblematic character of the festival.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:MRT5","text":"The central tension lies in the fact that Zarathustra recognizes the higher human beings’ own achievement while at the same time subordinating it to his own memory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:MRT6","text":"A further tension remains between the command not to forget the night and the demand for renewed cheerfulness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3C_9:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument, provided that the festival is treated not as a mere celebration, but as proof, means, and form of memory.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3C_9:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_3C_9@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_3C_9:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"The Ass Festival","source_section_label":"3.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Four and Last"],"reading_title":"The Ass Festival · 3","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","The Ass Festival","3."],"original_title":"3."}],"source_title_context":"Das Eselsfest","source_section_label":"3.","source_title_hierarchy":["Vierter und letzter Theil"],"reading_title":"The Ass Festival · 3","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","The Ass Festival","3."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 170","title":"The Ass Festival · 3","context":"Part Four and Last","original_context":"Vierter und letzter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Das Eselsfest · 3"},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19","layer":"CH","title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 1","order":171,"parents":["RAW_97E9_1_19"],"revision":"CH_97E9_1_19@R001","sha256":"e9ff37b72b1c7d82e245f9f3cc08a11dcd288fe4af578e87e45c6f92e6aa7a33","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:AS1","text":"Eine geschützte nächtliche Gemeinschaft ermöglicht den höheren Menschen, ihr gegenwärtiges Erdenglück wahrzunehmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:AS2","text":"Der hässlichste Mensch überführt seine Genesung in die klare Frage nach der Wiederholbarkeit des Lebens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:AS3","text":"Die Bejahung eines einzelnen Festes wird als Bejahung des ganzen gelebten Lebens artikuliert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:AS4","text":"Die höheren Menschen erkennen ihre Verwandlung und schreiben sie Zarathustra zu.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:AS5","text":"Die Erzählung relativiert die empirische Gewissheit des Wunders zugunsten der größeren Wirksamkeit der Lebensbejahung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:A1","text":"Eine gemeinsame nächtliche Situation kann innere Verwandlung sichtbar und erfahrbar machen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:A2","text":"Der hässlichste Mensch ist fähig, seine bisherige Lebensverneinung in eine artikulierte Frage zu überführen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:A3","text":"Ein einzelner erfüllter Tag kann dem gesamten gelebten Leben nachträglich Wert verleihen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:A4","text":"Die Formel „War Das — das Leben? Wohlan! Noch Ein Mal!“ bezeichnet eine Bereitschaft zur Wiederholung des Lebens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:A5","text":"Die höheren Menschen können ihre Verwandlung als Genesung erkennen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:A6","text":"Die höhere Menschengruppe führt ihre Verwandlung auf Zarathustras Gegenwart oder Wirksamkeit zurück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:A7","text":"Dankbarkeit, Verehrung, Lachen und Weinen sind verschiedene Ausdrucksformen derselben erfahrenen Verwandlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:A8","text":"Die Wahrheit des Wunders hängt nicht an der faktischen Wahrheit jedes erzählten Einzelereignisses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:NX1","text":"Lebenswert ist nicht an die Gesamtheit aller vergangenen Lebensmomente gebunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:NX2","text":"Die Verwandlung wird nicht als bloße äußere Belehrung dargestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:NX3","text":"Die Formel der Wiederholung ist nicht auf eine bloße Verlängerung des Lebens reduziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:NX4","text":"Die höhere Menschengruppe bleibt nicht in ihrer früheren Müdigkeit und Bedürftigkeit fixiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:NX5","text":"Die Bedeutung des Geschehens wird nicht durch die Entscheidung über die historische Wahrheit des Eseltanzes erschöpft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:NX6","text":"Zarathustras Wirkung wird nicht als einheitlich normierter Reaktionsmodus bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:D1","text":"Das gegenwärtige Fest fungiert als retrospektive Rechtfertigung des gesamten Lebens.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_19:A2","CH_97E9_1_19:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:D2","text":"Die Frage des hässlichsten Menschen verwandelt persönliche Genesung in eine gemeinsam prüfbare Lebensentscheidung.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_19:A2","CH_97E9_1_19:A4","CH_97E9_1_19:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:D3","text":"Die Anrufung des Todes verschiebt die Lebensbejahung in die Form eines hypothetischen Wiederholungswillens.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_19:A3","CH_97E9_1_19:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:D4","text":"Die höhere Menschengruppe erkennt Zarathustra nicht nur als Gastgeber, sondern als Ursache ihrer Genesung.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_19:A5","CH_97E9_1_19:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:D5","text":"Die Verschiedenheit der Reaktionen bestätigt die Einheit der zugrunde liegenden Verwandlung.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_19:A6","CH_97E9_1_19:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:D6","text":"Die Unsicherheit über den Eseltanz schwächt die Wunderstruktur nicht, sondern ordnet sie einer stärkeren inneren Transformation unter.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_19:A7","CH_97E9_1_19:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:SD1","text":"Lebensbejahung entsteht nicht aus der Tilgung des Leidens, sondern aus der Fähigkeit, das ganze Leben durch einen bejahten Augenblick wiederholbar zu machen.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_19:A1","CH_97E9_1_19:A3","CH_97E9_1_19:A4","CH_97E9_1_19:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:SD2","text":"Zarathustras eigentliche Wirkung besteht darin, dass die höheren Menschen ihre eigene Verwandlung als gemeinsam geteilte Erfahrung erkennen.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_19:A1","CH_97E9_1_19:A5","CH_97E9_1_19:A6","CH_97E9_1_19:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:SD3","text":"Die Erzählung macht die innere Wahrheit des Wunders von seiner empirischen Beglaubigung unabhängig.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_19:A7","CH_97E9_1_19:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:SD4","text":"Die Gruppe der höheren Menschen wird von einem Zustand empfangener Rettung in einen Zustand aktiver Wiederholungsbereitschaft überführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_19:A3","CH_97E9_1_19:A4","CH_97E9_1_19:A5","CH_97E9_1_19:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:DNX1","text":"Das Leben darf nicht als abgeschlossene Bilanz behandelt werden, deren Wert nur aus der Summe seiner einzelnen Erfahrungen hervorgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:DNX2","text":"Heilung darf nicht als Rückkehr zu einem früheren Normalzustand verstanden werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:DNX3","text":"Der Sinn des Geschehens darf nicht von einer metaphysischen oder empirischen Sicherung des Wunders abhängig gemacht werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:DNX4","text":"Die Gemeinschaft darf nicht auf eine einzige autoritative Gefühlsreaktion reduziert werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:DNX5","text":"Zarathustra darf nicht lediglich als äußerer Auslöser eines zufälligen Affekts fungieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Lebensordnung, in der der Sinn des Lebens erst durch ein außerhalb des Lebens liegendes Heil garantiert werden müsste.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Subjektform, die ihre Verwandlung nur passiv empfängt und nicht in einen eigenen Wiederholungswillen übersetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Wirklichkeit, deren Bedeutung vollständig von der faktischen Entscheidung zwischen Wahrheit und Erzählung abhängt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Zeitordnung, in der der vergangene Lebenslauf endgültig abgeschlossen und nicht durch gegenwärtige Bejahung neu bewertet werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:FGS1","text":"Geschützte Gemeinschaft + nächtliche Schwelle → Wahrnehmung des gegenwärtigen Erdenglücks → Öffnung für Verwandlung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:FGS2","text":"Verwandlung des Einzelnen → Frage nach der Wiederholbarkeit des Lebens → retrospektive Bejahung des gesamten Lebenslaufs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:FGS3","text":"Gemeinsame Aufnahme der Frage → Selbsterkenntnis der Genesung → Zuschreibung der Wirkung an Zarathustra → affektive Danksagung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:FGS4","text":"Unsicherheit über ein äußeres Wunder → Abkopplung der Bedeutung vom Faktum → Vorrang der inneren und gemeinschaftlichen Transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:AF1","text":"Entfremdung und Müdigkeit → nächtliche Sammlung → Wahrnehmung des Erdenglücks.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:AF2","text":"Einzelne Lebensfreude → Frage an den Tod → Wiederholungsbereitschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:AF3","text":"Ausgesprochene Frage → kollektive Selbsterkenntnis → Verehrung Zarathustras.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:AF4","text":"Zweifel am äußeren Wunder → Vorrang der inneren Genesung → Schließung mit „was liegt daran!“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:ME1","text":"Ein einzelnes Fest wird von einem Ereignis unter vielen zu einem Maßstab für den Wert des ganzen Lebens umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:ME2","text":"Die Frage des Einzelnen wird als kollektive Schwelle klassifiziert, an der eine Gruppe ihre Verwandlung erkennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:ME3","text":"Wunder werden von überprüfbaren Einzelphänomenen auf die Ebene wirksamer Lebensverwandlung verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:ME4","text":"Verschiedene affektive Reaktionen werden nicht als Gegensätze, sondern als Varianten einer gemeinsamen Genesung lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:ME5","text":"Zarathustras Rolle wird von der eines Führers zur Instanz der Ermöglichung und Wiedererkennung von Lebensbejahung umgezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:ALT1","text":"Surface — Eine Gruppe verweilt nachts bei Zarathustra; der hässlichste Mensch spricht die Lebensfrage aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:ALT2","text":"Structural — Ein erfüllter Augenblick organisiert die nachträgliche Bewertung des gesamten Lebens und integriert individuelle Verwandlung in kollektive Anerkennung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die Erzählung entzieht die entscheidende Bedeutung der Bejahung sowohl der bloßen Gefühlsäußerung als auch der empirischen Beglaubigung eines Wunders.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Das Leben erscheint als wiederholbar bejahbare Zeitgestalt, deren vergangener Sinn durch eine gegenwärtige Zustimmung neu bestimmt werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von nächtlicher Sammlung über Lebensbejahung zu kollektiver Genesung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob die Wiederholung metaphysisch, existenziell oder primär rhetorisch gemeint ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt ferner, ob Zarathustra Ursache, Medium oder bloßer Anlass der Verwandlung ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:MRT4","text":"Intern kohärent ist die Struktur dort, wo sie äußeres Wunder und innere Wirkung voneinander trennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung besteht zwischen dem einzelnen Fest, der Frage an den Tod und der retrospektiven Lebensbejahung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion hängt an der komprimierten Gleichsetzung von „Noch Ein Mal“ mit einer umfassenden Bereitschaft zur Lebenswiederholung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:MRT7","text":"Die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung bleibt erhalten, sofern die Anekdote des Eseltanzes als absichtlich nachgeordnete Unsicherheit behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T185930648968Z_28924c48","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"1.","source_sha256":"e9ff37b72b1c7d82e245f9f3cc08a11dcd288fe4af578e87e45c6f92e6aa7a33","sha256":"a92b978bc0140b1d98a6bf5b273df860a88136b4064fa344ce0658556f2a5c9b","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T18:59:30.651702+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:AS1","text":"A protected nocturnal community enables the higher human beings to perceive their present earthly happiness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:AS2","text":"The ugliest human being translates his recovery into the clear question of the repeatability of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:AS3","text":"The affirmation of a single festival is articulated as the affirmation of the whole life lived.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:AS4","text":"The higher human beings recognize their transformation and attribute it to Zarathustra.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:AS5","text":"The narrative relativizes the empirical certainty of the miracle in favor of the greater efficacy of the affirmation of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:A1","text":"A shared nocturnal situation can render inner transformation visible and experienceable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:A2","text":"The ugliest human being is capable of translating his previous negation of life into an articulated question.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:A3","text":"A single fulfilled day can retrospectively confer value upon the entire life lived.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:A4","text":"The formula „War Das — das Leben? Wohlan! Noch Ein Mal!“ denotes a readiness for the repetition of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:A5","text":"The higher human beings can recognize their transformation as recovery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:A6","text":"The group of higher human beings attributes its transformation to Zarathustra's presence or efficacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:A7","text":"Gratitude, veneration, laughter, and weeping are different forms of expression of the same experienced transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:A8","text":"The truth of the miracle does not depend on the factual truth of every narrated individual event.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:NX1","text":"The value of life is not bound to the totality of all past moments of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:NX2","text":"The transformation is not presented as mere external instruction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:NX3","text":"The formula of repetition is not reduced to a mere prolongation of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:NX4","text":"The group of higher human beings does not remain fixed in its former weariness and neediness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:NX5","text":"The significance of what occurs is not exhausted by the decision concerning the historical truth of the donkey dance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:NX6","text":"Zarathustra's efficacy is not determined as a uniformly normed mode of response.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:D1","text":"The present festival functions as a retrospective justification of the entire life.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_19:A2","CH_97E9_1_19:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:D2","text":"The question of the ugliest human being transforms personal recovery into a life-decision examinable in common.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_19:A2","CH_97E9_1_19:A4","CH_97E9_1_19:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:D3","text":"The invocation of death shifts the affirmation of life into the form of a hypothetical will to repetition.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_19:A3","CH_97E9_1_19:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:D4","text":"The group of higher human beings recognizes Zarathustra not merely as host, but as the cause of its recovery.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_19:A5","CH_97E9_1_19:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:D5","text":"The diversity of reactions confirms the unity of the underlying transformation.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_19:A6","CH_97E9_1_19:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:D6","text":"The uncertainty concerning the donkey dance does not weaken the miracle structure, but subordinates it to a stronger inner transformation.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_19:A7","CH_97E9_1_19:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:SD1","text":"The affirmation of life arises not from the eradication of suffering, but from the capacity to render the whole life repeatable through an affirmed moment.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_19:A1","CH_97E9_1_19:A3","CH_97E9_1_19:A4","CH_97E9_1_19:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:SD2","text":"Zarathustra's proper efficacy consists in the higher human beings recognizing their own transformation as a jointly shared experience.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_19:A1","CH_97E9_1_19:A5","CH_97E9_1_19:A6","CH_97E9_1_19:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:SD3","text":"The narrative makes the inner truth of the miracle independent of its empirical authentication.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_19:A7","CH_97E9_1_19:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:SD4","text":"The group of higher human beings is transferred from a state of received salvation into a state of active readiness for repetition.","refs":["CH_97E9_1_19:A3","CH_97E9_1_19:A4","CH_97E9_1_19:A5","CH_97E9_1_19:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:DNX1","text":"Life must not be treated as a closed balance sheet whose value derives only from the sum of its individual experiences.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:DNX2","text":"Healing must not be understood as a return to an earlier normal state.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:DNX3","text":"The meaning of what occurs must not be made dependent on a metaphysical or empirical securing of the miracle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:DNX4","text":"The community must not be reduced to a single authoritative emotional reaction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:DNX5","text":"Zarathustra must not function merely as the external trigger of a contingent affect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:SNX1","text":"Excluded is an order of life in which the meaning of life would first have to be guaranteed by a salvation lying outside life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:SNX2","text":"Excluded is a form of subjectivity that receives its transformation only passively and does not translate it into a will to repetition of its own.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:SNX3","text":"Excluded is a reality whose significance depends entirely on the factual decision between truth and narrative.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:SNX4","text":"Excluded is a temporal order in which the past course of life is definitively concluded and cannot be revalued through present affirmation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:FGS1","text":"Protected community + nocturnal threshold → perception of present earthly happiness → opening for transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:FGS2","text":"Transformation of the individual → question of the repeatability of life → retrospective affirmation of the entire life course.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:FGS3","text":"Shared reception of the question → self-recognition of recovery → attribution of efficacy to Zarathustra → affective thanksgiving.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:FGS4","text":"Uncertainty concerning an external miracle → decoupling of significance from fact → primacy of inner and communal transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:AF1","text":"Alienation and weariness → nocturnal gathering → perception of earthly happiness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:AF2","text":"Individual joy in life → question to death → readiness for repetition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:AF3","text":"Uttered question → collective self-recognition → veneration of Zarathustra.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:AF4","text":"Doubt concerning the external miracle → primacy of inner recovery → closure with „was liegt daran!“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:ME1","text":"A single festival is remapped from one event among many into a measure for the value of the whole life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:ME2","text":"The question of the individual is classified as a collective threshold at which a group recognizes its transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:ME3","text":"Miracles are shifted from verifiable individual phenomena to the level of efficacious transformation of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:ME4","text":"Different affective reactions become legible not as opposites, but as variants of a shared recovery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:ME5","text":"Zarathustra's role is redrawn from that of a leader to an instance enabling and recognizing the affirmation of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:ALT1","text":"Surface — A group remains with Zarathustra at night; the ugliest human being voices the question of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:ALT2","text":"Structural — A fulfilled moment organizes the retrospective evaluation of the entire life and integrates individual transformation into collective recognition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The narrative withdraws the decisive significance of affirmation from both mere emotional expression and the empirical authentication of a miracle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Life appears as a temporal form affirmable in repetition, whose past meaning can be newly determined through a present assent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from nocturnal gathering through affirmation of life to collective recovery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether repetition is meant metaphysically, existentially, or primarily rhetorically.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:MRT3","text":"It further remains underdetermined whether Zarathustra is the cause, medium, or mere occasion of the transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:MRT4","text":"The structure is internally coherent where it separates external miracle and inner efficacy from one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:MRT5","text":"The strongest connection lies between the individual festival, the question to death, and the retrospective affirmation of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction depends on the compressed equation of „Noch Ein Mal“ with a comprehensive readiness for the repetition of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_1_19:MRT7","text":"The actual argumentative movement is preserved provided that the anecdote of the donkey dance is treated as an intentionally subordinated uncertainty.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_1_19:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_1_19@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_1_19:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song","source_section_label":"1.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Four and Last"],"reading_title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 1","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","The Night-Wanderer’s Song","1."],"original_title":"1."}],"source_title_context":"Das Nachtwandler-Lied","source_section_label":"1.","source_title_hierarchy":["Vierter und letzter Theil"],"reading_title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 1","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","The Night-Wanderer’s Song","1."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 171","title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 1","context":"Part Four and Last","original_context":"Vierter und letzter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Das Nachtwandler-Lied · 1"},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19","layer":"CH","title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 2","order":172,"parents":["RAW_97E9_2_19"],"revision":"CH_97E9_2_19@R001","sha256":"6678b69cc91ddbd3ed71baaf7bcf24c599115806875b24e3307983effa7fcfeb","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:AS1","text":"Die Begegnung mit dem hässlichsten Menschen versetzt Zarathustra in eine körperliche und geistige Erschütterung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:AS2","text":"Die Erschütterung wird als Rückzug des Geistes aus der Gegenwart und als Vorauseilen in einen zeitlichen Zwischenraum bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:AS3","text":"Körperliche Stützung ermöglicht eine partielle Rückkehr, ohne die innere Distanz aufzuheben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:AS4","text":"Ein aus der Tiefe kommendes Glockensignal ersetzt die sprachlose Schwelle durch einen wiederholten Ruf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:AS5","text":"Der Ruf verwandelt die versammelte Stille in eine gemeinsame Bewegung auf die Nacht und Mitternacht zu.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:A1","text":"Die Begegnung mit dem hässlichsten Menschen destabilisiert Zarathustras körperliche und sprachliche Selbstgegenwart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:A2","text":"Zarathustras innere Gedanken bleiben für die Umstehenden undurchsichtig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:A3","text":"Sein Geist entfernt sich aus der unmittelbaren Situation und bewegt sich zwischen Vergangenheit und Zukunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:A4","text":"Die höheren Menschen halten Zarathustra körperlich und ermöglichen seine partielle Rückkehr zu sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:A5","text":"Zarathustra weist das Gedränge der Verehrenden und Besorgten zurück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:A6","text":"Ein Glockenklang steigt aus einer Tiefe herauf und wird von Zarathustra als richtungsgebendes Signal aufgenommen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:A7","text":"Geste und Wiederholung des Wortes „Kommt!“ organisieren die Reaktion der Anwesenden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:A8","text":"„Mitternacht“ und „Nacht“ fungieren als zeitliche und räumliche Zielbestimmung der Bewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:A9","text":"Der Ruf dehnt sich von den Menschen auf Tiere, Höhle, Mond und Nacht aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:A10","text":"Die Stimme verändert sich im Verlauf der dreifachen Anrufung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:NX1","text":"Zarathustra spricht nach der Erschütterung zunächst nicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:NX2","text":"Die Gedanken in Zarathustras Seele werden nicht erklärt oder zugänglich gemacht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:NX3","text":"Zarathustra bleibt zunächst an seinem Ort und bewegt sich nicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:NX4","text":"Das Gedränge der Verehrenden und Besorgten wird nicht als angemessene Antwort zugelassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:NX5","text":"Der Ruf entsteht nicht aus einer argumentativen Erklärung, sondern aus Hören, Schweigen und Geste.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:NX6","text":"Die anwesenden Wesen werden nicht als voneinander getrennte Zuhörer behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:D1","text":"Die innere Erschütterung erzeugt keine unmittelbare Erkenntnismitteilung, sondern eine Unterbrechung der Sprache.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_19:A1","CH_97E9_2_19:A2","CH_97E9_2_19:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:D2","text":"Zarathustras Zwischenstellung zwischen Vergangenheit und Zukunft macht die Gegenwart zu einem Übergangszustand.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_19:A3","CH_97E9_2_19:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:D3","text":"Die körperliche Rückkehr zu sich selbst stellt keine soziale Wiedereingliederung in das Gedränge her, sondern ermöglicht dessen Zurückweisung.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_19:A4","CH_97E9_2_19:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:D4","text":"Das Glockensignal erhält seine operative Bedeutung erst dadurch, dass Zarathustra es hört, markiert und in einen Ruf übersetzt.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_19:A6","CH_97E9_2_19:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:D5","text":"Die dreifache Wiederholung steigert den Ruf von einer Unterbrechung zu einer kollektiven Bewegungsanweisung.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_19:A7","CH_97E9_2_19:A9","CH_97E9_2_19:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:D6","text":"Die Nacht wird nicht bloß als Umgebung, sondern als Ziel und Medium des gemeinsamen Wandels erzeugt.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_19:A8","CH_97E9_2_19:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:SD1","text":"Die Krise wird nicht durch Erklärung aufgelöst, sondern durch eine ritualisierte Umwandlung von körperlicher Erstarrung in kollektive Bewegung.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_19:A1","CH_97E9_2_19:A4","CH_97E9_2_19:A6","CH_97E9_2_19:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:SD2","text":"Der Übergang zwischen Vergangenheit und Zukunft wird als hörbare, gemeinschaftlich vollziehbare Bewegung auf Mitternacht verdichtet.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_19:A3","CH_97E9_2_19:A6","CH_97E9_2_19:A8","CH_97E9_2_19:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:SD3","text":"Die Autorität Zarathustras entsteht nicht aus unmittelbarer Souveränität, sondern aus der Fähigkeit, Schweigen, Klang, Geste und Wiederholung zu einer gemeinsamen Orientierung zu verbinden.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_19:A5","CH_97E9_2_19:A6","CH_97E9_2_19:A7","CH_97E9_2_19:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:SD4","text":"Die Anrufung totalisiert den Hörraum, indem sie menschliche, tierische, räumliche und kosmische Elemente in dieselbe horchende Ordnung einbezieht.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_19:A7","CH_97E9_2_19:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:DNX1","text":"Die Krise darf nicht als vollständig artikulierbarer psychischer Inhalt behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:DNX2","text":"Körperliche Wiederherstellung darf nicht mit Aufhebung der inneren Schwelle gleichgesetzt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:DNX3","text":"Gemeinschaft entsteht nicht durch Verehrung, Fürsorge oder Nähe zum Führenden, sondern erst durch gemeinsam ausgerichtetes Hören und Gehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:DNX4","text":"Zeit darf nicht als stabile Gegenwart vorausgesetzt werden; die operative Zeitform ist der Übergang.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:DNX5","text":"Der Ruf darf nicht auf menschliche Sprache als isoliertes Kommunikationsmedium reduziert werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Rückkehr zu einer transparenten, ungebrochenen Gegenwart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine soziale Ordnung, in der Verehrung und Besorgtheit bereits Gemeinschaft stiften.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Welt, deren Elemente außerhalb eines gemeinsamen Signals und einer gemeinsamen Richtung stehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Möglichkeit, die Schwelle durch bloße Bewegung zu überspringen; die Bewegung bleibt an Schweigen, Hören und Wiederholung gebunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:FGS1","text":"Begegnung mit dem hässlichsten Menschen → körperlich-sprachliche Destabilisierung → Verlust unmittelbarer Selbstgegenwart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:FGS2","text":"Destabilisierung → geistiger Rückzug aus der Gegenwart → Positionierung zwischen Vergangenheit und Zukunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:FGS3","text":"Körperliche Stützung → partielle Selbstsammlung → Abwehr des sozialen Gedränges.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:FGS4","text":"Abwehr und Schweigen → Hören eines Signals aus der Tiefe → Markierung durch Geste.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:FGS5","text":"Geste → dreifache Anrufung → Stimmverwandlung → kollektives Horchen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:FGS6","text":"Kollektives Horchen → Einbeziehung aller anwesenden Instanzen → gemeinsame Bewegung in die Nacht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:FGS7","text":"Nachtbewegung → zeitliche Schließung auf Mitternacht → Übergang statt Rückkehr in die Gegenwart.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:AF1","text":"Begegnung und Erschütterung → geistiger Rückzug → zeitlicher Zwischenraum → körperliche Stützung → Zurückweisung des Gedränges → Glockensignal → dreifache Anrufung → kollektives Horchen → Gang in die Nacht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:ME1","text":"Die Szene wird von einer psychischen Krise auf eine Schwellenbewegung zwischen Vergangenheit, Zukunft und Mitternacht umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:ME2","text":"Schweigen wird vom Zeichen des Zusammenbruchs zum konstitutiven Medium des gemeinsamen Hörens umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:ME3","text":"Die höheren Menschen werden von fürsorglich Haltenden zu Teilnehmern einer durch Zarathustras Ruf ausgerichteten Bewegung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:ME4","text":"Die Grenze zwischen Subjekt, Tier, Raum und kosmischer Umgebung wird durch die gemeinsame Hörbewegung durchlässig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:ME5","text":"Bewegung erscheint nicht als spontane Reaktion, sondern als durch Signal, Geste, Wiederholung und zeitliche Zielsetzung erzeugte Ordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — Zarathustra schwankt, schweigt, hört, spricht den Ruf und fordert zum Wandeln in die Nacht auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — Körperliche Stützung, Zurückweisung des Gedränges, Glockensignal und Wiederholung organisieren den Übergang von Vereinzelung zu kollektiver Ausrichtung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — Die Szene ersetzt autoritative Erklärung durch eine Praxis der Unterbrechung, des Hörens und der schrittweisen Mobilisierung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — Wirklichkeit erscheint als Schwellenordnung zwischen Vergangenem und Zukünftigem, in der auch Tiere, Höhle, Mond und Nacht an der Wahrnehmung beteiligt sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von Erschütterung über Schweigen und Hören zur nächtlichen Kollektivbewegung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt der konkrete Inhalt von Zarathustras inneren Gedanken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, weil körperliche Destabilisierung, zeitlicher Rückzug, Signalempfang und Anrufung aufeinander aufbauen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung besteht zwischen der dreifachen Wiederholung und der Ausweitung des Hörens auf die gesamte Szene.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:MRT5","text":"Eine Spannung bleibt zwischen Zarathustras anfänglicher Bewegungsunfähigkeit und dem Imperativ des Wanderns bestehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:MRT6","text":"Eine zweite Spannung besteht zwischen der räumlichen Fixierung Zarathustras und der geistigen Bewegung zwischen Vergangenheit und Zukunft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, sofern die Nacht nicht als bloße Kulisse, sondern als erzeugtes Ziel der gemeinsamen Transformation verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T191149722182Z_8757981a","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"2.","source_sha256":"6678b69cc91ddbd3ed71baaf7bcf24c599115806875b24e3307983effa7fcfeb","sha256":"7dce04025ad9a77c5c289cf0c3f855b2b6e9dd90a5e5cfc13692c5a9b0dca44d","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:11:49.724667+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:AS1","text":"The encounter with the ugliest human being plunges Zarathustra into a physical and spiritual shock.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:AS2","text":"The shock is determined as the withdrawal of the spirit from the present and as a hastening ahead into a temporal interval.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:AS3","text":"Physical support enables a partial return without abolishing the inner distance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:AS4","text":"A bell signal coming from the depths replaces the speechless threshold with a repeated call.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:AS5","text":"The call transforms the assembled silence into a shared movement toward the night and midnight.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:A1","text":"The encounter with the ugliest human being destabilizes Zarathustra's physical and linguistic self-presence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:A2","text":"Zarathustra's inner thoughts remain opaque to those standing around him.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:A3","text":"His spirit moves away from the immediate situation and moves between past and future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:A4","text":"The higher human beings physically support Zarathustra and enable his partial return to himself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:A5","text":"Zarathustra rejects the thronging of the worshipful and the concerned.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:A6","text":"A sound of bells rises up from a depth and is received by Zarathustra as a direction-giving signal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:A7","text":"Gesture and repetition of the word “Come!” organize the reaction of those present.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:A8","text":"“Midnight” and “night” function as the temporal and spatial determination of the movement's destination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:A9","text":"The call extends from human beings to animals, cave, moon, and night.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:A10","text":"The voice changes in the course of the threefold invocation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:NX1","text":"After the shock, Zarathustra initially does not speak.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:NX2","text":"The thoughts in Zarathustra's soul are neither explained nor made accessible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:NX3","text":"Zarathustra initially remains in his place and does not move.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:NX4","text":"The thronging of the worshipful and the concerned is not admitted as an appropriate response.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:NX5","text":"The call does not arise from an argumentative explanation, but from hearing, silence, and gesture.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:NX6","text":"The beings present are not treated as listeners separated from one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:D1","text":"The inner shock produces no immediate communication of knowledge, but rather an interruption of language.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_19:A1","CH_97E9_2_19:A2","CH_97E9_2_19:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:D2","text":"Zarathustra's intermediate position between past and future makes the present into a transitional state.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_19:A3","CH_97E9_2_19:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:D3","text":"The physical return to himself does not restore a social reintegration into the throng, but enables its rejection.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_19:A4","CH_97E9_2_19:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:D4","text":"The bell signal acquires its operative significance only through Zarathustra's hearing it, marking it, and translating it into a call.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_19:A6","CH_97E9_2_19:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:D5","text":"The threefold repetition intensifies the call from an interruption into an instruction for collective movement.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_19:A7","CH_97E9_2_19:A9","CH_97E9_2_19:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:D6","text":"The night is produced not merely as an environment, but as the destination and medium of shared transformation.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_19:A8","CH_97E9_2_19:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:SD1","text":"The crisis is not resolved through explanation, but through a ritualized transformation of physical rigidity into collective movement.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_19:A1","CH_97E9_2_19:A4","CH_97E9_2_19:A6","CH_97E9_2_19:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:SD2","text":"The transition between past and future is condensed as an audible movement toward midnight, executable in common.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_19:A3","CH_97E9_2_19:A6","CH_97E9_2_19:A8","CH_97E9_2_19:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:SD3","text":"Zarathustra's authority arises not from immediate sovereignty, but from the capacity to connect silence, sound, gesture, and repetition into a shared orientation.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_19:A5","CH_97E9_2_19:A6","CH_97E9_2_19:A7","CH_97E9_2_19:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:SD4","text":"The invocation totalizes the space of hearing by including human, animal, spatial, and cosmic elements within the same listening order.","refs":["CH_97E9_2_19:A7","CH_97E9_2_19:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:DNX1","text":"The crisis must not be treated as fully articulable psychic content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:DNX2","text":"Physical restoration must not be equated with the abolition of the inner threshold.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:DNX3","text":"Community does not arise through worship, care, or proximity to the leader, but only through jointly directed hearing and walking.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:DNX4","text":"Time must not be presupposed as a stable present; the operative temporal form is transition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:DNX5","text":"The call must not be reduced to human language as an isolated medium of communication.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a return to a transparent, unbroken present.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:SNX2","text":"Excluded is a social order in which worship and concern already establish community.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:SNX3","text":"Excluded is a world whose elements stand outside a shared signal and a shared direction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:SNX4","text":"Excluded is the possibility of leaping over the threshold through mere movement; movement remains bound to silence, hearing, and repetition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:FGS1","text":"Encounter with the ugliest human being → physical-linguistic destabilization → loss of immediate self-presence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:FGS2","text":"Destabilization → spiritual withdrawal from the present → positioning between past and future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:FGS3","text":"Physical support → partial self-gathering → repulsion of the social throng.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:FGS4","text":"Repulsion and silence → hearing a signal from the depths → marking through gesture.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:FGS5","text":"Gesture → threefold invocation → transformation of the voice → collective listening.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:FGS6","text":"Collective listening → inclusion of all present instances → shared movement into the night.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:FGS7","text":"Movement into the night → temporal closure upon midnight → transition rather than return into the present.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:AF1","text":"Encounter and shock → spiritual withdrawal → temporal interval → physical support → rejection of the throng → bell signal → threefold invocation → collective listening → walk into the night.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:ME1","text":"The scene is remapped from a psychic crisis onto a threshold movement between past, future, and midnight.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:ME2","text":"Silence is reclassified from the sign of collapse into the constitutive medium of shared hearing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:ME3","text":"The higher human beings are remapped from those who provide caring support into participants in a movement oriented by Zarathustra's call.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:ME4","text":"The boundary between subject, animal, space, and cosmic environment becomes permeable through the shared movement of hearing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:ME5","text":"Movement appears not as a spontaneous reaction, but as an order produced through signal, gesture, repetition, and temporal orientation toward a destination.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — Zarathustra staggers, falls silent, hears, speaks the call, and calls upon them to walk into the night.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — Physical support, rejection of the throng, bell signal, and repetition organize the transition from isolation to collective orientation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — The scene replaces authoritative explanation with a practice of interruption, hearing, and gradual mobilization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — Reality appears as a threshold order between what has passed and what is to come, in which animals, cave, moon, and night also participate in perception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from shock, through silence and hearing, to nocturnal collective movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:MRT2","text":"The concrete content of Zarathustra's inner thoughts remains underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent because physical destabilization, temporal withdrawal, reception of a signal, and invocation build upon one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:MRT4","text":"The strongest connection exists between the threefold repetition and the extension of hearing to the entire scene.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:MRT5","text":"A tension remains between Zarathustra's initial inability to move and the imperative of walking.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:MRT6","text":"A second tension exists between Zarathustra's spatial fixation and the spiritual movement between past and future.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_2_19:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual argumentative movement provided that the night is understood not as a mere backdrop, but as a produced destination of shared transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_2_19:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_2_19@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_2_19:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song","source_section_label":"2.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Four and Last"],"reading_title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 2","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","The Night-Wanderer’s Song","2."],"original_title":"2."}],"source_title_context":"Das Nachtwandler-Lied","source_section_label":"2.","source_title_hierarchy":["Vierter und letzter Theil"],"reading_title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 2","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","The Night-Wanderer’s Song","2."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 172","title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 2","context":"Part Four and Last","original_context":"Vierter und letzter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Das Nachtwandler-Lied · 2"},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10","layer":"CH","title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 3","order":173,"parents":["RAW_97E9_3_10"],"revision":"CH_97E9_3_10@R001","sha256":"620823d98daaa197eb6855b606cbbd46a0903a14d5001d12c9675d92e0699f0f","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:AS1","text":"Der Text richtet sich an „höhere Menschen“ an einer zeitlichen und akustischen Schwelle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:AS2","text":"Die Mitternachtsglocke wird als vermittelnde Stimme eines älteren, schmerzgesättigten Erfahrungswissens eingesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:AS3","text":"Die Nacht hebt den Tageslärm und das hörbare Geräusch der Herzen auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:AS4","text":"Erst diese Stilllegung macht verborgene Rede wahrnehmbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:AS5","text":"Das Vernehmbare bleibt zugleich heimlich, schrecklich und herzlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:AS6","text":"Die Bewegung endet nicht in einer Mitteilung, sondern in der Aufforderung zur gesteigerten Aufmerksamkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:A1","text":"Mitternacht bildet eine Schwellenzeit zwischen Tagesordnung und nächtlicher Wahrnehmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:A2","text":"Die Mitternachtsglocke besitzt eine eigene, menschenübersteigende Erfahrungsdimension.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:A3","text":"Die Glocke bewahrt und zählt die Herzensschläge vergangener Generationen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:A4","text":"Schmerz ist in der akustischen Erscheinung der Glocke eingeschrieben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:A5","text":"Tageslärm verhindert oder verdeckt bestimmte Formen des Hörens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:A6","text":"Kühle Nachtluft und gestillte Herzen erzeugen eine Bedingung erhöhter Hörbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:A7","text":"Das Verborgene kann sich einer nächtlich wachen Seele mitteilen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:A8","text":"Die Mitteilung tritt nicht neutral, sondern zugleich heimlich, schrecklich und herzlich auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:A9","text":"Der Mensch ist für diese Mitteilung verantwortlich aufmerksam zu bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:A10","text":"Die Mitternachtsglocke verbindet gegenwärtiges Hören mit transgenerationaler Zeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:NX1","text":"Die entscheidende Rede wird nicht als öffentliche Tagesrede bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:NX2","text":"Das hörbare Ereignis ist nicht mit gewöhnlichem Lärm vereinbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:NX3","text":"Die nächtliche Mitteilung ist nicht vollständig offen oder explizit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:NX4","text":"Das Schweigen der Herzen bedeutet nicht das Ende von Rede.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:NX5","text":"Die Glocke ist nicht bloß ein äußerer Zeitmesser.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:NX6","text":"Die Warnung erschöpft sich nicht in einer begrifflichen Erklärung des Gehörten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:D1","text":"Erst der Entzug des Tageslärms lässt die verborgene Rede hervortreten.","refs":["CH_97E9_3_10:A5","CH_97E9_3_10:A6","CH_97E9_3_10:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:D2","text":"Die Glocke fungiert als Gedächtnismedium zwischen den Schmerzen der Vorfahren und dem gegenwärtigen Hörer.","refs":["CH_97E9_3_10:A2","CH_97E9_3_10:A3","CH_97E9_3_10:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:D3","text":"Das nächtliche Hören setzt eine Seele voraus, die zugleich wach und für nichtöffentliche Rede empfänglich ist.","refs":["CH_97E9_3_10:A6","CH_97E9_3_10:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:D4","text":"Die wiederholte Verbindung von Seufzen und Lachen erzeugt eine doppelte Affektstruktur aus Schmerz und traumartiger Entlastung.","refs":["CH_97E9_3_10:A4","CH_97E9_3_10:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:D5","text":"Die Rede der Glocke überschreitet individuelles Erleben, ohne ihre Vermittlung durch ein einzelnes Hören aufzugeben.","refs":["CH_97E9_3_10:A2","CH_97E9_3_10:A7","CH_97E9_3_10:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:D6","text":"Die imperative Anrede verwandelt Wahrnehmung in eine Verpflichtung zur Aufmerksamkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_3_10:A8","CH_97E9_3_10:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:SD1","text":"Wahrheit erscheint als etwas, das erst durch eine bestimmte zeitliche, akustische und affektive Disposition zugänglich wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:SD2","text":"Schweigen wird von einer bloßen Abwesenheit von Geräusch in ein produktives Medium der Offenbarung umcodiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:SD3","text":"Individuelles Hören wird in eine transgenerationale Kontinuität von Schmerz, Erinnerung und Anrede eingespannt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:SD4","text":"Die Rede gewinnt ihre Autorität gerade aus der Spannung, dass sie zugleich geheim, erschreckend, innig und nicht vollständig artikuliert ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:DNX1","text":"Das System hängt davon ab, dass die Tageswirklichkeit nicht bereits den vollständigen Horizont des Hörbaren bildet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:DNX2","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass Erkenntnis primär durch begriffliche Klarheit oder öffentliche Mitteilung entsteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:DNX3","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass Vergangenheit abgeschlossen und von der Gegenwart abgetrennt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:DNX4","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass Affektive Gegensätze wie Schmerz und Lachen sich gegenseitig aufheben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:DNX5","text":"Es wird ausgeschlossen, dass der Mensch autonomer Ursprung der vernommenen Rede ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:SNX1","text":"Die Möglichkeit einer vollständig verfügbaren, öffentlichen und abschließbaren Wahrheit bleibt versperrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:SNX2","text":"Das Argument organisiert sich um die Abwesenheit einer direkt ausgesprochenen Botschaft, deren Wirkung dennoch eine Warnung erzwingt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:SNX3","text":"Unmöglich gemacht wird ein Hören ohne Schwelle, ohne Stille und ohne affektive Gefährdung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:FGS1","text":"Tageslärm und gewöhnliche Herzbewegung → Verdeckung der verborgenen Rede.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:FGS2","text":"Mitternacht und Stille → Herstellung einer nächtlich wachen Wahrnehmungsinstanz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:FGS3","text":"Glocke als transgenerationale Vermittlung → Übertragung von Schmerzgedächtnis in gegenwärtiges Hören.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:FGS4","text":"Ambivalente Affektqualität → Erzeugung einer nicht auflösbaren, aber dringlichen Mitteilung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:FGS5","text":"Unvollständige Mitteilung → imperative Schließung durch Aufmerksamkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:AF1","text":"Verdeckte Rede → Stilllegung des Tageslärms → nächtliche Hörbarkeit → transgenerationale Vermittlung → affektive Ambivalenz → Aufforderung zur Aufmerksamkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:ME1","text":"Zeit wird nicht mehr als lineare Abfolge, sondern als akustische Überlagerung von Gegenwart und Vorfahrenschmerz kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:ME2","text":"Stille wird vom passiven Zustand zur Bedingung produktiver Wahrnehmung umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:ME3","text":"Die Glocke wird vom Messinstrument zum Gedächtnis- und Übertragungsmedium umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:ME4","text":"Die Grenze zwischen äußerem Klang und innerem Herzensereignis wird durchlässig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:ME5","text":"Aufmerksamkeit erscheint nicht als freiwillige Konzentration, sondern als Antwort auf eine latent verpflichtende Anrede.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Eine nächtliche Glocke spricht einen Menschen an, der hören soll.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Lärm und Stille organisieren den Zugang zu verborgener Rede.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Der Text ersetzt direkte Erklärung durch eine Inszenierung von Schwelle, Wiederholung und erzwungener Aufmerksamkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Vergangenheit bleibt als fortwirkender Schmerz im gegenwärtigen Hören anwesend; Zeit wird hörbar und affektiv vermittelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von Tageslärm über nächtliche Stille zur Glockenrede zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:MRT2","text":"Die Struktur erklärt die Funktion der Glocke als Vermittlerin, ohne sie auf ein bloßes Symbol zu reduzieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, was die Glocke inhaltlich mitteilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:MRT4","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt ebenfalls, warum die Adressaten als „höhere Menschen“ bezeichnet werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:MRT5","text":"Die interne Kohärenz beruht auf der Verbindung von akustischer Verdeckung, nächtlicher Öffnung und verpflichtender Aufmerksamkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:MRT6","text":"Die stärkste Operation ist die Umkehrung von Schweigen und Rede: Das Verstummen erzeugt Hörbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die Spannung zwischen vertraulicher Mitteilung und öffentlicher Anrufung, zwischen Schrecken und Herzlichkeit sowie zwischen konkreter Stimme und unbestimmtem Inhalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T191643274942Z_208d6173","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"3.","source_sha256":"620823d98daaa197eb6855b606cbbd46a0903a14d5001d12c9675d92e0699f0f","sha256":"f6734e48a9f383ae4585c58c4ff2a28457dcc6b0923c9571c92e863f04089121","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:16:43.276621+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:AS1","text":"The text addresses “higher human beings” at a temporal and acoustic threshold.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:AS2","text":"The midnight bell is deployed as a mediating voice of an older experiential knowledge saturated with pain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:AS3","text":"The night suspends the noise of the day and the audible sound of hearts.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:AS4","text":"Only this suspension makes hidden speech perceptible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:AS5","text":"What is audible remains at once secret, terrible, and heartfelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:AS6","text":"The movement ends not in a communication, but in the demand for heightened attention.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:A1","text":"Midnight constitutes a threshold time between the order of the day and nocturnal perception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:A2","text":"The midnight bell possesses its own experiential dimension exceeding the human.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:A3","text":"The bell preserves and counts the heartbeats of past generations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:A4","text":"Pain is inscribed in the acoustic appearance of the bell.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:A5","text":"The noise of the day prevents or conceals certain forms of hearing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:A6","text":"Cool night air and stilled hearts produce a condition of heightened audibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:A7","text":"What is hidden can communicate itself to a soul awake at night.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:A8","text":"The communication does not occur neutrally, but at once secretly, terribly, and heartfully.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:A9","text":"The human being is responsible for remaining attentive to this communication.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:A10","text":"The midnight bell connects present hearing with transgenerational time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:NX1","text":"The decisive speech is not determined as public daytime speech.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:NX2","text":"The audible event is not compatible with ordinary noise.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:NX3","text":"The nocturnal communication is not completely open or explicit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:NX4","text":"The silence of hearts does not mean the end of speech.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:NX5","text":"The bell is not merely an external timekeeper.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:NX6","text":"The warning is not exhausted in a conceptual explanation of what is heard.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:D1","text":"Only the withdrawal of daytime noise allows hidden speech to emerge.","refs":["CH_97E9_3_10:A5","CH_97E9_3_10:A6","CH_97E9_3_10:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:D2","text":"The bell functions as a medium of memory between the pains of the ancestors and the present hearer.","refs":["CH_97E9_3_10:A2","CH_97E9_3_10:A3","CH_97E9_3_10:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:D3","text":"Nocturnal hearing presupposes a soul that is at once awake and receptive to non-public speech.","refs":["CH_97E9_3_10:A6","CH_97E9_3_10:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:D4","text":"The repeated conjunction of sighing and laughter produces a double affective structure of pain and dreamlike relief.","refs":["CH_97E9_3_10:A4","CH_97E9_3_10:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:D5","text":"The speech of the bell exceeds individual experience without relinquishing its mediation through a single hearing.","refs":["CH_97E9_3_10:A2","CH_97E9_3_10:A7","CH_97E9_3_10:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:D6","text":"The imperative address transforms perception into an obligation to attend.","refs":["CH_97E9_3_10:A8","CH_97E9_3_10:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:SD1","text":"Truth appears as something that becomes accessible only through a specific temporal, acoustic, and affective disposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:SD2","text":"Silence is recoded from a mere absence of sound into a productive medium of revelation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:SD3","text":"Individual hearing is bound into a transgenerational continuity of pain, memory, and address.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:SD4","text":"Speech gains its authority precisely from the tension that it is at once secret, frightening, intimate, and not fully articulated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:DNX1","text":"The system depends on the fact that daytime reality does not already constitute the complete horizon of what is audible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:DNX2","text":"It is excluded that knowledge arises primarily through conceptual clarity or public communication.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:DNX3","text":"It is excluded that the past is concluded and separated from the present.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:DNX4","text":"It is excluded that affective opposites such as pain and laughter cancel one another out.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:DNX5","text":"It is excluded that the human being is the autonomous origin of the speech heard.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:SNX1","text":"The possibility of a fully available, public, and closable truth remains blocked.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:SNX2","text":"The argument organizes itself around the absence of a directly uttered message whose effect nevertheless compels a warning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:SNX3","text":"Made impossible is a hearing without threshold, without silence, and without affective endangerment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:FGS1","text":"Daytime noise and ordinary movement of the heart → concealment of hidden speech.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:FGS2","text":"Midnight and silence → production of a nocturnally awake instance of perception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:FGS3","text":"Bell as transgenerational mediation → transmission of pain-memory into present hearing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:FGS4","text":"Ambivalent affective quality → production of a communication that cannot be resolved but is urgent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:FGS5","text":"Incomplete communication → imperative closure through attention.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:AF1","text":"Concealed speech → suspension of daytime noise → nocturnal audibility → transgenerational mediation → affective ambivalence → demand for attention.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:ME1","text":"Time is no longer mapped as a linear sequence, but as an acoustic superimposition of the present and ancestral pain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:ME2","text":"Silence is reclassified from a passive state into the condition of productive perception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:ME3","text":"The bell is remapped from an instrument of measurement into a medium of memory and transmission.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:ME4","text":"The boundary between external sound and an internal event of the heart becomes permeable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:ME5","text":"Attention appears not as voluntary concentration, but as a response to a latently obligatory address.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** A nocturnal bell addresses a human being who is to hear.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Noise and silence organize access to hidden speech.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** The text replaces direct explanation with a staging of threshold, repetition, and compelled attention.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** The past remains present in current hearing as continuing pain; time becomes audible and affectively mediated.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from daytime noise through nocturnal silence to the speech of the bell.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:MRT2","text":"The structure explains the function of the bell as mediator without reducing it to a mere symbol.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:MRT3","text":"What the bell communicates in terms of content remains underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:MRT4","text":"It likewise remains underdetermined why the addressees are designated as “higher human beings.”","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:MRT5","text":"The internal coherence rests on the connection of acoustic concealment, nocturnal opening, and obligatory attention.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:MRT6","text":"The strongest operation is the reversal of silence and speech: falling silent produces audibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_3_10:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the tension between confidential communication and public invocation, between terror and heartfeltness, and between concrete voice and indeterminate content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_3_10:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_3_10@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_3_10:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song","source_section_label":"3.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Four and Last"],"reading_title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 3","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","The Night-Wanderer’s Song","3."],"original_title":"3."}],"source_title_context":"Das Nachtwandler-Lied","source_section_label":"3.","source_title_hierarchy":["Vierter und letzter Theil"],"reading_title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 3","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","The Night-Wanderer’s Song","3."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 173","title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 3","context":"Part Four and Last","original_context":"Vierter und letzter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Das Nachtwandler-Lied · 3"},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5","layer":"CH","title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 4","order":174,"parents":["RAW_97E9_4C_5"],"revision":"CH_97E9_4C_5@R001","sha256":"b3e265172a10f86163df9fe01c307c37fe307656f7853c51db19d599cca6c9b3","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:AS1","text":"Ein sprechendes Ich erfährt Zeit als Verlust und die Welt als Schlaf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:AS2","text":"Der Abstieg in die Tiefe erzeugt ein Wissen, das nicht unmittelbar mitgeteilt werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:AS3","text":"Das Ich erklärt sich vorweg für gestorben, während eine noch kommende Stunde angekündigt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:AS4","text":"Die kommende Stunde verwandelt das intime Mitternachtswissen in eine Prüfung von Mut, Herrschaft und Hörfähigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:AS5","text":"Die Frage nach dem Herrn der Erde wird als Frage nach der Instanz zugespitzt, die den Lauf der Ströme bestimmen darf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:AS6","text":"Die Rede richtet sich schließlich an den höheren Menschen, bleibt aber auf feine Ohren und eine erschlossene Mitternachtssprache beschränkt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:A1","text":"Zeit wird als etwas erfahren, das verlorengegangen ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:A2","text":"Tiefe wird durch den Abstieg in Brunnen und durch die Mitternacht als Erkenntnisraum konstituiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:A3","text":"Die Welt befindet sich im Schlaf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:A4","text":"Das Mitternachtsherz trägt einen Gedanken, dessen Mitteilung verweigert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:A5","text":"Der Tod des sprechenden Ichs markiert einen Übergang, nicht den Abschluss der Rede.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:A6","text":"Eine kommende Stunde besitzt die Macht, zu fragen und zu erschüttern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:A7","text":"Diese Stunde fordert hinreichendes Herz beziehungsweise hinreichenden Mut.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:A8","text":"Die Erde erscheint als ein Bereich, dessen Herrschaft beansprucht werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:A9","text":"Herrschaft über die Erde wird als Anweisung des Laufs großer und kleiner Ströme vorgestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:A10","text":"Der höhere Mensch ist ein möglicher Adressat der kommenden Rede.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:A11","text":"Das Mitternachtswort ist nicht für jedes Ohr zugänglich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:A12","text":"Die Mitternacht spricht nicht direkt, sondern muss von einem hörfähigen Adressaten vernommen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:NX1","text":"Der zentrale Gedanke des Mitternachtsherzens wird nicht ausgesprochen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:NX2","text":"Die Rede ist nicht für die schlafende Welt bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:NX3","text":"Die kommende Stunde ist nicht durch eine Antwort, sondern durch wiederholtes Fragen bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:NX4","text":"Der Herr der Erde ist noch nicht identifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:NX5","text":"Die angemessene Herrschaft über die Ströme ist noch nicht festgelegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:NX6","text":"Die Rede richtet sich nicht an beliebige Hörer, sondern nur an „feine Ohren“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:NX7","text":"Der höhere Mensch ist noch nicht als tatsächlich hörender oder herrschender Mensch ausgewiesen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:D1","text":"Der Verlust der Zeit wird in eine Erwartung der kommenden Stunde überführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_5:A1","CH_97E9_4C_5:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:D2","text":"Die Tiefe erzeugt kein verfügbares Wissen, sondern ein Wissen, dessen Weitergabe an eine besondere Hörfähigkeit gebunden ist.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_5:A2","CH_97E9_4C_5:A4","CH_97E9_4C_5:A11","CH_97E9_4C_5:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:D3","text":"Der angekündigte Tod des Ichs verstärkt die Schwelle zwischen gegenwärtigem Sprechen und zukünftiger Offenbarung.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_5:A5","CH_97E9_4C_5:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:D4","text":"Die wiederholte Frage der Stunde ersetzt eine gegebene Ordnung durch eine Prüfung der Berechtigung zur Herrschaft.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_5:A6","CH_97E9_4C_5:A7","CH_97E9_4C_5:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:D5","text":"Herrschaft wird nicht als Besitz, sondern als Fähigkeit zur Richtungsgebung natürlicher Bewegungen bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_5:A8","CH_97E9_4C_5:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:D6","text":"Der höhere Mensch wird vom Gegenstand der Anrede zum möglichen Träger einer noch nicht eingelösten Antwort.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_5:A6","CH_97E9_4C_5:A10","CH_97E9_4C_5:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:SD1","text":"Die Struktur verwandelt eine subjektive Zeitkrise in eine ontologisch-politische Prüfung der Herrschaft über die Erde.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_5:A1","CH_97E9_4C_5:A6","CH_97E9_4C_5:A8","CH_97E9_4C_5:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:SD2","text":"Erkenntnis wird als Schwellenereignis organisiert: Sie entsteht in der Tiefe, wird durch Tod und Nacht vermittelt und bleibt auf selektive Hörbarkeit angewiesen.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_5:A2","CH_97E9_4C_5:A5","CH_97E9_4C_5:A11","CH_97E9_4C_5:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:SD3","text":"Herrschaft erscheint als noch offene Funktion einer kommenden Entscheidung, nicht als bereits bestehende Ordnung.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_5:A6","CH_97E9_4C_5:A7","CH_97E9_4C_5:A8","CH_97E9_4C_5:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:SD4","text":"Die Rede erzeugt ihre Autorität durch die gleichzeitige Verweigerung der Mitteilung und die Ankündigung einer notwendigen Antwort.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_5:A4","CH_97E9_4C_5:A6","CH_97E9_4C_5:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:DNX1","text":"Wahrheit ist nicht als vollständig gegenwärtiger und allgemein verfügbarer Inhalt vorausgesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:DNX2","text":"Zeit ist nicht als kontinuierlicher, neutraler Ablauf vorausgesetzt, sondern als Verlust, Schwelle und bevorstehende Unterbrechung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:DNX3","text":"Herrschaft ist nicht als vorgegebene Legitimität oder institutioneller Besitz vorausgesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:DNX4","text":"Die Welt ist nicht als wacher, gemeinsamer Verständigungsraum vorausgesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:DNX5","text":"Der höhere Mensch ist nicht als bereits vollendetes Subjekt vorausgesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:DNX6","text":"Naturbewegung ist nicht als bloß selbstlaufender Prozess behandelt, der jeder menschlichen Anweisung entzogen wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen bleibt eine Welt, in der Wahrheit ohne Schwelle, Prüfung oder Auswahl unmittelbar verfügbar wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen bleibt eine Herrschaft, deren Recht unabhängig von Mut, Antwort und Fähigkeit zur Richtungsgebung feststeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen bleibt eine gemeinsame Gegenwart, in der Sprechender, Welt und Adressat bereits wach und verständigt sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:SNX4","text":"Die entscheidende Möglichkeit einer legitimen Erdordnung bleibt abwesend; gerade diese Abwesenheit erzeugt die Frage nach dem künftigen Herrn.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:FGS1","text":"Zeitverlust + Weltschlaf → Abstieg in die Tiefe → exklusives Mitternachtswissen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:FGS2","text":"Exklusives Wissen + verweigerte Mitteilung → Todesschwelle des Ichs → angekündigte zukünftige Stunde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:FGS3","text":"Kommende Stunde + wiederholte Frage → Prüfung von Herz und Mut → Öffnung der Herrschaftsfrage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:FGS4","text":"Herrschaftsfrage + Bild der Ströme → Herrschaft als Richtungsgebung natürlicher Bewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:FGS5","text":"Richtungsgebende Herrschaft + selektive Hörbarkeit → Anrufung des höheren Menschen als möglicher Antwortinstanz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:FGS6","text":"Möglicher Adressat + fehlende Antwort → aufgeschobene Offenbarung und fortgesetzte Spannung zwischen Verkündigung und Verschweigen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:AF1","text":"Zeitverlust und Weltschlaf → Tiefenabstieg → unmitteilbares Mitternachtswissen → symbolischer Tod → kommende Frage-Stunde → Prüfung des Mutes → offene Erd- und Herrschaftsfrage → Anrufung des höheren Menschen → selektive Hörbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:ME1","text":"Eine subjektive Klage über verlorene Zeit wird als Vorzeichen einer geschichtlichen oder ontologischen Schwelle neu klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:ME2","text":"Das Verhältnis von Wissen und Kommunikation wird von allgemeiner Mitteilbarkeit auf gestufte Hörfähigkeit umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:ME3","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Natur und Herrschaft wird verschoben: Ströme erscheinen zugleich als natürliche Bewegungen und als Gegenstand möglicher Richtungsgebung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:ME4","text":"Der Tod des Sprechers wird nicht als Ende, sondern als Übergang zur autoritativen Frage reorganisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:ME5","text":"Der höhere Mensch wird nicht als fertige Lösung, sondern als ungeprüfter Empfänger und möglicher Vollzieher der Antwort kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — Klage, Angst, Nachtbilder, Todessprache und direkte Anrede bilden die unmittelbare Ausdrucksebene.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — Tiefe, Schwelle, Frage, Hörfähigkeit und Herrschaft organisieren die begriffliche Mechanik unterhalb der Bildsprache.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — Die Rede kontrolliert Zugang und Autorität, indem sie Wissen zurückhält und den Adressaten durch eine Frage zur Selbstpositionierung zwingt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — Zeit erscheint als diskontinuierliche Folge von Verlust, Tod und kommender Stunde; Realität wird als noch unentschiedene Ordnung der Erdbewegungen vorausgesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um den Übergang von Zeitverlust und Tiefe zur Frage nach Herrschaft und Hörfähigkeit zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, was der verschwiegene Gedanke des Mitternachtsherzens inhaltlich besagt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt ebenfalls, ob der höhere Mensch die geforderte Antwort besitzt oder nur als möglicher Adressat angerufen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:MRT4","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern der Tod des Ichs als Schwellenereignis und nicht als endgültiger Abschluss gelesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung besteht zwischen der kommenden Stunde, der Mutprüfung und der offenen Herrschaftsfrage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion hängt von der nicht vollständig aufgelösten Spannung zwischen Naturbewegung und menschlicher Richtungsgewalt ab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:MRT7","text":"Die Bewegung des Textes bleibt erhalten, solange die selektive Hörbarkeit nicht als bloßes Stilmittel, sondern als Bedingung der Offenbarung behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T191834243557Z_5653bc95","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"4.","source_sha256":"b3e265172a10f86163df9fe01c307c37fe307656f7853c51db19d599cca6c9b3","sha256":"9218ccfcc97543febfb120bed24690d0a6ed77b13f5b2a6315609dd4fa99d17d","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:18:34.244877+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:AS1","text":"A speaking I experiences time as loss and the world as sleep.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:AS2","text":"The descent into the depths produces a knowledge that cannot be communicated directly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:AS3","text":"The I declares itself dead in advance, while an hour yet to come is announced.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:AS4","text":"The coming hour transforms intimate midnight knowledge into a test of courage, rule, and capacity to hear.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:AS5","text":"The question of the lord of the earth is sharpened into the question of the authority permitted to determine the course of the streams.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:AS6","text":"The discourse ultimately addresses the higher human being, but remains restricted to fine ears and an opened-up midnight language.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:A1","text":"Time is experienced as something that has been lost.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:A2","text":"Depth is constituted through descent into wells and through midnight as a space of knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:A3","text":"The world is asleep.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:A4","text":"The midnight heart bears a thought whose communication is refused.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:A5","text":"The death of the speaking I marks a transition, not the conclusion of the discourse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:A6","text":"A coming hour possesses the power to question and to shake.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:A7","text":"This hour demands a sufficient heart or, respectively, sufficient courage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:A8","text":"The earth appears as a domain whose rule can be claimed.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:A9","text":"Rule over the earth is conceived as directing the course of great and small streams.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:A10","text":"The higher human being is a possible addressee of the coming discourse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:A11","text":"The midnight word is not accessible to every ear.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:A12","text":"Midnight does not speak directly, but must be heard by an addressee capable of hearing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:NX1","text":"The central thought of the midnight heart is not spoken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:NX2","text":"The discourse is not intended for the sleeping world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:NX3","text":"The coming hour is determined not by an answer, but by repeated questioning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:NX4","text":"The lord of the earth has not yet been identified.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:NX5","text":"The appropriate rule over the streams has not yet been determined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:NX6","text":"The discourse is addressed not to arbitrary listeners, but only to “fine ears.”","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:NX7","text":"The higher human being has not yet been shown to be an actually hearing or ruling human being.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:D1","text":"The loss of time is transferred into an expectation of the coming hour.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_5:A1","CH_97E9_4C_5:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:D2","text":"Depth produces not available knowledge, but knowledge whose transmission is bound to a special capacity to hear.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_5:A2","CH_97E9_4C_5:A4","CH_97E9_4C_5:A11","CH_97E9_4C_5:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:D3","text":"The announced death of the I intensifies the threshold between present speaking and future revelation.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_5:A5","CH_97E9_4C_5:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:D4","text":"The repeated question of the hour replaces a given order with a test of entitlement to rule.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_5:A6","CH_97E9_4C_5:A7","CH_97E9_4C_5:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:D5","text":"Rule is determined not as possession, but as the capacity to give direction to natural movements.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_5:A8","CH_97E9_4C_5:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:D6","text":"The higher human being shifts from the object of address to the possible bearer of an answer not yet fulfilled.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_5:A6","CH_97E9_4C_5:A10","CH_97E9_4C_5:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:SD1","text":"The structure transforms a subjective crisis of time into an ontological-political test of rule over the earth.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_5:A1","CH_97E9_4C_5:A6","CH_97E9_4C_5:A8","CH_97E9_4C_5:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:SD2","text":"Knowledge is organized as a threshold event: it arises in depth, is mediated through death and night, and remains dependent on selective audibility.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_5:A2","CH_97E9_4C_5:A5","CH_97E9_4C_5:A11","CH_97E9_4C_5:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:SD3","text":"Rule appears as a still-open function of a coming decision, not as an already existing order.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_5:A6","CH_97E9_4C_5:A7","CH_97E9_4C_5:A8","CH_97E9_4C_5:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:SD4","text":"The discourse produces its authority through the simultaneous refusal of communication and announcement of a necessary answer.","refs":["CH_97E9_4C_5:A4","CH_97E9_4C_5:A6","CH_97E9_4C_5:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:DNX1","text":"Truth is not presupposed as a fully present and generally available content.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:DNX2","text":"Time is not presupposed as a continuous, neutral progression, but as loss, threshold, and impending interruption.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:DNX3","text":"Rule is not presupposed as a given legitimacy or institutional possession.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:DNX4","text":"The world is not presupposed as an awake, shared space of understanding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:DNX5","text":"The higher human being is not presupposed as an already completed subject.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:DNX6","text":"Natural movement is not treated as a merely self-running process withdrawn from every human direction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a world in which truth would be immediately available without threshold, test, or selection.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:SNX2","text":"Excluded is a rule whose right is established independently of courage, answer, and the capacity to give direction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:SNX3","text":"Excluded is a shared present in which speaker, world, and addressee are already awake and mutually understanding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:SNX4","text":"The decisive possibility of a legitimate earthly order remains absent; precisely this absence generates the question of the future lord.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:FGS1","text":"Loss of time + sleep of the world → descent into depth → exclusive midnight knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:FGS2","text":"Exclusive knowledge + refused communication → death-threshold of the I → announced future hour.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:FGS3","text":"Coming hour + repeated question → test of heart and courage → opening of the question of rule.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:FGS4","text":"Question of rule + image of the streams → rule as the giving of direction to natural movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:FGS5","text":"Direction-giving rule + selective audibility → invocation of the higher human being as a possible answering authority.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:FGS6","text":"Possible addressee + absent answer → deferred revelation and continued tension between proclamation and concealment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:AF1","text":"Loss of time and sleep of the world → descent into depth → incommunicable midnight knowledge → symbolic death → coming questioning hour → test of courage → open question of earth and rule → invocation of the higher human being → selective audibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:ME1","text":"A subjective complaint about lost time is reclassified as a sign of a historical or ontological threshold.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:ME2","text":"The relation of knowledge and communication is remapped from general communicability to graduated capacity to hear.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:ME3","text":"The opposition between nature and rule is displaced: streams appear at once as natural movements and as the object of possible directional guidance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:ME4","text":"The death of the speaker is reorganized not as an end, but as a transition to the authoritative question.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:ME5","text":"The higher human being is mapped not as a finished solution, but as an untested recipient and possible executor of the answer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:ALT1","text":"**Surface** — Complaint, fear, night images, language of death, and direct address constitute the immediate level of expression.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:ALT2","text":"**Structural** — Depth, threshold, question, capacity to hear, and rule organize the conceptual mechanics beneath the imagery.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic** — The discourse controls access and authority by withholding knowledge and compelling the addressee, through a question, to position himself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal** — Time appears as a discontinuous sequence of loss, death, and coming hour; reality is presupposed as a still-undecided order of earthly movements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the transition from loss of time and depth to the question of rule and capacity to hear.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:MRT2","text":"What the concealed thought of the midnight heart says in content remains underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:MRT3","text":"It likewise remains underdetermined whether the higher human being possesses the demanded answer or is merely invoked as a possible addressee.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:MRT4","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as the death of the I is read as a threshold event and not as a final conclusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:MRT5","text":"The strongest connection exists between the coming hour, the test of courage, and the open question of rule.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction depends on the tension between natural movement and human power to give direction, which is not fully resolved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_4C_5:MRT7","text":"The movement of the text is preserved so long as selective audibility is treated not as a mere stylistic device, but as a condition of revelation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_4C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_4C_5@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_4C_5:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song","source_section_label":"4.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Four and Last"],"reading_title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 4","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","The Night-Wanderer’s Song","4."],"original_title":"4."}],"source_title_context":"Das Nachtwandler-Lied","source_section_label":"4.","source_title_hierarchy":["Vierter und letzter Theil"],"reading_title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 4","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","The Night-Wanderer’s Song","4."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 174","title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 4","context":"Part Four and Last","original_context":"Vierter und letzter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Das Nachtwandler-Lied · 4"},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5","layer":"CH","title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 5","order":175,"parents":["RAW_97E9_5C_5"],"revision":"CH_97E9_5C_5@R001","sha256":"6de892b5610da9d1f2d78d28ce56b16308de05d1a475b5cbf1bbf0d2b1bdd330","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:AS1","text":"Ekstatische Bewegung wird als Möglichkeit gesetzt, die Erde zu beherrschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:AS2","text":"Der Tanz erzeugt Aufstieg, bleibt jedoch an den Körper gebunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:AS3","text":"Die körperliche Unzulänglichkeit verwandelt den Aufstieg in ein Scheitern.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:AS4","text":"Mit dem Scheitern zerfallen Lust, Wein, Gefäß und Grab in materielle Verfallsformen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:AS5","text":"Die Toten artikulieren das ungelöste Bedürfnis nach Erlösung und Erwachen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:AS6","text":"Der Appell an die höheren Menschen steigert die Forderung, ohne die Bedingung ihrer Erfüllung bereitzustellen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:AS7","text":"Das Fortbestehen von Glocke, Herz, Holzwurm und Herzenswurm führt die misslungene Transzendenz in eine tiefe, weiterarbeitende Welt zurück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:A1","text":"Bewegung und Tanz eröffnen die Vorstellung einer möglichen Herrschaft über die Erde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:A2","text":"Der Körper begrenzt den Aufstieg, weil ein Bein kein Flügel ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:A3","text":"Der Aufstieg der Tänzer bleibt unterhalb der erforderlichen Höhe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:A4","text":"Die anfängliche Lust ist zeitlich und materiell vergänglich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:A5","text":"Der Verfall der Lust verwandelt Genussmittel und Gefäße in Zeichen des Zerfalls.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:A6","text":"Die Gräber bewahren eine nicht erfüllte Forderung nach Erlösung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:A7","text":"Erlösung wird als Befreiung der Toten und als Wiedererweckung der Leichname vorgestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:A8","text":"Das Fortbestehen von Herz, Wurm und Glocke verhindert den Abschluss des Todesprozesses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:A9","text":"Die Welt besitzt eine Tiefe, die durch ekstatische Bewegung nicht aufgehoben wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:NX1","text":"Der Tanz ist kein Fliegen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:NX2","text":"Das Bein ist kein Flügel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:NX3","text":"Die erreichte Höhe ist keine hinreichende Transzendenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:NX4","text":"Lust ist keine dauerhafte Erlösung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:NX5","text":"Der Wein bleibt nicht Wein, und der Becher bleibt nicht dauerhaftes Gefäß.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:NX6","text":"Das Grab ist kein abgeschlossener und stiller Endpunkt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:NX7","text":"Der Appell an die höheren Menschen bewirkt die Erlösung der Toten nicht unmittelbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:NX8","text":"Der Mondrausch hebt die Nacht nicht auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:D1","text":"Jede Bewegung zur Höhe erzeugt zugleich den Nachweis ihrer körperlichen Begrenzung.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_5:A1","CH_97E9_5C_5:A2","CH_97E9_5C_5:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:D2","text":"Das Scheitern des Aufstiegs lässt die anfängliche Lust als vorübergehenden Zustand erscheinen.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_5:A3","CH_97E9_5C_5:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:D3","text":"Der materielle Verfall übersetzt das Ende der Lust in eine Serie von Umwandlungen.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_5:A4","CH_97E9_5C_5:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:D4","text":"Die Toten werden nicht als schweigende Abwesenheit, sondern als fortbestehende Forderung konstruiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_5:A6","CH_97E9_5C_5:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:D5","text":"Erlösung nimmt die Form einer unmöglichen oder noch nicht vollzogenen Überschreitung des Todes an.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_5:A6","CH_97E9_5C_5:A7","CH_97E9_5C_5:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:D6","text":"Die Welt bleibt trotz des Erlösungsappells als tiefer Prozess wirksam.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_5:A7","CH_97E9_5C_5:A8","CH_97E9_5C_5:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:SD1","text":"Der Versuch, durch Tanz über die Erde hinauszugelangen, reproduziert die Bedingungen des Körpers, des Verfalls und des Todes, die er überwinden will.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_5:A1","CH_97E9_5C_5:A2","CH_97E9_5C_5:A4","CH_97E9_5C_5:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:SD2","text":"Transzendenz erscheint nicht als vollzogene Bewegung nach oben, sondern als misslingende Bewegung, deren Scheitern die Tiefe der Welt sichtbar macht.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_5:A3","CH_97E9_5C_5:A8","CH_97E9_5C_5:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:SD3","text":"Die höheren Menschen werden als Instanz angerufen, weil weder Tänzer noch Tote die Erlösung aus eigener Kraft vollenden.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_5:A6","CH_97E9_5C_5:A7","CH_97E9_5C_5:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:SD4","text":"Der Tod ist als aktiver, materiell weiterarbeitender Zusammenhang organisiert und nicht als reine Abwesenheit.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_5:A5","CH_97E9_5C_5:A6","CH_97E9_5C_5:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt eine körperlose Form des Aufstiegs aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:DNX2","text":"Es schließt eine unmittelbare Identität von Ekstase und Erlösung aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:DNX3","text":"Es schließt einen Tod aus, der keinerlei Restbewegung, Stimme oder Arbeit enthält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:DNX4","text":"Es schließt eine geschlossene Welt aus, in der die Tiefe durch einen einmaligen Aufstieg erschöpft wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:DNX5","text":"Es schließt eine höhere Instanz aus, deren bloße Anrufung die Toten tatsächlich erlöst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:SNX1","text":"Unmöglich ist eine Erlösung, die den Körper, den Verfall und die Zeit nicht durchquert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:SNX2","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist ein endgültiger Abschluss zwischen Leben, Tod und Welt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:SNX3","text":"Unzulässig ist die Gleichsetzung von Höhe mit Befreiung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:SNX4","text":"Versperrt bleibt die Möglichkeit, dass die Welt durch ekstatische Selbstüberschreitung stillgelegt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:FGS1","text":"Bewegungsimpuls → Anspruch auf Erdbeherrschung → Setzung des Tanzes als Aufstieg.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:FGS2","text":"Körperliche Bedingung → Differenz von Bein und Flügel → Begrenzung der erreichbaren Höhe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:FGS3","text":"Unzureichende Höhe → Zusammenbruch der Lust → materielle Umwandlung von Wein, Becher und Grab.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:FGS4","text":"Fortdauernder Tod → artikulierte Forderung der Gräber → Ruf nach Erlösung und Wiedererweckung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:FGS5","text":"Ausbleibende Erlösung → Weiterarbeit von Glocke, Herz und Wurm → Rückführung der Transzendenz in die Tiefe der Welt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:FGS6","text":"Die Maschine erzeugt aus dem Aufstiegsversuch keine Befreiung, sondern eine vertiefte Sichtbarkeit seiner materiellen Gegenbedingungen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:AF1","text":"Ekstatische Bewegung → Anspruch auf Herrschaft → körperliche Begrenzung → unzureichende Höhe → Verfall der Lust → Forderung der Toten → erfolglose Anrufung der höheren Menschen → fortdauernde Arbeit von Zeit, Körper und Verwesung → Tiefe der Welt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:ME1","text":"Aufstieg wird von einer räumlichen Bewegung zu einem Test der körperlichen Begrenzung umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:ME2","text":"Das Grab wird von einem Endpunkt zu einem sprechenden und fordernden Übergangszustand umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:ME3","text":"Lust und Verfall erscheinen als aufeinanderfolgende Zustände desselben materiellen Prozesses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:ME4","text":"Die höhere Stellung wird von einer erreichten Position zu einer nicht eingelösten Verantwortung gegenüber den Toten umgezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:ME5","text":"Tiefe bezeichnet nicht bloß räumliche Unterseite, sondern die nicht stillstellbare Produktivität von Welt, Zeit und Verwesung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:ALT1","text":"Surface — Tanz, Fliegen, Wein, Gräber, Glocke und Würmer bilden die unmittelbare Bild- und Handlungsebene.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Körpergrenze vermittelt zwischen Aufstiegsabsicht, Lustverlust und fortdauerndem Verfall.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text verschiebt die Frage von der erfolgreichen Selbstüberhöhung zur unbewältigten Aufgabe, die Toten zu erlösen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Sein erscheint als tiefer, zeitlich fortlaufender Prozess, in dem Tod und Leben durch Restbewegungen verbunden bleiben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um den Übergang von ekstatischer Bewegung zu misslingender Transzendenz zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:MRT2","text":"Die Relation zwischen den „höheren Menschen“ und der geforderten Erlösung bleibt absichtlich unterbestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Erlösung als Forderung und nicht als vollzogene Lösung verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Verbindung liegt in der Kette von körperlicher Begrenzung, Lustverlust und materieller Weiterarbeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:MRT5","text":"Die Spannung zwischen Tanz als Aufstieg und Welt als Tiefe wird nicht aufgelöst, sondern als generatives Prinzip erhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, weil sie das Scheitern nicht als Endpunkt, sondern als Übergang zur tieferen Weltstruktur behandelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T192017116786Z_eadfe669","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"5.","source_sha256":"6de892b5610da9d1f2d78d28ce56b16308de05d1a475b5cbf1bbf0d2b1bdd330","sha256":"aa3d75f5de5d3526c59d7763904514824a400e88bdcf9068c7c804982b08598b","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:20:17.119142+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:AS1","text":"Ecstatic movement is posited as a possibility of mastering the earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:AS2","text":"Dance produces ascent, yet remains bound to the body.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:AS3","text":"Bodily inadequacy transforms ascent into failure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:AS4","text":"With failure, pleasure, wine, vessel, and grave disintegrate into material forms of decay.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:AS5","text":"The dead articulate the unresolved need for redemption and awakening.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:AS6","text":"The appeal to the higher humans intensifies the demand without providing the condition for its fulfilment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:AS7","text":"The continued existence of bell, heart, woodworm, and heart-worm returns failed transcendence to a deep world that continues to operate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:A1","text":"Movement and dance open up the idea of a possible mastery over the earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:A2","text":"The body limits ascent because a leg is not a wing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:A3","text":"The dancers' ascent remains below the required height.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:A4","text":"Initial pleasure is temporally and materially transient.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:A5","text":"The decay of pleasure transforms stimulants and vessels into signs of disintegration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:A6","text":"The graves preserve an unfulfilled demand for redemption.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:A7","text":"Redemption is conceived as liberation of the dead and as reawakening of the corpses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:A8","text":"The continued existence of heart, worm, and bell prevents the completion of the death process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:A9","text":"The world possesses a depth that is not annulled by ecstatic movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:NX1","text":"Dance is not flying.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:NX2","text":"The leg is not a wing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:NX3","text":"The attained height is not sufficient transcendence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:NX4","text":"Pleasure is not enduring redemption.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:NX5","text":"Wine does not remain wine, and the cup does not remain an enduring vessel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:NX6","text":"The grave is not a completed and silent endpoint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:NX7","text":"The appeal to the higher humans does not directly bring about the redemption of the dead.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:NX8","text":"Moon-intoxication does not annul the night.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:D1","text":"Every movement toward height simultaneously produces proof of its bodily limitation.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_5:A1","CH_97E9_5C_5:A2","CH_97E9_5C_5:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:D2","text":"The failure of ascent makes initial pleasure appear as a temporary state.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_5:A3","CH_97E9_5C_5:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:D3","text":"Material decay translates the end of pleasure into a series of transformations.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_5:A4","CH_97E9_5C_5:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:D4","text":"The dead are constructed not as silent absence but as a persisting demand.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_5:A6","CH_97E9_5C_5:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:D5","text":"Redemption takes the form of an impossible or not-yet-accomplished transgression of death.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_5:A6","CH_97E9_5C_5:A7","CH_97E9_5C_5:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:D6","text":"Despite the appeal for redemption, the world remains effective as a deep process.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_5:A7","CH_97E9_5C_5:A8","CH_97E9_5C_5:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:SD1","text":"The attempt to reach beyond the earth through dance reproduces the conditions of body, decay, and death that it seeks to overcome.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_5:A1","CH_97E9_5C_5:A2","CH_97E9_5C_5:A4","CH_97E9_5C_5:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:SD2","text":"Transcendence appears not as an accomplished movement upward, but as a failing movement whose failure makes the depth of the world visible.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_5:A3","CH_97E9_5C_5:A8","CH_97E9_5C_5:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:SD3","text":"The higher humans are invoked as an agency because neither dancers nor dead accomplish redemption through their own power.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_5:A6","CH_97E9_5C_5:A7","CH_97E9_5C_5:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:SD4","text":"Death is organized as an active, materially continuing nexus and not as pure absence.","refs":["CH_97E9_5C_5:A5","CH_97E9_5C_5:A6","CH_97E9_5C_5:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:DNX1","text":"The system excludes a bodiless form of ascent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:DNX2","text":"It excludes an immediate identity of ecstasy and redemption.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:DNX3","text":"It excludes a death that contains no residual movement, voice, or work.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:DNX4","text":"It excludes a closed world in which depth would be exhausted by a one-time ascent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:DNX5","text":"It excludes a higher agency whose mere invocation actually redeems the dead.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:SNX1","text":"Impossible is a redemption that does not pass through the body, decay, and time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:SNX2","text":"Unavailable is a final closure between life, death, and world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:SNX3","text":"Impermissible is the equation of height with liberation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:SNX4","text":"Blocked remains the possibility that the world is brought to a standstill through ecstatic self-transcendence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:FGS1","text":"Impulse toward movement → claim to mastery over the earth → positing of dance as ascent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:FGS2","text":"Bodily condition → difference between leg and wing → limitation of attainable height.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:FGS3","text":"Insufficient height → collapse of pleasure → material transformation of wine, cup, and grave.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:FGS4","text":"Continuing death → articulated demand of the graves → call for redemption and reawakening.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:FGS5","text":"Absent redemption → continued operation of bell, heart, and worm → return of transcendence to the depth of the world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:FGS6","text":"From the attempt at ascent, the machine produces not liberation but a deepened visibility of its material counterconditions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:AF1","text":"Ecstatic movement → claim to mastery → bodily limitation → insufficient height → decay of pleasure → demand of the dead → unsuccessful invocation of the higher humans → continuing work of time, body, and decomposition → depth of the world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:ME1","text":"Ascent is remapped from a spatial movement into a test of bodily limitation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:ME2","text":"The grave is reclassified from an endpoint into a speaking and demanding transitional state.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:ME3","text":"Pleasure and decay appear as successive states of the same material process.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:ME4","text":"The higher position is redrawn from an attained position into an unfulfilled responsibility toward the dead.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:ME5","text":"Depth denotes not merely a spatial underside, but the productivity of world, time, and decomposition that cannot be brought to a standstill.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:ALT1","text":"Surface — Dance, flying, wine, graves, bell, and worms constitute the immediate level of image and action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:ALT2","text":"Structural — The bodily limit mediates between the intention of ascent, loss of pleasure, and continuing decay.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text shifts the question from successful self-elevation to the unresolved task of redeeming the dead.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Being appears as a deep, temporally continuous process in which death and life remain connected through residual movements.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the transition from ecstatic movement to failing transcendence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:MRT2","text":"The relation between the „higher humans“ and the demanded redemption remains deliberately underdetermined.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as redemption is understood as a demand and not as an accomplished solution.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:MRT4","text":"Its strongest connection lies in the chain of bodily limitation, loss of pleasure, and material continued operation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:MRT5","text":"The tension between dance as ascent and world as depth is not resolved, but preserved as a generative principle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_5C_5:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement because it treats failure not as an endpoint, but as a transition to the deeper world structure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_5C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_5C_5@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_5C_5:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song","source_section_label":"5.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Four and Last"],"reading_title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 5","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","The Night-Wanderer’s Song","5."],"original_title":"5."}],"source_title_context":"Das Nachtwandler-Lied","source_section_label":"5.","source_title_hierarchy":["Vierter und letzter Theil"],"reading_title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 5","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","The Night-Wanderer’s Song","5."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 175","title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 5","context":"Part Four and Last","original_context":"Vierter und letzter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Das Nachtwandler-Lied · 5"},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5","layer":"CH","title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 6","order":176,"parents":["RAW_97E9_6C_5"],"revision":"CH_97E9_6C_5@R001","sha256":"350c459560861052df55cf3c254ef5dbd5840e0dbe2826861834b9733ed95a3a","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:AS1","text":"Eine wiederkehrende, entfernte Tonquelle wird als Träger einer Liebes- und Erinnerungserfahrung gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:AS2","text":"Durch akkumulierten, generationenübergreifenden Schmerz gewinnt die Stimme Reife.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:AS3","text":"Die gereifte Stimme überträgt ihre Reife auf die Welt und macht sie als sterbende Fülle sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:AS4","text":"Die verborgene Qualität dieser Welt erscheint nicht als Erkenntnis, sondern als Geruch einer Ewigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:AS5","text":"Die Wahrnehmung dieses Geruchs privilegiert die höheren Menschen und mündet in die Behauptung einer Welttiefe jenseits des Tages.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:A1","text":"Der Ton der Leier trägt eine entfernte Beziehung zu den Teichen der Liebe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:A2","text":"Die Leier ist zugleich eine alte Glocke und bewahrt zeitliche Tiefe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:A3","text":"Schmerz schreibt sich unmittelbar in das Herz der Leier ein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:A4","text":"Vaterschmerz, Väterschmerz und Urväterschmerz bilden eine generationenübergreifende Schmerzfolge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:A5","text":"Die Einschreibung des Schmerzes lässt die Rede der Leier reif werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:A6","text":"Reife verbindet das Einsiedlerherz, den goldenen Herbst, den Nachmittag und die bräunende Traube.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:A7","text":"Die Welt selbst wird als gereift und dem Sterben nahe bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:A8","text":"Das Sterben der Welt ist als Glücksüberschuss und nicht als bloßer Verlust bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:A9","text":"Die Ewigkeit besitzt eine heimlich aufquellende, sinnlich wahrnehmbare Duftgestalt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:A10","text":"Die höheren Menschen können diese verborgene Duftgestalt wahrnehmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:A11","text":"Der Gesang des Sterbeglücks behauptet eine Welttiefe, die über die Erscheinung des Tages hinausgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:NX1","text":"Die eigentliche Bedeutung des Tons ist nicht gegenwärtig, sondern fern und vergangen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:NX2","text":"Die Reife der Rede ist nicht unmittelbare Jugend oder Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:NX3","text":"Die Welt ist nicht auf die sichtbare Oberfläche des Tages reduzierbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:NX4","text":"Das Glück der Welt ist nicht von ihrem Sterben getrennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:NX5","text":"Die Ewigkeit ist nicht offen und direkt verfügbar, sondern quillt heimlich hervor.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:NX6","text":"Die Wahrnehmung der Welttiefe ist nicht für jede menschliche Position gleichermaßen zugänglich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:D1","text":"Entfernung steigert den Ton von einer bloßen Erinnerung zu einer Quelle existenzieller Liebe.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_5:A1","CH_97E9_6C_5:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:D2","text":"Schmerz erzeugt keine Verstummung, sondern eine gereifte Sprache.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_5:A3","CH_97E9_6C_5:A4","CH_97E9_6C_5:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:D3","text":"Die zeitliche und genealogische Tiefe des Schmerzes wird in sprachliche Reife transformiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_5:A4","CH_97E9_6C_5:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:D4","text":"Reife ordnet individuelle Einsamkeit und kosmische Weltentwicklung derselben Form zu.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_5:A6","CH_97E9_6C_5:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:D5","text":"Das Ende der Welt erscheint als Vollendung einer überreifen Fülle.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_5:A7","CH_97E9_6C_5:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:D6","text":"Der Zugang zur Ewigkeit erfolgt über eine atmosphärische Wahrnehmung und nicht über begriffliche Demonstration.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_5:A9","CH_97E9_6C_5:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:D7","text":"Die sinnliche Wahrnehmung des Duftes bestätigt die Existenz einer nicht sichtbaren Welttiefe.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_5:A9","CH_97E9_6C_5:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:SD1","text":"Das System verwandelt akkumulierten genealogischen Schmerz in ein Medium kosmischer Erkenntnis.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_5:A3","CH_97E9_6C_5:A4","CH_97E9_6C_5:A5","CH_97E9_6C_5:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:SD2","text":"Reife bezeichnet zugleich sprachliche Vollendung, kosmische Sättigung und die Bereitschaft zum Sterben.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_5:A5","CH_97E9_6C_5:A6","CH_97E9_6C_5:A7","CH_97E9_6C_5:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:SD3","text":"Die tiefere Welt wird nicht durch Distanzierung vom Sinnlichen, sondern durch eine gesteigerte Sinnlichkeit erschlossen.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_5:A9","CH_97E9_6C_5:A10","CH_97E9_6C_5:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:SD4","text":"Der Text verschiebt die Grenze zwischen Tod und Glück, indem er den Tod als höchste Intensität des Glücks codiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_5:A7","CH_97E9_6C_5:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:DNX1","text":"Eine schmerzfreie oder genealogisch unbelastete Sprache wird als unfähig zur Reife ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:DNX2","text":"Eine Welt, deren Ende bloßes Scheitern oder Vernichtung wäre, wird ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:DNX3","text":"Eine ausschließlich sichtbare, gegenwartsgebundene Erkenntnisordnung wird ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:DNX4","text":"Eine gleichmäßig verteilte Zugänglichkeit zur Wahrheit der Welt wird ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:DNX5","text":"Eine Trennung von körperlicher Wahrnehmung und metaphysischer Bedeutung wird ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen bleibt eine Welt, deren Wahrheit vollständig im Tag, in der Oberfläche und in der unmittelbaren Präsenz aufgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:SNX2","text":"Unverfügbar bleibt eine Ewigkeit, die unabhängig von Stimmung, Geruch, Erinnerung und Sterbeerfahrung abstrakt gegeben wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:SNX3","text":"Unzulässig wird die Möglichkeit, Glück und Untergang als strikt entgegengesetzte Zustände zu behandeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:SNX4","text":"Die verborgene Abwesenheit einer nicht tragisch gereiften Welt strukturiert die gesamte Erkenntnisbewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:FGS1","text":"Entfernte Tonquelle → Liebeserinnerung → zeitliche und genealogische Einschreibung → gereifte Rede.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:FGS2","text":"Gereifte Rede → Übertragung der Reife auf die Welt → bräunende Traube → Todesbereitschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:FGS3","text":"Todesbereitschaft → Glücksüberschuss → heimlicher Ewigkeitsduft → privilegierte Wahrnehmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:FGS4","text":"Privilegierte Wahrnehmung → Gesang des Sterbeglücks → Behauptung einer Welttiefe jenseits des Tages.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:FGS5","text":"Schmerz wird nicht beseitigt, sondern als Vermittlungsstufe verwendet: Schmerz → Reife → Sinnlichkeit → metaphysische Tiefe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:AF1","text":"Ferner Erinnerungston → genealogisch eingeschriebener Schmerz → gereifte Stimme → gereifte Welt → glückliches Sterben → verborgener Ewigkeitsduft → Welttiefe jenseits des Tages.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:AF2","text":"Individuelle Einsamkeit → kosmische Reife → privilegierte Wahrnehmung → ontologische Neubestimmung der Welt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:ME1","text":"Schmerz wird von einem passiven Leiden zu einer produktiven Quelle sprachlicher und kosmischer Reife umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:ME2","text":"Tod und Glück werden nicht länger als Gegensätze, sondern als ineinander gesteigerte Zustände klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:ME3","text":"Erkenntnis wird von sichtbarer Erklärung auf atmosphärische, olfaktorische und musikalische Wahrnehmung verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:ME4","text":"Die Welt wird von einer tageshellen Oberfläche zu einer geschichteten, verborgenen Tiefe umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:ME5","text":"Die höheren Menschen werden als Wahrnehmungsposition und nicht lediglich als soziale Rangordnung bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:ALT1","text":"Surface: Eine alte Leier beziehungsweise Glocke singt von Schmerz, Reife, Glück und Sterben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:ALT2","text":"Structural: Genealogisch akkumulierte Schmerzen erzeugen eine gereifte Stimme, die individuelle und kosmische Zeit verbindet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Der Zugang zur Welttiefe wird an eine gesteigerte Wahrnehmungsfähigkeit der höheren Menschen gebunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Realität ist tiefer als ihre tageshelle Erscheinung; Reife führt nicht aus der Zeit hinaus, sondern in eine glückliche Todesnähe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um die Bewegung von Ton über Schmerz und Reife zu Weltentiefe zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob die Welttiefe ontologisch, poetisch oder ausschließlich stimmungshaft gemeint ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Sterben als Vollendung und nicht als Negation der Reife gelesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Verbindung liegt in der Kopplung von genealogischem Schmerz, sprachlicher Reife und kosmischer Tiefe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:MRT5","text":"Die zentrale Spannung liegt zwischen der Behauptung einer Weltwahrheit und ihrer Vermittlung durch subjektive Geruchs-, Ton- und Glückserfahrung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung entsteht daraus, dass die Ewigkeit zugleich heimlich verborgen und sinnlich wahrnehmbar ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung des Textes, verliert jedoch notwendigerweise die rhythmische und klangliche Evidenz seiner Schlussbehauptung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T192250839949Z_4075a0c5","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"6.","source_sha256":"350c459560861052df55cf3c254ef5dbd5840e0dbe2826861834b9733ed95a3a","sha256":"708a17c56e2ae4574e420b128fc5f66c3e10d878806424422d0f1a5fa5c7d612","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:22:50.843319+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:AS1","text":"A recurring, distant source of sound is posited as the bearer of an experience of love and remembrance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:AS2","text":"Through accumulated, transgenerational pain, the voice gains maturity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:AS3","text":"The matured voice transfers its maturity to the world and makes it visible as dying fullness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:AS4","text":"The hidden quality of this world appears not as knowledge, but as the scent of an eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:AS5","text":"The perception of this scent privileges the higher human beings and culminates in the assertion of a depth of world beyond the day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:A1","text":"The sound of the lyre bears a distant relation to the ponds of love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:A2","text":"The lyre is at once an old bell and preserves temporal depth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:A3","text":"Pain inscribes itself directly into the heart of the lyre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:A4","text":"Father-pain, fathers-pain, and forefathers-pain form a transgenerational sequence of pain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:A5","text":"The inscription of pain lets the speech of the lyre mature.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:A6","text":"Maturity connects the hermit's heart, golden autumn, the afternoon, and the browning grape.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:A7","text":"The world itself is determined as matured and close to dying.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:A8","text":"The dying of the world is determined as a surplus of happiness and not as mere loss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:A9","text":"Eternity possesses a secretly welling-up, sensuously perceptible form of scent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:A10","text":"The higher human beings can perceive this hidden form of scent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:A11","text":"The song of the happiness of dying asserts a depth of world that goes beyond the appearance of the day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:NX1","text":"The actual meaning of the sound is not present, but distant and past.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:NX2","text":"The maturity of speech is not immediate youth or immediacy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:NX3","text":"The world cannot be reduced to the visible surface of the day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:NX4","text":"The happiness of the world is not separate from its dying.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:NX5","text":"Eternity is not openly and directly available, but wells up secretly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:NX6","text":"The perception of the depth of world is not equally accessible to every human position.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:D1","text":"Distance elevates the sound from a mere remembrance to a source of existential love.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_5:A1","CH_97E9_6C_5:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:D2","text":"Pain produces not silence, but a matured language.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_5:A3","CH_97E9_6C_5:A4","CH_97E9_6C_5:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:D3","text":"The temporal and genealogical depth of pain is transformed into linguistic maturity.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_5:A4","CH_97E9_6C_5:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:D4","text":"Maturity assigns individual solitude and cosmic world-development to the same form.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_5:A6","CH_97E9_6C_5:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:D5","text":"The end of the world appears as the completion of an overripe fullness.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_5:A7","CH_97E9_6C_5:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:D6","text":"Access to eternity takes place through an atmospheric perception and not through conceptual demonstration.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_5:A9","CH_97E9_6C_5:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:D7","text":"The sensuous perception of the scent confirms the existence of a non-visible depth of world.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_5:A9","CH_97E9_6C_5:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:SD1","text":"The system transforms accumulated genealogical pain into a medium of cosmic knowledge.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_5:A3","CH_97E9_6C_5:A4","CH_97E9_6C_5:A5","CH_97E9_6C_5:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:SD2","text":"Maturity denotes at once linguistic completion, cosmic saturation, and readiness for dying.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_5:A5","CH_97E9_6C_5:A6","CH_97E9_6C_5:A7","CH_97E9_6C_5:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:SD3","text":"The deeper world is disclosed not through distancing from the sensuous, but through an intensified sensuousness.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_5:A9","CH_97E9_6C_5:A10","CH_97E9_6C_5:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:SD4","text":"The text shifts the boundary between death and happiness by coding death as the highest intensity of happiness.","refs":["CH_97E9_6C_5:A7","CH_97E9_6C_5:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:DNX1","text":"A painless or genealogically unburdened language is excluded as incapable of maturity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:DNX2","text":"A world whose end would be mere failure or annihilation is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:DNX3","text":"An order of knowledge that is exclusively visible and bound to the present is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:DNX4","text":"An evenly distributed accessibility to the truth of the world is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:DNX5","text":"A separation of bodily perception and metaphysical meaning is excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:SNX1","text":"Excluded remains a world whose truth is wholly exhausted in the day, the surface, and immediate presence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:SNX2","text":"Unavailable remains an eternity that would be abstractly given independently of mood, scent, remembrance, and the experience of dying.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:SNX3","text":"The possibility of treating happiness and downfall as strictly opposed states becomes inadmissible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:SNX4","text":"The hidden absence of a world not tragically matured structures the entire movement of knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:FGS1","text":"Distant source of sound → remembrance of love → temporal and genealogical inscription → matured speech.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:FGS2","text":"Matured speech → transfer of maturity to the world → browning grape → readiness for death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:FGS3","text":"Readiness for death → surplus of happiness → secret scent of eternity → privileged perception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:FGS4","text":"Privileged perception → song of the happiness of dying → assertion of a depth of world beyond the day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:FGS5","text":"Pain is not eliminated, but used as an intermediate stage: pain → maturity → sensuousness → metaphysical depth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:AF1","text":"Distant sound of remembrance → genealogically inscribed pain → matured voice → matured world → happy dying → hidden scent of eternity → depth of world beyond the day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:AF2","text":"Individual solitude → cosmic maturity → privileged perception → ontological redetermination of the world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:ME1","text":"Pain is remapped from passive suffering into a productive source of linguistic and cosmic maturity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:ME2","text":"Death and happiness are no longer classified as opposites, but as states intensified into one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:ME3","text":"Knowledge is shifted from visible explanation to atmospheric, olfactory, and musical perception.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:ME4","text":"The world is remapped from a daylight-bright surface to a layered, hidden depth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:ME5","text":"The higher human beings are determined as a position of perception and not merely as a social hierarchy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:ALT1","text":"Surface: An old lyre or bell sings of pain, maturity, happiness, and dying.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:ALT2","text":"Structural: Genealogically accumulated pains produce a matured voice that connects individual and cosmic time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Access to the depth of world is bound to an intensified capacity for perception of the higher human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Reality is deeper than its daylight-bright appearance; maturity does not lead out of time, but into a happy proximity to death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct the movement from sound through pain and maturity to depth of world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether the depth of world is meant ontologically, poetically, or exclusively as a matter of mood.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent provided that dying is read as completion and not as the negation of maturity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:MRT4","text":"Its strongest connection lies in the coupling of genealogical pain, linguistic maturity, and cosmic depth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:MRT5","text":"The central tension lies between the assertion of a world-truth and its mediation through subjective experiences of scent, sound, and happiness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:MRT6","text":"A further tension arises from the fact that eternity is at once secretly hidden and sensuously perceptible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_6C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_6C_5:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the text, but necessarily loses the rhythmic and sonic evidence of its concluding assertion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_6C_5@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_6C_5:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song","source_section_label":"6.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Four and Last"],"reading_title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 6","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","The Night-Wanderer’s Song","6."],"original_title":"6."}],"source_title_context":"Das Nachtwandler-Lied","source_section_label":"6.","source_title_hierarchy":["Vierter und letzter Theil"],"reading_title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 6","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","The Night-Wanderer’s Song","6."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 176","title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 6","context":"Part Four and Last","original_context":"Vierter und letzter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Das Nachtwandler-Lied · 6"},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5","layer":"CH","title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 7","order":177,"parents":["RAW_97E9_7C_5"],"revision":"CH_97E9_7C_5@R001","sha256":"231585f1e486e7f34a1ae1ce2ada935fb76e8e209ec4c04194982ae5dd96b4cc","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:AS1","text":"Der Sprecher setzt sich als reine, unberührbare und von Tag und Welt bedrohte Innerlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:AS2","text":"Die gewöhnliche Helligkeit des Tages wird gegenüber der Tiefe der Mitternacht abgewertet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:AS3","text":"Reinheit, Unbekanntheit und Stärke werden zu einem Herrschaftsanspruch über die Erde verbunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:AS4","text":"Der Zugriff von Tag und Welt scheitert an der Tiefe des Glücks und Unglücks des Sprechers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:AS5","text":"Die gesteigerte Tiefe wird sakral aufgeladen, aber durch die Verneinung der Göttlichkeit begrenzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:AS6","text":"Das Argument bewegt sich von Abwehr über Hierarchisierung und Ausschluss zu einer nichtgöttlichen Form von Tiefe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:A1","text":"Reinheit konstituiert eine Grenze gegen Berührung und Zugriff.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:A2","text":"Die Welt des Sprechers wird als ursprünglich vollkommen gesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:A3","text":"Der Tag verkörpert plumpe, tölpelhafte und oberflächliche Erkenntnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:A4","text":"Die Mitternacht besitzt größere Helligkeit und Tiefe als der Tag.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:A5","text":"Die Reinsten, Unerkanntesten und Stärksten bilden eine privilegierte Ordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:A6","text":"Diese privilegierte Ordnung ist zur Herrschaft über die Erde bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:A7","text":"Das Innere des Sprechers ist als Schatzgrube und Goldkammer unerschöpflich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:A8","text":"Glück und Unglück des Sprechers sind tiefer als der Zugriff von Tag und Welt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:A9","text":"Angemessener Zugriff auf diese Tiefe setzt klügere Hände und einen tieferen Griff voraus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:A10","text":"Tiefe erzeugt keine Identität mit Gott oder Göttlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:A11","text":"Die sakrale Sprache der Tiefe bleibt mit einer radikalen Abgrenzung vom Göttlichen verbunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:NX1","text":"Der Sprecher ist nicht berührbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:NX2","text":"Der Sprecher ist nicht für die Hände des Tages zugänglich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:NX3","text":"Der Tag ist nicht heller als die Mitternacht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:NX4","text":"Die Welt ist nicht befugt, den Sprecher unmittelbar zu beanspruchen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:NX5","text":"Der Sprecher ist nicht bloß weltlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:NX6","text":"Der Sprecher ist nicht bloß geistlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:NX7","text":"Der Sprecher ist nicht göttlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:NX8","text":"Die Tiefe des Sprechers ist keine Gottes-Hölle.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:NX9","text":"Gewöhnlicher Zugriff genügt nicht für das Erfassen des inneren Glücks und Unglücks.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:D1","text":"Die Abwehr der Berührung verwandelt Reinheit in eine soziale und erkenntnistheoretische Ausschlussregel.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_5:A1","CH_97E9_7C_5:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:D2","text":"Die Abwertung des Tages macht Dunkelheit zur Bedingung gesteigerter Helligkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_5:A3","CH_97E9_7C_5:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:D3","text":"Die Unbekanntheit wird nicht als Mangel, sondern als Bestandteil von Stärke und Herrschaft qualifiziert.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_5:A5","CH_97E9_7C_5:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:D4","text":"Der Reichtum des Sprechers kann von der Welt begehrt, aber nicht mit gewöhnlichen Mitteln erschlossen werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_5:A7","CH_97E9_7C_5:A8","CH_97E9_7C_5:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:D5","text":"Die Tiefe des Sprechers erhält sakrale Intensität, ohne in Göttlichkeit überzugehen.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_5:A10","CH_97E9_7C_5:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:D6","text":"Der Zugriff der Welt wird als Fehladressierung behandelt, weil er den Sprecher in keine verfügbare Kategorie einordnen kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_5:A8","CH_97E9_7C_5:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:SD1","text":"Das System erzeugt eine Hierarchie, in der epistemische Unsichtbarkeit zur Voraussetzung politischer Überlegenheit wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:SD2","text":"Helligkeit, Reinheit und Tiefe werden gegen Sichtbarkeit, Berührbarkeit und öffentliche Zugänglichkeit organisiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:SD3","text":"Der Sprecher wird als transzendenznahe, aber nichttranszendente Instanz konstruiert: über der Weltordnung stehend, ohne Gott zu sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:SD4","text":"Die Welt erscheint zugleich als begehrende Instanz und als strukturell unfähiger Zugriff.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:SD5","text":"Das System stabilisiert seine Autorität durch die Verbindung von Selbstverbergung, innerem Reichtum und verweigerter Identifikation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:DNX1","text":"Wahre Tiefe darf nicht mit öffentlicher Sichtbarkeit oder gewöhnlicher Helligkeit identisch sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:DNX2","text":"Herrschaft darf nicht aus Anerkennung, Transparenz oder kommunikativer Zugänglichkeit hervorgehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:DNX3","text":"Das Wertvollste darf nicht durch Besitz, Berührung oder weltliche Einordnung verfügbar werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:DNX4","text":"Sakrale Intensität darf nicht in eine positive Gottesbestimmung aufgelöst werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:DNX5","text":"Die gewöhnliche Opposition von weltlich und geistlich reicht zur Bestimmung des Sprechers nicht aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Welt, in der Wahrheit durch Sichtbarkeit, Berührung und gemeinsame Zugänglichkeit verbürgt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine abschließende ontologische Kategorie, in der der Sprecher entweder Weltwesen, Geistwesen oder Gott sein müsste.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:SNX3","text":"Die tragende Abwesenheit ist ein angemessener, nichtgewaltsamer Zugang zu einer Tiefe, die sich nur durch Entzug behauptet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:SNX4","text":"Die versperrte Möglichkeit ist eine nicht-hierarchische Beziehung zwischen innerem Reichtum und äußerer Welt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:FGS1","text":"Reinheit → Berührungsverweigerung → Errichtung einer Außengrenze.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:FGS2","text":"Tag als Oberflächeninstanz → Mitternacht als tiefere Helligkeit → Umkehrung der gewöhnlichen Wertordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:FGS3","text":"Reinheit + Unbekanntheit + Stärke → privilegierte Ordnung → Herrschaftsanspruch über die Erde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:FGS4","text":"Innerer Reichtum → Begehren durch Welt und Tag → Scheitern des unmittelbaren Zugriffs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:FGS5","text":"Tiefe von Glück und Unglück → sakrale Aufladung → Ausschluss der Identität mit Gott.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:FGS6","text":"Verweigerte Einordnung → ontologische Zwischenposition → Stabilisierung des autonomen Sprechers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:AF1","text":"Bedrohung durch Berührung → Reinheit als Grenze → Abwertung des Tages → Vorrang der Mitternacht → Herrschaft der Verborgenen → Scheitern weltlichen Zugriffs → nichtgöttliche Tiefe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:AF2","text":"Vollkommenheitsbehauptung → Ausschluss äußerer Hände → Umkehrung der Helligkeitsordnung → politische Sakralisierung → kategoriale Unverfügbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:ME1","text":"Helligkeit wird von der sichtbaren Oberfläche des Tages auf die verborgene Tiefe der Mitternacht umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:ME2","text":"Unbekanntheit wird von einem Defizit zu einer Herrschaftsressource umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:ME3","text":"Berührung wird nicht als Nähe, sondern als unangemessene Aneignung kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:ME4","text":"Die Kategorien weltlich, geistlich und göttlich verlieren ihre erschöpfende Ordnungskraft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:ME5","text":"Glück und Unglück werden als gemeinsam verborgene Tiefenformen desselben inneren Reichtums angeordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Ein Sprecher weist Tag, Welt und Berührung zurück und behauptet Reinheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Zugänglichkeit, Sichtbarkeit und gewöhnliche Erkenntnis werden als unzureichende Formen des Zugriffs bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Überlegenheit wird durch Entzug, Verweigerung und die Umkehrung etablierter Wertungen erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Die Wirklichkeit wird in eine oberflächliche Tagesordnung und eine tiefere, hellere Mitternachtsordnung geteilt; der Sprecher bleibt außerhalb der Kategorien Welt, Geist und Gott.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome sind hinreichend, um Abwehr, Hierarchisierung, Zugriffsverweigerung und nichtgöttliche Tiefe zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob der Herrschaftsanspruch politisch, symbolisch oder rein ontologisch gemeint ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:MRT3","text":"Die interne Logik ist in der Gegenüberstellung von Tag und Mitternacht kohärent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Verbindung besteht zwischen Unzugänglichkeit, Tiefe und gesteigerter Helligkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:MRT5","text":"Die Struktur bleibt von der rhetorischen Gleichsetzung von Reinheit, Reichtum und Herrschaft abhängig.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:MRT6","text":"Der zentrale Bruch liegt in der sakralen Aufladung des Sprechers bei gleichzeitiger Verneinung jeder Göttlichkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:MRT7","text":"Ein zweiter Bruch entsteht daraus, dass die Welt den Sprecher begehrt, aber als grundsätzlich unfähig zum angemessenen Zugriff erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung von Abwehr über Umwertung zu ontologischer Unverfügbarkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T192442403632Z_122c1b2b","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"7.","source_sha256":"231585f1e486e7f34a1ae1ce2ada935fb76e8e209ec4c04194982ae5dd96b4cc","sha256":"75190b0c874e400e8a90e2410dc2a917ebd95007e19318a471bc5047463241c5","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:24:42.404537+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:AS1","text":"The speaker posits himself as pure, untouchable inwardness threatened by day and world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:AS2","text":"The ordinary brightness of day is devalued in relation to the depth of midnight.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:AS3","text":"Purity, unknownness, and strength are joined into a claim to dominion over the earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:AS4","text":"The access of day and world fails against the depth of the speaker's happiness and unhappiness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:AS5","text":"The heightened depth is sacralized, but limited by the negation of divinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:AS6","text":"The argument moves from defense, through hierarchization and exclusion, to a non-divine form of depth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:A1","text":"Purity constitutes a boundary against touch and access.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:A2","text":"The speaker's world is posited as originally perfect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:A3","text":"Day embodies crude, clumsy, and superficial knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:A4","text":"Midnight possesses greater brightness and depth than day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:A5","text":"The purest, most unrecognized, and strongest form a privileged order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:A6","text":"This privileged order is destined for dominion over the earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:A7","text":"The speaker's interior is inexhaustible as a treasure mine and gold chamber.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:A8","text":"The speaker's happiness and unhappiness are deeper than the access of day and world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:A9","text":"Appropriate access to this depth presupposes wiser hands and a deeper grasp.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:A10","text":"Depth does not produce identity with God or divinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:A11","text":"The sacred language of depth remains linked to a radical demarcation from the divine.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:NX1","text":"The speaker is not touchable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:NX2","text":"The speaker is not accessible to the hands of day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:NX3","text":"Day is not brighter than midnight.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:NX4","text":"The world is not entitled to lay immediate claim to the speaker.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:NX5","text":"The speaker is not merely worldly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:NX6","text":"The speaker is not merely spiritual.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:NX7","text":"The speaker is not divine.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:NX8","text":"The speaker's depth is no God's-Hell.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:NX9","text":"Ordinary access does not suffice for grasping inner happiness and unhappiness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:D1","text":"The defense against touch transforms purity into a social and epistemological rule of exclusion.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_5:A1","CH_97E9_7C_5:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:D2","text":"The devaluation of day makes darkness the condition of heightened brightness.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_5:A3","CH_97E9_7C_5:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:D3","text":"Unknownness is qualified not as a deficiency, but as a component of strength and dominion.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_5:A5","CH_97E9_7C_5:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:D4","text":"The speaker's wealth may be desired by the world, but cannot be opened up by ordinary means.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_5:A7","CH_97E9_7C_5:A8","CH_97E9_7C_5:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:D5","text":"The speaker's depth acquires sacred intensity without passing over into divinity.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_5:A10","CH_97E9_7C_5:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:D6","text":"The world's access is treated as misaddressing, because it cannot assign the speaker to any available category.","refs":["CH_97E9_7C_5:A8","CH_97E9_7C_5:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:SD1","text":"The system produces a hierarchy in which epistemic invisibility becomes the precondition of political superiority.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:SD2","text":"Brightness, purity, and depth are organized against visibility, touchability, and public accessibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:SD3","text":"The speaker is constructed as an instance close to transcendence, but not transcendent: standing above the worldly order without being God.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:SD4","text":"The world appears simultaneously as a desiring instance and as structurally incapable access.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:SD5","text":"The system stabilizes its authority through the connection of self-concealment, inner wealth, and refused identification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:DNX1","text":"True depth must not be identical with public visibility or ordinary brightness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:DNX2","text":"Dominion must not arise from recognition, transparency, or communicative accessibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:DNX3","text":"What is most valuable must not become available through possession, touch, or worldly classification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:DNX4","text":"Sacred intensity must not be dissolved into a positive determination of God.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:DNX5","text":"The ordinary opposition between worldly and spiritual does not suffice for determining the speaker.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a world in which truth is guaranteed through visibility, touch, and shared accessibility.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:SNX2","text":"Excluded is a final ontological category in which the speaker would have to be either a worldly being, a spiritual being, or God.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:SNX3","text":"The sustaining absence is an appropriate, non-violent access to a depth that asserts itself only through withdrawal.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:SNX4","text":"The barred possibility is a non-hierarchical relation between inner wealth and the outer world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:FGS1","text":"Purity → refusal of touch → establishment of an outer boundary.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:FGS2","text":"Day as surface instance → midnight as deeper brightness → reversal of the ordinary order of value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:FGS3","text":"Purity + unknownness + strength → privileged order → claim to dominion over the earth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:FGS4","text":"Inner wealth → desire by world and day → failure of immediate access.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:FGS5","text":"Depth of happiness and unhappiness → sacralization → exclusion of identity with God.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:FGS6","text":"Refused classification → ontological intermediate position → stabilization of the autonomous speaker.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:AF1","text":"Threat through touch → purity as boundary → devaluation of day → primacy of midnight → dominion of the hidden → failure of worldly access → non-divine depth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:AF2","text":"Claim of perfection → exclusion of external hands → reversal of the order of brightness → political sacralization → categorical unavailability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:ME1","text":"Brightness is remapped from the visible surface of day onto the hidden depth of midnight.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:ME2","text":"Unknownness is reclassified from a deficit into a resource of dominion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:ME3","text":"Touch is mapped not as proximity, but as inappropriate appropriation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:ME4","text":"The categories worldly, spiritual, and divine lose their exhaustive ordering force.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:ME5","text":"Happiness and unhappiness are arranged as jointly hidden forms of depth of the same inner wealth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** A speaker rejects day, world, and touch, and asserts purity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Accessibility, visibility, and ordinary knowledge are determined as insufficient forms of access.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Superiority is produced through withdrawal, refusal, and the reversal of established valuations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Reality is divided into a superficial order of day and a deeper, brighter order of midnight; the speaker remains outside the categories of world, spirit, and God.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:MRT1","text":"The axioms are sufficient to reconstruct defense, hierarchization, refusal of access, and non-divine depth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether the claim to dominion is meant politically, symbolically, or purely ontologically.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:MRT3","text":"The internal logic is coherent in the juxtaposition of day and midnight.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:MRT4","text":"The strongest connection exists between inaccessibility, depth, and heightened brightness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:MRT5","text":"The structure remains dependent on the rhetorical equation of purity, wealth, and dominion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:MRT6","text":"The central rupture lies in the sacralization of the speaker alongside the simultaneous negation of all divinity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:MRT7","text":"A second rupture arises from the fact that the world desires the speaker, but appears fundamentally incapable of appropriate access.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_7C_5:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement from defense through revaluation to ontological unavailability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_7C_5:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_7C_5@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_7C_5:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song","source_section_label":"7.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Four and Last"],"reading_title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 7","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","The Night-Wanderer’s Song","7."],"original_title":"7."}],"source_title_context":"Das Nachtwandler-Lied","source_section_label":"7.","source_title_hierarchy":["Vierter und letzter Theil"],"reading_title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 7","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","The Night-Wanderer’s Song","7."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 177","title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 7","context":"Part Four and Last","original_context":"Vierter und letzter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Das Nachtwandler-Lied · 7"},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7","layer":"CH","title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 8","order":178,"parents":["RAW_97E9_8C_7"],"revision":"CH_97E9_8C_7@R001","sha256":"1471f1208b38561cda76be04bb7d34da9cecda0e1ee21d36caf2b392272d19a3","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:AS1","text":"Das zentrale Problem entsteht aus der Unfähigkeit des sprechenden Ichs, selbst Träger oder Ziel des gemeinten Schmerzes zu sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:AS2","text":"Das Ich wird als bloßes Instrument einer tieferen, auf Gottes Weh gerichteten Rede neu bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:AS3","text":"Die Rede bleibt für ihre höheren Adressaten unverständlich, muss aber dennoch vor ihnen erklingen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:AS4","text":"Die zeitliche Bewegung in Abend, Nacht und Mitternacht überführt die Unverständlichkeit in eine Struktur zunehmender Tiefe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:AS5","text":"Die trunkene Mitternacht kippt in nüchterne Selbstwahrnehmung und verarbeitet ihr eigenes Weh im Traum wieder.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:AS6","text":"Die abschließende Hierarchie setzt Lust als tiefer als Herzeleid, obwohl sie aus dessen Tiefe hervorgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:A1","text":"Gottes Weh ist tiefer als die unmittelbar gegebene Welt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:A2","text":"Das sprechende Ich ist nicht der eigentliche Gegenstand der geforderten Erkenntnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:A3","text":"Das Ich fungiert als Instrument, durch das eine fremde oder höhere Tiefe sprechen muss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:A4","text":"Die Stimme des Instruments ist für die höheren Menschen unverständlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:A5","text":"Unverständlichkeit hebt den Zwang zur Rede nicht auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:A6","text":"Die Zeitbewegung von Jugend und Mittag zu Abend, Nacht und Mitternacht ist eine Bewegung in Richtung Tiefe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:A7","text":"Wind und Mitternacht können als sprechende, tierische oder körperliche Vorgänge erscheinen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:A8","text":"Trunkenheit und Nüchternheit bilden keine stabil getrennten Zustände.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:A9","text":"Das Weh der Mitternacht wird im Traum wiedergekaut.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:A10","text":"Die Wiederaufnahme des Wehs schließt die Wiederaufnahme der Lust ein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:A11","text":"Lust kann tiefer als Herzeleid sein, wenn das Weh bereits tief ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:NX1","text":"Das Gemeinte ist nicht im sprechenden Ich zu suchen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:NX2","text":"Die Rede ist keine verständliche Mitteilung an die höheren Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:NX3","text":"Das Instrument ist keine souveräne Quelle seiner eigenen Stimme.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:NX4","text":"Mitternacht ist nicht bloß chronologische Nacht, sondern eine sprechende und empfindende Tiefe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:NX5","text":"Trunkenheit ist kein eindeutiger Gegenbegriff zu Nüchternheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:NX6","text":"Weh ist nicht die letzte oder tiefste Intensität des Erlebens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:NX7","text":"Lust ist nicht als oberflächliche Aufhebung des Schmerzes bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:D1","text":"Die Selbstentwertung des Sprechers schützt die behauptete Tiefe des gemeinten Schmerzes vor einer Reduktion auf persönliche Selbstdarstellung.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_7:A1","CH_97E9_8C_7:A2","CH_97E9_8C_7:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:D2","text":"Die Unverständlichkeit der Stimme wird nicht als Scheitern, sondern als notwendige Form ihrer instrumentellen Funktion erzeugt.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_7:A3","CH_97E9_8C_7:A4","CH_97E9_8C_7:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:D3","text":"Die Abfolge der Tageszeiten kartiert eine Steigerung von zeitlicher Oberfläche zu nächtlicher Tiefe.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_7:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:D4","text":"Die Vermenschlichung von Wind und Mitternacht verlagert psychische Regungen in eine kosmisch-akustische Szenerie.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_7:A6","CH_97E9_8C_7:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:D5","text":"Die Frage nach dem Überschreiten der Trunkenheit erzeugt eine Sprache, die ihren eigenen Bewusstseinszustand rückwirkend problematisiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_7:A7","CH_97E9_8C_7:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:D6","text":"Das Wiederkauen im Traum macht Erinnerung, Verarbeitung und Wiederholung zu einer einzigen Bewegung des Wehs.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_7:A8","CH_97E9_8C_7:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:D7","text":"Die Lust wird nicht nach dem Weh, sondern als dessen noch tiefere Wiederaufnahme bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_7:A9","CH_97E9_8C_7:A10","CH_97E9_8C_7:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:SD1","text":"Tiefe wird als fortgesetzte Selbstüberschreitung organisiert: vom Ich zu Gottes Weh, vom Tag zur Mitternacht und vom Weh zur Lust.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_7:A1","CH_97E9_8C_7:A2","CH_97E9_8C_7:A6","CH_97E9_8C_7:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:SD2","text":"Die Rede gewinnt ihre Notwendigkeit gerade aus der Unmöglichkeit, ihr Gemeintes verständlich zu übermitteln.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_7:A3","CH_97E9_8C_7:A4","CH_97E9_8C_7:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:SD3","text":"Das System erzeugt eine rekursive Tiefenlogik, in der jede erreichte Intensität durch ihre Wiederaufnahme und Umkehr überboten wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_7:A8","CH_97E9_8C_7:A9","CH_97E9_8C_7:A10","CH_97E9_8C_7:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:SD4","text":"Das Sprechen erscheint zugleich als Ausdruck, Entäußerung und unverständliche Selbstbewegung einer nicht souveränen Instanz.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_7:A2","CH_97E9_8C_7:A3","CH_97E9_8C_7:A4","CH_97E9_8C_7:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:DNX1","text":"Das System kann nicht auf der Annahme beruhen, dass subjektive Selbstaussage den tiefsten Sinn unmittelbar zugänglich macht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:DNX2","text":"Es kann nicht voraussetzen, dass Verständlichkeit die Voraussetzung wahrer oder notwendiger Rede ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:DNX3","text":"Es muss die Gleichsetzung von Tiefe und Schmerz ausschließen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:DNX4","text":"Es muss die Trennung von Bewusstseinszustand, Ausdruck und Traum ausschließen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:DNX5","text":"Es kann keine lineare Steigerung akzeptieren, in der die letzte Intensität einfach am Ende einer festen Rangordnung steht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Kommunikation, in der Sprecher, Aussage und Verstehen stabil zusammenfallen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein autonomes Ich als Ursprung derjenigen Tiefe, die durch es hindurch spricht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Welt, deren Ordnung zwischen menschlicher Stimme, tierischem Laut und kosmischem Geschehen eindeutig unterscheidet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Möglichkeit, das Weh als abschließende Negativität zu behandeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:SNX5","text":"Ausgeschlossen bleibt eine endgültige Mitteilbarkeit der göttlichen oder mitternächtlichen Tiefe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:FGS1","text":"Nicht-Identität des Ichs mit dem gemeinten Weh → Verweisung auf Gottes Weh → Instrumentalisierung des Sprechers.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:FGS2","text":"Instrumentalisierung → notwendige Rede trotz Unverständlichkeit → Stabilisierung der Stimme als nicht-souveräne Äußerung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:FGS3","text":"Zeitlicher Abstieg → Verwandlung von Wind und Nacht in sprechende Körper → Externalisierung innerer Intensität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:FGS4","text":"Trunkenheit → mögliche Überschreitung in Nüchternheit → rückläufiges Wiederkauen im Traum.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:FGS5","text":"Wiederkauen des Wehs → Einschluss der Lust → Setzung der Lust als tiefere Intensität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:AF1","text":"Selbstzurückweisung → Verweisung auf Gottes Weh → unverständliche instrumentelle Rede → zeitlicher Abstieg zur Mitternacht → rekursive Traumverarbeitung → Überordnung der Lust über das Herzeleid.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:ME1","text":"Das sprechende Ich wird vom Zentrum des Sinns zum Medium einer fremden Tiefe umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:ME2","text":"Unverständlichkeit wird von einem Kommunikationsdefizit zu einer konstitutiven Eigenschaft der Rede umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:ME3","text":"Die Tageszeitfolge wird von einer Chronologie zu einer Intensitäts- und Tiefenkarte transformiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:ME4","text":"Die Grenze zwischen Naturlaut, psychischem Ausdruck und dichterischer Stimme wird aufgehoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:ME5","text":"Die Opposition von Lust und Leid wird in eine Tiefenrelation überführt, in der Lust das Weh nicht beseitigt, sondern überbietet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Eine unverständliche Stimme spricht von Gottes Weh, Mitternacht, Traum und Lust.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Sprecher, Instrument, Adressat, Zeit und Affekt werden so angeordnet, dass jede Ausdrucksform auf eine tiefere Schicht verweist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Der Text entzieht sich der Erwartung verständlicher Mitteilung und macht gerade die notwendige, aber unverständliche Rede zum Verfahren der Darstellung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Realität erscheint als geschichtete Intensität, in der Zeit, Traum, Natur und Affekt ineinander übergehen und Lust als tiefere Wiederholung des Wehs hervortritt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung vom nicht-souveränen Ich zur tieferen Lust zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob Gottes Weh metaphysisch, poetisch oder nur innerhalb der Stimme gesetzt ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Tiefe als Steigerung und Wiederaufnahme verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:MRT4","text":"Ihre stärkste Verbindung liegt zwischen Unverständlichkeit, Instrumentalität und notwendiger Rede.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:MRT5","text":"Die schwächste Stelle ist der Übergang von tiefem Weh zu tieferer Lust, der behauptet, aber nicht weiter begründet wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:MRT6","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, solange die Bildlichkeit von Wind, Hund und Mitternacht als strukturelle Transformation behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T192707158049Z_8768b55b","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"8.","source_sha256":"1471f1208b38561cda76be04bb7d34da9cecda0e1ee21d36caf2b392272d19a3","sha256":"7efb0e37b9b1624e74be87c6919d51bb6325d4d2f3a6e57a720c911ea068f0fc","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:27:07.160083+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:AS1","text":"The central problem arises from the inability of the speaking I to be itself the bearer or object of the intended pain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:AS2","text":"The I is redefined as a mere instrument of a discourse directed toward God's woe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:AS3","text":"The discourse remains unintelligible to its higher addressees, yet must nevertheless resound before them.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:AS4","text":"The temporal movement through evening, night, and midnight transforms unintelligibility into a structure of increasing depth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:AS5","text":"Drunken midnight turns into sober self-perception and ruminates anew upon its own woe in the dream.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:AS6","text":"The concluding hierarchy places pleasure as deeper than heartache, although it proceeds from the latter's depth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:A1","text":"God's woe is deeper than the immediately given world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:A2","text":"The speaking I is not the actual object of the demanded knowledge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:A3","text":"The I functions as an instrument through which an alien or higher depth must speak.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:A4","text":"The voice of the instrument is unintelligible to the higher humans.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:A5","text":"Unintelligibility does not annul the compulsion to speak.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:A6","text":"The temporal movement from youth and noon to evening, night, and midnight is a movement in the direction of depth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:A7","text":"Wind and midnight can appear as speaking, animal, or bodily processes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:A8","text":"Drunkenness and sobriety do not constitute stably separate states.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:A9","text":"The woe of midnight is ruminated anew in the dream.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:A10","text":"The resumption of woe includes the resumption of pleasure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:A11","text":"Pleasure can be deeper than heartache when woe is already deep.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:NX1","text":"What is meant is not to be sought in the speaking I.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:NX2","text":"The discourse is not an intelligible communication to the higher humans.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:NX3","text":"The instrument is not a sovereign source of its own voice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:NX4","text":"Midnight is not merely chronological night, but a speaking and feeling depth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:NX5","text":"Drunkenness is not an unambiguous counterconcept to sobriety.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:NX6","text":"Woe is not the final or deepest intensity of experience.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:NX7","text":"Pleasure is not determined as a superficial overcoming of pain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:D1","text":"The speaker's self-devaluation protects the asserted depth of the intended pain from reduction to personal self-presentation.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_7:A1","CH_97E9_8C_7:A2","CH_97E9_8C_7:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:D2","text":"The unintelligibility of the voice is generated not as failure, but as a necessary form of its instrumental function.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_7:A3","CH_97E9_8C_7:A4","CH_97E9_8C_7:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:D3","text":"The sequence of times of day maps an intensification from temporal surface to nocturnal depth.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_7:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:D4","text":"The anthropomorphization of wind and midnight displaces psychic stirrings into a cosmic-acoustic scene.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_7:A6","CH_97E9_8C_7:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:D5","text":"The question of surpassing drunkenness generates a language that retrospectively problematizes its own state of consciousness.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_7:A7","CH_97E9_8C_7:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:D6","text":"Rumination in the dream makes memory, processing, and repetition into a single movement of woe.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_7:A8","CH_97E9_8C_7:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:D7","text":"Pleasure is determined not after woe, but as its still deeper resumption.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_7:A9","CH_97E9_8C_7:A10","CH_97E9_8C_7:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:SD1","text":"Depth is organized as continued self-surpassing: from the I to God's woe, from day to midnight, and from woe to pleasure.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_7:A1","CH_97E9_8C_7:A2","CH_97E9_8C_7:A6","CH_97E9_8C_7:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:SD2","text":"The discourse gains its necessity precisely from the impossibility of intelligibly conveying what it means.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_7:A3","CH_97E9_8C_7:A4","CH_97E9_8C_7:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:SD3","text":"The system generates a recursive logic of depth in which every attained intensity is surpassed through its resumption and reversal.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_7:A8","CH_97E9_8C_7:A9","CH_97E9_8C_7:A10","CH_97E9_8C_7:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:SD4","text":"Speaking appears at once as expression, externalization, and unintelligible self-movement of a non-sovereign instance.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_7:A2","CH_97E9_8C_7:A3","CH_97E9_8C_7:A4","CH_97E9_8C_7:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:DNX1","text":"The system cannot rest on the assumption that subjective self-statement makes the deepest meaning immediately accessible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:DNX2","text":"It cannot presuppose that intelligibility is the condition of true or necessary discourse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:DNX3","text":"It must exclude the equation of depth and pain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:DNX4","text":"It must exclude the separation of state of consciousness, expression, and dream.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:DNX5","text":"It cannot accept a linear intensification in which the final intensity simply stands at the end of a fixed hierarchy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a communication in which speaker, statement, and understanding stably coincide.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:SNX2","text":"Excluded is an autonomous I as the origin of the depth that speaks through it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:SNX3","text":"Excluded is a world whose order clearly distinguishes between human voice, animal sound, and cosmic event.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:SNX4","text":"Excluded is the possibility of treating woe as conclusive negativity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:SNX5","text":"Excluded remains a definitive communicability of divine or midnight depth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:FGS1","text":"Non-identity of the I with the intended woe → reference to God's woe → instrumentalization of the speaker.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:FGS2","text":"Instrumentalization → necessary discourse despite unintelligibility → stabilization of the voice as a non-sovereign utterance.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:FGS3","text":"Temporal descent → transformation of wind and night into speaking bodies → externalization of inner intensity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:FGS4","text":"Drunkenness → possible surpassing into sobriety → retrogressive rumination in the dream.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:FGS5","text":"Rumination of woe → inclusion of pleasure → positing of pleasure as deeper intensity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:AF1","text":"Self-rejection → reference to God's woe → unintelligible instrumental discourse → temporal descent to midnight → recursive dream processing → subordination of heartache to pleasure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:ME1","text":"The speaking I is remapped from the center of meaning to the medium of an alien depth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:ME2","text":"Unintelligibility is reclassified from a communicative deficit into a constitutive property of discourse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:ME3","text":"The sequence of times of day is transformed from a chronology into a map of intensity and depth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:ME4","text":"The boundary between natural sound, psychic expression, and poetic voice is abolished.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:ME5","text":"The opposition of pleasure and suffering is transferred into a relation of depth in which pleasure does not eliminate woe but surpasses it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** An unintelligible voice speaks of God's woe, midnight, dream, and pleasure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Speaker, instrument, addressee, time, and affect are arranged so that every form of expression refers to a deeper layer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** The text withdraws from the expectation of intelligible communication and makes precisely necessary yet unintelligible discourse into the procedure of representation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Reality appears as layered intensity, in which time, dream, nature, and affect pass into one another and pleasure emerges as a deeper repetition of woe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from the non-sovereign I to deeper pleasure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined whether God's woe is posited metaphysically, poetically, or only within the voice.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent, provided depth is understood as intensification and resumption.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:MRT4","text":"Its strongest connection lies between unintelligibility, instrumentality, and necessary discourse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:MRT5","text":"The weakest point is the transition from deep woe to deeper pleasure, which is asserted but not further justified.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_7:MRT6","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual argumentative movement so long as the imagery of wind, dog, and midnight is treated as structural transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_7:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_8C_7@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_8C_7:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song","source_section_label":"8.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Four and Last"],"reading_title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 8","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","The Night-Wanderer’s Song","8."],"original_title":"8."}],"source_title_context":"Das Nachtwandler-Lied","source_section_label":"8.","source_title_hierarchy":["Vierter und letzter Theil"],"reading_title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 8","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","The Night-Wanderer’s Song","8."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 178","title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 8","context":"Part Four and Last","original_context":"Vierter und letzter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Das Nachtwandler-Lied · 8"},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8","layer":"CH","title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 8","order":179,"parents":["RAW_97E9_8C_8"],"revision":"CH_97E9_8C_8@R001","sha256":"85ab96e1cf540fc47bcd5c1c9bedca4ad92630e356c116b0f58b23c8fa672b66","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:AS1","text":"Das Gedicht problematisiert das Lob des Leidenden gegenüber der Gewalt, durch die es zur Reife gebracht wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:AS2","text":"Der Schnitt wird zugleich als Grausamkeit, Reinigung und Bedingung der Vollendung bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:AS3","text":"Reife strebt auf das Ende, während Unreife am Leben festhält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:AS4","text":"Leiden wird neu bestimmt als Wille zum Weiterleben, zur Reifung und zur Überschreitung des gegenwärtigen Selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:AS5","text":"Lust widersetzt sich dieser gerichteten Überschreitung, weil sie sich selbst, ihre Dauer und ihre Wiederkehr begehrt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:AS6","text":"Das Argument endet in einer unaufgelösten Doppelbewegung: Das Wehe fordert Vergehen, während das Leidende nach Fortdauer und Höherem verlangt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:A1","text":"Der Weinstock wird durch einen gewaltsamen Schnitt bearbeitet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:A2","text":"Der Schnitt erzeugt Blut und erscheint deshalb als Grausamkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:A3","text":"Das Reife ist auf Vollendung und Tod ausgerichtet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:A4","text":"Das Unreife will leben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:A5","text":"Leiden will nicht bloß vergehen, sondern leben, reifen und sich verwandeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:A6","text":"Leiden ist auf ein Ferneres, Höheres und Helleres gerichtet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:A7","text":"Leiden äußert den Willen zu Erben und Kindern und damit zur Fortsetzung über das eigene Selbst hinaus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:A8","text":"Lust will weder Erben noch Kinder.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:A9","text":"Lust will sich selbst, Ewigkeit und Wiederkunft desselben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:A10","text":"Das Wehe spricht zugleich den Imperativ des Vergehens und den Imperativ der Bewegung, des Fliegens und des Aufstiegs aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:NX1","text":"Reife ist nicht bloße Lebensverlängerung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:NX2","text":"Leiden ist nicht mit dem Wunsch nach unmittelbarer Selbstvernichtung identisch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:NX3","text":"Lust ist nicht Wille zu Erbschaft, Nachkommenschaft oder Selbstüberschreitung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:NX4","text":"Ewigkeit der Lust ist nicht gerichtete Entwicklung auf ein Höheres.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:NX5","text":"Der Schnitt ist nicht nur Zerstörung, sondern eine Bedingung von Reife.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:NX6","text":"Das Lob des Weinstocks hebt die Gewalt des Winzermessers nicht auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:NX7","text":"Das Wehe bezeichnet nicht ausschließlich Stillstand, Untergang oder Passivität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:D1","text":"Die Anerkennung des Winzermessers entsteht aus der Umwandlung von Verletzung in Reifung.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_8:A1","CH_97E9_8C_8:A2","CH_97E9_8C_8:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:D2","text":"Der Wille zum Leben kann mit dem Willen zum Vergehen vermittelt sein, wenn Vergehen als Übergang zur Reife erscheint.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_8:A3","CH_97E9_8C_8:A4","CH_97E9_8C_8:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:D3","text":"Leiden erhält seine Richtung dadurch, dass es das gegenwärtige Selbst auf ein Ferneres und Höheres überschreitet.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_8:A5","CH_97E9_8C_8:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:D4","text":"Erbschaft und Kinder fungieren als Formen eines Lebenswillens, der nicht im gegenwärtigen Individuum enden will.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_8:A5","CH_97E9_8C_8:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:D5","text":"Lust bildet eine gegenläufige Zeitstruktur: Sie ersetzt Hervorbringung und Überschreitung durch Selbstidentität und Wiederkehr.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_8:A8","CH_97E9_8C_8:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:D6","text":"Das Wehe verbindet Untergang mit Steigerung, indem es Vergehen und Aufstieg in derselben Rede verschränkt.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_8:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:SD1","text":"Das Gedicht organisiert Leben nicht als Gegensatz zum Tod, sondern als gegensätzliche Formen von Fortsetzung: Reifung durch Überschreitung und Lust durch Wiederholung.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_8:A3","CH_97E9_8C_8:A5","CH_97E9_8C_8:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:SD2","text":"Gewalt wird als doppeldeutige Produktivkraft strukturiert: Sie verwundet das Lebendige und bringt es zugleich zur Vollendung.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_8:A1","CH_97E9_8C_8:A2","CH_97E9_8C_8:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:SD3","text":"Die höchste Spannung des Systems entsteht zwischen einer zukunftsgerichteten, vererbenden Lebensbewegung und einer selbstbezüglichen, ewige Gleichheit begehrenden Lust.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_8:A6","CH_97E9_8C_8:A7","CH_97E9_8C_8:A8","CH_97E9_8C_8:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:SD4","text":"Das Subjekt des Gedichts wird durch konkurrierende Willensrichtungen erzeugt: Es soll vergehen, weiterleben, sich verwandeln und zugleich wiederkehren.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_8:A5","CH_97E9_8C_8:A9","CH_97E9_8C_8:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:DNX1","text":"Das System schließt ein Leben aus, dessen einziges Ziel bloße Selbsterhaltung ohne Reifung oder Überschreitung wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:DNX2","text":"Es schließt eine Reife aus, die unabhängig von Verletzung, Schnitt oder Vergehen erreicht werden könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:DNX3","text":"Es schließt eine Zukunft aus, die lediglich Verlängerung des identischen Selbst statt Erbschaft, Kind oder Transformation wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:DNX4","text":"Es schließt eine Lust aus, die ihr Selbst durch Beziehung, Nachkommenschaft oder gerichtete Entwicklung verwirklichen würde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:DNX5","text":"Es schließt einen Schmerz aus, der nur negativ, passiv und lebensfeindlich wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Möglichkeit einer neutralen Vermittlung zwischen Leben und Tod; jede Bewegung muss als Reifung, Vergehen, Aufstieg oder Wiederkehr bestimmt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird ein unverletztes Werden: Vollendung ist nur innerhalb einer Ökonomie von Schnitt, Blut, Schmerz und Verlust denkbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Zukunft ohne Entscheidung zwischen Selbstüberschreitung und ewiger Selbstidentität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:SNX4","text":"Die verborgene Unmöglichkeit des Systems ist ein Zustand, in dem Leiden, Lust, Reife und Fortdauer dieselbe Zeit- und Willensrichtung besitzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:FGS1","text":"Verletzung → Blut → Benennung der Grausamkeit → Problem des Lobes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:FGS2","text":"Schnitt → Reifung → Vollendung → Ausrichtung auf Tod.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:FGS3","text":"Unreife → Lebenswille → Leiden → Reifungsbedürfnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:FGS4","text":"Leiden → Lebenserhaltung → Überschreitung → Ferneres/Höheres/Helleres.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:FGS5","text":"Leiden → Erben/Kinder → Fortsetzung über das Selbst hinaus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:FGS6","text":"Lust → Selbstbezug → Ewigkeit → Wiederkunft des Identischen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:FGS7","text":"Wehe → Vergehen und Brechen → Bewegung und Aufstieg → erneute Anrufung des Schmerzes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:FGS8","text":"Gegenüberstellung von gerichteter Transformation und selbstidentischer Dauer → strukturelle Unversöhnlichkeit der beiden Lebenswillen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:AF1","text":"Lob des Weinstocks → Enthüllung des gewaltsamen Schnitts → Problem der Anerkennung von Grausamkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:AF2","text":"Reife und Unreife → gegenläufige Verhältnisse zu Tod und Leben → differentielle Zeitordnung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:AF3","text":"Leiden → Wille zum Leben und zur Reifung → Ausrichtung auf Überschreitung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:AF4","text":"Überschreitung → Erben und Kinder → Zukunft jenseits des individuellen Selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:AF5","text":"Lust → Selbstbezug und Ewigkeit → Wiederkehr des Gleichen als Gegenmodell.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:AF6","text":"Wehe → Vergehen plus Aufstieg → Schluss in einer nicht aufgelösten Doppelbewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:ME1","text":"Verletzung wird von einem bloßen Schaden zu einer produktiven Bedingung von Reife umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:ME2","text":"Leben und Tod werden nicht mehr als einfache Gegensätze, sondern als unterschiedliche Modi von Entwicklung und Vollendung kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:ME3","text":"Leiden wird als gerichtete, zukunftserzeugende Kraft gegenüber der selbstbezüglichen Lust klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:ME4","text":"Nachkommenschaft wird als ontologische Überschreitung des Selbst und nicht bloß als biologische Fortsetzung sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:ME5","text":"Ewigkeit wird in zwei inkompatible Formen geteilt: Wiederholung des Identischen und Fortgang über das Selbst hinaus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:ME6","text":"Das Wehe wird als ambivalente Bewegungsform kartiert, die Auflösung und Steigerung zugleich hervorbringt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:ALT1","text":"Surface — Ein verwundeter Weinstock, ein Winzermesser, Reife, Unreife, Leiden und Lust werden in direkt anrufender Rede gegeneinandergestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:ALT2","text":"Structural — Der Text ordnet Willensformen nach ihren Beziehungen zu Gewalt, Reifung, Fortsetzung, Selbstüberschreitung und Wiederkehr.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Gegensatz zwischen Leiden und Lust verschiebt die Frage des Lebens von Selbsterhaltung auf die Wahl seiner Zeit- und Bewegungsform.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Sein erscheint entweder als Werden durch Vergehen und Überschreitung oder als ewige Wiederkehr des mit sich identischen Selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegungen von Schnitt, Reife, Leiden, Lust und Wehe zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:MRT2","text":"Die zentrale Unterscheidung zwischen zukunftsgerichteter Überschreitung und selbstidentischer Wiederkehr bleibt vollständig erhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob die Stimmen des Weinstocks, des Leidens, der Lust und des Wehes als eigenständige Instanzen oder als innere Willensformen zu lesen sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:MRT4","text":"Die interne Kohärenz beruht auf der Vermittlung von Leben und Tod durch Reifung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Struktur ist die Gegenüberstellung von Erbschaft und Wiederkunft als zwei Formen von Dauer.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:MRT6","text":"Die größte Spannung liegt darin, dass das Wehe zugleich Vergehen fordert und Bewegung, Aufstieg sowie Fortsetzung hervorruft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Argumentbewegung, sofern die Schlusswendung nicht als Auflösung, sondern als fortgesetzte Verschärfung des Widerspruchs gelesen wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T192732069295Z_b5db0f07","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"8.","source_sha256":"85ab96e1cf540fc47bcd5c1c9bedca4ad92630e356c116b0f58b23c8fa672b66","sha256":"9c6d655c0f745cf91a952bf52400bb650e5457cce36d8ffe032bddd7a18de782","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:27:32.071863+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumentative Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:AS1","text":"The poem problematizes the praise of the sufferer in relation to the violence through which it is brought to ripeness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:AS2","text":"The cut is determined simultaneously as cruelty, purification, and the condition of completion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:AS3","text":"Ripeness strives toward the end, whereas unripeness clings to life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:AS4","text":"Suffering is redefined as the will to go on living, to ripen, and to surpass the present self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:AS5","text":"Pleasure resists this directed surpassing because it desires itself, its duration, and its recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:AS6","text":"The argument ends in an unresolved double movement: woe demands passing away, while the sufferer desires continuance and something higher.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}]},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:A1","text":"The vine is worked by a violent cut.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:A2","text":"The cut produces blood and therefore appears as cruelty.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:A3","text":"What is ripe is oriented toward completion and death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:A4","text":"What is unripe wants to live.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:A5","text":"Suffering does not merely want to pass away, but to live, ripen, and transform itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:A6","text":"Suffering is directed toward something more distant, higher, and brighter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:A7","text":"Suffering expresses the will to heirs and children, and thus to continuation beyond its own self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:A8","text":"Pleasure wants neither heirs nor children.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:A9","text":"Pleasure wants itself, eternity, and the recurrence of the same.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:A10","text":"Woe simultaneously utters the imperative of passing away and the imperative of movement, flight, and ascent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:NX1","text":"Ripeness is not mere prolongation of life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:NX2","text":"Suffering is not identical with the desire for immediate self-destruction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:NX3","text":"Pleasure is not the will to inheritance, progeny, or self-surpassing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:NX4","text":"The eternity of pleasure is not directed development toward something higher.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:NX5","text":"The cut is not merely destruction, but a condition of ripeness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:NX6","text":"The praise of the vine does not annul the violence of the vintner's knife.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:NX7","text":"Woe does not designate exclusively stagnation, downfall, or passivity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:D1","text":"Recognition of the vintner's knife arises from the transformation of injury into ripening.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_8:A1","CH_97E9_8C_8:A2","CH_97E9_8C_8:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:D2","text":"The will to live can be mediated with the will to pass away when passing away appears as a transition to ripeness.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_8:A3","CH_97E9_8C_8:A4","CH_97E9_8C_8:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:D3","text":"Suffering receives its direction by surpassing the present self toward something more distant and higher.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_8:A5","CH_97E9_8C_8:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:D4","text":"Inheritance and children function as forms of a will to life that does not wish to end in the present individual.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_8:A5","CH_97E9_8C_8:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:D5","text":"Pleasure constitutes an opposing temporal structure: it replaces production and surpassing with self-identity and recurrence.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_8:A8","CH_97E9_8C_8:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:D6","text":"Woe connects downfall with intensification by intertwining passing away and ascent in the same speech.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_8:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:SD1","text":"The poem organizes life not as the opposite of death, but as opposing forms of continuation: ripening through surpassing and pleasure through repetition.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_8:A3","CH_97E9_8C_8:A5","CH_97E9_8C_8:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:SD2","text":"Violence is structured as an ambiguous productive force: it wounds what is living and at the same time brings it to completion.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_8:A1","CH_97E9_8C_8:A2","CH_97E9_8C_8:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:SD3","text":"The system's highest tension arises between a future-directed, inheriting movement of life and a self-referential pleasure desiring eternal sameness.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_8:A6","CH_97E9_8C_8:A7","CH_97E9_8C_8:A8","CH_97E9_8C_8:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:SD4","text":"The subject of the poem is produced by competing directions of will: it is to pass away, go on living, transform itself, and at the same time return.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_8:A5","CH_97E9_8C_8:A9","CH_97E9_8C_8:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:DNX1","text":"The system excludes a life whose sole goal would be mere self-preservation without ripening or surpassing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:DNX2","text":"It excludes a ripeness that could be attained independently of injury, cut, or passing away.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:DNX3","text":"It excludes a future that would be merely the prolongation of the identical self instead of inheritance, child, or transformation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:DNX4","text":"It excludes a pleasure that would realize its self through relation, progeny, or directed development.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:DNX5","text":"It excludes a pain that would be only negative, passive, and hostile to life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:SNX1","text":"Excluded is the possibility of a neutral mediation between life and death; every movement must be determined as ripening, passing away, ascent, or recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:SNX2","text":"Excluded is an uninjured becoming: completion is conceivable only within an economy of cut, blood, pain, and loss.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:SNX3","text":"Excluded is a future without a decision between self-surpassing and eternal self-identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:SNX4","text":"The system's hidden impossibility is a state in which suffering, pleasure, ripeness, and continuance possess the same temporal and volitional direction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:FGS1","text":"Injury → blood → naming of cruelty → problem of praise.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:FGS2","text":"Cut → ripening → completion → orientation toward death.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:FGS3","text":"Unripeness → will to life → suffering → need for ripening.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:FGS4","text":"Suffering → preservation of life → surpassing → something more distant/higher/brighter.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:FGS5","text":"Suffering → heirs/children → continuation beyond the self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:FGS6","text":"Pleasure → self-reference → eternity → recurrence of the identical.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:FGS7","text":"Woe → passing away and breaking → movement and ascent → renewed invocation of pain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:FGS8","text":"Opposition between directed transformation and self-identical duration → structural irreconcilability of the two wills to life.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:AF1","text":"Praise of the vine → revelation of the violent cut → problem of the recognition of cruelty.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:AF2","text":"Ripeness and unripeness → opposing relations to death and life → differential temporal order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:AF3","text":"Suffering → will to life and ripening → orientation toward surpassing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:AF4","text":"Surpassing → heirs and children → future beyond the individual self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:AF5","text":"Pleasure → self-reference and eternity → recurrence of the same as countermodel.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:AF6","text":"Woe → passing away plus ascent → conclusion in an unresolved double movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:ME1","text":"Injury is remapped from a mere harm into a productive condition of ripeness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:ME2","text":"Life and death are no longer mapped as simple opposites, but as different modes of development and completion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:ME3","text":"Suffering is classified as a directed, future-generating force in contrast to self-referential pleasure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:ME4","text":"Progeny becomes visible as an ontological surpassing of the self and not merely as biological continuation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:ME5","text":"Eternity is divided into two incompatible forms: repetition of the identical and progression beyond the self.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:ME6","text":"Woe is mapped as an ambivalent form of movement that simultaneously produces dissolution and intensification.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:ALT1","text":"Surface — A wounded vine, a vintner's knife, ripeness, unripeness, suffering, and pleasure are set against one another in directly apostrophic speech.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:ALT2","text":"Structural — The text orders forms of will according to their relations to violence, ripening, continuation, self-surpassing, and recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The opposition between suffering and pleasure shifts the question of life from self-preservation to the choice of its temporal and kinetic form.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Being appears either as becoming through passing away and surpassing or as the eternal recurrence of the self identical with itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movements of cut, ripeness, suffering, pleasure, and woe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:MRT2","text":"The central distinction between future-directed surpassing and self-identical recurrence remains fully preserved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:MRT3","text":"It remains underdetermined whether the voices of the vine, suffering, pleasure, and woe are to be read as independent instances or as inner forms of will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:MRT4","text":"The internal coherence rests on the mediation of life and death through ripening.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:MRT5","text":"The strongest structure is the opposition between inheritance and recurrence as two forms of duration.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0006","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:MRT6","text":"The greatest tension lies in the fact that woe simultaneously demands passing away and brings forth movement, ascent, and continuation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_8C_8:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement of the argument, provided that the concluding turn is read not as a resolution but as a continued intensification of the contradiction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_8C_8:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_8C_8@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_8C_8:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song","source_section_label":"8.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Four and Last"],"reading_title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 8","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","The Night-Wanderer’s Song","8."],"original_title":"8."}],"source_title_context":"Das Nachtwandler-Lied","source_section_label":"8.","source_title_hierarchy":["Vierter und letzter Theil"],"reading_title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 8","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","The Night-Wanderer’s Song","8."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 179","title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 8","context":"Part Four and Last","original_context":"Vierter und letzter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Das Nachtwandler-Lied · 8"},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4","layer":"CH","title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 10","order":180,"parents":["RAW_97E9_10_4"],"revision":"CH_97E9_10_4@R001","sha256":"56127f8ab2c5b4c0c46f33e9fb86ba9bfceac21e0081fbfc2da2d04f04c92792","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:AS1","text":"Eine ekstatische Rede stellt die Verlässlichkeit ihrer eigenen Sprecherposition durch eine Kette widersprüchlicher Benennungen in Frage.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:AS2","text":"Die gewöhnlichen Gegensätze von Lust und Schmerz, Segen und Fluch, Nacht und Sonne werden in eine gegenseitige Identität überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:AS3","text":"Die Bejahung einer einzigen Lust wird als Bejahung des gesamten mit ihr verketteten Geschehens bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:AS4","text":"Der Wunsch nach einer einmaligen Wiederholung eines Augenblicks impliziert den Wunsch nach der Wiederkehr aller Dinge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:AS5","text":"Die Welt wird dadurch als ewig verkettete, wiederkehrende Totalität konstituiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:AS6","text":"Die höchste Bejahung besteht darin, auch zum Wehe „vergeh, aber komm zurück!“ zu sagen, weil jede Lust nach Ewigkeit verlangt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:A1","text":"Die Sprecherposition ist nicht als eindeutige Identität, sondern als Schwelle zwischen Wahrsagung, Traum, Trunkenheit, Deutung und Glockenruf markiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:A2","text":"Die Welt kann als vollkommen erscheinen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:A3","text":"Mitternacht und Mittag können dieselbe umfassende Zeitordnung bezeichnen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:A4","text":"Schmerz und Lust sind keine absolut getrennten Wertbereiche.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:A5","text":"Fluch und Segen können ineinander übergehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:A6","text":"Nacht und Sonne können als verwandte oder identische Gestalten erscheinen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:A7","text":"Die Bejahung einer Lust verpflichtet zur Bejahung des mit ihr verbundenen Wehes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:A8","text":"Alle Dinge sind miteinander verkettet, verfädelt und verliebt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:A9","text":"Der Wunsch, einen Augenblick zweimal zu erleben, schließt den Wunsch nach der Wiederkehr des Ganzen ein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:A10","text":"Die Welt ist als Ganzes ewig wiederkehrend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:A11","text":"Lust ist ihrem innersten Anspruch nach auf Ewigkeit gerichtet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:A12","text":"Eine Weisheit, die die Gegensätze zusammenführt, erscheint zugleich als Narrheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:NX1","text":"Die Sprecherinstanz ist nicht auf eine einzige epistemische oder psychische Rolle festlegbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:NX2","text":"Lust ist nicht vom Schmerz isolierbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:NX3","text":"Segen ist nicht ohne Fluch bestimmbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:NX4","text":"Nacht ist nicht das einfache Gegenteil der Sonne.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:NX5","text":"Ein bejahter Augenblick ist nicht auf seine Einmaligkeit begrenzbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:NX6","text":"Das Wehe ist nicht als endgültig vergehendes Ereignis zugelassen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:NX7","text":"Weisheit ist nicht von Narrheit durch eine stabile Grenze getrennt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:D1","text":"Wer eine Lust unbedingt bejaht, bejaht aufgrund der Verkettung zugleich jedes mit ihr verbundene Wehe.","refs":["CH_97E9_10_4:A7","CH_97E9_10_4:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:D2","text":"Die selektive Bejahung eines positiven Augenblicks wird in eine totale Bejahung des Weltzusammenhangs überführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_10_4:A7","CH_97E9_10_4:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:D3","text":"Der Wunsch nach einer zweimaligen Existenz eines Augenblicks setzt die Wiederholung aller Dinge voraus.","refs":["CH_97E9_10_4:A8","CH_97E9_10_4:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:D4","text":"Ewigkeit bezeichnet nicht bloß Dauer, sondern die wiederholte Rückkehr jedes einzelnen Geschehens.","refs":["CH_97E9_10_4:A9","CH_97E9_10_4:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:D5","text":"Die vollständige Weltbejahung verlangt die Bejahung des Leidens unter der Bedingung seiner Wiederkehr.","refs":["CH_97E9_10_4:A7","CH_97E9_10_4:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:D6","text":"Der Wert einer Lust bemisst sich an ihrer Fähigkeit, die gesamte wiederkehrende Welt mitzutragen.","refs":["CH_97E9_10_4:A7","CH_97E9_10_4:A10","CH_97E9_10_4:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:SD1","text":"Die Bejahung wird von einer punktuellen Zustimmung zu einem Test der Fähigkeit totaler Weltannahme umgebildet.","refs":["CH_97E9_10_4:A7","CH_97E9_10_4:A8","CH_97E9_10_4:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:SD2","text":"Die Zeitordnung des Arguments verwandelt lineares Vergehen in zyklische Wiederkehr.","refs":["CH_97E9_10_4:A9","CH_97E9_10_4:A10","CH_97E9_10_4:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:SD3","text":"Die Aufhebung der Gegensatzpaare erzeugt eine Totalisierung, in der jedes Einzelereignis nur noch als Knoten des Ganzen Bedeutung besitzt.","refs":["CH_97E9_10_4:A3","CH_97E9_10_4:A4","CH_97E9_10_4:A5","CH_97E9_10_4:A6","CH_97E9_10_4:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:SD4","text":"Die höchste Form der Weltbejahung ist zugleich ethische Zumutung, ontologische These und zeitliche Verpflichtung.","refs":["CH_97E9_10_4:A7","CH_97E9_10_4:A10","CH_97E9_10_4:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:DNX1","text":"Das System kann nicht auf einer endgültigen Trennung von positivem und negativem Wert beruhen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:DNX2","text":"Es kann keine gültige Bejahung geben, die das Bejahte aus seinem leidvollen Zusammenhang herauslöst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:DNX3","text":"Zeit kann nicht als einmalige, unumkehrbare Abfolge organisiert sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:DNX4","text":"Das Individuum kann nicht als souveräner Besitzer isolierter Erlebnisse behandelt werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:DNX5","text":"Erlösung durch endgültiges Verschwinden des Schmerzes ist strukturell ausgeschlossen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:DNX6","text":"Eine Weisheit, die Widersprüche lediglich beseitigt, wäre für dieses System unzureichend.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Außen der Welt, von dem aus einzelne Ereignisse ohne ihre Wiederkehr und Verkettung bewertet werden könnten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Möglichkeit, das Leben selektiv zu bejahen und seine negativen Bedingungen endgültig abzuweisen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Zeit, in der das Geschehene endgültig abgeschlossen oder getilgt werden kann.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine nichttragische Form der Ewigkeit, die Lust bewahrt und Wehe entfernt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:FGS1","text":"Unbestimmte Sprecherinstanz → Auflösung stabiler Erkenntnisposition → Gleichsetzung der Gegensatzpaare.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:FGS2","text":"Gegensatzauflösung → Verkettung von Lust und Wehe → Ausschluss selektiver Bejahung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:FGS3","text":"Bejahung eines Augenblicks → Forderung seiner Wiederholung → Einbeziehung aller verketteten Dinge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:FGS4","text":"Wiederholung des Ganzen → Ewigkeit als zyklische Rückkehr → Verpflichtung zur Bejahung des Wehes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:FGS5","text":"Bejahung von Lust und Wehe → totale Weltliebe → zeitliche Formel: Vergehen und Wiederkommen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:AF1","text":"Uneindeutige Offenbarungsstimme → Aufhebung stabiler Sprechergewissheit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:AF2","text":"Aufhebung der Sprechergewissheit → Verschmelzung von Nacht und Mittag sowie Lust und Schmerz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:AF3","text":"Verschmelzung der Gegensätze → Verkettung aller Dinge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:AF4","text":"Verkettung aller Dinge → Bejahung einer Lust als Bejahung des gesamten Geschehens.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:AF5","text":"Wunsch nach Wiederholung eines Augenblicks → Wunsch nach Wiederkehr des Ganzen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:AF6","text":"Wiederkehr des Ganzen → ewige Weltliebe einschließlich des Wehes.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:AF7","text":"Ewige Weltliebe → Endposition der totalen Bejahung: Das Wehe soll vergehen und zurückkehren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:ME1","text":"Die Opposition von Lust und Schmerz wird in eine relationale Einheit umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:ME2","text":"Der einzelne Augenblick wird vom isolierten Erlebnis zum Index der Totalität umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:ME3","text":"Ewigkeit wird von zeitloser Dauer auf wiederholte Rückkehr jedes Geschehens umgestellt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:ME4","text":"Das Wehe wird vom zu beseitigenden Negativwert zur notwendigen Komponente der Weltbejahung umgewertet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:ME5","text":"Weisheit und Narrheit werden nicht mehr als ausschließende Gegensätze, sondern als koexistierende Perspektiven kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:ALT1","text":"Surface: Eine Rede fordert die Angesprochenen auf, Lust, Wehe und Wiederkehr gemeinsam zu bejahen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:ALT2","text":"Structural: Die Argumentation bindet jeden Wert an ein Netz von Verkettungen und verhindert isolierte Bewertung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Die Angesprochenen werden von selektiver Zustimmung zu einer Prüfung totaler Bejahungsfähigkeit gedrängt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Realität erscheint als widersprüchlich gegliederte, zyklisch wiederkehrende Totalität.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome A7 bis A11 reichen aus, um den Übergang von Lustbejahung zu Weltbejahung und Wiederkehr zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:MRT2","text":"A1 bis A6 und A12 erklären die rhetorische und begriffliche Auflösung stabiler Gegensätze, sind für die Kernableitung jedoch teilweise entbehrlich.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Verkettung und Wiederkehr als tragende ontologische Voraussetzungen akzeptiert werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:MRT4","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob die Wiederkehr als metaphysische Wirklichkeit, existentielle Zumutung oder rhetorische Konsequenz gemeint ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Operation ist die Ableitung des Ganzen aus der Bejahung eines einzigen Augenblicks.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:MRT6","text":"Die schwächste Stelle liegt im nicht ausgeführten Übergang von der subjektiven Zustimmung zur kosmologischen Notwendigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung von Gegensatzauflösung über Verkettung und Wiederholung zur totalen Weltbejahung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T184430960374Z_fc51dfe3","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"10.","source_sha256":"56127f8ab2c5b4c0c46f33e9fb86ba9bfceac21e0081fbfc2da2d04f04c92792","sha256":"855d1513a4a75adf537927a3212bf90d2552d4ec940c399b94cc09caf550b768","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T18:44:30.962728+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:AS1","text":"An ecstatic discourse calls the reliability of its own speaker-position into question through a chain of contradictory designations.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:AS2","text":"The ordinary oppositions of pleasure and pain, blessing and curse, night and sun are transposed into a reciprocal identity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:AS3","text":"The affirmation of a single pleasure is determined as affirmation of the entire occurrence chained together with it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:AS4","text":"The wish for the one-time repetition of a moment implies the wish for the return of all things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:AS5","text":"The world is thereby constituted as an eternally chained, recurring totality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:AS6","text":"The highest affirmation consists in saying even to woe, “perish, but come back!”, because every pleasure demands eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:A1","text":"The speaker-position is marked not as an unambiguous identity, but as a threshold between prophecy, dream, intoxication, interpretation, and bell-ringing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:A2","text":"The world can appear perfect.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:A3","text":"Midnight and noon can designate the same comprehensive temporal order.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:A4","text":"Pain and pleasure are not absolutely separate domains of value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:A5","text":"Curse and blessing can pass into one another.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:A6","text":"Night and sun can appear as related or identical figures.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:A7","text":"The affirmation of a pleasure entails the affirmation of the woe connected with it.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:A8","text":"All things are chained together, threaded together, and in love.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:A9","text":"The wish to experience a moment twice includes the wish for the return of the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:A10","text":"The world as a whole eternally recurs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:A11","text":"By its innermost claim, pleasure is directed toward eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:A12","text":"A wisdom that brings opposites together appears at the same time as folly.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:NX1","text":"The speaker-instance cannot be fixed to a single epistemic or psychic role.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:NX2","text":"Pleasure cannot be isolated from pain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:NX3","text":"Blessing cannot be determined without curse.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:NX4","text":"Night is not the simple opposite of the sun.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:NX5","text":"An affirmed moment cannot be limited to its singularity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:NX6","text":"Woe is not admitted as an event that finally passes away.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:NX7","text":"Wisdom is not separated from folly by a stable boundary.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:D1","text":"Whoever affirms a pleasure unconditionally, by virtue of the chaining, simultaneously affirms every woe connected with it.","refs":["CH_97E9_10_4:A7","CH_97E9_10_4:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:D2","text":"The selective affirmation of a positive moment is transposed into a total affirmation of the world's interconnectedness.","refs":["CH_97E9_10_4:A7","CH_97E9_10_4:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:D3","text":"The wish for a moment's twice-occurring existence presupposes the repetition of all things.","refs":["CH_97E9_10_4:A8","CH_97E9_10_4:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:D4","text":"Eternity designates not mere duration, but the repeated return of every individual occurrence.","refs":["CH_97E9_10_4:A9","CH_97E9_10_4:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:D5","text":"Complete affirmation of the world demands the affirmation of suffering under the condition of its recurrence.","refs":["CH_97E9_10_4:A7","CH_97E9_10_4:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:D6","text":"The value of a pleasure is measured by its capacity to bear along with it the entire recurring world.","refs":["CH_97E9_10_4:A7","CH_97E9_10_4:A10","CH_97E9_10_4:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:SD1","text":"Affirmation is transformed from a punctual assent into a test of the capacity for total acceptance of the world.","refs":["CH_97E9_10_4:A7","CH_97E9_10_4:A8","CH_97E9_10_4:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:SD2","text":"The temporal order of the argument transforms linear passing-away into cyclical recurrence.","refs":["CH_97E9_10_4:A9","CH_97E9_10_4:A10","CH_97E9_10_4:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:SD3","text":"The suspension of the pairs of opposites produces a totalization in which each individual event possesses meaning only as a node of the whole.","refs":["CH_97E9_10_4:A3","CH_97E9_10_4:A4","CH_97E9_10_4:A5","CH_97E9_10_4:A6","CH_97E9_10_4:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:SD4","text":"The highest form of affirmation of the world is at once an ethical demand, an ontological thesis, and a temporal obligation.","refs":["CH_97E9_10_4:A7","CH_97E9_10_4:A10","CH_97E9_10_4:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:DNX1","text":"The system cannot rest upon a final separation of positive and negative value.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:DNX2","text":"There can be no valid affirmation that detaches what is affirmed from its painful context.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:DNX3","text":"Time cannot be organized as a one-time, irreversible sequence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:DNX4","text":"The individual cannot be treated as the sovereign possessor of isolated experiences.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:DNX5","text":"Redemption through the final disappearance of pain is structurally excluded.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:DNX6","text":"A wisdom that merely eliminates contradictions would be inadequate for this system.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:SNX1","text":"Excluded is an outside of the world from which individual events could be evaluated without their recurrence and chaining.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:SNX2","text":"Excluded is the possibility of affirming life selectively and definitively rejecting its negative conditions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:SNX3","text":"Excluded is a time in which what has occurred can be definitively completed or effaced.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:SNX4","text":"Excluded is a non-tragic form of eternity that preserves pleasure and removes woe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:FGS1","text":"Indeterminate speaker-instance → dissolution of stable epistemic position → equation of the pairs of opposites.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:FGS2","text":"Dissolution of opposites → chaining of pleasure and woe → exclusion of selective affirmation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:FGS3","text":"Affirmation of a moment → demand for its repetition → inclusion of all chained things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:FGS4","text":"Repetition of the whole → eternity as cyclical return → obligation to affirm woe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:FGS5","text":"Affirmation of pleasure and woe → total love of the world → temporal formula: passing away and returning.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:AF1","text":"Ambiguous voice of revelation → suspension of stable certainty regarding the speaker.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:AF2","text":"Suspension of certainty regarding the speaker → fusion of night and noon, as well as pleasure and pain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:AF3","text":"Fusion of opposites → chaining of all things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:AF4","text":"Chaining of all things → affirmation of a pleasure as affirmation of the entire occurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:AF5","text":"Wish for the repetition of a moment → wish for the return of the whole.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:AF6","text":"Return of the whole → eternal love of the world, including woe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:AF7","text":"Eternal love of the world → final position of total affirmation: woe is to pass away and return.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:ME1","text":"The opposition of pleasure and pain is remapped into a relational unity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:ME2","text":"The individual moment is reclassified from an isolated experience into an index of totality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:ME3","text":"Eternity is shifted from timeless duration to the repeated return of every occurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:ME4","text":"Woe is revalued from a negative value to be eliminated into a necessary component of affirmation of the world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:ME5","text":"Wisdom and folly are no longer mapped as exclusive opposites, but as coexisting perspectives.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:ALT1","text":"Surface: A discourse calls upon those addressed to affirm pleasure, woe, and recurrence together.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:ALT2","text":"Structural: The argument binds every value to a network of chains and prevents isolated evaluation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic: Those addressed are pressed from selective assent toward a test of total capacity for affirmation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal: Reality appears as a contradictorily articulated, cyclically recurring totality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:MRT1","text":"Axioms A7 through A11 suffice to reconstruct the transition from affirmation of pleasure to affirmation of the world and recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:MRT2","text":"A1 through A6 and A12 explain the rhetorical and conceptual dissolution of stable opposites, but are partially dispensable for the core derivation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:MRT3","text":"The structure is internally coherent, provided that chaining and recurrence are accepted as supporting ontological presuppositions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:MRT4","text":"It remains underdetermined whether recurrence is meant as metaphysical reality, existential demand, or rhetorical consequence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:MRT5","text":"The strongest operation is the derivation of the whole from the affirmation of a single moment.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:MRT6","text":"The weakest point lies in the unelaborated transition from subjective assent to cosmological necessity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_10_4:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement from the dissolution of opposites through chaining and repetition to total affirmation of the world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_10_4:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_10_4@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_10_4:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song","source_section_label":"10.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Four and Last"],"reading_title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 10","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","The Night-Wanderer’s Song","10."],"original_title":"10."}],"source_title_context":"Das Nachtwandler-Lied","source_section_label":"10.","source_title_hierarchy":["Vierter und letzter Theil"],"reading_title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 10","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","The Night-Wanderer’s Song","10."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 180","title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 10","context":"Part Four and Last","original_context":"Vierter und letzter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Das Nachtwandler-Lied · 10"},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3","layer":"CH","title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 11","order":181,"parents":["RAW_97E9_11_3"],"revision":"CH_97E9_11_3@R001","sha256":"7e963eef32d8a345a4dfa234babbd01635e53451c944445cef012bc90a2fe58c","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:AS1","text":"Das zentrale Problem besteht darin, Lust nicht als isoliertes Wohlgefühl, sondern als umfassenden Willen zu bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:AS2","text":"Lust wird neu bestimmt als Wille zu aller Dinge Ewigkeit und damit als Wille zur Totalität ihrer Gegenstände.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:AS3","text":"Ihre Reichweite zeigt sich darin, dass sie Gegensätze zugleich umfasst: Liebe und Hass, Glück und Schmerz, Überfluss und Bedürftigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:AS4","text":"Die Selbstbezüglichkeit der Lust erzeugt ihren Willen zu Herzeleid, Hölle, Schmach und Welt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:AS5","text":"Die höheren Menschen erscheinen als bevorzugte Träger jenes Leidens, nach dem die ewige Lust verlangt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:AS6","text":"Die Argumentbewegung führt von der Entgrenzung der Lust zu ihrer Selbstbejahung als tiefer Ewigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:A1","text":"Lust will die Ewigkeit aller Dinge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:A2","text":"Lust will sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:A3","text":"Lust ist umfassender als Schmerz, ohne auf Schmerz reduzierbar zu sein.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:A4","text":"Lust umfasst widersprüchlich erscheinende Bestimmungen wie Liebe und Hass.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:A5","text":"Lust kann zugleich schenken, wegwerfen, bitten und danken.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:A6","text":"Überreiche Lust verlangt nach Wehe, Hölle, Hass und Schmach.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:A7","text":"Die Welt gehört zu den Gegenständen, nach denen Lust verlangt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:A8","text":"Die ewige Lust verlangt nach dem Leiden der höheren Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:A9","text":"Das Verlangen nach Herzeleid folgt aus dem Willen der Lust zu sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:A10","text":"Die Ewigkeit der Lust ist eine tiefe, nicht bloß zeitlich verlängerte Ewigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:NX1","text":"Lust ist nicht auf angenehme Empfindung begrenzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:NX2","text":"Lust ist nicht der Gegensatz zu Schmerz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:NX3","text":"Lust ist nicht durch Bedürfnislosigkeit definiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:NX4","text":"Lust ist nicht auf Liebe oder auf Hass festgelegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:NX5","text":"Lust ist nicht von Welt, Hölle, Schmach oder Missratenem gereinigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:NX6","text":"Ewigkeit ist nicht bloße Dauer eines gegenwärtigen Lustzustands.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:NX7","text":"Das Leiden der höheren Menschen ist nicht außerhalb des Begehrens der Lust angesiedelt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:D1","text":"Weil Lust alle Dinge in ihre Ewigkeit einbeziehen will, richtet sie sich nicht auf einen einzelnen angenehmen Gegenstand.","refs":["CH_97E9_11_3:A1","CH_97E9_11_3:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:D2","text":"Weil Lust sich selbst will, muss sie auch die Zustände wollen, durch die sie sich als umfassende Lust erhält.","refs":["CH_97E9_11_3:A2","CH_97E9_11_3:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:D3","text":"Weil Lust Liebe und Hass umfasst, kann ihr Gegenstand nicht durch eine moralische oder affektive Eindeutigkeit bestimmt werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_11_3:A3","CH_97E9_11_3:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:D4","text":"Weil Lust überreich ist, widerspricht ihr Betteln nicht ihrem Überfluss.","refs":["CH_97E9_11_3:A5","CH_97E9_11_3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:D5","text":"Weil Lust nach Wehe verlangt, wird Schmerz als Bestandteil ihrer Totalität und nicht als ihr äußerer Gegenpol bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_11_3:A3","CH_97E9_11_3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:D6","text":"Weil die ewige Lust nach dem Leiden der höheren Menschen verlangt, wird deren Missratenheit in den Horizont der Lust integriert.","refs":["CH_97E9_11_3:A8","CH_97E9_11_3:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:SD1","text":"Lust wird zu einer totalisierenden Bejahungsbewegung, die ihre eigene Negation als Bestandteil ihrer Selbstbejahung einverleibt.","refs":["CH_97E9_11_3:A1","CH_97E9_11_3:A2","CH_97E9_11_3:A3","CH_97E9_11_3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:SD2","text":"Die Gegensätze Glück und Schmerz verlieren ihre Funktion als voneinander getrennte Endpunkte und werden zu Momenten eines einzigen Begehrens.","refs":["CH_97E9_11_3:A3","CH_97E9_11_3:A4","CH_97E9_11_3:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:SD3","text":"Ewigkeit bezeichnet die unabschließbare Rückkehr der Lust zu sich selbst durch die Aufnahme aller Dinge und ihrer Gegensätze.","refs":["CH_97E9_11_3:A1","CH_97E9_11_3:A2","CH_97E9_11_3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:SD4","text":"Das höhere Menschsein wird nicht als Erlösung vom Leiden, sondern als bevorzugte Erscheinungsform der von Lust begehrten Wunde bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_11_3:A6","CH_97E9_11_3:A8","CH_97E9_11_3:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:DNX1","text":"Das System kann nicht auf einem Modell beruhen, in dem Lust durch Ausschaltung von Schmerz vollendet wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:DNX2","text":"Das System kann nicht auf einer linearen Steigerung beruhen, die von Mangel zu endgültiger Befriedigung führt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:DNX3","text":"Das System schließt eine transzendente Ordnung aus, in der Welt, Leid und Missratenheit überwunden werden müssen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:DNX4","text":"Das System schließt eine stabile Identität der Lust aus, die von ihren widersprüchlichen Affekten unberührt bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:DNX5","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass Selbstbejahung mit Selbstschutz oder Schmerzvermeidung gleichgesetzt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Möglichkeit einer Lust, die sich durch Abgrenzung gegen das Nicht-Lustvolle erhält.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird ein Ende des Begehrens, in dem Lust nicht mehr auf ihre eigene Wiederholung angewiesen wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Weltordnung, deren Wahrheit erst durch Entfernung des Leidens, des Hasses oder des Missratenen hergestellt werden müsste.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:SNX4","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine höhere Existenzform, deren Überlegenheit in der Abwesenheit von Verwundbarkeit bestünde.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:FGS1","text":"Affektive Grundsetzung: Lust will sich selbst.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:FGS2","text":"Totalisierung: Der Selbstwille der Lust erweitert sich zum Willen zur Ewigkeit aller Dinge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:FGS3","text":"Inklusion der Gegensätze: Liebe, Hass, Glück, Schmerz, Überfluss und Bedürftigkeit werden als kompatible Erscheinungen derselben Lust erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:FGS4","text":"Selbstbezügliche Umkehrung: Weil Lust sich selbst will, verlangt sie nach Herzeleid und den Bedingungen ihrer eigenen affektiven Tiefe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:FGS5","text":"Subjektivierung: Die höheren Menschen werden als Träger des von der Lust gesuchten Leidens eingesetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:FGS6","text":"Temporale Schließung: Die Bewegung endet in der tiefen Ewigkeit einer Lust, die alle Gegenstände und Gegenkräfte in sich zurückführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:AF1","text":"Begrenztes Lustverständnis → Entgrenzung zur Lust aller Dinge.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:AF2","text":"Lust aller Dinge → Wille zu aller Dinge Ewigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:AF3","text":"Wille zur Ewigkeit → Einbeziehung von Schmerz, Hass, Schmach und Welt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:AF4","text":"Einbeziehung des Negativen → Selbstbezüglicher Wille der Lust.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:AF5","text":"Selbstbezüglicher Wille → Verlangen nach dem Leiden der höheren Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:AF6","text":"Verlangen nach Leiden → Gleichsetzung von Glück und Schmerz in der tiefen Ewigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:ME1","text":"Lust wird von einem positiven Einzelzustand zu einer Totalitätskategorie umkartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:ME2","text":"Schmerz wird vom Gegenbegriff der Lust zu einem inneren Bestandteil ihrer Bewegungsform umklassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:ME3","text":"Liebe und Hass werden nicht länger als ausschließende Alternativen, sondern als koexistierende Richtungen desselben Willens lesbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:ME4","text":"Überfluss und Bedürftigkeit werden als simultane Zustände derselben Lust kartiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:ME5","text":"Die höheren Menschen werden aus der Position möglicher Erlösungsträger in die Position begehrter Leidensgestalten verschoben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:ME6","text":"Ewigkeit wird von zeitlicher Verlängerung in selbstbezügliche Totalisierung umgezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:ALT1","text":"Surface — Lust verlangt nach Ewigkeit, nach allen Dingen und nach widersprüchlichen Affekten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:ALT2","text":"Structural — Der Text organisiert Lust als System, das seine Gegenpole in die eigene Reproduktion aufnimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Die übliche Opposition von Lust und Leid wird durch eine gemeinsame Willensstruktur ersetzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Sein wird als zu bejahende Vielheit und Ewigkeit als tiefe Wiederkehr der selbstwollenden Lust bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von der Lust zur Ewigkeit und zur Aufnahme des Leidens zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:MRT2","text":"Die zentrale Abhängigkeit zwischen Selbstwille, Totalisierung und Gegenstandsinklusion bleibt erhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, ob die Ewigkeit ontologisch, zyklisch oder ausschließlich affektiv gemeint ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:MRT4","text":"Ebenfalls unterbestimmt bleibt, ob die höheren Menschen Subjekte, Symptome oder metaphorische Träger der Lust sind.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:MRT5","text":"Die Struktur ist intern kohärent, sofern Lust nicht als Gegensatz zu Schmerz, sondern als dessen umfassende Bedingung gefasst wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:MRT6","text":"Die stärkste Stelle des Systems liegt in der Ableitung des Leidens aus dem Selbstwillen der Lust.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:MRT7","text":"Die größte Spannung liegt in der gleichzeitigen Bestimmung der Lust als Überfluss und als bittendes, bedürftiges Verlangen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:MRT8","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung, solange die Schlussposition nicht als bloße Steigerung des Glücks, sondern als Totalisierung von Lust und Schmerz verstanden wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T184551133993Z_e6909085","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"11.","source_sha256":"7e963eef32d8a345a4dfa234babbd01635e53451c944445cef012bc90a2fe58c","sha256":"1851ad136ab26c249b8f72fed6fdfdff7e0fd7548dd6f9dec54ebd41e4b8dfe6","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T18:45:51.136447+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:AS1","text":"The central problem consists in determining pleasure not as an isolated feeling of well-being, but as a comprehensive will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:AS2","text":"Pleasure is newly determined as the will to the eternity of all things and thus as the will to the totality of its objects.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:AS3","text":"Its scope is shown in the fact that it simultaneously encompasses opposites: love and hate, happiness and pain, abundance and need.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:AS4","text":"The self-referentiality of pleasure generates its will to heartache, hell, disgrace, and world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:AS5","text":"The higher human beings appear as privileged bearers of that suffering which eternal pleasure demands.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:AS6","text":"The movement of the argument leads from the unbounding of pleasure to its self-affirmation as deep eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:A1","text":"Pleasure wills the eternity of all things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:A2","text":"Pleasure wills itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:A3","text":"Pleasure is more comprehensive than pain, without being reducible to pain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:A4","text":"Pleasure encompasses apparently contradictory determinations such as love and hate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:A5","text":"Pleasure can simultaneously give, throw away, beg, and give thanks.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:A6","text":"Overabundant pleasure demands woe, hell, hate, and disgrace.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:A7","text":"The world belongs among the objects that pleasure demands.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:A8","text":"Eternal pleasure demands the suffering of the higher human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:A9","text":"The demand for heartache follows from the will of pleasure toward itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:A10","text":"The eternity of pleasure is a deep eternity, not one merely extended in time.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:NX1","text":"Pleasure is not limited to pleasant sensation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:NX2","text":"Pleasure is not the opposite of pain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:NX3","text":"Pleasure is not defined by freedom from need.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:NX4","text":"Pleasure is not fixed upon love or hate.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:NX5","text":"Pleasure is not purified of world, hell, disgrace, or what has gone wrong.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:NX6","text":"Eternity is not mere duration of a present state of pleasure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:NX7","text":"The suffering of the higher human beings is not situated outside the desire of pleasure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:D1","text":"Because pleasure wills to include all things in its eternity, it is not directed toward a single pleasant object.","refs":["CH_97E9_11_3:A1","CH_97E9_11_3:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:D2","text":"Because pleasure wills itself, it must also will the states through which it preserves itself as comprehensive pleasure.","refs":["CH_97E9_11_3:A2","CH_97E9_11_3:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:D3","text":"Because pleasure encompasses love and hate, its object cannot be determined by a moral or affective univocity.","refs":["CH_97E9_11_3:A3","CH_97E9_11_3:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:D4","text":"Because pleasure is overabundant, its begging does not contradict its abundance.","refs":["CH_97E9_11_3:A5","CH_97E9_11_3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:D5","text":"Because pleasure demands woe, pain is determined as a component of its totality and not as its external counterpole.","refs":["CH_97E9_11_3:A3","CH_97E9_11_3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:D6","text":"Because eternal pleasure demands the suffering of the higher human beings, their failure is integrated into the horizon of pleasure.","refs":["CH_97E9_11_3:A8","CH_97E9_11_3:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:SD1","text":"Pleasure becomes a totalizing movement of affirmation that incorporates its own negation as a component of its self-affirmation.","refs":["CH_97E9_11_3:A1","CH_97E9_11_3:A2","CH_97E9_11_3:A3","CH_97E9_11_3:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:SD2","text":"The opposites happiness and pain lose their function as endpoints separate from one another and become moments of a single desire.","refs":["CH_97E9_11_3:A3","CH_97E9_11_3:A4","CH_97E9_11_3:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:SD3","text":"Eternity denotes the unfinishable return of pleasure to itself through the reception of all things and their opposites.","refs":["CH_97E9_11_3:A1","CH_97E9_11_3:A2","CH_97E9_11_3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:SD4","text":"Higher humanity is determined not as redemption from suffering, but as a privileged form of appearance of the wound desired by pleasure.","refs":["CH_97E9_11_3:A6","CH_97E9_11_3:A8","CH_97E9_11_3:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:DNX1","text":"The system cannot rest on a model in which pleasure is completed by the elimination of pain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:DNX2","text":"The system cannot rest on a linear intensification that leads from lack to final satisfaction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:DNX3","text":"The system excludes a transcendent order in which world, suffering, and failure must be overcome.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:DNX4","text":"The system excludes a stable identity of pleasure that remains untouched by its contradictory affects.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:DNX5","text":"The system excludes equating self-affirmation with self-protection or the avoidance of pain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:SNX1","text":"Excluded is the possibility of a pleasure that preserves itself through delimitation against what is non-pleasurable.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:SNX2","text":"Excluded is an end of desire in which pleasure would no longer depend on its own repetition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:SNX3","text":"Excluded is a world order whose truth would first have to be established by the removal of suffering, hate, or what has gone wrong.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:SNX4","text":"Excluded is a higher form of existence whose superiority would consist in the absence of vulnerability.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:FGS1","text":"Affective basic positing: Pleasure wills itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:FGS2","text":"Totalization: The self-will of pleasure expands into the will to the eternity of all things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:FGS3","text":"Inclusion of opposites: Love, hate, happiness, pain, abundance, and need are generated as compatible manifestations of the same pleasure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:FGS4","text":"Self-referential reversal: Because pleasure wills itself, it demands heartache and the conditions of its own affective depth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:FGS5","text":"Subjectivation: The higher human beings are installed as bearers of the suffering sought by pleasure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:FGS6","text":"Temporal closure: The movement ends in the deep eternity of a pleasure that returns all objects and counterforces into itself.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:AF1","text":"Limited understanding of pleasure → unbounding into the pleasure of all things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:AF2","text":"Pleasure of all things → will to the eternity of all things.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0008","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:AF3","text":"Will to eternity → inclusion of pain, hate, disgrace, and world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:AF4","text":"Inclusion of the negative → self-referential will of pleasure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:AF5","text":"Self-referential will → demand for the suffering of the higher human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:AF6","text":"Demand for suffering → equation of happiness and pain in deep eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:ME1","text":"Pleasure is remapped from a positive individual state into a category of totality.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:ME2","text":"Pain is reclassified from the counterconcept of pleasure into an internal component of its form of movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:ME3","text":"Love and hate become legible no longer as exclusive alternatives, but as coexisting directions of the same will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:ME4","text":"Abundance and need are mapped as simultaneous states of the same pleasure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:ME5","text":"The higher human beings are shifted from the position of possible bearers of redemption into the position of desired figures of suffering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:ME6","text":"Eternity is redrawn from temporal extension into self-referential totalization.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:ALT1","text":"Surface — Pleasure demands eternity, all things, and contradictory affects.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:ALT2","text":"Structural — The text organizes pleasure as a system that takes its counterpoles into its own reproduction.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The usual opposition of pleasure and suffering is replaced by a shared structure of will.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Being is determined as a multiplicity to be affirmed, and eternity as the deep return of self-willing pleasure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from pleasure to eternity and to the inclusion of suffering.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:MRT2","text":"The central dependency between self-will, totalization, and object inclusion is preserved.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:MRT3","text":"It remains underdetermined whether eternity is meant ontologically, cyclically, or exclusively affectively.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0008","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:MRT4","text":"It likewise remains underdetermined whether the higher human beings are subjects, symptoms, or metaphorical bearers of pleasure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0006","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:MRT5","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as pleasure is conceived not as the opposite of pain, but as its comprehensive condition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:MRT6","text":"The strongest point of the system lies in the derivation of suffering from the self-will of pleasure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:MRT7","text":"The greatest tension lies in the simultaneous determination of pleasure as abundance and as begging, needy desire.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_11_3:MRT8","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement so long as the concluding position is understood not as a mere intensification of happiness, but as the totalization of pleasure and pain.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_11_3:P0008","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_11_3@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_11_3:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song","source_section_label":"11.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Four and Last"],"reading_title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 11","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","The Night-Wanderer’s Song","11."],"original_title":"11."}],"source_title_context":"Das Nachtwandler-Lied","source_section_label":"11.","source_title_hierarchy":["Vierter und letzter Theil"],"reading_title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 11","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","The Night-Wanderer’s Song","11."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 181","title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 11","context":"Part Four and Last","original_context":"Vierter und letzter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Das Nachtwandler-Lied · 11"},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3","layer":"CH","title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 12","order":182,"parents":["RAW_97E9_12_3"],"revision":"CH_97E9_12_3@R001","sha256":"bd37d4a7a3245b555a1f12c85f5b2c56c6a6311a6795eb0d5d24a7089d5d328d","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:AS1","text":"Der Text prüft, ob die höheren Menschen den Sinn des vorausgehenden Liedes erkannt haben.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:AS2","text":"Die Prüfung wird in eine Aufforderung überführt, den Rundgesang selbst zu singen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:AS3","text":"Der Rundgesang wird durch „Noch ein Mal“ und „in alle Ewigkeit!“ als Wiederkehr und Ewigkeit bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:AS4","text":"Die Stimme der tiefen Mitternacht enthüllt die Welt als tiefer, als der Tag sie erscheinen lässt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:AS5","text":"Innerhalb dieser Tiefe wird Lust gegenüber dem Weh als noch tiefer bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:AS6","text":"Die Bewegung reicht von der Aufforderung zur Wiederholung über die Offenbarung der Welttiefe zur ewigen Bejahung der Lust.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:A1","text":"Der Sinn eines Liedes kann durch seine Wiederholung praktisch erwiesen werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:A2","text":"Die höheren Menschen sind fähig, den geforderten Rundgesang selbst zu singen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:A3","text":"„Noch ein Mal“ bezeichnet nicht bloße Wiederholung, sondern eine auf Ewigkeit gerichtete Wiederkehr.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:A4","text":"Die Welt besitzt eine Tiefe, die dem unmittelbaren Bewusstsein verborgen bleibt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:A5","text":"Der Tag bildet keinen ausreichenden Maßstab für die Tiefe der Welt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:A6","text":"Das Weh gehört zur tiefen Struktur der Welt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:A7","text":"Lust ist tiefer als Herzeleid.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:A8","text":"Das Weh spricht den Untergang oder das Vergehen aus.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:A9","text":"Die Lust verlangt nicht Vergehen, sondern Ewigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:A10","text":"Die tiefste Bestimmung der Lust ist der Wille zur ewigen Wiederkehr.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:NX1","text":"Der Sinn des Liedes ist nicht durch bloßes Zuhören erfüllt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:NX2","text":"Die Welt ist nicht auf das durch den Tag Erschlossene begrenzt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:NX3","text":"Die Tiefe der Welt ist nicht mit ihrem Weh erschöpft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:NX4","text":"Lust ist nicht dieselbe Größenordnung wie Herzeleid, sondern übertrifft es an Tiefe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:NX5","text":"Die letzte Antwort auf die Welt ist nicht die vom Weh ausgesprochene Auflösung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:NX6","text":"„Noch ein Mal“ bedeutet nicht einen letzten Durchgang vor dem Ende.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:D1","text":"Die höheren Menschen müssen den Sinn des Liedes performativ bestätigen, indem sie es selbst wiederholen.","refs":["CH_97E9_12_3:A1","CH_97E9_12_3:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:D2","text":"Der Rundgesang verbindet Wiederholung und Ewigkeit in einer einzigen Formel.","refs":["CH_97E9_12_3:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:D3","text":"Das Erwachen aus tiefem Traum fungiert als Übergang von verborgener zu ausgesprochener Welterkenntnis.","refs":["CH_97E9_12_3:A4","CH_97E9_12_3:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:D4","text":"Das Weh markiert die Welt als leidvolle, aber nicht abschließend bestimmte Realität.","refs":["CH_97E9_12_3:A6","CH_97E9_12_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:D5","text":"Die größere Tiefe der Lust verschiebt das Gewicht der Welterfahrung vom Leiden zur Bejahung.","refs":["CH_97E9_12_3:A6","CH_97E9_12_3:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:D6","text":"Die Ewigkeit wird nicht aus der Abwesenheit von Leid, sondern aus dem Willen der Lust erzeugt.","refs":["CH_97E9_12_3:A7","CH_97E9_12_3:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:SD1","text":"Die Erkenntnis der ewigen Wiederkehr wird als singbare Handlung und nicht als rein theoretischer Satz konstituiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:SD2","text":"Die tiefste Weltdeutung entsteht durch die Überordnung der Lust über das Vergehenswort des Wehs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:SD3","text":"Die Welt erscheint als Struktur, deren stärkster Impuls nicht im Leiden, sondern im Beharren auf Ewigkeit liegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:SD4","text":"Die höheren Menschen werden vom Empfänger einer Lehre zu ihrem ausführenden Medium umgebildet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:SD5","text":"Zeit wird von einer linearen Folge in eine wiederkehrende, durch Lust bejahte Dauer umcodiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:DNX1","text":"Das sichtbare und wache Bewusstsein besitzt keinen abschließenden Zugang zur Weltstruktur.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:DNX2","text":"Leid kann nicht als tiefster oder letzter Sinn der Welt gelten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:DNX3","text":"Die Äußerung „Vergeh!“ kann die Welt nicht endgültig bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:DNX4","text":"Ewigkeit darf nicht als bloße Fortdauer ohne Wert oder Bejahung verstanden werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:DNX5","text":"Erkenntnis bleibt unzureichend, wenn sie nicht in Wiederholung, Gesang und Zustimmung übergeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:SNX1","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Welt, deren tiefste Wahrheit im endgültigen Vergehen liegt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:SNX2","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Zeitordnung, in der Wiederholung nur Rückkehr desselben ohne Ewigkeitssinn wäre.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:SNX3","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird ein Subjekt, das die Wahrheit erkennen kann, ohne von ihr zur eigenen Wiederholung verpflichtet zu werden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:SNX4","text":"Abwesend bleibt eine Vermittlung, die den Gegensatz zwischen leidvoller Welt und ewiger Lust vollständig erklärt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:SNX5","text":"Die Kraft des Arguments beruht auf der versperrten Möglichkeit, dass das Weh das letzte Wort behalten könnte.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:FGS1","text":"Ungeprüftes Verständnis → Aufforderung zur eigenen Wiederholung → performative Bestätigung des Liedsinns.","refs":["CH_97E9_12_3:A1","CH_97E9_12_3:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:FGS2","text":"„Noch ein Mal“ → Wiederholung über den Einzelfall hinaus → Bestimmung als Ewigkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_12_3:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:FGS3","text":"Erwachen aus tiefem Traum → Überschreitung des Tagesmaßes → Offenlegung der Welttiefe.","refs":["CH_97E9_12_3:A4","CH_97E9_12_3:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:FGS4","text":"Welttiefe → Weh als Vergehensimpuls → Lust als tiefere Gegenbewegung → Wille zur Ewigkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_12_3:A6","CH_97E9_12_3:A7","CH_97E9_12_3:A8","CH_97E9_12_3:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:FGS5","text":"Tiefste Lust → ewige Wiederkehr → Aufforderung zur singenden Bejahung.","refs":["CH_97E9_12_3:A9","CH_97E9_12_3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:AF1","text":"Ungeprüftes Verstehen → performative Aufforderung → Wiederholung als „Noch ein Mal“ → Ewigkeit als Sinn → nächtliches Erwachen → Welttiefe → Überordnung der Lust → Bejahung der ewigen Wiederkehr.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:ME1","text":"Die Unterscheidung zwischen Verstehen und Singen wird in eine Unterscheidung zwischen passiver Kenntnis und vollzogener Zustimmung überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:ME2","text":"Der Gegensatz von Wiederholung und Einmaligkeit wird durch die Gleichsetzung von „Noch ein Mal“ und Ewigkeit neu geordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:ME3","text":"Die Hierarchie der Affekte wird so kartiert, dass Lust nicht als Gegenpol neben dem Leid, sondern als dessen tiefere Überschreitung erscheint.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:ME4","text":"Der Gegensatz von Tag und Nacht wird zu einer epistemischen Hierarchie von oberflächlicher und tiefer Welterkenntnis.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:ME5","text":"Das menschliche Subjekt wird von einem Adressaten der Offenbarung zu einem Träger ihrer Wiederholung klassifiziert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Höhere Menschen sollen den Rundgesang „Noch ein Mal“ singen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** Welt, Schmerz und Lust sind als gestufte Tiefenordnung miteinander verbunden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Erkenntnis wird durch Wiederholung, Gesang und Zustimmung in eine Haltung der Bejahung überführt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Die Wirklichkeit wird als ewige, wiederkehrende Dauer bestimmt, deren stärkster Trieb die Lust ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von der Aufforderung zum Gesang bis zur ewigen Bejahung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:MRT2","text":"Die zentrale Abhängigkeit von der Stimme der tiefen Mitternacht bleibt als Perspektivwechsel erhalten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:MRT3","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie die höheren Menschen die geforderte Zustimmung tatsächlich vollziehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:MRT4","text":"Ebenfalls ungelöst bleibt das Verhältnis zwischen dem „Vergeh!“ des Wehs und dem Ewigkeitstrieb der Lust.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:MRT5","text":"Die Struktur ist intern insofern kohärent, als die tiefere Lust die Vergehensbewegung des Wehs überbietet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:MRT6","text":"Die stärkste Stelle liegt in der Kopplung von affektiver Tiefe, Wiederholung und Ewigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion hängt an der nicht weiter begründeten Setzung, dass die größere Tiefe der Lust ihre ontologische Vorrangigkeit verbürgt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:MRT8","text":"Die Argumentbewegung bleibt erhalten, obwohl die Passage die Spannung zwischen Weltleid und Ewigkeit nicht vermittelt, sondern durch die Vorrangstellung der Lust entscheidet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T184651982743Z_dc66d365","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"12.","source_sha256":"bd37d4a7a3245b555a1f12c85f5b2c56c6a6311a6795eb0d5d24a7089d5d328d","sha256":"b592f827ac9a2076c9e1832219e30cc4437414b65f28a37d5faadb976681fa86","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T18:46:51.985208+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:AS1","text":"The text examines whether the higher human beings have understood the meaning of the preceding song.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0002","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:AS2","text":"The examination is transformed into an exhortation to sing the roundelay themselves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:AS3","text":"The roundelay is defined by „Noch ein Mal“ and „in alle Ewigkeit!“ as recurrence and eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:AS4","text":"The voice of deep midnight reveals the world as deeper than the day lets it appear.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:AS5","text":"Within this depth, joy is defined as deeper still in relation to woe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:AS6","text":"The movement extends from the exhortation to repetition, through the revelation of the world's depth, to the eternal affirmation of joy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:A1","text":"The meaning of a song can be practically demonstrated through its repetition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:A2","text":"The higher human beings are capable of singing the required roundelay themselves.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:A3","text":"„Noch ein Mal“ denotes not mere repetition, but a recurrence directed toward eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:A4","text":"The world possesses a depth that remains concealed from immediate consciousness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:A5","text":"The day does not provide an adequate measure for the depth of the world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:A6","text":"Woe belongs to the deep structure of the world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:A7","text":"Joy is deeper than heartache.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:A8","text":"Woe speaks forth downfall or passing away.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:A9","text":"Joy demands not passing away, but eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:A10","text":"The deepest determination of joy is the will to eternal recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:NX1","text":"The meaning of the song is not fulfilled by mere listening.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:NX2","text":"The world is not limited to what is disclosed by the day.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:NX3","text":"The depth of the world is not exhausted by its woe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:NX4","text":"Joy is not of the same order of magnitude as heartache, but surpasses it in depth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:NX5","text":"The final answer to the world is not the dissolution pronounced by woe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:NX6","text":"„Noch ein Mal“ does not mean one final passage before the end.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:D1","text":"The higher human beings must confirm the meaning of the song performatively by repeating it themselves.","refs":["CH_97E9_12_3:A1","CH_97E9_12_3:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:D2","text":"The roundelay joins repetition and eternity in a single formula.","refs":["CH_97E9_12_3:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:D3","text":"Awakening from a deep dream functions as a transition from concealed to spoken knowledge of the world.","refs":["CH_97E9_12_3:A4","CH_97E9_12_3:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:D4","text":"Woe marks the world as a painful, but not conclusively determined, reality.","refs":["CH_97E9_12_3:A6","CH_97E9_12_3:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:D5","text":"The greater depth of joy shifts the weight of world-experience from suffering to affirmation.","refs":["CH_97E9_12_3:A6","CH_97E9_12_3:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:D6","text":"Eternity is produced not from the absence of suffering, but from the will of joy.","refs":["CH_97E9_12_3:A7","CH_97E9_12_3:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:SD1","text":"Knowledge of eternal recurrence is constituted as a singable act and not as a purely theoretical proposition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:SD2","text":"The deepest interpretation of the world arises through the subordination of woe's word of passing away to joy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:SD3","text":"The world appears as a structure whose strongest impulse lies not in suffering, but in persistence upon eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:SD4","text":"The higher human beings are transformed from recipients of a teaching into its executing medium.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:SD5","text":"Time is recoded from a linear sequence into a recurring duration affirmed by joy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:DNX1","text":"Visible and waking consciousness has no conclusive access to the structure of the world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:DNX2","text":"Suffering cannot count as the deepest or final meaning of the world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:DNX3","text":"The utterance „Vergeh!“ cannot determine the world definitively.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:DNX4","text":"Eternity must not be understood as mere continuance without value or affirmation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:DNX5","text":"Knowledge remains inadequate if it does not pass into repetition, song, and assent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:SNX1","text":"Excluded is a world whose deepest truth lies in final passing away.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:SNX2","text":"Excluded is a temporal order in which repetition would be merely the return of the same without a sense of eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:SNX3","text":"Excluded is a subject that can recognize the truth without being obliged by it to its own repetition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:SNX4","text":"Absent remains a mediation that fully explains the opposition between a suffering world and eternal joy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:SNX5","text":"The force of the argument rests on the blocked possibility that woe might retain the last word.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:FGS1","text":"Unexamined understanding → exhortation to one's own repetition → performative confirmation of the meaning of the song.","refs":["CH_97E9_12_3:A1","CH_97E9_12_3:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0002","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:FGS2","text":"„Noch ein Mal“ → repetition beyond the individual case → determination as eternity.","refs":["CH_97E9_12_3:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:FGS3","text":"Awakening from a deep dream → transcendence of the measure of day → disclosure of the world's depth.","refs":["CH_97E9_12_3:A4","CH_97E9_12_3:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:FGS4","text":"Depth of the world → woe as impulse toward passing away → joy as deeper counter-movement → will to eternity.","refs":["CH_97E9_12_3:A6","CH_97E9_12_3:A7","CH_97E9_12_3:A8","CH_97E9_12_3:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:FGS5","text":"Deepest joy → eternal recurrence → exhortation to singing affirmation.","refs":["CH_97E9_12_3:A9","CH_97E9_12_3:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:AF1","text":"Unexamined understanding → performative exhortation → repetition as „Noch ein Mal“ → eternity as meaning → nocturnal awakening → depth of the world → subordination to joy → affirmation of eternal recurrence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:ME1","text":"The distinction between understanding and singing is transformed into a distinction between passive knowledge and enacted assent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:ME2","text":"The opposition between repetition and singularity is reordered through the equation of „Noch ein Mal“ and eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:ME3","text":"The hierarchy of affects is mapped in such a way that joy appears not as a counterpole alongside suffering, but as its deeper transcendence.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:ME4","text":"The opposition of day and night becomes an epistemic hierarchy of superficial and deep knowledge of the world.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:ME5","text":"The human subject is classified from an addressee of revelation into a bearer of its repetition.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:ALT1","text":"**Surface:** Higher human beings are to sing the roundelay „Noch ein Mal“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:ALT2","text":"**Structural:** World, pain, and joy are interconnected as a graduated order of depth.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:ALT3","text":"**Metastrategic:** Knowledge is transformed through repetition, song, and assent into an attitude of affirmation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:ALT4","text":"**Ontological/Temporal:** Reality is determined as an eternal, recurring duration whose strongest drive is joy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from the exhortation to song up to eternal affirmation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0002","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:MRT2","text":"The central dependence on the voice of deep midnight remains preserved as a change of perspective.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:MRT3","text":"It remains underdetermined how the higher human beings actually enact the required assent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0003","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:MRT4","text":"Likewise unresolved remains the relation between the „Vergeh!“ of woe and the drive toward eternity of joy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:MRT5","text":"The structure is internally coherent insofar as the deeper joy surpasses woe's movement toward passing away.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:MRT6","text":"The strongest point lies in the coupling of affective depth, repetition, and eternity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction hinges on the unsubstantiated positing that the greater depth of joy guarantees its ontological priority.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"low","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_12_3:MRT8","text":"The argumentative movement remains preserved, although the passage does not mediate the tension between world-suffering and eternity, but decides it through the priority of joy.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_12_3:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"repaired-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_12_3@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_12_3:v1","source_language_code":"de","source_title_context":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song","source_section_label":"12.","source_title_hierarchy":["Part Four and Last"],"reading_title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 12","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","The Night-Wanderer’s Song","12."],"original_title":"12."}],"source_title_context":"Das Nachtwandler-Lied","source_section_label":"12.","source_title_hierarchy":["Vierter und letzter Theil"],"reading_title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 12","reading_title_context":"Part Four and Last","reading_heading_titles":["Part Four and Last","The Night-Wanderer’s Song","12."],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 182","title":"The Night-Wanderer’s Song · 12","context":"Part Four and Last","original_context":"Vierter und letzter Theil"},"title_language_code":"en","original_title":"Das Nachtwandler-Lied · 12"},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ","layer":"CH","title":"The Sign","order":183,"parents":["RAW_97E9_DASZ"],"revision":"CH_97E9_DASZ@R001","sha256":"a2932bf8884bee013d41a8af5445c04c1ea7f20936ab2ff2f85b0ce010b71fe5","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:AS1","text":"Zarathustra sucht die zu seinem Werk und seinem Tag gehörenden Gefährten, erkennt jedoch die höheren Menschen als dafür ungeeignet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:AS2","text":"Die Unfähigkeit der höheren Menschen, seine Zeichen zu verstehen und seinem Ruf zu gehorchen, wird als strukturelle Schlafheit bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:AS3","text":"Das Erwachen von Adler, Tauben und Löwe erscheint Zarathustra als Zeichen einer ihm angemessenen Nähe: seiner „Kinder“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:AS4","text":"Die Flucht der höheren Menschen vor dem Löwen bestätigt rückwirkend ihre Unvereinbarkeit mit Zarathustras kommender Aufgabe.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:AS5","text":"Die Erinnerung an den Wahrsager übersetzt ihre Not in die Versuchung zum Mitleiden mit den höheren Menschen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:AS6","text":"Die Zurückweisung dieses Mitleidens verschiebt Zarathustras Orientierung von Glück und Rettung auf Werk, Reife und den kommenden großen Mittag.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:A1","text":"Zarathustras Handlung ist auf sein Werk gerichtet und nicht auf sein Glück.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:A2","text":"Die höheren Menschen verstehen Zarathustras morgendliche Zeichen nicht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:A3","text":"Den höheren Menschen fehlt das hörende und gehorchende Ohr.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:A4","text":"Richtige Gefährtschaft verlangt ein Erwachen, das Zarathustras eigenes Erwachen teilt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:A5","text":"Adler, Tauben und Löwe werden als Zarathustra zugehörige und erwachte Tiere anerkannt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:A6","text":"Das Zusammentreffen mit den Tieren gilt Zarathustra als Zeichen der Nähe seiner „Kinder“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:A7","text":"Der Löwe macht die Furcht und Fluchtbereitschaft der höheren Menschen sichtbar.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:A8","text":"Die Not der höheren Menschen erzeugt die Versuchung, sie zum Gegenstand des Mitleidens zu machen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:A9","text":"Das Mitleiden mit den höheren Menschen ist Zarathustras „letzte Sünde“.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:A10","text":"Diese letzte Sünde hat ihre Zeit gehabt und darf Zarathustras gegenwärtige Bewegung nicht mehr bestimmen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:A11","text":"Zarathustras Reife und Stunde werden durch den Beginn seines Tages und die Anrufung des großen Mittags bestimmt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:NX1","text":"Die höheren Menschen sind nicht Zarathustras rechte Gefährten.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:NX2","text":"Körperliches Erwachen ist nicht identisch mit der Fähigkeit, Zarathustras Zeichen zu verstehen.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:NX3","text":"Rang oder Höhe des Menschen ist nicht hinreichend für geistige Gefährtschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:NX4","text":"Zarathustras Weg ist nicht auf das Warten in der Höhle ausgerichtet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:NX5","text":"Der Schrei der Not ist nicht der maßgebliche Imperativ für Zarathustras Handeln.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:NX6","text":"Mitleiden ist nicht die letzte Form von Zarathustras Tugend, sondern die letzte zu überwindende Versuchung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:NX7","text":"Glück ist nicht der Endzweck von Zarathustras Bewegung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:NX8","text":"Die Bedeutung des Zeichens wird nicht durch die Anerkennung der höheren Menschen bestätigt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:D1","text":"Die höheren Menschen werden von möglichen Empfängern Zarathustras Lehre zu Objekten seiner zurückgewiesenen Versuchung umklassifiziert.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASZ:A2","CH_97E9_DASZ:A3","CH_97E9_DASZ:A8","CH_97E9_DASZ:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:D2","text":"Die Tiere fungieren als positives Gegenmodell zur menschlichen Unempfänglichkeit, weil sie Erwachen, Nähe und Zeichenfähigkeit verkörpern.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASZ:A4","CH_97E9_DASZ:A5","CH_97E9_DASZ:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:D3","text":"Der Löwe ist zugleich Zärtlichkeitszeichen für Zarathustra und Ausschlussmechanismus gegenüber den höheren Menschen.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASZ:A5","CH_97E9_DASZ:A6","CH_97E9_DASZ:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:D4","text":"Die Erinnerung an die Prophezeiung verwandelt die gegenwärtige Szene aus einem bloßen Ereignis in die Wiederkehr einer bereits benannten Prüfung.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASZ:A8","CH_97E9_DASZ:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:D5","text":"Zarathustras Tagesbeginn ist keine astronomische Feststellung, sondern die Vollzugsform seiner Entscheidung gegen Mitleid.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASZ:A1","CH_97E9_DASZ:A10","CH_97E9_DASZ:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:D6","text":"Die Nähe der „Kinder“ legitimiert den Aufbruch, obwohl die rechten Menschen weiterhin fehlen.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASZ:A6","CH_97E9_DASZ:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:SD1","text":"Das System ersetzt die Hierarchie „höhere Menschen“ durch ein Selektionskriterium der Resonanz: Zugehörig ist, wer Zeichen empfangen, Erwachen teilen und Zarathustras Bewegung nicht fliehen kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASZ:A2","CH_97E9_DASZ:A3","CH_97E9_DASZ:A4","CH_97E9_DASZ:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:SD2","text":"Das gefährliche oder furchterregende Ereignis wird als Prüfapparat umcodiert: Was die höheren Menschen vertreibt, bestätigt Zarathustra in seiner Reife.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASZ:A5","CH_97E9_DASZ:A6","CH_97E9_DASZ:A7","CH_97E9_DASZ:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:SD3","text":"Die Verweigerung des Mitleidens ist keine Gefühllosigkeit im Allgemeinen, sondern die Abwehr einer Bindung an eine historisch erschöpfte Form menschlicher Notverwaltung.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASZ:A8","CH_97E9_DASZ:A9","CH_97E9_DASZ:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:SD4","text":"Zarathustras Zukunft wird durch eine noch nicht anwesende Gemeinschaft der „Kinder“ autorisiert, während die vorhandene Gemeinschaft der höheren Menschen disqualifiziert wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASZ:A2","CH_97E9_DASZ:A6","CH_97E9_DASZ:A7","CH_97E9_DASZ:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:DNX1","text":"Das System setzt voraus, dass bestehende menschliche Exzellenz keine hinreichende Grundlage für die kommende Aufgabe bietet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:DNX2","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass Leid allein einen verbindlichen Anspruch auf Hilfe oder Selbstunterbrechung erzeugt.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:DNX3","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass Verständigung mit den gegenwärtig Anwesenden die Bedingung legitimer Handlung ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:DNX4","text":"Das System setzt voraus, dass symbolische Ereignisse eine höhere Orientierungsfunktion haben können als deliberative menschliche Zustimmung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:DNX5","text":"Das System schließt aus, dass die Zukunft aus einer graduellen Verbesserung der höheren Menschen hervorgeht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:SNX1","text":"Die rechte menschliche Gemeinschaft ist im entscheidenden Augenblick abwesend: Die höheren Menschen genügen nicht, die „Kinder“ sind nur als Nähe bezeichnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:SNX2","text":"Der große Mittag ist nicht gegenwärtig verfügbar, sondern organisiert die Gegenwart als gerichtete Erwartung und Aufbruch.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:SNX3","text":"Eine allgemein überprüfbare Instanz für die Wahrheit des Zeichens fehlt; seine Geltung entsteht allein innerhalb von Zarathustras Deutung und Entscheidung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:FGS1","text":"Erwachen Zarathustras → Prüfung der vorhandenen Gefährten → Feststellung ihrer Zeichenunfähigkeit.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:FGS2","text":"Zeichenereignis der Tiere → affektive Gewissheit der Kindernähe → Bestimmung eigener Reife.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:FGS3","text":"Begegnung der höheren Menschen mit dem Löwen → Flucht → sichtbarer Ausschluss aus der kommenden Gemeinschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:FGS4","text":"Erinnerung an Wahrsagung und Not → Identifikation der Versuchung als Mitleid → zeitliche Entwertung dieser Versuchung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:FGS5","text":"Zurückweisung des Mitleidens → Rückbindung an das Werk → Ausruf des eigenen Morgens und des großen Mittags.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:AF1","text":"Ungeeignete Gefährten → Zeichenunfähigkeit der höheren Menschen → Erwachen der Tiere.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:AF2","text":"Erwachen der Tiere → Zeichen der Kindernähe → Reife Zarathustras.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:AF3","text":"Löwenbegegnung → Flucht der höheren Menschen → Bestätigung ihres Ausschlusses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:AF4","text":"Erinnerung an ihre Not → Benennung des Mitleidens als letzte Sünde → Abweisung der Versuchung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:AF5","text":"Abweisung des Mitleidens → Vorrang des Werkes → Aufbruch in den kommenden Mittag.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:ME1","text":"Die Kategorie des „höheren Menschen“ verliert ihren Vorrang und wird von der Kategorie der Zeichenempfänglichkeit überordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:ME2","text":"Tiere werden nicht als bloße Naturkulisse behandelt, sondern als Träger von Erwachen, Anerkennung, Zärtlichkeit und selektiver Prüfung.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:ME3","text":"Mitleid wird von einer unmittelbar positiven Reaktion auf Not zu einer geschichtlich überholten Bindungsform umgeordnet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:ME4","text":"Die Zeitordnung verschiebt sich von Nacht und Morgen als Chronologie zu Nacht, Morgen, Tag und Mittag als Stufen existenzieller Reife.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:ME5","text":"Die Zukunft wird nicht als Fortsetzung der gegenwärtigen Gemeinschaft kartiert, sondern als Ankunft einer anderen, erst angekündigten Gemeinschaft.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:ALT1","text":"Surface — Zarathustra verlässt die Höhle, begegnet Adler, Tauben und Löwe, wird von den höheren Menschen getrennt und bricht erneut auf.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:ALT2","text":"Structural — Die Szene selektiert zwischen Zeichenempfänglichkeit und Zeichenunfähigkeit und verteilt Zugehörigkeit entsprechend dieser Differenz.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — Der Text löst Zarathustras Aufgabe aus der Pflicht, bestehende Eliten zu retten, zu überzeugen oder zu bemitleiden.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Wahrheit und Reife erscheinen als ereignishafte Zeichenordnung, deren Zeit nicht messbar-linear, sondern kairologisch strukturiert ist.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:MRT1","text":"Die Axiome reichen aus, um die Umklassifikation der höheren Menschen, die Funktion der Tiere und die Zurückweisung des Mitleidens zu rekonstruieren.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:MRT2","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wer oder was die „Kinder“ sind und worin ihre tatsächliche Nähe jenseits des Zeichens besteht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:MRT3","text":"Die Struktur ist kohärent, sofern Zarathustras Deutungshoheit über das Zeichen als interne Geltungsinstanz akzeptiert wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:MRT4","text":"Die stärkste Operation liegt in der Verbindung von Löwenangst, Flucht der höheren Menschen und rückwirkender Bestätigung ihres Ausschlusses.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:MRT5","text":"Die stärkste Bruchlinie liegt darin, dass die gewünschten rechten Menschen fehlen, während ihre Nähe dennoch als hinreichende Handlungslegitimation fungiert.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0023","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:MRT6","text":"Eine weitere Spannung besteht darin, dass körperliches Erwachen der höheren Menschen ihre fortdauernde geistige Schlafheit nicht aufhebt, sondern erst sichtbar macht.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:MRT7","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die Bewegung nur, wenn das Zeichen nicht als objektiver Beweis, sondern als Auslöser einer entscheidenden Selbstdeutung behandelt wird.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T193058315588Z_613da4de","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"The Sign","source_sha256":"a2932bf8884bee013d41a8af5445c04c1ea7f20936ab2ff2f85b0ce010b71fe5","sha256":"005dd94fd205395938ef0be7e29b122b7625c9a915a3a9c2cc270094f3809e4d","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:30:58.316669+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:AS1","text":"Zarathustra seeks the companions belonging to his work and his day, but recognizes the higher human beings as unsuitable for this.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:AS2","text":"The inability of the higher human beings to understand his signs and obey his call is determined as structural sleepiness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:AS3","text":"The awakening of eagle, doves, and lion appears to Zarathustra as a sign of a proximity appropriate to him: that of his “children.”","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:AS4","text":"The flight of the higher human beings from the lion retrospectively confirms their incompatibility with Zarathustra’s coming task.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:AS5","text":"The recollection of the soothsayer translates their distress into the temptation to suffer-with the higher human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:AS6","text":"The rejection of this suffering-with shifts Zarathustra’s orientation from happiness and salvation to work, maturity, and the coming great noon.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:A1","text":"Zarathustra’s action is directed toward his work and not toward his happiness.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0022","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:A2","text":"The higher human beings do not understand Zarathustra’s morning signs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0005","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:A3","text":"The higher human beings lack the hearing and obedient ear.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0006","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:A4","text":"Proper companionship requires an awakening that shares Zarathustra’s own awakening.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:A5","text":"Eagle, doves, and lion are recognized as animals belonging to Zarathustra and as awakened.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0008","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:A6","text":"The encounter with the animals counts for Zarathustra as a sign of the proximity of his “children.”","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0012","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0013","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:A7","text":"The lion makes the fear and readiness for flight of the higher human beings visible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:A8","text":"The distress of the higher human beings produces the temptation to make them the object of suffering-with.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:A9","text":"Suffering-with the higher human beings is Zarathustra’s “last sin.”","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:A10","text":"This last sin has had its time and may no longer determine Zarathustra’s present movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:A11","text":"Zarathustra’s maturity and hour are determined by the beginning of his day and the invocation of the great noon.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:NX1","text":"The higher human beings are not Zarathustra’s proper companions.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0004","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:NX2","text":"Bodily awakening is not identical with the capacity to understand Zarathustra’s signs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:NX3","text":"Rank or human elevation is not sufficient for spiritual companionship.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:NX4","text":"Zarathustra’s path is not oriented toward waiting in the cave.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0001","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0025","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:NX5","text":"The cry of distress is not the authoritative imperative for Zarathustra’s action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:NX6","text":"Suffering-with is not the final form of Zarathustra’s virtue, but the final temptation to be overcome.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0021","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:NX7","text":"Happiness is not the final end of Zarathustra’s movement.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0002","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:NX8","text":"The meaning of the sign is not confirmed through the recognition of the higher human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"4","name":"Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:D1","text":"The higher human beings are reclassified from possible recipients of Zarathustra’s teaching into objects of his rejected temptation.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASZ:A2","CH_97E9_DASZ:A3","CH_97E9_DASZ:A8","CH_97E9_DASZ:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:D2","text":"The animals function as a positive countermodel to human unreceptivity because they embody awakening, proximity, and capacity for signs.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASZ:A4","CH_97E9_DASZ:A5","CH_97E9_DASZ:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:D3","text":"The lion is at once a sign of tenderness for Zarathustra and a mechanism of exclusion vis-à-vis the higher human beings.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASZ:A5","CH_97E9_DASZ:A6","CH_97E9_DASZ:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:D4","text":"The recollection of the prophecy transforms the present scene from a mere event into the return of an already designated trial.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASZ:A8","CH_97E9_DASZ:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0016","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0017","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0018","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:D5","text":"The beginning of Zarathustra’s day is not an astronomical statement, but the enactment-form of his decision against suffering-with.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASZ:A1","CH_97E9_DASZ:A10","CH_97E9_DASZ:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0024","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:D6","text":"The proximity of the “children” legitimates departure, although the proper human beings continue to be absent.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASZ:A6","CH_97E9_DASZ:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"5","name":"Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:SD1","text":"The system replaces the hierarchy of “higher human beings” with a criterion of selection by resonance: belonging is accorded to whoever can receive signs, share awakening, and cannot flee Zarathustra’s movement.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASZ:A2","CH_97E9_DASZ:A3","CH_97E9_DASZ:A4","CH_97E9_DASZ:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0006","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:SD2","text":"The dangerous or frightening event is recoded as a testing apparatus: what drives away the higher human beings confirms Zarathustra in his maturity.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASZ:A5","CH_97E9_DASZ:A6","CH_97E9_DASZ:A7","CH_97E9_DASZ:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:SD3","text":"The refusal of suffering-with is not insensitivity in general, but the defense against a binding to a historically exhausted form of managing human distress.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASZ:A8","CH_97E9_DASZ:A9","CH_97E9_DASZ:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:SD4","text":"Zarathustra’s future is authorized by a not-yet-present community of the “children,” while the existing community of the higher human beings is disqualified.","refs":["CH_97E9_DASZ:A2","CH_97E9_DASZ:A6","CH_97E9_DASZ:A7","CH_97E9_DASZ:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:DNX1","text":"The system presupposes that existing human excellence offers no sufficient basis for the coming task.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:DNX2","text":"The system excludes that suffering alone generates a binding claim to help or self-interruption.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0016","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0021","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0022","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:DNX3","text":"The system excludes that understanding with those presently present is the condition of legitimate action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0005","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0014","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0024","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:DNX4","text":"The system presupposes that symbolic events can have a higher orienting function than deliberative human assent.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:DNX5","text":"The system excludes that the future emerges from a gradual improvement of the higher human beings.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0004","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0023","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Deep Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:SNX1","text":"The proper human community is absent at the decisive moment: the higher human beings do not suffice, the “children” are designated only as proximity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0009","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:SNX2","text":"The great noon is not presently available, but organizes the present as directed expectation and departure.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0023","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0024","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:SNX3","text":"A universally verifiable instance for the truth of the sign is absent; its validity arises solely within Zarathustra’s interpretation and decision.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics"},{"number":"8","name":"Formal Generative Schema","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:FGS1","text":"Zarathustra’s awakening → testing of the existing companions → determination of their incapacity for signs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:FGS2","text":"Sign-event of the animals → affective certainty of the children’s proximity → determination of his own maturity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:FGS3","text":"Encounter of the higher human beings with the lion → flight → visible exclusion from the coming community.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:FGS4","text":"Recollection of soothsaying and distress → identification of the temptation as suffering-with → temporal devaluation of this temptation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0016","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:FGS5","text":"Rejection of suffering-with → return-binding to the work → proclamation of his own morning and of the great noon.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema"},{"number":"9","name":"Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:AF1","text":"Unsuitable companions → incapacity for signs of the higher human beings → awakening of the animals.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:AF2","text":"Awakening of the animals → sign of the children’s proximity → Zarathustra’s maturity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:AF3","text":"Encounter with the lion → flight of the higher human beings → confirmation of their exclusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0014","trace_type":"Direct","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:AF4","text":"Recollection of their distress → designation of suffering-with as the last sin → rejection of the temptation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0017","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:AF5","text":"Rejection of suffering-with → priority of the work → departure into the coming noon.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"10","name":"Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:ME1","text":"The category of the “higher human being” loses its priority and is subordinated to the category of receptivity to signs.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0004","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0005","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:ME2","text":"Animals are not treated as mere natural scenery, but as bearers of awakening, recognition, tenderness, and selective testing.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0007","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0012","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0013","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:ME3","text":"Suffering-with is reordered from an immediately positive response to distress into a historically superseded form of binding.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0018","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0021","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0022","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:ME4","text":"The temporal order shifts from night and morning as chronology to night, morning, day, and noon as stages of existential maturity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:ME5","text":"The future is not mapped as a continuation of the present community, but as the arrival of another community, only announced as yet.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0009","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Map-Effects"},{"number":"11","name":"Altitude Levels","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:ALT1","text":"Surface — Zarathustra leaves the cave, encounters eagle, doves, and lion, is separated from the higher human beings, and sets out anew.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0001","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0025","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:ALT2","text":"Structural — The scene selects between receptivity to signs and incapacity for signs and distributes belonging according to this difference.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0005","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0006","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0007","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:ALT3","text":"Metastrategic — The text releases Zarathustra’s task from the duty to save, persuade, or pity existing elites.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:ALT4","text":"Ontological/Temporal — Truth and maturity appear as an event-like order of signs whose time is structured not measurably-linearly, but kairologically.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0024","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Altitude Levels"},{"number":"12","name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:MRT1","text":"The axioms suffice to reconstruct the reclassification of the higher human beings, the function of the animals, and the rejection of suffering-with.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0004","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0014","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0021","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0022","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:MRT2","text":"It remains underdetermined who or what the “children” are and wherein their actual proximity consists beyond the sign.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0009","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0013","trace_type":"Negative","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:MRT3","text":"The structure is coherent insofar as Zarathustra’s interpretive sovereignty over the sign is accepted as an internal instance of validity.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"medium","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:MRT4","text":"The strongest operation lies in the connection of fear of the lion, flight of the higher human beings, and retrospective confirmation of their exclusion.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0014","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0023","trace_type":"Composite","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:MRT5","text":"The strongest fault line lies in the fact that the desired proper human beings are absent, while their proximity nevertheless functions as sufficient legitimation for action.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0009","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0013","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0023","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:MRT6","text":"A further tension consists in the fact that the bodily awakening of the higher human beings does not cancel their continuing spiritual sleepiness, but rather first makes it visible.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0004","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0005","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0014","trace_type":"Tension","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]},{"id":"CH_97E9_DASZ:MRT7","text":"The reconstruction preserves the movement only if the sign is treated not as objective proof, but as the trigger of a decisive self-interpretation.","refs":[],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0012","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0013","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"},{"id":"RAW_97E9_DASZ:P0023","trace_type":"Structural","confidence":"high","alignment_provenance":"frozen-grounding"}]}],"original_name":"Minimal Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CH_97E9_DASZ@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CH_97E9_DASZ:v1","source_language_code":"de"}],"identity":{"layer":"CH","kicker":"Chapter 183","title":"The Sign","context":"Chapter 183","original_title":"Das Zeichen","original_context":"Chapter 183"},"original_title":"Das Zeichen","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CL_97E9_01","layer":"CL","title":"Chapters 01–03","order":1,"parents":["CH_97E9_1100","CH_97E9_2200","CH_97E9_3300"],"revision":"CL_97E9_01@R001","sha256":"eb2ac2c1359647ae4461472a6ae6c9bd6b0f1fc2407469e449beb1c19821a446","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_01:AS-B01","text":"Das System bearbeitet die Unmöglichkeit, geistige Überfülle als isolierten Besitz zu stabilisieren, ohne sie in soziale, irdische und transformative Wirkung zu überführen.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:AS-B02","text":"Der Abstieg aus Einsamkeit ist keine nachträgliche Anwendung einer vollendeten Weisheit, sondern die Bedingung, unter der Überfluss überhaupt wirksam und bestimmbar wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:AS-B03","text":"Das Sonnenmodell organisiert die Bewegung als produktive Selbstentäußerung: Höhe muss untergehen, damit ihr Reichtum in anderen Gestalten fortwirkt.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:AS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:AS-B04","text":"Die Gabe bleibt jedoch nicht unter Kontrolle des Gebenden, weil ihr öffentlicher Eintritt durch Misstrauen, Almosenlogik und Fehllektüre vermittelt wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:AS-B05","text":"Die Bewegung skaliert von Zarathustras persönlicher Verausgabung zu einer Diagnose des Menschen als Übergangsform, deren gegenwärtige Werte keine abschließende Gestalt besitzen.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:AS-B06","text":"Der Tod Gottes trennt die asketische Rückzugsökonomie vom neuen irdischen Transformationsregime, ohne die Möglichkeit gelingender Übermittlung bereits zu sichern.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:AS-B07","text":"Die öffentliche Verkündigung wird zur Prüfung der Empfangsfähigkeit: Schlaf, Diebstahlsverdacht und Spektakelerwartung zeigen, dass die Adressaten den Übergang nicht einfach vollziehen.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:AS3","CH_97E9_3300:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:AS-B08","text":"Die Clusterbewegung ist rekursiv und eskalativ: Überfülle erzwingt Abstieg, Abstieg erzeugt Rezeptionskrisen, und diese Krisen werden zum Beweis dafür, dass Selbstüberwindung noch aussteht.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:A3","CH_97E9_3300:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_01:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Geistiger Reichtum besitzt keinen stabilen Sinn als Eigenbesitz, sondern nur als Überschuss, der sich an Empfänger, Erde und Zukunft weitergibt.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:A5","CH_97E9_3300:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:GA-02","text":"[Mutating] Der Abstieg wandelt sich von der Selbstentäußerung eines einzelnen Weisen zur allgemeinen Bedingung, unter der der Mensch seine gegenwärtige Gestalt überschreiten kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:A8","CH_97E9_3300:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:GA-03","text":"[Emergent] Übermittlung ist keine einseitige Handlung des Gebenden, sondern ein konflikthaftes Verhältnis, in dem Empfänger den Sinn der Gabe vor ihrer Annahme umdeuten können.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:ME5","CH_97E9_3300:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:GA-04","text":"[Attractor] Die Erde fungiert als Attraktor, weil sie Gabe, Leib, Zukunft und Selbstüberwindung gegen jede überirdische Auslagerung des Sinns zusammenbindet.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A4","CH_97E9_3300:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:GA-05","text":"[Persistent] Einsamkeit kann Überfülle erzeugen, garantiert aber weder Erkenntnisgegenwart noch soziale Wirksamkeit und muss daher verlassen werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:A2","CH_97E9_2200:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:GA-06","text":"[Mutating] Der Gegensatz von Aufstieg und Abstieg verliert seine moralische Wertigkeit und wird zur Richtungsfrage: Asche wird hinaufgetragen, Feuer, Weisheit und Transformation müssen hinabgetragen werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:AS2","CH_97E9_2200:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:GA-07","text":"[Emergent] Produktive Negativität erscheint als notwendige Schwelle, weil Überdruss, Untergang und große Verachtung vorhandene Werte erst in transformierbares Material überführen.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:D4","CH_97E9_3300:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:GA-08","text":"[Terminal] Die religiöse Absonderung des Heiligen wird durch die Diagnose des Todes Gottes zeitlich disqualifiziert, bleibt aber als fortwirkendes Rezeptionshindernis bestehen.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:D7","CH_97E9_2200:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:GA-09","text":"[Attractor] Der Mensch ist weder Endpunkt noch transparenter Empfänger, sondern ein unreiner Übergang, dessen Unfähigkeit zur Aufnahme selbst die Notwendigkeit weiterer Überwindung anzeigt.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A2","CH_97E9_3300:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_01:RMD-01","text":"Weisheit kehrt als Überfluss wieder, mutiert aber von angesammeltem Besitz zu einer Gabe, deren Wahrheit erst in riskanter sozialer Zirkulation entsteht.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:A3","CH_97E9_2200:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:RMD-02","text":"Einsamkeit behält ihre produktive Funktion als Ort der Sammlung, verliert jedoch ihren Status als Ziel und erscheint zugleich als epistemischer Rückstand.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:A2","CH_97E9_2200:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:RMD-03","text":"Der Abstieg bleibt eine Bewegung aus der Höhe, erweitert sich jedoch von Zarathustras Menschwerdung zur immanenten Umgestaltung der menschlichen Gattung.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:D5","CH_97E9_3300:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:RMD-04","text":"Das Geschenk wird funktional umgekehrt: Was als Reichtum und Feuer angeboten wird, kann durch die Empfänger als Almosen, Diebstahl oder Spektakel umcodiert werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:NX4","CH_97E9_2200:ME3","CH_97E9_3300:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:RMD-05","text":"Die Verachtung wandert von einer möglichen Verneinung des Menschen zu einer produktiven Schwellenkraft, die gegenwärtige Genügsamkeit in Selbstüberwindungsdruck übersetzt.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:AS5","CH_97E9_3300:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_01:CGD-01","text":"Die Sonnenanalogie, Asche, Feuer, Wald, Täler, Meer, Blitz und Wahnsinn bleiben lokale Bildträger; auf Clusterebene werden sie als verschiedene Operatoren der Richtungsumkehr, Übertragung und Transformation absorbiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:A6","CH_97E9_2200:A3","CH_97E9_3300:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:CGD-02","text":"Die konkrete Begegnung mit dem Heiligen bleibt eine lokale Szene, skaliert aber als Gegenmodell einer abgeschlossenen Spiritualität, die keine irdische Übertragung vollzieht.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:AS4","CH_97E9_2200:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:CGD-03","text":"Die Unterscheidung Geschenk/Almosen gehört zunächst zur lokalen Gabenszene, wird auf Clusterebene zur allgemeinen Differenz zwischen überschüssiger Transformation und Verwaltung von Bedürftigkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:A8","CH_97E9_2200:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:CGD-04","text":"Der Übermensch ist keine isolierte Zukunftsfigur der dritten Einheit, sondern die höhere Form, in welche die vorausgehenden Bewegungen von Überfluss, Abstieg und misslingender Übermittlung konvergieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A3","CH_97E9_3300:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_01:GNX-01","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird ein Geist, der sich durch Absonderung, Besitz oder Selbstgenügsamkeit vollendet, ohne sich an andere und an die Erde zu verlieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:DNX1","CH_97E9_1100:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:GNX-02","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Spiritualität, die Menschenliebe durch Gottesliebe, Erdtreue durch Jenseitshoffnung oder Leib durch eine höhere Seele ersetzt.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:A6","CH_97E9_3300:NX3","CH_97E9_3300:NX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:GNX-03","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Annahme, dass moralische Genügsamkeit, Vernunft oder Mitleid bereits hinreichende Formen menschlicher Vollendung darstellen.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A9","CH_97E9_3300:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:GNX-04","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird ein transparentes Kommunikationsmodell, in dem die Intention des Gebenden den Sinn seiner Gabe und die Aufnahme seiner Lehre garantiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:DNX3","CH_97E9_2200:SNX4","CH_97E9_3300:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_01:DBN-01","text":"Damit die Architektur besteht, darf keine Höhe als selbstgenügsame Endposition gelten; jede Höhe muss in Abstieg, Selbstverlust und irdische Umwandlung übergehen.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:DNX3","CH_97E9_3300:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:DBN-02","text":"Damit Selbstüberwindung möglich bleibt, darf keine transzendente Instanz den Sinn garantieren, weil ein äußerer Garant sowohl Erdtreue als auch die Notwendigkeit des Werdens suspendieren würde.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:DNX2","CH_97E9_3300:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:DBN-03","text":"Damit Gabe transformativ bleibt, darf sie weder als Wohltätigkeit aus Mangel noch als bloße Information behandelt werden; sie muss eine Umordnung des Empfängers riskieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:D3","CH_97E9_2200:FGS5","CH_97E9_3300:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_01:BSA-01","text":"Die tiefste ausgeschlossene Möglichkeit ist eine versöhnte Gegenwart, in der Mensch, Werte, Empfänger und Sinn bereits vollständig bestimmt, verständlich und abgeschlossen wären.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:DNX1","CH_97E9_3300:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:BSA-02","text":"Das System umkreist eine nicht verfügbare Form gelingender kollektiver Aufnahme: Der Übermensch kann als Horizont, aber nicht als vorhandene soziale Wirklichkeit erscheinen.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:DNX6","CH_97E9_3300:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_01:XD-01","text":"Die Notwendigkeit des Abstiegs erzeugt keine gesicherte Gemeinschaft, sondern exponiert den Überfluss erst der sozialen Umcodierung; daher wird Wirkung zugleich notwendig und unkontrollierbar. ; Trace Type — Composite","refs":["CL_97E9_01:GA-01","CL_97E9_01:GA-03","CH_97E9_1100:D2","CH_97E9_2200:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:XD-02","text":"Die Ablösung der Gottesliebe durch Erdtreue radikalisiert die Gabe: Sie soll nicht Bedürftigkeit verwalten, sondern den gegenwärtigen Menschen als unzureichende Übergangsform entsetzen. ; Trace Type — Composite","refs":["CL_97E9_01:GA-04","CL_97E9_01:GA-08","CH_97E9_2200:SD2","CH_97E9_3300:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:XD-03","text":"Die Rezeptionsstörung ist kein äußerliches Scheitern der Verkündigung, sondern reproduziert auf sozialer Ebene genau jene Genügsamkeit, die die Lehre überwinden will. ; Trace Type — Tension","refs":["CL_97E9_01:GA-03","CL_97E9_01:GA-09","CH_97E9_2200:SD4","CH_97E9_3300:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:XD-04","text":"Untergang und große Verachtung bilden eine gemeinsame Transformationslogik: Beide suspendieren vorhandene Gestalten nicht um der Vernichtung willen, sondern damit Überschuss in eine andere Ordnung übergehen kann. ; Trace Type — Composite","refs":["CL_97E9_01:GA-02","CL_97E9_01:GA-07","CH_97E9_1100:SD4","CH_97E9_3300:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_01:BSD-01","text":"Das System ersetzt die Ontologie stabiler Wesen durch eine Ökonomie von Übergängen, in der Reichtum, Identität und Sinn nur als Prozesse ihrer Überschreitung bestehen.","refs":["CL_97E9_01:GA-01","CL_97E9_01:GA-09","CH_97E9_1100:ME1","CH_97E9_3300:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:BSD-02","text":"Handlungsmacht wird weder als souveräne Selbstbewahrung noch als bloßer Empfang bestimmt, sondern als riskante Fähigkeit, sich zu verausgaben und die fremde Umformung des Gegebenen auszuhalten.","refs":["CL_97E9_01:GA-02","CL_97E9_01:GA-03","CH_97E9_1100:SD1","CH_97E9_2200:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:BSD-03","text":"Geschichte erscheint als ungleichzeitige Konfrontation von Bewusstseinszeiten: religiöse Absonderung, erwachende Verkündigung und spektakelorientierte Menge koexistieren ohne gemeinsamen Horizont.","refs":["CL_97E9_01:GA-08","CL_97E9_01:GA-09","CH_97E9_2200:SNX1","CH_97E9_2200:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:BSD-04","text":"Die Erde wird zur Instanz ohne transzendenten Richter: Sie fordert nicht moralische Anpassung, sondern die Hervorbringung von Formen, die gegenwärtige Werte aufnehmen, übersteigen und verwandeln können.","refs":["CL_97E9_01:GA-04","CL_97E9_01:GA-07","CH_97E9_3300:A3","CH_97E9_3300:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_01:RLE-01","text":"Einsamkeit erzeugt Überfülle, Überfülle erzeugt Abstieg, Abstieg erzeugt Abhängigkeit von Empfängern, und deren Widerstand erzeugt erneut die Notwendigkeit weiterer Verwandlung.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:FGS1","CH_97E9_2200:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:RLE-02","text":"Die Gabe bildet eine rekursive Schleife, weil sie sich nur verwirklicht, indem sie ihren Urheber überschreitet, aber gerade dadurch dem Risiko fremder Deutung ausgeliefert wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:A5","CH_97E9_2200:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:RLE-03","text":"Die große Verachtung ist ein Attraktor, weil sie Enttäuschung über bestehende Werte nicht stillstellt, sondern in den Druck zur Selbstüberwindung zurückführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:D4","CH_97E9_3300:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:RLE-04","text":"Der Übermensch fungiert als Fernattraktor: Seine positive Gestalt bleibt ausgesetzt, aber seine Abwesenheit organisiert Kritik, Erdtreue, Verachtung und die Forderung nach neuer Aufnahmefähigkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:SNX1","CH_97E9_3300:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_01:FGS-B01","text":"Einsamkeit + geistige Ansammlung → Überfülle → Unmöglichkeit des weiteren Eigenbesitzes.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:FGS-B02","text":"Überfülle + Empfängerbedarf → Abstieg → Selbstentäußerung → Gabe aus Reichtum statt Almosen.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:FGS2","CH_97E9_2200:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:FGS-B03","text":"Gabe + soziale Verdächtigung → Umcodierung als Diebstahl oder Spektakel → Offenlegung der Nichtaufnahmefähigkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:FGS6","CH_97E9_3300:FGS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:FGS-B04","text":"Nichtaufnahmefähigkeit + Erdtreue → große Verachtung gegen gegenwärtige Genügsamkeit → Forderung nach Selbstüberwindung.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:FGS4","CH_97E9_3300:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:FGS-B05","text":"Selbstüberwindung ohne transzendenten Garant → Übermensch als nicht vorhandener Maßstab, Aufnahmeform und Transformationshorizont.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:FGS3","CH_97E9_3300:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_01:AFM-B01","text":"Isolierte Weisheit → Überdruss am Besitz → Notwendigkeit der Verausgabung.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:AFM-B02","text":"Verausgabung → Abstieg zu den Menschen → Verlust der abgesonderten Höhe.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:AF3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:AFM-B03","text":"Geschenk aus Überschuss → Konflikt mit Almosen- und Rückzugslogik → Verdacht gegen den Gebenden.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:FGS4","CH_97E9_2200:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:AFM-B04","text":"Religiöser Zeitversatz → Ausschluss überirdischer Sinnordnung → Erdtreue als neue Orientierungsbedingung.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:FGS7","CH_97E9_3300:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:AFM-B05","text":"Erdtreue → große Verachtung → eruptiver Transformationsdruck → Übermensch als Horizont bei fortdauernder kollektiver Fehllektüre.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:AF1","CH_97E9_3300:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_01:MME-01","text":"Weisheit wird von Eigentum zu Zirkulation umkartiert, und Zirkulation wird nicht als harmonischer Austausch, sondern als riskante Umordnung von Gebendem und Empfänger bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:ME1","CH_97E9_2200:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:MME-02","text":"Einsamkeit und Gemeinschaft werden nicht als Gegensätze, sondern als asymmetrische Phasen einer Ökonomie sichtbar, deren Übergang keine gelingende Vermittlung garantiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:ME4","CH_97E9_2200:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:MME-03","text":"Der Mensch wird zugleich als Adressat, Hindernis und Material der Verkündigung reklassifiziert; seine Fehllektüre ist Teil der Diagnose und nicht bloß ihr äußerer Empfang.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:ME5","CH_97E9_3300:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:MME-04","text":"Transzendenzkritik, Leibaffirmation und Wertkritik erscheinen als ein einziger Mechanismus, der Sinn von der Flucht aus der Welt auf die Umgestaltung der Welt verlegt.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:AS4","CH_97E9_3300:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_01:ALT-B01","text":"Surface level — Zarathustra verlässt die Einsamkeit, begegnet dem Heiligen, bietet den Menschen eine Gabe an und verkündet den Übermenschen.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:ALT1","CH_97E9_2200:ALT1","CH_97E9_3300:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:ALT-B02","text":"Structural level — Überfluss, Gabe, Misstrauen, Erdtreue und Selbstüberwindung bilden eine gekoppelte Maschine, in der jede Übertragung durch die Begrenztheit ihrer Empfänger geprüft wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:ALT2","CH_97E9_2200:ALT2","CH_97E9_3300:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:ALT-B03","text":"Metastrategic level — Intervention bedeutet nicht Belehrung aus sicherer Höhe, sondern den riskanten Verzicht auf Höhe zugunsten einer Übertragung, die vorhandene Werte destabilisiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:ALT3","CH_97E9_2200:ALT3","CH_97E9_3300:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:ALT-B04","text":"Ontological / Temporal level — Realität erscheint als Werden ohne transzendenten Abschluss, und Zeit als ungleichzeitige Folge von Einsamkeit, Untergang, Erwachen, Nichtaufnahme und zukünftiger Überwindung.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:ALT4","CH_97E9_2200:ALT4","CH_97E9_3300:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:ALT-B05","text":"Methodological / Performative level — Das System vollzieht seine These, indem es die Verkündigung nicht von ihrer Fehllektüre trennt: Die Form des misslingenden Empfangs demonstriert die behauptete Diagnose.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:D6","CH_97E9_3300:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_01:FL-01","text":"Der Abstieg ist zugleich Erfüllung der Überfülle und Verlust einer Sonderstellung; das System benötigt diese Doppelwertigkeit, ohne sie in eine eindeutige Bilanz aufzulösen.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:FL-02","text":"Die Menschen werden als notwendige Empfänger adressiert, aber zugleich als misstrauisch, schlafend und spektakelorientiert dargestellt; dadurch bleibt unklar, wie die verlangte Übertragung tatsächlich gelingen kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:MRT3","CH_97E9_2200:MRT6","CH_97E9_3300:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:MP-01","text":"Weisheit mutiert an der Schwelle von Besitz zu Gabe: Ihre Steigerung besteht nicht in Akkumulation, sondern in der Fähigkeit, sich durch Austeilung zu entleeren.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:SD3","CH_97E9_1100:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:MP-02","text":"Verachtung mutiert an der Schwelle von bloßer Negation zu produktiver Kraft, bleibt jedoch ohne unabhängiges Kriterium dafür, wann ihr eruptiver Charakter Transformation statt Zerstörung erzeugt.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:ME4","CH_97E9_3300:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_01:HSI-01","text":"Realität erscheint als zirkulierende Transformationsmaschine: Höhe produziert Überfluss, Überfluss verlangt Abstieg, und Abstieg setzt Stoffe frei, die gegen ihre gegenwärtige Form umgebildet werden müssen.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:FGS3","CH_97E9_3300:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:HSI-02","text":"Das Subjekt erscheint nicht als souveräner Besitzer seiner Wahrheit, sondern als Durchgangsstelle, die Reichtum, Feuer, Verachtung und Zukunft nur trägt, indem sie sich selbst preisgibt.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:D5","CH_97E9_3300:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:HSI-03","text":"Möglich bleibt ein Kampf gegen Selbstgenügsamkeit und Transzendenzflucht, dessen Erfolg weder durch den Gebenden noch durch die gegenwärtige Gemeinschaft garantiert wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:SNX4","CH_97E9_3300:DNX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_01:MRT-B01","text":"Die extrahierten Axiome reichen aus, um die Clusterarchitektur als Übergang von Überfluss über riskante Übermittlung zu irdischer Selbstüberwindung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:MRT1","CH_97E9_3300:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:MRT-B02","text":"Unterbestimmt bleiben die positive Gestalt des Übermenschen, der konkrete Inhalt der Gabe und die Bedingungen einer Aufnahme, die weder Almosenlogik noch Spektakel reproduziert.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:MRT2","CH_97E9_3300:MRT3","CH_97E9_3300:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:MRT-B03","text":"Die Architektur ist dort am stärksten, wo Untergang, Gabe, Erdtreue und Verachtung als miteinander verschränkte Transformationsoperatoren lesbar werden; sie bleibt von produktiv unaufgelösten Spannungen zwischen Sendung und Empfang abhängig.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:ME5","CH_97E9_3300:MRT4","CH_97E9_3300:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T195631866492Z_086da45c","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Chapters 01–03","source_sha256":"eb2ac2c1359647ae4461472a6ae6c9bd6b0f1fc2407469e449beb1c19821a446","sha256":"d24189d87fb3613f60f36627bd1efef8cdaf0c6599ffc8da0e2f78ac20aed947","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:56:31.868879+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_01:AS-B01","text":"The system addresses the impossibility of stabilizing spiritual abundance as isolated possession without transferring it into social, earthly, and transformative effect.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:AS-B02","text":"The descent from solitude is not a subsequent application of a completed wisdom, but the condition under which abundance becomes effective and determinable at all.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:AS-B03","text":"The solar model organizes the movement as productive self-externalization: height must set so that its wealth may continue to operate in other forms.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:AS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:AS-B04","text":"Yet the gift does not remain under the giver's control, because its public entry is mediated by mistrust, the logic of alms, and misreading.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:AS-B05","text":"The movement scales from Zarathustra's personal expenditure to a diagnosis of the human being as a transitional form whose present values possess no final shape.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:AS-B06","text":"The death of God separates the ascetic economy of withdrawal from the new earthly regime of transformation, without already securing the possibility of successful transmission.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:AS-B07","text":"Public proclamation becomes a test of receptivity: sleep, suspicion of theft, and expectation of spectacle show that the addressees do not simply accomplish the transition.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:AS3","CH_97E9_3300:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:AS-B08","text":"The cluster movement is recursive and escalatory: abundance compels descent, descent produces crises of reception, and these crises become proof that self-overcoming still remains to be achieved.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:A3","CH_97E9_3300:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_01:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Spiritual wealth has no stable meaning as one's own possession, but only as a surplus that passes itself on to recipients, earth, and future.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:A5","CH_97E9_3300:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:GA-02","text":"[Mutating] Descent changes from the self-externalization of a single wise person into the general condition under which the human being can surpass its present form.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:A8","CH_97E9_3300:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:GA-03","text":"[Emergent] Transmission is not a unilateral act of the giver, but a conflictual relation in which recipients can reinterpret the meaning of the gift before accepting it.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:ME5","CH_97E9_3300:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:GA-04","text":"[Attractor] The earth functions as an attractor because it binds together gift, body, future, and self-overcoming against every otherworldly displacement of meaning.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A4","CH_97E9_3300:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:GA-05","text":"[Persistent] Solitude can produce abundance, but guarantees neither the presence of insight nor social efficacy and must therefore be abandoned.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:A2","CH_97E9_2200:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:GA-06","text":"[Mutating] The opposition between ascent and descent loses its moral valence and becomes a question of direction: ashes are carried upward; fire, wisdom, and transformation must be carried downward.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:AS2","CH_97E9_2200:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:GA-07","text":"[Emergent] Productive negativity appears as a necessary threshold, because satiety, downfall, and great contempt first turn existing values into transformable material.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:D4","CH_97E9_3300:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:GA-08","text":"[Terminal] The religious seclusion of the holy is temporally disqualified by the diagnosis of the death of God, but remains as an enduring obstacle to reception.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:D7","CH_97E9_2200:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:GA-09","text":"[Attractor] The human being is neither endpoint nor transparent recipient, but an impure transition whose incapacity for reception itself indicates the necessity of further overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A2","CH_97E9_3300:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_01:RMD-01","text":"Wisdom recurs as abundance, but mutates from accumulated possession into a gift whose truth first arises in risky social circulation.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:A3","CH_97E9_2200:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:RMD-02","text":"Solitude retains its productive function as a site of gathering, yet loses its status as an end and appears simultaneously as an epistemic residue.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:A2","CH_97E9_2200:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:RMD-03","text":"Descent remains a movement from on high, yet expands from Zarathustra's becoming-human to the immanent transformation of the human species.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:D5","CH_97E9_3300:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:RMD-04","text":"The gift is functionally reversed: what is offered as wealth and fire can be recoded by recipients as alms, theft, or spectacle.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:NX4","CH_97E9_2200:ME3","CH_97E9_3300:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:RMD-05","text":"Contempt shifts from a possible negation of the human being to a productive threshold force that translates present contentment into pressure toward self-overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:AS5","CH_97E9_3300:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_01:CGD-01","text":"The solar analogy, ashes, fire, forest, valleys, sea, lightning, and madness remain local image-bearers; at the cluster level they are absorbed as different operators of directional reversal, transmission, and transformation.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:A6","CH_97E9_2200:A3","CH_97E9_3300:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:CGD-02","text":"The concrete encounter with the holy remains a local scene, but scales as a countermodel of a self-contained spirituality that accomplishes no earthly transmission.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:AS4","CH_97E9_2200:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:CGD-03","text":"The distinction gift/alms initially belongs to the local scene of giving; at the cluster level it becomes the general difference between surplus transformation and the administration of neediness.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:A8","CH_97E9_2200:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:CGD-04","text":"The Übermensch is not an isolated future figure of the third unit, but the higher form toward which the preceding movements of abundance, descent, and failed transmission converge.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A3","CH_97E9_3300:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_01:GNX-01","text":"Excluded is a spirit that completes itself through seclusion, possession, or self-sufficiency without losing itself to others and to the earth.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:DNX1","CH_97E9_1100:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:GNX-02","text":"Excluded is a spirituality that replaces love of human beings with love of God, fidelity to the earth with hope for an afterworld, or the body with a higher soul.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:A6","CH_97E9_3300:NX3","CH_97E9_3300:NX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:GNX-03","text":"Excluded is the assumption that moral contentment, reason, or compassion already constitute sufficient forms of human completion.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:A9","CH_97E9_3300:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:GNX-04","text":"Excluded is a transparent model of communication in which the giver's intention guarantees the meaning of the gift and the reception of the teaching.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:DNX3","CH_97E9_2200:SNX4","CH_97E9_3300:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_01:DBN-01","text":"For the architecture to hold, no height may count as a self-sufficient final position; every height must pass into descent, self-loss, and earthly transformation.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:DNX3","CH_97E9_3300:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:DBN-02","text":"For self-overcoming to remain possible, no transcendent instance may guarantee meaning, because an external guarantor would suspend both fidelity to the earth and the necessity of becoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:DNX2","CH_97E9_3300:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:DBN-03","text":"For the gift to remain transformative, it may be treated neither as charity arising from lack nor as mere information; it must risk a reordering of the recipient.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:D3","CH_97E9_2200:FGS5","CH_97E9_3300:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_01:BSA-01","text":"The most deeply excluded possibility is a reconciled present in which human being, values, recipients, and meaning would already be fully determined, intelligible, and complete.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:DNX1","CH_97E9_3300:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:BSA-02","text":"The system circles around an unavailable form of successful collective reception: the Übermensch can appear as a horizon, but not as an existing social reality.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:DNX6","CH_97E9_3300:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_01:XD-01","text":"The necessity of descent produces no secured community, but first exposes abundance to social recoding; effect therefore becomes at once necessary and uncontrollable. ; Trace Type — Composite","refs":["CL_97E9_01:GA-01","CL_97E9_01:GA-03","CH_97E9_1100:D2","CH_97E9_2200:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:XD-02","text":"The replacement of love of God by fidelity to the earth radicalizes the gift: it is not to administer neediness, but to disconcert the present human being as an insufficient transitional form. ; Trace Type — Composite","refs":["CL_97E9_01:GA-04","CL_97E9_01:GA-08","CH_97E9_2200:SD2","CH_97E9_3300:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:XD-03","text":"The disturbance of reception is not an external failure of proclamation, but reproduces at the social level precisely that contentment which the teaching seeks to overcome. ; Trace Type — Tension","refs":["CL_97E9_01:GA-03","CL_97E9_01:GA-09","CH_97E9_2200:SD4","CH_97E9_3300:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:XD-04","text":"Downfall and great contempt form a shared logic of transformation: neither suspends existing forms for the sake of destruction, but so that surplus can pass into another order. ; Trace Type — Composite","refs":["CL_97E9_01:GA-02","CL_97E9_01:GA-07","CH_97E9_1100:SD4","CH_97E9_3300:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_01:BSD-01","text":"The system replaces the ontology of stable beings with an economy of transitions in which wealth, identity, and meaning exist only as processes of their surpassing.","refs":["CL_97E9_01:GA-01","CL_97E9_01:GA-09","CH_97E9_1100:ME1","CH_97E9_3300:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:BSD-02","text":"Agency is determined neither as sovereign self-preservation nor as mere reception, but as the risky capacity to expend oneself and endure the other's reshaping of what is given.","refs":["CL_97E9_01:GA-02","CL_97E9_01:GA-03","CH_97E9_1100:SD1","CH_97E9_2200:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:BSD-03","text":"History appears as a non-synchronous confrontation of times of consciousness: religious seclusion, awakening proclamation, and the spectacle-oriented crowd coexist without a shared horizon.","refs":["CL_97E9_01:GA-08","CL_97E9_01:GA-09","CH_97E9_2200:SNX1","CH_97E9_2200:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:BSD-04","text":"The earth becomes an instance without a transcendent judge: it demands not moral adaptation, but the production of forms capable of receiving, surpassing, and transforming present values.","refs":["CL_97E9_01:GA-04","CL_97E9_01:GA-07","CH_97E9_3300:A3","CH_97E9_3300:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_01:RLE-01","text":"Solitude produces abundance, abundance produces descent, descent produces dependence on recipients, and their resistance once again produces the necessity of further transformation.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:FGS1","CH_97E9_2200:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:RLE-02","text":"The gift forms a recursive loop because it realizes itself only by surpassing its originator, but is thereby exposed to the risk of alien interpretation.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:A5","CH_97E9_2200:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:RLE-03","text":"Great contempt is an attractor because it does not arrest disappointment with existing values, but returns it to the pressure toward self-overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:D4","CH_97E9_3300:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:RLE-04","text":"The Übermensch functions as a distant attractor: its positive form remains suspended, but its absence organizes critique, fidelity to the earth, contempt, and the demand for a new capacity for reception.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:SNX1","CH_97E9_3300:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_01:FGS-B01","text":"Solitude + spiritual accumulation → abundance → impossibility of further self-possession.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:FGS-B02","text":"Abundance + need for recipients → descent → self-externalization → gift from wealth rather than alms.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:FGS2","CH_97E9_2200:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:FGS-B03","text":"Gift + social suspicion → recoding as theft or spectacle → disclosure of incapacity for reception.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:FGS6","CH_97E9_3300:FGS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:FGS-B04","text":"Incapacity for reception + fidelity to the earth → great contempt against present contentment → demand for self-overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:FGS4","CH_97E9_3300:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:FGS-B05","text":"Self-overcoming without a transcendent guarantor → Übermensch as non-existing standard, form of reception, and horizon of transformation.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:FGS3","CH_97E9_3300:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_01:AFM-B01","text":"Isolated wisdom → satiety with possession → necessity of expenditure.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:AFM-B02","text":"Expenditure → descent to human beings → loss of secluded height.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:AF3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:AFM-B03","text":"Gift from surplus → conflict with the logic of alms and withdrawal → suspicion toward the giver.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:FGS4","CH_97E9_2200:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:AFM-B04","text":"Religious temporal lag → exclusion of an otherworldly order of meaning → fidelity to the earth as a new condition of orientation.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:FGS7","CH_97E9_3300:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:AFM-B05","text":"Fidelity to the earth → great contempt → eruptive pressure of transformation → Übermensch as horizon amid continuing collective misreading.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:AF1","CH_97E9_3300:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_01:MME-01","text":"Wisdom is remapped from property to circulation, and circulation is determined not as harmonious exchange but as a risky reordering of giver and recipient.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:ME1","CH_97E9_2200:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:MME-02","text":"Solitude and community become visible not as opposites, but as asymmetric phases of an economy whose transition guarantees no successful mediation.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:ME4","CH_97E9_2200:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:MME-03","text":"The human being is reclassified simultaneously as addressee, obstacle, and material of proclamation; its misreading is part of the diagnosis and not merely its external reception.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:ME5","CH_97E9_3300:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:MME-04","text":"Critique of transcendence, affirmation of the body, and critique of values appear as a single mechanism that shifts meaning from flight out of the world to the transformation of the world.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:AS4","CH_97E9_3300:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_01:ALT-B01","text":"Surface level — Zarathustra leaves solitude, encounters the holy, offers human beings a gift, and proclaims the Übermensch.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:ALT1","CH_97E9_2200:ALT1","CH_97E9_3300:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:ALT-B02","text":"Structural level — Abundance, gift, mistrust, fidelity to the earth, and self-overcoming form a coupled machine in which every transmission is tested by the limitations of its recipients.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:ALT2","CH_97E9_2200:ALT2","CH_97E9_3300:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:ALT-B03","text":"Metastrategic level — Intervention does not mean instruction from a secure height, but the risky renunciation of height in favor of a transmission that destabilizes existing values.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:ALT3","CH_97E9_2200:ALT3","CH_97E9_3300:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:ALT-B04","text":"Ontological / Temporal level — Reality appears as becoming without transcendent closure, and time as a non-synchronous sequence of solitude, downfall, awakening, non-reception, and future overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:ALT4","CH_97E9_2200:ALT4","CH_97E9_3300:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:ALT-B05","text":"Methodological / Performative level — The system enacts its thesis by not separating proclamation from its misreading: the form of failed reception demonstrates the asserted diagnosis.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:D6","CH_97E9_3300:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_01:FL-01","text":"Descent is at once fulfillment of abundance and loss of a special position; the system requires this ambivalence without resolving it into an unambiguous balance.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:FL-02","text":"Human beings are addressed as necessary recipients, but are simultaneously portrayed as mistrustful, sleeping, and spectacle-oriented; this leaves unclear how the required transmission can actually succeed.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:MRT3","CH_97E9_2200:MRT6","CH_97E9_3300:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:MP-01","text":"Wisdom mutates at the threshold from possession to gift: its intensification consists not in accumulation, but in the capacity to empty itself through distribution.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:SD3","CH_97E9_1100:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:MP-02","text":"Contempt mutates at the threshold from mere negation to productive force, yet remains without an independent criterion for when its eruptive character produces transformation rather than destruction.","refs":["CH_97E9_3300:ME4","CH_97E9_3300:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_01:HSI-01","text":"Reality appears as a circulating machine of transformation: height produces abundance, abundance demands descent, and descent releases materials that must be reshaped against their present form.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:FGS3","CH_97E9_3300:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:HSI-02","text":"The subject appears not as the sovereign possessor of its truth, but as a passage-point that bears wealth, fire, contempt, and future only by surrendering itself.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:D5","CH_97E9_3300:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:HSI-03","text":"What remains possible is a struggle against self-sufficiency and flight into transcendence, whose success is guaranteed neither by the giver nor by the present community.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:SNX4","CH_97E9_3300:DNX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_01:MRT-B01","text":"The extracted axioms suffice to reconstruct the cluster architecture as a transition from abundance through risky transmission to earthly self-overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:MRT1","CH_97E9_3300:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:MRT-B02","text":"What remains underdetermined are the positive form of the Übermensch, the concrete content of the gift, and the conditions of a reception that reproduces neither the logic of alms nor spectacle.","refs":["CH_97E9_2200:MRT2","CH_97E9_3300:MRT3","CH_97E9_3300:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_01:MRT-B03","text":"The architecture is strongest where downfall, gift, fidelity to the earth, and contempt become legible as interwoven operators of transformation; it remains dependent on productively unresolved tensions between sending and reception.","refs":["CH_97E9_1100:ME5","CH_97E9_3300:MRT4","CH_97E9_3300:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CL_97E9_01@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CL_97E9_01:v1","source_language_code":"de","original_title":"Chapters 01–03"}],"identity":{"layer":"CL","kicker":"Cluster · Also sprach Zarathustra","title":"Chapters 01–03","context":"Zarathustra’s Vorrede · 1 · Zarathustra’s Vorrede · 2 · Zarathustra’s Vorrede · 3","original_title":"Chapters 01–03"},"original_title":"Chapters 01–03","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CL_97E9_02","layer":"CL","title":"Chapters 04–06","order":2,"parents":["CH_97E9_4400","CH_97E9_5500","CH_97E9_6600"],"revision":"CL_97E9_02@R001","sha256":"c64d115f1e3a4ba313115eda56c60269fbec03ee64d0468b6f0e0fb19d885048","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_02:ABS-01","text":"Das System bestimmt den Menschen als nicht-selbstgenügsame Übergangsform, deren Wert weder in Erhaltung noch in gegenwärtiger Zufriedenheit liegt.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:AS2","CH_97E9_5500:AS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:ABS-02","text":"Die auf Zukunft gerichtete Selbstüberschreitung benötigt Gefahr, Chaos, Verwundbarkeit und Verlustfähigkeit, weil nur diese Bedingungen die Schließung des Bestehenden aufbrechen.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:A12","CH_97E9_5500:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:ABS-03","text":"Der letzte Mensch ist die systemische Gegenfigur dieser Bewegung: eine Ordnung, die Sicherheit, Gleichheit, Gesundheitsnorm und Konfliktvermeidung in reproduzierbare Stillstellung übersetzt.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:AS5","CH_97E9_5500:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:ABS-04","text":"Der Seiltänzer materialisiert die Übergangslogik als leibliches Risiko, zeigt jedoch zugleich, dass Untergang nicht souverän verfügbar bleibt, sondern durch Konkurrenz, Dressur und öffentliche Gleichgültigkeit gewaltsam eintreten kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:A1","CH_97E9_6600:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:ABS-05","text":"Die Bewegung ist spiralförmig: Zukunftsverheißung erzeugt den Imperativ zur Überschreitung, deren soziale Neutralisierung den letzten Menschen hervorbringt, während die konkrete Katastrophe die Kosten dieser Überschreitung sichtbar macht.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:SD3","CH_97E9_5500:SD4","CH_97E9_6600:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:ABS-06","text":"Die Schließung bleibt negativ und immanent: Weder Fortschritt noch Jenseits garantieren die Zukunft; übrig bleiben gefährdete Hervorbringung, entmythologisierte Sterblichkeit und Anerkennung ohne Rettung.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:DNX4","CH_97E9_6600:NX8","CH_97E9_6600:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_02:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Der Mensch besitzt auf dieser Ebene keinen endgültigen Selbstzweck, sondern eine Übergangsfunktion zwischen gegebener und noch nicht hervorgebrachter Form.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:A2","CH_97E9_5500:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:GA-02","text":"[Attractor] Eine zukünftige höhere Gestalt ordnet gegenwärtige Werte rückwirkend, indem Erkenntnis, Arbeit, Tugend und Opfer an ihrer Hervorbringung gemessen werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:SD3","CH_97E9_4400:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:GA-03","text":"[Persistent] Selbstüberschreitung setzt eine produktive Nicht-Identität voraus, die als Chaos, Risiko, Verletzbarkeit, Sehnsucht und Gefährdung erscheint.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:A12","CH_97E9_5500:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:GA-04","text":"[Emergent] Die Beseitigung von Gefahr erzeugt nicht Neutralität, sondern eine gesellschaftliche Endform, die ihre eigene Begrenzung als Glück, Gesundheit und Gleichheit reproduziert.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:SD1","CH_97E9_5500:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:GA-05","text":"[Mutating] Untergang bezeichnet zunächst die freiwillige Preisgabe des gegenwärtigen Menschen zugunsten einer Zukunft, mutiert aber in der Katastrophe zur irreversiblen körperlichen Sterblichkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:D2","CH_97E9_6600:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:GA-06","text":"[Persistent] Transzendente Rechtfertigungs- und Strafmodelle werden ausgeschlossen, damit Untergang als immanenter Effekt von Körper, Konkurrenz und endlicher Situation lesbar wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:NX3","CH_97E9_6600:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:GA-07","text":"[Emergent] Anerkennung wird vom Erfolg, von Rettung und von gesellschaftlicher Nützlichkeit gelöst und als minimale Beziehung zum Unwiderruflichen bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:SD3","CH_97E9_6600:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:GA-08","text":"[Attractor] Die Wirkung einer Rede hängt nicht von ihrer Wahrheit allein ab, weil ihre Rezeption die Diagnose entweder vollzieht oder in ihr Gegenteil verkehrt.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:A13","CH_97E9_5500:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_02:RMD-01","text":"Die Brücke bleibt als stabile Übergangsfigur erhalten, verschiebt sich aber von einer teleologischen Anthropologie in eine konkrete Risikopraxis des Seiltänzers.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:A1","CH_97E9_6600:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:RMD-02","text":"Untergang mutiert von der produktiven Bedingung künftiger Hervorbringung zu einem Ereignis, das weder gewählt noch in Zukunft eingelöst werden kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:SD2","CH_97E9_6600:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:RMD-03","text":"Gefahr kehrt funktional wieder, doch ihre Valenz spaltet sich: Sie ist Bedingung der Höhe und zugleich Medium sozial erzeugter Zerstörung.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:D7","CH_97E9_6600:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:RMD-04","text":"Gleichheit wandert von einer möglichen politischen Negation der Herrschaft in eine Normierungsform, die Abweichung pathologisiert und Zukunftsöffnung stillstellt.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:A10","CH_97E9_5500:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:RMD-05","text":"Die Menge erscheint zunächst als hörunfähige Öffentlichkeit und später als flüchtige Zuschauerordnung; in beiden Formen verweigert sie die tragende Beziehung zum Gefährdeten.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:AS1","CH_97E9_6600:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:RMD-06","text":"Zarathustras Verkündigerrolle wird durch die Sterbebegleitung umcodiert: Aus der Ankündigung einer Zukunftsgestalt wird eine Praxis immanenter Anerkennung ohne Heilsversprechen.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:A14","CH_97E9_6600:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_02:CGD-01","text":"Die Einzelfunktion von Erkenntnis, Arbeit, Erfindung oder Tugend bleibt lokal, solange sie nur als besondere Vorbereitungstätigkeit erscheint; auf Clusterebene zählt ihre gemeinsame Unterordnung unter eine Zukunftsselektion.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:D3","CH_97E9_4400:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:CGD-02","text":"Die Beschreibung einzelner Komfortformen bleibt lokal, während ihre Kopplung aus Wärme, Sicherheit, Gesundheit, Gleichheit und Konfliktneutralisierung als selbststabilisierendes Endsystem skaliert.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:A7","CH_97E9_5500:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:CGD-03","text":"Der konkrete Absturz bleibt singulär, wird auf der gegenwärtigen Ebene aber zum Testfall dafür, ob Selbstüberschreitung als schöpferische Zukunftsbewegung oder als sozial exponierte Verletzbarkeit gedacht wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:A4","CH_97E9_6600:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:CGD-04","text":"Die Zurückweisung von Teufel und Hölle ist lokal metaphysikkritisch, gewinnt aber globale Tragweite, weil sie jede teleologische Garantie des Untergangs entzieht.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:A7","CH_97E9_4400:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:CGD-05","text":"Die minimale Dankesgeste bleibt keine allgemeine Sozialtheorie, aber sie skaliert als Grenzmodell einer Beziehung, die nach dem Zusammenbruch öffentlicher und religiöser Sicherungen bestehen bleibt.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:A14","CH_97E9_6600:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_02:GNX-01","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird der Mensch als endgültiger Zweck, stabile Identität oder verfügbares Endprodukt seiner Geschichte.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:NX1","CH_97E9_5500:DNX7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:GNX-02","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird Selbsterhaltung als oberstes Wertkriterium, weil ihre systemische Ausweitung die Bedingungen von Überschreitung neutralisiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:NX4","CH_97E9_5500:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:GNX-03","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Vorstellung, Bildung, Gleichheit oder Versöhnung seien ohne weiteres emanzipatorisch; sie können als Formen rezeptiver, normativer und zeitlicher Stillstellung wirken.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:NX1","CH_97E9_5500:DNX4","CH_97E9_5500:DNX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:GNX-04","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine transzendente Ursache oder nachträgliche Rechtfertigung der Katastrophe.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:NX1","CH_97E9_6600:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:GNX-05","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird Rettung als Bedingung von Anerkennung, weil der zerstörte Körper weder in Beruf, Öffentlichkeit noch Jenseits wiederhergestellt wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:DNX3","CH_97E9_6600:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_02:DBN-01","text":"Das System kann keine Gegenwart zulassen, die sich aus eigener Dauer legitimiert, weil jede selbstgenügsame Gegenwart entweder Übergang verweigert oder als letzter Mensch erstarrt.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:SNX2","CH_97E9_5500:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:DBN-02","text":"Es kann keine zukünftige Höhe zulassen, die ohne Bruch, Chaos oder Preisgabe der gegenwärtigen Form erreichbar wäre.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:SNX3","CH_97E9_5500:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:DBN-03","text":"Es kann keine soziale Ordnung zulassen, die Schutz verspricht und zugleich Differenz, Risiko und Schöpfung unverletzt bewahrt.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:DNX3","CH_97E9_6600:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:DBN-04","text":"Es kann keine Sinnordnung zulassen, die Tod in moralische Schuld, metaphysische Bestrafung oder versöhnte Fortexistenz überführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:DNX1","CH_97E9_6600:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_02:BSA-01","text":"Die tiefste ausgeschlossene Möglichkeit ist eine Welt, in der Selbststeigerung, soziale Sicherheit und ontologische Garantie gleichzeitig vereinbar wären.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:SNX1","CH_97E9_5500:DNX1","CH_97E9_6600:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:BSA-02","text":"Das System kreist um eine nicht verfügbare Zukunft, deren regulative Kraft gerade daraus folgt, dass sie weder positiv ausgeführt noch gegenwärtig besessen werden kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:MRT2","CH_97E9_4400:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:BSA-03","text":"Unzulässig bleibt eine Form von Gemeinschaft, die Gefahr absorbiert, ohne sie entweder in Herdennormierung oder in den Abbruch aller Solidarität zu verwandeln.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:SNX4","CH_97E9_6600:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_02:XD-01","text":"Die Zukunftsorientierung der Selbstüberschreitung erzeugt eine doppelte Gefährdung: Ohne Risiko erstarrt sie zur letzten Menschheit, unter realer Konkurrenz kann sie jedoch in tödliche Zerstörung umschlagen.","refs":["CL_97E9_02:GA-03","CL_97E9_02:GA-04","CL_97E9_02:GA-05","CH_97E9_5500:SD4","CH_97E9_6600:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:XD-02","text":"Die Kritik an Selbsterhaltung kann nicht in die Verherrlichung jedes Untergangs übergehen, weil der konkrete Absturz eine durch Konkurrenz produzierte und nicht sinnvoll abgeschlossene Gewaltform bleibt.","refs":["CL_97E9_02:GA-05","CL_97E9_02:GA-06","CH_97E9_6600:DNX2","CH_97E9_6600:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:XD-03","text":"Der letzte Mensch und die fliehende Zuschauermenge bilden zwei Varianten derselben sozialen Logik: Beide entziehen sich jener Beziehung, die Gefahr, Differenz und Endlichkeit nicht neutralisieren kann.","refs":["CL_97E9_02:GA-04","CL_97E9_02:GA-07","CH_97E9_5500:SD3","CH_97E9_6600:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:XD-04","text":"Die Entmythologisierung des Todes verschärft statt mildert den Anspruch auf Fürsorge, weil nach dem Wegfall transzendenter Kompensation nur Begleitung und Anerkennung verbleiben.","refs":["CL_97E9_02:GA-06","CL_97E9_02:GA-07","CH_97E9_6600:SD2","CH_97E9_6600:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:XD-05","text":"Das Missverständnis der Menge und die religiöse Fehlkausalität des Sterbenden zeigen gemeinsam, dass falsche Deutung nicht äußerlich zur Gefahr steht, sondern ihre soziale und existenzielle Verarbeitung mitbestimmt.","refs":["CL_97E9_02:GA-08","CL_97E9_02:GA-06","CH_97E9_5500:D8","CH_97E9_6600:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_02:BSD-01","text":"Das System erzeugt eine asymmetrische Ethik der Übergänge: Wert besitzt nicht, wer erhalten bleibt, sondern was eine Zukunft eröffnet, ohne dass diese Zukunft den Verlust nachträglich entschädigen kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:SD1","CH_97E9_6600:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:BSD-02","text":"Geschichte wird als Selektionsfeld rekonstruiert, in dem Zukunft nicht aus linearem Fortschritt hervorgeht, sondern aus der riskanten Differenz zwischen produktiver Spannung und reproduzierter Stillstellung.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:D1","CH_97E9_5500:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:BSD-03","text":"Das Subjekt wird weder als souveräner Schöpfer noch als bloßes Opfer bestimmt, sondern als durch Dressur, Beruf, Risiko und Anerkennungsbeziehungen ungleich geformter Träger eines gefährlichen Übergangs.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:D5","CH_97E9_6600:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:BSD-04","text":"Die politische Negation von Herrschaft reicht nicht aus, weil ihre bloße Abschaffung in Gleichmachung, Pathologisierung und soziale Konfliktlosigkeit umschlagen kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:D5","CH_97E9_5500:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:BSD-05","text":"Wahrheit erhält performativen Charakter: Eine Diagnose bewährt sich nicht bloß durch Aussagegehalt, sondern daran, ob ihre Adressaten ihre eigene Stillstellung oder Gefährdung erkennen können.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:SD5","CH_97E9_5500:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_02:RLE-01","text":"Selbstüberschreitung erzeugt Gefahr; Gefahr verlangt Deutung; die Deutung entscheidet, ob Gefahr zur Zukunftsbedingung, zur sozialen Neutralisierung oder zur metaphysischen Fehlkausalität wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:D2","CH_97E9_5500:D6","CH_97E9_6600:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:RLE-02","text":"Der Attraktor Übermensch ordnet die Gegenwart teleologisch, bleibt aber positiv unterbestimmt und erzeugt deshalb fortwährend neue Prüfungen dessen, was als vorbereitende oder verhindernde Kraft gilt.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:SD3","CH_97E9_4400:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:RLE-03","text":"Die Sicherheitslogik bildet eine gegenläufige Schleife: Sie beseitigt Risiko, nennt die Beseitigung Glück, reproduziert dadurch ihre eigene Bedürfnisverwaltung und verhindert die Rückkehr von Chaos.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:D3","CH_97E9_5500:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:RLE-04","text":"Die öffentliche Rede bildet eine Rezeptionsschleife, in der die Unfähigkeit zu hören durch die Umkehrung der Warnung performativ bestätigt wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:A13","CH_97E9_5500:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:RLE-05","text":"Der Zusammenbruch öffentlicher Ordnung führt nicht zur vollständigen Beziehungslosigkeit, sondern verdichtet soziale Bindung zur minimalen Geste zwischen Sterbendem und Begleitendem.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:D2","CH_97E9_6600:D8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_02:FGS-B01","text":"Mensch als Übergang ohne Selbstzweck + zukünftiger Attraktor → Umwertung gegenwärtiger Fähigkeiten in vorbereitende Funktionen.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:FGS1","CH_97E9_4400:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:FGS-B02","text":"Umwertung + produktives Chaos + Verwundbarkeit → Möglichkeit schöpferischer Selbstüberschreitung.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:FGS5","CH_97E9_5500:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:FGS-B03","text":"Neutralisierung von Chaos, Gefahr, Konflikt und Differenz → letzter Mensch als selbstreproduzierende Endform.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:FGS4","CH_97E9_5500:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:FGS-B04","text":"Öffentliche Risikopraxis + Konkurrenzordnung → leiblicher Untergang, der die abstrakte Übergangslogik ihrer materiellen Kosten aussetzt.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:FGS1","CH_97E9_6600:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:FGS-B05","text":"Leiblicher Untergang + Negation von Teufel und Hölle → immanente Sterblichkeitsdiagnose ohne teleologische Entschädigung.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:FGS2","CH_97E9_6600:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:FGS-B06","text":"Immanente Sterblichkeit + fehlende Rettung → Anerkennung als Begleitung, Bestattung und minimale Restbeziehung.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:FGS4","CH_97E9_6600:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_02:AFM-B01","text":"Mensch als gefährdeter Übergang → Zukunft als wertordnender Attraktor → Chaos und Risiko als Produktionsbedingungen → Sicherheitsordnung als soziale Stillstellung → öffentliche Risikopraxis als materielle Probe → Konkurrenz und Absturz → Entmythologisierung des Todes → Anerkennung ohne Rettung.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:AF1","CH_97E9_5500:AF1","CH_97E9_6600:AF1","CH_97E9_6600:AF6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_02:MME-01","text":"Der Mensch wird nicht länger primär als Wesen, sondern als topologische und zeitliche Übergangsfunktion kartiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:ME1","CH_97E9_5500:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:MME-02","text":"Untergang wird zugleich als schöpferische Bedingung und als nicht wiedergutzumachende Katastrophe lesbar; seine Ambivalenz wird zur zentralen Karte des Clusters.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:ME2","CH_97E9_6600:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:MME-03","text":"Sicherheit, Gesundheit, Gleichheit und Versöhnung werden von isolierten Gütern zu möglichen Verfahren der Zukunftsblockade umklassifiziert.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:ME3","CH_97E9_5500:ME4","CH_97E9_5500:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:MME-04","text":"Öffentlichkeit wird nicht als schützende Gemeinschaft, sondern als instabile Anordnung von Missverständnis, Spektakel, Flucht und Konkurrenz neu bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:ME6","CH_97E9_6600:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:MME-05","text":"Fürsorge wird als nicht-restitutive Praxis verfügbar: Sie anerkennt Wert im Scheitern, ohne Heilung, Kontinuität oder Jenseits zu behaupten.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:ME5","CH_97E9_6600:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_02:ALT-B01","text":"Surface level — Das System organisiert Reden über Übermensch und letzten Menschen sowie den Absturz eines Seiltänzers als miteinander verschränkte Grenzszenen.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:AS2","CH_97E9_6600:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:ALT-B02","text":"Structural level — Es verbindet Zukunftsselektion, Sicherheitsnorm, Konkurrenz, körperliche Disziplinierung und öffentliche Rezeptionsformen zu einer verteilten Maschinerie der Ermöglichung und Stillstellung.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:ALT2","CH_97E9_5500:ALT2","CH_97E9_6600:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:ALT-B03","text":"Metastrategic level — Es ersetzt die Frage nach humaner Bewahrung durch die Frage, welche Formen von Gefahr produktiv sind und welche bloß zerstörerische oder neutralisierende Macht ausüben.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:ALT3","CH_97E9_6600:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:ALT-B04","text":"Ontological / Temporal level — Realität erscheint als offene, nicht garantierte Zeitordnung, in der Zukunft Gegenwart bewertet, ohne deren Opfer nachträglich zu versöhnen.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:ME5","CH_97E9_5500:SNX5","CH_97E9_6600:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:ALT-B05","text":"Methodological / Performative level — Die Form vollzieht ihre Diagnose selbst, indem prophetische Rede missverstanden wird und die Katastrophe jede abstrakte Rede vom Übergang in leibliche Endlichkeit zurückführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:SD5","CH_97E9_6600:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_02:FL-01","text":"Die teleologische Aufwertung des Untergangs kollidiert mit dem faktischen Absturz, dessen Gewalt weder freiwillige Selbstüberschreitung noch geschichtliche Hervorbringung eindeutig bestätigt.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:SD2","CH_97E9_6600:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:FL-02","text":"Die Kritik an der Sicherheitsordnung benötigt Gefahr als Bedingung der Höhe, kann aber nicht erklären, nach welchem Maß produktives Risiko von sozial erzwungener Zerstörung zu unterscheiden ist.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:SD4","CH_97E9_6600:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:FL-03","text":"Die Verneinung des Jenseits erhöht den Anspruch auf immanente Fürsorge, lässt aber offen, ob Begleitung eine neue Gemeinschaft stiftet oder lediglich unaufhebbare Isolation verwaltet.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:DNX5","CH_97E9_6600:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:MP-01","text":"Der Begriff des Untergangs mutiert vom gewollten Übergang über Opfer und Selbstaufgabe zum körperlichen Zusammenbruch unter konkurrierender Gewalt.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:MRT3","CH_97E9_6600:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:MP-02","text":"Der Begriff der Freiheit mutiert von Selbstverschwendung und Selbstüberschreitung zu einer Berufswahl, die unter Dressur, Bedürftigkeit und äußerer Gefährdung steht.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:A11","CH_97E9_6600:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:MP-03","text":"Zarathustras Rolle mutiert vom Verkündiger eines kommenden Blitzes zum Begleiter eines Sterbenden, dessen Zukunft nicht mehr versprochen werden kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:A14","CH_97E9_6600:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_02:HSI-01","text":"Realität erscheint als selektive Übergangsmaschine, die Formen hervorbringt, indem sie sie Gefahren, Differenzen und Verlusten aussetzt.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:SD5","CH_97E9_6600:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:HSI-02","text":"Das Subjekt ist kein geschlossener Besitzer seiner selbst, sondern ein verletzlicher Knoten aus Zukunftssehnsucht, sozialer Formung, leiblicher Endlichkeit und begrenzter Anerkennung.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:D6","CH_97E9_6600:D5","CH_97E9_6600:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:HSI-03","text":"Zeit ist nicht kontinuierlicher Fortschritt, sondern eine offene, rückwirkend wertende und jederzeit durch Stillstellung oder Katastrophe unterbrechbare Ordnung.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:A13","CH_97E9_5500:D7","CH_97E9_5500:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:HSI-04","text":"Kampf bleibt möglich als Navigation zwischen produktiver Selbstüberschreitung und zerstörerischer Konkurrenz, während Flucht nur als Verlassen falscher Sicherungen, nicht als Wiederherstellung einer geschützten Ganzheit erscheint.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:SD1","CH_97E9_6600:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_02:MRT-B01","text":"Die extrahierten Axiome reichen aus, um die Clusterbewegung von Übergang, Zukunftsattraktor und sozialer Stillstellung bis zur entmythologisierten Sterblichkeit zu rekonstruieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:MRT1","CH_97E9_5500:MRT1","CH_97E9_6600:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:MRT-B02","text":"Unterbestimmt bleiben die positive Bestimmung der zukünftigen Zielgestalt sowie das Kriterium, durch das produktiver Untergang von bloßer Zerstörung getrennt werden kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:MRT2","CH_97E9_4400:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:MRT-B03","text":"Die Architektur ist dort am stärksten, wo Zukunftssehnsucht, Sicherheitskritik und konkrete Körpergefährdung nicht getrennt, sondern als gegenseitige Prüfungen organisiert werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:MRT6","CH_97E9_6600:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:MRT-B04","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bleibt auf bildhafte Träger wie Brücke, Abgrund, Stern, Ohr, Seil und Hand angewiesen, weil diese Bilder die Übergänge zwischen Anthropologie, Sozialdiagnose und Sterbebegleitung performativ verbinden.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:MRT7","CH_97E9_5500:MRT7","CH_97E9_6600:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T195703738909Z_cbc1a879","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Chapters 04–06","source_sha256":"c64d115f1e3a4ba313115eda56c60269fbec03ee64d0468b6f0e0fb19d885048","sha256":"efd6e8ba62cb8399024ac10e1329254bcb0cf6a08fce6675721586b0dcdfc6c8","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:57:03.739866+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_02:ABS-01","text":"The system determines the human being as a non-self-sufficient transitional form whose value lies neither in preservation nor in present satisfaction.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:AS2","CH_97E9_5500:AS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:ABS-02","text":"Self-overcoming directed toward the future requires danger, chaos, vulnerability, and the capacity for loss, because only these conditions break open the closure of the existing.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:A12","CH_97E9_5500:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:ABS-03","text":"The last human is the systemic counterfigure to this movement: an order that translates security, equality, the norm of health, and conflict avoidance into reproducible standstill.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:AS5","CH_97E9_5500:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:ABS-04","text":"The tightrope walker materializes the logic of transition as bodily risk, but simultaneously shows that downfall does not remain sovereignly available, but can occur violently through competition, training, and public indifference.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:A1","CH_97E9_6600:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:ABS-05","text":"The movement is spiral-shaped: the promise of the future generates the imperative of overcoming, whose social neutralization brings forth the last human, while concrete catastrophe makes the costs of this overcoming visible.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:SD3","CH_97E9_5500:SD4","CH_97E9_6600:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:ABS-06","text":"The closure remains negative and immanent: neither progress nor an afterworld guarantees the future; what remains are endangered production, demythologized mortality, and recognition without salvation.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:DNX4","CH_97E9_6600:NX8","CH_97E9_6600:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_02:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] At this level, the human being has no final end in itself, but rather a transitional function between a given form and a form not yet produced.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:A2","CH_97E9_5500:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:GA-02","text":"[Attractor] A future higher form retroactively orders present values by measuring knowledge, labor, virtue, and sacrifice against its production.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:SD3","CH_97E9_4400:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:GA-03","text":"[Persistent] Self-overcoming presupposes a productive non-identity that appears as chaos, risk, vulnerability, longing, and endangerment.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:A12","CH_97E9_5500:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:GA-04","text":"[Emergent] The elimination of danger does not produce neutrality, but a social final form that reproduces its own limitation as happiness, health, and equality.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:SD1","CH_97E9_5500:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:GA-05","text":"[Mutating] Downfall initially designates the voluntary relinquishment of the present human being in favor of a future, but mutates in catastrophe into irreversible bodily mortality.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:D2","CH_97E9_6600:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:GA-06","text":"[Persistent] Transcendent models of justification and punishment are excluded so that downfall becomes legible as an immanent effect of body, competition, and finite situation.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:NX3","CH_97E9_6600:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:GA-07","text":"[Emergent] Recognition is detached from success, salvation, and social utility and determined as a minimal relation to the irreversible.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:SD3","CH_97E9_6600:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:GA-08","text":"[Attractor] The effect of a speech does not depend on its truth alone, because its reception either enacts the diagnosis or reverses it into its opposite.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:A13","CH_97E9_5500:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_02:RMD-01","text":"The bridge remains preserved as a stable figure of transition, but shifts from a teleological anthropology into a concrete risk practice of the tightrope walker.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:A1","CH_97E9_6600:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:RMD-02","text":"Downfall mutates from the productive condition of future production into an event that can neither be chosen nor redeemed in the future.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:SD2","CH_97E9_6600:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:RMD-03","text":"Danger recurs functionally, but its valence splits: it is a condition of elevation and at once a medium of socially produced destruction.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:D7","CH_97E9_6600:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:RMD-04","text":"Equality migrates from a possible political negation of domination into a form of normalization that pathologizes deviation and brings the opening of the future to a standstill.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:A10","CH_97E9_5500:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:RMD-05","text":"The crowd appears first as a public unable to hear and later as a fleeing spectator order; in both forms it refuses the sustaining relation to the endangered.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:AS1","CH_97E9_6600:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:RMD-06","text":"Zarathustra's role as herald is recoded through attendance upon the dying: the announcement of a future form becomes a practice of immanent recognition without a promise of salvation.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:A14","CH_97E9_6600:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_02:CGD-01","text":"The individual function of knowledge, labor, invention, or virtue remains local so long as it appears merely as a particular preparatory activity; at the cluster level, their common subordination to a selection for the future counts.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:D3","CH_97E9_4400:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:CGD-02","text":"The description of individual forms of comfort remains local, while their coupling of warmth, security, health, equality, and conflict neutralization scales as a self-stabilizing final system.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:A7","CH_97E9_5500:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:CGD-03","text":"The concrete fall remains singular, but at the present level it becomes a test case for whether self-overcoming is conceived as a creative movement toward the future or as socially exposed vulnerability.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:A4","CH_97E9_6600:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:CGD-04","text":"The rejection of devil and hell is locally critical of metaphysics, but acquires global force because it withdraws every teleological guarantee from downfall.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:A7","CH_97E9_4400:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:CGD-05","text":"The minimal gesture of thanks remains no general social theory, but it scales as a boundary model of a relation that remains after the collapse of public and religious safeguards.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:A14","CH_97E9_6600:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_02:GNX-01","text":"Excluded is the human being as final purpose, stable identity, or available end product of its history.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:NX1","CH_97E9_5500:DNX7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:GNX-02","text":"Excluded is self-preservation as the highest criterion of value, because its systemic expansion neutralizes the conditions of overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:NX4","CH_97E9_5500:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:GNX-03","text":"Excluded is the notion that education, equality, or reconciliation are automatically emancipatory; they can operate as forms of receptive, normative, and temporal standstill.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:NX1","CH_97E9_5500:DNX4","CH_97E9_5500:DNX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:GNX-04","text":"Excluded is a transcendent cause or subsequent justification of catastrophe.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:NX1","CH_97E9_6600:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:GNX-05","text":"Excluded is salvation as a condition of recognition, because the destroyed body is restored neither in vocation, publicness, nor the afterworld.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:DNX3","CH_97E9_6600:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_02:DBN-01","text":"The system cannot permit a present that legitimates itself through its own duration, because every self-sufficient present either refuses transition or congeals as the last human.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:SNX2","CH_97E9_5500:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:DBN-02","text":"It cannot permit a future elevation that could be attained without rupture, chaos, or relinquishment of the present form.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:SNX3","CH_97E9_5500:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:DBN-03","text":"It cannot permit a social order that promises protection and at the same time preserves difference, risk, and creation unscathed.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:DNX3","CH_97E9_6600:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:DBN-04","text":"It cannot permit an order of meaning that transforms death into moral guilt, metaphysical punishment, or reconciled continued existence.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:DNX1","CH_97E9_6600:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_02:BSA-01","text":"The most deeply excluded possibility is a world in which self-enhancement, social security, and ontological guarantee would be simultaneously compatible.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:SNX1","CH_97E9_5500:DNX1","CH_97E9_6600:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:BSA-02","text":"The system circles around an unavailable future whose regulative force follows precisely from the fact that it can neither be positively elaborated nor presently possessed.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:MRT2","CH_97E9_4400:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:BSA-03","text":"Impermissible remains a form of community that absorbs danger without transforming it either into herd normalization or into the breakdown of all solidarity.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:SNX4","CH_97E9_6600:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_02:XD-01","text":"The future orientation of self-overcoming produces a double endangerment: without risk it congeals into the last humanity, but under real competition it can turn into deadly destruction.","refs":["CL_97E9_02:GA-03","CL_97E9_02:GA-04","CL_97E9_02:GA-05","CH_97E9_5500:SD4","CH_97E9_6600:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:XD-02","text":"The critique of self-preservation cannot pass into the glorification of every downfall, because the concrete fall remains a form of violence produced by competition and not meaningfully concluded.","refs":["CL_97E9_02:GA-05","CL_97E9_02:GA-06","CH_97E9_6600:DNX2","CH_97E9_6600:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:XD-03","text":"The last human and the fleeing crowd of spectators form two variants of the same social logic: both withdraw from that relation which cannot neutralize danger, difference, and finitude.","refs":["CL_97E9_02:GA-04","CL_97E9_02:GA-07","CH_97E9_5500:SD3","CH_97E9_6600:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:XD-04","text":"The demythologization of death intensifies rather than mitigates the claim upon care, because after the disappearance of transcendent compensation only accompaniment and recognition remain.","refs":["CL_97E9_02:GA-06","CL_97E9_02:GA-07","CH_97E9_6600:SD2","CH_97E9_6600:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:XD-05","text":"The crowd's misunderstanding and the dying man's religious false causality jointly show that false interpretation is not external to danger, but co-determines its social and existential processing.","refs":["CL_97E9_02:GA-08","CL_97E9_02:GA-06","CH_97E9_5500:D8","CH_97E9_6600:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_02:BSD-01","text":"The system generates an asymmetrical ethics of transitions: value belongs not to whoever remains preserved, but to what opens a future, without that future being able subsequently to compensate for the loss.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:SD1","CH_97E9_6600:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:BSD-02","text":"History is reconstructed as a field of selection in which the future does not emerge from linear progress, but from the risky difference between productive tension and reproduced standstill.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:D1","CH_97E9_5500:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:BSD-03","text":"The subject is determined neither as sovereign creator nor as mere victim, but as an unequally formed bearer of a dangerous transition through training, vocation, risk, and relations of recognition.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:D5","CH_97E9_6600:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:BSD-04","text":"The political negation of domination is insufficient, because its mere abolition can turn into leveling, pathologization, and social absence of conflict.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:D5","CH_97E9_5500:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:BSD-05","text":"Truth acquires a performative character: a diagnosis proves itself not merely through its propositional content, but through whether its addressees can recognize their own standstill or endangerment.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:SD5","CH_97E9_5500:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_02:RLE-01","text":"Self-overcoming generates danger; danger requires interpretation; interpretation decides whether danger becomes a condition of the future, social neutralization, or metaphysical false causality.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:D2","CH_97E9_5500:D6","CH_97E9_6600:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:RLE-02","text":"The attractor Übermensch orders the present teleologically, but remains positively underdetermined and therefore continually generates new tests of what counts as a preparatory or obstructive force.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:SD3","CH_97E9_4400:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:RLE-03","text":"The logic of security forms a countervailing loop: it eliminates risk, calls the elimination happiness, thereby reproduces its own management of needs, and prevents the return of chaos.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:D3","CH_97E9_5500:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:RLE-04","text":"Public speech forms a reception loop in which the inability to hear is performatively confirmed through the reversal of the warning.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:A13","CH_97E9_5500:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:RLE-05","text":"The collapse of public order does not lead to complete absence of relation, but condenses social bond into the minimal gesture between the dying person and the attendant.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:D2","CH_97E9_6600:D8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_02:FGS-B01","text":"Human being as transition without an end in itself + future attractor → revaluation of present capacities into preparatory functions.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:FGS1","CH_97E9_4400:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:FGS-B02","text":"Revaluation + productive chaos + vulnerability → possibility of creative self-overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:FGS5","CH_97E9_5500:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:FGS-B03","text":"Neutralization of chaos, danger, conflict, and difference → last human as self-reproducing final form.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:FGS4","CH_97E9_5500:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:FGS-B04","text":"Public risk practice + order of competition → bodily downfall that exposes the abstract logic of transition to its material costs.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:FGS1","CH_97E9_6600:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:FGS-B05","text":"Bodily downfall + negation of devil and hell → immanent diagnosis of mortality without teleological compensation.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:FGS2","CH_97E9_6600:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:FGS-B06","text":"Immanent mortality + absence of salvation → recognition as accompaniment, burial, and minimal residual relation.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:FGS4","CH_97E9_6600:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_02:AFM-B01","text":"Human being as endangered transition → future as value-ordering attractor → chaos and risk as conditions of production → security order as social standstill → public risk practice as material test → competition and fall → demythologization of death → recognition without salvation.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:AF1","CH_97E9_5500:AF1","CH_97E9_6600:AF1","CH_97E9_6600:AF6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_02:MME-01","text":"The human being is no longer mapped primarily as a being, but as a topological and temporal function of transition.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:ME1","CH_97E9_5500:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:MME-02","text":"Downfall becomes legible both as a creative condition and as an irreparable catastrophe; its ambivalence becomes the central map of the cluster.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:ME2","CH_97E9_6600:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:MME-03","text":"Security, health, equality, and reconciliation are reclassified from isolated goods into possible procedures of blocking the future.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:ME3","CH_97E9_5500:ME4","CH_97E9_5500:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:MME-04","text":"Publicness is newly determined not as a protective community, but as an unstable arrangement of misunderstanding, spectacle, flight, and competition.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:ME6","CH_97E9_6600:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:MME-05","text":"Care becomes available as a non-restitutive practice: it recognizes value in failure without asserting healing, continuity, or an afterworld.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:ME5","CH_97E9_6600:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_02:ALT-B01","text":"Surface level — The system organizes speeches on the Übermensch and the last human, as well as the fall of a tightrope walker, as interlocked threshold scenes.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:AS2","CH_97E9_6600:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:ALT-B02","text":"Structural level — It links selection for the future, the norm of security, competition, bodily disciplining, and forms of public reception into a distributed machinery of enabling and standstill.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:ALT2","CH_97E9_5500:ALT2","CH_97E9_6600:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:ALT-B03","text":"Metastrategic level — It replaces the question of humane preservation with the question of which forms of danger are productive and which exercise merely destructive or neutralizing power.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:ALT3","CH_97E9_6600:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:ALT-B04","text":"Ontological / Temporal level — Reality appears as an open, unguaranteed temporal order in which the future evaluates the present without subsequently reconciling its sacrifices.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:ME5","CH_97E9_5500:SNX5","CH_97E9_6600:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:ALT-B05","text":"Methodological / Performative level — The form itself enacts its diagnosis by having prophetic speech misunderstood and catastrophe return every abstract discourse of transition to bodily finitude.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:SD5","CH_97E9_6600:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_02:FL-01","text":"The teleological revaluation of downfall collides with the factual fall, whose violence unequivocally confirms neither voluntary self-overcoming nor historical production.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:SD2","CH_97E9_6600:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:FL-02","text":"The critique of the security order requires danger as a condition of elevation, but cannot explain by what measure productive risk is to be distinguished from socially compelled destruction.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:SD4","CH_97E9_6600:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:FL-03","text":"The negation of the afterworld heightens the claim to immanent care, but leaves open whether accompaniment founds a new community or merely administers irreducible isolation.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:DNX5","CH_97E9_6600:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:MP-01","text":"The concept of downfall mutates from willed transition through sacrifice and self-abandonment into bodily collapse under competitive violence.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:MRT3","CH_97E9_6600:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:MP-02","text":"The concept of freedom mutates from self-squandering and self-overcoming into a choice of vocation subject to training, need, and external endangerment.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:A11","CH_97E9_6600:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:MP-03","text":"Zarathustra's role mutates from the herald of a coming lightning bolt into the attendant of a dying person whose future can no longer be promised.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:A14","CH_97E9_6600:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_02:HSI-01","text":"Reality appears as a selective transition machine that produces forms by exposing them to dangers, differences, and losses.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:SD5","CH_97E9_6600:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:HSI-02","text":"The subject is not a closed possessor of itself, but a vulnerable knot of longing for the future, social formation, bodily finitude, and limited recognition.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:D6","CH_97E9_6600:D5","CH_97E9_6600:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:HSI-03","text":"Time is not continuous progress, but an open order that evaluates retroactively and can at any moment be interrupted by standstill or catastrophe.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:A13","CH_97E9_5500:D7","CH_97E9_5500:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:HSI-04","text":"Struggle remains possible as navigation between productive self-overcoming and destructive competition, while flight appears only as leaving false safeguards, not as restoration of a protected totality.","refs":["CH_97E9_6600:SD1","CH_97E9_6600:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_02:MRT-B01","text":"The extracted axioms suffice to reconstruct the cluster movement from transition, future attractor, and social standstill through to demythologized mortality.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:MRT1","CH_97E9_5500:MRT1","CH_97E9_6600:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:MRT-B02","text":"What remains underdetermined are the positive determination of the future target form and the criterion by which productive downfall can be separated from mere destruction.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:MRT2","CH_97E9_4400:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:MRT-B03","text":"The architecture is strongest where longing for the future, critique of security, and concrete bodily endangerment are not separated but organized as mutual tests.","refs":["CH_97E9_5500:MRT6","CH_97E9_6600:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_02:MRT-B04","text":"The reconstruction remains dependent on figurative carriers such as bridge, abyss, star, ear, rope, and hand, because these images performatively connect the transitions between anthropology, social diagnosis, and attendance upon the dying.","refs":["CH_97E9_4400:MRT7","CH_97E9_5500:MRT7","CH_97E9_6600:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CL_97E9_02@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CL_97E9_02:v1","source_language_code":"de","original_title":"Chapters 04–06"}],"identity":{"layer":"CL","kicker":"Cluster · Also sprach Zarathustra","title":"Chapters 04–06","context":"Zarathustra’s Vorrede · 4 · Zarathustra’s Vorrede · 5 · Zarathustra’s Vorrede · 6","original_title":"Chapters 04–06"},"original_title":"Chapters 04–06","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CL_97E9_03","layer":"CL","title":"Chapters 07–09","order":3,"parents":["CH_97E9_7700","CH_97E9_8800","CH_97E9_8C_2"],"revision":"CL_97E9_03@R001","sha256":"41903a9da139c9ace6c7d191e8f2d700f2eb69e2413981a02aecec2a171e3a99","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_03:AS-B01","text":"Das Cluster problematisiert den Übergang von einer öffentlichen Verkündigung, die keinen lebendigen Adressaten gewinnt, zu einer Bewegung, die zunächst einen Toten tragen muss.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:AS2","CH_97E9_8800:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:AS-B02","text":"Die Diagnose der Sinnlosigkeit wird nicht durch unmittelbare Sinnstiftung aufgehoben, sondern durch einen dunklen Zwischenraum von Ausschluss, Schutz, Hunger, Wegverlust und Bestattung vermittelt.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:A5","CH_97E9_8800:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:AS-B03","text":"Der Tote mutiert von der Negativfigur einer gegenwärtig sinnlosen Menschheit zu einem Prüfstein, an dem sich die Unzulänglichkeit von Öffentlichkeit, Herde, Gastlichkeit und Führung erweist.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:ME2","CH_97E9_8800:ME2","CH_97E9_8C_2:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:AS-B04","text":"Die Bewegung wird erst produktiv, als Zarathustra das Mittragen des Toten nicht als endgültige Gefährtenschaft, sondern als zu überschreitende Übergangsarbeit erkennt.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:D7","CH_97E9_8C_2:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:AS-B05","text":"Gemeinschaft wird vom Publikum, vom Volk und von der Herde abgelöst und als selektive Verbindung selbstgerichteter Mitschaffender bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:D1","CH_97E9_8C_2:A4","CH_97E9_8C_2:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:AS-B06","text":"Die gerichtete Bewegung ist rekursiv und schwellenförmig: Scheitern erzeugt Tragen, Tragen erzeugt Ausschluss, Ausschluss erzwingt Selbstprüfung, und Selbstprüfung erzeugt eine neue, nicht-hirtische Form der Gefährtenschaft.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:AS2","CH_97E9_8C_2:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_03:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Die gegenwärtige menschliche Ordnung verfügt nicht über einen bereits realisierten Sinn und kann deshalb keinen stabilen Ort für Zarathustras Lehre bilden.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:A5","CH_97E9_7700:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:GA-02","text":"[Mutating] Der Leichnam ist zunächst Negativgestalt der Sinnlosigkeit, wird dann zur materiellen Last und schließlich zum ausgeschlossenen Modell falscher Gefährtenschaft.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:ME2","CH_97E9_8800:SD2","CH_97E9_8C_2:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:GA-03","text":"[Persistent] Öffentliche Anerkennung, Publikum und Stadt fungieren nicht als Vermittlungsinstanzen der Wahrheit, sondern als erschöpfbare oder feindliche Ausschlussräume.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:NX3","CH_97E9_8800:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:GA-04","text":"[Emergent] Ausschluss ist nicht bloß negativer Widerstand, sondern erzeugt die Bedingungen, unter denen Bewegung, Schutz, Auswahl und Neuorientierung überhaupt stattfinden.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:FGS3","CH_97E9_8C_2:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:GA-05","text":"[Mutating] Zarathustras Autorität kann nicht als Hirtenmacht bestehen, weil sie sich von der Betreuung der Menge zur Selektion selbstbewegter Gefährten verschiebt.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:SD3","CH_97E9_8C_2:A10","CH_97E9_8C_2:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:GA-06","text":"[Attractor] Gültige Gefährtenschaft entsteht nur dort, wo gemeinsame Richtung aus Selbstfolge hervorgeht und nicht aus Gehorsam, Glauben oder passivem Mitgetragenwerden.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_2:A2","CH_97E9_8C_2:A3","CH_97E9_8C_2:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:GA-07","text":"[Emergent] Werteschöpfung verlangt die doppelte Operation des Bruchs mit bestehenden Tafeln und der kollektiven Hervorbringung neuer Tafeln.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_2:A6","CH_97E9_8C_2:A7","CH_97E9_8C_2:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:GA-08","text":"[Persistent] Der Weg besitzt keine gesicherte Teleologie; Hunger, Nacht, Wegverlust und Erschöpfung unterbrechen jede Vorstellung souveräner Fortbewegung.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A6","CH_97E9_8800:A11","CH_97E9_8800:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:GA-09","text":"[Terminal] Die Kopplung von Leben und Tod kann weder in reziproke Gemeinschaft noch in endgültige Versöhnung überführt werden; sie muss zugunsten lebendiger Gefährtenschaft verlassen werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:SNX4","CH_97E9_8C_2:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:GA-10","text":"[Attractor] Das kommende Ziel selektiert die Gegenwart, indem es Zögernde, Herden und Verteidiger bestehender Werte nicht integriert, sondern hinter sich lässt.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_2:A11","CH_97E9_8C_2:SD4","CH_97E9_8C_2:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_03:RMD-01","text":"Der „Fang“ kehrt nicht als Gewinnung wieder: Er mutiert vom gescheiterten Erwerb eines Menschen zum Fund eines Leichnams und wird dadurch zur Diagnose einer nicht gewinnbaren Gegenwart.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:AS2","CH_97E9_7700:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:RMD-02","text":"Der Tote behält seine materielle Präsenz, wechselt aber seine Funktion von Beweis der Sinnlosigkeit über soziale Stigmatisierung und Schutzobjekt zu dem, was keine künftige Gefährtenschaft mehr sein darf.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:D2","CH_97E9_8800:ME2","CH_97E9_8C_2:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:RMD-03","text":"Öffentlichkeit mutiert von flüchtiger Bühne zu feindlicher Klassifikationsmaschine und verschwindet dann zugunsten einer selektiven, nicht-universalen Adressierung.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:ME4","CH_97E9_8800:ME1","CH_97E9_8C_2:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:RMD-04","text":"Zarathustras Zwischenstellung zwischen Narr und Leichnam wird in die Entscheidung überführt, weder Totengräber noch Hirte zu bleiben.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:A9","CH_97E9_8C_2:NX3","CH_97E9_8C_2:NX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:RMD-05","text":"Bewegung bleibt als Funktion erhalten, doch ihr Modus verschiebt sich von dunkler Überführung über krisenhafte Wanderung zu selbstgesetztem Gang mit selektiver Gefährtenschaft.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:AF4","CH_97E9_8800:SD3","CH_97E9_8C_2:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_03:CGD-01","text":"Die konkrete Feindmarkierung durch Stadtstimmen bleibt lokal; auf Clusterebene wird sie zur allgemeinen Unfähigkeit öffentlicher Ordnungen, die lebend-tote Übergangskonstellation aufzunehmen.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A2","CH_97E9_8800:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:CGD-02","text":"Hunger, Brot, Wein, Sterne, Wölfe und hohler Baum bleiben lokale Schwellenmechanismen; ihre skalierte Funktion besteht darin, jede geistige Sendung an kontingente materielle Bedingungen zu binden.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A6","CH_97E9_8800:A12","CH_97E9_8800:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:CGD-03","text":"Die Bestattung bleibt nicht bloß eine Einzelhandlung, sondern wird auf Clusterebene zur Grenze zwischen der Pflege des Vergangenen und der Bildung einer künftigen schöpferischen Gemeinschaft.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:D7","CH_97E9_8C_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:CGD-04","text":"Der Wertbruch übersteigt die lokale Kritik an Guten, Gerechten und Gläubigen, weil er die Form der Gemeinschaft selbst von Wertbewahrung auf gemeinsame Wertproduktion umstellt.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_2:A5","CH_97E9_8C_2:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_03:GNX-01","text":"Das System verwirft die Annahme, dass öffentliche Sichtbarkeit, Erregung oder Spott eine dauerhafte soziale Trägerschaft der Lehre erzeugen könnten.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:DNX2","CH_97E9_8800:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:GNX-02","text":"Es schließt eine Gemeinschaft aus, die durch bloße Anwesenheit, gemeinsame Nahrung, Glaubensgleichheit oder Unterordnung als Gemeinschaft gelten könnte.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:D5","CH_97E9_8C_2:NX7","CH_97E9_8C_2:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:GNX-03","text":"Es verwirft die Vorstellung, der Tote könne entweder wiederbelebt, neutral klassifiziert oder folgenlos zurückgelassen werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:NX7","CH_97E9_8800:DNX5","CH_97E9_8800:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:GNX-04","text":"Es schließt aus, dass eine bestehende Wertordnung ihre Verteidigung und ihre Überschreitung dauerhaft in derselben politischen Form vereinigen kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_2:DNX5","CH_97E9_8C_2:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_03:DBN-01","text":"Damit das Cluster besteht, darf der Mensch weder als schon erfülltes Ziel noch als bloß zu rettendes Objekt behandelt werden; er erscheint als zu überwindende Übergangsform.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:DNX3","CH_97E9_7700:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:DBN-02","text":"Damit die neue Gefährtenschaft möglich wird, darf Führung nicht als Vermittlung zwischen Wahrheit und Volk begriffen werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_2:DNX3","CH_97E9_8C_2:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:DBN-03","text":"Damit Werteschöpfung möglich bleibt, darf die Bewahrung bestehender Tafeln keinen letzten normativen Vorrang beanspruchen.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_2:DNX1","CH_97E9_8C_2:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_03:BSA-01","text":"Abwesend bleibt eine Gegenwart, in der Sinn, Gemeinschaft und Wertordnung gleichzeitig gegeben, verständlich und sozial verkörpert wären.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:SNX1","CH_97E9_7700:SNX2","CH_97E9_8C_2:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:BSA-02","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine konfliktfreie Vermittlung zwischen Schaffenden und den Verteidigern bestehender Werte.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_2:D3","CH_97E9_8C_2:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:BSA-03","text":"Unzulässig bleibt die Rückkehr zu einer Ordnung, in der der Weg durch sichere Orientierung, soziale Anerkennung oder universale Ansprache garantiert wäre.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:DNX3","CH_97E9_8800:SNX1","CH_97E9_8C_2:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_03:XD-01","text":"Die Überführung des Toten und seine spätere Zurückweisung bilden zusammen keine Inkonsistenz, sondern eine Schwelle: Erst die konsequente Übernahme der vergangenen Last macht ihre Unvereinbarkeit mit lebendiger Gefährtenschaft sichtbar.","refs":["CL_97E9_03:GA-02","CL_97E9_03:GA-09","CH_97E9_7700:A11","CH_97E9_8C_2:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension.","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:XD-02","text":"Der Zusammenbruch der öffentlichen Szene und die Abkehr vom Volk sind zwei Stufen derselben Umcodierung: Wahrheit verliert ihren universalen Adressaten und gewinnt eine selektive Produktionsgemeinschaft.","refs":["CL_97E9_03:GA-03","CL_97E9_03:GA-06","CH_97E9_7700:D1","CH_97E9_8C_2:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite.","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:XD-03","text":"Die materielle Verletzlichkeit des Weges verhindert, dass Werteschöpfung als rein geistiger Akt erscheint; sie entsteht nur nach der Durchquerung von Ausschluss, Bedürftigkeit und Unterbrechung.","refs":["CL_97E9_03:GA-04","CL_97E9_03:GA-08","CH_97E9_8800:D4","CH_97E9_8800:FGS7","CH_97E9_8C_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite.","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:XD-04","text":"Die Ablehnung der Hirtenrolle ist nur möglich, weil Schweigen und Weitergehen zuvor als Alternative zur öffentlichen Selbstverteidigung ausgebildet werden.","refs":["CL_97E9_03:GA-05","CL_97E9_03:GA-10","CH_97E9_8800:D3","CH_97E9_8C_2:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite.","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:XD-05","text":"Die neue Gemeinschaft kann nicht aus dem Einschluss aller entstehen, weil ihre positive Form von Ausschlüssen gegen Tote, Herde, Volk, Zögernde und bestehende Tafeln abhängig bleibt.","refs":["CL_97E9_03:GA-04","CL_97E9_03:GA-06","CL_97E9_03:GA-07","CH_97E9_8C_2:NX1","CH_97E9_8C_2:NX2","CH_97E9_8C_2:NX10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative.","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_03:BSD-01","text":"Das Cluster erzeugt ein Modell von Wahrheit als selektiver Organisationskraft: Sie beweist sich nicht durch Zustimmung, sondern durch die Fähigkeit, tote Bindungen abzulegen und neue Produktionsbeziehungen zu bilden.","refs":["CL_97E9_03:GA-02","CL_97E9_03:GA-06","CL_97E9_03:GA-07","CH_97E9_8C_2:SD1","CH_97E9_8C_2:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:BSD-02","text":"Handlungsmacht wird weder als individuelle Souveränität noch als kollektive Gefolgschaft bestimmt, sondern als fortgesetzte Selbstbewegung unter nicht kontrollierbaren Bedingungen.","refs":["CL_97E9_03:GA-06","CL_97E9_03:GA-08","CH_97E9_8800:DNX4","CH_97E9_8C_2:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:BSD-03","text":"Die Zukunft fungiert nicht als Zielbild einer hellen Ordnung, sondern als Selektionsdruck, der die Gegenwart zur Trennung von ihren toten, herdhaften und wertbewahrenden Bindungen zwingt.","refs":["CL_97E9_03:GA-09","CL_97E9_03:GA-10","CH_97E9_7700:SNX4","CH_97E9_8C_2:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:BSD-04","text":"Die soziale Form des Schaffens ist asymmetrisch: Sie verlangt gemeinsame Produktion und Feier, ohne die Selbstfolge der Beteiligten in eine neue Unterordnung überführen zu dürfen.","refs":["CL_97E9_03:GA-05","CL_97E9_03:GA-06","CL_97E9_03:GA-07","CH_97E9_8C_2:A3","CH_97E9_8C_2:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_03:RLE-01","text":"Die zentrale Schleife lautet: Sinnlosigkeit erzeugt die Suche nach Sinn, diese Suche scheitert öffentlich, und ihr Scheitern erzwingt die Trennung, aus der eine andere Form von Gemeinschaft hervorgehen kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:D4","CH_97E9_7700:D1","CH_97E9_8C_2:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:RLE-02","text":"Der Tote ist ein Attraktor, weil jede räumliche, soziale und politische Bestimmung um die Frage kreist, ob er getragen, geschützt, integriert, verlassen oder überschritten werden soll.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:SD2","CH_97E9_8800:SNX2","CH_97E9_8C_2:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:RLE-03","text":"Ausschluss eskaliert rekursiv: Publikum zerfällt, Stadt stößt aus, Weg verschwindet, Herde wird verworfen und das Volk verliert den Status eines Adressaten.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:A2","CH_97E9_8800:D1","CH_97E9_8800:A11","CH_97E9_8C_2:NX9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:RLE-04","text":"Der Weg wird zur Maschine der Begriffsbildung, weil jede Unterbrechung nicht einfach Stop ist, sondern die Funktion der Bewegung neu bestimmt: Tragen, Schutz, Selbstprüfung, Abschied und Wertsetzung.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:D8","CH_97E9_8800:FGS1","CH_97E9_8C_2:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_03:FGS-B01","text":"Öffentliche Verkündigung ohne soziale Aufnahme → Leichnam statt gewonnenem Menschen → Diagnose einer noch sinnlosen menschlichen Gegenwart.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:AF1","CH_97E9_7700:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:FGS-B02","text":"Sinnlose Gegenwart plus tote Last → Ausschluss durch Stadt und Wildnis → erzwungene Bewegung unter materieller Abhängigkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:SD4","CH_97E9_8800:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:FGS-B03","text":"Unterbrechung der Bewegung → Schutz des Toten ohne Wiederbelebung → Einsicht in die Asymmetrie von Leben und Tod.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A12","CH_97E9_8800:NX7","CH_97E9_8800:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:FGS-B04","text":"Einsicht in die Unvereinbarkeit mitgetragener Toter → Ausschluss von Herde und Hirtenrolle → Definition selbstgerichteter Gefährtenschaft.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_2:D1","CH_97E9_8C_2:NX3","CH_97E9_8C_2:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:FGS-B05","text":"Bruch bestehender Wertetafeln → Mitschaffen, Ernten und Feiern → selektive Gemeinschaft neuer Wertproduktion.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_2:SD2","CH_97E9_8C_2:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_03:AFM-B01","text":"Erschöpfte Öffentlichkeit → gescheiterter Menschenfang → Leichnam als Rest der gegenwärtigen Menschheit.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:AFM-B02","text":"Leichnam als Rest → Übernahme und dunkle Überführung → Bindung der Lehre an eine noch nicht überwundene Gegenwart.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:AF4","CH_97E9_7700:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:AFM-B03","text":"Überführung → städtischer Ausschluss und Schweigen → Fortsetzung ohne öffentliche Rechtfertigung.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:D1","CH_97E9_8800:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:AFM-B04","text":"Fortsetzung → Hunger, Gastaufnahme und Wegverlust → Entzug souveräner Orientierung.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:D4","CH_97E9_8800:D7","CH_97E9_8800:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:AFM-B05","text":"Wegverlust → Schutz des Toten und Schlaf → Erwachen zur Unvereinbarkeit toter Last und eigener Bewegung.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:FGS7","CH_97E9_8C_2:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:AFM-B06","text":"Unvereinbarkeit → Abschied von Volk, Herde und Hirtenrolle → Bildung einer selektiven Wertschöpfungsgemeinschaft.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_2:D6","CH_97E9_8C_2:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_03:MME-01","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Scheitern und Schöpfung kollabiert: Das Scheitern der öffentlichen Lehre wird zur Voraussetzung einer anderen Organisationsform des Schaffens.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:SD1","CH_97E9_8C_2:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:MME-02","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Leben und Tod wird nicht aufgehoben, aber von einer ontologischen Differenz zu einer strategischen Frage der Bindung, des Schutzes und des Abschieds umkartiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:ME6","CH_97E9_8C_2:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:MME-03","text":"Gemeinschaft wird von Zugehörigkeit zu einer Praxis umklassifiziert: Nicht Identität oder Glauben, sondern Selbstfolge, Mitschaffen, Miternten und Mitfeiern konstituieren sie.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_2:SD3","CH_97E9_8C_2:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:MME-04","text":"Der Weg wird von einem Medium der Zielerreichung zu einem Selektionsverfahren, das sichtbar macht, welche Bindungen getragen, geschützt oder abgestoßen werden müssen.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:ME5","CH_97E9_8C_2:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_03:ALT-B01","text":"Surface level — Ein Lebender trägt einen Toten aus einer zerfallenden Öffentlichkeit durch Stadt und Wildnis, schützt ihn vor Wölfen und erkennt schließlich die Notwendigkeit des Abschieds.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:ALT1","CH_97E9_8800:A12","CH_97E9_8C_2:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:ALT-B02","text":"Structural level — Öffentliche Feindmarkierung, Hunger, Hausregel, Wegverlust, Wertverteidigung und Herdenbildung organisieren ein System, das Übergänge nur durch Ausschluss und Unterbrechung zulässt.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:ALT2","CH_97E9_8C_2:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:ALT-B03","text":"Metastrategic level — Die Strategie verschiebt sich von Bekehrung und Verteidigung zu Schweigen, Distanz, Auswahl und der Bildung selbstgerichteter Mitschaffender.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:ALT3","CH_97E9_8C_2:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:ALT-B04","text":"Ontological / Temporal level — Mensch, Leichnam, Übermensch und Schaffender bilden keine stabile Ontologie, sondern eine zeitliche Staffelung von Sinnlosigkeit, Übergang, Wertbruch und offenem Ziel.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:ALT4","CH_97E9_8C_2:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:ALT-B05","text":"Methodological / Performative level — Das Cluster vollzieht seine These selbst, indem es Sinn nicht durch eine harmonische Erklärung liefert, sondern durch serielle Negationen, Wegabbrüche und funktionale Umcodierungen erzeugt.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:FGS1","CH_97E9_8C_2:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_03:FL-01","text":"Die Lehre beansprucht einen zukünftigen Sinn, bleibt aber an eine Gegenwart gebunden, deren Sinne diesen Sinn nicht erreichen; Autorität und Unverständlichkeit bleiben deshalb zugleich wirksam.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:D5","CH_97E9_7700:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:FL-02","text":"Die Ablehnung der Hirtenrolle steht unter Spannung zur Führungswirkung des eigenen Gangs, der andere selektiert und Zögernde hinter sich lässt.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_2:MRT5","CH_97E9_8C_2:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:FL-03","text":"Die verlangte Teilnahme an der Gastgabe und die Unfähigkeit des Toten zur Gegenseitigkeit machen sichtbar, dass Gemeinschaft im Übergangsraum noch als unerfüllbare Form inszeniert wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:D5","CH_97E9_8800:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:MP-01","text":"Der Leichnam mutiert vom Gegenstand der Fürsorge zum Begriff dessen, was nicht mehr als Gefährte mitgeführt werden darf.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:D7","CH_97E9_8C_2:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:MP-02","text":"Schweigen mutiert von fehlender Widerlegung zu einer strategischen Technik, die Bewegung gegen die öffentliche Klassifikation schützt.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:NX2","CH_97E9_8800:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:MP-03","text":"Vernichtung mutiert von der Fremdbezeichnung des Schaffenden zu einer notwendigen Bedingung der Umwertung und neuen Wertsetzung.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_2:A9","CH_97E9_8C_2:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_03:HSI-01","text":"Die Realität erscheint als eine Schwellenmaschine, in der soziale Räume, körperliche Bedürfnisse, Wege und Wertordnungen Subjekte fortwährend aus ihren bisherigen Bindungen herauslösen.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:SD1","CH_97E9_8800:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:HSI-02","text":"Das Subjekt ist kein souveräner Besitzer eines Weges, sondern ein Träger, Schützer, Abschiednehmender und schließlich Selektor von Beziehungen.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:D8","CH_97E9_8C_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:HSI-03","text":"Zeit erscheint als nicht versöhnte Folge von Nachträglichkeit und Kommendem: Die tote Vergangenheit muss getragen werden, damit eine noch nicht gegebene Wertordnung möglich wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:SNX3","CH_97E9_8C_2:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:HSI-04","text":"Kampf bleibt als Navigation durch Ausschlüsse möglich, nicht als Gewinn einer universalen Gemeinschaft oder einer endgültig gesicherten Ankunft.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:SNX3","CH_97E9_8C_2:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_03:MRT-B01","text":"Die extrahierten Axiome reichen aus, um die Bewegung von öffentlichem Scheitern über Tragen, Ausschluss und Wegverlust bis zur selektiven Gefährtenschaft und Wertschöpfung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:MRT1","CH_97E9_8C_2:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:MRT-B02","text":"Unterbestimmt bleiben die positive Bestimmung des Übermenschen, die Kriterien der Auswahl von Mitschaffenden und die konkrete Entstehung neuer Wertetafeln.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:MRT2","CH_97E9_8C_2:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:MRT-B03","text":"Die Architektur ist kohärent, sofern der Abschied vom Toten nicht als Verwerfung jeder Vergangenheit, sondern als Ende einer passiven Bindungsform gelesen wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:MRT7","CH_97E9_8C_2:MRT7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:MRT-B04","text":"Ihre stärkste Schließung liegt in der Verbindung von Leichnam, Ausschluss, Selbstfolge und Wertbruch; ihre notwendige Offenheit bleibt die nicht garantierte Zukunft der neuen Gemeinschaft.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:MRT5","CH_97E9_8C_2:MRT8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T195735914951Z_0b1f7020","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Chapters 07–09","source_sha256":"41903a9da139c9ace6c7d191e8f2d700f2eb69e2413981a02aecec2a171e3a99","sha256":"6ddbabafbb18fefc3618de18deb95321bca6bfd6d6e8edc0b27abc7d4e159eb1","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:57:35.916312+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_03:AS-B01","text":"The cluster problematizes the transition from a public proclamation that gains no living addressee to a movement that must initially carry a dead person.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:AS2","CH_97E9_8800:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:AS-B02","text":"The diagnosis of meaninglessness is not overcome through immediate meaning-giving, but mediated through a dark intermediate space of exclusion, protection, hunger, loss of the way, and burial.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:A5","CH_97E9_8800:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:AS-B03","text":"The dead person mutates from the negative figure of a presently meaningless humanity into a touchstone at which the inadequacy of publicness, herd, hospitality, and leadership becomes manifest.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:ME2","CH_97E9_8800:ME2","CH_97E9_8C_2:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:AS-B04","text":"The movement becomes productive only when Zarathustra recognizes carrying the dead person along not as final companionship but as transitional work to be overcome.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:D7","CH_97E9_8C_2:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:AS-B05","text":"Community is detached from the audience, the people, and the herd and determined as a selective connection of self-directed co-creators.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:D1","CH_97E9_8C_2:A4","CH_97E9_8C_2:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:AS-B06","text":"The directed movement is recursive and threshold-like: failure produces carrying, carrying produces exclusion, exclusion compels self-examination, and self-examination produces a new, non-pastoral form of companionship.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:AS2","CH_97E9_8C_2:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_03:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] The present human order does not possess an already realized meaning and can therefore form no stable place for Zarathustra's teaching.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:A5","CH_97E9_7700:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:GA-02","text":"[Mutating] The corpse is initially a negative figure of meaninglessness, then becomes a material burden, and finally the excluded model of false companionship.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:ME2","CH_97E9_8800:SD2","CH_97E9_8C_2:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:GA-03","text":"[Persistent] Public recognition, audience, and city do not function as mediating instances of truth, but as exhaustible or hostile spaces of exclusion.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:NX3","CH_97E9_8800:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:GA-04","text":"[Emergent] Exclusion is not merely negative resistance, but produces the conditions under which movement, protection, selection, and reorientation can take place at all.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:FGS3","CH_97E9_8C_2:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:GA-05","text":"[Mutating] Zarathustra's authority cannot persist as pastoral power, because it shifts from the care of the multitude to the selection of self-moving companions.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:SD3","CH_97E9_8C_2:A10","CH_97E9_8C_2:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:GA-06","text":"[Attractor] Valid companionship arises only where a shared direction proceeds from self-following and not from obedience, faith, or passive being-carried-along.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_2:A2","CH_97E9_8C_2:A3","CH_97E9_8C_2:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:GA-07","text":"[Emergent] Value-creation requires the double operation of breaking with existing tables and the collective production of new tables.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_2:A6","CH_97E9_8C_2:A7","CH_97E9_8C_2:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:GA-08","text":"[Persistent] The way possesses no assured teleology; hunger, night, loss of the way, and exhaustion interrupt every notion of sovereign onward movement.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A6","CH_97E9_8800:A11","CH_97E9_8800:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:GA-09","text":"[Terminal] The coupling of life and death can be transferred neither into reciprocal community nor into final reconciliation; it must be abandoned in favor of living companionship.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:SNX4","CH_97E9_8C_2:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:GA-10","text":"[Attractor] The coming goal selects the present by not integrating the hesitant, herds, and defenders of existing values, but leaving them behind.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_2:A11","CH_97E9_8C_2:SD4","CH_97E9_8C_2:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_03:RMD-01","text":"The “catch” does not recur as acquisition: it mutates from the failed acquisition of a human being into the finding of a corpse and thereby becomes the diagnosis of a present that cannot be won over.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:AS2","CH_97E9_7700:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:RMD-02","text":"The dead person retains material presence, but changes function from proof of meaninglessness through social stigmatization and object of protection to that which no future companionship may any longer be.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:D2","CH_97E9_8800:ME2","CH_97E9_8C_2:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:RMD-03","text":"Publicness mutates from an ephemeral stage into a hostile machine of classification and then disappears in favor of a selective, non-universal address.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:ME4","CH_97E9_8800:ME1","CH_97E9_8C_2:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:RMD-04","text":"Zarathustra's intermediate position between fool and corpse is transferred into the decision to remain neither gravedigger nor shepherd.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:A9","CH_97E9_8C_2:NX3","CH_97E9_8C_2:NX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:RMD-05","text":"Movement remains preserved as a function, but its mode shifts from dark conveyance through crisis-ridden wandering to self-positing progress with selective companionship.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:AF4","CH_97E9_8800:SD3","CH_97E9_8C_2:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_03:CGD-01","text":"The concrete marking of enemies by voices from the city remains local; at cluster level, it becomes the general incapacity of public orders to accommodate the living-dead transitional constellation.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A2","CH_97E9_8800:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:CGD-02","text":"Hunger, bread, wine, stars, wolves, and hollow tree remain local threshold mechanisms; their scaled function consists in binding every spiritual mission to contingent material conditions.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A6","CH_97E9_8800:A12","CH_97E9_8800:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:CGD-03","text":"Burial does not remain merely an individual action, but at cluster level becomes the boundary between the care of the past and the formation of a future creative community.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:D7","CH_97E9_8C_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:CGD-04","text":"The break with values exceeds the local critique of the good, the just, and the believers, because it shifts the form of community itself from value-preservation to shared value-production.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_2:A5","CH_97E9_8C_2:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_03:GNX-01","text":"The system rejects the assumption that public visibility, excitement, or mockery could produce a durable social support of the teaching.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:DNX2","CH_97E9_8800:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:GNX-02","text":"It excludes a community that could count as community through mere presence, shared food, equality of faith, or subordination.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:D5","CH_97E9_8C_2:NX7","CH_97E9_8C_2:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:GNX-03","text":"It rejects the notion that the dead person could either be revived, neutrally classified, or left behind without consequence.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:NX7","CH_97E9_8800:DNX5","CH_97E9_8800:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:GNX-04","text":"It excludes the possibility that an existing value order can permanently unite its defense and its overcoming in the same political form.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_2:DNX5","CH_97E9_8C_2:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_03:DBN-01","text":"For the cluster to subsist, the human being must be treated neither as an already fulfilled goal nor as an object merely to be saved; the human being appears as a transitional form to be overcome.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:DNX3","CH_97E9_7700:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:DBN-02","text":"For the new companionship to become possible, leadership must not be understood as mediation between truth and the people.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_2:DNX3","CH_97E9_8C_2:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:DBN-03","text":"For value-creation to remain possible, the preservation of existing tables must not claim final normative precedence.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_2:DNX1","CH_97E9_8C_2:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_03:BSA-01","text":"Absent remains a present in which meaning, community, and value order would simultaneously be given, intelligible, and socially embodied.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:SNX1","CH_97E9_7700:SNX2","CH_97E9_8C_2:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:BSA-02","text":"Unavailable is a conflict-free mediation between creators and the defenders of existing values.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_2:D3","CH_97E9_8C_2:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:BSA-03","text":"Impermissible remains the return to an order in which the way would be guaranteed by secure orientation, social recognition, or universal address.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:DNX3","CH_97E9_8800:SNX1","CH_97E9_8C_2:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_03:XD-01","text":"The conveyance of the dead person and his later rejection together do not constitute an inconsistency, but a threshold: only the consistent assumption of the past burden makes its incompatibility with living companionship visible.","refs":["CL_97E9_03:GA-02","CL_97E9_03:GA-09","CH_97E9_7700:A11","CH_97E9_8C_2:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension.","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:XD-02","text":"The collapse of the public scene and the turning away from the people are two stages of the same recoding: truth loses its universal addressee and gains a selective community of production.","refs":["CL_97E9_03:GA-03","CL_97E9_03:GA-06","CH_97E9_7700:D1","CH_97E9_8C_2:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite.","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:XD-03","text":"The material vulnerability of the way prevents value-creation from appearing as a purely spiritual act; it arises only after the traversal of exclusion, need, and interruption.","refs":["CL_97E9_03:GA-04","CL_97E9_03:GA-08","CH_97E9_8800:D4","CH_97E9_8800:FGS7","CH_97E9_8C_2:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite.","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:XD-04","text":"The rejection of the shepherd's role is possible only because silence and moving onward are previously developed as alternatives to public self-defense.","refs":["CL_97E9_03:GA-05","CL_97E9_03:GA-10","CH_97E9_8800:D3","CH_97E9_8C_2:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite.","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:XD-05","text":"The new community cannot arise from the inclusion of all, because its positive form remains dependent on exclusions against the dead, the herd, the people, the hesitant, and existing tables.","refs":["CL_97E9_03:GA-04","CL_97E9_03:GA-06","CL_97E9_03:GA-07","CH_97E9_8C_2:NX1","CH_97E9_8C_2:NX2","CH_97E9_8C_2:NX10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative.","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_03:BSD-01","text":"The cluster produces a model of truth as a selective organizational force: it proves itself not through assent, but through the capacity to shed dead bonds and form new relations of production.","refs":["CL_97E9_03:GA-02","CL_97E9_03:GA-06","CL_97E9_03:GA-07","CH_97E9_8C_2:SD1","CH_97E9_8C_2:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:BSD-02","text":"Capacity for action is determined neither as individual sovereignty nor as collective followership, but as sustained self-movement under uncontrollable conditions.","refs":["CL_97E9_03:GA-06","CL_97E9_03:GA-08","CH_97E9_8800:DNX4","CH_97E9_8C_2:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:BSD-03","text":"The future functions not as the image of a bright order, but as a pressure of selection that compels the present to separate from its dead, herd-like, and value-preserving bonds.","refs":["CL_97E9_03:GA-09","CL_97E9_03:GA-10","CH_97E9_7700:SNX4","CH_97E9_8C_2:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:BSD-04","text":"The social form of creation is asymmetrical: it requires shared production and celebration, without being permitted to transfer the self-following of those involved into a new subordination.","refs":["CL_97E9_03:GA-05","CL_97E9_03:GA-06","CL_97E9_03:GA-07","CH_97E9_8C_2:A3","CH_97E9_8C_2:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_03:RLE-01","text":"The central loop is: meaninglessness generates the search for meaning, this search fails publicly, and its failure compels the separation from which another form of community can emerge.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:D4","CH_97E9_7700:D1","CH_97E9_8C_2:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:RLE-02","text":"The dead person is an attractor because every spatial, social, and political determination revolves around the question of whether he should be carried, protected, integrated, abandoned, or overcome.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:SD2","CH_97E9_8800:SNX2","CH_97E9_8C_2:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:RLE-03","text":"Exclusion escalates recursively: the audience disintegrates, the city expels, the way disappears, the herd is rejected, and the people lose the status of addressee.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:A2","CH_97E9_8800:D1","CH_97E9_8800:A11","CH_97E9_8C_2:NX9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:RLE-04","text":"The way becomes a machine of concept-formation, because every interruption is not simply a stop, but newly determines the function of movement: carrying, protection, self-examination, farewell, and value-positing.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:D8","CH_97E9_8800:FGS1","CH_97E9_8C_2:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_03:FGS-B01","text":"Public proclamation without social reception → corpse instead of a human being gained → diagnosis of a still meaningless human present.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:AF1","CH_97E9_7700:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:FGS-B02","text":"Meaningless present plus dead burden → exclusion by city and wilderness → compelled movement under material dependency.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:SD4","CH_97E9_8800:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:FGS-B03","text":"Interruption of movement → protection of the dead person without revival → insight into the asymmetry of life and death.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:A12","CH_97E9_8800:NX7","CH_97E9_8800:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:FGS-B04","text":"Insight into the incompatibility of dead persons carried along → exclusion of herd and shepherd's role → definition of self-directed companionship.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_2:D1","CH_97E9_8C_2:NX3","CH_97E9_8C_2:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:FGS-B05","text":"Break with existing tables of values → co-creating, harvesting, and celebrating → selective community of new value-production.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_2:SD2","CH_97E9_8C_2:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_03:AFM-B01","text":"Exhausted publicness → failed catching of human beings → corpse as the remnant of present humanity.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:AFM-B02","text":"Corpse as remnant → assumption and dark conveyance → binding of the teaching to a present not yet overcome.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:AF4","CH_97E9_7700:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:AFM-B03","text":"Conveyance → urban exclusion and silence → continuation without public justification.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:D1","CH_97E9_8800:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:AFM-B04","text":"Continuation → hunger, hospitality, and loss of the way → withdrawal of sovereign orientation.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:D4","CH_97E9_8800:D7","CH_97E9_8800:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:AFM-B05","text":"Loss of the way → protection of the dead person and sleep → awakening to the incompatibility of dead burden and one's own movement.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:FGS7","CH_97E9_8C_2:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:AFM-B06","text":"Incompatibility → farewell to people, herd, and shepherd's role → formation of a selective community of value-creation.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_2:D6","CH_97E9_8C_2:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_03:MME-01","text":"The opposition between failure and creation collapses: the failure of the public teaching becomes the precondition of another organizational form of creation.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:SD1","CH_97E9_8C_2:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:MME-02","text":"The opposition between life and death is not overcome, but remapped from an ontological difference into a strategic question of binding, protection, and farewell.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:ME6","CH_97E9_8C_2:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:MME-03","text":"Community is reclassified from belonging to a practice: not identity or faith, but self-following, co-creating, co-harvesting, and co-celebrating constitute it.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_2:SD3","CH_97E9_8C_2:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:MME-04","text":"The way is transformed from a medium of goal-attainment into a procedure of selection that makes visible which bonds must be carried, protected, or repelled.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:ME5","CH_97E9_8C_2:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_03:ALT-B01","text":"Surface level — A living person carries a dead person out of a disintegrating publicness through city and wilderness, protects him from wolves, and finally recognizes the necessity of farewell.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:ALT1","CH_97E9_8800:A12","CH_97E9_8C_2:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:ALT-B02","text":"Structural level — Public marking of enemies, hunger, house rule, loss of the way, defense of values, and herd formation organize a system that permits transitions only through exclusion and interruption.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:ALT2","CH_97E9_8C_2:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:ALT-B03","text":"Metastrategic level — The strategy shifts from conversion and defense to silence, distance, selection, and the formation of self-directed co-creators.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:ALT3","CH_97E9_8C_2:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:ALT-B04","text":"Ontological / Temporal level — Human being, corpse, Übermensch, and creator do not form a stable ontology, but a temporal sequence of meaninglessness, transition, break with values, and open goal.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:ALT4","CH_97E9_8C_2:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:ALT-B05","text":"Methodological / Performative level — The cluster itself performs its thesis by producing meaning not through a harmonious explanation, but through serial negations, interruptions of the way, and functional recodings.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:FGS1","CH_97E9_8C_2:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_03:FL-01","text":"The teaching lays claim to a future meaning, yet remains bound to a present whose meanings do not attain that meaning; authority and incomprehensibility therefore remain effective at once.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:D5","CH_97E9_7700:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:FL-02","text":"The rejection of the shepherd's role stands in tension with the guiding effect of one's own progress, which selects others and leaves the hesitant behind.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_2:MRT5","CH_97E9_8C_2:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:FL-03","text":"The demanded participation in the gift of hospitality and the incapacity of the dead person for reciprocity make visible that community in the transitional space is still staged as an unfulfillable form.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:D5","CH_97E9_8800:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:MP-01","text":"The corpse mutates from an object of care into the concept of that which may no longer be carried along as a companion.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:D7","CH_97E9_8C_2:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:MP-02","text":"Silence mutates from the absence of refutation into a strategic technique that protects movement against public classification.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:NX2","CH_97E9_8800:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:MP-03","text":"Destruction mutates from the external designation of the creator into a necessary condition of revaluation and new value-positing.","refs":["CH_97E9_8C_2:A9","CH_97E9_8C_2:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_03:HSI-01","text":"Reality appears as a threshold machine in which social spaces, bodily needs, ways, and value orders continually detach subjects from their previous bonds.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:SD1","CH_97E9_8800:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:HSI-02","text":"The subject is not a sovereign possessor of a way, but a carrier, protector, one taking farewell, and finally selector of relations.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:D8","CH_97E9_8C_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:HSI-03","text":"Time appears as an unreconciled sequence of belatedness and what is coming: the dead past must be carried so that a value order not yet given may become possible.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:SNX3","CH_97E9_8C_2:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:HSI-04","text":"Struggle remains possible as navigation through exclusions, not as the attainment of a universal community or an arrival secured once and for all.","refs":["CH_97E9_8800:SNX3","CH_97E9_8C_2:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_03:MRT-B01","text":"The extracted axioms suffice to reconstruct the movement from public failure through carrying, exclusion, and loss of the way up to selective companionship and value-creation.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:MRT1","CH_97E9_8C_2:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:MRT-B02","text":"The positive determination of the Übermensch, the criteria for selecting co-creators, and the concrete emergence of new tables of values remain underdetermined.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:MRT2","CH_97E9_8C_2:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:MRT-B03","text":"The architecture is coherent insofar as the farewell to the dead person is read not as a rejection of every past, but as the end of a passive form of binding.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:MRT7","CH_97E9_8C_2:MRT7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_03:MRT-B04","text":"Its strongest closure lies in the connection of corpse, exclusion, self-following, and break with values; its necessary openness remains the unguaranteed future of the new community.","refs":["CH_97E9_7700:MRT5","CH_97E9_8C_2:MRT8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CL_97E9_03@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CL_97E9_03:v1","source_language_code":"de","original_title":"Chapters 07–09"}],"identity":{"layer":"CL","kicker":"Cluster · Also sprach Zarathustra","title":"Chapters 07–09","context":"Zarathustra’s Vorrede · 7 · Zarathustra’s Vorrede · 8 · Zarathustra’s Vorrede · 8","original_title":"Chapters 07–09"},"original_title":"Chapters 07–09","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CL_97E9_04","layer":"CL","title":"Chapters 10–12","order":4,"parents":["CH_97E9_10CH","CH_97E9_VDDV","CH_97E9_VDLH"],"revision":"CL_97E9_04@R001","sha256":"0f4629567ab9a068d2992a6243f7db3594afb3e524cf2eebb36513c533deee93","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_04:AS-B01","text":"Das System untersucht, wie ein Geist seine Handlungsfähigkeit unter Bedingungen von Unsicherheit, Überlieferung und institutioneller Beruhigung erzeugen oder verlieren kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:AS-B02","text":"Seine Grundbewegung trennt drei unvereinbare Formen der Selbststabilisierung: kompensatorischen Stolz, gehorsame Tugendverwaltung und schöpferische Selbstverwandlung.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:AS-B03","text":"Die tierische Konstellation zeigt, dass Orientierung nicht aus souveräner Selbstgewissheit entsteht, sondern aus einer prekären Verbindung von Klugheit, Gefährdung und Ersatzkontinuität.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:AS-B04","text":"Die Verwandlungslehre bildet die positive Gegenbewegung: Last, Negation und Freiheit genügen nicht, solange sie nicht in einen Anfang übergehen, der neue Werte hervorbringt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:AS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:AS-B05","text":"Die Lehrstuhlweisheit erscheint als Gegenmaschine zur Verwandlung, weil sie Tugend, Wahrheit und Selbstüberwindung in Verfahren der Ermüdung, Versöhnung und sozialen Stilllegung überführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:AS-B06","text":"Der Konflikt des Clusters lautet daher nicht Tugend gegen Laster, sondern schöpferische Wachheit gegen jede Ordnung, die Selbstverhältnis, Politik und Erkenntnis auf Ruhe reduziert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:AS-B07","text":"Die Bewegung ist spiralig: Unsicherheit erzwingt eine Stütze, die Stütze kann zur Untergangsform werden, und nur die Verwandlung des Willens verhindert ihre Erstarrung zur Schlaftechnik.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:AS-B08","text":"Die Schließung bleibt offen, weil der Übergang zur schöpferischen Bejahung zwar notwendig gesetzt, aber weder positiv begründet noch gegen seine erneute Institutionalisierung gesichert wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_04:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Geistige Orientierung ist keine stabile Eigenschaft des Subjekts, sondern eine prekäre, vermittelte und verlustfähige Funktion.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:GA-02","text":"[Mutating] Selbstüberwindung besitzt keinen einheitlichen Wert: Sie kann Lastfähigkeit hervorbringen, Schlaf vorbereiten oder als Übergang zur Wertschöpfung dienen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:GA-03","text":"[Emergent] Freiheit wird nur produktiv, wenn sie sich von der bloßen Negation überlieferter Gebote in einen schöpferischen Anfang verwandelt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:GA-04","text":"[Persistent] Jede bestehende Wertordnung tendiert dazu, ihre eigene Geschichtlichkeit zu verbergen und sich als letzte, bereits vollständige Form von Wert auszugeben.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:GA-05","text":"[Mutating] Tugend wird entweder als Material der Verwandlung oder als Technik der Stilllegung wirksam; ihr Status entscheidet sich an ihrer zeitlichen Funktion.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:GA-06","text":"[Attractor] Das heilige Ja bezeichnet keinen Zustand des Friedens, sondern die Fähigkeit, nach Last und Negation wieder einen ersten Anfang hervorzubringen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:GA-07","text":"[Terminal] Wo Wahrheit, Gehorsam und Selbstüberwindung dem Schlaf untergeordnet werden, endet Weisheit nicht in Erkenntnis, sondern in Gedankenentzug und Liegen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:GA-08","text":"[Attractor] Untergang und Schöpfung markieren gegensätzliche Folgen derselben Krise der Selbstkontinuität: Ersatzstabilisierung führt zur Zersetzung, Neubeginn zur Wertbildung.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_04:RMD-01","text":"Die Wüste kehrt als Schwellenraum wieder: Sie ist weder bloße Isolation noch Flucht, sondern die Zone, in der Lastordnung, Selbstgewissheit und überlieferte Herrschaft ihre bindende Kraft verlieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:RMD-02","text":"Selbstüberwindung mutiert von der freiwilligen Annahme des Schwersten zur gezählten Tagesdisziplin; im ersten Fall öffnet sie Transformation, im zweiten wird sie durch Versöhnung neutralisiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:RMD-03","text":"Der Wille verschiebt sich vom „Ich will“ als negativem Freiheitsakt zum kindlichen Ja als weltbildender Erstbewegung; die Negation wird dadurch absorbiert, aber nicht widerrufen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:RMD-04","text":"Stolz bleibt als Kontinuitätsbegehren erhalten, mutiert jedoch von einer möglichen Trägerinstanz zu einer Gefahr, sobald er Klugheit nicht begleitet, sondern ersetzt.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:RMD-05","text":"Wahrheit erscheint zunächst als Teil der Schlafökonomie und verliert dort ihren offenen Erkenntnischarakter; sie kann nur außerhalb dieser Stilllegungsfunktion wieder schöpferisch relevant werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:RMD-06","text":"Das Tiermotiv wird von symbolischer Begleitung zu epistemischer Außeninstanz verschoben und bildet damit einen Gegenpol zur institutionellen Autorität des Lehrstuhls.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_04:CGD-01","text":"Die konkrete Gestalt von Adler und Schlange bleibt lokal, während ihre Funktion als externe Prüfung einer unsicheren Selbstorientierung auf die Clusterebene skaliert.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:CGD-02","text":"Kamel, Löwe und Kind bleiben lokale Funktionsfiguren, aber ihre Abfolge wird global zur Regel, dass Belastung und Befreiung ohne affirmative Neubildung unvollständig bleiben.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:CGD-03","text":"Die Zehnerordnung der Tugendlehre bleibt eine lokale Disziplinartechnik, doch ihre Reduktion aller Werte auf Reibungsminimierung wird zum übergeordneten Gegenmodell schöpferischer Existenz.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:CGD-04","text":"Die menschliche Gefährdung Zarathustras bleibt situativ, wird aber auf Cluster-Ebene zur Diagnose, dass soziale Ordnungen Orientierung in Anpassung oder Selbstverlust umformen können.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:CGD-05","text":"Der gute Schlaf bleibt ein lokales Telos des Lehrstuhlweisen, aber seine Funktion als Endpunkt institutionalisierter Tugend wird zur allgemeinen Figur anti-schöpferischer Schließung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_04:GNX-01","text":"Das System verwirft die Annahme, dass Klugheit, Wahrheit oder Tugend als dauerhaft verfügbare Besitzformen eines stabilen Subjekts existieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:NX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:GNX-02","text":"Es verwirft die Gleichsetzung von Gehorsam mit Geistigkeit, weil das „Du-sollst“ Vergangenheit als geschlossene Autorität gegen neue Wertbildung mobilisiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:GNX-03","text":"Es verwirft die Gleichsetzung von Freiheit und Schöpfung, weil das Nein des Löwen nur den Raum öffnet, den das Kind erst positiv besetzen kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:GNX-04","text":"Es verwirft jede Tugendordnung, deren Erfolg in konfliktloser Anpassung, politischem Gehorsam und traumloser Bewusstseinsreduktion besteht.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:GNX-05","text":"Es verwirft eine Selbstbehauptung, die den Verlust der Klugheit durch fortbestehenden Stolz kompensieren will, weil diese Kompensation bereits eine Untergangsbewegung eröffnet.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_04:DBN-01","text":"Damit der Cluster Bestand hat, darf keine Identität als autonom, vollständig und endgültig gesichert angenommen werden; jede Identität bleibt von Prüfung, Verlust und Verwandlung abhängig.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:DBN-02","text":"Damit Wertschöpfung möglich bleibt, darf die Vergangenheit nicht als erschöpfte Totalität aller Werte gelten.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:NX8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:DBN-03","text":"Damit Wachheit produktiv bleibt, darf Selbstüberwindung nicht in Versöhnung, Ermüdung und Stillstellung abgeschlossen werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:DBN-04","text":"Damit Freiheit nicht leer bleibt, darf die Negation des alten Gesetzes nicht als letzte Form des Willens fixiert werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:DBN-05","text":"Damit politische und existentielle Transformation möglich bleibt, darf Ruhe nicht als letzter Sinnhorizont von Tugend, Denken und Sozialität fungieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_04:BSA-01","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Welt, in der Sinn durch endgültige Beruhigung erreicht werden könnte, ohne dass diese Beruhigung zugleich Denken, Konflikt und Zukunft entzieht.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:BSA-02","text":"Unverfügbar bleibt eine Form von Schöpfung, die weder durch Last, Negation und Verlust hindurchgehen noch die Gefahr ihrer eigenen Erstarrung tragen müsste.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:BSA-03","text":"Ontologisch unzulässig ist ein Subjekt, das sich durch Besitz seiner Fähigkeiten selbst garantiert; Orientierung muss von außen geprüft, zeitlich erneuert und gegen ihre eigene Verhärtung geschützt werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:BSA-04","text":"Nicht zugelassen wird eine Ordnung, in der Anpassung an bestehende Macht als ethische Vollendung gelten kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_04:XD-01","text":"Die Verwandlung des Geistes verlangt eine Orientierung, die nicht zur Ersatzidentität erstarrt: Was als Stolz gegen den Verlust der Klugheit dient, muss durch kindlichen Neubeginn überschritten werden.","refs":["CL_97E9_04:GA-01","CL_97E9_04:GA-06","CL_97E9_04:GA-08","CH_97E9_10CH:A8","CH_97E9_VDDV:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:XD-02","text":"Die Lehrstuhlweisheit bildet die degenerierte Doppelgängerin der Verwandlungslehre: Sie übernimmt Selbstüberwindung, blockiert aber ihre Passage durch Negation und Neubeginn.","refs":["CL_97E9_04:GA-02","CL_97E9_04:GA-03","CL_97E9_04:GA-05","CH_97E9_VDLH:A4","CH_97E9_VDDV:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:XD-03","text":"Der Kampf gegen überlieferte Werte und die Genealogie der Tugendlehre gehören zusammen, weil beide zeigen, dass moralische Autorität ihre eigene Funktion verschleiert: einmal als Drache, einmal als Schlafdisziplin.","refs":["CL_97E9_04:GA-04","CL_97E9_04:GA-05","CH_97E9_VDDV:A6","CH_97E9_VDLH:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:XD-04","text":"Die Nichtmenschen und das Kind besetzen analoge Gegenpositionen zur Lehrstuhlautorität: Beide unterbrechen eine selbstgenügsame moralische Ordnung, ohne eine neue Norm als fertiges Gesetz auszugeben.","refs":["CL_97E9_04:GA-01","CL_97E9_04:GA-06","CH_97E9_10CH:ME1","CH_97E9_VDDV:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:XD-05","text":"Die tiefere Gefahr liegt nicht in Konflikt oder Einsamkeit, sondern in deren administrativer Neutralisierung durch eine Ordnung, die jedes Denken auf Schlafverträglichkeit prüft.","refs":["CL_97E9_04:GA-07","CH_97E9_VDLH:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_04:BSD-01","text":"Der Cluster rekonstruiert Wertbildung als Kampf um die Zeitform des Geistes: Vergangenheit bindet als Gebot, Gegenwart verwaltet als Schlafdisziplin, Zukunft entsteht nur als vergessender Neubeginn.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:BSD-02","text":"Das Subjekt wird weder als souveräner Ursprung noch als bloßes Objekt der Norm verstanden, sondern als instabile Kreuzung von äußerer Prüfung, Last, Gegenwehr, Affektregulation und Schöpfung.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:BSD-03","text":"Moralische Systeme werden danach klassifiziert, ob sie Kräfte in offene Transformation überführen oder sie in reproduzierbare Passivität und institutionelle Ruhe zurückführen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:BSD-04","text":"Die politische Konsequenz lautet, dass Gehorsam nicht an seiner normativen Oberfläche, sondern an seiner Funktion für die Unterdrückung von Konflikt, Zukunft und Wertschöpfung beurteilt werden muss.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:BSD-05","text":"Untergang wird als immanente Fehlform der Selbststabilisierung bestimmt: Er beginnt, wenn eine notwendige Stütze sich als Ersatz für die Verwandlung des ganzen Willens etabliert.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_04:RLE-01","text":"Die zentrale Schleife lautet: Unsicherheit erzeugt Stütze, Stütze erzeugt Kontinuität, Kontinuität droht zur Erstarrung zu werden, und Erstarrung erzwingt eine neue Verwandlung.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:RLE-02","text":"Die Verwandlungssequenz bildet einen Eskalationspfad, in dem Last in Negation, Negation in Freiheit und Freiheit in affirmatives Schaffen übergehen muss.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:RLE-03","text":"Die Schlafmaschine bildet eine inverse Schleife: Wachen wird diszipliniert, Disziplin erzeugt Ermüdung, Ermüdung erzeugt Schlaf, und Schlaf entzieht dem Denken die Bedingungen seiner Fortsetzung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:RLE-04","text":"Der Attraktor des Clusters ist der Neubeginn, weil er weder aus gesicherter Klugheit noch aus bloßer Freiheit hervorgeht, sondern beide Ordnungen nach ihrem Verlust reorganisiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:RLE-05","text":"Die produktive Wiederkehr des Konflikts markiert keinen Fehler, sondern die Bedingung dafür, dass Tugend nicht zur Technik des Einschlafens und Freiheit nicht zur bloßen Pose wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_04:FGS-B01","text":"Prekäre Orientierung + mögliche Flucht der Klugheit → Suche nach Kontinuität → Gefahr kompensatorischer Selbstbehauptung.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:FGS-B02","text":"Überlieferte Lastordnung + freiwillige Lastübernahme → Wüste → Freilegung des „Du-sollst“ als historisch totalisierte Herrschaft.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:FGS-B03","text":"Negation des Gebots + „Ich will“ → Freiheit ohne positive Weltbildung → Unzulänglichkeit des kämpfenden Willens.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:FGS-B04","text":"Vergessen + Spiel + heiliges Ja → Erstbewegung → eigene Welt und neue Wertbildung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:FGS-B05","text":"Tugend als Schlafmittel + institutionelle Autorität → Reibungsminimierung → Entzug von Konflikt, Denken und Zukunft.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:FGS-B06","text":"Der Cluster erzeugt seine positive Architektur durch die Unterscheidung zwischen Verwandlung, die Kräfte neu ordnet, und Disziplin, die Kräfte zum Stillstand bringt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_04:AFM-B01","text":"Fragliche Selbstkontinuität → äußere Orientierung → Verlustmöglichkeit der Klugheit → kompensatorischer Stolz → Untergangsrisiko.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:AFM-B02","text":"Lastübernahme → Wüste → Entheiligung des „Du-sollst“ → Freiheit → Unzulänglichkeit der Negation → kindlicher Neubeginn → Wertschöpfung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:AFM-B03","text":"Institutionelle Tugend → Tagesdisziplin → soziale Befriedung → Schlaf → Gedankenentzug → genealogische Entwertung der Lehrstuhlweisheit.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:AFM-B04","text":"Prekäre Orientierung → Verwandlung oder Beruhigung → offene Wertbildung oder passive Schließung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_04:MME-01","text":"Die Karte des Geistes wird von einer Besitzlogik auf eine Transformationslogik umgestellt: Fähigkeiten gelten nicht als Eigentum, sondern als verlustfähige und neu zu erzeugende Relationen.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:MME-02","text":"Die Opposition zwischen Mensch und Tier wird durch eine andere Opposition ersetzt: institutionalisierte Selbstberuhigung gegen nichtmenschlich vermittelte Orientierung.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:MME-03","text":"Freiheit wird neu kartiert als Zwischenzone zwischen Gehorsam und Schöpfung und verliert damit jeden Anspruch, bereits ihr eigener Endzweck zu sein.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:MME-04","text":"Tugend wird in zwei inkompatible Funktionsweisen gespalten: als Material des Übergangs oder als Dispositiv der Reibungsminimierung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:MME-05","text":"Untergang wird von einem äußeren Schicksalsereignis in einen internen Effekt verfehlter Selbststabilisierung umklassifiziert.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_04:ALT-B01","text":"Surface level — Tiere, Verwandlungsgestalten und Lehrstuhlweisen bilden konkrete Szenen, in denen Orientierung, Wertschöpfung und Schlaf als konkurrierende Lebensformen auftreten.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:ALT-B02","text":"Structural level — Das System verteilt geistige Kräfte zwischen äußerer Prüfung, Lastübernahme, Negation, Neubeginn und institutioneller Stilllegung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:ALT-B03","text":"Metastrategic level — Die angemessene Intervention besteht weder im Gehorsam noch im bloßen Widerstand, sondern in der Erzeugung eines Willens, der nach dem Nein wieder bejahen kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:ALT-B04","text":"Ontological / Temporal level — Realität erscheint als offene Folge von Übergängen, in der Vergangenheit Gebote sedimentiert, Gegenwart Kräfte verwaltet und Zukunft nur als nicht ableitbarer Anfang möglich wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:ALT-B05","text":"Methodological / Performative level — Die Figurenfolge vollzieht selbst ihre Theorie, indem sie keine feste Tugendlehre darbietet, sondern die Wiederverwendbarkeit jeder Haltung in wechselnden Funktionen exponiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_04:FL-01","text":"Die Architektur benötigt Selbstüberwindung als Voraussetzung der Verwandlung, muss aber zugleich verhindern, dass sie in der Versöhnungsökonomie des Schlafs aufgeht.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:FL-02","text":"Der Stolz soll Klugheit und Torheit überdauern, doch genau diese zeitliche Ausdehnung lässt ihn von einer Stütze zu einer Untergangsform mutieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:FL-03","text":"Die Freiheit des Löwen ist notwendig, aber ihre kämpferische Form steht unter dem Druck, durch das Vergessen des Kindes entmächtigt oder aufgehoben zu werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:FL-04","text":"Die neue Wertschöpfung wird als notwendig behauptet, ohne dass ihre Kriterien der Geltung positiv ausgewiesen werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:MRT7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:MP-01","text":"Klugheit mutiert von einer erwünschten geistigen Fähigkeit zu einem flüchtigen Element, dessen Abwesenheit die Notwendigkeit anderer Orientierungsformen sichtbar macht.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:MP-02","text":"Tugend mutiert von einer scheinbar autonomen moralischen Qualität zu einer operativen Technik, deren Wert durch ihre Beziehung zu Wachheit oder Schlaf bestimmt wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:MP-03","text":"Das Nein mutiert von einer Befreiungsoperation zu einer unzureichenden Zwischenform, sobald die Frage nach positiver Weltbildung auftritt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:NX7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_04:HSI-01","text":"Die Realität erscheint als Feld konkurrierender Umwandlungsmaschinen: Tiere prüfen Orientierung, Drachen konservieren Werte, Lehrstühle beruhigen Kräfte, und das Kind eröffnet neue Weltbildung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:HSI-02","text":"Das Subjekt ist keine Einheit, sondern eine durch Last, Verlust, Prüfung, Widerstand und Spiel hindurch rekonfigurierte Passage.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:HSI-03","text":"Zeit ist nicht lineare Fortsetzung, sondern ein Kampf zwischen sedimentierter Vergangenheit, stillgelegter Gegenwart und einer Zukunft, die nur als erster, nicht ableitbarer Schritt eintreten kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:HSI-04","text":"Möglich bleibt ein Kampf, der sich weder auf dauernden Stolz noch auf dauernde Opposition stützt, sondern seine Kräfte in wiederholte Verwandlung überführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_04:MRT-B01","text":"Die extrahierten Axiome reichen aus, um die zentrale Alternative des Clusters zu rekonstruieren: Selbststabilisierung kann in Verwandlung und Wertschöpfung oder in Beruhigung und Gedankenverlust übergehen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:MRT-B02","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt die positive Geltung der neuen Werte, weil der Neubeginn formal bestimmt wird, ohne seine materiellen Kriterien oder sozialen Prüfverfahren zu liefern.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:MRT-B03","text":"Die stärkste architektonische Verbindung liegt in der Unterscheidung zwischen Freiheit und Schöpfung, weil sie zugleich Stolz, Tugend, Gehorsam und Schlaf neu funktional verteilt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:MRT-B04","text":"Die Rekonstruktion hängt wesentlich an der Wiederkehr derselben Operationen in veränderter Valenz: Last kann Voraussetzung oder Disziplin sein, Tugend kann Übergang oder Stilllegung sein, Stolz kann Stütze oder Untergang sein.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:MRT-B05","text":"Die Kohärenz des Clusters ist produktiv unvollständig, weil er die Notwendigkeit des Neubeginns demonstriert, ohne die Gefahr auszuräumen, dass jeder Neubeginn erneut zur Wertordnung, Autorität oder Schlafmaschine sedimentiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T195807497058Z_e23e8aca","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Chapters 10–12","source_sha256":"0f4629567ab9a068d2992a6243f7db3594afb3e524cf2eebb36513c533deee93","sha256":"dae666b47a218f04691edb462bbc1c2f4186e3a3012d4f7cf769b805ead36ef9","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:58:07.498570+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_04:AS-B01","text":"The system examines how a spirit can generate or lose its capacity for action under conditions of uncertainty, tradition, and institutional pacification.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:AS-B02","text":"Its basic movement distinguishes three incompatible forms of self-stabilization: compensatory pride, obedient administration of virtue, and creative self-transformation.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:AS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:AS-B03","text":"The animal constellation shows that orientation does not arise from sovereign self-certainty, but from a precarious connection of prudence, endangerment, and substitute continuity.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:AS-B04","text":"The doctrine of transformation forms the positive counter-movement: burden, negation, and freedom do not suffice as long as they do not pass into a beginning that produces new values.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:AS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:AS-B05","text":"The wisdom of the chair appears as a counter-machine to transformation because it converts virtue, truth, and self-overcoming into procedures of fatigue, reconciliation, and social immobilization.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:AS-B06","text":"The conflict of the cluster is therefore not virtue against vice, but creative wakefulness against every order that reduces self-relation, politics, and knowledge to rest.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:AS-B07","text":"The movement is spiral-shaped: uncertainty compels a support, the support can become a form of downfall, and only the transformation of the will prevents its congealing into a technique of sleep.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:AS-B08","text":"The closure remains open because the transition to creative affirmation is posited as necessary, but is neither positively grounded nor secured against its renewed institutionalization.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_04:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Spiritual orientation is not a stable property of the subject, but a precarious, mediated, and losable function.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:GA-02","text":"[Mutating] Self-overcoming has no uniform value: it can produce the capacity to bear burdens, prepare sleep, or serve as a transition to value-creation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:GA-03","text":"[Emergent] Freedom becomes productive only when it transforms itself from the mere negation of inherited commandments into a creative beginning.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:GA-04","text":"[Persistent] Every existing order of values tends to conceal its own historicity and to present itself as the final, already complete form of value.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:GA-05","text":"[Mutating] Virtue becomes effective either as material for transformation or as a technique of immobilization; its status is decided by its temporal function.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:GA-06","text":"[Attractor] The sacred Yes denotes not a state of peace, but the capacity to bring forth a first beginning again after burden and negation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:GA-07","text":"[Terminal] Where truth, obedience, and self-overcoming are subordinated to sleep, wisdom ends not in knowledge but in the withdrawal of thought and lying down.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:GA-08","text":"[Attractor] Downfall and creation mark opposing consequences of the same crisis of self-continuity: substitute stabilization leads to decomposition, new beginning to value-formation.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_04:RMD-01","text":"The desert recurs as a threshold space: it is neither mere isolation nor flight, but the zone in which the order of burdens, self-certainty, and inherited domination lose their binding force.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:RMD-02","text":"Self-overcoming mutates from the voluntary acceptance of the heaviest burden into a counted daily discipline; in the first case it opens transformation, in the second it is neutralized through reconciliation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:RMD-03","text":"The will shifts from “I will” as a negative act of freedom to the childlike Yes as a world-forming primal movement; negation is thereby absorbed, but not revoked.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:RMD-04","text":"Pride remains as a desire for continuity, but mutates from a possible supporting instance into a danger as soon as it does not accompany prudence but replaces it.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:RMD-05","text":"Truth first appears as part of the economy of sleep and there loses its open character of knowledge; it can become creatively relevant again only outside this function of immobilization.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:RMD-06","text":"The animal motif is displaced from symbolic accompaniment to an epistemic external instance and thus forms a counterpole to the institutional authority of the chair.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_04:CGD-01","text":"The concrete form of eagle and serpent remains local, while their function as an external test of an uncertain self-orientation scales to the cluster level.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:CGD-02","text":"Camel, lion, and child remain local functional figures, but their sequence becomes globally the rule that burden and liberation remain incomplete without affirmative re-formation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:CGD-03","text":"The decimal order of the doctrine of virtue remains a local disciplinary technique, yet its reduction of all values to friction minimization becomes the overarching countermodel to creative existence.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:CGD-04","text":"Zarathustra's human endangerment remains situational, but at the cluster level becomes the diagnosis that social orders can transform orientation into adaptation or self-loss.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:CGD-05","text":"Good sleep remains a local telos of the wise man of the chair, but its function as the endpoint of institutionalized virtue becomes the general figure of anti-creative closure.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_04:GNX-01","text":"The system rejects the assumption that prudence, truth, or virtue exist as permanently available possessions of a stable subject.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:NX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:GNX-02","text":"It rejects the equation of obedience with spirituality, because the “Thou shalt” mobilizes the past as closed authority against new value-formation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:GNX-03","text":"It rejects the equation of freedom and creation, because the lion's No only opens the space that the child can occupy positively only thereafter.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:GNX-04","text":"It rejects every order of virtue whose success consists in conflict-free adaptation, political obedience, and dreamless reduction of consciousness.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:GNX-05","text":"It rejects a self-assertion that seeks to compensate for the loss of prudence through enduring pride, because this compensation already initiates a movement of downfall.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_04:DBN-01","text":"For the cluster to endure, no identity may be assumed to be autonomous, complete, and finally secured; every identity remains dependent on testing, loss, and transformation.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:DBN-02","text":"For value-creation to remain possible, the past may not count as the exhausted totality of all values.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:NX8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:DBN-03","text":"For wakefulness to remain productive, self-overcoming may not be concluded in reconciliation, fatigue, and immobilization.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:DBN-04","text":"For freedom not to remain empty, the negation of the old law may not be fixed as the final form of the will.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:DBN-05","text":"For political and existential transformation to remain possible, rest may not function as the final horizon of meaning of virtue, thought, and sociality.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_04:BSA-01","text":"Excluded is a world in which meaning could be attained through final pacification without this pacification simultaneously withdrawing thought, conflict, and future.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:BSA-02","text":"Unavailable remains a form of creation that would neither have to pass through burden, negation, and loss nor bear the danger of its own congealing.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:BSA-03","text":"Ontologically inadmissible is a subject that guarantees itself through possession of its capacities; orientation must be tested from outside, temporally renewed, and protected against its own hardening.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:BSA-04","text":"An order in which adaptation to existing power can count as ethical completion is not admitted.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_04:XD-01","text":"The transformation of the spirit requires an orientation that does not congeal into a substitute identity: what serves as pride against the loss of prudence must be surpassed through childlike new beginning.","refs":["CL_97E9_04:GA-01","CL_97E9_04:GA-06","CL_97E9_04:GA-08","CH_97E9_10CH:A8","CH_97E9_VDDV:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:XD-02","text":"The wisdom of the chair forms the degenerate double of the doctrine of transformation: it takes over self-overcoming, but blocks its passage through negation and new beginning.","refs":["CL_97E9_04:GA-02","CL_97E9_04:GA-03","CL_97E9_04:GA-05","CH_97E9_VDLH:A4","CH_97E9_VDDV:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:XD-03","text":"The struggle against inherited values and the genealogy of the doctrine of virtue belong together because both show that moral authority conceals its own function: once as dragon, once as sleep discipline.","refs":["CL_97E9_04:GA-04","CL_97E9_04:GA-05","CH_97E9_VDDV:A6","CH_97E9_VDLH:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:XD-04","text":"The nonhumans and the child occupy analogous counterpositions to the authority of the chair: both interrupt a self-sufficient moral order without presenting a new norm as a finished law.","refs":["CL_97E9_04:GA-01","CL_97E9_04:GA-06","CH_97E9_10CH:ME1","CH_97E9_VDDV:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:XD-05","text":"The deeper danger lies not in conflict or solitude, but in their administrative neutralization by an order that tests every thought for compatibility with sleep.","refs":["CL_97E9_04:GA-07","CH_97E9_VDLH:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_04:BSD-01","text":"The cluster reconstructs value-formation as a struggle over the temporal form of spirit: the past binds as commandment, the present administers as sleep discipline, the future arises only as a forgetting new beginning.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:BSD-02","text":"The subject is understood neither as a sovereign origin nor as a mere object of the norm, but as an unstable intersection of external testing, burden, resistance, affect regulation, and creation.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:BSD-03","text":"Moral systems are classified according to whether they lead forces into open transformation or return them to reproducible passivity and institutional rest.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:BSD-04","text":"The political consequence is that obedience must be judged not by its normative surface, but by its function in the suppression of conflict, future, and value-creation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:BSD-05","text":"Downfall is determined as an immanent failed form of self-stabilization: it begins when a necessary support establishes itself as a substitute for the transformation of the entire will.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_04:RLE-01","text":"The central loop is: uncertainty produces support, support produces continuity, continuity threatens to become congealing, and congealing compels a new transformation.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:RLE-02","text":"The sequence of transformation forms an escalation path in which burden must pass into negation, negation into freedom, and freedom into affirmative creation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:RLE-03","text":"The sleep machine forms an inverse loop: waking is disciplined, discipline produces fatigue, fatigue produces sleep, and sleep withdraws from thought the conditions of its continuation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:RLE-04","text":"The attractor of the cluster is the new beginning because it proceeds neither from secured prudence nor from mere freedom, but reorganizes both orders after their loss.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:RLE-05","text":"The productive recurrence of conflict marks not an error, but the condition under which virtue does not become a technique of falling asleep and freedom does not become a mere pose.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_04:FGS-B01","text":"Precarious orientation + possible flight of prudence → search for continuity → danger of compensatory self-assertion.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:FGS-B02","text":"Inherited order of burdens + voluntary assumption of burden → desert → exposure of the “Thou shalt” as historically totalized domination.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:FGS-B03","text":"Negation of the commandment + “I will” → freedom without positive world-formation → insufficiency of the struggling will.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:FGS-B04","text":"Forgetting + play + sacred Yes → primal movement → own world and new value-formation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:FGS-B05","text":"Virtue as a soporific + institutional authority → friction minimization → withdrawal of conflict, thought, and future.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:FGS-B06","text":"The cluster generates its positive architecture through the distinction between transformation, which reorders forces, and discipline, which brings forces to a standstill.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_04:AFM-B01","text":"Questionable self-continuity → external orientation → possibility of the loss of prudence → compensatory pride → risk of downfall.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:AFM-B02","text":"Assumption of burden → desert → desacralization of the “Thou shalt” → freedom → insufficiency of negation → childlike new beginning → value-creation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:AFM-B03","text":"Institutional virtue → daily discipline → social pacification → sleep → withdrawal of thought → genealogical devaluation of the wisdom of the chair.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:AFM-B04","text":"Precarious orientation → transformation or pacification → open value-formation or passive closure.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_04:MME-01","text":"The map of spirit is shifted from a logic of possession to a logic of transformation: capacities count not as property, but as losable and newly generable relations.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:MME-02","text":"The opposition between human and animal is replaced by another opposition: institutionalized self-pacification against nonhumanly mediated orientation.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:MME-03","text":"Freedom is remapped as an intermediate zone between obedience and creation and thereby loses every claim to already be its own final end.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:MME-04","text":"Virtue is split into two incompatible modes of operation: as material of transition or as an apparatus of friction minimization.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:MME-05","text":"Downfall is reclassified from an external event of fate into an internal effect of failed self-stabilization.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_04:ALT-B01","text":"Surface level — Animals, figures of transformation, and wise men of the chair form concrete scenes in which orientation, value-creation, and sleep appear as competing forms of life.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:ALT-B02","text":"Structural level — The system distributes spiritual forces among external testing, assumption of burden, negation, new beginning, and institutional immobilization.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:ALT-B03","text":"Metastrategic level — The appropriate intervention consists neither in obedience nor in mere resistance, but in generating a will that can affirm again after the No.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:ALT-B04","text":"Ontological / Temporal level — Reality appears as an open sequence of transitions in which the past sediments commandments, the present administers forces, and the future becomes possible only as a non-derivable beginning.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:ALT-B05","text":"Methodological / Performative level — The sequence of figures itself performs its theory by presenting no fixed doctrine of virtue, but exposing the reusability of every stance in shifting functions.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_04:FL-01","text":"The architecture requires self-overcoming as a precondition of transformation, but must simultaneously prevent it from being absorbed into the reconciliation economy of sleep.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:FL-02","text":"Pride is supposed to outlast prudence and folly, yet precisely this temporal extension lets it mutate from a support into a form of downfall.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:FL-03","text":"The freedom of the lion is necessary, but its combative form stands under pressure to be disempowered or sublated through the child's forgetting.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:FL-04","text":"New value-creation is asserted as necessary without its criteria of validity being positively specified.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:MRT7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:MP-01","text":"Prudence mutates from a desired spiritual capacity into a fleeting element whose absence makes the necessity of other forms of orientation visible.","refs":["CH_97E9_10CH:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:MP-02","text":"Virtue mutates from a seemingly autonomous moral quality into an operative technique whose value is determined by its relation to wakefulness or sleep.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:MP-03","text":"The No mutates from an operation of liberation into an insufficient intermediate form as soon as the question of positive world-formation arises.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:NX7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_04:HSI-01","text":"Reality appears as a field of competing transformation machines: animals test orientation, dragons preserve values, chairs pacify forces, and the child opens new world-formation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:HSI-02","text":"The subject is not a unity, but a passage reconfigured through burden, loss, testing, resistance, and play.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:HSI-03","text":"Time is not linear continuation, but a struggle between sedimented past, immobilized present, and a future that can occur only as a first, non-derivable step.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:HSI-04","text":"Possible remains a struggle that relies neither on enduring pride nor on enduring opposition, but transfers its forces into repeated transformation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_04:MRT-B01","text":"The extracted axioms suffice to reconstruct the central alternative of the cluster: self-stabilization can pass into transformation and value-creation or into pacification and loss of thought.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:MRT-B02","text":"The positive validity of the new values remains underdetermined because the new beginning is formally determined without supplying its material criteria or social procedures of testing.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:MRT-B03","text":"The strongest architectural connection lies in the distinction between freedom and creation because it simultaneously redistributes pride, virtue, obedience, and sleep in new functional terms.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDDV:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:MRT-B04","text":"The reconstruction depends essentially on the recurrence of the same operations in altered valence: burden can be precondition or discipline, virtue can be transition or immobilization, pride can be support or downfall.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_04:MRT-B05","text":"The coherence of the cluster is productively incomplete because it demonstrates the necessity of new beginning without removing the danger that every new beginning will again sediment into an order of values, authority, or sleep machine.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDLH:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CL_97E9_04@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CL_97E9_04:v1","source_language_code":"de","original_title":"Chapters 10–12"}],"identity":{"layer":"CL","kicker":"Cluster · Also sprach Zarathustra","title":"Chapters 10–12","context":"Zarathustra’s Vorrede · 10 · Von den drei Verwandlungen · Von den Lehrstühlen der Tugend","original_title":"Chapters 10–12"},"original_title":"Chapters 10–12","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CL_97E9_05","layer":"CL","title":"Chapters 13–15","order":5,"parents":["CH_97E9_VDH0","CH_97E9_VDVC","CH_97E9_VDFU"],"revision":"CL_97E9_05@R001","sha256":"3ca2b2e00113ea5f4d09c2e2bc7247b7f17779cede7febf6c8e2487f83a040f4","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_05:AS-01","text":"Das System bekämpft nicht bloß religiöse Transzendenz, sondern jede Ordnung, die Ursprung, Wert, Wahrheit oder Selbstüberschreitung außerhalb der leiblichen Erzeugungsbedingungen verortet.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:AS3","CH_97E9_VDVC:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:AS-02","text":"Seine Neubestimmung verlegt das Sein vom jenseitigen Objekt in die organisierende, wertende und schöpferische Tätigkeit des Leibes.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A8","CH_97E9_VDVC:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:AS-03","text":"Das Ich, der Geist, die Seele und die Tugend bleiben wirksam, verlieren jedoch den Status unabhängiger Ursprünge und werden zu Funktionen, Namen oder Transformationen leiblicher Selbsttätigkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A3","CH_97E9_VDFU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:AS-04","text":"Die Argumentation bewegt sich genealogisch: Hinterwelt, Leibverachtung und normierende Tugend erscheinen als Ergebnisse bestimmter leiblicher Zustände, nicht als übergeordnete Wahrheiten.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:AS2","CH_97E9_VDVC:AS6","CH_97E9_VDFU:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:AS-05","text":"Die positive Gegenbewegung besteht nicht in der Wiederherstellung eines stabilen Subjekts, sondern in einer Steigerung des Selbst, die Wert schafft, Leidenschaften umbildet und den Menschen als Übergangsform behandelt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A9","CH_97E9_VDFU:AS5","CH_97E9_VDFU:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:AS-06","text":"Die Bewegung ist rekursiv und spiralförmig, weil jede Flucht aus Leib, Erde oder Leidenschaft auf jene leibliche Produktionsbasis zurückgeführt wird, die sie zu verlassen beansprucht.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A13","CH_97E9_VDVC:D5","CH_97E9_VDFU:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:AS-07","text":"Der entscheidende Gegensatz lautet nicht Körper gegen Geist, sondern schöpferische Selbststeigerung gegen blockierte, erschöpfte oder verallgemeinernde Selbstverneinung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A10","CH_97E9_VDVC:A11","CH_97E9_VDFU:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:AS-08","text":"Die clusterweite Schließung bleibt offen: Gesundheit, Einzeltugend und Erdsinn fungieren als Orientierungen, aber keine von ihnen hebt Kampf, Mehrdeutigkeit oder die Notwendigkeit der Selbstüberwindung auf.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A16","CH_97E9_VDFU:A12","CH_97E9_VDFU:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_05:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Jede behauptete Transzendenz bleibt auf leibliche, menschliche und affektive Erzeugungsbedingungen zurückführbar.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Der Leib ist nicht Gegenstand eines übergeordneten Subjekts, sondern die organisierende Wirklichkeit, aus der Sinn, Geist, Ich und Wert hervorgehen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A1","CH_97E9_VDVC:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:GA-03","text":"[Mutating] Das Ich bleibt notwendig, mutiert jedoch vom souveränen Ursprung zum redenden, wertenden und zugleich beherrschten Werkzeug einer tieferen leiblichen Selbstorganisation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A8","CH_97E9_VDVC:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:GA-04","text":"[Attractor] Das Selbst ist die immanente Instanz, die Wahrnehmung, Denken, Wertung, Lust, Schmerz und Wille in eine schöpferische Ordnung überführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A6","CH_97E9_VDVC:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:GA-05","text":"[Mutating] Wahrheit wird nicht durch körperlose Allgemeingültigkeit bestimmt, sondern durch die Redlichkeit und Produktivität der leiblichen Selbstbeziehung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A10","CH_97E9_VDFU:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:GA-06","text":"[Emergent] Wert entsteht weder durch göttliches Gesetz noch durch soziale Satzung, sondern durch die gerichtete Umformung leiblicher Leidenschaften unter einem höchsten Ziel.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFU:A5","CH_97E9_VDFU:A6","CH_97E9_VDFU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:GA-07","text":"[Persistent] Leibverachtung ist keine Überschreitung des Leibes, sondern eine negative Selbstbeziehung eines Selbst, dessen schöpferische Steigerung blockiert wurde.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:AS6","CH_97E9_VDVC:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:GA-08","text":"[Emergent] Die Einzahl einer eigenen Tugend ist eine strategische Verdichtung von Kraft, weil konkurrierende Tugenden die innere Vielheit in Eifersucht, Krieg und Selbstzerstörung verwandeln.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFU:A12","CH_97E9_VDFU:A13","CH_97E9_VDFU:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:GA-09","text":"[Terminal] Selbstüberwindung bedeutet weder Erlösung in einem Jenseits noch harmonische Integration, sondern die Hervorbringung einer höheren leiblichen Form durch produktive Umwertung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A11","CH_97E9_VDVC:ME6","CH_97E9_VDFU:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:GA-10","text":"[Attractor] Das System organisiert sich um die Frage, ob leibliche Vielheit eine schöpferische Rangordnung bilden oder in erschöpfte Negation und inneren Krieg zerfallen wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A2","CH_97E9_VDVC:A11","CH_97E9_VDFU:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_05:RMD-01","text":"Der Leib kehrt zunächst als Gegenstand der Verzweiflung wieder, wird dann als große Vernunft und schließlich als Bedingung jeder singulären Tugend absorbiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A2","CH_97E9_VDFU:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:RMD-02","text":"Das Ich mutiert von der redlichsten Form verkörperter Selbstrede zu einer sekundären Funktion, deren Anspruch auf Souveränität vom Selbst überboten wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A8","CH_97E9_VDVC:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:RMD-03","text":"Krankheit verschiebt ihre Funktion von der Genealogie der Hinterwelt zur Diagnose blockierter Selbstüberschreitung und wird dadurch vom Ursprung falscher Weltbilder zum Indikator einer gestörten Zukunftsfähigkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A12","CH_97E9_VDVC:AS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:RMD-04","text":"Leidenschaft erfährt eine Valenzumkehr: Sie ist nicht mehr Material des Bösen, sondern wird durch Zielsetzung zur Tugend; destruktiv bleibt ihre Konkurrenz um die totale Besetzung des Menschen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFU:A9","CH_97E9_VDFU:A11","CH_97E9_VDFU:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:RMD-05","text":"Überwindung kehrt in drei inkompatiblen Formen wieder: als Fluchtphantasie, als schöpferische Selbststeigerung und als gefährdeter Untergang des Menschen; nur die mittlere Form bleibt systemisch produktiv.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A15","CH_97E9_VDVC:A10","CH_97E9_VDFU:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_05:CGD-01","text":"Die konkrete Polemik gegen Gott, Seele oder Herdenmoral bleibt lokal; auf Clusterebene trägt allein die allgemeine Rückführung jeder externen Legitimation auf immanente leibliche Produktion.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:NX2","CH_97E9_VDFU:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:CGD-02","text":"Die Beschreibung von Schmerz und Lust als Denkregulation bleibt eine lokale Mechanik, wird aber clusterweit zur These erweitert, dass Erkenntnis und Wertung aus derselben Selbstorganisation hervorgehen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A8","CH_97E9_VDVC:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:CGD-03","text":"Die Unterscheidung zwischen gesundem und krankem Leib skaliert nur dann nach oben, wenn sie nicht als biologische Typologie, sondern als Unterscheidung produktiver und blockierter Selbststeigerung gelesen wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A16","CH_97E9_VDVC:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:CGD-04","text":"Die einzelne Tugend ist keine allgemeine Ethikregel, sondern eine clusterweite Strategie gegen die Zersplitterung schöpferischer Kraft in konkurrierende Wertzentren.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFU:A12","CH_97E9_VDFU:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_05:GNX-01","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird ein Jenseits, das unabhängig von den leiblichen Bedingungen seiner Erfindung als Ursprung von Sinn fungieren könnte.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A6","CH_97E9_VDH0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:GNX-02","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird ein geistiges oder moralisches Subjekt, das dem Leib äußerlich gegenübersteht und dessen Werte aus einer unabhängigen Sphäre empfangen könnte.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A3","CH_97E9_VDFU:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:GNX-03","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Gleichsetzung von Negation mit Selbstüberwindung, weil Leibflucht als Symptom verlorener Schöpferkraft und nicht als höherer Weg erscheint.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A11","CH_97E9_VDVC:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:GNX-04","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine universelle Tugendordnung, weil öffentliche Benennung Singularität in Herde und gemeinsame Norm verwandelt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFU:A1","CH_97E9_VDFU:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_05:DBN-01","text":"Das System kann keinen Standpunkt zulassen, der außerhalb der leiblichen Selbstorganisation liegt, weil ein solcher Standpunkt die genealogische Rückführung von Transzendenz, Geist und Moral unmöglich machen würde.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A7","CH_97E9_VDVC:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:DBN-02","text":"Das System kann keine fertige menschliche Natur zulassen, weil seine positiven Begriffe nur als Prozesse der Umwertung, Rangbildung und Selbstüberschreitung funktionieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A10","CH_97E9_VDFU:A9","CH_97E9_VDFU:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:DBN-03","text":"Das System kann keine stabile Versöhnung pluraler Werte zulassen, weil Wertschöpfung selbst als konfliktfähige Kraft und nicht als Integration vorausgesetzt wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFU:A13","CH_97E9_VDFU:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_05:BSA-01","text":"Die tiefste ausgeschlossene Möglichkeit ist eine Wahrheit ohne Erzeugungsgeschichte: Was als wahr, gut oder höher gilt, darf nicht von Leid, Leib, Wertung und Schöpfung ablösbar sein.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:AS2","CH_97E9_VDVC:A9","CH_97E9_VDFU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:BSA-02","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine endgültige Identität des Menschen, weil sowohl Ich als auch Tugend und Leib nur als bewegliche Konfigurationen einer noch nicht abgeschlossenen Selbststeigerung erscheinen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A4","CH_97E9_VDFU:AS7","CH_97E9_VDFU:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:BSA-03","text":"Ontologisch unstatthaft ist eine Flucht aus der Immanenz, denn sogar ihre Bilder, Gifte, Maßstäbe und Wünsche werden als Erzeugnisse der Erde und des Leibes lesbar.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A13","CH_97E9_VDFU:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_05:XD-01","text":"Die Zurückweisung der Hinterwelt und die Entthronung des Ichs bilden gemeinsam keine bloße Materialisierung, sondern eine Verlagerung von Autorität auf ein nicht selbsttransparentes, schöpferisches Selbst im Leib.  ; Trace Type — Composite","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A8","CH_97E9_VDVC:A4","CH_97E9_VDVC:A6","CL_97E9_05:GA-02","CL_97E9_05:GA-03","CL_97E9_05:GA-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:XD-02","text":"Die Umwertung der Leidenschaft ergänzt die Kritik der Leibverachtung: Nicht Affektivität ist das Problem, sondern ihre Hemmung, Entwertung oder Zerstreuung in unvereinbare höchste Ansprüche.  ; Trace Type — Composite","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:AS6","CH_97E9_VDFU:A9","CH_97E9_VDFU:A13","CL_97E9_05:GA-06","CL_97E9_05:GA-07","CL_97E9_05:GA-10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:XD-03","text":"Die Erde erhält ihren Sinn nicht durch eine vorgefundene Ordnung, sondern durch die riskante Konzentration leiblicher Kräfte in wertschaffende und selbstüberschreitende Formen.  ; Trace Type — Composite","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A11","CH_97E9_VDVC:A9","CH_97E9_VDFU:A12","CL_97E9_05:GA-04","CL_97E9_05:GA-08","CL_97E9_05:GA-09"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:XD-04","text":"Die Kritik an religiöser Gewissheit und die Kritik an öffentlicher Tugendbenennung konvergieren in einer Kritik fremdgarantierter Geltung: Beide verwandeln gelebte Kräfte in normierende Herrschaftsformen.  ; Trace Type — Negative","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A14","CH_97E9_VDFU:A2","CL_97E9_05:GA-01","CL_97E9_05:GA-05","CL_97E9_05:GA-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:XD-05","text":"Die privilegierte Stellung des gesunden Leibes bleibt strukturell instabil, weil der Leib zugleich als Grund aller Wahrheit und als Ort von Krankheit, Eifersucht, Selbstzerfall und Todeswunsch fungiert.  ; Trace Type — Tension","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A16","CH_97E9_VDH0:A12","CH_97E9_VDFU:A15","CL_97E9_05:GA-05","CL_97E9_05:GA-10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_05:BSD-01","text":"Ontologie wird in eine Genealogie produktiver und pathologischer Kräfte transformiert: Sein ist nicht mehr der Gegenstand einer jenseitigen Erklärung, sondern das Resultat verkörperter Selbstorganisation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:AS3","CH_97E9_VDVC:A2","CL_97E9_05:GA-01","CL_97E9_05:GA-02","CL_97E9_05:GA-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:BSD-02","text":"Das Subjekt wird als geschichtete Herrschaftsordnung rekonstruiert, in der das Ich weder Ursprung noch Endzweck ist, sondern eine vorläufige Oberfläche tieferer Wert- und Schöpfungsprozesse.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A4","CH_97E9_VDVC:A7","CH_97E9_VDFU:A16","CL_97E9_05:GA-03","CL_97E9_05:GA-04","CL_97E9_05:GA-09"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:BSD-03","text":"Geschichte erscheint nicht als Fortschritt zu einer höheren transzendenten Wahrheit, sondern als Kampf zwischen Formen der Selbststeigerung und Formen des erschöpften Rückzugs.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:AS5","CH_97E9_VDVC:A11","CH_97E9_VDFU:A16","CL_97E9_05:GA-07","CL_97E9_05:GA-09"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:BSD-04","text":"Ethik wird zu einer Kunst der Kraftverteilung: Sie beurteilt nicht die Reinheit einzelner Affekte, sondern ihre Fähigkeit, eine singuläre, schöpferische und über sich hinausgehende Ordnung zu bilden.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFU:A9","CH_97E9_VDFU:A12","CH_97E9_VDFU:A14","CL_97E9_05:GA-06","CL_97E9_05:GA-08","CL_97E9_05:GA-09"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_05:RLE-01","text":"Leibverneinung erzeugt eine Hinterwelt oder einen Todeswillen, doch diese Negation wird auf den Leib zurückgeführt und dadurch als dessen krankhafte Selbstbeziehung lesbar.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A15","CH_97E9_VDVC:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:RLE-02","text":"Leidenschaft wird durch ein höchstes Ziel zur Tugend, aber die vervielfältigte Tugend erzeugt erneut Konflikt; Umwertung produziert daher nicht Harmonie, sondern eine höhere Form der Gefährdung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFU:A9","CH_97E9_VDFU:A13","CH_97E9_VDFU:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:RLE-03","text":"Der Attraktor des Clusters ist schöpferische Selbststeigerung: Sie entscheidet darüber, ob Leib, Geist, Tugend und Leiden als Material einer höheren Form oder als Symptome des Niedergangs fungieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A10","CH_97E9_VDVC:A11","CH_97E9_VDFU:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:RLE-04","text":"Redlichkeit bildet eine Eskalationsschleife, weil sie zuerst Transzendenz genealogisch zerstört, dann den Leib privilegiert und schließlich die Kriterien dieser Privilegierung selbst problematisch macht.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A10","CH_97E9_VDH0:A16","CH_97E9_VDVC:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_05:FGS-B01","text":"Leibliche Erschöpfung oder Verzweiflung → Projektion von Hinterwelt, Seele oder äußerem Gesetz → Verlust der immanenten Erzeugungsgeschichte.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:AS2","CH_97E9_VDFU:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:FGS-B02","text":"Genealogische Rückführung → Entzauberung externer Ursprünge → Reorganisation von Geist, Ich und Wert als Funktionen leiblicher Selbsttätigkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A3","CH_97E9_VDVC:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:FGS-B03","text":"Leibliche Selbsttätigkeit → Setzung eines höchsten Ziels → Umwertung von Leidenschaft in Tugend → Konzentration schöpferischer Kraft.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A10","CH_97E9_VDFU:AS5","CH_97E9_VDFU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:FGS-B04","text":"Vervielfältigung totaler Wertansprüche → Eifersucht und innerer Krieg → Gefahr von Selbstzerstörung oder blockierter Selbstüberschreitung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFU:A13","CH_97E9_VDFU:A14","CH_97E9_VDFU:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:FGS-B05","text":"Strategische Verdichtung der Kräfte → Erdsinn, gesunder Leib und eigene Tugend → fortgesetzte Selbstüberwindung ohne transzendente Endgarantie.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A11","CH_97E9_VDH0:A16","CH_97E9_VDFU:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_05:AFM-B01","text":"Leid und Erschöpfung → Projektion einer Hinterwelt oder eines äußeren Gesetzes → Verlust der leiblichen Herkunft von Wert und Wahrheit.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:AS2","CH_97E9_VDH0:A6","CH_97E9_VDFU:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:AFM-B02","text":"Genealogische Rückführung → Leib als große Vernunft → Selbst als verdeckte Steuerungs- und Schöpfungsinstanz.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A1","CH_97E9_VDVC:A2","CH_97E9_VDVC:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:AFM-B03","text":"Entthronung des Ichs → Neufassung von Denken, Wertung und Geist als leibliche Instrumente → Auflösung äußerer Maßstäbe.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A3","CH_97E9_VDVC:A4","CH_97E9_VDVC:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:AFM-B04","text":"Leidenschaft → höchstes Ziel → Tugend → Konzentration einer singulären Lebensform.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFU:AS5","CH_97E9_VDFU:A9","CH_97E9_VDFU:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:AFM-B05","text":"Mehrere totalisierende Tugenden → Eifersucht → innerer Krieg → Gefährdung der Selbststeigerung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFU:A13","CH_97E9_VDFU:A14","CH_97E9_VDFU:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:AFM-B06","text":"Produktive Selbstüberwindung → Erdsinn und höherer Leib → offene, nicht versöhnte Zukunft des Menschen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A11","CH_97E9_VDH0:D9","CH_97E9_VDFU:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_05:MME-01","text":"Der Gegensatz von Immanenz und Transzendenz wird neu kartiert: Transzendenz erscheint nicht als Außen, sondern als leiblich erzeugte Fluchtfigur innerhalb der Immanenz.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:MME-02","text":"Der Gegensatz von Körper und Geist zerfällt zugunsten einer Hierarchie, in der Geist und Ich als kleine, abgeleitete Vernünfte operieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A2","CH_97E9_VDVC:A3","CH_97E9_VDVC:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:MME-03","text":"Der Gegensatz von Leidenschaft und Tugend wird durch eine Umwertungslogik ersetzt, die Moral als Transformation und nicht als ursprüngliche Reinheit lesbar macht.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFU:AS4","CH_97E9_VDFU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:MME-04","text":"Das Böse wird von einem Stoffmerkmal einzelner Affekte zu einem Effekt konkurrierender Anspruchszentren verschoben.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFU:A11","CH_97E9_VDFU:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:MME-05","text":"Der Mensch wird von einer zu rettenden oder zu vollendenden Substanz zu einer riskanten Übergangsformation umklassifiziert, deren höchste Möglichkeit ihre eigene Überwindung einschließt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A10","CH_97E9_VDFU:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_05:ALT-B01","text":"Surface level — Explizit verhandelt werden Gott, Hinterwelt, Leib, Seele, Geist, Ich, Leidenschaft, Tugend, Krankheit und Überwindung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:AS1","CH_97E9_VDVC:AS2","CH_97E9_VDFU:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:ALT-B02","text":"Structural level — Die wiederkehrende Struktur besteht in der Rückführung scheinbar autonomer Instanzen auf eine leibliche Organisation, die zugleich produziert, bewertet, erleidet und sich spaltet.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:AS4","CH_97E9_VDVC:A9","CH_97E9_VDFU:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:ALT-B03","text":"Metastrategic level — Intervention besteht nicht in Belehrung oder Normsetzung, sondern in genealogischer Entmächtigung äußerer Garantien und strategischer Konzentration schöpferischer Kraft.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:AS1","CH_97E9_VDFU:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:ALT-B04","text":"Ontological / Temporal level — Realität ist leiblich organisierte Vielheit; Zeit ist der Übergang von Projektion und Blockade zu Umwertung, Selbststeigerung und möglicher Selbstüberwindung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A2","CH_97E9_VDFU:A9","CH_97E9_VDFU:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:ALT-B05","text":"Methodological / Performative level — Die Form vollzieht ihre These, indem sie Begriffe nicht stabil definiert, sondern sie durch Rückführung, Hierarchisierung, Umwertung und konflikthafte Wiederkehr funktional verschiebt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:AS3","CH_97E9_VDVC:A3","CH_97E9_VDFU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_05:FL-01","text":"Die Kritik externer Wahrheit kollidiert mit der Privilegierung des gesunden Leibes, weil dessen Redlichkeit als Maßstab fungiert, ohne selbst vollständig genealogisch relativiert zu werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A16","CH_97E9_VDH0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:FL-02","text":"Die Entthronung des Ichs erzeugt eine neue Herrschaftsinstanz im Selbst, deren Verhältnis zum Leib zwischen Identität, Funktion und innerer Regierung oszilliert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A4","CH_97E9_VDVC:A6","CH_97E9_VDVC:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:FL-03","text":"Die Singularität der Tugend steht unter Druck, weil ihre Umwertung aus mehreren Leidenschaften hervorgeht, während ihre strategische Einzahl zugleich innere Konkurrenz ausschließen soll.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFU:A9","CH_97E9_VDFU:A12","CH_97E9_VDFU:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:FL-04","text":"Selbstüberwindung bleibt doppeldeutig, weil sie sowohl schöpferische Steigerung als auch Untergang des Menschen bezeichnet und keine sichere Grenze zwischen beiden Formen bereitstellt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A10","CH_97E9_VDVC:A11","CH_97E9_VDFU:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:MP-01","text":"Der Begriff des Leibes mutiert vom leidenden Ursprung metaphysischer Flucht zur großen Vernunft und anschließend zur Voraussetzung eines höheren, noch nicht bestimmten Leibes.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A2","CH_97E9_VDH0:D9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:MP-02","text":"Der Begriff des Geistes mutiert vom Träger transzendenter Anmaßung zum Werkzeug des Selbst und verliert damit seine ontologische Eigenständigkeit, ohne seine operative Wirksamkeit zu verlieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A14","CH_97E9_VDVC:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:MP-03","text":"Der Begriff des Bösen mutiert von der zugeschriebenen Eigenschaft der Leidenschaft zum Ergebnis der Rivalität zwischen Tugenden.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFU:AS4","CH_97E9_VDFU:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:MP-04","text":"Der Begriff der Überwindung mutiert von einer abgelehnten Flucht aus dem Leib zu einer immanenten Steigerung, die den Menschen selbst als Übergangsmaterial behandelt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A15","CH_97E9_VDVC:ME6","CH_97E9_VDFU:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_05:HSI-01","text":"Realität erscheint als eine Maschine leiblicher Vielheiten, die ihre eigenen Bilder, Werte, Herrschaftsformen und Fluchtwege produziert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A2","CH_97E9_VDVC:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:HSI-02","text":"Das Subjekt erscheint als Oberfläche eines tieferen Selbst, das seine Instrumente hervorbringt, beherrscht und gegen sich selbst wenden kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A4","CH_97E9_VDVC:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:HSI-03","text":"Zeit erscheint als irreversible Prüfung, in der Kräfte entweder zu höherer Schöpfung verdichtet oder in Hinterwelt, Todeswunsch, Herde und Tugendkrieg zerstreut werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A11","CH_97E9_VDFU:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:HSI-04","text":"Möglich bleibt kein endgültiges Entkommen, sondern Navigation durch immanente Konflikte mittels Umwertung, Rangbildung, Redlichkeit und riskanter Selbstüberwindung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A10","CH_97E9_VDFU:A9","CH_97E9_VDFU:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_05:MRT-B01","text":"Die extrahierten Axiome reichen aus, um die clusterweite Bewegung von der genealogischen Entzauberung äußerer Instanzen zur immanenten Organisation schöpferischer Selbststeigerung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A2","CH_97E9_VDVC:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:MRT-B02","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie zwischen gesundem Leib, bloßer Kraftsteigerung und destruktiver Selbstvernichtung unterschieden werden kann, ohne einen erneut externen Maßstab einzuführen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A16","CH_97E9_VDVC:A11","CH_97E9_VDFU:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:MRT-B03","text":"Die Architektur ist am stärksten, wo sie Transzendenz, Geist und Moral nicht einfach verwirft, sondern als abgeleitete und mutierbare Leistungen der leiblichen Selbstorganisation rekonstruiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A13","CH_97E9_VDVC:A3","CH_97E9_VDFU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:MRT-B04","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bleibt nur dann der tatsächlichen Bewegung treu, wenn sie die produktive Unauflösbarkeit von Gesundheit und Krankheit, Einzeltugend und Tugendkampf sowie Schöpfung und Untergang bewahrt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A12","CH_97E9_VDFU:A12","CH_97E9_VDFU:A13","CH_97E9_VDFU:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T195842503359Z_d3d8dea9","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Chapters 13–15","source_sha256":"3ca2b2e00113ea5f4d09c2e2bc7247b7f17779cede7febf6c8e2487f83a040f4","sha256":"915436be7313c0d30b25eaeec9deaae0b1924f9685ebf0625dbb848539e86ed7","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:58:42.504238+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumentative Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_05:AS-01","text":"The system combats not merely religious transcendence, but every order that locates origin, value, truth, or self-transcendence outside the corporeal conditions of production.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:AS3","CH_97E9_VDVC:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:AS-02","text":"Its redefinition relocates being from the otherworldly object into the organizing, valuing, and creative activity of the body.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A8","CH_97E9_VDVC:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:AS-03","text":"The I, spirit, soul, and virtue remain effective, yet lose the status of independent origins and become functions, names, or transformations of corporeal self-activity.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A3","CH_97E9_VDFU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:AS-04","text":"The argument proceeds genealogically: the otherworld, contempt for the body, and norming virtue appear as results of determinate corporeal states, not as superior truths.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:AS2","CH_97E9_VDVC:AS6","CH_97E9_VDFU:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:AS-05","text":"The positive counter-movement does not consist in the restoration of a stable subject, but in an intensification of the self that creates value, transforms passions, and treats the human being as a transitional form.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A9","CH_97E9_VDFU:AS5","CH_97E9_VDFU:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:AS-06","text":"The movement is recursive and spiral-shaped, because every flight from body, earth, or passion is led back to that corporeal basis of production which it claims to leave.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A13","CH_97E9_VDVC:D5","CH_97E9_VDFU:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:AS-07","text":"The decisive opposition is not body against spirit, but creative self-intensification against blocked, exhausted, or generalizing self-negation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A10","CH_97E9_VDVC:A11","CH_97E9_VDFU:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:AS-08","text":"The cluster-wide closure remains open: health, singular virtue, and the sense of the earth function as orientations, but none of them abolishes struggle, ambiguity, or the necessity of self-overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A16","CH_97E9_VDFU:A12","CH_97E9_VDFU:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}]},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_05:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Every asserted transcendence remains traceable back to corporeal, human, and affective conditions of production.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] The body is not the object of a higher subject, but the organizing reality from which sense, spirit, I, and value emerge.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A1","CH_97E9_VDVC:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:GA-03","text":"[Mutating] The I remains necessary, but mutates from a sovereign origin into the speaking, valuing, and at once governed instrument of a deeper corporeal self-organization.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A8","CH_97E9_VDVC:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:GA-04","text":"[Attractor] The self is the immanent instance that transforms perception, thought, valuation, pleasure, pain, and will into a creative order.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A6","CH_97E9_VDVC:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:GA-05","text":"[Mutating] Truth is determined not by disembodied universality, but by the probity and productivity of corporeal self-relation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A10","CH_97E9_VDFU:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:GA-06","text":"[Emergent] Value arises neither through divine law nor through social enactment, but through the directed transformation of corporeal passions under a highest goal.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFU:A5","CH_97E9_VDFU:A6","CH_97E9_VDFU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:GA-07","text":"[Persistent] Contempt for the body is not a transcendence of the body, but a negative self-relation of a self whose creative intensification has been blocked.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:AS6","CH_97E9_VDVC:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:GA-08","text":"[Emergent] The singularity of one's own virtue is a strategic condensation of force, because competing virtues transform inner multiplicity into jealousy, war, and self-destruction.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFU:A12","CH_97E9_VDFU:A13","CH_97E9_VDFU:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:GA-09","text":"[Terminal] Self-overcoming means neither redemption in an otherworld nor harmonious integration, but the production of a higher corporeal form through productive revaluation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A11","CH_97E9_VDVC:ME6","CH_97E9_VDFU:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:GA-10","text":"[Attractor] The system organizes itself around the question of whether corporeal multiplicity will form a creative hierarchy or disintegrate into exhausted negation and inner war.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A2","CH_97E9_VDVC:A11","CH_97E9_VDFU:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_05:RMD-01","text":"The body first recurs as an object of despair, then is absorbed as great reason, and finally as the condition of every singular virtue.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A2","CH_97E9_VDFU:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:RMD-02","text":"The I mutates from the most probitable form of embodied self-speech into a secondary function whose claim to sovereignty is surpassed by the self.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A8","CH_97E9_VDVC:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:RMD-03","text":"Illness shifts its function from the genealogy of the otherworld to the diagnosis of blocked self-transcendence, thereby becoming from the origin of false worldviews an indicator of impaired capacity for the future.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A12","CH_97E9_VDVC:AS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:RMD-04","text":"Passion undergoes a reversal of valence: it is no longer the material of evil, but becomes virtue through the positing of a goal; destructive remains its competition for the total occupation of the human being.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFU:A9","CH_97E9_VDFU:A11","CH_97E9_VDFU:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:RMD-05","text":"Overcoming recurs in three incompatible forms: as a fantasy of flight, as creative self-intensification, and as the endangered downfall of the human being; only the middle form remains systemically productive.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A15","CH_97E9_VDVC:A10","CH_97E9_VDFU:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_05:CGD-01","text":"The concrete polemic against God, soul, or herd morality remains local; at the cluster level, only the general reduction of every external legitimation to immanent corporeal production is operative.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:NX2","CH_97E9_VDFU:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:CGD-02","text":"The description of pain and pleasure as regulation of thought remains a local mechanism, but is expanded cluster-wide into the thesis that cognition and valuation emerge from the same self-organization.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A8","CH_97E9_VDVC:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:CGD-03","text":"The distinction between healthy and sick body scales upward only if it is read not as a biological typology, but as a distinction between productive and blocked self-intensification.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A16","CH_97E9_VDVC:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:CGD-04","text":"The individual virtue is not a general ethical rule, but a cluster-wide strategy against the fragmentation of creative force into competing centers of value.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFU:A12","CH_97E9_VDFU:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_05:GNX-01","text":"Excluded is an otherworld that could function as the origin of meaning independently of the corporeal conditions of its invention.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A6","CH_97E9_VDH0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:GNX-02","text":"Excluded is a spiritual or moral subject that stands externally opposed to the body and could receive its values from an independent sphere.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A3","CH_97E9_VDFU:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:GNX-03","text":"Excluded is the equation of negation with self-overcoming, because flight from the body appears as a symptom of lost creative force and not as a higher way.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A11","CH_97E9_VDVC:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:GNX-04","text":"Excluded is a universal order of virtue, because public naming transforms singularity into herd and common norm.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFU:A1","CH_97E9_VDFU:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_05:DBN-01","text":"The system cannot permit a standpoint lying outside corporeal self-organization, because such a standpoint would make the genealogical reduction of transcendence, spirit, and morality impossible.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A7","CH_97E9_VDVC:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:DBN-02","text":"The system cannot permit a completed human nature, because its positive concepts function only as processes of revaluation, rank-formation, and self-transcendence.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A10","CH_97E9_VDFU:A9","CH_97E9_VDFU:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:DBN-03","text":"The system cannot permit a stable reconciliation of plural values, because value-creation itself is presupposed as a force capable of conflict and not as integration.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFU:A13","CH_97E9_VDFU:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_05:BSA-01","text":"The deepest excluded possibility is a truth without a history of production: what counts as true, good, or higher must not be detachable from suffering, body, valuation, and creation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:AS2","CH_97E9_VDVC:A9","CH_97E9_VDFU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:BSA-02","text":"Unavailable is a final identity of the human being, because both I and virtue and body appear only as mobile configurations of a self-intensification not yet completed.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A4","CH_97E9_VDFU:AS7","CH_97E9_VDFU:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:BSA-03","text":"Ontologically impermissible is a flight from immanence, for even its images, poisons, standards, and desires become readable as products of the earth and the body.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A13","CH_97E9_VDFU:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_05:XD-01","text":"The rejection of the otherworld and the dethroning of the I together do not constitute a mere materialization, but a displacement of authority onto a non-self-transparent, creative self in the body.  ; Trace Type — Composite","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A8","CH_97E9_VDVC:A4","CH_97E9_VDVC:A6","CL_97E9_05:GA-02","CL_97E9_05:GA-03","CL_97E9_05:GA-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:XD-02","text":"The revaluation of passion supplements the critique of contempt for the body: affectivity is not the problem, but rather its inhibition, devaluation, or dispersal into incompatible highest claims.  ; Trace Type — Composite","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:AS6","CH_97E9_VDFU:A9","CH_97E9_VDFU:A13","CL_97E9_05:GA-06","CL_97E9_05:GA-07","CL_97E9_05:GA-10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:XD-03","text":"The earth receives its meaning not through a pre-given order, but through the risky concentration of corporeal forces in value-creating and self-transcending forms.  ; Trace Type — Composite","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A11","CH_97E9_VDVC:A9","CH_97E9_VDFU:A12","CL_97E9_05:GA-04","CL_97E9_05:GA-08","CL_97E9_05:GA-09"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:XD-04","text":"The critique of religious certainty and the critique of public naming of virtue converge in a critique of externally guaranteed validity: both transform lived forces into norming forms of domination.  ; Trace Type — Negative","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A14","CH_97E9_VDFU:A2","CL_97E9_05:GA-01","CL_97E9_05:GA-05","CL_97E9_05:GA-06"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:XD-05","text":"The privileged position of the healthy body remains structurally unstable, because the body functions at once as the ground of all truth and as the site of illness, jealousy, self-disintegration, and the wish for death.  ; Trace Type — Tension","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A16","CH_97E9_VDH0:A12","CH_97E9_VDFU:A15","CL_97E9_05:GA-05","CL_97E9_05:GA-10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_05:BSD-01","text":"Ontology is transformed into a genealogy of productive and pathological forces: being is no longer the object of an otherworldly explanation, but the result of embodied self-organization.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:AS3","CH_97E9_VDVC:A2","CL_97E9_05:GA-01","CL_97E9_05:GA-02","CL_97E9_05:GA-04"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:BSD-02","text":"The subject is reconstructed as a layered order of domination in which the I is neither origin nor final end, but a provisional surface of deeper processes of value and creation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A4","CH_97E9_VDVC:A7","CH_97E9_VDFU:A16","CL_97E9_05:GA-03","CL_97E9_05:GA-04","CL_97E9_05:GA-09"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:BSD-03","text":"History appears not as progress toward a higher transcendent truth, but as struggle between forms of self-intensification and forms of exhausted retreat.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:AS5","CH_97E9_VDVC:A11","CH_97E9_VDFU:A16","CL_97E9_05:GA-07","CL_97E9_05:GA-09"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:BSD-04","text":"Ethics becomes an art of the distribution of force: it judges not the purity of individual affects, but their capacity to form a singular, creative, and self-transcending order.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFU:A9","CH_97E9_VDFU:A12","CH_97E9_VDFU:A14","CL_97E9_05:GA-06","CL_97E9_05:GA-08","CL_97E9_05:GA-09"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_05:RLE-01","text":"Negation of the body produces an otherworld or a will to death, yet this negation is led back to the body and thereby becomes readable as its pathological self-relation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A15","CH_97E9_VDVC:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:RLE-02","text":"Passion becomes virtue through a highest goal, but multiplied virtue generates conflict anew; revaluation therefore produces not harmony, but a higher form of endangerment.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFU:A9","CH_97E9_VDFU:A13","CH_97E9_VDFU:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:RLE-03","text":"The attractor of the cluster is creative self-intensification: it determines whether body, spirit, virtue, and suffering function as material for a higher form or as symptoms of decline.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A10","CH_97E9_VDVC:A11","CH_97E9_VDFU:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:RLE-04","text":"Probity forms an escalation loop, because it first genealogically destroys transcendence, then privileges the body, and finally renders problematic the criteria of this privileging themselves.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A10","CH_97E9_VDH0:A16","CH_97E9_VDVC:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_05:FGS-B01","text":"Corporeal exhaustion or despair → projection of otherworld, soul, or external law → loss of the immanent history of production.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:AS2","CH_97E9_VDFU:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:FGS-B02","text":"Genealogical reduction → disenchantment of external origins → reorganization of spirit, I, and value as functions of corporeal self-activity.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A3","CH_97E9_VDVC:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:FGS-B03","text":"Corporeal self-activity → positing of a highest goal → revaluation of passion into virtue → concentration of creative force.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A10","CH_97E9_VDFU:AS5","CH_97E9_VDFU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:FGS-B04","text":"Multiplication of total claims to value → jealousy and inner war → danger of self-destruction or blocked self-transcendence.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFU:A13","CH_97E9_VDFU:A14","CH_97E9_VDFU:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:FGS-B05","text":"Strategic condensation of forces → sense of the earth, healthy body, and one's own virtue → continued self-overcoming without transcendent final guarantee.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A11","CH_97E9_VDH0:A16","CH_97E9_VDFU:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_05:AFM-B01","text":"Suffering and exhaustion → projection of an otherworld or external law → loss of the corporeal origin of value and truth.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:AS2","CH_97E9_VDH0:A6","CH_97E9_VDFU:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:AFM-B02","text":"Genealogical reduction → body as great reason → self as concealed instance of control and creation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A1","CH_97E9_VDVC:A2","CH_97E9_VDVC:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:AFM-B03","text":"Dethroning of the I → reformulation of thought, valuation, and spirit as corporeal instruments → dissolution of external standards.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A3","CH_97E9_VDVC:A4","CH_97E9_VDVC:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:AFM-B04","text":"Passion → highest goal → virtue → concentration of a singular form of life.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFU:AS5","CH_97E9_VDFU:A9","CH_97E9_VDFU:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:AFM-B05","text":"Several totalizing virtues → jealousy → inner war → endangerment of self-intensification.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFU:A13","CH_97E9_VDFU:A14","CH_97E9_VDFU:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:AFM-B06","text":"Productive self-overcoming → sense of the earth and higher body → open, unreconciled future of the human being.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A11","CH_97E9_VDH0:D9","CH_97E9_VDFU:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_05:MME-01","text":"The opposition between immanence and transcendence is remapped: transcendence appears not as an outside, but as a corporeally produced figure of flight within immanence.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:MME-02","text":"The opposition between body and spirit disintegrates in favor of a hierarchy in which spirit and I operate as small, derivative reasons.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A2","CH_97E9_VDVC:A3","CH_97E9_VDVC:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:MME-03","text":"The opposition between passion and virtue is replaced by a logic of revaluation that makes morality readable as transformation and not as original purity.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFU:AS4","CH_97E9_VDFU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:MME-04","text":"Evil is displaced from a material characteristic of individual affects to an effect of competing centers of claims.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFU:A11","CH_97E9_VDFU:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:MME-05","text":"The human being is reclassified from a substance to be saved or completed into a risky transitional formation whose highest possibility includes its own overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A10","CH_97E9_VDFU:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_05:ALT-B01","text":"Surface level — God, otherworld, body, soul, spirit, I, passion, virtue, illness, and overcoming are explicitly addressed.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:AS1","CH_97E9_VDVC:AS2","CH_97E9_VDFU:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:ALT-B02","text":"Structural level — The recurring structure consists in reducing apparently autonomous instances to a corporeal organization that at once produces, evaluates, suffers, and divides itself.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:AS4","CH_97E9_VDVC:A9","CH_97E9_VDFU:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:ALT-B03","text":"Metastrategic level — Intervention consists not in instruction or norm-setting, but in the genealogical disempowerment of external guarantees and the strategic concentration of creative force.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:AS1","CH_97E9_VDFU:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:ALT-B04","text":"Ontological / Temporal level — Reality is corporeally organized multiplicity; time is the transition from projection and blockage to revaluation, self-intensification, and possible self-overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A2","CH_97E9_VDFU:A9","CH_97E9_VDFU:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:ALT-B05","text":"Methodological / Performative level — The form enacts its thesis by not defining concepts stably, but by functionally displacing them through reduction, hierarchization, revaluation, and conflictual recurrence.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:AS3","CH_97E9_VDVC:A3","CH_97E9_VDFU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_05:FL-01","text":"The critique of external truth collides with the privileging of the healthy body, because its probity functions as a standard without itself being fully genealogically relativized.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A16","CH_97E9_VDH0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:FL-02","text":"The dethroning of the I produces a new ruling instance in the self, whose relation to the body oscillates between identity, function, and inner government.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A4","CH_97E9_VDVC:A6","CH_97E9_VDVC:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:FL-03","text":"The singularity of virtue is under pressure because its revaluation proceeds from multiple passions, while its strategic singularity is at the same time meant to exclude inner competition.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFU:A9","CH_97E9_VDFU:A12","CH_97E9_VDFU:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:FL-04","text":"Self-overcoming remains ambiguous, because it denotes both creative intensification and the downfall of the human being and provides no secure boundary between the two forms.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A10","CH_97E9_VDVC:A11","CH_97E9_VDFU:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:MP-01","text":"The concept of the body mutates from the suffering origin of metaphysical flight into great reason and subsequently into the precondition of a higher body not yet determined.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A2","CH_97E9_VDH0:D9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:MP-02","text":"The concept of spirit mutates from the bearer of transcendent presumption into the instrument of the self and thereby loses its ontological independence without losing its operative efficacy.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A14","CH_97E9_VDVC:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:MP-03","text":"The concept of evil mutates from the ascribed property of passion into the result of rivalry between virtues.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFU:AS4","CH_97E9_VDFU:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:MP-04","text":"The concept of overcoming mutates from a rejected flight from the body into an immanent intensification that treats the human being itself as transitional material.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A15","CH_97E9_VDVC:ME6","CH_97E9_VDFU:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_05:HSI-01","text":"Reality appears as a machine of corporeal multiplicities that produces its own images, values, forms of domination, and routes of flight.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A2","CH_97E9_VDVC:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:HSI-02","text":"The subject appears as the surface of a deeper self that produces, governs, and can turn its instruments against itself.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A4","CH_97E9_VDVC:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:HSI-03","text":"Time appears as an irreversible trial in which forces are either condensed into higher creation or dispersed into otherworld, wish for death, herd, and war of virtues.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A11","CH_97E9_VDFU:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:HSI-04","text":"What remains possible is no final escape, but navigation through immanent conflicts by means of revaluation, rank-formation, probity, and risky self-overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A10","CH_97E9_VDFU:A9","CH_97E9_VDFU:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_05:MRT-B01","text":"The extracted axioms suffice to reconstruct the cluster-wide movement from the genealogical disenchantment of external instances to the immanent organization of creative self-intensification.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDVC:A2","CH_97E9_VDVC:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:MRT-B02","text":"It remains underdetermined how a distinction can be made between healthy body, mere intensification of force, and destructive self-annihilation without introducing a once again external standard.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A16","CH_97E9_VDVC:A11","CH_97E9_VDFU:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:MRT-B03","text":"The architecture is strongest where it does not simply reject transcendence, spirit, and morality, but reconstructs them as derivative and mutable achievements of corporeal self-organization.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A13","CH_97E9_VDVC:A3","CH_97E9_VDFU:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_05:MRT-B04","text":"The reconstruction remains faithful to the actual movement only if it preserves the productive irresolvability of health and illness, singular virtue and war of virtues, as well as creation and downfall.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDH0:A12","CH_97E9_VDFU:A12","CH_97E9_VDFU:A13","CH_97E9_VDFU:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CL_97E9_05@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CL_97E9_05:v1","source_language_code":"de","original_title":"Chapters 13–15"}],"identity":{"layer":"CL","kicker":"Cluster · Also sprach Zarathustra","title":"Chapters 13–15","context":"Of the Afterworldly · Of the Despisers of the Body · Of the Joys and Passions","original_title":"Chapters 13–15","original_context":"Von den Hinterweltlern · Von den Verächtern des Leibes · Von den Freuden- und Leidenschaften"},"original_title":"Chapters 13–15","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CL_97E9_06","layer":"CL","title":"Chapters 16–18","order":6,"parents":["CH_97E9_VBV0","CH_97E9_VLUS","CH_97E9_VBAB"],"revision":"CL_97E9_06@R001","sha256":"015f381c4bad6e6beaf8706657795bd14a380b3a6d49423d13660c2296e0d35b","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_06:AS-01","text":"Das System behandelt Selbst, Tat, Freiheit und Geist nicht als stabile Besitzstände, sondern als konflikthafte Übergangsformen, deren scheinbare Einheit erst nachträglich erzeugt wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:AS1","CH_97E9_VBAB:AS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:AS-02","text":"Es ersetzt moralische Zurechnung durch eine Topologie von Trieben, Bildern, Höhen, Gefängnissen, Schwere und Selbstüberwindung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:AS5","CH_97E9_VBAB:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:AS-03","text":"Die zentrale Bewegung führt von der Dekonstruktion fremder Urteile und allgemeiner Verständlichkeit zu selektiver Selbstformung, Reinigung und höherer Wertsetzung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:AS4","CH_97E9_VLUS:A3","CH_97E9_VBAB:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:AS-04","text":"Höhe fungiert nicht als Erlösung vom Niederen, sondern als Intensivierung der dunklen, schweren und triebhaften Gegenkräfte, die der Aufstieg mitführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBAB:A2","CH_97E9_VLUS:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:AS-05","text":"Der Cluster organisiert eine Umwertung, in der das Gute, die Versöhnung, die Lesbarkeit und die Selbsterhaltung ihre Vorrangstellung verlieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:A14","CH_97E9_VBV0:A6","CH_97E9_VLUS:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:AS-06","text":"Die positive Gegenbewegung besteht weder in Rückkehr noch in Entlastung, sondern in einer riskanten Verbindung von Selbstgericht, Schöpfung, Lachen, Reinigung und selbst erzeugter Bewegung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:A3","CH_97E9_VLUS:A12","CH_97E9_VBAB:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:AS-07","text":"Die Argumentation ist rekursiv und spiralförmig: Jede Befreiung legt eine neue Gefangenschaft frei, jede Höhe erzeugt Tiefe, und jede Wertsetzung muss sich gegen ihre eigene Entleerung behaupten.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBAB:A8","CH_97E9_VBAB:ME2","CH_97E9_VBAB:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:AS-08","text":"Die erreichte Schließung ist keine Versöhnung, sondern eine selektive Ethik der fortgesetzten Selbstüberwindung, deren Maßstab Zukunftsfähigkeit statt moralischer Unschuld ist.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:A6","CH_97E9_VBV0:A17","CH_97E9_VBAB:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_06:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Das Subjekt ist keine transparente Einheit, sondern eine konflikthafte Vielheit, deren Triebe, Bilder, Urteile und Selbstdeutungen auseinanderfallen können.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:A13","CH_97E9_VBV0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Moralische Kategorien verlieren ihre unmittelbare Erklärungskraft, weil Handlung, Begehren und Selbstbild nicht bruchlos zusammenfallen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:A12","CH_97E9_VBV0:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:GA-03","text":"[Mutating] Freiheit bezeichnet keinen erreichten Zustand, sondern einen Reinigungsprozess innerhalb fortbestehender Triebhaftigkeit, Gefangenschaft und Selbsttäuschung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBAB:A8","CH_97E9_VBAB:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:GA-04","text":"[Mutating] Höhe ist eine Doppelbewegung, in der Erhebung zugleich Einsamkeit, Verwurzelung im Dunklen und gesteigerte Gefährdung erzeugt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBAB:A2","CH_97E9_VBAB:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:GA-05","text":"[Emergent] Wertung wird von moralischer Schuld auf Rang, Schöpfung, Selbstüberwindung und die Bewahrung einer höchsten Orientierung umgestellt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:SD4","CH_97E9_VBAB:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:GA-06","text":"[Persistent] Allgemeine Zugänglichkeit erscheint nicht als Neutralität, sondern als Gefahr der Nivellierung, Passivierung und Entleerung geistiger Form.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLUS:A3","CH_97E9_VLUS:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:GA-07","text":"[Attractor] Die Schwere fungiert als Name für jene Kräfte, die Bewegung in Fall, Ernst in Erstarrung und Geist in Passivität verwandeln.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLUS:A11","CH_97E9_VLUS:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:GA-08","text":"[Terminal] Lebensrechtfertigung entsteht nur dort, wo Selbstüberwindung, Schöpfung und höhere Zukunftsorientierung die bloße Selbsterhaltung übersteigen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:A6","CH_97E9_VBV0:A16","CH_97E9_VBAB:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_06:RMD-01","text":"Das Motiv des Wahnsinns kehrt nicht identisch wieder: Es verschiebt sich von einer psychischen Erklärung der Tat zu einer produktiven Spannung zwischen Liebe, Vernunft, Freiheit und Schöpfung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:A10","CH_97E9_VLUS:A9","CH_97E9_VLUS:MRT7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:RMD-02","text":"Der Richter mutiert von einer äußeren Strafinstanz zu einem Modell jeder wertenden Instanz, die ihr eigenes Weiterleben und ihre eigene Zukunftsordnung rechtfertigen muss.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:A5","CH_97E9_VBV0:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:RMD-03","text":"Die Höhe bleibt als funktionale Wiederkehr erhalten, wandelt sich jedoch vom selektiven Standpunkt des Spruchs zur paradoxen Topologie einer tiefer wurzelnden Gefährdung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLUS:A5","CH_97E9_VBAB:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:RMD-04","text":"Die Selbstbewegung erweitert sich von körperlichem Gehen, Fliegen und Tanzen zu einer ethischen Forderung nach Reinigung und fortgesetzter Befreiung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLUS:A13","CH_97E9_VBAB:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_06:CGD-01","text":"Die konkrete Umdeutung des Verbrechers bleibt lokal, doch die Auflösung des einheitlichen moralischen Täters skaliert zur allgemeinen Kritik stabiler Subjekt- und Schuldformen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:ME1","CH_97E9_VBV0:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:CGD-02","text":"Blutinschrift, Gipfel und Tanz bleiben bildspezifische Verfahren, während die selektive Verteilung von Verstehen und Wert als clusterweite Struktur fortbesteht.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLUS:A1","CH_97E9_VLUS:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:CGD-03","text":"Das Baumgleichnis bleibt eine lokale Bildmaschine, doch seine Kopplung von Aufstieg und Gegenbewegung wird zur übergeordneten Logik jeder Selbstüberschreitung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBAB:AS2","CH_97E9_VBAB:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_06:GNX-01","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird ein geschlossenes Subjekt, dessen bewusste Motive die Ursachen seiner Handlungen zuverlässig ausdrücken.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:DNX1","CH_97E9_VBV0:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:GNX-02","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Straf- und Moralordnung, die Rache, Schuld und unveränderliche Wertbegriffe als letzte Grundlage behandelt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:NX2","CH_97E9_VBV0:NX7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:GNX-03","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine egalitäre Kommunikationsordnung, in der Wahrheit ohne Distanz, Gefährdung und Auswahl allgemein verfügbar wäre.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLUS:NX1","CH_97E9_VLUS:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_06:DBN-01","text":"Das System kann keine Befreiung zulassen, die von ihren materiellen, triebhaften und geschichtlichen Resten gereinigt wäre, bevor der Reinigungsprozess überhaupt beginnt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBAB:DNX5","CH_97E9_VBAB:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:DBN-02","text":"Es kann keine Versöhnung anerkennen, die Konflikt durch Reintegration, Schonung oder Rückkehr zur bestehenden Ordnung neutralisiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:SNX1","CH_97E9_VBAB:D8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:DBN-03","text":"Es kann keine Lebensbejahung anerkennen, die Behagen, Schonung, Ernst oder Selbsterhaltung als höchste Güter behandelt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:DNX6","CH_97E9_VLUS:DNX7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_06:BSA-01","text":"Unverfügbar bleibt eine reine Höhe, die weder Erde, Dunkel, Schwere noch die Möglichkeit des Falls mitführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBAB:SNX1","CH_97E9_VLUS:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:BSA-02","text":"Unverfügbar bleibt eine endgültige Selbstbegründung, in der Freiheit, Wahrheit oder Heldentum ohne fremde Vermittlung, Restgefängnis und Selbstgefährdung bestehen könnten.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBAB:SNX2","CH_97E9_VBAB:DNX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_06:XD-01","text":"Die Kritik der moralischen Schuld und die Kritik allgemeiner Lesbarkeit erzeugen gemeinsam eine Ordnung, in der sowohl Urteil als auch Verstehen als selektive Prüfungen von Rang und Tragfähigkeit fungieren. ; Trace Type — Composite","refs":["CL_97E9_06:GA-02","CL_97E9_06:GA-06","CH_97E9_VBV0:SD4","CH_97E9_VLUS:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:XD-02","text":"Selbstgericht, Lachen und Reinigung bilden unterschiedliche Operationen derselben Gegenmacht: Sie unterbrechen die Versteinerung des Subjekts in Schuld, Schwere oder Gefangenschaft. ; Trace Type — Composite","refs":["CL_97E9_06:GA-01","CL_97E9_06:GA-03","CL_97E9_06:GA-07","CH_97E9_VBV0:A3","CH_97E9_VLUS:A12","CH_97E9_VBAB:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:XD-03","text":"Der Aufstieg ist nur dann produktiv, wenn er seine Gegenkräfte nicht verleugnet, sondern sie in eine höhere Form von Selbstformung überführt. ; Trace Type — Tension","refs":["CL_97E9_06:GA-03","CL_97E9_06:GA-04","CH_97E9_VBAB:A2","CH_97E9_VBAB:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:XD-04","text":"Die Ablehnung des Guten als bloßer Bewahrung und die Ablehnung der gegenwärtigen Tugend als Selbsterhaltung verbinden sich zu einer schöpferischen Wertordnung, die Zerstörung nicht ausschließt. ; Trace Type — Composite","refs":["CL_97E9_06:GA-05","CL_97E9_06:GA-08","CH_97E9_VBV0:A16","CH_97E9_VBAB:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_06:BSD-01","text":"Das System ersetzt Kausalität als lineare Zurechnung durch eine geschichtete Kausalität aus Trieb, Bild, Urteil, Gegenkraft und nachträglicher Selbstdeutung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:SD2","CH_97E9_VBAB:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:BSD-02","text":"Die politische und ethische Frage lautet nicht mehr, wer unschuldig oder schuldig ist, sondern welche Formen von Urteil, Schrift und Befreiung Leben in höhere Beweglichkeit überführen können.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:SD1","CH_97E9_VLUS:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:BSD-03","text":"Die höchste Gefahr liegt nicht primär im äußeren Gegner, sondern in der sekundären Entleerung, durch die Befreiung zu Arglist, Höhe zu Verachtung und Geist zu Schwere wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBAB:A9","CH_97E9_VBAB:D7","CH_97E9_VLUS:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_06:RLE-01","text":"Triebhafte Spaltung erzeugt Tat oder Selbstwiderlegung; deren Bild erzeugt Schuld, Verachtung oder Gefangenschaft; diese Zustände erzwingen entweder Selbstüberwindung oder Verfall.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:A9","CH_97E9_VBAB:A3","CH_97E9_VBAB:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:RLE-02","text":"Der Attraktor der Schwere zieht Ernst, Tiefe, Passivität und Fall zusammen, während Lachen, Mut und Bewegung als Gegenattraktor operieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLUS:A11","CH_97E9_VLUS:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:RLE-03","text":"Der Attraktor der Höhe organisiert eine Spirale aus Erhebung, Distanz, Einsamkeit, Verwurzelung und erneuter Forderung nach Reinigung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLUS:A6","CH_97E9_VBAB:A5","CH_97E9_VBAB:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_06:FGS-B01","text":"Spaltung von Trieb, Tat, Bild und Urteil → Zusammenbruch moralischer Transparenz → Neubestimmung von Schuld als nachträglicher Selbstfixierung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:D5","CH_97E9_VBV0:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:FGS-B02","text":"Aufstieg, Spruch und selektive Distanz → Gewinn von Höhe → Sichtbarwerden von Einsamkeit, Verwurzelung und Nichtverfügbarkeit allgemeiner Verständigung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLUS:D3","CH_97E9_VBAB:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:FGS-B03","text":"Freisetzung von Trieben → Einsicht in fortbestehende Gefangenschaft → Reinigung als Bedingung wirklicher Selbstbewegung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBAB:A7","CH_97E9_VBAB:D4","CH_97E9_VBAB:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:FGS-B04","text":"Kritik von Rache, Behagen und Bewahrung → Umwertung der Tugend → Schöpfung und höchste Hoffnung als selektive Zukunftsorientierung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:NX2","CH_97E9_VBV0:A17","CH_97E9_VBAB:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_06:AFM-B01","text":"Zurechnungs- und Verständniskrise → Zerlegung von Subjekt, Tat und Mitteilung → Verlust moralischer und kommunikativer Unmittelbarkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:AS1","CH_97E9_VLUS:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:AFM-B02","text":"Verlust der Unmittelbarkeit → Höhe, Distanz und Selbstgericht als neue Prüfungsformen → Sichtbarwerden von Schwere, Einsamkeit und Gefangenschaft.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:AS3","CH_97E9_VLUS:A6","CH_97E9_VBAB:NX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:AFM-B03","text":"Sichtbarwerden der Gegenkräfte → Reinigung, Lachen und Selbstbewegung → partielle Überführung der Schwere in Beweglichkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLUS:A12","CH_97E9_VLUS:A13","CH_97E9_VBAB:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:AFM-B04","text":"Partielle Befreiung → Gefahr von Verfall und Selbstentstellung → Bewahrung von Liebe, Hoffnung und schöpferischer Ausrichtung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBAB:D7","CH_97E9_VBAB:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_06:MME-01","text":"Schuld wird von einer moralischen Eigenschaft zu einem Effekt nachträglicher Bild- und Urteilsmacht umkartiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:ME3","CH_97E9_VBV0:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:MME-02","text":"Freiheit wird von äußerer Unabhängigkeit zu einer inneren Arbeit an fortbestehenden Resten von Gefangenschaft umkartiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBAB:ME3","CH_97E9_VBAB:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:MME-03","text":"Kommunikation wird von allgemeiner Übertragung zu einer gefährdeten, hierarchischen und erinnerungsorientierten Auswahloperation umkartiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLUS:ME1","CH_97E9_VLUS:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_06:ALT-B01","text":"Surface level — Verbrecher, Richter, Leser, Spruch, Jüngling, Baum, Höhe, Freiheit und Tanz bilden verschiedene Szenen einer gemeinsamen Krise von Urteil und Selbstformung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:ALT1","CH_97E9_VLUS:ALT1","CH_97E9_VBAB:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:ALT-B02","text":"Structural level — Triebe, Tatbilder, Schwere, unsichtbare Kräfte und Restgefängnisse bilden eine verteilte Mechanik, in der Selbstverhältnisse nie unmittelbar sind.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:ALT2","CH_97E9_VLUS:ALT2","CH_97E9_VBAB:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:ALT-B03","text":"Metastrategic level — Interpretation und Intervention werden als Auswahl, Umwertung und Reinigung organisiert, nicht als Wiederherstellung eines ursprünglichen Gleichgewichts.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:ALT3","CH_97E9_VLUS:ALT3","CH_97E9_VBAB:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:ALT-B04","text":"Ontological / Temporal level — Zeit erscheint als Selbstwiderlegung, Nachträglichkeit und wiederkehrende Gegenbewegung, nicht als lineare Verbesserung oder abgeschlossene Gegenwart.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:ALT4","CH_97E9_VBAB:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:ALT-B05","text":"Methodological / Performative level — Die Rede vollzieht ihre Theorie, indem sie das Publikum selektiert, moralische Namen verweigert und Bilder als Denkmaschinen statt als Illustrationen einsetzt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:A18","CH_97E9_VLUS:NX2","CH_97E9_VBAB:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_06:FL-01","text":"Die Verwerfung moralischer Etiketten bleibt spannungsvoll, weil die neue Rangordnung weiterhin entscheidet, welche Lebensformen höher, reinigungsfähig oder zukunftsfähig sind.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:SD4","CH_97E9_VBAB:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:FL-02","text":"Die Kritik äußerer Verursachung kollidiert produktiv mit der Diagnose unsichtbarer Kräfte, weil Selbstreinigung zugleich gefordert und durch nicht verfügbare Bedingungen begrenzt wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBAB:A1","CH_97E9_VBAB:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:MP-01","text":"Mitleid mutiert von einer möglichen Alternative zur Rache zu einer problematischen Rechtfertigung des Weiterlebens der Urteilenden.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:A5","CH_97E9_VBV0:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:MP-02","text":"Höhe mutiert vom Zeichen geistiger Auswahl zum Ort erhöhter Verletzlichkeit, Einsamkeit und dunkler Verwurzelung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLUS:A5","CH_97E9_VBAB:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_06:HSI-01","text":"Realität erscheint als Feld gegenläufiger Kräfte, in dem jede sichtbare Bewegung von unsichtbaren Trieben, Bildern und Gegenrichtungen mitproduziert wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBAB:A1","CH_97E9_VBV0:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:HSI-02","text":"Das Subjekt erscheint als Übergangsmaschine, die sich nur durch Selbstgericht, Reinigung, Erinnerung und riskante Selbstbewegung aus ihren eigenen Versteinerungen lösen kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:A3","CH_97E9_VBAB:A10","CH_97E9_VLUS:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:HSI-03","text":"Zeit erscheint als nicht versöhnte Spirale, in der frühere Gestalten widerlegt werden, aber als Wurzel, Last und Gefängnis in die nächste Gestalt zurückkehren.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBAB:A3","CH_97E9_VBAB:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_06:MRT-B01","text":"Die extrahierte Architektur reicht aus, sofern Subjektspaltung, selektive Wertsetzung, paradoxe Höhe und fortgesetzte Reinigung als voneinander abhängige Operationen gelesen werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:MRT3","CH_97E9_VBAB:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:MRT-B02","text":"Unterbestimmt bleiben die Kriterien, nach denen Mitleid, Reinheit, Größe und höhere Hoffnung verbindlich unterschieden werden können.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:MRT2","CH_97E9_VLUS:MRT2","CH_97E9_VBAB:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:MRT-B03","text":"Die Rekonstruktion hängt notwendig an produktiven Spannungen zwischen Bestimmung und Selbstformung, Hierarchie und Mitteilung, Zerstörung und Bewahrung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:MRT5","CH_97E9_VLUS:MRT5","CH_97E9_VBAB:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T195907580455Z_c230232b","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Chapters 16–18","source_sha256":"015f381c4bad6e6beaf8706657795bd14a380b3a6d49423d13660c2296e0d35b","sha256":"726865ae44a3e4fa5368b3bb8efd13d45ce836f95dd9c5393fb80a2b42aef759","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:59:07.581691+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_06:AS-01","text":"The system treats self, deed, freedom, and spirit not as stable possessions, but as conflictual transitional forms whose apparent unity is only subsequently produced.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:AS1","CH_97E9_VBAB:AS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:AS-02","text":"It replaces moral attribution with a topology of drives, images, heights, prisons, gravity, and self-overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:AS5","CH_97E9_VBAB:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:AS-03","text":"The central movement leads from the deconstruction of foreign judgments and general intelligibility to selective self-formation, purification, and higher valuation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:AS4","CH_97E9_VLUS:A3","CH_97E9_VBAB:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:AS-04","text":"Height functions not as redemption from the lower, but as an intensification of the dark, heavy, and drive-like counterforces that ascent carries along with it.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBAB:A2","CH_97E9_VLUS:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:AS-05","text":"The cluster organizes a revaluation in which the good, reconciliation, legibility, and self-preservation lose their privileged status.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:A14","CH_97E9_VBV0:A6","CH_97E9_VLUS:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:AS-06","text":"The positive counter-movement consists neither in return nor in relief, but in a risky connection of self-judgment, creation, laughter, purification, and self-generated movement.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:A3","CH_97E9_VLUS:A12","CH_97E9_VBAB:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:AS-07","text":"The argument is recursive and spiral-shaped: every liberation exposes a new captivity, every height produces depth, and every valuation must assert itself against its own emptying-out.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBAB:A8","CH_97E9_VBAB:ME2","CH_97E9_VBAB:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:AS-08","text":"The closure achieved is not reconciliation, but a selective ethics of continued self-overcoming, whose criterion is capacity for the future rather than moral innocence.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:A6","CH_97E9_VBV0:A17","CH_97E9_VBAB:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_06:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] The subject is not a transparent unity, but a conflictual multiplicity whose drives, images, judgments, and self-interpretations can diverge.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:A13","CH_97E9_VBV0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Moral categories lose their immediate explanatory force because action, desire, and self-image do not coincide without rupture.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:A12","CH_97E9_VBV0:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:GA-03","text":"[Mutating] Freedom denotes not an attained state, but a process of purification within persisting drive-like character, captivity, and self-deception.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBAB:A8","CH_97E9_VBAB:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:GA-04","text":"[Mutating] Height is a double movement in which elevation simultaneously produces solitude, rootedness in the dark, and heightened danger.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBAB:A2","CH_97E9_VBAB:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:GA-05","text":"[Emergent] Valuation is shifted from moral guilt to rank, creation, self-overcoming, and the preservation of a highest orientation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:SD4","CH_97E9_VBAB:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:GA-06","text":"[Persistent] General accessibility appears not as neutrality, but as the danger of levelling, passivation, and the emptying-out of spiritual form.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLUS:A3","CH_97E9_VLUS:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:GA-07","text":"[Attractor] Gravity functions as the name for those forces that transform movement into falling, seriousness into rigidity, and spirit into passivity.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLUS:A11","CH_97E9_VLUS:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:GA-08","text":"[Terminal] Justification of life arises only where self-overcoming, creation, and higher orientation toward the future surpass mere self-preservation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:A6","CH_97E9_VBV0:A16","CH_97E9_VBAB:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_06:RMD-01","text":"The motif of madness does not recur identically: it shifts from a psychological explanation of the deed to a productive tension among love, reason, freedom, and creation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:A10","CH_97E9_VLUS:A9","CH_97E9_VLUS:MRT7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:RMD-02","text":"The judge mutates from an external punitive authority into a model of every valuing instance that must justify its own continued life and its own future order.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:A5","CH_97E9_VBV0:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:RMD-03","text":"Height remains preserved as a functional recurrence, yet changes from the selective standpoint of pronouncement into the paradoxical topology of a more deeply rooted danger.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLUS:A5","CH_97E9_VBAB:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:RMD-04","text":"Self-movement expands from bodily walking, flying, and dancing into an ethical demand for purification and continued liberation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLUS:A13","CH_97E9_VBAB:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_06:CGD-01","text":"The concrete reinterpretation of the criminal remains local, yet the dissolution of the unified moral agent scales into a general critique of stable forms of subjecthood and guilt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:ME1","CH_97E9_VBV0:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:CGD-02","text":"Blood-inscription, summit, and dance remain image-specific procedures, while the selective distribution of understanding and value persists as a cluster-wide structure.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLUS:A1","CH_97E9_VLUS:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:CGD-03","text":"The tree allegory remains a local image-machine, yet its coupling of ascent and counter-movement becomes the higher-order logic of every self-transcendence.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBAB:AS2","CH_97E9_VBAB:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_06:GNX-01","text":"Excluded is a closed subject whose conscious motives reliably express the causes of its actions.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:DNX1","CH_97E9_VBV0:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:GNX-02","text":"Excluded is an order of punishment and morality that treats revenge, guilt, and unchangeable concepts of value as its ultimate foundation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:NX2","CH_97E9_VBV0:NX7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:GNX-03","text":"Excluded is an egalitarian order of communication in which truth would be generally available without distance, danger, and selection.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLUS:NX1","CH_97E9_VLUS:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_06:DBN-01","text":"The system cannot permit a liberation that would be purified of its material, drive-like, and historical remnants before the process of purification even begins.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBAB:DNX5","CH_97E9_VBAB:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:DBN-02","text":"It cannot acknowledge a reconciliation that neutralizes conflict through reintegration, sparing, or return to the existing order.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:SNX1","CH_97E9_VBAB:D8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:DBN-03","text":"It cannot acknowledge an affirmation of life that treats comfort, sparing, seriousness, or self-preservation as the highest goods.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:DNX6","CH_97E9_VLUS:DNX7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_06:BSA-01","text":"Unavailable remains a pure height that carries with it neither earth, darkness, gravity, nor the possibility of falling.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBAB:SNX1","CH_97E9_VLUS:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:BSA-02","text":"Unavailable remains a final self-grounding in which freedom, truth, or heroism could subsist without external mediation, residual captivity, and self-endangerment.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBAB:SNX2","CH_97E9_VBAB:DNX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_06:XD-01","text":"The critique of moral guilt and the critique of general legibility jointly produce an order in which both judgment and understanding function as selective tests of rank and capacity to bear. ; Trace Type — Composite","refs":["CL_97E9_06:GA-02","CL_97E9_06:GA-06","CH_97E9_VBV0:SD4","CH_97E9_VLUS:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:XD-02","text":"Self-judgment, laughter, and purification form different operations of the same counter-power: they interrupt the petrification of the subject into guilt, gravity, or captivity. ; Trace Type — Composite","refs":["CL_97E9_06:GA-01","CL_97E9_06:GA-03","CL_97E9_06:GA-07","CH_97E9_VBV0:A3","CH_97E9_VLUS:A12","CH_97E9_VBAB:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:XD-03","text":"Ascent is productive only when it does not deny its counterforces, but rather transforms them into a higher form of self-formation. ; Trace Type — Tension","refs":["CL_97E9_06:GA-03","CL_97E9_06:GA-04","CH_97E9_VBAB:A2","CH_97E9_VBAB:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:XD-04","text":"The rejection of the good as mere preservation and the rejection of present virtue as self-preservation combine into a creative order of value that does not exclude destruction. ; Trace Type — Composite","refs":["CL_97E9_06:GA-05","CL_97E9_06:GA-08","CH_97E9_VBV0:A16","CH_97E9_VBAB:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_06:BSD-01","text":"The system replaces causality as linear attribution with a layered causality of drive, image, judgment, counterforce, and subsequent self-interpretation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:SD2","CH_97E9_VBAB:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:BSD-02","text":"The political and ethical question is no longer who is innocent or guilty, but which forms of judgment, writing, and liberation can transform life into higher mobility.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:SD1","CH_97E9_VLUS:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:BSD-03","text":"The highest danger lies not primarily in the external enemy, but in the secondary emptying-out through which liberation becomes cunning, height becomes contempt, and spirit becomes gravity.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBAB:A9","CH_97E9_VBAB:D7","CH_97E9_VLUS:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_06:RLE-01","text":"Drive-like division produces deed or self-refutation; its image produces guilt, contempt, or captivity; these states compel either self-overcoming or decline.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:A9","CH_97E9_VBAB:A3","CH_97E9_VBAB:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:RLE-02","text":"The attractor of gravity draws together seriousness, depth, passivity, and falling, while laughter, courage, and movement operate as a counter-attractor.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLUS:A11","CH_97E9_VLUS:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:RLE-03","text":"The attractor of height organizes a spiral of elevation, distance, solitude, rootedness, and renewed demand for purification.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLUS:A6","CH_97E9_VBAB:A5","CH_97E9_VBAB:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_06:FGS-B01","text":"Division of drive, deed, image, and judgment → collapse of moral transparency → redefinition of guilt as subsequent self-fixation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:D5","CH_97E9_VBV0:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:FGS-B02","text":"Ascent, pronouncement, and selective distance → gain of height → becoming visible of solitude, rootedness, and the unavailability of general understanding.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLUS:D3","CH_97E9_VBAB:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:FGS-B03","text":"Release of drives → insight into persisting captivity → purification as the condition of genuine self-movement.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBAB:A7","CH_97E9_VBAB:D4","CH_97E9_VBAB:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:FGS-B04","text":"Critique of revenge, comfort, and preservation → revaluation of virtue → creation and highest hope as selective orientation toward the future.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:NX2","CH_97E9_VBV0:A17","CH_97E9_VBAB:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_06:AFM-B01","text":"Crisis of attribution and understanding → decomposition of subject, deed, and communication → loss of moral and communicative immediacy.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:AS1","CH_97E9_VLUS:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:AFM-B02","text":"Loss of immediacy → height, distance, and self-judgment as new forms of testing → becoming visible of gravity, solitude, and captivity.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:AS3","CH_97E9_VLUS:A6","CH_97E9_VBAB:NX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:AFM-B03","text":"Becoming visible of the counterforces → purification, laughter, and self-movement → partial transformation of gravity into mobility.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLUS:A12","CH_97E9_VLUS:A13","CH_97E9_VBAB:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:AFM-B04","text":"Partial liberation → danger of decline and self-disfigurement → preservation of love, hope, and creative orientation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBAB:D7","CH_97E9_VBAB:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_06:MME-01","text":"Guilt is remapped from a moral property to an effect of subsequent power of image and judgment.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:ME3","CH_97E9_VBV0:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:MME-02","text":"Freedom is remapped from external independence to an inner labor on persisting remnants of captivity.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBAB:ME3","CH_97E9_VBAB:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:MME-03","text":"Communication is remapped from general transmission to an endangered, hierarchical, and memory-oriented operation of selection.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLUS:ME1","CH_97E9_VLUS:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_06:ALT-B01","text":"Surface level — Criminal, judge, reader, pronouncement, youth, tree, height, freedom, and dance form different scenes of a shared crisis of judgment and self-formation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:ALT1","CH_97E9_VLUS:ALT1","CH_97E9_VBAB:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:ALT-B02","text":"Structural level — Drives, deed-images, gravity, invisible forces, and residual captivities form a distributed mechanics in which relations to self are never immediate.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:ALT2","CH_97E9_VLUS:ALT2","CH_97E9_VBAB:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:ALT-B03","text":"Metastrategic level — Interpretation and intervention are organized as selection, revaluation, and purification, not as restoration of an original equilibrium.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:ALT3","CH_97E9_VLUS:ALT3","CH_97E9_VBAB:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:ALT-B04","text":"Ontological / Temporal level — Time appears as self-refutation, subsequentness, and recurring counter-movement, not as linear improvement or completed present.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:ALT4","CH_97E9_VBAB:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:ALT-B05","text":"Methodological / Performative level — The discourse enacts its theory by selecting its audience, refusing moral names, and employing images as thinking-machines rather than as illustrations.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:A18","CH_97E9_VLUS:NX2","CH_97E9_VBAB:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_06:FL-01","text":"The rejection of moral labels remains tension-filled because the new hierarchy continues to decide which forms of life are higher, capable of purification, or capable of the future.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:SD4","CH_97E9_VBAB:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:FL-02","text":"The critique of external causation collides productively with the diagnosis of invisible forces, because self-purification is both demanded and limited by unavailable conditions.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBAB:A1","CH_97E9_VBAB:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:MP-01","text":"Compassion mutates from a possible alternative to revenge into a problematic justification for the continued life of those who judge.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:A5","CH_97E9_VBV0:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:MP-02","text":"Height mutates from the sign of spiritual selection into the site of heightened vulnerability, solitude, and dark rootedness.","refs":["CH_97E9_VLUS:A5","CH_97E9_VBAB:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_06:HSI-01","text":"Reality appears as a field of opposing forces in which every visible movement is co-produced by invisible drives, images, and counter-directions.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBAB:A1","CH_97E9_VBV0:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:HSI-02","text":"The subject appears as a transitional machine that can free itself from its own petrifications only through self-judgment, purification, remembrance, and risky self-movement.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:A3","CH_97E9_VBAB:A10","CH_97E9_VLUS:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:HSI-03","text":"Time appears as an unreconciled spiral in which earlier forms are refuted, yet return in the next form as root, burden, and prison.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBAB:A3","CH_97E9_VBAB:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_06:MRT-B01","text":"The extracted architecture is sufficient provided that subject-division, selective valuation, paradoxical height, and continued purification are read as mutually dependent operations.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:MRT3","CH_97E9_VBAB:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:MRT-B02","text":"The criteria by which compassion, purity, greatness, and higher hope can be bindingly distinguished remain underdetermined.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:MRT2","CH_97E9_VLUS:MRT2","CH_97E9_VBAB:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_06:MRT-B03","text":"The reconstruction necessarily depends on productive tensions between determination and self-formation, hierarchy and communication, destruction and preservation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBV0:MRT5","CH_97E9_VLUS:MRT5","CH_97E9_VBAB:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CL_97E9_06@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CL_97E9_06:v1","source_language_code":"de","original_title":"Chapters 16–18"}],"identity":{"layer":"CL","kicker":"Cluster · Also sprach Zarathustra","title":"Chapters 16–18","context":"Of the Pale Criminal · Of Reading and Writing · Of the Tree on the Mountainside","original_title":"Chapters 16–18","original_context":"Vom bleichen Verbrecher · Vom Lesen und Schreiben · Vom Baum am Berge"},"original_title":"Chapters 16–18","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CL_97E9_07","layer":"CL","title":"Chapters 19–21","order":7,"parents":["CH_97E9_VDPD","CH_97E9_VKUK","CH_97E9_VNGT"],"revision":"CL_97E9_07@R001","sha256":"9ead853f9e1cade1a7b94b793cff6c08d72d8818a6a9bd234240dcf7451aff70","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_07:AS-01","text":"Das System diagnostiziert Lebensverneinung nicht als bloße Todessehnsucht, sondern als variable Technik, die Leiden, Frieden, Moral, Arbeit, Staat und Erlösung in Formen der Entbindung vom Leben verwandelt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:AS6","CH_97E9_VNGT:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:AS-02","text":"Es ersetzt die moralische Bewertung einzelner Haltungen durch eine Funktionsanalyse: Entscheidend ist, ob eine Praxis Leben, Selbstüberwindung und schöpferische Vielheit trägt oder in Beschleunigung, Massenbindung und Selbstauflösung überführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:FGS4","CH_97E9_VNGT:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:AS-03","text":"Die positive Gegenbewegung besteht nicht in Schonung, Frieden oder institutioneller Sicherheit, sondern in einer harten Bejahung, die Dauer, Feindschaft, Gefahr, Einsamkeit und Überwindung aushält.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:SD6","CH_97E9_VKUK:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:AS-04","text":"Die Bewegung ist spiralförmig: Private Erschöpfung wird zur Predigt, Predigt zur sozialen Form, soziale Form zur staatlichen Erfassung und staatliche Erfassung zum Hindernis einer nichtüberflüssigen Existenz.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:SD1","CH_97E9_VNGT:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:AS-05","text":"Krieg fungiert als ambivalente Selektionsform: Er kann Selbstüberwindung, Redlichkeit und Zukunft eröffnen, kann aber zugleich in die lebensverneinende Sprache kollektiver Opferung umschlagen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:SD3","CH_97E9_VNGT:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:AS-06","text":"Die vorläufige Schließung liegt im Austritt aus den Apparaten des beschleunigten Verschwindens zugunsten einer Lebensform, die weder sich selbst noch andere in Überflüssigkeit, Schonung oder Masse auflöst.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:SD4","CH_97E9_VDPD:SNX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_07:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Lebensverneinung ist eine funktionale, nicht doktrinäre Kategorie: Gegensätzliche Moralformen gehören zusammen, sofern sie Abstand vom gegenwärtigen Leben organisieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:D1","CH_97E9_VDPD:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:GA-02","text":"[Mutating] Leiden, Tod und Schwäche widerlegen nicht das Leben, sondern werden zum Prüfpunkt dafür, ob ein Blick partikulare Negativität totalisiert oder in eine größere Lebensbewegung integriert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:SD5","CH_97E9_VDPD:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:GA-03","text":"[Persistent] Der zentrale Gegensatz verläuft nicht zwischen Aktivität und Passivität, sondern zwischen lebenshaltendem Verweilen und beschleunigter Selbstentbindung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:SD3","CH_97E9_VDPD:D9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:GA-04","text":"[Mutating] Mitleid, Tugend, Arbeit, Frieden und Erlösung verlieren ihre Selbstlegitimation, sobald sie als Mittel der Flucht, Disziplinierung oder Massenbindung fungieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:ME3","CH_97E9_VKUK:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:GA-05","text":"[Attractor] Der Gegner ist nicht bloß zu beseitigen, sondern konstituiert die Möglichkeit von Prüfung, Größe, Redlichkeit und Selbstüberwindung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:D7","CH_97E9_VKUK:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:GA-06","text":"[Emergent] Das Subjekt ist keine autonome Substanz, sondern eine prekäre Übergangsform, die durch Befehl, Widerstand, Dauer und Selbstüberwindung geformt wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:SD2","CH_97E9_VKUK:D11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:GA-07","text":"[Mutating] Staatliche Ordnung erscheint als technische Umkehrung des Lebens: Sie usurpiert Volk, Sprache, Tugend und Besitz, um die Vielen als verfügbare Masse zu verarbeiten.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:D3","CH_97E9_VNGT:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:GA-08","text":"[Terminal] Befreiung verlangt nicht die Eroberung des Zentrums, sondern Distanz zu jenen Formen, die Tod, Gehorsam und Selbstverlust als Leben ausgeben.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:SD4","CH_97E9_VNGT:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:GA-09","text":"[Tension] Gehorsam kann eine Form der Formung sein, wird aber destruktiv, wenn er nicht Überwindung ermöglicht, sondern staatliche oder moralische Unterwerfung stabilisiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:D8","CH_97E9_VNGT:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:GA-10","text":"[Attractor] Der nichtüberflüssige Mensch bezeichnet keinen erreichten Zustand, sondern die Schwelle einer Existenz, die weder Masse noch Schonung noch bloße Selbsterhaltung als Ziel anerkennt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:A16","CH_97E9_VKUK:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_07:RMD-01","text":"Der Tod kehrt zunächst als wörtliche Lebensbeendigung wieder, mutiert dann zur beschleunigten Entbindung und wird schließlich als staatlich organisierte Selbstauflösung der Vielen politisiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:D10","CH_97E9_VNGT:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:RMD-02","text":"Mitleid wiederholt sich nicht als stabile Tugend: Es erscheint zuerst als mögliche Bindungstechnik und wird auf Clusterebene in den Vorrang von Tapferkeit und Prüfung umcodiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:D6","CH_97E9_VKUK:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:RMD-03","text":"Arbeit verschiebt sich von rastloser Selbstflucht zu einer kriegerisch umdefinierten Tätigkeit und wird im Staat zur Verwertungsform der Überflüssigen absorbiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:D8","CH_97E9_VKUK:D3","CH_97E9_VNGT:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:RMD-04","text":"Frieden verliert die Stellung eines Gegenbegriffs zum Tod und zum Krieg: Als Flucht ist er lebensverneinend, als kurzer Sieg wird er taktisch, als Staatsordnung wird er verdächtig.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:DNX4","CH_97E9_VKUK:D4","CH_97E9_VKUK:DNX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:RMD-05","text":"Das Volk bleibt Träger schöpferischer Eigenart, während der Staat dessen Namen übernimmt, seine Sprache simuliert und die produktive Vielheit in verwaltete Masse umkehrt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:A2","CH_97E9_VNGT:D1","CH_97E9_VNGT:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:RMD-06","text":"Selbstüberwindung mutiert von individueller Kampfaufgabe zu einer nachstaatlichen Grenzfigur, deren Möglichkeit durch die Entfernung von massenförmiger Verfügung offenbleiben soll.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:D11","CH_97E9_VNGT:SD5","CH_97E9_VNGT:FGS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_07:CGD-01","text":"Die konkreten Figuren des Selbsttöters, Asketen, rastlos Arbeitenden und Mitleidigen bleiben lokale Ausprägungen; auf Clusterebene zählen sie nur als unterschiedliche Medien derselben Entbindungslogik.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:SD2","CH_97E9_VDPD:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:CGD-02","text":"Die Unterscheidung Soldat/Kriegsmann bleibt lokal, wird aber global relevant, weil sie den Übergang von äußerer Zugehörigkeit zu einer durch Widerstand geformten Existenz markiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:D2","CH_97E9_VKUK:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:CGD-03","text":"Die staatliche Polemik gegen Besitz, Zeitung, Thron und Bildung bleibt lokal, sofern sie einzelne Symptome bezeichnet; global wird sie als Diagnose einer Apparatur der Umbenennung und Aneignung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:A14","CH_97E9_VNGT:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:CGD-04","text":"Auf Clusterebene skaliert allein die Unterscheidung zwischen lebensdienlicher Formung und lebensverneinender Erfassung über individuelle, moralische, militärische und politische Bereiche hinweg.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:ALT2","CH_97E9_VKUK:ALT2","CH_97E9_VNGT:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:CGD-05","text":"Die positive Begriffsreste von Warten, Tapferkeit, freier Einsamkeit und geringer Armut werden nicht zu einem vollständigen Programm synthetisiert, sondern als verstreute Bedingungen einer nichtüberflüssigen Existenz erhalten.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:MRT2","CH_97E9_VNGT:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_07:GNX-01","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird jede Lehre, die aus Leiden, Endlichkeit oder Tod ein gültiges Gesamturteil gegen das Leben ableitet.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:DNX1","CH_97E9_VDPD:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:GNX-02","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Annahme, moralische Selbstbeschreibungen wie Mitleid, Tugend, Frieden oder Erlösung beglaubigten bereits die lebensfördernde Funktion einer Praxis.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:NX6","CH_97E9_VKUK:NX1","CH_97E9_VNGT:NX7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:GNX-03","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird ein konfliktfreier Maßstab von Wahrheit, Größe und Erkenntnis, der weder Feind noch Prüfung noch Selbstüberwindung voraussetzt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:DNX2","CH_97E9_VKUK:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:GNX-04","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird ein Staat, der Leben repräsentieren könnte, ohne Volk, Sprache, Tugend und Vielheit in eine Ordnung der Aneignung zu überführen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:DNX1","CH_97E9_VNGT:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_07:DBN-01","text":"Das System kann keine neutrale Vermittlungsinstanz zulassen: Jede Instanz, die sich als allgemeine Rettung, Ordnung oder Wahrheit ausgibt, muss nach ihrer Funktion für Leben oder Entbindung geprüft werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:DNX7","CH_97E9_VNGT:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:DBN-02","text":"Unzulässig ist ein Selbst, das seine eigene Erschöpfung, seinen Willen oder seine moralische Absicht als letzten Maßstab ausgeben kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:DNX2","CH_97E9_VKUK:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:DBN-03","text":"Unzulässig ist eine Kollektivform, in der Vielheit ohne Umschlag in Masse, Verfügbarkeit oder Selbstverlust institutionell gesichert werden könnte.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:DNX5","CH_97E9_VNGT:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_07:BSA-01","text":"Der Cluster kreist um die nicht verfügbare Möglichkeit einer Lebensform, die zugleich gemeinschaftsfähig, konfliktfähig und frei von massenhafter Erfassung wäre.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:SNX6","CH_97E9_VNGT:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:BSA-02","text":"Nicht verfügbar bleibt ein endgültiger Frieden, weil Frieden entweder als Flucht, taktische Zwischenzeit oder staatliche Lüge fungiert, nie aber als selbstgenügsame Versöhnung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:SD3","CH_97E9_VKUK:A8","CH_97E9_VKUK:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:BSA-03","text":"Nicht verfügbar bleibt eine positive institutionelle Gestalt nach dem Staat; die Architektur kann Distanz und Übergang bestimmen, aber keine dauerhafte politische Vermittlung ausformulieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:SNX3","CH_97E9_VNGT:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_07:XD-01","text":"Die Todespredigt und der neue Götze bilden eine gemeinsame Umbenennungsmaschine: Was als Rettung, Leben oder Ordnung erscheint, kann funktional die organisierte Entbindung vom Leben vollziehen.","refs":["CL_97E9_07:GA-01","CL_97E9_07:GA-07","CH_97E9_VDPD:D10","CH_97E9_VNGT:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:XD-02","text":"Der kriegerische Imperativ bildet ein Gegenmittel gegen passive Lebensmüdigkeit nur unter der Bedingung, dass der Kampf auf Selbstüberwindung gerichtet bleibt und nicht als staatliche Opferökonomie vereinnahmt wird.","refs":["CL_97E9_07:GA-05","CL_97E9_07:GA-09","CH_97E9_VKUK:SD3","CH_97E9_VNGT:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:XD-03","text":"Der Begriff des Überflüssigen entsteht aus der Verbindung von individueller Lebensflucht und politischer Verarbeitung: Er bezeichnet den Menschen, dessen Müdigkeit als Masse verwertbar wird.","refs":["CL_97E9_07:GA-01","CL_97E9_07:GA-07","CH_97E9_VDPD:SD1","CH_97E9_VNGT:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:XD-04","text":"Die Zurückweisung von Mitleid, Schonung und langem Frieden ist keine bloße Härteethik, sondern eine negative Sicherung gegen jede Form, in der Erhaltung zur Verhinderung von Überwindung wird.","refs":["CL_97E9_07:GA-04","CL_97E9_07:GA-06","CH_97E9_VKUK:A11","CH_97E9_VKUK:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:XD-05","text":"Der strategische Austritt aus dem Staat ist nur dann kohärent, wenn er nicht in eine weitere Flucht vor sich selbst zurückfällt, sondern innere Dauer und nichtüberflüssige Selbstformung ermöglicht.","refs":["CL_97E9_07:GA-03","CL_97E9_07:GA-08","CH_97E9_VDPD:SD6","CH_97E9_VNGT:D8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_07:BSD-01","text":"Das System erzeugt eine allgemeine Theorie der Verkehrung: Institutionen und Tugenden werden nicht nach ihrem Namen, sondern danach bewertet, ob sie Lebenskraft in Flucht, Masse oder Opferung umwandeln.","refs":["CL_97E9_07:GA-01","CL_97E9_07:GA-04","CL_97E9_07:GA-07","CH_97E9_VDPD:ME3","CH_97E9_VNGT:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:BSD-02","text":"Realität erscheint als Feld konkurrierender Formungen, in dem Tod nicht nur biologisches Ende, sondern eine soziale und zeitliche Operation der Entbindung, Beschleunigung und Verwertung ist.","refs":["CL_97E9_07:GA-02","CL_97E9_07:GA-03","CL_97E9_07:GA-07","CH_97E9_VDPD:SD3","CH_97E9_VNGT:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:BSD-03","text":"Geschichte ist kein Fortschritt zur Sicherung des Menschen, sondern eine selektive Passage, in der Menschliches entweder zur Masse erstarrt oder zur Überwindungsbrücke wird.","refs":["CL_97E9_07:GA-06","CL_97E9_07:GA-10","CH_97E9_VKUK:ME6","CH_97E9_VNGT:ME7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:BSD-04","text":"Handlungsmacht besteht weder in souveräner Willkür noch in Unterwerfung, sondern in der Fähigkeit, Befehle, Feinde und Zwänge in eine gerichtete Praxis der Selbstüberwindung umzuwandeln.","refs":["CL_97E9_07:GA-05","CL_97E9_07:GA-09","CH_97E9_VKUK:D8","CH_97E9_VKUK:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_07:RLE-01","text":"Leiden → totalisierendes Urteil → Fluchtvorschrift → soziale Bindung → verstärkte Lebensmüdigkeit bildet die rekursive Schleife der Todespredigt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:FGS1","CH_97E9_VDPD:FGS3","CH_97E9_VDPD:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:RLE-02","text":"Feind → Prüfung → Tapferkeit → Gehorsam → Selbstüberwindung bildet die gegenläufige Formierungsschleife, deren Ziel nie als abgeschlossene Identität erreicht wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:FGS3","CH_97E9_VKUK:FGS6","CH_97E9_VKUK:FGS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:RLE-03","text":"Müdigkeit → staatliche Vereinnahmung → Masse → Selbstverlust → weitere Müdigkeit bildet die politische Eskalationsschleife des neuen Götzen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:D5","CH_97E9_VNGT:FGS3","CH_97E9_VNGT:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:RLE-04","text":"Der Attraktor des Clusters ist die nichtüberflüssige Existenz: Sie zieht Warten, Kampf, Einsamkeit, geringe Armut und Überwindung zusammen, ohne sie zu einem positiven Endzustand zu schließen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:A16","CH_97E9_VDPD:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_07:FGS-B01","text":"Partikulare Schwäche oder Müdigkeit wird isoliert und als Urteil über Leben, Frieden, Gemeinschaft oder Menschheit ausgegeben.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:FGS1","CH_97E9_VNGT:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:FGS-B02","text":"Das Urteil wird durch Moral, Religion, Arbeit, Krieg oder Staat in eine Vorschrift zur Formierung anderer Leben übersetzt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:FGS3","CH_97E9_VKUK:SD1","CH_97E9_VNGT:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:FGS-B03","text":"Die Vorschrift wird funktional geprüft: Sie gilt als lebensverneinend, wenn sie Flucht, Beschleunigung, Schonung, Masse oder Selbstauflösung produziert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:FGS4","CH_97E9_VDPD:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:FGS-B04","text":"Gegen die Entbindungslogik wird eine Formierungslogik gesetzt, die Gegner, Prüfung, Dauer und Selbstüberwindung als Bedingungen von Größe behandelt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:FGS3","CH_97E9_VKUK:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:FGS-B05","text":"Diese Formierungslogik kippt in ihr Gegenteil, sobald Krieg, Tugend oder Gehorsam von einem Apparat monopolisiert und in massenhafte Opferung übersetzt werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:MRT7","CH_97E9_VNGT:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:FGS-B06","text":"Die verbleibende Öffnung lautet: Distanz zu den Apparaten der Umkehrung ermöglicht eine noch unbestimmte, aber nichtüberflüssige Form des Menschlichen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:FGS7","CH_97E9_VNGT:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_07:AFM-B01","text":"Partikulare Erschöpfung → Totalurteil gegen das Leben → moralische und soziale Todespredigt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:D2","CH_97E9_VDPD:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:AFM-B02","text":"Todespredigt → funktionale Entlarvung von Askese, Mitleid, Arbeit und Erlösung → zeitliche Achse von Verweilen und Entbindung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:SD2","CH_97E9_VDPD:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:AFM-B03","text":"Entbindungslogik → Gegenform des kriegerischen Prüfens → Feind, Tapferkeit und Gehorsam als Selbstüberwindungsdisziplin.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:FGS3","CH_97E9_VKUK:FGS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:AFM-B04","text":"Selbstüberwindungsdisziplin → Gefahr ihrer politischen Aneignung → Staat als Verarbeiter von Tugend, Müdigkeit und Masse.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:A12","CH_97E9_VNGT:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:AFM-B05","text":"Staatliche Selbstauflösung → Entfernung vom Zentrum → nichtüberflüssiger Mensch als offene Brücke jenseits der staatlichen Lebensform.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:SD4","CH_97E9_VNGT:AF4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_07:MME-01","text":"Die Karte ersetzt den Gegensatz Leben/Tod durch die präzisere Unterscheidung zwischen lebenshaltender Dauer und allen Formen beschleunigter Entbindung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:ME4","CH_97E9_VDPD:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:MME-02","text":"Die Karte ersetzt den Gegensatz Aktivität/Passivität durch die Unterscheidung zwischen schöpferischer Formung und rastloser Selbstflucht.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:D8","CH_97E9_VNGT:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:MME-03","text":"Die Karte ersetzt den Gegensatz Krieg/Frieden durch eine Prüfung ihrer Funktionen: Kampf kann Überwindung ermöglichen, Frieden kann taktisch sein, und beide können in lebensverneinende Organisation umschlagen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:D4","CH_97E9_VKUK:SD6","CH_97E9_VNGT:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:MME-04","text":"Die Karte ersetzt politische Repräsentation durch eine Unterscheidung von schöpferischer Vielheit und staatlicher Aneignung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:D1","CH_97E9_VNGT:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:MME-05","text":"Die Karte ersetzt Autonomie durch eine differenzierte Theorie der Formung, in der Selbstüberwindung möglich bleibt, aber weder als bloßer Eigenwille noch als institutioneller Gehorsam verstanden werden kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:DNX4","CH_97E9_VKUK:ME4","CH_97E9_VNGT:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_07:ALT-B01","text":"Surface level — Sichtbar sind Todesprediger, Kriegsmänner, Feinde, Überflüssige, Volk und Staat als polemische Figuren eines Kampfes um die Bedeutung des Lebens.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:ALT1","CH_97E9_VKUK:ALT1","CH_97E9_VNGT:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:ALT-B02","text":"Structural level — Die Figuren werden durch wiederkehrende Operationen der Totalisierung, Umbenennung, Bindung, Prüfung, Aneignung und Selbstauflösung verbunden.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:ALT2","CH_97E9_VKUK:ALT2","CH_97E9_VNGT:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:ALT-B03","text":"Metastrategic level — Das System verlegt Kritik von moralischen Namen auf Funktionen und verlegt politischen Kampf von der Zentrumseroberung auf Distanz, Selektion und Selbstformung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:ALT3","CH_97E9_VNGT:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:ALT-B04","text":"Ontological / Temporal level — Realität erscheint als unabschließbarer Übergang, in dem Leben Dauer und Vielheit tragen muss, während Menschsein eine noch zu überschreitende Zwischenform bleibt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:ALT4","CH_97E9_VKUK:ALT4","CH_97E9_VNGT:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:ALT-B05","text":"Methodological / Performative level — Die Rede vollzieht ihre eigene Methode, indem sie scheinbar positive Werte gegen ihre Funktionen kehrt und dadurch den Leser in eine dauernde Diagnosehaltung zwingt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:ALT3","CH_97E9_VDPD:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_07:FL-01","text":"Die Kritik totalisierender Urteile über das Leben erzeugt selbst ein totalisierendes Urteil über Todesprediger, staatliche Ordnung und die Überflüssigen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:MRT6","CH_97E9_VNGT:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:FL-02","text":"Die privilegierte Stellung des Krieges bleibt instabil, weil Krieg zugleich als Form der Selbstüberwindung und als Modell der staatlichen Opferung auftreten kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:SD6","CH_97E9_VNGT:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:FL-03","text":"Die positive Alternative bleibt unterbestimmt: Warten, Einsamkeit, Armut und Überwindung werden affirmiert, ohne ihre gemeinschaftliche oder institutionelle Vermittlung zu bestimmen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:MRT2","CH_97E9_VNGT:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:MP-01","text":"Der Tod mutiert von einem Ereignis des Endes zu einer Funktionskategorie, die Selbstmord, Jenseitshoffnung, hektische Flucht und staatlich organisiertes Sterben zusammenliest.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:D10","CH_97E9_VNGT:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:MP-02","text":"Gehorsam mutiert von Unterordnung zu Vornehmheit, bleibt aber brüchig, weil nicht entschieden wird, wie ein überwindender Befehl von einem vereinnahmenden Befehl unterschieden werden kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:D8","CH_97E9_VKUK:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:MP-03","text":"Tugend mutiert von schöpferischer Kraft zu politischem Köder; dadurch bleibt offen, ob irgendeine soziale Anerkennung von Tugend ihrer Vereinnahmung entgehen kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:D6","CH_97E9_VNGT:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_07:HSI-01","text":"Realität erscheint als Feld von Apparaten und Übergängen, in dem Begriffe nicht bloß beschreiben, sondern Kräfte der Bindung, Entbindung, Formung und Vereinnahmung ausüben.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:SD4","CH_97E9_VNGT:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:HSI-02","text":"Das Subjekt erscheint als durchlässige Kampfzone zwischen Müdigkeit, Flucht, Befehl, Feindschaft und der noch nicht gesicherten Fähigkeit zur Selbstüberwindung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:SD2","CH_97E9_VDPD:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:HSI-03","text":"Zeit erscheint als Konflikt zwischen beschleunigtem Abschied und tragfähigem Verweilen; Zukunft entsteht nicht aus Fortschritt, sondern aus dem Aushalten einer unvollendeten Überwindung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:SD6","CH_97E9_VKUK:D11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:HSI-04","text":"Kampf bleibt möglich als Navigation zwischen der staatlichen Maschine der Überflüssigkeit und einer nichtinstitutionalisierten Praxis von Distanz, Härte und freier Einsamkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:SD4","CH_97E9_VNGT:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_07:MRT-B01","text":"Die globalen Axiome reichen aus, um die gemeinsame Bewegung von Lebensdiagnose über kriegerische Umformung bis zur staatlichen Verkehrung und nachstaatlichen Öffnung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:MRT8","CH_97E9_VKUK:MRT8","CH_97E9_VNGT:MRT9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:MRT-B02","text":"Die Architektur ist am stärksten, wo sie heterogene Werte nach ihren Wirkungen statt nach ihrer Selbstbeschreibung klassifiziert und dadurch moralische Gegensätze funktional neu ordnet.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:MRT3","CH_97E9_VKUK:MRT4","CH_97E9_VNGT:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:MRT-B03","text":"Unterbestimmt bleiben die positive Ontologie des bejahten Lebens, die Kriterien eines nicht vereinnahmenden Gehorsams und die kollektive Form einer nachstaatlichen Welt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:MRT2","CH_97E9_VKUK:MRT2","CH_97E9_VNGT:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:MRT-B04","text":"Die Rekonstruktion hängt notwendig von produktiver Kompression ab: Sie muss Tod, Krieg und Staat als miteinander verschränkte Funktionsfelder lesen, ohne ihre irreduziblen Spannungen in eine widerspruchsfreie Doktrin aufzulösen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:MRT5","CH_97E9_VKUK:MRT7","CH_97E9_VNGT:MRT7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T195939307539Z_6803a6b3","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Chapters 19–21","source_sha256":"9ead853f9e1cade1a7b94b793cff6c08d72d8818a6a9bd234240dcf7451aff70","sha256":"3231296cd9a13e195f0046f782688133f9e66bbf03c9378952a31ca92e7a1d2b","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T19:59:39.308790+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_07:AS-01","text":"The system diagnoses life-denial not as mere death-wish, but as a variable technique that transforms suffering, peace, morality, work, state, and redemption into forms of release from life.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:AS6","CH_97E9_VNGT:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:AS-02","text":"It replaces the moral evaluation of individual attitudes with a functional analysis: decisive is whether a practice sustains life, self-overcoming, and creative multiplicity, or transfers them into acceleration, mass-binding, and self-dissolution.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:FGS4","CH_97E9_VNGT:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:AS-03","text":"The positive counter-movement consists not in protection, peace, or institutional security, but in a hard affirmation that endures duration, enmity, danger, solitude, and overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:SD6","CH_97E9_VKUK:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:AS-04","text":"The movement is spiral-shaped: private exhaustion becomes preaching, preaching becomes social form, social form becomes state capture, and state capture becomes the obstacle to a non-superfluous existence.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:SD1","CH_97E9_VNGT:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:AS-05","text":"War functions as an ambivalent form of selection: it can open self-overcoming, honesty, and the future, but can at the same time turn into the life-denying language of collective sacrifice.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:SD3","CH_97E9_VNGT:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:AS-06","text":"The provisional closure lies in withdrawing from the apparatuses of accelerated disappearance in favor of a form of life that dissolves neither itself nor others into superfluity, protection, or mass.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:SD4","CH_97E9_VDPD:SNX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_07:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Life-denial is a functional, not a doctrinal category: opposed moral forms belong together insofar as they organize distance from present life.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:D1","CH_97E9_VDPD:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:GA-02","text":"[Mutating] Suffering, death, and weakness do not refute life, but become the test of whether a perspective totalizes particular negativity or integrates it into a larger movement of life.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:SD5","CH_97E9_VDPD:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:GA-03","text":"[Persistent] The central opposition runs not between activity and passivity, but between life-sustaining abiding and accelerated self-release.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:SD3","CH_97E9_VDPD:D9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:GA-04","text":"[Mutating] Compassion, virtue, work, peace, and redemption lose their self-legitimation as soon as they function as means of flight, disciplining, or mass-binding.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:ME3","CH_97E9_VKUK:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:GA-05","text":"[Attractor] The enemy is not merely to be eliminated, but constitutes the possibility of testing, greatness, honesty, and self-overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:D7","CH_97E9_VKUK:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:GA-06","text":"[Emergent] The subject is not an autonomous substance, but a precarious transitional form shaped through command, resistance, duration, and self-overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:SD2","CH_97E9_VKUK:D11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:GA-07","text":"[Mutating] State order appears as a technical inversion of life: it usurps people, language, virtue, and property in order to process the many as an available mass.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:D3","CH_97E9_VNGT:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:GA-08","text":"[Terminal] Liberation does not demand the conquest of the center, but distance from those forms that pass off death, obedience, and self-loss as life.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:SD4","CH_97E9_VNGT:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:GA-09","text":"[Tension] Obedience can be a form of formation, but becomes destructive when it does not enable overcoming, but stabilizes state or moral subjection.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:D8","CH_97E9_VNGT:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:GA-10","text":"[Attractor] The non-superfluous human being denotes not an attained state, but the threshold of an existence that recognizes neither mass nor protection nor mere self-preservation as its goal.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:A16","CH_97E9_VKUK:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_07:RMD-01","text":"Death initially recurs as literal termination of life, then mutates into accelerated release, and is finally politicized as the state-organized self-dissolution of the many.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:D10","CH_97E9_VNGT:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:RMD-02","text":"Compassion does not recur as a stable virtue: it first appears as a possible technique of binding and is recoded at the cluster level into the priority of courage and testing.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:D6","CH_97E9_VKUK:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:RMD-03","text":"Work shifts from restless flight from oneself to an activity redefined in martial terms, and is absorbed in the state as a form of exploitation of the superfluous.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:D8","CH_97E9_VKUK:D3","CH_97E9_VNGT:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:RMD-04","text":"Peace loses the status of a counter-concept to death and war: as flight, it is life-denying; as a brief victory, it is tactical; as state order, it is suspect.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:DNX4","CH_97E9_VKUK:D4","CH_97E9_VKUK:DNX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:RMD-05","text":"The people remains the bearer of creative distinctiveness, while the state takes over its name, simulates its language, and inverts productive multiplicity into administered mass.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:A2","CH_97E9_VNGT:D1","CH_97E9_VNGT:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:RMD-06","text":"Self-overcoming mutates from an individual task of struggle into a post-state boundary figure, whose possibility is to remain open through removal from mass-form availability.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:D11","CH_97E9_VNGT:SD5","CH_97E9_VNGT:FGS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_07:CGD-01","text":"The concrete figures of the suicide, ascetic, restless worker, and compassionate person remain local manifestations; at the cluster level, they count only as different media of the same logic of release.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:SD2","CH_97E9_VDPD:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:CGD-02","text":"The distinction between soldier and man of war remains local, but becomes globally relevant because it marks the transition from external affiliation to an existence shaped through resistance.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:D2","CH_97E9_VKUK:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:CGD-03","text":"The state polemic against property, newspaper, throne, and education remains local insofar as it designates individual symptoms; globally, it becomes a diagnosis of an apparatus of renaming and appropriation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:A14","CH_97E9_VNGT:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:CGD-04","text":"At the cluster level, only the distinction between life-serving formation and life-denying capture scales across individual, moral, military, and political domains.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:ALT2","CH_97E9_VKUK:ALT2","CH_97E9_VNGT:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:CGD-05","text":"The positive conceptual remnants of waiting, courage, free solitude, and modest poverty are not synthesized into a complete program, but preserved as scattered conditions of a non-superfluous existence.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:MRT2","CH_97E9_VNGT:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_07:GNX-01","text":"Excluded is every doctrine that derives from suffering, finitude, or death a valid total judgment against life.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:DNX1","CH_97E9_VDPD:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:GNX-02","text":"Excluded is the assumption that moral self-descriptions such as compassion, virtue, peace, or redemption already certify the life-promoting function of a practice.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:NX6","CH_97E9_VKUK:NX1","CH_97E9_VNGT:NX7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:GNX-03","text":"Excluded is a conflict-free standard of truth, greatness, and knowledge that presupposes neither enemy nor testing nor self-overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:DNX2","CH_97E9_VKUK:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:GNX-04","text":"Excluded is a state that could represent life without transferring people, language, virtue, and multiplicity into an order of appropriation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:DNX1","CH_97E9_VNGT:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_07:DBN-01","text":"The system cannot permit a neutral mediating instance: every instance that presents itself as general salvation, order, or truth must be examined according to its function for life or release.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:DNX7","CH_97E9_VNGT:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:DBN-02","text":"Inadmissible is a self that can present its own exhaustion, its will, or its moral intention as the ultimate standard.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:DNX2","CH_97E9_VKUK:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:DBN-03","text":"Inadmissible is a collective form in which multiplicity could be institutionally secured without turning into mass, availability, or self-loss.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:DNX5","CH_97E9_VNGT:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_07:BSA-01","text":"The cluster revolves around the unavailable possibility of a form of life that would at once be capable of community, capable of conflict, and free of mass capture.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:SNX6","CH_97E9_VNGT:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:BSA-02","text":"A final peace remains unavailable, because peace functions either as flight, as a tactical interim period, or as a state lie, but never as self-sufficient reconciliation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:SD3","CH_97E9_VKUK:A8","CH_97E9_VKUK:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:BSA-03","text":"A positive institutional form after the state remains unavailable; the architecture can determine distance and transition, but cannot elaborate lasting political mediation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:SNX3","CH_97E9_VNGT:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_07:XD-01","text":"The preaching of death and the new idol form a shared machine of renaming: what appears as salvation, life, or order can functionally effect the organized release from life.","refs":["CL_97E9_07:GA-01","CL_97E9_07:GA-07","CH_97E9_VDPD:D10","CH_97E9_VNGT:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:XD-02","text":"The martial imperative forms an antidote to passive weariness of life only on the condition that struggle remains directed toward self-overcoming and is not appropriated as a state economy of sacrifice.","refs":["CL_97E9_07:GA-05","CL_97E9_07:GA-09","CH_97E9_VKUK:SD3","CH_97E9_VNGT:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:XD-03","text":"The concept of the superfluous emerges from the connection between individual flight from life and political processing: it denotes the human being whose weariness becomes exploitable as mass.","refs":["CL_97E9_07:GA-01","CL_97E9_07:GA-07","CH_97E9_VDPD:SD1","CH_97E9_VNGT:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:XD-04","text":"The rejection of compassion, protection, and long peace is not mere ethics of hardness, but a negative safeguard against every form in which preservation becomes the prevention of overcoming.","refs":["CL_97E9_07:GA-04","CL_97E9_07:GA-06","CH_97E9_VKUK:A11","CH_97E9_VKUK:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:XD-05","text":"The strategic withdrawal from the state is coherent only if it does not relapse into a further flight from oneself, but enables inner duration and non-superfluous self-formation.","refs":["CL_97E9_07:GA-03","CL_97E9_07:GA-08","CH_97E9_VDPD:SD6","CH_97E9_VNGT:D8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_07:BSD-01","text":"The system produces a general theory of inversion: institutions and virtues are evaluated not according to their name, but according to whether they transform life-force into flight, mass, or sacrifice.","refs":["CL_97E9_07:GA-01","CL_97E9_07:GA-04","CL_97E9_07:GA-07","CH_97E9_VDPD:ME3","CH_97E9_VNGT:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:BSD-02","text":"Reality appears as a field of competing formations in which death is not merely biological end, but a social and temporal operation of release, acceleration, and exploitation.","refs":["CL_97E9_07:GA-02","CL_97E9_07:GA-03","CL_97E9_07:GA-07","CH_97E9_VDPD:SD3","CH_97E9_VNGT:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:BSD-03","text":"History is not progress toward securing the human being, but a selective passage in which the human either congeals into mass or becomes a bridge of overcoming.","refs":["CL_97E9_07:GA-06","CL_97E9_07:GA-10","CH_97E9_VKUK:ME6","CH_97E9_VNGT:ME7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:BSD-04","text":"Power to act consists neither in sovereign arbitrariness nor in subjection, but in the capacity to transform commands, enemies, and constraints into a directed practice of self-overcoming.","refs":["CL_97E9_07:GA-05","CL_97E9_07:GA-09","CH_97E9_VKUK:D8","CH_97E9_VKUK:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_07:RLE-01","text":"Suffering → totalizing judgment → prescription of flight → social binding → intensified weariness of life forms the recursive loop of the preaching of death.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:FGS1","CH_97E9_VDPD:FGS3","CH_97E9_VDPD:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:RLE-02","text":"Enemy → testing → courage → obedience → self-overcoming forms the countervailing loop of formation, whose goal is never attained as a completed identity.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:FGS3","CH_97E9_VKUK:FGS6","CH_97E9_VKUK:FGS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:RLE-03","text":"Weariness → state appropriation → mass → self-loss → further weariness forms the political escalation loop of the new idol.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:D5","CH_97E9_VNGT:FGS3","CH_97E9_VNGT:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:RLE-04","text":"The attractor of the cluster is non-superfluous existence: it draws together waiting, struggle, solitude, modest poverty, and overcoming without closing them into a positive final state.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:A16","CH_97E9_VDPD:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_07:FGS-B01","text":"Particular weakness or weariness is isolated and presented as a judgment on life, peace, community, or humanity.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:FGS1","CH_97E9_VNGT:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:FGS-B02","text":"The judgment is translated through morality, religion, work, war, or state into a prescription for forming other lives.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:FGS3","CH_97E9_VKUK:SD1","CH_97E9_VNGT:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:FGS-B03","text":"The prescription is tested functionally: it counts as life-denying if it produces flight, acceleration, protection, mass, or self-dissolution.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:FGS4","CH_97E9_VDPD:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:FGS-B04","text":"Against the logic of release is set a logic of formation that treats enemy, testing, duration, and self-overcoming as conditions of greatness.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:FGS3","CH_97E9_VKUK:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:FGS-B05","text":"This logic of formation tips into its opposite as soon as war, virtue, or obedience are monopolized by an apparatus and translated into mass sacrifice.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:MRT7","CH_97E9_VNGT:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:FGS-B06","text":"The remaining opening is: distance from the apparatuses of inversion enables a still indeterminate, but non-superfluous form of the human.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:FGS7","CH_97E9_VNGT:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_07:AFM-B01","text":"Particular exhaustion → total judgment against life → moral and social preaching of death.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:D2","CH_97E9_VDPD:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:AFM-B02","text":"Preaching of death → functional unmasking of asceticism, compassion, work, and redemption → temporal axis of abiding and release.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:SD2","CH_97E9_VDPD:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:AFM-B03","text":"Logic of release → counter-form of martial testing → enemy, courage, and obedience as discipline of self-overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:FGS3","CH_97E9_VKUK:FGS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:AFM-B04","text":"Discipline of self-overcoming → danger of its political appropriation → state as processor of virtue, weariness, and mass.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:A12","CH_97E9_VNGT:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:AFM-B05","text":"State self-dissolution → removal from the center → non-superfluous human being as an open bridge beyond the state form of life.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:SD4","CH_97E9_VNGT:AF4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_07:MME-01","text":"The map replaces the opposition life/death with the more precise distinction between life-sustaining duration and all forms of accelerated release.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:ME4","CH_97E9_VDPD:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:MME-02","text":"The map replaces the opposition activity/passivity with the distinction between creative formation and restless flight from oneself.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:D8","CH_97E9_VNGT:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:MME-03","text":"The map replaces the opposition war/peace with an examination of their functions: struggle can enable overcoming, peace can be tactical, and both can turn into life-denying organization.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:D4","CH_97E9_VKUK:SD6","CH_97E9_VNGT:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:MME-04","text":"The map replaces political representation with a distinction between creative multiplicity and state appropriation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:D1","CH_97E9_VNGT:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:MME-05","text":"The map replaces autonomy with a differentiated theory of formation, in which self-overcoming remains possible but can be understood neither as mere individual will nor as institutional obedience.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:DNX4","CH_97E9_VKUK:ME4","CH_97E9_VNGT:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_07:ALT-B01","text":"Surface level — Visible are preachers of death, men of war, enemies, the superfluous, people, and state as polemical figures of a struggle over the meaning of life.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:ALT1","CH_97E9_VKUK:ALT1","CH_97E9_VNGT:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:ALT-B02","text":"Structural level — The figures are connected through recurring operations of totalization, renaming, binding, testing, appropriation, and self-dissolution.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:ALT2","CH_97E9_VKUK:ALT2","CH_97E9_VNGT:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:ALT-B03","text":"Metastrategic level — The system shifts critique from moral names to functions and shifts political struggle from conquering the center to distance, selection, and self-formation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:ALT3","CH_97E9_VNGT:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:ALT-B04","text":"Ontological / Temporal level — Reality appears as an unfinishable transition in which life must sustain duration and multiplicity, while being human remains an intermediate form yet to be surpassed.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:ALT4","CH_97E9_VKUK:ALT4","CH_97E9_VNGT:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:ALT-B05","text":"Methodological / Performative level — The discourse performs its own method by turning seemingly positive values against their functions and thereby compelling the reader into a stance of continuous diagnosis.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:ALT3","CH_97E9_VDPD:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_07:FL-01","text":"The critique of totalizing judgments about life itself produces a totalizing judgment about preachers of death, state order, and the superfluous.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:MRT6","CH_97E9_VNGT:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:FL-02","text":"The privileged position of war remains unstable, because war can appear both as a form of self-overcoming and as a model of state sacrifice.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:SD6","CH_97E9_VNGT:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:FL-03","text":"The positive alternative remains underdetermined: waiting, solitude, poverty, and overcoming are affirmed without determining their communal or institutional mediation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:MRT2","CH_97E9_VNGT:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:MP-01","text":"Death mutates from an event of ending into a functional category that reads together suicide, hope for the beyond, hectic flight, and state-organized dying.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:D10","CH_97E9_VNGT:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:MP-02","text":"Obedience mutates from subordination into nobility, but remains fragile because it is not decided how a command that overcomes can be distinguished from an appropriating command.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:D8","CH_97E9_VKUK:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:MP-03","text":"Virtue mutates from creative force into political bait; it therefore remains open whether any social recognition of virtue can escape its appropriation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:D6","CH_97E9_VNGT:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_07:HSI-01","text":"Reality appears as a field of apparatuses and transitions in which concepts do not merely describe, but exert forces of binding, release, formation, and appropriation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:SD4","CH_97E9_VNGT:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:HSI-02","text":"The subject appears as a permeable zone of struggle between weariness, flight, command, enmity, and the not-yet-secured capacity for self-overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUK:SD2","CH_97E9_VDPD:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:HSI-03","text":"Time appears as a conflict between accelerated departure and sustainable abiding; the future arises not from progress, but from enduring an unfinished overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:SD6","CH_97E9_VKUK:D11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:HSI-04","text":"Struggle remains possible as navigation between the state machine of superfluity and a non-institutionalized practice of distance, hardness, and free solitude.","refs":["CH_97E9_VNGT:SD4","CH_97E9_VNGT:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_07:MRT-B01","text":"The global axioms suffice to reconstruct the shared movement from the diagnosis of life through martial reshaping to state inversion and post-state opening.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:MRT8","CH_97E9_VKUK:MRT8","CH_97E9_VNGT:MRT9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:MRT-B02","text":"The architecture is strongest where it classifies heterogeneous values according to their effects rather than their self-description, and thereby functionally reorders moral oppositions.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:MRT3","CH_97E9_VKUK:MRT4","CH_97E9_VNGT:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:MRT-B03","text":"Underdetermined remain the positive ontology of affirmed life, the criteria of non-appropriating obedience, and the collective form of a post-state world.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:MRT2","CH_97E9_VKUK:MRT2","CH_97E9_VNGT:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_07:MRT-B04","text":"The reconstruction necessarily depends on productive compression: it must read death, war, and state as mutually interwoven functional fields without resolving their irreducible tensions into a contradiction-free doctrine.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDPD:MRT5","CH_97E9_VKUK:MRT7","CH_97E9_VNGT:MRT7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CL_97E9_07@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CL_97E9_07:v1","source_language_code":"de","original_title":"Chapters 19–21"}],"identity":{"layer":"CL","kicker":"Cluster · Also sprach Zarathustra","title":"Chapters 19–21","context":"Of the Preachers of Death · Of War and Warriors · Of the New Idol","original_title":"Chapters 19–21","original_context":"Von den Predigern des Todes · Vom Krieg und Kriegsvolke · Vom neuen Götzen"},"original_title":"Chapters 19–21","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CL_97E9_08","layer":"CL","title":"Chapters 22–24","order":8,"parents":["CH_97E9_VDFD","CH_97E9_VDK0","CH_97E9_VOMF"],"revision":"CL_97E9_08@R001","sha256":"25480a62b64cffd08ab43aa79e0154601af6c6c4d029071fc8216b63bbe11b84","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_08:AS-01","text":"Das Cluster bearbeitet die Frage, wie schöpferische, triebhafte und relationale Kräfte erhalten werden können, ohne von Markt, moralischer Verdrängung oder verschmelzender Nähe in fremde Zwecke überführt zu werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:AS-02","text":"Seine globale These lautet, dass Erhaltung nicht durch Reinheit, Öffentlichkeit oder harmonische Bindung geschieht, sondern durch eine selektive Distanz, welche Triebe entkleidet, Alterität bewahrt und produktiven Widerstand organisiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:SD4","CH_97E9_VOMF:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:AS-03","text":"Das Argument wird zu einer dreifachen Reorganisation von Außen, Innen und Zwischenraum: Der Markt wird verlassen, der Trieb wird verwandelt, und die Beziehung wird als antagonistische Vermittlung rekonstruiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:SD6","CH_97E9_VDK0:SD1","CH_97E9_VOMF:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:AS-04","text":"Die Bewegung ist nicht linear, sondern rekursiv: Einsamkeit schützt vor öffentlicher Beschädigung, erzeugt aber Selbstverdopplung; diese verlangt einen Freund, dessen Widerstand jedoch nur tragfähig bleibt, wenn er weder Besitz noch Herrschaft wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:AS1","CH_97E9_VOMF:D1","CH_97E9_VOMF:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:AS-05","text":"Der Cluster erzeugt keine versöhnte Sozialform, sondern eine Architektur bedingter Durchlässigkeit, in der Distanz und Verbindung, Sinnlichkeit und Form, Feindschaft und Freundschaft einander regulieren müssen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:ME2","CH_97E9_VOMF:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:AS-06","text":"Seine Schließung ist deshalb vorläufig und selektiv: Nicht kollektive Umgestaltung des Marktes, sondern die Bewahrung von Räumen, Affekten und Beziehungen, in denen Überwindung überhaupt möglich bleibt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:SNX3","CH_97E9_VOMF:SD6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_08:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Öffentliche Anerkennung, moralische Benennung und emotionale Bekundung sind keine verlässlichen Indikatoren für Größe, Reinheit oder Beziehungsgüte, weil sie die Kräfte verdecken können, die sie zu bezeichnen vorgeben.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:NX3","CH_97E9_VDK0:D5","CH_97E9_VOMF:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] Das Entscheidende ist nicht die sichtbare Form einer Handlung oder Haltung, sondern ihre Herkunft, ihre Triebökonomie und ihre Wirkung auf die Möglichkeit von Selbstüberwindung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:SD3","CH_97E9_VOMF:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:GA-03","text":"[Mutating] Einsamkeit ist zunächst Schutzraum gegen Markt, Lärm und kumulative Verletzung, wird aber als vollständige Lösung widerrufen, weil sie das Selbst in eine unzureichende Selbstbeziehung spaltet.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:SD4","CH_97E9_VOMF:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:GA-04","text":"[Emergent] Produktive Nähe verlangt eine regulierte Distanz, die weder öffentliche Auslieferung noch intime Verschmelzung, weder vollständige Transparenz noch indifferente Absonderung zulässt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:A10","CH_97E9_VOMF:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:GA-05","text":"[Mutating] Der Trieb ist nicht durch Unterdrückung zu überwinden, sondern durch Diagnose seiner Verkleidungen und durch Umformung seiner affektiven Valenz.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:A4","CH_97E9_VDK0:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:GA-06","text":"[Attractor] Unschuld bezeichnet keine Abwesenheit von Sinnlichkeit, Aggression oder Widerstand, sondern deren nicht-neidische, nicht-ressentimentale und nicht-dominierende Gestalt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:AS5","CH_97E9_VDK0:SD4","CH_97E9_VOMF:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:GA-07","text":"[Persistent] Das Große oder Überwindende bleibt strukturell verwundbar, weil Sichtbarkeit Ressentiment erzeugt, Verdrängung sich moralisch maskiert und Nähe in Zugriff umschlagen kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:SD2","CH_97E9_VDFD:A8","CH_97E9_VDK0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:GA-08","text":"[Emergent] Freundschaft ist die Form, in der Selbstüberwindung relational werden kann: Der Freund ist nicht Bestätigung, sondern Spiegel, Grenze und Vektor einer noch nicht erreichten Gestalt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:AS5","CH_97E9_VOMF:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:GA-09","text":"[Terminal] Weder allgemeine Tugendnormen noch gegenwärtige soziale Formen liefern die gesuchte Ordnung; tragfähig sind nur individuell aufgenommene und zukünftig zu erzeugende Formen der Beziehung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:NX3","CH_97E9_VOMF:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_08:RMD-01","text":"Einsamkeit behält ihre Funktion als Schutz vor heteronomer Beschädigung, mutiert jedoch von einer positiven Produktionszone zu einer unvollständigen Vorbedingung, weil sie den Bedarf nach vermittelter Beziehung erzeugt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A12","CH_97E9_VOMF:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:RMD-02","text":"Die Diagnose der Verkleidung wandert vom Markt in die Moral und in die Freundessehnsucht: Schauspiel, Tugend, Mitleid, Liebe und Angriff werden als mögliche Masken nicht eingestandener Kräfte lesbar.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A5","CH_97E9_VDK0:A9","CH_97E9_VOMF:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:RMD-03","text":"Der Begriff des Widerstands kehrt funktional wieder, verändert aber seine Valenz: Gegen den Markt führt er zum Entzug, innerhalb der Freundschaft zur Nähe, die durch Feindfähigkeit erst tragfähig wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:D7","CH_97E9_VOMF:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:RMD-04","text":"Reinheit wird aus einem moralischen und sexuellen Register abgelöst und in eine allgemeine Prüfung der Herkunft überführt, wodurch Unschuld die Rolle der positiven, aber nicht institutionell garantierbaren Zielgröße übernimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:NX4","CH_97E9_VDK0:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:RMD-05","text":"Die Figur des Dritten entsteht erst auf Clusterebene als Gegengewicht zu zwei dysfunktionalen Polen: der anonymen Menge des Marktes und der geschlossenen Dyade von Ich und Mich.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A11","CH_97E9_VOMF:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:RMD-06","text":"Das Überwinden verschiebt sich von der Flucht vor Beschädigung über die Entlarvung des Triebs zur relationalen Transformation des Menschen; es absorbiert Schutz, Diagnose und Freundschaft in eine gemeinsame Bewegungsrichtung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:SD6","CH_97E9_VDK0:SD4","CH_97E9_VOMF:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_08:CGD-01","text":"Die Marktanalyse, die Stadtdiagnose und die Kritik gegenwärtiger Kameradschaft bleiben jeweils lokale Terrainbestimmungen; auf Clusterebene werden sie als verschiedene Regime der Fehlbindung lesbar.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:ME2","CH_97E9_VDK0:A1","CH_97E9_VOMF:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:CGD-02","text":"Die lokalen Figuren von Schauspieler, asketischem Moralisten und bedürftigem Freund werden nach oben als Varianten einer gemeinsamen Struktur absorbiert: Eine Oberfläche beansprucht Wahrheit, Reinheit oder Liebe, während ihre Triebgrundlage verdeckt bleibt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A5","CH_97E9_VDK0:A6","CH_97E9_VOMF:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:CGD-03","text":"Der Rückzug aus dem Markt skaliert nicht als allgemeine Sozialtheorie, sondern als negative Bedingung: Er markiert, was dem Schöpfer entzogen werden muss, bevor eine andere Form der Beziehung denkbar wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:DNX5","CH_97E9_VOMF:SD6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:CGD-04","text":"Die gegenwärtige Ebene erzeugt als neue Proposition, dass Schutz, Triebverwandlung und Freundschaft keine getrennten Ethiken bilden, sondern aufeinander angewiesene Operationen einer einzigen Selektionsmaschine sind.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:FGS7","CH_97E9_VDK0:FGS4","CH_97E9_VOMF:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_08:GNX-01","text":"Das Cluster schließt die Gleichsetzung von öffentlicher Sichtbarkeit mit Größe, von Glaubenserzeugung mit Wahrheit und von Zustimmung mit Erkenntnis aus.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:NX1","CH_97E9_VDFD:NX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:GNX-02","text":"Es schließt die Annahme aus, dass moralische Formen wie Keuschheit, Geist oder Mitleid ihren Triebursprung von selbst reinigen oder offenlegen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:NX5","CH_97E9_VDK0:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:GNX-03","text":"Es schließt eine Beziehung aus, die durch Verschmelzung, totale Offenlegung, dauerhafte Herrschaft oder bloße Schonung stabilisiert werden soll.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:NX5","CH_97E9_VOMF:NX7","CH_97E9_VOMF:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:GNX-04","text":"Die negative Architektur richtet sich gegen alle Ordnungen, die Differenz in Lärm, Norm, Besitz oder Unterwerfung neutralisieren und damit die Bedingungen der Überwindung zerstören.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A2","CH_97E9_VDK0:NX3","CH_97E9_VOMF:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_08:DBN-01","text":"Falsch sein muss, dass ein Subjekt sich durch Rückzug, Askese oder Selbstbild allein stabilisieren kann; jede dieser Lösungen produziert entweder Verdrängung, Spaltung oder neue Abhängigkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:AS1","CH_97E9_VDK0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:DBN-02","text":"Falsch sein muss, dass die soziale Welt ein neutrales Feld von Anerkennung und Nähe bildet; sie erscheint vielmehr als Medium von Fehlbewertung, Ressentiment, Projektion und verdecktem Zugriff.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:D1","CH_97E9_VDFD:D4","CH_97E9_VOMF:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:DBN-03","text":"Nicht zugelassen werden kann die Identität von Befreiung und Triebverneinung, weil die negierte Kraft in moralischer, geistiger oder affektiver Gestalt zurückkehrt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:DNX1","CH_97E9_VDK0:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_08:BSA-01","text":"Die tiefste ausgeschlossene Möglichkeit ist eine unmittelbar verfügbare, unschuldige Gemeinschaft: Öffentlichkeit korrumpiert Größe, Normen maskieren Triebe und gegenwärtige Beziehung bleibt Kameradschaft statt Freundschaft.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:SNX1","CH_97E9_VDK0:SNX4","CH_97E9_VOMF:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:BSA-02","text":"Das Cluster kreist um die Abwesenheit eines vollständig autonomen Subjekts, das weder Schutz, Spiegelung noch Widerstand benötigte und dennoch zur Selbstüberwindung fähig wäre.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:DNX1","CH_97E9_VOMF:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:BSA-03","text":"Ontologisch unzulässig bleibt jede Ordnung, in der Differenz entweder als Feindschaft vernichtet oder als Einheit aufgehoben wird; möglich bleibt nur eine fragile Differenz, die Widerstand ohne Unterwerfung trägt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:NX4","CH_97E9_VOMF:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_08:XD-01","text":"Der Rückzug aus öffentlicher Beschädigung genügt nicht als Endstrategie, weil die so geschützte Einsamkeit ihre eigene innere Zweierstruktur erzeugt und damit den Bedarf nach einem nicht-marktförmigen Gegenüber freisetzt.","refs":["CL_97E9_08:GA-03","CL_97E9_08:GA-04","CH_97E9_VDFD:SD6","CH_97E9_VOMF:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension.","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:XD-02","text":"Die Kritik am Schauspiel und die Kritik an moralischer Keuschheit erzeugen zusammen ein generalisiertes Verdachtsverfahren: Sichtbare Tugend, sichtbare Wahrheit und sichtbare Liebe müssen auf ihre verborgene Kraftökonomie geprüft werden.","refs":["CL_97E9_08:GA-01","CL_97E9_08:GA-02","CH_97E9_VDFD:A5","CH_97E9_VDK0:AS4","CH_97E9_VOMF:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite.","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:XD-03","text":"Die positive Alternative zur Verdrängung ist nicht spontane Enthemmung, sondern eine Form der Selbstbeziehung, in der Sinnlichkeit weder verleugnet noch zur Herrschaft über Andere gemacht wird.","refs":["CL_97E9_08:GA-05","CL_97E9_08:GA-06","CH_97E9_VDK0:A4","CH_97E9_VOMF:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite.","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:XD-04","text":"Der Freund wird zur sozialen Gegenform des Marktes, weil seine Beziehung nicht auf Glaubenserzeugung, öffentlicher Wirkung oder identischer Zustimmung, sondern auf selektiver Erkenntnis und produktivem Widerstand beruht.","refs":["CL_97E9_08:GA-01","CL_97E9_08:GA-04","CL_97E9_08:GA-08","CH_97E9_VDFD:D2","CH_97E9_VOMF:A10","CH_97E9_VOMF:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite.","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:XD-05","text":"Die Unmöglichkeit einer allgemeinen Tugendnorm und die Unmöglichkeit einer konfliktfreien Sozialform führen zu einer Ethik der Typendifferenz: Tragfähigkeit hängt von individueller Triebverfassung und relationaler Widerstandsfähigkeit ab.","refs":["CL_97E9_08:GA-02","CL_97E9_08:GA-09","CH_97E9_VDK0:A5","CH_97E9_VOMF:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative.","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_08:BSD-01","text":"Das Cluster verwandelt Freiheit von einem Zustand der Unabhängigkeit in eine Fähigkeit zur regulierten Exposition: Man muss sich dem Markt entziehen, dem eigenen Trieb stellen und einem widerständigen Freund aussetzen können.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A12","CH_97E9_VDK0:D3","CH_97E9_VOMF:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:BSD-02","text":"Realität erscheint als Konkurrenz mehrerer Wahrnehmungs- und Affektordnungen: Markt, Askese und Kameradschaft vereinfachen Kräfte, während schöpferische Einsamkeit, unschuldige Sinnlichkeit und Freundschaft sie differenzieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:SD1","CH_97E9_VDK0:ME1","CH_97E9_VOMF:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:BSD-03","text":"Zeit wird dreifach reorganisiert: Marktzeit erzwingt sofortige Wirkung, Verdrängung wiederholt den ausgeschlossenen Trieb, Freundschaft eröffnet eine Zukunftszeit der noch ausstehenden Überwindung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:D3","CH_97E9_VDK0:DNX4","CH_97E9_VOMF:SD6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:BSD-04","text":"Das Subjekt wird weder als autonome Einheit noch als bloßes Opfer von Kräften bestimmt, sondern als umkämpfte Übergangsform, die durch Schutz, Entlarvung und Widerstand ihre Form verändern kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:A1","CH_97E9_VDK0:SD4","CH_97E9_VOMF:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:BSD-05","text":"Politisch erzeugt der Cluster keine kollektive Gegeninstitution, sondern eine strategische Minorität: Erhaltung und Überwindung hängen von kleinen Räumen nicht-spektakulärer, nicht-normativer und nicht-dominierender Praxis ab.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:SNX3","CH_97E9_VDK0:A14","CH_97E9_VOMF:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_08:RLE-01","text":"Die Markt-Schleife lautet: Sichtbarkeit erzeugt Ressentiment, Ressentiment erzeugt kleine Verletzungen, Verletzungen erzwingen Rückzug, und der Rückzug entzieht die Wertschöpfung erneut der öffentlichen Sichtbarkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:SD2","CH_97E9_VDFD:D5","CH_97E9_VDFD:FGS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:RLE-02","text":"Die Triebschleife lautet: Unterdrückung verlagert Sinnlichkeit in Tugend, Geist oder Mitleid; die neue moralische Form verdeckt den Trieb und verlängert damit die Notwendigkeit seiner erneuten Diagnose.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:FGS2","CH_97E9_VDK0:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:RLE-03","text":"Die Beziehungsschleife lautet: Einsamkeit spaltet das Selbst, der Freund vermittelt diese Spaltung, seine Feindschaft verhindert Verschmelzung, und seine Spiegelung erzeugt erneute Selbstüberwindung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:FGS1","CH_97E9_VOMF:FGS4","CH_97E9_VOMF:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:RLE-04","text":"Der zentrale Attraktor ist eine nicht-aneignende Distanz: Sie erscheint als Einsamkeit gegenüber dem Markt, als Unschuld gegenüber dem Trieb und als begrenztes Wissen gegenüber dem Freund.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:SD4","CH_97E9_VDK0:D1","CH_97E9_VOMF:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:RLE-05","text":"Der Eskalationspfad führt von lokaler Verletzung über affektive Fehlbindung zu ontologischer Umformung: Die Frage nach Markt, Keuschheit oder Freundschaft wird schließlich zur Frage, welche Art Mensch überhaupt entstehen kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A9","CH_97E9_VDK0:D6","CH_97E9_VOMF:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_08:FGS-B01","text":"Öffentliche Wirkung oder moralische Oberfläche → Verdeckung von Wertschöpfung, Trieb oder Bedürftigkeit → Diagnose der falschen Zuschreibung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:D1","CH_97E9_VDK0:FGS3","CH_97E9_VOMF:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:FGS-B02","text":"Diagnose der Verdeckung → Ausschluss von Lärm, Normzwang, Sinnestötung, Transparenz und Herrschaft → Freilegung einer nicht-reduktiven Differenz.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:DNX5","CH_97E9_VDK0:NX2","CH_97E9_VOMF:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:FGS-B03","text":"Freigelegte Differenz → Schutzraum, Triebverwandlung und antagonistische Vermittlung → Erhaltung der Bedingungen von Selbstüberwindung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:FGS7","CH_97E9_VDK0:FGS4","CH_97E9_VOMF:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:FGS-B04","text":"Selbstüberwindung → keine endgültige Reinheit oder soziale Versöhnung, sondern erneute Prüfung der Herkunft, der Distanz und der Fähigkeit zum Widerstand.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:D8","CH_97E9_VOMF:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_08:AFM-B01","text":"Marktzwang und affektive Verengung → Entkopplung von Sichtbarkeit, Reinheit und Wahrheit → Diagnose öffentlicher und innerer Verkleidung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:AF1","CH_97E9_VDK0:AF1","CH_97E9_VOMF:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:AFM-B02","text":"Diagnose der Verkleidung → Rückweisung von Gegenwehr, Askese und Verschmelzung → Suche nach einer nicht-repressiven Form von Distanz.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:DNX5","CH_97E9_VDK0:NX2","CH_97E9_VOMF:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:AFM-B03","text":"Distanz → Einsamkeit als Schutz → innere Verdopplung → Freund als Dritter und Feind → Ausrichtung auf eine noch nicht verwirklichte Überwindungsform.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:FGS6","CH_97E9_VOMF:AS1","CH_97E9_VOMF:A3","CH_97E9_VOMF:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_08:MME-01","text":"Öffentlichkeit, Moral und Intimität werden als drei unterschiedliche, aber strukturell verwandte Zonen der Fehllektüre kartiert: Jede kann sichtbare Formen mit ihren tatsächlichen Kräften verwechseln.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:ME2","CH_97E9_VDK0:ME4","CH_97E9_VOMF:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:MME-02","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Rückzug und Beziehung bricht zusammen, weil Einsamkeit als Bedingung des Schutzes und Freundschaft als Bedingung der nicht-solipsistischen Überwindung zugleich erforderlich werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:SD4","CH_97E9_VOMF:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:MME-03","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Sinnlichkeit und Geist wird durch eine Kartierung ersetzt, in der Triebe ihre Gestalt wechseln und deshalb nach ihrer Richtung statt nach ihrem Namen beurteilt werden müssen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:ME3","CH_97E9_VDK0:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:MME-04","text":"Freund und Feind, Milde und Härte, Mitleid und Widerstand werden aus exklusiven Gegensätzen in gekoppelte Funktionen einer transformierenden Beziehung überführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:ME2","CH_97E9_VOMF:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:MME-05","text":"Die strategische Landschaft wird von institutioneller Reform auf selektive Praxis umgestellt: Nicht jede Öffentlichkeit, Norm oder Bindung wird bekämpft, sondern ihre Zugriffsmacht wird begrenzt und umfunktioniert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:SD6","CH_97E9_VDK0:ME6","CH_97E9_VOMF:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_08:ALT-B01","text":"Surface level — Das Cluster behandelt Markt, Stadt, Keuschheit, Einsamkeit, Liebe, Mitleid, Freundschaft und Kameradschaft als konkrete Felder existenzieller Orientierung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:ALT1","CH_97E9_VDK0:ALT1","CH_97E9_VOMF:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:ALT-B02","text":"Structural level — Es rekonstruiert diese Felder als Systeme von Sichtbarkeit, Triebverlagerung und relationaler Vermittlung, in denen Kräfte ihre Namen wechseln, ohne notwendig ihre Wirksamkeit zu verlieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:ALT2","CH_97E9_VDK0:ALT2","CH_97E9_VOMF:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:ALT-B03","text":"Metastrategic level — Kampf wird als Entzug aus unendlicher Reaktion, als Entlarvung von Verkleidung und als Aufbau einer Beziehung zum Feind neu bestimmt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:ALT3","CH_97E9_VDK0:ALT3","CH_97E9_VOMF:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:ALT-B04","text":"Ontological / Temporal level — Realität besteht aus ungleichzeitigen Prozessen: langsame Wertschöpfung, wiederkehrende Triebverschiebung und zukünftige Selbstüberwindung widerstehen der sofortigen Gegenwart des Marktes.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:ALT4","CH_97E9_VDK0:ALT4","CH_97E9_VOMF:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:ALT-B05","text":"Methodological / Performative level — Die eigene Form vollzieht ihre These, indem sie Begriffe nicht positiv fixiert, sondern durch wiederholte Ausschlüsse, Umcodierungen und funktionale Verschiebungen erzeugt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:FGS1","CH_97E9_VDK0:FGS3","CH_97E9_VOMF:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_08:FL-01","text":"Die Einsamkeit ist zugleich notwendiger Schutz und unzureichender Zustand: Sie bewahrt das Schöpferische vor Markt und Ressentiment, bringt aber eine Selbstverdopplung hervor, die nach Vermittlung verlangt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:SD4","CH_97E9_VOMF:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:FL-02","text":"Die Strategie des Rückzugs schützt die Bedingungen der Wertschöpfung, überlässt jedoch die öffentliche Ordnung den Schauspielern und liefert keine positive kollektive Gegenform.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:SNX3","CH_97E9_VDFD:MRT7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:FL-03","text":"Die positive Bestimmung der Keuschheit bleibt instabil, weil sie einerseits als seltene unschuldige Gestalt gelten soll, andererseits als erzwungene Praxis in dieselbe Brunst zurückschlagen kann, die sie verhindern will.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:A11","CH_97E9_VDK0:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:FL-04","text":"Die Freundschaft soll Spiegel und irreduzibler Feind zugleich sein; diese Spannung ist produktiv, bleibt aber nur stabil, sofern Nähe nicht in Aneignung und Feindschaft nicht in Herrschaft umschlägt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:A11","CH_97E9_VOMF:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:MP-01","text":"Der Begriff des Widerstands mutiert an der Grenze zwischen Markt und Freundschaft: Was gegenüber der Menge als Flucht fungiert, wird gegenüber dem Freund als notwendige Nähe im Widerstreit.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:D7","CH_97E9_VOMF:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:MP-02","text":"Der Begriff der Reinheit mutiert von moralischer Sauberkeit zu unschuldiger Sinnlichkeit; damit wird nicht das Begehren abgeschafft, sondern seine neidische und reaktive Organisation problematisiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:A12","CH_97E9_VDK0:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:MP-03","text":"Die geschlechtliche Behauptung des Freundschaftskapitels bleibt als lokale Bruchlinie markiert, weil ihre Ausschließung weiblicher Liebe nicht in ein stabiles männliches Gegenmodell mündet, sondern in eine allgemeinere Diagnose menschlicher Unzulänglichkeit umschlägt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:D10","CH_97E9_VOMF:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_08:HSI-01","text":"Die Realität erscheint als Maschine der Kraftverkleidung: Markt, Moral und Nähe geben Kräften Namen, die ihre Herkunft verdecken und ihre Wirkungen umlenken.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:SD1","CH_97E9_VDK0:SD2","CH_97E9_VOMF:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:HSI-02","text":"Das Subjekt ist eine poröse Übergangseinheit, die von Lärm, Trieben, Projektionen und Beziehungen durchquert wird und nur durch selektive Distanz eine eigene Richtung gewinnen kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A10","CH_97E9_VDK0:A7","CH_97E9_VOMF:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:HSI-03","text":"Zeit ist nicht einheitlich, sondern besteht aus der sofortigen Zeit der Wirkung, der wiederkehrenden Zeit der Verdrängung und der offenen Zukunft der Überwindung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:D3","CH_97E9_VDK0:DNX4","CH_97E9_VOMF:SD6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:HSI-04","text":"Kampf bleibt möglich als Navigation zwischen Entzug und Exposition: Man entzieht sich der Menge, verweigert der Norm ihre Reinheitsgewalt und begegnet dem Freund in einer Feindschaft, die Überwindung statt Unterwerfung erzeugen soll.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:SD6","CH_97E9_VDK0:NX3","CH_97E9_VOMF:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_08:MRT-B01","text":"Die extrahierten Axiome reichen aus, um das Cluster als Maschine der selektiven Distanz zu rekonstruieren: Sie verbinden Marktflucht, Triebdiagnose und antagonistische Freundschaft ohne diese Ebenen zu identifizieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:SD4","CH_97E9_VDK0:SD4","CH_97E9_VOMF:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:MRT-B02","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie aus der individuellen Schutz- und Transformationspraxis eine dauerhafte soziale Form entstehen könnte, da Öffentlichkeit verworfen und Freundschaft als ausstehend bestimmt wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:SNX3","CH_97E9_VOMF:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:MRT-B03","text":"Die Architektur ist am stärksten dort, wo sie dieselbe Operation in mehreren Bereichen sichtbar macht: Oberfläche wird verdächtig, verborgene Kraft wird diagnostiziert, und die Kraft wird weder zerstört noch ungeprüft freigesetzt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:D2","CH_97E9_VDK0:D3","CH_97E9_VOMF:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:MRT-B04","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bleibt auf die produktiven Spannungen zwischen Einsamkeit und Freundschaft, Keuschheit und Sinnlichkeit sowie Spiegelung und Feindschaft angewiesen; ihre Auflösung würde die generative Bewegung des Clusters zerstören.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:AS1","CH_97E9_VDK0:MRT5","CH_97E9_VOMF:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T200011787406Z_f9cf4ea6","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Chapters 22–24","source_sha256":"25480a62b64cffd08ab43aa79e0154601af6c6c4d029071fc8216b63bbe11b84","sha256":"3b36a4bb301026c148c6812c60ce1e83941b976cc4db7362d2b527e71ec6a419","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T20:00:11.789269+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_08:AS-01","text":"The cluster addresses the question of how creative, instinctual, and relational forces can be preserved without being transferred into alien purposes by the market, moral repression, or fusing closeness.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:AS-02","text":"Its global thesis is that preservation does not occur through purity, publicity, or harmonious attachment, but through a selective distance that unclothes instincts, preserves alterity, and organizes productive resistance.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:SD4","CH_97E9_VOMF:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:AS-03","text":"The argument becomes a threefold reorganization of exterior, interior, and interspace: the market is left behind, the instinct is transformed, and the relationship is reconstructed as antagonistic mediation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:SD6","CH_97E9_VDK0:SD1","CH_97E9_VOMF:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:AS-04","text":"The movement is not linear but recursive: solitude protects against public injury, but produces self-doubling; this requires a friend whose resistance, however, remains viable only if it becomes neither possession nor domination.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:AS1","CH_97E9_VOMF:D1","CH_97E9_VOMF:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:AS-05","text":"The cluster produces no reconciled social form, but an architecture of conditional permeability in which distance and connection, sensuality and form, enmity and friendship must regulate one another.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:ME2","CH_97E9_VOMF:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:AS-06","text":"Its closure is therefore provisional and selective: not collective transformation of the market, but the preservation of spaces, affects, and relationships in which overcoming remains possible at all.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:SNX3","CH_97E9_VOMF:SD6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_08:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Public recognition, moral designation, and emotional avowal are not reliable indicators of greatness, purity, or relational quality, because they can conceal the forces they purport to designate.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:NX3","CH_97E9_VDK0:D5","CH_97E9_VOMF:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:GA-02","text":"[Persistent] What is decisive is not the visible form of an action or attitude, but its origin, its instinctual economy, and its effect on the possibility of self-overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:SD3","CH_97E9_VOMF:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:GA-03","text":"[Mutating] Solitude is initially a protected space against market, noise, and cumulative injury, but is revoked as a complete solution because it splits the self into an inadequate self-relation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:SD4","CH_97E9_VOMF:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:GA-04","text":"[Emergent] Productive closeness requires a regulated distance that permits neither public exposure nor intimate fusion, neither complete transparency nor indifferent segregation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:A10","CH_97E9_VOMF:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:GA-05","text":"[Mutating] The instinct is not to be overcome through repression, but through diagnosing its disguises and transforming its affective valence.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:A4","CH_97E9_VDK0:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:GA-06","text":"[Attractor] Innocence denotes not the absence of sensuality, aggression, or resistance, but their non-envious, non-resentful, and non-dominating form.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:AS5","CH_97E9_VDK0:SD4","CH_97E9_VOMF:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:GA-07","text":"[Persistent] The great or overcoming remains structurally vulnerable, because visibility produces ressentiment, repression masks itself morally, and closeness can turn into appropriation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:SD2","CH_97E9_VDFD:A8","CH_97E9_VDK0:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:GA-08","text":"[Emergent] Friendship is the form in which self-overcoming can become relational: the friend is not affirmation, but mirror, boundary, and vector of a form not yet attained.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:AS5","CH_97E9_VOMF:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:GA-09","text":"[Terminal] Neither general norms of virtue nor present social forms supply the order sought; viable are only individually assumed and yet-to-be-produced forms of relationship.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:NX3","CH_97E9_VOMF:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_08:RMD-01","text":"Solitude retains its function as protection against heteronomous injury, but mutates from a positive zone of production into an incomplete precondition because it generates the need for mediated relationship.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A12","CH_97E9_VOMF:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:RMD-02","text":"The diagnosis of disguise migrates from the market into morality and the longing for friendship: acting, virtue, compassion, love, and attack become legible as possible masks of unacknowledged forces.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A5","CH_97E9_VDK0:A9","CH_97E9_VOMF:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:RMD-03","text":"The concept of resistance recurs functionally, but changes its valence: against the market it leads to withdrawal; within friendship, to a closeness that becomes viable only through the capacity for enmity.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:D7","CH_97E9_VOMF:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:RMD-04","text":"Purity is detached from a moral and sexual register and transferred into a general examination of origin, whereby innocence assumes the role of a positive but not institutionally guaranteed target magnitude.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:NX4","CH_97E9_VDK0:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:RMD-05","text":"The figure of the third emerges only at cluster level as a counterweight to two dysfunctional poles: the anonymous multitude of the market and the closed dyad of I and Me.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A11","CH_97E9_VOMF:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:RMD-06","text":"Overcoming shifts from flight from injury, via the unmasking of instinct, to the relational transformation of the human being; it absorbs protection, diagnosis, and friendship into a common direction of movement.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:SD6","CH_97E9_VDK0:SD4","CH_97E9_VOMF:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_08:CGD-01","text":"Market analysis, urban diagnosis, and critique of present-day comradeship each remain local determinations of terrain; at cluster level they become legible as different regimes of misbinding.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:ME2","CH_97E9_VDK0:A1","CH_97E9_VOMF:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:CGD-02","text":"The local figures of the actor, the ascetic moralist, and the needy friend are absorbed upward as variants of a common structure: a surface claims truth, purity, or love, while its instinctual basis remains concealed.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A5","CH_97E9_VDK0:A6","CH_97E9_VOMF:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:CGD-03","text":"Withdrawal from the market does not scale into a general social theory, but into a negative condition: it marks what must be withdrawn from the creator before another form of relationship becomes conceivable.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:DNX5","CH_97E9_VOMF:SD6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:CGD-04","text":"The current level produces as a new proposition that protection, instinct-transformation, and friendship do not form separate ethics, but operations of a single selection machine dependent upon one another.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:FGS7","CH_97E9_VDK0:FGS4","CH_97E9_VOMF:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_08:GNX-01","text":"The cluster excludes the equation of public visibility with greatness, of belief-production with truth, and of assent with knowledge.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:NX1","CH_97E9_VDFD:NX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:GNX-02","text":"It excludes the assumption that moral forms such as chastity, spirit, or compassion cleanse or disclose their instinctual origin of themselves.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:NX5","CH_97E9_VDK0:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:GNX-03","text":"It excludes a relationship that is to be stabilized through fusion, total disclosure, permanent domination, or mere sparing.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:NX5","CH_97E9_VOMF:NX7","CH_97E9_VOMF:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:GNX-04","text":"The negative architecture is directed against all orders that neutralize difference in noise, norm, possession, or subjection and thereby destroy the conditions of overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A2","CH_97E9_VDK0:NX3","CH_97E9_VOMF:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_08:DBN-01","text":"It must be false that a subject can stabilize itself through withdrawal, asceticism, or self-image alone; each of these solutions produces either repression, splitting, or new dependency.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:AS1","CH_97E9_VDK0:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:DBN-02","text":"It must be false that the social world forms a neutral field of recognition and closeness; rather, it appears as a medium of misvaluation, ressentiment, projection, and concealed appropriation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:D1","CH_97E9_VDFD:D4","CH_97E9_VOMF:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:DBN-03","text":"The identity of liberation and instinct-denial cannot be admitted, because the negated force returns in moral, spiritual, or affective form.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:DNX1","CH_97E9_VDK0:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_08:BSA-01","text":"The most deeply excluded possibility is an immediately available, innocent community: publicity corrupts greatness, norms mask instincts, and present relationship remains comradeship rather than friendship.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:SNX1","CH_97E9_VDK0:SNX4","CH_97E9_VOMF:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:BSA-02","text":"The cluster revolves around the absence of a fully autonomous subject that required neither protection, mirroring, nor resistance and yet would be capable of self-overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:DNX1","CH_97E9_VOMF:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:BSA-03","text":"Ontologically inadmissible remains every order in which difference is either destroyed as enmity or sublated as unity; possible remains only a fragile difference that bears resistance without subjection.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:NX4","CH_97E9_VOMF:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_08:XD-01","text":"Withdrawal from public injury does not suffice as an end strategy, because the solitude thereby protected generates its own internal twofold structure and thus releases the need for a non-market-form counterpart.","refs":["CL_97E9_08:GA-03","CL_97E9_08:GA-04","CH_97E9_VDFD:SD6","CH_97E9_VOMF:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension.","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:XD-02","text":"The critique of acting and the critique of moral chastity together produce a generalized procedure of suspicion: visible virtue, visible truth, and visible love must be examined with regard to their concealed economy of forces.","refs":["CL_97E9_08:GA-01","CL_97E9_08:GA-02","CH_97E9_VDFD:A5","CH_97E9_VDK0:AS4","CH_97E9_VOMF:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite.","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:XD-03","text":"The positive alternative to repression is not spontaneous disinhibition, but a form of self-relation in which sensuality is neither denied nor made into domination over others.","refs":["CL_97E9_08:GA-05","CL_97E9_08:GA-06","CH_97E9_VDK0:A4","CH_97E9_VOMF:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite.","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:XD-04","text":"The friend becomes the market's social counterform because the relationship is based not on belief-production, public effect, or identical assent, but on selective knowledge and productive resistance.","refs":["CL_97E9_08:GA-01","CL_97E9_08:GA-04","CL_97E9_08:GA-08","CH_97E9_VDFD:D2","CH_97E9_VOMF:A10","CH_97E9_VOMF:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite.","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:XD-05","text":"The impossibility of a general norm of virtue and the impossibility of a conflict-free social form lead to an ethics of type-difference: viability depends on individual instinctual constitution and relational capacity for resistance.","refs":["CL_97E9_08:GA-02","CL_97E9_08:GA-09","CH_97E9_VDK0:A5","CH_97E9_VOMF:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Negative.","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_08:BSD-01","text":"The cluster transforms freedom from a state of independence into a capacity for regulated exposure: one must be able to withdraw from the market, confront one's own instinct, and expose oneself to a resistant friend.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A12","CH_97E9_VDK0:D3","CH_97E9_VOMF:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:BSD-02","text":"Reality appears as a competition among several perceptual and affective orders: market, asceticism, and comradeship simplify forces, whereas creative solitude, innocent sensuality, and friendship differentiate them.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:SD1","CH_97E9_VDK0:ME1","CH_97E9_VOMF:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:BSD-03","text":"Time is reorganized threefold: market time compels immediate effect, repression repeats the excluded instinct, and friendship opens a future time of overcoming still outstanding.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:D3","CH_97E9_VDK0:DNX4","CH_97E9_VOMF:SD6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:BSD-04","text":"The subject is determined neither as an autonomous unity nor as the mere victim of forces, but as a contested transitional form that can transform its form through protection, unmasking, and resistance.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:A1","CH_97E9_VDK0:SD4","CH_97E9_VOMF:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:BSD-05","text":"Politically, the cluster produces no collective counter-institution, but a strategic minority: preservation and overcoming depend on small spaces of non-spectacular, non-normative, and non-dominating practice.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:SNX3","CH_97E9_VDK0:A14","CH_97E9_VOMF:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_08:RLE-01","text":"The market loop is as follows: visibility produces ressentiment, ressentiment produces minor injuries, injuries compel withdrawal, and withdrawal once again removes value-creation from public visibility.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:SD2","CH_97E9_VDFD:D5","CH_97E9_VDFD:FGS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:RLE-02","text":"The instinct loop is as follows: repression displaces sensuality into virtue, spirit, or compassion; the new moral form conceals the instinct and thereby prolongs the necessity of diagnosing it anew.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:FGS2","CH_97E9_VDK0:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:RLE-03","text":"The relationship loop is as follows: solitude splits the self, the friend mediates this split, his enmity prevents fusion, and his mirroring produces renewed self-overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:FGS1","CH_97E9_VOMF:FGS4","CH_97E9_VOMF:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:RLE-04","text":"The central attractor is a non-appropriative distance: it appears as solitude in relation to the market, as innocence in relation to instinct, and as limited knowledge in relation to the friend.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:SD4","CH_97E9_VDK0:D1","CH_97E9_VOMF:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:RLE-05","text":"The escalation path leads from local injury through affective misbinding to ontological transformation: the question of market, chastity, or friendship ultimately becomes the question of what kind of human being can emerge at all.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A9","CH_97E9_VDK0:D6","CH_97E9_VOMF:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_08:FGS-B01","text":"Public effect or moral surface → concealment of value-creation, instinct, or neediness → diagnosis of false attribution.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:D1","CH_97E9_VDK0:FGS3","CH_97E9_VOMF:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:FGS-B02","text":"Diagnosis of concealment → exclusion of noise, normative compulsion, sense-killing, transparency, and domination → disclosure of a non-reductive difference.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:DNX5","CH_97E9_VDK0:NX2","CH_97E9_VOMF:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:FGS-B03","text":"Disclosed difference → protected space, instinct-transformation, and antagonistic mediation → preservation of the conditions of self-overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:FGS7","CH_97E9_VDK0:FGS4","CH_97E9_VOMF:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:FGS-B04","text":"Self-overcoming → no final purity or social reconciliation, but renewed examination of origin, distance, and the capacity for resistance.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:D8","CH_97E9_VOMF:D7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_08:AFM-B01","text":"Market compulsion and affective narrowing → decoupling of visibility, purity, and truth → diagnosis of public and internal disguise.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:AF1","CH_97E9_VDK0:AF1","CH_97E9_VOMF:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:AFM-B02","text":"Diagnosis of disguise → rejection of counter-resistance, asceticism, and fusion → search for a non-repressive form of distance.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:DNX5","CH_97E9_VDK0:NX2","CH_97E9_VOMF:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:AFM-B03","text":"Distance → solitude as protection → internal doubling → friend as third and enemy → orientation toward a form of overcoming not yet realized.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:FGS6","CH_97E9_VOMF:AS1","CH_97E9_VOMF:A3","CH_97E9_VOMF:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_08:MME-01","text":"Publicity, morality, and intimacy are mapped as three distinct but structurally related zones of misreading: each can mistake visible forms for their actual forces.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:ME2","CH_97E9_VDK0:ME4","CH_97E9_VOMF:ME3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:MME-02","text":"The opposition between withdrawal and relationship collapses because solitude as a condition of protection and friendship as a condition of non-solipsistic overcoming become simultaneously necessary.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:SD4","CH_97E9_VOMF:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:MME-03","text":"The opposition between sensuality and spirit is replaced by a mapping in which instincts change their form and must therefore be judged by their direction rather than by their name.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:ME3","CH_97E9_VDK0:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:MME-04","text":"Friend and enemy, gentleness and hardness, compassion and resistance are transferred from exclusive oppositions into coupled functions of a transformative relationship.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:ME2","CH_97E9_VOMF:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:MME-05","text":"The strategic landscape is shifted from institutional reform to selective practice: not every publicity, norm, or attachment is fought, but their power of appropriation is limited and repurposed.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:SD6","CH_97E9_VDK0:ME6","CH_97E9_VOMF:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_08:ALT-B01","text":"Surface level — The cluster treats market, city, chastity, solitude, love, compassion, friendship, and comradeship as concrete fields of existential orientation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:ALT1","CH_97E9_VDK0:ALT1","CH_97E9_VOMF:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:ALT-B02","text":"Structural level — It reconstructs these fields as systems of visibility, instinctual displacement, and relational mediation in which forces change their names without necessarily losing their efficacy.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:ALT2","CH_97E9_VDK0:ALT2","CH_97E9_VOMF:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:ALT-B03","text":"Metastrategic level — Struggle is newly determined as withdrawal from infinite reaction, as unmasking of disguise, and as the construction of a relationship to the enemy.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:ALT3","CH_97E9_VDK0:ALT3","CH_97E9_VOMF:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:ALT-B04","text":"Ontological / Temporal level — Reality consists of non-simultaneous processes: slow value-creation, recurring instinctual displacement, and future self-overcoming resist the market's immediate present.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:ALT4","CH_97E9_VDK0:ALT4","CH_97E9_VOMF:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:ALT-B05","text":"Methodological / Performative level — Its own form enacts its thesis by not positively fixing concepts, but producing them through repeated exclusions, recodings, and functional displacements.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:FGS1","CH_97E9_VDK0:FGS3","CH_97E9_VOMF:FGS5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_08:FL-01","text":"Solitude is at once necessary protection and an insufficient state: it preserves the creative from market and ressentiment, but produces a self-doubling that demands mediation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:SD4","CH_97E9_VOMF:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:FL-02","text":"The strategy of withdrawal protects the conditions of value-creation, yet leaves the public order to the actors and supplies no positive collective counterform.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:SNX3","CH_97E9_VDFD:MRT7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:FL-03","text":"The positive determination of chastity remains unstable because, on the one hand, it is to count as a rare innocent form, while, on the other, as an enforced practice it can relapse into the same ardor it seeks to prevent.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:A11","CH_97E9_VDK0:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:FL-04","text":"Friendship is to be mirror and irreducible enemy at once; this tension is productive, but remains stable only insofar as closeness does not turn into appropriation and enmity does not turn into domination.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:A11","CH_97E9_VOMF:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:MP-01","text":"The concept of resistance mutates at the boundary between market and friendship: what functions as flight in relation to the multitude becomes, in relation to the friend, necessary closeness in conflict.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:D7","CH_97E9_VOMF:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:MP-02","text":"The concept of purity mutates from moral cleanliness into innocent sensuality; this does not abolish desire, but problematizes its envious and reactive organization.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDK0:A12","CH_97E9_VDK0:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:MP-03","text":"The gendered assertion of the friendship chapter remains marked as a local fault line because its exclusion of female love does not culminate in a stable male countermodel, but turns into a more general diagnosis of human insufficiency.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:D10","CH_97E9_VOMF:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_08:HSI-01","text":"Reality appears as a machine of force-disguise: market, morality, and closeness give names to forces that conceal their origin and redirect their effects.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:SD1","CH_97E9_VDK0:SD2","CH_97E9_VOMF:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:HSI-02","text":"The subject is a porous transitional unity traversed by noise, instincts, projections, and relationships, and can gain a direction of its own only through selective distance.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:A10","CH_97E9_VDK0:A7","CH_97E9_VOMF:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:HSI-03","text":"Time is not uniform, but consists of the immediate time of effect, the recurring time of repression, and the open future of overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:D3","CH_97E9_VDK0:DNX4","CH_97E9_VOMF:SD6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:HSI-04","text":"Struggle remains possible as navigation between withdrawal and exposure: one withdraws from the multitude, denies the norm its power of purity, and encounters the friend in an enmity that is to produce overcoming rather than subjection.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:SD6","CH_97E9_VDK0:NX3","CH_97E9_VOMF:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_08:MRT-B01","text":"The extracted axioms suffice to reconstruct the cluster as a machine of selective distance: they connect flight from the market, instinct-diagnosis, and antagonistic friendship without identifying these levels with one another.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:SD4","CH_97E9_VDK0:SD4","CH_97E9_VOMF:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:MRT-B02","text":"It remains underdetermined how a durable social form could arise from individual practices of protection and transformation, since publicity is rejected and friendship is determined as outstanding.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:SNX3","CH_97E9_VOMF:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:MRT-B03","text":"The architecture is strongest where it makes the same operation visible in several domains: the surface becomes suspect, concealed force is diagnosed, and the force is neither destroyed nor released without examination.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDFD:D2","CH_97E9_VDK0:D3","CH_97E9_VOMF:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_08:MRT-B04","text":"The reconstruction remains dependent on the productive tensions between solitude and friendship, chastity and sensuality, as well as mirroring and enmity; their resolution would destroy the generative movement of the cluster.","refs":["CH_97E9_VOMF:AS1","CH_97E9_VDK0:MRT5","CH_97E9_VOMF:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CL_97E9_08@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CL_97E9_08:v1","source_language_code":"de","original_title":"Chapters 22–24"}],"identity":{"layer":"CL","kicker":"Cluster · Also sprach Zarathustra","title":"Chapters 22–24","context":"Of the Flies of the Marketplace · Of Chastity · Of the Friend","original_title":"Chapters 22–24","original_context":"Von den Fliegen des Marktes · Von der Keuschheit · Vom Freunde"},"original_title":"Chapters 22–24","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CL_97E9_09","layer":"CL","title":"Chapters 25–27","order":9,"parents":["CH_97E9_VTUE","CH_97E9_VDNC","CH_97E9_VWDS"],"revision":"CL_97E9_09@R001","sha256":"ef77ca91a27d36e3dc26347a7044af08352ada054da12b9489e2f767bdac0a7b","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_09:BAS-01","text":"Das Cluster rekonstruiert Wert, Liebe und Freiheit als keine vorfindlichen Güter, sondern als konfliktive Hervorbringungen von Kollektiven, Beziehungen und sich absondernden Einzelnen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:AS3","CH_97E9_VWDS:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:BAS-02","text":"Seine Bewegung führt von pluralen Wertordnungen über die Entlarvung sozialer Nähe als Selbstflucht zur einsamen Selbstgesetzgebung, welche neue Werte nur durch Trennung, Feindschaft und Selbstverwandlung erzeugen kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:AS5","CH_97E9_VDNC:AS1","CH_97E9_VWDS:AS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:BAS-03","text":"Das Problem besteht darin, wie aus unvermeidlich partikularen Wertsetzungen eine höhere Form von Menschheit, Freundschaft oder Schaffen hervorgehen kann, ohne in transzendente Moral, Herdenbindung oder unmittelbare Versöhnung zurückzufallen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A15","CH_97E9_VDNC:A12","CH_97E9_VWDS:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:BAS-04","text":"Das Argument wird spiralförmig: Kollektive schaffen den Einzelnen; der Einzelne löst sich schöpferisch von der Kollektivordnung; seine Selbstschöpfung bleibt jedoch von deren verinnerlichter Stimme, von Beziehung und von Zukunftsfiguren abhängig.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A10","CH_97E9_VWDS:A2","CH_97E9_VDNC:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:BAS-05","text":"Die vorläufige Schließung besteht nicht in einer erreichten Einheit, sondern in einer produktiven Leerstelle: Das Eine Ziel, die nicht-entfremdete Gemeinschaft und das gesicherte Selbst bleiben ausstehend und treiben die Wertschöpfung weiter.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A14","CH_97E9_VDNC:SNX5","CH_97E9_VWDS:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_09:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Wert ist keine vorgegebene Eigenschaft der Dinge, sondern entsteht durch Schätzen, Setzen und Ordnen menschlicher Lebensformen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A7","CH_97E9_VTUE:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:GA-02","text":"[Mutating] Wertschöpfung beginnt kollektiv als Selbsterhaltungsordnung, mutiert aber im Schaffenden zur gefährdeten Selbstgesetzgebung gegen die eigene Herkunft.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:AS2","CH_97E9_VTUE:A10","CH_97E9_VWDS:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:GA-03","text":"[Persistent] Jede positive Ordnung erzeugt sich durch Ausschluss, Überwindung oder Vernichtung einer vorausgehenden Ordnung und kann daher nicht unschuldig kontinuierlich fortbestehen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:AS4","CH_97E9_VWDS:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:GA-04","text":"[Mutating] Nähe ist zunächst Träger kollektiver Wertbindung, wird dann als Mechanismus der Selbstvermeidung entwertet und schließlich durch eine selektive, schöpferische Freundschaft ersetzt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A11","CH_97E9_VDNC:A1","CH_97E9_VDNC:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:GA-05","text":"[Attractor] Das Fernste und Künftige fungiert als normativer Attraktor, der gegenwärtige Beziehungen, Selbstbilder und Wertsetzungen rückwirkend ausrichtet.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A10","CH_97E9_VDNC:A17","CH_97E9_VDNC:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:GA-06","text":"[Emergent] Freiheit ist nicht Befreiung von Bindung, sondern die Fähigkeit, eigenes Gut und Böses zu setzen, zu richten und unter den Folgen dieser Setzung standzuhalten.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A4","CH_97E9_VWDS:A5","CH_97E9_VWDS:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:GA-07","text":"[Persistent] Das Selbst ist weder ursprünglicher Ursprung noch stabile Einheit, sondern ein hervorgebrachtes, gespaltenes und sich transformierendes Verhältnis.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A10","CH_97E9_VDNC:A2","CH_97E9_VWDS:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:GA-08","text":"[Terminal] Gerechtigkeit und Güte können nicht als vorgängige Maßstäbe fungieren, sondern erscheinen allenfalls verspätet als Effekte eines riskanten Werdens durch Zufall, Böses und Selbstzerstörung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A15","CH_97E9_VDNC:A16","CH_97E9_VWDS:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:GA-09","text":"[Attractor] Das Cluster organisiert seine Figuren um eine nicht erreichte Menschheit, deren Einheit nicht entdeckt, sondern durch eine noch unbestimmte höhere Wertschöpfung erzeugt werden müsste.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A14","CH_97E9_VTUE:A15","CH_97E9_VWDS:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_09:RMD-01","text":"Wertung kehrt stabil als Lebensbedingung wieder, verschiebt sich jedoch von der kollektiven Tafel über die Kritik sozialer Moral zur individuellen Selbstgesetzgebung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A1","CH_97E9_VDNC:A3","CH_97E9_VWDS:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:RMD-02","text":"Liebe mutiert von einem kollektiven Bindungs- und Herrschaftsmedium in eine verdächtige Näheform und schließlich in eine selektive Energie der Selbstüberwindung und Weltgabe.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A11","CH_97E9_VDNC:A1","CH_97E9_VWDS:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:RMD-03","text":"Der Einzelne erscheint zunächst als spätes Erzeugnis kollektiver Wertschöpfung, wird dann als durch soziale Spiegelung gefährdete Figur und zuletzt als gesetzgebende, aber innerlich vielfach geteilte Instanz.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A10","CH_97E9_VDNC:A5","CH_97E9_VWDS:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:RMD-04","text":"Das Böse wird von einer durch Wertung erzeugten Kategorie zu einem Durchgangsmaterial des Guten und zu einem inneren Gegenmachtfeld des Schaffenden umcodiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:AS3","CH_97E9_VDNC:A15","CH_97E9_VWDS:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:RMD-05","text":"Gemeinschaft wird nicht einfach verworfen, sondern in eine Abfolge aus Volk, Herde, Nächstenordnung und Freundschaft überführt, deren jeweilige Funktion zwischen Erhaltung, Täuschung, Prüfung und Schöpfung wechselt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:AS2","CH_97E9_VDNC:A8","CH_97E9_VDNC:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_09:CGD-01","text":"Die konkreten Gegensätze einzelner Völker und ihrer Gütertafeln bleiben untere Ebene; auf Clusterebene tragen sie nur als Beleg dafür, dass jede Wertordnung an Erhaltung, Macht und Ausschluss gebunden ist.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A3","CH_97E9_VTUE:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:CGD-02","text":"Die Diagnose sozialer Rollen, Zuschauer und verführter Zeugen bleibt lokal, wird aber global relevant, weil sie die Unzulänglichkeit jeder unmittelbaren Anerkennung für Selbstbildung zeigt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A5","CH_97E9_VDNC:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:CGD-03","text":"Die sieben Teufel, Asche und der geschaffene Gott bleiben bildhafte Mechanismen der unteren Ebene, werden auf Clusterebene jedoch in die allgemeine Regel überführt, dass Schaffen nur durch Umwandlung innerer Gegenmächte möglich wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A13","CH_97E9_VWDS:A14","CH_97E9_VWDS:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:CGD-04","text":"Die clusterweite Proposition lautet daher nicht, dass jede Person sich isolieren soll, sondern dass höhere Wertbildung weder durch geerbte Kollektivmoral noch durch unmittelbare Nähe gesichert werden kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A9","CH_97E9_VDNC:NX1","CH_97E9_VWDS:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_09:GNX-01","text":"Das System weist eine transzendente oder objektiv vorliegende Wertordnung zurück: Gut und Böse sind weder himmlische Vorgaben noch unabhängig vorhandene Gegenstände.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:NX4","CH_97E9_VTUE:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:GNX-02","text":"Es verwirft die Annahme, soziale Nähe garantiere Selbstlosigkeit, Wahrheit, Charakter oder Güte; Nähe kann vielmehr Selbstflucht, Rollenspiel und Externalisierung von Kosten organisieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:NX1","CH_97E9_VDNC:NX7","CH_97E9_VDNC:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:GNX-03","text":"Es verweigert Freiheit als negative Entbindung und ersetzt sie durch eine Freiheit, die sich in Selbstgesetz, Selbstgericht und Selbstgefährdung exponieren muss.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:NX3","CH_97E9_VWDS:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:GNX-04","text":"Es lässt weder ein stabiles Selbst noch eine Schöpfung ohne Selbstvernichtung zu; Kontinuität gilt als unzureichend für das Werden des Schaffenden.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:DNX1","CH_97E9_VWDS:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:GNX-05","text":"Es verweigert der Gegenwart die letzte normative Autorität, weil Wert, Güte und Menschheit an Zukunftsfiguren und nicht an unmittelbar gegebene Zustände gebunden werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:NX11","CH_97E9_VDNC:A17","CH_97E9_VTUE:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_09:DBN-01","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Gesamtmodell, in dem Menschheit bereits eine natürliche Einheit bildet und ihre Werte nur noch erkennen oder harmonisieren müsste.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:SNX1","CH_97E9_VTUE:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:DBN-02","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Gesamtmodell, in dem soziale Anerkennung und individuelle Selbstwerdung zusammenfallen; Anerkennung erscheint als potenzielle Maskierung, während Selbstwerdung Konflikt und Absonderung benötigt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A5","CH_97E9_VWDS:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:DBN-03","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist ein Gesamtmodell, in dem Autonomie eine ungespaltene Selbstherrschaft bedeutet; das autonome Selbst muss zugleich Gesetzgeber, Richter, Rächer, Feind und Material seiner eigenen Umformung sein.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A6","CH_97E9_VWDS:A12","CH_97E9_VWDS:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:DBN-04","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Ethik der unmittelbaren Reinheit, denn das Gute entsteht nur unter Einschluss von Zufall, Bösem, Verachtung und möglichem Zugrundegehen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A15","CH_97E9_VDNC:A16","CH_97E9_VWDS:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_09:BSA-01","text":"Die tiefste Abwesenheit ist eine nicht hergestellte Einheit, die zugleich universal, nicht-herrschaftlich und nicht-partikular wäre; ihre Unverfügbarkeit hält die gesamte Maschine der Wertschöpfung in Bewegung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:SNX3","CH_97E9_VTUE:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:BSA-02","text":"Unzulässig ist die Möglichkeit eines Selbst, das sich ohne Fremdprägung, ohne Selbstflucht, ohne innere Gegnerschaft und ohne Selbstzerstörung unmittelbar besitzen könnte.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:SNX2","CH_97E9_VWDS:SNX3","CH_97E9_VWDS:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:BSA-03","text":"Das System umkreist eine Gemeinschaft, in der Nähe weder Täuschung noch Herdenzwang noch Opferung der Fernen wäre, stellt eine solche Gemeinschaft aber nicht positiv bereit.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:SNX5","CH_97E9_VWDS:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_09:XD-01","text":"Die Pluralität der Wertordnungen und die Kritik der Nächstenliebe verbinden sich zu der Konsequenz, dass moralische Universalität nicht aus geteilter Nähe hervorgehen kann, weil Nähe selbst eine partikulare Erhaltungs- und Selbsttäuschungsordnung sein kann.","refs":["CL_97E9_09:GA-01","CL_97E9_09:GA-04","CH_97E9_VTUE:A4","CH_97E9_VDNC:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:XD-02","text":"Der Übergang vom Volk zum Schaffenden erzeugt keine Befreiung von sozialer Macht, sondern verlagert deren Wert- und Schuldmechanismen in die Selbstbeziehung des Einzelnen.","refs":["CL_97E9_09:GA-02","CL_97E9_09:GA-07","CH_97E9_VTUE:A10","CH_97E9_VWDS:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:XD-03","text":"Freundschaft erhält ihre höhere Funktion nur, wenn sie weder Nächstenordnung noch bloße Vereinsamung reproduziert, sondern eine Beziehung bildet, die Distanz, Weltgabe und Zukunftsursächlichkeit zugleich trägt.","refs":["CL_97E9_09:GA-04","CL_97E9_09:GA-05","CH_97E9_VDNC:A12","CH_97E9_VDNC:A14","CH_97E9_VDNC:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:XD-04","text":"Die Selbstgesetzgebung des Schaffenden radikalisiert die genealogische Werttheorie: Was für Völker als Werttafel fungiert, muss der Einzelne als gefährdetes Gesetz seiner Selbstüberwindung erzeugen.","refs":["CL_97E9_09:GA-01","CL_97E9_09:GA-02","CL_97E9_09:GA-06","CH_97E9_VTUE:A5","CH_97E9_VWDS:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:XD-05","text":"Die zeitliche Umkehrung durch das Fernste verschiebt die Frage nach dem Einen Ziel: Es erscheint nicht als gegenwärtiger Konsens, sondern als Zukunftsursache, die bestehende Wertordnungen transformieren müsste.","refs":["CL_97E9_09:GA-05","CL_97E9_09:GA-09","CH_97E9_VTUE:A14","CH_97E9_VDNC:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_09:BSD-01","text":"Das Cluster erzeugt eine Ontologie der normativen Produktion: Realität erscheint nicht als wertneutraler Grund, auf den Werte aufgesetzt werden, sondern als Feld, dessen Sinn, Subjekte und Zwecke durch Wertkämpfe hervorgebracht werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A8","CH_97E9_VDNC:A16","CH_97E9_VWDS:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:BSD-02","text":"Politische und ethische Ordnung werden als Technologien der Subjektproduktion lesbar: Volk, Herde, Nächster und Freund bezeichnen nicht natürliche Gruppen, sondern unterschiedliche Maschinen der Bindung, Prüfung und Umformung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A10","CH_97E9_VDNC:A8","CH_97E9_VDNC:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:BSD-03","text":"Die höchste Handlungsmacht liegt nicht im Schutz einer vorhandenen Identität, sondern in der Fähigkeit, innere und äußere Gegnerschaft als Material einer riskanten Neuschöpfung zu verwenden.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A9","CH_97E9_VWDS:A12","CH_97E9_VWDS:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:BSD-04","text":"Geschichte wird als unabschließbarer Prozess gelesen, in dem neue Ziele nur entstehen, indem sie frühere Ziele zerstören, ihre eigene Partikularität riskieren und mögliche Untergänge einschließen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A9","CH_97E9_VWDS:A14","CH_97E9_VWDS:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_09:RLE-01","text":"Die Grundschleife lautet: Wertsetzung erzeugt Bindung; Bindung erzeugt Herde und soziale Moral; diese Moral erzeugt Selbstflucht oder Schuld; die Krise erzwingt neue Wertsetzung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:AS2","CH_97E9_VDNC:AS2","CH_97E9_VWDS:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:RLE-02","text":"Die Selbstschöpfungsschleife lautet: Absonderung erzeugt innere Anklage; Anklage erzwingt Selbstgesetzgebung; Selbstgesetzgebung vertieft Einsamkeit; Einsamkeit liefert das Material der Selbstverbrennung und damit neuen Schaffens.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A2","CH_97E9_VWDS:A6","CH_97E9_VWDS:A7","CH_97E9_VWDS:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:RLE-03","text":"Die Zukunft fungiert als Attraktor, weil sie zugleich das fehlende Eine Ziel, den Fernsten, den Übermenschen und die noch nicht erreichte Gerechtigkeit bündelt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A14","CH_97E9_VDNC:A10","CH_97E9_VDNC:A18","CH_97E9_VWDS:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:RLE-04","text":"Die Eskalation verläuft von kollektiver Differenz über soziale Kritik zu ontologischer Selbstverwandlung: Wertpluralität wird nicht aufgehoben, sondern im Schaffenden zur Pflicht einer gefährdeten eigenen Wertordnung verdichtet.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:AS1","CH_97E9_VDNC:AS3","CH_97E9_VWDS:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_09:FGS-B01","text":"Verschiedene Lebenslagen → verschiedene Werttafeln → Wert als Macht-, Überwindungs- und Selbsterhaltungsordnung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:AS1","CH_97E9_VTUE:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:FGS-B02","text":"Kollektive Wertordnung → Vorrang des Du und der Herde → soziale Spiegelung, Selbstflucht und Verinnerlichung des Gewissens.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A3","CH_97E9_VDNC:A5","CH_97E9_VWDS:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:FGS-B03","text":"Kritik der Nähe → Vorrang von Fernstem und Zukunft → Freundschaft als selektive Beziehung der Weltgabe und Überschreitung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A10","CH_97E9_VDNC:A12","CH_97E9_VDNC:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:FGS-B04","text":"Absonderung → Forderung nach neuem Recht → Selbstgesetzgebung → innere und äußere Feindschaft → Selbstverbrennung → neue Wertschöpfung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A3","CH_97E9_VWDS:A6","CH_97E9_VWDS:A9","CH_97E9_VWDS:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:FGS-B05","text":"Neue Wertschöpfung → verspätete Güte und Gerechtigkeit → erneute Öffnung auf ein noch fehlendes gemeinsames Ziel.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A15","CH_97E9_VWDS:A17","CH_97E9_VTUE:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_09:AFM-B01","text":"Wertpluralität → Entnaturalisierung von Gut und Böse → Kritik der Nähe als Selbstflucht → Fernsten- und Zukunftsorientierung → Absonderung von der Herde → Selbstgesetzgebung → konfliktive Selbstverbrennung → erneute Wertschöpfung → unvollendete Menschheit.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:AS5","CH_97E9_VTUE:A7","CH_97E9_VDNC:AS1","CH_97E9_VDNC:A10","CH_97E9_VWDS:AS1","CH_97E9_VWDS:A5","CH_97E9_VWDS:A14","CH_97E9_VTUE:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_09:MME-01","text":"Moral wird von einem Feld richtiger Regeln in ein Feld konkurrierender Produktionsweisen von Sinn, Macht, Subjektivität und Zukunft umkartiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:ME1","CH_97E9_VDNC:ME1","CH_97E9_VWDS:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:MME-02","text":"Das Soziale wird neu klassifiziert: Es ist weder einfach Grundlage des Menschen noch bloß Gegner des Einzelnen, sondern ein ambivalenter Apparat aus Wertbindung, Anerkennungstäuschung, Kostenverschiebung und Material für Überschreitung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A11","CH_97E9_VDNC:A7","CH_97E9_VWDS:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:MME-03","text":"Freiheit wird als strategische Kompetenz lesbar, die eigene Normen setzt, ihre destruktiven Kosten trägt und Widerstand nicht als äußerlichen Unfall, sondern als Prüfungsbedingung behandelt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A4","CH_97E9_VWDS:A9","CH_97E9_VWDS:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:MME-04","text":"Zeit wird umgeordnet: Gegenwart ist nicht Ursprung der Zukunft, sondern wird durch künftige Gestalten, Ziele und Wertmöglichkeiten rückwirkend selektiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A17","CH_97E9_VDNC:D10","CH_97E9_VDNC:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_09:ALT-B01","text":"Surface level — Völker, Herde, Nächste, Freund und Einsamer erscheinen als unterschiedliche Figuren der Wertbindung, Selbsttäuschung, Absonderung und Schöpfung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:AS5","CH_97E9_VDNC:AS5","CH_97E9_VWDS:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:ALT-B02","text":"Structural level — Wertordnungen erzeugen Subjekte, soziale Beziehungen regulieren Selbstverhältnisse, und Selbstwerdung entsteht als konflikthafte Umwandlung kollektiver Normen in eigene Gesetzgebung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A10","CH_97E9_VDNC:AS3","CH_97E9_VWDS:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:ALT-B03","text":"Metastrategic level — Die entscheidende Intervention besteht darin, Nähe, Reinheit und bloße Befreiung durch Distanz, selektive Beziehung, Zukunftsbindung und produktive Selbstgefährdung zu ersetzen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A10","CH_97E9_VDNC:NX12","CH_97E9_VWDS:NX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:ALT-B04","text":"Ontological / Temporal level — Realität wird als Werden von Sinn und Wert gefasst; das Selbst bleibt gespalten, Zukunft wird ursächlich, und Gerechtigkeit ist ein nachträglicher, nicht garantierter Effekt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A8","CH_97E9_VDNC:A17","CH_97E9_VWDS:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:ALT-B05","text":"Methodological / Performative level — Die Form vollzieht ihre These, indem sie Begriffe nicht stabil definiert, sondern sie durch Umkehrung, Rangverschiebung und bildhafte Selbstzersetzung in operative Maschinen verwandelt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:AS4","CH_97E9_VWDS:A14","CH_97E9_VWDS:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_09:FL-01","text":"Die notwendige Eigenwertung der Völker steht unter Spannung mit der Forderung nach einem Einen Ziel, weil ein gemeinsames Ziel selbst nur als weitere, machtvolle und möglicherweise partikulare Wertsetzung gedacht werden kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A2","CH_97E9_VTUE:A14","CH_97E9_VTUE:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:FL-02","text":"Die Kritik sozialer Nähe steht unter Spannung mit der positiven Funktion des Freundes, weil Freundschaft zugleich als Ausweg aus Selbsttäuschung und als neue Form der Abhängigkeit von einer Beziehung fungiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A8","CH_97E9_VDNC:A12","CH_97E9_VDNC:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:FL-03","text":"Die Selbstgesetzgebung bleibt paradox, weil sie Autonomie fordert, aber aus Herdengewissen, sozialer Feindschaft und einer fremden Aufforderung zur Rechtfertigung hervorgeht.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A2","CH_97E9_VWDS:A9","CH_97E9_VWDS:SD6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:MP-01","text":"Liebe mutiert an der Grenze zwischen Nächstenliebe und Freundschaft: Was als Nähe und Hilfe verdächtig wird, kehrt als distanzierende Weltgabe und Zukunftsbeziehung wieder.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A1","CH_97E9_VDNC:A12","CH_97E9_VDNC:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:MP-02","text":"Gerechtigkeit mutiert von einem vorausgesetzten Maßstab zu einem verspäteten Resultat des Schaffens und verliert damit ihre Fähigkeit, den Weg vorab zu legitimieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A17","CH_97E9_VWDS:D11","CH_97E9_VWDS:ME7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:MP-03","text":"Das Selbst mutiert von einem kollektiv erzeugten Produkt zu einer selbstgesetzgebenden Instanz, ohne seine Herkunft aus Kollektivität oder seine innere Spaltung vollständig abstreifen zu können.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A10","CH_97E9_VWDS:A5","CH_97E9_VWDS:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_09:HSI-01","text":"Die Realität erscheint als Wertschöpfungsmaschine, in der Kollektive und Einzelne Sinn durch Auswahl, Ausschluss, Selbstbindung und Zerstörung erzeugen; keine Instanz bleibt außerhalb dieser Produktion.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A7","CH_97E9_VTUE:A9","CH_97E9_VWDS:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:HSI-02","text":"Das Subjekt erscheint als Durchgangsform zwischen Herde und Zukunft: Es ist zugleich Produkt vergangener Werttafeln, Träger verinnerlichter Gegner und möglicher Schöpfer einer noch nicht vorhandenen Ordnung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A10","CH_97E9_VWDS:A2","CH_97E9_VWDS:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:HSI-03","text":"Zeit erscheint als rückwirkende Kausalität, in der das Noch-nicht die Gegenwart formt, während Kampf als Navigation durch Selbstflucht, Distanz, Selbstzerstörung und erneute Setzung möglich bleibt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A17","CH_97E9_VWDS:A16","CH_97E9_VWDS:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_09:MRT-B01","text":"Die extrahierten Axiome reichen aus, um die clusterweite Bewegung von Wertpluralität über die Kritik sozialer Moral bis zur Selbstgesetzgebung und offenen Zukunftsorientierung zu rekonstruieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:AS6","CH_97E9_VDNC:AS4","CH_97E9_VWDS:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:MRT-B02","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, nach welchem Kriterium eine selbstgesetzte Wertordnung von bloßer Willkür unterschieden werden kann und wie ein gemeinsames Ziel entstehen soll, ohne die genealogisch behauptete Pluralität gewaltsam zu neutralisieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:SNX4","CH_97E9_VWDS:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:MRT-B03","text":"Die Architektur ist am stärksten, wo Wertschöpfung, Selbstverhältnis, Zukunft und Zerstörung als rekursive Einheit sichtbar werden; sie bleibt auf produktive Unentschiedenheit angewiesen, wo Freundschaft, Menschheit und Gerechtigkeit positive Gestalt annehmen sollen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A9","CH_97E9_VDNC:A18","CH_97E9_VWDS:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:MRT-B04","text":"Die Rekonstruktion bewahrt die tatsächliche Bewegung nur, wenn ihre Bilder nicht als dekorative Metaphern reduziert werden: Herde, Fernster, Freund, Teufel, Flamme und Übermensch operieren als Transformationsfiguren der Begriffsmaschine.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A10","CH_97E9_VDNC:A18","CH_97E9_VWDS:A13","CH_97E9_VWDS:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T200044999226Z_6ed000e0","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Chapters 25–27","source_sha256":"ef77ca91a27d36e3dc26347a7044af08352ada054da12b9489e2f767bdac0a7b","sha256":"c9c853585385b1ce67768241666befe57a60f4ecf316c5d91cde40dbc351ef8d","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T20:00:45.000928+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_09:BAS-01","text":"The cluster reconstructs value, love, and freedom not as pre-existing goods, but as conflictual productions of collectives, relationships, and individuals separating themselves off.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:AS3","CH_97E9_VWDS:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:BAS-02","text":"Its movement leads from plural value orders, through the unmasking of social proximity as flight from oneself, to solitary self-legislation, which can produce new values only through separation, enmity, and self-transformation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:AS5","CH_97E9_VDNC:AS1","CH_97E9_VWDS:AS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:BAS-03","text":"The problem consists in how a higher form of humanity, friendship, or creation can emerge from inevitably particular value-positings without relapsing into transcendent morality, herd attachment, or immediate reconciliation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A15","CH_97E9_VDNC:A12","CH_97E9_VWDS:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:BAS-04","text":"The argument becomes spiral-shaped: collectives create the individual; the individual creatively detaches from the collective order; yet his self-creation remains dependent on its internalized voice, on relationship, and on figures of the future.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A10","CH_97E9_VWDS:A2","CH_97E9_VDNC:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:BAS-05","text":"The provisional closure consists not in an attained unity, but in a productive blank: the One Goal, the non-alienated community, and the secured self remain outstanding and continue to drive value creation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A14","CH_97E9_VDNC:SNX5","CH_97E9_VWDS:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_09:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Value is not a pre-given property of things, but arises through the valuing, positing, and ordering of human forms of life.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A7","CH_97E9_VTUE:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:GA-02","text":"[Mutating] Value creation begins collectively as an order of self-preservation, but mutates in the creator into endangered self-legislation against its own origin.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:AS2","CH_97E9_VTUE:A10","CH_97E9_VWDS:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:GA-03","text":"[Persistent] Every positive order creates itself through the exclusion, overcoming, or destruction of a preceding order and can therefore not persist innocently and continuously.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:AS4","CH_97E9_VWDS:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:GA-04","text":"[Mutating] Proximity is initially the bearer of collective value attachment, is then devalued as a mechanism of self-avoidance, and is finally replaced by a selective, creative friendship.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A11","CH_97E9_VDNC:A1","CH_97E9_VDNC:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:GA-05","text":"[Attractor] The most distant and the future function as a normative attractor that retrospectively orients present relationships, self-images, and value-positings.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A10","CH_97E9_VDNC:A17","CH_97E9_VDNC:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:GA-06","text":"[Emergent] Freedom is not liberation from attachment, but the capacity to posit and judge one's own good and evil and to withstand the consequences of this positing.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A4","CH_97E9_VWDS:A5","CH_97E9_VWDS:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:GA-07","text":"[Persistent] The self is neither an original origin nor a stable unity, but a produced, divided, and self-transforming relation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A10","CH_97E9_VDNC:A2","CH_97E9_VWDS:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:GA-08","text":"[Terminal] Justice and goodness cannot function as prior standards, but appear, if at all, belatedly as effects of a risky becoming through chance, evil, and self-destruction.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A15","CH_97E9_VDNC:A16","CH_97E9_VWDS:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:GA-09","text":"[Attractor] The cluster organizes its figures around an unattained humanity whose unity would have to be produced, rather than discovered, through a still indeterminate higher value creation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A14","CH_97E9_VTUE:A15","CH_97E9_VWDS:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_09:RMD-01","text":"Valuation recurs stably as a condition of life, but shifts from the collective table through the critique of social morality to individual self-legislation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A1","CH_97E9_VDNC:A3","CH_97E9_VWDS:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:RMD-02","text":"Love mutates from a collective medium of attachment and domination into a suspicious form of proximity and finally into a selective energy of self-overcoming and world-giving.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A11","CH_97E9_VDNC:A1","CH_97E9_VWDS:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:RMD-03","text":"The individual initially appears as a late product of collective value creation, then as a figure endangered by social mirroring, and finally as a legislating but inwardly multiply divided instance.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A10","CH_97E9_VDNC:A5","CH_97E9_VWDS:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:RMD-04","text":"Evil is recoded from a category produced by valuation into a transitional material of the good and into an inner field of counter-power of the creator.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:AS3","CH_97E9_VDNC:A15","CH_97E9_VWDS:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:RMD-05","text":"Community is not simply rejected, but transferred into a sequence of people, herd, neighbor-order, and friendship, whose respective function shifts among preservation, deception, testing, and creation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:AS2","CH_97E9_VDNC:A8","CH_97E9_VDNC:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_09:CGD-01","text":"The concrete oppositions of individual peoples and their tables of goods remain at the lower level; at the cluster level, they matter only as evidence that every value order is bound to preservation, power, and exclusion.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A3","CH_97E9_VTUE:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:CGD-02","text":"The diagnosis of social roles, spectators, and seduced witnesses remains local, but becomes globally relevant because it shows the inadequacy of every immediate recognition for self-formation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A5","CH_97E9_VDNC:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:CGD-03","text":"The seven devils, ashes, and the created god remain figurative mechanisms of the lower level, but at the cluster level are transferred into the general rule that creation is possible only through the transformation of inner counter-powers.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A13","CH_97E9_VWDS:A14","CH_97E9_VWDS:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:CGD-04","text":"The cluster-wide proposition is therefore not that every person should isolate themselves, but that higher value formation can be secured neither through inherited collective morality nor through immediate proximity.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A9","CH_97E9_VDNC:NX1","CH_97E9_VWDS:NX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_09:GNX-01","text":"The system rejects a transcendent or objectively existing value order: good and evil are neither heavenly prescriptions nor independently existing objects.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:NX4","CH_97E9_VTUE:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:GNX-02","text":"It rejects the assumption that social proximity guarantees selflessness, truth, character, or goodness; proximity can instead organize flight from oneself, role-playing, and the externalization of costs.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:NX1","CH_97E9_VDNC:NX7","CH_97E9_VDNC:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:GNX-03","text":"It refuses freedom as negative release from bonds and replaces it with a freedom that must expose itself in self-legislation, self-judgment, and self-endangerment.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:NX3","CH_97E9_VWDS:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:GNX-04","text":"It permits neither a stable self nor a creation without self-destruction; continuity is held insufficient for the becoming of the creator.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:DNX1","CH_97E9_VWDS:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:GNX-05","text":"It denies the present final normative authority, because value, goodness, and humanity are bound to figures of the future rather than to immediately given states.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:NX11","CH_97E9_VDNC:A17","CH_97E9_VTUE:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_09:DBN-01","text":"Excluded is an overall model in which humanity already forms a natural unity and would merely have to recognize or harmonize its values.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:SNX1","CH_97E9_VTUE:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:DBN-02","text":"Excluded is an overall model in which social recognition and individual self-becoming coincide; recognition appears as potential masking, while self-becoming requires conflict and separation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A5","CH_97E9_VWDS:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:DBN-03","text":"Excluded is an overall model in which autonomy means undivided self-rule; the autonomous self must at once be legislator, judge, avenger, enemy, and material of its own reshaping.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A6","CH_97E9_VWDS:A12","CH_97E9_VWDS:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:DBN-04","text":"Excluded is an ethics of immediate purity, for the good arises only through the inclusion of chance, evil, contempt, and possible ruin.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A15","CH_97E9_VDNC:A16","CH_97E9_VWDS:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_09:BSA-01","text":"The deepest absence is an unproduced unity that would at once be universal, non-dominating, and non-particular; its unavailability keeps the entire machine of value creation in motion.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:SNX3","CH_97E9_VTUE:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:BSA-02","text":"Impermissible is the possibility of a self that could immediately possess itself without external shaping, without flight from itself, without inner antagonism, and without self-destruction.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:SNX2","CH_97E9_VWDS:SNX3","CH_97E9_VWDS:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:BSA-03","text":"The system circles around a community in which proximity would be neither deception nor herd compulsion nor sacrifice of the distant, but does not positively provide such a community.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:SNX5","CH_97E9_VWDS:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_09:XD-01","text":"The plurality of value orders and the critique of neighborly love combine in the consequence that moral universality cannot arise from shared proximity, because proximity itself can be a particular order of preservation and self-deception.","refs":["CL_97E9_09:GA-01","CL_97E9_09:GA-04","CH_97E9_VTUE:A4","CH_97E9_VDNC:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:XD-02","text":"The transition from the people to the creator produces no liberation from social power, but relocates its mechanisms of value and guilt into the individual's relation to self.","refs":["CL_97E9_09:GA-02","CL_97E9_09:GA-07","CH_97E9_VTUE:A10","CH_97E9_VWDS:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:XD-03","text":"Friendship receives its higher function only if it reproduces neither neighbor-order nor mere isolation, but instead forms a relation that simultaneously bears distance, world-giving, and future-causality.","refs":["CL_97E9_09:GA-04","CL_97E9_09:GA-05","CH_97E9_VDNC:A12","CH_97E9_VDNC:A14","CH_97E9_VDNC:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:XD-04","text":"The creator's self-legislation radicalizes genealogical value theory: what functions as a table of values for peoples, the individual must produce as the endangered law of their self-overcoming.","refs":["CL_97E9_09:GA-01","CL_97E9_09:GA-02","CL_97E9_09:GA-06","CH_97E9_VTUE:A5","CH_97E9_VWDS:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:XD-05","text":"The temporal reversal through the most distant displaces the question of the One Goal: it appears not as present consensus, but as a future cause that would have to transform existing value orders.","refs":["CL_97E9_09:GA-05","CL_97E9_09:GA-09","CH_97E9_VTUE:A14","CH_97E9_VDNC:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_09:BSD-01","text":"The cluster produces an ontology of normative production: reality appears not as a value-neutral ground upon which values are imposed, but as a field whose meaning, subjects, and purposes are produced through value struggles.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A8","CH_97E9_VDNC:A16","CH_97E9_VWDS:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:BSD-02","text":"Political and ethical order become legible as technologies of subject production: people, herd, neighbor, and friend designate not natural groups, but different machines of attachment, testing, and transformation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A10","CH_97E9_VDNC:A8","CH_97E9_VDNC:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:BSD-03","text":"The highest agency lies not in protecting an existing identity, but in the capacity to use inner and outer antagonism as material for a risky re-creation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A9","CH_97E9_VWDS:A12","CH_97E9_VWDS:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:BSD-04","text":"History is read as an unfinishable process in which new goals arise only by destroying earlier goals, risking their own particularity, and including possible downfalls.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A9","CH_97E9_VWDS:A14","CH_97E9_VWDS:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_09:RLE-01","text":"The basic loop is: value-positing produces attachment; attachment produces herd and social morality; this morality produces flight from oneself or guilt; the crisis compels new value-positing.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:AS2","CH_97E9_VDNC:AS2","CH_97E9_VWDS:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:RLE-02","text":"The self-creation loop is: separation produces inner accusation; accusation compels self-legislation; self-legislation deepens solitude; solitude supplies the material of self-burning and thereby of new creation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A2","CH_97E9_VWDS:A6","CH_97E9_VWDS:A7","CH_97E9_VWDS:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:RLE-03","text":"The future functions as an attractor because it simultaneously bundles the missing One Goal, the most distant one, the Übermensch, and justice not yet attained.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A14","CH_97E9_VDNC:A10","CH_97E9_VDNC:A18","CH_97E9_VWDS:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:RLE-04","text":"The escalation proceeds from collective difference through social critique to ontological self-transformation: value plurality is not sublated, but condensed in the creator into the duty of an endangered value order of one's own.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:AS1","CH_97E9_VDNC:AS3","CH_97E9_VWDS:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_09:FGS-B01","text":"Different situations of life → different tables of values → value as an order of power, overcoming, and self-preservation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:AS1","CH_97E9_VTUE:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:FGS-B02","text":"Collective value order → priority of the You and the herd → social mirroring, flight from oneself, and internalization of conscience.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A3","CH_97E9_VDNC:A5","CH_97E9_VWDS:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:FGS-B03","text":"Critique of proximity → priority of the most distant and the future → friendship as a selective relation of world-giving and transgression.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A10","CH_97E9_VDNC:A12","CH_97E9_VDNC:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:FGS-B04","text":"Separation → demand for new law → self-legislation → inner and outer enmity → self-burning → new value creation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A3","CH_97E9_VWDS:A6","CH_97E9_VWDS:A9","CH_97E9_VWDS:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:FGS-B05","text":"New value creation → belated goodness and justice → renewed opening toward a still-missing common goal.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A15","CH_97E9_VWDS:A17","CH_97E9_VTUE:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_09:AFM-B01","text":"Value plurality → denaturalization of good and evil → critique of proximity as flight from oneself → orientation toward the most distant and the future → separation from the herd → self-legislation → conflictual self-burning → renewed value creation → unfinished humanity.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:AS5","CH_97E9_VTUE:A7","CH_97E9_VDNC:AS1","CH_97E9_VDNC:A10","CH_97E9_VWDS:AS1","CH_97E9_VWDS:A5","CH_97E9_VWDS:A14","CH_97E9_VTUE:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_09:MME-01","text":"Morality is remapped from a field of correct rules into a field of competing modes of producing meaning, power, subjectivity, and future.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:ME1","CH_97E9_VDNC:ME1","CH_97E9_VWDS:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:MME-02","text":"The social is reclassified: it is neither simply the foundation of the human being nor merely the opponent of the individual, but an ambivalent apparatus of value attachment, the deception of recognition, displacement of costs, and material for transgression.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A11","CH_97E9_VDNC:A7","CH_97E9_VWDS:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:MME-03","text":"Freedom becomes legible as a strategic competence that posits its own norms, bears their destructive costs, and treats resistance not as an external accident, but as a condition of testing.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A4","CH_97E9_VWDS:A9","CH_97E9_VWDS:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:MME-04","text":"Time is reordered: the present is not the origin of the future, but is retrospectively selected by future forms, goals, and value possibilities.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A17","CH_97E9_VDNC:D10","CH_97E9_VDNC:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_09:ALT-B01","text":"Surface level — peoples, herd, neighbor, friend, and solitary one appear as different figures of value attachment, self-deception, separation, and creation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:AS5","CH_97E9_VDNC:AS5","CH_97E9_VWDS:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:ALT-B02","text":"Structural level — value orders produce subjects, social relationships regulate relations to self, and self-becoming arises as the conflictual transformation of collective norms into legislation of one's own.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A10","CH_97E9_VDNC:AS3","CH_97E9_VWDS:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:ALT-B03","text":"Metastrategic level — the decisive intervention consists in replacing proximity, purity, and mere liberation with distance, selective relation, attachment to the future, and productive self-endangerment.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A10","CH_97E9_VDNC:NX12","CH_97E9_VWDS:NX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:ALT-B04","text":"Ontological / Temporal level — reality is conceived as the becoming of meaning and value; the self remains divided, the future becomes causal, and justice is a subsequent, unguaranteed effect.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A8","CH_97E9_VDNC:A17","CH_97E9_VWDS:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:ALT-B05","text":"Methodological / Performative level — the form enacts its thesis by not defining concepts stably, but by transforming them into operative machines through reversal, shifts of rank, and figurative self-disintegration.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:AS4","CH_97E9_VWDS:A14","CH_97E9_VWDS:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_09:FL-01","text":"The necessary self-valuation of peoples stands in tension with the demand for a One Goal, because a common goal itself can be conceived only as a further, powerful, and possibly particular value-positing.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A2","CH_97E9_VTUE:A14","CH_97E9_VTUE:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:FL-02","text":"The critique of social proximity stands in tension with the positive function of the friend, because friendship functions both as a way out of self-deception and as a new form of dependence on a relationship.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A8","CH_97E9_VDNC:A12","CH_97E9_VDNC:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:FL-03","text":"Self-legislation remains paradoxical because it demands autonomy, yet arises from herd conscience, social enmity, and an alien demand for justification.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A2","CH_97E9_VWDS:A9","CH_97E9_VWDS:SD6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:MP-01","text":"Love mutates at the boundary between neighborly love and friendship: what becomes suspect as proximity and assistance returns as distancing world-giving and a relation to the future.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A1","CH_97E9_VDNC:A12","CH_97E9_VDNC:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:MP-02","text":"Justice mutates from a presupposed standard into a belated result of creation and thereby loses its capacity to legitimize the path in advance.","refs":["CH_97E9_VWDS:A17","CH_97E9_VWDS:D11","CH_97E9_VWDS:ME7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:MP-03","text":"The self mutates from a collectively produced product into a self-legislating instance without being able fully to shed either its origin in collectivity or its inner division.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A10","CH_97E9_VWDS:A5","CH_97E9_VWDS:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_09:HSI-01","text":"Reality appears as a machine of value creation in which collectives and individuals produce meaning through selection, exclusion, self-attachment, and destruction; no instance remains outside this production.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A7","CH_97E9_VTUE:A9","CH_97E9_VWDS:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:HSI-02","text":"The subject appears as a transitional form between herd and future: it is at once the product of past tables of values, bearer of internalized enemies, and possible creator of an order not yet existing.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A10","CH_97E9_VWDS:A2","CH_97E9_VWDS:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:HSI-03","text":"Time appears as retroactive causality, in which the not-yet shapes the present, while struggle remains possible as navigation through flight from oneself, distance, self-destruction, and renewed positing.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A17","CH_97E9_VWDS:A16","CH_97E9_VWDS:A18"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_09:MRT-B01","text":"The extracted axioms suffice to reconstruct the cluster-wide movement from value plurality through the critique of social morality to self-legislation and open orientation toward the future.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:AS6","CH_97E9_VDNC:AS4","CH_97E9_VWDS:AS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:MRT-B02","text":"It remains underdetermined by what criterion a self-positing value order can be distinguished from mere arbitrariness and how a common goal is to arise without violently neutralizing the genealogically asserted plurality.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:SNX4","CH_97E9_VWDS:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:MRT-B03","text":"The architecture is strongest where value creation, relation to self, future, and destruction become visible as a recursive unity; it remains dependent on productive indeterminacy where friendship, humanity, and justice are to assume positive form.","refs":["CH_97E9_VTUE:A9","CH_97E9_VDNC:A18","CH_97E9_VWDS:A17"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_09:MRT-B04","text":"The reconstruction preserves the actual movement only if its images are not reduced to decorative metaphors: herd, most distant one, friend, devil, flame, and Übermensch operate as transformational figures of the conceptual machine.","refs":["CH_97E9_VDNC:A10","CH_97E9_VDNC:A18","CH_97E9_VWDS:A13","CH_97E9_VWDS:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CL_97E9_09@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CL_97E9_09:v1","source_language_code":"de","original_title":"Chapters 25–27"}],"identity":{"layer":"CL","kicker":"Cluster · Also sprach Zarathustra","title":"Chapters 25–27","context":"Of a Thousand and One Goals · Of Neighbor-Love · Of the Way of the Creator","original_title":"Chapters 25–27","original_context":"Von tausend und Einem Ziele · Von der Nächstenliebe · Vom Wege des Schaffenden"},"original_title":"Chapters 25–27","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CL_97E9_10","layer":"CL","title":"Chapters 28–30","order":10,"parents":["CH_97E9_VAUJ","CH_97E9_VBDN","CH_97E9_VKUE"],"revision":"CL_97E9_10@R001","sha256":"2f80806aaaa075d0bd0dd15c8c1014096b44aa6f8d88b752fff03b98b032b7d7","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_10:ABS-01","text":"Das Cluster prüft soziale, erotische und feindliche Beziehungen nicht nach Gegenseitigkeit oder institutioneller Anerkennung, sondern nach ihrer Fähigkeit, eine stärkere Form des Lebens hervorzubringen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:ABS-02","text":"Die Beziehung wird nur gültig, sofern sie Gegenwart, Bedürfnis, Verletzung oder Geschlechterfunktion in einen über den unmittelbar Beteiligten hinausweisenden Prozess der Selbstüberwindung überführt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:AS3","CH_97E9_VBDN:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:ABS-03","text":"Reproduktion fungiert zunächst als asymmetrische Unterwerfung weiblicher Existenz unter Kind, Mann und Zukunft, wird aber in der Ehe-Lehre zu einem selektiven Projekt gemeinsamer Hervorbringung mutiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A2","CH_97E9_VKUE:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:ABS-04","text":"Die Gerechtigkeitslehre unterbricht jede Vorstellung, dass Überwindung mit Versöhnung identisch sei, weil Verletzung als erinnerbarer Rest erhalten bleibt und in spätere Vergeltung umschlagen kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:ABS-05","text":"Liebe wird weder als autonomer Affekt noch als friedliche Bindung behandelt, sondern als gefährliche, schmerzhafte und normierbare Energie, die auf Krieg, Gehorsam, Schaffen oder eine höhere Zukunft verteilt wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:AS5","CH_97E9_VKUE:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:ABS-06","text":"Die Bewegung des Clusters ist spiralförmig: Beziehung wird auf einen zukünftigen Überschuss verpflichtet, erzeugt dabei Ausschlüsse und Lasten, und kehrt als nicht aufgelöste Gegenkraft von Erinnerung, Gefahr oder weiblicher Gegenrede zurück.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:AS7","CH_97E9_VBDN:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:ABS-07","text":"Die Norm wird nicht als allgemein anwendbares Gesetz erzeugt, sondern als Rangprüfung derjenigen, die Wünsche, Schmerz, Unrecht und Zukunft tragen können.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:A6","CH_97E9_VKUE:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:ABS-08","text":"Die erreichte Schließung bleibt prekär, weil das System schöpferische Zukunft nur durch hierarchische Funktionszuweisung, ungleiche Tragfähigkeit und fortbestehende Reste der Vergeltung organisieren kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A12","CH_97E9_VBDN:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_10:GA-01","text":"[Attractor] Eine Beziehung besitzt Gültigkeit nur, wenn sie über die unmittelbaren Beteiligten hinaus eine größere, zukünftige oder stärkere Form erzeugt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:A7","CH_97E9_VKUE:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:GA-02","text":"[Mutating] Fortpflanzung bleibt ein Verfahren der Zukunftsproduktion, mutiert jedoch von der einseitigen Funktionalisierung des Weibes zu einer selektiven Forderung nach Selbstüberstieg und gemeinsamem Schaffen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A2","CH_97E9_VKUE:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:GA-03","text":"[Persistent] Unmittelbares Begehren legitimiert weder Kind, Ehe, Liebe noch Vergeltung; legitim wird nur, was durch Kraft, Selbstbezwingung oder Tragfähigkeit geprüft ist.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:A1","CH_97E9_VBDN:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:GA-04","text":"[Emergent] Die angemessene Norm ist nicht Gleichheit, sondern eine relationale Verteilung von Last, Wille, Ehre, Gefahr und schöpferischer Fähigkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:A11","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:GA-05","text":"[Mutating] Liebe ist keine Endform der Gegenseitigkeit, sondern eine operative Energie, die je nach Feld Gehorsam, Opfer, Mut, Schmerz, Schaffen oder Überstieg hervorbringt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A10","CH_97E9_VKUE:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:GA-06","text":"[Persistent] Eine höhere Ordnung verlangt, dass ihre Träger Unrecht, Schmerz und Verlust nicht vermeiden, sondern in produktive Lasten umformen können.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:A3","CH_97E9_VKUE:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:GA-07","text":"[Emergent] Institutionelle, religiöse und moralische Anerkennung verlieren ihre legitimierende Kraft; entscheidend wird die immanente Qualität des Wollens und Hervorbringens.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:NX5","CH_97E9_VBDN:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:GA-08","text":"[Attractor] Der Übermensch fungiert als zeitlicher Attraktor, der Reproduktion, Ehe, Liebe und Selbstformung auf ein noch nicht gegenwärtiges Schaffen ausrichtet.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A9","CH_97E9_VKUE:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:GA-09","text":"[Terminal] Keine Ordnung kann das Unrecht restlos versöhnen, weil Erinnerung, Beleidigung und asymmetrische Gegenrede als irreduzible Rückstände fortbestehen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:A12","CH_97E9_VAUJ:AS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:GA-10","text":"[Tension] Das System verlangt zugleich gemeinsame Hervorbringung und hierarchische Funktionsordnung, ohne die Gleichrangigkeit der Hervorbringenden stabil begründen zu können.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:A8","CH_97E9_VAUJ:NX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_10:RMD-01","text":"Der Begriff des Kindes bleibt als Zukunftsträger persistent, wechselt aber von einem weiblich reproduzierten Zweck zu einem Denkmal gemeinsamer Selbstüberwindung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A3","CH_97E9_VKUE:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:RMD-02","text":"Die Asymmetrie der Geschlechterordnung wird nicht einfach wiederholt, sondern in der Ehelehre teilweise durch zwei Wollende ersetzt, deren Beziehung dennoch einem höheren Dritten untergeordnet bleibt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A12","CH_97E9_VKUE:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:RMD-03","text":"Gefahr mutiert von einer männlich begehrten Eigenschaft des Spiels zu einer Bedingung gerechter Feindschaft, in der Unrecht weder getilgt noch schrankenlos eskaliert werden darf.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A4","CH_97E9_VBDN:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:RMD-04","text":"Liebe wandert von einer geschlechtlich asymmetrischen Affektordnung in eine schöpferische Übergangstechnik, ohne ihre Bindung an Schmerz, Opfer und Überstieg zu verlieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A11","CH_97E9_VKUE:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:RMD-05","text":"Die Figur der Tiefe verschiebt sich von männlicher Erkenntnisautorität zu einer zeitlichen Speicherstruktur, in der der Einsiedler Beleidigung als mögliche Vergeltung bewahrt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A13","CH_97E9_VBDN:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_10:CGD-01","text":"Die konkrete Zuordnung von Mann zu Krieg und Weib zu Erholung bleibt eine lokale Geschlechtermechanik; auf Clusterebene wird sie als Sonderfall einer allgemeinen Ordnung asymmetrischer Funktionsverteilung lesbar.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:CGD-02","text":"Die Natterepisode bleibt lokal als dramatischer Auslöser, während ihre skalierende Funktion darin besteht, Verletzung in eine Prüfung von Tragfähigkeit, Gegengabe und nicht-neutraler Gerechtigkeit zu überführen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:AS1","CH_97E9_VBDN:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:CGD-03","text":"Die Zurückweisung der gewöhnlichen Ehe bleibt nicht bloß moralische Polemik, sondern wird zur clusterweiten Selektionslogik, welche Bedürfnis, institutionelle Anerkennung und biologische Fortsetzung von schöpferischer Gültigkeit trennt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:A9","CH_97E9_VKUE:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_10:GNX-01","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird jede Beziehung, die sich in Gegenseitigkeit, Behagen, Vergebung oder natürlicher Fortsetzung erschöpft und keinen Überschuss an Selbstüberwindung erzeugt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:NX4","CH_97E9_VBDN:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:GNX-02","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird ein universales Maß, das jedem abstrakt dasselbe Recht, dieselbe Würde oder dieselbe Deutungshoheit zuspricht.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:NX7","CH_97E9_VAUJ:NX8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:GNX-03","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Vorstellung, dass soziale oder religiöse Formen den Wert einer Verbindung unabhängig von Kraft, Willen und Schaffensfähigkeit garantieren könnten.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:NX5","CH_97E9_VKUE:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_10:DBN-01","text":"Das Cluster kann keine autonome Gegenwart zulassen, in der Beziehung ihren Sinn bereits im Paar, im individuellen Glück oder in der beendeten Verletzung besitzt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:SNX4","CH_97E9_VBDN:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:DBN-02","text":"Das Cluster disqualifiziert die Annahme, dass ein Subjekt ohne vorgängige Selbstformung, Kraftreserve oder Rangdifferenz legitim schaffen, urteilen, lieben oder verzeihen könne.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:A2","CH_97E9_VBDN:DNX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_10:BSA-01","text":"Die tiefste ausgeschlossene Möglichkeit ist eine nicht-hierarchische Welt, in der Liebe, Ehe, Geschlechterdifferenz und Gerechtigkeit ohne Mittel-Zweck-Ordnung, Überordnung oder Restvergeltung bestehen könnten.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:SNX2","CH_97E9_VBDN:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:BSA-02","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist ein Maßstab, der richten könnte, ohne selbst Gewalt, Schuld, Erinnerung oder asymmetrische Macht neu zu erzeugen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_10:XD-01","text":"Die Zukunftsproduktion wird zugleich biologisch, affektiv und ethisch organisiert: Das Hervorgebrachte soll nicht bloß geboren werden, sondern die Selbstüberwindung seiner Erzeugenden materialisieren.","refs":["CL_97E9_10:GA-01","CL_97E9_10:GA-02","CL_97E9_10:GA-08","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A9","CH_97E9_VKUE:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:XD-02","text":"Die Forderung nach Tragfähigkeit verbindet Ehe und Gerechtigkeit: Nur wer Verlust, Schmerz oder Unrecht aufnehmen kann, besitzt im System die Voraussetzung, über sich hinaus zu schaffen statt bloß Bedürfnis zu reproduzieren.","refs":["CL_97E9_10:GA-03","CL_97E9_10:GA-06","CH_97E9_VBDN:A6","CH_97E9_VKUE:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:XD-03","text":"Die weibliche Gegenrede und die Erinnerung des Einsiedlers bilden zwei irreduzible Rückkehrformen dessen, was die normierende Lehre funktionalisieren oder abschließen will.","refs":["CL_97E9_10:GA-09","CL_97E9_10:GA-10","CH_97E9_VAUJ:AS7","CH_97E9_VBDN:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:XD-04","text":"Das System ersetzt Versöhnung nicht durch schrankenlose Gewalt, sondern durch begrenzte, ehrenfähige und rangabhängige Gegengabe; diese Begrenzung bleibt jedoch mit der hierarchischen Geschlechterordnung spannungsvoll verbunden.","refs":["CL_97E9_10:GA-04","CL_97E9_10:GA-10","CH_97E9_VBDN:A4","CH_97E9_VAUJ:NX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_10:BSD-01","text":"Subjektivität wird als Fähigkeit umkartiert, sich selbst zu formen, Lasten zu tragen und eigene Affekte in eine zukünftige Hervorbringung zu überführen; bloßes Wollen besitzt keinen normativen Status.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:A5","CH_97E9_VBDN:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:BSD-02","text":"Zeit wird nicht als Fortschritt zur Versöhnung konstruiert, sondern als Feld konkurrierender Nachwirkungen: Zeugung und Schöpfung eröffnen Zukunft, während Beleidigung und Ausschluss unvertilgbare Rückkehr erzeugen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:A11","CH_97E9_VBDN:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:BSD-03","text":"Politik und Ethik werden als Selektionsmaschinen organisiert, welche Beziehungen nach ihrer Kapazität bewerten, höhere Formen hervorzubringen, statt nach Gleichheit, Bedürfnisbefriedigung oder neutraler Regelanwendung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:SD1","CH_97E9_VBDN:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_10:RLE-01","text":"Wunsch wird genealogisch geprüft, durch Selbstbezwingung qualifiziert, auf Schaffen ausgerichtet und durch das hervorgebrachte Kind oder Werk rückwirkend als berechtigt bestätigt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:D1","CH_97E9_VKUE:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:RLE-02","text":"Verletzung erzeugt Erinnerung, Erinnerung bewahrt Vergeltung, Vergeltung verlangt Tragfähigkeit, und Tragfähigkeit wird wiederum zum Rangkriterium höherer Gerechtigkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:D8","CH_97E9_VBDN:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:RLE-03","text":"Der Übermensch wirkt als Attraktor, indem Liebe, Fortpflanzung, Schmerz und Ehe immer wieder aus ihrer Gegenwartsfunktion herausgezogen und auf eine noch ausstehende Form des Schaffens bezogen werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:D8","CH_97E9_VKUE:FGS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_10:FGS-B01","text":"Unmittelbares Begehren, Verletzung oder Geschlechterdifferenz → genealogische Prüfung auf Bedürfnis, Gefahr, Rang und Tragfähigkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:A3","CH_97E9_VBDN:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:FGS-B02","text":"Genealogische Prüfung → Ausschluss von Gleichheit, Behagen, abstrakter Zuteilung und bloßer institutioneller Anerkennung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:NX4","CH_97E9_VBDN:NX7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:FGS-B03","text":"Ausschluss gewöhnlicher Modelle → Neubestimmung der Beziehung als asymmetrische oder selektiv gemeinsame Produktionsform.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:D2","CH_97E9_VKUE:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:FGS-B04","text":"Produktionsform → Umwandlung von Liebe, Schmerz, Unrecht und Erinnerung in Ressourcen oder Lasten eines übergreifenden Schaffens.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:D5","CH_97E9_VBDN:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:FGS-B05","text":"Zukunftsorientierte Hervorbringung → Rückkehr nicht absorbierbarer Reste in Gestalt von Gegenrede, Gefahr, Beleidigung und möglicher Vergeltung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:SD5","CH_97E9_VBDN:D9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_10:AFM-B01","text":"Begehren oder Verletzung → Verdacht gegen die unmittelbare Selbstdeutung des Subjekts.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:A1","CH_97E9_VBDN:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:AFM-B02","text":"Verdacht → Ausschluss von Bedürfnisgemeinschaft, Gutvergeltung, Gleichverteilung und religiöser Legitimation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:NX3","CH_97E9_VBDN:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:AFM-B03","text":"Ausschluss → Rangprüfung von Selbstbeherrschung, Kraft, Wille, Ehre und Tragfähigkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:A2","CH_97E9_VBDN:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:AFM-B04","text":"Rangprüfung → Umcodierung von Liebe, Ehe, Reproduktion und Gerechtigkeit als Formen der Hervorbringung und Lastverteilung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:AS4","CH_97E9_VBDN:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:AFM-B05","text":"Hervorbringung → zeitliche Öffnung auf Übermensch, Erinnerung und Rückkehr der nicht versöhnten Gegenkraft.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A9","CH_97E9_VBDN:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_10:MME-01","text":"Familie, Ehe und Geschlechterbeziehung werden von privaten oder institutionellen Ordnungen zu Technologien der Zukunftsproduktion umklassifiziert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:ME1","CH_97E9_VAUJ:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:MME-02","text":"Gerechtigkeit wird von Gleichverteilung und neutralem Urteil auf Tragfähigkeit, Selbstbelastung, relationale Gegengabe und nicht vollendete Erinnerung verschoben.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:ME5","CH_97E9_VBDN:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:MME-03","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen Liebe und Schmerz zerfällt, weil Schmerz als Selektions- und Antriebskraft derjenigen Liebe erscheint, die über ihre Träger hinausweist.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:ME5","CH_97E9_VKUE:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_10:ALT-B01","text":"Surface level — Das Cluster verhandelt Weib, Mann, Kind, Ehe, Natter, Feind, Strafe, Liebe und den Einsiedler als explizite Gegenstände.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:ALT1","CH_97E9_VBDN:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:ALT-B02","text":"Structural level — Die Gegenstände werden durch asymmetrische Arbeitsteilung, Selbstformung, selektive Reproduktion, Lastverteilung und erinnernde Vergeltung organisiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:ALT2","CH_97E9_VKUE:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:ALT-B03","text":"Metastrategic level — Interpretation und Intervention werden als Rangprüfung umgerahmt: Entscheidend ist nicht, wer Anspruch erhebt, sondern wer die Folgen des Anspruchs tragen und produktiv wenden kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:ALT3","CH_97E9_VKUE:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:ALT-B04","text":"Ontological / Temporal level — Realität erscheint als nicht abgeschlossene Verteilung von Willen, Tiefe, Leib, Erinnerung und Zukunft, in der keine Gegenwart ihre eigenen Rückstände endgültig aufheben kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:ALT4","CH_97E9_VBDN:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:ALT-B05","text":"Methodological / Performative level — Das Cluster vollzieht seine Normbildung durch aphoristische Setzung, systematische Ausschlüsse und Gegenstimmen, die seine eigene Schließung zugleich erzwingen und destabilisieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:SNX4","CH_97E9_VKUE:MRT7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_10:FL-01","text":"Die Forderung nach gemeinsamer Hervorbringung kollidiert mit der fortbestehenden Reduktion des Weibes auf Mittel, Spielzeug und reproduktive Funktion.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A8","CH_97E9_VKUE:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:FL-02","text":"Die Kritik am Richtenden bleibt instabil, weil das System zugleich eine neue Rangordnung formuliert, die über Ehre, Kraft und zulässige Gegengabe urteilen muss.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:A7","CH_97E9_VBDN:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:MP-01","text":"Fortpflanzung mutiert vom biologisch und geschlechtlich fixierten Zweck zu einer metaphorisch-schöpferischen Praxis des Übersichhinausbauens, ohne die frühere Instrumentalisierung vollständig zu tilgen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:D1","CH_97E9_VKUE:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:MP-02","text":"Liebe mutiert von affektiver Unterordnung und Gefährlichkeit zu produktivem Schmerz, doch beide Formen bewahren die Forderung, dass Liebe sich nicht selbst genügen darf.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:D5","CH_97E9_VKUE:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_10:HSI-01","text":"Realität erscheint als Selektionsmaschine, in der Beziehungen nach ihrer Fähigkeit bewertet werden, stärkere Formen hervorzubringen und unvermeidliche Lasten zu tragen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:SD1","CH_97E9_VBDN:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:HSI-02","text":"Das Subjekt ist weder autonomes Rechtssubjekt noch bloßer Triebträger, sondern ein unvollendeter Knoten von Selbstformung, Erinnerung, Verletzbarkeit und schöpferischem Überschuss.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:A5","CH_97E9_VBDN:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:HSI-03","text":"Zeit ist eine doppelte Dynamik aus Hervorbringung und Rückkehr: Zukunft wird erzeugt, während das nicht getilgte Unrecht als verzögerte Gegenmacht im System gespeichert bleibt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:SD2","CH_97E9_VBDN:D9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_10:MRT-B01","text":"Die extrahierten Axiome reichen aus, um die zentrale Clusterbewegung von genealogischer Prüfung über selektive Umcodierung bis zur Rückkehr nicht versöhnter Reste zu rekonstruieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:AF1","CH_97E9_VBDN:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:MRT-B02","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, wie die geforderte Rang- und Tragfähigkeitsprüfung ohne erneute Willkür, verdeckte Herrschaft oder unentscheidbare Zuschreibung praktisch vollzogen werden könnte.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:MRT2","CH_97E9_VBDN:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:MRT-B03","text":"Die Architektur ist am stärksten, wo sie Gegenwart, Beziehung und Moral als Zukunfts- und Lastregime verbindet; sie bleibt auf produktive Inkohärenz angewiesen, weil Hierarchie, gemeinsame Schöpfung, Gegenrede und Vergeltungsrest nicht vollständig integrierbar sind.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:MRT5","CH_97E9_VBDN:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T200114126711Z_b311bdab","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Chapters 28–30","source_sha256":"2f80806aaaa075d0bd0dd15c8c1014096b44aa6f8d88b752fff03b98b032b7d7","sha256":"8ea78e91b3adac8ce36014cfe20f5315dc2cafd9e9bceff22d701aff1b774b74","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T20:01:14.128906+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_10:ABS-01","text":"The cluster examines social, erotic, and hostile relations not according to reciprocity or institutional recognition, but according to their capacity to bring forth a stronger form of life.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:ABS-02","text":"The relation becomes valid only insofar as it transforms presence, need, injury, or gender function into a process of self-overcoming that points beyond those immediately involved.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:AS3","CH_97E9_VBDN:A3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:ABS-03","text":"Reproduction initially functions as an asymmetrical subjection of female existence to child, man, and future, but in the doctrine of marriage it mutates into a selective project of shared bringing-forth.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A2","CH_97E9_VKUE:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:ABS-04","text":"The doctrine of justice interrupts every notion that overcoming is identical with reconciliation, because injury remains preserved as a memorable remainder and can turn into later retaliation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:ABS-05","text":"Love is treated neither as an autonomous affect nor as a peaceful bond, but as a dangerous, painful, and normable energy distributed toward war, obedience, creation, or a higher future.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:AS5","CH_97E9_VKUE:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:ABS-06","text":"The movement of the cluster is spiral-shaped: relation is obligated to a future surplus, thereby produces exclusions and burdens, and returns as an unresolved counterforce of memory, danger, or female counter-speech.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:AS7","CH_97E9_VBDN:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:ABS-07","text":"The norm is produced not as a universally applicable law, but as a test of rank for those who can bear desires, pain, injustice, and future.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:A6","CH_97E9_VKUE:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:ABS-08","text":"The closure achieved remains precarious, because the system can organize a creative future only through hierarchical allocation of functions, unequal capacity to bear, and persisting remnants of retaliation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A12","CH_97E9_VBDN:SNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_10:GA-01","text":"[Attractor] A relation possesses validity only when, beyond those immediately involved, it produces a greater, future, or stronger form.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:A7","CH_97E9_VKUE:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:GA-02","text":"[Mutating] Procreation remains a procedure of future-production, but mutates from the one-sided functionalization of woman into a selective demand for self-transcendence and shared creation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A2","CH_97E9_VKUE:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:GA-03","text":"[Persistent] Immediate desire legitimates neither child, marriage, love, nor retaliation; only what has been tested through strength, self-mastery, or capacity to bear becomes legitimate.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:A1","CH_97E9_VBDN:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:GA-04","text":"[Emergent] The appropriate norm is not equality, but a relational distribution of burden, will, honor, danger, and creative capacity.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:A11","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:GA-05","text":"[Mutating] Love is not a final form of reciprocity, but an operative energy that, depending on the field, produces obedience, sacrifice, courage, pain, creation, or transcendence.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A10","CH_97E9_VKUE:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:GA-06","text":"[Persistent] A higher order demands that its bearers not avoid injustice, pain, and loss, but be able to transform them into productive burdens.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:A3","CH_97E9_VKUE:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:GA-07","text":"[Emergent] Institutional, religious, and moral recognition lose their legitimating force; decisive becomes the immanent quality of willing and bringing-forth.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:NX5","CH_97E9_VBDN:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:GA-08","text":"[Attractor] The Übermensch functions as a temporal attractor that orients reproduction, marriage, love, and self-formation toward a creation not yet present.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A9","CH_97E9_VKUE:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:GA-09","text":"[Terminal] No order can fully reconcile injustice, because memory, insult, and asymmetrical counter-speech persist as irreducible residues.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:A12","CH_97E9_VAUJ:AS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:GA-10","text":"[Tension] The system simultaneously demands shared bringing-forth and hierarchical functional order, without being able to stably ground the equal rank of those who bring forth.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:A8","CH_97E9_VAUJ:NX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_10:RMD-01","text":"The concept of the child persists as bearer of the future, but shifts from a female-reproduced purpose to a monument of shared self-overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A3","CH_97E9_VKUE:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:RMD-02","text":"The asymmetry of the gender order is not simply repeated, but in the doctrine of marriage is partially replaced by two willing beings whose relation nevertheless remains subordinated to a higher third.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A12","CH_97E9_VKUE:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:RMD-03","text":"Danger mutates from a masculine-desired property of play into a condition of just enmity, in which injustice may neither be erased nor escalated without limit.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A4","CH_97E9_VBDN:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:RMD-04","text":"Love migrates from a gender-asymmetrical affective order into a creative technique of transition, without losing its bond to pain, sacrifice, and transcendence.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A11","CH_97E9_VKUE:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:RMD-05","text":"The figure of depth shifts from masculine epistemic authority to a temporal storage structure in which the hermit preserves insult as possible retaliation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A13","CH_97E9_VBDN:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_10:CGD-01","text":"The concrete assignment of man to war and woman to recuperation remains a local gender mechanics; at the cluster level, it becomes legible as a special case of a general order of asymmetrical functional distribution.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:CGD-02","text":"The viper episode remains local as a dramatic trigger, while its scaling function consists in transforming injury into a test of capacity to bear, counter-gift, and non-neutral justice.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:AS1","CH_97E9_VBDN:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:CGD-03","text":"The rejection of ordinary marriage remains not merely moral polemic, but becomes a cluster-wide logic of selection that separates need, institutional recognition, and biological continuation from creative validity.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:A9","CH_97E9_VKUE:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_10:GNX-01","text":"Excluded is every relation that exhausts itself in reciprocity, comfort, forgiveness, or natural continuation and produces no surplus of self-overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:NX4","CH_97E9_VBDN:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:GNX-02","text":"Excluded is a universal measure that accords to everyone abstractly the same right, the same dignity, or the same interpretive authority.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:NX7","CH_97E9_VAUJ:NX8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:GNX-03","text":"Excluded is the notion that social or religious forms could guarantee the value of a bond independently of strength, will, and creative capacity.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:NX5","CH_97E9_VKUE:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_10:DBN-01","text":"The cluster cannot allow an autonomous present in which relation already possesses its meaning in the couple, in individual happiness, or in injury brought to an end.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:SNX4","CH_97E9_VBDN:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:DBN-02","text":"The cluster disqualifies the assumption that a subject without prior self-formation, reserve of strength, or difference in rank could legitimately create, judge, love, or forgive.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:A2","CH_97E9_VBDN:DNX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_10:BSA-01","text":"The most deeply excluded possibility is a non-hierarchical world in which love, marriage, gender difference, and justice could exist without means-end order, superordination, or residual retaliation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:SNX2","CH_97E9_VBDN:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:BSA-02","text":"Unavailable is a standard that could judge without itself reproducing violence, guilt, memory, or asymmetrical power.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_10:XD-01","text":"Future-production is organized simultaneously biologically, affectively, and ethically: what is brought forth is not merely to be born, but to materialize the self-overcoming of those who produce it.","refs":["CL_97E9_10:GA-01","CL_97E9_10:GA-02","CL_97E9_10:GA-08","CH_97E9_VAUJ:A9","CH_97E9_VKUE:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:XD-02","text":"The demand for capacity to bear connects marriage and justice: only whoever can take on loss, pain, or injustice possesses within the system the prerequisite for creating beyond themselves rather than merely reproducing need.","refs":["CL_97E9_10:GA-03","CL_97E9_10:GA-06","CH_97E9_VBDN:A6","CH_97E9_VKUE:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Composite","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:XD-03","text":"Female counter-speech and the hermit's memory form two irreducible modes of return of that which the norming doctrine seeks to functionalize or conclude.","refs":["CL_97E9_10:GA-09","CL_97E9_10:GA-10","CH_97E9_VAUJ:AS7","CH_97E9_VBDN:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:XD-04","text":"The system replaces reconciliation not with unbounded violence, but with limited, honor-capable, and rank-dependent counter-gift; this limitation nevertheless remains tension-filled in relation to the hierarchical gender order.","refs":["CL_97E9_10:GA-04","CL_97E9_10:GA-10","CH_97E9_VBDN:A4","CH_97E9_VAUJ:NX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"Tension","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_10:BSD-01","text":"Subjectivity is remapped as the capacity to form oneself, bear burdens, and transform one's own affects into a future bringing-forth; mere willing possesses no normative status.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:A5","CH_97E9_VBDN:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:BSD-02","text":"Time is constructed not as progress toward reconciliation, but as a field of competing aftereffects: procreation and creation open the future, while insult and exclusion produce ineradicable return.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:A11","CH_97E9_VBDN:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:BSD-03","text":"Politics and ethics are organized as machines of selection that assess relations according to their capacity to bring forth higher forms, rather than according to equality, satisfaction of needs, or neutral application of rules.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:SD1","CH_97E9_VBDN:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_10:RLE-01","text":"Desire is genealogically tested, qualified through self-mastery, oriented toward creation, and retrospectively confirmed as justified through the child or work brought forth.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:D1","CH_97E9_VKUE:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:RLE-02","text":"Injury produces memory, memory preserves retaliation, retaliation demands capacity to bear, and capacity to bear in turn becomes the criterion of rank for higher justice.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:D8","CH_97E9_VBDN:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:RLE-03","text":"The Übermensch acts as an attractor by repeatedly drawing love, procreation, pain, and marriage out of their present function and relating them to a still-outstanding form of creation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:D8","CH_97E9_VKUE:FGS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_10:FGS-B01","text":"Immediate desire, injury, or gender difference → genealogical examination for need, danger, rank, and capacity to bear.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:A3","CH_97E9_VBDN:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:FGS-B02","text":"Genealogical examination → exclusion of equality, comfort, abstract allocation, and mere institutional recognition.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:NX4","CH_97E9_VBDN:NX7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:FGS-B03","text":"Exclusion of ordinary models → redefinition of relation as an asymmetrical or selectively shared form of production.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:D2","CH_97E9_VKUE:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:FGS-B04","text":"Form of production → transformation of love, pain, injustice, and memory into resources or burdens of an overarching creation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:D5","CH_97E9_VBDN:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:FGS-B05","text":"Future-oriented bringing-forth → return of non-absorbable residues in the form of counter-speech, danger, insult, and possible retaliation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:SD5","CH_97E9_VBDN:D9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_10:AFM-B01","text":"Desire or injury → suspicion toward the subject's immediate self-interpretation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:A1","CH_97E9_VBDN:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:AFM-B02","text":"Suspicion → exclusion of community of need, requital of good, equal distribution, and religious legitimation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:NX3","CH_97E9_VBDN:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:AFM-B03","text":"Exclusion → test of rank in self-mastery, strength, will, honor, and capacity to bear.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:A2","CH_97E9_VBDN:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:AFM-B04","text":"Test of rank → recoding of love, marriage, reproduction, and justice as forms of bringing-forth and burden-distribution.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:AS4","CH_97E9_VBDN:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:AFM-B05","text":"Bringing-forth → temporal opening toward Übermensch, memory, and the return of unreconciled counterforce.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A9","CH_97E9_VBDN:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_10:MME-01","text":"Family, marriage, and gender relation are reclassified from private or institutional orders into technologies of future-production.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:ME1","CH_97E9_VAUJ:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:MME-02","text":"Justice is shifted from equal distribution and neutral judgment toward capacity to bear, self-burdening, relational counter-gift, and uncompleted memory.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:ME5","CH_97E9_VBDN:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:MME-03","text":"The opposition between love and pain disintegrates, because pain appears as a force of selection and impetus of that love which points beyond its bearers.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:ME5","CH_97E9_VKUE:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_10:ALT-B01","text":"Surface level — The cluster addresses woman, man, child, marriage, viper, enemy, punishment, love, and the hermit as explicit objects.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:ALT1","CH_97E9_VBDN:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:ALT-B02","text":"Structural level — The objects are organized through asymmetrical division of labor, self-formation, selective reproduction, burden-distribution, and remembering retaliation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:ALT2","CH_97E9_VKUE:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:ALT-B03","text":"Metastrategic level — Interpretation and intervention are reframed as a test of rank: decisive is not who raises a claim, but who can bear and productively turn the consequences of the claim.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:ALT3","CH_97E9_VKUE:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:ALT-B04","text":"Ontological / Temporal level — Reality appears as an uncompleted distribution of will, depth, body, memory, and future, in which no present can definitively annul its own residues.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:ALT4","CH_97E9_VBDN:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:ALT-B05","text":"Methodological / Performative level — The cluster carries out its norm-formation through aphoristic positing, systematic exclusions, and countervoices that simultaneously compel and destabilize its own closure.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:SNX4","CH_97E9_VKUE:MRT7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_10:FL-01","text":"The demand for shared bringing-forth collides with the persisting reduction of woman to means, toy, and reproductive function.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:A8","CH_97E9_VKUE:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:FL-02","text":"The critique of the judge remains unstable, because the system simultaneously formulates a new hierarchy that must judge through honor, strength, and permissible counter-gift.","refs":["CH_97E9_VBDN:A7","CH_97E9_VBDN:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:MP-01","text":"Procreation mutates from a biologically and sexually fixed purpose into a metaphorical-creative practice of building beyond oneself, without fully erasing the earlier instrumentalization.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:D1","CH_97E9_VKUE:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:MP-02","text":"Love mutates from affective subordination and dangerousness into productive pain, yet both forms preserve the demand that love must not suffice unto itself.","refs":["CH_97E9_VAUJ:D5","CH_97E9_VKUE:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_10:HSI-01","text":"Reality appears as a machine of selection in which relations are assessed according to their capacity to bring forth stronger forms and bear unavoidable burdens.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:SD1","CH_97E9_VBDN:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:HSI-02","text":"The subject is neither an autonomous subject of rights nor a mere bearer of drives, but an unfinished knot of self-formation, memory, vulnerability, and creative surplus.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:A5","CH_97E9_VBDN:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:HSI-03","text":"Time is a double dynamic of bringing-forth and return: future is produced, while un-erased injustice remains stored in the system as a delayed counterforce.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:SD2","CH_97E9_VBDN:D9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_10:MRT-B01","text":"The extracted axioms suffice to reconstruct the central cluster movement from genealogical examination through selective recoding to the return of unreconciled residues.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:AF1","CH_97E9_VBDN:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:MRT-B02","text":"It remains underdetermined how the required examination of rank and capacity to bear could be practically carried out without renewed arbitrariness, concealed domination, or undecidable attribution.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:MRT2","CH_97E9_VBDN:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_10:MRT-B03","text":"The architecture is strongest where it connects present, relation, and morality as regimes of future and burden; it remains dependent on productive incoherence because hierarchy, shared creation, counter-speech, and the residue of retaliation are not fully integrable.","refs":["CH_97E9_VKUE:MRT5","CH_97E9_VBDN:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CL_97E9_10@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CL_97E9_10:v1","source_language_code":"de","original_title":"Chapters 28–30"}],"identity":{"layer":"CL","kicker":"Cluster · Also sprach Zarathustra","title":"Chapters 28–30","context":"Of Old and Young Women · Of the Bite of the Adder · Of Child and Marriage","original_title":"Chapters 28–30","original_context":"Von alten und jungen Weiblein · Vom Biss der Natter · Von Kind und Ehe"},"original_title":"Chapters 28–30","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CL_97E9_11","layer":"CL","title":"Chapters 31–33","order":11,"parents":["CH_97E9_VFT0","CH_97E9_1C_2","CH_97E9_2C_2"],"revision":"CL_97E9_11@R001","sha256":"fa48febd82fc5d312d54500c14b48152bfcf9d88b56b6592f121c6de67733dd6","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_11:AS-B01","text":"Das System bestimmt menschliche Vollendung weder als bloße Lebensdauer noch als Besitz von Werten, sondern als leiblich erzeugte Fähigkeit, Überschuss in Zukunft, Erbe und Neubildung zu überführen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:AS2","CH_97E9_1C_2:SD1","CH_97E9_2C_2:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:AS-B02","text":"Der Tod wird zum Grenzakt einer Wertökonomie, in der ein Leben nur dann vollendet ist, wenn seine Selbstbegrenzung weitere Wertschöpfung, Selbstheilung und Erhöhung ermöglicht.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:AS5","CH_97E9_2C_2:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:AS-B03","text":"Die Rückkehr zu Erde und Leib ist keine Regression gegen Geist und Erkenntnis, sondern ihre Rekodierung als Verfahren der Reinigung, Wertsetzung, Gabe und Selbstüberwindung.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:D6","CH_97E9_2C_2:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:AS-B04","text":"Das Argument bewegt sich spiralförmig: verkörpertes Erbe erzeugt Krankheit, Krankheit erzwingt Selbstformung, Selbstformung erzeugt Werte, Werte verlangen Weitergabe, und Weitergabe verlangt eine selektive Zukunft.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A4","CH_97E9_2C_2:A12","CH_97E9_2C_2:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:AS-B05","text":"Die Schließung entsteht nicht durch Stabilisierung eines erreichten Zustands, sondern durch die geregelte Übergabe von Kraft: Aneignung wird Gabe, Reife wird Verzicht, Einsamkeit wird Volk und Leben wird Erbe.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:A4","CH_97E9_VFT0:D9","CH_97E9_2C_2:D8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:AS-B06","text":"Die aktuelle Ebene rekonstruiert eine selektive Erzeugungsmaschine, deren Ziel nicht Erhaltung des Menschen, sondern die Hervorbringung einer erdgebundenen, sich selbst übersteigenden Zukunftsform ist.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A1","CH_97E9_2C_2:SD4","CH_97E9_VFT0:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_11:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Wert besitzt nur dort höhere Geltung, wo angeeigneter Überschuss in eine über den Eigentümer hinausgehende Weitergabe transformiert wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:A4","CH_97E9_VFT0:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:GA-02","text":"[Mutating] Selbstbejahung ist nicht als Selbstbewahrung bestimmt, sondern als produktive Selbststeigerung, die ihre Kraft in Gabe, Erbe, Heilung und Hervorbringung entäußert.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:A5","CH_97E9_2C_2:A12","CH_97E9_VFT0:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:GA-03","text":"[Persistent] Der Leib ist die primäre Produktionsstätte von Erkenntnis, Tugend, Wert und Transformation; Geist bezeichnet dessen artikulierende und rückwirkende Funktion.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:A9","CH_97E9_1C_2:D6","CH_97E9_2C_2:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:GA-04","text":"[Emergent] Reife ist eine qualitative Zeitform, in der Vollendung nicht durch Dauer, sondern durch die erreichte Fähigkeit zur Übergabe und Selbstbegrenzung bestimmt wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:A3","CH_97E9_VFT0:SD2","CH_97E9_2C_2:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:GA-05","text":"[Mutating] Erkenntnis ist keine Distanz vom Leben, sondern eine leibliche Prüf- und Reinigungsoperation, durch die Triebe geheiligt, Werte neu gesetzt und Zukunftsmöglichkeiten erzeugt werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A10","CH_97E9_2C_2:A11","CH_97E9_2C_2:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:GA-06","text":"[Attractor] Erde fungiert als immanenter Prüfungsraum, in dem Wert, Gesundheit, Tod und Zukunft nur gültig sind, sofern sie das Leben nicht verleugnen, sondern dessen Steigerung und Umformung ermöglichen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:A15","CH_97E9_2C_2:A1","CH_97E9_2C_2:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:GA-07","text":"[Emergent] Gemeinschaft entsteht nicht aus Gleichheit oder Integration, sondern aus Selbstwahl, selektiver Erhöhung und der Übertragung einer bereits gewonnenen Form auf zukünftige Träger.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A14","CH_97E9_2C_2:D7","CH_97E9_VFT0:D9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:GA-08","text":"[Terminal] Ein gelungenes Leben muss seine eigene Fortdauer begrenzen können, sobald Festhalten den Übergang von Schöpfung zu Verbrauch, Verfall oder bloßer Wiederholung markieren würde.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:A8","CH_97E9_VFT0:D8","CH_97E9_VFT0:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:GA-09","text":"[Attractor] Der Übermensch ist keine vorhandene Identität, sondern der Name für die aus leiblicher Umformung, neuer Wertsetzung, Erbschaft und selektiver Gemeinschaft hervorgehende Zukunftsfigur.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A15","CH_97E9_2C_2:D8","CH_97E9_2C_2:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_11:RMD-01","text":"Selbstsucht kehrt nicht als stabile moralische Kategorie wieder: Sie mutiert von einer Frage des Eigenbezugs zu einer Frage der Richtung, in die Reichtum, Kraft und Werte fließen.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:D4","CH_97E9_1C_2:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:RMD-02","text":"Der Tod verschiebt sich vom privaten Ende zur sozialen Übergabetechnik; seine Freiheit liegt nicht im isolierten Willensakt, sondern in der Fähigkeit, eine Zukunft jenseits des Sterbenden zu organisieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:D2","CH_97E9_VFT0:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:RMD-03","text":"Der Leib behält seine generative Funktion, erweitert sie jedoch: Aus Ursprung der Tugend wird zugleich Archiv des Irrtums, Labor der Erkenntnis und Material künftiger Erhöhung.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:SD4","CH_97E9_2C_2:D2","CH_97E9_2C_2:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:RMD-04","text":"Der Geist verliert seine souveräne Stellung, verschwindet aber nicht; er wird als Ausdruck, Werkzeug und Rückbindung leiblicher Prozesse in eine immanente Wertmaschine absorbiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:A10","CH_97E9_2C_2:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:RMD-05","text":"Reife mutiert von individueller Vollendung zu einer selektiven Zukunftsbedingung: Sie legitimiert sowohl das Ende eines einzelnen Lebens als auch die Erzeugung eines noch nicht vorhandenen Kollektivs.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:A14","CH_97E9_2C_2:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:RMD-06","text":"Erde bleibt der positive Attraktor, doch ihre Funktion erweitert sich von Gegenstand der Bejahung zu einem noch unerschöpften Feld von Heilung, Wertproduktion und transhumaner Hervorbringung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:SNX4","CH_97E9_2C_2:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_11:CGD-01","text":"Die Rangfolge einzelner Todesformen bleibt eine lokale Differenzierung; auf Clusterebene zählt allein die übergreifende Regel, dass Vollendung an zeitlich geregelte Weitergabe gebunden ist.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:D4","CH_97E9_VFT0:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:CGD-02","text":"Gold, Sonne und Schlange bleiben lokale Symbolträger; nach oben skaliert die durch sie erzeugte Struktur einer nicht-nützlichen, überströmenden und erkenntnisfähigen Wertproduktion.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:A17","CH_97E9_1C_2:SD6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:CGD-03","text":"Die Diagnose vergangener Irrtümer bleibt lokal am Menschen als Versuch gebunden; auf aktueller Ebene wird sie zur allgemeinen Bedingung, dass jede Zukunft durch Umformung verkörperter Vergangenheit erzeugt werden muss.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A4","CH_97E9_2C_2:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:CGD-04","text":"Der Gegensatz zwischen schenkender und hungernder Selbstsucht wird in eine umfassendere Unterscheidung zwischen generativer Zirkulation und terminaler Selbstbindung absorbiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:A5","CH_97E9_1C_2:A6","CH_97E9_VFT0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:CGD-05","text":"Selbstauswahl ist nicht bloß ein Modell künftiger Gemeinschaft, sondern die kollektive Entsprechung jener Reife, die auf individueller Ebene zum freien Verzicht auf Fortdauer befähigt.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A14","CH_97E9_VFT0:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_11:GNX-01","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird jede Ordnung, die Dauer, Besitz, Nützlichkeit oder Selbstbewahrung als letzten Maßstab von Wert behandelt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:DNX1","CH_97E9_1C_2:DNX1","CH_97E9_1C_2:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:GNX-02","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird ein Geist, der seine Wahrheit unabhängig von Leib, Trieb, Erbe und Erde erzeugen könnte.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:DNX3","CH_97E9_2C_2:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:GNX-03","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Moral, die Tugend als Selbstlosigkeit, Anerkennung, Komfort oder Anpassung versteht.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:NX5","CH_97E9_1C_2:NX7","CH_97E9_1C_2:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:GNX-04","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Zukunft, die als bloße Verlängerung der gegenwärtigen Menschengestalt oder als allgemeine Erlösung ohne Transformation erscheinen könnte.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:DNX5","CH_97E9_2C_2:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:GNX-05","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird ein neutraler Tod, weil jedes Ende entweder Verfall verlängert oder eine Form von Erbe, Stachel und zukünftiger Wertbildung überträgt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:SNX1","CH_97E9_VFT0:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_11:DBN-01","text":"Das System kann nicht zulassen, dass ein Subjekt durch Bewahren seiner selbst erfüllt wird; ohne Selbstüberschreitung wird Selbstbejahung zur Krankheit.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:DNX4","CH_97E9_1C_2:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:DBN-02","text":"Das System kann nicht zulassen, dass Wert außerhalb seiner materiellen, leiblichen und zeitlichen Produktion besteht; jede transzendente Norm würde die immanente Umwertung blockieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:DNX1","CH_97E9_2C_2:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:DBN-03","text":"Das System kann nicht zulassen, dass Hilfe von der Selbstveränderung des Helfenden getrennt wird, weil sonst die Übertragung von Kraft zu bloßer Verwaltung eines Mangels zerfiele.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A12","CH_97E9_2C_2:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:DBN-04","text":"Das System kann nicht zulassen, dass Geschichte als Vernunftkontinuum gilt, weil die Notwendigkeit der Umformung nur aus einem verkörperten Erbe von Irrtum, Wahnsinn und Zufall hervorgeht.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A6","CH_97E9_2C_2:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_11:BSA-01","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine Form des Lebens, die sich bejahen könnte, ohne ihr Ende, ihre Weitergabe und ihre Überschreitung mitzudenken.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:SNX3","CH_97E9_VFT0:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:BSA-02","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist ein endgültiges Wissen über Wert, Gut oder Böse, weil Wert nur als fortgesetzte, leiblich riskierte und zukunftserzeugende Setzung existiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:A11","CH_97E9_1C_2:DNX4","CH_97E9_2C_2:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:BSA-03","text":"Ontologisch unzulässig ist ein vollkommen versöhntes Subjekt: Das Subjekt bleibt eine Übergangsform zwischen sedimentiertem Erbe, gegenwärtiger Selbstheilung und noch ausstehender Überformung.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A5","CH_97E9_2C_2:SD3","CH_97E9_2C_2:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_11:XD-01","text":"Die schenkende Tugend und der freie Tod bilden zwei Phasen derselben Zirkulation: Erst wird Überschuss gesammelt und rückgegeben, dann wird die Person selbst als Grenze aufgehoben, damit ihre Kraft Erben erreicht.","refs":["CL_97E9_11:GA-01","CL_97E9_11:GA-04","CL_97E9_11:GA-08","CH_97E9_1C_2:A4","CH_97E9_VFT0:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:XD-02","text":"Die leibliche Herkunft der Tugend und die leibliche Reinigung durch Erkenntnis verbinden Wertschöpfung mit Therapie: Neue Werte sind keine Urteile über das Leben, sondern Umbauten seiner Triebökonomie.","refs":["CL_97E9_11:GA-03","CL_97E9_11:GA-05","CH_97E9_1C_2:D6","CH_97E9_2C_2:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:XD-03","text":"Der Unterschied zwischen gesundem Geben und krankem Festhalten wird durch die Todeslehre radikalisiert: Selbstbewahrung erscheint als legitim nur solange sie künftige Übergabe vorbereitet.","refs":["CL_97E9_11:GA-02","CL_97E9_11:GA-08","CH_97E9_1C_2:A6","CH_97E9_VFT0:A8","CH_97E9_VFT0:D9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:XD-04","text":"Selbstauswahl und Erbschaft erzeugen zusammen eine nicht-genealogische Genealogie: Zukunft wird nicht durch biologische Abstammung garantiert, sondern durch die selektive Weitergabe einer transformierten Lebensform.","refs":["CL_97E9_11:GA-07","CL_97E9_11:GA-09","CH_97E9_2C_2:A14","CH_97E9_VFT0:D9","CH_97E9_2C_2:D8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:XD-05","text":"Die Erdbejahung erhält erst durch die Verbindung von Reife und Selbstheilung ihre operative Bedeutung: Erde ist weder Besitz noch Naturgrund, sondern das Feld, auf dem Verfall in zukünftige Gesundheit umgewendet werden muss.","refs":["CL_97E9_11:GA-04","CL_97E9_11:GA-06","CH_97E9_VFT0:SD2","CH_97E9_2C_2:A16","CH_97E9_2C_2:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_11:BSD-01","text":"Kausalität wird von linearer Ursache-Wirkung in eine Erb- und Rückwirkungsstruktur verschoben: Vergangenes wirkt im Leib fort, gegenwärtige Selbstformung verändert den Trieb, und der Tod organisiert die Weiterwirkung in anderen.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A4","CH_97E9_2C_2:A10","CH_97E9_VFT0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:BSD-02","text":"Das Subjekt wird zur temporären Verdichtungsform eines Überschusses, dessen Legitimität daran hängt, ob es ihn in Werte, Heilung, Erben und zukünftige Gestalten überführen kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:SD5","CH_97E9_1C_2:SD1","CH_97E9_2C_2:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:BSD-03","text":"Geschichte erscheint nicht als Fortschritt, sondern als umkämpfte Rekodierung eines belasteten Erbes, in der jeder höhere Zustand zugleich Auslese, Heilung und Risiko neuer Herrschaft ist.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A6","CH_97E9_2C_2:SD2","CH_97E9_2C_2:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:BSD-04","text":"Die politische Form des Systems ist weder universalistisch noch privatistisch: Sie organisiert eine selektive Gemeinschaft über exemplarische Selbsttransformation und nicht über Recht, Herkunft oder Mehrheit.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:D7","CH_97E9_2C_2:DNX6","CH_97E9_2C_2:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_11:RLE-01","text":"Verkörperter Irrtum erzeugt den Bedarf an Erkenntnis; Erkenntnis reinigt und erhöht den Leib; der erhöhte Leib erzeugt neue Werte; neue Werte verändern die Bedingungen zukünftiger Verkörperung.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A4","CH_97E9_2C_2:A10","CH_97E9_1C_2:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:RLE-02","text":"Überschuss bildet einen rekursiven Attraktor: Aneignung wird nur legitim durch Gabe, Gabe erzeugt Erben, Erben sichern die Möglichkeit weiterer Aneignung und weiterer Gabe.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:A4","CH_97E9_1C_2:D3","CH_97E9_VFT0:D9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:RLE-03","text":"Reife eskaliert von persönlicher Selbstbegrenzung zu historischer Auswahl: Wer sein Ende zeitlich ordnen kann, wird Modell für die Erzeugung einer Zukunft, die den gegenwärtigen Menschen überschreitet.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:A14","CH_97E9_2C_2:D8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:RLE-04","text":"Der Attraktor Erde hält divergierende Prozesse zusammen: Leib, Tod, Erkenntnis, Heilung, Wert und Zukunft bleiben nur als immanente Operationen eines gemeinsamen Transformationsfeldes verbindbar.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A1","CH_97E9_2C_2:SD1","CH_97E9_2C_2:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_11:FGS-B01","text":"Verkörpertes Erbe aus Irrtum, Wahn und Zufall → Diagnose des Menschen als unvollendete und gefährdete Übergangsform.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A4","CH_97E9_2C_2:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:FGS-B02","text":"Rückführung von Geist und Tugend auf Leib und Erde → Erkenntnis als Reinigung, Erprobung und Erhöhung der Triebe.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A3","CH_97E9_2C_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:FGS-B03","text":"Leibliche Erhöhung → schöpferische Wertsetzung → Überschussaufnahme und Rückgabe als schenkende Tugend.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:A12","CH_97E9_1C_2:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:FGS-B04","text":"Schenkende Selbstbejahung → Selbstheilung und exemplarische Hilfe → selektive Bildung zukünftiger Träger.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:A5","CH_97E9_2C_2:A12","CH_97E9_2C_2:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:FGS-B05","text":"Erreichte Reife plus vorhandenes Erbe → freie Selbstbegrenzung → Tod als Übertragungsakt statt als Abbruch.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:A5","CH_97E9_VFT0:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:FGS-B06","text":"Wiederholte Übergabe von Werten, Trieben und Zielen → neue Gemeinschaft → Zukunftsfigur jenseits der gegebenen Menschengestalt.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:D8","CH_97E9_2C_2:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_11:AFM-B01","text":"Verkörperter Irrtum → Rückbindung an Erde und Leib → Erkenntnis als Selbstreinigung → schenkende Wertproduktion → Reife als Fähigkeit zum Nein → Übertragung an Erben → selektive Gemeinschaft → Übermensch als erzeugte Zukunft.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:AF1","CH_97E9_1C_2:AF1","CH_97E9_VFT0:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_11:MME-01","text":"Die Opposition Leben/Tod wird durch eine Architektur von Reife, Übergabe und Verfall ersetzt; Tod wird nicht Gegenbegriff des Lebens, sondern dessen mögliche Form der Fortsetzung in anderen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:ME2","CH_97E9_VFT0:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:MME-02","text":"Die Opposition Selbstsucht/Altruismus zerfällt zugunsten einer Kartierung von Wertflüssen: Entscheidend ist nicht der Selbstbezug, sondern ob Kraft eingeschlossen oder überströmend gemacht wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:ME2","CH_97E9_1C_2:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:MME-03","text":"Die Opposition Geist/Leib zerfällt zugunsten einer asymmetrischen Einheit, in der Geist nur als produktive Artikulation und Rückwirkung verkörperter Prozesse fungiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:ME3","CH_97E9_1C_2:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:MME-04","text":"Heilung wird von der Reparatur eines Einzelnen zu einer Methode der Zukunftsbildung umgeordnet: Selbstheilung ist nur gültig, wenn sie beispielhaft, übertragbar und gemeinschaftsbildend wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:ME3","CH_97E9_2C_2:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:MME-05","text":"Zukunft wird als selektive Hervorbringung und nicht als Fortschreibung, Erlösung oder Entdeckung eines bereits vorhandenen menschlichen Wesens kartiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:ME4","CH_97E9_2C_2:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_11:ALT-B01","text":"Surface level — Tod, Gold, Selbstsucht, Tugend, Leib, Erde, Krankheit und Übermensch erscheinen als explizite Gegenstände einer gemeinsamen Umwertungsarbeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:ALT1","CH_97E9_1C_2:ALT1","CH_97E9_2C_2:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:ALT-B02","text":"Structural level — Überschuss, verkörpertes Erbe, Reinigung, Wertsetzung, Erbschaft und Selektion bilden eine zusammenhängende Produktionskette.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:ALT2","CH_97E9_2C_2:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:ALT-B03","text":"Metastrategic level — Das System ersetzt Bewahrung, Kontemplation, moralische Anerkennung und fremde Heilung durch Selbstformung, Härte, Gabe, Auswahl und Übergabe.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:ALT3","CH_97E9_2C_2:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:ALT-B04","text":"Ontological / Temporal level — Realität erscheint als unvollendete Verkörperung; Zeit ist qualitative Reifezeit, und Zukunft ist eine erzeugte Differenz zur gegenwärtigen Menschengestalt.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:ALT4","CH_97E9_2C_2:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:ALT-B05","text":"Methodological / Performative level — Die metaphorische Verdichtung von Gold, Sonne, Schlange, Erbe und Erde vollzieht selbst die geforderte Umwertung, indem Begriffe nicht definiert, sondern in Bewegungsdiagramme überführt werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:D7","CH_97E9_1C_2:SD6","CH_97E9_1C_2:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_11:FL-01","text":"Die Freiheit des Todes bleibt gespannt zwischen subjektivem Wollen und objektiver Reife, weil der Wille nur frei sein soll, wenn Ziel, Erbe und Vollendung bereits als Kriterien gelten.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:MRT6","CH_97E9_VFT0:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:FL-02","text":"Die Zurückweisung endgültigen Wissens über Gut und Böse kollidiert mit der entschiedenen Diagnose von Gesundheit, Krankheit, Entartung und höherer Zukunft.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:MRT7","CH_97E9_1C_2:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:FL-03","text":"Die Kritik an Erbe als Verkörperung von Irrtum steht unter Spannung zur positiven Funktion von Erben, Volk und selektiver Weitergabe.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:D2","CH_97E9_2C_2:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:FL-04","text":"Die Erdbejahung bleibt instabil, weil sie ihre höchste Form nicht im unbedingten Leben, sondern in der Fähigkeit zur rechtzeitigen Beendigung des Lebens findet.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:MRT8","CH_97E9_VFT0:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:MP-01","text":"Aneignung mutiert am Punkt der Rückgabe: Was als Räuberei erscheint, wird erst durch seine zirkulierende Zielrichtung zur schenkenden Tugend.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:D3","CH_97E9_1C_2:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:MP-02","text":"Einsamkeit mutiert vom sozialen Ausschluss zur Vorform einer künftigen Gemeinschaft, ohne dass das Kriterium dieser Auswahl vollständig ausgewiesen wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:NX9","CH_97E9_2C_2:ME6","CH_97E9_2C_2:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:MP-03","text":"Tod mutiert vom Ende der Person zur produktiven Schwelle einer Fortsetzung, wodurch Selbstaufgabe zugleich als höchste Selbstbejahung lesbar wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:SD1","CH_97E9_VFT0:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_11:HSI-01","text":"Realität erscheint als metabolische Maschine verkörperter Kräfte: Sie nimmt Erbe, Irrtum und Reichtum auf, reinigt und steigert sie, gibt sie als Werte weiter und verwirft Formen, die nur noch sich selbst erhalten.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A4","CH_97E9_1C_2:SD1","CH_97E9_VFT0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:HSI-02","text":"Das Subjekt ist kein souveräner Besitzer seiner selbst, sondern ein Übergangsorgan, das Kraft sammeln, umformen, übertragen und im rechten Augenblick freigeben muss.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:SD5","CH_97E9_1C_2:A4","CH_97E9_VFT0:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:HSI-03","text":"Zeit ist eine Folge qualitativer Schwellen, in der Vergangenheit als Leib fortwirkt, Gegenwart als Selbstheilung kämpft und Zukunft nur durch Selektions- und Übergabeakte hervorgebracht wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:SD2","CH_97E9_2C_2:SD2","CH_97E9_2C_2:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:HSI-04","text":"Kampf bleibt als Navigation zwischen Verfall und Überströmung möglich: Er besteht nicht in Erhaltung, sondern in der Durchsetzung jener Formen, die Erde, Leib und Zukunft produktiv miteinander verbinden.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A9","CH_97E9_2C_2:SD1","CH_97E9_2C_2:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_11:MRT-B01","text":"Die extrahierten Axiome reichen aus, um die gemeinsame Architektur von freiem Tod, schenkender Tugend und erdgebundener Zukunftsproduktion zu rekonstruieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:MRT1","CH_97E9_1C_2:MRT1","CH_97E9_2C_2:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:MRT-B02","text":"Die Rekonstruktion ist auf Clusterebene kohärent, sofern Selbstbegrenzung, Selbstbejahung und Selbstheilung als verschiedene Formen derselben generativen Weitergabe gelesen werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:MRT3","CH_97E9_1C_2:MRT3","CH_97E9_2C_2:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:MRT-B03","text":"Unterbestimmt bleiben die Kriterien, nach denen Reife, legitime Erbschaft, Gesundheit, neue Werte und Selbstauswahl konkret entschieden werden können.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:MRT2","CH_97E9_1C_2:MRT2","CH_97E9_2C_2:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:MRT-B04","text":"Die stärkste Architektur liegt in der rekursiven Verbindung von Leib, Wert, Gabe, Tod und Zukunft; sie bewahrt die Bewegung vom belasteten Erbe zur selektiv erzeugten Fortsetzung.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:MRT4","CH_97E9_1C_2:MRT4","CH_97E9_2C_2:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:MRT-B05","text":"Die Reduktion widersteht einer vollständigen Schließung, weil das System seine produktiven Spannungen benötigt: Es muss freien Willen normieren, Erbe zugleich verwerfen und übertragen sowie Selektivität ohne abschließendes Wissen rechtfertigen.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:MRT6","CH_97E9_2C_2:MRT6","CH_97E9_1C_2:MRT7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T200149729372Z_c22a6abb","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Chapters 31–33","source_sha256":"fa48febd82fc5d312d54500c14b48152bfcf9d88b56b6592f121c6de67733dd6","sha256":"fc4c97a884b933e5bdd0950333ed9d7ecaecbbc625502fed4cb3ec7a75d4d29e","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T20:01:49.730746+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_11:AS-B01","text":"The system determines human perfection neither as mere lifespan nor as the possession of values, but as the bodily generated capacity to transfer surplus into future, inheritance, and new formation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:AS2","CH_97E9_1C_2:SD1","CH_97E9_2C_2:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:AS-B02","text":"Death becomes the boundary act of an economy of value in which a life is perfected only if its self-limitation enables further value creation, self-healing, and elevation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:AS5","CH_97E9_2C_2:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:AS-B03","text":"The return to earth and body is not a regression against spirit and knowledge, but their recoding as procedures of purification, value-positing, gift, and self-overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:D6","CH_97E9_2C_2:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:AS-B04","text":"The argument moves spirally: embodied inheritance produces illness, illness compels self-formation, self-formation produces values, values demand transmission, and transmission demands a selective future.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A4","CH_97E9_2C_2:A12","CH_97E9_2C_2:A15"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:AS-B05","text":"Closure arises not through stabilizing an attained state, but through the regulated transfer of force: appropriation becomes gift, maturity becomes renunciation, solitude becomes people, and life becomes inheritance.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:A4","CH_97E9_VFT0:D9","CH_97E9_2C_2:D8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:AS-B06","text":"The current level reconstructs a selective generative machine whose aim is not the preservation of the human being, but the production of an earth-bound future form that surpasses itself.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A1","CH_97E9_2C_2:SD4","CH_97E9_VFT0:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_11:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Value possesses higher validity only where appropriated surplus is transformed into a transmission that extends beyond its owner.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:A4","CH_97E9_VFT0:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:GA-02","text":"[Mutating] Self-affirmation is determined not as self-preservation, but as productive self-enhancement that externalizes its force in gift, inheritance, healing, and bringing-forth.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:A5","CH_97E9_2C_2:A12","CH_97E9_VFT0:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:GA-03","text":"[Persistent] The body is the primary site of production of knowledge, virtue, value, and transformation; spirit denotes its articulating and retroactive function.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:A9","CH_97E9_1C_2:D6","CH_97E9_2C_2:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:GA-04","text":"[Emergent] Maturity is a qualitative form of time in which perfection is determined not by duration, but by the attained capacity for transmission and self-limitation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:A3","CH_97E9_VFT0:SD2","CH_97E9_2C_2:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:GA-05","text":"[Mutating] Knowledge is not a distance from life, but a bodily operation of testing and purification through which drives are sanctified, values newly posited, and future possibilities produced.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A10","CH_97E9_2C_2:A11","CH_97E9_2C_2:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:GA-06","text":"[Attractor] Earth functions as an immanent space of testing in which value, health, death, and future are valid only insofar as they do not deny life, but enable its enhancement and transformation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:A15","CH_97E9_2C_2:A1","CH_97E9_2C_2:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:GA-07","text":"[Emergent] Community arises not from equality or integration, but from self-selection, selective elevation, and the transmission of an already attained form to future bearers.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A14","CH_97E9_2C_2:D7","CH_97E9_VFT0:D9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:GA-08","text":"[Terminal] A successful life must be able to limit its own continuation as soon as holding on would mark the transition from creation to consumption, decay, or mere repetition.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:A8","CH_97E9_VFT0:D8","CH_97E9_VFT0:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:GA-09","text":"[Attractor] The Overman is not an existing identity, but the name for the future figure emerging from bodily transformation, new value-positing, inheritance, and selective community.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A15","CH_97E9_2C_2:D8","CH_97E9_2C_2:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_11:RMD-01","text":"Selfishness does not recur as a stable moral category: it mutates from a question of self-relation into a question of the direction in which wealth, force, and values flow.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:D4","CH_97E9_1C_2:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:RMD-02","text":"Death shifts from a private end to a social technique of transmission; its freedom lies not in the isolated act of will, but in the capacity to organize a future beyond the dying person.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:D2","CH_97E9_VFT0:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:RMD-03","text":"The body retains its generative function, but expands it: from origin of virtue it becomes at once archive of error, laboratory of knowledge, and material of future elevation.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:SD4","CH_97E9_2C_2:D2","CH_97E9_2C_2:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:RMD-04","text":"Spirit loses its sovereign position, but does not disappear; as expression, tool, and reconnection of bodily processes, it is absorbed into an immanent machine of value.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:A10","CH_97E9_2C_2:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:RMD-05","text":"Maturity mutates from individual perfection into a selective condition of the future: it legitimates both the end of an individual life and the production of a collective not yet existing.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:A14","CH_97E9_2C_2:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:RMD-06","text":"Earth remains the positive attractor, yet its function expands from object of affirmation into a still unexhausted field of healing, value production, and transhuman bringing-forth.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:SNX4","CH_97E9_2C_2:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_11:CGD-01","text":"The hierarchy of individual forms of death remains a local differentiation; at the cluster level, only the overarching rule counts that perfection is bound to temporally regulated transmission.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:D4","CH_97E9_VFT0:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:CGD-02","text":"Gold, sun, and snake remain local bearers of symbols; what scales upward is the structure they produce of a non-useful, overflowing, and knowledge-capable production of value.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:A17","CH_97E9_1C_2:SD6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:CGD-03","text":"The diagnosis of past errors remains locally bound to the human being as experiment; at the current level it becomes the general condition that every future must be produced through the transformation of embodied past.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A4","CH_97E9_2C_2:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:CGD-04","text":"The opposition between giving and hungry selfishness is absorbed into a more comprehensive distinction between generative circulation and terminal self-binding.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:A5","CH_97E9_1C_2:A6","CH_97E9_VFT0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:CGD-05","text":"Self-selection is not merely a model of future community, but the collective counterpart of that maturity which at the individual level enables free renunciation of continuation.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A14","CH_97E9_VFT0:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_11:GNX-01","text":"Excluded is every order that treats duration, possession, utility, or self-preservation as the ultimate measure of value.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:DNX1","CH_97E9_1C_2:DNX1","CH_97E9_1C_2:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:GNX-02","text":"Excluded is a spirit that could produce its truth independently of body, drive, inheritance, and earth.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:DNX3","CH_97E9_2C_2:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:GNX-03","text":"Excluded is a morality that understands virtue as selflessness, recognition, comfort, or adaptation.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:NX5","CH_97E9_1C_2:NX7","CH_97E9_1C_2:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:GNX-04","text":"Excluded is a future that could appear as a mere prolongation of the present human form or as universal redemption without transformation.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:DNX5","CH_97E9_2C_2:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:GNX-05","text":"Excluded is a neutral death, because every end either prolongs decay or transmits a form of inheritance, sting, and future value-formation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:SNX1","CH_97E9_VFT0:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_11:DBN-01","text":"The system cannot allow a subject to be fulfilled by preserving itself; without self-transcendence, self-affirmation becomes illness.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:DNX4","CH_97E9_1C_2:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:DBN-02","text":"The system cannot allow value to exist outside its material, bodily, and temporal production; every transcendent norm would block immanent revaluation.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:DNX1","CH_97E9_2C_2:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:DBN-03","text":"The system cannot allow help to be separated from the helper's self-transformation, because otherwise the transmission of force would disintegrate into the mere administration of a deficiency.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A12","CH_97E9_2C_2:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:DBN-04","text":"The system cannot allow history to count as a continuum of reason, because the necessity of transformation arises only from an embodied inheritance of error, madness, and chance.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A6","CH_97E9_2C_2:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_11:BSA-01","text":"Unavailable is a form of life that could affirm itself without also thinking its end, its transmission, and its surpassing.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:SNX3","CH_97E9_VFT0:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:BSA-02","text":"Unavailable is definitive knowledge of value, good, or evil, because value exists only as a continued, bodily risked, and future-producing positing.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:A11","CH_97E9_1C_2:DNX4","CH_97E9_2C_2:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:BSA-03","text":"Ontologically inadmissible is a perfectly reconciled subject: the subject remains a transitional form between sedimented inheritance, present self-healing, and transformation still outstanding.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A5","CH_97E9_2C_2:SD3","CH_97E9_2C_2:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_11:XD-01","text":"Giving virtue and free death form two phases of the same circulation: first surplus is gathered and returned, then the person itself is abolished as a boundary so that its force reaches heirs.","refs":["CL_97E9_11:GA-01","CL_97E9_11:GA-04","CL_97E9_11:GA-08","CH_97E9_1C_2:A4","CH_97E9_VFT0:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:XD-02","text":"The bodily origin of virtue and bodily purification through knowledge connect value creation with therapy: new values are not judgments about life, but restructurings of its economy of drives.","refs":["CL_97E9_11:GA-03","CL_97E9_11:GA-05","CH_97E9_1C_2:D6","CH_97E9_2C_2:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:XD-03","text":"The difference between healthy giving and sick holding-on is radicalized through the doctrine of death: self-preservation appears legitimate only so long as it prepares future transmission.","refs":["CL_97E9_11:GA-02","CL_97E9_11:GA-08","CH_97E9_1C_2:A6","CH_97E9_VFT0:A8","CH_97E9_VFT0:D9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:XD-04","text":"Self-selection and inheritance together produce a non-genealogical genealogy: future is guaranteed not through biological descent, but through the selective transmission of a transformed form of life.","refs":["CL_97E9_11:GA-07","CL_97E9_11:GA-09","CH_97E9_2C_2:A14","CH_97E9_VFT0:D9","CH_97E9_2C_2:D8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:XD-05","text":"Earth-affirmation acquires its operative significance only through the connection of maturity and self-healing: earth is neither possession nor natural ground, but the field on which decay must be turned into future health.","refs":["CL_97E9_11:GA-04","CL_97E9_11:GA-06","CH_97E9_VFT0:SD2","CH_97E9_2C_2:A16","CH_97E9_2C_2:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_11:BSD-01","text":"Causality is shifted from linear cause and effect into a structure of inheritance and retroaction: the past continues to act in the body, present self-formation changes the drive, and death organizes continued efficacy in others.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A4","CH_97E9_2C_2:A10","CH_97E9_VFT0:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:BSD-02","text":"The subject becomes a temporary form of condensation of a surplus whose legitimacy depends on whether it can transfer it into values, healing, heirs, and future forms.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:SD5","CH_97E9_1C_2:SD1","CH_97E9_2C_2:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:BSD-03","text":"History appears not as progress, but as a contested recoding of a burdened inheritance, in which every higher state is at once selection, healing, and the risk of new domination.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A6","CH_97E9_2C_2:SD2","CH_97E9_2C_2:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:BSD-04","text":"The political form of the system is neither universalist nor privatist: it organizes a selective community through exemplary self-transformation and not through law, descent, or majority.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:D7","CH_97E9_2C_2:DNX6","CH_97E9_2C_2:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_11:RLE-01","text":"Embodied error produces the need for knowledge; knowledge purifies and elevates the body; the elevated body produces new values; new values alter the conditions of future embodiment.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A4","CH_97E9_2C_2:A10","CH_97E9_1C_2:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:RLE-02","text":"Surplus forms a recursive attractor: appropriation becomes legitimate only through gift, gift produces heirs, heirs secure the possibility of further appropriation and further gift.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:A4","CH_97E9_1C_2:D3","CH_97E9_VFT0:D9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:RLE-03","text":"Maturity escalates from personal self-limitation to historical selection: whoever can temporally order their end becomes a model for producing a future that surpasses the present human being.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:A14","CH_97E9_2C_2:D8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:RLE-04","text":"The attractor earth holds divergent processes together: body, death, knowledge, healing, value, and future remain connectable only as immanent operations of a common field of transformation.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A1","CH_97E9_2C_2:SD1","CH_97E9_2C_2:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_11:FGS-B01","text":"Embodied inheritance from error, delusion, and chance → diagnosis of the human being as an unperfected and endangered transitional form.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A4","CH_97E9_2C_2:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:FGS-B02","text":"Reduction of spirit and virtue to body and earth → knowledge as purification, testing, and elevation of the drives.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A3","CH_97E9_2C_2:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:FGS-B03","text":"Bodily elevation → creative value-positing → absorption and return of surplus as giving virtue.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:A12","CH_97E9_1C_2:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:FGS-B04","text":"Giving self-affirmation → self-healing and exemplary help → selective formation of future bearers.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:A5","CH_97E9_2C_2:A12","CH_97E9_2C_2:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:FGS-B05","text":"Attained maturity plus existing inheritance → free self-limitation → death as an act of transmission rather than as interruption.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:A5","CH_97E9_VFT0:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:FGS-B06","text":"Repeated transmission of values, drives, and goals → new community → future figure beyond the given human form.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:D8","CH_97E9_2C_2:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_11:AFM-B01","text":"Embodied error → reconnection to earth and body → knowledge as self-purification → giving value production → maturity as the capacity to say no → transmission to heirs → selective community → Overman as produced future.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:AF1","CH_97E9_1C_2:AF1","CH_97E9_VFT0:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_11:MME-01","text":"The opposition life/death is replaced by an architecture of maturity, transmission, and decay; death becomes not the counter-concept of life, but its possible form of continuation in others.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:ME2","CH_97E9_VFT0:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:MME-02","text":"The opposition selfishness/altruism disintegrates in favor of a mapping of value flows: decisive is not self-relation, but whether force is enclosed or made overflowing.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:ME2","CH_97E9_1C_2:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:MME-03","text":"The opposition spirit/body disintegrates in favor of an asymmetrical unity in which spirit functions only as productive articulation and retroaction of embodied processes.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:ME3","CH_97E9_1C_2:ME4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:MME-04","text":"Healing is reordered from the repair of an individual into a method of future formation: self-healing is valid only if it becomes exemplary, transferable, and community-forming.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:ME3","CH_97E9_2C_2:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:MME-05","text":"Future is mapped as selective bringing-forth and not as continuation, redemption, or discovery of an already existing human essence.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:ME4","CH_97E9_2C_2:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_11:ALT-B01","text":"Surface level — Death, gold, selfishness, virtue, body, earth, illness, and Overman appear as explicit objects of a shared work of revaluation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:ALT1","CH_97E9_1C_2:ALT1","CH_97E9_2C_2:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:ALT-B02","text":"Structural level — Surplus, embodied inheritance, purification, value-positing, inheritance, and selection form a coherent chain of production.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:ALT2","CH_97E9_2C_2:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:ALT-B03","text":"Metastrategic level — The system replaces preservation, contemplation, moral recognition, and external healing with self-formation, hardness, gift, selection, and transmission.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:ALT3","CH_97E9_2C_2:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:ALT-B04","text":"Ontological / Temporal level — Reality appears as unperfected embodiment; time is qualitative time of maturity, and future is a produced difference from the present human form.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:ALT4","CH_97E9_2C_2:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:ALT-B05","text":"Methodological / Performative level — The metaphorical condensation of gold, sun, snake, inheritance, and earth itself enacts the demanded revaluation by transferring concepts not into definitions, but into diagrams of movement.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:D7","CH_97E9_1C_2:SD6","CH_97E9_1C_2:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_11:FL-01","text":"The freedom of death remains tense between subjective willing and objective maturity, because the will is to be free only if goal, inheritance, and perfection already count as criteria.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:MRT6","CH_97E9_VFT0:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:FL-02","text":"The rejection of definitive knowledge of good and evil collides with the decisive diagnosis of health, illness, degeneration, and higher future.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:MRT7","CH_97E9_1C_2:A11"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:FL-03","text":"The critique of inheritance as embodiment of error stands in tension with the positive function of heirs, people, and selective transmission.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:D2","CH_97E9_2C_2:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:FL-04","text":"Earth-affirmation remains unstable because it finds its highest form not in unconditional life, but in the capacity for the timely ending of life.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:MRT8","CH_97E9_VFT0:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:MP-01","text":"Appropriation mutates at the point of return: what appears as robbery becomes giving virtue only through its circulating directionality.","refs":["CH_97E9_1C_2:D3","CH_97E9_1C_2:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:MP-02","text":"Solitude mutates from social exclusion into the preliminary form of a future community, without the criterion of this selection being fully established.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:NX9","CH_97E9_2C_2:ME6","CH_97E9_2C_2:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:MP-03","text":"Death mutates from the end of the person into the productive threshold of a continuation, whereby self-abandonment becomes readable at once as the highest self-affirmation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:SD1","CH_97E9_VFT0:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_11:HSI-01","text":"Reality appears as a metabolic machine of embodied forces: it takes in inheritance, error, and wealth, purifies and enhances them, passes them on as values, and discards forms that preserve only themselves.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A4","CH_97E9_1C_2:SD1","CH_97E9_VFT0:A8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:HSI-02","text":"The subject is not a sovereign possessor of itself, but a transitional organ that must gather, transform, transmit, and at the right moment release force.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:SD5","CH_97E9_1C_2:A4","CH_97E9_VFT0:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:HSI-03","text":"Time is a sequence of qualitative thresholds in which the past continues to act as body, the present struggles as self-healing, and the future is brought forth only through acts of selection and transmission.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:SD2","CH_97E9_2C_2:SD2","CH_97E9_2C_2:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:HSI-04","text":"Struggle remains possible as navigation between decay and overflowing: it consists not in preservation, but in enforcing those forms that productively connect earth, body, and future.","refs":["CH_97E9_2C_2:A9","CH_97E9_2C_2:SD1","CH_97E9_2C_2:A16"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_11:MRT-B01","text":"The extracted axioms suffice to reconstruct the shared architecture of free death, giving virtue, and earth-bound future production.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:MRT1","CH_97E9_1C_2:MRT1","CH_97E9_2C_2:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:MRT-B02","text":"The reconstruction is coherent at the cluster level, provided that self-limitation, self-affirmation, and self-healing are read as different forms of the same generative transmission.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:MRT3","CH_97E9_1C_2:MRT3","CH_97E9_2C_2:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:MRT-B03","text":"The criteria by which maturity, legitimate inheritance, health, new values, and self-selection can concretely be decided remain underdetermined.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:MRT2","CH_97E9_1C_2:MRT2","CH_97E9_2C_2:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:MRT-B04","text":"The strongest architecture lies in the recursive connection of body, value, gift, death, and future; it preserves the movement from burdened inheritance to selectively produced continuation.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:MRT4","CH_97E9_1C_2:MRT4","CH_97E9_2C_2:MRT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_11:MRT-B05","text":"The reduction resists complete closure because the system requires its productive tensions: it must norm free will, reject and transmit inheritance at once, and justify selectivity without conclusive knowledge.","refs":["CH_97E9_VFT0:MRT6","CH_97E9_2C_2:MRT6","CH_97E9_1C_2:MRT7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CL_97E9_11@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CL_97E9_11:v1","source_language_code":"de","original_title":"Chapters 31–33"}],"identity":{"layer":"CL","kicker":"Cluster · Also sprach Zarathustra","title":"Chapters 31–33","context":"Vom freien Tode · Von der schenkenden Tugend · 1 · Von der schenkenden Tugend · 2","original_title":"Chapters 31–33"},"original_title":"Chapters 31–33","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CL_97E9_12","layer":"CL","title":"Chapters 34–36","order":12,"parents":["CH_97E9_3C_2","CH_97E9_ZWET","CH_97E9_DKMD"],"revision":"CL_97E9_12@R001","sha256":"7f68d8fb80c38219d3bfa92fcd37bdaaf417505f0ecbaff3a91ace792a501d6c","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_12:AS-01","text":"Das Cluster rekonstruiert Autorität als eine Form, die ihre eigene Aufhebung erzwingen muss, weil fortgesetzte Bindung Selbstwerdung, Erkenntnis und erneuerte Gemeinschaft blockiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:AS2","CH_97E9_3C_2:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:AS-02","text":"Verleugnung, Verlust und Unterbrechung fungieren nicht als Endpunkte, sondern als Schwellen einer nicht-identischen Wiederaufnahme von Beziehung, Liebe und Suche.","refs":["CH_97E9_ZWET:D1","CH_97E9_ZWET:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:AS-03","text":"Die Rückkehr ist keine Wiederherstellung einer ursprünglichen Gemeinschaft, sondern eine riskante Zirkulation einer mutierten Lehre durch ein Feld aus verlorenen Freunden, feindlicher Entstellung und erneuerter Anrede.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:AS4","CH_97E9_DKMD:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:AS-04","text":"Die Bewegung ist spiralförmig: Bindung erzeugt Trennung, Trennung erzeugt Selbst- und Weltverlust, Verlust erzwingt neue Rede, und neue Rede sucht eine Gemeinschaft, die nicht mehr als ursprüngliche Einheit verfügbar ist.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:AF1","CH_97E9_DKMD:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_12:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Eine Beziehung, die Selbstwerdung ermöglichen soll, darf nicht als dauerhafte Hierarchie zwischen Lehrer und Schüler fortbestehen.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:A1","CH_97E9_3C_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:GA-02","text":"[Mutating] Verleugnung wandelt sich von einem Abbruch der Bindung in die notwendige Operation ihrer späteren, nicht-identischen Erneuerung.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:A5","CH_97E9_ZWET:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:GA-03","text":"[Persistent] Erkenntnis und Selbstfindung verlangen Widerstand gegen die Autorität, deren Lehre sie ursprünglich ermöglicht hat.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:A2","CH_97E9_3C_2:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:GA-04","text":"[Emergent] Die soziale Wirksamkeit einer Lehre hängt nicht allein von ihrem Ursprung, sondern von ihrem öffentlichen Bild, ihrer zirkulierenden Aufnahme und ihrer Anfechtbarkeit ab.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:A4","CH_97E9_DKMD:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:GA-05","text":"[Mutating] Rückzug ist weder Flucht noch Zielzustand, sondern ein Produktionsmodus, dessen Überschuss die Rückkehr in eine beschädigte soziale Welt erzwingt.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:A1","CH_97E9_DKMD:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:GA-06","text":"[Attractor] Gemeinschaft bleibt nur als verlorene, erneut suchbare und durch verändertes Sehen sowie Lieben zu bildende Konstellation möglich.","refs":["CH_97E9_ZWET:A6","CH_97E9_ZWET:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:GA-07","text":"[Emergent] Liebe ist keine konfliktfreie Bindung, sondern eine überströmende Zirkulation, die Freunde und Feinde zugleich anspricht, gefährdet und neu ordnet.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:A8","CH_97E9_DKMD:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:GA-08","text":"[Terminal] Der Mensch, die Lehre und die Gemeinschaft dürfen nicht als abschließbare Gestalten behandelt werden; ihr Sinn liegt im Übergang zu einer noch nicht verfügbaren Form.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:A7","CH_97E9_DKMD:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_12:RMD-01","text":"Die Lehrerfigur bleibt als Ausgangspunkt erhalten, verliert jedoch ihre Funktion als dauerhafte Quelle von Gehorsam und wird zur Instanz ihrer eigenen Überwindung.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:AS2","CH_97E9_3C_2:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:RMD-02","text":"Verleugnung kehrt funktional wieder, mutiert jedoch von der Bedingung individueller Selbstfindung zur Bedingung relationaler Transformation und sozialer Wiederaufnahme.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:A5","CH_97E9_ZWET:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:RMD-03","text":"Die Rückkehr verschiebt sich von der Wiederbegegnung mit dem Lehrer zur strategischen Re-Zirkulation einer durch öffentliche Entstellung gefährdeten Lehre.","refs":["CH_97E9_ZWET:AS2","CH_97E9_DKMD:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:RMD-04","text":"Freundschaft wird von einer nachgeordneten Möglichkeit nach vollzogener Selbstwerdung zu einem ungesicherten Rezeptionsgrund für wilde, noch nicht stabilisierte Weisheit erweitert.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:AS5","CH_97E9_DKMD:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_12:CGD-01","text":"Die Forderung, den Lehrer zu verlassen, gehört lokal zur Pädagogik der Selbstfindung; auf Clusterebene wird sie zur allgemeinen Regel, dass produktive Autorität nur durch ihre Nicht-Verfügbarkeit fortwirkt.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:D1","CH_97E9_3C_2:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:CGD-02","text":"Das veränderte Sehen und Lieben gehört lokal zur Rückkehrbewegung; auf Clusterebene wird es zur Bedingung jeder Beziehung, die den Verlust nicht durch Wiederherstellung annullieren darf.","refs":["CH_97E9_ZWET:A4","CH_97E9_ZWET:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:CGD-03","text":"Das Spiegelbild gehört lokal zur Diagnose feindlicher Entstellung; auf Clusterebene markiert es die Unterscheidung zwischen einer Lehre und ihrer kontingenten sozialen Erscheinungsform.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:A3","CH_97E9_DKMD:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_12:GNX-01","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist jede Gemeinschaftsform, deren Einheit auf fortgesetzter Verehrung, ungebrochener Anerkennung oder stabiler Schülerbindung beruht.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:SNX1","CH_97E9_ZWET:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:GNX-02","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist eine Rückkehr, die das Früher einfach wiederholt, weil Rückkehr nur unter veränderten Wahrnehmungs- und Liebesbedingungen möglich wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_ZWET:NX2","CH_97E9_ZWET:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:GNX-03","text":"Ausgeschlossen ist die Gleichsetzung von Wahrheit und öffentlichem Bild, weil die Lehre durch Verzerrung, Scham und feindliche Aneignung vermittelt bleibt.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:NX1","CH_97E9_DKMD:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_12:DBN-01","text":"Das System kann keine selbstgenügsame Innerlichkeit zulassen: Weisheit, die in Rückzug verbleibt, verliert ihre soziale Wirksamkeit und überlässt ihr Bild der Entstellung.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:NX3","CH_97E9_DKMD:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:DBN-02","text":"Das System kann keine ungebrochene Kontinuität zulassen, weil Selbstwerdung, Liebe und Erkenntnis nur durch Verlust, zeitliche Distanz und Umformung entstehen.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:DNX1","CH_97E9_ZWET:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:DBN-03","text":"Das System kann keine endgültige Versöhnung zulassen, weil die soziale Wiederannäherung den Gegensatz zu Feinden nicht beseitigt, sondern in ihre Bewegung integriert.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:SD6","CH_97E9_DKMD:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_12:BSA-01","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist eine Gegenwart, in der Autorität, Gemeinschaft und Bedeutung zugleich vollständig anerkannt, unverzerrt und abgeschlossen wären.","refs":["CH_97E9_ZWET:SNX1","CH_97E9_DKMD:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:BSA-02","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist ein letzter Sinn außerhalb von Übergang, Verlust und erneuter Aufnahme; jede erreichte Form muss ihre eigene Überschreitung ermöglichen.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:SNX4","CH_97E9_DKMD:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_12:XD-01","text":"Die Aufhebung der Lehrerautorität und die öffentliche Gefährdung der Lehre bilden gemeinsam eine doppelte Entbindung: Die Anhänger müssen sich vom Lehrer lösen, während die Lehre sich aus der Privatheit ihres Ursprungs lösen muss. ; Trace Type — [Composite]","refs":["CL_97E9_12:GA-01","CL_97E9_12:GA-04","CH_97E9_3C_2:SD1","CH_97E9_DKMD:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:XD-02","text":"Die vollständige Verleugnung wird erst auf Clusterebene als Schnittstelle sichtbar, an der individuelle Selbstwerdung, relationale Umformung und soziale Suche gleichzeitig organisiert werden. ; Trace Type — [Composite]","refs":["CL_97E9_12:GA-02","CL_97E9_12:GA-06","CH_97E9_3C_2:D4","CH_97E9_ZWET:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:XD-03","text":"Die Rückkehr muss neue Sprache hervorbringen, weil die Rückkehrenden nicht zu einer früheren Gemeinschaft zurückkehren, sondern ein durch Verlust und Entstellung verändertes Feld erneut adressieren. ; Trace Type — [Composite]","refs":["CL_97E9_12:GA-04","CL_97E9_12:GA-05","CH_97E9_ZWET:SD4","CH_97E9_DKMD:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:XD-04","text":"Die Einbeziehung der Feinde ist nicht ein Zusatz zur Freundschaft, sondern die Bedingung, unter der Freundschaft nach Verlust und öffentlicher Verzerrung überhaupt noch gesucht werden kann. ; Trace Type — [Tension]","refs":["CL_97E9_12:GA-06","CL_97E9_12:GA-07","CH_97E9_DKMD:A10","CH_97E9_DKMD:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_12:BSD-01","text":"Das Cluster erzeugt ein Modell nicht-souveräner Autorität: Wirksam ist Autorität nur, sofern sie Abhängigkeit zerstört, ihre Bilder nicht kontrollieren kann und ihre Wiederkehr nicht als Besitzanspruch vollzieht.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:SD2","CH_97E9_DKMD:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:BSD-02","text":"Geschichte erscheint als Folge irreversibler Übergänge, in denen Wiederkehr keine Rückkehr zum Ursprung, sondern eine Wiederaufnahme unter anderen Bedingungen bezeichnet.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:SD4","CH_97E9_ZWET:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:BSD-03","text":"Das Subjekt wird nicht als autonomer Ursprung, sondern als Durchgangsform bestimmt, die sich durch Widerstand, Verlust, Bildkonflikt und erneute Anrede konstituiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:A7","CH_97E9_DKMD:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:BSD-04","text":"Lehre wird als offene Zirkulationsmaschine bestimmt: Sie produziert Entstellungen, Verluste und Gegenkräfte, aus denen sie neue Rede und noch ungesicherte Formen der Aufnahme erzeugen muss.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:SD7","CH_97E9_DKMD:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_12:RLE-01","text":"Autorität erzeugt Bindung, Bindung verhindert Selbstfindung, Selbstfindung verlangt Verleugnung, und die Verleugnung ermöglicht erst eine Beziehung ohne ursprüngliche Unterordnung.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:FGS1","CH_97E9_3C_2:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:RLE-02","text":"Rückzug erzeugt Weisheitsüberschuss, Überschuss erzeugt Schmerz und neue Rede, neue Rede exponiert sich erneut der sozialen Entstellung und erzwingt damit weitere Rückkehrbewegungen.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:D1","CH_97E9_DKMD:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:RLE-03","text":"Der Attraktor des Clusters ist die nicht-identische Wiederkehr: Jede Rückkehr bewahrt einen Bezug auf das Verlorene, verändert jedoch die Form des Sehens, Liebens, Sprechens und Zusammenkommens.","refs":["CH_97E9_ZWET:D5","CH_97E9_ZWET:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_12:FGS-B01","text":"Bindung an Autorität → Abhängigkeit und Suspendierung der Selbstsuche → notwendige Verleugnung.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:AS1","CH_97E9_3C_2:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:FGS-B02","text":"Verleugnung → Verlust und zeitliche Unterbrechung → Mutation von Wahrnehmung und Liebe → nicht-identische Rückkehr.","refs":["CH_97E9_ZWET:FGS2","CH_97E9_ZWET:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:FGS-B03","text":"Rückzug → Akkumulation und Schmerz der Weisheit → Diagnose öffentlicher Entstellung → Imperativ erneuter sozialer Zirkulation.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:FGS1","CH_97E9_DKMD:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:FGS-B04","text":"Neue Rede → antagonistische Anrede von Freunden und Feinden → riskante Suche nach einem noch nicht gesicherten Grund der Aufnahme.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:FGS5","CH_97E9_DKMD:FGS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_12:AFM-B01","text":"Verehrung und Bindung → Abhängigkeit → geforderte Trennung → Selbstfindung.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:AFM-B02","text":"Selbstfindung → Verleugnung als Schwelle → Verlust der ursprünglichen Gemeinschaft → veränderte Rückkehr.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:D5","CH_97E9_ZWET:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:AFM-B03","text":"Veränderte Rückkehr → Konfrontation mit öffentlicher Entstellung → Verlust der Freunde → neue Sprache und soziale Suche.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:D2","CH_97E9_DKMD:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:AFM-B04","text":"Neue Sprache und antagonistische Liebe → Zirkulation durch Freunde und Feinde → offene Suche nach einer Gemeinschaft ohne ursprüngliche Identität.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:SD3","CH_97E9_DKMD:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_12:MME-01","text":"Autorität wird nicht länger als stabile Quelle kartiert, sondern als Übergangsfunktion, deren Legitimität an die Produktion unabhängiger Gegenkräfte gebunden ist.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:ME1","CH_97E9_3C_2:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:MME-02","text":"Verlust wird von bloßem Entzug zu einer produktiven Kategorie umklassifiziert, weil er Selbstfindung, veränderte Liebe und erneute Suche zugleich ermöglicht.","refs":["CH_97E9_ZWET:ME5","CH_97E9_ZWET:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:MME-03","text":"Die Grenze zwischen Freund und Feind verliert ihre ordnende Eindeutigkeit, weil beide zu Adressaten einer Liebe und Rede werden, die den Konflikt nicht stillstellt.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:ME3","CH_97E9_DKMD:SD6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_12:ALT-B01","text":"Surface level — Verlassen, Verleugnen, Wiederkehren, Spiegeln, Suchen, Schenken und Sprechen bilden die sichtbaren Operationen der Bewegung.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:ALT1","CH_97E9_DKMD:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:ALT-B02","text":"Structural level — Beziehungen werden durch Abhängigkeit, Unterbrechung, öffentliche Bildvermittlung, Verlust und erneute Zirkulation organisiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:ALT2","CH_97E9_DKMD:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:ALT-B03","text":"Metastrategic level — Intervention bedeutet nicht Bewahrung einer reinen Lehre, sondern Steigerung ihrer zirkulierenden Rede unter Bedingungen von Entstellung und Gegnerschaft.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:ALT3","CH_97E9_DKMD:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:ALT-B04","text":"Ontological / Temporal level — Identität bleibt nur als transformierbare Kontinuität bestehen, während Mensch, Gemeinschaft und Weisheit als Übergangs- und Werdensformen erscheinen.","refs":["CH_97E9_ZWET:ALT4","CH_97E9_DKMD:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:ALT-B05","text":"Methodological / Performative level — Das System vollzieht seine These, indem es Wiederkehr als Variation, Negation als produktive Schwelle und Bildlichkeit als operative Diagnose statt als bloße Ausschmückung organisiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_ZWET:ME2","CH_97E9_DKMD:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_12:FL-01","text":"Die Selbstaufhebung von Autorität bleibt spannungsvoll, weil die Aufforderung zur Verleugnung selbst weiterhin von der Autorität desjenigen ausgeht, der überwunden werden soll.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:SD1","CH_97E9_3C_2:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:FL-02","text":"Die Umwandlung von Verlust in produktive Suche bleibt instabil, weil nicht entschieden wird, ob der Verlust tatsächlich eingetreten ist oder nur als zukünftige Bedingung angekündigt wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_ZWET:MRT2","CH_97E9_ZWET:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:FL-03","text":"Die Rückkehr zur Freundschaft bleibt gefährdet, weil die wilde Rede, die Freunde zurückrufen soll, sie zugleich erschrecken und erneut vertreiben kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:SD5","CH_97E9_DKMD:MRT7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:MP-01","text":"Die Verleugnung mutiert vom negativen Gestus gegen eine Autorität zur positiven Bedingung, unter der eine andere Form der Beziehung überhaupt erst entstehen kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:ME3","CH_97E9_ZWET:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:MP-02","text":"Liebe mutiert von einer Beziehung zwischen Zugehörigen zu einer überströmenden, sprachbildenden und antagonistischen Kraft, die Freundschaft nicht von Feindschaft trennt.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:ME4","CH_97E9_DKMD:NX8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_12:HSI-01","text":"Realität erscheint als ein Feld zirkulierender Kräfte, in dem Lehren, Bilder, Bindungen und Feindschaften keine festen Objekte, sondern umkämpfte Vermittlungen sind.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:SD1","CH_97E9_DKMD:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:HSI-02","text":"Das Subjekt erscheint als Durchgangs- und Entladungsform, die nur durch Verlust von Fremdgrund, Widerstand gegen Autorität und riskante Rückkehr zu sich gelangt.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:DNX1","CH_97E9_DKMD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:HSI-03","text":"Zeit erscheint nicht als lineare Vollendung, sondern als Folge von Rückzügen, Unterbrechungen, Wiederkehren und Übergängen zu Gestalten, die noch keinen gesicherten sozialen Ort besitzen.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:SD4","CH_97E9_DKMD:MRT8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_12:MRT-B01","text":"Die extrahierten Axiome reichen aus, um die übergreifende Bewegung von Abhängigkeit über Verleugnung und Verlust zu mutierter Rückkehr und offener sozialer Zirkulation zu rekonstruieren.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:MRT1","CH_97E9_DKMD:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:MRT-B02","text":"Unterbestimmt bleibt, welche konkrete Lehre zirkuliert, welche geschichtliche Bestimmung Freunde und Feinde haben und ob die öffentliche Entstellung nur äußere Verzerrung oder reale Mutation der Lehre anzeigt.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:MRT2","CH_97E9_DKMD:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:MRT-B03","text":"Die Rekonstruktion ist dort am stärksten, wo sie Autorität, Verlust und Rückkehr als rekursive Umformungsmaschine fasst; sie bleibt von der produktiven Spannung abhängig, dass Befreiung neue Bindung sucht, ohne in die alte Bindung zurückfallen zu dürfen.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:MRT4","CH_97E9_3C_2:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"language_code":"de","language_name":"Deutsch","translations":[{"id":"CAREVAR_20261015T200214453582Z_cd456296","language_code":"en","language_name":"English","title":"Chapters 34–36","source_sha256":"7f68d8fb80c38219d3bfa92fcd37bdaaf417505f0ecbaff3a91ace792a501d6c","sha256":"16f6b5a4da9239e2ec6a55ecde57d3d2527172d6d193f20976425c909fcde92a","rendition_type":"machine","review_status":"machine","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","created":"2026-10-15T20:02:14.456021+00:00","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_12:AS-01","text":"The cluster reconstructs authority as a form that must compel its own suspension, because continued attachment blocks self-becoming, knowledge, and renewed community.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:AS2","CH_97E9_3C_2:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:AS-02","text":"Denial, loss, and interruption function not as endpoints, but as thresholds of a non-identical resumption of relation, love, and seeking.","refs":["CH_97E9_ZWET:D1","CH_97E9_ZWET:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:AS-03","text":"Return is not a restoration of an original community, but a risky circulation of a mutated teaching through a field of lost friends, hostile distortion, and renewed address.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:AS4","CH_97E9_DKMD:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:AS-04","text":"The movement is spiral-shaped: attachment produces separation, separation produces loss of self and world, loss compels new speech, and new speech seeks a community that is no longer available as original unity.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:AF1","CH_97E9_DKMD:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_12:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] A relation intended to enable self-becoming must not persist as a permanent hierarchy between teacher and student.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:A1","CH_97E9_3C_2:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:GA-02","text":"[Mutating] Denial transforms from a rupture of attachment into the necessary operation of its later, non-identical renewal.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:A5","CH_97E9_ZWET:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:GA-03","text":"[Persistent] Knowledge and self-discovery require resistance to the authority whose teaching originally made them possible.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:A2","CH_97E9_3C_2:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:GA-04","text":"[Emergent] The social efficacy of a teaching depends not solely on its origin, but on its public image, its circulating reception, and its contestability.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:A4","CH_97E9_DKMD:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:GA-05","text":"[Mutating] Withdrawal is neither flight nor an end-state, but a mode of production whose surplus compels return into a damaged social world.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:A1","CH_97E9_DKMD:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:GA-06","text":"[Attractor] Community remains possible only as a lost constellation, one to be sought anew and formed through altered seeing and loving.","refs":["CH_97E9_ZWET:A6","CH_97E9_ZWET:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:GA-07","text":"[Emergent] Love is not a conflict-free attachment, but an overflowing circulation that addresses, endangers, and reorders friends and enemies alike.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:A8","CH_97E9_DKMD:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:GA-08","text":"[Terminal] The human being, the teaching, and the community must not be treated as forms that can be brought to completion; their meaning lies in transition to a form not yet available.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:A7","CH_97E9_DKMD:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_12:RMD-01","text":"The teacher figure remains preserved as a point of departure, but loses its function as a permanent source of obedience and becomes the instance of its own overcoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:AS2","CH_97E9_3C_2:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:RMD-02","text":"Denial recurs functionally, but mutates from the condition of individual self-discovery into the condition of relational transformation and social resumption.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:A5","CH_97E9_ZWET:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:RMD-03","text":"Return shifts from re-encounter with the teacher to the strategic re-circulation of a teaching endangered by public distortion.","refs":["CH_97E9_ZWET:AS2","CH_97E9_DKMD:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:RMD-04","text":"Friendship is expanded from a subordinate possibility following accomplished self-becoming into an unsecured ground of reception for wild, not-yet-stabilized wisdom.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:AS5","CH_97E9_DKMD:A14"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_12:CGD-01","text":"The demand to leave the teacher belongs locally to the pedagogy of self-discovery; at the cluster level, it becomes the general rule that productive authority endures only through its unavailability.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:D1","CH_97E9_3C_2:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:CGD-02","text":"Altered seeing and loving belong locally to the movement of return; at the cluster level, they become the condition of every relation that must not annul loss through restoration.","refs":["CH_97E9_ZWET:A4","CH_97E9_ZWET:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:CGD-03","text":"The mirror image belongs locally to the diagnosis of hostile distortion; at the cluster level, it marks the distinction between a teaching and its contingent social form of appearance.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:A3","CH_97E9_DKMD:NX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_12:GNX-01","text":"Excluded is every form of community whose unity rests on continued veneration, unbroken recognition, or stable student attachment.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:SNX1","CH_97E9_ZWET:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:GNX-02","text":"Excluded is a return that simply repeats what came before, because return becomes possible only under altered conditions of perception and love.","refs":["CH_97E9_ZWET:NX2","CH_97E9_ZWET:D5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:GNX-03","text":"Excluded is the equation of truth and public image, because the teaching remains mediated through distortion, shame, and hostile appropriation.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:NX1","CH_97E9_DKMD:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_12:DBN-01","text":"The system cannot permit self-sufficient inwardness: wisdom that remains in withdrawal loses its social efficacy and yields its image to distortion.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:NX3","CH_97E9_DKMD:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:DBN-02","text":"The system cannot permit unbroken continuity, because self-becoming, love, and knowledge arise only through loss, temporal distance, and transformation.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:DNX1","CH_97E9_ZWET:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:DBN-03","text":"The system cannot permit final reconciliation, because social rapprochement does not eliminate opposition to enemies, but integrates it into its movement.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:SD6","CH_97E9_DKMD:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_12:BSA-01","text":"Unavailable is a present in which authority, community, and meaning would at once be fully recognized, undistorted, and complete.","refs":["CH_97E9_ZWET:SNX1","CH_97E9_DKMD:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:BSA-02","text":"Unavailable is a final meaning outside transition, loss, and renewed reception; every attained form must enable its own surpassing.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:SNX4","CH_97E9_DKMD:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole"},{"number":"8","name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_12:XD-01","text":"The suspension of teacherly authority and the public endangerment of the teaching together form a double release: followers must detach themselves from the teacher, while the teaching must detach itself from the privacy of its origin. ; Trace Type — [Composite]","refs":["CL_97E9_12:GA-01","CL_97E9_12:GA-04","CH_97E9_3C_2:SD1","CH_97E9_DKMD:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:XD-02","text":"Complete denial becomes visible only at the cluster level as the interface at which individual self-becoming, relational transformation, and social seeking are organized simultaneously. ; Trace Type — [Composite]","refs":["CL_97E9_12:GA-02","CL_97E9_12:GA-06","CH_97E9_3C_2:D4","CH_97E9_ZWET:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:XD-03","text":"Return must bring forth new language, because those who return do not return to an earlier community, but address anew a field altered by loss and distortion. ; Trace Type — [Composite]","refs":["CL_97E9_12:GA-04","CL_97E9_12:GA-05","CH_97E9_ZWET:SD4","CH_97E9_DKMD:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:XD-04","text":"The inclusion of enemies is not an addition to friendship, but the condition under which friendship can still be sought at all after loss and public distortion. ; Trace Type — [Tension]","refs":["CL_97E9_12:GA-06","CL_97E9_12:GA-07","CH_97E9_DKMD:A10","CH_97E9_DKMD:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"From","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Cross-Unit Derivative Propositions"},{"number":"9","name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_12:BSD-01","text":"The cluster produces a model of non-sovereign authority: authority is effective only insofar as it destroys dependency, cannot control its images, and does not enact its return as a claim of possession.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:SD2","CH_97E9_DKMD:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:BSD-02","text":"History appears as a sequence of irreversible transitions in which recurrence signifies not a return to the origin, but a resumption under different conditions.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:SD4","CH_97E9_ZWET:ME2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:BSD-03","text":"The subject is determined not as an autonomous origin, but as a transitional form that constitutes itself through resistance, loss, conflict over images, and renewed address.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:A7","CH_97E9_DKMD:ME1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:BSD-04","text":"Teaching is determined as an open circulation machine: it produces distortions, losses, and counterforces, from which it must generate new speech and still-unsecured forms of reception.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:SD7","CH_97E9_DKMD:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Super-Derivatives"},{"number":"10","name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_12:RLE-01","text":"Authority produces attachment, attachment prevents self-discovery, self-discovery requires denial, and denial first makes possible a relation without original subordination.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:FGS1","CH_97E9_3C_2:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:RLE-02","text":"Withdrawal produces a surplus of wisdom, surplus produces pain and new speech, new speech again exposes itself to social distortion and thereby compels further movements of return.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:D1","CH_97E9_DKMD:AF2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:RLE-03","text":"The attractor of the cluster is non-identical recurrence: every return preserves a relation to what has been lost, yet changes the form of seeing, loving, speaking, and coming together.","refs":["CH_97E9_ZWET:D5","CH_97E9_ZWET:FGS6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recursive Loops, Escalation Paths, and Conceptual Attractors"},{"number":"11","name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_12:FGS-B01","text":"Attachment to authority → dependency and suspension of the search for self → necessary denial.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:AS1","CH_97E9_3C_2:FGS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:FGS-B02","text":"Denial → loss and temporal interruption → mutation of perception and love → non-identical return.","refs":["CH_97E9_ZWET:FGS2","CH_97E9_ZWET:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:FGS-B03","text":"Withdrawal → accumulation and pain of wisdom → diagnosis of public distortion → imperative of renewed social circulation.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:FGS1","CH_97E9_DKMD:FGS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:FGS-B04","text":"New speech → antagonistic address of friends and enemies → risky search for a still-unsecured ground of reception.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:FGS5","CH_97E9_DKMD:FGS7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Formal Generative Schema of the Whole Book"},{"number":"12","name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_12:AFM-B01","text":"Veneration and attachment → dependency → demanded separation → self-discovery.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:AFM-B02","text":"Self-discovery → denial as threshold → loss of the original community → altered return.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:D5","CH_97E9_ZWET:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:AFM-B03","text":"Altered return → confrontation with public distortion → loss of friends → new language and social seeking.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:D2","CH_97E9_DKMD:AF1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:AFM-B04","text":"New language and antagonistic love → circulation through friends and enemies → open search for a community without original identity.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:SD3","CH_97E9_DKMD:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Whole-Book Argument Flow Map"},{"number":"13","name":"Macro Map-Effects","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_12:MME-01","text":"Authority is no longer mapped as a stable source, but as a transitional function whose legitimacy is bound to the production of independent counterforces.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:ME1","CH_97E9_3C_2:ALT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:MME-02","text":"Loss is reclassified from mere deprivation into a productive category, because it simultaneously enables self-discovery, altered love, and renewed seeking.","refs":["CH_97E9_ZWET:ME5","CH_97E9_ZWET:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:MME-03","text":"The boundary between friend and enemy loses its ordering unambiguity, because both become addressees of a love and speech that do not suspend conflict.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:ME3","CH_97E9_DKMD:SD6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Macro Map-Effects"},{"number":"14","name":"Altitude Integration","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_12:ALT-B01","text":"Surface level — Leaving, denying, returning, mirroring, seeking, giving, and speaking form the visible operations of the movement.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:ALT1","CH_97E9_DKMD:ALT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:ALT-B02","text":"Structural level — Relations are organized through dependency, interruption, public mediation through images, loss, and renewed circulation.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:ALT2","CH_97E9_DKMD:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:ALT-B03","text":"Metastrategic level — Intervention does not mean preserving a pure teaching, but intensifying its circulating speech under conditions of distortion and antagonism.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:ALT3","CH_97E9_DKMD:SD4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:ALT-B04","text":"Ontological / Temporal level — Identity persists only as transformable continuity, while the human being, community, and wisdom appear as forms of transition and becoming.","refs":["CH_97E9_ZWET:ALT4","CH_97E9_DKMD:ALT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:ALT-B05","text":"Methodological / Performative level — The system enacts its thesis by organizing recurrence as variation, negation as a productive threshold, and imagery as an operative diagnosis rather than as mere embellishment.","refs":["CH_97E9_ZWET:ME2","CH_97E9_DKMD:MRT4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Altitude Integration"},{"number":"15","name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_12:FL-01","text":"The self-suspension of authority remains fraught with tension, because the call to denial itself still proceeds from the authority of the one who is to be overcome.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:SD1","CH_97E9_3C_2:MRT6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:FL-02","text":"The transformation of loss into productive seeking remains unstable, because it is not decided whether the loss has actually occurred or is only announced as a future condition.","refs":["CH_97E9_ZWET:MRT2","CH_97E9_ZWET:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:FL-03","text":"The return to friendship remains endangered, because the wild speech that is meant to call friends back can at once frighten them and drive them away again.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:SD5","CH_97E9_DKMD:MRT7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:MP-01","text":"Denial mutates from the negative gesture against an authority into the positive condition under which another form of relation can arise in the first place.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:ME3","CH_97E9_ZWET:D1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:MP-02","text":"Love mutates from a relation between those who belong into an overflowing, language-forming, and antagonistic force that does not separate friendship from enmity.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:ME4","CH_97E9_DKMD:NX8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Internal Tensions, Mutation Points, and Fault Lines"},{"number":"16","name":"Hidden System Image","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_12:HSI-01","text":"Reality appears as a field of circulating forces in which teachings, images, attachments, and enmities are not fixed objects, but contested mediations.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:SD1","CH_97E9_DKMD:ALT2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:HSI-02","text":"The subject appears as a form of passage and discharge that reaches itself only through loss of an external ground, resistance to authority, and risky return.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:DNX1","CH_97E9_DKMD:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:HSI-03","text":"Time appears not as linear completion, but as a sequence of withdrawals, interruptions, returns, and transitions to forms that do not yet possess a secured social place.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:SD4","CH_97E9_DKMD:MRT8"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Hidden System Image"},{"number":"17","name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_12:MRT-B01","text":"The extracted axioms suffice to reconstruct the overarching movement from dependency through denial and loss to mutated return and open social circulation.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:MRT1","CH_97E9_DKMD:MRT1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:MRT-B02","text":"It remains underdetermined which concrete teaching circulates, what historical determination friends and enemies possess, and whether public distortion indicates merely external distortion or a real mutation of the teaching.","refs":["CH_97E9_DKMD:MRT2","CH_97E9_DKMD:MRT3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_12:MRT-B03","text":"The reconstruction is strongest where it grasps authority, loss, and return as a recursive machine of transformation; it remains dependent on the productive tension that liberation seeks new attachment without being permitted to fall back into the old attachment.","refs":["CH_97E9_3C_2:MRT4","CH_97E9_3C_2:MRT5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Minimal Whole-Book Reconstruction Test"}],"revision":"CL_97E9_12@R001","source_variant_id":"canonical:CL_97E9_12:v1","source_language_code":"de","original_title":"Chapters 34–36"}],"identity":{"layer":"CL","kicker":"Cluster · Also sprach Zarathustra","title":"Chapters 34–36","context":"Von der schenkenden Tugend · 3 · Zweiter Theil · Das Kind mit dem Spiegel","original_title":"Chapters 34–36"},"original_title":"Chapters 34–36","title_language_code":"en"},{"id":"CL_97E9_13","layer":"CL","title":"Chapters 37–39","order":13,"parents":["CH_97E9_ADGC","CH_97E9_WZID","CH_97E9_AUND"],"revision":"CL_97E9_13@R001","sha256":"fb11397310d324b37b2f635fb865ef87c0f212801cc0c4e488e53ef2153bf228","sections":[{"number":"1","name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_13:AS-01","text":"Das System bearbeitet die Frage, wie nach dem Ausschluss einer transzendenten Ordnung dennoch Wahrheit, Wert, Hoffnung und Zukunft erzeugt werden können.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADGC:AS2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_13:AS-02","text":"Es bestimmt Gott zunächst als Mutmaßung, anschließend als lebensfeindliche Operation und schließlich als Hindernis jeder schöpferischen Selbst- und Weltbildung.","refs":["CH_97E9_WZID:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_13:AS-03","text":"An die Stelle einer fertigen oder ewigen Wirklichkeit tritt ein Werden, in dem Erkennen, Wollen, Leiden, Zerstören und Schaffen ineinandergreifen.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:FGS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_13:AS-04","text":"Der argumentative Weg führt von der metaphysischen Mutmaßung über ihre zeit- und leibfeindlichen Wirkungen zur affirmativen Ontologie der Vergänglichkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_WZID:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_13:AS-05","text":"Die Bewegung ist rekursiv: Der Mensch verwirft die göttliche Schöpfungsinstanz, übernimmt deren Funktion und wird dabei selbst zum unfertigen Material weiterer Hervorbringung.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_13:AS-06","text":"Die Schließung besteht nicht in einem erreichten Endzustand, sondern in der Setzung des Übermenschen als unabschließbarem Produktions- und Vollendungsvektor.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:A13"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Book-Scale Argumental Spine"},{"number":"2","name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_13:GA-01","text":"[Persistent] Eine transzendente Ordnung besitzt keine gesicherte letzte Geltung; sie erscheint als Mutmaßung, deren Anspruch an ihren Wirkungen geprüft wird.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADGC:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_13:GA-02","text":"[Mutating] Die Gottesnegation verändert sich von einer epistemischen Zurückweisung über die Kritik einer anti-zeitlichen Operation zur positiven Voraussetzung menschlicher Schöpfung.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_13:GA-03","text":"[Persistent] Werden, Zeitlichkeit und Vergänglichkeit sind keine Defizite gegenüber dem Sein, sondern Bedingungen jeder wirklichen Gestaltung.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:A2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_13:GA-04","text":"[Emergent] Erkennen ist keine passive Aufnahme einer fertigen Welt, sondern eine Form ihrer menschlichen Übersetzung und Hervorbringung.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADGC:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_13:GA-05","text":"[Persistent] Schöpfung setzt Leiden, Verlust, Sterben und vielfache Verwandlung voraus; Zerstörung ist eine operative Phase der Gestaltung.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:A4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_13:GA-06","text":"[Mutating] Der Wille wandelt sich vom Prinzip der Welterzeugung zum Prinzip der Selbstbefreiung, der Schicksalsbejahung und der fortgesetzten Selbstumbildung.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:D3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_13:GA-07","text":"[Emergent] Leibliche Affekte wie Schwindel, Erbrechen, Leichtigkeit und Schmerz fungieren als Prüfungen metaphysischer Wertungen.","refs":["CH_97E9_WZID:SD2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_13:GA-08","text":"[Emergent] Hoffnung und Leichtigkeit sind keine jenseitigen Gaben, sondern Effekte einer gelungenen schöpferischen Umwandlung von Leiden und Vergänglichkeit.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:AS3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_13:GA-09","text":"[Attractor] Der Übermensch bezeichnet keine gegebene Substanz, sondern die genealogische Richtung, auf die menschliche Selbstüberwindung zuläuft.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADGC:A6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_13:GA-10","text":"[Terminal] Der Mensch wird vom Empfänger einer kosmischen Ordnung zu deren einzig verfügbarem Material und vorläufigem Produzenten umcodiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:ME6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_13:GA-11","text":"[Attractor] Das verborgene Bild im Stein organisiert die Zukunft als noch nicht sichtbare, durch gewaltsame Freilegung zu erzeugende Gestalt.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:A12"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_13:GA-12","text":"[Terminal] Eine fertige, unveränderliche und nichtmenschliche Letztbegründung wird ausgeschlossen, damit Schöpfung als offene Aufgabe bestehen kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:SNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Load-Bearing Axioms"},{"number":"3","name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_13:RMD-01","text":"„Gott“ kehrt identisch als Name wieder, mutiert jedoch funktional von einer Mutmaßung zu einer gegen die Zeit gerichteten Operation und schließlich zu einem Schöpfungshindernis.","refs":["CH_97E9_WZID:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_13:RMD-02","text":"Das Unvergängliche wird zunächst als Lüge oder menschenfeindliche Vollendung zurückgewiesen und anschließend als bloßes Gleichnis in die Ordnung des Werdens absorbiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:A1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_13:RMD-03","text":"Vergänglichkeit verschiebt ihre Valenz vom Mangel zur produktiven Ontologie und wird dadurch selbst zum Rechtfertigungsgrund des Schaffens.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:SD1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_13:RMD-04","text":"Erkenntnis wandert von der Wahrheitssuche zur Vermenschlichung des Wirklichen und weiter zum Zeugungswillen, der Erkenntnis in einen Produktionsvorgang einbindet.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:FGS4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_13:RMD-05","text":"Der Wille kehrt als schöpferische Kraft, Befreiung, Schicksalsbejahung und Zwang zur weiteren Verwandlung wieder; seine Funktion bleibt produktiv, seine Valenz wird ambivalent.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:SD3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_13:RMD-06","text":"Der Übermensch wird vom Ersatz für Gott zum genealogischen Ziel, dann zum Schatten und schließlich zum Attraktor einer niemals abgeschlossenen Gestaltung.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:SD5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_13:RMD-07","text":"Körperliche Übelkeit und schöpferischer Schmerz werden aus bloßen Reaktionen zu epistemischen und ontologischen Selektionsmechanismen umcodiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_WZID:D2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_13:RMD-08","text":"Zerstörung verliert ihre ausschließlich negative Bedeutung und wird als Hammerfunktion in die Freilegung zukünftiger Gestalt aufgenommen.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:D6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_13:RMD-09","text":"Die unabhängige Außenwelt, das fertige Subjekt und die neutrale Wahrheit verschwinden als eigenständige Pole, nachdem sie als Gegenmodelle disqualifiziert worden sind.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADGC:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Recurrence, Mutation, and Displacement Matrix"},{"number":"4","name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_13:CGD-01","text":"Einzelne Bilder von Feigen, Adlern, Übelkeit, Gebären und Hämmern bleiben lokale Träger der jeweiligen Szene; auf Cluster-Ebene werden sie zu Funktionen einer gemeinsamen Produktionslogik.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADGC:AS1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_13:CGD-02","text":"Die lokale Sprecherposition, die ihre eigene Nicht-Göttlichkeit als unerträglich bestimmt, skaliert nach oben als allgemeines Ausschlusskriterium gegen transzendente Letztinstanzen.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADGC:A10"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_13:CGD-03","text":"Der einzelne Schwindel ist kein globales Axiom; global tragend wird erst die Regel, dass leibliche Wirkung metaphysische Wertungen mitentscheidet.","refs":["CH_97E9_WZID:A7"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_13:CGD-04","text":"Die lokale Kritik an Dichtern wird auf Cluster-Ebene zur Spannung zwischen bildhafter Darstellung und der Zurückweisung fertiger, ewiger Bilder.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:NX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_13:CGD-05","text":"Die Kapitel unterscheiden verschiedene Formen von Gotteskritik; die Cluster-Synthese absorbiert sie in die umfassendere Operation der Enttranszendierung.","refs":["CH_97E9_WZID:D4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_13:CGD-06","text":"Die je lokale Beschreibung des Übermenschen als Horizont, Schatten oder verborgenes Bild wird auf Cluster-Ebene als ein einziger Attraktor rekonstruiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADGC:A5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_13:CGD-07","text":"Die lokalen Mechanismen bleiben nur dort eigenständig, wo sie die gemeinsame Architektur qualifizieren: körperliche Abwehr, poetische Bildlichkeit und gewaltsame Freilegung markieren unterschiedliche Zugänge zum selben Werden.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:ME5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Lower-Layer vs Current-Level Distinction"},{"number":"5","name":"Global Apophatic Structure","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_13:GNX-01","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine transzendente Instanz, die unabhängig vom menschlichen Schaffen Maß, Sinn oder Wahrheit garantiert.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADGC:DNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_13:GNX-02","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine fertige Welt, die dem Erkennen vorausliegt und nur passiv aufgenommen werden müsste.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADGC:NX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_13:GNX-03","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Aufwertung von Einheit, Fülle, Ruhe und Dauer zu höchsten ontologischen Normen.","refs":["CH_97E9_WZID:DNX2"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_13:GNX-04","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird ein Wissen, das vom Wollen, Bewerten, Fühlen und Hervorbringen unabhängig wäre.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:DNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_13:GNX-05","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird eine Schöpfung ohne Leiden, Verlust, Sterben und Zerstörung.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:DNX5"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_13:GNX-06","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird die Annahme, Vergänglichkeit sei bloß ein minderwertiger Abfall vom Ewigen.","refs":["CH_97E9_WZID:DNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_13:GNX-07","text":"Ausgeschlossen wird ein bereits vollendeter Mensch, weil jede feste Gestalt die weitere Selbstüberschreitung blockieren würde.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:DNX6"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Global Apophatic Structure"},{"number":"6","name":"Deep Book Apophatics","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_13:DBN-01","text":"Das System kann nur bestehen, wenn keine vom Menschen unabhängige Wirklichkeit letzte Geltung beansprucht.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADGC:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_13:DBN-02","text":"Es muss falsch sein, dass Zeit und Vergänglichkeit bloße Mängel sind; andernfalls würde jede schöpferische Bewegung zum Defizit erklärt.","refs":["CH_97E9_WZID:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_13:DBN-03","text":"Es muss falsch sein, dass leiblicher Widerstand gegenüber einer Lehre als bloße Täuschung abgetan werden kann.","refs":["CH_97E9_WZID:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_13:DBN-04","text":"Es muss falsch sein, dass ein Schöpfer unverändert bleibt; Schöpfung verlangt die gleichzeitige Erzeugung und Zerstörung des Schaffenden.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:SNX3"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_13:DBN-05","text":"Es muss falsch sein, dass Hoffnung nur durch eine jenseitige Garantie möglich wird; Hoffnung wird aus menschlicher Weltbildung erzeugt.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADGC:A9"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_13:DBN-06","text":"Es muss falsch sein, dass die Zukunft als fertiges Ziel vor dem schöpferischen Vollzug verfügbar ist.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]}],"original_name":"Deep Book Apophatics"},{"number":"7","name":"Super-Apophatics of the Whole","items":[{"id":"CL_97E9_13:BSA-01","text":"Die tiefste organisierende Abwesenheit ist eine nichtmenschliche Garantie, welche die Welt bereits vor jeder Schöpfung rechtfertigen würde.","refs":["CH_97E9_AUND:SNX1"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_13:BSA-02","text":"Das System umkreist die Möglichkeit eines Wirklichen, das sich menschlicher Aneignung entzieht, ohne diese Möglichkeit positiv ausarbeiten zu können.","refs":["CH_97E9_ADGC:SNX4"],"deep_refs":[],"trace_type":"","passages":[]},{"id":"CL_97E9_13:BSA-03","text":"Nicht verfügbar ist ein endgültiger Zustand, in dem Mensch, Welt und Wahrheit ihre endgültige Form bereits besitzen.","